(200, 'Sunshine Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Sunshine Yoga Studio: Cultivating Wellness in the Heart of Assam</strong></p><p>Sunshine Yoga Studio, strategically located on the 2nd floor of Fortune Central by Atishay, is a boutique yoga and wellness center dedicated to fostering holistic well-being within the vibrant community of Assam. More than just a fitness studio, we are a sanctuary for mindful movement, breathwork, and self-discovery. We recognize the growing demand for accessible and authentic wellness practices in the region and are committed to providing a supportive and nurturing environment for individuals of all ages, abilities, and experience levels.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Assam, with its rich cultural tapestry and increasing awareness of health and lifestyle choices, represents a significant market for specialized wellness services. Recognizing this, Sunshine Yoga Studio aims to fill a crucial gap by offering a diverse range of yoga styles rooted in traditional practices but adapted for modern lifestyles. We address the specific needs of the Assamese community by incorporating elements of local philosophy and promoting mindful integration of physical and mental practices into daily life. This is particularly relevant in a region experiencing increasing stress levels due to rapid development and evolving work patterns. We believe that integrating yoga is not merely about physical fitness; it''s about cultivating inner peace, resilience, and a deeper connection to oneself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Wellness</strong></p><p>Our offerings are designed to be comprehensive and cater to various preferences. Central to our practice is a core schedule of Hatha, Vinyasa, and Restorative Yoga classes, each carefully curated to complement different body types and fitness levels. We offer beginner-friendly classes alongside more advanced sessions for experienced practitioners. A significant differentiator for Sunshine Yoga Studio is our emphasis on Gentle Yoga &amp; Prenatal Yoga, acknowledging the unique physical and emotional needs of these populations. In addition, we provide specialized workshops focusing on topics such as mindful eating, stress management techniques, and breathwork practices. These workshops are led by experienced instructors who are deeply knowledgeable in the therapeutic benefits of each practice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Unique Selling Points: Empowering Growth Through Integrated Wellness</strong></p><p>Several factors set Sunshine Yoga Studio apart. Firstly, our instructors are rigorously trained and experienced, holding certifications from recognized yoga schools both nationally and internationally. We prioritize instructor development, fostering a collaborative environment where expertise is shared and continuous learning is encouraged. Secondly, we emphasize a strong sense of community. Our studio hosts regular social events, workshops, and partner with local health and wellness providers, building a network that supports overall community well-being. Thirdly, we champion accessibility. We offer flexible class schedules and drop-in options to accommodate busy lifestyles, and are committed to creating an inclusive space for individuals of all backgrounds and abilities. Furthermore, our meticulously designed studio space provides a calming and inviting atmosphere, crucial for promoting relaxation and mindfulness. We have invested in high-quality mats, props, and natural lighting to ensure a comfortable and supportive environment for all.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Customer Experience: Cultivating a Supportive and Engaging Community</strong></p><p>At Sunshine Yoga Studio, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable exploring their practice and connecting with others. Our instructors are known for their personalized approach, taking the time to understand each student''s individual needs and goals. We actively encourage open communication and feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure customer satisfaction. Beyond the physical studio space, we foster a sense of community through regular social gatherings, workshops, and partnerships with local organizations. We are committed to being an integral part of the local Assam community, actively participating in events and initiatives that promote health and wellness. Our marketing efforts focus on highlighting the transformative power of yoga and showcasing the positive impact it has on individual lives – a key aspect of our commitment to holistic well-being.</p><p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Empowering Growth</strong></p><p>Looking ahead, Sunshine Yoga Studio envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market. Our immediate plans involve expanding our class offerings to include specialized workshops focused on specific health conditions, such as back pain and anxiety. We also plan to introduce online yoga classes and virtual retreats, reaching a wider audience across the region. Long-term, we aim to establish Sunshine Yoga Studio as a leading wellness center in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality instruction, community engagement, and holistic well-being. This includes exploring opportunities to partner with corporate wellness programs and wellness tourism initiatives. We are determined to empower individuals to cultivate a healthier and more mindful lifestyle, one breath at a time. Our ultimate goal is to contribute to the overall well-being of the Assam community by providing accessible and transformative yoga experiences.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '2nd floor, Fortune Central by Atishay', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6900182516', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2026-08-07T11:06:21.232Z'),
(201, 'Divyam yoga & wellness centre', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<p>Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre: Cultivating Holistic Wellbeing in Beltala Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre is a dedicated haven for health and wellbeing, strategically located at House No. 52, Navin Path, in the vibrant walking zone directly in front of Kendriya Vidyalaya on Beltala Road, Assam. We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community-focused wellness hub committed to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth for individuals of all ages and fitness levels. In a region where traditional healing practices and a focus on holistic health are increasingly valued, Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre aims to bridge the gap between ancient wisdom and contemporary wellbeing, offering accessible and effective practices tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese populace.<br><br>Our core offering centers on a diverse spectrum of yoga styles, meticulously curated to cater to varying preferences and physical capabilities. We provide classes in Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Flow, Ashtanga Yoga (beginner and advanced levels), and Restorative Yoga, ensuring a comprehensive approach to physical and mental rejuvenation. Beyond yoga, we also offer specialized workshops focused on meditation techniques, pranayama (breathwork) practices, and mindfulness exercises. Our workshops are designed to provide practical tools for managing stress, improving sleep quality, and enhancing overall emotional resilience – key needs within the fast-paced environment of modern life in Assam.<br><br>A significant unique selling point of Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre is our emphasis on personalized instruction. We believe in a holistic approach, recognizing that individual needs are paramount. Our certified instructors provide one-on-one consultations to assess each client''s physical condition, health goals, and experience level, creating customized yoga plans that maximize effectiveness and minimize the risk of injury. This personalized approach distinguishes us from larger, more generalized yoga studios and resonates deeply with a clientele seeking individualized attention and demonstrable results. Furthermore, we prioritize the use of locally sourced organic herbal teas and healthy snacks during our classes and workshops, reinforcing our commitment to wellness in all aspects.<br><br>The local market in Beltala and surrounding areas presents a burgeoning demand for accessible and affordable wellness solutions. Many residents grapple with stress related to work, family, and the demands of daily life. Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre directly addresses this need by providing a readily available and inviting space for stress reduction, physical fitness, and mental clarity. Our classes are designed to be inclusive and welcoming, fostering a supportive and non-judgmental environment where individuals can explore the transformative power of yoga without feeling intimidated. We actively engage with the Kendriya Vidyalaya community through outreach programs and workshops for students and parents, positioning ourselves as a valuable resource for holistic wellbeing within the educational ecosystem.<br><br>Our customer experience is at the heart of everything we do. We strive to create a welcoming and nurturing atmosphere that encourages connection and community. Our instructors are highly trained in creating inclusive and supportive class environments, ensuring everyone feels comfortable and empowered to participate. We maintain a clean, serene, and aesthetically pleasing studio space, further contributing to the sense of calm and wellbeing. Feedback is actively solicited through regular surveys and informal conversations, allowing us to continually refine our offerings and ensure we are meeting the evolving needs of our clientele. We foster a strong sense of community through regular social events and workshops, building lasting relationships among our participants.<br><br>Looking ahead, Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre envisions significant expansion and growth within the Beltala community and beyond. Our immediate plans include expanding our workshop offerings to incorporate specialized areas like holistic nutrition and stress management. We are also exploring the possibility of offering online yoga classes to reach a wider audience and accommodate those who may be unable to attend in-person sessions. Long-term, we aim to establish Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre as a leading wellness destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality instruction, personalized care, and community engagement. We intend to invest in advanced equipment and resources to enhance the learning experience and maintain the highest standards of physical and mental wellbeing. Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives, grounded in the principles of yoga and holistic wellbeing. We are committed to contributing positively to the health and vitality of the Beltala community and beyond, one breath and one pose at a time.&nbsp;<br><br>Divyam Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre is dedicated to providing accessible, quality yoga and wellness services, fostering a thriving community, and contributing to the overall health and well-being of individuals in Assam.</p>', 'House no 52, Navin Path, walking zone front of Kendriya Vidyalaya Beltala Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9555877368', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2026-08-07T11:06:21.232Z'),
(202, 'Bodhi Tree Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<p><strong>Bodhi Tree Yoga Studio: Cultivating Wellness in the Heart of Assam</strong></p><p>Bodhi Tree Yoga Studio, strategically located at HOUSE NO, 2, Namghar Path, is a dedicated wellness center committed to fostering holistic well-being through the practice of yoga and mindfulness. We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub designed to nurture physical, mental, and spiritual growth within the vibrant landscape of Assam. Recognizing a growing demand for accessible and authentic yoga experiences, we aim to provide a welcoming and supportive environment for individuals of all ages and fitness levels.</p><p>Our studio distinguishes itself through a deep respect for traditional yoga philosophy and a contemporary adaptation tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese population. We believe in the power of yoga to integrate seamlessly into daily life, facilitating stress reduction, improved flexibility, enhanced strength, and a greater sense of inner peace – values deeply resonant within the cultural fabric of Assam.</p><p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Wellness</strong></p><p>Bodhi Tree offers a comprehensive range of yoga classes, meticulously designed to cater to diverse preferences and skill levels. Our primary offerings include:</p><ul><li><strong>Hatha Yoga:</strong> Foundation-building classes focusing on fundamental postures, breathing techniques, and mindful movement. These classes are perfect for beginners and provide a solid base for further exploration.</li><li><strong>Vinyasa Flow Yoga:</strong> Dynamic and flowing sequences that link breath to movement, building strength, flexibility, and cardiovascular health. We incorporate variations to accommodate various physical abilities.</li><li><strong>Yin Yoga:</strong> Passive, meditative poses held for longer durations to target deep connective tissues, promoting relaxation and flexibility. This style is particularly beneficial for stress management and restorative practices.</li><li><strong>Restorative Yoga:</strong> Gentle, supported poses designed to completely relax the body and mind, ideal for stress reduction and recovery.</li><li><strong>Prenatal Yoga:</strong> Adapted yoga sequences specifically designed for expectant mothers, addressing the physical and emotional changes of pregnancy. This class is led by experienced instructors with specialized knowledge of prenatal health.</li><li><strong>Meditation &amp; Mindfulness Sessions:</strong> Guided meditation practices and mindfulness exercises to cultivate inner peace, reduce anxiety, and enhance focus. We believe that mindfulness is an integral part of a balanced lifestyle.</li></ul><p>Our unique selling points extend beyond the breadth of our class offerings. We prioritize experienced and certified instructors deeply committed to guiding students with empathy and expertise. Our instructors are locally sourced, ensuring a strong connection to the Assamese community and a commitment to delivering instruction tailored to local anatomical needs. Furthermore, we offer workshops and occasional retreats focused on specific aspects of yoga and mindfulness, providing opportunities for deeper learning and personal growth. Our studio spaces are designed to promote tranquility and focus, with natural light, calming decor, and comfortable seating areas, creating a sanctuary for self-care.</p><p>These services directly address the prevalent needs in the Assam region. The increasing awareness of the benefits of yoga and the rising stress levels in professional and personal life have fueled a strong demand for convenient and accessible wellness solutions. Our classes are offered at multiple times throughout the week, with varying durations, to accommodate busy schedules. The emphasis on gentle and restorative yoga caters to a wide range of physical capabilities, ensuring inclusivity for all.</p><p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Community and Connection</strong></p><p>At Bodhi Tree, we are dedicated to fostering a warm and welcoming community. We believe that yoga is not just a physical practice, but a journey of self-discovery, and we strive to create an environment that nurtures this journey. Our customer service philosophy centers around personalized attention, genuine care, and a commitment to empowering individuals to achieve their wellness goals. We actively encourage interaction and create opportunities for students to connect with one another through social events and informal gatherings – such as monthly potlucks and shared meditation sessions.</p><p>We are deeply invested in connecting with the local community through partnerships with nearby schools and organizations, offering introductory workshops and wellness programs. We also organize community clean-up drives and other initiatives to demonstrate our commitment to social responsibility. Our studio actively participates in local festivals and cultural events, showcasing the power of yoga as a unifying force. We understand the importance of cultural sensitivity and strive to provide instruction that is respectful of Assamese traditions and values.</p><p>Feedback from our students is paramount, and we actively solicit and incorporate suggestions to continuously improve our services. We create a space where individuals feel comfortable exploring their practice, sharing their experiences, and supporting one another.</p><p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding Wellness and Impact</strong></p><p>Bodhi Tree Yoga Studio envisions a future where yoga is an integral part of the well-being of the Assamese population. Our plans include expanding our class offerings to include specialized programs such as trauma-informed yoga and adaptive yoga for individuals with physical limitations. We aim to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers and wellness centers to promote yoga as a complementary therapy. Furthermore, we aspire to offer online yoga classes and workshops to reach a wider audience beyond our immediate location. We are also exploring opportunities to participate in yoga teacher training programs and establish a network of certified instructors across Assam. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized and respected leader in the wellness sector, contributing to a healthier and more mindful society. We intend to continually evolve our offerings, adapting to the changing needs of our community while staying true to the core principles of yoga – self-awareness, inner peace, and a commitment to a more balanced and fulfilling life.</p><p>Bodhi Tree Yoga Studio is poised to become a vital resource for wellness in Assam, offering more than just yoga – it''s a pathway to a happier, healthier, and more connected life.</p>', 'HOUSE NO, 2, Namghar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6003037246', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2026-08-07T11:06:21.232Z'),
(203, 'Upaveda''s Yoga Now', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '```html
<h1>Upaveda''s Yoga Now</h1>
<p>Nestled on the 2nd floor of the Ambika Complex, Upaveda''s Yoga Now offers a unique and transformative yoga experience tailored to the vibrant community of Assam.  More than just a studio, we are a sanctuary dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual well-being through the ancient practice of yoga.  Our approach blends traditional Asana practice with a deep understanding of the local cultural context, creating a truly enriching and accessible experience for individuals of all levels and backgrounds. We aim to become a leading voice in the wellness sector of Assam, promoting healthy lifestyles and community engagement.</p>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>
<p>Upaveda''s Yoga Now provides a comprehensive range of yoga services designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. Our core offerings include:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Hatha Yoga:</strong>  Fundamental postures and breathing techniques, perfect for beginners and those seeking a grounding practice. Our Hatha classes emphasize proper alignment and mindful movement, ensuring a safe and effective experience for all fitness levels.</li>
  <li><strong>Ashtanga Yoga:</strong> A vigorous and dynamic style focusing on a set sequence of postures, designed to build strength, flexibility, and stamina.  Our experienced instructors guide students through the series, adapting the practice to individual capabilities.</li>
  <li><strong>Vinyasa Yoga:</strong>  A flowing style of yoga that links breath with movement, creating a dynamic and meditative experience.  Our Vinyasa classes emphasize creative sequencing and mindful transitions, fostering both physical and mental agility.</li>
  <li><strong>Restorative Yoga:</strong>  A gentle and therapeutic style using props to support the body in deeply relaxing poses, promoting stress reduction and overall well-being.  This class is ideal for relaxation, injury recovery, or simply unwinding after a long day.</li>
  <li><strong>Prenatal Yoga:</strong>  Designed specifically for expectant mothers, this class focuses on building strength, flexibility, and relaxation techniques to prepare for childbirth.  Our certified prenatal instructors provide safe and supportive guidance throughout pregnancy.</li>
  <li><strong>Yoga Workshops and Retreats:</strong>  We regularly host workshops and occasional retreats focusing on specific aspects of yoga, such as pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga philosophy. These events provide opportunities for deeper learning and connection within our community.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Unique Selling Points:</strong> Upaveda''s Yoga Now distinguishes itself through its commitment to authenticity, accessibility, and community engagement. We offer small class sizes to ensure personalized attention, experienced and certified instructors with a deep understanding of yoga philosophy, and a welcoming atmosphere that fosters a sense of belonging.  Our commitment to sourcing locally-made, sustainable materials for our studio contributes to our commitment to environmental responsibility.</p>
<p><strong>Meeting Local Market Needs:</strong>  Assam''s growing interest in wellness and holistic lifestyles creates a significant demand for accessible and high-quality yoga instruction. Upaveda''s Yoga Now directly addresses this need by offering diverse class styles, convenient scheduling, and affordable pricing.  Our emphasis on community engagement through workshops and outreach initiatives further strengthens our connection with the local population.</p>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>
<p>At Upaveda''s Yoga Now, we believe that a positive customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable, supported, and respected. Our approach emphasizes:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Personalized Attention:</strong>  Small class sizes allow our instructors to provide individual feedback and adjustments, ensuring safe and effective practice for all levels.</li>
  <li><strong>Experienced Instructors:</strong>  Our instructors are highly qualified and passionate about sharing their knowledge and expertise in a supportive and encouraging manner.</li>
  <li><strong>Welcoming Atmosphere:</strong>  We foster a sense of community within our studio, encouraging interaction and connection amongst our students.</li>
  <li><strong>Community Engagement:</strong>  We actively participate in local events and initiatives, promoting the benefits of yoga and building strong ties with our community.</li>
</ul>
<p>We prioritize open communication and encourage feedback to continuously improve our services and meet the evolving needs of our clientele. Our commitment to creating a positive and transformative experience sets us apart from other studios in the region.</p>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>
<p>Upaveda''s Yoga Now envisions a future where yoga becomes an integral part of the Assamese community''s wellness routine. We plan to expand our offerings by introducing new yoga styles, workshops, and teacher training programs.  We also aim to strengthen our community partnerships, collaborating with local businesses and organizations to promote health and well-being.  Long-term goals include establishing a larger, more comprehensive yoga center with specialized facilities and expanding our reach through online platforms to serve a wider audience.</p>
<p>Our commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement will continue to drive our growth and ensure Upaveda''s Yoga Now remains a trusted and valued resource for the people of Assam.  We believe that by fostering a culture of well-being, we can contribute to a healthier and more vibrant community.</p>
```', '2nd floor, Ambika Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:50:26.000Z'),
(204, 'Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '```html
<h1>Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre</h1>
<p>Nestled on the bustling GS Road, the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre stands as a sanctuary of peace and well-being in the heart of Assam.  More than just a yoga studio, we are a holistic wellness center dedicated to promoting physical, mental, and spiritual health within the vibrant community. We distinguish ourselves through a unique blend of traditional Himalayan yoga practices, modern wellness techniques, and a deep commitment to fostering a sense of community and belonging among our students.</p>

<h2>Business Overview</h2>
<p>In a region increasingly focused on modern conveniences and fast-paced lifestyles, the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre offers a vital counterpoint – a space for introspection, rejuvenation, and connection with the self.  We recognize the growing need for accessible and effective stress management techniques and holistic wellness practices in Assam. Our center addresses this demand by providing high-quality instruction in various yoga styles, meditation techniques, and related wellness programs, all tailored to the specific needs and preferences of our diverse clientele.  Our approach is rooted in the ancient wisdom of Himalayan traditions, while also incorporating contemporary insights to create a truly transformative experience.</p>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>
<p>Our primary offerings encompass a wide range of yoga classes catering to different levels of experience and physical abilities.  These include Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Yoga, Yin Yoga, and specialized classes focusing on specific needs like back care and prenatal yoga.  Beyond yoga, we offer guided meditation sessions, workshops on mindfulness and stress reduction, and pranayama (breathwork) techniques.  We also incorporate elements of Ayurveda, offering consultations and wellness workshops based on this ancient Indian system of medicine.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our highly qualified instructors, many of whom have extensive experience in Himalayan yoga traditions and a deep understanding of the local context. We curate our schedules to cater to the diverse working hours of our community, offering classes throughout the day and evening.  This accessibility allows us to reach a broader audience and make our services convenient for busy professionals and families alike.</p>

<p>We differentiate ourselves further by offering personalized attention.  Our instructors work closely with students to understand their individual needs and goals, adapting the classes and providing tailored guidance.  This personalized approach ensures that everyone, regardless of their fitness level or prior experience, feels comfortable, supported, and empowered in their wellness journey.  We also place a strong emphasis on the use of locally sourced, organic products in our workshops and wellness offerings, aligning with our commitment to sustainability and supporting the local economy.</p>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>
<p>At the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre, we believe that creating a positive and welcoming environment is paramount to our success. Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond simply providing quality classes. We strive to cultivate a strong sense of community among our students, fostering a supportive and inclusive space where individuals can connect, share their experiences, and grow together. This is fostered through regular social events, workshops focused on community building, and the creation of a friendly and encouraging atmosphere within our studio.  </p>

<p>Our approach extends to personalized communication.  We actively engage with our students, seeking feedback and ensuring their satisfaction. We build relationships based on trust and mutual respect, helping our students feel genuinely valued and heard.  This commitment to personalized service, coupled with our welcoming atmosphere, has resulted in high student retention rates and positive word-of-mouth referrals within the local community. We actively participate in local events, partnering with other businesses and organizations to promote wellness and contribute to the betterment of our neighborhood.  This active engagement demonstrates our commitment to being more than just a business; we are an integral part of the Assam community.</p>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>
<p>The Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre envisions a future where wellness practices are accessible and integrated into the daily lives of the people of Assam.  We plan to expand our services to include additional yoga styles, specialized workshops on advanced meditation techniques, and potential collaborations with local healthcare providers to integrate yoga and meditation into therapeutic programs.  We aim to increase our reach through strategic partnerships with local businesses, educational institutions, and community organizations.  Our long-term goal is to establish the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre as a leading wellness destination in the region, recognized for its high-quality instruction, welcoming atmosphere, and meaningful contribution to the health and well-being of our community. We are exploring the possibility of offering teacher training programs, empowering local individuals to become certified yoga and meditation instructors and further disseminating the benefits of these practices throughout the region.  We also plan to invest in creating a larger and more modern facility to accommodate our expanding clientele and program offerings.</p>

<p>Our commitment to continuous improvement and expansion is underpinned by our deep understanding of the unique needs and aspirations of the Assam community.  We believe that by fostering a culture of wellness and self-discovery, we can contribute significantly to the overall health and well-being of the region. We remain dedicated to providing accessible, high-quality services, promoting a sense of community, and leaving a lasting positive impact on the lives of our students.</p>
```', 'GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002466438', NULL, 'http://www.hymcindia.com/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:50:34.000Z'),
(205, 'ANUYOGA', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '```html
<h1>ANUYOGA: Elevating Wellness in Jayanagar</h1>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Naren Square, Jayanagar Road, near Bharat Petroleum, ANUYOGA is more than just a wellness center; it''s a sanctuary dedicated to holistic well-being.  We are uniquely positioned within the Assam business landscape, offering a comprehensive approach to health and fitness that caters to the specific needs and preferences of our local community.  Unlike generic fitness studios, ANUYOGA emphasizes a personalized and integrated approach, combining traditional practices with modern techniques to foster lasting positive change in our clients'' lives.</p>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>ANUYOGA offers a diverse range of services designed to address the multifaceted aspects of wellness. Our core offerings include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Customized Yoga Programs:</strong> We offer a variety of yoga styles, from gentle Hatha to invigorating Vinyasa, tailored to individual fitness levels, goals, and preferences. Our expert instructors assess each client''s needs and develop a personalized program focusing on flexibility, strength, balance, and stress reduction.  This personalized approach differentiates us, providing a superior level of care compared to standardized group classes.</li>
  <li><strong>Ayurvedic Wellness Consultations:</strong> Recognizing the rich Ayurvedic heritage of Assam, we integrate traditional Ayurvedic principles into our practice.  Our consultations involve a detailed assessment of individual constitution (Prakriti) to recommend personalized dietary and lifestyle adjustments for optimal health. We work with certified Ayurvedic practitioners to ensure authentic and effective treatments.</li>
  <li><strong>Meditation and Mindfulness Workshops:</strong>  In today''s fast-paced world, stress management is crucial. We offer regular workshops focused on meditation and mindfulness techniques, empowering individuals to cultivate inner peace and reduce stress levels.  These workshops incorporate elements of traditional Assamese mindfulness practices to create a unique and culturally relevant experience.</li>
  <li><strong>Wellness Retreats (Seasonal):</strong>  ANUYOGA periodically hosts weekend wellness retreats, offering an immersive experience combining yoga, meditation, Ayurvedic therapies, and healthy Assamese cuisine. These retreats provide a much-needed escape from the daily grind and promote deep relaxation and rejuvenation. This unique offering sets us apart from competitors and fosters a strong sense of community.</li>
</ul>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in the seamless integration of these services.  We understand that true well-being encompasses physical, mental, and emotional health. By offering a holistic approach, we help clients achieve a balanced and sustainable lifestyle, addressing the growing local demand for integrated wellness solutions.</p>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At ANUYOGA, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where clients feel comfortable and empowered to pursue their wellness goals.  Our approach is built on:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Personalized attention:</strong>  We prioritize individual needs and preferences, designing customized programs that cater to each client''s specific circumstances and aspirations.</li>
  <li><strong>Highly qualified instructors:</strong> Our team comprises experienced and certified yoga instructors and Ayurvedic practitioners, dedicated to providing high-quality instruction and guidance.</li>
  <li><strong>Community building:</strong> We foster a sense of community among our clients through workshops, retreats, and social events, creating a supportive network for shared growth and well-being.</li>
  <li><strong>Exceptional customer service:</strong>  We maintain open communication, providing prompt and attentive service to address any questions or concerns.</li>
  <li><strong>Commitment to local partnerships:</strong> We source locally grown, organic produce for our retreats and workshops, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices, thereby enriching our connection to the Assam community.</li>
</ul>

<p>This commitment to personalized service and community engagement distinguishes ANUYOGA from competitors and creates a loyal client base within the Jayanagar and surrounding areas.</p>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>ANUYOGA envisions becoming a leading wellness center in Assam, renowned for its holistic approach and commitment to client well-being. Our future plans include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Expansion of services:</strong>  We plan to expand our offerings to include additional Ayurvedic treatments, workshops on nutrition and healthy cooking, and specialized programs for specific populations (e.g., seniors, expectant mothers).</li>
  <li><strong>Increased community outreach:</strong>  We aim to increase our engagement with the local community through partnerships with schools, businesses, and other organizations, promoting wellness education and access to our services.</li>
  <li><strong>Development of online resources:</strong>  We plan to create online resources, such as guided meditations and yoga videos, to extend our reach and support clients beyond our physical location.</li>
  <li><strong>Strategic partnerships:</strong> We aim to build strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations that align with our values and mission, fostering collaboration and expanding our network.</li>
</ul>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish ANUYOGA as a trusted and respected resource for holistic wellness in Assam, empowering individuals to lead healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives.  We are committed to sustainable growth, prioritizing quality over quantity and maintaining our commitment to personalized care and community engagement.</p>
```', 'Naren Square, Jayanagar Rd, near Bharat Petroleum', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864039780', NULL, 'https://anuyogaofficial.in/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:50:42.000Z'),
(206, 'Guwahati yoga studio', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '```html
<h1>Guwahati Yoga Studio: Finding Balance in the Heart of Assam</h1>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, Guwahati Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of peace and rejuvenation.  More than just a yoga studio, we are a community hub dedicated to promoting holistic well-being through the practice of yoga and mindfulness.  In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and fast-paced modern life, we provide a vital space for individuals to connect with their inner selves and cultivate a healthier, more balanced lifestyle.  We differentiate ourselves through a deeply personalized approach, a commitment to authentic yoga traditions, and a strong focus on building a supportive and inclusive community within the heart of Guwahati.</p>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Guwahati Yoga Studio offers a diverse range of yoga classes catering to all levels of experience, from absolute beginners to seasoned practitioners.  Our core offerings include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Hatha Yoga:</strong>  A foundational style emphasizing proper alignment and breathwork, ideal for building strength, flexibility, and mindfulness.</li>
  <li><strong>Ashtanga Yoga:</strong> A more vigorous style focusing on a set sequence of postures, promoting physical strength and stamina.</li>
  <li><strong>Vinyasa Yoga:</strong> A flowing style that synchronizes movement with breath, creating a dynamic and invigorating practice.</li>
  <li><strong>Restorative Yoga:</strong> A gentle and relaxing style that utilizes props to support the body in passive stretches, promoting deep relaxation and stress reduction.</li>
  <li><strong>Prenatal Yoga:</strong>  Specifically designed for expecting mothers, this class helps to build strength, flexibility, and manage pregnancy-related discomfort.</li>
  <li><strong>Yoga Workshops & Retreats (Seasonal):</strong> We regularly host workshops and (occasionally) retreats focusing on specific aspects of yoga, mindfulness, and holistic well-being. These events provide in-depth learning experiences and opportunities for community building.</li>
</ul>

<p>Our unique selling points include small class sizes ensuring personalized attention from our experienced and certified instructors. We prioritize individual needs and modifications, making yoga accessible to individuals with varying physical capabilities and limitations.  Furthermore, we source high-quality, sustainable yoga props, reflecting our commitment to environmental consciousness.  Our classes address the growing local demand for stress management techniques, physical fitness options beyond traditional gyms, and mindful practices that foster mental and emotional well-being, particularly relevant in the increasingly demanding lifestyle of modern Guwahati.</p>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Guwahati Yoga Studio, we believe that a positive and supportive environment is crucial for a transformative yoga experience. We foster a welcoming atmosphere where every individual feels comfortable, respected, and encouraged to progress at their own pace.  Our instructors are not only highly skilled but also deeply passionate about sharing their knowledge and creating a sense of community.  We prioritize building strong relationships with our students, getting to know their individual needs and goals, and tailoring our approach accordingly.  This personalized touch helps us build loyalty and foster a sense of belonging.</p>

<p>Beyond the studio, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and offering discounted rates or free introductory classes to underprivileged groups. We believe in making yoga accessible to everyone, regardless of their background or financial situation. We also leverage social media and local media outlets to promote the benefits of yoga and create awareness about our services within the Guwahati community.</p>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Guwahati Yoga Studio envisions itself as a leading center for holistic well-being in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include other complementary therapies such as meditation workshops, breathwork sessions, and potentially Ayurveda-inspired wellness programs. We also plan to increase our outreach initiatives within the community by partnering with local schools, corporations, and healthcare providers to promote the benefits of yoga for stress reduction, improved mental health, and overall well-being.  We aim to expand our physical space to accommodate larger classes and offer additional amenities such as a dedicated meditation room and a retail space featuring ethically sourced yoga apparel and props.</p>

<p>Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the community while promoting a healthier and happier lifestyle for our students. We aim to become a recognized leader in the Assam yoga scene, known for our exceptional customer service, highly qualified instructors, and our strong commitment to fostering a vibrant and supportive yoga community in Guwahati.</p>

<p>We are confident that our dedication to providing high-quality yoga instruction within a supportive and inclusive community will allow us to achieve sustained growth and make a lasting impact on the well-being of individuals and the community in Guwahati.</p>
```', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9706319179', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:50:49.000Z'),
(207, 'YOGSHAKTI (Health & Wellness Center)', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '```html
<h1>YOGSHAKTI: Health & Wellness Center</h1>

<p>Nestled at House No. 51, 2nd Floor, RN Choudhury Path, opposite the Bata Showroom, YOGSHAKTI is a premier health and wellness center dedicated to fostering holistic well-being within the vibrant community of Assam.  We recognize the growing demand for comprehensive health solutions that integrate traditional practices with modern advancements, and YOGSHAKTI is uniquely positioned to meet this need.  Our center distinguishes itself through a personalized approach, a commitment to evidence-based practices, and a strong emphasis on building meaningful connections with our clients.  We are more than just a wellness center; we are a community hub focused on empowering individuals to achieve optimal physical, mental, and spiritual health.</p>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>YOGSHAKTI offers a diverse range of services designed to cater to the specific needs of our clientele.  Our core offerings include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Personalized Yoga Programs:</strong> We offer customized yoga programs tailored to individual fitness levels, health goals, and specific needs. Whether you are a seasoned yogi or a complete beginner, our experienced instructors will guide you through a safe and effective practice. We specialize in various yoga styles, including Hatha, Vinyasa, and restorative yoga, catering to a wide range of preferences and physical capabilities.  Our unique selling point here is our integration of traditional Ashtanga principles with modern modifications to ensure accessibility for all.</li>
  <li><strong>Ayurvedic Consultations and Treatments:</strong>  Recognizing the rich Ayurvedic heritage of Assam, we incorporate traditional Ayurvedic principles into our wellness programs.  Our qualified Ayurvedic practitioners provide personalized consultations, assessing individual constitution (Prakriti) and recommending tailored therapies, including herbal remedies and massage therapies, to restore balance and promote overall well-being.  This unique blend of traditional wisdom and modern scientific understanding sets us apart in the local market.</li>
  <li><strong>Meditation and Mindfulness Workshops:</strong>  In today''s fast-paced world, stress management is crucial.  YOGSHAKTI offers regular workshops and classes focusing on meditation and mindfulness techniques to help individuals cultivate inner peace, reduce stress, and improve mental clarity.  These workshops are designed to be accessible to individuals of all experience levels, emphasizing practical application in daily life.</li>
  <li><strong>Nutrition and Wellness Counseling:</strong>  We understand that holistic wellness extends beyond physical exercise.  Our certified nutritionists provide personalized dietary guidance based on individual needs and goals. We emphasize the importance of incorporating locally sourced, seasonal produce into a healthy diet, reflecting our commitment to supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.</li>
  <li><strong>Wellness Retreats (Seasonal):</strong> We offer occasional weekend retreats providing immersive experiences combining yoga, meditation, Ayurvedic therapies, and healthy nutrition. These retreats offer an opportunity for participants to disconnect from daily stressors and reconnect with their inner selves in a tranquil and supportive environment.</li>
</ul>

<p>These services are designed to address the specific health and wellness needs of the Assam community, focusing on accessible and culturally relevant practices that resonate with our clientele. The integration of Ayurveda, yoga, and modern wellness techniques provides a comprehensive approach to well-being that is unique within the local landscape.</p>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At YOGSHAKTI, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount.  We foster a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and supported.  Our highly trained and certified instructors and practitioners are committed to providing personalized attention and guidance, ensuring a safe and effective experience for each client.  We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs and goals, and tailoring our services accordingly.  We actively engage with the local community through workshops, health fairs, and partnerships with local organizations, fostering a sense of belonging and shared well-being.</p>

<p>Our commitment to personalized service, coupled with our culturally relevant approach, ensures that every individual feels understood and empowered on their wellness journey.  This personal touch, combined with our commitment to community engagement, sets YOGSHAKTI apart as a truly unique and valuable resource within the Assam region.</p>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>YOGSHAKTI envisions becoming a leading health and wellness center in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement.  Our future plans include expanding our range of services to encompass additional holistic therapies, developing specialized programs for specific demographics (e.g., prenatal yoga, senior wellness), and strengthening our partnerships with local healthcare professionals and organizations. We aim to build a sustainable business model that contributes positively to the community''s health and economic well-being.  We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the accessibility of our services, offering online classes and consultations, and developing a robust online platform for booking and managing appointments.</p>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish YOGSHAKTI as a trusted and respected resource for holistic wellness, empowering individuals to lead healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives.  We believe that by fostering a strong sense of community and providing accessible, high-quality services, we can make a significant contribution to the overall well-being of the Assam community for years to come.</p>
```', 'House No. 51, 2nd Floor, RN Choudhury Path, opp. Bata Showroom', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7086525766', NULL, 'http://www.yogshakti.org/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:50:57.000Z'),
(208, 'Yoga Home by Priyanka', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Yoga Home by Priyanka</h1>
<p>Located at Ln 5, Yoga Home by Priyanka offers a unique and transformative yoga experience tailored to the vibrant community of Assam.  More than just a studio, Yoga Home by Priyanka is a sanctuary designed to foster physical well-being, mental clarity, and spiritual growth.  Priyanka''s deep understanding of traditional yoga practices, combined with her innovative approach to adapting them to the specific needs of the local population, sets her business apart in the burgeoning wellness sector of Assam.  This commitment to personalized attention and community engagement has quickly established Yoga Home by Priyanka as a trusted and respected name in the region.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>
<p>Yoga Home by Priyanka offers a diverse range of yoga classes catering to all levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners.  These include Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and restorative yoga styles. Each class is meticulously designed to enhance flexibility, strength, balance, and mindfulness.  Priyanka emphasizes the correct alignment and breathing techniques crucial for a safe and effective practice, helping students avoid injuries and maximize their benefits.  Beyond the regular classes, the studio also offers specialized workshops focused on specific aspects of yoga, such as pranayama (breathwork) and meditation.  These workshops provide deeper insights into yoga philosophy and its practical application in daily life.  Further differentiating Yoga Home by Priyanka is its commitment to integrating traditional Assamese elements into the practice, subtly incorporating local wisdom and cultural nuances into the yoga experience, making it uniquely relevant to the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A unique selling point is Priyanka''s personal approach.  She takes the time to understand each student''s individual needs and goals, providing personalized guidance and modifications as necessary.  This individual attention is rare in larger studios and is deeply appreciated by clients seeking a more tailored and supportive yoga journey.  Recognizing the importance of accessibility, Yoga Home by Priyanka also offers affordable class packages to ensure that yoga is accessible to a wider range of individuals within the community.  This commitment to inclusivity reflects Priyanka''s vision of making the transformative benefits of yoga available to everyone.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>
<p>At Yoga Home by Priyanka, the customer experience is paramount. The studio aims to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where students feel comfortable and empowered to explore their yoga practice.  The ambiance is designed to be serene and calming, fostering relaxation and inner peace.  This is achieved through careful attention to detail, including the use of natural light, calming music, and the incorporation of traditional Assamese art and décor, which contributes to a sense of place and belonging.  Beyond the physical space, Priyanka prioritizes building genuine connections with her students, fostering a sense of community and belonging.  She frequently organizes social events and gatherings outside of class, allowing students to connect with each other and build lasting relationships.  This approach extends beyond the studio walls, with Priyanka actively engaging with the local community through participation in local wellness events and collaborations with other businesses in the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The studio also utilizes online booking systems and communication channels to ensure a seamless and convenient experience for its clients.  This digital approach complements the personalized touch, providing a modern, efficient, yet deeply personal service.  Regular feedback mechanisms allow Priyanka to continuously improve the studio''s offerings and tailor them to the evolving needs of her clients, ensuring customer satisfaction remains a top priority.  This iterative approach underscores a dedication to continuous improvement and responsiveness to the specific needs of the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>
<p>Yoga Home by Priyanka has ambitious plans for the future.  The studio aims to expand its offerings by introducing new yoga styles and workshops, potentially incorporating specialized programs for prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and therapeutic yoga.  This expansion reflects a commitment to meeting the diverse needs of the local population.  Further growth will include potentially expanding the physical space of the studio to accommodate an increased number of students and classes. This would allow the studio to offer a greater variety of classes and potentially incorporate additional wellness services, such as massage therapy or meditation retreats.  Such expansion would solidify Yoga Home by Priyanka''s position as a leading wellness hub in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond physical expansion, Priyanka plans to increase the studio''s online presence through a dedicated website and active engagement on social media platforms.  This will enable the studio to reach a wider audience and attract new clients both locally and potentially internationally.  The long-term goal is to establish Yoga Home by Priyanka as a nationally recognized name synonymous with quality yoga instruction, community engagement, and a deep respect for traditional Assamese culture.  This would involve further strengthening the studio''s reputation through collaborations with local and national wellness organizations, participation in yoga conferences, and potentially the development of teacher training programs to further spread the benefits of yoga throughout Assam and beyond.  Priyanka''s vision is not merely about building a successful business but also about creating a positive impact on the lives of individuals and the community at large.</p>', 'Ln 5', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8075149656', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:55:12.000Z'),
(209, 'North East Yoga Meditation Centre', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>North East Yoga Meditation Centre</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at H/No: 34, Ground Floor, Link Road, Kidzee School, Mother Teresa Rd, near Anzel''s Home, the North East Yoga Meditation Centre offers a tranquil oasis for individuals seeking physical, mental, and spiritual well-being.  In a region increasingly focused on rapid development, our centre provides a vital counterpoint, offering a space for introspection, mindful movement, and stress reduction. We are committed to enriching the lives of our community by providing accessible and high-quality yoga and meditation instruction, tailored to the specific needs and preferences of the people of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique approach blends traditional yogic practices with modern techniques, making it suitable for individuals of all ages, fitness levels, and backgrounds. We recognize that the fast-paced life of modern Assam can be demanding, and our services provide a much-needed antidote to the pervasive stress and anxiety that many face. We create a supportive and welcoming environment where participants feel comfortable exploring their inner selves and fostering a sense of connection, both within themselves and with others.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our core offerings encompass a range of yoga styles, from Hatha and Vinyasa to restorative and prenatal yoga.  Each class is carefully designed to cater to different needs and experience levels, ensuring accessibility for everyone.  Beyond yoga, we offer a diverse selection of meditation practices, including mindfulness meditation, guided imagery, and transcendental meditation, enabling individuals to cultivate inner peace and manage stress effectively. We also conduct workshops and retreats focusing on specific aspects of yoga and meditation, providing deeper dives into particular practices and philosophies.</p> <br> <br>

<p>One of our key unique selling propositions is our emphasis on personalized attention. Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, committed to providing tailored guidance and support to each participant.  We take the time to understand individual needs and goals, adapting our instruction to ensure optimal benefit.  Further distinguishing us is our focus on incorporating local elements into our practices. We draw inspiration from the rich cultural heritage of Assam, weaving in elements of Assamese traditions and philosophies to create a unique and culturally relevant experience. This approach resonates deeply with our local community, fostering a stronger sense of belonging and connection.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The demand for holistic well-being solutions is growing rapidly in Assam.  Our services directly address this need by offering a practical and effective path towards stress management, improved physical health, and enhanced mental clarity.  Our flexible class schedules and various pricing options ensure accessibility for a wide range of individuals, regardless of their socioeconomic background. We strive to make yoga and meditation accessible to everyone in our community, believing that these practices offer invaluable benefits to everyone.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At the North East Yoga Meditation Centre, we prioritize creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels valued and respected.  Our instructors are known for their friendly and approachable demeanor, making newcomers feel comfortable and at ease. We foster a strong sense of community among our students, encouraging interaction and mutual support.  Regular social gatherings and events help build bonds and deepen the connections within our community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to personalized attention extends beyond the classroom. We offer individual consultations to assist participants in designing personalized practice plans that meet their specific needs and goals.  We also maintain open communication channels, readily addressing any questions or concerns our clients may have. This personalized, attentive approach distinguishes us from larger, impersonal studios and creates a loyal and engaged client base. We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local businesses, participation in community events, and offering subsidized classes to underprivileged groups.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Our vision is to establish the North East Yoga Meditation Centre as a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam. We plan to expand our offerings to include additional yoga styles, workshops, and retreats. We also aim to increase our outreach to the wider community by partnering with local schools, businesses, and organizations to promote the benefits of yoga and meditation. We envision developing teacher training programs to cultivate a new generation of yoga and meditation instructors within Assam, ensuring the continued growth and dissemination of these beneficial practices.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Further plans include the development of a dedicated online platform offering virtual classes and resources, expanding our reach beyond our physical location. We are exploring opportunities to integrate traditional Assamese healing practices with our yoga and meditation offerings, creating a truly unique and culturally integrated wellness experience.  Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving centre that positively impacts the lives of countless individuals, contributing to the overall health and well-being of the Assam community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Through consistent dedication to quality instruction, exceptional customer service, and a strong commitment to community engagement, the North East Yoga Meditation Centre is poised for significant growth and continued success. We are confident in our ability to fulfill our vision of becoming a cornerstone of holistic wellness in the region, fostering a healthier, happier, and more mindful community in Assam.</p>', 'H/No: 34, Ground Floor, Link Road, Kidzee School, Mother Teresa Rd, near Anzel''s Home', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8135828417', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:55:20.000Z'),
(210, 'Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam at 5QP7+446, Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness offers a unique sanctuary for physical, mental, and spiritual well-being.  We are committed to providing high-quality yoga and wellness services tailored to the specific needs and cultural context of the local community.  Our approach integrates traditional yogic principles with modern wellness practices, creating a holistic experience that resonates deeply with the Assam ethos.  We distinguish ourselves not only through our diverse offerings but also through our genuine dedication to fostering a supportive and nurturing environment for our clients.  This commitment, combined with our expert instructors and personalized approach, makes Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness a valuable asset to the growing wellness landscape of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p><b>Core Services and Products:</b>  Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness provides a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse needs and experience levels. Our core offerings include various styles of yoga, from gentle Hatha and restorative yoga for beginners to more challenging Vinyasa and Ashtanga flows for experienced practitioners. We also offer specialized classes focusing on specific needs, such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and therapeutic yoga for individuals managing stress or chronic pain.  Beyond yoga, we incorporate mindfulness meditation, breathing exercises (pranayama), and wellness workshops covering topics such as stress management, healthy eating, and Ayurveda. We pride ourselves on offering small class sizes, ensuring individualized attention and a personalized approach.  This allows our instructors to provide modifications and adjustments as needed, maximizing the benefits for each participant.  A unique selling point is our integration of Assamese cultural elements into some of our classes, incorporating local music and traditional practices to enhance the experience and connect deeply with the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our workshops focus on practical application, equipping participants with tools and techniques they can readily incorporate into their daily lives. For example, our stress management workshops incorporate techniques specifically adapted to the everyday challenges faced by individuals in the region, combining ancient wisdom with modern coping strategies. Our commitment to using locally sourced, organic products for our wellness offerings also further underscores our commitment to the local community and sustainable practices.  This focus on locally sourced materials in our workshops and any associated products underscores our dedication to supporting local businesses and reducing our environmental impact.</p> <br> <br>

<p><b>Customer Experience:</b> At Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness, we believe that creating a positive and welcoming environment is paramount.  We prioritize building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their individual goals and aspirations, and tailoring our services accordingly.   Our friendly and knowledgeable instructors create a supportive and non-judgmental atmosphere, ensuring that all individuals feel comfortable and confident in their practice, regardless of their experience level or physical abilities.  We encourage open communication and feedback, constantly striving to improve and enhance our services based on client input.  We actively participate in local community events, offering free introductory yoga sessions and wellness workshops to introduce the benefits of yoga and mindfulness to a wider audience. We also collaborate with local businesses and organizations, further strengthening our ties within the community and promoting overall well-being.  This commitment to community engagement distinguishes us, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose among our clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p><b>Future Vision:</b>  Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness envisions a future where we become a leading wellness center in Assam, providing comprehensive and accessible services to a broader demographic.  We plan to expand our range of services to include additional wellness modalities, such as aromatherapy, massage therapy, and traditional Assamese healing practices. We also aim to increase our community outreach programs, offering subsidized or free classes to underserved populations.  A key strategic goal is the establishment of teacher training programs, nurturing local talent and creating a sustainable network of yoga and wellness professionals within Assam.  We foresee developing partnerships with local healthcare providers to integrate yoga and mindfulness into preventative healthcare initiatives, promoting holistic well-being within the community. We are also exploring the possibility of developing an online platform to offer virtual classes and resources, making our services accessible to a wider geographical area.  Our ultimate aim is to become a beacon of holistic wellness in Assam, empowering individuals to lead healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness is more than just a business; it’s a commitment to the well-being of the Assam community. We are dedicated to fostering a culture of wellness, promoting both individual growth and communal harmony through the practice of yoga and mindful living. We invite you to experience the transformative power of Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness.</p>', '5QP7+446', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9101589679', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:55:28.000Z'),
(211, 'AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub</h1>

<p>Nestled at House No. 01, (1st floor) Nilgiri Path, RG Baruah Rd, near Doordarshan Kendra, behind Blue Dart Express, AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub stands as a beacon of wellness in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a holistic sanctuary designed to nurture the mind, body, and spirit of the community.  In a region increasingly recognizing the importance of preventative healthcare and mindful living, AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub offers a unique and comprehensive approach to wellness, filling a significant gap in the local market by providing a dedicated space for holistic self-care and personal growth.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence is reflected in our meticulously curated range of services. We offer a diverse selection of yoga classes catering to all levels, from beginner-friendly Hatha and Vinyasa flows to more advanced Ashtanga and Yin styles.  Our experienced and certified instructors are deeply passionate about yoga and its transformative power.  Beyond traditional yoga practices, we also provide specialized workshops focusing on pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga nidra (yogic sleep), all designed to alleviate stress, enhance mental clarity, and promote overall well-being. In addition, we incorporate ancient Ayurvedic principles into our offerings, providing personalized consultations and guidance on diet and lifestyle choices to support individual health goals.  Our unique selling proposition lies in the careful blending of these ancient practices with a modern, accessible approach, ensuring that the benefits of holistic wellness are available to everyone in the community, regardless of their prior experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub, we believe that a truly transformative experience begins with exceptional customer service.  We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable, respected, and supported on their wellness journey.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to answer questions, provide guidance, and assist in creating a personalized wellness plan.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and the sponsorship of local initiatives promoting health and well-being.  We regularly host free introductory sessions and workshops to make yoga and holistic wellness accessible to those who may not have considered it before, demonstrating our commitment to enriching the lives of individuals and fostering a stronger, healthier community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our vision for the future extends beyond simply providing excellent services. We plan to expand our offerings to include a wider range of holistic therapies such as aromatherapy, sound healing, and traditional massage techniques. We are also exploring the possibility of establishing partnerships with local health professionals to offer integrated wellness programs that combine the benefits of yoga and other complementary therapies.  This expansion will further strengthen our position as a leading holistic wellness center in Guwahati, catering to the evolving needs of the community and attracting a wider clientele.  Our long-term goal is to establish AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub as a recognized center of excellence in holistic wellness, contributing significantly to the health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The location of AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub near Doordarshan Kendra and Blue Dart Express provides excellent visibility and accessibility.  Our commitment to providing a clean, comfortable, and inspiring space further enhances the overall customer experience.  We utilize high-quality yoga equipment and maintain the highest standards of hygiene to ensure a safe and enjoyable environment for all. Our carefully designed schedule ensures flexible class timings to accommodate busy lifestyles, and we offer both individual and group packages to make our services accessible to a wide range of budgets.  The continued success of AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub is driven by our dedication to our students and community, our commitment to providing the highest quality services, and our unwavering passion for holistic wellness.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub represents a significant contribution to the growing health and wellness sector in Assam.  Our unique blend of traditional yoga practices, modern approaches, and a deep commitment to customer service positions us for continued success and expansion. We are not just a business; we are a community hub dedicated to promoting a holistic and balanced lifestyle for all.  We invite you to experience the transformative power of AK YOGA Centre & Holistic Hub and embark on your journey towards a healthier, happier you.</p>', 'House No.01,(1st floor) Nilgiri Path, RG Baruah Rd, near Doordarshan Kendra, behind Blue Dart Express', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002953235', NULL, 'http://akyogacentre.blogspot.com/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:55:35.000Z'),
(212, 'Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre</h1>

<p>Nestled near Adarsh High School in New, Assam, Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre offers a holistic approach to wellness, integrating the ancient wisdom of yoga and naturopathy with modern therapeutic practices.  We strive to be a leading provider of accessible and effective natural health solutions within the local community, addressing the growing demand for preventative healthcare and alternative therapies in Assam.  Our unique blend of traditional and contemporary methods sets us apart, offering a personalized and results-oriented experience for our clients.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to authenticity and personalized care forms the foundation of our practice. We recognize that individual needs vary significantly, and therefore, we tailor our programs to address specific health goals and challenges. This personalized approach ensures that each client receives the appropriate level of guidance and support to achieve optimal well-being.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre provides a comprehensive range of services designed to promote physical, mental, and emotional health.  Our core offerings include personalized yoga therapy sessions catering to various fitness levels and health conditions. These sessions are meticulously designed to address specific needs, whether it''s improving flexibility, managing stress, or recovering from injuries. We also incorporate pranayama (breathing techniques) and meditation practices to enhance overall well-being.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our naturopathy services encompass a variety of natural therapies, including herbal remedies, dietary counseling, and lifestyle modifications.  Our qualified naturopaths work closely with clients to identify underlying causes of imbalances and create customized treatment plans focusing on detoxification, improved digestion, and enhanced immunity. We emphasize the use of locally sourced, organic ingredients wherever possible, reflecting our commitment to sustainability and supporting local farmers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A unique selling point of Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre is our integration of yoga and naturopathy.  This synergistic approach allows us to address health concerns holistically, combining the physical benefits of yoga with the natural healing properties of naturopathy for enhanced efficacy.  We also offer workshops and seminars on topics such as stress management, healthy eating, and mindful living, empowering individuals to take control of their health and well-being.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The services offered directly address the increasing demand for alternative and complementary healthcare in Assam.  Many individuals are seeking natural and holistic approaches to managing chronic conditions, improving their mental health, and enhancing their overall quality of life.  Our centre provides a safe, supportive, and accessible environment for individuals to explore these options.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre, we prioritize a warm, welcoming, and personalized approach to customer service.  Our highly qualified and experienced practitioners are dedicated to providing compassionate care and building trusting relationships with each client.  We believe that open communication and a collaborative approach are essential to achieving optimal health outcomes.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We differentiate ourselves by offering a tranquil and serene environment conducive to relaxation and healing.  Our centre is designed to create a peaceful and calming atmosphere, allowing clients to escape the stresses of daily life and fully immerse themselves in their healing journey. We also maintain a strong emphasis on privacy and confidentiality, ensuring our clients feel safe and comfortable sharing their health concerns.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Connecting with the local community is central to our mission. We participate in local health fairs and wellness events, offering free consultations and educational materials.  We also collaborate with local organizations to provide yoga and naturopathy services to underserved populations.  Our aim is to become an integral part of the community, promoting health and well-being for all.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre envisions expanding its services to include advanced yoga and naturopathy therapies, such as Ayurvedic treatments and specialized workshops on specific health conditions.  We plan to invest in advanced technology and training to enhance our capabilities and offer even more comprehensive care.  We are also exploring collaborations with local healthcare providers to integrate our services into mainstream healthcare systems.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre as a leading wellness destination in Assam, known for its high-quality services, compassionate care, and commitment to community well-being.  We aim to continue expanding our reach and impact, making holistic healthcare more accessible and affordable to a wider population. We believe that by combining ancient wisdom with modern practices, we can create a sustainable and thriving wellness community in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are dedicated to continuous improvement and innovation, striving to stay at the forefront of holistic health practices. Our commitment to excellence ensures that Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre remains a valuable resource for individuals seeking natural and effective pathways to achieve optimal health and well-being.</p>', 'Adarsh High School, Near, New', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T11:55:43.000Z'),
(213, 'Saif Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Saif Yoga Studio: Cultivating Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Rabha Bhawan, Bank of India Building, Saif Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of tranquility and well-being within the vibrant Assamese landscape.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub fostering physical health, mental clarity, and spiritual growth. Our unique approach blends traditional yogic practices with modern wellness techniques, catering to the specific needs and preferences of the Guwahati community.  We are committed to providing an accessible and inclusive space where individuals of all ages, backgrounds, and experience levels can discover the transformative power of yoga.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to authenticity and quality distinguishes Saif Yoga Studio within the growing wellness sector of Assam. We recognize the increasing demand for holistic wellness solutions and aim to fill this need by providing expert-led classes, personalized attention, and a supportive environment that fosters personal growth.  Our location, within the easily accessible Bank of India Building, ensures convenient access for individuals across Guwahati.  We believe in providing a space where individuals can escape the daily stresses of urban life and reconnect with their inner selves.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Saif Yoga Studio offers a diverse range of yoga classes to cater to various needs and fitness levels.  Our offerings include Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Flow, Ashtanga Yoga, and restorative yoga sessions, ensuring there is a practice suitable for every individual.  We also incorporate mindfulness and meditation techniques into many of our classes, emphasizing the holistic benefits of yogic practices.  Beyond group classes, we provide personalized yoga instruction for individuals seeking more tailored support. This includes one-on-one sessions designed to address specific health concerns or fitness goals.  We also regularly host workshops covering advanced yoga techniques, anatomy and physiology relevant to yoga, and pranayama (breathwork) practices.  This comprehensive approach distinguishes us as a center for serious yoga practitioners and those simply seeking a path to improved well-being.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling point lies in our dedication to individualized instruction and community building.  Unlike larger studios, we prioritize smaller class sizes to allow for personalized attention and adjustments, ensuring that each student receives the support they need to achieve their goals safely and effectively.  We also actively foster a sense of community by hosting regular events, workshops, and social gatherings, creating a supportive environment where students can connect with each other and build lasting relationships.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Saif Yoga Studio, we believe that customer experience is paramount. Our team of highly qualified and experienced yoga instructors are not only proficient in their respective styles of yoga but are also compassionate and dedicated to helping our students achieve their personal best. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where students feel comfortable, supported, and respected.  Our studio is designed to be aesthetically pleasing and calming, providing a tranquil escape from the bustling city. We offer a range of amenities to enhance the customer experience, such as comfortable mats, clean changing rooms, and refreshing beverages.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local businesses and organizations. We offer discounted rates to students and senior citizens, ensuring yoga is accessible to a broad demographic.  By hosting workshops open to the public on health and wellness related topics, we contribute to the overall well-being of the community.  This commitment to community engagement strengthens our connection with our clients and makes Saif Yoga Studio an integral part of the Guwahati landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Saif Yoga Studio envisions a future where we become a leading wellness center in Guwahati, providing comprehensive yoga and wellness programs to a wider audience. We plan to expand our range of services to include yoga therapy, specialized workshops focusing on specific needs (e.g., prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors), and potentially incorporating other complementary wellness modalities such as Ayurveda or meditation retreats. We also aim to increase our community outreach by collaborating with schools, hospitals, and corporate organizations to promote the benefits of yoga and wellness.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that positively impacts the lives of our students and the wider Guwahati community.  We are committed to continuous improvement, investing in our instructors'' professional development and expanding our facilities to meet the growing demand.  We aspire to create a lasting legacy of well-being and self-discovery, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives.  By staying true to our core values of authenticity, community, and excellence, we are confident in our ability to achieve these ambitious yet attainable goals.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We believe Saif Yoga Studio will not only meet the current demand for holistic well-being in Guwahati but also play a pivotal role in shaping the future of wellness within the region. We are enthusiastic about the potential for growth and the opportunity to contribute to the health and happiness of the community we serve.</p>', 'Rabha Bhawan, Bank of India Building', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, 'https://saifyogastudio.com/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:00:11.000Z'),
(214, 'Ritual Wellness Centre', 'Pilates studio', NULL, '<h1>Ritual Wellness Centre: Redefining Wellbeing in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nestled on the 5th Floor of Nikita Pinnacle, adjacent to Bank Of Baroda and opposite Taj Vivanta in Guwahati, Assam, Ritual Wellness Centre stands as a beacon of holistic wellbeing, offering a unique and comprehensive approach to health and wellness tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community.  We are not merely a spa or wellness center; we are a sanctuary dedicated to nurturing the mind, body, and spirit, fostering a deeper connection between individuals and their inner selves.  Our establishment represents a significant addition to Guwahati''s burgeoning wellness landscape, providing a much-needed haven for those seeking respite and rejuvenation in a fast-paced world.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Unlike many generic wellness centers, Ritual Wellness Centre distinguishes itself through its curated approach to treatments and services. We offer a meticulously crafted menu of therapies, integrating traditional Ayurvedic practices with contemporary wellness techniques. Our primary offerings include personalized Ayurvedic consultations and treatments, tailored to individual constitution (Prakriti) and health needs. This involves a detailed assessment followed by customized massage therapies, herbal remedies, and dietary recommendations.  Beyond Ayurveda, we also provide a wide array of services such as yoga and meditation sessions, stress management workshops, and specialized beauty treatments using natural and organic products.  The unique selling point lies in our holistic approach, focusing on preventative care and sustainable wellbeing, rather than simply addressing immediate symptoms.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to serving the local market extends beyond simply offering services. We source many of our ingredients locally, supporting Assamese farmers and businesses.  Furthermore, we have designed our treatment packages to be accessible to a wide range of individuals, catering to diverse budgets and preferences. We understand the importance of affordability and accessibility in making wellness a reality for everyone in our community.  Recognizing the cultural nuances of Assam, we have incorporated elements of local traditions and practices into our services, creating a truly authentic and culturally relevant wellness experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Ritual Wellness Centre, customer experience is paramount. We believe that true wellbeing begins with a nurturing and compassionate environment.  From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and personalized attention. Our therapists are highly skilled and experienced professionals who are deeply passionate about their craft.  They are committed not only to providing exceptional treatments but also to building a genuine connection with each client, fostering a sense of trust and understanding. We prioritize clear communication, ensuring clients are fully informed about the treatments and their potential benefits. Regular feedback mechanisms allow us to continuously improve and adapt our services to meet the evolving needs of our community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to the community extends beyond our clients. We actively engage in local outreach programs, conducting workshops and seminars on health and wellness topics, free of charge or at subsidized rates for underprivileged communities.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and fostering a culture of health and wellbeing for all. We also collaborate with local businesses and organizations to promote healthy lifestyles and advocate for holistic wellbeing within the wider Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Ritual Wellness Centre is ambitious yet grounded in our commitment to excellence.  We plan to expand our range of services, incorporating new and innovative therapies while maintaining our focus on holistic wellbeing.  This might include the introduction of specialized wellness retreats, expanding our team of experts, and developing online resources to make our services more accessible.  We aim to establish Ritual Wellness Centre as a leading wellness destination in Northeast India, attracting clients from across the region and beyond.  Our long-term goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes not only to the economic growth of Guwahati but also to the overall wellbeing of the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Growth will be driven by a combination of strategic marketing, cultivating strong relationships with local businesses and healthcare professionals, and continually investing in the professional development of our team. We plan to leverage technology to enhance our customer experience, through online booking systems, personalized communication channels, and the development of a mobile application.  We are committed to remaining at the forefront of wellness innovation, adapting and expanding our offerings to meet the changing needs of our clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, Ritual Wellness Centre represents a significant investment in the health and wellbeing of the Guwahati community. We are confident that our unique approach, combined with our unwavering commitment to excellence, will establish us as a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam.  We invite you to experience the transformative power of Ritual Wellness Centre and embark on a journey towards a healthier, happier, and more fulfilling life.</p>', '5th Floor, Nikita Pinnacle, adjacent to Bank Of Baroda, opp. Taj Vivanta', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8099245027', NULL, 'http://www.ritualcentre.com/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:00:19.000Z'),
(215, 'Yooj Wellness', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Yooj Wellness: Nurturing Well-being in the Heart of Assam</h1>

<p>Nestled in the tranquil setting of House No-6, Adarshapur path, near the Forensic Science Laboratory, Yooj Wellness stands as a beacon of holistic well-being in the vibrant landscape of Assam.  We are more than just a wellness center; we are a community hub dedicated to empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. Our unique approach blends traditional Assamese wellness practices with modern therapeutic techniques, creating a truly personalized and effective experience for our clients.  We recognize the specific needs of the local community and strive to provide accessible and culturally sensitive services that resonate deeply with our clientele.  Yooj Wellness is committed to becoming a leading provider of comprehensive wellness solutions in the region, fostering a culture of health and vitality.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>At Yooj Wellness, we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to address the diverse needs of our clients.  Our core offerings include personalized yoga and meditation programs tailored to individual fitness levels and health goals. These programs incorporate traditional Asanas and Pranayama techniques, adapting them for both beginners and experienced practitioners. We also provide specialized Ayurvedic consultations and treatments, harnessing the wisdom of this ancient Indian system of medicine to promote overall well-being and address specific health concerns.  Our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners work closely with each client to create individualized treatment plans focused on restoring balance and promoting natural healing.  </p> <br> <br>

<p>In addition to these core services, Yooj Wellness offers a selection of high-quality, ethically sourced wellness products, including herbal teas, essential oils, and natural skincare products, all carefully selected to promote holistic health and well-being.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to personalized care. We don’t offer one-size-fits-all solutions; instead, we carefully assess each individual''s needs and preferences before developing a bespoke wellness plan. This personalized approach, coupled with our deep understanding of local culture and health priorities, sets us apart from other wellness centers in the region. We strive to address the growing demand for accessible and culturally sensitive wellness solutions in Assam, recognizing the unique health challenges and opportunities within our community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At the heart of Yooj Wellness lies a commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience.  We believe that a supportive and nurturing environment is crucial for achieving optimal wellness results. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where clients feel comfortable and supported throughout their wellness journey.  We prioritize open communication and build strong, trusting relationships with our clients, ensuring they feel heard and understood. We actively gather feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure we meet the evolving needs of our community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond individual client interactions, Yooj Wellness actively engages with the local community.  We regularly host workshops and educational events to promote health awareness and provide practical tools for self-care.  We collaborate with local organizations and community leaders to address specific health challenges within our region.  By fostering a sense of community and connection, we aim to create a ripple effect of positive change, promoting a culture of wellness that extends beyond the walls of our center. We believe in building relationships based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect – principles that form the cornerstone of our customer interactions and community engagement.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Yooj Wellness envisions a future where holistic wellness is accessible to everyone in the Assam region.  We plan to expand our services to include additional therapeutic modalities, such as massage therapy and nutritional counseling, to cater to a wider range of client needs.  We are also exploring opportunities to expand our reach through online platforms, offering remote consultations and online wellness programs to reach individuals beyond our immediate geographic area. This will allow us to extend our impact on a larger scale, impacting a wider community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, we aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations to create a robust network of support for holistic well-being in Assam.  We are committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring they remain at the forefront of wellness practices and are equipped to provide the highest quality care.  Our long-term goal is to establish Yooj Wellness as a nationally recognized leader in holistic wellness, setting a new standard for accessible and culturally sensitive healthcare in Assam and beyond.  We believe that our unique blend of traditional and modern approaches, coupled with our unwavering commitment to personalized care and community engagement, positions us for significant growth and lasting impact.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, Yooj Wellness is more than just a business; it is a commitment to fostering a healthier, happier, and more vibrant community in Assam.  We are proud to be a part of this dynamic region and look forward to continuing our journey of promoting holistic well-being for all.</p>', 'House No-6, Adarshapur path, near Forensic Science Laboratory', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822029969', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:00:27.000Z'),
(216, 'Sthira Shakti Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Sthira Shakti Yoga Studio: Cultivating Inner Strength in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Sthira Shakti Yoga Studio, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of traditional and contemporary yoga practices designed to empower individuals physically, mentally, and spiritually.  We stand apart in the vibrant Assamese wellness landscape by focusing on a holistic approach to yoga, catering to the specific needs and preferences of the local community. Our commitment to accessible, high-quality instruction, combined with a strong emphasis on community building, distinguishes us as a leading yoga destination in the region. <br> <br>

Our studio recognizes the growing demand for mindful wellness practices in Guwahati.  The fast-paced nature of modern life, coupled with the unique cultural context of Assam, necessitates a yoga approach that is both effective and culturally sensitive. We aim to provide a sanctuary where individuals can find respite from daily stressors and cultivate inner strength and resilience, contributing positively to their overall well-being and integration into their community. <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Sthira Shakti Yoga Studio offers a diverse range of yoga classes designed to meet the varying needs and levels of experience of our students.  We provide foundational Hatha yoga classes for beginners, building a strong base in fundamental postures and breathing techniques.  For those seeking a more dynamic practice, we offer Vinyasa flow classes, which emphasize movement and breath synchronization. We also incorporate elements of Ashtanga, Yin, and Restorative yoga into our class schedule, catering to a wider range of preferences and physical abilities.  <br> <br>

Our unique selling proposition lies in our specialized workshops and retreats. These focus on specific themes relevant to the Assamese culture and climate, such as yoga for stress management, improving flexibility and posture common in the local population and mindfulness techniques for navigating busy lifestyles.  We also offer personalized yoga therapy sessions tailored to individual needs, guided by experienced and certified instructors. These sessions incorporate aspects of traditional Ayurvedic principles alongside modern yoga techniques to provide holistic support for our students'' well-being.  Our classes are designed to not only improve physical fitness but also to foster a deep sense of self-awareness and inner peace.  We emphasize the importance of mindful movement, proper alignment, and the connection between breath and body, ensuring students experience yoga’s transformative benefits safely and effectively.  <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Sthira Shakti, customer experience is central to our philosophy. We foster a welcoming and inclusive environment where students of all backgrounds and levels feel comfortable and supported.  Our instructors are highly qualified and passionate about sharing their knowledge and expertise in a clear, compassionate, and accessible manner.  We prioritize building a strong sense of community within the studio, organizing social gatherings and workshops that encourage interaction and networking among students.  <br> <br>

Our commitment to local community engagement extends beyond the studio walls. We partner with local organizations to offer yoga classes to underprivileged communities and conduct workshops on the benefits of yoga and mindfulness in schools and colleges.  This approach strengthens our connection with the Assamese community, allowing us to contribute to the overall well-being of our region while fulfilling our social responsibility. We actively seek feedback from our students to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet their evolving needs.  Through regular surveys, informal conversations, and social media engagement, we ensure that our studio remains responsive to the needs of the community we serve.  <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Sthira Shakti Yoga Studio envisions becoming a leading wellness center in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our offerings by incorporating additional wellness modalities, such as meditation, pranayama workshops, and Ayurveda consultations, to provide a comprehensive approach to holistic well-being.  We also aim to grow our team by recruiting qualified and experienced yoga instructors, further enhancing the quality and diversity of our classes and workshops.  <br> <br>

Our long-term goals include establishing a yoga teacher training program to cultivate the next generation of yoga instructors in Assam.  This will contribute significantly to promoting yoga education within the state and create opportunities for local individuals to pursue a career in the wellness industry. We also aspire to develop a retreat center outside of the city, providing a tranquil setting for longer retreats and workshops, allowing us to further cater to the growing demand for immersive yoga experiences. Our commitment to sustainable and ethical practices will guide all aspects of our growth. We plan to implement eco-friendly measures within the studio and collaborate with local businesses and organizations that share our values.  By nurturing our local community, promoting holistic wellness, and fostering a sustainable approach to growth, Sthira Shakti Yoga Studio aims to establish itself as a cornerstone of health and well-being in the heart of Assam for years to come. <br> <br>
</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638399431', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:00:35.000Z'),
(217, 'Studio Groom Up', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Studio Groom Up: Elevating Grooming Standards in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Studio Groom Up, located at Abhijeet Path, Sachal Path, near Rahman Hospitals in Guwahati, Assam, represents a significant advancement in men''s grooming services within the region.  We offer a sophisticated and personalized experience that caters to the discerning gentleman, combining traditional barbering techniques with contemporary style and advanced grooming practices.  Our establishment transcends the typical barbershop, providing a haven of relaxation and rejuvenation where clients can escape the everyday and emerge feeling refreshed, confident, and revitalized.  We distinguish ourselves through our meticulous attention to detail, commitment to client satisfaction, and dedication to fostering a strong connection with the local community. <br> <br></p>


<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Studio Groom Up provides a comprehensive range of grooming services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele.  Our offerings extend beyond the traditional haircut, encompassing a meticulous selection of services designed to enhance both appearance and well-being.  These include classic haircuts and styling for all hair types, precision beard trimming and shaping, hot towel shaves offering a luxurious and relaxing experience, and specialized treatments such as scalp massages and hair conditioning.  We also offer a curated selection of premium grooming products, from high-quality beard oils and balms to styling gels and pomades, all carefully chosen for their efficacy and superior quality. <br> <br></p>

<p>A key differentiator for Studio Groom Up lies in our unwavering commitment to personalization.  Our skilled barbers undergo rigorous training to stay abreast of the latest trends and techniques, allowing them to tailor each service to the individual client''s unique features, preferences, and style.  This personalized approach ensures that every client leaves feeling not only well-groomed, but also confident and comfortable in their appearance.  We understand that the needs of our clients may vary, and we strive to cater to all preferences, whether they seek a classic, contemporary, or avant-garde style.  In a region where traditional barbering remains prominent, we bridge the gap between classic techniques and modern trends, attracting clients who appreciate both tradition and innovation.  Our commitment to using only high-quality products complements this dedication to excellence, ensuring clients receive the best possible care and results.<br> <br></p>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Studio Groom Up, client satisfaction is paramount. We believe that a superior grooming experience extends far beyond the technical skills of our barbers; it involves creating a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere that fosters a sense of comfort and well-being.  Our clean, modern, and stylish space is designed to promote relaxation, allowing clients to unwind and enjoy the pampering experience.  We strive to build genuine rapport with each client, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences before beginning any service.  Open communication and a personalized approach are at the heart of our customer service philosophy.  We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure we meet the evolving needs of our community. <br> <br></p>

<p>Beyond exceptional service, we cultivate a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives.  We actively participate in local events and collaborations, fostering relationships with other businesses and members of the Guwahati community.  This commitment to community engagement extends to our support of local charities and causes, reflecting our belief in giving back to the city that supports our business.  Our aim is to be more than just a grooming establishment; we strive to become an integral part of the Guwahati landscape, contributing positively to the overall community fabric. We understand the importance of building trust and loyalty with our clients, recognizing that repeat business is a testament to our commitment to excellence. <br> <br></p>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Studio Groom Up envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond. We plan to further develop our service offerings, potentially incorporating additional specialized treatments and incorporating the latest technologies in the grooming industry.  We are committed to expanding our team of skilled barbers, ensuring we can meet the growing demand for our services.  This expansion will be accompanied by ongoing training and professional development for our staff, guaranteeing they remain at the forefront of industry trends and techniques. <br> <br></p>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Studio Groom Up as the premier men''s grooming destination in Guwahati, synonymous with exceptional quality, personalized service, and a commitment to community engagement.  We aim to become a recognized brand, known for its exceptional standards and its dedication to providing a truly exceptional client experience.  We will achieve this through strategic marketing and promotional initiatives, carefully targeted to reach our desired clientele while continuing to prioritize building strong relationships with our existing client base.  We are committed to investing in the future, embracing innovation, and adapting to the ever-evolving needs of our customers, ensuring that Studio Groom Up remains a cornerstone of the Guwahati grooming landscape for years to come. <br> <br></p>

<p>We believe that our focus on personalization, community engagement, and a commitment to excellence will not only ensure our continued success, but also solidify our position as a leader in the men’s grooming sector in Guwahati.  Studio Groom Up is more than just a barbershop; it''s an experience, a testament to our dedication to providing a superior level of service and creating a positive impact on the community. <br> <br></p>', 'Abhijeet Path, Sachal Path, near Rahman Hospitals', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:00:44.000Z'),
(218, 'Ark Yoga and Wellness (offline & online sessions) Yoga Studio and School', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Ark Yoga and Wellness: Cultivating Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Ark Yoga and Wellness, located at Ashi Grand, Kahilipara Main Rd, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of holistic well-being in the heart of the city.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a comprehensive wellness center offering a unique blend of offline and online yoga classes, teacher training programs, and specialized workshops designed to meet the diverse needs of the vibrant Assamese community.  Our approach integrates ancient yogic practices with modern wellness principles, providing a supportive and transformative experience for individuals seeking physical, mental, and spiritual growth.  In a region increasingly focused on fast-paced lifestyles, Ark Yoga and Wellness offers a sanctuary of calm and a pathway towards a more balanced and fulfilling life.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence sets us apart in the local landscape. We recognize the growing demand for accessible and high-quality wellness services in Guwahati. The increasing awareness of the benefits of yoga and mindfulness has created a significant market for practitioners offering authentic and effective instruction. Ark Yoga and Wellness caters to this demand by providing a diverse range of services tailored to various skill levels and interests.  We understand that individual needs differ; therefore, our offerings span from beginner-friendly Hatha yoga to more advanced styles like Ashtanga and Vinyasa, ensuring inclusivity and accessibility to a broad spectrum of the community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our core offerings include a comprehensive schedule of offline yoga classes held at our beautifully appointed studio in Ashi Grand.  These classes are designed to cater to various experience levels and preferences.  In addition to our offline classes, we also offer a selection of online yoga sessions, enabling individuals across Assam and beyond to participate in our programs regardless of geographical limitations. This innovative approach expands our reach and caters to busy professionals or individuals with scheduling constraints.   We pride ourselves on our experienced and certified instructors who are passionate about sharing their knowledge and expertise. They create a welcoming and supportive environment conducive to learning and personal growth.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond our regular classes, we conduct specialized workshops focusing on specific aspects of yoga and wellness, such as meditation, pranayama (breathwork), and yoga philosophy.  Furthermore, we offer comprehensive yoga teacher training programs, designed to equip aspiring teachers with the necessary knowledge and skills to lead their own classes and inspire others.  This program not only contributes to the growth of the yoga community in Assam but also provides a valuable career opportunity for those passionate about the practice. Our unique selling point lies in our comprehensive approach, blending traditional yoga methods with modern wellness techniques to create a truly holistic experience for our clients.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Ark Yoga and Wellness, we are deeply committed to providing an exceptional customer experience. We believe that building a strong and trusting relationship with our clients is paramount to their success in their yoga journey.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to creating a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable exploring their potential.  We offer personalized guidance and support, helping clients set realistic goals and achieve their desired outcomes.  Our studio is designed with comfort and serenity in mind, providing a peaceful retreat from the stresses of daily life.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations.  We organize free community yoga sessions, workshops, and wellness events to promote the benefits of yoga and mindfulness to a wider audience.  We also actively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure they meet the evolving needs of our community.  Our dedication to community engagement not only fosters a sense of belonging among our clients, but also strengthens our position as a leading wellness center in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Ark Yoga and Wellness has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We aim to establish ourselves as a leading yoga and wellness destination in Assam, renowned for our exceptional quality of instruction, supportive community, and holistic approach to well-being.  We envision expanding our offerings to include a broader range of wellness services, such as Ayurveda consultations, nutritional guidance, and other complementary therapies, further solidifying our position as a comprehensive wellness center. This expansion will allow us to cater to a wider range of needs and contribute to the overall well-being of the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We also plan to expand our online platform, developing advanced digital resources and interactive content to reach a wider audience across India and internationally.  This includes creating online courses, workshops, and membership programs that allow for greater flexibility and accessibility.  We envision a future where Ark Yoga and Wellness becomes a recognized leader in online yoga education, providing high-quality instruction to individuals worldwide.  Our long-term goal is to create a lasting legacy, empowering individuals to cultivate inner peace, enhance their well-being, and live more fulfilling lives.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Ark Yoga and Wellness is committed to fostering a culture of well-being in Assam and beyond. We believe that yoga and mindfulness are powerful tools for personal transformation, and we are dedicated to sharing these benefits with as many people as possible. Our journey is one of continuous growth and evolution, always striving to provide exceptional service, meet the evolving needs of our community, and contribute to the creation of a healthier, happier, and more balanced world.</p>', 'Ark Yoga Wellness, Ashi Grand, Kahilipara Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, 'http://www.arkyogawellness.in/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:05:11.000Z'),
(219, 'Lotus Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Lotus Yoga Studio: Finding Harmony in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nestled at House No. 2, near the Forensic Science Laboratory in Guwahati, Assam, Lotus Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of tranquility and well-being amidst the bustling city life.  We are not just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to promoting physical and mental wellness through the ancient practice of yoga and mindfulness.  Our unique approach blends traditional yogic principles with a contemporary understanding of individual needs, creating a transformative experience for every student, regardless of their experience level.  In the vibrant and growing wellness sector of Assam, Lotus Yoga Studio distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized instruction, community engagement, and a serene learning environment.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around a diverse range of yoga styles tailored to meet the specific needs of the local community.  From the invigorating flow of Vinyasa to the restorative calm of Yin Yoga, we offer classes for all levels, from beginners seeking to improve flexibility and strength to experienced practitioners looking to deepen their practice.  Our signature offering, a unique blend of Hatha and Ashtanga Yoga incorporating elements of traditional Assamese movements, reflects our commitment to integrating local culture with global wellness practices.  This unique class resonates deeply with the local community, providing a sense of familiarity and cultural pride within the yoga practice.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on prenatal yoga, yoga for back pain relief, and meditation techniques. These workshops are designed to address common health concerns within our community and offer effective, holistic solutions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Lotus Yoga Studio, we believe that the customer experience is paramount.  We strive to cultivate a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every individual feels comfortable and supported. Our highly qualified and experienced instructors are not only skilled yoga practitioners but also compassionate guides, dedicated to providing personalized attention and modifications to suit individual needs and limitations.  Beyond the mat, we foster a strong sense of community through social events, workshops, and regular community outreach programs.  We collaborate with local organizations to promote wellness initiatives and offer discounted classes to underprivileged groups, actively contributing to the well-being of the wider Guwahati community.  Our commitment to building relationships goes beyond simple transactions; it’s about nurturing a supportive network where individuals can connect, grow, and thrive together.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our vision for Lotus Yoga Studio extends far beyond its current location. We envision becoming a leading wellness center in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional yoga instruction, strong community ties, and commitment to holistic well-being.  Our future plans include expanding our class offerings to encompass a wider range of wellness practices, such as Pilates, meditation retreats, and Ayurveda workshops. We also aim to create a dedicated space for teacher training, empowering local individuals to become certified yoga instructors and further spreading the practice within Assam.  We envision partnerships with local businesses to offer corporate wellness programs and to collaborate with healthcare providers to integrate yoga into their patient care plans.  Our long-term goal is to build a sustainable and impactful business that contributes significantly to the health and happiness of the Guwahati community, solidifying our position as a trusted and respected leader in the region''s wellness landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Lotus Yoga Studio''s commitment to personalized attention, community engagement, and a unique blend of traditional and contemporary yoga styles sets us apart in the competitive wellness market of Assam.  We believe in the transformative power of yoga and are dedicated to sharing this transformative experience with as many individuals as possible. We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a vibrant community fostering well-being and harmony, one breath at a time.</p> <br> <br>', 'House No. 2, near Forensic Science Laboratory', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7086827151', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T12:05:17.000Z'),
