<p>[Website (if applicable)]</p>', 'Beltola, above Federal Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896921642', NULL, 'https://instagram.com/dronaacademyofmartialarts?igshid=OGIzYTJhMTRmYQ==', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T13:45:28.000Z'),
(321, 'VIAAN FITNESS CLUB', 'Physical fitness program', NULL, '<h1>VIAAN FITNESS CLUB: Shaping a Healthier Assam</h1>

<p>VIAAN Fitness Club, strategically located at Zila Parishad, Market Complex, Bus Stop, near Kali Mandir, is more than just a gym; it''s a vibrant community hub dedicated to promoting health and wellness in the heart of Assam.  We understand the unique needs and aspirations of our local community and have designed our services to cater specifically to them, offering a holistic fitness experience that goes beyond traditional gym memberships.  Our commitment to personalized attention, state-of-the-art equipment, and a supportive environment sets us apart in the burgeoning fitness landscape of the region. </p><br><br>

<p>We are deeply invested in the growth and wellbeing of our community.  Our establishment represents a significant contribution to the development of accessible and high-quality fitness facilities in the area, addressing a growing demand for healthier lifestyles.  By offering a comprehensive range of fitness options, we empower individuals to achieve their personal fitness goals, regardless of their experience level or specific needs. This focus on community engagement and personalized service makes VIAAN Fitness Club a valuable asset to the local economy and the wellbeing of its residents.</p><br><br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>VIAAN Fitness Club offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to diverse fitness levels and preferences.  Our state-of-the-art facility boasts a wide array of cardio equipment, including treadmills, elliptical trainers, stationary bikes, and rowing machines, all maintained to the highest standards.  We also feature a fully-equipped weight training area with a diverse selection of free weights and weight machines, ensuring a varied and engaging workout experience.  Beyond traditional gym equipment, we offer a range of specialized fitness classes. These include, but are not limited to, Zumba, Yoga, Pilates, and high-intensity interval training (HIIT) sessions, led by certified and experienced instructors.  We also incorporate functional training elements into our programs, focusing on building strength and improving overall fitness through exercises that mimic everyday movements.</p><br><br>

<p>A key differentiator for VIAAN Fitness Club is our personalized approach. We offer individual fitness consultations to assess client needs and goals, tailoring workout plans to suit individual abilities and preferences.  Our trainers provide guidance and support throughout the fitness journey, ensuring clients stay motivated and on track.  We understand that dietary choices significantly impact overall fitness success and therefore offer nutritional guidance and advice as part of our comprehensive fitness packages. This holistic approach, combining exercise and nutrition, is designed to deliver optimal results for our members.</p><br><br>

<p>Recognizing the importance of community, we strive to create an inclusive and welcoming environment.  Our flexible membership options cater to diverse lifestyles and budgets, making fitness accessible to a wide range of individuals. We regularly organize community fitness events and workshops, fostering a sense of camaraderie and promoting a culture of healthy living within the local area. This focus on community building has been instrumental in creating a supportive and motivating environment for our members.</p><br><br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At VIAAN Fitness Club, customer satisfaction is paramount. We pride ourselves on providing exceptional customer service, from the moment a member walks through our doors.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to answer questions, offer assistance, and create a welcoming atmosphere.  We believe in fostering strong relationships with our members, understanding their fitness goals, and providing the necessary support and resources to help them achieve them.  Regular feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve our services and meet the evolving needs of our community.</p><br><br>

<p>Our commitment to cleanliness and hygiene is unwavering.  We maintain the highest standards of sanitation in our facility, ensuring a safe and comfortable environment for all members.  We regularly update and maintain our equipment to ensure optimal functionality and safety.  By prioritizing cleanliness, safety, and personalized attention, we aim to create a positive and motivating fitness environment that fosters both physical and mental wellbeing.</p><br><br>

<p>Our connection with the local community extends beyond our membership base. We actively collaborate with local businesses and organizations to promote health and wellness initiatives.  We believe in contributing to the overall growth and development of our community through our services and our community engagement initiatives. This synergistic approach strengthens our ties with our local area and emphasizes our commitment to holistic well-being.</p><br><br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>VIAAN Fitness Club has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision becoming the leading fitness center in the region, renowned for its exceptional services and strong community ties.  Our expansion plans include the potential addition of new fitness classes, specialized training programs, and potentially, the introduction of advanced fitness technologies to enhance our members'' experiences.  We will continue to adapt our offerings to meet the ever-evolving demands of our clientele and maintain our commitment to personalized service.</p><br><br>

<p>We aim to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers and wellness professionals to create a holistic wellness ecosystem in the community.  This would involve collaborating on health screenings, workshops, and educational programs focused on promoting overall health and wellbeing.  Long-term, our vision includes the possibility of expanding our facilities to accommodate a growing membership and to offer even more comprehensive fitness and wellness services.</p><br><br>

<p>Our commitment to creating a healthier and more vibrant Assam fuels our growth strategy. We believe that investing in the health and well-being of our community is an investment in the future.  By continuing to provide exceptional services, foster strong community ties, and adapt to evolving needs, VIAAN Fitness Club is poised for sustained growth and continued success, becoming an integral part of the health and wellness fabric of the Assam region.</p>', 'Zila Parishad, Market Complex, Bus Stop, near Kali Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T13:45:38.000Z'),
(322, 'SK-27 Gym, Guwahati', 'Fitness center', NULL, '<h1>SK-27 Gym, Guwahati: Your Fitness Journey Starts Here</h1>

<p>SK-27 Gym, strategically located on the 2nd Floor of the Achyut & Choudhury Complex, Bora Service, above Kalyan Jewellers in Guwahati, is more than just a fitness center; it''s a vibrant community hub dedicated to transforming lives through fitness and wellness.  We understand the unique needs and aspirations of the Guwahati community and strive to provide a superior fitness experience tailored to the local landscape.  Our commitment to personalized service, state-of-the-art equipment, and a motivating atmosphere sets us apart in the competitive fitness market of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Guwahati, a city known for its vibrant culture and growing health consciousness, demands high-quality fitness options.  SK-27 Gym directly addresses this demand by offering a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to individuals of all fitness levels and goals.  We recognize that fitness is a personal journey, and our approach prioritizes individual needs, fostering a supportive and inclusive environment for all members.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of fitness solutions.  We offer a fully equipped gym with a diverse selection of modern cardio and strength training equipment, ensuring members have access to the tools they need to achieve their fitness objectives.  Beyond the standard gym facilities, SK-27 Gym distinguishes itself with specialized group fitness classes, led by certified instructors. These classes vary from high-intensity interval training (HIIT) and Zumba to yoga and Pilates, providing members with diverse options to maintain motivation and challenge themselves.  We also offer personalized training sessions with experienced fitness professionals who create customized workout plans tailored to individual needs and goals, providing guidance, support, and accountability.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A key differentiator for SK-27 Gym is our commitment to providing a clean, safe, and well-maintained facility.  We prioritize hygiene and regularly sanitize equipment to ensure a healthy and comfortable environment for our members.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized approach, combining cutting-edge facilities with a strong emphasis on community building and individualized attention. We believe that creating a supportive environment is crucial for achieving long-term fitness success.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, we cater to the specific market needs of Guwahati by offering flexible membership options to suit diverse lifestyles and budgets.  We understand that time is a valuable commodity, and our convenient location and flexible scheduling options are designed to accommodate busy schedules.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At SK-27 Gym, customer experience is paramount.  We prioritize creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where members feel comfortable, motivated, and supported throughout their fitness journey. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to assist members with their fitness goals and provide guidance on using the equipment effectively.  We regularly organize community events and workshops to foster a sense of belonging and encourage members to connect with each other and with the broader Guwahati community. These events could include health and nutrition seminars, fitness challenges, and social gatherings, all aimed at creating a supportive network of like-minded individuals.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We foster a strong sense of community by encouraging interaction among members and staff. This positive environment helps to improve member retention and fosters a sense of loyalty. Our commitment to exceptional customer service is evident in our personalized approach to fitness training and our responsiveness to member feedback.  We actively solicit member feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting the evolving needs of our community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>SK-27 Gym has ambitious growth plans for the future. We envision expanding our range of fitness services to incorporate advanced fitness technologies and innovative training methodologies.  This may include introducing new group fitness classes, incorporating advanced fitness tracking systems, and expanding our personal training options to include specialized areas such as sports-specific training and rehabilitation. We also aim to expand our community engagement initiatives, partnering with local businesses and organizations to promote health and wellness in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish SK-27 Gym as the premier fitness destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional customer service, state-of-the-art facilities, and commitment to community building.  We are committed to continually investing in our facilities, training our staff, and developing innovative programs to meet the evolving fitness needs of our members.  By focusing on building strong relationships with our members and the local community, we are confident in our ability to achieve sustainable growth and become a leading force in the Assam fitness landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, SK-27 Gym is more than just a gym; it''s an investment in the health and well-being of the Guwahati community.  We are dedicated to providing a holistic fitness experience that empowers individuals to achieve their fitness goals and live healthier, happier lives. </p>', '2nd Floor, Achyut & Choudhury Complex, Bora Service, above Kalyan Jewellers', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6901266626', NULL, 'http://sk27gym.com/', 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T13:45:46.000Z'),
(323, 'Yogatherapy by Shivangi', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Yogatherapy by Shivangi</h1>

<p>Nestled at House no-180, Rajgarh Rd, near Sainik Bhawan, Yogatherapy by Shivangi offers a unique and holistic approach to wellness in the heart of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a sanctuary for physical and mental rejuvenation, tailored to meet the specific needs of the local community.  Our approach integrates the ancient wisdom of yoga with modern therapeutic techniques, creating a transformative experience that fosters both inner peace and improved physical health.  In a region increasingly focused on rapid development, Yogatherapy by Shivangi provides a much-needed oasis of calm and a pathway to sustainable well-being, setting us apart in the vibrant Assam business landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our core offering centers around personalized yoga therapy sessions designed to address a wide range of physical and mental health concerns.  These sessions are not generic group classes; instead, they involve a detailed initial consultation to understand individual needs, limitations, and goals.  This personalized approach ensures that each client receives a tailored practice that is safe, effective, and enjoyable.  We cater to diverse client needs, from individuals seeking stress reduction and improved flexibility to those managing chronic pain or recovering from injuries.  Our services include therapeutic yoga for back pain, anxiety management through yoga and breathwork, prenatal and postnatal yoga, and yoga for seniors. We also offer workshops and specialized programs focused on specific needs, such as stress management for working professionals or yoga for improved sleep quality.  A unique selling point is our integration of traditional Assamese healing practices with yoga, creating a truly unique and locally relevant approach to wellness.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond individual sessions, Yogatherapy by Shivangi offers small group classes for those seeking a more interactive and community-based experience. These classes are kept intentionally small to maintain a high level of personalized attention and allow for effective modifications based on individual needs.  We also host regular workshops and retreats focused on specific aspects of yoga and wellness, providing opportunities for deeper learning and community building.  Our commitment to providing high-quality, locally-relevant services makes us a vital part of the Assam wellness scene. The emphasis on individualized programs and the integration of local practices creates a distinct value proposition that resonates deeply within the community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Yogatherapy by Shivangi, our commitment to exceptional customer service is paramount. We believe in building a strong relationship with each client, fostering a sense of trust and understanding that is vital for effective therapeutic practice.  Our spacious and serene studio is designed to create a peaceful and welcoming environment, enhancing the overall experience.  We take the time to listen to our clients'' concerns, answer their questions, and adapt our services to meet their evolving needs.  Our friendly and knowledgeable instructors are passionate about yoga and its therapeutic benefits.  They are trained to work with individuals of all levels and abilities, ensuring a safe and comfortable experience for everyone.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and offering subsidized sessions to those in need.  This commitment to giving back is deeply ingrained in our values and helps us build strong relationships with our neighbors and clients.  We are committed to being more than just a business – we strive to be a positive force within our community, promoting holistic well-being and fostering a sense of connection among our clients and the wider Assamese community.  Our commitment to accessibility also includes offering flexible scheduling options to cater to the busy lifestyles of our clients.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Yogatherapy by Shivangi has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  We envision becoming a leading center for holistic wellness in Assam, offering an ever-expanding range of services to meet the growing demand for yoga therapy and related wellness practices.  Our future plans include expanding our team of instructors, developing new workshops and specialized programs, and exploring opportunities for online classes and virtual consultations to reach a wider audience. We also aim to continue strengthening our community partnerships, expanding our outreach initiatives, and providing even more accessible and affordable services.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Yogatherapy by Shivangi as a recognized leader in holistic wellness, not only within Assam but also regionally. This will involve continued investment in professional development for our instructors, the adoption of innovative technologies to enhance client experience, and a unwavering commitment to providing high-quality, personalized care.  We believe that yoga therapy has the power to transform lives, and we are dedicated to making its benefits accessible to everyone in our community and beyond.  Our continued growth will be driven by our commitment to excellence, our dedication to our clients, and our passion for sharing the transformative power of yoga.</p> <br> <br>', 'House no-180, Rajgarh Rd, near Sainik Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T13:50:13.000Z'),
(324, 'DURLAV YOGA CENTRE, JALUKBARI', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>DURLAV YOGA CENTRE, JALUKBARI</h1>

<p>Nestled on the 3rd Floor of House no -19, N/H-37, Jalukbari, DURLAV YOGA CENTRE offers a sanctuary of well-being in the heart of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to promoting physical and mental health through the transformative power of yoga. Our unique approach blends traditional yogic practices with modern understanding of wellness, creating a truly personalized and effective experience for each individual. In a region increasingly focused on holistic well-being, DURLAV YOGA CENTRE provides a vital resource, offering a unique blend of expertise and accessibility to the local community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence is reflected in the breadth and depth of our offerings.  We provide a diverse range of yoga classes catering to all levels, from absolute beginners to experienced practitioners.  Our curriculum includes Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and restorative yoga styles, each expertly taught by certified and experienced instructors.  Beyond regular classes, we also offer specialized workshops focusing on specific areas such as stress management, back pain relief, and prenatal yoga.  This curated selection of services ensures that we meet the diverse needs of our clientele, fostering a personalized approach that goes beyond the standard group class setting.  A unique selling point is our emphasis on individual attention – our smaller class sizes allow instructors to provide personalized adjustments and guidance, ensuring proper form and maximizing the benefits of each practice.  This personalized approach is particularly valuable in addressing the specific physical and mental health concerns prevalent in our community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At DURLAV YOGA CENTRE, the customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and supported on their wellness journey. Our studio is designed with comfort and serenity in mind, featuring a calming atmosphere and state-of-the-art facilities.  We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is key to their success.  Our instructors are not merely teachers; they are mentors, providing guidance and encouragement to help individuals achieve their personal wellness goals. We regularly engage with the local community through free introductory classes, workshops at local events, and collaborations with other health and wellness businesses. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and helps us to become an integral part of the vibrant Jalukbari landscape. This strong local focus allows us to tailor our offerings to the specific needs and preferences of our community, solidifying our place as a trusted resource for health and wellness.</p> <br> <br>

<p>DURLAV YOGA CENTRE’s future vision is ambitious yet grounded in our core values. We plan to expand our offerings to include advanced yoga teacher training programs, empowering individuals to become qualified instructors themselves. This will contribute significantly to the growth of the yoga community in Jalukbari and the surrounding areas. We also intend to introduce specialized programs targeting specific demographics, such as senior citizens and children, further catering to the diverse needs of our community.  We aim to increase our online presence through a user-friendly website and social media engagement, allowing us to reach a wider audience and build a stronger online community.  Our long-term goal is to establish DURLAV YOGA CENTRE as the leading yoga and wellness center in Jalukbari, a trusted resource for physical and mental health, and a vibrant hub for community connection.  This growth will be facilitated by consistent investment in our instructors’ professional development, the expansion of our facilities, and continued dedication to providing a superior customer experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, DURLAV YOGA CENTRE, JALUKBARI is more than a business; it is a commitment to the well-being of our community.  Our unique blend of traditional practices, personalized attention, and community engagement sets us apart. We are confident that our dedication to excellence and our ambitious future plans will allow us to continue to thrive and make a significant contribution to the health and happiness of the people of Jalukbari and beyond.  Our commitment extends beyond just teaching yoga; it''s about fostering a sense of community, empowering individuals, and promoting holistic well-being within a supportive and enriching environment.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We invite you to experience the DURLAV YOGA CENTRE difference.  Contact us today to learn more about our offerings and join our growing community of dedicated yogis.</p>', '3rd Floor, House no -19, N/H-37', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9854915115', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T13:50:22.000Z'),
(325, 'Manash Yoga', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Manash Yoga: Cultivating Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nestled at House No 47, Sukanya Path, Kali Mandir Rd, Manash Yoga offers a sanctuary of tranquility in the heart of Guwahati.  More than just a yoga studio, Manash Yoga is a vibrant community hub dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual well-being through authentic yoga practices tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community. We are committed to providing accessible and high-quality yoga instruction, fostering a sense of belonging, and contributing positively to the overall health and happiness of our city.  Our unique approach blends traditional Asana practice with a deep understanding of the local culture, creating a truly distinctive yoga experience unavailable elsewhere in the region.</p><br><br>

<p>Manash Yoga’s commitment to authenticity shines through in our diverse range of offerings. Our core services include Hatha, Vinyasa, and Yin Yoga classes for all levels, from beginners to advanced practitioners.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga philosophy, drawing from ancient texts and adapting them to contemporary life in Assam.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our careful curation of instructors.  Each teacher undergoes a rigorous selection process, ensuring not only exceptional yoga expertise but also a deep understanding of the local culture and sensitivity to the unique needs of our diverse clientele. This ensures a welcoming and inclusive environment for all.</p><br><br>

<p>Recognizing the growing demand for accessible and culturally relevant wellness practices in Guwahati, Manash Yoga caters specifically to the needs of the local community.  Our class schedules are designed to accommodate busy lifestyles, with options available throughout the day and evening.  We offer classes in both English and Assamese to ensure inclusivity and remove language barriers.  We also prioritize affordability, offering a variety of membership options to make our services accessible to a wide range of income levels.  Beyond our core offerings, we regularly organize community events such as free introductory yoga sessions, workshops on healthy living, and collaborations with local businesses to promote holistic well-being within the greater Guwahati community.</p><br><br>

<p>At Manash Yoga, we believe that exceptional customer experience is paramount.  From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care.  Our welcoming studio is designed to be a calming and restorative space, promoting a sense of peace and relaxation. Our instructors are not just teachers; they are mentors and guides, committed to fostering a supportive and encouraging environment for every student.  We actively solicit feedback and utilize it to continuously improve our services. This personalized approach, coupled with our commitment to building strong relationships with our clients, has earned us a reputation for providing exceptional customer service within the Guwahati yoga community. We aim to be more than just a business; we strive to be a trusted partner in our clients'' wellness journeys.</p><br><br>

<p>Our vision for Manash Yoga extends beyond our current offerings.  We aspire to become a leading wellness center in Guwahati, offering a comprehensive range of services that promote holistic health and well-being.  Our future plans include expanding our class schedule to incorporate additional yoga styles and specialized programs, such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and therapeutic yoga for specific conditions.  We are also exploring the possibility of offering teacher training programs to nurture the next generation of yoga instructors within Assam.  Furthermore, we envision building stronger partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote a healthier and more vibrant community. We aim to not only meet the current demands for yoga in Guwahati, but to also proactively shape the future of wellness in our city, contributing to a healthier and happier Assam.</p><br><br>

<p>Manash Yoga is more than just a yoga studio; it''s a testament to the growing awareness of holistic well-being in Assam.  Our commitment to authentic yoga practices, culturally sensitive instruction, exceptional customer service, and community engagement positions us uniquely within the Guwahati wellness landscape. We are confident in our ability to continue to grow and evolve, consistently exceeding the expectations of our clients and contributing positively to the community we serve. We invite you to experience the transformative power of Manash Yoga and embark on your journey towards inner peace and lasting well-being.</p><br><br>

