[Website Address]</p>', 'House No 47, Sukanya Path, Kali Mandir Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8486287593', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-11T09:52:22.000Z', '2025-08-11T13:50:29.000Z'),
(326, 'Guwahati School Of Excellence', 'Yoga studio', NULL, '<h1>Guwahati School of Excellence</h1>
<p>Located at House No 8, Arunoday Path, Sachal Path, Guwahati, Assam, the Guwahati School of Excellence (GSOE) stands as a beacon of academic rigor and holistic development in the heart of Assam.  We are committed to fostering a vibrant learning environment that nurtures intellectual curiosity, critical thinking, and a lifelong love of learning.  Our unique approach, rooted in a deep understanding of the local context and a forward-looking vision, sets us apart in the dynamic educational landscape of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>GSOE differentiates itself from other institutions through a focused commitment to providing a superior educational experience.  We believe that education is not merely the acquisition of knowledge but the cultivation of well-rounded individuals prepared to thrive in a rapidly changing world. This philosophy underpins our curriculum design, teaching methodologies, and overall school culture. Unlike many schools that focus solely on rote learning, we emphasize experiential learning, project-based activities, and collaborative learning, fostering creativity and problem-solving skills vital for success in the 21st century.</p> <br> <br>

