<p>We are confident that our dedication to quality, our commitment to client satisfaction, and our deep connection with the Guwahati community will solidify Espalon Hair & Beauty as the preferred destination for those seeking the highest standards in hair and beauty care. We aim to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a sanctuary of style, a celebration of beauty, and a testament to the thriving spirit of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond providing exceptional services. We actively participate in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses, and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This dedication reflects our belief in the power of collaboration and shared success within the vibrant landscape of Guwahati.  Our ultimate goal is to not merely meet the expectations of our clients but to consistently exceed them, delivering experiences that leave a lasting impression and inspire confidence.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Espalon Hair & Beauty is more than just a business; it''s a statement of commitment to excellence, a reflection of the dynamic spirit of Guwahati, and a celebration of the unique beauty of each individual. We look forward to welcoming you and making you feel your best.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9365460280', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T09:35:41.000Z'),
