<p>We plan to expand our physical space to accommodate the growing demand for our services, creating a larger and more luxurious facility that offers an even more comprehensive range of treatments. We also envision expanding our product line, potentially developing our own line of skincare products inspired by the natural ingredients of Assam.  Our commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing will remain central to this expansion. <br> <br> </p>

<p>We are also exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with other businesses in the beauty and wellness industry, as well as community organizations. This collaboration will not only enhance our brand but also strengthen our ties with the local community, further establishing Chi Glam Studio as an integral part of the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati. Our ultimate goal is to be a brand synonymous with luxury, professionalism, and exceptional customer service in the region, setting a benchmark for beauty in Assam. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T10:00:44.000Z'),
(384, 'LOOKS SALON', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>LOOKS SALON: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

