<ul>
  <li><strong>Hair Care:</strong> Haircuts, styling, coloring (including highlights, balayage, and ombre), keratin treatments, hair spa treatments, and extensions.</li>
  <li><strong>Facial Treatments:</strong> Customized facials catering to different skin types, including cleansing, exfoliation, and moisturizing treatments. We also offer advanced treatments addressing specific skin concerns such as acne, pigmentation, and aging.</li>
