<br> <br>

<p>We believe in the power of beauty to transform lives, and we are committed to providing an experience that is both luxurious and empowering.  BLONDE HOUSE is more than just a salon; it’s a sanctuary where individuals can reconnect with themselves, embrace their inner beauty, and leave feeling refreshed, rejuvenated, and confident.  Our commitment to exceeding expectations and consistently delivering exceptional services will ensure our continued success and growth within the dynamic and ever-evolving beauty landscape of Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8811902183', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T11:45:19.000Z'),
(437, 'DU CHEE UNISEX SALOON AND MAKEUP STUDIO', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>DU CHEE Unisex Saloon and Makeup Studio: Redefining Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

