<p>Ultimately, Cheveu Salon is more than a business; it is a testament to the power of combining international expertise with a deep understanding of local needs. We are committed to providing a transformative experience for every client, enhancing not only their appearance but also their overall well-being.  We look forward to continuing to serve the Guwahati community and contributing to the vibrant beauty scene of Assam for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8876760222', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T11:55:11.000Z'),
(446, 'ETHEREA- The Beauty Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>ETHEREA - The Beauty Salon: Guwahati, Assam</h1>

