<p>Our long-term goal is to become the leading hair, beauty, and spa destination in Guwahati, recognized for our exceptional service, commitment to quality, and dedication to the local community.  We will achieve this through continuous innovation, consistent high standards of service, and a unwavering commitment to exceeding the expectations of our valued clients.  We envision New R15 as a place where individuals not only enhance their outer beauty but also experience a deep sense of inner peace and well-being. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:00:14.000Z'),
(451, 'Relaxum Spa & Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Relaxum Spa & Salon: Unveiling Tranquility in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, Relaxum Spa & Salon offers a sanctuary of rejuvenation and self-care.  We are more than just a spa and salon; we are a haven designed to cater to the unique needs and desires of the discerning clientele of Assam. Our commitment to exceptional service, coupled with our utilization of high-quality products and traditional techniques blended with modern expertise, sets us apart in the competitive landscape of Guwahati''s beauty and wellness industry. We strive to provide an experience that transcends the ordinary, leaving our clients feeling refreshed, revitalized, and deeply connected to their inner peace. <br> <br> </p>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Blend of Tradition and Modernity</h2>

