<p>To complement our core services, we also offer a curated selection of high-quality beauty products for sale, allowing clients to maintain their look and feel at home. These products are carefully chosen for their effectiveness and suitability for the local climate and skin types.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At New Naynas, customer experience is paramount.  We believe that a visit to the salon should be a relaxing and enjoyable experience, a sanctuary from the daily grind. Our warm and welcoming atmosphere, complemented by our attentive and professional staff, creates a comfortable and inviting space for all clients. We strive to build long-lasting relationships with our clientele, understanding that trust and loyalty are crucial for sustained success.  We achieve this by actively listening to client feedback, consistently striving to exceed expectations, and offering personalized recommendations tailored to individual needs and preferences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We go beyond providing excellent service; we actively engage with the local community.  We support local charities and participate in community events, demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of our city. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable practices further strengthens our connection with the community.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>New Naynas Unisex Salon has ambitious plans for the future. We envision expanding our services to include advanced beauty treatments and wellness offerings, further strengthening our position as a premier beauty destination in Guwahati.  This might include advanced skincare technologies, specialized hair treatments, and potentially incorporating other wellness services, like aromatherapy or massage therapies. We also plan to increase our team size, carefully selecting highly skilled and passionate professionals who share our commitment to excellence.  Expansion into additional locations within Guwahati or nearby areas is also a possibility, bringing our high-quality services to a wider clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in the Assamese beauty industry, known for our unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service.  By consistently exceeding expectations and adapting to evolving trends, we aim to maintain our position as a beloved and trusted destination for personal grooming in the heart of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We believe that New Naynas Unisex Salon is not just a business; it’s a testament to the evolving beauty landscape of Assam and a reflection of the city’s vibrant spirit. We are committed to providing an inclusive and exceptional experience for every individual who walks through our doors.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638146382', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:00:46.000Z'),
(455, 'Vishal Hair Cafe', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Vishal Hair Cafe: Guwahati''s Premier Destination for Hair Care and Wellness</h1>

<p>Vishal Hair Cafe, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and sophisticated approach to hair care, combining traditional expertise with modern techniques. We are not just a salon; we are a holistic hair wellness destination, meticulously crafted to cater to the diverse needs and preferences of the discerning Guwahati clientele.  Our commitment to excellence, personalized service, and utilization of premium products sets us apart in the competitive Assam market, establishing us as a leader in the region''s beauty industry. <br> <br> </p>


