<p>At Vishal Hair Cafe, we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to address every aspect of hair health and styling. Our expertise extends from classic haircuts and styling for men and women to advanced treatments focusing on hair restoration and repair. We specialize in intricate bridal hairstyling, catering to the unique demands of Assamese wedding traditions.  We also provide a complete color bar with globally recognized professional hair color brands that are tailored to the specific needs of our clients'' hair texture and tones.  <br> <br> </p>

