<p>Our long-term goal is to establish MISTERS CUTT SALOON as the leading men''s grooming brand in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, high-quality products, and strong community ties. We believe in continuous improvement, consistently seeking ways to refine our services, enhance our client experience, and strengthen our position within the local market.  This will be achieved through a combination of strategic investments, consistent innovation, and a unwavering dedication to our clients.  We envision MISTERS CUTT SALOON becoming a synonymous with style, sophistication, and exceptional men''s grooming in Assam. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002239440', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:15:36.000Z'),
