<p>N.B Family Salon has ambitious plans for future growth.  We aim to expand our service offerings to include advanced cosmetic treatments and potentially open additional locations within Guwahati to better serve the growing demand for our services.  We are also investing in ongoing training and development for our staff to keep them abreast of the latest industry trends and technologies. We’ll continue to prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of loyalty and community that sets us apart.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish N.B Family Salon as the leading hair and beauty destination in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional services, commitment to community, and unwavering dedication to client satisfaction.  We envision becoming a household name synonymous with quality, professionalism, and a truly personalized beauty experience.  This commitment to continuous improvement and expansion will not only enhance our business but also contribute to the economic growth and vibrancy of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, N.B Family Salon is more than just a business; it’s a reflection of our commitment to excellence, community engagement, and providing a uniquely Assamese beauty experience.  We look forward to welcoming you to our salon and helping you discover your most beautiful self.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822569070', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:20:21.000Z'),
