<p>Reyaz has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We aim to enhance our online presence, creating a user-friendly e-commerce platform that allows us to reach a wider customer base, both within Assam and across India. This expansion will also enable us to showcase the artistry and skills of Assamese artisans to a much larger audience.  We plan to strategically expand our product range, introducing new items while maintaining our commitment to quality and authenticity. We will also explore opportunities for collaborations with other businesses and organizations that share our vision of promoting Assamese heritage and craftsmanship.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading retailer of authentic Assamese products, contributing significantly to the state''s economic growth and promoting its rich cultural heritage on a national and even international stage. We are committed to sustainable practices and ethical sourcing, ensuring that our business continues to thrive while supporting the communities we serve.  We believe in the power of collaboration and innovation to achieve our vision, making Reyaz a brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional customer experience in the years to come.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Reyaz is more than just a business; it''s a testament to the spirit of Assam, a celebration of its artistry, and a commitment to building a thriving community. We invite you to experience the Reyaz difference.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002892509', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:40:10.000Z'),
(491, 'Finesse', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Finesse: Elevating Experiences in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Finesse, located in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, is a rapidly growing business dedicated to providing exceptional services and high-quality products tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese market. We distinguish ourselves through a commitment to unparalleled customer service, a deep understanding of local preferences, and a forward-thinking approach to business.  Our aim is not merely to meet expectations, but to exceed them, fostering lasting relationships with our valued clientele and contributing positively to the economic and social fabric of Guwahati.</p>
<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Blend of Tradition and Innovation</h2>

<p>Finesse offers a diverse range of services and products carefully curated to cater to the evolving demands of the Guwahati market. Our offerings are characterized by a unique blend of traditional Assamese craftsmanship and contemporary design sensibilities. While the specifics of our product and service portfolio are constantly evolving to meet market needs, our current offerings focus on several key areas. These include high-end artisanal home décor items showcasing the rich heritage of Assamese weaving and wood carving, carefully selected and ethically sourced.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>Another significant focus is on bespoke event planning services, catering to weddings, corporate events, and private celebrations. We understand the importance of cultural sensitivity and personalized touches in event management, working closely with our clients to craft memorable experiences that reflect their unique vision and values.   Furthermore, Finesse offers a curated selection of high-quality teas sourced directly from the finest tea gardens in Assam, offering a premium tea experience reflecting the state''s rich tea-growing heritage.  This includes exclusive blends and unique packaging, appealing to both local consumers and those seeking a taste of Assam''s finest offerings.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to seamlessly integrate traditional craftsmanship with modern aesthetics and operational efficiency.  We partner with local artisans, ensuring fair wages and promoting sustainable practices, while simultaneously offering contemporary designs that resonate with a modern customer base.  This approach directly addresses the local market need for high-quality, ethically sourced products that reflect both Assam''s cultural heritage and global design trends.</p>
<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, One Interaction at a Time</h2>

<p>At Finesse, our commitment to exceptional customer service is not merely a policy; it is the foundation upon which our business is built. We believe in fostering genuine relationships with our clientele, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations at every touchpoint.  Our approach is deeply rooted in the values of respect, empathy, and personalized attention, reflecting the warm and welcoming hospitality that is synonymous with Assamese culture.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>We invest heavily in training our staff, ensuring they are equipped with the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service.  Our team members are not just employees; they are brand ambassadors, representing Finesse''s commitment to excellence.  We actively seek feedback from our customers, constantly striving to improve our processes and ensure customer satisfaction. This commitment extends to our active engagement with the local community through sponsorships of local events and charities. By supporting local initiatives, we strengthen our connection with our community and contribute to its overall growth and well-being.</p>
<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion</h2>

<p>Finesse''s future vision is ambitious yet grounded in the principles that have guided our success to date.  We see significant opportunities for growth and expansion, both within Guwahati and across Assam.  Our strategic plans involve diversifying our product and service offerings, capitalizing on emerging market trends, and exploring new channels for reaching a wider customer base.  This includes developing an online presence to reach a broader audience beyond Guwahati, while maintaining the personalized service that sets us apart.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>We are also actively exploring strategic partnerships with other businesses and organizations that share our values and commitment to excellence.  These collaborations will help us expand our reach and offer a wider array of services to our clients.  A key part of our future strategy involves investing in research and development, continually innovating to create new and exciting products that reflect the evolving tastes and preferences of our customers.  Our long-term goal is to establish Finesse as a leading provider of high-quality products and exceptional services in Assam, contributing significantly to the economic development and cultural enrichment of the region.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>In essence, Finesse is more than just a business; it''s a commitment to excellence, a celebration of Assamese heritage, and a dedication to building strong and lasting relationships within the Guwahati community.  We are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious goals, driven by our passion, our commitment to innovation, and our unwavering focus on exceeding customer expectations.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6901319677', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:40:17.000Z'),
(492, 'Kloee Unisex Salon & Spa', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Kloee Unisex Salon & Spa: Redefining Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Kloee Unisex Salon & Spa is a premier beauty destination in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing exceptional and personalized grooming experiences.  We stand apart from the competition through our commitment to using high-quality, ethically sourced products, our highly skilled and professionally trained stylists and therapists, and our unwavering dedication to creating a welcoming and luxurious atmosphere for every client.  In the vibrant and evolving beauty market of Guwahati, Kloee aims to set a new standard of excellence, offering a comprehensive range of services that cater to the diverse needs and preferences of the local community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Beauty</h2>

<p>Kloee offers a wide array of services designed to enhance both inner and outer beauty.  Our comprehensive menu includes advanced hair care treatments, utilizing international and locally sourced products that nourish and revitalize the hair. This encompasses everything from stylish haircuts and coloring (including traditional Assamese hair braiding techniques incorporated into modern styles) to keratin treatments, hair extensions, and specialized scalp therapies.  We also offer a complete range of beauty services, including manicures, pedicures, facials tailored to various skin types and concerns (specific attention paid to addressing the unique challenges of the Assamese climate), waxing, threading, and makeup application for special occasions and everyday looks. Our spa services promote relaxation and well-being, offering aromatherapy massages, body scrubs, and other rejuvenating treatments.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A unique selling proposition of Kloee is our focus on incorporating traditional Assamese beauty practices into our modern offerings.  We believe in celebrating the rich cultural heritage of the region and strive to integrate time-honored techniques with innovative approaches. This cultural sensitivity resonates with the local clientele and provides a distinctive experience. We also prioritize the use of locally sourced, organic ingredients where possible, supporting local businesses and minimizing our environmental footprint.  This commitment to sustainability and community engagement sets us apart in the competitive market. Our meticulously curated product line includes internationally recognized brands alongside carefully selected local products, ensuring that our clients have access to the best options available.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</h2>

<p>At Kloee, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success.  Our team is comprised of highly skilled and certified professionals who are passionate about their craft. They are not only technically proficient but also possess excellent interpersonal skills, ensuring a warm and welcoming experience for each client.  We emphasize personalized consultations to understand individual needs and preferences, tailoring our services to achieve the best possible results. We strive to create a sanctuary of relaxation and rejuvenation where clients can escape the everyday stresses and indulge in a truly transformative experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment extends beyond providing individual services. Kloee actively engages with the local community through various initiatives.  We participate in local events, sponsor community programs, and support local artisans by showcasing their work within the salon.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and fostering a sense of belonging among our clients. This community-centric approach has helped to build strong relationships and a loyal customer base.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Our Reach and Impact</h2>

<p>Kloee has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We envision becoming a leading beauty destination not only in Guwahati but also across Assam. Our plans include expanding our service offerings to incorporate more specialized treatments and wellness programs.  We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical footprint, potentially opening new locations to better serve our growing clientele.  Further investment in employee training and development is a priority, ensuring that our team remains at the forefront of the latest industry trends and techniques.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A key aspect of our long-term vision is to continue our commitment to sustainability and community engagement. We plan to implement more eco-friendly practices within our operations and further support local businesses and initiatives.  We also aim to develop strategic partnerships with other businesses in the region to offer integrated wellness packages and enhance the overall customer experience.  Our ultimate goal is to build a thriving and sustainable business that not only provides exceptional beauty services but also contributes positively to the economic and social fabric of Guwahati and Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, Kloee Unisex Salon & Spa is more than just a beauty salon; it’s a holistic wellness destination that celebrates both beauty and culture. We are committed to providing an exceptional experience for every client, exceeding expectations through personalized service, high-quality products, and a strong commitment to the community.  We look forward to welcoming you to Kloee and helping you discover your most radiant self.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6003140183', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:40:24.000Z'),
(493, 'Shine Blonde', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Shine Blonde: Elevating Haircare in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Shine Blonde is a premium hair salon and beauty studio nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  We are dedicated to providing exceptional hair care services specifically tailored to the diverse needs and preferences of the Assamese community.  Our commitment to quality, innovation, and personalized service sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati beauty market, offering a unique blend of international expertise and local understanding.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Guwahati, with its vibrant culture and growing awareness of personal grooming, presents a dynamic market for high-quality beauty services. Shine Blonde fills a niche by offering sophisticated hair care solutions that go beyond basic salon services. We recognize that the needs of Assamese hair, often characterized by its unique texture and resilience, require specialized attention and expertise.  Our salon''s focus on this nuanced understanding makes us a vital contributor to the city''s evolving beauty landscape.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our core services revolve around blonde hair treatments, encompassing a full spectrum of expert techniques. We offer a range of services including precision cutting, coloring (including balayage, ombre, and highlights tailored to various skin tones), keratin treatments, extensions, and styling for all hair types.  Beyond blonde, we also provide a full suite of services for all hair colors and styles.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to using only high-quality, internationally recognized hair care products that are gentle on the hair and scalp.  We also prioritize personalized consultations, meticulously analyzing each client''s hair type, texture, and desired look to create a customized treatment plan. This ensures that every client leaves Shine Blonde feeling confident and empowered, with hair that is healthy, vibrant, and reflects their individual style.  This highly personalized approach is crucial in fulfilling the specific needs of the diverse clientele in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We understand that maintaining healthy, beautiful hair often requires ongoing maintenance. Therefore, we also offer a range of retail products, including shampoos, conditioners, styling products, and hair masks, carefully selected to complement our services and maintain the results achieved in our salon. We strive to offer products that cater to a range of budgets and preferences while ensuring uncompromising quality.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Shine Blonde, customer experience is paramount.  We believe that a visit to our salon should be a relaxing and enjoyable experience, fostering a sense of well-being and confidence. Our dedicated team of stylists and technicians are highly skilled, professionally trained, and passionate about their craft.  They are committed to providing exceptional customer service, ensuring every client feels valued, understood, and pampered throughout their visit.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We differentiate ourselves through personalized attention, open communication, and a commitment to exceeding expectations. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continually improve our services and ensure we meet their evolving needs.  This focus on personalized service and ongoing communication has helped us build strong relationships with our clients, many of whom become loyal regulars. Our aim is to create a loyal client base who recommend us to their friends and family.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are committed to engaging with the local community. We participate in local events, sponsor community initiatives, and actively seek partnerships with other businesses in Guwahati to contribute to the city''s growth and well-being. This local focus strengthens our connection to the community and allows us to better understand and serve the evolving needs of our clients.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Shine Blonde has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a leading provider of premium hair care services in Guwahati and beyond.  Our future plans include expanding our service offerings, possibly introducing advanced hair treatments and technologies to further enhance our client experience. We also aim to broaden our retail product line to provide a more comprehensive range of hair care solutions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are committed to investing in the continuous professional development of our team, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of the latest hair care trends and techniques. This ongoing investment in training and development will guarantee that we consistently deliver the highest quality services to our clients. Long-term, we aspire to establish Shine Blonde as a recognizable and trusted brand in the Assamese beauty industry, synonymous with excellence, innovation, and exceptional customer service.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence, combined with a deep understanding of the local market and a dedicated team, positions Shine Blonde for significant growth and lasting success in the vibrant and dynamic beauty industry of Guwahati. We believe that through consistent quality, exceptional customer service, and community engagement, we will continue to elevate the standards of hair care in Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002915007', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:40:32.000Z'),
(494, 'ILLUSION UNISEX SALON', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>ILLUSION Unisex Salon: Redefining Style in Guwahati</h1>

<p>ILLUSION Unisex Salon is a premier hair and beauty destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. We are more than just a salon; we are a haven of self-expression, a sanctuary where creativity blossoms, and a reflection of Guwahati''s vibrant and evolving style landscape. We pride ourselves on offering a unique blend of international expertise and a deep understanding of the local aesthetic preferences, resulting in a personalized experience unlike any other in the city.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment lies in providing exceptional service and high-quality products, curated to meet the diverse needs of our clientele.  We understand that beauty is subjective, and our experienced stylists work collaboratively with each individual to bring their unique vision to life.  We cater to a broad spectrum of needs, recognizing the growing demand for unisex services that transcend traditional gender norms.  This inclusive approach is reflective of the modern, forward-thinking spirit of Guwahati itself.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>ILLUSION Unisex Salon offers a comprehensive range of services designed to enhance and celebrate individual beauty.  Our core offerings include haircuts and styling for men and women, using advanced techniques and high-end products. We specialize in coloring services, including balayage, ombre, and vibrant color treatments, tailored to suit individual skin tones and preferences. We also provide a wide array of hair treatments aimed at maintaining healthy, lustrous hair, including deep conditioning treatments, scalp treatments, and keratin smoothing. Beyond hair, our services extend to expert makeup applications for special occasions and everyday wear, along with various skincare treatments designed to rejuvenate and revitalize the skin. Our carefully selected product lines consist of both internationally recognized brands and carefully vetted, high-quality local products.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A unique selling point for ILLUSION is our commitment to personalized consultations.  We believe that understanding a client''s lifestyle, hair type, and personal preferences is crucial to achieving the best possible results. Our stylists take the time to listen, assess, and advise, creating a bespoke experience rather than a one-size-fits-all approach. This emphasis on personalization, combined with our use of advanced techniques and high-quality products, sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati market. Our commitment to sustainability is also reflected in our choice of environmentally conscious products, aligning with growing consumer preferences for eco-friendly options.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Guwahati''s dynamic and diverse population demands a salon that caters to a wide range of tastes and preferences.  ILLUSION meets this need by providing an extensive menu of services and products. Whether it''s a classic cut, a bold new color, or a relaxing spa treatment, we provide an experience that exceeds expectations and caters to the discerning needs of the modern Guwahati resident.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At ILLUSION, we believe that customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere where clients feel comfortable and pampered. Our salon is designed with a modern, sophisticated aesthetic, incorporating elements that promote tranquility and well-being.  From the moment a client walks in, they are greeted with a warm welcome, a complimentary beverage, and a personalized consultation.  Our stylists are not only highly skilled professionals but are also known for their friendly and approachable demeanor.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to exceeding expectations extends beyond individual appointments.  We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives such as partnering with local charities, offering discounts to students, and sponsoring community events.  This commitment to community building helps us cultivate strong relationships with our clients, turning them into loyal patrons who feel a sense of belonging.   Our online presence is also strong, with active social media engagement and a user-friendly website that facilitates bookings and provides access to our latest promotions and services.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to providing exceptional customer service is central to our business philosophy.  We continuously strive for improvement by soliciting feedback and adapting our services to best meet the evolving needs and preferences of our clients. Our goal is not simply to provide a service, but to create a memorable experience that fosters loyalty and word-of-mouth referrals.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>ILLUSION Unisex Salon has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a leading name in the Assam beauty industry, synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service.  Our future plans include expanding our range of services, incorporating new and innovative technologies, and potentially opening additional locations within Guwahati and beyond.  We will continue to invest in professional development for our stylists, ensuring they remain at the forefront of the latest trends and techniques.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that positively contributes to the Guwahati community.  We are committed to nurturing talent within our team, supporting local businesses, and promoting sustainable practices within our industry. We strive to be more than just a salon—we aim to be a contributing member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its vibrant and evolving cultural landscape while setting new standards in the beauty industry.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are confident that ILLUSION Unisex Salon will continue to flourish, driven by our commitment to excellence, innovation, and a dedication to building lasting relationships with our clients. We look forward to shaping the future of beauty in Guwahati and becoming an integral part of the city’s thriving social and economic fabric.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9127215362', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:40:40.000Z'),
(495, 'The Hair salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>The Hair Salon: Guwahati''s Premier Destination for Exquisite Hair Care</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, The Hair Salon stands as a beacon of sophisticated hair care and styling.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary where clients can relax, rejuvenate, and emerge feeling confident and beautiful. Our commitment to excellence, combined with our deep understanding of the unique needs and preferences of the Guwahati community, has solidified our position as a leading hair salon in the region. We pride ourselves on delivering exceptional service, utilizing premium products, and fostering a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the warm spirit of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The Hair Salon''s success is built upon a foundation of unwavering dedication to quality and client satisfaction. We strive to create a bespoke experience for each individual, recognizing that everyone''s hair and style requirements are unique. This personalized approach sets us apart from the competition, ensuring that every visit results in a truly transformative experience. Our commitment extends beyond individual pampering; we actively engage with the local community, participating in charitable events and supporting local businesses, strengthening our ties to the vibrant culture of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our comprehensive range of services caters to the diverse needs of our clientele.  We offer a full spectrum of hair care treatments, including precision haircuts for men and women, customized color services utilizing premium, ammonia-free products, and a variety of styling options to suit any occasion.  Our expertise extends to advanced hair treatments designed to address specific concerns, such as hair thinning, damage repair, and scalp health. We also specialize in traditional Assamese hair braiding techniques, offering a unique cultural twist on classic styling. We use only the highest quality products sourced from reputable brands, ensuring both efficacy and the health of our clients'' hair.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What truly differentiates The Hair Salon is our commitment to understanding the specific needs of our local community. We recognize the importance of incorporating traditional Assamese hair care practices while simultaneously offering cutting-edge techniques and styles. This blend of tradition and modernity allows us to provide a truly unique and relevant service that resonates deeply with our clients.  For example, we offer specialized treatments incorporating natural ingredients sourced locally, reflecting our commitment to sustainability and supporting local businesses.  This approach not only provides superior results but also contributes to the economic vibrancy of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At The Hair Salon, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm welcome and a personalized consultation to assess their hair needs and goals.  Our highly skilled and experienced stylists take the time to understand each client''s individual preferences and offer expert advice to ensure they achieve their desired look.  We pride ourselves on our friendly and professional team, dedicated to creating a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere where clients can feel pampered and at ease.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond our technical expertise, we focus on building genuine relationships with our clients.  We strive to foster a sense of community within our salon, creating a welcoming space where clients can connect and feel comfortable. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet evolving client needs. Our commitment to building strong relationships with our clients reflects the close-knit nature of the Guwahati community, ensuring that The Hair Salon remains a trusted and cherished establishment.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>The Hair Salon has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We aim to continue enhancing our service offerings, incorporating innovative techniques and products to stay ahead of industry trends.  Our long-term goal is to become a regional leader in the hair care industry, expanding our reach beyond Guwahati while maintaining our unwavering commitment to quality, personalized service, and community engagement.  We plan to achieve this through strategic investments in training and development for our team, expanding our physical space to accommodate growing demand, and exploring opportunities for collaboration with other local businesses and organizations.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We also envision expanding our range of services to include advanced hair restoration techniques, specialized bridal styling packages tailored to the unique requirements of Assamese weddings, and workshops and educational programs designed to empower individuals with the skills and knowledge to care for their hair effectively at home.  Our commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing will remain a core value, ensuring that our growth is both responsible and impactful.  Ultimately, The Hair Salon aims to be more than just a hair salon; we strive to be a valuable contributor to the economic and social fabric of Guwahati, enriching the lives of our clients and the wider community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The Hair Salon is dedicated to providing a premium hair care experience that transcends mere aesthetics.  It is our mission to empower our clients to embrace their natural beauty, fostering self-confidence and celebrating the unique cultural heritage of Assam. We invite you to experience the difference at The Hair Salon and discover why we are the preferred choice for discerning clients in Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8134036974', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:45:11.000Z'),
(496, 'Veda', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Veda: Elevating Experiences in Guwahati, Assam</h1>

