<p>We plan to leverage technology to enhance our client experience, such as implementing online booking systems and loyalty programs to reward our valued clientele. We also intend to actively engage in digital marketing to expand our reach and attract new customers.  Our ultimate vision is to make Mirror Looks Unisex Salon the preferred destination for beauty and wellness in Guwahati and beyond, consistently exceeding client expectations and contributing to the vibrant beauty landscape of Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8399822967', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T12:55:28.000Z'),
