<p>The Comb Unisex Salon is not merely a business; it is a testament to the power of personalized service, meticulous attention to detail, and a deep commitment to community engagement.  We are proud to be a part of Guwahati’s vibrant tapestry and look forward to continuing to serve our valued clients for many years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002684585', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:05:40.000Z'),
(520, 'Radiance Beauty Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Radiance Beauty Salon: Illuminating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Radiance Beauty Salon, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a salon; it''s a sanctuary of self-care and beauty enhancement.  We are committed to providing superior services and creating a personalized experience for every client, reflecting the rich cultural heritage and modern aspirations of the Guwahati community. Our dedication to quality, coupled with our understanding of local preferences, sets us apart in the vibrant Assam beauty market.</p> <br> <br>

