<p>Our understanding of the local market needs is integral to our success.  We recognize the importance of both traditional and contemporary styling preferences within Guwahati and offer a curated range of services that appeal to a broad spectrum of clients.  We actively seek feedback and adapt our offerings to ensure they resonate with our community, continuously evolving to meet the ever-changing demands of the beauty industry.</p>
<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Where Luxury Meets Personalization</h2>

<p>At Mintu New Looks Hair Spa Salon, customer experience is paramount.  We foster a warm, welcoming, and professional environment where clients feel comfortable and pampered.  Our team of highly trained and experienced stylists and therapists are not only skilled professionals but also dedicated to providing personalized attention and exceptional customer service.   From the moment you walk through our doors, you’ll be greeted with a friendly smile and offered a relaxing atmosphere designed to enhance your overall experience.  We believe in open communication, actively listening to our client''s needs and preferences to ensure complete satisfaction.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>We go beyond simply providing services; we cultivate genuine connections with our clients, building lasting relationships based on trust and mutual respect. Our commitment extends to the wider Guwahati community, with initiatives aimed at supporting local artisans and businesses. We strive to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a contributing member of the community, promoting beauty, well-being, and local enterprise.</p>
<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion in Guwahati and Beyond</h2>

<p>Mintu New Looks Hair Spa Salon has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading hair and beauty destination in Guwahati, known for its exceptional service, innovative treatments, and strong community engagement.  We plan to expand our range of services, potentially incorporating advanced technologies and techniques to enhance our offerings.  This might include introducing new hair care products, expanding our spa treatments, or offering specialized beauty services to cater to an even broader range of client needs. We also aim to develop and nurture the talents of our stylists and therapists through continued training and professional development programs.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a recognizable brand within the Assam region, potentially expanding our presence through additional locations within Guwahati or venturing into other major cities in the state.  Our success will be measured not only by our financial growth but also by our sustained commitment to providing exceptional customer service, empowering our employees, and enriching the lives of our clientele and the community we serve.  We are dedicated to continuously evolving and adapting to the changing needs of the market, ensuring that Mintu New Looks Hair Spa Salon remains a leading provider of hair care and beauty services in Assam for years to come.</p>
<br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:10:20.000Z'),
(522, 'Plush Hair Beauty spa salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon: Redefining Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon is a premier beauty destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. We are committed to providing exceptional beauty services that cater to the diverse needs and preferences of the Assamese community, while simultaneously introducing innovative trends from the global beauty industry.  Our establishment transcends the typical salon experience; it’s a sanctuary where clients can relax, rejuvenate, and emerge feeling confident and beautiful. We strive to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a vital part of the vibrant Guwahati lifestyle, contributing to the city’s burgeoning beauty and wellness scene.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique positioning within the Guwahati market stems from a commitment to blending traditional Assamese beauty practices with contemporary techniques and high-quality international products. We recognize the importance of incorporating locally-sourced, natural ingredients into our treatments, showcasing the rich biodiversity of Assam and aligning with a growing consumer preference for sustainable and ethically-sourced products.  This commitment sets us apart from competitors who may solely focus on mainstream trends without acknowledging the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon offers a comprehensive range of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. Our core offerings include a wide variety of hair treatments, ranging from classic haircuts and styling to advanced techniques like keratin smoothing, global coloring, and hair extensions.  We use only premium quality hair products sourced from reputable international brands, ensuring the best possible results and minimizing damage. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond hair care, we provide an extensive menu of beauty services. This includes expertly administered facials customized to different skin types and concerns, using both traditional and cutting-edge techniques. Our skilled makeup artists offer flawless bridal makeup, party makeup, and everyday looks, perfectly suited for the dynamic social landscape of Guwahati.  We also provide advanced skincare treatments like microdermabrasion and chemical peels, alongside classic manicures, pedicures, and waxing services.</p> <br> <br>

<p>One of our unique selling propositions is our specialized "Assam Herbal Spa" treatments.  These treatments incorporate traditional Assamese herbs and oils known for their therapeutic properties, offering clients a unique experience that blends modern beauty practices with the rich cultural heritage of the region.  These treatments are not only relaxing but also beneficial for skin and hair health, reflecting a commitment to natural and sustainable beauty solutions, a growing trend amongst discerning consumers in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon, exceptional customer service is paramount. We believe in creating a welcoming and relaxing environment where clients feel pampered and valued from the moment they step inside.  Our highly trained and experienced staff are not only skilled professionals but also warm and friendly, dedicated to providing personalized attention and ensuring client satisfaction.  We pride ourselves on building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs and preferences to create a truly bespoke beauty experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We consistently strive to exceed expectations, paying close attention to detail and ensuring a seamless and comfortable experience.  This includes a tranquil and stylish salon environment, comfortable seating, and the latest technology and equipment to enhance the quality of our services.  Our commitment to hygiene and sanitation is unwavering, ensuring a safe and healthy environment for all our clients.  Beyond individual service, we actively engage with the local community, supporting local events and participating in charity initiatives to further strengthen our connection with the city of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon has ambitious growth plans for the future. We aim to expand our services to incorporate advanced beauty technologies and techniques, always remaining at the forefront of the industry.  This includes exploring partnerships with international brands and incorporating innovative treatments to meet the evolving demands of our clientele. We also plan to expand our team, recruiting highly skilled professionals who share our commitment to excellence and customer satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term vision includes establishing Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon as the leading beauty destination in Guwahati and beyond. We envision expanding to multiple locations throughout Assam, bringing our unique blend of traditional and modern beauty services to a wider audience. We also plan to develop our own line of beauty products, leveraging the rich natural resources of Assam to create high-quality, locally-sourced products that reflect our commitment to sustainable and ethical practices.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Plush Hair Beauty Spa Salon is dedicated to empowering individuals to embrace their natural beauty and feel confident in their skin. We aim to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a sanctuary of beauty and well-being, deeply rooted in the community, and continually evolving to meet the dynamic needs of our clients and the vibrant city of Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:10:28.000Z'),
(523, 'NEW LOOKS', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>NEW LOOKS: Redefining Style in Guwahati</h1>

<p>NEW LOOKS is a dynamic and rapidly growing fashion and lifestyle destination located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. We are committed to providing the people of Assam with access to high-quality, trendsetting apparel, accessories, and personalized styling services.  Our unique approach blends the latest international fashion trends with a deep understanding of the local aesthetic, creating a shopping experience that is both exciting and relevant to the Guwahati community.  We strive to be more than just a retail store; we aim to be a style hub, fostering a sense of community and empowering individuals to express their unique personalities through fashion.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Guwahati''s vibrant cultural landscape and growing fashion consciousness provide a fertile ground for a business like NEW LOOKS.  The city boasts a diverse population with a keen interest in fashion, yet often faces limitations in accessing a wide range of high-quality, contemporary styles.  NEW LOOKS fills this gap by offering a curated selection of clothing and accessories that cater to diverse tastes and preferences, ensuring something for every individual. We recognize the importance of supporting local artisans and businesses whenever possible, incorporating unique Assamese designs and materials into our offerings where appropriate, to support and showcase the rich cultural heritage of the region. This commitment to local partnerships sets us apart and strengthens our connection with the community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>NEW LOOKS offers a comprehensive range of products and services. Our apparel collection spans various styles, from casual wear to formal attire, encompassing both international brands and carefully selected pieces from emerging designers.  We prioritize quality materials, craftsmanship, and versatility in our selections. Our accessories range complements our apparel, offering a diverse selection of footwear, handbags, jewelry, and other fashion accessories.  Beyond retail, we also offer personalized styling services. Our experienced stylists work closely with clients to understand their individual needs and preferences, helping them create looks that enhance their confidence and reflect their personal style.  This personalized approach distinguishes us from other retailers and provides a unique value proposition for our customers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling points lie in our curated selection, emphasizing quality over quantity, our commitment to personalized customer service, and our focus on integrating local craftsmanship and designs into our offerings. We believe in providing a shopping experience that is both enjoyable and informative, ensuring our customers feel confident and empowered in their style choices.  The need for contemporary, stylish clothing and accessories combined with a personalized shopping experience is a significant gap in the market that NEW LOOKS expertly fills.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At NEW LOOKS, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful business. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every customer feels valued and respected.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always ready to assist customers with finding the perfect outfit, offering style advice, and answering any questions. We also leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, offering online browsing capabilities, convenient payment options, and personalized recommendations based on individual customer profiles.  Our aim is to foster a loyal customer base by creating long-lasting relationships built on trust and mutual respect.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives.  This could include sponsoring local events, partnering with charitable organizations, or collaborating with local influencers to promote our brand and connect with a wider audience. We recognize that our success is intertwined with the success of the community we serve, and we are committed to giving back and contributing positively to Guwahati''s vibrant social fabric. Our commitment to fostering a sense of community, combined with our personalized approach and exceptional customer service, sets us apart and builds customer loyalty.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>NEW LOOKS has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We envision expanding our product lines to include a wider range of lifestyle products and services.  This could involve introducing home décor items, beauty products, or fitness apparel, further consolidating our position as a one-stop shop for fashion-conscious individuals in Guwahati.  We also plan to explore opportunities to expand our physical presence through the opening of additional stores across Assam or even online retail options, thereby reaching a broader customer base. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish NEW LOOKS as the leading fashion and lifestyle destination in Assam, renowned for its high-quality products, exceptional customer service, and strong community engagement. We are committed to constantly evolving and adapting to changing trends, while staying true to our core values of quality, style, and personalized service. We believe that by continuing to innovate, embrace technology, and remain deeply connected to the Guwahati community, NEW LOOKS will achieve sustainable growth and lasting success.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In summary, NEW LOOKS is poised for significant growth and success.  Our strategic location in Guwahati, our unique blend of international trends and local influences, and our commitment to exceptional customer service provide a solid foundation for future expansion and market leadership.  We are confident in our ability to not only meet but exceed the expectations of our customers and contribute positively to the vibrant fashion landscape of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8453925072', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:10:36.000Z'),
(524, 'Brush & Blush by Amreen', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Brush & Blush by Amreen: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Brush & Blush by Amreen is a premier beauty destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  Established with a vision to provide exceptional beauty services and a personalized experience, we stand apart in the vibrant and growing beauty market of the region. Our commitment to using high-quality products, coupled with a deep understanding of the unique beauty needs of Assamese women, sets us apart and makes us a trusted name in the community.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary where clients can relax, rejuvenate, and emerge feeling confident and beautiful. <br> <br> </p>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Blend of Tradition and Trend</h2>

<p>At Brush & Blush by Amreen, we offer a comprehensive range of beauty services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. Our services encompass a wide spectrum, from classic manicures and pedicures to advanced skincare treatments and sophisticated makeup artistry.  We specialize in bridal makeup, catering to the unique requirements and preferences of Assamese brides, incorporating traditional elements with contemporary techniques.  We pride ourselves on using only premium, internationally recognized brands alongside carefully curated, locally sourced, natural ingredients wherever possible, reflecting our commitment to both quality and sustainability.  <br> <br> </p>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized approach. We take the time to understand each client''s individual needs, preferences, and skin type, creating customized treatment plans that deliver visible and lasting results.  Whether it''s a simple eyebrow shaping or a complete bridal makeover, our skilled and experienced beauticians ensure a seamless and satisfying experience. We also offer specialized hair treatments using natural ingredients, catering to the specific challenges of maintaining healthy hair in the Assamese climate. This focus on personalized care, coupled with our commitment to quality, has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish a strong reputation within Guwahati.  <br> <br> </p>

<p>The local market in Guwahati demands high-quality beauty services that are both modern and sensitive to the regional aesthetic.  We cater to this demand by offering a range of services that seamlessly blend international trends with local preferences. Our use of locally sourced ingredients, where appropriate, highlights our commitment to supporting the local economy and reflecting the rich cultural heritage of Assam in our services. This approach resonates strongly with our clients, reinforcing our position as a beauty haven that truly understands and celebrates the beauty of the region.  <br> <br> </p>


<h2>Customer Experience:  More Than Just a Service</h2>

<p>At Brush & Blush by Amreen, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm welcome and a relaxing atmosphere.  Our team is highly trained, not only in their respective beauty specializations but also in providing personalized attention and creating a comfortable environment for every client.  We strive to create a sense of community among our clients, fostering a space where they feel valued, understood, and pampered. <br> <br> </p>

<p>Our commitment to building strong relationships with our clients extends beyond individual appointments.  We actively engage with our community through various initiatives, including collaborations with local businesses and participation in community events.  This focus on building genuine connections allows us to stay attuned to the evolving needs of our clients and the broader Guwahati market.  We actively solicit feedback and use it to improve our services and ensure we consistently meet and exceed client expectations. We regularly conduct surveys and hold informal feedback sessions to ensure our services remain relevant and enjoyable for our valued clientele. <br> <br> </p>

<p>What truly sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to client satisfaction. We are dedicated to creating a luxurious and welcoming atmosphere, coupled with a genuine desire to help our clients feel their best. We believe in the transformative power of beauty and strive to create a space where our clients can truly relax, rejuvenate, and embrace their natural beauty.  Our personalized approach, combined with our commitment to building genuine connections with the community, defines our unique approach to customer service and helps differentiate us from other businesses in the area.  <br> <br> </p>


<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons</h2>

<p>Brush & Blush by Amreen has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision expanding our services to include additional advanced treatments and incorporating emerging beauty trends in a manner that respects and complements the unique beauty of the Assamese woman.  We plan on strategically expanding our range of products to offer a more comprehensive selection of high-quality cosmetics and skincare items for retail sale within the salon. This will allow us to provide a more holistic beauty experience for our clients, catering to their needs beyond appointment-based services. <br> <br> </p>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become the leading beauty destination in Guwahati and a recognized name throughout Assam.  This involves investing in ongoing training for our team, embracing technological advancements, and expanding our physical presence to accommodate growing demand.  We are committed to consistently enhancing our service offerings, staying at the forefront of industry trends, and continuing to build strong relationships with both our clients and the wider community. We are exploring opportunities for franchise expansion, allowing us to share our unique brand of personalized beauty care with other regions of Assam and beyond.  This expansion will be carefully managed to maintain our high standards of quality and personalized service. <br> <br> </p>

<p>Ultimately, our vision for Brush & Blush by Amreen is to be more than just a beauty salon; we aspire to be a beauty community hub that celebrates the unique beauty of Assamese women, supports the local economy, and empowers individuals to embrace their confidence and shine. Our commitment to excellence and our dedication to our clients will guide our growth and ensure our continued success in the years to come. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002777243', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:10:45.000Z'),
(525, 'AAKAR HAIR & BEAUTY SALON', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>AAKAR Hair & Beauty Salon: Guwahati''s Premier Destination for Hair and Beauty</h1>

