<p>Our long-term goal is to establish D''mystique Family Salon as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service.  We are committed to continuous improvement and professional development, ensuring that our staff remain at the forefront of the beauty industry.  Through our dedication to excellence, our commitment to community engagement, and our forward-thinking approach, we are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious goals and create a lasting impact on the beauty landscape of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, D''mystique Family Salon aspires to be more than just a business; we aim to be a cherished part of the Guwahati community, enriching the lives of our clients one beautiful experience at a time.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9954172298', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:30:44.000Z'),
(545, 'Jk Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Jk Salon: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

