<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Jk Salon as the leading beauty destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative approach, and strong community ties.  We aim to build on our reputation for quality, personalized service, and cultural sensitivity, continually evolving to meet the changing needs and expectations of our valued clientele. We are committed to maintaining our commitment to ethical sourcing of products and our dedication to creating a sustainable and environmentally conscious business.  Our unwavering focus on providing a superior salon experience combined with our commitment to the Guwahati community will solidify our position as a leading beauty provider for years to come.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T13:35:11.000Z'),
