<p>Our commitment extends beyond individual clients; we are actively involved in fostering connections within the local business community. We regularly organize networking events and workshops, providing platforms for collaboration and knowledge sharing among entrepreneurs and businesses in Guwahati. This fosters a sense of community and mutual support, strengthening the overall business ecosystem of the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We pride ourselves on our responsiveness and accessibility. We understand the importance of timely and effective communication, ensuring that our clients receive prompt responses and regular updates on their progress. This commitment to transparency and accessibility builds trust and strengthens the relationships we establish with our clients.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>B U envisions a future where it plays a leading role in the economic development of Guwahati and Assam. Our plans involve expanding our service offerings to incorporate emerging technologies and industry trends. We will continue to invest in developing our expertise and expanding our team, attracting top talent from within the region and beyond. This will allow us to better serve our growing client base and adapt to the ever-evolving business landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We also aim to further strengthen our community engagement initiatives. This will involve creating more opportunities for collaboration, skill development, and networking within the local business community. Our long-term goal is to not only contribute to the growth of individual businesses but also to help foster a thriving and sustainable economic ecosystem in Guwahati and Assam. We believe that through collaboration, innovation, and a strong commitment to customer satisfaction, B U can achieve its vision and make a significant and lasting impact on the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our ultimate vision is to establish B U as a benchmark for excellence in business support and consulting services within Assam, known for its unwavering commitment to client success, its deep understanding of the local market, and its positive contribution to the growth and development of the Assamese economy. We are confident that our dedication to innovation, community engagement, and superior customer service will position B U for continued success and lasting impact.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8876111174', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:25:19.000Z'),
(584, 'Mallika''s Beauty Parlour', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Mallika''s Beauty Parlour: Enhancing Beauty, Celebrating Heritage</h1>

<p>Mallika''s Beauty Parlour, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a beauty salon; it''s a haven of rejuvenation and self-expression, deeply rooted in the rich cultural tapestry of the region.  Established with a vision to provide exceptional beauty services tailored to the unique needs and preferences of Assamese women and men, Mallika''s has quickly become a trusted name, renowned for its personalized approach and commitment to excellence.  We strive to not only enhance our clients'' outward appearance but also to foster a sense of confidence and well-being, reflecting the vibrant spirit of Assam itself. Our unique blend of traditional Assamese beauty practices and modern techniques sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of beauty treatments, meticulously designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele.  We offer a wide array of hair services, from traditional oil treatments infused with locally sourced herbs to the latest in hair styling and coloring techniques.  Our expertise extends to advanced skincare treatments, including facials tailored to different skin types using natural ingredients, and specialized therapies addressing specific skin concerns.  We also provide expertly applied makeup services for special occasions, ensuring a flawless and natural look that enhances individual beauty.  Beyond these core offerings, we are proud to offer traditional Assamese bridal makeup services, preserving and celebrating the rich heritage of the region’s beauty rituals.  This unique offering caters specifically to the needs of the local community, drawing on ancestral techniques combined with modern cosmetic advancements.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What truly sets Mallika''s Beauty Parlour apart is our unwavering commitment to personalized customer service. We believe in building strong, lasting relationships with each client, understanding their unique needs and preferences, and tailoring our services accordingly. Our highly skilled and professionally trained beauticians are not only experts in their respective fields but also possess exceptional interpersonal skills, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where clients feel comfortable and pampered.  We actively engage with the local community, participating in regional events and sponsoring local initiatives, further strengthening our ties and demonstrating our commitment to the growth and well-being of Guwahati.  Regular workshops and training programs for our staff ensure that we consistently stay abreast of the latest trends and techniques, while also maintaining the highest standards of hygiene and professionalism.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our dedication to customer satisfaction is further reinforced by our use of high-quality, ethically sourced products. We prioritize the use of natural and organic ingredients whenever possible, aligning with our commitment to sustainable and environmentally responsible practices.  Many of our products are locally sourced, supporting local businesses and artisans, reflecting our deep commitment to the Assamese community.  This conscious choice not only benefits our clients'' skin and hair but also contributes to the overall economic well-being of the region.  Client feedback is actively solicited and used to continually improve our services and refine our approach. We actively foster a culture of continuous improvement, ensuring that we constantly adapt to meet the evolving needs of our diverse clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Mallika''s Beauty Parlour envisions a future where it remains a leading provider of exceptional beauty services in Guwahati, consistently exceeding client expectations.  We plan to expand our service offerings to include advanced beauty treatments and wellness therapies, potentially incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices. This expansion will not only enhance our current offerings but also further solidify our unique position in the market.  We aim to increase our brand visibility through strategic marketing and community engagement initiatives, reaching a wider audience and building stronger relationships with our valued clientele.  Investing in advanced technology and further training for our staff will ensure that we maintain our position at the forefront of the beauty industry in Assam.  Our long-term goal is to become a recognized symbol of excellence, beauty, and cultural preservation within the Guwahati community and beyond.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are committed to fostering a sustainable and ethical business model, promoting environmental responsibility and supporting local communities.  Our dedication to using natural and locally sourced products is a testament to this commitment.  We aim to create a positive impact on the environment and contribute to the economic prosperity of the region.  By combining traditional Assamese practices with modern techniques, Mallika''s Beauty Parlour is not only enhancing the beauty of its clients but also preserving and celebrating the rich cultural heritage of Assam.  Our future plans include collaborations with local artisans and businesses, promoting their products and services within our salon. This strategy supports local entrepreneurs and provides our clients with an even wider range of quality products and experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, Mallika''s Beauty Parlour stands as a testament to the power of combining tradition with innovation. We are more than just a beauty salon; we are a community hub, a place of rejuvenation, and a celebration of Assamese beauty and culture.  Our commitment to exceptional customer service, high-quality products, and sustainable practices ensures that we will continue to thrive and make a meaningful contribution to the Guwahati community for years to come.  We are confident that our personalized approach, coupled with our dedication to innovation and community engagement, will ensure our continued success and allow us to achieve our ambitious vision for the future.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:25:27.000Z'),
(585, 'Curl Cure Salon - Guwahati', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Curl Cure Salon - Guwahati</h1>

<p>Curl Cure Salon, nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a hair salon; it''s a haven for embracing and celebrating natural hair texture.  We understand the unique needs of the diverse population of Assam, and our salon is specifically designed to cater to those needs with expertise and personalized care. In a region where traditional hair care practices often clash with modern styling trends, Curl Cure Salon bridges this gap, providing a modern, professional approach to hair care that respects and enhances natural beauty. We aim to be the leading destination for all things curly, coily, and naturally textured in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence starts with our highly skilled and experienced stylists.  Each stylist undergoes rigorous training in the latest techniques for managing and styling all hair types, with a special emphasis on textured hair. We pride ourselves on staying abreast of the latest industry trends and continuously upgrading our skills to ensure we offer the best possible services to our clients. This dedication to professional development translates directly into superior service and a noticeable difference in the results our clients experience.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our comprehensive service menu is designed to address every aspect of textured hair care.  We offer a range of services including customized haircuts tailored to individual curl patterns, deep conditioning treatments to nourish and repair damaged hair, and a variety of styling options, from natural looks to more elaborate styles for special occasions.  We utilize only high-quality, professional-grade products specifically formulated for textured hair, ensuring the health and vibrancy of each client''s hair.  Our product lines are carefully curated to cater to various hair types and concerns, ranging from moisturizing and defining products to treatments aimed at minimizing frizz and promoting healthy growth.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets Curl Cure Salon apart is our unwavering focus on personalized attention. We believe that each client deserves an individualized approach, understanding that no two heads of hair are alike.  Our consultations are thorough and informative, allowing us to understand our clients'' hair goals and concerns, before creating a customized care plan that addresses their specific needs. This personalized service, coupled with the use of high-quality products and advanced techniques, allows us to deliver exceptional results consistently. We also recognize the unique climate of Assam and adapt our treatments to manage the challenges posed by humidity and environmental factors.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment extends beyond mere styling; we actively educate our clients about proper hair care practices.  We aim to empower our clients to manage their hair effectively at home, providing them with the knowledge and tools needed to maintain the health and beauty of their hair between salon visits. This approach fosters a long-term relationship with our clients, built on trust, education, and shared success in achieving beautiful, healthy hair.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Curl Cure Salon, we believe that the customer experience is paramount.  From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Our salon is designed to be a relaxing and comfortable space, where clients can feel pampered and rejuvenated.  We pride ourselves on providing exceptional customer service, ensuring that each client feels heard, valued, and understood.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our dedication to building strong relationships with our local community is integral to our business philosophy.  We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events to foster a sense of belonging and connection.  We believe in supporting local businesses and actively seek out partnerships with other businesses in the Guwahati area.  This commitment to community engagement is not only good for business but also reflects our values and strengthens our ties with the people we serve.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Curl Cure Salon has ambitious plans for the future. We envision expanding our services to include advanced hair treatments, workshops, and educational programs for aspiring hair stylists, specifically focusing on textured hair care.  We also plan to expand our product line to encompass a wider range of products, possibly including organic and locally sourced ingredients, reflecting our commitment to sustainability and supporting local artisans.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in the textured hair care industry in Assam, setting a new standard for excellence and professionalism. We aim to build a brand that is synonymous with quality, integrity, and a deep understanding of the unique needs of our diverse clientele.  Through continued investment in training, technology, and community engagement, we are confident in our ability to achieve this vision and become a cornerstone of the beauty industry in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are committed to remaining at the forefront of innovation in hair care, constantly adapting to emerging trends and technologies. We strive to create an inclusive and welcoming environment where every client feels comfortable and confident in their natural beauty.  At Curl Cure Salon, we don''t just style hair; we empower individuals to embrace and celebrate their unique beauty.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9395976020', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:25:35.000Z'),
(586, 'Ki & Ka', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Ki & Ka: Elevating Assamese Craftsmanship and Culinary Traditions in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Ki & Ka, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a unique enterprise dedicated to celebrating and showcasing the rich tapestry of Assamese culture through handcrafted goods and authentic culinary experiences.  We are not merely a business; we are a vibrant reflection of the state''s heritage, striving to connect the past with the present and build a sustainable future for local artisans and culinary talents. Our commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement sets us apart in the dynamic Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our distinct approach lies in our dual focus: meticulously curated Assamese handicrafts and a delightful culinary journey through the flavors of Assam.  This synergy allows us to offer a holistic experience that captures the essence of the region. We believe in showcasing the unparalleled skill and artistry of Assamese artisans, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience and secure a fair income for their exceptional work.  Simultaneously, we present a refined culinary experience, offering traditional Assamese dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, using recipes passed down through generations. This commitment to authenticity ensures that our customers savor the true taste of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our handcrafted goods encompass a diverse range of items, including intricately woven Muga silk garments, exquisitely crafted bamboo and cane products, beautiful pottery showcasing traditional Assamese motifs, and hand-painted textiles. Each item tells a story, reflecting the dedication and artistry of the artisans who created them.  Our unique selling point is our rigorous commitment to sourcing directly from skilled artisans, ensuring fair trade practices and preserving traditional craftsmanship.  This allows us to guarantee the authenticity and quality of each product, offering customers a piece of Assamese heritage to treasure.</p> <br> <br>

<p>On the culinary front, Ki & Ka offers a curated menu featuring classic Assamese dishes.  From the aromatic flavors of Masor Tenga (fish curry) to the comforting warmth of Khar (a unique fermented bamboo shoot dish), our menu is a celebration of Assamese culinary traditions. We use locally sourced, seasonal ingredients whenever possible, ensuring the freshest and most authentic taste. We also offer a selection of traditional Assamese sweets and beverages, offering a complete culinary journey through the region’s diverse flavours. Our unique selling proposition here is our dedication to using traditional recipes and techniques, preserving the unique taste profile of Assamese cuisine while catering to modern palates. The local market benefits from the promotion of these traditional foods, ensuring their continued relevance and appeal.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Ki & Ka, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and engaging atmosphere where customers can not only purchase exquisite goods and enjoy delectable food but also learn about the rich cultural heritage behind them. Our knowledgeable staff are passionate about sharing their understanding of Assamese art and cuisine, providing personalized service and ensuring every interaction is memorable.  We believe in building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and loyalty.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local artisans and participation in community events. This approach builds strong relationships, supports local talent, and showcases the essence of Assamese culture to both locals and visitors alike. Our commitment to sustainability is reflected in our responsible sourcing practices, ethical business dealings, and the use of eco-friendly packaging where possible.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and strive to operate ethically and sustainably.  This commitment resonates with our customers, further strengthening our brand identity.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Ki & Ka envisions a future where we become a leading destination for experiencing the best of Assamese culture. We plan to expand our product line by including more items from across Assam, collaborating with a wider network of artisans, and introducing new culinary creations.  We will also explore opportunities for online sales to reach a broader audience, both nationally and internationally, while maintaining our commitment to quality and authenticity. This expansion will require strategic partnerships with regional and national retailers while simultaneously investing in our online presence.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Ki & Ka as a sustainable and thriving business that not only contributes to the economic empowerment of Assamese artisans and culinary professionals but also plays a vital role in promoting the cultural heritage of Assam to the world.  We aim to establish a strong brand identity synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Through innovative strategies, strategic partnerships, and a steadfast commitment to our core values, we are confident in achieving our ambitious vision and continuing to celebrate the unique cultural identity of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Ki & Ka is more than just a business; it is a testament to the enduring spirit of Assamese craftsmanship and culinary excellence. We are committed to providing an exceptional experience for our customers, while also contributing significantly to the economic and cultural growth of Guwahati and Assam as a whole.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822511411', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:25:42.000Z'),
(587, 'Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Salon: Redefining Elegance in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Salon, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a salon; it''s a sanctuary of style and self-care, meticulously crafted to cater to the discerning clientele of the region.  We understand the unique beauty standards and preferences of the Assamese community and strive to provide services that reflect and enhance them. Our commitment to using high-quality products, coupled with our team of highly skilled and passionate stylists, sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati beauty market. We are not just a business; we are a community hub where individuals can relax, rejuvenate, and celebrate their individuality.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our significance in the local landscape stems from our dedication to offering a comprehensive range of services tailored to the specific needs of our diverse clientele.  We recognize the rich cultural heritage of Assam and strive to incorporate traditional elements alongside contemporary trends, creating a unique experience that resonates with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, further solidifying our position as a trusted and integral part of the Guwahati business community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Salon offers a comprehensive suite of hair and beauty services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clients. Our hair services range from classic cuts and styling to advanced color treatments, including highlights, balayage, and ombre techniques, utilizing premium, internationally recognized brands.  We also specialize in traditional Assamese bridal hair and makeup, incorporating intricate designs and styles that reflect the region''s rich cultural heritage. Our skilled makeup artists are adept at creating both classic and contemporary looks, using high-quality cosmetics that are gentle on the skin.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond hair and makeup, we offer a range of other services, including manicures, pedicures, facials, and waxing.  We utilize innovative techniques and technologically advanced equipment to ensure superior results. Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to personalized service. Each client receives a thorough consultation to determine their individual needs and preferences, ensuring a customized experience that reflects their unique style and personality. We also offer exclusive packages tailored to special occasions, such as weddings and festivals, providing comprehensive beauty solutions for our clients’ most important events.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The use of high-quality, ethically sourced products is another key differentiator. We prioritize environmentally friendly and cruelty-free options, reflecting our commitment to sustainability and responsible business practices.  Our selection caters to various skin types and hair textures, ensuring that each client receives the most appropriate and effective treatment.  We also offer a curated selection of retail products, allowing clients to maintain their salon look at home.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Salon, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. We strive to create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere where clients feel pampered and valued. Our friendly and professional staff are dedicated to providing personalized attention and exceeding expectations.  We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our clients, and we foster a sense of community within our salon, creating a space where clients feel comfortable and connected.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to providing a superior customer experience extends beyond individual interactions. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, sponsoring local events, and partnering with charitable organizations. This demonstrates our commitment to giving back and fostering positive relationships within the community we serve. We also leverage digital platforms to interact with our clients, offering convenient online booking, appointment reminders, and ongoing communication to enhance the overall customer journey. We value feedback and continuously strive to improve our services based on client suggestions.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Salon envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond.  Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to incorporate additional specialized treatments and therapies. We also plan to develop our online presence and enhance our digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience.  We are exploring partnerships with local businesses and influencers to increase brand awareness and solidify our position as a leading beauty destination in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Long-term, we aim to become a recognized leader in the Assamese beauty industry, known for our exceptional services, commitment to quality, and dedication to customer satisfaction.  We will continue to invest in our staff through ongoing training and development, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge to deliver the highest standards of service.  Our goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local economy and community while providing unparalleled beauty experiences to our clients.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Salon''s vision is to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a trusted partner in our clients’ journey of self-care and self-expression, creating a lasting legacy of beauty and well-being within the vibrant city of Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:30:11.000Z'),
(588, 'Purple Orchid Unisex Saloon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Purple Orchid Unisex Saloon: A Guwahati Oasis of Style and Care</h1>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, Purple Orchid Unisex Saloon stands as a testament to modern aesthetics and traditional hospitality.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary of self-care, offering a comprehensive range of services designed to enhance the beauty and well-being of our diverse clientele.  In a city known for its rich cultural tapestry and burgeoning modern sensibilities, Purple Orchid caters to the evolving needs of Guwahati''s residents, providing a unique blend of professional expertise and personalized attention. We aim to be more than just a beauty destination; we aim to be a part of the community fabric, contributing to a sense of well-being and confidence among our valued patrons. <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence is reflected in our dedication to providing a superior customer experience. We firmly believe that every individual deserves to feel pampered and valued, regardless of their background or preferences. This commitment shapes every aspect of our operations, from the selection of premium products to the professional training of our highly skilled team members. We recognize that the beauty industry in Guwahati is competitive; however, our focus on personalized care and attention to detail sets us apart from the competition.  <br> <br>


<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Purple Orchid offers a complete range of hair care, skin care, and nail care services for both men and women. Our highly trained stylists are adept in the latest international trends while incorporating traditional techniques to create personalized styles that flatter individual features and preferences. Our hair services include haircuts, styling, coloring, treatments (including oil treatments specifically tailored for the local climate), and extensions.  We use premium, internationally recognized hair care products that are both effective and gentle on the scalp and hair.  <br> <br>

<p>Our skincare services encompass facials tailored to different skin types and concerns, using both natural and clinically proven ingredients. We provide a wide array of beauty treatments, such as waxing, threading, and makeup application, catering to various occasions and preferences. Our nail care services include manicures, pedicures, and nail art, featuring a variety of creative designs and colors.  We are particularly proud of our commitment to using eco-friendly and cruelty-free products wherever possible, reflecting a growing demand for sustainable beauty practices in Guwahati.  <br> <br>


<p>What truly sets Purple Orchid apart is our commitment to using locally sourced, organic ingredients whenever feasible, particularly in our skincare treatments. This aligns with a growing consumer preference for natural and sustainable beauty options and showcases our dedication to supporting local farmers and businesses. Furthermore, we strive to offer competitive pricing structures to make our services accessible to a wide range of customers. We understand that beauty should be inclusive and affordable for everyone in the community. <br> <br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Purple Orchid, we believe that the customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and relaxing environment where our clients can feel comfortable and pampered. Our staff is trained to be friendly, professional, and attentive to individual needs. We prioritize open communication, ensuring that our clients are fully involved in the process and feel heard. We encourage feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure we meet the evolving needs of our community. <br> <br>


<p>Our dedication to customer service extends beyond individual appointments. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We participate in local events and offer special promotions to support local charities.  We are committed to building long-term relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of loyalty and trust.  Regular client loyalty programs, personalized recommendations, and special offers contribute to fostering this relationship. We believe our commitment to community engagement positions Purple Orchid as more than just a business, but as a contributing member of the Guwahati community. <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Purple Orchid has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  We aim to continue expanding our range of services to meet the evolving needs of our clientele. This includes exploring new beauty trends, incorporating advanced technologies, and introducing specialized treatments.  We are committed to maintaining our high standards of quality and customer service, while constantly striving to improve and innovate.  We recognize the importance of staying ahead of industry trends and adapting our offerings to meet the changing preferences of our diverse clientele. <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Purple Orchid as the leading unisex salon in Guwahati, known for its exceptional service, professional expertise, and commitment to community engagement. We plan to achieve this through a combination of strategic marketing, continuous training and development for our staff, and a relentless focus on providing an unparalleled customer experience. We are exploring potential expansion opportunities, including the possibility of opening additional locations within Guwahati or expanding to neighboring regions of Assam. This expansion would allow us to reach a wider audience and contribute to the economic growth of the region. We believe that a strong community presence and commitment to excellence will enable us to successfully achieve our ambitious goals. <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:30:19.000Z'),
(589, 'M.D BEAUTY STUDIO', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>M.D BEAUTY STUDIO: Elevating Beauty Standards in Guwahati</h1>

<p>M.D Beauty Studio, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a beauty salon; it''s a sanctuary of self-care and a testament to the growing appreciation for personalized beauty services in the region.  We are committed to providing exceptional beauty treatments and fostering a welcoming environment where every client feels pampered and empowered.  Our unique approach blends traditional beauty practices with modern techniques, creating a distinctive experience that resonates with the sophisticated tastes of Guwahati''s clientele.  We recognize the evolving needs of the Assamese beauty market and strive to offer services that cater to diverse preferences and skin tones, reflecting the rich cultural tapestry of our community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to quality and personalized service sets us apart.  We understand that beauty is subjective and deeply personal. Therefore, we prioritize individual consultations to understand each client''s unique needs and aspirations before recommending any treatment. This individualized approach ensures that every experience is tailored to achieve optimal results and enhance natural beauty.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>M.D Beauty Studio offers a comprehensive range of beauty services, catering to a broad spectrum of needs. Our expertise spans several key areas:</p> <br> <br>

<p><strong>Skincare:</strong>  We offer a variety of facials, tailored to different skin types and concerns. From deep cleansing and exfoliation to hydrating and anti-aging treatments, our facials utilize high-quality products that are suitable for sensitive skin and address common concerns like acne, pigmentation, and dullness. We also provide advanced skincare solutions, including chemical peels and microdermabrasion, performed by experienced and certified professionals.</p> <br> <br>

<p><strong>Hair Care:</strong> Our hair services encompass a wide array of options, from precision haircuts and styling to specialized treatments for hair growth, repair, and damage control. We use premium hair products that are carefully selected for their effectiveness and gentle formulations. Our stylists are well-versed in the latest trends and techniques, ensuring clients leave with a style that complements their features and personality.</p> <br> <br>

<p><strong>Makeup:</strong>  Whether it''s for a special occasion, a wedding, or everyday wear, our makeup artists are highly skilled in creating both natural and dramatic looks. We use long-lasting, high-quality makeup products to ensure a flawless finish that lasts throughout the day or night. We offer makeup consultations to help clients find the perfect look for their features and style preferences.</p> <br> <br>

<p><strong>Waxing & Threading:</strong>  Our expert beauticians perform precise and efficient waxing and threading services, ensuring a smooth and comfortable experience for our clients. We maintain the highest standards of hygiene and use only top-quality products to minimize any discomfort and potential irritation.</p> <br> <br>

<p><strong>Unique Selling Proposition:</strong>  Our unique selling points lie in our personalized approach, the use of high-quality products, and the continuous training and development of our team.  We prioritize client comfort and satisfaction, creating a luxurious and relaxing atmosphere that sets us apart from other beauty salons in Guwahati.  We also focus on using products that are suited to the unique needs of Assamese skin and hair, offering solutions that are both effective and culturally sensitive. </p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At M.D Beauty Studio, the customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming, comfortable, and luxurious atmosphere where clients feel valued and relaxed. From the moment they step into our studio, clients are greeted with warmth and professionalism. We believe in open communication and actively listen to our clients'' needs and preferences, tailoring our services accordingly.  We prioritize building long-term relationships with our clients based on trust and mutual respect.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond our services. We maintain meticulous hygiene standards and utilize only top-of-the-line, sanitized equipment and products.  We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and by supporting local charities. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>M.D Beauty Studio envisions itself as a leading beauty destination in Guwahati, known for its exceptional services, personalized attention, and commitment to excellence. We plan to expand our service offerings to include additional treatments and products based on evolving market demands and technological advancements within the beauty industry.  We aim to continue investing in our team''s professional development through ongoing training programs and workshops, ensuring our staff remains at the forefront of industry best practices.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goals include expanding our studio''s physical space to accommodate more treatment rooms and enhance client comfort.  We also plan to explore opportunities for online booking and retail sales of our preferred beauty products.  Our ultimate aim is to provide a holistic beauty experience that exceeds expectations and contributes to the overall well-being of our valued clientele. We see ourselves as more than just a beauty studio; we aspire to be a trusted partner in helping our clients feel confident, radiant, and empowered.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are confident that our dedication to personalized service, quality products, and continuous improvement will allow M.D Beauty Studio to flourish and become a highly sought-after destination for beauty enthusiasts in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:30:28.000Z'),
(590, 'Lucky AC Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Lucky AC Salon: Redefining Luxury and Comfort in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Lucky AC Salon, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a salon; it''s a haven of relaxation and rejuvenation, meticulously designed to cater to the discerning clientele of the city.  We understand the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese community and have tailored our services and approach to reflect the local culture while incorporating contemporary trends in hair and beauty care.  Our commitment to excellence, coupled with a luxurious and comfortable environment, sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati beauty landscape, offering an unparalleled experience that goes beyond the typical salon visit. <br> <br>

Our dedication to providing top-tier services in a climate-controlled setting – a crucial factor given Guwahati''s tropical climate – is a significant differentiator. The "AC" in our name is not just a label; it represents our commitment to providing a consistently comfortable and enjoyable experience, regardless of the weather outside.  We believe this enhances client comfort and significantly improves the overall salon experience, leading to greater customer satisfaction. <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Lucky AC Salon offers a comprehensive range of hair and beauty services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clients.  Our expertly trained stylists provide a wide array of hairstyles, including traditional Assamese styles alongside modern cuts, coloring, and treatments. We use high-quality, internationally recognized hair products to ensure the health and vibrancy of our clients'' hair.  Beyond hair care, we offer a comprehensive menu of beauty services, including facials tailored to the specific needs of Assamese skin, manicures, pedicures, and waxing services. We also offer bridal packages, meticulously curated to meet the demands of traditional Assamese wedding ceremonies and celebrations.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized service; each client receives a detailed consultation to understand their needs and preferences before any service commences, ensuring a customized and highly satisfying experience. <br> <br>

Our services address the local market need for high-quality, accessible, and comfortable beauty services that blend traditional and modern aesthetics.  We recognize that many salons in Guwahati may not offer the same level of personalized attention or the luxurious climate-controlled environment that we provide. Our focus on hygiene, coupled with the use of advanced tools and techniques, further enhances our value proposition within the local market. <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Lucky AC Salon, our commitment to exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where clients feel pampered and valued from the moment they step inside.  Our team of skilled and friendly professionals are trained not only in their respective areas of expertise but also in providing excellent customer service. We actively listen to our clients'' needs, offering personalized advice and ensuring they feel heard and understood.  This dedication to building strong client relationships helps us foster a loyal customer base, a vital aspect of our success in Guwahati. <br> <br>

We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events and collaborating with other businesses in the area.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and this commitment strengthens our bond with our clients and the larger Guwahati landscape. We also incorporate elements of Assamese culture and aesthetics within the salon''s design and services, further reinforcing our connection with the local community and contributing to the unique identity of our business.  Our commitment to personalized service, coupled with our community engagement efforts, sets us apart from competitors and helps establish Lucky AC Salon as a trusted and cherished part of the Guwahati community. <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Lucky AC Salon envisions continued growth and expansion within Guwahati and potentially beyond.  We plan to expand our service offerings to include advanced beauty treatments and potentially introduce a product line of our own, leveraging the expertise and experience gained over time. We also plan to further develop our strong online presence, creating an easily accessible platform for appointments and promoting our services to a wider audience.  This strategic digital presence will enhance our visibility and allow us to reach clients more effectively. <br> <br>

Our long-term goal is to establish Lucky AC Salon as the leading beauty destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional customer service, high-quality services, and commitment to the local community.  We aim to achieve this by continually investing in training and development for our staff, staying ahead of industry trends, and maintaining our commitment to providing an unparalleled luxurious and comfortable experience for every client.  We believe in sustainable growth and aim to expand our business ethically and responsibly, ensuring that we remain a valued asset to the Guwahati community for many years to come.  The future for Lucky AC Salon is bright, built on a foundation of exceptional service, community engagement, and a deep understanding of the needs and preferences of our valued clients. <br> <br>
</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864265403', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:30:35.000Z'),
(591, 'Waves Spa & saloon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Waves Spa & Saloon: A Haven of Rejuvenation in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Waves Spa & Saloon, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a sanctuary of tranquility and rejuvenation.  We are more than just a spa and salon; we are a holistic wellness destination designed to cater to the unique needs and preferences of the discerning clientele of Guwahati.  Our establishment distinguishes itself through a commitment to exceptional service, the use of high-quality, ethically sourced products, and a deep understanding of the cultural nuances of our community. In the vibrant and rapidly developing landscape of Guwahati''s beauty and wellness industry, Waves Spa & Saloon strives to be a leader, setting new standards for excellence and client satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to providing a truly exceptional experience begins with the selection of our team.  We employ highly skilled and experienced therapists, stylists, and beauty professionals who are passionate about their craft and dedicated to exceeding client expectations.  Regular training and professional development ensure our team remains at the forefront of industry trends and techniques, allowing us to offer the most advanced and effective treatments available.  Furthermore, our team undergoes rigorous customer service training, ensuring a welcoming and personalized experience for every visitor.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Waves Spa & Saloon offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. Our spa services include a variety of massages (ranging from traditional Ayurvedic therapies to modern Swedish techniques), luxurious body wraps and scrubs utilizing natural ingredients sourced locally whenever possible, and rejuvenating facials tailored to individual skin types.  We also offer advanced skincare treatments using cutting-edge technology and premium products.  Our salon services encompass a full spectrum of hair care, including precision haircuts, styling, coloring, and treatments aimed at improving hair health and vibrancy. Manicures, pedicures, and eyebrow threading are also available, ensuring a complete beauty experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>One of our unique selling points is our commitment to using ethically sourced and locally-produced products whenever feasible. We believe in supporting local artisans and businesses, while simultaneously minimizing our environmental impact. We collaborate with Assam-based suppliers of organic essential oils, herbs, and other natural ingredients, reflecting our commitment to sustainability and community engagement. This approach not only provides our clients with high-quality, natural treatments, but also contributes to the economic vitality of our region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The market in Guwahati is increasingly demanding high-quality, personalized beauty and wellness services. Our diverse offerings, combined with our commitment to natural and ethically sourced products, directly address these demands.  We understand the importance of providing options that cater to a wide range of budgets and preferences, ensuring accessibility and inclusivity for all members of the community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Waves Spa & Saloon, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming, luxurious, and relaxing atmosphere where clients can escape the stresses of daily life and indulge in self-care.  Our dedication to personalized service means that each client receives individualized attention, ensuring their needs and preferences are fully understood and met.  We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is essential, and we foster a sense of community within our establishment.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our approach to customer service goes beyond providing exceptional treatments. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local events and participating in charity drives. We aim to build a reputation not only for excellence in our services but also for our commitment to social responsibility and community engagement.  Our commitment to providing a welcoming and inclusive environment ensures all our clients feel valued and respected.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Waves Spa & Saloon envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond.  We plan to introduce new and innovative treatments and services, staying at the forefront of industry trends.  This will involve ongoing research and development, and the incorporation of new technologies and techniques to enhance our offerings.   We are also exploring opportunities to expand our retail offerings, showcasing and selling the high-quality natural products we use in our treatments. This will allow us to broaden our reach and provide our clients with the opportunity to continue their self-care journey at home.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Waves Spa & Saloon as a leading destination for beauty and wellness in Assam, known for its commitment to exceptional service, high-quality products, and a strong sense of community. We aim to build a brand that is synonymous with luxury, relaxation, and rejuvenation, and which contributes positively to the economic and social fabric of Guwahati.  We believe our dedication to quality, innovation, and community engagement will position us for continued success and sustainable growth in the years to come.  We are confident that Waves Spa & Saloon will not only meet but exceed the growing expectations of the discerning beauty and wellness consumers in Guwahati and beyond.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638091168', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:30:43.000Z'),
(592, 'Nailashes', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Nailashes: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nailashes, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a beauty salon; it''s a destination where artistry meets relaxation, offering a curated experience that caters to the discerning tastes of the Assamese clientele.  We understand the unique beauty standards and preferences prevalent in our region, and our services reflect this deep understanding.  Our commitment to quality, coupled with our dedication to personalized service, sets us apart in the vibrant Guwahati beauty landscape. We strive to be the leading provider of premium nail and lash services, building a loyal customer base through consistent excellence and community engagement.</p><br><br>

<p>Our establishment distinguishes itself by blending traditional hospitality with contemporary beauty techniques.  We recognize that beauty services are not just transactional; they are a form of self-care and personal expression.  Our salon provides a tranquil and welcoming atmosphere, ensuring that each visit is a rejuvenating escape from the daily hustle of city life.  We prioritize a calm and comfortable environment, enhancing the overall pampering experience.</p><br><br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Nailashes provides a comprehensive range of nail and lash enhancement services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clients.  Our nail services include manicures and pedicures, utilizing high-quality, internationally recognized brands, along with advanced nail art techniques reflective of both global trends and traditional Assamese aesthetics. We offer a variety of gel polishes, acrylics, and natural nail treatments, ensuring that we cater to every preference and nail type. We also offer specialized nail treatments for strengthening brittle nails and addressing specific nail concerns.</p><br><br>

<p>Our lash services extend from classic eyelash extensions to more elaborate volume lash sets, using only premium, cruelty-free products. Our skilled lash technicians undergo rigorous training to ensure precise application and maximum comfort.  We focus on customizing lash designs to suit individual facial features and personal styles, creating natural-looking or dramatic lash looks, as preferred by the client.  Furthermore, we offer lash lifting and tinting services, providing a low-maintenance alternative to extensions.</p><br><br>

<p>A key differentiator for Nailashes is our dedication to utilizing only high-quality, ethically sourced products. We believe that beauty should not compromise health or ethical practices. We carefully select our products, ensuring they are free from harsh chemicals and adhere to international safety standards.  This commitment resonates strongly with our environmentally conscious clientele in Guwahati, who are increasingly seeking sustainable and ethical beauty solutions.</p><br><br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Nailashes, customer satisfaction is paramount.  We believe in providing a personalized experience, taking the time to understand each client’s individual needs and preferences.  Our skilled and friendly technicians are highly trained, not only in technical skills, but also in providing exceptional customer service. We prioritize building rapport and trust with each client, fostering a comfortable and welcoming environment where clients feel valued and heard.</p><br><br>

<p>We go above and beyond to ensure every aspect of the customer''s experience is exceptional. This includes offering complimentary refreshments, creating a relaxing ambiance with soothing music and aromatherapy, and ensuring meticulous hygiene standards are upheld.  We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and cater to their evolving needs.</p><br><br>

<p>Our commitment extends beyond individual clients.  Nailashes is deeply committed to engaging with the local community. We actively participate in local events and collaborate with other businesses in Guwahati to foster a strong sense of community and mutual support.  We also support local artists by showcasing their work in the salon and collaborating on special projects.</p><br><br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Nailashes envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market.  Our immediate plans include expanding our service offerings to incorporate additional beauty treatments that complement our existing nail and lash services.  This could include eyebrow shaping and tinting, facials, or other related services that align with the beauty needs of our target clientele.</p><br><br>

<p>We also plan to strengthen our online presence through an enhanced website and active social media engagement.  This will allow us to reach a wider audience and build stronger relationships with our existing and potential clients.  We intend to leverage digital marketing strategies to increase brand awareness and drive customer acquisition.  Furthermore, we are actively exploring opportunities for franchise expansion within Assam, aiming to bring the Nailashes experience to other cities and towns across the state.</p><br><br>

<p>Our long-term vision is to establish Nailashes as the leading beauty destination in Assam, renowned for its unparalleled service, commitment to quality, and strong community ties. We believe in building a sustainable and profitable business that contributes positively to the local economy and empowers women within the beauty industry.  We are dedicated to constant innovation, ensuring we remain at the forefront of beauty trends and consistently exceed the expectations of our valued clientele.</p><br><br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8062645547', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:35:19.000Z'),
(593, 'Waves joean luxury day spa & salon Thai spa special', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Waves Joean Luxury Day Spa & Salon: A Thai Spa Special in Guwahati, Assam</h1>

<p>Waves Joean Luxury Day Spa & Salon brings a unique blend of traditional Thai spa therapies and modern beauty treatments to the discerning clientele of Guwahati, Assam.  Nestled in the heart of the city, our establishment offers a tranquil oasis where individuals can escape the daily grind and rejuvenate their mind, body, and spirit. We distinguish ourselves in the competitive Assam beauty and wellness market by offering an unparalleled level of personalized service, luxurious amenities, and authentic Thai techniques, creating an experience that transcends the typical spa visit.  Our commitment to quality and exceptional customer care firmly positions us as a leader in the burgeoning luxury wellness sector of Guwahati.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>At the core of our offerings are authentic Thai massage techniques, meticulously performed by our highly trained and certified therapists.  We provide a diverse range of massages, from traditional Thai oil massages promoting deep relaxation and muscle release to invigorating foot massages designed to revitalize energy flow.  Our menu also features specialized treatments such as herbal compresses, aromatherapy massages, and traditional Thai acupressure.  Beyond massage, Waves Joean offers a comprehensive array of salon services, including hairstyling, manicures, pedicures, facials, and waxing, all performed using high-quality, internationally recognized products.  This holistic approach sets us apart, catering to the diverse beauty and wellness needs of our clientele. We emphasize the use of natural and organic products wherever possible, reflecting a commitment to both customer well-being and environmental consciousness – a growing concern among Guwahati''s environmentally aware residents.  This aligns with the increasing local demand for sustainable and ethical beauty practices.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>The customer experience at Waves Joean is paramount.  From the moment guests step into our serene and exquisitely designed spa, they are enveloped in an atmosphere of calm and tranquility.  Our dedicated team is committed to providing personalized attention, ensuring each client feels valued and understood.  We prioritize building strong relationships with our clientele, fostering a sense of community and loyalty. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and charitable organizations, reflecting our commitment to contributing to the growth and well-being of Guwahati. Regular workshops and introductory offers targeting specific segments of the local population help us build rapport and awareness within the community. This approach to customer relations not only builds trust but also helps us understand the evolving needs of our client base, allowing us to constantly refine our services and offerings.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to exceptional service extends beyond individual treatments. We meticulously maintain the highest standards of hygiene and cleanliness, ensuring a safe and relaxing environment for all our guests. This attention to detail, coupled with our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, has resulted in consistently positive reviews and strong word-of-mouth referrals within the Guwahati community.  We actively solicit feedback and utilize it to continuously improve our services and exceed customer expectations. This dedication to excellence solidifies our reputation as a premier luxury day spa and salon in the city.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Waves Joean envisions significant growth and expansion.  Our future plans include introducing new and innovative treatments, incorporating the latest advancements in beauty and wellness technology, and further developing our training programs for our therapists.  We aim to become a regional leader in the luxury spa and salon industry, attracting clients not just from Guwahati but from across Assam and beyond. We also plan to expand our product line to include high-quality, locally sourced products that align with our commitment to sustainability.  This expansion will involve strategic partnerships with local artisans and businesses, contributing to the economic growth of the region.  Our long-term goal is to establish Waves Joean as a recognizable and respected brand synonymous with luxury, authenticity, and exceptional customer service in the Assamese wellness landscape.  This involves a combination of strategic marketing initiatives, building stronger relationships with key influencers, and maintaining our unwavering commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.</p>
<br> <br>

<p>In summary, Waves Joean Luxury Day Spa & Salon offers a unique and highly valued experience in the Guwahati market. By combining authentic Thai spa techniques with a modern, luxurious setting and a commitment to exceptional customer service, we are effectively meeting and exceeding the evolving demands of the local community. Our future vision is one of growth, expansion, and continued excellence, firmly establishing Waves Joean as a leading destination for luxury wellness in Assam.</p>
<br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9957810506', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:36:01.000Z'),
(594, 'Facecraft Unisex Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Facecraft Unisex Salon: Elevating Style in Guwahati</h1>

