<p>Facecraft Unisex Salon is more than just a salon; it''s a place where individuals can enhance their beauty, connect with their community, and discover their most confident selves.  We invite you to experience the Facecraft difference.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9874010485', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:40:11.000Z'),
(595, 'Geometry salon', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Geometry Salon: Redefining Elegance in Guwahati</h1>

