<p>Ultimately, Natural Care Beauty Parlour aims to be more than just a place to get beautified; it''s a place where individuals can relax, rejuvenate, and reconnect with their inner selves, while also supporting a business that is committed to sustainability and community growth within the heart of Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9678431769', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T14:50:11.000Z'),
(601, 'Style Station', 'Beauty Parlors', NULL, '<h1>Style Station: Elevating Fashion in Guwahati</h1>

