, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:25:28.000Z'),
(635, 'Prayukti N.G.O/Rehab Center/Rehabilitation center/Nasha Mukti Kendra', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>Prayukti: A Beacon of Hope in Assam''s Fight Against Addiction</h1>

<p>Prayukti, located at H/no 14, Uttaran Path, stands as a leading Non-Governmental Organization (NGO) and rehabilitation center in Assam, dedicated to providing comprehensive care and support for individuals struggling with substance abuse.  We are more than just a rehabilitation center; we are a lifeline, offering a holistic approach that addresses the physical, psychological, and social aspects of addiction.  In a region where substance abuse remains a significant challenge, Prayukti’s commitment to evidence-based treatment and community engagement sets us apart, making a tangible difference in the lives of countless individuals and families.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique approach combines the best practices of modern addiction treatment with a deep understanding of the cultural nuances of Assam.  We recognize that addiction is a complex issue with multifaceted roots, and our programs are meticulously designed to address these complexities. We avoid a one-size-fits-all approach, instead tailoring treatment plans to the unique needs of each individual.  This personalized approach fosters a supportive and empowering environment where individuals feel safe, respected, and encouraged to embark on their journey to recovery.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Prayukti offers a comprehensive range of services aimed at achieving long-term recovery and reintegration into society.  Our core services include detoxification programs, individual and group therapy sessions, family counseling, vocational training, and aftercare support.  Our detoxification program is medically supervised, ensuring a safe and comfortable transition from active addiction. We utilize evidence-based therapies, such as Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) and Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), to help individuals identify and address the underlying issues contributing to their addiction.  Our vocational training programs equip individuals with marketable skills, increasing their chances of successful reintegration into the workforce.</p> <br> <br>

<p>A significant differentiator for Prayukti is our unwavering focus on aftercare support.  We understand that recovery is a journey, not a destination. Our aftercare programs provide ongoing support, guidance, and resources to help individuals maintain their sobriety and navigate the challenges of life after treatment.  We facilitate support groups, offer relapse prevention strategies, and maintain close contact with individuals even after they complete their formal rehabilitation program. This continuous support network is crucial for sustaining long-term recovery and prevents relapse.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The local market needs in Assam are significantly addressed by our culturally sensitive approach.  Understanding the socio-economic realities of the region and integrating them into our treatment plans is critical.  Our programs are designed to be accessible and affordable for individuals from diverse backgrounds. We work closely with local communities, fostering trust and eliminating the stigma associated with addiction, thereby promoting help-seeking behavior.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Prayukti, we believe that exceptional customer service is not just a policy, but a fundamental principle that underpins our entire mission. We foster a compassionate and empathetic environment where individuals feel understood, valued, and empowered.  Our staff is comprised of highly trained professionals, including medical doctors, psychologists, counselors, and social workers, who are dedicated to providing personalized and holistic care.  We strive to create a safe, confidential, and respectful atmosphere that encourages open communication and active participation in the recovery process.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to building strong relationships with our clients and their families. We understand that addiction affects not just the individual but the entire family system.  Therefore, we actively involve family members in the treatment process, providing them with support, education, and guidance. This family-centered approach strengthens family bonds and creates a supportive network essential for long-term recovery. We actively engage with the local community through awareness campaigns, educational workshops, and partnerships with local organizations. We aim to foster a culture of understanding and acceptance, reducing stigma and encouraging help-seeking behavior.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Prayukti envisions a future where addiction is treated not as a moral failing but as a treatable health condition.  Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a wider population across Assam, establishing additional rehabilitation centers in underserved areas, and developing specialized programs to address specific addiction challenges prevalent in the region. We are committed to conducting research and promoting evidence-based practices in the field of addiction treatment. We aim to contribute significantly to the development of a robust and comprehensive addiction treatment system in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships with governmental agencies, non-profit organizations, and community leaders.  We will continue to invest in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of addiction treatment practices. We also aim to enhance our technological capabilities to improve efficiency and reach, potentially leveraging technology for remote support and telehealth services.  Our ultimate vision is to create a society where individuals struggling with addiction receive the timely, compassionate, and effective care they deserve, leading to a healthier and more vibrant community in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In conclusion, Prayukti is more than just a rehabilitation center; it is a beacon of hope, a testament to the power of compassion, and a catalyst for positive change in Assam’s fight against addiction. Our commitment to evidence-based treatment, our culturally sensitive approach, and our unwavering dedication to our clients are the cornerstones of our success and the foundation for a brighter future.</p>', 'H/no 14, Uttaran Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8011789663', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:25:37.000Z'),
(636, 'AAKAAR REHABILITATION FACILITY, DRUG ADDICTION TREATMENT CENTER', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>AAKAAR REHABILITATION FACILITY, DRUG ADDICTION TREATMENT CENTER</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, near Dakhingaon on Dakhingaon Road, Eidgah Maidan, Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility stands as a beacon of hope for individuals struggling with drug addiction.  More than just a treatment center, Aakaar is a comprehensive rehabilitation facility dedicated to providing holistic care and fostering lasting recovery.  Recognizing the significant impact of substance abuse on families and communities in the region, Aakaar addresses this critical need with a compassionate and evidence-based approach, filling a vital gap in Assam''s healthcare landscape.  Our commitment to individualized care and community engagement sets us apart, making us a crucial resource for those seeking a path to a healthier, more fulfilling life.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility offers a wide range of services designed to address the multifaceted nature of drug addiction.  Our comprehensive program incorporates medically supervised detoxification, individual and group therapy, family counseling, and vocational training.  We utilize evidence-based therapeutic modalities tailored to meet the unique needs of each patient.  This personalized approach ensures that treatment plans are effective and sustainable, maximizing the chances of long-term recovery. Our programs encompass various substance abuse issues, including but not limited to opioid addiction, alcohol dependence, and substance abuse related mental health issues. A dedicated team of medical professionals, therapists, and counselors ensures comprehensive and empathetic care. </p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets Aakaar apart is our commitment to holistic healing.  We understand that addiction is not just a physical or psychological issue but also a social one.  Therefore, our programs incorporate social reintegration strategies, connecting patients with community resources and support networks that promote long-term well-being and reduce the risk of relapse. This includes assistance in securing employment, finding suitable housing, and rebuilding healthy relationships. Our unique selling proposition lies in our integrated approach, encompassing the medical, psychological, social, and vocational aspects of recovery, promoting a sustainable and holistic path toward recovery.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The services offered by Aakaar directly address the pressing needs of the local community in Assam.  Drug addiction is a significant social problem, and the lack of accessible and comprehensive treatment options has created a significant demand for specialized care. Aakaar fills this gap by providing high-quality, affordable, and culturally sensitive services.  Our proximity to Dakhingaon ensures accessibility for individuals across the region, removing geographical barriers to treatment and promoting timely intervention. </p> <br> <br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Aakaar, we prioritize a patient-centered approach to care. We believe that recovery is best achieved within an environment of compassion, respect, and understanding.  Our team is committed to building trusting relationships with patients and their families, creating a supportive and encouraging atmosphere conducive to healing.  We work collaboratively with each individual to develop a personalized treatment plan, ensuring their active involvement in the recovery process.  Regular assessments and progress evaluations allow us to adapt the treatment approach as needed, ensuring its effectiveness and relevance. </p> <br> <br>

<p>We strive to create a comfortable and supportive environment, fostering a sense of community among our patients.  We organize regular group sessions, recreational activities, and workshops that promote social interaction and emotional well-being.  Beyond the immediate treatment period, Aakaar provides ongoing support and follow-up care to help patients maintain their sobriety and navigate the challenges of reintegrating into society.  This post-treatment support significantly increases the likelihood of lasting recovery.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Aakaar actively engages with the local community through educational programs, awareness campaigns, and collaborations with local organizations.  We believe that combating drug addiction requires a collaborative effort, involving families, community leaders, and healthcare professionals.  By fostering open communication and building strong relationships with community stakeholders, we work towards creating a more supportive and understanding environment for individuals recovering from addiction.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility envisions a future where addiction is understood, prevented, and treated effectively within our community. We aim to expand our services to include additional specialized programs to cater to diverse needs. This may involve developing specialized treatment modules for adolescents, expanding our capacity to accommodate a larger number of patients, and potentially offering outpatient services to those who require less intensive care. We also plan on establishing a robust aftercare program, strengthening our community engagement and advocacy initiatives to continue supporting individuals long after they complete their treatment. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading provider of drug addiction treatment in Assam, recognized for our high-quality care, compassionate approach, and lasting impact on the lives of those we serve.  We aim to contribute to a reduction in substance abuse within the region and promote a culture of understanding and support for individuals struggling with addiction.  We will achieve this through continued innovation in treatment approaches, strengthening our collaborations with local organizations, and expanding our capacity to serve a wider community of those affected by substance use disorder.  Through continuous improvement and a steadfast commitment to our mission, Aakaar strives to make a substantial contribution to the betterment of the lives of individuals and families within the Assam region.</p> <br> <br>', 'Eidgah Maidan, Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility, Dakhingaon Rd, near Dakhingaon', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896267828', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:30:21.000Z'),
(637, 'Rehabilitation centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>Rehabilitation Centre: Restoring Lives, Strengthening Communities</h1>

<p>Located at 3PXC+V5W in Assam, the Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and healing, providing comprehensive rehabilitation services to individuals facing diverse physical and cognitive challenges.  We are committed to delivering exceptional care within a supportive and compassionate environment, significantly contributing to the improved well-being of our community.  Our unique approach blends evidence-based therapeutic techniques with a deep understanding of the cultural nuances of Assam, ensuring culturally sensitive and effective interventions.  We are not just a rehabilitation facility; we are a vital part of the local healthcare ecosystem, working collaboratively with other organizations to create a holistic support network.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our significance in the Assam business landscape extends beyond simply providing healthcare services. We contribute to the economic well-being of the region by creating employment opportunities for skilled professionals and supporting local businesses through our procurement practices. We also actively engage in community outreach programs, educating the public about rehabilitation needs and promoting inclusivity.  This commitment to community engagement sets us apart and reinforces our position as a responsible and valuable contributor to the local economy.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>The Rehabilitation Centre offers a wide range of specialized services tailored to meet individual needs. Our primary services include physical therapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and cognitive rehabilitation.  We employ cutting-edge technologies and evidence-based methodologies to deliver optimal treatment outcomes.  Our physical therapy program emphasizes restoring mobility and functionality through customized exercise regimens, manual therapies, and assistive device training.  Occupational therapy focuses on enhancing daily living skills, improving independence, and adapting the environment to meet individual needs. Our speech therapy services address communication disorders, while our cognitive rehabilitation program aims to improve cognitive functions affected by injury or illness.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets us apart is our highly personalized approach. Each client receives a comprehensive assessment to develop a customized treatment plan that addresses their unique challenges and goals.  We maintain a low client-to-therapist ratio, ensuring individualized attention and maximizing the effectiveness of our interventions.  Recognizing the unique cultural context of Assam, we integrate traditional practices and knowledge into our treatment plans whenever appropriate and culturally sensitive, ensuring that our services are both effective and respectful of local customs.  This culturally sensitive approach is a crucial element in meeting the unmet needs of the local community, addressing barriers to access, and fostering trust.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At the Rehabilitation Centre, our clients are not just patients; they are individuals on a journey towards recovery and regaining their independence. We prioritize building strong therapeutic relationships based on trust, respect, and empathy.  Our team of highly skilled and compassionate therapists are committed to providing personalized care and support. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable environment that promotes healing and fosters a sense of community amongst our clients. We offer regular feedback sessions and progress reports to keep our clients and their families informed and actively involved in their rehabilitation journey.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond our therapeutic interventions. We also focus on providing exceptional administrative support, ensuring seamless scheduling, efficient billing processes, and responsive communication.  Our commitment to accessibility and inclusivity ensures that our services are available to all members of the community, regardless of their socioeconomic background or physical limitations. This commitment resonates deeply within the local community, fostering strong relationships and a sense of shared purpose.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>The Rehabilitation Centre has ambitious plans for the future. We envision becoming a leading regional provider of comprehensive rehabilitation services, expanding our services to meet the evolving healthcare needs of the Assam community. We plan to invest in advanced technologies and expand our team of specialists to broaden our range of therapeutic interventions. This includes exploring new avenues such as telehealth services to expand accessibility to individuals in remote areas.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive rehabilitation center of excellence in Assam, renowned for its quality of care, commitment to research and innovation, and its strong community ties. We will continue to actively engage in community outreach programs, educating the public about rehabilitation services and promoting health and wellness initiatives.  We believe in the power of rehabilitation to transform lives and empower individuals to reach their full potential, and we remain dedicated to making a lasting positive impact on the communities we serve.  Our ultimate aim is to build a sustainable model for providing high-quality, accessible, and culturally sensitive rehabilitation care that can be replicated across the state of Assam and serve as a model for other underserved areas in India.</p> <br> <br>', '3PXC+V5W', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6900508562', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:30:28.000Z'),
(638, 'Vastab Wellness Society-Best Rehab Center/Drug /Alcohol/De-Addiction/Psychological Treatment in Guwahati', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>Vastab Wellness Society: Guwahati''s Leading Rehab Center</h1>

<p>Vastab Wellness Society, located at House Number 40(A), Lachit Nagar Main Rd, Guwahati, stands as a beacon of hope and healing in Assam''s fight against substance abuse and mental health challenges.  We offer comprehensive, compassionate care for individuals struggling with drug addiction, alcohol dependency, and various psychological issues.  Our commitment to holistic wellness sets us apart in the local landscape, providing a vital service that addresses a critical and often overlooked need within the community. We are dedicated to providing evidence-based treatment, personalized care, and a supportive environment to facilitate lasting recovery and improved quality of life for our clients. <br> <br> </p>


<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Vastab Wellness Society provides a multi-faceted approach to addiction and mental health treatment. Our primary services encompass a wide range of therapies and support systems tailored to meet the unique needs of each individual.  These include medically supervised detoxification programs for alcohol and drug withdrawal, individual and group therapy sessions led by experienced psychologists and counselors, family therapy to address the impact of addiction on loved ones, and relapse prevention planning to equip clients with the tools for long-term recovery.  We also provide comprehensive psychological assessments to diagnose underlying mental health conditions that may contribute to addiction. <br> <br> </p>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our integrated approach. We understand that addiction is often intertwined with underlying mental health issues, such as depression, anxiety, and trauma. We address these co-occurring disorders simultaneously, rather than in isolation, fostering a more holistic and effective recovery process.  Furthermore, our commitment to culturally sensitive care ensures that our services resonate deeply with the needs of the Assamese community. Our team includes professionals fluent in Assamese, enabling effective communication and fostering trust within the therapeutic relationship.  We also collaborate with local support groups and community organizations to create a robust network of ongoing support after treatment concludes.  This approach directly addresses the local market need for accessible, culturally appropriate, and comprehensive addiction and mental health services. <br> <br> </p>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Vastab Wellness Society, we prioritize a client-centered approach, ensuring a safe, confidential, and supportive environment.  Our team of highly qualified professionals is dedicated to providing personalized care, understanding that each individual''s journey to recovery is unique.  From the initial consultation to ongoing aftercare, we maintain open communication and actively involve clients in developing their personalized treatment plans. We understand that seeking help for addiction or mental health challenges requires immense courage, and we strive to create a non-judgmental and empathetic environment where clients feel comfortable sharing their experiences. <br> <br> </p>

<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to building strong relationships with our clients and their families. We offer regular progress updates, provide opportunities for feedback, and strive to maintain open lines of communication throughout the treatment process.  Our dedication extends beyond the formal treatment period, with ongoing aftercare support and resources to help clients navigate challenges and maintain their recovery.  We actively engage with the local community through awareness campaigns, educational workshops, and collaborations with relevant organizations to help reduce the stigma surrounding addiction and mental health issues. This fosters a sense of community and connection, vital in supporting long-term recovery. <br> <br> </p>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Vastab Wellness Society envisions a future where addiction and mental health challenges are met with understanding, compassion, and effective treatment. We plan to expand our services to include specialized programs for specific demographics, such as adolescents or individuals with co-occurring physical health conditions.  We are also exploring the implementation of innovative therapeutic approaches, incorporating technological advancements where appropriate to enhance the effectiveness of our services.  Our growth strategy focuses on building strong relationships with healthcare providers, community organizations, and government agencies to expand our reach and impact within the state of Assam. <br> <br> </p>

<p>Long-term, we aspire to become a leading center of excellence for addiction and mental health treatment in the Northeast region.  This involves continuing to invest in our team''s professional development, conducting ongoing research to advance treatment modalities, and becoming a respected resource for education and advocacy within the community. We aim to be a driving force in changing the landscape of mental health and addiction treatment in Assam, providing hope and healing to those who need it most, and contributing to the overall well-being of the state.  Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live fulfilling, healthy, and addiction-free lives. <br> <br> </p>', 'House Number 40(A, Lachit Nagar Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6901315416', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:30:35.000Z'),
(639, 'New Jyoti Foundation, De-addiction Cum Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>New Jyoti Foundation, De-addiction Cum Rehabilitation Centre</h1>

<p>The New Jyoti Foundation, De-addiction Cum Rehabilitation Centre, stands as a beacon of hope in Assam, offering comprehensive and compassionate care for individuals struggling with substance abuse and addiction.  Located at its dedicated rehabilitation center, the foundation distinguishes itself through its holistic approach, combining evidence-based medical treatments with traditional therapies deeply rooted in Assamese culture and understanding.  We recognize that addiction is a complex issue with profound social and familial ramifications, and our commitment extends beyond simply treating the addiction itself; we aim to restore individuals to their full potential, reintegrating them successfully back into their communities.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In a region where the stigma surrounding addiction remains significant, New Jyoti Foundation strives to create a safe, non-judgmental environment that fosters healing and recovery. We actively combat misconceptions and promote a culture of understanding and support. Our presence helps address a critical gap in accessible, quality addiction treatment services within Assam, significantly impacting the lives of countless individuals and families affected by substance abuse.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our comprehensive range of services focuses on a holistic model of recovery.  This includes medically supervised detoxification programs tailored to the individual''s needs and substance of abuse.  We provide individual and group therapy sessions led by experienced counselors and therapists trained in evidence-based practices, such as Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) and Motivational Interviewing (MI).  Our program also incorporates traditional Assamese healing practices, recognizing the importance of cultural sensitivity and integrating them effectively with modern techniques. This approach resonates deeply with our clientele, creating a more comfortable and effective recovery process.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond the clinical aspects, we emphasize the crucial role of social and vocational rehabilitation.  We provide life skills training, vocational guidance, and job placement assistance to help individuals rebuild their lives after recovery.  This holistic approach, addressing both the physical and psychological aspects alongside social and economic integration, distinguishes us from other centers.  The integration of traditional practices also provides a unique selling point, reflecting a deep understanding and respect for the cultural context of our clients’ experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized approach.  We recognize that every individual’s journey through addiction is unique, and we tailor our treatment plans to meet the specific needs and circumstances of each client. This personalized attention, combined with our commitment to cultural sensitivity and holistic recovery, has resulted in consistently high rates of successful rehabilitation and long-term recovery.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At New Jyoti Foundation, the client experience is paramount.  We foster an environment of respect, empathy, and understanding, recognizing the vulnerability and courage it takes to seek help for addiction.  Our staff, consisting of highly trained medical professionals, counselors, and support staff, are committed to providing compassionate and individualized care. We believe that a supportive and nurturing atmosphere is essential for successful recovery. Regular family counseling sessions are also offered, to foster healing and understanding within the familial unit, as healthy family structures play a vital role in sustained recovery.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through awareness campaigns, workshops, and educational programs.  By breaking down stigma and promoting open conversations about addiction, we strive to create a supportive network that extends beyond our center''s walls. We actively collaborate with local NGOs, government agencies, and healthcare professionals, forming strategic partnerships to broaden our reach and impact. This community engagement strengthens our commitment to improving the lives of those affected by addiction in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>New Jyoti Foundation envisions a future where addiction is understood not as a moral failing but as a treatable health condition. We plan to expand our services by increasing our capacity to accommodate more clients and broadening our range of treatment options. We are exploring the incorporation of new technological advancements in addiction treatment, incorporating digital tools to enhance our therapy sessions and monitoring systems.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading regional center for addiction treatment and rehabilitation, setting a benchmark for excellence in care and community engagement. We aim to replicate our successful model in other parts of Assam, making high-quality addiction treatment more accessible to those who need it most.  We are actively seeking opportunities for collaboration with national and international organizations to further enhance our capabilities and expand our reach.  We believe in building sustainable partnerships to ensure the long-term success of our mission to create a healthier and more resilient Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The New Jyoti Foundation is committed to being at the forefront of addiction treatment and rehabilitation in Assam, leading the way in creating a society that is informed, compassionate, and supportive of those struggling with substance abuse. We believe that with continued dedication, collaboration, and a commitment to holistic care, we can significantly reduce the impact of addiction and build a healthier future for our community.</p>', 'Rehabilitation center', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:30:42.000Z'),
(640, 'Rani rehabilitation center', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>Rani Rehabilitation Center: Restoring Lives, Strengthening Communities</h1>

<p>Nestled at House no. 2, Sonali Path, Rani Rehabilitation Center stands as a beacon of hope and healing in the heart of Assam.  We are a dedicated rehabilitation facility committed to providing comprehensive and compassionate care to individuals recovering from a wide range of physical and cognitive challenges. Our unique approach blends evidence-based therapeutic practices with a deep understanding of the local culture and needs, setting us apart in the Assam healthcare landscape. We recognize the specific challenges faced by individuals in the region and strive to provide tailored solutions that promote holistic well-being and successful reintegration into the community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products:  A Holistic Approach to Rehabilitation</h2>

<p>Rani Rehabilitation Center offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to address the diverse needs of our patients. Our core offerings include physiotherapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and cognitive rehabilitation.  These services are tailored to individual needs and recovery goals, ensuring a personalized and effective treatment plan. We utilize state-of-the-art equipment and employ highly trained and experienced therapists who are passionate about their work.  Our physiotherapy program encompasses a wide range of techniques, from manual therapy and electrotherapy to exercise prescription and gait training.  Occupational therapy focuses on regaining daily living skills, while speech therapy addresses communication and swallowing difficulties.  Cognitive rehabilitation aims to improve memory, attention, and problem-solving skills. </p> <br> <br>

<p>What truly distinguishes Rani Rehabilitation Center is our commitment to integrating traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate, alongside modern therapies. We believe in a holistic approach that considers the mind, body, and spirit, recognizing the deep connection between physical health and emotional well-being.  This unique integration of traditional and modern methods resonates deeply within the local community, fostering trust and improving patient outcomes.  We also offer specialized programs designed to meet the specific needs of individuals recovering from stroke, traumatic brain injury, orthopedic injuries, and other conditions common in the region.  Our services are designed to fill a significant gap in the provision of quality rehabilitation care, particularly for those facing economic or geographical barriers to accessing such services.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Exceptional Customer Experience: Compassionate Care at the Heart of Our Mission</h2>

<p>At Rani Rehabilitation Center, we believe that exceptional customer service is not merely a business practice but a fundamental aspect of our commitment to compassionate care. Our team prioritizes building strong relationships with our patients and their families, creating a supportive and encouraging environment conducive to healing and recovery. We strive to understand the unique challenges each individual faces and tailor our approach accordingly. This personalized attention, combined with our commitment to open communication and transparency, fosters trust and promotes active participation in the rehabilitation process. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Beyond individual care, we are actively engaged in strengthening our connection with the local community. We regularly conduct health awareness workshops, provide educational resources, and collaborate with local organizations to promote healthy lifestyles and prevent disability.  We actively seek feedback from our patients and their families, continuously striving to improve our services and better meet the needs of the community we serve. Our commitment to building strong relationships extends beyond our patients to encompass local healthcare providers and community leaders, forging vital partnerships that enhance the overall quality of rehabilitation services available in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Access to Quality Rehabilitation</h2>

<p>Rani Rehabilitation Center envisions a future where high-quality rehabilitation services are accessible to all members of the Assam community.  Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to incorporate additional specialized therapies and technologies. We are committed to ongoing professional development for our staff, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of rehabilitation advancements.  This commitment to continuous improvement ensures that we are able to provide the most effective and compassionate care possible.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We also plan to expand our facilities to accommodate a growing patient population and broaden our reach into underserved areas.  This expansion will involve strategic partnerships with local healthcare institutions and community organizations to create a network of support for individuals undergoing rehabilitation. We are actively pursuing opportunities to secure funding to support these expansion plans and ensure the long-term sustainability of the center.  Ultimately, our long-term goal is to become a leading rehabilitation center in Assam, recognized for its exceptional quality of care, its commitment to community engagement, and its significant contribution to improving the lives of individuals and families across the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Rani Rehabilitation Center is more than just a rehabilitation facility; it’s a place of hope, healing, and transformation. We are dedicated to restoring lives and strengthening communities, one patient at a time.  Our commitment to excellence, compassionate care, and community engagement makes us a vital asset to the Assam healthcare landscape.</p>', 'House no. 2, Sonali path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8876379822', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:35:12.000Z'),
(641, 'Aliveness Wellness Foundation/ Rehab Centre/ Drug addiction treatment', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>Aliveness Wellness Foundation/Rehab Centre/Drug Addiction Treatment</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, at House No. 17, near Bylane Number 3, near Royal De Casa, Aliveness Wellness Foundation stands as a beacon of hope and recovery for individuals struggling with drug addiction.  We are more than just a rehab centre; we are a comprehensive wellness foundation dedicated to providing holistic, compassionate care tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese community.  Our approach transcends the limitations of traditional rehabilitation models, integrating evidence-based therapies with culturally sensitive practices to foster lasting recovery and empower individuals to lead fulfilling lives free from addiction.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In a region grappling with the pervasive challenges of substance abuse, Aliveness Wellness Foundation fills a critical gap in the provision of accessible, high-quality treatment. Unlike many facilities that prioritize solely medical intervention, we recognize the multi-faceted nature of addiction. Our integrated approach addresses the physical, psychological, and social aspects of addiction, recognizing that sustainable recovery demands a holistic transformation.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing a comprehensive and personalized approach to drug addiction treatment. This includes medically supervised detoxification, individual and group therapy sessions facilitated by qualified professionals, and ongoing aftercare support. We offer a variety of therapeutic modalities, including Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT), Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), and motivational interviewing, tailored to suit each individual''s specific needs and circumstances.  We also offer family therapy to address the impact of addiction on family dynamics, ensuring a supportive environment for long-term recovery. </p> <br> <br>

<p>A unique selling point of Aliveness Wellness Foundation is our deep understanding of the local context. We have incorporated traditional Assamese healing practices and cultural considerations into our treatment plans, fostering a sense of belonging and trust among our clients. Our multilingual staff ensures effective communication and cultural sensitivity, building rapport and creating a comfortable space for open dialogue. We also work closely with local community leaders and organizations to facilitate reintegration into society post-treatment.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Recognizing the specific needs of the Assamese population, we provide services in Assamese and other prevalent local languages.  We actively engage with local communities to raise awareness about addiction and the services we offer, addressing the stigma surrounding substance abuse. Our commitment to culturally appropriate care creates a more effective and empathetic treatment environment.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Aliveness Wellness Foundation, we are committed to providing a supportive and non-judgmental environment where individuals feel safe and empowered to embark on their recovery journey.  Our approach emphasizes empathy, respect, and individualized treatment plans.  We believe that genuine connection and trust are crucial for successful recovery, so we prioritize building strong therapeutic relationships with our clients. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Our dedicated team of highly qualified professionals, including doctors, therapists, and counselors, works collaboratively to provide personalized care.  Regular assessments and ongoing evaluations ensure that treatment plans are tailored to individual progress and evolving needs. Beyond the formal therapeutic sessions, we foster a sense of community among our clients through recreational activities, support groups, and skill-building workshops, promoting holistic well-being and social integration.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We go beyond providing treatment; we focus on building strong relationships with families, employing a family-centered approach where appropriate. We involve family members in the treatment process whenever possible, educating them about addiction and providing support and guidance. Our community outreach programs aim to prevent addiction through education and awareness campaigns targeted at schools, youth groups, and community centers.  We believe in creating a ripple effect of positive change, impacting individuals, families, and the wider community.</p> <br> <br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Aliveness Wellness Foundation envisions a future where addiction is understood, effectively addressed, and ultimately prevented within the Assamese community. We plan to expand our services to include a wider range of addiction-related issues and develop specialized programs to cater to specific demographics, such as adolescents and women. We aim to become a leading center of excellence for addiction treatment and research in the region. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goals include establishing partnerships with other healthcare providers, NGOs, and government agencies to strengthen the regional addiction treatment network. We plan to invest in advanced training for our staff, incorporating cutting-edge therapeutic techniques and research findings to ensure we provide the highest quality care.  We are committed to conducting research on the specific challenges of addiction within the Assamese context, contributing to the development of evidence-based interventions and policies.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, we envision expanding our community outreach programs, reaching a wider audience and providing educational resources to prevent substance abuse.  By fostering a culture of understanding and support, we aim to create a community where individuals struggling with addiction feel empowered to seek help without fear of judgment or stigma. Our ultimate goal is to contribute to a healthier, happier, and more vibrant Assam, one individual at a time.</p> <br> <br>', 'house no 17, near, Bylane Number 3, near royal de casa', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9365466268', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T15:35:20.000Z'),
