<p>In summary, Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal''s medical practice represents a significant contribution to the healthcare landscape of Guwahati.  Its blend of advanced medical expertise, personalized patient care, and strong community engagement positions it as a valuable resource for individuals and families in the region.  The practice''s commitment to continuous improvement and its future vision promise a continued positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves.</p>', 'Medicity Guwahati, dispur hatigaon main road opp Sankar path, near Sewali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8486483479', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T17:55:41.000Z'),
(772, 'ALIVIO PHYSIOTHERAPY AND SPORTS REHAB CENTRE', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>ALIVIO Physiotherapy and Sports Rehab Centre</h1>

<p>Nestled on the bustling VIP Airport Road, ALIVIO Physiotherapy and Sports Rehab Centre stands as a beacon of holistic healthcare in Assam.  We are dedicated to providing comprehensive physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation services, tailored to meet the diverse needs of our community.  Our commitment to evidence-based practice, coupled with a personalized approach to patient care, sets us apart in the competitive landscape of Assam''s healthcare sector. We strive to be more than just a clinic; we aim to be a trusted partner in our clients'' journey towards physical well-being and improved quality of life.</p> <br> <br>

<p>ALIVIO’s significance lies in bridging the gap in access to high-quality physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation services within the region.  Recognizing the growing demand for specialized care for athletic injuries, musculoskeletal disorders, and post-surgical rehabilitation, we have curated a range of services designed to address these prevalent needs.  Our strategic location on VIP Airport Road provides convenient accessibility for residents and travellers alike, emphasizing our commitment to serving a wide spectrum of the population.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Our comprehensive service portfolio encompasses a wide array of treatments and rehabilitation programs.  We offer specialized physiotherapy for conditions such as back pain, neck pain, arthritis, sports injuries (including those common in popular Assamese sports), and post-operative rehabilitation. Our services extend to manual therapy, electrotherapy, therapeutic exercises, and individualized exercise prescription.  We also offer specialized programs for pre and post-natal care, addressing the specific physical demands of pregnancy and postpartum recovery. Our sports rehabilitation program focuses on injury prevention, performance enhancement, and the safe return to athletic activity.  This includes biomechanical assessments, strength and conditioning programs, and sports-specific rehabilitation protocols.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets ALIVIO apart is our commitment to personalized care.  We don''t believe in a "one-size-fits-all" approach. Our experienced physiotherapists conduct thorough assessments to understand each patient''s unique needs and develop customized treatment plans accordingly. We utilize advanced technology and evidence-based techniques to ensure the highest standards of care, making us a leader in innovative physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation within Assam.  We also strive to make our services accessible to a wide range of individuals, offering flexible appointment scheduling and transparent pricing.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At ALIVIO, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful healthcare practice. From the moment a patient walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere.  We strive to create a comfortable and supportive environment where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered to take an active role in their recovery. Our team of physiotherapists and support staff are not only highly skilled professionals but also compassionate individuals dedicated to providing personalized attention to each patient.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We are committed to building strong relationships with our patients, fostering open communication and transparency throughout the treatment process.  We provide regular progress updates, encourage patient feedback, and actively involve them in developing their individualized rehabilitation programs.  We also actively engage with the local community through health awareness campaigns, workshops, and collaborations with local sports clubs and organizations, promoting proactive health and injury prevention. We believe in building trust and fostering a sense of community, vital to long-term success and patient satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>ALIVIO Physiotherapy and Sports Rehab Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation services in Assam.  We plan to expand our service offerings to encompass new areas of specialization, such as pediatric physiotherapy and neurological rehabilitation, in response to the evolving needs of our community. We are committed to investing in advanced technologies and continuing professional development for our team to maintain our position at the forefront of physiotherapy practice. This includes staying abreast of the latest research and implementing the most effective and innovative treatment techniques.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a strong network of referral partners, including physicians, athletic trainers, and other healthcare professionals, to facilitate seamless access to our services. We also plan to develop strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote workplace wellness and injury prevention programs.  We aspire to become a recognized leader in advocating for improved access to quality physiotherapy care throughout Assam, contributing to a healthier and more active population. Through continuous improvement and a unwavering commitment to our patients, we aim to make ALIVIO the premier choice for physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation in the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, ALIVIO''s success will be measured by the positive impact we have on the lives of our patients.  Our commitment to excellence, personalized care, and community engagement will drive our continued growth and solidify our position as a trusted and respected healthcare provider within the heart of Assam.</p>', 'VIP Airport Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T18:00:12.000Z'),
(773, 'Seedlings ABA Therapy & Child Skill Development Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>Seedlings ABA Therapy & Child Skill Development Centre</h1>

<p>Seedlings ABA Therapy & Child Skill Development Centre, located at Wireless, House No 33, Rupalim Path, Rangamancha Path, is a pioneering centre dedicated to providing high-quality Applied Behavior Analysis (ABA) therapy and comprehensive child skill development services in the heart of Assam.  We recognise the critical need for specialized support for children with autism spectrum disorder (ASD) and other developmental challenges within our community, and we are committed to filling that gap with compassionate, evidence-based care. Our centre differentiates itself through a holistic approach, combining cutting-edge ABA techniques with a nurturing environment that fosters individual growth and empowers families.</p> <br> <br>

<p>In a region where access to specialized developmental services may be limited, Seedlings strives to be a beacon of hope and support. We understand the unique challenges faced by families navigating the complexities of developmental disabilities, and we are dedicated to providing a supportive and understanding environment. Our commitment to inclusivity ensures that every child, regardless of their background or abilities, feels welcome, valued, and empowered to reach their full potential. We believe that early intervention is key and that with the right support, every child can thrive.  Seedlings aims to be a leading provider of such essential support in Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Seedlings offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet the diverse needs of children and their families.  Our core services include individualized ABA therapy programs tailored to each child''s specific developmental profile and goals.  These programs are developed and overseen by Board Certified Behavior Analysts (BCBAs) and implemented by highly trained Registered Behavior Technicians (RBTs).  We utilize evidence-based practices to address a wide range of challenges, including communication deficits, social skills development, and adaptive behavior enhancement.  Beyond ABA therapy, we also offer speech therapy, occupational therapy, and play therapy, ensuring a holistic approach to child development.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling points include our small group sizes, which allow for individualized attention and customized learning plans. We also prioritize parent training and involvement, equipping families with the tools and knowledge to support their child''s development at home.  We understand the importance of creating a comfortable and stimulating learning environment, and our centre is designed to be a welcoming and enriching space for children.  Furthermore, we are committed to ongoing professional development for our team, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of best practices in ABA therapy and child development.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The demand for specialized services like ABA therapy and comprehensive child development programs is rapidly growing in Assam.  Seedlings directly addresses this unmet need by providing accessible, high-quality care to children and families who might otherwise lack access to these essential services. We recognize the cultural nuances of our community and tailor our approach accordingly, ensuring that our services are culturally sensitive and respectful.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Seedlings, we prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with our clients.  We believe that open communication and collaboration are crucial to achieving optimal outcomes. Our approach is rooted in empathy, understanding, and a deep commitment to empowering families.  We provide regular progress reports, parent consultations, and opportunities for feedback, ensuring that families are actively involved in their child''s treatment plan.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to personalized care. We don’t believe in a “one-size-fits-all” approach. Each child is unique, with their own strengths, challenges, and learning styles.  We meticulously assess each child''s needs and tailor our interventions to their individual profile, ensuring that every child receives the most effective and appropriate support.  This commitment to personalized care extends beyond the therapy sessions; we also strive to create a supportive community for families, providing resources, workshops, and networking opportunities.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, hospitals, and other relevant organizations.  This allows us to extend our reach and contribute to the overall well-being of children in the region. We believe that by working collaboratively with other professionals and community stakeholders, we can create a more supportive and inclusive environment for children with developmental needs.  We participate in local events and workshops, raising awareness about autism and other developmental disabilities, and providing resources and support to families in need.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Seedlings envisions a future where every child in Assam has access to high-quality developmental services. We plan to expand our services to include a wider range of therapeutic interventions and support programs.  This may involve expanding our physical space, recruiting additional qualified professionals, and developing innovative programs tailored to the evolving needs of our community. We also aim to become a leading research and training center in ABA therapy and child development, contributing to the advancement of the field and empowering future professionals.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a sustainable and impactful organization that continues to make a positive difference in the lives of children and families for generations to come. We are committed to continuous improvement, staying abreast of the latest research and best practices, and adapting our services to meet the evolving needs of our clients.  We aspire to be a model for excellence in ABA therapy and child skill development, setting a high standard for quality and compassionate care within Assam and beyond.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Seedlings’ vision is to build a brighter future for children with developmental challenges, empowering them to reach their full potential and lead fulfilling lives. We believe that with dedication, innovation, and a commitment to excellence, we can make a lasting impact on the lives of children and families in our community.</p>', 'Wireless, House No 33, Rupalim Path, Rangamancha Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9395919009', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2025-08-12T09:57:53.000Z', '2025-08-12T18:00:21.000Z'),
(774, 'SHAKTI SADAN ,GOLD', 'Rehabilitation Center', NULL, '<h1>SHAKTI SADAN, GOLD: A Legacy of Quality and Trust in Assam</h1>

