<p>Objective Classes envisions continued growth and expansion in the coming years.  Our plans include enhancing our existing programs through the incorporation of cutting-edge technology and innovative teaching methodologies.  We also aim to expand our reach by offering online coaching programs, thereby catering to students from different parts of Assam and beyond.  We aspire to become a leading provider of high-quality education across multiple streams, including potentially expanding into other competitive examination preparation areas beyond NEET, IIT-JEE, and CEE, depending on market demand.</p> <br> <br>

