(813, 'BSC Academy Guwahati-Coaching Center for Bank|SSC|Railway|Assam Govt Exam|CTET/ATET|LIC|MAT|CDS,NDA|APSC|ADRE', 'Coaching Center', NULL, '<h1>BSC Academy Guwahati: Your Gateway to Success</h1>

