<p>PHYSICS & FUN envisions becoming a leading provider of quality physics education in Assam.  Our future plans include expanding our course offerings to encompass a wider range of science subjects, potentially incorporating online learning platforms to reach a broader audience and enhance accessibility.  We aim to develop strategic partnerships with local schools and colleges to further integrate our services into the existing educational landscape.  We also plan to invest in advanced teaching technologies and resources to enhance the learning experience and ensure that our students are equipped with the most current and relevant knowledge.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to cultivate a generation of scientifically literate individuals who are equipped to contribute meaningfully to the growth and development of Assam and beyond.  By providing high-quality physics education, fostering a passion for learning, and nurturing critical thinking skills, PHYSICS & FUN aims to empower students to achieve their academic aspirations and contribute positively to society.  We are committed to continually improving our services and adapting to the evolving needs of our students and the broader educational landscape.</p> <br> <br>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9101455417', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.284Z', '2025-08-19T04:50:31.000Z'),
