<p>Our vision for the future includes expanding our range of services to meet the evolving needs of the community.  We plan to introduce new courses and workshops catering to different age groups and learning styles. We are exploring the possibility of incorporating technology more effectively into our teaching methodologies to enhance the learning experience and provide students with access to a wider range of resources.  We also aim to expand our physical infrastructure to accommodate an increasing student population, maintaining our commitment to small class sizes and personalized instruction.  Our long-term goal is to establish Shahi Classes as a leading educational institution in Assam, renowned for its high standards of teaching, its dedication to student success, and its positive impact on the local community.  This will involve continuing our investments in teacher training, curriculum development, and technological advancements, all while maintaining our core values of personalized attention and a commitment to academic excellence. <br> <br>

