<p>We aim to achieve this vision through a combination of strategic partnerships, investment in infrastructure and technology, and an unwavering commitment to our core values of excellence, innovation, and community engagement.  Exponent Classes is poised for significant growth and success, and we are excited to contribute to the future of education in Assam.</p>', 'House No-260, R.G Baruah Road, Pragati Path, near Commerce College', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8453425256', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.287Z', '2025-08-19T05:25:17.000Z'),
