<p>What sets us apart is our dedication to building strong relationships with the local community in Assam.  We actively engage with healthcare organizations and professionals throughout the state, collaborating on projects and initiatives that address pressing healthcare needs.  We regularly organize outreach programs and workshops in various parts of Assam, increasing access to high-quality medical education and training for a wider audience. This community engagement extends to our curriculum, ensuring the needs and context of Assam''s healthcare system are integrated into our teaching methodologies. Our commitment to local partnerships helps us develop programs that are both relevant and effective in addressing specific challenges within the region.<br> <br> </p>


