<p>Delhi Academy of Medical Sciences (P) Ltd. envisions a future where we are a leading provider of medical education and training in Assam, significantly contributing to the improvement of healthcare access and quality across the state.  Our growth strategy focuses on expanding our program offerings to encompass a wider range of specialized areas within medicine, responding directly to identified gaps in the availability of trained medical personnel in Assam.  This includes exploring opportunities to establish partnerships with leading medical institutions in Assam and leveraging technology to enhance the accessibility and reach of our programs.  <br> <br> </p>

