<p>In summary, Scientia Tutorials provides a comprehensive and personalized home tuition experience in Guwahati.  Our unique approach, focusing on experienced tutors, individualized instruction, and a strong emphasis on student well-being, sets us apart.  Our commitment to the local community and our future vision of growth and expansion position us as a valuable asset to the educational landscape of Assam. We are confident in our ability to continue providing exceptional learning experiences for students in the years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864920707', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.288Z', '2025-08-19T05:35:19.000Z'),
(858, 'THELS CLASSES', 'Coaching Center', NULL, '<h1>THELS CLASSES: Empowering Assam''s Future Through Quality Education</h1>

