<p>At THELS CLASSES, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and supportive learning environment where every student feels valued and empowered.  Our dedicated team of instructors and support staff are committed to providing personalized guidance and assistance, ensuring that each student receives the individual attention they require to succeed. We actively encourage open communication and feedback, constantly seeking ways to enhance the student experience and improve the effectiveness of our programs.  <br> <br> </p>

<p>We foster a strong sense of community within THELS CLASSES by organizing regular workshops, seminars, and mentorship programs that provide students with opportunities for networking, collaboration, and personal development.  We are actively involved in the local community through partnerships with schools, colleges, and other educational institutions. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we regularly organize outreach programs to promote education and skill development amongst underprivileged sections of society. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, strengthening our ties with the community and building a reputation for responsible and impactful engagement.  <br> <br> </p>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>THELS CLASSES envisions itself as a leading provider of quality education and skill development in Assam, continuously evolving to meet the changing needs of the local and global market. Our future plans include expanding our range of courses and programs, incorporating new technologies and teaching methodologies, and strengthening our partnerships with educational institutions and industry professionals.  We aim to establish a robust online learning platform to reach a wider audience across Assam and potentially beyond.  <br> <br> </p>

<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute significantly to the socio-economic development of Assam by empowering individuals with the knowledge and skills they need to thrive in the 21st-century workforce. We aim to build a legacy of excellence, shaping the future of Assam one student at a time.  We are committed to investing in research and development to continuously improve the quality of our programs and stay ahead of the curve in the ever-evolving field of education. We strive to cultivate a culture of innovation and entrepreneurship within our institution, encouraging our students and faculty to explore new ideas and approaches to learning and development.  We are confident that by staying true to our mission and adapting to the evolving educational landscape, THELS CLASSES will continue to play a vital role in the development of Assam for years to come. <br> <br> </p>

<p>We believe that quality education is the key to unlocking human potential, and we are proud to play our part in shaping a brighter future for the people of Assam.  We invite you to join us in our mission to empower individuals and build a stronger, more prosperous Assam. <br> <br> </p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9706781479', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.288Z', '2025-08-19T05:35:25.000Z'),
(859, 'Broad Roots Education Care', 'Coaching Center', NULL, '<h1>Broad Roots Education Care: Nurturing Young Minds in Chachal</h1>

<p>Broad Roots Education Care, located at Ground Floor, H.No: 85, Mani-Mugdha Nagar, Chachal, VIP Rd, is a dynamic and rapidly growing educational care center dedicated to providing high-quality, holistic learning experiences for children in the Chachal community and surrounding areas of Assam.  We recognize the unique educational needs of children in this region and strive to create a nurturing and stimulating environment that fosters academic excellence, personal growth, and a lifelong love of learning. Our commitment to individualized attention, engaging curriculum, and strong community ties sets us apart in the local educational landscape.</p> <br> <br>

