<p>Broad Roots Education Care has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We envision expanding our facilities to accommodate a larger number of children and developing new programs to meet the evolving needs of the community. We are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing professional development opportunities, ensuring that our educators possess the skills and knowledge needed to deliver high-quality education. We are also exploring partnerships with local organizations and businesses to create additional opportunities for our children and further contribute to the economic growth of our region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Broad Roots Education Care as the leading provider of high-quality childcare and early education in Chachal and the surrounding areas. We aim to become a recognized center of excellence, known for its innovative approach to learning, strong community ties, and unwavering commitment to nurturing the potential of every child.  Our commitment to excellence, combined with our deep understanding of the local community, positions us for continued success and a lasting positive impact on the lives of children in Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'Ground Floor, H.No: 85, Mani-Mugdha Nagar, Chachal, VIP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002215217', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.288Z', '2025-08-19T05:35:32.000Z'),
(860, 'MPA - Mind Power Academy', 'Coaching Center', NULL, '<h1>MPA - Mind Power Academy</h1>

