<p>Our future plans involve strategically expanding our physical presence, developing online learning platforms to reach a wider audience, and establishing a robust alumni network to foster continued connections and support among our participants.  By investing in cutting-edge technology and maintaining our commitment to personalized service, MPA aims to be at the forefront of the personal development landscape in Assam for years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6001853307', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.289Z', '2025-08-19T05:35:40.000Z'),
