<br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence, coupled with our deep understanding of the local business environment, positions IMS Guwahati for significant growth and continued success as a pivotal contributor to the economic development of Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864057575', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.291Z', '2025-08-19T05:55:32.000Z'),
(880, 'Aimers Study Centre', 'Coaching Center', NULL, '<h1>Aimers Study Centre: Nurturing Academic Excellence in Assam</h1>

