<p>Through our unwavering commitment to quality education, holistic development, and community engagement, Potential & Concept Educations aims to empower the youth of Dharapur and beyond, equipping them with the knowledge and skills necessary to achieve their full potential and become productive members of society. We believe that education is the key to unlocking individual and collective progress, and we are dedicated to making a lasting impact on the lives we touch.</p>', 'Bhaben Thakuria Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.293Z', '2025-08-19T06:35:34.000Z')
