(920, 'Potential and Concept Educations Dighalipukhuri Block 2', 'Coaching Center', NULL, '<h1>Potential and Concept Educations Dighalipukhuri Block 2</h1>

<p>Potential and Concept Educations, situated in Dighalipukhuri Block 2, is a dynamic educational institution playing a vital role in shaping the future of Assam''s youth.  We are committed to providing high-quality education and fostering a learning environment that empowers students to reach their full potential. Our unique approach blends traditional academic excellence with innovative teaching methodologies, ensuring our students are well-prepared for the challenges and opportunities of the 21st century.  We differentiate ourselves through a strong focus on individual student needs and a deep connection with the local community, actively contributing to the region''s intellectual and social growth. </p><br><br>

<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond the classroom. We actively cultivate a supportive and nurturing learning environment where students feel comfortable exploring their interests, developing their critical thinking skills, and building lasting relationships with their peers and mentors. We believe that education is a transformative journey, and we are dedicated to guiding our students every step of the way. In a region where access to quality education can be limited, Potential and Concept Educations serves as a beacon of hope, providing a pathway to success for students from diverse backgrounds.</p><br><br>


<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Potential and Concept Educations offers a comprehensive range of educational services catering to the diverse needs of students in the region.  Our core offerings include tailored tutoring programs focusing on various academic subjects, from primary school levels through secondary and beyond.  We also provide specialized exam preparation courses for crucial examinations like the Higher Secondary Leaving Certificate (HSLC) and the Higher Secondary (HS) examinations, equipping students with the knowledge and skills necessary to excel. Recognizing the importance of practical skills, we incorporate vocational training programs designed to equip students with employable skills, enhancing their career prospects within the local and national job markets.  Our curriculum is regularly updated to meet the evolving needs of the educational landscape, incorporating contemporary teaching methodologies and modern technological tools.</p><br><br>

<p>A unique selling proposition of Potential and Concept Educations is our personalized learning approach. We believe in understanding each student''s individual learning style, strengths, and weaknesses to create a customized learning plan that maximizes their potential.  Our small class sizes and dedicated instructors allow for individualized attention, ensuring every student receives the support they need to succeed. This commitment to personalized learning, coupled with our strong emphasis on practical application, sets us apart in the competitive educational landscape of Assam.  We directly address the local market need for quality education by providing accessible, affordable, and effective learning opportunities, bridging the gap between aspirational students and the resources required for success.</p><br><br>


<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Potential and Concept Educations, we prioritize building strong, lasting relationships with our students and their families.  We foster an open communication channel, ensuring parents are kept informed about their child''s progress and are actively involved in the learning process.  We believe that a collaborative approach between the institution, students, and parents is essential for achieving optimal learning outcomes. Our customer service extends beyond academic support; we provide guidance and mentorship to help students navigate the complexities of choosing a career path and preparing for higher education.</p><br><br>

<p>Our commitment to the local community is a cornerstone of our philosophy.  We regularly organize workshops, seminars, and community outreach programs to promote education and empower individuals in the Dighalipukhuri Block 2 area. We actively engage with local organizations and leaders to identify and address the specific educational needs of our community.  This dedication to community engagement reflects our belief that education is a catalyst for positive social change and that we have a responsibility to contribute to the overall well-being of our region. We strive to create a warm and welcoming learning environment where students feel valued, respected, and empowered.</p><br><br>


<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Potential and Concept Educations envisions a future where we become a leading educational institution in Assam, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement.  Our future plans include expanding our range of educational services to meet the growing demand for specialized training programs in emerging fields.  We aim to integrate more advanced technologies into our teaching methods, leveraging the power of digital learning tools to enhance the learning experience. We also plan to further strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and industries to create more opportunities for internships and apprenticeships for our students.</p><br><br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to empower generations of students from Dighalipukhuri Block 2 and the surrounding areas by providing them with the knowledge, skills, and confidence to achieve their full potential.  We aspire to contribute to the economic and social development of Assam by fostering a highly skilled and educated workforce.  We will continue to invest in our infrastructure, curriculum, and faculty to ensure we remain at the forefront of educational innovation, always adapting to the evolving needs of our students and community.  We envision a future where Potential and Concept Educations becomes synonymous with quality education and transformative learning in the heart of Assam.</p><br><br>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.293Z', '2025-08-19T06:35:41.000Z'),
(922, 'Kairali Ayurvedic Centre, Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Kairali Ayurvedic Centre, Guwahati, nestled at 1, B N SAIKIA PATH, represents a haven of traditional healing amidst the bustling cityscape. More than just a wellness center, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre stands as a beacon of authentic Ayurvedic practices, bringing the ancient wisdom of Kerala to the heart of Assam. Its presence significantly contributes to the growing health and wellness sector in Guwahati, offering a holistic alternative to conventional healthcare. By focusing on personalized treatments rooted in centuries-old traditions, the center distinguishes itself from generic spas and wellness clinics, catering to a growing demand for natural and sustainable health solutions within the local community. Its strategic location ensures accessibility for residents seeking authentic Ayurvedic care.

<br> <br>

At its core, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre offers a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic services and products designed to restore balance and promote overall well-being. These services encompass personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create tailored treatment plans. These plans typically include specialized Ayurvedic therapies such as Abhyangam (full body massage with medicated oils), Shirodhara (gentle pouring of oil on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapies), and other traditional Ayurvedic treatments. Furthermore, the centre provides dietary guidance based on Ayurvedic principles, empowering clients to make informed choices that support their health goals.

<br> <br>

A key differentiator for Kairali Ayurvedic Centre lies in its commitment to authenticity. The centre utilizes genuine Ayurvedic oils and herbs, many sourced directly from Kerala, ensuring the efficacy and purity of its treatments. This dedication to quality, coupled with the expertise of its therapists trained in traditional Ayurvedic techniques, sets it apart from competitors who may offer diluted or superficial versions of these therapies. The centre also addresses specific local market needs, such as managing lifestyle-related ailments common in the region, including stress, digestive issues, and joint pain, through targeted Ayurvedic interventions. Additionally, it offers personalized wellness packages catering to different needs, such as stress management, weight management, and rejuvenation, further enhancing its appeal to the local populace.

<br> <br>

Kairali Ayurvedic Centre prioritizes creating a nurturing and supportive environment for its clients. From the moment a client walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. The centre''s staff takes the time to understand each individual''s unique needs and concerns, providing personalized attention throughout their treatment journey. The therapists are not only skilled in their techniques but also empathetic and attentive, ensuring that clients feel comfortable and relaxed during their sessions. To foster a deeper connection with the local community, the centre actively participates in health awareness programs and workshops, educating people about the benefits of Ayurveda and promoting holistic well-being. This active engagement demonstrates a commitment beyond mere service provision, establishing Kairali Ayurvedic Centre as a trusted partner in the community''s health and wellness journey. Feedback is actively sought and integrated to continually improve the client experience.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre, Guwahati envisions becoming the premier destination for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in the region. Future plans include expanding its service offerings to incorporate specialized Ayurvedic treatments for specific conditions, such as diabetes and cardiovascular diseases. The centre also aims to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. Exploring opportunities to cultivate medicinal herbs locally and creating Ayurvedic products tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese population is also a long-term goal. The centre anticipates leveraging digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible. Ultimately, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre seeks to empower individuals to take control of their health through the wisdom of Ayurveda, contributing to a healthier and more balanced community in Guwahati and beyond. This growth strategy is predicated on upholding the highest standards of quality, authenticity, and customer satisfaction, solidifying its position as a trusted and respected Ayurvedic center.', '1, B N SAIKIA PATH', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:46:58.000Z'),
(923, 'Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre, Guwahati, Assam', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional healing, offering authentic Ayurvedic treatments and Panchakarma therapies in the heart of Guwahati. Located at No 1, 1st Flr, Anupama Mention, H No 316, Bajrakbati Road, near Nabajyoti Club, the clinic provides a serene and accessible environment for individuals seeking natural and holistic wellness solutions. Jiva Ayurveda is not just a clinic; it represents a commitment to reviving and promoting the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda in a modern context, catering specifically to the health needs of the Assamese community and beyond. Its presence significantly contributes to the growing wellness industry in the region, offering a credible alternative to conventional medicine and empowering individuals to take charge of their health through natural and sustainable practices.
<br> <br>
The core of Jiva Ayurveda''s offering lies in its comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and authentic Panchakarma therapies. The clinic provides expert Ayurvedic consultations by qualified and experienced Ayurvedic doctors who meticulously assess each patient''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to diagnose the root cause of their health concerns. Based on this thorough assessment, individualized treatment plans are developed, incorporating dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specific Ayurvedic therapies.

<br> <br>
Panchakarma, the cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation, is a specialized offering at the centre. The clinic provides a range of Panchakarma procedures, including Vamana (emesis therapy), Virechana (purgation therapy), Basti (enema therapy), Nasya (nasal administration), and Raktamokshana (bloodletting therapy), each meticulously performed under the supervision of skilled therapists and doctors. These therapies are instrumental in eliminating accumulated toxins, restoring balance to the body''s doshas, and promoting overall well-being.

<br> <br>
A key differentiating factor for Jiva Ayurveda is its unwavering commitment to using authentic Ayurvedic principles and high-quality herbal formulations. The clinic sources its herbs and ingredients from reputable suppliers, ensuring their purity and potency. Furthermore, the doctors and therapists at Jiva Ayurveda possess extensive knowledge and experience in Ayurvedic medicine, enabling them to provide effective and safe treatments. By offering personalized and authentic Ayurvedic solutions, Jiva Ayurveda directly addresses the growing need for natural and holistic healthcare options in Guwahati and the surrounding areas, where there is a rising awareness of the benefits of traditional medicine. It fulfills a vital niche by providing accessible and effective Ayurvedic care rooted in time-tested principles.
<br> <br>
Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every patient. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized care, ensuring that each patient feels comfortable and respected throughout their treatment journey. The clinic’s approach to customer service emphasizes education and empowerment. Patients are actively involved in their treatment plans, receiving clear explanations of their condition, the recommended therapies, and lifestyle adjustments. This collaborative approach fosters a sense of ownership and encourages patients to take an active role in their healing process.

<br> <br>
Furthermore, Jiva Ayurveda actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the principles of Ayurveda, its benefits, and its relevance to modern lifestyles. By participating in local events and partnering with community organizations, Jiva Ayurveda strengthens its connection with the community and establishes itself as a trusted resource for health and wellness information. The clinic also focuses on providing culturally sensitive care, understanding and respecting the local customs and traditions of the Assamese community. This approach ensures that patients feel comfortable and understood, fostering a strong sense of trust and loyalty.
<br> <br>
Looking ahead, Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre envisions expanding its reach and impact within Guwahati and beyond. The clinic plans to introduce specialized Ayurvedic programs targeting specific health concerns prevalent in the region, such as diabetes, arthritis, and respiratory disorders. This strategic focus will allow the clinic to cater to the unique healthcare needs of the local population and establish itself as a center of excellence for specific Ayurvedic treatments.

<br> <br>
The clinic also aims to enhance its infrastructure and services, potentially incorporating additional wellness modalities such as yoga and meditation to complement its Ayurvedic offerings. Furthermore, there are plans to expand the team of doctors and therapists, ensuring that the clinic can meet the growing demand for its services. In the long term, Jiva Ayurveda aspires to become a leading Ayurvedic healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles, personalized care, and community engagement. The vision is to empower individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through the transformative power of Ayurveda, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community. The clinic also intends to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and educational resources, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to individuals in remote areas.', 'No 1, 1st Flr, Anupama Mention, H No 316, Bajrakbati Road, near Nabajyoti Club', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '069013 70770', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:47:05.000Z'),
(924, 'AYONext Healthcare- A Multispeciality Ayurveda & Holistic clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>AYONext Healthcare: Bridging Tradition and Modernity in Holistic Wellness</p>

<p>Nestled opposite Cafe Coffee Day at House fed, Bus stop, Beltola - Basistha Rd, AYONext Healthcare stands as a beacon of holistic wellness in Guwahati. More than just a clinic, AYONext Healthcare is a multispeciality Ayurveda and holistic center dedicated to providing comprehensive and personalized healthcare solutions rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, integrated with modern diagnostic and therapeutic approaches. In the vibrant and rapidly evolving business landscape of Assam, AYONext Healthcare fills a crucial niche by offering a unique blend of traditional healing and contemporary medical understanding. This approach addresses the growing demand for natural, preventative, and personalized healthcare solutions, distinguishing it from conventional medical practices and contributing significantly to the local wellness ecosystem. AYONext Healthcare aims to be the premier destination for individuals seeking authentic and effective Ayurvedic care, promoting a healthier and more balanced lifestyle within the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Holistic Healthcare Tailored to Your Needs: Core Services and Products</p>

<p>At the heart of AYONext Healthcare lies a commitment to providing a wide array of services designed to cater to diverse health and wellness needs. Our core offerings include: Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, Panchakarma therapies, specialized Ayurvedic treatments for chronic conditions, yoga and meditation sessions, dietary and lifestyle counseling, and herbal remedies. What truly sets AYONext Healthcare apart is its integrated approach. Our experienced Ayurvedic physicians conduct thorough assessments, considering not only physical symptoms but also mental and emotional well-being. This holistic understanding allows for the creation of customized treatment plans that address the root cause of ailments, promoting long-term healing. <br> <br> Our Panchakarma therapies, a cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification, are meticulously performed by trained therapists using authentic Ayurvedic principles. These therapies aim to eliminate toxins, restore balance, and rejuvenate the body. Furthermore, our specialized Ayurvedic treatments cater to a range of chronic conditions, such as arthritis, diabetes, skin disorders, and digestive issues. We also offer yoga and meditation sessions, guided by certified instructors, to enhance physical flexibility, reduce stress, and promote mental clarity. Dietary and lifestyle counseling forms an integral part of our approach, empowering individuals to make informed choices that support their overall health and well-being. Our carefully curated selection of herbal remedies, sourced from trusted suppliers, complements our therapies, offering natural and effective solutions for various health concerns. We differentiate ourselves by emphasizing education and empowerment, ensuring our clients understand their conditions and actively participate in their healing journey. By providing comprehensive, personalized, and authentic Ayurvedic care, AYONext Healthcare effectively meets the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions in the local market, offering a valuable alternative or complement to conventional medical treatments.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Building Trust, Nurturing Well-being: The AYONext Healthcare Customer Experience</p>

<p>The customer experience at AYONext Healthcare is built upon a foundation of empathy, respect, and personalized attention. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. Our staff is dedicated to creating a welcoming and comfortable environment, fostering a sense of trust and openness. We prioritize active listening, taking the time to understand each client''s individual needs, concerns, and goals. Our Ayurvedic physicians conduct thorough consultations, explaining diagnoses and treatment plans in a clear and accessible manner, ensuring clients feel informed and empowered. <br> <br> We go the extra mile to provide exceptional customer service, offering personalized follow-up care and ongoing support. Our commitment extends beyond the clinic walls, as we actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health awareness programs. These initiatives aim to educate individuals about the benefits of Ayurveda and holistic living, empowering them to take proactive steps towards their well-being. We actively seek feedback from our clients, using their insights to continuously improve our services and enhance their experience. By fostering strong relationships and building a reputation for integrity and excellence, AYONext Healthcare has established itself as a trusted healthcare partner within the local community. We believe that healing is a collaborative process, and we are dedicated to providing our clients with the support, guidance, and resources they need to achieve optimal health and well-being. Our dedication to personalized care, community engagement, and continuous improvement sets us apart, fostering a loyal client base and contributing to the overall health and vitality of the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>A Vision for a Healthier Tomorrow: Future Growth and Long-Term Goals</p>

<p>AYONext Healthcare envisions a future where Ayurveda and holistic healthcare are integral components of mainstream healthcare in Assam and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a wider audience, establishing ourselves as a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research, and contributing to the development of sustainable healthcare practices. We plan to expand our range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments, incorporating advanced diagnostic technologies to enhance accuracy and effectiveness. <br> <br> We also aim to establish partnerships with local businesses, schools, and community organizations to promote wellness initiatives and raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda. Investing in research and development is a key priority, as we seek to validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments through scientific studies and contribute to the growing body of evidence-based Ayurvedic medicine. We also envision establishing a training center to educate and empower the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable practices, sourcing our herbal remedies from ethical and environmentally responsible suppliers, and minimizing our environmental impact. By pursuing these goals, AYONext Healthcare aspires to become a catalyst for positive change in the healthcare landscape, promoting a holistic approach to wellness that integrates mind, body, and spirit. Our vision is to create a healthier and more vibrant community, empowering individuals to live their lives to the fullest.</p>', 'House fed, Bus stop, Beltola - Basistha Rd, opposite Cafe Coffee Day', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080113 93135', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:47:13.000Z'),
(925, 'Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved | Apollo Clinic Dispur', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved | Apollo Clinic Dispur: Reimagining Wellness Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Dispur, Guwahati, at 4QQX+8HH Abode Grand, near SBI ATM, opposite Downtown Hospital, Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved operates within the prestigious Apollo Clinic Dispur, offering a unique and integrated approach to healthcare. More than just a clinic, it represents a confluence of traditional Ayurvedic practices and modern medical understanding. In the burgeoning Assam healthcare landscape, this practice stands out by providing personalized, holistic wellness solutions deeply rooted in Ayurvedic principles, tailored to address the specific health needs of the local community. This synergy allows for a comprehensive treatment paradigm, offering patients the best of both worlds – the time-tested efficacy of Ayurveda and the assurance of Apollo Clinic''s quality and infrastructure.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Well-being</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved offers a wide spectrum of Ayurvedic services designed to promote health and well-being. The cornerstone of the practice is personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of the individual''s <i>prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance), allowing Dr. Kalita to create tailored treatment plans that address the root cause of ailments. These plans may encompass dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Key service offerings include:
<ul>
    <li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> A comprehensive detoxification and rejuvenation program, customized to the individual''s needs and administered under expert supervision.</li>
    <li><b>Herbal Medicine:</b> A curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, sourced from reputable suppliers, to support various health conditions.</li>
    <li><b>Diet and Lifestyle Counseling:</b> Personalized guidance on diet and lifestyle adjustments to promote optimal health and prevent disease.</li>
    <li><b>Stress Management Programs:</b> Utilizing Ayurvedic techniques such as yoga, meditation, and aromatherapy to reduce stress and improve mental well-being.</li>
    <li><b>Management of Chronic Diseases:</b> Ayurvedic approaches for managing chronic conditions such as diabetes, arthritis, and respiratory disorders, often complementing conventional medical treatments.</li>
</ul>
</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Dr. Kalita''s practice apart is the emphasis on personalized care and the integration of Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic tools. The practice leverages the resources of Apollo Clinic Dispur, allowing for comprehensive diagnostic testing when needed to ensure accurate assessment and effective treatment. Furthermore, the focus extends beyond symptom management to address the underlying imbalances that contribute to disease, promoting long-term health and well-being. This unique combination addresses the growing local demand for holistic healthcare options that are both effective and sustainable.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Customer Experience: Nurturing a Community of Wellness</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved, patient well-being is paramount. The clinic cultivates a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered to take control of their health. The approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine commitment to providing personalized care. Time is taken to thoroughly understand each patient''s concerns, answer their questions, and explain treatment options in a clear and accessible manner. Follow-up consultations are conducted to monitor progress and make necessary adjustments to the treatment plan.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The practice actively connects with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and educational seminars on Ayurvedic principles and healthy living. These initiatives aim to empower individuals with the knowledge and tools they need to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. By fostering a strong sense of community and promoting a holistic approach to health, Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved is not only providing healthcare but also building a community of wellness within Dispur.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding the Reach of Authentic Ayurveda</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>The vision for Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved is to become a leading center for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, personalized care, and integrated approach. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, incorporating advanced Ayurvedic therapies, and developing specialized programs for specific health conditions. Collaboration with other healthcare professionals and organizations is a key focus, aiming to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare and foster a more holistic approach to patient care.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>There''s also an aspiration to increase community outreach efforts, extending health awareness programs to a wider audience and promoting the benefits of Ayurveda through various channels. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the community, Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved aims to play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare in Assam, ensuring that the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda is accessible to all those seeking a path to holistic health and well-being. This involves leveraging digital platforms to reach a broader audience and offer virtual consultations, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to individuals in remote areas.</p>', '4QQX+8HH Abode Grand, near SBI ATM, opp. Downtown Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:47:21.000Z'),
(926, 'SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre offers a haven of holistic healing nestled in the heart of Assam. Located at House no 28, Wireless, Namghar Path 2, opposite the BSNL office, SIDDHI is more than just a wellness centre; it''s a sanctuary dedicated to restoring balance and promoting optimal well-being through the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and Panchakarma therapies. Recognizing the growing need for authentic and accessible Ayurvedic care in the region, SIDDHI aims to bridge the gap between traditional practices and modern lifestyles, providing a path to rejuvenation and lasting health. The centre distinguishes itself by focusing on personalized treatments, expert consultations, and a serene environment conducive to healing. Its presence strengthens the local business landscape by offering a unique service that aligns with a growing global interest in natural and holistic health solutions, catering to both local residents and visitors seeking authentic Ayurvedic experiences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre lies a comprehensive range of services designed to address various health concerns and promote overall well-being. The primary offerings include: Ayurvedic Consultations, providing in-depth assessments of individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to determine personalized treatment plans. Panchakarma Therapies, encompassing a variety of detoxification and rejuvenation treatments like Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), Basti (medicated enema), Nasya (nasal administration), and Vamana (therapeutic emesis), each tailored to individual needs and health conditions. Additionally, the centre offers specialized Ayurvedic treatments for various ailments, including joint pain, digestive disorders, stress management, and skin conditions. Complementing these core therapies, SIDDHI provides wellness programs focused on lifestyle modifications, dietary recommendations, and yoga and meditation practices. A unique selling point is the centre''s commitment to using only high-quality, ethically sourced Ayurvedic herbs and oils, ensuring the efficacy and safety of all treatments. The services offered are carefully curated to meet the specific health needs prevalent in the local market, addressing lifestyle-related disorders and promoting preventative healthcare practices rooted in traditional Ayurvedic principles.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience at SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre is paramount. The approach is built on creating a warm, welcoming, and personalized environment where each individual feels valued and supported throughout their wellness journey. From the moment a client enters the centre, they are greeted with genuine care and attention. The team is committed to providing clear and informative consultations, ensuring that clients understand their individual constitution, health concerns, and proposed treatment plans. Therapists are highly trained and experienced in administering Ayurvedic treatments with precision and compassion. The centre maintains a clean, serene, and aesthetically pleasing environment to enhance relaxation and promote a sense of tranquility. SIDDHI actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars to promote the benefits of Ayurveda and holistic living. Building strong relationships with local residents and businesses fosters trust and establishes SIDDHI as a reliable resource for authentic Ayurvedic care. This dedication to exceptional customer service, combined with community engagement, sets SIDDHI apart and contributes to its positive reputation within the local area.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre is one of sustainable growth and expanding its reach as a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond. Future plans include expanding the range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments offered, incorporating advanced diagnostic techniques, and establishing partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream healthcare. There is also a vision to develop a line of high-quality, locally produced Ayurvedic products, further supporting the local economy and promoting the use of natural remedies. Long-term goals encompass establishing a dedicated training program for Ayurvedic therapists, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing system. SIDDHI aims to become a recognized centre of excellence in Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and practices in the field. Furthermore, the centre aspires to explore opportunities for expanding its services to other locations, making authentic Ayurvedic care more accessible to a wider population. By continuously innovating, adapting to evolving healthcare needs, and upholding its commitment to quality and authenticity, SIDDHI is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a trusted and respected wellness centre in the region.</p>', 'House no 28, Wireless, Namghar Path 2, opposite BSNL office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '090855 03254', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:47:27.000Z'),
(927, 'Vivekananda Health Global - Ayurveda, Yoga & Naturopathy Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Vivekananda Health Global - Ayurveda, Yoga & Naturopathy Guwahati is a comprehensive wellness center dedicated to providing holistic healthcare solutions rooted in the ancient Indian traditions of Ayurveda, Yoga, and Naturopathy. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, this center addresses the growing demand for natural and preventive healthcare options within the region. Vivekananda Health Global aims to empower individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through personalized treatment plans and lifestyle modifications, making a significant contribution to the local healthcare ecosystem by offering an integrated and alternative approach to conventional medicine.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The center''s core services encompass a wide range of therapeutic modalities designed to cater to diverse health needs. Ayurvedic consultations form the foundation, where qualified Ayurvedic practitioners assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to devise tailored dietary and lifestyle recommendations, along with herbal remedies. Yoga therapy, another cornerstone, offers structured yoga sessions designed to improve flexibility, strength, and mental clarity, addressing specific health conditions under the guidance of experienced instructors. Naturopathy treatments, including hydrotherapy, mud therapy, and massage, are employed to detoxify the body and stimulate its inherent healing capabilities. A key differentiator lies in the integrated approach, where these three disciplines are synergistically combined to create holistic treatment plans. For example, a patient suffering from chronic back pain might receive Ayurvedic herbal remedies to reduce inflammation, combined with targeted yoga asanas to strengthen core muscles and naturopathic hydrotherapy to alleviate muscle tension. This personalized and integrated approach, tailored to the unique needs of each patient, sets Vivekananda Health Global apart from other wellness centers in Guwahati and meets the growing local demand for natural and effective healthcare solutions. The center also offers wellness packages focusing on detoxification, weight management, and stress reduction, reflecting the specific health challenges prevalent in the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Vivekananda Health Global. The center strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered throughout their healing journey. A key element of their approach is personalized attention, beginning with an in-depth initial consultation to thoroughly understand the patient''s health history, lifestyle, and goals. Treatment plans are co-created with the patient, ensuring their active participation and understanding. The center invests in highly qualified and compassionate practitioners who are dedicated to providing individualized care. Beyond the treatments themselves, Vivekananda Health Global actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda, Yoga, and Naturopathy, fostering a greater understanding of holistic health principles and promoting preventive healthcare practices. This community outreach not only builds trust and credibility but also contributes to a healthier and more informed society in Guwahati. The center fosters a strong doctor-patient relationship. Regular follow-up consultations are conducted to monitor progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and provide ongoing support and encouragement. This comprehensive approach ensures that patients receive the personalized care and attention they need to achieve lasting health improvements.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Vivekananda Health Global envisions becoming a leading center for integrated healthcare in Guwahati and a recognized hub for promoting Ayurvedic, Yoga, and Naturopathic principles throughout Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered to encompass specialized therapies such as Panchakarma (Ayurvedic detoxification), advanced yoga techniques, and customized dietary programs. The center also aims to establish collaborations with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate traditional medicine into mainstream healthcare. This collaborative approach would facilitate referrals, promote a more holistic approach to patient care, and contribute to the overall advancement of healthcare in the region. Furthermore, Vivekananda Health Global plans to invest in research and development to validate the efficacy of its treatments and contribute to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting traditional medicine. Long-term goals include establishing a training center to educate and empower future practitioners of Ayurveda, Yoga, and Naturopathy, ensuring the continued availability of qualified healthcare professionals in the region. By focusing on innovation, collaboration, and education, Vivekananda Health Global aims to solidify its position as a trusted and respected provider of holistic healthcare, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community in Guwahati and beyond. The business also intends to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience, offering online consultations, educational resources, and virtual yoga classes to promote accessibility and convenience.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098646 28232', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:50:08.000Z'),
(928, 'Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic: Restoring Balance and Well-being in the Heart of Assam

Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic, strategically located on G. S. Road, near PNB Bank, stands as a beacon of traditional healing and holistic well-being in the bustling landscape of Assam. Rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda, Kayachikitsa offers a comprehensive approach to health, focusing on restoring balance and harmony within the individual. Unlike conventional medical practices that primarily address symptoms, Kayachikitsa delves into the root causes of ailments, offering personalized treatments that consider each individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). The clinic''s presence enriches the local business environment by providing a valuable alternative and complementary healthcare option that is deeply connected to India''s rich heritage.

<br> <br>

At the core of Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic are its diverse range of services designed to address a spectrum of health concerns. Primary services include thorough Ayurvedic consultations, Panchakarma therapies, specialized Ayurvedic treatments for chronic conditions, and personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations. The clinic specializes in addressing common ailments prevalent in the region, such as digestive disorders, respiratory issues, joint pain, skin conditions, and stress-related imbalances. Each service is tailored to meet the specific needs of the individual, following a detailed assessment of their physical, mental, and emotional well-being.

<br> <br>

A key differentiator for Kayachikitsa is its unwavering commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles. The clinic utilizes high-quality, ethically sourced herbs and natural ingredients in its formulations and treatments. Experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners, trained in traditional techniques, administer these therapies with precision and care. Furthermore, the clinic emphasizes patient education, empowering individuals with the knowledge and tools to actively participate in their own healing journey. This holistic approach, combining traditional wisdom with modern understanding, sets Kayachikitsa apart as a trusted center for authentic Ayurvedic care in the region.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic. The clinic strives to create a warm, welcoming, and nurturing environment where patients feel comfortable and supported. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine care and attention. Consultations are conducted with empathy and patience, ensuring that patients feel heard and understood. Treatment plans are clearly explained, and patients are actively involved in the decision-making process. The clinic also provides ongoing support and guidance, helping patients to integrate Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives.

<br> <br>

The clinic fosters a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives. It conducts regular workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles, healthy living, and stress management, providing valuable knowledge to the community. Kayachikitsa also collaborates with local organizations to promote health and wellness, participating in health camps and awareness programs. By actively engaging with the community, the clinic seeks to promote a deeper understanding and appreciation for the benefits of Ayurveda. Furthermore, the clinic actively sources some of its ingredients locally, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare and wellness in Assam and beyond. The clinic plans to expand its range of services to include specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes management and women''s health. It also aims to establish a training center to nurture the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. In the long term, Kayachikitsa aspires to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare, working collaboratively with other healthcare providers to offer a truly integrated and holistic approach to health and well-being. Expansion into related product lines, such as Ayurvedic supplements and personal care items, is also being considered to further enhance the clinic''s offerings and reach a wider audience. The ultimate goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health and live a balanced, fulfilling life through the wisdom of Ayurveda.', 'G. S.road, near PNB bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070022 35198', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:50:13.000Z'),
(929, 'Amrit clinic, Ayurvedic holistic centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Amrit Clinic, Ayurvedic Holistic Centre, nestled at H/no 56, Dr. Zakir Hussain Rd, is a dedicated wellness haven bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the heart of Assam. More than just a clinic, Amrit Clinic is a sanctuary designed to restore balance and promote holistic well-being through personalized Ayurvedic treatments, therapies, and lifestyle guidance. In a region deeply rooted in traditional practices, Amrit Clinic stands out by blending authentic Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostics and a commitment to individualized care, addressing the growing need for natural and preventative healthcare solutions within the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the core of Amrit Clinic''s offerings are personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations, conducted by experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners, delve into an individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any existing imbalances (Vikriti). This forms the foundation for crafting tailored treatment plans encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and specific Ayurvedic therapies. The clinic offers a range of authentic Ayurvedic treatments, including Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification therapies), and various other therapeutic massages and herbal treatments. These therapies are meticulously performed using high-quality, ethically sourced Ayurvedic herbs and oils, ensuring optimal therapeutic benefits. Furthermore, Amrit Clinic provides guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into daily life, offering workshops and educational sessions on topics such as mindful eating, stress management techniques, and herbal remedies for common ailments. A key differentiator is the clinic''s focus on preventative care, empowering individuals to proactively manage their health and prevent the onset of disease through a holistic and sustainable approach. This proactive approach resonates strongly with the local community, seeking natural and sustainable solutions for long-term well-being, and addresses the limitations of conventional healthcare systems in managing chronic conditions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Amrit Clinic prioritizes creating a warm, welcoming, and healing environment for every individual who walks through its doors. From the moment a patient arrives, they are greeted with genuine care and attention, fostering a sense of trust and comfort. The practitioners at Amrit Clinic are not just healthcare providers; they are dedicated guides on each patient''s journey towards holistic well-being. They take the time to listen attentively to individual concerns, answer questions thoroughly, and provide personalized support throughout the treatment process. Beyond individual care, Amrit Clinic actively engages with the local community through health awareness camps, workshops on Ayurvedic cooking and lifestyle practices, and collaborations with local organizations. This commitment to community outreach fosters a sense of belonging and reinforces Amrit Clinic''s position as a trusted resource for holistic health and well-being within the region. The emphasis on building strong relationships with patients and community members sets Amrit Clinic apart, creating a loyal following and fostering positive word-of-mouth referrals. The clinic actively seeks feedback from patients to continuously improve its services and ensure that it is meeting the evolving needs of the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Amrit Clinic envisions becoming a leading Ayurvedic holistic centre in Assam, recognized for its commitment to providing authentic, personalized, and effective Ayurvedic care. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic therapies offered, incorporating advanced diagnostic tools for a more comprehensive assessment of individual health needs, and establishing a dedicated herbal pharmacy to ensure access to high-quality Ayurvedic medicines. The clinic also aims to strengthen its community outreach initiatives by partnering with local schools and workplaces to promote Ayurvedic principles of health and wellness. Furthermore, Amrit Clinic is exploring opportunities to develop specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes, arthritis, and stress-related disorders, tailoring Ayurvedic treatments and lifestyle recommendations to address the unique needs of these patient populations. The long-term goal is to establish Amrit Clinic as a centre of excellence for Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition and empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. The expansion of online consultation services is also under consideration, extending the reach of Amrit Clinic''s expertise to individuals beyond the local area and providing convenient access to Ayurvedic guidance and support.</p>', 'H/no 56, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:50:18.000Z'),
(930, 'Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar, a trusted name in traditional healthcare, stands prominently on G.S. Road, near Hotel Ambarish and opposite Shah Petrol Pump, serving the community with authentic Ayurvedic products and remedies. For years, this establishment has been a cornerstone of holistic wellness in Assam, offering a curated selection of herbs, medicines, and personal care items rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda. In a region where traditional healing practices are deeply respected, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar distinguishes itself by upholding the principles of quality, authenticity, and personalized service, becoming a vital resource for those seeking natural and effective healthcare solutions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar lies a commitment to providing a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products. This includes classical Ayurvedic medicines formulated according to traditional recipes, single herbs and herbal blends sourced from reputable suppliers, and a variety of Ayurvedic personal care products such as soaps, shampoos, and oils. The store also offers a selection of Ayurvedic supplements designed to promote overall well-being and address specific health concerns. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing products from companies that adhere to stringent quality control measures and ethical sourcing practices. Furthermore, the availability of knowledgeable staff who can provide guidance and recommendations based on individual needs sets Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar apart from generic pharmacies and online retailers. The business strategically caters to the local market''s preference for natural and time-tested remedies, providing access to products that are often difficult to find elsewhere.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar. The staff is trained not just to sell products, but to understand the principles of Ayurveda and provide informed advice. They take the time to listen to customers'' concerns, assess their individual needs, and recommend appropriate products or suggest lifestyle modifications that align with Ayurvedic principles. This personalized approach fosters trust and loyalty among customers who value the expertise and genuine care offered. The store environment is designed to be welcoming and calming, reflecting the holistic nature of Ayurveda. Beyond individual consultations, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar actively engages with the local community through workshops and educational events on topics related to Ayurvedic health and wellness. This commitment to education and community engagement strengthens the business''s reputation as a trusted source of information and support, solidifying its position as a vital part of the local healthcare landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar envisions expanding its reach and impact within the region. Future plans include increasing the selection of specialized Ayurvedic products to cater to a wider range of health needs. The business also aims to enhance its online presence to provide convenient access to its products and services for customers beyond its immediate geographical location. Exploring partnerships with local Ayurvedic practitioners and healthcare providers to offer integrated healthcare solutions is another key objective. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a leading center for Ayurvedic knowledge and wellness in Assam, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. By continuing to prioritize quality, authenticity, and customer-centricity, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar is poised for sustainable growth and a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves.</p>', 'G.S. Road, near Hotel Ambarish, opposite Shah Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '086385 67937', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:50:23.000Z'),
(931, 'Jagati Nature Care', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Jagati Nature Care stands as a beacon of sustainable living and holistic well-being within the vibrant business environment of Assam. More than just a provider of nature-based products, Jagati Nature Care embodies a philosophy that harmonizes human needs with environmental preservation. Recognizing the rich biodiversity and traditional knowledge inherent in Assam, the business is dedicated to ethically sourcing, processing, and delivering products that promote a healthier lifestyle while simultaneously supporting local communities and safeguarding the region''s natural heritage. In a market increasingly aware of the importance of sustainable practices, Jagati Nature Care differentiates itself through its unwavering commitment to authenticity, traceability, and social responsibility, carving a unique niche as a purveyor of truly ethical and nature-inspired solutions.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Jagati Nature Care lies a carefully curated selection of products designed to cater to diverse needs. The business specializes in handcrafted soaps made with locally sourced ingredients like Assam tea, aromatic herbs, and pure essential oils. These soaps are crafted using traditional cold-process methods, ensuring the preservation of natural glycerine and maximizing their skin-nourishing properties. Beyond soaps, Jagati Nature Care offers a range of herbal teas, each blend carefully formulated to address specific wellness needs, drawing upon the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and local botanical knowledge. Furthermore, the business offers a selection of locally sourced honey, renowned for its purity and unique floral profiles. These products are unique not only for their natural composition but also for their cultural significance, representing a fusion of traditional practices and modern demands. The unique selling point lies in the transparent supply chain, ensuring that customers are aware of the origin of the ingredients and the positive impact of their purchase on local farmers and artisans. Each product is meticulously crafted to meet the specific needs of the local market, addressing concerns such as skin sensitivity, digestive health, and the desire for natural, chemical-free alternatives.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Jagati Nature Care. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment, whether online or in person. Staff members are trained to provide expert advice on product selection and usage, ensuring that each customer finds the solution best suited to their individual needs. Jagati Nature Care goes beyond simply selling products; it fosters a sense of community through workshops and educational programs on topics such as sustainable living, herbal remedies, and the importance of preserving local biodiversity. The business actively participates in local farmers'' markets and community events, further strengthening its connection to the community and promoting awareness of its mission. This dedication to building relationships and providing exceptional service has cultivated a loyal customer base that values not only the quality of the products but also the ethical values and social responsibility that Jagati Nature Care represents.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking towards the future, Jagati Nature Care envisions expanding its product line while maintaining its unwavering commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing. Plans are underway to introduce a range of natural skincare products, including face masks, serums, and lotions, all formulated with locally sourced ingredients. The business also aims to establish partnerships with more local farmers and artisans, providing them with fair prices and access to wider markets. Expansion into neighboring regions of Northeast India is also a strategic goal, allowing Jagati Nature Care to share its unique blend of nature-based products and sustainable practices with a broader audience. Long-term, the goal is to establish Jagati Nature Care as a leading brand in the region, synonymous with quality, ethical practices, and a deep commitment to preserving the natural heritage of Assam. The business is exploring opportunities to implement more environmentally friendly packaging solutions and to further reduce its carbon footprint. Furthermore, Jagati Nature Care intends to invest in research and development to discover new applications for local botanicals and to develop innovative products that address emerging market needs, solidifying its position as a pioneer in the field of sustainable and holistic well-being. This commitment to innovation and expansion will ensure that Jagati Nature Care continues to thrive and make a positive impact on the local community and the environment for years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094385 94891', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:50:28.000Z'),
(932, 'Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP, located at 28, Namghar Path 1, represents a dedicated endeavor to bring the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the forefront of modern wellness in Assam. Situated in the heart of the community, Pranasara isn''t just another health center; it''s a sanctuary committed to holistic healing, preventative care, and personalized well-being, deeply rooted in the principles of Ayurvedic science. Recognizing the increasing demand for natural and sustainable health solutions, Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP aims to bridge the gap between traditional practices and contemporary lifestyles, offering comprehensive and accessible Ayurvedic solutions to the local community and beyond. It stands as a beacon of natural healing, promoting not just the absence of disease, but the attainment of optimal health – encompassing physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. Its strategic location makes it easily accessible for residents seeking authentic Ayurvedic treatments and consultations. In a region rich in natural resources and cultural heritage, Pranasara is positioned to significantly contribute to the local economy by providing employment opportunities and promoting sustainable health practices, while also preserving and promoting the rich heritage of Ayurveda.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP are its core services, designed to address a wide range of health concerns and promote overall wellness. These include personalized Ayurvedic consultations, Panchakarma detoxification therapies, specialized Ayurvedic treatments for various ailments, yoga and meditation sessions, and the provision of authentic Ayurvedic medicines and herbal products. The cornerstone of the practice lies in the individualized approach to each client. Initial consultations involve a thorough assessment of the individual''s ''prakriti'' (constitution) and ''vikriti'' (imbalance) to determine the root cause of any health issues. This allows for the creation of bespoke treatment plans that address specific needs and promote long-term healing. A significant unique selling point is the commitment to sourcing the highest quality herbs and ingredients, many of which are locally sourced, supporting local farmers and ensuring the efficacy of the treatments. The Panchakarma therapies, meticulously administered by experienced therapists, offer a deep cleanse and rejuvenation, helping to eliminate toxins and restore balance within the body. Understanding the prevalence of certain health issues within the local population, such as digestive disorders, stress-related conditions, and joint pains, Pranasara''s services are specifically tailored to address these needs. For example, the availability of specific therapies for arthritis and back pain caters directly to the common ailments faced by the aging population in the region. Furthermore, the emphasis on preventive care through lifestyle guidance and dietary recommendations helps individuals adopt healthier habits and reduce their risk of developing chronic diseases.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP prides itself on providing an exceptional customer experience, built on empathy, respect, and genuine care. The team is dedicated to creating a welcoming and supportive environment where clients feel comfortable and understood. The focus extends beyond just providing treatments; it encompasses educating clients about Ayurveda and empowering them to take an active role in their own health and well-being. Every interaction, from the initial consultation to the follow-up appointments, is designed to be informative and personalized. The therapists and practitioners are not only highly skilled in Ayurvedic techniques but also possess excellent communication skills, ensuring that clients fully understand the treatments they are receiving and the rationale behind them. What sets Pranasara apart is the deep connection it fosters with the local community. Beyond providing healthcare services, Pranasara actively participates in community events, conducting workshops on Ayurvedic principles and promoting healthy living practices. This outreach extends to local schools and organizations, raising awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and encouraging individuals to adopt a holistic approach to health. By actively engaging with the community, Pranasara aims to build trust and establish itself as a trusted resource for health and wellness information. This commitment to community engagement is further exemplified through collaborations with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable health initiatives. For instance, partnerships with local farmers to source organic produce not only ensures the quality of ingredients used in treatments but also supports the local economy and promotes environmentally friendly practices.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP is to expand its reach and impact, becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healing and education in Assam and beyond. The long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive wellness center that integrates Ayurvedic treatments with other complementary therapies, such as yoga, meditation, and naturopathy, to offer a truly holistic approach to health. Expansion plans include increasing the range of specialized treatments offered, developing educational programs for aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, and establishing a network of satellite clinics in neighboring communities to make Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to a wider population. The business also aims to leverage technology to enhance its services, such as through online consultations, personalized wellness apps, and digital resources for clients. Furthermore, Pranasara envisions establishing collaborations with research institutions to conduct clinical trials on the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments and contribute to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting the benefits of Ayurveda. This commitment to research and innovation will help to solidify Ayurveda''s position as a credible and effective healthcare modality. Ultimately, Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP aspires to be more than just a healthcare provider; it aims to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', '28, Namghar Path 1', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:55:11.000Z'),
(933, 'Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit, strategically located at 68, Dr RP Rd, Guwahati, stands as a dedicated provider of authentic Ayurvedic therapies delivered directly to the comfort of your home. In the bustling business landscape of Assam, where traditional healing practices hold deep cultural significance, we distinguish ourselves by offering personalized, convenient, and highly effective Panchakarma treatments, bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to modern lifestyles. Our focus is on providing accessible and affordable holistic wellness solutions, addressing the growing need for natural and preventative healthcare within the community. <br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around Panchakarma, the cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation. We provide a range of customized Panchakarma therapies, including Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Swedana (herbal steam therapy), Basti (medicated enema), Nasya (nasal administration of medication), and Vamana (therapeutic emesis), all administered by experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners. Each treatment plan is meticulously tailored to an individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) after a thorough consultation. This personalized approach ensures maximum efficacy and safety. Beyond Panchakarma, we also offer Shirodhara (pouring medicated oil on the forehead), Kati Basti (local retention of warm oil for back pain), and other specialized Ayurvedic treatments designed to address specific health concerns such as stress, digestive issues, joint pain, and skin disorders. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to bring the clinic to the client. This eliminates the need for travel and allows patients to receive treatment in a familiar and relaxed environment, promoting deeper healing and relaxation. By making Panchakarma more accessible, we address a key market need – the increasing demand for convenient and effective wellness solutions that seamlessly integrate into busy schedules. <br> <br>

At Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit, customer experience is paramount. From the initial consultation to the completion of the treatment plan, we are committed to providing compassionate, professional, and individualized care. Our practitioners take the time to thoroughly understand each client''s health history, lifestyle, and specific concerns. We prioritize open communication and patient education, empowering individuals to actively participate in their healing journey. We build trust by maintaining the highest standards of hygiene, using authentic Ayurvedic herbs and oils, and adhering to traditional protocols. Our commitment to excellence extends beyond the treatment itself. We provide comprehensive post-treatment guidance on diet, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies to help clients maintain the benefits of Panchakarma and cultivate long-term well-being. We connect with the local community through collaborations with yoga studios, wellness centers, and community events, raising awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and promoting a holistic approach to health. Furthermore, we actively seek feedback from our clients to continually improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. <br> <br>

Looking ahead, Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit envisions becoming the leading provider of accessible and authentic Ayurvedic therapies in Assam and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our service area to reach more communities and offering a wider range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments. We also aim to develop educational programs and workshops to promote Ayurvedic principles and empower individuals to take control of their health. We are exploring partnerships with local businesses and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream wellness programs. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking appointments, accessing educational resources, and tracking treatment progress. We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of quality and authenticity as we scale our business. Our long-term goal is to establish Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit as a trusted resource for holistic health and well-being, contributing to a healthier and more balanced community in Assam and beyond. We are dedicated to preserving and promoting the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, making it accessible to all who seek natural and effective solutions for their health challenges.', '68, Dr RP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:55:17.000Z'),
(934, 'Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic stands as a beacon of traditional healing in Assam, dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic healthcare solutions and promoting holistic wellness. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, our clinic and pharmacy offer a unique blend of traditional practices and modern understanding to address the health and wellness needs of the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located at ·, we are committed to serving the specific healthcare needs of the local population while upholding the highest standards of Ayurvedic practice. Assam, with its rich biodiversity and traditional knowledge of herbal remedies, provides a fertile ground for Ayurvedic practices. We aim to leverage this heritage by sourcing many of our herbal ingredients locally, contributing to the economic empowerment of local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and access to a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic medicines and products. We offer detailed consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners who carefully assess each individual''s <i>prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance) to identify the root cause of their ailments. Based on this assessment, we develop personalized treatment plans that may include herbal remedies, dietary modifications, lifestyle recommendations, and therapeutic procedures.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our pharmacy stocks a comprehensive selection of classical Ayurvedic formulations, proprietary medicines, and herbal supplements sourced from reputable manufacturers committed to quality and authenticity. We emphasize the use of high-quality, ethically sourced ingredients to ensure the efficacy and safety of our products. We also prepare customized herbal formulations based on individual prescriptions, catering to specific patient needs.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles and our holistic approach to healing. Unlike conventional medicine, which often focuses on treating symptoms, Ayurveda seeks to restore balance and harmony within the individual by addressing the underlying causes of disease. Our practitioners take the time to understand each patient''s unique circumstances and develop personalized treatment plans that consider their physical, mental, and emotional well-being. Furthermore, our dedication to sourcing local ingredients when possible strengthens our connection with the local community and ensures the freshness and potency of our herbal remedies.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We understand the specific health challenges faced by the local population in Assam, including issues related to digestion, respiratory health, and lifestyle disorders. Our services are designed to address these concerns through traditional Ayurvedic practices. For example, we offer specialized treatments for digestive ailments such as acidity, indigestion, and constipation, which are common concerns in the region. We also provide herbal remedies and lifestyle recommendations to support respiratory health, particularly during the monsoon season.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic, we prioritize customer experience above all else. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable and empowered to take charge of their health. Our staff is trained to provide compassionate and personalized care, guiding patients through their healing journey with empathy and understanding. We emphasize clear communication, ensuring that patients understand their condition, treatment plan, and the importance of adherence to Ayurvedic principles.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars on Ayurveda and holistic wellness. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda and empower them to make informed choices about their health. We also collaborate with local community organizations to provide healthcare services to underserved populations, promoting health equity and social responsibility.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, quality, and patient-centered care. We plan to expand our services to include specialized treatments for chronic diseases such as diabetes, arthritis, and cardiovascular conditions. We also aim to establish a training center for Ayurvedic practitioners, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to ensure a sustainable and ethical supply chain of herbal ingredients.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to integrate Ayurveda into the mainstream healthcare system in Assam, working in collaboration with conventional medical practitioners to provide comprehensive and holistic healthcare solutions. We believe that Ayurveda has a valuable role to play in promoting health, preventing disease, and improving the quality of life for the people of Assam. By staying true to our values and embracing innovation, we are confident that Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic will continue to serve as a trusted source of healing and wellness for generations to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099546 50853', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:55:24.000Z'),
(935, 'Sri Krishna Ayurveda', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Sri Krishna Ayurveda, nestled at H.no 01 Sanjog Path, behind Government Junior Basic School, Sixmile, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the heart of the city. More than just a business, Sri Krishna Ayurveda is a commitment to holistic wellness, drawing upon the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to serve the modern needs of the local community. In a region rich in cultural heritage and a growing awareness of natural healthcare alternatives, Sri Krishna Ayurveda plays a vital role in providing authentic Ayurvedic solutions for a healthier and more balanced life. The business is deeply rooted in the principles of personalized care and utilizes time-tested Ayurvedic practices to address a wide range of health concerns.

<br> <br>

Sri Krishna Ayurveda’s core offerings revolve around providing authentic Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and a curated selection of Ayurvedic products. At the heart of the business is the Ayurvedic consultation service, where experienced practitioners thoroughly assess each individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). This detailed assessment forms the basis of a tailored treatment plan that may incorporate dietary recommendations, lifestyle adjustments, herbal remedies, and therapeutic treatments. The clinic offers a variety of traditional Ayurvedic therapies, including Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (warm oil stream on the forehead), and other Panchakarma treatments designed to detoxify and rejuvenate the body. In addition to services, Sri Krishna Ayurveda also provides a range of high-quality Ayurvedic products, from herbal supplements and classical formulations to skincare and personal care items. These products are carefully selected to ensure authenticity, purity, and effectiveness, aligning with the business''s commitment to providing the best of Ayurveda. The unique selling point lies in the personalized approach to healing and the emphasis on using traditional methods combined with a deep understanding of the local community''s health needs and lifestyle. Sri Krishna Ayurveda caters to the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions, particularly among those seeking alternatives to conventional medicine or those looking to complement their existing healthcare regimen.

<br> <br>

The customer experience at Sri Krishna Ayurveda is centered around building trust, providing personalized care, and fostering a sense of community. From the moment a client walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect. The practitioners take the time to listen attentively to their concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and educate them about Ayurvedic principles and practices. This emphasis on education empowers clients to take an active role in their own healing journey. Sri Krishna Ayurveda distinguishes itself through its commitment to maintaining a serene and welcoming atmosphere, creating a space where clients feel comfortable and supported. The business also actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness about Ayurveda and its benefits. By participating in local events and partnering with community organizations, Sri Krishna Ayurveda strengthens its connection with the community and reinforces its commitment to serving the well-being of its neighbors. This dedication to community engagement not only builds brand loyalty but also establishes Sri Krishna Ayurveda as a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness within the Sixmile area and beyond.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Sri Krishna Ayurveda envisions expanding its reach and deepening its impact on the health and well-being of the local community. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic therapies offered, incorporating new and innovative approaches while staying true to traditional principles. There is also a strategic intent to introduce specialized programs tailored to specific health concerns, such as stress management, weight management, and women''s health. Further expansion may include establishing a dedicated space for Ayurvedic education and training, offering courses and workshops for both healthcare professionals and the general public. Long-term goals involve becoming a recognized center of excellence for Ayurveda in the region, attracting clients from across Assam and beyond. This vision encompasses not only providing high-quality healthcare services but also contributing to the preservation and promotion of Ayurvedic knowledge for future generations. Sri Krishna Ayurveda aims to be a catalyst for positive change in the healthcare landscape, fostering a greater appreciation for the wisdom of Ayurveda and its potential to transform lives. The business is poised for sustainable growth, driven by its commitment to quality, integrity, and a genuine desire to serve the community.', 'H.no 01 Sanjog Path behind Government Junior Basic School Sixmile', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097065 99256', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:55:30.000Z'),
(936, 'Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander, strategically situated on Dr. Zakir Hussain Road, G.S. Road, opposite Down Town Hospital in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional Ayurvedic healthcare and well-being. More than just a retail outlet, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander is a trusted institution, deeply rooted in the community and dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic products and expert guidance to promote holistic health. In the vibrant and increasingly health-conscious Assam business landscape, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander fills a crucial niche, offering a time-tested alternative and complement to conventional medical practices. The business distinguishes itself through its unwavering commitment to quality, sourcing genuine Ayurvedic herbs and formulations, and its knowledgeable staff who are dedicated to educating and empowering customers to make informed choices about their health.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander’s offerings lies a comprehensive selection of Ayurvedic products sourced from reputable manufacturers known for their adherence to traditional preparation methods and rigorous quality control. This includes a wide array of classical Ayurvedic medicines (<em>shastriya yogas</em>), proprietary formulations designed to address specific health concerns, herbal supplements, and personal care products. Furthermore, the Bhander offers raw Ayurvedic herbs, catering to individuals who prefer to prepare their own remedies or are practitioners of Ayurveda. Uniquely, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander specializes in sourcing locally cultivated herbs whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and potency of ingredients. Understanding that Ayurveda is not just about treating ailments but also about preventative care, the Bhander also stocks Ayurvedic food products and beverages known for their health-promoting properties. The products are carefully categorized and displayed, and detailed information on each product''s uses, ingredients, and potential benefits are readily available to customers. This emphasis on transparency and education is a key differentiator, setting Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander apart from generic retail outlets.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander prides itself on delivering an exceptional customer experience built on trust, personalized attention, and a genuine desire to help customers achieve optimal health. The staff consists of individuals trained in basic Ayurvedic principles, capable of providing knowledgeable guidance and answering customer inquiries about products and their applications. More than just salespeople, they act as health advisors, taking the time to understand each customer''s unique needs and recommending appropriate products or suggesting lifestyle adjustments. The Bhander cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of community among its customers. Regular workshops and seminars on various aspects of Ayurvedic health and wellness are organized, featuring guest speakers who are experts in the field. This interactive approach strengthens the Bhander''s connection with the local community, transforming it into a hub for Ayurvedic knowledge and support. Further emphasizing its commitment to the community, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander actively participates in local health initiatives and collaborates with Ayurvedic practitioners in the region to promote awareness and access to Ayurvedic healthcare.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking towards the future, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander envisions itself as a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region. The business aims to expand its product line to include a wider range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments and therapies. This includes exploring opportunities to offer consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners directly within the Bhander, providing customers with access to personalized treatment plans. Recognizing the growing importance of online accessibility, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander plans to establish an online presence, allowing customers to easily browse and purchase products from the comfort of their homes. This expansion will also enable the Bhander to reach a wider audience beyond its immediate geographical location. Long-term goals include establishing partnerships with Ayurvedic research institutions to contribute to the advancement of Ayurvedic knowledge and the development of innovative Ayurvedic products. Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander is committed to upholding the highest standards of quality and authenticity, ensuring that future growth is aligned with its core values of promoting holistic health and well-being through the principles of Ayurveda. The business strives to be more than just a retail establishment; it aspires to be a trusted partner in its customers'' journey towards a healthier and more balanced life, contributing to the rich tapestry of the Assamese community.</p>', 'Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, G.S.Road, opposite down town hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097064 82270', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T02:55:36.000Z'),
(937, 'UPAVEDA- Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>UPAVEDA- Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic, located on the 1st Floor of Ambika Complex, is a dedicated center focused on providing holistic pain management and promoting overall wellness through authentic Ayurvedic practices. UPAVEDA stands out in the Assam healthcare landscape by integrating traditional Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic techniques to offer personalized treatment plans tailored to the specific needs of each patient. Our commitment extends beyond mere symptom relief; we strive to address the root cause of ailments, empowering individuals to achieve lasting health and vitality. Recognizing the rich Ayurvedic heritage in India, and specifically its potential within Assam, UPAVEDA aims to be a leading provider of natural and effective healthcare solutions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At UPAVEDA, our core services revolve around addressing various types of pain, ranging from chronic back pain and arthritis to sports injuries and neuropathic pain. We offer a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic treatments including Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy for mental relaxation), Kati Basti (localized oil retention therapy for lower back pain), and Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapy). In addition to these traditional therapies, we also provide personalized dietary and lifestyle consultations, as these are integral to achieving long-term health and well-being within the Ayurvedic framework. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of experienced Ayurvedic practitioners, high-quality herbal formulations sourced responsibly, and a patient-centric approach that emphasizes individualized care. We understand the specific health challenges faced by the local community, which may include lifestyle-related disorders and musculoskeletal issues. Our services are specifically designed to address these concerns, offering a natural and sustainable alternative to conventional pain management methods. The clinic also offers a selection of Ayurvedic herbal products, formulated in-house or sourced from trusted suppliers, designed to complement the treatments and support overall wellness.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at UPAVEDA. From the moment a patient walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. Our approach is built on active listening, thorough assessment, and clear communication. We take the time to understand each patient''s unique medical history, lifestyle, and health goals, ensuring that the treatment plan is tailored to their individual needs. We believe in empowering our patients through education, providing them with the knowledge and tools they need to take control of their health. What sets UPAVEDA apart is our unwavering commitment to providing personalized care and building strong relationships with our patients. We strive to create a supportive and nurturing environment where patients feel comfortable and confident in their healing journey. We are actively involved in the local community through health awareness programs and workshops, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and a healthy lifestyle. Building trust and fostering a sense of connection with the community is essential to our mission.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>UPAVEDA envisions a future where Ayurveda is recognized as a primary healthcare choice for pain management and overall well-being in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our services to offer specialized treatments for specific conditions, such as diabetes, hypertension, and respiratory ailments, all within the Ayurvedic paradigm. We also intend to invest in research and development to further enhance the efficacy of our treatments and develop new and innovative Ayurvedic solutions. A key component of our growth strategy involves establishing strategic partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare. We aspire to become a center of excellence for Ayurvedic education and training, empowering future generations of practitioners to carry on the legacy of this ancient healing tradition. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the health and well-being of the community while upholding the highest standards of Ayurvedic practice. We believe that through dedication, innovation, and a commitment to patient care, UPAVEDA can play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare in Assam.</p>', '1st Floor, Ambika Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '087248 72789', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T03:00:08.000Z'),
(938, 'Heritage Ayurveda- Dr. Mofida Khatun', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Heritage Ayurveda - Dr. Mofida Khatun, nestled in the serene environs of House no. 24, Neel Kamal Path, represents a harmonious blend of ancient Ayurvedic wisdom and modern healthcare practices. More than just a clinic, it is a sanctuary for holistic wellness, deeply rooted in the Assamese tradition and dedicated to providing personalized care to the community. Located in a region rich with indigenous medicinal knowledge, Heritage Ayurveda stands out by offering authentic Ayurvedic treatments tailored to the unique needs and constitutions of its clients, while actively promoting awareness about preventive healthcare.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Dr. Mofida Khatun brings a wealth of experience and expertise to Heritage Ayurveda. The core of the business lies in offering a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services designed to address a variety of health concerns. These include detailed consultations, personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, therapeutic massages (Abhyanga), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapy), and specialized treatments for specific ailments. Each service is carefully administered, using high-quality, ethically sourced herbal formulations. A key differentiator is the focus on Prakriti analysis – understanding an individual''s unique constitution – to provide treatments that are not only effective but also perfectly aligned with their inherent nature. This personalized approach, coupled with the use of locally sourced herbs where possible, ensures that the treatments are both potent and relevant to the local environment and its inhabitants. The clinic addresses common health issues prevalent in Assam, such as digestive disorders, respiratory problems, joint pain, and stress-related ailments, offering natural and sustainable solutions that go beyond simply alleviating symptoms.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Heritage Ayurveda prioritizes creating a warm and welcoming environment for every individual who walks through its doors. Dr. Khatun believes in building strong, trusting relationships with her clients, taking the time to listen to their concerns and understand their health goals. The clinic staff is trained to provide compassionate and attentive service, ensuring that each visit is a positive and enriching experience. Beyond individual treatments, Heritage Ayurveda actively engages with the local community through health awareness workshops, educational seminars, and participation in local health initiatives. This commitment to community outreach not only promotes Ayurvedic principles but also fosters a sense of connection and shared well-being. By emphasizing preventative care and empowering individuals to take control of their health, Heritage Ayurveda aims to be a trusted resource and a positive force within the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Heritage Ayurveda envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and personalized care. Future plans include expanding the range of services to include specialized Ayurvedic programs for specific conditions, such as diabetes management and women''s health. There is also a long-term goal to establish a small-scale herbal garden, allowing the clinic to cultivate and utilize fresh, locally grown herbs in its formulations, further enhancing the potency and sustainability of its treatments. Furthermore, the business aspires to partner with local organizations and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices, contributing to a more holistic and comprehensive approach to well-being. Heritage Ayurveda’s ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live healthier, happier lives by embracing the wisdom of Ayurveda and fostering a deep connection with their own innate healing potential.</p>', 'House no. 24, Neel Kamal Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084719 35978', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T03:00:13.000Z'),
(939, 'Ayurvedic center', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Ayurvedic Center: Nurturing Wellness on Hengrabari Road</p>

<p>Located on the bustling Hengrabari Road, Ayurvedic Center stands as a sanctuary of traditional healing and holistic wellness, bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the heart of Guwahati, Assam. In a region rich with natural resources and a deep appreciation for traditional practices, Ayurvedic Center offers a unique approach to health, focusing on preventive care, personalized treatments, and the restoration of balance within the individual. Recognizing the growing demand for authentic and natural healthcare solutions, Ayurvedic Center distinguishes itself by providing time-tested therapies and herbal remedies, contributing to the overall well-being of the local community and beyond. The center operates with a strong commitment to ethical practices and the preservation of the integrity of Ayurvedic principles, setting it apart within the evolving landscape of wellness businesses in Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Healing</p>

<p>Ayurvedic Center offers a comprehensive range of services designed to address various health concerns and promote overall wellness. Our primary services include personalized Ayurvedic consultations, Panchakarma detoxification therapies, Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy for stress relief), and specialized treatments for chronic conditions such as arthritis, diabetes, and skin disorders. Central to our approach is a focus on individualized care. Each client undergoes a thorough assessment, including pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha) and a detailed review of their lifestyle and medical history, to determine their unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti). This allows our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners to tailor treatment plans specifically to each individual''s needs, ensuring optimal results. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with modern diagnostic techniques, providing a holistic and effective approach to health management. We also offer a range of authentic Ayurvedic herbal remedies, sourced from reputable suppliers committed to sustainable harvesting and quality control. These remedies, prescribed by our practitioners, complement our therapies and support the body''s natural healing processes. By addressing the root causes of illness and promoting balance within the body, mind, and spirit, Ayurvedic Center meets the growing demand for natural and personalized healthcare solutions in the local market, offering an alternative to conventional medicine.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Well-being</p>

<p>At Ayurvedic Center, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment for our clients. Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine desire to help individuals achieve their health goals. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with personalized attention and care. Our staff is trained to listen attentively to their concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and provide clear explanations of our treatments and therapies. We believe in empowering our clients with knowledge, encouraging them to actively participate in their healing journey. We go beyond providing treatments; we offer guidance on lifestyle modifications, dietary recommendations, and stress management techniques to support long-term well-being. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the treatment room. We regularly follow up with clients to monitor their progress, address any concerns, and provide ongoing support. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness of Ayurveda and its benefits. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients and becoming a trusted resource for health and wellness in the Hengrabari Road area and beyond. Our emphasis on personalized care, authentic Ayurvedic practices, and community engagement sets us apart and allows us to connect deeply with the local population, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Deepening Impact</p>

<p>Ayurvedic Center envisions a future where traditional Ayurvedic medicine is recognized and integrated as a vital component of mainstream healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a wider audience, establishing ourselves as a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research, and contributing to the preservation and promotion of Ayurvedic knowledge. We plan to introduce specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as women''s health, geriatric care, and pediatric wellness. We also aim to develop partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to offer integrated treatment options. We are exploring opportunities to expand our product line, introducing new herbal formulations and wellness products that align with our commitment to natural and sustainable practices. Furthermore, we aspire to establish a training institute where aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners can receive comprehensive education and practical experience. By investing in research and development, we aim to contribute to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting the efficacy of Ayurvedic therapies. We believe that by combining traditional wisdom with modern advancements, Ayurvedic Center can play a significant role in improving the health and well-being of the community and promoting a more holistic and sustainable approach to healthcare in Assam. Our dedication to quality, innovation, and community engagement will be instrumental in realizing our vision and solidifying our position as a trusted and respected center for Ayurvedic healing on Hengrabari Road and beyond.</p>', 'Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.294Z', '2025-11-30T03:00:20.000Z'),
