At the heart of Unora lies a comprehensive suite of wellness services designed to nourish the body, mind, and spirit. The core offerings include a diverse range of Ayurvedic therapies, traditional massages, revitalizing facials, and specialized body treatments. Each treatment is meticulously crafted and personalized to meet the unique needs of every individual, ensuring optimal results and a truly transformative experience. Unora''s unique selling point resides in its commitment to authenticity and the seamless integration of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with modern techniques. The spa utilizes premium, ethically sourced ingredients, including locally sourced herbs and oils whenever possible, enhancing the connection to the surrounding environment. Addressing a clear need in the local market, Unora provides an accessible yet luxurious wellness destination, catering to both residents seeking respite from urban life and travelers desiring a rejuvenating experience during their stay. The focus is on preventative wellness and promoting a balanced lifestyle, differentiating Unora from conventional spas.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Unora. From the moment guests step through the doors, they are enveloped in an atmosphere of serene elegance and personalized attention. The highly trained and experienced therapists at Unora are dedicated to providing exceptional service and ensuring the comfort and well-being of each guest. Beyond the technical expertise, the team embodies genuine warmth and empathy, creating a strong connection with clients and fostering a sense of trust and care. Unora actively engages with the local community through wellness workshops, collaborative events, and special promotions tailored to local festivals and celebrations. This proactive approach fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the spa''s connection to the cultural fabric of Guwahati. By prioritizing personalized service and community engagement, Unora aims to cultivate long-lasting relationships with its clients, becoming a trusted partner in their wellness journey. The focus is on creating memorable experiences that resonate with the local culture and values.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Unora by Tattva Wellness Spa envisions becoming the leading wellness destination in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to excellence, authenticity, and community engagement. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized wellness programs, incorporating yoga, meditation, and nutritional guidance, to provide a more holistic and integrated approach to well-being. There are also aspirations to develop partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote wellness initiatives and contribute to the overall health and vitality of the community. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to incorporate more locally sourced ingredients into its treatments and to further enhance the spa''s sustainable practices. Unora aims to continuously innovate and adapt to the evolving needs of its clientele, while remaining true to its core values of authenticity, personalized care, and holistic well-being. The long-term vision encompasses establishing Unora as a beacon of wellness, contributing to the overall health and happiness of the Guwahati community and solidifying its position as a key player in the regional wellness industry.', 'Down Town, Novotel Hotel, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099991 20413', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:05:21.000Z'),
(945, 'Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy, nestled at 68, SRCB Rd in the heart of Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional healing, seamlessly blending ancient Ayurvedic principles with modern pharmaceutical practices. More than just a dispensary, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy is a dedicated center for holistic well-being, committed to providing the community with authentic Ayurvedic medicines, personalized consultations, and a comprehensive range of natural health products. In a region steeped in cultural heritage and a growing awareness of alternative medicine, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy plays a vital role in preserving and promoting the rich tradition of Ayurveda, while addressing the contemporary healthcare needs of the local population. The pharmacy’s commitment to quality, authenticity, and personalized care sets it apart, making it a trusted and valued resource in the Assam business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy''s offerings are a meticulously curated selection of Ayurvedic medicines, sourced from reputable manufacturers known for their adherence to stringent quality control measures. This includes classical formulations like Chyawanprash, Dashmularishta, and various herbal decoctions, along with proprietary Ayurvedic products designed to address a wide array of health concerns, from digestive issues and respiratory ailments to skin conditions and joint pain. A key differentiator lies in the pharmacy''s emphasis on providing authentic Ayurvedic medicines, free from adulteration and formulated according to traditional recipes. Beyond medicines, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy offers a comprehensive range of natural health products, including herbal teas, dietary supplements, personal care items, and organic food products. The pharmacy also specializes in offering personalized Ayurvedic consultations with experienced practitioners, who assess individual health conditions based on Ayurvedic principles and recommend tailored treatment plans encompassing dietary modifications, lifestyle adjustments, and herbal remedies. This holistic approach ensures that customers receive not just symptom relief, but also guidance towards achieving long-term health and well-being. By combining traditional wisdom with a modern understanding of healthcare needs, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy effectively bridges the gap between ancient practices and contemporary lifestyles, meeting the growing demand for natural and holistic health solutions in the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy distinguishes itself through an unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction and a personalized approach to healthcare. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide informed advice and compassionate support to customers, ensuring a positive and empowering experience. Beyond simply dispensing medications, the pharmacy fosters a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring natural treatment options. Emphasis is placed on building long-term relationships with customers, understanding their individual needs, and providing ongoing support and guidance. The pharmacy actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops on Ayurvedic principles, and participation in local events. By fostering a sense of trust and community, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy has established itself as more than just a business; it is a trusted resource and a vital part of the local healthcare ecosystem. This strong community connection is further reinforced through personalized service, remembering regular customers, and proactively reaching out to address their specific needs, fostering a sense of belonging and loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy envisions itself as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, expanding its reach and deepening its impact on the community''s well-being. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic medicines and natural health products, introducing new services such as Panchakarma therapies (Ayurvedic detoxification treatments), and establishing a dedicated wellness center offering yoga, meditation, and other holistic practices. The pharmacy also aims to leverage technology to enhance customer experience, through online consultations, telemedicine services, and an e-commerce platform that allows customers to access products and information conveniently. A key focus will be on strengthening collaborations with local Ayurvedic practitioners and healthcare providers, fostering a collaborative approach to healthcare and ensuring that customers receive the best possible care. Furthermore, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy is committed to promoting sustainable and ethical practices, by sourcing products from environmentally responsible suppliers and supporting local farmers and artisans. By staying true to its core values of authenticity, quality, and personalized care, while embracing innovation and expanding its reach, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy is poised for continued growth and success, solidifying its position as a trusted and valued resource in the Assam business landscape and beyond. The long-term goal is to establish Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy as a brand synonymous with holistic health and well-being, inspiring individuals to embrace the wisdom of Ayurveda and live healthier, more fulfilling lives.</p>', '68, SRCB Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094351 96799', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:05:27.000Z'),
(946, 'ASSAM UNANI CLINIC ( Ayurvedic,UNANI, Sexologist, Piles and Pain Specialist)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>ASSAM UNANI CLINIC (Ayurvedic, UNANI, Sexologist, Piles and Pain Specialist) is a comprehensive healthcare provider located in the heart of Assam, offering a unique blend of traditional and specialized medical services. Recognizing the growing need for holistic and accessible healthcare in the region, our clinic is dedicated to providing personalized and effective treatments rooted in the ancient sciences of Ayurveda and Unani medicine, complemented by specialized expertise in sexual health, piles management, and pain relief. We strive to be a beacon of health and wellness, addressing the diverse healthcare needs of our community with compassion and expertise.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our clinic distinguishes itself by integrating traditional Ayurvedic and Unani practices with modern diagnostic approaches. This allows us to provide a truly holistic treatment experience, addressing not just the symptoms but also the underlying causes of illness. Unlike conventional healthcare providers that may focus solely on allopathic medicine, we offer a wider spectrum of treatment options, empowering patients to make informed choices about their health. Our commitment to traditional medicine, particularly Unani, a relatively less common practice in Assam, makes us a unique healthcare destination in the region, catering to those seeking alternative and time-tested remedies.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core services offered at ASSAM UNANI CLINIC encompass a wide range of healthcare needs. Firstly, our Ayurvedic consultations provide personalized treatment plans based on individual constitution and imbalances, utilizing herbal remedies, dietary adjustments, and lifestyle modifications. Secondly, our Unani medicine specialists offer diagnosis and treatment through the Unani system, which emphasizes the balance of the body''s natural humors and the power of natural healing. Thirdly, our specialized sexologists provide confidential and sensitive care for various sexual health concerns, addressing both physical and psychological aspects. Fourthly, our expertise in piles management involves comprehensive diagnosis and treatment, including non-surgical and surgical options depending on the severity. Finally, our pain management services utilize a combination of Ayurvedic and Unani therapies, along with modern techniques, to provide effective relief from chronic pain conditions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key unique selling point is our integrated approach, combining the strengths of different medical systems. We don''t see Ayurveda, Unani, and modern medicine as mutually exclusive but rather as complementary tools in the pursuit of optimal health. Our ability to offer a wide array of treatment options under one roof, from herbal remedies to specialized consultations, is a significant advantage for our patients. Furthermore, we prioritize the use of high-quality, ethically sourced ingredients in our herbal formulations, ensuring safety and efficacy. Our services directly address the local market needs by providing culturally sensitive and affordable healthcare options, particularly for those who prefer traditional medicine or have found limited relief from conventional treatments. We acknowledge the prevalence of certain health issues in Assam, such as lifestyle-related diseases and pain conditions, and tailor our services to effectively address these concerns.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At ASSAM UNANI CLINIC, we are committed to providing a patient-centric experience that is built on trust, respect, and empathy. Our approach to customer service is rooted in active listening and personalized attention. We understand that each patient is unique, and we take the time to thoroughly assess their individual needs and concerns. Our team of healthcare professionals is not only highly skilled but also deeply compassionate, creating a safe and supportive environment for patients to discuss their health challenges. We strive to make the clinic environment welcoming and comfortable, ensuring that patients feel at ease throughout their treatment journey. We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and free medical camps, promoting preventive healthcare and empowering individuals to take control of their well-being. We believe that building strong relationships with our patients and the community is essential to our success.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, ASSAM UNANI CLINIC envisions becoming a leading integrated healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate more advanced diagnostic technologies and treatment modalities while maintaining our core focus on traditional medicine. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with other healthcare providers and organizations to enhance our referral network and expand our reach. We also aim to invest in research and development to further validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic and Unani treatments and contribute to the growing body of knowledge in these fields. Long-term, we aspire to establish a state-of-the-art wellness center that offers a comprehensive range of holistic therapies, including yoga, meditation, and nutritional counseling, creating a true haven for health and well-being. Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the power of integrated healthcare.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080119 85992', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:05:34.000Z'),
(947, 'Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati stands as a beacon of holistic healthcare in the heart of Assam, bringing a unique and integrated approach to wellness that sets it apart within the regional healthcare landscape. Committed to providing comprehensive and compassionate care, the hospital combines the best of modern medicine with the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and other traditional healing systems, creating a synergy that addresses the root causes of illness and promotes lasting well-being. While the exact founding year is not publicly available, the hospital’s presence has already begun to impact the Guwahati community and beyond, offering an alternative and complementary path to health and healing.</p>
<br> <br>
