*   <b>Expanding Outreach Programs:</b> Reaching out to more communities through health camps and educational initiatives.
<br>
*   <b>Telemedicine and Remote Consultations:</b> Offering remote consultations and telemedicine services to reach patients in remote areas.
<br>
*   <b>Strategic Partnerships:</b> Collaborating with other healthcare providers and organizations to expand its reach and impact.
<br>
By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the community, Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati is committed to providing accessible, affordable, and effective holistic healthcare solutions that empower individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. The hospital strives to become a symbol of hope and healing, contributing to the overall well-being of the people of Assam and beyond. The long-term goal is not merely to treat illness, but to cultivate a culture of wellness and prevention, fostering a community where individuals thrive in body, mind, and spirit.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '087920 87920', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:10:10.000Z'),
(948, 'Namaste Ayurveda & Panchakarma therapeutics centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Namaste Ayurveda & Panchakarma Therapeutics Centre is a dedicated wellness sanctuary nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically located at Sreenagar Path, Kali Mandir Path, opposite Sreenagar. We offer authentic Ayurvedic treatments and Panchakarma therapies designed to restore balance, promote healing, and enhance overall well-being. In a region steeped in traditional healing practices, yet increasingly influenced by modern lifestyles, Namaste Ayurveda bridges the gap, offering accessible and effective solutions rooted in ancient wisdom.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around the principles of Ayurveda, the ancient Indian science of life. We provide personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who carefully assess each individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). Based on this assessment, a customized treatment plan is developed, encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and therapeutic procedures. Panchakarma, the cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation, is a central offering. This involves a series of cleansing therapies designed to eliminate toxins from the body, restore cellular function, and enhance immunity. We offer a range of Panchakarma procedures, including Vamana (emesis), Virechana (purgation), Basti (enema), Nasya (nasal administration), and Raktamokshana (bloodletting), performed under strict medical supervision and adhering to traditional Ayurvedic protocols. Beyond Panchakarma, we provide specialized Ayurvedic treatments for a variety of health concerns, such as arthritis, diabetes, skin disorders, respiratory ailments, and stress-related conditions. These treatments often involve Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (warm oil stream on the forehead), Pinda Sweda (herbal bolus massage), and other targeted therapies. We also offer a selection of high-quality Ayurvedic herbal formulations, sourced from reputable suppliers, to complement our therapies and support long-term wellness. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments in a serene and comfortable environment, combined with a deep understanding of the specific health needs of the local population.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Namaste Ayurveda, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where clients feel comfortable and cared for. Our approach is centered on building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual health goals and concerns. From the moment they step through our doors, clients are greeted with warmth and respect. Our staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every interaction is positive and informative. We prioritize clear communication, explaining treatment procedures in detail and addressing any questions or concerns that clients may have. We also place a strong emphasis on follow-up care, providing ongoing support and guidance to help clients maintain their health and well-being long after their treatment is completed. We are actively involved in the local community, participating in health awareness campaigns and workshops to promote the benefits of Ayurveda. We also collaborate with local businesses and organizations to offer wellness programs and initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with our community, we aim to become a trusted resource for Ayurvedic healthcare and holistic wellness in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Namaste Ayurveda & Panchakarma Therapeutics Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond. We plan to expand our services to include specialized Ayurvedic programs for women''s health, children''s health, and geriatric care. We also aim to establish a training center to educate and empower individuals interested in learning the principles and practices of Ayurveda. We intend to incorporate technology to enhance our service delivery, such as online consultations, remote monitoring, and personalized health tracking. This will allow us to reach a wider audience and provide more convenient and accessible care. Furthermore, we aspire to collaborate with research institutions to conduct clinical studies on the effectiveness of Ayurvedic treatments for various health conditions. This will contribute to the growing body of evidence supporting the benefits of Ayurveda and help to integrate it more fully into mainstream healthcare. Our long-term goal is to create a holistic wellness ecosystem that encompasses not only treatment but also education, research, and community outreach, making Ayurveda an integral part of people''s lives.</p>', 'Sreenagar Path, Kali Mandir Path, opp. Sreenagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060038 29300', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:10:16.000Z'),
(949, 'Miracle Nest: Achieving Wellness Inside and Out', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><strong>Miracle Nest: Achieving Wellness Inside and Out</strong></p>
<p>Located at Ground Floor, Anand Abashsthali, Miracle Nest, 38, Lakhimi Nagar Rd, Miracle Nest is a holistic wellness center dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and emotional well-being within the vibrant community of Assam. We offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to address the diverse needs of individuals seeking a balanced and fulfilling lifestyle. Recognizing the growing demand for accessible and personalized wellness solutions in the region, Miracle Nest aims to be a sanctuary where individuals can embark on their unique journey towards inner and outer harmony. We distinguish ourselves by integrating traditional Assamese practices with modern wellness techniques, creating a unique and culturally relevant experience for our clients.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of wellness modalities, catering to diverse needs and preferences. At the heart of our offerings is our specialized yoga and meditation program. This program incorporates traditional Hatha yoga, mindfulness practices, and pranayama techniques, adapted to the specific climate and lifestyle of Assam. We also offer Ayurvedic consultations, providing personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations based on individual doshas (body types). These consultations are augmented by access to traditionally prepared Ayurvedic herbs and remedies, sourced locally where possible, ensuring both potency and authenticity. Furthermore, we provide massage therapy services, including Abhyanga (Ayurvedic massage) and therapeutic deep tissue massage, administered by certified and experienced therapists. These services are complemented by nutritional counseling, focused on promoting healthy eating habits and addressing specific dietary concerns prevalent in the local community. What truly sets Miracle Nest apart is the integration of these distinct services into tailored wellness packages, providing a cohesive and personalized approach to achieving optimal well-being. These packages are designed to address specific concerns such as stress management, weight management, and improved sleep quality, ensuring tangible and sustainable results for our clients.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Miracle Nest, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment where every individual feels valued and understood. Our approach is characterized by attentive listening, personalized care, and a genuine commitment to helping our clients achieve their wellness goals. From the moment a client enters our center, they are greeted by friendly and knowledgeable staff who are dedicated to providing exceptional service. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Our practitioners are not only highly skilled in their respective fields but also possess a deep understanding of the local culture and traditions, allowing them to provide culturally sensitive and relevant care. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and community events, promoting awareness of wellness and healthy living practices. Our commitment to community engagement extends to supporting local artisans and suppliers, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. We strive to create a space where wellness is not just a service but a shared experience, fostering a sense of belonging and connection within the community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Miracle Nest envisions becoming the leading wellness destination in Assam, renowned for its holistic approach, exceptional customer service, and commitment to community well-being. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate other complementary therapies, such as acupuncture and traditional Assamese healing practices. We also aim to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers and educational institutions to promote integrated wellness programs. A key focus will be on developing innovative wellness retreats and workshops that cater to specific needs and interests, such as stress management retreats for corporate professionals and wellness workshops for students. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of wellness knowledge and practice. In the long term, we aspire to establish a research and development center dedicated to studying the efficacy of traditional Assamese wellness practices and integrating them with modern scientific approaches. Ultimately, our goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health and well-being, fostering a healthier and more vibrant community for generations to come. We see the business growing beyond just a physical location to encompass online resources and virtual consultations, expanding our reach and impact across the region and beyond.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Anand Abashsthali, Miracle Nest, 38, Lakhimi Nagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '069004 92656', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:10:22.000Z'),
(950, 'jeevak ayurveda and holistic centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre: Nurturing Wellness in the Heart of Assam</b></p>

<p>Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre stands as a beacon of traditional healing and modern wellness, nestled on the second floor of Alankar Premises, conveniently located behind HDFC Bank. Situated in the heart of Assam, Jeevak is more than just a wellness centre; it''s a sanctuary dedicated to promoting holistic well-being through the time-tested principles of Ayurveda and complementary therapies. Understanding the unique cultural landscape of Assam, Jeevak integrates traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques, offering a personalized and comprehensive approach to health. In a region rich in natural resources and a deep-rooted understanding of herbal medicine, Jeevak Ayurveda aims to revitalize and preserve this heritage by providing authentic and accessible Ayurvedic solutions to the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre are its diverse and specialized services, all designed to cater to a wide spectrum of health needs. Our primary offerings include:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Personalized health assessments conducted by experienced Ayurvedic doctors to determine individual <i>Prakriti</i> (body constitution) and identify imbalances. These consultations form the foundation for tailored treatment plans.</li>
<li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> Offering the full range of traditional Panchakarma detoxification treatments, including Vamana (emesis), Virechana (purgation), Basti (enema), Nasya (nasal administration), and Raktamokshana (bloodletting), performed under strict medical supervision to eliminate accumulated toxins and restore balance.</li>
<li><b>Herbal Remedies:</b> Providing a wide array of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, sourced ethically and prepared according to traditional recipes, addressing various health concerns from digestive issues to skin ailments. Custom formulations are also available based on individual needs.</li>
<li><b>Yoga and Meditation:</b> Guided yoga sessions and meditation classes tailored to different skill levels, promoting physical flexibility, mental clarity, and emotional well-being. These classes are designed to complement Ayurvedic treatments and enhance overall health.</li>
<li><b>Nutritional Counseling:</b> Personalized dietary recommendations based on Ayurvedic principles, emphasizing the importance of food as medicine and promoting a balanced and healthy lifestyle.</li>
<li><b>Specialized Therapies:</b> A range of specialized therapies like Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Kati Basti (lower back oil retention), and others addressing specific health concerns and promoting relaxation and rejuvenation.</li>
</ul>

<p>Jeevak Ayurveda distinguishes itself through its commitment to authenticity, personalized care, and a holistic approach. Our unique selling points include:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Experienced Practitioners:</b> A team of highly qualified and experienced Ayurvedic doctors, therapists, and yoga instructors dedicated to providing the highest quality of care.</li>
<li><b>Authentic Ayurvedic Practices:</b> Adherence to traditional Ayurvedic principles and practices, ensuring the efficacy and safety of all treatments.</li>
<li><b>Customized Treatment Plans:</b> Tailoring treatment plans to individual needs and health goals, considering their unique constitution, lifestyle, and medical history.</li>
<li><b>High-Quality Herbal Products:</b> Sourcing only the finest quality herbal ingredients, ensuring the potency and effectiveness of our remedies.</li>
<li><b>Holistic Approach:</b> Addressing the root cause of health issues by considering the physical, mental, and emotional aspects of well-being.</li>
</ul>

<p>These services directly address the local market needs by providing a natural and holistic alternative to conventional medicine. With a growing awareness of the benefits of Ayurveda and a desire for preventative healthcare, Jeevak Ayurveda offers a valuable resource for the community to achieve optimal health and well-being.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre. We believe in creating a welcoming and nurturing environment where individuals feel supported and empowered on their wellness journey. From the moment a client enters our centre, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. Our staff is trained to provide exceptional customer service, ensuring that every individual feels heard, understood, and respected.</p>

<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to building genuine relationships with our clients. We take the time to understand their unique needs and concerns, providing personalized attention and support throughout their treatment. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness about Ayurveda and holistic living. We collaborate with local organizations and healthcare providers to create a network of support for our clients. Furthermore, we actively participate in community events and initiatives, contributing to the well-being of the local population. By fostering strong connections with the community, Jeevak Ayurveda aims to become a trusted resource for health and wellness in Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic and holistic healthcare in Assam and beyond. Our potential for growth is significant, driven by the increasing demand for natural and preventative healthcare solutions. Our future plans include:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Expanding our Service Offerings:</b> Introducing new therapies and treatments to cater to a wider range of health needs, including specialized programs for women''s health, children''s health, and senior care.</li>
<li><b>Establishing a Training Centre:</b> Creating a training centre to educate and train aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, ensuring the preservation and propagation of this ancient healing art.</li>
<li><b>Developing a Line of Ayurvedic Products:</b> Formulating and manufacturing our own line of high-quality Ayurvedic products, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible.</li>
<li><b>Expanding our Reach:</b> Opening additional centres in other locations, making our services more accessible to a wider population.</li>
<li><b>Integrating Technology:</b> Incorporating technology to enhance our services, such as online consultations, digital health records, and personalized wellness apps.</li>
</ul>

<p>Our long-term goals include establishing Jeevak Ayurveda as a centre of excellence for Ayurvedic research and education, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and the promotion of holistic health. We are committed to staying true to our values of authenticity, compassion, and integrity, ensuring that we continue to provide the highest quality of care to our clients and contribute to the well-being of the community for generations to come.</p>', 'second floor, Alankar Premises, behind hdfc bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:10:31.000Z'),
(951, 'Assam Ayurvedic Products', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Assam Ayurvedic Products, nestled in the heart of Assam at 5QMQ+G6W, Maniram Dewan Rd, represents a modern revival of ancient healing traditions. More than just a purveyor of Ayurvedic remedies, the business stands as a testament to the rich botanical heritage of the region, offering products sourced directly from the verdant landscapes of Assam. This commitment to local sourcing and traditional knowledge sets Assam Ayurvedic Products apart, solidifying its position as a key player in promoting wellness within the local community and beyond.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The business operates on the core principle of bringing authentic Ayurvedic solutions to contemporary health concerns. Assam Ayurvedic Products specializes in a range of health and wellness products, including herbal supplements, medicinal oils, personal care items, and traditional Assamese remedies passed down through generations. The unique selling point lies not only in the efficacy of the formulations, drawing on centuries of Ayurvedic wisdom, but also in the uncompromised quality of the ingredients. Herbs are meticulously sourced from local farms, often employing sustainable harvesting practices to ensure minimal environmental impact and to support the livelihoods of local cultivators. Each product is carefully crafted, blending traditional Ayurvedic principles with modern manufacturing standards to guarantee purity, potency, and safety. This commitment to quality and authenticity directly addresses the local market''s growing demand for natural and holistic health solutions, catering to consumers seeking alternatives to conventional medicine and embracing a preventive approach to wellness.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Assam Ayurvedic Products. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment for every customer, fostering a deep understanding of Ayurveda and its benefits. Knowledgeable staff are readily available to provide personalized consultations, guiding customers through the product range and offering tailored recommendations based on individual health needs and concerns. This personalized approach extends beyond the point of sale. Assam Ayurvedic Products actively engages with the local community through workshops and seminars, educating individuals on the principles of Ayurveda, the benefits of local herbs, and the importance of a balanced lifestyle. Furthermore, the business actively solicits feedback from customers to continuously improve its products and services, demonstrating a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction and building lasting relationships within the community. This emphasis on education and personalized care cultivates trust and loyalty, transforming customers into advocates for the brand and Ayurveda itself.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Assam Ayurvedic Products envisions significant growth and expansion, while remaining firmly rooted in its core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. The business aims to expand its product line, introducing innovative formulations that address contemporary health challenges, while simultaneously preserving the integrity of traditional Ayurvedic practices. This includes exploring opportunities for research and development, collaborating with Ayurvedic practitioners and scientists to validate the efficacy of traditional remedies and develop new and improved products. Furthermore, Assam Ayurvedic Products plans to expand its reach beyond the local market, leveraging e-commerce platforms and strategic partnerships to make its products accessible to a wider audience, both nationally and internationally. The long-term goal is to establish Assam Ayurvedic Products as a leading brand in the Ayurvedic sector, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and the preservation of traditional knowledge, thereby contributing to the economic prosperity of the local community and promoting the holistic well-being of individuals worldwide.</p>', '5QMQ+G6W, Maniram Dewan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '088768 22848', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:10:35.000Z'),
(952, 'ASSAM AYURVEDIC BHANDAR', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>ASSAM AYURVEDIC BHANDAR: Bridging Tradition and Wellness in the Heart of Assam</b></p>

<p>Nestled on Assam Trunk Road, opposite the landmark Vishwaratna Hotel, Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar stands as a trusted and established purveyor of authentic Ayurvedic products and knowledge. More than just a retail outlet, it''s a cultural touchstone, deeply rooted in the region’s rich heritage of traditional medicine. Situated in a prime location, Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar plays a vital role in preserving and promoting Ayurvedic practices, offering the local community and beyond a gateway to holistic well-being. We distinguish ourselves by carefully sourcing our products, emphasizing quality and authenticity, and fostering a deep understanding of Ayurveda within our team to best serve our customers. The Bhandar represents a commitment to accessible and reliable Ayurvedic care, contributing significantly to the health and wellness of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Core Offerings: A Comprehensive Spectrum of Ayurvedic Solutions</b></p>

<p>Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products designed to address diverse health and wellness needs. This includes a wide selection of classical Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, personal care items, and traditional remedies. We carefully curate our inventory, prioritizing products formulated with high-quality, ethically sourced ingredients. Our selection extends to include specific Assamese traditional medicines and preparations that leverage the unique flora and fauna of the region, providing localized solutions for prevalent health concerns. We also provide authentic Ayurvedic formulations prepared using traditional methods. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local health challenges and our ability to recommend tailored solutions based on Ayurvedic principles. Furthermore, we offer consultations with experienced practitioners, providing customers with personalized guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic practices into their daily lives. We stock a wide variety of Ayurvedic products that cater to different needs and age groups.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Customer Experience: Cultivating Wellness Through Personalized Service</b></p>

<p>At Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar, we believe in providing exceptional customer service rooted in empathy, knowledge, and genuine care. Our team members are not merely sales associates; they are trained to understand the fundamentals of Ayurveda and assist customers in making informed decisions about their health. We dedicate time to understand each customer''s unique needs and concerns, offering personalized recommendations based on their individual constitution and health goals. We are committed to creating a welcoming and informative environment, where customers feel comfortable asking questions and exploring the world of Ayurveda. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through workshops and educational events, promoting awareness of Ayurvedic principles and healthy living practices. This commitment to customer education and personalized service sets us apart and fosters long-term relationships with our valued patrons. Our commitment extends to sourcing products that are not only effective but also sustainable and environmentally responsible.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons While Upholding Tradition</b></p>

<p>The future of Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar lies in expanding its reach while upholding its commitment to authenticity and quality. We envision growing our product line to include a wider range of specialized Ayurvedic formulations and customized wellness programs. This includes exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to source ingredients sustainably, supporting the local economy and ensuring the purity of our products. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing an online platform for product information, consultations, and ordering. We aim to become a leading center for Ayurvedic knowledge and practice in the region, offering comprehensive training programs for aspiring practitioners and promoting research into the efficacy of traditional Ayurvedic treatments. By combining our deep-rooted traditions with modern advancements, we aspire to create a sustainable and impactful business that contributes to the health and well-being of the community for generations to come. We also are exploring the possibility of partnering with Ayurvedic doctors to provide in-house consultations and treatment plans.</p>', 'Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar, Assam Trunk Rd, opposite Vishwaratna Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 61800', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:15:07.000Z'),
(953, 'DreamLife Ayurveda- Ayurvedic Clinic and Medicine', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'DreamLife Ayurveda: Revitalizing Wellness in the Heart of Assam

DreamLife Ayurveda, situated opposite Saraighat Bazaar, is a dedicated Ayurvedic clinic and medicine provider committed to bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the people of Assam. We are more than just a healthcare provider; we are a sanctuary for holistic well-being, offering personalized consultations, authentic Ayurvedic treatments, and genuine Ayurvedic medicines, all rooted in the profound principles of natural healing. In a region where traditional practices are deeply valued, DreamLife Ayurveda stands out by blending time-tested Ayurvedic knowledge with contemporary diagnostic approaches, providing effective and sustainable healthcare solutions.

<br> <br>

In the bustling business landscape of Assam, DreamLife Ayurveda fills a vital niche. The increasing awareness and demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions present a significant opportunity. Our clinic distinguishes itself by focusing on individualized patient care, emphasizing preventive medicine, and promoting a balanced lifestyle, thereby addressing the root causes of illness rather than merely treating symptoms. We are dedicated to preserving and promoting the rich Ayurvedic heritage, making it accessible and relevant to the modern Assamese lifestyle. We see ourselves as partners in the community''s journey towards optimal health and well-being.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings are centered around authentic Ayurvedic principles. We provide comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations with qualified and experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who assess each individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). Based on this assessment, personalized treatment plans are developed, encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies. These therapies include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil stream on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification), and other rejuvenation treatments designed to restore balance and promote healing.

<br> <br>

DreamLife Ayurveda also offers a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic medicines, sourced from reputable manufacturers and prepared according to traditional formulations. We prioritize quality and efficacy, ensuring that our patients receive the best possible therapeutic benefits. Our range includes classical Ayurvedic formulations, proprietary medicines, and herbal supplements, addressing a wide spectrum of health concerns, from chronic ailments to general well-being. What sets us apart is our commitment to educating our patients about the benefits of each medicine and how to incorporate it effectively into their daily routine. Our unique selling point lies in the integration of traditional knowledge with modern quality control measures, ensuring the safety and effectiveness of our products and treatments.

<br> <br>

Understanding the local market needs is crucial to our success. Assam, with its rich cultural heritage and diverse population, has a long history of using traditional medicine. DreamLife Ayurveda caters to this existing affinity for natural healing while addressing contemporary health challenges. We are particularly focused on providing solutions for prevalent health issues in the region, such as digestive disorders, respiratory problems, joint pain, and stress-related ailments. By offering accessible and affordable Ayurvedic healthcare, we aim to empower the community to take control of their health and well-being.

<br> <br>

At DreamLife Ayurveda, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a patient walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, compassion, and respect. Our staff is trained to provide personalized attention, ensuring that each individual feels heard, understood, and supported throughout their healing journey. We take the time to educate our patients about their health conditions and treatment options, empowering them to make informed decisions. We also provide ongoing support and guidance, helping our patients integrate Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives.

<br> <br>

Our commitment to the local community extends beyond providing healthcare services. We actively participate in community health initiatives, organizing workshops, seminars, and health camps to raise awareness about Ayurveda and promote preventive healthcare practices. We believe in building strong relationships with local organizations and community leaders to collectively address the health needs of the region. This dedication to community engagement sets us apart and fosters a sense of trust and loyalty among our patients.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, DreamLife Ayurveda envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our clinic facilities to accommodate a wider range of treatments and therapies. We also plan to introduce specialized Ayurvedic programs tailored to specific health conditions, such as diabetes management, women''s health, and geriatric care. Furthermore, we aspire to establish a training center to educate and empower aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, thereby contributing to the growth and development of Ayurveda in the region.

<br> <br>

We are committed to leveraging technology to enhance our services and reach a wider audience. This includes developing an online platform for consultations, medicine ordering, and health education. We also aim to integrate digital tools for patient monitoring and follow-up, ensuring seamless and personalized care. Our ultimate goal is to make Ayurveda accessible and convenient for everyone, empowering them to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. DreamLife Ayurveda remains steadfast in its commitment to revitalizing wellness in Assam, one patient at a time.', 'opposite Saraighat Bazaar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070020 41373', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:15:15.000Z'),
(954, 'Dr Amrita Pincha - Ayurveda Consultant', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Dr. Amrita Pincha - Ayurveda Consultant: Bridging Ancient Wisdom with Modern Well-being on GS Road</b></p>

<p>Nestled on the bustling GS Road, Dr. Amrita Pincha - Ayurveda Consultant, stands as a beacon of holistic health and wellness, offering authentic Ayurvedic consultations and personalized treatment plans. In a region like Assam, deeply rooted in traditional practices and natural remedies, Dr. Pincha''s clinic provides a valuable bridge between ancient wisdom and contemporary healthcare needs. The clinic is not just a place for treatment; it''s a sanctuary where individuals can reconnect with their inner selves and embark on a journey toward sustainable well-being. The significance lies in bringing personalized, preventative healthcare within reach, catering to the specific climatic and dietary needs prevalent in Assam, offering a distinct alternative to conventional approaches. Dr. Pincha aims to empower individuals to take proactive control of their health, promoting longevity and vitality through the time-tested principles of Ayurveda.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><b>Core Services: A Holistic Approach to Health</b></p>

<p>At the heart of Dr. Amrita Pincha''s practice are comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations are far more than just symptom assessments; they involve a detailed evaluation of an individual''s <i>Prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>Vikriti</i> (imbalance), considering their lifestyle, diet, and environmental factors. This personalized approach allows Dr. Pincha to identify the root cause of health issues rather than merely addressing the symptoms. Based on this thorough assessment, she develops individualized treatment plans encompassing dietary recommendations tailored to the local availability of fresh produce and regional food habits, lifestyle modifications that consider the demands of modern life in Assam, and herbal remedies sourced ethically and responsibly. While the clinic may not always dispense ready-made Ayurvedic medicines, Dr. Pincha offers guidance on sourcing high-quality herbal products from trusted suppliers. A unique selling point is the integration of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with a modern understanding of physiology and disease, making the treatments relevant and effective for today''s population. Further, Dr. Pincha provides specialized consultations for common ailments prevalent in Assam, such as digestive disorders, respiratory problems (particularly relevant given the region''s climate), and joint pain, often caused by demanding agricultural work.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><b>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</b></p>

<p>Dr. Amrita Pincha understands that healing goes beyond just treatment; it requires creating a nurturing and supportive environment. The clinic''s atmosphere is designed to be calming and welcoming, reflecting the principles of Ayurveda. Every patient is treated with utmost respect and empathy, ensuring that they feel heard and understood. The consultation process is not rushed; Dr. Pincha takes the time to build a rapport with each patient, explaining the Ayurvedic principles behind the diagnosis and treatment plan in a clear and accessible manner. What truly sets the practice apart is the commitment to empowering patients with knowledge. Dr. Pincha actively educates individuals about Ayurveda, encouraging them to adopt healthy habits and make informed choices about their well-being. The connection with the local community is also a priority. Dr. Pincha may conduct workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles and healthy living at local community centers or schools, creating awareness and promoting preventative healthcare. This active engagement helps build trust and establishes Dr. Pincha as a respected and valued member of the GS Road community, dedicated to improving the health and well-being of its residents.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><b>Future Vision: Growing with the Community</b></p>

<p>Dr. Amrita Pincha envisions her Ayurveda consultancy as a thriving center for holistic health and wellness in Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, such as introducing specialized Ayurvedic therapies like Panchakarma (detoxification) and Abhyanga (oil massage), performed by trained therapists under her supervision. Another key goal is to establish collaborations with local farmers and herbal suppliers to source high-quality, organic ingredients for herbal remedies, supporting sustainable agriculture and promoting local businesses. The long-term vision is to create an integrated wellness center that combines Ayurvedic consultations with other complementary therapies like yoga and meditation, offering a comprehensive approach to health. The clinic may also explore partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream medical practices, promoting a collaborative and holistic approach to healthcare. Ultimately, Dr. Amrita Pincha aims to make Ayurveda accessible to a wider audience in Assam, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives, rooted in the ancient wisdom of this profound healing system.</p>', 'GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '090856 12000', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:15:21.000Z'),
(955, 'Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute: Nurturing Wellness Through Tradition</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, at 5QFR+FHC, the Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute stands as a beacon of traditional healing, dedicated to preserving and promoting the ancient science of Ayurveda. This institute is more than just a healthcare provider; it’s a testament to the rich cultural heritage of Assam, offering holistic wellness solutions deeply rooted in centuries of Ayurvedic wisdom. In a region where traditional healing practices are still valued and sought after, the Institute plays a vital role in bridging the gap between ancient wisdom and modern healthcare needs.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Institute distinguishes itself through its commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles, personalized care, and a serene environment conducive to healing. Unlike conventional healthcare providers, the focus here is on identifying the root cause of imbalances within the individual, rather than merely treating symptoms. This holistic approach makes it a unique and significant player in the local Assam business landscape, contributing to the well-being of the community and the preservation of its cultural heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Well-being</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services, meticulously tailored to individual needs. These services include: </p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
<li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Detailed consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners to assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti), leading to personalized treatment plans. These consultations go beyond surface-level assessments, delving deep into lifestyle, diet, and environmental factors to understand the complete picture of an individual''s health.</li>
<li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> A complete detoxification and rejuvenation program, involving a series of therapeutic procedures designed to eliminate toxins from the body and restore balance. Panchakarma is not just a cleanse; it’s a transformative experience that aims to revitalize the body, mind, and spirit.</li>
<li><b>Ayurvedic Treatments:</b> A variety of traditional Ayurvedic treatments, including Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil dripping on the forehead), Pizhichil (oil bath), and other therapies aimed at specific health conditions and overall well-being. Each treatment is administered with precision and care, using high-quality, natural ingredients.</li>
<li><b>Herbal Formulations:</b> The Institute offers a range of carefully formulated herbal medicines and supplements, prepared according to traditional Ayurvedic recipes, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. These formulations are designed to support the body''s natural healing processes and address specific health concerns.</li>
<li><b>Yoga and Meditation:</b> Integral components of Ayurvedic healing, yoga and meditation classes are offered to promote physical and mental well-being. These classes are tailored to individual needs and abilities, providing a gentle yet effective way to enhance overall health and reduce stress.</li>
<li><b>Dietary Guidance:</b> Personalized dietary recommendations based on individual constitution and health conditions, emphasizing the importance of food as medicine. The Institute promotes awareness of locally available, seasonal foods that are beneficial for health.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiator for the Institute is its unwavering commitment to authenticity. All treatments are conducted according to traditional Ayurvedic principles, using time-tested methods and high-quality, natural ingredients. Furthermore, the emphasis on locally sourced herbs and ingredients not only ensures freshness and potency but also supports local farmers and communities, strengthening the Institute''s ties to the region. This commitment to local sourcing and traditional practices strongly resonates within the Assamese community, who hold deep respect for local traditions and natural remedies.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Institute directly addresses local market needs by providing accessible and affordable Ayurvedic healthcare options. In a region where access to conventional healthcare can be limited, the Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute serves as a vital resource for those seeking natural and holistic solutions to their health concerns.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Customer Experience: Healing with Compassion and Care</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>The customer experience at the Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute is paramount. From the moment a client enters the serene premises, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. The Institute prides itself on providing personalized attention to each individual, ensuring that their needs are understood and addressed with the utmost care. Every aspect of the Institute, from the tranquil treatment rooms to the comfortable waiting areas, is designed to create a relaxing and healing environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets the Institute apart is its deep connection with the local community. The Institute actively participates in local health awareness programs, conducting workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles and healthy living. This active engagement builds trust and fosters a sense of community ownership, solidifying the Institute''s position as a trusted healthcare provider within the region. Furthermore, the Institute often collaborates with local NGOs and community organizations to provide Ayurvedic healthcare to underserved populations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Preserving Traditions</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute envisions a future where Ayurveda plays an even greater role in promoting health and well-being in Assam and beyond. The Institute has plans for strategic growth, including expanding its facilities to accommodate more patients and enhancing its research capabilities to further validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments. Future plans also include developing educational programs to train the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners and promote awareness of Ayurveda among the general public.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Long-term goals encompass establishing the Institute as a center of excellence for Ayurvedic education and research in the region, attracting students and researchers from across the country. Furthermore, the Institute aims to expand its outreach programs to remote areas, bringing the benefits of Ayurveda to those who need it most. By embracing innovation while staying true to its traditional roots, the Sashikanta Bezbaruah Memorial Ayurvedic Institute is poised to make a lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the community for generations to come. Ultimately, the Institute aspires to be a model for sustainable and culturally sensitive healthcare, demonstrating the power of Ayurveda to heal and transform lives.</p>', '5QFR+FHC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:15:30.000Z'),
(956, 'Assam Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Assam Ayurvedic Clinic, situated at House no. 60, Budh Bazar Rd, stands as a beacon of traditional healing amidst the bustling commercial landscape of Assam. The clinic specializes in providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments, consultations, and herbal remedies rooted in the ancient Indian system of medicine. More than just a healthcare provider, Assam Ayurvedic Clinic is committed to preserving and promoting the rich Ayurvedic heritage of the region, offering a holistic approach to wellness that resonates deeply with the cultural values of the local community. The clinic distinguishes itself by combining time-tested Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic techniques, ensuring patients receive comprehensive and personalized care. Its location within Budh Bazar Rd makes it readily accessible, fostering a sense of trust and familiarity within the neighborhood and wider community. This dedication positions Assam Ayurvedic Clinic as a unique and significant contributor to the health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The clinic''s core offerings encompass a range of Ayurvedic services tailored to individual needs. These include in-depth consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who assess patients'' <em>prakriti</em> (constitution) and <em>vikriti</em> (imbalance) to develop personalized treatment plans. Treatment modalities include traditional Ayurvedic therapies like <em>Panchakarma</em> (detoxification and rejuvenation), <em>Abhyanga</em> (therapeutic massage), <em>Shirodhara</em> (oil pouring therapy for mental well-being), and customized herbal remedies. The clinic also provides specialized treatments for various health conditions, such as arthritis, digestive disorders, skin ailments, and respiratory problems, addressing the prevalent health concerns within the local population. A key differentiator is the clinic''s emphasis on using locally sourced, high-quality herbs and natural ingredients in its remedies, ensuring both efficacy and sustainability. This commitment to local resources resonates with the community''s values and supports local farmers and suppliers. Furthermore, the clinic offers preventative healthcare through lifestyle recommendations, dietary advice, and yoga sessions, empowering individuals to take proactive control of their health and well-being, catering to the growing awareness and demand for holistic health practices in Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Assam Ayurvedic Clinic, the patient experience is paramount. The clinic fosters a warm, welcoming, and healing environment where individuals feel comfortable and cared for. The staff is dedicated to providing personalized attention, taking the time to listen to patients'' concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and educate them about their health conditions and treatment options. This commitment to transparency and open communication builds trust and empowers patients to actively participate in their healing journey. What truly sets Assam Ayurvedic Clinic apart is its deep connection to the local community. The clinic actively engages in community outreach programs, conducting health awareness camps, workshops on Ayurvedic principles, and free consultations for underprivileged individuals. This dedication to serving the community fosters goodwill and strengthens the clinic''s reputation as a trusted healthcare provider. Moreover, the clinic actively incorporates Assamese cultural elements into its ambiance and practices, creating a sense of familiarity and belonging for patients. This combination of personalized care, community engagement, and cultural sensitivity makes Assam Ayurvedic Clinic a unique and valued healthcare resource in the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Assam Ayurvedic Clinic envisions a future of sustainable growth and expanded impact. The clinic aims to enhance its service offerings by incorporating modern diagnostic tools while maintaining the integrity of traditional Ayurvedic practices. This includes exploring partnerships with research institutions to validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments and develop innovative healthcare solutions. Expansion plans include establishing satellite clinics in other parts of Assam, making Ayurvedic healthcare accessible to a wider population. The clinic also aims to develop a comprehensive online platform to provide virtual consultations, educational resources, and access to herbal remedies, catering to the growing demand for online healthcare services. A long-term goal is to establish an Ayurvedic training center, nurturing the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners and preserving the region''s rich Ayurvedic heritage. Ultimately, Assam Ayurvedic Clinic strives to become a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Northeast India, promoting holistic well-being and contributing to a healthier, more vibrant community. This vision includes not only expansion of services but also a commitment to sustainable and ethical practices, ensuring that the clinic''s growth benefits both the community and the environment.</p>', 'House no, 60, Budh Bazar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:15:37.000Z'),
(957, 'Arya Wellness Centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '```html
<h1>Arya Wellness Centre: Nurturing Holistic Well-being in Assam</h1>

Arya Wellness Centre is a haven dedicated to promoting holistic health and well-being, nestled in the heart of Assam. More than just a wellness center, it''s a sanctuary designed to integrate traditional Assamese healing practices with modern wellness techniques. Recognizing the unique cultural and environmental context of Assam, Arya Wellness Centre offers a comprehensive range of services tailored to address the specific needs and aspirations of the local community. We stand out by providing accessible, culturally sensitive, and evidence-based wellness solutions, contributing significantly to the overall health and vitality of the region. Our commitment extends beyond mere treatment; we strive to empower individuals to take control of their health journey, fostering a culture of preventative care and sustainable well-being throughout Assam.

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Blend of Tradition and Innovation</h2>

Arya Wellness Centre offers a diverse portfolio of services, meticulously crafted to cater to the multifaceted dimensions of wellness. Our core offerings include:

*   **Traditional Assamese Healing Therapies:** Rooted in ancient wisdom, these therapies utilize indigenous herbs, massage techniques, and mindfulness practices passed down through generations. We offer specialized treatments for common ailments prevalent in the region, addressing physical discomfort and promoting mental clarity. A key highlight is our expert practitioners who are deeply knowledgeable about local medicinal plants and their application in healing.

*   **Yoga and Meditation Programs:** We provide a range of yoga classes suitable for all levels, from beginners to advanced practitioners. Our instructors are certified and experienced in adapting yoga postures to individual needs, focusing on alignment, breathing techniques, and mindfulness. Meditation sessions, guided by experienced facilitators, aim to reduce stress, improve focus, and foster inner peace.

*   **Nutritional Counseling and Diet Planning:** Recognizing the crucial role of nutrition in overall well-being, our registered dietitians offer personalized counseling sessions. We assess individual dietary needs, taking into account cultural preferences and local food availability, to create sustainable meal plans that support optimal health and weight management. We emphasize the importance of incorporating locally sourced, seasonal ingredients into the diet.

*   **Stress Management Workshops:** In today''s fast-paced world, stress is a significant health concern. Our workshops equip participants with practical tools and techniques to manage stress effectively, including mindfulness exercises, relaxation techniques, and cognitive behavioral strategies. We address the unique stressors faced by individuals in the Assamese community, fostering resilience and promoting mental well-being.

Our unique selling point lies in the integration of traditional Assamese healing practices with evidence-based modern wellness techniques. This holistic approach ensures that our clients receive comprehensive care that addresses their physical, mental, and emotional needs. By incorporating local traditions and knowledge, we provide a culturally relevant and accessible wellness experience that resonates deeply with the community.

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Connecting with the Community</h2>

At Arya Wellness Centre, we are committed to providing an exceptional customer experience that is characterized by warmth, empathy, and personalized attention. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of trust and belonging. Our approach to customer service is guided by the following principles:

*   **Personalized Care:** We take the time to understand each client''s unique needs and goals, tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements.

*   **Expert Guidance:** Our team of highly qualified and experienced professionals provides expert guidance and support throughout the client''s wellness journey.

*   **Warm and Welcoming Environment:** We have created a serene and inviting space where clients feel comfortable and relaxed.

*   **Community Engagement:** We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and outreach programs, promoting health awareness and fostering a culture of well-being.

We distinguish ourselves through our unwavering commitment to client satisfaction and our dedication to providing culturally sensitive care. By actively listening to our clients'' needs and responding with compassion and expertise, we create a lasting positive impact on their lives. We actively participate in local events and collaborate with community organizations to promote health and wellness throughout Assam.

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion</h2>

Arya Wellness Centre envisions a future where holistic wellness is accessible to all members of the Assamese community. Our long-term goals include:

*   **Expanding our service offerings:** We plan to introduce new services, such as Ayurvedic consultations, specialized therapies for chronic conditions, and corporate wellness programs.

*   **Establishing strategic partnerships:** We seek to collaborate with local healthcare providers, educational institutions, and community organizations to expand our reach and impact.

*   **Investing in research and development:** We are committed to researching and documenting the efficacy of traditional Assamese healing practices, contributing to the body of knowledge on holistic wellness.

*   **Creating a training center:** We aim to establish a training center to educate and empower local individuals to become qualified wellness practitioners, preserving and promoting traditional Assamese healing techniques.

We believe that Arya Wellness Centre has the potential to become a leading wellness destination in Assam, promoting a culture of health, happiness, and well-being throughout the region. Our dedication to providing exceptional care, coupled with our commitment to community engagement, positions us for sustainable growth and lasting positive impact. We aspire to be more than just a business; we aim to be a trusted partner in the health and wellness journey of the Assamese community.
```', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060009 05080', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:20:08.000Z'),
(958, 'Sushrut Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Sushrut Ayurvedic, nestled on Vidya Mandir Path, is a premier center dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic healthcare and wellness solutions to the community of Assam. Situated in a locality known for its educational institutions and peaceful atmosphere, Sushrut Ayurvedic aims to blend traditional healing practices with a modern understanding of well-being, offering a holistic approach to health that resonates deeply with the local culture and lifestyle. The business distinguishes itself by emphasizing personalized care, drawing upon the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to address the specific needs of each individual, fostering a profound sense of healing and revitalization.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Sushrut Ayurvedic are its core services: Ayurvedic consultations, personalized wellness programs, and the provision of high-quality Ayurvedic medicines and products. Consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners form the cornerstone of the practice. These consultations delve into a patient''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) through detailed questioning and pulse diagnosis, enabling the creation of tailored treatment plans. These plans often incorporate dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and specific herbal remedies. The wellness programs are designed to address a range of health concerns, including stress management, digestive disorders, joint pain, and skin conditions. These programs often include Panchakarma therapies – detoxification and rejuvenation treatments considered essential for restoring balance and promoting long-term health. The Ayurvedic medicines and products offered at Sushrut Ayurvedic are carefully sourced and formulated, ensuring purity, potency, and adherence to traditional Ayurvedic principles. Many of the formulations are based on locally available herbs, strengthening the connection to the land and promoting sustainable practices. A unique selling point is the emphasis on preventative healthcare, empowering individuals to take proactive steps toward maintaining optimal health and preventing disease through Ayurvedic principles. The growing awareness of natural and holistic healthcare solutions in Assam makes Sushrut Ayurvedic particularly relevant, providing a credible and trusted alternative to conventional medical approaches.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Sushrut Ayurvedic places immense importance on providing an exceptional customer experience. The approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine desire to help individuals achieve their health goals. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness, creating a welcoming and supportive environment. Practitioners take the time to listen carefully to each patient''s concerns, ensuring that they feel heard and understood. Treatment plans are explained thoroughly, empowering patients to actively participate in their own healing journey. What sets Sushrut Ayurvedic apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its patients, providing ongoing support and guidance to help them maintain long-term well-being. This is achieved through regular follow-up consultations, educational workshops on Ayurvedic principles, and a dedicated team that is always available to answer questions and provide assistance. To connect with the local community, Sushrut Ayurvedic actively participates in health fairs and awareness campaigns, sharing valuable information about Ayurveda and its benefits. The business also collaborates with local organizations and educational institutions to promote healthy living and wellness within the community. The emphasis on personalized care and community engagement has helped Sushrut Ayurvedic build a strong reputation for excellence and trustworthiness, fostering a loyal customer base.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Sushrut Ayurvedic envisions itself as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare and education in Assam and beyond. The business plans to expand its range of services and products to meet the evolving needs of its patients. This includes introducing specialized therapies for women''s health, children''s health, and geriatric care. Further, there are plans to develop a line of signature Ayurvedic products, incorporating locally sourced ingredients and traditional formulations. Another key area of focus is education and training. Sushrut Ayurvedic aims to establish itself as a hub for Ayurvedic knowledge, offering workshops, seminars, and training programs for both healthcare professionals and the general public. This will help to raise awareness about Ayurveda and promote its integration into mainstream healthcare. In the long term, Sushrut Ayurvedic envisions establishing a fully integrated Ayurvedic wellness center, complete with treatment rooms, yoga studios, meditation spaces, and gardens. This center will provide a comprehensive and immersive Ayurvedic experience, attracting individuals from all over the region seeking authentic healing and rejuvenation. The goal is to not only provide healthcare but also to empower individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda, contributing to the well-being of the community and promoting the preservation of this ancient healing tradition.</p>', 'Vidya Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094355 47823', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:20:14.000Z'),
(959, 'Dr. Binod Kr. Bharali- DS Ayurvedic Clinic and Pharmacy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Dr. Binod Kr. Bharali - DS Ayurvedic Clinic and Pharmacy stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the bustling Bus Stand area, offering a comprehensive approach to wellness rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda. This establishment is more than just a clinic and pharmacy; it''s a trusted healthcare partner dedicated to providing personalized and holistic care that addresses the root causes of illness and promotes overall well-being within the local Assamese community. Situated in a convenient location, the clinic serves as an accessible resource for individuals seeking natural and effective healthcare solutions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The core of Dr. Bharali''s practice lies in providing authentic Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations go beyond simply treating symptoms; they involve a thorough assessment of an individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti) that may be contributing to health concerns. Dr. Bharali leverages his extensive knowledge of Ayurvedic principles to diagnose conditions, taking into account lifestyle, diet, and environmental factors. Following the consultation, personalized treatment plans are developed, incorporating a range of Ayurvedic therapies. These therapies may include herbal remedies prepared within the in-house pharmacy, dietary recommendations tailored to the individual''s constitution, lifestyle modifications, and specific Ayurvedic procedures designed to restore balance. The clinic also offers specialized treatments targeting various health issues, providing relief and long-term management strategies. A key unique selling point is the integration of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with a modern understanding of health conditions, ensuring both efficacy and safety. The pharmacy component offers a wide array of meticulously sourced Ayurvedic medicines, classical formulations, and herbal preparations, guaranteeing the quality and authenticity of the treatments prescribed. By focusing on individualized care and offering a combination of consultation and readily available remedies, the clinic addresses a crucial need for accessible and holistic healthcare within the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Dr. Binod Kr. Bharali - DS Ayurvedic Clinic and Pharmacy, the patient experience is paramount. The clinic prides itself on creating a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable and respected. Dr. Bharali and his staff are committed to providing compassionate care, taking the time to listen to patients'' concerns and explain treatment plans in a clear and understandable manner. A strong emphasis is placed on building long-term relationships with patients, fostering trust and ensuring continuity of care. This patient-centric approach extends to the pharmacy, where knowledgeable staff are available to answer questions about medications and provide guidance on their proper usage. The clinic actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs and workshops, educating individuals on the principles of Ayurveda and promoting preventative healthcare practices. This dedication to community well-being establishes the clinic as a trusted and valued resource, fostering a sense of connection and shared responsibility for health within the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Dr. Binod Kr. Bharali - DS Ayurvedic Clinic and Pharmacy envisions continued growth and expansion to better serve the community. Plans may include incorporating additional Ayurvedic therapies, expanding the pharmacy''s product offerings to include specialized health foods and wellness products, and establishing satellite clinics in neighboring areas to increase accessibility. There is also a desire to develop educational programs for aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. The long-term goal is to establish the clinic as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, renowned for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and patient-centered care. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, Dr. Binod Kr. Bharali - DS Ayurvedic Clinic and Pharmacy is poised to make a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community for generations to come.</p>', 'Bus stand', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 72567', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:20:19.000Z'),
(960, 'Punarnava Ayurvedic Clinic And Wellness Centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<h1>Punarnava Ayurvedic Clinic and Wellness Centre: Revitalizing Health the Ayurvedic Way in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Punarnava Ayurvedic Clinic and Wellness Centre stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Located at House No. 74, Pandokan Stoppage, Lokhra Rd, opposite V Mart, Punarnava offers a holistic approach to health and wellness, rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda. In a region steeped in natural beauty and a growing awareness of alternative medicine, Punarnava distinguishes itself by providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments and personalized wellness programs, catering specifically to the needs of the local community. We are dedicated to empowering individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through natural and sustainable practices.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Journey to Holistic Well-being</h2>

<p>Punarnava Ayurvedic Clinic and Wellness Centre provides a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services designed to address various health concerns and promote overall well-being. Our core services include:
</p>

<br>
<br>

<ul>
    <li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Our experienced Ayurvedic doctors conduct thorough consultations, assessing an individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti). This personalized approach allows us to create tailored treatment plans that address the root cause of health issues, rather than simply managing symptoms.</li>

    <li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> We offer authentic Panchakarma, a detoxification and rejuvenation therapy that eliminates accumulated toxins from the body. This powerful cleansing process involves a series of specialized treatments, including Abhyanga (oil massage), Swedana (herbal steam therapy), Basti (enema therapy), Nasya (nasal administration), and Vamana (therapeutic emesis).</li>

    <li><b>Specialized Ayurvedic Treatments:</b> We provide specialized treatments for a variety of health conditions, including joint pain, digestive disorders, skin problems, respiratory ailments, and stress-related issues. These treatments utilize herbal remedies, therapeutic massage, and dietary modifications to restore balance and promote healing.</li>

    <li><b>Wellness Programs:</b> Our wellness programs are designed to help individuals achieve specific health goals, such as weight management, stress reduction, and improved sleep. These programs combine Ayurvedic treatments, yoga, meditation, and lifestyle counseling to create a holistic and sustainable approach to well-being.</li>

    <li><b>Ayurvedic Products:</b> We offer a range of high-quality Ayurvedic herbal products, including herbal supplements, oils, and skincare products. These products are carefully selected for their purity, potency, and effectiveness, and are formulated to support the body''s natural healing processes.</li>
</ul>

<br>
<br>

<p>Punarnava''s unique selling point lies in its commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments in a modern and comfortable setting. Our experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners are dedicated to providing personalized care and guidance to each client. Furthermore, we prioritize using locally sourced, high-quality ingredients in our treatments and products, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices. We distinguish ourselves by blending traditional wisdom with a contemporary understanding of health and wellness, making Ayurveda accessible and relevant to the modern lifestyle of Guwahati''s residents. By focusing on preventive care and empowering individuals to take control of their health, we address a critical need in the local market, where there''s a growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Nurturing Relationships and Building Community</h2>

<p>At Punarnava Ayurvedic Clinic and Wellness Centre, we are committed to providing an exceptional customer experience. From the moment clients step through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, respect, and personalized attention. Our approach to customer service is centered around building genuine relationships and creating a supportive and nurturing environment. We prioritize active listening, empathy, and clear communication to ensure that each client feels heard, understood, and valued. Our practitioners take the time to educate clients about Ayurveda and empower them to make informed decisions about their health and well-being.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness of Ayurveda and its benefits. We also collaborate with local organizations and businesses to offer wellness programs and initiatives that support the health and well-being of the community. This community-focused approach has enabled us to build trust and establish ourselves as a trusted source of Ayurvedic knowledge and care in Guwahati. We believe that by fostering strong relationships with our clients and the community, we can create a positive impact on the health and well-being of the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Empowering Wellness</h2>

<p>Punarnava Ayurvedic Clinic and Wellness Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized therapies for chronic diseases, establishing a training center for Ayurvedic practitioners, and developing a line of locally produced Ayurvedic products. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare. Our long-term goal is to promote Ayurveda as a sustainable and effective approach to health and wellness, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. We plan to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and educational resources. We aim to contribute significantly to the growing wellness tourism sector in Assam by offering authentic Ayurvedic experiences to visitors seeking rejuvenation and holistic healing. We envision Punarnava as a center of excellence in Ayurveda, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition for generations to come.</p>', 'House No. 74, Pandokan Stoppage, Lokhra Rd, opposite V Mart', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060004 20032', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.295Z', '2025-11-30T03:20:27.000Z'),
(961, 'North Eastern India Ayurveda Research Institute, Ministry Of Ayush, GOI', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'North Eastern India Ayurveda Research Institute, Ministry Of Ayush, GOI, stands as a pivotal institution dedicated to the advancement and promotion of Ayurveda within the unique socio-cultural and ecological context of North Eastern India. Operating under the aegis of the Ministry of Ayush, Government of India, the Institute is strategically positioned to serve as a beacon for Ayurvedic research, education, and healthcare delivery in the region. Recognizing the rich biodiversity and traditional healing practices prevalent in the North East, the Institute aims to integrate these indigenous knowledge systems with modern scientific methodologies to create holistic and effective healthcare solutions. Its presence addresses a significant need for accessible, affordable, and culturally relevant healthcare options for the diverse communities inhabiting this geographically significant area. The Institute fosters an environment where traditional Ayurvedic wisdom is meticulously researched, validated, and translated into practical applications that benefit both the local population and the broader scientific community.

<br> <br>

The core mission of the North Eastern India Ayurveda Research Institute revolves around three primary pillars: research, education, and healthcare delivery. In terms of research, the Institute conducts rigorous scientific investigations into the efficacy of Ayurvedic formulations and therapies, particularly those utilizing medicinal plants native to the North East. This includes pharmacological studies, clinical trials, and ethno-botanical surveys to document and preserve traditional knowledge. The Institute is also actively involved in developing standardized protocols for Ayurvedic treatments and quality control measures for herbal medicines.

<br> <br>

The educational arm of the Institute focuses on training and capacity building. This encompasses offering specialized courses, workshops, and seminars for Ayurvedic practitioners, researchers, and students. The curriculum is designed to equip participants with the latest advancements in Ayurvedic science while grounding them in the principles of traditional practice. Furthermore, the Institute actively promotes awareness about Ayurveda and its benefits among the general public through outreach programs and public lectures.

<br> <br>

Healthcare delivery forms another crucial aspect of the Institute''s operations. It provides comprehensive Ayurvedic medical services through its dedicated outpatient and inpatient facilities. These services encompass diagnosis, treatment, and management of a wide range of health conditions, employing a holistic approach that integrates diet, lifestyle modifications, herbal medicines, and specialized therapies like Panchakarma. A key unique selling point lies in the utilization of locally sourced medicinal plants and formulations, catering specifically to the health needs and preferences of the local population. This commitment to regional specificity differentiates the Institute from other Ayurvedic institutions and ensures the cultural appropriateness and effectiveness of its healthcare offerings.

<br> <br>

The North Eastern India Ayurveda Research Institute prioritizes patient-centric care and aims to create a welcoming and healing environment for all. The Institute recognizes the importance of building trust and rapport with the local community and actively engages in community outreach programs to promote health awareness and preventive healthcare practices. Staff are trained to be culturally sensitive and communicate effectively with patients from diverse backgrounds. Patient feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continuously improve the quality of care. The Institute also collaborates with local community leaders and organizations to identify pressing healthcare needs and develop targeted interventions. By fostering strong relationships with the community, the Institute aims to become a trusted source of healthcare information and services for the residents of North Eastern India. The Institute''s outreach extends to schools and villages, educating about the benefits of Ayurvedic lifestyle, diet, and preventive measures.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, the North Eastern India Ayurveda Research Institute envisions becoming a leading center of excellence for Ayurvedic research and healthcare in the region and beyond. The Institute plans to expand its research capabilities by establishing state-of-the-art laboratories and collaborating with national and international research institutions. Future plans include developing new and innovative Ayurvedic formulations based on local medicinal plants, conducting large-scale clinical trials to validate their efficacy, and promoting the sustainable cultivation and conservation of medicinal plants in the North East.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, the Institute intends to enhance its educational programs by offering advanced degree courses in Ayurveda and related disciplines. It also aims to establish a dedicated training center for Ayurvedic practitioners, providing them with hands-on experience in clinical practice and research. The Institute is committed to promoting the integration of Ayurveda into the mainstream healthcare system and working closely with government agencies and other stakeholders to develop policies and programs that support the growth of Ayurveda in the region. A key long-term goal is to establish a network of Ayurvedic healthcare centers across North Eastern India, making Ayurvedic healthcare accessible to all segments of the population. The Institute strives to become a self-sustaining entity through research grants, consultancy services, and the commercialization of its research findings, contributing to the economic development of the region while preserving its rich heritage of traditional healing practices.', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:20:33.000Z'),
(962, 'Elysium Spa', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Elysium Spa: A Sanctuary of Wellness in Assam</h1>

<p>Elysium Spa offers a haven of tranquility and rejuvenation in the heart of Assam, providing a comprehensive range of wellness services tailored to the unique needs and preferences of the local community. More than just a spa, Elysium strives to be a destination where individuals can escape the stresses of daily life, reconnect with themselves, and embark on a journey toward holistic well-being. Elysium Spa recognizes the growing demand for high-quality wellness services in Assam, catering to a discerning clientele seeking authentic and effective treatments.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>Elysium Spa''s core offerings center around providing a diverse and carefully curated menu of spa treatments, body therapies, and wellness programs. These include a variety of massage therapies, such as traditional Ayurvedic massage, Swedish massage, deep tissue massage, and aromatherapy massage, all delivered by highly trained and experienced therapists. Facial treatments utilize premium skincare products and incorporate modern techniques to address a wide range of skin concerns, from anti-aging to acne treatment. Body wraps and scrubs, using natural and locally sourced ingredients where possible, offer detoxification and exfoliation, leaving skin feeling refreshed and revitalized. Elysium Spa also features specialized treatments like reflexology, which focuses on stimulating pressure points on the feet to promote overall health, and hot stone therapy, which uses heated stones to ease muscle tension and improve circulation.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiating factor for Elysium Spa is its commitment to integrating traditional Assamese wellness practices with modern spa techniques. This includes incorporating local herbs and ingredients into treatments, offering traditional Assamese massage techniques, and creating wellness programs that reflect the region''s rich cultural heritage. This approach not only provides a unique and authentic experience for clients but also supports local businesses and promotes the sustainable use of natural resources. Furthermore, Elysium Spa offers personalized consultations to understand each client''s specific needs and goals, allowing for the creation of customized treatment plans that deliver optimal results. The spa retail area features a selection of high-quality skincare products, aromatherapy oils, and wellness accessories, allowing clients to continue their self-care journey at home.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Recognizing the fast-paced lifestyle of many Assam residents, Elysium Spa provides express treatments for those seeking a quick and effective way to relax and rejuvenate. These treatments, such as express facials and chair massages, are designed to fit seamlessly into busy schedules without compromising on quality or effectiveness. Elysium Spa aims to meet a need for accessible wellness solutions in the local market, promoting a healthier and more balanced lifestyle for the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>Elysium Spa is committed to providing an exceptional customer experience that exceeds expectations. From the moment clients enter the spa, they are greeted with warmth, professionalism, and a genuine desire to help them achieve their wellness goals. The spa''s ambiance is carefully designed to create a sense of tranquility and serenity, with calming music, soothing lighting, and comfortable furnishings. All staff members are trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each client feels valued and cared for.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Elysium Spa actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations. The spa participates in local events and festivals, offering mini-spa treatments and promoting wellness awareness. Elysium Spa also supports local charities and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. Feedback is actively solicited from clients to continuously improve the spa''s services and offerings, ensuring that it remains responsive to the evolving needs of the community. By fostering a strong sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, Elysium Spa aims to build long-lasting relationships with its clients and become a trusted destination for wellness in Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Elysium Spa envisions becoming the leading wellness destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and customer satisfaction. Future plans include expanding the spa''s range of services to include holistic wellness programs that address not only physical health but also mental and emotional well-being. This may involve offering yoga classes, meditation sessions, and stress management workshops. Elysium Spa is also exploring opportunities to develop its own line of natural skincare products, using locally sourced ingredients and traditional Assamese formulations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Further expansion within Assam is also a key part of the long-term strategy. This could involve opening additional spa locations in other cities or towns, or partnering with resorts and hotels to offer spa services to their guests. Elysium Spa also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as through online booking systems, virtual consultations, and personalized wellness apps. By embracing innovation and expanding its reach, Elysium Spa is committed to making wellness accessible to a wider audience and contributing to the overall health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>
</article>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094351 50544', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:25:08.000Z'),
