(971, 'Dr. Maratha Clinic | Best Sexologist in Guwahati | Top Ayurvedic Sexual Health Specialist', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Dr. Maratha Clinic, located on the First Floor of B Thakuria Plaza, RG Baruah Rd in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a leading provider of specialized sexual health and wellness services, blending the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda with modern diagnostic approaches. More than just a clinic, it''s a dedicated center focused on providing discreet, effective, and personalized care to individuals seeking to improve their sexual health and overall well-being. In the dynamic and often underserved Assam market, Dr. Maratha Clinic distinguishes itself by offering a holistic and culturally sensitive approach to sexual health, addressing not only the physical aspects but also the emotional and psychological dimensions of each patient’s concerns. The clinic''s presence fills a crucial gap, providing a trusted and reliable resource for individuals seeking expert guidance in a comfortable and confidential environment.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Dr. Maratha Clinic lies a comprehensive suite of services tailored to address a wide spectrum of sexual health concerns. The clinic specializes in Ayurvedic treatments for sexual dysfunction, premature ejaculation, erectile dysfunction, low libido, and infertility. Beyond purely symptom-based solutions, the clinic emphasizes identifying and addressing the root causes of these issues, promoting long-term health and vitality. A key differentiator is the clinic''s integrated approach, combining traditional Ayurvedic therapies with modern diagnostic tools to ensure accurate assessment and personalized treatment plans. This includes detailed consultations, physical examinations, and when necessary, relevant lab tests. The Ayurvedic treatments offered encompass herbal remedies, dietary modifications, lifestyle recommendations, and specialized therapies like Panchakarma, all carefully curated to restore balance and optimize sexual health. Furthermore, Dr. Maratha Clinic also provides counseling and support to address the psychological aspects of sexual health, recognizing the strong connection between mind and body. This comprehensive and holistic approach sets the clinic apart from other providers in the region, making it a sought-after destination for individuals seeking lasting solutions and improved quality of life.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Dr. Maratha Clinic prioritizes creating a positive and supportive customer experience. The clinic understands the sensitive nature of sexual health concerns and is committed to providing a discreet, respectful, and non-judgmental environment for all patients. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with empathy and understanding. The staff is trained to provide compassionate care and ensure that patients feel comfortable discussing their concerns openly and honestly. Consultations are conducted in private and confidential settings, allowing patients to share their experiences without fear of judgment. The clinic also emphasizes clear and transparent communication, ensuring that patients are fully informed about their condition, treatment options, and expected outcomes. In addition to personalized care within the clinic, Dr. Maratha Clinic is actively involved in community outreach, promoting awareness about sexual health and wellness through educational programs and workshops. By building trust and fostering open dialogue, the clinic aims to destigmatize conversations about sexual health and empower individuals to take control of their well-being. This commitment to exceptional customer service and community engagement strengthens Dr. Maratha Clinic''s reputation as a trusted healthcare provider in Guwahati and beyond.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Dr. Maratha Clinic envisions a future where sexual health is recognized as an integral part of overall well-being and where individuals feel empowered to seek help and support without shame or stigma. The clinic''s long-term goals include expanding its range of services, incorporating advanced diagnostic technologies, and further integrating modern medical practices with Ayurvedic principles. There are plans to establish a dedicated research wing to conduct clinical trials and validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments for sexual health conditions. The clinic also aims to increase its reach through online consultations and telehealth services, making its expertise accessible to a wider audience across Assam and neighboring regions. Furthermore, Dr. Maratha Clinic plans to collaborate with other healthcare providers and organizations to promote sexual health awareness and education on a larger scale. By continuously innovating and expanding its capabilities, Dr. Maratha Clinic aims to solidify its position as the leading provider of sexual health and wellness services in Guwahati and a trusted resource for individuals seeking to improve their quality of life.</p>', 'First Floor, B Thakuria Plaza, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094109 49437', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:30:37.000Z'),
(972, 'Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor, conveniently located near Shiv Mandir, offers a time-honored approach to health and wellness, deeply rooted in the principles of Ayurveda. As a dedicated Ayurvedic practitioner serving the local Assam community, Dr. Ozah provides personalized consultations and treatments designed to restore balance and promote holistic well-being. In a region where traditional medicine holds significant cultural relevance, Dr. Ozah''s practice bridges ancient wisdom with contemporary needs, offering a vital alternative and complementary approach to healthcare. The business stands as a beacon of natural healing, contributing to the well-being of the community and preserving the rich heritage of Ayurvedic medicine within the local business ecosystem.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core of Dr. Samprity Ozah''s practice lies in personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual''s <i>prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance) through pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), tongue analysis, and detailed questioning about lifestyle, diet, and medical history. Based on this assessment, Dr. Ozah recommends tailored treatment plans that may include dietary adjustments, herbal remedies, lifestyle modifications, and specific Ayurvedic therapies. A significant offering includes Panchakarma, the classical Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation therapy. Tailored Panchakarma programs are designed to eliminate accumulated toxins, restore balance to the doshas (Vata, Pitta, Kapha), and enhance overall health. Further enriching the service portfolio are specialized treatments for various ailments, including digestive disorders, skin conditions, respiratory problems, and joint pain, using traditional Ayurvedic formulations and techniques. The unique selling point resides in the personalized and holistic nature of the treatments. Dr. Ozah takes the time to understand each patient''s unique constitution and health concerns, crafting individualized plans that address the root cause of the problem rather than merely alleviating symptoms. This approach resonates deeply with the local community, who value the personalized attention and natural remedies offered by Ayurvedic medicine. The services cater to the local market need for accessible and affordable holistic healthcare, providing an alternative to conventional medicine and empowering individuals to take control of their health through natural and time-tested methods.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every patient. The approach to customer service is built on empathy, understanding, and genuine care. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect. Dr. Ozah takes the time to listen attentively to their concerns, answering their questions thoroughly and providing clear explanations of the proposed treatment plans. What sets the practice apart is the dedication to building long-term relationships with patients. Dr. Ozah emphasizes patient education, empowering individuals to understand their own bodies and make informed choices about their health. This involves providing guidance on diet, lifestyle, and self-care practices that can support their overall well-being. Connecting with the local community is paramount. The practice actively participates in local health awareness events and workshops, sharing knowledge about Ayurveda and promoting healthy living. Furthermore, Dr. Ozah strives to source local and sustainable ingredients for herbal formulations, supporting local farmers and businesses. This commitment to the community fosters trust and strengthens the practice''s reputation as a valuable resource for holistic health and wellness. Word-of-mouth referrals play a significant role in attracting new patients, highlighting the positive experiences and strong relationships that Dr. Ozah cultivates with each individual.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region. This includes expanding the range of services offered, such as incorporating yoga and meditation classes to complement the Ayurvedic treatments. There are plans to establish a small in-house pharmacy offering high-quality, locally sourced Ayurvedic formulations. The business aspires to collaborate with other healthcare professionals, such as doctors and therapists, to create an integrated approach to patient care, combining the best of traditional and modern medicine. A key long-term goal is to raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and promote its integration into mainstream healthcare. This will involve conducting educational programs for the public and healthcare providers, as well as advocating for policies that support the practice of Ayurveda. The potential for growth is significant, driven by the increasing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions. Dr. Ozah is committed to staying abreast of the latest research and advancements in Ayurveda, ensuring that the practice remains at the forefront of the field. By continuing to provide personalized, compassionate care and engaging with the local community, Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor is poised to make a lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the region for years to come. The business plans to leverage digital platforms to increase its reach and accessibility, providing online consultations and educational resources to a wider audience.</p>', 'near Shiv Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097077 66208', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:35:09.000Z'),
(973, 'Aarogyaveda', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Aarogyaveda, situated at H, 60A, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Down Town Hospital in Guwahati, is a holistic wellness center dedicated to providing integrated healthcare solutions rooted in traditional Ayurvedic principles and modern scientific understanding. More than just a clinic or a pharmacy, Aarogyaveda strives to be a haven for individuals seeking a personalized path to optimal health and well-being, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant Assam.</p> <br> <br>

