Beyond products, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal provides personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti), leading to customized recommendations for diet, lifestyle, and herbal remedies. This holistic approach acknowledges the interconnectedness of mind, body, and spirit, addressing the root causes of health issues rather than just treating symptoms. The business also offers therapeutic services such as Abhyanga (Ayurvedic massage) and Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), designed to promote relaxation, detoxification, and overall well-being. The unique selling point lies in the personalized attention and guidance offered to each customer, ensuring they receive the most appropriate and effective solutions for their individual needs. These services directly address the local market''s growing interest in natural and holistic healthcare options, providing a trusted alternative to conventional medicine.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Maa Shefa Adi U Asal. The business strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring the benefits of Ayurveda. Staff members are trained to provide knowledgeable and compassionate service, offering guidance on product selection and usage. The business emphasizes building long-term relationships with customers based on trust and mutual respect. This is achieved through attentive listening, personalized recommendations, and ongoing support. Maa Shefa Adi U Asal actively participates in local community events, organizing workshops and seminars to educate people about Ayurveda and promote healthy living. By fostering strong connections with the local community, the business aims to become a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness, enriching the lives of its customers and contributing to the overall well-being of the region.

<br> <br>

Looking to the future, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal envisions significant growth and expansion. The business plans to broaden its product line to include a wider range of Ayurvedic remedies and personal care products, catering to an even greater variety of health needs. Expansion of the consultation and therapeutic services is also planned, potentially including the addition of specialized treatments and experienced practitioners. There is a strategic interest in exploring online platforms to reach a wider audience and provide convenient access to products and services beyond the immediate geographic location. A long-term goal is to establish Maa Shefa Adi U Asal as a leading Ayurvedic wellness center in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and customer care. This vision encompasses not only business growth but also a dedication to preserving and promoting the rich heritage of Ayurveda for the benefit of future generations. Through continuous improvement, innovation, and a steadfast commitment to its core values, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal aims to make a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves.', 'Idgah Rd, near Little Angel School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:35:21.000Z'),
(975, 'Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Ayurvedic Clinic: Nurturing Wellness the Traditional Way in AK Dev Road</h1>

<p>Ayurvedic Clinic, strategically located at 5P2H+8VX, AK Dev Rd, represents a dedicated sanctuary for holistic wellness, deeply rooted in the ancient principles of Ayurveda. In the heart of Assam, where traditional healing practices are interwoven with daily life, our clinic offers a unique and authentic approach to health, emphasizing natural remedies and personalized care. We are more than just a clinic; we are a partner in your journey towards optimal health, providing accessible and effective Ayurvedic solutions tailored to the specific needs of the local community.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Restoring Balance and Vitality</h2>

<p>At Ayurvedic Clinic, our core offering revolves around providing comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and authentic herbal remedies. Our experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners begin with a thorough assessment of each individual''s <i>Prakriti</i> (constitutional type) and <i>Vikriti</i> (current imbalances) to understand their unique health challenges. This detailed analysis informs the development of bespoke treatment strategies that may incorporate a combination of therapies including:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> In-depth assessments to determine individual constitutions and imbalances.</li>
<li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> A detoxifying and rejuvenating treatment involving five therapeutic procedures to eliminate toxins and restore balance. Specific therapies might include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), and Basti (enema therapy).</li>
<li><b>Herbal Remedies:</b> Custom-blended herbal formulations using locally sourced and traditionally prepared ingredients to address specific health concerns.</li>
<li><b>Dietary and Lifestyle Guidance:</b> Personalized recommendations on diet, exercise, and daily routines to support optimal health and prevent future imbalances.</li>
<li><b>Yoga and Meditation:</b> Gentle yoga sessions and guided meditation practices to promote physical and mental well-being.</li>
</ul>

<p>A key differentiator for Ayurvedic Clinic lies in our commitment to authenticity and quality. We prioritize the use of organically grown herbs whenever possible and adhere to traditional Ayurvedic principles in the preparation of our remedies. This ensures that our clients receive the most potent and effective natural treatments. Furthermore, we are acutely aware of the prevalence of certain health conditions within the Assamese community, such as digestive disorders, joint pain, and respiratory issues. Our services are specifically designed to address these prevalent health concerns using evidence-based Ayurvedic approaches.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</h2>

<p>At Ayurvedic Clinic, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount to fostering trust and building lasting relationships with our clients. Our approach is centered around providing personalized attention and creating a warm, welcoming environment. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with empathy and respect. Our practitioners take the time to listen attentively to their concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and empower them to actively participate in their own healing journey.</p>

<p>We strive to stand out by offering a holistic and integrative approach that goes beyond simply treating symptoms. We educate our clients about the principles of Ayurveda and empower them to make informed choices that support their overall well-being. We also prioritize building strong connections with the local community. This involves participating in local health fairs and wellness events, offering educational workshops on Ayurvedic principles, and collaborating with other healthcare providers to create a network of integrated care. Our location on AK Dev Road allows us to be easily accessible to the residents of the area, fostering a sense of community and trust. We aim to be a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness within the neighborhood and beyond.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Reach and Deepening Impact</h2>

<p>Ayurvedic Clinic envisions a future where Ayurvedic principles are more widely understood and integrated into mainstream healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a broader audience and deepening our impact on the health and well-being of the community. This involves several strategic initiatives:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Expanding our team of qualified Ayurvedic practitioners:</b> To meet the growing demand for our services and ensure that we can provide timely and personalized care to all our clients.</li>
<li><b>Developing new and innovative Ayurvedic products:</b> To address the evolving health needs of the community and make Ayurvedic remedies more accessible and convenient. This might include developing specialized herbal blends for specific conditions or creating Ayurvedic-inspired skincare products.</li>
<li><b>Establishing partnerships with local businesses and organizations:</b> To promote Ayurvedic principles and offer wellness programs to employees and members.</li>
<li><b>Investing in education and training:</b> To enhance the knowledge and skills of our practitioners and educate the community about the benefits of Ayurveda.</li>
<li><b>Exploring opportunities to integrate technology:</b> To improve the efficiency of our operations and enhance the client experience. This could involve implementing online appointment scheduling, virtual consultations, or a mobile app for tracking progress and accessing resources.</li>
</ul>

<p>Ultimately, Ayurvedic Clinic aims to be a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic care in Assam, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community. We are committed to preserving and promoting the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda while adapting it to meet the modern needs of the local population. Our unwavering dedication to quality, authenticity, and personalized care positions us for sustained growth and long-term success.</p>
</article>', '5P2H+8VX, AK Dev Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060029 32308', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:35:28.000Z'),
(976, 'Dr Bishnu Prasad Sarma - Best Ayurvedic Doctor in Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma - Best Ayurvedic Doctor in Guwahati: Restoring Health Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located in the heart of Guwahati, adjacent to the iconic Kelvin Cinema and Vishwaratna Hotel, and conveniently nestled near Shardhanjali Complex on SRCB Road, Tokobari, Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma’s Ayurvedic practice stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the modern world. More than just a clinic, it''s a sanctuary where ancient Ayurvedic principles are meticulously applied to address the contemporary health challenges faced by the local community in Assam. Dr. Sarma''s practice is distinguished by its holistic approach, focusing not only on symptom management but also on identifying and addressing the root cause of ailments. This commitment to comprehensive well-being, coupled with Dr. Sarma''s extensive experience, establishes his practice as a vital resource in Guwahati''s healthcare landscape, providing a natural and effective alternative to conventional medicine.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core of Dr. Sarma''s practice lies in providing personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any existing imbalances (Vikriti) through pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), detailed questioning about lifestyle and dietary habits, and a physical examination. Based on this comprehensive evaluation, Dr. Sarma crafts bespoke treatment plans that may include herbal remedies sourced from the attached Ayurvedic Pharmacy, dietary recommendations aligned with Ayurvedic principles, lifestyle modifications to promote balance, and detoxification therapies (Panchakarma). The on-site Ayurvedic Pharmacy ensures the availability of high-quality, authentic Ayurvedic medicines, prepared using traditional methods and sourced from trusted suppliers. Dr. Sarma also offers guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into daily life, empowering patients to take an active role in maintaining their health and preventing future ailments. A unique selling point is the integration of traditional knowledge with a modern understanding of health issues, allowing for treatments that are both effective and relevant to the patient’s specific needs. The practice directly addresses the local market''s need for natural, preventive healthcare solutions, appealing to individuals seeking alternatives to pharmaceutical-based treatments and those interested in preserving their well-being through time-tested Ayurvedic practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma''s clinic. From the moment patients step through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect, creating a welcoming and supportive environment. Dr. Sarma believes in building strong, trusting relationships with his patients, taking the time to listen attentively to their concerns and answer their questions thoroughly. This personalized approach fosters a sense of collaboration and empowers patients to actively participate in their healing journey. The practice distinguishes itself by providing ongoing support and guidance, even after the initial consultation and treatment. Follow-up appointments are scheduled to monitor progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and provide continued encouragement. Furthermore, Dr. Sarma actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness programs and workshops, sharing his knowledge of Ayurveda and promoting healthy living practices. This commitment to community engagement reinforces the practice''s role as a trusted resource and contributes to its positive reputation within Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma envisions expanding his practice to further enhance its reach and impact within the local community and beyond. Future plans include incorporating advanced diagnostic techniques, integrating technology to improve patient communication and monitoring, and expanding the range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments offered. There is also a long-term goal to establish an Ayurvedic wellness center that offers comprehensive holistic health programs, including yoga, meditation, and Ayurvedic cooking classes. Dr. Sarma aims to partner with local organizations and healthcare providers to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare, making its benefits accessible to a wider population. The ultimate vision is to establish Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma''s practice as a leading center of Ayurvedic excellence in Northeast India, contributing to the health and well-being of individuals and communities through the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', 'Kelvin Cinema and Vishwaratna Hotel, Ayurvedic Pharmacy, SRCB Road, Tokobari Near Shardhanjali Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 36018', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:35:34.000Z'),
(977, 'Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre.', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre stands as a unique and vital resource within the Assam healthcare landscape, offering traditional Tibetan medical practices to address a broad range of health concerns. Rooted in ancient wisdom and centuries of accumulated knowledge, the Centre provides a holistic approach to healing, emphasizing balance within the body, mind, and spirit. Its presence in Assam fills a crucial gap by offering an alternative and complementary treatment modality, particularly appealing to those seeking natural and integrative healthcare solutions. The Centre is more than just a medical facility; it''s a place of healing, learning, and cultural preservation, contributing to the diverse tapestry of Assam''s wellness offerings. The precise location ensures accessibility for residents of the surrounding area and promotes a quiet, peaceful environment conducive to healing.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core services at Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre are centered around the principles of Sowa Rigpa, the traditional Tibetan system of medicine. This encompasses a range of diagnostic and therapeutic techniques, including pulse diagnosis, urine analysis, and detailed patient interviews to ascertain the individual''s unique constitution and imbalances. Based on these assessments, personalized treatment plans are developed, which may include herbal medicine prescriptions crafted from carefully sourced and prepared natural ingredients. These medicines are often compounded on-site, adhering to traditional Tibetan pharmaceutical practices. Furthermore, the Centre offers external therapies such as Kunye massage, a specialized form of Tibetan massage that focuses on specific energy points and channels to release blockages and promote circulation. Moxibustion, a technique involving the burning of dried mugwort near acupuncture points, is also employed to stimulate energy flow and alleviate pain. Dietary and lifestyle recommendations are integral to the treatment process, empowering patients to take an active role in their own well-being. One of the Centre''s unique selling points is its commitment to preserving the authenticity of Tibetan medical practices, ensuring that patients receive treatments that are true to the tradition. The centre is committed to using the highest-quality ingredients, some of which are sourced directly from the Himalayan region. These services address the local market''s increasing demand for natural, holistic, and culturally sensitive healthcare options, particularly in a region where traditional healing practices hold significant cultural value. The availability of these therapies can address various health concerns, from chronic pain and digestive issues to stress management and overall well-being.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre, customer experience is paramount. The Centre strives to create a welcoming and compassionate environment where patients feel heard, respected, and supported throughout their healing journey. The practitioners are not only highly skilled in Tibetan medicine but also possess strong communication skills and cultural sensitivity, ensuring that patients from diverse backgrounds feel comfortable and understood. The initial consultation involves a thorough assessment of the patient''s health history, lifestyle, and concerns, fostering a strong doctor-patient relationship built on trust and mutual understanding. Follow-up appointments are equally attentive, allowing practitioners to monitor progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and provide ongoing support and guidance. The Centre actively engages with the local community through educational workshops, health awareness programs, and cultural events, fostering a deeper understanding of Tibetan medicine and its benefits. By participating in local festivals and collaborating with community organizations, Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre aims to become an integral part of the local fabric, promoting health, wellness, and cultural exchange. Patients consistently express satisfaction with the personalized care, the effectiveness of the treatments, and the overall sense of well-being they experience at the Centre. This commitment to exceptional customer service is a key differentiator, setting Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre apart from other healthcare providers in the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre envisions expanding its reach and impact within the Assam community and beyond. Future plans include establishing a training program for local healthcare professionals interested in learning Tibetan medical practices, contributing to the preservation and dissemination of this valuable knowledge. The Centre also aims to develop a sustainable sourcing model for herbal ingredients, supporting local farmers and ensuring the long-term availability of high-quality medicines. Exploring collaborations with other healthcare providers, both traditional and modern, to offer integrated treatment approaches is also a key objective. By integrating with other forms of care, more effective treatment can be offered, while respecting the traditions of Sowa Rigpa. This might involve offering workshops for conventional doctors to improve their understanding of the practice and develop opportunities to incorporate the therapy to other medical treatments. Telemedicine consultations may be considered to extend access to care for patients in remote areas. The long-term goal is to establish Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre as a leading center for Tibetan medicine in the region, renowned for its authenticity, quality of care, and commitment to community well-being. The Centre also sees potential in attracting medical tourists interested in experiencing traditional Tibetan healing practices, further boosting the local economy and promoting Assam as a destination for wellness and cultural tourism. By staying true to its mission and continuously innovating, Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre is poised for continued growth and success, making a lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the community it serves.
</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '069092 76510', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.296Z', '2025-11-30T03:40:10.000Z'),
