<p>At the heart of Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan’s offerings are a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products and services. The Bhawan boasts a diverse selection of herbal medicines, classical Ayurvedic formulations, and proprietary products crafted with meticulously sourced ingredients. These offerings span various health categories, addressing common ailments such as digestive issues, respiratory problems, skin conditions, and joint pain. A key differentiator is the Bhawan’s emphasis on quality control and adherence to traditional Ayurvedic manufacturing practices. Furthermore, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan provides personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti), leading to tailored recommendations for diet, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies. This personalized approach ensures that customers receive solutions that are specifically suited to their needs, maximizing the potential for effective healing and improved well-being. Given the increasing awareness of natural health solutions and the prevalence of lifestyle-related diseases in the region, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan''s services directly address a significant market need.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan places paramount importance on creating a positive and supportive customer experience. The Bhawan fosters a welcoming atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable seeking guidance and support on their wellness journey. The staff is committed to providing knowledgeable and empathetic service, taking the time to understand each customer''s concerns and providing clear, concise explanations of Ayurvedic principles and treatment options. This dedication to customer service extends beyond the point of sale, with follow-up consultations and ongoing support offered to ensure that customers achieve optimal results. Moreover, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards their health. By building strong relationships with its customers and actively participating in community initiatives, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan has cultivated a reputation as a trusted and reliable source of Ayurvedic wisdom and natural healing.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan is one of sustainable growth and expanded impact. Building upon its established foundation, the Bhawan aims to further solidify its position as a leading provider of Ayurvedic solutions in Assam and beyond. Strategic initiatives include expanding the product line to encompass a wider range of Ayurvedic formulations and wellness products, catering to evolving customer needs. There are also plans to enhance the consultation services by incorporating modern diagnostic techniques and integrating them with traditional Ayurvedic assessments. Exploration of partnerships with local healthcare providers and wellness centers to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare offerings is also underway. Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan intends to leverage digital platforms to reach a broader audience, providing online consultations, educational resources, and convenient access to its products. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan as a center of excellence for Ayurvedic education, research, and practice, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition for generations to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 63258', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.297Z', '2025-11-30T03:50:37.000Z'),
(992, 'Sharma Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Sharma Ayurvedic stands as a beacon of traditional healing and wellness within the vibrant business landscape of Assam. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, this establishment offers a comprehensive approach to health, emphasizing preventative care and natural remedies. Positioned to address the growing interest in holistic well-being and traditional medicine, Sharma Ayurvedic provides authentic Ayurvedic treatments and products designed to harmonize the mind, body, and spirit. Its commitment to quality, authenticity, and personalized care sets it apart, making it a valuable resource for the local community seeking natural and sustainable paths to health.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Sharma Ayurvedic''s offerings are a diverse range of services and products meticulously crafted to address a spectrum of health concerns. These include personalized Ayurvedic consultations that assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create tailored treatment plans. Therapeutic massages, or Abhyanga, utilizing herbal-infused oils, form a cornerstone of the practice, promoting relaxation, detoxification, and improved circulation. Furthermore, Sharma Ayurvedic offers Shirodhara, a deeply relaxing treatment involving the gentle pouring of warm oil over the forehead, known for its calming effects on the nervous system and its ability to alleviate stress and anxiety. Beyond treatments, Sharma Ayurvedic provides a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic products, including herbal supplements, medicinal oils, skincare products, and teas. These products are sourced and formulated based on traditional Ayurvedic principles, ensuring purity and efficacy. A key differentiator is the emphasis on using locally sourced herbs and ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and contributing to the sustainability of the business. This commitment to local resources not only ensures freshness and quality but also strengthens ties within the community. By offering a blend of personalized treatments and high-quality products, Sharma Ayurvedic caters to the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions in the region, providing a viable alternative to conventional medicine for those seeking preventative and complementary approaches to wellness.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Sharma Ayurvedic prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every client. The approach to customer service is deeply rooted in empathy and understanding, recognizing that each individual''s health journey is unique. Initial consultations are conducted with thoroughness and care, ensuring that practitioners gain a comprehensive understanding of the client''s health history, lifestyle, and goals. This personalized approach extends beyond the consultation room, with ongoing support and guidance provided to help clients integrate Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives. What truly distinguishes Sharma Ayurvedic is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its clients and the wider community. Regular workshops and educational seminars are organized to disseminate knowledge about Ayurveda, empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards managing their health. Furthermore, Sharma Ayurvedic actively participates in local health fairs and community events, offering free consultations and promoting awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda. This community engagement fosters trust and strengthens the bond between the business and the local population, solidifying Sharma Ayurvedic''s position as a trusted resource for holistic health.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Sharma Ayurvedic envisions significant growth and expansion, driven by a steadfast commitment to its core values and a dedication to serving the evolving needs of the community. A key element of this vision is expanding the range of Ayurvedic treatments offered, potentially incorporating specialized therapies for specific conditions and age groups. Furthermore, there are plans to enhance the product line, introducing new formulations based on traditional Ayurvedic recipes and incorporating innovative approaches to product development. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local healthcare providers and wellness centers is also a priority, aiming to integrate Ayurvedic practices into mainstream healthcare settings. This collaboration could involve offering Ayurvedic consultations and therapies within hospitals or partnering with wellness centers to provide comprehensive health programs. Long-term, Sharma Ayurvedic aspires to establish itself as a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research in the region, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. This could involve offering training programs for aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners and conducting research on the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments. Ultimately, Sharma Ayurvedic is committed to expanding its reach and impact, empowering more individuals to embrace the transformative power of Ayurveda and achieve optimal health and well-being. The long-term goal is not just business growth, but also to contribute significantly to the health and wellness of the Assam community, making traditional Ayurvedic care accessible and trusted.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '078968 77659', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.297Z', '2025-11-30T03:55:09.000Z'),
(993, 'Dr Hameed Ibrahim Khokar - Kerala Ayurveda- Sexologist & Infertility Specialist', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Dr. Hameed Ibrahim Khokar - Kerala Ayurveda- Sexologist & Infertility Specialist: Nurturing Wellness Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located on the ground floor of Himalaya Ayurveda Harendra Kusum Arcade, near Boripara Road, at the Bus Stop, Dr. Hameed Ibrahim Khokar''s clinic stands as a beacon of hope and healing, offering specialized Ayurvedic treatments for sexual health and infertility. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Kerala Ayurveda, the clinic provides a holistic and personalized approach to wellness, addressing the underlying causes of health concerns rather than merely alleviating symptoms. In the local Assam business landscape, Dr. Khokar’s practice carves a unique niche by seamlessly blending traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques, making specialized healthcare accessible and culturally relevant.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core of Dr. Khokar''s practice lies in the provision of specialized Ayurvedic consultations and treatments tailored to individual needs. The primary services offered include comprehensive sexual health assessments, personalized treatment plans for sexual dysfunctions (such as erectile dysfunction, premature ejaculation, and low libido), and holistic fertility treatments for both men and women. Utilizing traditional Kerala Ayurvedic therapies, such as Panchakarma, herbal remedies, and lifestyle modifications, Dr. Khokar addresses a range of conditions, aiming to restore balance and vitality. A key differentiator is the emphasis on understanding the patient''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to formulate highly personalized treatment strategies. This personalized approach ensures optimal efficacy and minimizes potential side effects, a significant advantage over conventional medical practices that often follow a more generalized approach. The clinic fulfills a critical need in the local market by offering a natural and holistic alternative for individuals seeking to address sexual health concerns and infertility issues, often stigmatized or inadequately addressed by mainstream healthcare systems.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Dr. Khokar''s clinic prioritizes creating a compassionate and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable discussing sensitive health issues. The approach to customer service is centered around building trust and fostering open communication. Every patient interaction, from the initial consultation to follow-up appointments, is conducted with utmost respect and confidentiality. The clinic distinguishes itself through its commitment to patient education, empowering individuals to actively participate in their healing journey. Patients receive detailed explanations of their condition, treatment options, and lifestyle recommendations, enabling them to make informed decisions about their health. Connecting with the local community is paramount, and the clinic actively participates in health awareness campaigns and workshops to promote the benefits of Ayurveda and educate the public on preventive healthcare measures. This proactive engagement demonstrates a genuine commitment to the well-being of the community beyond the confines of the clinic.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Khokar envisions expanding the clinic''s reach and impact by incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and treatment modalities while staying true to the core principles of Kerala Ayurveda. Future plans include the introduction of specialized Ayurvedic programs for stress management, weight management, and geriatric care, further diversifying the clinic''s offerings and catering to the evolving needs of the community. A long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive Ayurvedic wellness center that integrates traditional healing practices with modern amenities, providing a holistic sanctuary for individuals seeking to enhance their overall well-being. Furthermore, Dr. Khokar aims to collaborate with local healthcare providers and institutions to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare, fostering a more comprehensive and patient-centered approach to medicine. This vision reflects a commitment to not only individual healing but also to the advancement of Ayurveda as a valuable healthcare modality in the region.</p>', 'GROUND FLOOR, HIMALAYA AYURVEDA HARENDRA KUSUM ARCADE, BUS STOP, near Boripara Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099952 02100', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.297Z', '2025-11-30T03:55:14.000Z'),
(994, 'Dr Chandrama Kalita | Senior Ayurvedic Doctor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Senior Ayurvedic Doctor: Restoring Wellness Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled within the serene surroundings of Chitraban Enclave, Apollo Clinic on Zoo Road, RG Baruah Rd, Dr. Chandrama Kalita’s practice represents a unique fusion of traditional Ayurvedic principles and contemporary healthcare needs. As a senior Ayurvedic doctor, Dr. Kalita brings years of experience and deep-rooted knowledge to the Assam business landscape, offering personalized and holistic healthcare solutions. In a region where traditional medicine holds significant cultural relevance, Dr. Kalita''s practice serves as a vital resource, providing accessible and authentic Ayurvedic care to the local community and beyond. The practice distinguishes itself by its commitment to individualized treatment plans, emphasizing preventative care and empowering patients to take an active role in their well-being. It fills a crucial gap in the market by providing a trusted and reputable source for authentic Ayurvedic consultations and therapies, catering to the growing demand for natural and holistic approaches to health.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Dr. Kalita''s practice offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services designed to address a wide spectrum of health concerns. The core services include in-depth Ayurvedic consultations, personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, herbal remedies, and specialized therapies. Consultations involve a thorough assessment of the patient''s overall health, taking into account their physical, mental, and emotional well-being, along with a detailed examination of their ''Prakriti'' (constitution) and ''Vikriti'' (imbalance). Based on this assessment, Dr. Kalita develops customized treatment plans that incorporate dietary adjustments, lifestyle modifications, and the prescription of Ayurvedic herbs and formulations. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing high-quality, authentic herbs, ensuring the efficacy and safety of the remedies. Furthermore, the practice offers specialized Ayurvedic therapies, such as Panchakarma, a detoxification and rejuvenation program designed to eliminate toxins and restore balance to the body. These therapies are tailored to individual needs and administered under Dr. Kalita''s expert supervision. The practice stands out by integrating traditional knowledge with modern diagnostic tools, providing patients with a comprehensive and evidence-based approach to Ayurvedic care. This integration addresses the local market''s desire for both traditional healing methods and the reassurance of modern medical understanding.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Dr. Chandrama Kalita''s practice, the patient experience is paramount. From the moment a patient enters the clinic, they are greeted with warmth and empathy, creating a welcoming and supportive environment. Dr. Kalita believes in building strong doctor-patient relationships based on trust, open communication, and mutual respect. Consultations are conducted with patience and attentiveness, ensuring that patients feel heard and understood. The practice emphasizes patient education, empowering individuals to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. Follow-up care is an integral part of the treatment process, with regular check-ins and ongoing support provided to ensure optimal outcomes. The practice actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to adopt healthier lifestyles. By participating in local events and collaborating with community organizations, the practice demonstrates its commitment to serving the health needs of the region. This proactive approach to community engagement fosters trust and solidifies the practice''s reputation as a reliable and caring healthcare provider. The focus on personalized attention, holistic care, and community involvement sets Dr. Kalita''s practice apart, creating a truly exceptional patient experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Chandrama Kalita envisions expanding the practice to reach a wider audience and further promote the benefits of Ayurveda. Future plans include offering online consultations to cater to patients in remote areas and establishing collaborations with other healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream medical practice. The long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive Ayurvedic wellness center that offers a full range of services, including consultations, therapies, educational programs, and a retail outlet for authentic Ayurvedic products. This wellness center would serve as a hub for promoting Ayurvedic knowledge and practices, contributing to the overall health and well-being of the community. Dr. Kalita is also committed to continuing her professional development, staying abreast of the latest research and advancements in the field of Ayurveda. By embracing innovation while staying true to the core principles of Ayurveda, Dr. Kalita aims to establish her practice as a leading center for Ayurvedic care in Assam and beyond. The vision is to not only provide high-quality healthcare services but also to empower individuals to live healthier, more balanced lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', 'Chitraban Enclave, Apollo Clinic, Zoo Road, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '075779 44444', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T03:55:20.000Z'),
(995, 'Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<h1>Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor: Nurturing Wellness in the Heart of Assam</h1>

Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor offers a dedicated and personalized approach to chiropractic care, situated conveniently at House no 13, Bylane No. 1, near Royal De Casa Hotel in the vibrant landscape of Assam. This practice is more than just a clinic; it''s a haven for those seeking relief from pain, improved mobility, and a holistic path to overall well-being. Recognizing the growing need for specialized musculoskeletal care within the region, Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor distinguishes itself by combining evidence-based techniques with a deep understanding of the local community''s specific health needs. The practice aims to be a trusted resource, contributing to a healthier and more active lifestyle for the residents of Assam.

<br> <br>

Our core mission at Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor is to provide comprehensive and effective chiropractic services tailored to each individual''s unique condition. The primary service offered is chiropractic adjustments, utilizing gentle and precise techniques to correct spinal misalignments (subluxations) and restore proper nerve function. These adjustments aim to alleviate pain, reduce muscle tension, and improve overall biomechanics. Beyond adjustments, the practice offers a range of complementary therapies, including soft tissue mobilization, therapeutic exercises, and postural assessments. These modalities work synergistically to address not only the symptoms but also the underlying causes of musculoskeletal problems. A key differentiator is the emphasis on patient education, empowering individuals to take an active role in their recovery and long-term health maintenance. By providing clear explanations of their condition and treatment plan, patients gain a better understanding of their body and how to prevent future issues. The services provided are particularly relevant to the local market, where manual labor and physically demanding lifestyles can contribute to a higher prevalence of back pain, neck pain, and other musculoskeletal conditions. Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor bridges the gap by providing accessible, high-quality care that addresses these specific needs.

<br> <br>

At Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor, the patient experience is paramount. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. The practice prides itself on creating a comfortable and supportive environment where individuals feel heard and understood. Initial consultations involve a thorough history review and physical examination to accurately diagnose the patient''s condition and develop a personalized treatment plan. A significant aspect of the customer service approach is the commitment to building strong relationships with patients. The chiropractor takes the time to listen to their concerns, answer their questions, and provide ongoing support throughout their treatment journey. This personal touch fosters trust and encourages open communication, leading to better treatment outcomes. The practice actively connects with the local community through participation in health fairs, workshops, and educational seminars. By sharing knowledge and promoting awareness about the benefits of chiropractic care, Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor strives to be an integral part of the community''s health and wellness ecosystem. The clinic understands that cultural sensitivity is important and adapts its approach to cater to the local Assamese population''s specific needs and preferences. This includes being mindful of communication styles and incorporating traditional practices where appropriate and safe.

<br> <br>

The vision for Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor extends beyond simply providing chiropractic care; it encompasses a commitment to becoming a leading provider of holistic health services in Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered to incorporate other complementary therapies such as acupuncture, massage therapy, and nutritional counseling. These additions will allow the practice to address a wider range of health concerns and provide patients with a more comprehensive and integrated approach to wellness. Furthermore, there are aspirations to establish partnerships with local businesses, schools, and community organizations to promote health and wellness initiatives. By working collaboratively with other stakeholders, Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor can further expand its reach and impact within the community. Long-term goals include investing in advanced technology and equipment to enhance the diagnostic and treatment capabilities of the practice. This will ensure that patients receive the highest quality care using the latest advancements in chiropractic medicine. The overall vision is to create a center of excellence for musculoskeletal health and wellness, serving as a trusted resource for the people of Assam for years to come. This commitment to growth and innovation underscores the dedication to providing the best possible care and contributing to a healthier future for the community.', 'House no 13, Bylane No. 1, near Royal De Casa Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060008 29739', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T03:55:27.000Z'),
(996, 'Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties: A Holistic Approach to Wellness in Assam</b></p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, at the location identified as 4PX6+FGF, lies Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties, a business dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic healthcare and a diverse range of related products. More than just a commercial venture, Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties serves as a vital bridge connecting the rich traditions of Ayurveda with the modern needs of the local community. In a region steeped in natural beauty and a growing awareness of holistic well-being, the center distinguishes itself by offering personalized care rooted in ancient wisdom, contributing significantly to the Assam business landscape by fostering a culture of health and wellness.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties provides a comprehensive suite of services centered around the principles of Ayurveda. At its core, the center offers personalized Ayurvedic consultations, conducted by experienced practitioners trained in diagnosing imbalances and recommending tailored treatment plans. These consultations delve into an individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) to understand their specific health requirements. Treatment plans may incorporate dietary recommendations, lifestyle adjustments, and the use of Ayurvedic medicines and therapies.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Beyond consultations, the center provides a variety of therapeutic treatments designed to restore balance and promote overall well-being. These may include Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (gentle pouring of oil on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapy), and other specialized Ayurvedic procedures. These therapies are performed by trained therapists using authentic Ayurvedic oils and herbs, creating a rejuvenating and healing experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Complementing the Ayurvedic treatments, Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties offers a curated selection of Ayurvedic products. This includes a range of herbal medicines, classical Ayurvedic formulations, and personal care products made with natural ingredients. The product selection is carefully chosen to ensure quality and authenticity, providing customers with access to genuine Ayurvedic remedies. The “Varieties” aspect of the business name reflects a broader selection of related items that support a healthy lifestyle, potentially including organic foods, yoga accessories, and books on Ayurveda and wellness. The unique selling point lies in the holistic approach – combining expert consultations, effective treatments, and authentic products under one roof. This integrated approach addresses the growing local demand for natural and preventive healthcare solutions, offering a viable alternative to conventional medicine for many common ailments.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties. The center strives to create a welcoming and nurturing environment where customers feel comfortable and cared for. The practitioners and staff are committed to providing personalized attention, taking the time to understand each individual''s needs and concerns. Consultations are conducted with empathy and respect, ensuring that customers are fully informed about their condition and treatment options. Transparency and open communication are emphasized throughout the process. The center goes beyond simply providing treatments; it aims to educate customers about Ayurveda and empower them to take control of their own health.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The business fosters a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in health awareness programs and workshops. By organizing educational events and collaborating with local organizations, the center promotes the benefits of Ayurveda and encourages a healthy lifestyle. This commitment to community engagement builds trust and establishes Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties as a valuable resource for holistic healthcare in the region. Word-of-mouth referrals are highly valued, and the center actively seeks feedback to continuously improve its services and customer experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties envisions significant growth and expansion. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic treatments offered, potentially incorporating specialized therapies for specific health conditions. The business aims to increase its product offerings, sourcing more products from local farmers and artisans to support the local economy and promote sustainability. Expanding the team of qualified practitioners and therapists is also a priority, ensuring that the center can meet the growing demand for its services.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Long-term goals include establishing Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties as a leading Ayurvedic healthcare provider in Assam. This will involve enhancing the center''s reputation for quality, authenticity, and customer service. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with other healthcare providers and institutions to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare is also a key objective. Ultimately, the vision is to contribute to the overall well-being of the community by promoting the principles of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. The business aims to remain adaptive to the evolving needs of the community, continually innovating and refining its services to ensure it remains a relevant and valuable resource for generations to come. The center aims to explore online platforms to reach a wider audience and offer teleconsultations, making Ayurvedic healthcare accessible to more individuals in the region.</p>', '4PX6+FGF', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T03:55:33.000Z'),
(997, 'Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi, strategically located on the 1st Floor of Shree Ganesh Market, VIP Rd, near UCO Bank Narangi, and opposite Union Bank of India, is a dedicated wellness center bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and the holistic philosophy of Patanjali Yogpeeth to the heart of Narangi, Assam. More than just a retail outlet, it serves as a comprehensive resource for individuals seeking natural and holistic solutions for health, well-being, and a balanced lifestyle. Recognizing the growing demand for authentic Ayurvedic products and therapies in Assam, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi stands out as a trusted destination, offering a carefully curated selection of products and services aimed at promoting preventative healthcare and addressing specific health concerns using natural, time-tested methods. Its prime location ensures accessibility and visibility, making it a convenient option for residents across Narangi and surrounding areas.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the core of Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi lies a commitment to providing a diverse range of Ayurvedic products and wellness services. The Kendra offers a wide selection of Patanjali’s renowned Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, personal care products, and food items. These products are formulated using natural ingredients and adhere to stringent quality standards, reflecting the principles of Ayurveda. Beyond products, the Kendra provides access to consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners (Vaidyas), who can assess individual health needs and recommend personalized treatment plans. These consultations delve into understanding the patient''s <i>prakriti</i> (body constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance) to address the root cause of health issues. Complementing the consultations are therapies and treatments rooted in traditional Ayurvedic practices, such as Panchakarma detoxification, massage therapies, and dietary guidance. The Kendra''s unique selling point rests on its ability to offer a holistic approach encompassing not just treatment but also education and lifestyle modifications, empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards maintaining their health. By offering these services, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi actively addresses the local market''s need for safe, effective, and accessible natural healthcare solutions, fostering a community centered around well-being.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience at Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi is paramount. The staff is trained to provide knowledgeable and empathetic service, guiding customers through the extensive product range and assisting them in making informed choices. Emphasis is placed on creating a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring natural alternatives. The Kendra strives to build strong relationships with its customers, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty. This connection with the local community is further strengthened through organizing health awareness camps, workshops on yoga and Ayurveda, and promotional events. By actively engaging with the local community, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi positions itself as more than just a business; it becomes a valuable resource contributing to the overall health and well-being of the Narangi community. The focus on personalized attention, coupled with the genuine desire to help customers achieve optimal health, sets the Kendra apart and creates a loyal customer base.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi envisions expanding its reach and deepening its impact on the community. Future plans may include expanding the range of Ayurvedic therapies offered, incorporating specialized wellness programs targeting specific health conditions prevalent in the region, and strengthening partnerships with local healthcare providers to promote integrated healthcare solutions. The Kendra also aims to enhance its educational initiatives by conducting more frequent and comprehensive workshops on Ayurvedic principles, healthy cooking, and yoga practices. Furthermore, exploring opportunities to offer online consultations and product delivery services could broaden accessibility and cater to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi as the leading center for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, holistic approach, and dedication to empowering individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of the community and upholding the principles of Ayurveda, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi is poised for sustained growth and continued success in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Shree Ganesh Market, VIP Rd, near UCO Bank Narangi, opp. Union Bank of India', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 72606', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:00:09.000Z'),
(998, 'SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Harendra Resicom Building, AK Dev Rd, near Gopinath Path, is a dedicated center for Ayurvedic wellness, offering a holistic approach to health and well-being deeply rooted in the ancient traditions of Ayurveda. Situated in a prominent location easily accessible to residents and visitors alike, the Kendra stands as a beacon of authentic Ayurvedic practices, catering to the growing demand for natural and preventive healthcare solutions in Assam. What sets SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra apart is its commitment to providing personalized care, combining traditional wisdom with contemporary understanding to address the unique health needs of each individual.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The significance of SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra in the local Assam business landscape extends beyond simply providing healthcare services. It represents a revival and promotion of indigenous healing practices, contributing to the preservation of Assam''s rich cultural heritage. In a market increasingly saturated with conventional medicine, the Kendra offers a refreshing alternative, emphasizing the importance of balance, harmony, and natural remedies. It’s a haven where individuals can seek authentic Ayurvedic consultations, therapies, and herbal formulations, all under one roof, contributing to a more balanced and healthier community.</p> <br> <br>

