(1001, 'HIMALAYA AYURVEDA / Piles/ Paralysis/sprain/diabetes/Migraine/insomnia clinic in Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'HIMALAYA AYURVEDA / Piles/ Paralysis/sprain/diabetes/Migraine/insomnia clinic in Guwahati stands as a beacon of traditional Ayurvedic healing in the heart of Assam. Located on the ground floor of Harendra kusum Arcade, Boripara, near the Bus Stop, our clinic offers a comprehensive and holistic approach to health and wellness, catering to a wide range of ailments. We distinguish ourselves by blending ancient Ayurvedic principles with a modern understanding of health, providing personalized treatment plans designed to address the root causes of illness rather than merely suppressing symptoms. Our presence strengthens the local Assam business landscape by providing accessible and authentic Ayurvedic healthcare, promoting a natural and sustainable approach to well-being.

<br> <br>

HIMALAYA AYURVEDA specializes in the treatment of several key health concerns prevalent in the region. Our core services include specialized Ayurvedic therapies for Piles (Hemorrhoids), Paralysis, Sprains, Diabetes, Migraines, and Insomnia. We employ a range of traditional Ayurvedic practices such as Panchakarma (detoxification), herbal remedies, dietary modifications, and lifestyle recommendations. What sets us apart is our commitment to personalized care; each patient undergoes a thorough consultation to determine their unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). This allows us to create highly individualized treatment protocols, ensuring optimal effectiveness. Unlike conventional treatments that often focus on symptom management, our Ayurvedic approach aims to restore balance and harmony within the body, promoting long-term healing and preventing recurrence. We also offer guidance on preventative care, empowering individuals to take proactive steps toward maintaining their health and vitality.

<br> <br>

At HIMALAYA AYURVEDA, the patient experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and healing environment where individuals feel comfortable and supported throughout their treatment journey. Our team of experienced Ayurvedic practitioners and support staff are dedicated to providing compassionate and personalized care. We take the time to listen attentively to our patients'' concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and educate them about their condition and treatment options. Our clinic maintains strict hygiene standards and adheres to the highest ethical practices. We actively engage with the local community by participating in health awareness campaigns and offering educational workshops on Ayurveda and holistic living. This commitment to community outreach helps us build strong relationships and establish ourselves as a trusted source of Ayurvedic healthcare in Guwahati. We also ensure follow-up care is easily accessible, fostering a long-term partnership with our patients in their wellness journey.

<br> <br>

The future vision of HIMALAYA AYURVEDA is to become a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Northeast India. We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized therapies for other chronic conditions and lifestyle disorders. We envision incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and technologies to enhance the accuracy and effectiveness of our treatments while remaining firmly rooted in Ayurvedic principles. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our practitioners, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of Ayurvedic knowledge and practice. Furthermore, we aim to establish partnerships with local organizations and institutions to promote research and education in Ayurveda. Our long-term goal is to make Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible and integrated into the mainstream healthcare system, empowering individuals to make informed choices about their health and well-being. This includes exploring options for tele-Ayurveda consultations to reach patients in remote areas and offering tailored wellness packages to promote preventive health practices.', 'ground floor,Boripara, Harendra kusum Arcade, Bus Stop', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094355 89733', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:00:34.000Z'),
(1002, 'Vedika Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Vedika Clinic: A Beacon of Holistic Healthcare in Somnath Nagar</p>

<p>Nestled strategically on Somnath Nagar Path, between the revered Somnath Mandir and the advanced medical facilities of Apollo and Excel Care Hospital Road, Vedika Clinic stands as a vital healthcare provider serving the local community of Assam. Recognizing the unique needs and cultural sensitivities of the region, Vedika Clinic distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized, compassionate care. More than just a medical facility, Vedika Clinic strives to be a trusted partner in the health and well-being of its patients, offering a blend of modern medical practices and traditional healing approaches relevant to the local context. Its prime location provides easy accessibility for residents and commuters alike, solidifying its position as a convenient and reliable healthcare destination within the vibrant tapestry of Assam''s business landscape. The clinic aims to fill the gap between general healthcare access and specialized medical attention, offering a wide array of services tailored to the specific needs of the community.</p>

