Looking ahead, Dr. Nabanita Das envisions expanding her practice to further serve the growing demand for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam. This includes plans to incorporate specialized diagnostic tools based on Ayurvedic principles to enhance the accuracy and effectiveness of treatment plans. There are also ambitions to develop a range of proprietary herbal formulations, utilizing locally sourced ingredients, to address specific health needs of the Assamese population. Furthermore, Dr. Das aims to establish collaborative partnerships with other healthcare providers, integrating Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. This collaborative approach seeks to create a more comprehensive and integrated healthcare system that benefits the entire community. The long-term goal is to establish Dr. Nabanita Das''s practice as a leading center of excellence for Ayurvedic medicine in Northeast India, providing accessible, affordable, and effective healthcare solutions rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda. This includes mentoring aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners and contributing to the preservation and promotion of Ayurvedic knowledge for future generations.', 'Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080 4628 7161', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:05:26.000Z'),
(1006, 'Wellness centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Wellness Centre, strategically located at 4QR6+FR7 in the heart of Assam, is a dedicated haven for holistic well-being. More than just a business, it represents a commitment to fostering a healthier and more balanced lifestyle for the local community, acknowledging the unique needs and cultural nuances of the region. In a fast-paced world, Wellness Centre offers a serene escape and a comprehensive range of services designed to rejuvenate the mind, body, and spirit. We strive to be a trusted partner in our client''s journey towards optimal wellness, providing personalized care and evidence-based practices in a supportive and welcoming environment. Our presence significantly contributes to the local business landscape by promoting preventative healthcare and enhancing the overall quality of life within the community. </p>
