(1008, 'SCIM Assam State Council of Indian Medicine', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'SCIM Assam State Council of Indian Medicine (SCIM Assam), located at 5Q69+RV8, Himadri Path, serves as a pivotal institution dedicated to the advancement and regulation of traditional Indian medicine practices within the state of Assam. Recognizing the rich heritage and enduring relevance of Ayurveda, Yoga & Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, and Sowa-Rigpa (AYUSH) systems, SCIM Assam plays a crucial role in safeguarding the quality of education, ensuring ethical practices, and promoting the integration of these traditional systems into the mainstream healthcare landscape of Assam. Its significance lies in bridging the gap between ancient wisdom and modern healthcare needs, fostering a holistic approach to well-being that resonates deeply with the local community.

<br> <br>

SCIM Assam''s core functions revolve around several key areas. Firstly, it regulates and accredits educational institutions offering courses in various AYUSH disciplines. This includes ensuring adherence to established curricula, maintaining qualified faculty, and providing adequate infrastructure to nurture competent practitioners. Secondly, it serves as a regulatory body for registered practitioners of Indian medicine in Assam, upholding ethical standards, addressing grievances, and promoting continuing professional development. Thirdly, SCIM Assam actively promotes awareness and adoption of AYUSH systems through public health initiatives, workshops, and collaborations with government and non-governmental organizations. Finally, it acts as a liaison between the practitioners of Indian medicine and the state government, advocating for policies that support the growth and integration of these systems into the broader healthcare framework. A unique selling point is its commitment to maintaining the authenticity of traditional practices while embracing evidence-based approaches and modern advancements. These services directly address the growing local demand for holistic and preventative healthcare options, particularly in rural and underserved areas where access to conventional medicine may be limited.

<br> <br>

SCIM Assam prioritizes a patient-centric and community-focused approach. While it primarily oversees the regulatory and educational aspects of Indian medicine, it indirectly contributes to enhanced patient care by ensuring that practitioners are well-trained, ethical, and accountable. Furthermore, its outreach programs and awareness campaigns aim to empower the local community with knowledge about the benefits of AYUSH systems, encouraging them to make informed choices about their health and well-being. The council understands the importance of cultural sensitivity and incorporates local traditions and practices into its programs, fostering a sense of trust and connection with the community. SCIM Assam actively seeks feedback from stakeholders, including practitioners, patients, and community leaders, to continuously improve its services and ensure that they are relevant and responsive to the evolving needs of the population. This commitment to community engagement distinguishes SCIM Assam as a proactive and responsible steward of Indian medicine in the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, SCIM Assam envisions a future where traditional Indian medicine is seamlessly integrated into the mainstream healthcare system of Assam, providing accessible and affordable options for all. The council aims to expand its educational initiatives, fostering collaborations with leading institutions to offer advanced courses and research opportunities in AYUSH disciplines. It also plans to strengthen its regulatory framework, ensuring that practitioners adhere to the highest ethical standards and providing robust mechanisms for addressing grievances. SCIM Assam is committed to leveraging technology to enhance its services, developing online platforms for registration, continuing education, and information dissemination. The long-term goal is to establish Assam as a center of excellence for traditional Indian medicine, attracting patients and researchers from across the region and contributing to the overall health and well-being of the state''s population. Furthermore, the council aims to actively participate in national and international forums to promote the recognition and acceptance of Indian medicine as a valuable component of global healthcare.', '5Q69+RV8, Himadri path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '073810 59269', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:10:13.000Z'),
(1009, 'Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy: Rejuvenating Health the Natural Way in Assam</b></p>

<p>Nestled below the trusted SBI branch at Maa Rukmini Agencies, Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy stands as a beacon of holistic health in the heart of Assam. More than just a clinic and pharmacy, it''s a sanctuary where ancient Ayurvedic principles are seamlessly integrated with modern understanding to provide personalized and comprehensive wellness solutions. In a region rich with traditional healing practices, Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy distinguishes itself through its commitment to authenticity, quality, and patient-centric care, offering a vital alternative and complementary approach to healthcare within the local business landscape.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, providing a diverse range of services and products designed to address the root cause of ailments and promote overall well-being. Our Ayurvedic Clinic offers consultations with experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual’s <i>Prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>Vikriti</i> (imbalance), leading to personalized treatment plans that encompass dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies. We specialize in addressing a variety of health concerns, including digestive disorders, respiratory issues, skin ailments, joint pain, stress management, and women’s health. Beyond individual consultations, we also offer specialized Ayurvedic therapies such as <i>Panchakarma</i>, a detoxification and rejuvenation process, tailored to individual needs and administered under expert supervision.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Complementing our clinic services is our well-stocked Ayurvedic Pharmacy, where we dispense a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, and wellness products. We meticulously source our products from reputable manufacturers known for their adherence to traditional Ayurvedic formulations and stringent quality control measures. Our pharmacy staff are trained to provide guidance on the appropriate usage and dosage of these products, ensuring safe and effective self-care. We also offer a selection of Ayurvedic personal care products, including herbal shampoos, soaps, and skin creams, promoting natural beauty and wellness from the outside in. A key differentiator is our focus on sourcing locally grown herbs whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and potency of our ingredients. This dedication to local sourcing contributes to the economic well-being of the community and enhances the sustainability of our practices.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where patients feel comfortable and supported throughout their healing journey. Our staff is trained to listen attentively to patient concerns, answer questions thoroughly, and provide personalized guidance with empathy and understanding. We go beyond simply providing treatments and medications; we empower our patients with the knowledge and tools they need to take control of their health and well-being. We actively engage with the local community by organizing health awareness workshops, seminars, and camps, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and preventive healthcare. We participate in local festivals and events, further strengthening our connection with the community and demonstrating our commitment to their health and well-being. We understand the cultural nuances and healthcare needs of the Assamese people, and we tailor our services accordingly, ensuring that our approach is both effective and culturally sensitive. This deep understanding of the local context allows us to build strong relationships with our patients and establish ourselves as a trusted healthcare provider.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services to encompass specialized Ayurvedic treatments, such as <i>Ksharasutra</i> therapy for piles and fistulas, and establishing a dedicated research and development wing to explore the potential of local herbs and traditional formulations. We plan to forge partnerships with local educational institutions to offer training programs in Ayurveda, contributing to the growth of a skilled workforce in this field. We also aim to leverage digital technologies to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and educational resources. Our vision is to not only provide effective healthcare but also to promote the rich heritage of Ayurveda and empower individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. We are committed to continuous improvement and innovation, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of Ayurvedic healthcare and continue to serve the evolving needs of our community. Our commitment to sustainable practices and ethical sourcing will remain central to our operations, ensuring that we contribute to the well-being of both people and the planet.</p>', 'Maa Rukmini Agencies, below SBI', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 53865', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:10:19.000Z'),
(1010, 'Ayurvedic hospital', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Ayurvedic Hospital: Nurturing Wellness at 81A, Assam</h1>

<p>Ayurvedic Hospital, located at 81A, stands as a beacon of holistic healing and wellness within the vibrant business landscape of Assam. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, we offer a comprehensive approach to healthcare, emphasizing prevention, natural remedies, and personalized treatment plans. Unlike conventional medical facilities, our focus extends beyond symptom management to addressing the root causes of illness, promoting long-term health, and fostering a harmonious balance between mind, body, and spirit. Our unique position lies in seamlessly blending traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques to provide effective and sustainable solutions for our patients. We are committed to upholding the rich Ayurvedic heritage while adapting to the evolving healthcare needs of the community we serve in Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Healing</h2>

<p>Our primary services encompass a wide range of Ayurvedic treatments and therapies, meticulously designed to address various health conditions and promote overall well-being. These include:
<br> <br>
*   **Panchakarma:** This is a specialized detoxification and rejuvenation therapy, involving five cleansing procedures to eliminate toxins from the body, restore balance, and enhance vitality. We tailor each Panchakarma program to the individual''s specific constitution (Prakriti) and health needs.
<br> <br>
*   **Ayurvedic Consultations:** Our experienced Ayurvedic physicians conduct thorough consultations, assessing an individual''s health history, lifestyle, and Prakriti to formulate personalized treatment plans. These plans may include dietary recommendations, herbal remedies, lifestyle modifications, and therapeutic procedures.
<br> <br>
*   **Herbal Medicine:** We offer a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, prepared using traditional methods and sourced from trusted suppliers. These remedies are carefully selected to address specific health concerns and support the body''s natural healing processes.
<br> <br>
*   **Yoga and Meditation:** Recognizing the crucial role of mental and emotional well-being in overall health, we provide yoga and meditation sessions guided by qualified instructors. These practices help reduce stress, improve flexibility, enhance mental clarity, and promote inner peace.
<br> <br>
*   **Specialized Therapies:** We offer specialized therapies for various conditions, including joint pain, skin disorders, respiratory problems, digestive issues, and stress-related ailments. These therapies may involve specific massage techniques, herbal applications, and other Ayurvedic procedures.
<br> <br>
What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments, tailored to the individual needs of each patient. We prioritize the use of high-quality herbal ingredients, sourced ethically and sustainably. Furthermore, our emphasis on patient education empowers individuals to take control of their health and make informed decisions about their well-being. Our services directly address the local market needs in Assam, where there is a growing awareness and appreciation for traditional healing systems like Ayurveda. Many individuals seek natural and holistic approaches to healthcare, particularly for chronic conditions and lifestyle-related ailments, aligning perfectly with our core offerings.</p>
<br> <br>
<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</h2>

<p>At Ayurvedic Hospital, we believe in providing a warm, compassionate, and personalized experience for every patient. From the moment they step through our doors, they are greeted with respect, empathy, and genuine care. Our team is dedicated to creating a comfortable and supportive environment, where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered.
<br> <br>
We prioritize clear and open communication, ensuring that patients are fully informed about their condition, treatment options, and progress. Our physicians take the time to explain Ayurvedic principles in a simple and accessible manner, empowering patients to actively participate in their healing journey. We foster a strong doctor-patient relationship, built on trust, respect, and mutual understanding.
<br> <br>
Beyond individual care, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and educational seminars. These initiatives aim to promote the benefits of Ayurveda, educate the public about preventive healthcare, and empower individuals to adopt healthy lifestyle habits. We collaborate with local organizations and community leaders to reach a wider audience and make a positive impact on the health and well-being of the community. We source locally whenever possible, supporting other Assam businesses and reducing our environmental footprint, strengthening our ties with the people around us.
<br> <br>
We continuously seek feedback from our patients to improve our services and enhance their experience. We are committed to upholding the highest standards of ethical and professional conduct, ensuring that our patients receive the best possible care in a safe and supportive environment.</p>
<br> <br>
<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Wellness Horizons</h2>

<p>Ayurvedic Hospital envisions a future where Ayurvedic healthcare is accessible to all, playing a significant role in promoting overall health and well-being in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our facilities to accommodate a growing patient base and offering a wider range of specialized treatments. We plan to establish a state-of-the-art Ayurvedic research center to conduct clinical trials and validate the efficacy of traditional Ayurvedic therapies.
<br> <br>
We aim to integrate technology into our practice, utilizing digital platforms to enhance patient care, streamline administrative processes, and expand our reach to remote areas. We are exploring the possibility of offering online consultations and telemedicine services to individuals who may not be able to visit our hospital in person.
<br> <br>
Furthermore, we are committed to training and educating the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. We plan to establish an Ayurvedic educational institution to provide comprehensive training in Ayurvedic medicine and therapy, ensuring that the rich heritage of Ayurveda is preserved and passed on to future generations. We strive to become a leading center of excellence for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, recognized for our commitment to quality, innovation, and patient-centered care. We believe that by combining the wisdom of Ayurveda with modern advancements, we can create a healthier and more vibrant community for all.</p>
</article>', '81A', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:10:27.000Z'),
(1011, 'Prachin Herbs Healthcare Pvt Ltd', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Prachin Herbs Healthcare Pvt Ltd, situated at House no 8, 1, Pragati Path, Guwahati, Assam, is a dedicated healthcare company focused on harnessing the power of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge combined with modern scientific principles to provide holistic health and wellness solutions. Positioned strategically within the vibrant Assam business ecosystem, Prachin Herbs stands out by offering locally relevant and sustainably sourced herbal products and healthcare services designed to improve the overall well-being of the community. The company''s unique approach centers on respecting ancient healing traditions while adhering to stringent quality control measures, ensuring that customers receive safe, effective, and trustworthy solutions. Prachin Herbs Healthcare fills a crucial need in a region where traditional medicine holds deep cultural significance and where a growing awareness of natural healthcare alternatives is evident.

