<br> <br>

Prachin Herbs Healthcare envisions a future where traditional Ayurvedic medicine plays an increasingly important role in promoting the health and well-being of individuals and communities across Assam and beyond. The company’s growth strategy focuses on expanding its product line to address a wider range of health needs, leveraging research and development to innovate new and improved formulations, and increasing its reach through strategic partnerships and online channels. In the long term, Prachin Herbs aims to establish itself as a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. The company plans to invest in training and development programs to nurture a skilled workforce of Ayurvedic practitioners and herbal specialists, ensuring the continued growth and success of the business. Moreover, Prachin Herbs is committed to preserving and promoting the rich heritage of traditional Assamese medicine, working closely with local communities to document and safeguard indigenous knowledge for future generations. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, Prachin Herbs Healthcare is poised to achieve significant growth and make a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the communities it serves.', 'House no 8, 1, Pragati Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084730 07089', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:10:33.000Z'),
(1012, 'AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP, strategically located near LUCKY MOBAIL CENTRE, stands as a dedicated purveyor of authentic Ayurvedic remedies and herbal products, deeply rooted in the ancient traditions of healing and wellness. Situated within the vibrant Assam business landscape, we aim to bridge the gap between traditional Ayurvedic practices and the growing demand for natural, holistic healthcare solutions within the community. Our commitment is to providing high-quality, ethically sourced herbal medicines and personalized consultations, empowering individuals to take proactive control of their health and well-being through time-tested natural methods.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP lies a carefully curated selection of Ayurvedic products, encompassing a wide range of therapeutic needs. Our offerings include: meticulously prepared herbal formulations addressing common ailments such as digestive issues, respiratory problems, skin conditions, and joint pain; single herbs and herbal blends sourced directly from reputable growers and suppliers, ensuring purity and potency; and traditional Ayurvedic oils and massage products designed to promote relaxation, rejuvenation, and therapeutic relief. A key differentiator is our emphasis on sourcing herbs grown locally or within India, supporting sustainable agricultural practices and reducing our environmental footprint. We meticulously verify the authenticity and quality of our products through rigorous quality control measures, ensuring that our customers receive safe and effective remedies. Furthermore, we offer personalized Ayurvedic consultations, guiding individuals toward tailored herbal regimens and lifestyle recommendations based on their unique constitution and health concerns. This personalized approach distinguishes us from generic pharmacies and positions us as trusted advisors in the realm of Ayurvedic health.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel comfortable seeking guidance and exploring the world of Ayurveda. Our staff is trained to provide knowledgeable assistance, explaining the benefits of different herbs and formulations, and answering questions with clarity and patience. We emphasize building lasting relationships with our customers, fostering trust and understanding as we work together to support their health goals. Beyond individual consultations, we aim to actively engage with the local community by organizing workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles, healthy lifestyle practices, and the benefits of herbal remedies. We also collaborate with local healthcare practitioners, promoting the integration of Ayurvedic medicine with conventional healthcare approaches. By actively participating in community events and supporting local initiatives, we demonstrate our commitment to the well-being of the community we serve and solidify our position as a trusted resource for natural healthcare solutions. We encourage feedback from our customers and continually strive to improve our products and services based on their needs and preferences. This commitment to customer-centricity is what truly sets us apart.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP involves expanding our reach and deepening our impact within the local community and beyond. We plan to introduce a wider range of Ayurvedic products, including specialized formulations for specific health conditions and a selection of Ayurvedic personal care items. We envision establishing strategic partnerships with Ayurvedic doctors and wellness centers, creating a referral network to provide comprehensive healthcare services. We are also exploring the possibility of offering online consultations and developing an e-commerce platform to reach a wider audience and make our products more accessible. A key long-term goal is to establish a small-scale herbal processing unit, allowing us to directly source and process local herbs, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local farmers. We are also committed to promoting research and education in the field of Ayurveda, collaborating with academic institutions and organizations to advance the understanding and application of this ancient healing system. By continuously innovating, expanding our services, and staying true to our core values of quality, authenticity, and customer care, AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP aims to become a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region and beyond, contributing to a healthier and more balanced community.</p>', 'near LUCKY MOBAIL CENTRE', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '093953 32676', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.298Z', '2025-11-30T04:15:09.000Z'),
(1013, 'Ayurvedic shop', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><b>Ayurvedic Shop: Nurturing Wellness in the Heart of Datalpara</b></p>

