(1015, 'HIMLEKHAA AYURVEDA PVT.LTD', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'HIMLEKHAA AYURVEDA PVT. LTD., nestled near Balaji Temple within the Mr. Budhu Majhy complex on Road No. 11, represents a significant and burgeoning force in Assam''s revitalized embrace of traditional Ayurvedic practices. More than just a business, Himlekhaa Ayurveda is a commitment to holistic well-being, deeply rooted in ancient wisdom and tailored for modern lifestyles. We aim to bridge the gap between traditional Ayurvedic principles and the contemporary needs of the local community, fostering a greater understanding and appreciation for natural health solutions. Our location, purposefully chosen, places us at the heart of the community, easily accessible and fostering a sense of trust and familiarity.

