<br> <br>

We also aim to increase our educational outreach, conducting more workshops, seminars, and training programs to empower individuals with the knowledge and skills to integrate Ayurveda into their daily lives. We aspire to become a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research in the region, contributing to the advancement of Ayurvedic knowledge and practices. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with other healthcare providers and organizations to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare, making it more accessible and integrated for all. Our vision is to establish Himlekhaa Ayurveda as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with holistic health, well-being, and authentic Ayurvedic practices in Assam and beyond.', 'No- 11Near, Balaji Temple, Mr.Budhu Majhy complex, Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.299Z', '2025-11-30T04:15:26.000Z'),
