(1021, 'Ayushmaan', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Ayushmaan, strategically situated at 5QCH+75F, RG Baruah Rd, Guwahati, stands as a burgeoning hub dedicated to holistic well-being and traditional healthcare solutions within the vibrant Assam business ecosystem. More than just a business, Ayushmaan is committed to revitalizing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and integrating it with modern wellness practices to serve the unique needs of the local community. The company aims to bridge the gap between traditional healing methods and contemporary lifestyles, providing accessible, authentic, and effective healthcare options.

