Looking ahead, Ayushmaan envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market and beyond. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, potentially incorporating complementary therapies such as yoga and meditation. Ayushmaan is also exploring opportunities to partner with local farmers and producers to source ingredients sustainably, supporting the local economy and ensuring the quality and authenticity of its products. Furthermore, the business plans to leverage digital technologies to reach a wider audience, offering online consultations, educational resources, and e-commerce options. The long-term vision for Ayushmaan is to establish itself as a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region, promoting holistic well-being and contributing to the overall health and vitality of the community. The business is committed to upholding the principles of Ayurveda, providing authentic and effective healthcare options, and empowering individuals to live healthier, more balanced lives. Ayushmaan aims to become synonymous with quality, authenticity, and personalized care in the realm of traditional healthcare.', '5QCH+75F, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '073991 10646', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.299Z', '2025-11-30T04:20:33.000Z'),
(1022, 'My recharge Ayurbeda Tushar Baruah', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p><strong>My recharge Ayurbeda Tushar Baruah: Nurturing Wellness the Ayurvedic Way in Assam</strong></p>

