<br>
<br>

<p>Maa Rukmini Agencies places a high premium on delivering exceptional customer experiences. The agency understands that building strong, long-lasting relationships is crucial for sustained success. The approach to customer service is characterized by responsiveness, transparency, and a genuine commitment to meeting the individual needs of each client. Rather than adopting a one-size-fits-all approach, the agency invests time in understanding the specific challenges and opportunities faced by its clients, tailoring its services to provide customized solutions. This commitment to personalized service extends to both suppliers and retailers, fostering a collaborative environment where mutual success is prioritized. The agency''s connection with the local community is strengthened by its physical presence alongside the well-respected Navjeewan Ayurvedic Center. This association not only provides visibility but also reinforces the agency''s commitment to contributing to the well-being and prosperity of the region. By actively participating in local events and initiatives, Maa Rukmini Agencies aims to become an integral part of the community fabric, fostering trust and goodwill among its clientele.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Maa Rukmini Agencies is one of sustained growth and expanded impact within the Assam business landscape. The agency aims to become a leading distribution and agency partner for businesses operating in the region, known for its reliability, integrity, and commitment to customer success. Future plans include expanding the product portfolio to encompass a wider range of essential goods and services, catering to the evolving needs of the local market. This may involve forging strategic partnerships with new suppliers and manufacturers, both within and outside the region. Furthermore, the agency intends to leverage technology to streamline its operations, improve efficiency, and enhance the customer experience. This may include implementing online ordering platforms, developing mobile applications for order tracking and inventory management, and utilizing data analytics to gain insights into market trends and customer preferences. Long-term goals involve establishing a strong brand reputation as a trusted and reliable partner, contributing to the economic development of Assam, and creating opportunities for local businesses to thrive. By focusing on innovation, collaboration, and a deep understanding of the local market, Maa Rukmini Agencies is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a significant player in the region’s business ecosystem.</p>', 'C/O-Navjeewan Ayurbedic Center, below SBI Kalipur branch', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 53865', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:35:21.000Z'),
(1035, 'Ayushman Herbo Care (SRI SRI TATTVA products available)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, 'Ayushman Herbo Care (SRI SRI TATTVA products available) is a dedicated wellness retailer situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically at the bustling Danish Market, A. K. Deb Road, directly opposite the renowned Kamakhya Sweets. More than just a store, Ayushman Herbo Care is a portal to holistic well-being, offering a curated selection of authentic SRI SRI TATTVA products designed to promote health, vitality, and balance. In a region steeped in traditional medicine and a growing awareness of natural health solutions, Ayushman Herbo Care serves as a trusted source for individuals seeking genuine and effective Ayurvedic remedies. We are committed to providing access to high-quality products that seamlessly integrate ancient wisdom with modern lifestyles.

<br> <br>

At the core of Ayushman Herbo Care''s offerings lies a comprehensive range of SRI SRI TATTVA products. This includes a wide array of Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, personal care items, and nutritious food products. From immunity-boosting formulations like Chyawanprash and Giloy tablets to calming herbal teas and natural skin care solutions, the selection caters to a diverse range of health needs. A key differentiator for Ayushman Herbo Care is our focus on authentic SRI SRI TATTVA products. SRI SRI TATTVA is known for its rigorous quality control measures, ethical sourcing practices, and commitment to preserving the integrity of Ayurvedic formulations. This assures our customers that they are receiving products that are not only effective but also safe and trustworthy. Recognizing the specific health challenges and lifestyle preferences of the local community, we also stock products designed to address common ailments such as digestive issues, stress, and respiratory problems prevalent in the region. By providing a curated selection of readily available and reliable herbal solutions, Ayushman Herbo Care empowers individuals to proactively manage their health and well-being.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Ayushman Herbo Care. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel comfortable exploring the world of Ayurveda. Our knowledgeable staff is trained to provide personalized guidance, answering questions about products, offering recommendations based on individual needs, and educating customers about the principles of Ayurvedic living. We understand that many people may be new to Ayurveda, so we take the time to explain the benefits of different herbs and formulations in a clear and accessible manner. Beyond simply selling products, Ayushman Herbo Care aims to build lasting relationships with our customers. We regularly host in-store events and workshops on topics such as healthy eating, stress management, and Ayurvedic self-care practices. By fostering a sense of community and providing valuable educational resources, we strive to empower our customers to make informed choices about their health. Our location, directly opposite Kamakhya Sweets, a well-known landmark, further enhances our accessibility and integration within the local community. We view ourselves not just as a retailer, but as a partner in our customers'' journey towards optimal health and wellness.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Ayushman Herbo Care envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic solutions in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our product offerings to include a wider range of SRI SRI TATTVA products, catering to the evolving health needs of our customers. Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our online presence, allowing customers to conveniently access our products and services from the comfort of their homes. A key focus will be on developing educational content and resources to further promote awareness about Ayurveda and its benefits. We aspire to collaborate with local healthcare professionals and wellness practitioners to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. Ultimately, Ayushman Herbo Care''s long-term goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health through the power of Ayurveda, fostering a healthier and more vibrant community in Assam and contributing to the growing global movement towards natural and holistic wellness. We are committed to remaining a trusted and reliable source for authentic SRI SRI TATTVA products, consistently upholding the highest standards of quality, integrity, and customer service.', 'Danish Market, A. K, Deb Road, opposite to Kamakhya Sweets', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097747 60961', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:35:26.000Z'),
(1036, 'Rejuve Aesthetics : Aesthetic clinic | Chemical Peel | Laser Hair Removal | Hydra Facial Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Rejuve Aesthetics stands as a premier aesthetic clinic in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing advanced and personalized skincare solutions. Positioned at a convenient location in the heart of the city, Rejuve Aesthetics addresses the growing demand for sophisticated and effective aesthetic treatments within the local community. The clinic distinguishes itself by offering a comprehensive range of services, including expertly administered chemical peels, state-of-the-art laser hair removal, and rejuvenating HydraFacial treatments, all delivered in a comfortable and professional environment. Recognizing the unique needs of its clientele, Rejuve Aesthetics blends cutting-edge technology with a deep understanding of individual skin types and concerns, making it a trusted destination for enhancing natural beauty and promoting skin health in the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of Rejuve Aesthetics'' service offerings are three key treatments: Chemical Peels, Laser Hair Removal, and HydraFacial. The Chemical Peel services are tailored to address various skin concerns, from acne and hyperpigmentation to fine lines and wrinkles. Using a range of peel formulations, skilled aestheticians customize treatments to suit individual skin types and desired outcomes. Laser Hair Removal utilizes advanced laser technology to provide a safe and effective solution for long-term hair reduction. This service offers a convenient and less invasive alternative to traditional hair removal methods, catering to the demand for permanent hair reduction solutions. HydraFacial treatments offer a multi-step approach to cleansing, exfoliating, extracting, hydrating, and protecting the skin. This non-invasive procedure delivers immediate and visible results, leaving the skin refreshed, radiant, and deeply hydrated. These services are carefully selected and meticulously executed to meet the specific needs and preferences of the local market, ensuring that clients receive the most effective and appropriate treatments for their skin concerns. Rejuve Aesthetics distinguishes itself by employing highly trained and experienced professionals who are committed to providing the highest quality of care using industry-leading technologies.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Rejuve Aesthetics prioritizes customer satisfaction and strives to create a positive and welcoming experience for every client. From the initial consultation to the completion of treatment, the clinic''s staff is dedicated to providing personalized attention and guidance. Each client receives a thorough skin assessment to determine the most suitable treatment plan, ensuring that individual needs and expectations are met. The clinic fosters a relaxing and comfortable atmosphere, designed to put clients at ease and enhance their overall experience. Recognizing the importance of building strong relationships with the local community, Rejuve Aesthetics actively participates in local events and initiatives, promoting skin health awareness and providing valuable information on skincare best practices. The clinic also leverages social media and other digital platforms to engage with its audience, share informative content, and foster a sense of community among its clients. Customer feedback is highly valued and used to continuously improve services and ensure that Rejuve Aesthetics remains a trusted and respected provider of aesthetic treatments in Guwahati.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking towards the future, Rejuve Aesthetics envisions becoming the leading aesthetic clinic in Guwahati and the surrounding region. The clinic plans to expand its range of services to include advanced skincare treatments and innovative technologies, staying at the forefront of the aesthetic industry. Future plans involve investing in further training and education for the staff, ensuring that they remain knowledgeable and skilled in the latest techniques and procedures. Rejuve Aesthetics also aims to expand its physical presence, potentially opening additional locations to better serve a wider client base. By continuously striving for excellence and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Rejuve Aesthetics is committed to providing exceptional aesthetic services and empowering individuals to feel confident and beautiful in their own skin. The long-term goal is to establish Rejuve Aesthetics as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and personalized care in the aesthetic industry.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080116 11002', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:35:31.000Z'),
(1037, 'Patanjali Chikitsalay', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Patanjali Chikitsalay, strategically located on the 1st floor, No 191, Road, opposite the MLA Hostel in Assam, serves as a vital center for holistic health and well-being within the local community. Distinguishing itself through its commitment to traditional Ayurvedic principles and the integration of Patanjali''s extensive range of products, the Chikitsalay offers a unique approach to healthcare that resonates deeply with the cultural values and preferences of the Assamese people. It stands as a beacon of natural and preventative healthcare, addressing the growing demand for alternative and complementary medicine within the region. This business is more than just a retail outlet; it is a health and wellness hub fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation of Ayurveda.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Patanjali Chikitsalay''s offerings lie personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced and knowledgeable practitioners. These consultations are designed to identify individual <i>prakriti</i> (body constitution) and imbalances (<i>vikriti</i>), paving the way for tailored treatment plans. These plans often incorporate a combination of herbal remedies, dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and yoga practices. The Chikitsalay provides access to a comprehensive range of Patanjali products, including herbal supplements, Ayurvedic medicines, personal care items, and food products. A key differentiator is the emphasis on education and guidance. Staff are trained to provide detailed information about the benefits and appropriate usage of each product, ensuring customers can make informed decisions about their health and well-being. This focus on personalized care and readily available product knowledge distinguishes Patanjali Chikitsalay from conventional pharmacies and general stores, establishing it as a trusted resource for Ayurvedic solutions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience at Patanjali Chikitsalay is paramount. The team fosters a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring natural treatment options. A patient-centric approach emphasizes building long-term relationships based on trust and understanding. This involves active listening, empathy, and a genuine commitment to helping individuals achieve their health goals. What sets this Chikitsalay apart is its active engagement with the local community. This often includes organizing health awareness camps, workshops on yoga and meditation, and educational sessions on Ayurvedic principles. By actively participating in community events and fostering relationships with local organizations, Patanjali Chikitsalay strengthens its connection with the people of Assam and reinforces its role as a reliable source of holistic health information and resources. This proactive approach goes beyond mere transactions; it cultivates a sense of shared well-being and community ownership.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Patanjali Chikitsalay is one of sustainable growth and expanded impact. The business aims to enhance its offerings by incorporating advanced diagnostic techniques rooted in Ayurveda, potentially including pulse diagnosis (<i>Nadi Pariksha</i>) and tongue analysis. There is potential to expand the range of services to include specialized therapies like Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation) in a dedicated and appropriately equipped space, although this would be subject to careful planning and resource allocation. Furthermore, the Chikitsalay plans to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and product information. Collaborations with local healthcare providers and organizations are also envisioned to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices, contributing to a more holistic and integrated approach to health management. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Patanjali Chikitsalay as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, empowering individuals to take control of their health and well-being through natural and time-tested methods. The aim is to create a model Chikitsalay that can be replicated across the region, further promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and contributing to a healthier society.</p>', '1st floor, No 191, Road, opposite Mla Hostel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '0373 232 8191', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:40:09.000Z'),
(1038, 'BALARAM PILES CLINIC', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>BALARAM PILES CLINIC is a dedicated healthcare provider located in Assam, specializing in the diagnosis and treatment of hemorrhoids (piles) and other anorectal conditions. Understanding the sensitive nature of these ailments and the often-stigmatized approach to seeking treatment, the clinic has established itself as a trusted and compassionate center for comprehensive care. The clinic distinguishes itself through a patient-centric philosophy, emphasizing personalized treatment plans tailored to each individual''s specific needs and medical history. By combining modern medical advancements with a culturally sensitive approach, BALARAM PILES CLINIC addresses a significant healthcare need within the Assam community, promoting well-being and restoring quality of life for its patients.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of BALARAM PILES CLINIC lies its core offering: a comprehensive suite of services dedicated to the management of piles and related conditions. These services encompass a wide range, starting with thorough and discrete diagnostic assessments. These assessments may involve physical examinations, anoscopy, and sigmoidoscopy, ensuring accurate identification and staging of the condition. Based on the diagnosis, the clinic offers both non-surgical and surgical treatment options. Non-surgical treatments include lifestyle modifications, dietary recommendations, topical creams, and minimally invasive procedures such as sclerotherapy and rubber band ligation. When surgery is deemed necessary, the clinic utilizes advanced techniques to minimize discomfort, speed up recovery, and reduce the risk of recurrence. The clinic’s unique selling point is its commitment to offering a complete spectrum of treatment options, ensuring patients receive the most appropriate and effective care tailored to their individual circumstances. This comprehensive approach is crucial in a region where access to specialized medical care can be limited, offering a vital service that addresses a prevalent health concern within the local population.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>BALARAM PILES CLINIC places paramount importance on the patient experience. From the moment a patient contacts the clinic, they are met with empathy, respect, and discretion. The clinic environment is designed to be comfortable and reassuring, fostering a sense of trust and openness. Medical professionals at BALARAM PILES CLINIC prioritize clear and concise communication, ensuring patients fully understand their condition, treatment options, and expected outcomes. Emphasis is placed on answering all questions thoroughly and addressing any anxieties or concerns patients may have. Beyond the immediate treatment, the clinic provides ongoing support and guidance, including post-operative care and lifestyle recommendations to prevent recurrence. The clinic fosters strong connections with the local community through educational initiatives and awareness programs about piles and related health issues. By actively engaging with the community and fostering a culture of open dialogue, BALARAM PILES CLINIC builds trust and reinforces its commitment to the well-being of the people it serves.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, BALARAM PILES CLINIC envisions becoming the leading center for anorectal care in Assam. The clinic is actively exploring opportunities to expand its services and reach, potentially through establishing satellite clinics in underserved areas and partnering with local healthcare providers to enhance accessibility. Furthermore, the clinic is committed to staying at the forefront of medical advancements, continuously updating its treatment protocols and incorporating innovative technologies to improve patient outcomes. Investing in staff training and professional development is also a key priority, ensuring the clinic maintains a high standard of expertise and remains equipped to address the evolving healthcare needs of the community. Long-term goals include establishing a research component to contribute to the understanding and treatment of piles in the context of the local population, and ultimately, reducing the burden of this condition in the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>BALARAM PILES CLINIC is not just a healthcare provider; it is a vital community resource dedicated to providing compassionate and comprehensive care for a sensitive and often overlooked health issue. Through its commitment to patient-centric service, innovative treatment options, and community engagement, the clinic plays a significant role in promoting the health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084866 88424', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:40:16.000Z'),
(1039, 'Patanjali Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>Patanjali Ayurvedic, nestled at the heart of Assam (4RMG+77H), stands as a beacon of traditional wellness, bringing the time-tested wisdom of Ayurveda to the local community. More than just a retail outlet, it''s a sanctuary where ancient healing practices meet contemporary needs. In a region steeped in rich cultural heritage and a growing awareness of holistic health, Patanjali Ayurvedic fills a crucial gap, offering authentic Ayurvedic products and guidance that promote well-being and balance. Its presence significantly contributes to the local business landscape by championing sustainable, natural alternatives and fostering a deeper appreciation for India''s ancient healing traditions. The business is deeply rooted in the principles of Patanjali, a name synonymous with quality and purity in the Ayurvedic world.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Patanjali Ayurvedic provides a wide spectrum of Ayurvedic products, carefully formulated and sourced using traditional methods and high-quality ingredients. The product range encompasses everything from herbal medicines and dietary supplements to personal care items like shampoos, soaps, and skincare solutions. A significant portion of the offerings cater to specific health concerns prevalent in the region, such as digestive issues, joint pain, and respiratory ailments. These products are meticulously crafted to address these needs effectively and naturally. A key unique selling point lies in the authenticity and purity of the ingredients, many of which are sourced directly from local farms and ethically harvested. This commitment to quality ensures that customers receive genuine Ayurvedic solutions that are both safe and effective. Furthermore, the store provides personalized consultations, offering guidance from experienced practitioners who can recommend suitable products and lifestyle modifications based on individual needs and health conditions. This emphasis on personalized care distinguishes Patanjali Ayurvedic from standard retail outlets, positioning it as a trusted partner in the pursuit of holistic wellness for the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Patanjali Ayurvedic. The approach to customer service is rooted in the Ayurvedic philosophy of "Atithi Devo Bhava" – treating guests as God. Every customer is greeted with warmth and respect, fostering a welcoming and supportive environment. The staff is trained not only on product knowledge but also on the basic principles of Ayurveda, enabling them to provide informed guidance and address customer concerns effectively. What truly sets Patanjali Ayurvedic apart is its commitment to building genuine relationships with customers. This goes beyond simply selling products; it involves educating the community about the benefits of Ayurveda, organizing workshops on healthy living, and participating in local events to promote wellness. The store actively seeks feedback from customers, using it to continuously improve its offerings and services. By actively engaging with the local community and prioritizing customer well-being, Patanjali Ayurvedic has cultivated a strong reputation as a trusted source of authentic Ayurvedic solutions and a valuable contributor to the region''s health and wellness ecosystem.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Patanjali Ayurvedic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic wellness in Assam. This involves expanding its product range to include a wider variety of specialized Ayurvedic formulations and therapies. Future plans also include establishing a dedicated wellness center, offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments such as Panchakarma, Abhyanga, and Shirodhara, under the guidance of qualified Ayurvedic doctors and therapists. Another key focus is on strengthening partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to promote sustainable sourcing practices and support the local economy. The long-term goal is to not only provide access to high-quality Ayurvedic products and services but also to empower the community with the knowledge and tools to lead healthier, more balanced lives. By staying true to its core values of authenticity, quality, and customer-centricity, Patanjali Ayurvedic is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare and wellness in Assam, while remaining deeply connected to its local roots and contributing to the prosperity of the region.</p>', '4RMG+77H', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:40:22.000Z'),
(1040, 'DIGI AYUR CARE', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>DIGI AYUR CARE, situated on Nabagraha Road, is a modern healthcare provider seamlessly integrating traditional Ayurvedic principles with cutting-edge digital technology to offer accessible, personalized, and preventative healthcare solutions to the residents of Guwahati and the wider Assam region. More than just a clinic, DIGI AYUR CARE is envisioned as a wellness hub dedicated to promoting holistic well-being and empowering individuals to take control of their health journey. We aim to bridge the gap between ancient wisdom and contemporary convenience, making Ayurveda relevant and accessible to a digitally connected population.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core offerings revolve around a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and a carefully curated range of Ayurvedic products. We offer in-person consultations at our Nabagraha Road clinic, providing a comfortable and welcoming environment where experienced Ayurvedic practitioners assess each individual''s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to develop bespoke treatment strategies. These strategies often encompass dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies. Furthermore, recognizing the demands of modern life, we leverage digital platforms to offer online consultations and remote monitoring, ensuring accessibility for individuals across geographical boundaries and busy schedules. This hybrid approach ensures that individuals can access quality Ayurvedic care regardless of their location or lifestyle.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>A key differentiator for DIGI AYUR CARE is our commitment to evidence-based Ayurveda. While deeply rooted in traditional practices, we actively integrate modern diagnostic tools and research methodologies to validate and refine our treatment protocols. This approach not only enhances the efficacy of our therapies but also fosters greater trust and acceptance among a population increasingly accustomed to data-driven healthcare solutions. Our range of Ayurvedic products, sourced from reputable suppliers and manufactured under strict quality control standards, complements our consultations and treatments. We prioritize authentic, sustainably sourced ingredients and offer a diverse selection of herbal supplements, skincare products, and wellness essentials tailored to meet the specific needs of our clients. We cater to the common ailments of the region with formulations specific to the climate, diet and lifestyle of the people of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is at the heart of the DIGI AYUR CARE philosophy. We strive to create a warm, empathetic, and empowering environment where individuals feel heard, understood, and supported throughout their wellness journey. Our team is trained to provide personalized attention, answer questions thoroughly, and educate clients about the principles of Ayurveda. We believe that informed individuals are better equipped to make proactive choices that support their health and well-being. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness about Ayurvedic principles and preventative healthcare strategies. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to offer corporate wellness programs, bringing the benefits of Ayurveda to a wider audience. DIGI AYUR CARE is deeply invested in building strong relationships within the community and fostering a culture of holistic well-being.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking towards the future, DIGI AYUR CARE envisions expanding its services to become a leading integrated healthcare provider in Assam. Our plans include incorporating complementary therapies such as yoga and meditation into our wellness programs, further enhancing our holistic approach to healthcare. We are also exploring opportunities to collaborate with other healthcare professionals, including allopathic doctors, to create a truly integrated healthcare system that combines the best of both worlds. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to personalize the customer experience even further. We plan to develop a mobile app that allows clients to track their progress, access personalized recommendations, and connect with our team remotely. Data analytics will be used to identify emerging health trends and tailor our services to meet the evolving needs of the community. Our long-term goal is to establish DIGI AYUR CARE as a trusted brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and holistic well-being, empowering individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Ultimately, DIGI AYUR CARE aims to be more than just a business; it aims to be a catalyst for positive change in the health and wellness landscape of Assam, bringing the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda to the forefront of modern healthcare.</p>', 'Nabagraha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094350 47103', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:40:28.000Z'),
(1041, 'GUWAHATI WELLNESS CENTRE - One stop ayurvedic solution', 'Ayurvedic Centers', NULL, '<p>GUWAHATI WELLNESS CENTRE – One Stop Ayurvedic Solution, located in the heart of the city at GR Kalita Commercial Complex, GS Rd, stands as a beacon of traditional healing amidst the bustling commercial landscape of Guwahati. More than just a retail outlet or clinic, Guwahati Wellness Centre is a comprehensive Ayurvedic ecosystem dedicated to providing authentic and personalized wellness solutions rooted in ancient Indian wisdom. We aim to bridge the gap between traditional Ayurvedic practices and the modern lifestyle, offering accessible and effective remedies for a wide range of health concerns. Our presence in Guwahati addresses the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare options within Assam, complementing the existing allopathic medical facilities with time-tested Ayurvedic principles. We are committed to promoting preventative healthcare and empowering individuals to take control of their well-being through natural and sustainable methods.
<br> <br>
Our unique significance in the local business landscape stems from our unwavering commitment to authenticity and quality. We source our herbs and ingredients from reputable suppliers, prioritizing locally grown and sustainably harvested resources whenever possible. This not only supports the local economy but also ensures the potency and efficacy of our products and treatments. We stand apart by offering a personalized approach to wellness, tailoring our services to meet the specific needs and constitution (Prakriti) of each individual. This personalized approach is crucial in a region with diverse health concerns and varying cultural practices.
<br> <br>
Guwahati Wellness Centre offers a wide array of Ayurvedic services and products designed to address a spectrum of health and wellness needs. Our core offerings include:

*   <b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Experienced and qualified Ayurvedic doctors conduct thorough consultations to assess individual health conditions, identify imbalances, and develop personalized treatment plans. These consultations delve beyond symptomatic relief, focusing on identifying the root cause of ailments and promoting long-term well-being.

*   <b>Panchakarma Therapies:</b> We provide authentic Panchakarma treatments, a detoxification and rejuvenation therapy, administered under the supervision of skilled therapists. These therapies are carefully tailored to individual needs and are essential for restoring balance and vitality. Specific treatments include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil stream on forehead), and Basti (enema therapy).

*   <b>Ayurvedic Medicines and Herbal Formulations:</b> We offer a wide range of classical Ayurvedic medicines, herbal formulations, and single herbs, carefully selected for their quality and efficacy. These products are sourced from trusted manufacturers and are prepared according to traditional Ayurvedic principles. We also provide customized herbal blends based on individual needs and consultations.

*   <b>Wellness Products:</b> Our selection of wellness products includes Ayurvedic teas, herbal supplements, skincare products, and lifestyle items designed to promote overall health and well-being. These products are carefully curated to ensure they align with Ayurvedic principles and are free from harmful chemicals and additives.

Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing authentic, personalized, and high-quality Ayurvedic solutions. We differentiate ourselves from other wellness providers by emphasizing preventative healthcare and empowering individuals to take proactive steps to improve their health. Our services are specifically designed to address the prevalent health concerns in the local market, such as digestive issues, stress-related ailments, and lifestyle disorders.
<br> <br>
At Guwahati Wellness Centre, we prioritize creating a welcoming and supportive environment for our customers. Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, understanding, and a genuine desire to help individuals achieve their wellness goals. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention, ongoing support, and educational resources. We actively listen to our customers'' concerns, address their questions, and provide guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives.

We connect with the local community through various initiatives, including organizing wellness workshops, seminars, and community outreach programs. These events aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda, promote healthy lifestyle choices, and empower individuals to take control of their health. We also collaborate with local organizations and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. Our commitment to community engagement extends to supporting local farmers and artisans who produce Ayurvedic herbs and products.
<br> <br>
Looking ahead, Guwahati Wellness Centre envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic solutions in Assam and the Northeast region. Our future plans include expanding our range of services, offering specialized Ayurvedic treatments for specific health conditions, and establishing a dedicated Ayurvedic training center to nurture the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. We also plan to enhance our online presence, providing access to Ayurvedic information, online consultations, and a wider range of products to customers across the region.

We are committed to fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation of Ayurveda among the local population. Our long-term goals include integrating Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices, promoting the use of natural and sustainable healthcare solutions, and empowering individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. We believe that by staying true to our core values of authenticity, quality, and personalized care, Guwahati Wellness Centre can make a significant contribution to the health and well-being of the community.
</p>', 'GR Kalita Commercial Complex, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:40:36.000Z'),
(1042, 'Ginger Guwahati', 'Resorts', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Ginger Guwahati: A Taste of Innovation in Assam''s Hospitality Scene</h1>

<p>Ginger Guwahati stands as a modern beacon of hospitality in the heart of Assam''s bustling capital. Beyond simply offering accommodation, Ginger Guwahati strives to be a catalyst for comfortable, convenient, and connected experiences, catering to both business and leisure travelers alike. Located strategically in Guwahati, the hotel serves as an ideal base for exploring the city''s rich cultural heritage and accessing its growing commercial centers. In a region traditionally known for its personalized, albeit sometimes less standardized, service, Ginger Guwahati introduces a new level of professionalism, efficiency, and consistency, addressing a crucial need in the evolving Assam business landscape. The hotel aims to be a preferred choice for the discerning traveler seeking a seamless blend of modern amenities and genuine Assamese hospitality.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>At its core, Ginger Guwahati provides well-appointed, contemporary rooms designed for optimal comfort and productivity. These rooms feature essential amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi, comfortable bedding, efficient climate control, and functional workspaces. Understanding the needs of modern travelers, the hotel offers a range of room categories to cater to varying budgets and requirements. Beyond accommodation, Ginger Guwahati provides a suite of services including a fitness center, meeting rooms equipped with audio-visual technology, and a reliable laundry service. A particular focus is placed on providing hassle-free check-in and check-out processes, minimizing downtime and maximizing convenience for guests. Furthermore, the on-site restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and popular international dishes, ensuring that guests have access to quality dining options throughout their stay. Ginger Guwahati differentiates itself by offering a predictable and reliable experience, something that is highly valued by business travelers who require consistency. The hotel directly addresses the need for standardized, high-quality accommodation and related services within Guwahati, contributing to the city''s appeal as a destination for both business and leisure.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Uniquely Guwahati</h2>

<p>While adhering to global standards of service, Ginger Guwahati makes a conscious effort to incorporate elements of local Assamese culture and hospitality. This includes showcasing local artwork in the hotel''s public spaces, offering traditional Assamese cuisine on the restaurant menu, and training staff to provide warm and personalized service with a touch of local charm. The hotel partners with local businesses and artisans to source products and services, thereby contributing to the local economy and promoting Assamese craftsmanship. Furthermore, Ginger Guwahati actively participates in community initiatives, demonstrating a commitment to social responsibility and fostering positive relationships with the local community. This balance of global standards and local engagement allows Ginger Guwahati to offer a unique and authentic experience that resonates with both domestic and international guests. The hotel strives to be more than just a place to stay; it aims to be a gateway to experiencing the rich culture and heritage of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: The Ginger Guwahati Promise</h2>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Ginger Guwahati. The hotel operates with a strong emphasis on proactive service and prompt resolution of any guest concerns. A dedicated team of customer service professionals is available 24/7 to assist guests with their needs. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the hotel''s services and amenities. The hotel leverages technology to enhance the guest experience, including online booking platforms, digital check-in/check-out options, and mobile apps for accessing hotel information and services. What truly sets Ginger Guwahati apart is its commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all guests. The staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and provide personalized recommendations to enhance their stay. Furthermore, the hotel actively engages with the local community through partnerships and sponsorships, demonstrating a commitment to giving back and fostering positive relationships. This holistic approach to customer service ensures that guests feel valued, comfortable, and connected during their stay at Ginger Guwahati. The aim is to build lasting relationships with guests and establish Ginger Guwahati as their preferred choice for accommodation in Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons</h2>

<p>Looking ahead, Ginger Guwahati envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam region and beyond. The hotel plans to explore opportunities to introduce new services and amenities that cater to the evolving needs of its guests. This includes expanding its meeting and event facilities, enhancing its dining options, and incorporating sustainable practices into its operations. Furthermore, Ginger Guwahati aims to leverage technology to further personalize the guest experience and streamline its operations. The long-term goal is to establish Ginger Guwahati as a leading hospitality brand in the Northeast India, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction. By continuously adapting to the changing market dynamics and investing in its people and infrastructure, Ginger Guwahati is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the growth of the tourism and hospitality industry in Assam.</p>
</article>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:45:09.000Z'),
(1043, 'Vivanta Guwahati', 'Resorts', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Vivanta Guwahati: A Gateway to Bespoke Business Solutions in Assam</h1>

<p>Vivanta Guwahati stands as a dynamic and multifaceted business entity, strategically positioned in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a service provider, Vivanta Guwahati acts as a pivotal partner for businesses navigating the unique opportunities and challenges of the Northeast Indian market. The company distinguishes itself through a commitment to providing customized solutions, a deep understanding of the local business ecosystem, and a forward-thinking approach to fostering sustainable growth within the region. Recognizing the evolving needs of businesses operating in Assam, Vivanta Guwahati has established itself as a reliable resource, bridging the gap between global best practices and local realities. Its significance lies in its ability to empower local entrepreneurs and attract external investment, contributing significantly to the economic vibrancy of the state.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Tailored Solutions for Regional Success</h2>

<p>Vivanta Guwahati offers a diverse portfolio of services designed to address the specific needs of businesses across various sectors. These core offerings are broadly categorized into strategic consulting, market entry support, and operational optimization. The strategic consulting arm provides in-depth market analysis, competitive landscape assessments, and tailored business plans that enable clients to make informed decisions and chart a course for sustainable growth. Recognizing the complexities of entering the Assam market, Vivanta Guwahati offers comprehensive market entry support, including regulatory guidance, partner identification, and logistical assistance. This ensures a smooth and efficient launch for businesses seeking to establish a presence in the region. Finally, operational optimization services focus on enhancing efficiency, streamlining processes, and improving overall performance through technology integration, process automation, and talent development. A unique selling point lies in the company''s ability to integrate cultural sensitivity into its solutions, ensuring that business strategies are not only effective but also aligned with the local values and customs. These services directly address the needs of the local market by providing businesses with the tools and knowledge necessary to thrive in a competitive environment, fostering innovation, and creating opportunities for economic advancement.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships and Fostering Community</h2>

<p>At Vivanta Guwahati, customer experience is paramount. The company operates on a relationship-centric model, prioritizing open communication, responsiveness, and personalized attention. A dedicated account manager is assigned to each client, serving as a single point of contact and ensuring seamless coordination across all service lines. What truly sets Vivanta Guwahati apart is its commitment to fostering a sense of community. The company actively participates in local business events, sponsors initiatives that support entrepreneurship, and collaborates with educational institutions to develop talent within the region. This proactive engagement fosters goodwill, builds trust, and positions Vivanta Guwahati as a valued member of the local business community. The company actively solicits feedback from its clients through surveys, interviews, and ongoing communication, using these insights to continuously improve its services and enhance the customer experience. This dedication to customer satisfaction has resulted in strong client loyalty and a reputation for excellence within the industry. </p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Sustainable Development</h2>

<p>Vivanta Guwahati envisions a future where it serves as a catalyst for economic growth and sustainable development in Assam. The company plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized solutions tailored to emerging industries such as renewable energy, sustainable tourism, and organic agriculture. Recognizing the importance of technology in driving innovation, Vivanta Guwahati is investing in research and development to create cutting-edge solutions that leverage artificial intelligence, data analytics, and other advanced technologies. A key element of the company''s future vision is to expand its geographic reach within the Northeast region, establishing a network of offices and partnerships that enable it to serve a wider range of clients. Vivanta Guwahati is also committed to fostering a culture of innovation and entrepreneurship within the region by launching an incubator program that provides mentorship, funding, and resources to aspiring entrepreneurs. By empowering local talent and supporting the growth of innovative businesses, Vivanta Guwahati aims to contribute to the long-term prosperity of Assam and the surrounding region.</p>
</article>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:45:14.000Z'),
(1044, 'Brahmaputra Jungle Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Brahmaputra Jungle Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility and Adventure in Guwahati</p>

<p>Brahmaputra Jungle Resort offers an unparalleled escape into the heart of Assam''s natural beauty, providing a unique blend of luxurious comfort and immersive jungle experiences. Strategically located near Guwahati, yet nestled away from the city''s hustle, the resort serves as a gateway to explore the region''s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage. In a rapidly growing Assam tourism sector, Brahmaputra Jungle Resort distinguishes itself by prioritizing sustainable tourism practices, employing local communities, and offering authentic cultural immersion, setting a new standard for responsible travel within the region. The resort directly contributes to the local economy by sourcing produce and services from nearby villages, fostering a mutually beneficial relationship with the indigenous population and preserving their traditional way of life. It offers an alternative to mass tourism, attracting discerning travelers seeking enriching and ecologically sensitive experiences.</p>

<p>Our Core Services and Products</p>

<p>Brahmaputra Jungle Resort provides a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests. At its heart lies luxurious accommodation, with elegantly appointed cottages and suites that seamlessly blend modern amenities with rustic charm. Each room is designed to provide panoramic views of the surrounding jungle, allowing guests to connect with nature from the comfort of their private sanctuary. The resort offers a variety of curated experiences, including guided jungle treks led by experienced local naturalists, offering insights into the region''s flora and fauna. Birdwatching tours, a particularly popular activity, showcase Assam''s diverse avian population, attracting ornithologists and nature enthusiasts alike. River cruises on the Brahmaputra provide stunning views of the landscape and offer opportunities to spot river dolphins, a truly unique experience. We also offer cultural programs, showcasing traditional Assamese music, dance, and crafts. These programs are designed to provide an authentic glimpse into the local culture, enriching the guest experience beyond typical tourist activities. The resort''s multi-cuisine restaurant serves a delightful array of local Assamese delicacies as well as international dishes, prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing bespoke experiences tailored to individual guest preferences, whether it''s arranging a private bonfire under the stars or organizing a visit to a nearby tea garden. By integrating cultural experiences with luxurious amenities, we provide an experience that is both enriching and rejuvenating.</p>

<p>Customer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection</p>

<p>At Brahmaputra Jungle Resort, customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized experience for every guest, ensuring their needs are met with the utmost care and attention. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional service, anticipating guest needs and going the extra mile to exceed their expectations. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and provided with a dedicated concierge service to assist with any requests or inquiries. We understand the importance of creating a comfortable and relaxing environment, and we are committed to providing a seamless and stress-free experience. Our commitment to the local community sets us apart. We actively engage with neighboring villages, supporting local artisans and businesses, and providing employment opportunities. Guests have the opportunity to interact with local communities through guided tours and cultural experiences, fostering a deeper understanding of the region''s unique heritage. The resort also participates in community development projects, contributing to the welfare and sustainability of the local ecosystem. We host regular events and workshops for local residents, promoting education, healthcare, and environmental awareness. By actively engaging with and supporting the community, we create a positive impact on the region and provide guests with an authentic and meaningful travel experience. We believe in creating a strong sense of connection between our guests, our staff, and the local community, fostering a spirit of mutual respect and understanding.</p>

<p>Future Vision: Sustainable Growth and Enhanced Experiences</p>

<p>Brahmaputra Jungle Resort envisions a future of sustainable growth, expanding our offerings while remaining true to our core values of environmental responsibility and community engagement. We plan to introduce eco-friendly initiatives, such as solar power and rainwater harvesting, to minimize our environmental footprint and promote sustainable practices. We aim to become a model for responsible tourism in the region, inspiring other businesses to adopt similar practices. We plan to expand our range of activities and experiences, introducing new adventure options such as rock climbing and rappelling, as well as expanding our cultural immersion programs. The resort intends to enhance partnerships with local artisans and communities, providing them with opportunities to showcase their products and skills to a wider audience. In the long term, we aspire to establish a research and conservation center dedicated to studying and preserving the biodiversity of the region. This center will conduct research on local flora and fauna, working with local communities to promote sustainable resource management and conservation practices. We also plan to develop educational programs for schools and universities, raising awareness about the importance of biodiversity conservation. By investing in research, education, and community engagement, we aim to contribute to the long-term preservation of Assam''s natural heritage and create a positive impact on the region for generations to come. Our long-term goal is to establish Brahmaputra Jungle Resort as a leading ecotourism destination in Northeast India, known for its commitment to sustainability, cultural preservation, and exceptional guest experiences.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:45:22.000Z'),
(1045, 'Aranya The Merian Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Aranya The Merian Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers an unparalleled escape into tranquility, seamlessly blending modern luxury with the region''s rich cultural heritage. More than just a place to stay, Aranya The Merian Resort is a destination that promises immersive experiences, mindful rejuvenation, and a deep connection with the natural beauty of Northeast India. In a region increasingly sought after for its unique tourism offerings, Aranya The Merian Resort distinguishes itself through a commitment to sustainable practices, exceptional personalized service, and a dedication to showcasing the best of Assamese hospitality. The resort aims to redefine luxury hospitality in Guwahati, setting a new benchmark for quality and guest satisfaction within the local business environment.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing a sanctuary of comfort and relaxation. This is primarily achieved through our exquisitely designed accommodations, encompassing a range of room types from deluxe rooms to expansive suites and private villas. Each space is thoughtfully furnished with locally sourced materials and contemporary amenities, creating a harmonious blend of comfort and authenticity. Beyond accommodation, Aranya The Merian Resort boasts a diverse range of services catering to both leisure and business travelers. These include a state-of-the-art conference center equipped for hosting corporate events and meetings, multiple dining venues offering a diverse culinary journey from traditional Assamese cuisine to international flavors, a rejuvenating spa providing Ayurvedic treatments and wellness programs, and a sprawling outdoor swimming pool and recreational facilities. Our unique selling point lies in our experiential offerings: guided tours to nearby tea gardens and wildlife sanctuaries, cultural performances showcasing Assamese dance and music, and cooking classes focused on regional delicacies. These experiences allow guests to immerse themselves in the local culture, fostering a deeper appreciation for the region''s heritage. By providing high-quality accommodation, diverse amenities, and unique experiences, Aranya The Merian Resort addresses the growing demand for premium tourism and business facilities within Guwahati and the surrounding areas, catering to discerning travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of our operations. We strive to create a personalized and memorable experience for every guest, anticipating their needs and exceeding their expectations. Our approach to customer service is rooted in the principles of genuine Assamese hospitality: warmth, respect, and attentiveness. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with personalized attention and care, ensuring a seamless and comfortable stay. Our dedicated concierge service is available to assist with any requests, from arranging transportation and excursions to providing local insights and recommendations. What sets us apart is our commitment to building genuine connections with our guests and fostering a sense of belonging. We actively engage with the local community by sourcing local produce for our restaurants, partnering with local artisans to showcase their crafts, and supporting community-based tourism initiatives. This allows our guests to not only experience the beauty of Assam but also contribute to its sustainable development. We also host local cultural events and festivals, inviting the community to share in the resort''s vibrant atmosphere and celebrate the region''s rich heritage. By prioritizing personalized service, fostering genuine connections, and actively engaging with the local community, Aranya The Merian Resort aims to create a truly unique and enriching experience for every guest, building lasting relationships and fostering a sense of loyalty.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Aranya The Merian Resort is to solidify its position as the premier luxury destination in Guwahati and a leading advocate for sustainable tourism in Assam. We aim to expand our experiential offerings, introducing new activities and programs that showcase the region''s unique biodiversity and cultural heritage. This includes developing partnerships with local communities to offer authentic and immersive travel experiences, such as village stays and homestays. We also plan to invest in eco-friendly technologies and practices to minimize our environmental footprint and promote sustainable tourism. This includes implementing water conservation measures, reducing energy consumption, and supporting local conservation efforts. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our operations to other locations within Northeast India, bringing our unique brand of luxury hospitality and sustainable tourism to new markets. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in the hospitality industry, known for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and social responsibility. By continuously innovating, embracing sustainability, and expanding our reach, Aranya The Merian Resort aims to contribute to the growth and development of the tourism sector in Assam and the wider Northeast region, while providing unparalleled experiences for our guests and creating positive impacts on the local community.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:45:30.000Z'),
(1046, 'Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa: A Sanctuary of Wellness in Guwahati

Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa offers a tranquil escape within the bustling city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a spa, it''s a holistic wellness destination committed to providing rejuvenating experiences rooted in traditional Assamese hospitality and modern spa therapies. Recognizing the increasing demand for wellness tourism and stress-relieving services in the region, Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa distinguishes itself by offering bespoke wellness programs tailored to the unique needs of its clientele, setting it apart from standard spa offerings and contributing to the growing wellness sector in the Northeast.

<br> <br>

Nestled amidst lush greenery, Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa offers a comprehensive range of services designed to promote physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. Our core services include:

*   **Spa Therapies:** We offer a diverse menu of massage therapies, including traditional Ayurvedic treatments, aromatherapy, deep tissue massages, and specialized local treatments incorporating indigenous herbs and oils. Our skilled therapists are trained to personalize each session to address individual concerns and preferences.

*   **Facial Treatments:** Utilizing premium skincare products and advanced techniques, our facial treatments are designed to revitalize and rejuvenate the skin. We offer a range of options, from classic facials to targeted treatments addressing specific skin concerns like aging, acne, and hyperpigmentation.

*   **Body Treatments:** Indulge in exfoliating scrubs, detoxifying wraps, and hydrating treatments that leave your skin feeling soft, smooth, and renewed. We incorporate natural ingredients and aromatherapy to enhance the therapeutic benefits.

*   **Yoga and Meditation:** Participate in guided yoga and meditation sessions led by experienced instructors. These sessions are designed to promote relaxation, reduce stress, and improve overall well-being. We offer group classes and private sessions to cater to all levels of experience.

*   **Accommodation:** Comfortable and well-appointed rooms are available for guests seeking an extended retreat experience. Each room is designed to provide a peaceful and relaxing environment.

*   **Healthy Cuisine:** Our on-site cafe offers a menu of nutritious and delicious meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We cater to various dietary needs and preferences, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa apart is our commitment to incorporating local Assamese traditions and ingredients into our services. We utilize indigenous herbs and oils in our massage therapies, offer traditional Assamese body wraps, and feature local artwork and crafts throughout the retreat. This provides guests with an authentic and culturally enriching experience that cannot be found elsewhere. We also cater to the specific needs of the local market, offering packages designed for working professionals seeking stress relief, as well as specialized treatments for common ailments in the region.

<br> <br>

At Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa, we prioritize providing exceptional customer service and creating a welcoming and personalized experience for each guest. From the moment you arrive, you will be greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff is dedicated to understanding your needs and ensuring that your experience exceeds your expectations. We actively seek feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings.

<br> <br>

We believe in fostering strong connections with the local community. We partner with local artisans and suppliers to source our products and ingredients, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices. We also host community events and workshops to promote health and wellness awareness. Furthermore, we offer discounted rates and packages for local residents, making our services accessible to a wider audience. We aim to be more than just a spa; we aspire to be a valuable asset to the Guwahati community, contributing to its overall well-being and prosperity.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming the premier wellness destination in Northeast India, attracting both local and international guests. Our future plans include:

*   **Expanding our facilities:** We plan to add new treatment rooms, a larger yoga studio, and a swimming pool to enhance our offerings and accommodate more guests.

*   **Developing new wellness programs:** We are actively researching and developing innovative wellness programs that incorporate cutting-edge therapies and address emerging health trends.

*   **Establishing partnerships with healthcare professionals:** We aim to collaborate with doctors and other healthcare providers to offer integrated wellness solutions that address both physical and mental health.

*   **Expanding our online presence:** We are investing in our website and social media platforms to reach a wider audience and promote our services effectively.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goal is to establish Bougainvillea Retreat & Spa as a leading wellness brand known for its exceptional service, innovative therapies, and commitment to promoting holistic well-being. We are confident that by staying true to our values and continuously striving for excellence, we can achieve this vision and make a positive impact on the lives of our guests and the community we serve. We aim to champion sustainable tourism practices and contribute to the preservation of Assam''s rich cultural heritage while providing a world-class wellness experience.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:45:37.000Z'),
(1047, 'Mayfair Spring Valley Resort, Guwahati', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Mayfair Spring Valley Resort, Guwahati, is a premium hospitality destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil escape from the bustling city life. More than just a resort, it represents a commitment to showcasing the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of the region while providing world-class service and amenities. Situated strategically, it serves as a gateway for exploring the diverse landscapes of Northeast India, catering to both leisure travelers seeking relaxation and corporate clients looking for a sophisticated venue for events and conferences. The resort’s unique position within the local business landscape is defined by its dedication to sustainable practices, promoting local artisans and businesses, and fostering a positive impact on the surrounding community. It aims to be the leading hospitality provider in Guwahati, setting new standards for luxury, comfort, and responsible tourism.

<br> <br>

Mayfair Spring Valley Resort offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a wide array of needs and preferences. At its core, the resort provides luxurious accommodation, featuring elegantly appointed rooms and suites that offer breathtaking views of the surrounding valley. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, ensuring a comfortable and convenient stay for every guest. Beyond accommodation, the resort boasts exceptional dining experiences across multiple restaurants, each offering a unique culinary journey. From authentic Assamese cuisine that showcases local flavors and ingredients to international delicacies prepared by experienced chefs, the resort caters to diverse palates. Furthermore, Mayfair Spring Valley Resort excels in providing state-of-the-art facilities for corporate events, conferences, and weddings. The resort features spacious banquet halls, well-equipped meeting rooms, and dedicated event planning services to ensure the seamless execution of any event. A luxurious spa and wellness center offers a range of rejuvenating treatments, promoting relaxation and well-being. A key differentiator is the emphasis on personalized service, where every guest is treated with utmost care and attention, creating a memorable and tailored experience. The resort actively supports local businesses by sourcing ingredients and crafts locally, adding an authentic Assamese touch to the guest experience. This not only enhances the visitor''s experience but also contributes to the economic growth of the region.

<br> <br>

The resort prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience from the moment a guest arrives until their departure. A dedicated concierge service assists guests with all their needs, from arranging transportation and tours to providing recommendations for local attractions and activities. The staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and provide personalized attention, ensuring a comfortable and stress-free stay. What sets Mayfair Spring Valley Resort apart is its commitment to fostering a sense of community and connection. The resort actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as organizing cultural events and supporting local artisans and businesses. The resort also emphasizes sustainable practices, reducing its environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism. Guests are encouraged to participate in these initiatives, fostering a deeper understanding of the local culture and environment. This community-focused approach extends to the resort''s hiring practices, prioritizing local talent and providing opportunities for career development. The resort also actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and ensure that it is meeting their evolving needs.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Mayfair Spring Valley Resort envisions significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as the leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a prominent destination in Northeast India. Future plans include expanding the resort''s accommodation capacity by adding new rooms and suites, catering to the growing demand for premium hospitality services in the region. The resort also plans to introduce new and innovative services, such as adventure tourism packages that showcase the natural beauty of Assam and its neighboring states. This may include guided treks, wildlife safaris, and river cruises, offering guests unique and unforgettable experiences. Furthermore, the resort aims to enhance its corporate event facilities by incorporating the latest technology and expanding its banquet hall capacity, attracting larger-scale conferences and events. Long-term goals include establishing Mayfair Spring Valley Resort as a sustainable and eco-friendly destination, minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism practices. This includes investing in renewable energy sources, implementing waste management programs, and supporting local conservation efforts. The resort also aims to further strengthen its ties with the local community, creating employment opportunities and supporting local businesses. By continuously innovating and investing in its services and infrastructure, Mayfair Spring Valley Resort is poised to achieve its vision of becoming a world-class hospitality destination that celebrates the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:50:08.000Z'),
(1048, 'Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp, Khanapara', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp, Khanapara, nestled in the picturesque hills overlooking Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a campsite; it''s a sustainable tourism initiative dedicated to providing immersive, nature-based experiences while promoting environmental conservation and supporting local communities. In a region increasingly recognizing the value of ecotourism, Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp distinguishes itself by seamlessly blending comfortable accommodations with authentic cultural immersion and a strong commitment to minimizing its environmental footprint. Our location, strategically positioned near Khanapara, provides convenient access for both local residents seeking a weekend escape and tourists eager to explore the natural beauty of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp, we offer a range of services designed to cater to diverse interests and preferences. Our core offering revolves around comfortable and eco-friendly accommodation options, including well-appointed safari tents and sustainably built cottages that harmonize with the surrounding landscape. These accommodations provide guests with a relaxing and rejuvenating experience without compromising on modern amenities. Beyond lodging, we provide guided nature treks through the lush hills, offering opportunities to discover the rich biodiversity of the region, including diverse flora and fauna. Birdwatching enthusiasts will be particularly delighted by the vibrant avian life. We also curate engaging cultural experiences, such as traditional Assamese cooking classes where guests learn to prepare local delicacies using fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Bonfires with storytelling sessions under the starlit sky offer a unique opportunity to connect with fellow travelers and learn about the local folklore and traditions. Furthermore, we provide specialized packages for corporate team-building events and school excursions, tailored to promote collaboration, leadership skills, and environmental awareness. Our unique selling proposition lies in our unwavering commitment to sustainability, our dedication to providing authentic cultural experiences, and our personalized approach to customer service, ensuring that every guest has a memorable and enriching stay.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp’s philosophy. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests feel like part of the family. Our staff, primarily sourced from local communities, are not only knowledgeable about the region''s ecology and culture but are also passionate about sharing their heritage with visitors. We believe in going the extra mile to anticipate and exceed customer expectations, whether it''s arranging personalized tours, catering to dietary needs, or providing assistance with travel arrangements. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Our connection with the local community is deeply ingrained in our operations. We prioritize sourcing local produce and employing local artisans, contributing to the economic empowerment of the surrounding villages. We also organize regular community outreach programs, such as environmental awareness campaigns and educational workshops, to foster a sense of shared responsibility for protecting the environment. This commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism resonates strongly with our guests, many of whom are increasingly seeking travel experiences that are both enriching and responsible.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp is to become a leading ecotourism destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to sustainability, cultural preservation, and exceptional customer service. We plan to expand our accommodation options while maintaining our eco-friendly principles, incorporating innovative sustainable technologies such as solar power and rainwater harvesting. We envision developing new and exciting activities, such as organic farming workshops and opportunities for guests to participate in local conservation projects. A key aspect of our future strategy is to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, further empowering them through employment opportunities, skill development programs, and support for local businesses. We also intend to enhance our online presence and marketing efforts to reach a wider audience of eco-conscious travelers. Our long-term goal is to create a replicable model for sustainable tourism that can be adopted by other communities in Assam and beyond, contributing to the preservation of natural and cultural heritage while promoting economic development in a responsible and equitable manner. We aim to establish Encamp Hilltop Eco Camp as not just a place to stay, but a catalyst for positive change in the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:50:14.000Z'),
(1049, 'Dichang Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Dichang Resort: A Tranquil Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati

Dichang Resort emerges as a distinctive hospitality destination within Guwahati, Assam, offering a curated experience that blends modern comfort with the region''s rich cultural heritage and natural beauty. Recognizing a demand for refined yet accessible leisure options, Dichang distinguishes itself by providing an immersive escape from the city''s hustle, creating a haven for both local residents seeking weekend retreats and discerning travelers exploring Northeast India. The resort aims to redefine hospitality standards in the area by focusing on personalized service, sustainable practices, and genuine connection with the local community, becoming more than just a place to stay, but a memorable destination in itself.

<br> <br>

At the core of Dichang Resort''s offerings are thoughtfully designed accommodations, ranging from well-appointed rooms to spacious suites, each reflecting a contemporary aesthetic complemented by subtle Assamese influences. Beyond accommodation, the resort boasts a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to diverse needs. These include:

*   **Fine Dining Experiences:** An in-house restaurant serving a delectable array of regional Assamese cuisine alongside international favorites, prepared using locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Special dietary requirements are readily catered for, and private dining options are available for more intimate gatherings.
*   **Event and Conference Facilities:** Well-equipped banquet halls and meeting rooms provide ideal venues for hosting corporate events, weddings, and social celebrations. Dedicated event planning services ensure seamless execution and unforgettable experiences.
*   **Recreational Amenities:** A swimming pool, fitness center, and landscaped gardens offer ample opportunities for relaxation and rejuvenation. Outdoor activities, such as nature walks and birdwatching tours, are also organized to showcase the surrounding natural beauty.
*   **Spa and Wellness Center:** A sanctuary for holistic well-being, offering a range of therapeutic treatments and massages designed to revitalize the body and mind, drawing inspiration from traditional Assamese healing practices.
*   **Cultural Immersion Programs:** Dichang Resort actively promotes Assamese culture through curated experiences such as traditional dance performances, cooking classes featuring local recipes, and art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional artisans.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Dichang Resort apart is its unwavering commitment to creating exceptional and personalized guest experiences. The staff are meticulously trained to anticipate needs and provide warm, attentive service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and cared for. The resort places immense emphasis on building genuine connections with the local community. This is achieved through active participation in local events, sourcing produce and materials from regional suppliers, and employing individuals from nearby villages, contributing to economic empowerment and sustainable development. Further enhancing the experience is the serene ambiance of the resort, thoughtfully landscaped to create a peaceful oasis that contrasts sharply with the bustling city. From personalized welcome amenities to tailored activity recommendations, Dichang Resort strives to exceed expectations and create lasting memories for every guest.

<br> <br>

Dichang Resort envisions a future characterized by sustained growth, innovation, and an unwavering dedication to excellence. Expansion plans include the addition of new accommodation options, incorporating eco-friendly design principles and integrating seamlessly with the surrounding landscape. The resort also plans to enhance its wellness offerings by introducing specialized programs focused on holistic health and mindfulness. Furthermore, Dichang is committed to deepening its connection with the local community through increased investment in sustainable tourism initiatives, supporting local artisans and promoting the rich cultural heritage of Assam. A key objective is to establish Dichang Resort as a premier destination not just in Guwahati, but across Northeast India, attracting both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. By consistently exceeding guest expectations, embracing sustainable practices, and actively contributing to the community, Dichang Resort aspires to become a symbol of hospitality excellence in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:50:20.000Z'),
(1050, 'Aroohan Serenity Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Aroohan Serenity Resort, nestled amidst the lush landscapes of Guwahati, Assam, offers a tranquil escape from the bustling city life. More than just a resort, Aroohan Serenity is a sanctuary designed to rejuvenate the mind, body, and soul, providing a unique and holistic experience for its guests. In the burgeoning Assam tourism sector, Aroohan Serenity distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable practices, personalized service, and deep integration with the local culture and community. It stands as a beacon of hospitality, blending modern comfort with the serene beauty of the Northeast.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Aroohan Serenity’s offerings lies a commitment to providing diverse experiences catering to various needs. Our core services encompass luxurious accommodation in well-appointed rooms and suites, each designed to offer panoramic views and unparalleled comfort. These accommodations range from standard rooms perfect for a quick getaway to expansive suites ideal for families or extended stays. Complementing the accommodations are our meticulously crafted wellness programs, including Ayurvedic treatments, yoga and meditation sessions, and nature-based therapies, designed to promote relaxation and overall well-being. Guests can indulge in authentic Assamese cuisine at our in-house restaurant, prepared with locally sourced, fresh ingredients, providing a culinary journey that reflects the region''s rich gastronomic heritage. Furthermore, Aroohan Serenity offers curated tours and experiences, allowing guests to explore the natural beauty and cultural richness of Guwahati and the surrounding areas, including visits to nearby tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and historical sites. The unique selling proposition of Aroohan Serenity lies in its ability to seamlessly blend luxury and wellness with a deep respect for the environment and local community. We provide an experience that is both enriching and sustainable, appealing to discerning travelers seeking authentic and meaningful connections. This approach directly addresses the growing market demand for eco-tourism and culturally sensitive travel options in the Northeast region of India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Aroohan Serenity Resort. We believe in anticipating the needs of our guests and exceeding their expectations at every turn. Our highly trained staff is dedicated to providing personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. From the moment of arrival to departure, guests are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. We offer concierge services to assist with travel arrangements, tour bookings, and any other needs. Beyond providing exceptional service within the resort, Aroohan Serenity actively engages with the local community. We partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and support their livelihoods. We also organize cultural events and workshops, providing guests with opportunities to learn about Assamese traditions and customs. Our commitment to sustainability extends to our sourcing practices, prioritizing local and organic products whenever possible. This approach not only reduces our environmental impact but also supports the local economy and fosters a sense of community. By creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, both for our guests and the local community, Aroohan Serenity strives to be more than just a resort; it aims to be a positive force in the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Aroohan Serenity envisions a future of sustainable growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include increasing our capacity through the addition of eco-friendly cottages and villas, further enhancing our wellness programs with specialized treatments and therapies, and expanding our partnerships with local communities to create more immersive cultural experiences. We plan to leverage technology to improve efficiency and enhance the guest experience, including online booking platforms, personalized service applications, and sustainable energy solutions. We also aim to become a recognized leader in sustainable tourism in the Northeast region, advocating for responsible travel practices and promoting environmental conservation. Another key aspect of our future vision is to develop training programs for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge needed to succeed in the hospitality industry. By investing in the local community and promoting sustainable practices, Aroohan Serenity aims to create a lasting positive impact on the region, ensuring that future generations can enjoy the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:50:27.000Z'),
(1051, 'Chang''s Resort & Restaurant', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Chang''s Resort & Restaurant offers a unique and immersive experience that blends tranquil relaxation with the vibrant flavours of authentic Assam cuisine, establishing itself as a premier destination within Guwahati''s burgeoning hospitality sector. Situated amidst the natural beauty that surrounds the city, Chang''s provides a welcome escape from the urban hustle, offering a haven for both local residents seeking a weekend getaway and tourists eager to explore the cultural richness of the region. We strive to embody the spirit of Assamese hospitality, delivering exceptional service and creating lasting memories for every guest.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Chang''s Resort & Restaurant provides a dual offering designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. The resort features elegantly appointed rooms and suites, each designed with comfort and aesthetic appeal in mind. Thoughtful amenities, including high-speed internet access and personalized service, ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. Beyond accommodation, our resort offers a range of recreational facilities, such as a swimming pool, a well-equipped fitness center, and beautifully landscaped gardens perfect for leisurely strolls. The restaurant, the second key element of our business, specialises in authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We offer a curated menu that showcases both traditional dishes and innovative interpretations, allowing guests to experience the true taste of Assam. What sets us apart is our commitment to sourcing ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, supporting the local economy and ensuring the highest quality and freshness. We also offer curated cooking classes, allowing guests to delve deeper into the art of Assamese cuisine.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The Chang''s Resort & Restaurant customer experience is built on a foundation of genuine warmth and personalized attention. Our team is dedicated to anticipating and exceeding guest expectations, creating a welcoming and memorable stay. We understand that each guest is unique, and we strive to tailor our services to meet individual needs and preferences. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans and cultural organisations. This allows us to showcase the rich heritage of Assam to our guests, offering unique cultural experiences such as traditional dance performances and handicraft demonstrations. We also participate in local festivals and events, strengthening our ties with the community and contributing to the vibrant cultural tapestry of Guwahati. By fostering a sense of community and providing exceptional service, we aim to create a loyal customer base and establish ourselves as a beloved destination in the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Chang''s Resort & Restaurant envisions becoming a leading eco-friendly destination in Northeast India, synonymous with sustainable tourism and cultural immersion. Our long-term goals include expanding our resort facilities to accommodate a growing number of guests while minimizing our environmental impact. We plan to implement green initiatives such as solar power generation, rainwater harvesting, and waste management programs to reduce our carbon footprint. Furthermore, we aim to develop new and innovative cultural experiences for our guests, such as guided tours to nearby tea gardens and wildlife sanctuaries. We are also exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans to create a retail space within the resort, showcasing and selling their handcrafted products. Through continuous improvement, sustainable practices, and a unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, Chang''s Resort & Restaurant aims to solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati, contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam and showcasing the region''s unique beauty and culture to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:50:31.000Z'),
(1052, 'Aarian Woods a Boutique Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Aarian Woods, a Boutique Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility in Guwahati

Aarian Woods is a boutique resort nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of luxury accommodation, personalized service, and immersive cultural experiences. Unlike conventional hotels, Aarian Woods aims to provide a sanctuary where guests can reconnect with nature, rejuvenate their senses, and explore the rich heritage of Assam. The resort distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable practices, its intimate scale fostering a sense of exclusivity, and its dedication to showcasing local artistry and cuisine. Aarian Woods fills a vital niche in the local business landscape by providing a high-end, culturally sensitive option for both leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic and enriching stay. The resort is poised to become a landmark destination, contributing significantly to the region''s tourism sector and promoting Assam''s unique identity to a global audience.

<br> <br>

Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Comfort and Culture

Aarian Woods offers a range of meticulously crafted services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its discerning clientele. At its core, the resort provides luxury accommodation in elegantly appointed rooms and suites, each designed with a blend of contemporary aesthetics and traditional Assamese elements. These havens of comfort offer unparalleled views of the surrounding landscape and are equipped with modern amenities to ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay.

<br> <br>

Beyond accommodation, Aarian Woods features a curated culinary experience that highlights the vibrant flavors of Assam. The resort''s restaurant specializes in authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients and presented with contemporary flair. Guests can embark on a gastronomic journey, discovering the unique spices and cooking techniques that define the region''s culinary heritage. Special dietary needs and preferences are also accommodated with personalized menu options.

<br> <br>

Adding to its unique selling proposition, Aarian Woods offers a range of curated experiences that showcase the cultural richness of Assam. These include guided tours of local tea gardens, visits to historical sites, and opportunities to engage with local artisans and craftsmen. Guests can participate in traditional weaving workshops, learn about Assamese music and dance, or explore the region''s biodiversity through nature walks and birdwatching expeditions. The resort also boasts a serene spa offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments and modern wellness therapies, providing a holistic approach to relaxation and rejuvenation. This integrated approach to hospitality distinguishes Aarian Woods, making it a sought-after destination for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience. The resort’s location also makes it an ideal venue for small to medium sized corporate retreats and destination weddings, offering bespoke event planning services to ensure seamless and memorable occasions.

<br> <br>

Customer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection

Aarian Woods prioritizes exceptional customer service, fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere that resonates with the local community. The resort''s staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide personalized attention, ensuring that every stay is seamless and memorable. From arranging airport transfers to curating bespoke itineraries, the team is dedicated to exceeding expectations and creating lasting impressions.

<br> <br>

The resort actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local artisans and businesses. A significant portion of the resort''s supplies are sourced from local farmers and producers, ensuring fair trade practices and contributing to the region''s economic growth. The resort also collaborates with local organizations to promote cultural preservation and environmental conservation, fostering a sense of shared responsibility. This commitment to community engagement sets Aarian Woods apart, making it a respected and valued member of the Guwahati business landscape. By showcasing local talent and promoting sustainable practices, Aarian Woods fosters a deeper connection with its guests, enriching their experience and fostering a sense of belonging.

<br> <br>

Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Sustainable Practices

Aarian Woods envisions becoming a leading boutique resort in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to excellence, sustainability, and cultural preservation. Future plans include expanding the resort''s capacity to accommodate growing demand, while maintaining its intimate and exclusive atmosphere. The resort also aims to introduce new and innovative services, such as wellness retreats focused on yoga and meditation, and adventure tourism packages that explore the region''s natural beauty.

<br> <br>

The resort is committed to further strengthening its sustainability initiatives, implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations. This includes reducing energy consumption, minimizing waste, and promoting responsible water management. Aarian Woods plans to invest in renewable energy sources and implement a comprehensive recycling program to minimize its environmental footprint. Furthermore, the resort will continue to support local communities through educational initiatives and economic empowerment programs, fostering a mutually beneficial relationship. By embracing innovation, prioritizing sustainability, and nurturing community connections, Aarian Woods is poised for continued growth and success, solidifying its position as a premier destination in Guwahati and a valuable asset to the region''s tourism industry. The long-term goal is to establish Aarian Woods as a model for sustainable tourism, inspiring other businesses to embrace responsible practices and contribute to the well-being of the local community and the environment.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.300Z', '2025-11-30T04:55:10.000Z'),
(1053, 'Panacea-The Village', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Panacea-The Village: A Sanctuary of Wellness in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant landscape of Guwahati, Panacea-The Village stands as a unique haven dedicated to holistic well-being and revitalization. More than just a wellness center, Panacea-The Village is a carefully curated ecosystem designed to address the growing need for accessible and comprehensive health solutions within the Assam community. Unlike traditional, fragmented approaches to healthcare, Panacea-The Village integrates diverse modalities, fostering a synergistic environment that promotes physical, mental, and emotional balance. Its significance lies in bridging the gap between conventional wellness practices and the rich, often untapped, healing traditions of Northeast India, offering a personalized and culturally relevant path to optimal health. The business aims to be a cornerstone in the regional wellness sector, promoting a proactive approach to health and contributing to a more vibrant and healthier Guwahati.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our Core Offerings: A Symphony of Services for Your Well-being</p>

<p>At Panacea-The Village, we offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. These services are carefully categorized to ensure clarity and ease of access. Central to our offerings is a range of therapeutic massage therapies, drawing inspiration from both classic techniques and indigenous Assam practices. This includes options for relaxation, pain management, and stress reduction, performed by skilled and certified therapists. Supplementing this is a fully equipped yoga and meditation studio that runs daily classes for all skill levels. We believe in the power of mindful movement and offer guidance on various yoga styles from Hatha to Vinyasa to restorative sessions. The studio also facilitates meditation retreats and workshops throughout the year, promoting mindfulness and inner peace. Furthermore, Panacea-The Village houses a dedicated Ayurvedic consultation and treatment center. Here, qualified Ayurvedic practitioners conduct thorough assessments to determine individual constitutions and prescribe personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, as well as traditional Ayurvedic therapies. In support of inner and outer wellbeing, the Village includes a thoughtfully curated retail space that carries natural and organic health products, including locally sourced teas, herbal supplements, aromatherapy blends, and artisanal skincare products. The integration of these complementary services under one roof is a core differentiator. Our offerings are unique for the local market as they blend local Ayurvedic principles with modern western health practices.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Elevating the Customer Experience: A Personalized Journey to Wellness</p>

<p>At Panacea-The Village, our commitment to customer service extends beyond mere transactions; we strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where every individual feels valued and understood. Our approach is built on the principles of personalized care, attentiveness, and genuine connection. From the moment a client steps through our doors, they are greeted by a warm and knowledgeable team member who is dedicated to understanding their specific needs and concerns. We prioritize active listening and thorough consultations to ensure that our services are tailored to each individual''s unique circumstances. The serene ambiance of Panacea-The Village is also central to our customer experience. The space has been thoughtfully designed to evoke a sense of tranquility and peace, creating an oasis of calm amidst the bustling city. This includes calming color palettes, the use of natural materials, and soothing ambient sounds. Our customer experience is further enhanced through our commitment to community engagement. We actively partner with local organizations and participate in community events to promote health and wellness awareness. This includes offering free workshops, educational seminars, and community outreach programs. We also actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Through these initiatives, we aim to foster a strong sense of connection with the local community, building trust and establishing Panacea-The Village as a valued resource for health and well-being.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Envisioning the Future: Growing with Guwahati, Expanding Horizons</p>

<p>The future vision for Panacea-The Village is one of sustainable growth and continued dedication to holistic well-being within Guwahati and beyond. We envision expanding our service offerings to include specialized programs tailored to specific demographics, such as prenatal wellness, senior care, and corporate wellness initiatives. We also intend to strengthen our partnerships with local healthcare providers to facilitate integrated care pathways, fostering a more collaborative and holistic approach to health management. This involves building strong relationships with local doctors, physiotherapists, and other healthcare professionals to provide our clients with a truly holistic and integrated approach to their health. From a business expansion perspective, we plan to carefully evaluate opportunities to establish satellite locations in other parts of Guwahati and potentially explore expansion into other Northeast Indian cities. This expansion will be strategic and measured, ensuring that we maintain the quality and integrity of our services while reaching a wider audience. Furthermore, we plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online booking platforms, virtual consultations, and personalized wellness apps. In alignment with our commitment to sustainability, we will continue to prioritize eco-friendly practices throughout our operations. This includes sourcing local and sustainable products, reducing our carbon footprint, and promoting environmentally conscious behaviors. Our long-term goal is to solidify Panacea-The Village as a leading center for holistic wellness in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T04:55:18.000Z'),
(1054, 'TRAVENTURE BUDDY', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>TRAVENTURE BUDDY: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Assam Experiences</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, TRAVENTURE BUDDY is a dynamic and innovative travel company dedicated to providing authentic and immersive experiences throughout Assam and the surrounding region. In a landscape increasingly seeking sustainable and culturally rich tourism, TRAVENTURE BUDDY distinguishes itself by focusing on personalized itineraries, responsible travel practices, and genuine connections with local communities. We''re not just selling tours; we''re crafting memories that last a lifetime, contributing to the growth of local economies, and preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Assam. Our presence is particularly significant in the Assam business landscape, as we champion responsible tourism and offer a unique alternative to mass-market tours, appealing to discerning travelers seeking deeper and more meaningful experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of TRAVENTURE BUDDY lies a commitment to showcasing the diverse beauty and cultural richness of Assam. Our core services are built around curated travel experiences designed to cater to a wide range of interests and preferences. These include:</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
<li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> We specialize in crafting tailor-made travel plans that align perfectly with individual interests, budgets, and timeframes. Whether a client seeks an adventurous trek through lush rainforests, a peaceful retreat in a tea garden, or an exploration of ancient temples, we create bespoke journeys that exceed expectations.</li>
<li><b>Cultural Immersion Tours:</b> Our cultural immersion tours provide authentic insights into the traditions, art, music, and cuisine of Assam''s diverse communities. We work closely with local artisans, performers, and families to offer travelers meaningful opportunities for interaction and learning.</li>
<li><b>Wildlife Safaris and Eco-Tours:</b> Assam is renowned for its rich biodiversity, and we offer expertly guided wildlife safaris and eco-tours to national parks and wildlife sanctuaries, including Kaziranga National Park, home to the endangered one-horned rhinoceros. We prioritize responsible wildlife tourism, ensuring minimal impact on the environment and contributing to conservation efforts.</li>
<li><b>Homestay Experiences:</b> We provide opportunities to stay in locally-owned homestays, offering travelers a chance to experience the warm hospitality of Assamese families and gain a deeper understanding of local life.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets TRAVENTURE BUDDY apart is our unwavering commitment to responsible tourism, our deep local expertise, and our dedication to providing exceptional customer service. We prioritize sustainability by supporting local businesses, minimizing our environmental impact, and promoting cultural preservation. Our team comprises experienced travel professionals who possess an in-depth knowledge of Assam and its surrounding areas, enabling us to create authentic and enriching experiences. We also offer multi-lingual support, ensuring seamless communication and personalized attention for every traveler. These combined factors create a unique selling point for TRAVENTURE BUDDY, appealing to conscious travelers seeking authentic and sustainable travel experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at TRAVENTURE BUDDY. We strive to create a personalized and memorable experience for every traveler. Our approach to customer service is built on three core principles: responsiveness, attentiveness, and genuine care. We promptly respond to inquiries, provide detailed information and advice, and go the extra mile to ensure that every aspect of the trip is seamless and enjoyable. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and encouraging repeat business. We regularly solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our customers. By actively engaging with the local community through responsible tourism initiatives, we create a symbiotic relationship that benefits both our customers and the people of Assam. We participate in local festivals, support community-based tourism projects, and promote local handicrafts, contributing to the economic and cultural well-being of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, TRAVENTURE BUDDY envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour offerings to encompass emerging destinations and niche interests, such as tea tourism, adventure sports, and wellness retreats. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including a user-friendly online platform and mobile app. Furthermore, we are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its growth. We aim to create a positive impact on the environment and society, promoting responsible tourism practices and contributing to the long-term sustainability of the region. Our long-term goal is to position TRAVENTURE BUDDY as a responsible and innovative leader in the tourism industry, showcasing the beauty and cultural richness of Assam while preserving its natural heritage for future generations. We aspire to be more than just a travel company; we want to be a catalyst for positive change, fostering economic development, promoting cultural understanding, and protecting the environment.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T04:55:26.000Z'),
(1055, 'Club Nirvana', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Club Nirvana: A Tranquil Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati

Club Nirvana is emerging as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of relaxation, recreation, and refined entertainment. Distinct from conventional establishments, Club Nirvana strives to be more than just a business; it aims to cultivate a thriving social hub that caters to the discerning tastes of the local community. Nestled strategically within Guwahati, Club Nirvana is poised to become synonymous with quality leisure and premium service, enriching the Assam business landscape by elevating standards in the hospitality and entertainment sector. It''s envisioned as a sanctuary where members and guests can escape the daily grind and immerse themselves in a world of curated experiences.

<br> <br>

Core Services and Products: Curating Exceptional Experiences

At its core, Club Nirvana offers a multi-faceted experience designed to cater to a diverse range of preferences. The primary service offerings revolve around three key pillars: relaxation, recreation, and refined entertainment. The relaxation aspect is anchored by a state-of-the-art spa and wellness center, offering a comprehensive range of treatments from traditional Ayurvedic therapies to contemporary wellness techniques. Skilled therapists and serene ambiance create a haven for rejuvenation and stress relief.

<br> <br>

The recreational facilities include a well-equipped fitness center with certified trainers providing personalized workout plans and group classes, catering to all fitness levels. A sparkling swimming pool offers a refreshing escape, while indoor games such as billiards and table tennis provide ample opportunities for friendly competition. Further enhancing the recreational offerings are curated excursions to local points of interest, allowing members to connect with the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam.

<br> <br>

Refined entertainment is epitomized by the Club Nirvana''s restaurant and bar. The restaurant offers a diverse culinary experience, featuring both authentic Assamese cuisine prepared with locally sourced ingredients and international flavors to satisfy diverse palates. The bar boasts an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and handcrafted cocktails, all expertly prepared by experienced mixologists. Regular live music performances, themed events, and cultural showcases provide a vibrant social atmosphere, creating memorable experiences for members and guests.

<br> <br>

Club Nirvana’s unique selling point lies in its commitment to providing a holistic lifestyle destination, seamlessly integrating wellness, recreation, and entertainment under one roof. This comprehensive approach, combined with an unwavering focus on quality and personalized service, sets it apart from other establishments in the region. Furthermore, Club Nirvana directly addresses the increasing demand in Guwahati for sophisticated leisure options, meeting the needs of a growing middle class seeking premium recreational and entertainment experiences close to home.

<br> <br>

Customer Experience: Fostering Community and Connection

Club Nirvana is dedicated to providing an unparalleled customer experience, built on principles of personalized attention, genuine hospitality, and a deep understanding of the local community. Every interaction is carefully curated to ensure that members and guests feel valued, comfortable, and connected. Staff members are extensively trained to anticipate needs, address concerns promptly, and exceed expectations at every touchpoint.

<br> <br>

What truly distinguishes Club Nirvana is its commitment to fostering a strong sense of community. Regular social events, networking opportunities, and member-exclusive programs are designed to encourage interaction, build relationships, and create a vibrant social circle. Furthermore, the club actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events, partnerships with local businesses, and initiatives that support local artisans and cultural traditions. By investing in the well-being of the community, Club Nirvana aims to become an integral part of the social fabric of Guwahati. Feedback is actively solicited through surveys, suggestion boxes, and personal interactions to ensure continuous improvement and alignment with the evolving needs of its members and guests. This focus on customer-centricity ensures lasting relationships and a strong reputation within the community.

<br> <br>

Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enriching Lives

Looking ahead, Club Nirvana envisions a future characterized by sustained growth, expanded offerings, and an even deeper commitment to the local community. Expansion plans include the addition of new facilities such as a dedicated children’s play area, expanded spa services, and upgraded sports amenities. The long-term goal is to establish Club Nirvana as the preeminent lifestyle destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional service, vibrant community, and unwavering commitment to enriching the lives of its members and guests.

<br> <br>

Strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations will further enhance the club’s offerings and expand its reach within the community. Exploration of franchise opportunities in other cities within Assam is also under consideration, allowing the Club Nirvana experience to be shared with a wider audience. Ultimately, Club Nirvana aspires to be more than just a business; it aims to be a catalyst for positive social change, fostering a thriving community, supporting local talent, and promoting a culture of wellness and connection in the heart of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T04:55:33.000Z'),
(1056, 'The Falcon Eco Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>The Falcon Eco Resort: A Sustainable Sanctuary in Guwahati</p>

<p>The Falcon Eco Resort is a sustainably-minded hospitality destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of immersive nature experiences and authentic Assamese culture. In a region increasingly seeking eco-conscious travel options, The Falcon Eco Resort stands out by seamlessly integrating environmental responsibility with luxurious comfort and personalized service. The resort not only provides a tranquil escape from the bustling city life of Guwahati but also actively contributes to the preservation of Assam''s natural heritage, making it a significant player in the local business landscape. It''s a place where visitors can reconnect with nature, experience the rich tapestry of Assamese traditions, and contribute to a more sustainable future, all within a relaxed and rejuvenating environment.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Services and Products: Immersive Experiences & Sustainable Practices</p>

<p>The Falcon Eco Resort provides a diverse array of services designed to cater to both leisure and business travelers seeking an eco-friendly retreat. At its core, the resort offers comfortable and thoughtfully designed accommodations, ranging from well-appointed rooms with panoramic views to independent eco-cottages built with locally sourced, sustainable materials. These accommodations are designed to minimize environmental impact while maximizing guest comfort and providing an authentic sense of place. <br> <br>Beyond accommodation, the resort offers a range of experiential activities. Guided nature walks through the surrounding forests showcase the region''s biodiversity and educate guests about local flora and fauna. Birdwatching tours, led by knowledgeable local guides, allow guests to witness the vibrant avian life that calls Assam home. Cultural immersion experiences, such as traditional Assamese cooking classes, weaving workshops, and folk music performances, provide authentic insights into the region''s rich cultural heritage. <br> <br>Dining at The Falcon Eco Resort is a culinary journey that emphasizes locally sourced, organic ingredients. The resort''s restaurant features a menu of traditional Assamese dishes prepared with fresh produce from local farms, promoting sustainable agriculture and supporting local communities. Special dietary requirements are readily catered to, ensuring that every guest enjoys a delightful and health-conscious dining experience. <br> <br>The Falcon Eco Resort also caters to the business community, offering well-equipped conference and meeting facilities in a serene setting. These facilities are ideal for corporate retreats, team-building events, and workshops that prioritize a connection with nature and a focus on sustainability. <br> <br>What truly sets The Falcon Eco Resort apart is its unwavering commitment to sustainability. From energy-efficient lighting and water conservation measures to waste reduction programs and support for local conservation initiatives, the resort integrates sustainable practices into every aspect of its operations. This commitment not only minimizes the resort''s environmental footprint but also resonates strongly with an increasingly eco-conscious customer base, making it a unique and attractive destination.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection</p>

<p>At The Falcon Eco Resort, the customer experience is paramount. The resort emphasizes personalized service, with a dedicated team committed to ensuring that every guest''s needs are met with warmth and efficiency. From pre-arrival arrangements to on-site assistance, the staff is trained to provide attentive and proactive service that exceeds expectations. <br> <br>The resort strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere that reflects the warmth and hospitality of Assamese culture. Guests are treated as individuals, and their preferences are carefully considered to create a tailored experience that meets their specific needs and interests. The resort''s staff is composed of local individuals, providing guests with authentic insights into the region''s culture and traditions. <br> <br>Beyond providing exceptional service, The Falcon Eco Resort is deeply connected to the local community. The resort actively partners with local artisans, farmers, and conservation organizations to support sustainable development and promote economic opportunities for the region. Guests are encouraged to engage with the local community through guided tours of nearby villages, visits to local craft workshops, and opportunities to learn about traditional livelihoods. This connection to the community not only enriches the guest experience but also contributes to the long-term well-being of the region. <br> <br>The resort actively solicits feedback from guests and uses it to continuously improve its services and offerings. This commitment to continuous improvement ensures that The Falcon Eco Resort remains at the forefront of sustainable tourism in Assam, providing guests with an unforgettable and responsible travel experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Future Vision: Expansion, Innovation, and Sustainable Leadership</p>

<p>The Falcon Eco Resort envisions a future of continued growth and innovation, solidifying its position as a leader in sustainable tourism in Guwahati and beyond. The resort plans to expand its accommodation options, adding new eco-cottages and villas that further minimize environmental impact while enhancing guest comfort and privacy. Future development will prioritize the use of renewable energy sources, such as solar power, to reduce the resort''s carbon footprint and promote energy independence. <br> <br>The resort also intends to expand its range of experiential activities, offering new and exciting opportunities for guests to connect with nature and culture. This may include the development of new hiking trails, the introduction of wildlife photography workshops, and the expansion of cultural immersion programs. <br> <br>The Falcon Eco Resort is committed to sharing its knowledge and expertise in sustainable tourism with other businesses and organizations in the region. The resort plans to launch training programs and workshops that empower local communities to adopt sustainable practices and develop eco-tourism initiatives. This commitment to knowledge sharing will contribute to the growth of a more sustainable tourism industry in Assam and beyond. <br> <br>Ultimately, The Falcon Eco Resort aims to become a model for sustainable tourism development, demonstrating that it is possible to create a thriving business that benefits both the environment and the local community. By continuing to innovate, collaborate, and prioritize sustainability, The Falcon Eco Resort is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of tourism in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T04:55:41.000Z'),
(1057, 'Orang Village Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Orang Village Resort: A Gateway to Assam''s Natural Splendor

Orang Village Resort offers an immersive and authentic Assamese experience, providing a tranquil escape from the bustling city of Guwahati. Nestled in a serene location on the outskirts of the city, the resort distinguishes itself as a sanctuary where guests can reconnect with nature while experiencing the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Unlike typical hotels, Orang Village Resort emphasizes sustainable tourism practices and promotes the local economy, making it a significant contributor to the responsible tourism sector in the region. It caters to both domestic and international tourists seeking an authentic and enriching travel experience, as well as local residents seeking a weekend getaway. The resort fills a crucial niche by offering a balance of comfort, adventure, and cultural immersion.

<br> <br>

At its core, Orang Village Resort provides comfortable and well-appointed accommodations, ranging from traditionally styled cottages to modern rooms equipped with essential amenities. These accommodations are designed to blend seamlessly with the natural surroundings, offering stunning views and a sense of privacy. Beyond lodging, the resort offers a range of curated experiences that showcase the best of Assam. These include guided tours to the nearby Orang National Park, home to a diverse array of wildlife, including the one-horned rhinoceros. We also offer curated tours of local tea gardens and opportunities to learn about the tea-making process from experts.

<br> <br>

Culinary experiences are another cornerstone of the resort. Our in-house restaurant specializes in authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared using locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor traditional dishes prepared with unique regional spices and cooking techniques, providing a true taste of Assam. Furthermore, the resort provides curated cultural performances featuring traditional Assamese music and dance, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the region''s vibrant artistic heritage. What truly sets Orang Village Resort apart is its commitment to personalized service and authentic experiences. We go beyond simply providing a place to stay; we curate memorable moments that connect guests with the heart and soul of Assam. We can arrange specialized cultural classes, guided treks, and visits to local artisan workshops, depending on our guests'' interests.

<br> <br>

Customer service at Orang Village Resort is built on the principles of warmth, hospitality, and attentiveness. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized attention to each guest, ensuring that their needs are met promptly and efficiently. We believe in anticipating guest requests and going the extra mile to create a truly memorable stay. This dedication to exceptional service has earned the resort a loyal following of repeat customers and positive word-of-mouth referrals.

<br> <br>

Beyond providing excellent service, Orang Village Resort actively engages with the local community. We partner with local artisans and businesses to source our products and services, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We also participate in community development initiatives, such as supporting local schools and providing training opportunities for local residents. This commitment to community engagement not only benefits the local community but also enhances the guest experience by providing opportunities to connect with the local culture and people. We also prioritize environmental sustainability by employing eco-friendly practices such as waste reduction, water conservation, and energy efficiency. Our goal is to minimize our environmental footprint and preserve the natural beauty of the region for future generations.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Orang Village Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for sustainable and responsible tourism in Assam. We plan to expand our facilities to accommodate a growing number of guests while maintaining our commitment to personalized service and authentic experiences. This includes adding new accommodation options, expanding our range of curated experiences, and developing new partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We also plan to invest in technology to improve the guest experience and streamline our operations, such as implementing online booking systems and enhancing our communication channels.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, we aim to develop Orang Village Resort as a center for cultural exchange and education. We plan to host workshops, seminars, and cultural events that showcase the rich heritage of Assam and promote cross-cultural understanding. We will also collaborate with local universities and research institutions to conduct research on sustainable tourism practices and promote responsible tourism development in the region. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a destination that not only provides a memorable experience for our guests but also contributes to the sustainable development of the local community and the preservation of the natural environment.

<br> <br>

Our dedication to providing authentic experiences, supporting local communities, and promoting sustainable practices positions Orang Village Resort for continued success and growth in the burgeoning Assam tourism market. We are confident that Orang Village Resort will continue to be a preferred destination for travelers seeking an unforgettable and enriching experience in the heart of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:00:09.000Z'),
(1058, 'Xorapat eco resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Xorapat Eco Resort: A Sanctuary of Sustainable Serenity in Guwahati

Xorapat Eco Resort emerges as a tranquil haven nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of eco-conscious hospitality and authentic Assamese experiences. Unlike conventional accommodations, Xorapat strives to harmonize seamlessly with its natural surroundings, promoting environmental sustainability while providing guests with an unforgettable retreat. The resort stands as a testament to responsible tourism, aiming to contribute positively to the local ecosystem and community. In a region increasingly conscious of environmental impact, Xorapat fills a crucial niche, appealing to discerning travelers seeking both luxury and mindful living. Xorapat distinguishes itself by not only offering accommodation but also by curating an immersive cultural experience that captures the essence of Assam.

<br> <br>

At the core of Xorapat''s offerings lies a spectrum of eco-friendly accommodations, ranging from thoughtfully designed cottages built with locally sourced, sustainable materials to comfortable rooms in the main lodge, all designed to minimize environmental impact. Each living space is meticulously crafted to provide a serene and relaxing atmosphere, blending modern amenities with natural elements. Beyond accommodation, Xorapat offers a range of curated experiences. These include guided nature walks through the lush landscapes surrounding the resort, showcasing the region’s rich biodiversity and promoting environmental awareness. Guests can participate in traditional Assamese cooking classes, learning to prepare authentic regional dishes using fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Furthermore, Xorapat arranges cultural performances, featuring Bihu dance and other regional art forms, providing guests with a vibrant glimpse into Assam''s rich heritage. The resort boasts an on-site organic farm, supplying the kitchen with fresh produce and allowing guests to learn about sustainable farming practices. This farm-to-table dining experience emphasizes healthy eating and supports local farmers. By emphasizing sustainable practices and authentic cultural immersion, Xorapat addresses the growing demand for responsible and enriching travel experiences in the Guwahati area.

<br> <br>

Xorapat Eco Resort prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience rooted in personalized service and genuine connection. The staff are meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide attentive, friendly service, ensuring that every stay is comfortable and memorable. Beyond exceptional service, Xorapat strives to foster a strong connection with the local community. The resort actively partners with local artisans and businesses, showcasing their crafts and products to guests, thereby supporting the local economy. Xorapat also engages in community outreach programs, such as environmental awareness campaigns and educational initiatives, aiming to empower local communities and promote sustainable living. The resort''s commitment to fair labor practices ensures that employees are treated with respect and provided with opportunities for professional growth. By prioritizing guest satisfaction, community engagement, and ethical employment practices, Xorapat aims to create a positive and lasting impact on both its guests and the local community. The goal is to cultivate a loyal customer base that values not only the resort''s amenities but also its commitment to sustainability and social responsibility.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Xorapat Eco Resort envisions expanding its offerings and solidifying its position as a leader in sustainable tourism in the Northeast. Future plans include developing new eco-friendly accommodations, such as treehouses and glamping sites, to cater to a wider range of travelers. The resort also aims to enhance its educational programs, offering workshops on sustainable living and responsible tourism to both guests and local communities. Xorapat plans to further integrate technology into its operations, implementing smart energy management systems and waste reduction strategies to minimize its environmental footprint. The resort also intends to expand its partnerships with local businesses and organizations, creating new opportunities for collaboration and economic growth. Long-term, Xorapat aspires to become a model for sustainable tourism development in Assam, inspiring other businesses to adopt environmentally responsible practices and contribute to the well-being of local communities. The resort aims to achieve certifications for its sustainability efforts, demonstrating its commitment to environmental excellence and attracting eco-conscious travelers from around the world. By continuously innovating and expanding its offerings, Xorapat Eco Resort is poised to become a premier destination for travelers seeking authentic, sustainable, and enriching experiences in the heart of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:00:16.000Z'),
(1059, 'Ratnamouli Palace', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Ratnamouli Palace stands as a distinguished establishment in the heart of Guwahati, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern amenities. More than just a place to stay, it represents a commitment to showcasing the rich cultural heritage of Assam while providing exceptional service and comfortable accommodations. In a city that serves as the gateway to Northeast India, Ratnamouli Palace strives to be a landmark destination, contributing significantly to the region''s tourism and hospitality sector.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing a memorable and enriching experience for our guests. This encompasses meticulously designed accommodations, ranging from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each reflecting the local aesthetic through carefully chosen décor and furnishings. We also provide a range of essential services including concierge assistance, laundry services, and complimentary Wi-Fi throughout the property. However, Ratnamouli Palace goes beyond the standard hotel offerings. Our in-house restaurant specializes in authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients, providing guests with a true taste of the region. We also offer curated cultural experiences, such as traditional dance performances and cooking classes, allowing visitors to immerse themselves in the vibrant culture of Assam. A significant unique selling point is our commitment to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental footprint through initiatives like water conservation, waste management, and support for local artisans. This resonates strongly with environmentally conscious travelers and positions us as a responsible business within the community. By providing a holistic experience that combines comfortable lodging, authentic local cuisine, and cultural immersion, Ratnamouli Palace directly addresses the growing demand for culturally sensitive and authentic travel experiences in the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Ratnamouli Palace, the guest experience is paramount. We believe that genuine hospitality and personalized service are the keys to creating lasting memories. Our staff is carefully selected and trained not only to provide efficient service but also to embody the warmth and friendliness that Assamese culture is known for. We strive to anticipate the needs of our guests and go the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. This includes offering personalized recommendations for local attractions, arranging transportation, and catering to special dietary requirements. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services. Beyond individual guest interactions, Ratnamouli Palace actively engages with the local community. We partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region. We also support local charities and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility. This deep connection with the community fosters a sense of belonging and reinforces our position as a trusted and respected establishment in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Ratnamouli Palace is to solidify its position as the premier destination for travelers seeking an authentic Assamese experience in Guwahati. We plan to expand our offerings to include more specialized cultural tours and excursions, showcasing the diverse landscapes and traditions of the region. We are also exploring the possibility of developing partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector to create comprehensive travel packages. Technology will play a crucial role in our growth strategy, with plans to implement a user-friendly online booking platform and enhance our digital marketing efforts. Furthermore, we are committed to expanding our sustainable practices and exploring opportunities to reduce our environmental impact even further. In the long term, Ratnamouli Palace envisions becoming a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and sustainability in the Northeast Indian hospitality sector. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we can achieve this vision and contribute significantly to the growth and development of the region''s tourism industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:00:21.000Z'),
(1060, 'Kanoka Village Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Kanoka Village Resort: A Tranquil Escape Rooted in Assamese Hospitality</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Kanoka Village Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and authentic hospitality experience that distinguishes itself from conventional hotels and resorts. More than just a place to stay, Kanoka Village Resort is a carefully curated haven designed to immerse guests in the rich cultural tapestry and natural beauty of Assam. The resort strives to be a responsible and sustainable tourism entity, contributing positively to the local economy and preserving the region''s unique heritage. In a region witnessing increasing urbanization, Kanoka Village Resort offers a refreshing escape, providing an opportunity to reconnect with nature and experience the authentic charm of Assamese village life without sacrificing modern comforts.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The resort''s significance in the local business landscape lies in its commitment to promoting sustainable tourism practices and supporting local artisans and businesses. Kanoka Village Resort actively sources local produce and materials, contributing to the economic empowerment of the surrounding communities. Furthermore, the resort showcases Assamese culture through its architecture, décor, cuisine, and curated experiences, thereby serving as a cultural ambassador and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s unique identity.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Core Services and Products</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Kanoka Village Resort''s primary offering is its meticulously designed accommodation, which includes a range of options to suit different needs and preferences. Guests can choose from traditionally styled Assamese cottages, modern rooms with panoramic views, and spacious family suites, all designed to blend seamlessly with the natural surroundings. Each accommodation option is equipped with modern amenities, ensuring a comfortable and relaxing stay.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond accommodation, Kanoka Village Resort offers a diverse array of services designed to enhance the guest experience. The resort''s in-house restaurant specializes in authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients and traditional cooking methods. Guests can savor the unique flavors of Assam and experience the culinary heritage of the region. The resort also boasts a spa offering traditional Assamese massage therapies, providing a rejuvenating and holistic wellness experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Unique selling points of Kanoka Village Resort include its immersive cultural experiences, its commitment to sustainability, and its dedication to providing personalized service. The resort organizes guided tours of local villages, allowing guests to interact with artisans and learn about traditional crafts. Cultural performances showcasing Assamese music and dance are regularly held, providing a vibrant and engaging cultural experience. The resort also offers nature walks and birdwatching tours, allowing guests to explore the rich biodiversity of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Kanoka Village Resort caters to the growing demand for authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in the region. The resort provides an alternative to mass tourism, offering a more intimate and meaningful connection with the local culture and environment. By promoting responsible tourism practices, the resort helps to preserve the natural and cultural heritage of Assam for future generations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer Experience</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Kanoka Village Resort, customer service is paramount. The resort prides itself on its warm and personalized approach, treating each guest as a valued member of the Kanoka family. The staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide attentive and efficient service. The resort strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel comfortable and relaxed.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Kanoka Village Resort apart is its commitment to building meaningful connections with its guests. The staff takes the time to learn about guest interests and preferences, tailoring experiences to create lasting memories. The resort also actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and offerings.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Kanoka Village Resort is deeply rooted in the local community. The resort actively supports local initiatives and events, fostering a strong sense of community engagement. The resort also partners with local schools and organizations to promote education and environmental awareness. By contributing to the well-being of the local community, Kanoka Village Resort strengthens its reputation as a responsible and ethical business.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Future Vision</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Kanoka Village Resort envisions a future of sustainable growth and expansion, while remaining true to its core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. The resort plans to expand its accommodation offerings, adding new cottages and facilities while preserving the natural environment. The resort also intends to further develop its cultural and wellness programs, offering guests an even richer and more immersive experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>In the long term, Kanoka Village Resort aims to become a leading destination for sustainable tourism in Northeast India, showcasing the region''s unique cultural and natural heritage to the world. The resort plans to establish partnerships with other tourism operators and organizations to promote responsible tourism practices throughout the region. By working together, Kanoka Village Resort believes that it can contribute to the sustainable development of Assam and preserve its unique identity for generations to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:00:28.000Z'),
(1061, 'Daorai Jungle Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Daorai Jungle Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility and Adventure in Guwahati</p>

<p>Nestled amidst the lush greenery surrounding Guwahati, Daorai Jungle Resort offers a unique blend of serene relaxation and exhilarating adventure, providing an unparalleled escape from the everyday. As a premier eco-tourism destination, we are committed to showcasing the natural beauty of Assam while fostering sustainable tourism practices. Daorai Jungle Resort distinguishes itself in the local hospitality sector by offering an immersive experience that caters to both leisure travelers seeking respite and adventure enthusiasts eager to explore the region''s rich biodiversity. We aim to be more than just a resort; we aspire to be a gateway to understanding and appreciating the natural wonders that Assam has to offer, contributing positively to the local economy and environmental conservation.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Nature and Hospitality</p>

<p>At Daorai Jungle Resort, our core offering revolves around providing an enriching and memorable stay for our guests. This encompasses a diverse range of services and amenities tailored to meet the needs of a wide spectrum of travelers. Our accommodation options range from elegantly appointed standard rooms to luxurious jungle-themed cottages, each designed to provide comfort and tranquility while seamlessly blending with the natural surroundings. Beyond accommodation, we offer a curated selection of experiences designed to immerse guests in the local environment and culture. Guided jungle treks, led by experienced local naturalists, provide opportunities to observe native flora and fauna. Birdwatching tours, particularly popular during migratory seasons, allow guests to witness the region''s vibrant avian population. For those seeking a more adventurous experience, we offer options such as river rafting on the nearby Brahmaputra River (subject to seasonal conditions and safety regulations) and organized excursions to nearby wildlife sanctuaries. Our in-house restaurant features a menu that showcases the flavors of Assam, with a focus on locally sourced ingredients and traditional recipes. We also cater to specific dietary needs and preferences upon request. A key differentiator for Daorai Jungle Resort is our commitment to personalized service. We strive to anticipate and exceed the expectations of our guests, creating a truly bespoke experience that leaves a lasting impression. This, coupled with our dedication to sustainable practices, sets us apart in the competitive tourism market of Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer Experience: Connecting with Nature and the Community</p>

<p>At Daorai Jungle Resort, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in genuine hospitality and a deep understanding of our guests'' needs. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with warmth and attentiveness by our team, who are dedicated to ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. We emphasize personalized attention, tailoring experiences to individual preferences whenever possible. Whether it''s arranging a special dietary meal, organizing a private jungle trek, or simply providing recommendations for local attractions, we strive to go above and beyond to create memorable moments. We understand the importance of connecting with the local community and strive to create opportunities for our guests to engage with the culture and traditions of Assam. We partner with local artisans to showcase their crafts in our gift shop, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. We also organize cultural performances featuring traditional Assamese music and dance, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the rich heritage of the region. Furthermore, we actively participate in community development initiatives, supporting local schools and healthcare programs. This commitment to social responsibility not only enhances the customer experience but also strengthens our connection with the local community, fostering a sense of mutual respect and understanding. Our commitment to sustainable tourism ensures that our activities have a minimal impact on the environment, preserving the natural beauty of Assam for future generations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Future Vision: Growth, Sustainability, and Community Enrichment</p>

<p>Daorai Jungle Resort envisions a future where sustainable tourism thrives, contributing to both economic prosperity and environmental conservation in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation capacity while maintaining our commitment to preserving the natural integrity of the surrounding area. We plan to introduce new and innovative eco-tourism activities, such as nature photography workshops and educational programs focused on biodiversity conservation. We are also exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to source more of our ingredients locally, further supporting the regional economy and reducing our carbon footprint. A key focus for the future is strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We aim to create more employment opportunities for local residents and to provide training programs that equip them with the skills necessary to succeed in the tourism industry. We also plan to expand our support for local schools and healthcare programs, contributing to the overall well-being of the community. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in renewable energy sources and implementing water conservation measures to minimize our environmental impact. By pursuing these initiatives, Daorai Jungle Resort aims to become a model for sustainable tourism in Assam, demonstrating that it is possible to achieve both economic success and environmental responsibility. We believe that by providing exceptional customer experiences, fostering a strong connection with the local community, and adhering to the highest standards of sustainability, Daorai Jungle Resort will continue to flourish as a premier eco-tourism destination in Guwahati, attracting visitors from around the world and contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:00:34.000Z'),
(1062, 'Royal Mandala Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Royal Mandala Resort: A Gateway to Tranquility in Guwahati

Royal Mandala Resort, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of luxurious accommodation, authentic Assamese hospitality, and a serene ambiance that distinguishes it as a premier destination for both leisure and business travelers. More than just a place to stay, Royal Mandala Resort is an immersive experience designed to rejuvenate the mind, body, and soul, contributing significantly to the region’s growing tourism sector. Its strategic location provides easy access to Guwahati''s key attractions while offering a peaceful retreat from the city''s hustle and bustle, filling a crucial gap in the market for sophisticated and culturally sensitive hospitality.

<br> <br>

At its core, Royal Mandala Resort provides a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. Accommodation options range from elegantly appointed standard rooms to lavish suites, each meticulously designed to offer comfort and tranquility. The resort also boasts state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, making it an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. A multi-cuisine restaurant serves a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies, alongside popular Indian and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The Ayurvedic spa offers traditional healing therapies, promoting holistic well-being. What truly sets Royal Mandala Resort apart is its commitment to providing personalized service, anticipating guest needs, and exceeding expectations. It is this dedication that cultivates lasting relationships and encourages repeat business. These services directly address the needs of both domestic and international tourists seeking an authentic Assamese experience, as well as the growing demand for quality MICE (Meetings, Incentives, Conferences, and Exhibitions) facilities in the region.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Royal Mandala Resort. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality, characterized by genuine smiles and attentive service. The resort strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and respected. Staff members are not only highly trained professionals but also knowledgeable ambassadors of Assamese culture, eager to share insights and recommendations on local attractions, traditions, and customs. The resort actively engages with the local community by supporting local artisans and businesses, showcasing their products and promoting cultural events. It also participates in environmental initiatives, demonstrating a commitment to sustainable tourism practices. Regular feedback is actively solicited from guests, allowing the resort to continuously improve its services and tailor offerings to meet evolving needs. This personalized approach fosters strong connections with guests, turning them into loyal patrons and enthusiastic advocates for the resort. The dedication to customer satisfaction translates into positive reviews and word-of-mouth referrals, fueling the resort’s continued success.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Royal Mandala Resort envisions becoming the leading luxury eco-tourism destination in Northeast India. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity with the addition of eco-friendly cottages that blend seamlessly with the natural surroundings. The resort intends to develop adventure tourism activities, such as guided treks, bird watching tours, and river cruises, showcasing the region’s rich biodiversity. Furthermore, it plans to establish a training center for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to excel in the hospitality industry, thereby contributing to the economic development of the region. The long-term goal is to create a sustainable and responsible tourism model that benefits both the business and the local community, preserving the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam for future generations. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and community engagement, Royal Mandala Resort aims to solidify its position as a symbol of excellence in the Assam hospitality landscape and a catalyst for positive change in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:05:08.000Z'),
(1063, 'The Greenwood Resort, Guwahati', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>The Greenwood Resort, Guwahati, stands as a premier destination in the heart of Assam, offering a tranquil escape and a sophisticated hospitality experience. Strategically located in Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, the resort caters to both leisure and business travelers, providing a seamless blend of modern amenities and the region’s rich cultural heritage. The Greenwood Resort distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable practices, its emphasis on showcasing local artistry, and its dedication to providing personalized service, contributing significantly to the burgeoning tourism and hospitality sector of Assam. The resort aims to be more than just a place to stay; it is a destination that connects guests with the essence of Assam, fostering memorable experiences and contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The Greenwood Resort offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. At its core, the resort provides luxurious accommodation options, ranging from elegantly appointed rooms and suites to private villas, each offering panoramic views of the surrounding landscape. The resort boasts multiple dining venues, each specializing in distinct culinary experiences. "The Assam Table" celebrates the region’s unique flavors, using locally sourced ingredients to create authentic Assamese dishes. "The Global Grill" offers a diverse menu of international cuisine, catering to discerning palates. A dedicated events team manages conferences, weddings, and social gatherings of all sizes, ensuring seamless execution and unforgettable experiences. The resort also features a state-of-the-art spa and wellness center, offering a range of rejuvenating treatments inspired by ancient Ayurvedic principles. What sets The Greenwood Resort apart is its curated experiences, such as guided tours of tea gardens, cultural performances showcasing Bihu dance and music, and opportunities to engage with local artisans. These immersive experiences provide guests with a deeper understanding and appreciation of Assam’s cultural richness. The resort actively addresses the local market’s need for high-quality accommodation, diverse dining options, and exceptional event management capabilities, all within a setting that reflects the region’s unique identity. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The Greenwood Resort prioritizes providing an exceptional customer experience, built on a foundation of warmth, efficiency, and personalized attention. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted by a team dedicated to anticipating their needs and exceeding their expectations. The resort emphasizes training its staff to be knowledgeable about the local culture and attractions, enabling them to provide insightful recommendations and personalized itineraries. The Greenwood Resort actively seeks feedback from its guests through surveys and direct communication, using this information to continuously improve its services and offerings. The resort believes in fostering a strong connection with the local community. It actively supports local businesses by sourcing products and services from regional suppliers. Furthermore, the resort partners with local artisans and cultural groups to showcase their work and talent to a wider audience. The Greenwood Resort actively participates in community development initiatives, such as supporting education programs and promoting sustainable tourism practices. This commitment to social responsibility strengthens the resort''s reputation and enhances its appeal to both domestic and international travelers who value ethical and sustainable tourism.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The Greenwood Resort envisions a future where it remains a leading destination in Assam, renowned for its exceptional hospitality, sustainable practices, and commitment to showcasing the region’s unique cultural heritage. The resort’s growth strategy includes expanding its accommodation options to cater to a wider range of travelers, from budget-conscious explorers to luxury seekers. Future plans include developing new and innovative culinary experiences, such as cooking classes that introduce guests to the intricacies of Assamese cuisine. The resort aims to further enhance its wellness offerings by introducing new spa treatments and fitness programs. A key focus is on strengthening its partnerships with local businesses and cultural organizations, creating more immersive and authentic experiences for guests. The Greenwood Resort is committed to embracing sustainable practices in all aspects of its operations, from energy conservation and waste management to supporting local conservation efforts. Long-term, the resort aspires to become a model for sustainable tourism in Northeast India, inspiring other businesses to adopt responsible and ethical practices. The Greenwood Resort aims to contribute to the economic and social well-being of the local community, while providing guests with unforgettable experiences that celebrate the beauty and richness of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:05:14.000Z'),
(1064, 'Daomasar Eco Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Daomasar Eco Resort: A Sanctuary of Sustainability in Guwahati

Daomasar Eco Resort emerges as a distinctive haven nestled in the vibrant landscape surrounding Guwahati, Assam. More than just an accommodation provider, it''s an experience meticulously crafted to harmonize with the natural beauty of the region while championing sustainable tourism practices. In a business environment increasingly conscious of ecological impact and seeking authentic cultural immersion, Daomasar Eco Resort positions itself as a leading example of responsible and enriching hospitality within the Assam tourism sector. Its existence signifies a conscious effort to move beyond conventional tourism models, offering visitors a unique opportunity to connect with nature, support local communities, and minimize their environmental footprint.

<br> <br>

At its core, Daomasar Eco Resort offers a range of services designed to cater to diverse traveler preferences, all underpinned by a commitment to environmental stewardship. The resort boasts a variety of eco-friendly accommodations, from traditionally styled cottages crafted from locally sourced, sustainable materials to comfortable and modern rooms designed to minimize energy consumption. Beyond accommodation, Daomasar offers curated nature-based experiences, including guided birdwatching tours led by local experts, trekking expeditions through surrounding hills, and opportunities to explore the region’s rich biodiversity. Guests can also participate in workshops focused on traditional Assamese crafts and cooking, providing a deeper understanding of the local culture. What sets Daomasar apart is its dedication to low-impact tourism; it emphasizes minimal waste generation through composting and recycling programs, utilizes solar power where possible, and actively promotes conservation efforts in collaboration with local communities. These initiatives directly address the growing demand for sustainable tourism options in the region, appealing to environmentally conscious travelers seeking authentic and meaningful experiences. The focus is on creating a mutually beneficial relationship where tourism contributes positively to the local ecosystem and economy.

<br> <br>

The customer experience at Daomasar Eco Resort is paramount, centered on personalized service and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained not only to provide efficient service but also to act as cultural ambassadors, sharing their knowledge of the region''s history, traditions, and environmental challenges. The resort actively engages with the local community, sourcing fresh produce from nearby farms and employing local artisans and guides. This creates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, allowing guests to connect with the heart of Assam beyond the typical tourist attractions. Feedback is actively sought and integrated to constantly improve the guest experience and ensure that the resort''s operations align with the needs and expectations of its visitors. Furthermore, the resort fosters a sense of community among its guests, encouraging interaction and the sharing of experiences, further enhancing the overall experience.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Daomasar Eco Resort envisions itself as a catalyst for sustainable tourism development in the region. Future plans include expanding its accommodation offerings while maintaining its commitment to eco-friendly construction and operation. The resort also aims to deepen its partnerships with local communities, providing increased economic opportunities and supporting educational initiatives focused on environmental conservation. Further development of ecotourism activities, such as nature photography workshops and river cruises, is also under consideration. The long-term goal is to establish Daomasar as a model for responsible tourism, demonstrating that environmental sustainability and economic prosperity can go hand in hand. By continually innovating and refining its practices, Daomasar Eco Resort aspires to become a leading destination for travelers seeking immersive, authentic, and environmentally conscious experiences in the heart of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.301Z', '2025-11-30T05:05:20.000Z'),
(1065, 'Pankhiraj resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Pankhiraj Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a serene escape from the bustling city life, while remaining conveniently accessible to all its amenities. As a premier hospitality destination in Assam, Pankhiraj Resort distinguishes itself through its commitment to providing an authentic Assamese experience blended with modern comforts and impeccable service. Unlike typical hotels, the resort emphasizes a connection with nature, local culture, and personalized attention, making it a significant contributor to the tourism sector of the region. Its tranquil setting, coupled with its dedication to promoting local arts and crafts, positions Pankhiraj Resort as a unique and valued entity within the local business ecosystem.

<br> <br>

At its core, Pankhiraj Resort provides a comprehensive range of hospitality services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. Accommodation options range from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each meticulously designed to offer a blend of comfort and aesthetic appeal. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. Beyond accommodation, the resort boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and international favorites, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. This focus on local produce supports local farmers and contributes to the authenticity of the dining experience. A standout feature is the resort''s expansive outdoor space, including lush gardens, a swimming pool, and dedicated areas for recreational activities. This ample space allows for hosting events ranging from corporate retreats and conferences to weddings and family gatherings. The availability of customized event planning services further enhances the resort’s appeal. Unique selling points include curated experiences such as tea garden tours, traditional Assamese cooking classes, and cultural performances showcasing local music and dance. These offerings allow guests to immerse themselves in the rich culture of Assam, setting Pankhiraj Resort apart from conventional accommodation providers. By offering such authentic experiences, the resort caters to the growing demand for experiential travel and contributes to the promotion of Assam''s unique cultural heritage.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Pankhiraj Resort, shaping every aspect of its operations. The resort''s staff is trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest, ensuring a personalized and memorable stay. From the warm welcome at reception to the attentive service in the restaurant, the emphasis is on creating a genuine and hospitable atmosphere. The resort actively seeks feedback from guests through surveys and direct interactions, continuously refining its services to meet evolving expectations. Beyond providing exceptional service, Pankhiraj Resort actively engages with the local community. It supports local artisans by showcasing their products in the resort''s gift shop and incorporating local crafts into the décor. It also participates in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of community and contributing to the preservation of Assamese traditions. Furthermore, the resort prioritizes employing local residents, providing economic opportunities and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. By focusing on personalized service and actively engaging with the local community, Pankhiraj Resort fosters strong relationships with its guests and solidifies its position as a respected and valued member of the Guwahati community.

<br> <br>

The future vision for Pankhiraj Resort is ambitious, focused on sustainable growth and enhancing its contribution to the region''s tourism sector. Plans are underway to expand the resort''s facilities, including adding more rooms and developing specialized wellness programs centered on traditional Assamese healing practices. A key focus is on embracing sustainable tourism practices, minimizing the resort''s environmental footprint, and promoting responsible travel. This includes initiatives such as implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. The resort also intends to strengthen its partnerships with local tour operators and travel agencies to attract a wider range of visitors and promote Assam as a premier tourist destination. Exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism initiatives, such as guided nature walks and birdwatching tours, is also on the horizon. Furthermore, the resort aims to become a hub for cultural exchange, hosting workshops and seminars on Assamese art, music, and literature. By focusing on sustainable practices, expanding its offerings, and actively promoting Assam''s cultural heritage, Pankhiraj Resort envisions a future where it continues to thrive as a premier hospitality destination, contributing significantly to the economic and cultural prosperity of the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:05:26.000Z'),
(1066, 'Arya Eco Resort, Pobitora', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Arya Eco Resort, Pobitora: A Sanctuary of Sustainability and Assam''s Untamed Beauty

Arya Eco Resort, Pobitora, stands as a testament to responsible tourism and a celebration of Assam''s rich biodiversity. Nestled near the famed Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary, often dubbed "Mini Kaziranga" for its high density of Indian rhinoceros, the resort offers a unique and immersive experience that blends comfortable accommodations with a commitment to ecological preservation and community engagement. Unlike conventional hotels, Arya Eco Resort is deeply rooted in sustainable practices and strives to minimize its environmental impact while simultaneously contributing to the socio-economic well-being of the surrounding villages. The resort''s significance lies not just in providing a tranquil escape, but in fostering environmental awareness and supporting the conservation efforts vital to protecting Pobitora''s unique ecosystem. It represents a growing trend in the Assam tourism sector, catering to discerning travelers who seek authentic experiences and prioritize ethical and sustainable travel choices.

<br> <br>

The core of Arya Eco Resort''s offerings revolves around providing comfortable and ecologically responsible accommodation options. These range from traditionally styled cottages that reflect the local architecture to well-appointed rooms designed to minimize energy consumption. Beyond accommodation, the resort provides a comprehensive suite of services designed to enhance the visitor''s experience of Pobitora and Assam. These include guided tours of the wildlife sanctuary led by experienced and knowledgeable local guides, nature walks that delve into the region''s flora and fauna, and opportunities to engage with the local community through cultural performances and village visits.

<br> <br>

A key differentiator for Arya Eco Resort is its unwavering commitment to sustainability. This is evident in its use of locally sourced materials in construction, its reliance on renewable energy sources wherever possible, and its implementation of waste management and water conservation practices. Furthermore, the resort actively promotes responsible tourism by educating guests about the importance of conservation and encouraging them to adopt eco-friendly habits during their stay. The resort also boasts a farm-to-table dining experience, sourcing fresh produce from local farmers and minimizing its carbon footprint. This commitment to sustainability is a major selling point, attracting environmentally conscious travelers who are increasingly seeking destinations that align with their values. By directly supporting local communities through employment and procurement, Arya Eco Resort contributes to the economic empowerment of the region, creating a symbiotic relationship between tourism and local development.

<br> <br>

At Arya Eco Resort, customer experience is paramount. The staff is dedicated to providing personalized service and ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and cared for. The resort prides itself on its ability to create a warm and authentic atmosphere, allowing visitors to connect with the local culture and environment on a deeper level. The team are almost exclusively recruited from local villages and are trained not only in hospitality but also in environmental awareness and cultural sensitivity. This ensures that guests receive informed and respectful guidance throughout their stay.

<br> <br>

The resort actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local schools and healthcare facilities, participating in conservation projects, and promoting local handicrafts. These efforts not only strengthen the resort''s ties to the community but also enhance the visitor''s experience by providing opportunities to interact with local people and learn about their traditions and way of life. The resort strives to create a mutually beneficial relationship, ensuring that tourism contributes to the well-being of the community while preserving its cultural heritage. This approach not only differentiates Arya Eco Resort from other accommodations but also fosters a sense of responsibility and shared purpose among guests and staff alike.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Arya Eco Resort envisions becoming a leading example of sustainable tourism in Assam, setting a benchmark for responsible hospitality practices. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity while maintaining its commitment to low-impact development. The resort also aims to develop more immersive and educational programs focused on wildlife conservation and local culture, further enriching the visitor experience. A key long-term goal is to establish a training center for sustainable tourism practices, empowering local communities to develop their own eco-tourism initiatives and contribute to the economic growth of the region.

<br> <br>

Moreover, Arya Eco Resort seeks to collaborate with local conservation organizations and government agencies to strengthen the protection of the Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary and its surrounding areas. This includes supporting anti-poaching efforts, promoting sustainable land management practices, and raising awareness about the importance of biodiversity conservation. By playing an active role in conservation efforts, Arya Eco Resort aims to ensure the long-term sustainability of its operations and contribute to the preservation of Assam''s natural heritage for future generations. The vision is to not only provide a memorable experience for visitors but also to create a lasting positive impact on the environment and the community. Ultimately, Arya Eco Resort aspires to be more than just a place to stay; it strives to be a catalyst for sustainable development and a guardian of Assam''s natural treasures.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:05:34.000Z'),
(1067, 'The Residency Tourist Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>The Residency Tourist Resort stands as a distinguished hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil escape coupled with modern amenities and an authentic cultural experience. Situated strategically to provide easy access to the city’s key attractions while maintaining a serene atmosphere, The Residency caters to both leisure and business travelers seeking a refined and memorable stay. More than just a place to rest, The Residency embodies the spirit of Assamese hospitality, acting as a gateway to exploring the rich heritage and natural beauty of the region. Its significance in the local business landscape stems from its commitment to providing exceptional service, supporting local artisans and businesses, and contributing to the sustainable growth of tourism in Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The Residency Tourist Resort offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. At its core, the resort provides luxurious accommodation, ranging from elegantly appointed rooms to spacious suites, each meticulously designed to offer comfort and relaxation. These accommodations are equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and climate control systems. Beyond accommodation, The Residency boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant, "Flavors of Assam," specializing in authentic Assamese cuisine alongside international favorites, providing a gastronomic journey that delights the palate. For corporate guests and event organizers, the resort offers state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, capable of hosting a wide range of events, from small meetings to large-scale conferences. A unique selling point lies in the resort''s focus on curating personalized experiences, such as guided tours of local tea gardens, cultural performances showcasing Bihu dance and music, and workshops on Assamese handicrafts. These offerings address the growing demand for immersive travel experiences that connect visitors with the local culture and heritage, thereby fulfilling a crucial need in the Guwahati tourism market.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At The Residency, customer experience is paramount. The resort cultivates a culture of genuine hospitality, where every guest is treated with personalized attention and care. Staff members are trained to anticipate guest needs and exceed their expectations, fostering a welcoming and memorable stay. The resort''s commitment to service excellence extends beyond the provision of amenities; it encompasses creating a sense of belonging and connection. The Residency actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as sourcing fresh produce from local farmers, partnering with artisans to showcase their crafts in the resort''s gift shop, and supporting local schools and charities. This commitment to social responsibility not only enhances the resort''s reputation but also fosters a strong connection with the local community, making The Residency a beloved institution in Guwahati. Customer feedback is actively sought and valued, with the resort continuously striving to improve its services and offerings based on guest preferences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, The Residency Tourist Resort envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the broader Assam region. Future plans include expanding the resort''s accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for quality lodging. This expansion will be carefully planned to maintain the resort''s tranquil atmosphere and preserve its commitment to sustainable practices. The resort also intends to further develop its offerings of curated experiences, introducing new tours and activities that showcase the diverse cultural and natural attractions of Assam. This includes exploring partnerships with local tour operators to offer specialized itineraries focused on wildlife tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural immersion. The long-term goals of The Residency include establishing itself as a benchmark for sustainable tourism in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices, and contributing to the economic development of the local community. This will involve implementing eco-friendly initiatives, such as reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting local conservation efforts. Furthermore, The Residency aims to foster a strong sense of corporate social responsibility, actively engaging in community development projects and contributing to the well-being of the region. By pursuing these goals, The Residency Tourist Resort seeks to create a lasting positive impact on the local environment and community, while providing exceptional hospitality experiences for its guests.</p>
</body>
</html>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:10:09.000Z'),
(1068, 'Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort in Chanaka', 'Resorts', NULL, '<h1>Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort in Chanaka, Guwahati: A Tranquil Escape Rooted in Assamese Hospitality</h1>

Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort, nestled in the serene landscape of Chanaka, Guwahati, offers a unique and immersive experience that blends the tranquility of nature with the rich cultural heritage of Assam. More than just a resort, it’s a haven designed to provide guests with an authentic and rejuvenating escape from the everyday, contributing meaningfully to the local tourism sector by showcasing sustainable practices and promoting regional artistry. Situated just a short drive from the bustling city of Guwahati, the resort provides a readily accessible retreat, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking solace and cultural immersion. The resort strives to be a benchmark for sustainable tourism in the region, demonstrating responsible environmental stewardship alongside excellent customer service. <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Nature, Comfort, and Culture</h2>

At the heart of Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality within an environmentally conscious framework. The resort''s core offerings center around providing comfortable and thoughtfully designed accommodations, authentic Assamese cuisine, and curated experiences that showcase the region''s natural beauty and cultural traditions. <br> <br>

Our accommodations are crafted primarily from locally sourced bamboo, reflecting Assam''s rich tradition of bamboo craftsmanship. These eco-friendly cottages and suites offer a blend of rustic charm and modern amenities, ensuring a comfortable and relaxing stay. Each dwelling is designed to maximize natural light and ventilation, minimizing the resort''s environmental footprint while providing guests with stunning views of the surrounding landscape. We offer a range of room types to cater to diverse needs, from solo travelers seeking quiet contemplation to families desiring a memorable vacation. <br> <br>

The resort''s dining experience is a celebration of Assamese cuisine, featuring fresh, locally sourced ingredients prepared with traditional techniques. Our chefs are dedicated to showcasing the diverse flavors of the region, from aromatic curries and flavorful fish preparations to delectable sweets and refreshing beverages. We also offer cooking classes that allow guests to learn about the art of Assamese cooking and create their own culinary masterpieces. Emphasis is placed on utilizing seasonal produce and supporting local farmers and producers, further bolstering the regional economy. <br> <br>

Beyond accommodations and dining, Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort offers a range of curated experiences designed to connect guests with the region''s natural beauty and cultural heritage. These include guided nature walks through the surrounding hills, birdwatching tours led by knowledgeable local guides, visits to nearby tea gardens, and cultural performances showcasing traditional Assamese music and dance. We also offer opportunities for guests to participate in local craft workshops, learning about traditional weaving, pottery, and bamboo art from skilled artisans. These experiences provide a deeper understanding of Assamese culture and foster a sense of connection to the local community. The resort also focuses on wellness, offering yoga sessions, massage services utilizing local herbs and oils, and meditative spaces for relaxation and rejuvenation. <br> <br>

Our unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of sustainable practices, authentic cultural experiences, and personalized service. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact while maximizing the positive impact we have on the local community. This commitment resonates with environmentally conscious travelers seeking authentic and meaningful experiences. <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Hospitality and Community Engagement</h2>

Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized experience for each guest. Our dedicated staff is committed to providing attentive and friendly service, ensuring that every need is met with warmth and efficiency. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality and treated as valued members of our extended family. We understand that every guest is unique, and we strive to tailor our services to meet their individual preferences and needs. <br> <br>

We actively engage with the local community, sourcing our products and services from local suppliers and artisans whenever possible. This not only supports the local economy but also provides guests with an authentic taste of Assamese culture. We also host regular community events, such as cultural festivals and workshops, that bring together locals and visitors to celebrate the region''s rich heritage. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we create a mutually beneficial partnership that enhances the overall guest experience. The resort participates in local tourism initiatives, promoting the region as a desirable destination for responsible and sustainable travel. We also strive to educate our guests about Assamese culture and environmental conservation, encouraging them to become ambassadors for the region. <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Sustainable Growth and Regional Leadership</h2>

Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort envisions a future of sustainable growth, becoming a leading example of responsible tourism in the region. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodations while maintaining our commitment to eco-friendly practices, developing new and innovative experiences that showcase the region''s unique cultural and natural assets, and further strengthening our relationships with the local community. We plan to implement more advanced sustainability measures, such as solar power generation and rainwater harvesting, to minimize our environmental footprint. We also aim to create educational programs that empower local communities to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its economic opportunities. In the coming years, we hope to achieve certifications for our sustainable practices, ensuring we adhere to high standards of environmental and social responsibility. Ultimately, Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort aims to be more than just a resort; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable tourism, cultural preservation, and community development in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:10:16.000Z'),
(1069, 'Hill View Holiday Home & Resort, Guwahati', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Hill View Holiday Home & Resort stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a serene escape from the bustling city life while providing easy access to the region’s rich cultural and natural attractions. More than just accommodation, Hill View is an experience, carefully crafted to provide both leisure and convenience for discerning travelers and local residents seeking a refreshing getaway. Positioned uniquely within the Guwahati hospitality sector, it combines the tranquility of a secluded retreat with the accessibility of a city-adjacent location, filling a crucial need for high-quality, restorative experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations catering to a diverse clientele. These range from cozy, family-friendly rooms in our Holiday Home section to luxurious suites within the Resort, each designed with meticulous attention to detail. Beyond accommodation, Hill View boasts a range of complementary services, including an on-site restaurant serving authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular international dishes, a well-maintained swimming pool, and beautifully landscaped gardens perfect for relaxation and leisurely strolls. We also provide event spaces suitable for weddings, corporate retreats, and family gatherings, equipped with modern amenities and customizable packages. A key differentiator is our focus on showcasing the local culture and heritage. This is reflected in our decor, cuisine, and curated experiences like guided tours to nearby tea gardens and cultural sites. We understand the needs of the local market, which values authenticity, personalized service, and a strong connection to the region''s identity. We strive to fulfill these needs by offering a genuine Assamese hospitality experience coupled with modern comforts and conveniences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Hill View''s operations. We aim to create a welcoming and personalized atmosphere for every guest. Our staff is meticulously trained to anticipate needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. From the moment a guest arrives until their departure, we prioritize attentiveness and responsiveness. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing a room; we strive to create a connection with our guests and the local community. We actively engage with local artisans and suppliers, promoting their products and showcasing the region''s talent. We also participate in local events and initiatives, contributing to the community''s well-being. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our online presence is equally important, with dedicated channels for responding to inquiries, addressing concerns, and maintaining transparent communication. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests, fostering a sense of loyalty and trust that extends beyond a single visit. By offering a personalized and culturally immersive experience, we aim to stand out from generic hotel chains and become a preferred destination for travelers seeking an authentic connection with Guwahati and Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Hill View Holiday Home & Resort envisions a future where it stands as a landmark destination, synonymous with quality hospitality and authentic Assamese experiences. Our long-term goals involve expanding our accommodation capacity to cater to the growing demand for tourism in the region. We plan to introduce new amenities and services, such as a spa and wellness center, and further enhance our event facilities to accommodate larger gatherings. Sustainability is also a key consideration, and we aim to implement eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, reducing our environmental footprint and promoting responsible tourism. We are exploring partnerships with local tourism operators to offer enhanced tour packages and curated experiences, showcasing the diverse attractions of Assam. We also plan to invest in technology to streamline our operations, improve communication with guests, and enhance the overall customer experience. Furthermore, we intend to develop training programs for local youth, equipping them with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in the hospitality industry, thus contributing to the region''s economic development. Ultimately, our vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that benefits both our guests and the local community, solidifying Hill View Holiday Home & Resort as a leading destination in Guwahati''s hospitality landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:10:22.000Z'),
(1070, 'Brahmaputra Calling!', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p><b>Brahmaputra Calling!: Unveiling Assam''s Treasures to the World</b></p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Brahmaputra Calling! is more than just a business; it''s a vibrant gateway to the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Northeast India. We are a specialized tourism and cultural experience provider dedicated to showcasing the authentic essence of Assam, offering curated journeys that resonate with discerning travelers seeking unique and immersive encounters. In a region often overlooked by mainstream tourism, Brahmaputra Calling! stands out by prioritizing sustainable practices, supporting local communities, and providing unparalleled access to Assam''s hidden gems.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core strength lies in crafting bespoke travel itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We offer a diverse portfolio of services, including:</p>

<ul>
    <li><b>Curated Tours:</b> We design thematic tours focusing on various aspects of Assamese culture, wildlife, and adventure. These include tea garden tours showcasing the art of tea making, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (home to the one-horned rhinoceros), river cruises along the mighty Brahmaputra, and cultural immersion experiences in tribal villages.</li>
    <li><b>Homestays and Eco-Lodges:</b> We partner with local families and eco-conscious accommodations to provide authentic and sustainable lodging options that immerse travelers in the local way of life. This fosters cultural exchange and contributes directly to the economic well-being of the communities we work with.</li>
    <li><b>Cultural Experiences:</b> We arrange interactive workshops and demonstrations featuring traditional Assamese crafts, cuisine, music, and dance. These experiences offer a deeper understanding of Assam''s heritage and provide opportunities for guests to connect with local artisans and performers.</li>
    <li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> We understand that every traveler has unique interests and preferences. Our team works closely with clients to create personalized itineraries that cater to their specific needs and ensure an unforgettable journey.</li>
    <li><b>Corporate Retreats & Team Building:</b> We design unique corporate events incorporating elements of Assamese culture and adventure, fostering collaboration and team spirit amidst the serene landscape.</li>
</ul>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our unwavering commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. We prioritize ethical tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and maximize benefits for local communities. We work with experienced local guides who possess in-depth knowledge of the region''s history, culture, and natural environment. This ensures that our guests receive accurate information and gain a genuine appreciation for Assam''s unique identity. Furthermore, our commitment to using locally sourced products and services helps to support the local economy and promote sustainable development.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Brahmaputra Calling!, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment for our guests, ensuring that their needs are met with professionalism and care. From the moment they make their inquiry to the completion of their journey, our team is dedicated to providing personalized attention and seamless support. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services. Our commitment to building strong relationships with local communities is reflected in the positive feedback we receive from our partners and the long-lasting memories we create for our guests. We actively participate in local festivals and events, showcasing Assamese culture to a wider audience and fostering a sense of pride within the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Brahmaputra Calling! envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Northeast India. We plan to expand our network of partner homestays and eco-lodges, further enhancing our commitment to community-based tourism. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as wellness tourism and adventure travel. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development programs for our local guides and staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to provide world-class service. We are also actively working on creating partnerships with international tourism organizations to promote Assam as a premier travel destination. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the region, preserving its rich cultural heritage and natural environment for future generations to enjoy. We aim to be a catalyst for responsible tourism, inspiring travelers to connect with Assam in a meaningful way and make a positive impact on the local communities.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:10:28.000Z'),
(1071, 'Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp is a unique and immersive nature-based tourism venture nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. It offers a sustainable and enriching experience, catering to travelers seeking authentic connection with the region''s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage. In a landscape increasingly aware of environmental responsibility, Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp stands out as a pioneer, promoting eco-tourism practices while providing an unforgettable experience for its guests. It contributes significantly to the local economy by creating employment opportunities and supporting local artisans, farmers, and communities. As Assam''s tourism sector grows, Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp provides a refreshing alternative to conventional tourism, emphasizing responsible travel and fostering a deep appreciation for the natural world. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core offerings of Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp revolve around providing comfortable and sustainable accommodation amidst nature. Guests can choose from a range of eco-friendly options, including thoughtfully designed bamboo cottages and elevated treehouses that blend seamlessly with the surrounding environment. These accommodations are crafted using locally sourced materials and designed to minimize environmental impact. Beyond accommodation, the camp offers a variety of guided nature treks and birdwatching tours, led by experienced local guides who share their intimate knowledge of the region''s flora and fauna. These treks are tailored to different fitness levels and interests, ensuring a rewarding experience for all. A key differentiator is the focus on immersive cultural experiences, which allows guests to interact directly with local communities. This includes opportunities to learn about traditional Assamese crafts, participate in cooking demonstrations featuring local ingredients, and witness cultural performances that showcase the region''s vibrant heritage. The camp also features a farm-to-table dining experience, serving fresh, seasonal meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients, promoting sustainable agriculture and supporting local farmers. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp''s philosophy. The business prides itself on providing personalized and attentive service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. Upon arrival, guests are greeted with warm hospitality and provided with a comprehensive orientation to the camp''s facilities and activities. The staff, drawn from the local community, are passionate about sharing their knowledge and love for the region with guests. The camp fosters a friendly and inclusive atmosphere, encouraging interaction between guests and staff, creating a sense of community. What truly sets Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp apart is its commitment to responsible tourism. The business actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local schools, promoting sustainable farming practices, and empowering local artisans. Guests are encouraged to participate in these initiatives, further enhancing their understanding of the local culture and environment. The camp also prioritizes environmental sustainability by implementing waste reduction programs, using renewable energy sources, and minimizing its carbon footprint. By focusing on responsible tourism and community engagement, Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp provides a unique and meaningful experience for its guests, while also contributing to the well-being of the local community. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp envisions becoming a leading eco-tourism destination in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and exceptional customer experiences. Future plans include expanding the range of accommodation options, adding more treehouses and perhaps glamping sites, while maintaining the focus on minimal environmental impact. The business aims to enhance its educational offerings by developing interpretive trails and workshops on local ecology and culture. There are also plans to establish a dedicated research center focused on biodiversity conservation and sustainable tourism practices in the region. Another key goal is to strengthen partnerships with local communities, providing greater economic opportunities and empowering them to become active participants in the tourism industry. Long-term, Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp aspires to serve as a model for sustainable tourism development, demonstrating how tourism can be a force for good, benefiting both the environment and the local community. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Georgie''s Retreat Eco Camp is poised to achieve its ambitious vision and solidify its position as a leader in the eco-tourism sector in Assam. </p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:10:34.000Z'),
(1072, 'Exotic Villa Homestay', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Exotic Villa Homestay: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>

<p>Exotic Villa Homestay offers a distinctive accommodation experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, blending the comforts of a modern guesthouse with the warmth and personalized service of a traditional Assamese home. Situated amidst the vibrant tapestry of the city, yet nestled away from the hustle and bustle, we provide a tranquil haven for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching stay. Unlike conventional hotels, Exotic Villa Homestay aims to immerse guests in the local culture, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation for the region''s unique heritage and hospitality. In a market increasingly dominated by standardized hotel chains, Exotic Villa Homestay distinguishes itself by providing a personalized, culturally relevant experience that resonates with both domestic and international visitors. We contribute to the local economy by sourcing local produce, supporting regional artisans, and employing members of the community, thereby reinforcing Assam''s rich cultural identity and promoting sustainable tourism.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and tastefully decorated rooms, each designed to reflect the essence of Assam''s artistic traditions. Rooms are equipped with modern amenities, including air conditioning, high-speed internet, and private bathrooms, ensuring a seamless blend of convenience and cultural immersion. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. This includes: customized guided tours of Guwahati and surrounding areas, tailored to individual interests; cooking classes focused on authentic Assamese cuisine, allowing guests to learn the secrets of local delicacies; cultural performances showcasing traditional Assamese music and dance; and assistance with travel arrangements, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free journey. One of our key differentiators is the emphasis on personalized service. We strive to understand each guest''s needs and preferences, curating experiences that cater to their individual interests. Whether it''s arranging a visit to a local tea garden, organizing a trek in the nearby hills, or simply recommending the best places to sample local street food, we go the extra mile to ensure that our guests have an unforgettable stay. Furthermore, we actively promote eco-tourism principles, encouraging responsible travel practices and minimizing our environmental impact. We source organic produce whenever possible, support local artisans, and actively participate in community initiatives aimed at preserving Assam''s natural beauty.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Exotic Villa Homestay, we believe that customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel valued and respected. Our staff are carefully selected and trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating guests'' needs and exceeding their expectations. We prioritize building genuine connections with our guests, fostering a sense of community and belonging. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and enhance the guest experience. One aspect that distinguishes us is our commitment to promoting local culture. We organize cultural events and workshops, providing opportunities for guests to interact with local artists and artisans. We also work closely with community organizations to support local initiatives and promote sustainable tourism. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by participating in local festivals, sponsoring community events, and supporting local businesses. We believe that by working together, we can create a vibrant and sustainable tourism ecosystem that benefits both visitors and residents alike. We regularly receive positive feedback regarding the cleanliness of our accommodations, the friendliness of our staff, and the authenticity of the cultural experiences we offer. Our commitment to providing exceptional customer service has resulted in a high rate of repeat customers and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Exotic Villa Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goal is to expand our operations, adding new locations and services while maintaining our commitment to quality and personalized service. We plan to introduce new cultural experiences, such as weaving workshops and pottery classes, further immersing guests in the rich artistic traditions of Assam. We also aim to develop partnerships with local tour operators and transportation providers, creating integrated travel packages that showcase the best of the region. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our online presence, reaching a wider audience and facilitating online bookings. We are committed to investing in technology and innovation, leveraging digital platforms to enhance the guest experience and streamline our operations. Our commitment to sustainability will remain a core focus as we grow. We plan to implement new environmental initiatives, such as rainwater harvesting and solar energy, further reducing our environmental impact. Ultimately, our vision is to create a business that not only provides exceptional travel experiences but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community. We believe that by fostering a culture of innovation, collaboration, and sustainability, we can achieve our goals and create a lasting positive impact on the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:15:08.000Z'),
(1073, 'Zisuku Villa & Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Zisuku Villa & Resort: A Sanctuary of Tranquility in the Heart of Assam</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled amidst the lush landscapes of Guwahati, Assam, Zisuku Villa & Resort offers a premium hospitality experience, blending modern comfort with the serene beauty of the region. More than just a place to stay, Zisuku is designed as a destination – a tranquil escape where guests can reconnect with nature, rejuvenate their senses, and experience the authentic charm of Assamese culture. In a region known for its burgeoning tourism sector, Zisuku distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, sustainable practices, and a deeply rooted connection to the local community. By offering a unique blend of luxury and authenticity, Zisuku Villa & Resort aims to redefine hospitality standards within Guwahati and become a preferred destination for both domestic and international travelers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Zisuku''s offerings lies a diverse range of services tailored to meet the needs of discerning travelers. Accommodation options include exquisitely designed villas that offer privacy and exclusivity, along with well-appointed resort rooms that provide unparalleled comfort. Each space is meticulously crafted to create a harmonious blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region. Beyond accommodation, Zisuku boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant that serves a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies alongside international favorites, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. The resort also features a state-of-the-art spa and wellness center, offering a range of rejuvenating treatments designed to promote relaxation and well-being.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Zisuku apart is its commitment to providing immersive experiences that showcase the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam. Guests can participate in guided tours of nearby tea gardens, explore the vibrant local markets, or embark on wildlife safaris to Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage site. Zisuku also offers cultural performances that showcase traditional Assamese music and dance, providing guests with an authentic and unforgettable cultural experience. These unique selling points not only cater to the growing demand for experiential travel but also contribute to the sustainable development of the local community by supporting local artisans, farmers, and cultural performers. By offering a holistic and immersive travel experience, Zisuku addresses the evolving needs of the modern traveler seeking authenticity and connection.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Zisuku Villa & Resort. Every interaction is carefully orchestrated to ensure that guests feel valued, respected, and cared for. From personalized check-in procedures to attentive concierge services, the staff at Zisuku are dedicated to exceeding expectations. The resort prides itself on its warm and welcoming atmosphere, where guests are treated as individuals rather than just room numbers. To enhance guest satisfaction, Zisuku actively seeks feedback and continuously strives to improve its services based on guest preferences. The resort also fosters strong relationships with the local community by sourcing products and services from local businesses, creating employment opportunities, and supporting local initiatives. This commitment to community engagement not only enriches the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the region. By creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, Zisuku aims to foster long-term relationships with its guests and become a trusted brand synonymous with exceptional hospitality.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Zisuku Villa & Resort envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, building upon its reputation as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the resort''s accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for luxury travel in the region. The resort also intends to introduce new and innovative services, such as adventure tourism packages, eco-tourism initiatives, and wellness retreats, catering to a wider range of traveler interests. Furthermore, Zisuku aims to strengthen its commitment to sustainable practices by implementing eco-friendly technologies and promoting responsible tourism. By investing in its infrastructure, expanding its service offerings, and embracing sustainable practices, Zisuku Villa & Resort is poised to become a leading force in the Assam hospitality industry, contributing to the economic growth and cultural preservation of the region. The long-term goal is to establish Zisuku as a benchmark for excellence in hospitality, recognized for its commitment to customer satisfaction, community engagement, and environmental sustainability.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:15:14.000Z'),
(1074, 'The Blue Orchid Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'The Blue Orchid Resort: A Serene Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati

The Blue Orchid Resort offers a tranquil escape from the bustling city life of Guwahati, presenting a harmonious blend of modern comfort and Assamese hospitality. Situated amidst lush greenery, the resort is strategically located to provide easy access to key attractions while maintaining a serene and secluded ambiance. Unlike generic hotels, The Blue Orchid Resort aims to provide a holistic experience, celebrating the culture, cuisine, and natural beauty of Assam. The resort has quickly become a preferred destination for both leisure and business travelers, distinguishing itself as a unique establishment within Guwahati''s hospitality sector by focusing on personalized service and authentic local experiences.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings revolve around providing exceptional accommodation, diverse dining experiences, and versatile event spaces. Our well-appointed rooms and suites cater to a variety of needs, from solo travelers seeking a quiet retreat to families desiring a comfortable and spacious stay. Each room is designed with a focus on comfort and aesthetics, featuring modern amenities and tasteful décor reflecting the region''s artistic heritage.

<br> <br>

The resort''s dining options are a significant draw, showcasing the rich culinary tapestry of Assam and beyond. Our multi-cuisine restaurant offers a curated menu featuring traditional Assamese dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients, alongside popular Indian and international fare. We also provide customized dining experiences, including private dinners and themed buffets, catering to specific dietary requirements and preferences. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to promoting Assamese cuisine and supporting local farmers and producers. This approach not only provides a distinctive culinary experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the local community.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, The Blue Orchid Resort boasts state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, making it an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. Our event spaces are designed to be flexible and adaptable, accommodating both small meetings and large-scale celebrations. The resort provides comprehensive event planning services, ensuring that every detail is meticulously managed to create a seamless and memorable experience. By offering a comprehensive range of services and focusing on quality and customization, The Blue Orchid Resort directly addresses the growing demand for sophisticated and personalized hospitality in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

At The Blue Orchid Resort, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our staff is carefully trained to provide warm, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and comfortable. We strive to anticipate the needs of our guests and go the extra mile to exceed their expectations. This proactive approach to customer service has earned us a loyal clientele and positive word-of-mouth referrals.

<br> <br>

We are committed to connecting with the local community through various initiatives. We actively support local artisans and craftsmen by showcasing their work in our gift shop and incorporating their designs into our décor. We also partner with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to community development projects. Furthermore, we organize cultural events and performances that showcase the rich heritage of Assam, providing our guests with a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local culture. This strong community engagement fosters goodwill and reinforces our position as a responsible and valued member of the Guwahati business landscape.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, The Blue Orchid Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for eco-tourism and cultural immersion in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options, developing new and innovative dining concepts, and enhancing our event facilities. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local tour operators to offer curated excursions that showcase the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam.

<br> <br>

We are committed to adopting sustainable business practices and minimizing our environmental impact. This includes implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and promoting responsible water usage. We believe that by operating in a sustainable and ethical manner, we can contribute to the long-term prosperity of the local community and protect the environment for future generations.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goal is to establish The Blue Orchid Resort as a landmark destination in Guwahati, synonymous with exceptional hospitality, authentic local experiences, and sustainable tourism. We are confident that our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement will enable us to achieve this vision and solidify our position as a leader in the region''s hospitality industry.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:15:19.000Z'),
(1075, 'Madhumita''s Homestay', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Madhumita''s Homestay: A Sanctuary of Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati

Madhumita''s Homestay offers an authentic and immersive experience of Assam, nestled in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a place to stay, it''s a portal to the rich culture, traditions, and warm hospitality that define this vibrant region of India. In a city increasingly dominated by generic hotel chains, Madhumita''s Homestay provides a refreshing alternative, catering to discerning travelers seeking genuine connection and personalized service. We aim to be a significant contributor to Assam''s burgeoning tourism sector by showcasing the unique charm and beauty of the state to a global audience, providing an income source for local communities through employment and collaborations. Our commitment extends to promoting sustainable tourism practices that respect the environment and preserve Assam''s cultural heritage.

<br> <br>

At its core, Madhumita''s Homestay provides comfortable and welcoming accommodation designed to reflect the traditional Assamese aesthetic. Our rooms are thoughtfully furnished with local materials and handcrafted details, creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere. Beyond the rooms themselves, we offer a range of services designed to enhance our guests'' experience. This includes home-cooked meals featuring authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor the flavors of the region, from the tangy Masor Tenga (fish sour curry) to the comforting Khar (alkaline dish).

<br> <br>

What truly distinguishes Madhumita''s Homestay is the emphasis on personalized experiences. We offer guided tours of Guwahati and its surrounding areas, including visits to the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum. We can also arrange excursions to Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site renowned for its population of one-horned rhinoceroses. Furthermore, we facilitate cultural interactions, such as opportunities to learn traditional Assamese weaving, participate in Bihu dance workshops, or attend local festivals. This hands-on approach allows guests to deeply engage with the local culture and create lasting memories. Our unique selling point lies in offering these curated experiences, going beyond basic accommodation to provide a holistic and enriching journey. This resonates with a market increasingly seeking authentic travel experiences and a desire to connect with the local culture.

<br> <br>

Customer service at Madhumita''s Homestay is rooted in genuine care and attention to detail. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests feel like part of the family. From the moment they arrive, they are greeted with genuine smiles and personalized assistance. We take the time to understand their individual needs and preferences, tailoring our services to ensure a comfortable and memorable stay. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests, fostering a sense of community and belonging. We actively engage with the local community by sourcing products and services from local artisans and businesses. We also participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility. By fostering these connections, we not only enhance the guest experience but also contribute to the well-being of the local community. Positive word-of-mouth referrals are a testament to the effectiveness of this approach, forming a vital part of our marketing strategy.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Madhumita''s Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and cultural preservation. We plan to expand our services to include more curated experiences, such as culinary tours, tea garden visits, and opportunities to learn about Assamese medicinal plants. We also aim to develop partnerships with local organizations to promote responsible tourism practices and support community development initiatives. This may include offering training programs for local youth in hospitality and tourism, empowering them to participate in the growing tourism sector.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of expanding our physical presence, adding more rooms and facilities to accommodate the growing demand for our unique brand of hospitality. This expansion will be carefully planned to ensure that it remains true to our core values and does not compromise the intimate and personalized atmosphere that defines Madhumita''s Homestay. We intend to utilize technology to enhance the guest experience, such as online booking platforms, virtual tours, and digital information resources. However, we will always prioritize human interaction and maintain a personal touch in our service delivery. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional hospitality but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of Assam. By staying true to our roots and embracing innovation, we believe that Madhumita''s Homestay will continue to flourish and serve as a beacon of Assamese hospitality for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:15:25.000Z'),
(1076, 'Saanvi Royal Club', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Saanvi Royal Club stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of luxury, recreation, and community engagement. Nestled in the heart of the city, the Club provides an exclusive environment for members to connect, unwind, and pursue their passions. More than just a social hub, Saanvi Royal Club is committed to enriching the lives of its members by providing exceptional facilities, personalized services, and a vibrant social calendar. In a region known for its strong community bonds and appreciation for refined experiences, Saanvi Royal Club fills a distinct niche, offering a sophisticated space for business and leisure.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>The core of Saanvi Royal Club’s offerings lies in its comprehensive suite of services and meticulously maintained facilities. Central to the Club is its state-of-the-art fitness center, equipped with the latest cardiovascular and strength-training equipment, alongside dedicated spaces for yoga, Pilates, and other group fitness classes. Expert trainers are available to provide personalized fitness plans tailored to individual needs and goals. Complementing the fitness facilities is a luxurious spa offering a range of rejuvenating treatments, including massages, facials, and body wraps, providing a sanctuary for relaxation and well-being.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Beyond fitness and wellness, Saanvi Royal Club boasts exceptional dining experiences. Multiple restaurants and bars cater to diverse palates, ranging from authentic Assamese cuisine highlighting local flavors to international dishes prepared with the finest ingredients. The Club also offers private dining rooms, ideal for business meetings, family gatherings, or special celebrations. Moreover, Saanvi Royal Club provides extensive recreational amenities, including a swimming pool, tennis courts, and badminton courts, encouraging members to engage in healthy and enjoyable activities. A dedicated children’s play area and activity center ensure that families can enjoy quality time together within the Club''s secure and engaging environment.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>What truly distinguishes Saanvi Royal Club is its commitment to fostering a strong sense of community among its members. The Club regularly organizes a variety of social events, including themed parties, live music performances, cultural celebrations, and networking opportunities. These events provide members with ample opportunities to connect with like-minded individuals, build relationships, and expand their social and professional circles. The Club also hosts workshops, seminars, and guest speaker events on topics ranging from business and finance to arts and culture, enriching the intellectual and cultural lives of its members. The unique selling point of Saanvi Royal Club lies in its ability to seamlessly blend luxury, recreation, and community, offering a holistic experience that caters to the diverse needs and interests of its discerning clientele. By providing a welcoming and inclusive environment, the Club addresses the local market''s desire for a sophisticated social hub that promotes personal growth, well-being, and meaningful connections.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Saanvi Royal Club. From the moment a member enters the Club, they are greeted with warm hospitality and personalized attention. A dedicated concierge service is available to assist members with their needs, whether it''s making reservations, arranging transportation, or providing information about local attractions. The Club''s staff is meticulously trained to anticipate and exceed member expectations, ensuring that every visit is a memorable and enjoyable experience. Saanvi Royal Club actively seeks feedback from its members to continuously improve its services and offerings. Regular surveys and focus groups are conducted to gather insights into member preferences and identify areas for enhancement. The Club also encourages open communication through various channels, including a dedicated member portal and a responsive customer service team.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>To further connect with the local community, Saanvi Royal Club actively supports local charities and initiatives. The Club regularly hosts fundraising events and partners with local organizations to address community needs. By engaging in social responsibility initiatives, Saanvi Royal Club demonstrates its commitment to making a positive impact on the lives of people in Guwahati. This active community involvement strengthens the Club''s reputation and fosters a sense of pride among its members.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Looking ahead, Saanvi Royal Club envisions significant growth and expansion. The Club plans to introduce new facilities and services to further enhance the member experience. This includes potentially expanding the fitness center, adding new recreational amenities, and introducing innovative dining concepts. The Club also aims to expand its membership base by attracting new members from diverse backgrounds and interests. Strategic marketing initiatives and targeted outreach programs will be implemented to raise awareness of the Club''s offerings and attract prospective members.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>In the long term, Saanvi Royal Club aspires to become the premier social and recreational destination in Guwahati and the surrounding region. The Club is committed to maintaining its high standards of quality and service, while continuously innovating and adapting to meet the evolving needs of its members. By fostering a strong sense of community, providing exceptional facilities, and engaging in social responsibility initiatives, Saanvi Royal Club aims to create a lasting legacy as a vital contributor to the social and economic fabric of Guwahati. The Club''s ultimate goal is to provide an unparalleled experience for its members, enriching their lives and fostering a sense of belonging that extends beyond the Club''s walls.
</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:15:34.000Z'),
(1077, 'Capital O Spring Valley Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Capital O Spring Valley Resort stands as a tranquil oasis on the outskirts of Guwahati, offering a blend of modern comfort and Assamese hospitality. More than just a resort, it''s a destination designed to cater to both leisure travelers seeking respite from the bustling city and corporate clients requiring a productive and serene environment for conferences and retreats. Situated amidst lush greenery, the resort provides a refreshing escape, setting it apart from the more conventional hotels within the city limits. Its significance lies in its ability to cater to the growing demand for premium accommodation options that provide an immersive experience, connecting visitors with the natural beauty of Assam, without compromising on accessibility to the city.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Capital O Spring Valley Resort''s offerings are its meticulously designed rooms and suites, each promising a comfortable and rejuvenating stay. The resort boasts a range of accommodation options, from standard rooms tailored for budget-conscious travelers to spacious suites perfect for families or extended stays. Beyond accommodation, the resort excels in providing comprehensive event hosting services. It features multiple well-equipped conference halls and outdoor spaces suitable for weddings, corporate events, and social gatherings. Culinary experiences are a key highlight, with an on-site restaurant serving a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and international cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The swimming pool, fitness center, and recreational activities such as nature walks and birdwatching enhance the guest experience, creating a truly memorable stay. Its unique selling point is the combination of modern amenities with the tranquility of its natural surroundings, offering a unique escape that is hard to replicate in downtown Guwahati. These services directly address the needs of a market that values both comfort and convenience, while also seeking authentic experiences rooted in the local environment.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Capital O Spring Valley Resort. The resort prides itself on its personalized service, with a dedicated team committed to ensuring every guest''s needs are met promptly and efficiently. From the warm welcome at check-in to the attentive service in the restaurant and the efficient handling of event logistics, the focus is always on exceeding expectations. What truly makes the business stand out is its genuine commitment to showcasing Assamese culture and hospitality. Staff members are encouraged to share their knowledge of local traditions, customs, and attractions, fostering a deeper connection between guests and the region. The resort actively engages with the local community by sourcing products and services from local suppliers, supporting local artisans, and participating in community events. This not only strengthens the resort''s ties to the community but also contributes to the economic well-being of the region. The team is trained to be sensitive to the needs of both domestic and international travelers, ensuring a culturally aware and respectful environment for all guests.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Capital O Spring Valley Resort envisions becoming the premier destination for leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the resort''s capacity with additional rooms and suites, adding new recreational facilities such as a spa and wellness center, and further enhancing its event hosting capabilities. The resort aims to strengthen its position as a sustainable and environmentally responsible business by implementing green initiatives such as reducing energy consumption, minimizing waste, and promoting eco-friendly practices. A key long-term goal is to develop partnerships with local tour operators and tourism agencies to offer curated experiences that showcase the diverse attractions of Assam, including tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and cultural heritage sites. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Capital O Spring Valley Resort is committed to providing exceptional hospitality and contributing to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam. The ultimate ambition is to establish the resort as a landmark destination, synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:20:07.000Z'),
(1078, 'Ethnic Village Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Ethnic Village Resort: A Gateway to Assam''s Rich Cultural Heritage</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Ethnic Village Resort offers an immersive experience into the vibrant tapestry of Assam''s diverse ethnic communities. More than just a resort, it''s a cultural sanctuary designed to preserve, promote, and celebrate the rich heritage of the region. In a rapidly modernizing world, Ethnic Village Resort stands as a unique testament to the enduring traditions, art, and lifestyles of Assam''s indigenous tribes, providing both a tranquil escape for visitors and a vital platform for local artisans and performers. It addresses a growing demand for authentic cultural tourism, providing an alternative to conventional hospitality options and solidifying its position as a significant contributor to the local economy and cultural preservation efforts.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The resort''s core offerings are meticulously crafted to provide a holistic and engaging cultural journey. Accommodation consists of traditionally styled cottages, each reflecting the unique architectural designs of different Assamese ethnic groups. Guests can choose to stay in a Bodo-inspired dwelling, a Mishing chang ghar (stilt house), or a Karbi-style hut, among others. These aren''t simply themed rooms; they are constructed using traditional materials and techniques, offering an authentic glimpse into the daily lives of these communities.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond accommodation, Ethnic Village Resort provides a range of immersive experiences. These include traditional Assamese cooking classes, where guests learn to prepare local delicacies using indigenous ingredients and methods. Weaving demonstrations showcase the intricate artistry of Assamese textiles, renowned for their silk and vibrant patterns. Folk dance and music performances, often featuring local tribes, offer a captivating window into the region''s rich artistic traditions. Furthermore, the resort curates guided tours to nearby villages, allowing guests to interact directly with local communities, learn about their customs, and purchase handcrafted souvenirs directly from the artisans, fostering economic empowerment and cultural exchange. A dedicated museum within the resort grounds showcases artifacts, costumes, and historical information about the different ethnic groups of Assam. What distinguishes Ethnic Village Resort is its commitment to authenticity and sustainability. Unlike some cultural resorts that offer a superficial experience, Ethnic Village Resort actively collaborates with local communities, ensuring that the cultural representations are accurate and respectful. A significant portion of the resort’s revenue is reinvested into supporting local artisans, cultural preservation projects, and community development initiatives.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Ethnic Village Resort, customer service is deeply rooted in Assamese hospitality, known for its warmth and genuine care. Every staff member is trained to be a cultural ambassador, capable of sharing insights into the region''s history, traditions, and customs. The resort strives to create a personalized and enriching experience for each guest, anticipating their needs and going the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. This dedication to exceptional service, combined with the unique cultural offerings, has earned the resort a loyal following among both domestic and international travelers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, Ethnic Village Resort actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. It partners with local schools and organizations to offer educational programs on Assamese culture and heritage. The resort also hosts cultural events and festivals that are open to the public, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talents. By fostering a strong sense of community and cultural pride, Ethnic Village Resort strengthens its bond with the local population and reinforces its commitment to preserving Assam''s rich heritage for future generations. Guest feedback is actively solicited and incorporated into the resort''s operations, ensuring continuous improvement and responsiveness to the evolving needs of its clientele.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Ethnic Village Resort envisions expanding its reach and impact. Future plans include developing additional cottages that represent even more of Assam''s diverse ethnic communities. The resort also aims to create a dedicated cultural center that will serve as a hub for research, education, and artistic expression. A key objective is to enhance the sustainability of the resort''s operations, incorporating eco-friendly practices and reducing its environmental footprint. This includes exploring renewable energy sources, implementing waste management programs, and sourcing local and organic products whenever possible. The long-term goal is to establish Ethnic Village Resort as a leading destination for sustainable cultural tourism in Northeast India, attracting visitors from around the world who are eager to experience the authentic beauty and richness of Assam''s heritage. Further expansion may include offering specialized wellness programs incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices and collaborating with other tourism operators to promote integrated cultural tourism circuits in the region. Ethnic Village Resort seeks to be more than just a resort; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive social, economic, and cultural change in Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:20:13.000Z'),
(1079, 'Segun Bagan Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Segun Bagan Resort: A Serene Escape in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Segun Bagan Resort is a premier hospitality destination nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a resort, it''s an oasis of tranquility, offering guests an unparalleled experience steeped in local culture and natural beauty. Recognizing the growing demand for both leisure and business travel in the region, Segun Bagan Resort fills a vital need for high-quality accommodation and exceptional service, contributing significantly to the burgeoning Assam tourism and hospitality sector. We are committed to providing an authentic and memorable experience that reflects the unique charm and warmth of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Comfort and Convenience</p>

<p>At Segun Bagan Resort, we offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests. Our primary offerings include exquisitely appointed rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide the utmost comfort and relaxation. These accommodations range from elegantly furnished standard rooms ideal for solo travelers and couples to spacious suites perfect for families and extended stays. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and climate control, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. <br> <br> Beyond accommodation, Segun Bagan Resort boasts a range of facilities designed to enhance the guest experience. Our in-house restaurant serves a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies and international cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This emphasis on regional flavors distinguishes us from other resorts, offering guests an authentic culinary journey. We also provide banquet and conference facilities, making Segun Bagan Resort an ideal venue for business meetings, corporate retreats, and social gatherings. Our event spaces are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and can be customized to meet the specific requirements of each event. <br> <br> What truly sets Segun Bagan Resort apart is our commitment to personalized service and attention to detail. We offer a range of concierge services, including airport transfers, tour bookings, and car rentals, ensuring that our guests can explore the region with ease and convenience. Our experienced and dedicated staff are always on hand to assist with any request, ensuring a truly seamless and unforgettable experience. Moreover, we incorporate elements of Assamese culture, such as traditional decor and cultural performances, to provide a unique and immersive experience that resonates with both domestic and international travelers.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer Experience: Where Hospitality Meets Heart</p>

<p>At Segun Bagan Resort, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our approach is rooted in the principles of empathy, responsiveness, and personalized attention. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality, setting the tone for a memorable stay. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and facilities. <br> <br> We strive to create a strong connection with the local community by supporting local businesses and initiatives. We partner with local artisans and vendors to source unique products and experiences, allowing our guests to immerse themselves in the authentic culture of Assam. Furthermore, we actively participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of the local community. We also prioritize employing local residents, providing them with valuable employment opportunities and contributing to the economic growth of the region. <br> <br> Segun Bagan Resort fosters a welcoming and inclusive environment for all guests. Our staff are trained to be sensitive to the diverse needs and preferences of our guests, ensuring that everyone feels comfortable and valued. We go above and beyond to anticipate and fulfill the needs of our guests, creating a personalized and memorable experience that exceeds their expectations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enriching Experiences</p>

<p>Segun Bagan Resort is committed to sustainable growth and continuous improvement. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, including the addition of eco-friendly cottages and luxury villas. We also plan to develop additional recreational facilities, such as a swimming pool, spa, and fitness center, further enhancing the guest experience. <br> <br> We envision Segun Bagan Resort as a leading eco-tourism destination in Assam, promoting sustainable practices and responsible travel. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact by implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. We aim to educate our guests about the importance of environmental conservation and encourage them to participate in sustainable tourism practices. <br> <br> Our long-term goals include establishing Segun Bagan Resort as a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with exceptional service, authentic experiences, and sustainable practices. We plan to expand our presence to other key tourist destinations in Assam and the Northeast, creating a network of resorts that offer a seamless and unforgettable travel experience. Ultimately, our vision is to be a catalyst for positive change in the Assam tourism industry, promoting sustainable growth, empowering local communities, and showcasing the unique beauty and culture of the region to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:20:21.000Z'),
(1080, 'Kumars Green Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Kumars Green Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility in Guwahati''s Embrace</p>

<p>Kumars Green Resort offers a rejuvenating escape from the hustle and bustle of city life, providing a serene sanctuary nestled amidst the lush landscapes surrounding Guwahati. More than just a getaway, the resort is meticulously crafted to blend seamlessly with the natural environment, offering guests an immersive experience that celebrates Assam''s rich cultural heritage and breathtaking biodiversity. Positioned strategically to offer both accessibility and seclusion, Kumars Green Resort is rapidly emerging as a significant player in the Guwahati hospitality sector, catering to both leisure travelers seeking respite and corporate clients in search of a conducive environment for retreats and conferences. The resort''s commitment to sustainable practices and community engagement further distinguishes it, aligning with the growing demand for eco-conscious tourism within the region and contributing positively to the local economy.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Comfort and Nature</p>

<p>At the heart of Kumars Green Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality through a diverse range of services tailored to meet the needs of discerning travelers. The resort boasts elegantly appointed accommodations, ranging from cozy cottages to spacious suites, all designed to offer maximum comfort while maintaining a rustic charm that reflects the local aesthetic. A key offering is the immersive nature experiences, including guided treks through nearby tea gardens, birdwatching tours led by local experts, and opportunities to explore the vibrant flora and fauna of the region. The resort''s in-house restaurant showcases the diverse flavors of Assamese cuisine, utilizing locally sourced ingredients to create authentic culinary experiences. For corporate clients, Kumars Green Resort provides state-of-the-art conference facilities equipped with modern amenities, ideal for hosting meetings, seminars, and team-building events. The unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of nature, culture, and hospitality, offering a truly holistic experience unavailable elsewhere in Guwahati. The resort addresses a growing market need for sustainable and authentic tourism, providing an alternative to generic hotel experiences and promoting responsible travel within the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer Experience: Crafting Memorable Moments with Assamese Hospitality</p>

<p>Kumars Green Resort prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else, fostering a culture of genuine hospitality and personalized service. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm smiles and attentive assistance, ensuring a seamless and memorable experience. The resort prides itself on its well-trained staff, who are knowledgeable about the local area and eager to share their insights with visitors. Recognizing the importance of cultural immersion, Kumars Green Resort actively involves the local community in its operations, providing employment opportunities and showcasing local art, crafts, and traditions. Regular cultural performances and workshops are organized to provide guests with a deeper understanding of Assam''s rich heritage. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered to continuously improve the guest experience. What truly sets Kumars Green Resort apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its guests, creating a sense of belonging and encouraging repeat visits. The resort also actively participates in local initiatives, supporting community development projects and promoting environmental awareness, further solidifying its connection with the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Future Vision: Growing Roots and Expanding Horizons</p>

<p>Kumars Green Resort envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued contribution to the Guwahati tourism landscape. The long-term goal is to establish the resort as a leading eco-tourism destination in Assam, renowned for its commitment to environmental conservation, cultural preservation, and exceptional hospitality. Future plans include expanding the resort''s accommodations, adding new amenities such as a wellness center offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments, and developing innovative tour packages that showcase the diverse attractions of the region. Furthermore, the resort aims to strengthen its ties with the local community through increased collaboration with artisans, farmers, and cultural organizations. Embracing technology is also a key aspect of the future vision, with plans to implement online booking platforms, enhance digital marketing efforts, and leverage data analytics to personalize the guest experience. By focusing on sustainable practices, community engagement, and continuous innovation, Kumars Green Resort is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a beacon of responsible tourism in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:20:26.000Z'),
(1081, 'ANIYAA EDITION A LUXURY BOUTIQUE HOTEL AND BANQUETS', 'Resorts', NULL, 'ANIYAA EDITION: A LUXURY BOUTIQUE HOTEL AND BANQUETS

Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, ANIYAA EDITION is a premier luxury boutique hotel and banquets, redefining hospitality in Assam. More than just a place to stay or host an event, ANIYAA EDITION is an experience, meticulously crafted to blend modern elegance with the rich cultural heritage of the region. We stand as a beacon of refined comfort and personalized service, catering to discerning travelers and those seeking an exceptional venue for memorable celebrations. In a city rapidly embracing global trends, ANIYAA EDITION distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of international standards and authentic Assamese hospitality, filling a crucial gap in the market for sophisticated and intimate experiences. We contribute to the local business landscape by attracting high-value tourism and providing a platform for showcasing local artistry and culinary excellence.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings revolve around providing unparalleled luxury and bespoke service in both accommodation and event hosting. As a boutique hotel, we offer a limited number of exquisitely designed rooms and suites, each reflecting a commitment to impeccable detail and guest comfort. Each room is appointed with premium amenities, from plush bedding and state-of-the-art entertainment systems to meticulously curated local artwork, providing a sense of place and cultural immersion. Our banqueting facilities are equally impressive, boasting versatile spaces that can be tailored to accommodate a wide range of events, from intimate gatherings to grand celebrations. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to personalization. We understand that every guest and every event is unique. Our dedicated team of event planners and hospitality professionals work closely with each client to curate bespoke experiences that exceed expectations, paying meticulous attention to every detail from décor and catering to entertainment and logistics. This personalized approach, combined with our luxurious amenities and prime location, directly addresses the local market''s growing demand for high-end event venues and sophisticated accommodation options. We source local ingredients and partner with local artisans, supporting the regional economy and offering guests an authentic taste of Assam.

<br> <br>

At ANIYAA EDITION, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating not just satisfied customers, but loyal advocates. Our approach to customer service is rooted in anticipating needs, exceeding expectations, and fostering genuine connections. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our well-trained staff is dedicated to providing seamless and intuitive service, ensuring that every aspect of their stay or event is flawless. We proactively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. But our commitment extends beyond just the confines of the hotel. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, support for cultural initiatives, and participation in community events. We aim to be more than just a business; we want to be a contributing member of the Guwahati community, fostering a sense of belonging and shared prosperity. We regularly host events showcasing local talent and promoting Assamese culture, further cementing our connection with the community and offering guests a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local way of life. Our commitment to sustainability and ethical practices further resonates with the community, fostering trust and loyalty.

<br> <br>

The future vision for ANIYAA EDITION is to establish ourselves as the undisputed leader in luxury boutique hospitality and event hosting in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our services and offerings, while remaining true to our core values of personalized service, luxurious comfort, and authentic cultural immersion. This includes exploring opportunities to add specialized wellness services, enhance our culinary offerings with innovative regional cuisine, and develop unique experiential packages that showcase the best of Assam. We are also exploring strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector to create synergistic offerings that enhance the overall visitor experience in Guwahati. Our long-term goals include expanding our brand presence to other key locations in Northeast India, bringing our unique blend of luxury and local flavor to a wider audience. We envision ANIYAA EDITION becoming a symbol of excellence in hospitality, a catalyst for economic growth in the region, and a proud ambassador of Assamese culture to the world. We are committed to continuous innovation, staying ahead of industry trends, and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers, ensuring that ANIYAA EDITION remains a destination of choice for discerning travelers and event organizers for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:20:32.000Z'),
(1082, 'Vivanta Guwahati', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Vivanta Guwahati: A Gateway to Elevated Experiences in Assam</p>

<p>Vivanta Guwahati stands as a beacon of refined hospitality and exceptional service within the vibrant and burgeoning business landscape of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to stay, Vivanta Guwahati is a destination – a meticulously crafted environment designed to cater to the discerning needs of business travelers, leisure seekers, and the local community alike. Nestled strategically within Guwahati, the hotel offers unparalleled accessibility to key commercial hubs, cultural landmarks, and transportation networks, making it an ideal base for exploring the region. Vivanta Guwahati strives to seamlessly blend global standards of excellence with the warmth and authenticity of Assamese hospitality, creating a truly unique and memorable experience for every guest. It contributes significantly to the local economy, providing employment opportunities and supporting local businesses, thereby playing an integral role in the region''s growth story. The hotel is known for its commitment to sustainable practices, minimizing its environmental footprint and actively engaging with the local community through various initiatives.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Elevated Hospitality: Core Services and Products</p>

<p>Vivanta Guwahati offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. At its heart are exquisitely appointed guest rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide a haven of comfort and tranquility. From stylishly furnished interiors to state-of-the-art amenities, every detail is carefully considered to ensure a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Vivanta Guwahati excels in its culinary offerings. Multiple dining venues tantalize the palate with a diverse range of flavors, from authentic Assamese cuisine that showcases local ingredients and culinary traditions to international delicacies prepared by seasoned chefs. The hotel''s banquet and conferencing facilities are equipped with the latest technology and supported by a dedicated events team, making it an ideal venue for corporate meetings, conferences, and social gatherings. The hotel also offers a fully equipped fitness center and spa, providing guests with opportunities to rejuvenate and unwind. What sets Vivanta Guwahati apart is its unwavering commitment to personalized service. From customized catering options to bespoke travel arrangements, the hotel''s team goes the extra mile to anticipate and exceed guest expectations. These services directly address the needs of the local market by providing a premium venue for business events, offering a sophisticated dining experience for local residents, and contributing to the overall tourism infrastructure of Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Crafting Unforgettable Experiences: The Customer-Centric Approach</p>

<p>At Vivanta Guwahati, the guest experience is paramount. The hotel cultivates a culture of genuine care and attentiveness, empowering its staff to create meaningful connections with every guest. This commitment to exceptional service is reflected in consistently positive guest feedback and a strong reputation for hospitality excellence. The hotel distinguishes itself through its proactive approach to anticipating guest needs, offering personalized recommendations, and promptly addressing any concerns. Furthermore, Vivanta Guwahati actively engages with the local community, organizing cultural events and supporting local artisans and businesses. This commitment to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the hotel''s position as a valued member of the Guwahati community. The hotel regularly partners with local organizations to promote Assamese art, culture, and traditions, showcasing the region''s rich heritage to its guests and contributing to its preservation. Vivanta Guwahati’s focus extends beyond simply providing accommodation and dining; it aims to create lasting memories and foster a sense of connection with the local culture and community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking Ahead: A Vision for Growth and Excellence</p>

<p>Vivanta Guwahati envisions a future marked by continued growth, innovation, and a steadfast commitment to delivering exceptional experiences. The hotel aims to further enhance its services and facilities to meet the evolving needs of its guests and the local market. Expansion plans may include the addition of new guest rooms and suites, the introduction of innovative dining concepts, and the enhancement of its conferencing and event facilities. Vivanta Guwahati is also exploring opportunities to integrate sustainable practices further into its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the local community. The hotel is committed to investing in the training and development of its staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge to deliver world-class service. By continually striving for excellence and embracing innovation, Vivanta Guwahati aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a valuable contributor to the region''s economic and cultural development. It aims to be synonymous with quality, innovation, and a genuine commitment to providing unforgettable experiences.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:25:08.000Z'),
(1083, 'Eagle Nest Home Stay', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Eagle Nest Home Stay: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati

Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Eagle Nest Home Stay offers a unique blend of comfortable accommodation and immersive cultural experiences. More than just a place to rest your head, we provide a gateway to exploring the rich tapestry of Assamese traditions, cuisine, and natural beauty. In a region increasingly catering to discerning travelers seeking authentic and personalized experiences, Eagle Nest Home Stay distinguishes itself by providing a haven that combines modern amenities with a genuine connection to the local community. We contribute to the vibrant tourism sector of Assam by promoting responsible tourism practices and showcasing the unique charm of Guwahati and its surrounding areas.

<br> <br>

Our core service revolves around providing well-appointed and thoughtfully designed accommodation to both domestic and international travelers. We offer a range of room options, from cozy standard rooms perfect for solo adventurers or couples, to larger family suites equipped with all the necessary comforts. Each room is designed with meticulous attention to detail, blending modern aesthetics with elements of traditional Assamese design, creating a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere. Beyond accommodation, we offer a curated selection of experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. This includes Assamese cooking classes where guests can learn to prepare traditional dishes, guided tours of local temples and historical sites, and opportunities to participate in traditional Assamese crafts like silk weaving. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly integrate comfort with cultural immersion, creating memorable experiences that go beyond the typical tourist itinerary. We cater to the growing demand for experiential travel, offering a more enriching and authentic alternative to conventional hotels.

<br> <br>

At Eagle Nest Home Stay, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on genuine warmth, personalized attention, and a deep understanding of our guests'' needs. We go above and beyond to ensure that every guest feels welcomed and cared for, from providing personalized recommendations for local attractions to arranging transportation and assisting with any special requests. We actively engage with the local community by sourcing local produce for our kitchen, supporting local artisans by showcasing their crafts, and promoting local businesses through our concierge services. This not only ensures that our guests experience the authentic flavors of Assam but also contributes to the sustainable development of the local economy. We foster a strong sense of community by organizing cultural events and activities that bring together guests and locals, creating opportunities for meaningful interactions and cultural exchange. We are committed to building lasting relationships with our guests, turning them into ambassadors for Assam and for Eagle Nest Home Stay.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Eagle Nest Home Stay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, developing new and innovative cultural experiences, and further strengthening our ties with the local community. We plan to incorporate eco-friendly practices into our operations, such as using renewable energy sources and reducing waste, to minimize our environmental impact. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local NGOs and community organizations to support social and environmental initiatives in the region. Our vision is to create a positive impact on the local community while providing our guests with unforgettable experiences that celebrate the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we aspire to be a catalyst for cultural exchange and sustainable tourism in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:25:12.000Z'),
(1084, 'Mawing resort', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Mawing Resort: A Sanctuary of Tranquility in the Heart of Assam

Nestled amidst the lush green landscapes surrounding Guwahati, Mawing Resort offers a unique blend of serenity and modern hospitality, making it a premier destination for both leisure and business travelers in the region. Unlike typical hotels concentrated in the city center, Mawing Resort capitalizes on its strategic location to provide an escape from the urban bustle while remaining easily accessible. Its distinctive architectural design, inspired by traditional Assamese aesthetics, coupled with contemporary amenities, distinguishes it within the local hospitality sector. Mawing Resort strives to contribute to the growing tourism industry in Assam by showcasing the region''s natural beauty and rich cultural heritage.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Mawing Resort''s offerings lies a commitment to providing a holistic and enriching experience. The resort boasts a range of meticulously designed accommodation options, from well-appointed rooms offering panoramic views to luxurious suites catering to discerning guests. These spaces are designed to evoke a sense of calm and relaxation, featuring comfortable furnishings and modern conveniences. Beyond accommodation, Mawing Resort presents a diverse array of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. A key highlight is the on-site restaurant, which showcases authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular Indian and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This focus on local produce supports regional farmers and provides guests with a genuine taste of Assam. Additionally, the resort offers comprehensive event facilities, including spacious banquet halls and meeting rooms equipped with state-of-the-art technology, making it an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. The resort also features recreational facilities such as a swimming pool, a well-equipped fitness center, and curated nature walks, allowing guests to rejuvenate and connect with the surrounding environment. The unique selling proposition lies in the combination of world-class amenities with an authentic Assamese experience, something often missing in standard hotel chains. Mawing Resort addresses the growing demand for experiential travel, providing a sanctuary where guests can immerse themselves in the region''s culture and natural beauty.

<br> <br>

Customer satisfaction is paramount at Mawing Resort, and this is reflected in every aspect of the guest experience. The resort emphasizes personalized service, with a dedicated team of well-trained staff committed to anticipating and exceeding guest expectations. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. The resort actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and offerings. This commitment to customer-centricity extends beyond individual interactions to encompass a genuine connection with the local community. Mawing Resort actively supports local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services within the resort. The resort also participates in community initiatives aimed at promoting sustainable tourism and preserving the region''s cultural heritage. By fostering strong relationships with local communities, Mawing Resort creates a more enriching experience for guests while contributing to the economic and social well-being of the region. Regular cultural programs are organized to showcase the rich traditions of Assam, further immersing guests in the local culture.

<br> <br>

Mawing Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for sustainable and culturally immersive tourism in Northeast India. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity to cater to the growing influx of tourists to the region, while maintaining its commitment to environmental sustainability. The resort also intends to further develop its wellness offerings, incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices and Ayurvedic therapies to provide guests with a truly rejuvenating experience. Investment in eco-friendly technologies and practices is a key priority, aiming to minimize the resort''s environmental footprint and promote responsible tourism. Long-term goals include establishing Mawing Resort as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, sustainability, and authentic Assamese hospitality. The resort aims to play a vital role in promoting tourism to Assam, contributing to the region''s economic growth and showcasing its unique cultural heritage to the world. Future expansions may include partnering with local tour operators to offer curated excursions to nearby attractions, such as Kaziranga National Park and Majuli Island, further enriching the guest experience and promoting regional tourism.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.302Z', '2025-11-30T05:25:19.000Z'),
(1085, 'Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi, nestled in the heart of Assam''s silk village, Sualkuchi, just a short distance from Guwahati, offers a unique and authentic experience that distinguishes it within the regional tourism sector. More than just a place to stay, it''s a gateway to understanding and experiencing the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam. The resort provides a serene escape from the bustling city life, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the tranquility of rural Assam while enjoying comfortable and modern amenities. Its location in Sualkuchi, renowned for its silk weaving industry, gives it a distinct advantage, offering guests immediate access to witness the intricate artistry and craftsmanship that has been passed down through generations. This makes Binodini Village Resort a cultural tourism destination of significant importance, promoting local artistry and providing a sustainable income source for the community. <br> <br>

The resort''s primary offerings center around providing comfortable accommodation, authentic Assamese cuisine, and immersive cultural experiences. Accommodation options range from well-appointed rooms with modern amenities to traditional Assamese-style cottages that blend seamlessly with the natural surroundings. Each room is designed to offer a relaxing and comfortable stay, featuring locally sourced materials and reflecting the region''s aesthetic. The dining experience is a highlight, with a restaurant serving a delectable array of traditional Assamese dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor the unique flavors of Assam, often enjoying meals prepared using traditional cooking methods. Beyond accommodation and dining, Binodini Village Resort differentiates itself by offering guided tours of Sualkuchi''s silk weaving workshops, allowing guests to witness the entire silk-making process, from cocoon to finished product. We also arrange for traditional Assamese dance and music performances, showcasing the vibrant cultural heritage of the region. Furthermore, the resort offers nature walks and bird-watching excursions, allowing guests to explore the surrounding natural beauty. These services directly address the growing demand for authentic and immersive travel experiences, catering to both domestic and international tourists seeking to connect with the local culture and environment. <br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi. The resort''s approach is rooted in personalized service and genuine Assamese hospitality. The staff is dedicated to creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. From assisting with travel arrangements to providing insightful information about local customs and traditions, the team goes the extra mile to exceed expectations. What truly sets the resort apart is its deep connection with the local community. The resort actively supports local artisans and businesses, sourcing products and services from the village. This not only contributes to the local economy but also provides guests with an authentic glimpse into the lives of the people of Sualkuchi. Furthermore, the resort regularly organizes cultural events and workshops, inviting local residents to participate and share their skills and knowledge with guests. This fosters a sense of community and creates opportunities for meaningful interaction between visitors and locals. The resort also emphasizes sustainable tourism practices, minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible travel. This commitment to sustainability and community engagement resonates with travelers seeking ethical and authentic experiences. <br> <br>

The future vision for Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi is to become a leading cultural and eco-tourism destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and authentic experiences. Expansion plans include adding more accommodation options, such as eco-friendly cottages and family suites, to cater to a wider range of travelers. The resort also aims to develop new and innovative cultural experiences, such as immersive workshops on Assamese cuisine, silk weaving, and traditional crafts. These initiatives will further enhance the resort''s appeal as a center for cultural learning and exchange. Long-term goals include establishing partnerships with local educational institutions to offer internship programs and training opportunities for young people in the community. This will help to develop a skilled workforce and promote sustainable tourism practices. The resort also plans to expand its outreach efforts, promoting Sualkuchi as a must-visit destination for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching cultural experience. By continuing to invest in its people, its community, and its environment, Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi aims to create a lasting positive impact on the region and contribute to the sustainable development of tourism in Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:25:24.000Z'),
(1086, 'Xhyiteez - The Eco Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Xhyiteez - The Eco Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a sustainable and immersive retreat that harmonizes seamlessly with the natural beauty of Assam. We are more than just a resort; we are a conscious haven dedicated to providing guests with an unforgettable experience while preserving the region''s rich ecological heritage. Our commitment to responsible tourism sets us apart in the Guwahati hospitality sector, offering a unique blend of luxury, adventure, and environmental stewardship. We aim to be a leading example of sustainable tourism in Northeast India, contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural resources and supporting local communities. Xhyiteez represents a growing trend towards eco-conscious travel, providing an alternative to conventional tourism that resonates with both local and international visitors seeking authentic and responsible experiences.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Our core services revolve around providing comfortable and eco-friendly accommodations, curated experiences that showcase the region''s natural and cultural assets, and delicious, locally sourced cuisine. We offer a range of accommodation options, from elegantly designed eco-cottages built using sustainable materials to thoughtfully appointed rooms that minimize environmental impact. Each space is designed to provide comfort without compromising our commitment to sustainability. Our unique selling point lies in our immersive experiences. We offer guided nature walks through nearby forests, birdwatching tours led by local experts, and opportunities to engage with Assamese culture through traditional music and dance performances. These experiences are designed to educate guests about the region''s biodiversity and promote cultural understanding. Furthermore, our restaurant focuses on utilizing fresh, seasonal ingredients sourced from local farmers and producers. This not only supports the local economy but also ensures that our guests enjoy authentic Assamese cuisine while minimizing our carbon footprint. The emphasis on locally sourced products allows us to contribute directly to the sustainability of the region, creating a positive economic impact for local communities.</p> <br> <br>
<p>At Xhyiteez, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests feel connected to both the resort and the surrounding environment. Our staff is trained to provide personalized attention and cater to individual needs, ensuring that every guest has a memorable and enriching experience. We prioritize building strong relationships with the local community through various initiatives. We actively partner with local artisans and craftspeople, providing them with a platform to showcase their products and skills. We also support local schools and community organizations through donations and volunteer programs. Our commitment to community engagement extends to our hiring practices, where we prioritize employing local residents and providing them with opportunities for professional development. This focus on community integration not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the overall well-being of the region. We encourage open communication and feedback from our guests and the community to continuously improve our services and strengthen our commitment to responsible tourism.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Xhyiteez envisions becoming a regional leader in sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options while maintaining our commitment to eco-friendly design and construction. We aim to develop new and innovative experiences that further showcase the natural and cultural heritage of Assam, such as establishing a dedicated organic farm to supply our restaurant and offering educational workshops on sustainable living practices. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and organizations, empowering them to participate in and benefit from our tourism initiatives. Our long-term goals include obtaining relevant certifications for sustainable practices and sharing our knowledge and experience with other businesses in the region to promote responsible tourism across Northeast India. We believe that by continuing to prioritize sustainability, community engagement, and exceptional customer service, Xhyiteez can play a significant role in preserving Assam''s natural beauty and fostering economic growth for local communities. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the tourism industry while remaining true to our core values of environmental stewardship and social responsibility. We see our future as being deeply intertwined with the prosperity of the local community and the preservation of the environment.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:25:29.000Z'),
(1087, 'River bank guest house (Restaurant & self cooking)', 'Resorts', NULL, 'River Bank Guest House (Restaurant & Self Cooking) presents a unique hospitality experience nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil retreat with the flexibility of self-catering options. Situated strategically, it caters to both tourists seeking an authentic Assamese experience and business travelers desiring a comfortable and convenient stay. River Bank distinguishes itself from conventional hotels by combining the personalized service of a guest house with the culinary delights of a restaurant and the independence of self-cooking facilities, filling a specific niche within Guwahati''s diverse hospitality sector. Its significance lies in providing affordable, comfortable, and customizable accommodation catering to varied traveler preferences, adding a distinct flavor to the city''s accommodation choices.

<br> <br>

River Bank Guest House offers a three-pronged approach to hospitality. Firstly, it provides well-appointed guest rooms, each designed to offer a comfortable and relaxing stay. These range from standard rooms to family suites, all equipped with essential amenities to ensure a pleasant experience. Secondly, the on-site restaurant serves a delectable array of Assamese and Indian cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor authentic regional flavors without venturing far from their accommodation. Thirdly, and perhaps most uniquely, River Bank offers self-cooking facilities in select rooms and a communal kitchen area. This empowers guests to prepare their own meals, catering to specific dietary requirements, personal preferences, or simply the desire for a home-cooked meal while traveling. This self-catering option is a significant differentiator, appealing to budget-conscious travelers, families with young children, and those with specific dietary needs, a segment often underserved in the Guwahati market. The unique selling point lies in this combination of convenience, comfort, and culinary flexibility, making it an attractive alternative to traditional hotels and guesthouses.

<br> <br>

At River Bank, customer service is paramount. The staff is trained to provide personalized attention, anticipating guests'' needs and offering assistance with local information, transportation arrangements, and other requests. The guest house prides itself on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of community among guests. What sets River Bank apart is its commitment to showcasing Assamese culture and hospitality. The decor incorporates local crafts and artwork, the restaurant menu features traditional dishes, and the staff are knowledgeable about the region''s history and attractions. This dedication to authentic Assamese experiences resonates with travelers seeking more than just a place to stay; they seek a cultural immersion. River Bank actively engages with the local community by sourcing ingredients from local farmers and artisans, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of its offerings. Regular cultural events, such as Bihu celebrations or Assamese music performances, are organized to further connect guests with the local community and provide a memorable experience.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, River Bank Guest House envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the accommodation capacity, adding more rooms and diversifying the room types to cater to an even wider range of travelers. This includes exploring options for eco-friendly and sustainable practices, aligning with the growing demand for responsible tourism. The restaurant aims to further enhance its menu, incorporating more innovative Assamese dishes and catering to evolving culinary trends. The self-cooking facilities will be upgraded with modern equipment and expanded to accommodate larger groups. Long-term goals include establishing River Bank as a leading provider of hospitality services in Guwahati, recognized for its unique blend of comfort, culinary excellence, and cultural immersion. The business also aims to develop partnerships with local tour operators and businesses to offer comprehensive travel packages, further enhancing the guest experience and promoting tourism in the region. River Bank’s vision is to not only provide a comfortable stay but to be a gateway for visitors to experience the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:30:09.000Z'),
(1088, 'Hotel Park Riviera', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Hotel Park Riviera: Guwahati''s Premier Destination for Comfort and Connectivity</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Hotel Park Riviera stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati, offering a unique blend of modern hospitality and Assamese warmth. Strategically located in the heart of the city, it serves as a vital hub for both business and leisure travelers seeking a seamless and enriching experience. Unlike many hotels in the region, Park Riviera distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, contemporary amenities, and a deep understanding of the local cultural landscape. Recognizing the growing demand for sophisticated accommodation within Assam, Park Riviera fills a critical gap by providing international standards of comfort coupled with the authentic flavor of the Northeast. The hotel plays a crucial role in supporting Guwahati''s burgeoning tourism and business sectors, contributing to the city''s reputation as a gateway to Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Hotel Park Riviera provides comprehensive lodging solutions, ranging from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a range of essential services including:
   <ul>
     <li><b>Dining:</b> On-site restaurants offer a diverse culinary journey, featuring both international cuisine and authentic Assamese dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients. A focus is placed on showcasing the region''s unique flavors and culinary traditions.</li>
     <li><b>Event Spaces:</b> Versatile banquet halls and conference rooms provide ideal venues for corporate meetings, conferences, weddings, and social gatherings. Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual technology and customizable layouts, these spaces cater to events of all sizes.</li>
     <li><b>Recreational Facilities:</b> Guests can unwind and rejuvenate at the hotel''s fitness center and swimming pool. These facilities are designed to provide relaxation and well-being during their stay.</li>
     <li><b>Business Center:</b> A fully equipped business center offers essential services such as printing, photocopying, and secretarial support, catering to the needs of business travelers.</li>
     <li><b>Concierge Services:</b> Dedicated concierge staff provide personalized assistance with travel arrangements, local sightseeing tours, and other bespoke requests, ensuring a seamless and memorable experience for every guest.</li>
   </ul>

    A significant unique selling point of Hotel Park Riviera lies in its dedication to providing authentic cultural experiences. This includes showcasing local art and crafts within the hotel''s interiors, organizing cultural performances, and offering guided tours of nearby historical and cultural sites. The hotel directly addresses the increasing demand for quality accommodation that provides a genuine connection to the local environment, making it a preferred choice for both domestic and international visitors.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Hotel Park Riviera prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience centered around personalized service, attentiveness, and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a comfortable and stress-free stay. What sets Hotel Park Riviera apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its guests, fostering a sense of community and belonging. The hotel actively engages with the local community by participating in local festivals, supporting local artisans, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. Initiatives include sourcing produce from local farms, employing local talent, and supporting local environmental conservation efforts. This commitment to social responsibility enhances the hotel''s reputation and strengthens its connection with the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Park Riviera envisions itself as a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to excellence and sustainable practices. Future plans include expanding its accommodation options, enhancing its wellness and recreational facilities, and further developing its culinary offerings to showcase the diverse flavors of the region. The hotel aims to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, implementing smart room features, online check-in/check-out processes, and personalized communication channels. Furthermore, Hotel Park Riviera intends to strengthen its partnerships with local tourism operators and businesses to promote Guwahati as a premier destination for both leisure and business travel. Long-term goals include achieving industry-leading sustainability certifications and contributing to the economic and social development of the region. By consistently exceeding guest expectations and embracing innovation, Hotel Park Riviera aims to solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati, contributing significantly to the region''s growth and prosperity. The hotel is also exploring opportunities to expand its brand presence in other key locations within Northeast India, further establishing itself as a leader in the hospitality industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:30:15.000Z'),
(1089, 'OYO 12808 Victoria Villa', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>OYO 12808 Victoria Villa: A Comfortable Haven in the Heart of Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa offers a welcoming and comfortable accommodation option for travelers seeking convenience, affordability, and a touch of local charm. More than just a place to stay, Victoria Villa strives to provide a memorable experience, bridging the gap between budget-friendly travel and genuine hospitality. Positioned strategically within Guwahati, the Villa acts as a perfect launchpad for exploring the city''s historical sites, bustling markets, and serene natural landscapes. It aims to distinguish itself within the competitive Guwahati hospitality scene by focusing on consistent quality, cleanliness, and a guest-centric approach, offering a reliable and pleasant stay for both leisure and business travelers.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa provides well-maintained and thoughtfully furnished rooms catering to a diverse range of needs. Guests can choose from various room types, including standard, deluxe, and family rooms, each equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, comfortable bedding, private bathrooms with hot and cold water, and televisions. A key differentiator lies in the Villa''s commitment to cleanliness and hygiene, ensuring a comfortable and worry-free experience for every guest. Furthermore, complimentary Wi-Fi access is provided throughout the premises, enabling guests to stay connected for work or leisure. Recognizing the needs of modern travelers, the Villa also offers services such as laundry facilities, travel assistance, and 24-hour front desk support. These services directly address the needs of tourists visiting Guwahati to explore its cultural heritage and natural beauty, as well as business travelers seeking a convenient and reliable place to stay. The competitive pricing structure, coupled with the provision of essential amenities, positions OYO 12808 Victoria Villa as an attractive option for budget-conscious travelers seeking value for their money.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at OYO 12808 Victoria Villa. The staff is trained to provide warm, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that guests feel welcomed and valued from the moment they arrive. A dedicated front desk team is available around the clock to assist with check-in/check-out procedures, address inquiries, and provide recommendations for local attractions and dining options. Beyond the standard hospitality offerings, the Villa aims to foster a sense of connection with the local community. The staff are encouraged to share their knowledge of Guwahati, providing guests with insights into local customs, traditions, and hidden gems. Furthermore, the Villa actively supports local businesses by sourcing products and services from nearby vendors, contributing to the local economy and providing guests with an authentic taste of Guwahati. Feedback is actively sought from guests to continuously improve service delivery and tailor the experience to meet evolving needs. This proactive approach to customer service ensures that OYO 12808 Victoria Villa not only meets but exceeds guest expectations, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa envisions becoming a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to quality, affordability, and exceptional customer service. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, such as introducing breakfast options featuring local Assamese cuisine, partnering with local tour operators to provide curated sightseeing packages, and enhancing the overall guest experience through personalized amenities and services. The business also plans to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and increase brand awareness. A key focus will be on sustainable practices, such as implementing energy-efficient lighting and water conservation measures, demonstrating a commitment to environmental responsibility. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish OYO 12808 Victoria Villa as a preferred choice for travelers visiting Guwahati, contributing to the growth of the local tourism industry and creating a positive impact on the community. By consistently delivering value, fostering strong relationships with guests, and adapting to evolving market trends, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa is poised for continued success and sustainable growth in the dynamic Guwahati hospitality landscape.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:30:21.000Z'),
(1090, 'Maibong Eco Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Maibong Eco Resort: A Sustainable Sanctuary in the Heart of Assam</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled amidst the verdant landscapes surrounding Guwahati, Maibong Eco Resort offers a distinctive blend of serene retreat and sustainable tourism, catering to discerning travelers seeking an authentic and environmentally conscious experience. More than just a place to stay, Maibong Eco Resort is envisioned as a catalyst for responsible tourism in Assam, showcasing the region’s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage while minimizing its environmental footprint. It aims to provide an escape from the bustling city life, offering a tranquil environment for relaxation, rejuvenation, and reconnection with nature. Positioned strategically near Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, Maibong Eco Resort offers easy accessibility while maintaining a secluded ambiance, making it a compelling destination for both domestic and international visitors.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, Maibong Eco Resort provides comfortable and eco-friendly accommodations designed to harmonize with the surrounding environment. These include thoughtfully designed cottages constructed using locally sourced, sustainable materials, minimizing their impact on the ecosystem. Each cottage provides modern amenities while retaining a rustic charm that reflects the local aesthetic. Beyond accommodations, the resort offers a range of curated experiences designed to immerse guests in the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. These experiences include guided nature walks through surrounding forests, birdwatching expeditions led by knowledgeable local guides, and opportunities to participate in traditional Assamese cooking classes and cultural performances. A key differentiator is the resort''s commitment to sustainable practices. This is evident in its initiatives such as rainwater harvesting, solar energy utilization, waste management programs, and the promotion of organic farming practices within the resort premises. The resort also actively partners with local communities, sourcing produce and employing local artisans, thereby contributing to the economic empowerment of the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Maibong Eco Resort prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized customer experience. The staff is meticulously trained to provide warm and attentive service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and cared for. From the moment of arrival to departure, guests are treated with genuine hospitality, creating a sense of belonging and fostering lasting memories. The resort distinguishes itself through its emphasis on creating meaningful connections with the local community. Guests are encouraged to interact with local villagers, learn about their traditions, and participate in activities that promote cultural exchange. The resort also actively supports local initiatives, such as promoting local handicrafts and providing educational opportunities for children in the surrounding villages. This commitment to community engagement enhances the guest experience, providing a deeper understanding and appreciation of the local culture and environment. Regular feedback is solicited from guests to continuously improve services and offerings, ensuring that the resort remains responsive to evolving customer needs and preferences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Maibong Eco Resort is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth. Expansion plans include the addition of new eco-friendly accommodations, incorporating innovative designs and technologies to further minimize the environmental impact. There are also plans to develop more comprehensive nature trails and adventure activities, such as zip-lining and rock climbing, catering to a wider range of interests and preferences. A significant focus will be placed on strengthening partnerships with local communities and organizations, further enhancing the resort''s contribution to the region''s economic and social development. This includes initiatives to promote sustainable agriculture, support local artisans, and provide educational and training opportunities for local youth. The resort also aims to become a recognized leader in sustainable tourism, serving as a model for other businesses in the region. This will involve actively sharing best practices, participating in industry forums, and advocating for policies that promote responsible tourism development. The long-term goal is to establish Maibong Eco Resort as a premier destination for eco-conscious travelers, attracting visitors from around the world and showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam while preserving its natural heritage for future generations.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:30:27.000Z'),
(1091, 'Anurag Residency - #1 Hotel in Lokhra', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Anurag Residency: Redefining Hospitality in Lokhra, Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Anurag Residency, proudly recognized as the #1 Hotel in Lokhra, Guwahati, stands as a beacon of exceptional hospitality in Assam. More than just a place to stay, Anurag Residency represents a commitment to providing a comfortable, memorable, and genuinely Assamese experience. Situated strategically in Lokhra, a vibrant and increasingly important commercial and residential hub of Guwahati, the residency caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from business travelers seeking seamless efficiency to tourists eager to explore the rich cultural tapestry of the region. Anurag Residency distinguishes itself through its personalized service, meticulous attention to detail, and a deep understanding of the unique needs and preferences of its guests. This dedication elevates it beyond a standard hotel, establishing it as a crucial element of the local business landscape, contributing to the region''s economic vitality and reinforcing its reputation as a welcoming destination.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Anurag Residency''s offerings lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to every guest''s need. The residency boasts a range of well-appointed rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to offer a blend of comfort and functionality. Whether a guest requires a standard room for a short business trip or a spacious suite for a family vacation, Anurag Residency provides accommodations to suit diverse requirements. Key features include complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi throughout the property, ensuring seamless connectivity for business and leisure purposes. The in-house restaurant serves a delectable array of culinary delights, encompassing both authentic Assamese cuisine and popular international dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, providing a true taste of Assam. Furthermore, Anurag Residency offers a range of supplementary services, including laundry and dry cleaning, airport transfers, and travel assistance, ensuring a hassle-free and convenient stay for every guest. What truly sets Anurag Residency apart is its commitment to providing personalized service. The staff are trained to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a memorable and comfortable experience. The residency also offers customized packages tailored to specific needs, such as corporate retreats, family celebrations, and cultural tours, further enhancing its appeal to a broad range of travelers. By focusing on these distinctive selling points, Anurag Residency effectively meets the needs of the local market, offering a compelling alternative to larger, impersonal hotel chains.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Anurag Residency. The business philosophy is deeply rooted in the principle of "Atithi Devo Bhava" (the guest is equivalent to God), a traditional Indian value that emphasizes the importance of hospitality and respect towards guests. This philosophy permeates every aspect of the business, from the warm welcome at reception to the attentive service in the restaurant. The staff are not only professionally trained but also deeply connected to the local community, providing guests with valuable insights and recommendations on local attractions, cultural events, and hidden gems. Anurag Residency actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local artisans and businesses, participating in community events, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. This commitment to social responsibility strengthens its bond with the local community and reinforces its position as a responsible and ethical business. Regular feedback is actively solicited from guests to continuously improve services and ensure that the residency remains responsive to evolving needs and preferences. This dedication to customer satisfaction has resulted in consistently positive reviews and a strong reputation for excellence in hospitality. The team strives to create a personal connection with each guest, fostering a sense of belonging and ensuring that every stay is a truly memorable experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Anurag Residency envisions significant growth and expansion. The long-term goals include increasing its market share within the Guwahati hospitality sector, becoming the undisputed leader in Lokhra, and expanding its offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers. Future plans include the addition of new amenities, such as a fitness center and a rooftop terrace, to further enhance the guest experience. The residency also plans to invest in technology to streamline operations, improve efficiency, and enhance customer service. A key strategic objective is to develop and promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing the environmental impact of the business and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural beauty. This includes implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. Another area of focus is staff development. Anurag Residency is committed to investing in training and development programs to equip its staff with the skills and knowledge necessary to excel in their roles and provide exceptional service. This commitment to employee empowerment will not only enhance the quality of service but also create a positive and supportive work environment. By pursuing these ambitious goals, Anurag Residency aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and contribute to the region''s economic and social development.</p>
</body>
</html>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:30:34.000Z'),
(1092, 'Prashaanti Tourist Lodge, ATDC', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Prashaanti Tourist Lodge, an Assam Tourism Development Corporation (ATDC) initiative located in the heart of Guwahati, offers a tranquil and culturally immersive experience for travelers seeking an authentic taste of Assam. Beyond simply providing accommodation, Prashaanti Tourist Lodge acts as a gateway to exploring the rich heritage, natural beauty, and vibrant traditions of the region. It stands as a testament to ATDC''s commitment to promoting sustainable tourism and fostering a deep appreciation for Assam''s unique identity. In a city teeming with various lodging options, Prashaanti distinguishes itself through its strategic location, emphasis on Assamese hospitality, and direct connection to the state''s tourism infrastructure.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, Prashaanti Tourist Lodge provides comfortable and well-maintained accommodation catering to diverse traveler needs. This includes a range of room options, from standard rooms to suites, all designed with a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics. Each room is equipped to ensure a relaxing and convenient stay, including features like air conditioning, private bathrooms, and reliable internet access. Beyond accommodation, Prashaanti offers a range of services designed to enhance the overall travel experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and popular international dishes, a travel desk providing expert guidance on local attractions and tour packages, and conference facilities for business travelers. A unique selling point is the Lodge’s inherent connection to ATDC''s extensive network, allowing guests seamless access to information, transportation, and curated experiences throughout Assam. This direct link mitigates the challenges often faced by independent travelers navigating a new region. Prashaanti directly addresses the market need for reliable, culturally sensitive, and centrally located accommodation options in Guwahati, serving as an ideal base for exploring the city and surrounding areas.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer service at Prashaanti Tourist Lodge is rooted in the Assamese tradition of ''Atithi Devo Bhava'' – treating guests as God. The staff are trained to provide personalized attention, anticipate needs, and offer genuine hospitality that goes beyond standard hotel service. What truly sets Prashaanti apart is its commitment to showcasing Assamese culture. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as showcasing local handicrafts and artwork within the lodge, organizing cultural performances for guests, and promoting local cuisine in the restaurant. The Lodge actively engages with the local community by sourcing produce from nearby farms and employing local artisans and craftsmen. This not only supports the local economy but also provides guests with an authentic and immersive experience. By fostering a sense of connection to Assam''s culture and community, Prashaanti strives to create lasting memories and encourage responsible tourism.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Prashaanti Tourist Lodge is to further solidify its position as a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality and a key player in promoting sustainable tourism in the region. Growth plans include expanding the Lodge’s capacity to accommodate a growing influx of tourists, upgrading existing facilities to meet evolving customer expectations, and developing new and innovative tourism packages that showcase the diverse attractions of Assam. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing online booking platforms, providing virtual tours of local attractions, and offering personalized recommendations based on guest preferences. Furthermore, Prashaanti aims to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and businesses to create a more inclusive and sustainable tourism ecosystem. Long-term goals include establishing Prashaanti as a model for responsible tourism development in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize cultural preservation, environmental sustainability, and community engagement. By consistently delivering exceptional service, promoting Assamese culture, and embracing innovation, Prashaanti Tourist Lodge aspires to be the preferred choice for travelers seeking an unforgettable and enriching experience in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:35:07.000Z'),
(1093, 'Hotel ROYALE de CASA', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA: A Luxurious Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a distinctive blend of luxury, comfort, and personalized service. Nestled amidst the vibrant cityscape, our hotel provides a tranquil escape for both business and leisure travelers. We distinguish ourselves in the regional hospitality landscape by meticulously crafting an experience that resonates with the rich cultural heritage of Assam while adhering to the highest international standards of excellence. Our commitment to providing an unmatched guest experience makes us a preferred choice for discerning travelers seeking sophistication and unparalleled service in Northeast India.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Hotel ROYALE de CASA, we provide a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. Our core offerings include luxuriously appointed guest rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide optimal comfort and relaxation. Each room features modern amenities, plush furnishings, and stunning views, creating a serene haven for our guests. Beyond accommodation, we boast an array of exceptional dining options, from fine-dining restaurants serving authentic Assamese cuisine alongside international delicacies to casual cafes perfect for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon. Our state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities are equipped to host a wide range of events, from corporate meetings and conferences to weddings and social gatherings, supported by a dedicated event planning team. Furthermore, guests can rejuvenate and unwind at our wellness center, featuring a fully equipped fitness center, a revitalizing spa offering traditional and contemporary treatments, and a refreshing swimming pool. Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach to hospitality, ensuring that every guest''s needs are anticipated and exceeded. By incorporating elements of Assamese art, culture, and culinary traditions into our offerings, we provide a truly immersive and authentic experience that sets us apart from generic hotel chains. These services directly address the local market''s desire for high-quality accommodation, diverse dining options, and comprehensive event facilities, meeting the increasing demands of both domestic and international visitors to Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Hotel ROYALE de CASA. We believe in creating lasting memories for our guests by providing exceptional service with a personal touch. Our dedicated team of hospitality professionals is meticulously trained to anticipate and fulfill every guest''s needs, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable stay. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and crafts within the hotel. We also partner with local tour operators to offer authentic cultural experiences, allowing our guests to immerse themselves in the rich heritage of Assam. Furthermore, we participate in community initiatives and charitable events, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility and contributing to the well-being of the local community. By fostering strong relationships with local businesses and organizations, we aim to create a welcoming and inclusive environment for our guests and contribute to the overall vibrancy of Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Hotel ROYALE de CASA is to solidify our position as the premier luxury hotel in Guwahati and a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India. We envision expanding our facilities and services to meet the growing demand for high-quality accommodation and event spaces in the region. Future plans include adding more guest rooms and suites, enhancing our dining options with innovative culinary concepts, and expanding our wellness center to offer a wider range of treatments and services. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new tourism products and experiences that showcase the unique cultural and natural attractions of Assam. Furthermore, we are committed to adopting sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the long-term well-being of the region. This includes investing in energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in sustainable tourism, setting an example for other hospitality providers in the region. By continuously innovating, expanding our offerings, and embracing sustainable practices, we are confident that Hotel ROYALE de CASA will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati and Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:35:14.000Z'),
(1094, 'dichang hotel', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Dichang Hotel, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a haven of comfort and authentic Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, Dichang Hotel embodies a commitment to showcasing the rich culture and traditions of the region, providing guests with an immersive and unforgettable experience. Situated strategically in Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, Dichang Hotel caters to both business and leisure travelers seeking a blend of modern amenities and genuine local charm. In a region experiencing rapid growth in tourism and commerce, Dichang Hotel distinguishes itself by offering personalized service, a focus on sustainability, and a dedication to supporting the local community, making it a significant contributor to the Assam business landscape. <br> <br>

Dichang Hotel''s core offerings revolve around providing exceptional accommodation and dining experiences. Our well-appointed rooms, ranging from standard suites to luxurious executive spaces, are designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. Each room features modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable furnishings, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Dichang Hotel boasts a meticulously crafted culinary experience centered around authentic Assamese cuisine. Our in-house restaurant, ''Jonaki,'' serves traditional dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients, allowing guests to savor the unique flavors of Assam. We also offer a selection of continental and Indian favorites to cater to broader palates. A unique selling point is our curated experiences, including guided tours of local tea gardens, cultural performances showcasing Assamese music and dance, and opportunities to interact with local artisans. These experiences directly address the growing demand for authentic cultural immersion among travelers visiting Assam, making Dichang Hotel a preferred choice for those seeking more than just a hotel stay. <br> <br>

At Dichang Hotel, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our guests, ensuring every interaction is marked by warmth, attentiveness, and personalized service. Our well-trained staff is dedicated to anticipating and fulfilling the needs of our guests, from arranging transportation to providing insightful recommendations on local attractions. We go beyond standard customer service by actively engaging with the local community. We partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services within the hotel, contributing to their economic empowerment and providing guests with a unique shopping experience. Dichang Hotel also participates in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of community and promoting Assamese culture to a wider audience. Our commitment to sustainable practices, such as waste reduction and energy conservation, further enhances the guest experience by demonstrating our dedication to responsible tourism. Online feedback mechanisms, including surveys and social media engagement, are actively utilized to continuously improve our services and ensure guest satisfaction remains at the forefront of our operations. <br> <br>

Dichang Hotel envisions becoming a leading hospitality brand in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and cultural preservation. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for quality lodging in Guwahati. We are also exploring the development of additional amenities, such as a spa and wellness center, to enhance the guest experience further. A key focus is on strengthening our ties with the local community by providing training and employment opportunities for local youth. We aim to establish partnerships with educational institutions to offer hospitality internships and mentorship programs, contributing to the development of a skilled workforce in the region. Furthermore, we plan to implement innovative technologies to streamline operations, enhance guest services, and reduce our environmental footprint. Long-term, Dichang Hotel aims to expand its presence beyond Guwahati, establishing a network of eco-friendly and culturally sensitive hotels across Northeast India, contributing to the sustainable growth of the region''s tourism sector and showcasing the unique beauty and culture of Assam to the world.
</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:35:20.000Z'),
(1095, 'Kaaamini village resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Kaaamini Village Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers an authentic and immersive experience that distinguishes it as a unique player in the region''s burgeoning hospitality sector. More than just a place to stay, Kaaamini Village Resort is a sanctuary that celebrates the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam, offering guests a chance to reconnect with tradition and tranquility. In a market increasingly dominated by standardized hotel chains, Kaaamini stands out by providing a genuine taste of local life, contributing significantly to the promotion of Assam''s tourism and supporting local artisans and communities.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of Kaaamini Village Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality intertwined with authentic cultural experiences. The resort offers a range of meticulously designed accommodations, from traditionally styled cottages that reflect Assamese architecture to modern rooms that offer comfort and convenience, all surrounded by lush greenery. Beyond accommodation, Kaaamini provides curated experiences designed to immerse guests in Assamese culture. These include traditional Assamese cooking classes where guests learn to prepare local delicacies, cultural performances showcasing Bihu dance and music, and guided tours of nearby villages and tea gardens, offering insights into the region''s rich history and traditions. The resort also boasts a restaurant that serves authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients, offering a gastronomic journey through the flavors of the region. A unique selling point is the resort''s dedication to sustainable tourism practices, emphasizing environmental conservation and community empowerment, which appeals to the growing number of environmentally conscious travelers. This approach directly addresses the increasing demand for authentic and responsible travel experiences within the local market and beyond.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Kaaamini Village Resort prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized customer experience. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to anticipate guests'' needs and provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. What truly sets Kaaamini apart is its ability to foster a deep connection with the local community. The resort actively involves local artisans and craftsmen in its operations, showcasing their work and providing them with opportunities to generate income. Guests have the chance to interact with local villagers, learn about their traditions, and purchase handcrafted souvenirs, contributing directly to the economic well-being of the community. The resort also organizes community events and initiatives, further strengthening its ties with the local population. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also helps to preserve and promote Assam''s cultural heritage.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Kaaamini Village Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for cultural and eco-tourism in Assam. The resort aims to expand its range of services and experiences, offering even more opportunities for guests to immerse themselves in Assamese culture and explore the region''s natural beauty. Future plans include developing new eco-friendly accommodations, expanding the restaurant''s menu to showcase a wider range of Assamese cuisine, and organizing more community-based tourism initiatives. Kaaamini also plans to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, such as offering online booking and personalized concierge services. Furthermore, the resort aims to establish partnerships with local tourism organizations and tour operators to promote Assam as a premier tourist destination. The long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional hospitality but also contributes to the preservation of Assam''s cultural heritage and the economic empowerment of local communities. Kaaamini Village Resort aspires to be more than just a resort; it aims to be a gateway to discovering the soul of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:35:25.000Z'),
(1096, 'Nirvana Guest House', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Nirvana Guest House: A Tranquil Haven in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Nirvana Guest House offers a peaceful and welcoming retreat for travelers seeking comfort and convenience in Guwahati, Assam. Nestled amidst the vibrant energy of the city, our guest house provides a serene escape, balancing modern amenities with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. We stand out in the local hospitality sector by offering a personalized experience that caters to both business and leisure travelers, establishing ourselves as a preferred choice for those seeking a home away from home. Unlike larger hotels, Nirvana Guest House provides a more intimate and attentive atmosphere, allowing us to focus on individual guest needs and create memorable stays. Our commitment to cleanliness, comfort, and genuine care sets us apart, contributing to our positive reputation within the Guwahati community and beyond.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Services and Products: Your Gateway to Comfort and Convenience</p>

<p>At Nirvana Guest House, we provide a range of services designed to ensure a relaxing and productive stay. Our primary offering is comfortable and well-appointed guest rooms, each thoughtfully designed with modern amenities. Rooms feature air conditioning, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions with cable channels, and private bathrooms with hot and cold water. We offer a variety of room types, including single, double, and family rooms, catering to the diverse needs of our guests. <br> <br> Beyond accommodation, we offer a complimentary breakfast service featuring a selection of continental and Indian dishes, providing a nourishing start to the day. We also provide laundry services, ensuring guests can travel light and maintain a fresh wardrobe. Our concierge service assists with travel arrangements, airport transfers, and local sightseeing recommendations, helping guests make the most of their time in Guwahati. What truly differentiates Nirvana Guest House is our dedication to providing a personalized experience. We go the extra mile to understand our guests'' preferences and needs, tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. This could include arranging specific dietary requests, organizing guided tours of local attractions, or providing assistance with business-related tasks. This personalized touch, combined with our competitive pricing, positions us as a valuable and accessible option for travelers seeking quality accommodation in Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Cultivating a Community Connection Through Exceptional Customer Experience</p>

<p>Customer service lies at the heart of Nirvana Guest House''s philosophy. We believe in creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every guest, ensuring they feel comfortable and valued from the moment they arrive. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We emphasize proactive communication, anticipating guest needs and addressing any concerns promptly and effectively. <br> <br> What truly makes our customer experience exceptional is our connection to the local community. We actively promote local culture and tourism, recommending authentic Assamese restaurants, cultural events, and local attractions. We also partner with local businesses, supporting the growth of the community and providing guests with unique and enriching experiences. We believe in building relationships with our guests beyond their stay. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and maintain open communication channels for future bookings and inquiries. Many of our guests are repeat visitors, a testament to our commitment to providing a consistently positive and memorable experience. This focus on community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also strengthens our reputation as a responsible and caring business within Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking Ahead: Growth and Innovation at Nirvana Guest House</p>

<p>Nirvana Guest House envisions a future of sustained growth and continued excellence in the Guwahati hospitality market. Our long-term goals include expanding our capacity to accommodate a greater number of guests while maintaining our commitment to personalized service. We are exploring opportunities to add new amenities, such as a small business center, to cater to the needs of business travelers. We also aim to enhance our sustainability practices, implementing eco-friendly initiatives to reduce our environmental impact. <br> <br> Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and partnerships with online travel agencies. We will also continue to leverage social media to engage with potential guests and promote Guwahati as a desirable tourist destination. We are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring they remain at the forefront of hospitality best practices. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Nirvana Guest House aims to solidify its position as a leading guest house in Guwahati, known for its exceptional service, comfortable accommodations, and genuine connection to the local community. We believe in fostering a culture of continuous improvement and are dedicated to providing our guests with an unforgettable experience that reflects the unique charm and hospitality of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:35:32.000Z'),
(1097, 'Hotel Orchid', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Hotel Orchid stands as a distinguished hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, providing exceptional accommodation and comprehensive services designed to cater to the discerning traveler. Located strategically in the heart of the city, Hotel Orchid distinguishes itself through a commitment to blending contemporary comfort with the rich cultural tapestry of Assam, offering guests an immersive and unforgettable experience. The hotel plays a significant role in the local business landscape by providing premium lodging and event spaces, supporting tourism, and contributing to the economic vitality of the region. It is a place where business blends seamlessly with leisure, providing a tranquil retreat amidst the bustling city.
<br> <br>
At Hotel Orchid, our core offering revolves around providing superior accommodation. Our rooms and suites are meticulously designed, featuring modern amenities and elegant décor, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay for both leisure and business travelers. Beyond lodging, we offer a range of services including multiple on-site dining options featuring both local Assamese cuisine and international flavors, a well-equipped business center for corporate needs, and comprehensive event and conference facilities capable of hosting a wide array of gatherings, from intimate meetings to large-scale conferences and weddings.
<br> <br>
Our unique selling points are multifaceted. We pride ourselves on our commitment to showcasing the authentic Assam experience. From incorporating local art and handicrafts into our décor to offering culinary experiences that highlight regional specialties, we provide guests with a genuine taste of Assam. This commitment to cultural immersion, coupled with our dedication to modern amenities and exceptional service, sets us apart from competitors. Our focus on providing personalized service, anticipating guest needs, and exceeding expectations makes us a preferred choice for both domestic and international travelers. The ability to cater to diverse needs – from corporate events to family vacations – positions us as a versatile and valuable resource within Guwahati''s hospitality sector. We address local market needs by providing a high-quality alternative to other establishments, delivering consistent service, and actively contributing to the positive image of Guwahati as a destination.
<br> <br>
Customer experience is paramount at Hotel Orchid. Our approach to customer service is rooted in a philosophy of genuine care and attention to detail. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized experience for every guest, ensuring their needs are not only met but exceeded. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality, and our dedicated staff is always available to assist with any requests. We differentiate ourselves through proactive service, anticipating needs and going the extra mile to ensure guest satisfaction. This includes offering personalized concierge services, tailored dining experiences, and assistance with travel arrangements and local excursions.
<br> <br>
Hotel Orchid actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. We collaborate with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services, contributing to the local economy. We participate in community events and support local charities, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. Furthermore, we prioritize employing local residents, providing job opportunities and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This engagement fosters goodwill and strengthens our relationship with the people of Guwahati, establishing Hotel Orchid as not just a business, but a valued member of the community. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests and the community alike.
<br> <br>
The future vision for Hotel Orchid is one of sustainable growth and continued excellence. We aim to expand our reach within the Assam market and beyond, exploring opportunities to establish new properties in other strategic locations. We are committed to continuously improving our services and facilities, incorporating the latest technologies and trends to enhance the guest experience. A key aspect of our future plans involves developing our event and conference facilities further, positioning Hotel Orchid as a premier destination for business and social gatherings in the region.
<br> <br>
Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our commitment to sustainability, implementing eco-friendly practices throughout our operations. This includes reducing our environmental footprint, conserving resources, and supporting local conservation efforts. Our long-term goals involve establishing Hotel Orchid as a recognized leader in the hospitality industry in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional service, commitment to quality, and dedication to the local community. We aspire to be more than just a hotel; we aim to be a destination that embodies the spirit of Assam and provides guests with an unforgettable experience that they will cherish for years to come. Our vision is to be synonymous with luxury, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality.
</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:40:10.000Z'),
(1098, 'Vaanya Retreat', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Vaanya Retreat: A Sanctuary of Wellness in Guwahati

Vaanya Retreat emerges as a haven of tranquility in the bustling heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a wellness center, it is a dedicated space designed to foster holistic well-being, drawing inspiration from the region''s rich cultural heritage and natural abundance. In a market increasingly seeking mindful escapes and authentic experiences, Vaanya Retreat stands apart by offering a curated blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern wellness practices, creating a truly unique and rejuvenating experience. It addresses the growing need for accessible and comprehensive wellness solutions within the local community and beyond.

<br> <br>

At its core, Vaanya Retreat offers a diverse portfolio of services designed to cater to various aspects of well-being. The offerings include revitalizing spa treatments incorporating locally sourced ingredients and traditional Assamese massage techniques, personalized yoga and meditation sessions led by certified instructors, and curated wellness programs focused on stress management, detoxification, and overall health improvement. Unique to Vaanya Retreat is its emphasis on incorporating Assam''s natural resources, such as locally grown herbs and teas, into its treatments and programs. This not only enhances the therapeutic benefits but also promotes local sustainability. A signature offering is the "Kamrup Revival," a multi-day wellness package that combines yoga, meditation, Ayurvedic-inspired treatments, and healthy Assamese cuisine, offering a deep immersion into the region''s healing traditions. This distinctive approach differentiates Vaanya Retreat from generic spa and wellness centers, directly appealing to the discerning customer seeking an authentic and enriching experience. We also offer curated tea tasting experiences showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam tea, a crucial aspect of the region''s identity.

<br> <br>

Vaanya Retreat prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience at every touchpoint. From the moment guests enter the serene and thoughtfully designed space, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized attention, understanding individual needs and preferences to tailor treatments and programs accordingly. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of community and belonging. What truly sets Vaanya Retreat apart is its commitment to engaging with the local community. We actively collaborate with local artisans and suppliers, showcasing their crafts and products within the retreat. Regular wellness workshops and events are organized, inviting community members to learn about healthy living, stress management, and traditional Assamese healing practices. By actively participating in local initiatives and promoting sustainable practices, Vaanya Retreat aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a valuable member of the Guwahati community. We also partner with local tourism operators to offer wellness packages that integrate cultural experiences, such as visits to tea gardens and temples, further enhancing the guest experience and promoting regional tourism.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Vaanya Retreat envisions becoming a leading wellness destination in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the range of services to include specialized wellness programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes management and post-COVID recovery. We also aim to establish a training academy to nurture local talent in the wellness industry, providing opportunities for employment and professional development. A key focus is on enhancing the online presence and reach, attracting both domestic and international guests seeking a unique and rejuvenating wellness experience. We plan to introduce online consultations and virtual wellness programs, making our services accessible to a wider audience. Ultimately, Vaanya Retreat aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the health and well-being of the community, promoting a holistic approach to life and celebrating the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities for establishing eco-friendly accommodations within the retreat premises, creating a self-contained wellness sanctuary. This will allow guests to fully immerse themselves in the tranquil environment and deepen their connection with nature.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:40:15.000Z'),
(1099, 'Kordoi Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Kordoi Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility in Guwahati</p>

<p>Kordoi Resort emerges as a premier destination within Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of modern luxury and traditional Assamese hospitality. Nestled amidst the lush landscapes characteristic of the region, Kordoi isn''t merely a place to stay; it''s an immersive experience designed to connect guests with the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. In a region increasingly seeking sophisticated yet authentic travel experiences, Kordoi Resort distinguishes itself by prioritizing sustainable practices, supporting local artisans, and delivering unparalleled personalized service. It aims to be a leading establishment not just within Guwahati but as a beacon of responsible and high-quality tourism in Northeast India.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Kordoi Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality through a diverse range of services and facilities. The resort boasts luxuriously appointed accommodations, ranging from elegantly designed rooms with panoramic views to private villas offering secluded retreats. Each room reflects a careful balance of contemporary design and local craftsmanship, featuring handcrafted textiles and locally sourced materials. Beyond accommodation, Kordoi offers a comprehensive suite of amenities, including:
<br> <br>

*   <b>Gourmet Dining:</b> Multiple restaurants and cafes showcase the diverse culinary landscape of Assam and the broader Indian subcontinent, with a focus on fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Special dietary needs and preferences are meticulously catered to.
<br> <br>
*   <b>Wellness & Recreation:</b> A state-of-the-art spa provides a range of rejuvenating treatments inspired by traditional Assamese wellness practices. A fully equipped fitness center, swimming pool, and various recreational activities, such as nature walks and birdwatching tours, cater to diverse interests.
<br> <br>
*   <b>Event & Conference Facilities:</b> Kordoi Resort offers versatile event spaces, ideal for weddings, corporate retreats, and social gatherings. These spaces are equipped with modern technology and supported by a dedicated events team to ensure seamless execution.
<br> <br>
*   <b>Cultural Experiences:</b> Unique to Kordoi is its focus on showcasing Assamese culture. Guests can participate in traditional dance performances, cooking classes featuring local cuisine, and guided tours of nearby historical and cultural sites.
<br> <br>
Kordoi''s unique selling proposition lies in its ability to seamlessly blend luxury with authenticity. Unlike generic hotel chains, Kordoi actively promotes and celebrates the rich heritage of Assam, creating a deeply immersive and memorable experience for every guest. This approach effectively addresses the growing demand for authentic travel experiences and positions Kordoi as a cultural gateway to the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Kordoi Resort. Every interaction, from initial booking to departure, is meticulously designed to exceed expectations. A dedicated concierge service provides personalized assistance, curating bespoke itineraries and catering to individual needs. The resort prides itself on its highly trained and attentive staff, who are deeply knowledgeable about the local culture and committed to providing warm and genuine hospitality.
<br> <br>

Kordoi actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. The resort sources local produce and handicrafts, supporting local farmers and artisans and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. It also collaborates with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and environmental conservation. The resort regularly hosts community events, showcasing local talent and fostering a sense of connection between guests and the local population. By prioritizing ethical and sustainable practices, Kordoi aims to be a responsible corporate citizen and a positive force within the Guwahati community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Kordoi Resort is one of sustainable growth and regional leadership. The resort aims to expand its offerings, potentially including the development of eco-lodges in other parts of Assam, furthering its commitment to responsible tourism. Plans are also in place to enhance the cultural immersion programs, creating even more authentic and engaging experiences for guests. Furthermore, Kordoi aspires to become a center for promoting Assamese art and culture, hosting exhibitions, workshops, and festivals that showcase the region''s unique heritage.
<br> <br>

Long-term, Kordoi Resort aims to be recognized as a premier destination for discerning travelers seeking authentic cultural experiences and unparalleled hospitality in Northeast India. The focus remains on continuous improvement, innovation, and a steadfast commitment to sustainability, ensuring that Kordoi Resort remains a treasured asset to the Guwahati community and a beacon of responsible tourism in the region for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:40:23.000Z'),
(1100, 'Hotel Green Valley', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Hotel Green Valley: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati

Nestled amidst the verdant landscapes surrounding Guwahati, Hotel Green Valley offers a distinctive hospitality experience that seamlessly blends modern comfort with the rich cultural heritage of Assam. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Green Valley serves as a gateway to exploring the region’s natural beauty, vibrant traditions, and warm hospitality. We are committed to providing exceptional service and creating memorable experiences for every guest, contributing to the thriving tourism sector and the overall economic landscape of Assam. Our commitment to sustainable practices further distinguishes us, making us a responsible and forward-thinking member of the Guwahati business community.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Hotel Green Valley lies our dedication to providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. We offer a range of rooms and suites, each designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests, from business travelers seeking a productive workspace to families desiring a relaxing retreat. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and en-suite bathrooms, ensuring a pleasant and convenient stay.

<br> <br>

Beyond accommodation, we provide a comprehensive suite of services designed to enhance our guests'' experience. Our in-house restaurant showcases the authentic flavors of Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, alongside a selection of international dishes to cater to diverse palates. We also offer banqueting and conference facilities, making Hotel Green Valley an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and other special occasions. These facilities are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless execution and memorable experiences. Our travel desk assists guests in planning excursions to nearby attractions, including the Kamakhya Temple, Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary, and the scenic Brahmaputra River, allowing them to fully immerse themselves in the beauty and culture of Assam.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Hotel Green Valley apart is our unwavering commitment to providing exceptional customer service. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide personalized attention, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. We actively engage with the local community by supporting local artisans and promoting Assamese culture through our events and activities. We showcase local artwork within the hotel and collaborate with local businesses to offer authentic Assamese experiences to our guests, fostering a sense of connection and contributing to the local economy. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, further solidifying our connection with the community.

<br> <br>

Customer feedback is paramount to our continuous improvement. We actively solicit and analyze guest feedback to identify areas for enhancement and ensure that we are consistently exceeding expectations. We utilize various channels, including online surveys, comment cards, and direct interaction with guests, to gather valuable insights and refine our services. We empower our staff to address guest concerns promptly and effectively, ensuring that any issues are resolved to the guest''s satisfaction. This proactive approach to customer service has earned us a reputation for excellence and fostered strong relationships with our guests.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Hotel Green Valley envisions expanding its operations and solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the surrounding region. We plan to introduce new services and amenities to cater to the evolving needs of our guests, including a wellness center offering spa treatments and fitness facilities. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-friendly initiatives and promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural beauty.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goals include establishing a training program for local youth to provide them with valuable skills and employment opportunities in the hospitality industry. We believe in investing in the local community and fostering a culture of excellence that will benefit both our employees and our guests. We are also committed to expanding our marketing efforts to reach a wider audience and attract more tourists to Guwahati and Assam, contributing to the growth of the local economy and promoting the region''s rich cultural heritage. Hotel Green Valley aims to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be a cornerstone of the Guwahati community, a champion of Assamese culture, and a leader in sustainable tourism.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:40:29.000Z'),
(1101, 'Capital O Wedding Resort', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Capital O Wedding Resort stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, revolutionizing the landscape of wedding venues and event hosting. More than just a location, it offers a comprehensive and unforgettable experience, catering to the growing demand for sophisticated and personalized celebrations within the region. Strategically positioned to embrace the natural beauty of Assam while remaining accessible to the city, Capital O Wedding Resort fills a crucial gap in the market for a high-quality, full-service wedding and event venue. It represents a significant investment in the local hospitality sector, fostering economic growth and providing employment opportunities, while simultaneously setting a new benchmark for excellence in the event management industry within Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering centers around providing a seamless and stress-free wedding experience. We offer a range of customizable packages designed to cater to diverse budgets and preferences. These packages encompass everything from venue rental and decoration to catering services, photography, videography, and entertainment. Our in-house team of experienced wedding planners works closely with each couple to understand their vision and bring it to life, ensuring every detail is meticulously executed. Beyond weddings, Capital O Wedding Resort is also equipped to host a variety of other events, including corporate conferences, social gatherings, and private parties. We boast multiple indoor and outdoor spaces, including beautifully landscaped gardens, spacious banquet halls, and comfortable accommodation for guests. What truly distinguishes Capital O Wedding Resort is our commitment to incorporating local Assamese traditions and aesthetics into our offerings. We collaborate with local artisans and vendors to provide authentic cultural experiences, allowing couples to celebrate their heritage in a meaningful way. For example, we can arrange traditional Bihu dance performances, offer Assamese cuisine options, and incorporate local silk fabrics into the décor. This focus on cultural relevance sets us apart from generic event venues and resonates deeply with the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Capital O Wedding Resort, we prioritize creating an exceptional customer experience from the initial inquiry to the final farewell. Our dedicated team is committed to providing personalized attention and responsive support throughout the planning process. We understand that planning a wedding or any major event can be overwhelming, so we strive to alleviate the stress and make the experience enjoyable. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their unique needs, and exceeding their expectations. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing a service; we aim to create cherished memories that last a lifetime. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events and supporting local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has welcomed us and fostering a positive relationship with our neighbors. We also strive to be environmentally conscious, implementing sustainable practices in our operations, such as waste reduction and energy conservation. Our reputation within the local community is paramount, and we actively seek feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure customer satisfaction.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Capital O Wedding Resort envisions becoming the leading wedding and event destination in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our facilities to accommodate larger events and offer even more diverse services. We aim to incorporate the latest technology into our offerings, such as virtual reality tours of the venue and interactive event planning tools. We also plan to partner with more local businesses and artisans to further enhance the cultural experience we offer. One of our long-term goals is to establish a training program for aspiring event planners and hospitality professionals in Assam. We believe in investing in the local talent and contributing to the growth of the hospitality industry in the region. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional branches in other cities in Northeast India, bringing our unique blend of quality service and cultural relevance to a wider audience. Ultimately, our vision is to create a legacy of excellence in event management and contribute to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam and the entire Northeast region. We strive to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a vital part of the community, a catalyst for celebration, and a symbol of lasting memories.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.303Z', '2025-11-30T05:40:35.000Z'),
