<br> <br>
<p>At LIVE as GHY926, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers by providing personalized service and creating a welcoming and inclusive environment. Our team is composed of individuals who are passionate about the local community and deeply committed to providing exceptional customer support. We strive to understand each customer''s unique needs and tailor our services to meet those needs effectively.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We actively engage with the local community through [mention specific initiatives – e.g., sponsoring local events; partnering with local NGOs; offering discounts to local residents; hosting community workshops]. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and fostering a sense of shared responsibility for the well-being of Guwahati. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers and the community to ensure that our services remain relevant and responsive to their evolving needs. This commitment to continuous improvement is a core value of our business.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, LIVE as GHY926 envisions becoming a leading force in the Guwahati business landscape, recognized for its commitment to innovation, community engagement, and cultural preservation. Our long-term goals include [mention specific future plans – e.g., expanding our services to other cities in Assam; developing new products that cater to the evolving needs of the local market; establishing a foundation to support local artists and entrepreneurs; becoming a certified sustainable business].</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We are committed to sustainable growth and believe that business should be a force for good in the world. We will continue to invest in our team, our community, and our planet, ensuring that LIVE as GHY926 remains a positive and impactful presence in Guwahati for years to come. Our ambition is to not only grow our business but also contribute to the overall prosperity and well-being of the Assamese community, fostering a vibrant and sustainable future for generations to come.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Ultimately, LIVE as GHY926 seeks to be synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit in Guwahati. We are more than just a business; we are a part of the city''s story, committed to shaping a brighter future for all.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.304Z', '2025-11-30T06:00:34.000Z'),
(1122, 'OYO Ashirwad Heritage', 'Resorts', NULL, 'OYO Ashirwad Heritage, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just accommodation, we strive to provide an immersive cultural experience, positioning ourselves as a significant contributor to the growing tourism sector of Assam. We recognize the increasing demand for authentic travel experiences, particularly for visitors seeking to explore the rich cultural heritage of the region. Our establishment stands as a testament to Assam’s architectural beauty while adhering to contemporary standards of comfort and service, making us a distinctive presence in Guwahati''s hospitality landscape.
<br> <br>
Our core service revolves around providing comfortable and affordable accommodation through the OYO platform, benefiting from their widespread reach and technological infrastructure. We offer a variety of room types to cater to diverse needs, from standard rooms for budget-conscious travelers to premium rooms for those seeking a more luxurious experience. However, what truly distinguishes OYO Ashirwad Heritage is our commitment to showcasing Assamese culture. This is reflected in the architectural design of the property, incorporating traditional elements and motifs. We also offer curated experiences like traditional Assamese cooking classes, folk music performances, and guided tours of local historical sites. These unique offerings set us apart from generic hotels and cater specifically to the growing demand for culturally immersive travel experiences in Guwahati. By seamlessly integrating local heritage with modern amenities, we create a memorable and enriching stay for our guests, directly addressing the market need for authentic cultural tourism options.
<br> <br>
At OYO Ashirwad Heritage, customer satisfaction is paramount. We are deeply committed to providing personalized service and creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is trained not only in hospitality best practices but also in sharing their knowledge of local culture and traditions. We go beyond simply providing a room; we aim to act as a concierge, offering recommendations for local eateries, assisting with travel arrangements, and ensuring guests have a truly enriching experience in Guwahati. Our connection with the local community is strengthened through partnerships with local artisans and cultural organizations. We showcase and sell locally made handicrafts in our lobby, providing a platform for local artisans and giving our guests the opportunity to take home authentic souvenirs. Furthermore, we actively participate in local festivals and events, further integrating ourselves into the community fabric and demonstrating our commitment to promoting Assamese culture. We regularly solicit feedback from our guests and actively use this information to improve our services and offerings, ensuring we are constantly evolving to meet their needs and expectations.
<br> <br>
OYO Ashirwad Heritage envisions becoming a leading destination for culturally immersive travel in Guwahati and the wider Assam region. We plan to expand our offerings by adding more curated cultural experiences, such as tea garden tours and visits to local weaving villages. We also aim to incorporate sustainable tourism practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural beauty. This includes sourcing local and organic produce for our restaurant, implementing energy-efficient technologies, and supporting local conservation initiatives. We are exploring the possibility of developing partnerships with other heritage properties in Assam to create a network of culturally significant destinations, allowing visitors to experience the full diversity of the region''s heritage. Long-term, we aspire to be recognized not only as a comfortable and convenient place to stay but also as a cultural ambassador for Assam, playing a vital role in promoting tourism and preserving the region''s rich heritage for future generations. Our focus remains on delivering authentic experiences, strengthening our community ties, and championing sustainable practices to ensure a bright future for OYO Ashirwad Heritage and the tourism sector of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.304Z', '2025-11-30T06:05:07.000Z'),
(1123, 'Moon Hill Homestay', 'Resorts', NULL, '<p>Moon Hill Homestay: A Sanctuary of Tranquility in Guwahati</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled amidst the verdant hills surrounding Guwahati, Moon Hill Homestay offers a unique and authentic Assamese hospitality experience. Beyond simply providing accommodation, Moon Hill Homestay strives to be a gateway to the region''s rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and warm community. In a region increasingly embracing tourism, Moon Hill distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable practices, personalized service, and deep connection to the local environment. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we aim to be a memorable and enriching part of our guests'' Assam journey, contributing positively to the local economy and showcasing the true spirit of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service revolves around providing comfortable and culturally immersive accommodation. We offer a range of rooms, each thoughtfully designed to blend modern comfort with traditional Assamese aesthetics. Guests can choose from standard rooms offering essential amenities to more spacious family suites with private balconies overlooking the surrounding hills. What truly sets us apart is the curated experience we provide. This includes offering guests homemade Assamese meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients, providing insightful guided tours of nearby attractions, and facilitating interactions with local artisans and craftspeople. Our "Assam Discovery Package," for example, combines comfortable lodging with a customized itinerary featuring visits to tea gardens, Kaziranga National Park, and local craft villages, offering a holistic exploration of the region. We cater to both leisure travelers seeking relaxation and adventure, as well as business travelers looking for a peaceful and convenient base from which to operate. We also provide specialized services such as airport transfers, laundry facilities, and reliable Wi-Fi access to ensure a seamless and hassle-free stay.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Moon Hill Homestay, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our team is dedicated to creating a welcoming and personalized experience for every guest. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness. We take pride in anticipating their needs and going the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. Our staff are not just employees; they are local residents who possess a deep understanding of the region and are passionate about sharing its stories and traditions with our guests. We actively encourage feedback and use it to continually improve our services and offerings. We foster a strong connection with the local community by sourcing our produce and employing local talent, ensuring that our business directly benefits the surrounding villages. We also participate in local initiatives, such as supporting local schools and promoting sustainable tourism practices, demonstrating our commitment to responsible business operations. This engagement fosters a sense of trust and goodwill within the community, enhancing the overall experience for our guests and strengthening our roots in the region. Furthermore, we actively promote local culture through traditional music and dance performances held on the premises, providing our guests with a vibrant and authentic cultural immersion.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Moon Hill Homestay envisions becoming a leading eco-tourism destination in Guwahati. We aim to expand our accommodation options to include eco-friendly cottages and glamping sites, further minimizing our environmental footprint. We are actively exploring opportunities to integrate renewable energy sources, such as solar power, into our operations. A key aspect of our future plans involves developing specialized wellness programs centered around traditional Assamese healing practices and yoga retreats, catering to the growing demand for holistic travel experiences. We also intend to establish partnerships with local conservation organizations to support their efforts in protecting the region''s biodiversity and promoting sustainable tourism. We plan to launch a comprehensive online platform that showcases our offerings, highlights local attractions, and facilitates seamless booking processes. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional hospitality but also contributes significantly to the economic and social well-being of the local community and promotes the preservation of Assam''s unique cultural heritage. Ultimately, we aspire for Moon Hill Homestay to be recognized as a model for responsible and sustainable tourism in the region, inspiring others to adopt similar practices and contribute to a brighter future for Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.304Z', '2025-11-30T06:05:13.000Z'),
(1124, 'Debojani Ashralaya Travellers Hostel by OK! North East', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Debojani Ashralaya Travellers Hostel by OK! North East, located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of comfort, affordability, and cultural immersion for travellers exploring the vibrant North East region of India. More than just a place to stay, it functions as a gateway, connecting visitors with the rich tapestry of Assamese culture, adventure opportunities, and the warmth of the local community. In a landscape where tourism is rapidly evolving, Debojani Ashralaya aims to fill a crucial niche by providing budget-friendly accommodation without compromising on quality, safety, and authentic local experiences. It stands apart by fostering a sense of community among travellers and acting as a responsible promoter of sustainable tourism practices within the Assam context.

<br> <br>

The hostel''s core service is providing clean, comfortable, and secure accommodation suitable for solo travellers, backpackers, groups, and budget-conscious explorers. A variety of room options are available, including dormitories with secure lockers and private rooms catering to different needs and preferences. Beyond accommodation, Debojani Ashralaya distinguishes itself by offering curated travel experiences and support services. These include guided city tours of Guwahati, excursions to nearby attractions like the Kamakhya Temple and Umananda Island, and assistance with planning longer trips into the North East, encompassing destinations like Kaziranga National Park, Shillong, and Tawang. A significant unique selling point is the strong partnership with OK! North East, a well-established and respected local tour operator. This collaboration allows the hostel to offer reliable, vetted, and culturally sensitive tours, ensuring travellers have authentic and enriching experiences. Further enhancing the offering, the hostel provides practical amenities like laundry facilities, free Wi-Fi, a communal kitchen for self-catering, and a comfortable common area for socialising and exchanging travel stories. These services address a critical need in the market for affordable, reliable, and informative travel support, especially for independent travellers venturing into a region that may be less familiar.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Debojani Ashralaya. The hostel strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, fostering a sense of belonging for every guest. The staff, primarily comprised of locals, are trained to be more than just service providers; they act as cultural ambassadors, offering insights into Assamese customs, traditions, and cuisine. They are readily available to provide personalised recommendations for local eateries, cultural events, and off-the-beaten-path destinations, ensuring that guests have a truly immersive experience. What sets Debojani Ashralaya apart is its active engagement with the local community. The hostel supports local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services, creating opportunities for cultural exchange and economic empowerment. The hostel also hosts cultural events, such as traditional Assamese music performances, cooking classes, and language workshops, offering guests a unique opportunity to connect with the local culture on a deeper level. This commitment to responsible tourism and community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the region. The business actively seeks feedback from guests to continually improve its services and ensure that it meets their evolving needs.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Debojani Ashralaya has ambitious plans for growth and development. The immediate focus is on strengthening its online presence and expanding its network of partners within the local tourism industry. Future plans include developing thematic tours focusing on specific interests such as wildlife, tea tourism, and cultural heritage. The business also aims to establish a network of similar hostels in other key locations across the North East, creating a seamless and affordable travel circuit for backpackers and independent travellers. A long-term goal is to become a leading advocate for sustainable tourism practices in the region, promoting responsible travel that benefits both visitors and local communities. This includes initiatives to reduce the hostel''s environmental footprint, support local conservation efforts, and raise awareness among travellers about the importance of respecting local cultures and traditions. By consistently providing exceptional service, fostering a strong sense of community, and actively promoting responsible tourism, Debojani Ashralaya aims to establish itself as a cornerstone of the North East''s tourism landscape and a trusted gateway for travellers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. The business envisions becoming synonymous with responsible and culturally immersive travel within the region, contributing to its economic growth while preserving its unique cultural heritage.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.304Z', '2025-11-30T06:05:20.000Z'),
(1125, 'Baruah Abax', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Baruah Abax: Bridging Innovation and Tradition in Guwahati''s Business Ecosystem

Baruah Abax stands as a dynamic and forward-thinking enterprise nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a business, Baruah Abax embodies a commitment to fostering economic growth and innovation while honoring the rich cultural heritage of the region. Operating within a vibrant, yet often underserved, market, the company distinguishes itself by offering tailored solutions that address the specific needs and challenges faced by local businesses and individuals. Baruah Abax strives to be a catalyst for positive change, driving progress through a blend of cutting-edge technologies and time-honored business principles.

<br> <br>

Core Services and Products: Empowering Growth in Assam

Baruah Abax specializes in providing comprehensive business solutions across a spectrum of areas, primarily focusing on two key pillars: technology integration and strategic consulting. On the technology front, the company offers tailored software development, digital marketing strategies, and IT infrastructure support to empower local businesses to thrive in the digital age. Recognizing the growing need for businesses to establish a robust online presence, Baruah Abax provides website design and development services, search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, and content creation, all specifically designed to resonate with the local audience and capture their attention.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, Baruah Abax provides strategic consulting services encompassing market research, business plan development, financial planning, and operational efficiency improvements. Understanding that each business is unique, the company adopts a personalized approach, working closely with clients to identify their specific goals and challenges, and then developing customized strategies to achieve sustainable growth. A key unique selling point lies in their deep understanding of the local market dynamics, cultural nuances, and regulatory landscape, allowing them to provide insights and guidance that larger, nationally focused firms often overlook. By providing culturally relevant and practical business advice, Baruah Abax helps local enterprises navigate the complexities of the market and unlock their full potential. This blend of technological prowess and strategic acumen positions Baruah Abax as a valuable partner for businesses seeking to scale and compete effectively in the modern marketplace.

<br> <br>

Customer Experience: Building Lasting Relationships Through Local Connection

Baruah Abax prioritizes building strong, lasting relationships with its clients and fostering a sense of community. The company believes in going beyond the transactional, focusing on understanding the unique needs and aspirations of each client. The customer service approach is rooted in transparency, integrity, and responsiveness, ensuring that clients feel valued and supported throughout their journey. Baruah Abax fosters open communication channels, providing personalized support and guidance to address any concerns or challenges that may arise.

<br> <br>

Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Baruah Abax actively participates in local initiatives and events, supporting organizations that contribute to the well-being and development of Guwahati. This involvement not only strengthens its ties with the community but also provides valuable insights into the evolving needs of the market. By actively listening to the community and incorporating their feedback, Baruah Abax ensures that its services remain relevant and aligned with the needs of the local population. Through its commitment to exceptional customer service and active community engagement, Baruah Abax strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be a trusted partner and a positive force for change in the region.

<br> <br>

Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Driving Sustainable Growth

Looking ahead, Baruah Abax envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam business landscape and beyond. The company is committed to staying at the forefront of technological advancements and adapting its services to meet the evolving needs of the market. This includes exploring opportunities in emerging areas such as artificial intelligence, data analytics, and sustainable business practices. A key long-term goal is to establish Baruah Abax as a leading provider of business solutions in Northeast India, empowering businesses across the region to achieve their full potential.

<br> <br>

