Hotel Bhargav Grand’s core offerings center around providing a seamless and enriching guest experience. Our well-appointed rooms and suites, designed with a blend of contemporary elegance and traditional Assamese aesthetics, offer a sanctuary of comfort. Each room is equipped with modern amenities including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and luxurious bedding, ensuring a restful and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of exceptional services tailored to meet diverse needs. Our on-site multi-cuisine restaurant tantalizes taste buds with a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and international favorites, prepared by experienced chefs using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. For business travelers, we provide state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, equipped with audio-visual technology and supported by a dedicated events team, ideal for hosting meetings, conferences, and social gatherings. Our wellness center, complete with a fully equipped gym and spa, allows guests to rejuvenate and unwind. What truly sets Hotel Bhargav Grand apart is our personalized approach to hospitality. We anticipate guest needs before they arise, offering bespoke services such as personalized concierge assistance, airport transfers, and curated local tours to showcase the best of Guwahati and its surrounding areas. This dedication to exceeding expectations makes us a preferred choice for discerning travelers seeking an authentic and memorable experience.

<br> <br>

At Hotel Bhargav Grand, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our team is comprised of highly trained and dedicated professionals who are passionate about providing personalized attention and anticipating guest needs. We foster a culture of empathy and responsiveness, empowering our staff to go the extra mile to ensure every guest feels valued and cared for. We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our local community. We actively participate in local initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. Our restaurant prioritizes sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, contributing to the local economy and ensuring the freshness of our offerings. We also regularly host community events and cultural celebrations, fostering a sense of belonging and connection. Furthermore, we actively seek feedback from our guests and the local community, using their insights to continuously improve our services and offerings. This commitment to continuous improvement and community engagement ensures that Hotel Bhargav Grand remains a vital and valued part of the Guwahati landscape.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Hotel Bhargav Grand envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued excellence. We plan to expand our facilities and services, adding more rooms and suites to accommodate growing demand while maintaining our commitment to personalized service. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new amenities, such as a rooftop infinity pool and bar, to further enhance the guest experience. A key focus of our future strategy is embracing sustainable practices. We are committed to reducing our environmental footprint through initiatives such as energy conservation, water management, and waste reduction. We plan to implement green technologies and adopt eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, aligning with global sustainability standards. Furthermore, we aim to become a recognized leader in hospitality training and development in the region. We plan to establish a hospitality training program to nurture local talent, providing young individuals with the skills and knowledge necessary to succeed in the industry. By investing in our people and our community, we are confident that Hotel Bhargav Grand will continue to thrive and contribute to the prosperity of Guwahati for years to come. Our long-term goal is to establish Hotel Bhargav Grand as a leading hospitality brand in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and unwavering dedication to guest satisfaction.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.305Z', '2025-11-30T06:10:07.000Z'),
(1128, 'Green View Guest House', 'Resorts', NULL, 'Green View Guest House is an established hospitality provider nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil retreat from the city''s bustling energy. More than just a place to stay, Green View Guest House is a sanctuary designed to connect visitors with the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. Its unique blend of comfortable accommodations, personalized service, and commitment to showcasing the region''s authentic charm positions it as a significant player in Guwahati''s growing tourism sector. In a market dominated by larger hotel chains, Green View Guest House distinguishes itself through its intimate atmosphere, personalized attention, and focus on sustainable practices. This emphasis caters to the increasing demand for authentic and responsible travel experiences, setting it apart within the local business landscape.

