<br>

<p>The future vision for OYO Indiraj includes expanding its reach within Guwahati and potentially branching out to other locations in Assam. This expansion could involve increasing the number of rooms available or introducing new service offerings such as extended-stay options or bundled packages that include local tours and experiences. A key focus area is likely to be strengthening its online presence and leveraging digital marketing strategies to attract a wider audience. Furthermore, OYO Indiraj could explore partnerships with local businesses and organizations to offer exclusive deals and promotions to its guests. This collaborative approach would not only enhance the guest experience but also contribute to the growth of the local economy. Long-term goals may encompass incorporating sustainable practices, such as energy-efficient technologies and waste reduction programs, to minimize its environmental impact and align with the growing emphasis on responsible tourism. By continuously adapting to market trends and prioritizing customer satisfaction, OYO Indiraj aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a valuable contributor to the region''s tourism industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.305Z', '2025-11-30T06:15:29.000Z'),
(1137, 'OYO 44696 Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse', 'Resorts', NULL, 'OYO 44696 Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse: A Welcoming Haven in Guwahati

