Beyond accommodation, Om Shree Residency provides a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving a delectable array of local and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This focus on regional cuisine offers guests an authentic taste of Assam, adding a cultural dimension to their stay. Furthermore, the residency offers laundry services, travel assistance, and airport transfers, ensuring a hassle-free experience from arrival to departure.

