Feedback is actively sought from guests to continuously improve services and facilities. This commitment to continuous improvement ensures that Om Shree Residency remains responsive to the evolving needs of its clientele and maintains its position as a leading provider of accommodation in Guwahati. The residency also utilizes online platforms and social media to engage with guests, respond to inquiries, and promote its services, further enhancing its accessibility and responsiveness.

<br> <br>

Future Vision

Looking ahead, Om Shree Residency envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati. Future plans include potential expansion of facilities to accommodate a growing clientele, as well as the introduction of new services and amenities designed to further enhance the guest experience. This may include adding a fitness center, spa services, or expanding the dining options.

<br> <br>

A key focus of the future vision is to further develop Om Shree Residency''s brand identity, emphasizing its commitment to personalized service, local engagement, and sustainable business practices. The residency also aims to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, potentially through the implementation of online check-in systems, mobile concierge services, and smart room technology. By staying abreast of industry trends and continuously innovating, Om Shree Residency is poised to maintain its competitive edge and achieve its long-term goals of becoming a premier destination for travelers visiting Guwahati. The commitment to providing exceptional value and fostering lasting relationships with guests will remain at the core of Om Shree Residency''s future success.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:40:15.000Z'),
(1147, 'Ratnamouli Palace', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Ratnamouli Palace, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, stands as a testament to the rich cultural heritage and burgeoning hospitality sector of Assam. More than just a business, Ratnamouli Palace is an experience, meticulously crafted to provide unparalleled comfort, convenience, and a genuine taste of Assamese warmth to its patrons. Situated strategically in Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, the establishment caters to a diverse clientele, from discerning business travelers and tourists seeking authentic cultural immersion to local residents looking for a refined dining or event venue. Its significance in the local business landscape lies in its commitment to quality, its dedication to promoting local artisans and traditions, and its contribution to the region''s growing reputation as a prime destination for both leisure and commerce. Ratnamouli Palace is not just a place to stay or dine; it''s a celebration of Assam''s vibrant spirit.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, Ratnamouli Palace offers a comprehensive suite of hospitality services designed to meet the multifaceted needs of its guests. This includes elegantly appointed accommodations ranging from comfortable standard rooms to luxurious suites, each designed with a blend of contemporary amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics. The in-house dining experience is a significant draw, featuring a multi-cuisine restaurant that showcases both international delicacies and authentic Assamese cuisine. Emphasis is placed on sourcing fresh, locally grown ingredients to support local farmers and offer guests a true taste of the region. Beyond accommodations and dining, Ratnamouli Palace boasts state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, ideal for hosting corporate events, weddings, and other special occasions. These spaces are equipped with the latest technology and supported by a dedicated events team to ensure seamless execution and unforgettable experiences. What truly distinguishes Ratnamouli Palace is its commitment to cultural immersion. Guests are offered opportunities to engage with local artisans, participate in traditional Assamese cooking classes, and explore the region''s rich cultural heritage through curated tours and experiences. This unique blend of modern comfort and authentic cultural engagement sets Ratnamouli Palace apart from its competitors and directly addresses the growing demand for experiential travel in the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Ratnamouli Palace, shaping every aspect of its operations. The establishment prides itself on providing personalized and attentive service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. A highly trained and multilingual staff is dedicated to anticipating and exceeding guest expectations, from seamless check-in procedures to customized concierge services. The focus extends beyond mere efficiency to creating genuine connections with guests, fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere that reflects Assamese hospitality. Ratnamouli Palace actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, including partnerships with local artisans and businesses, supporting cultural events, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. These efforts not only contribute to the region''s economic and cultural vitality but also strengthen the business''s ties with the community and enhance its reputation as a responsible and socially conscious organization. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve services and adapt to evolving customer needs, demonstrating a commitment to ongoing refinement and a genuine desire to provide the best possible experience. The goal is to create not just satisfied customers, but loyal advocates who will return to Ratnamouli Palace and recommend it to others.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Ratnamouli Palace is ambitious, encompassing strategic growth and a continued commitment to excellence. Plans are underway to expand the property with additional rooms and suites, incorporating sustainable design principles and further enhancing the guest experience. Exploration of opportunities to develop complementary businesses, such as a wellness center or a specialized Assamese handicraft boutique, is also being considered to diversify revenue streams and offer guests an even more comprehensive range of services. Recognizing the growing importance of technology, Ratnamouli Palace aims to invest in cutting-edge technologies to streamline operations, enhance communication with guests, and personalize their experiences. This includes exploring the implementation of AI-powered concierge services and advanced data analytics to better understand customer preferences and tailor offerings accordingly. Long-term goals include establishing Ratnamouli Palace as a leading hospitality brand in Northeast India, known for its unwavering commitment to quality, its dedication to cultural preservation, and its positive impact on the local community. The vision is to create a legacy that extends beyond mere profitability, contributing to the sustainable development of the region and showcasing the beauty and richness of Assamese culture to the world. This will involve active participation in regional tourism initiatives, supporting local entrepreneurs, and promoting responsible environmental practices. Ultimately, Ratnamouli Palace aims to be a beacon of hospitality excellence, inspiring others in the industry and contributing to the continued growth and prosperity of Guwahati and the surrounding region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:40:21.000Z'),
(1148, 'Hotel Sai Rain Tree', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Hotel Sai Rain Tree: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Hotel Sai Rain Tree offers a tranquil escape, blending modern amenities with the region''s rich cultural heritage. More than just a place to stay, we strive to be a gateway to the wonders of Assam, providing exceptional service and fostering a deep connection with the local community. Hotel Sai Rain Tree stands out as a premier hospitality destination, catering to both discerning travelers and local residents seeking a refined experience. We contribute to the vibrant Guwahati business landscape by providing a reliable and high-quality accommodation and event space, attracting both national and international visitors.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Core Services and Products: Tailored for Every Traveler</p>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. We offer a range of rooms and suites designed to meet diverse needs, from cozy standard rooms perfect for solo travelers to spacious family suites ideal for larger groups. Each room is meticulously maintained and equipped with modern conveniences, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and climate control. <br> <br> Beyond accommodation, Hotel Sai Rain Tree boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant, "Flavors of Assam," showcasing the diverse culinary tapestry of the region alongside popular international dishes. We prioritize using locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and offering guests an authentic taste of Assam. Our dedicated banquet and conference facilities cater to both corporate and social events, equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and customizable seating arrangements. We also offer curated travel packages for guests looking to explore the surrounding areas, including Kaziranga National Park and other regional attractions. <br> <br> What distinguishes Hotel Sai Rain Tree is our unwavering commitment to personalized service and our deep understanding of the local market. We recognize that each guest has unique needs and preferences. We proactively cater to these needs, providing bespoke services and creating a truly memorable experience. Our emphasis on local sourcing and cultural integration further enhances our appeal, attracting visitors seeking an authentic and immersive travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer Experience: Creating Lasting Connections</p>

<p>At Hotel Sai Rain Tree, customer service is not just a department; it''s a philosophy. We believe in anticipating our guests'' needs and exceeding their expectations. Our team is comprised of highly trained and passionate individuals who are dedicated to providing attentive and personalized service. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, ensuring that every guest feels valued and cared for. <br> <br> We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, supporting local artisans and cultural events. This commitment to social responsibility resonates with our guests and reinforces our position as a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. We also gather regular feedback from our guests through surveys and online platforms, using this information to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our commitment to transparency and responsiveness fosters trust and loyalty among our clientele. We actively promote local tourism, providing information and resources to help guests explore the region''s hidden gems. This not only enhances the guest experience but also supports local businesses and communities.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Future Vision: Growing with Guwahati</p>

<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Sai Rain Tree is committed to sustainable growth and continuous improvement. We envision expanding our services to meet the evolving needs of the Guwahati market and solidify our position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. This includes potential expansion of our accommodation capacity, the addition of new amenities such as a spa or wellness center, and the development of new culinary experiences. <br> <br> We are also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing online check-in and personalized concierge services through a mobile app. Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our ties with the local community through expanded partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We aim to promote Guwahati as a premier tourism destination, attracting more visitors and contributing to the economic growth of the region. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with exceptional hospitality and cultural immersion in Guwahati, a beacon of comfort and Assam''s rich heritage.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:40:28.000Z'),
(1149, 'Hotel ROYALE de CASA', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA: A Gateway to Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati</p>

<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA stands as a distinguished beacon of hospitality in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to stay, it’s an experience crafted to immerse guests in the rich cultural tapestry and warm traditions of the region. Situated in a prime location within Guwahati, the hotel offers a tranquil retreat while providing convenient access to key business districts, historical landmarks, and the breathtaking natural beauty that defines Assam. ROYALE de CASA fills a crucial need in the Guwahati hospitality market by catering to both discerning travelers seeking authentic cultural experiences and business professionals demanding efficiency and comfort. Its commitment to blending modern amenities with a deep respect for local heritage distinguishes it from larger, more generic hotel chains and smaller guesthouses alike.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Exquisite Accommodation and Immersive Cultural Experiences</p>

<p>At its core, Hotel ROYALE de CASA provides meticulously designed and well-appointed accommodation to ensure a restful and productive stay for every guest. Rooms range from elegantly furnished standard options to luxurious suites, each reflecting a commitment to comfort and aesthetic appeal. Beyond accommodation, the hotel distinguishes itself by offering a curated selection of services designed to immerse guests in Assamese culture. These include traditional Assamese cooking classes, guided tours to nearby tea gardens and historical sites, and curated cultural performances showcasing local music and dance. The on-site restaurant serves authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients, offering a delectable culinary journey through the region''s diverse flavors. For business travelers, ROYALE de CASA provides state-of-the-art conference facilities equipped with the latest technology, ensuring seamless meetings and presentations. The availability of personalized concierge services caters to the unique needs of each guest, arranging transportation, booking excursions, and providing expert local insights. This blend of comfortable lodging and immersive cultural experiences is the hotel''s key differentiator, satisfying the growing demand for authentic and meaningful travel experiences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer-Centric Service and Community Engagement</p>

<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA is built on a foundation of exceptional customer service. The hotel''s staff are meticulously trained to anticipate and exceed guest expectations, providing a personalized and attentive experience from check-in to check-out. A key aspect of the hotel’s approach is its commitment to creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, reflecting the genuine hospitality that is synonymous with Assamese culture. The hotel actively fosters a sense of community by partnering with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services. This includes featuring locally crafted handicrafts in the hotel''s gift shop and sourcing ingredients for its restaurant from regional farmers. Moreover, ROYALE de CASA actively participates in local cultural events and supports community initiatives, solidifying its role as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. This dedication to customer satisfaction and community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also strengthens the hotel''s reputation as a trusted and valued member of the Guwahati community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Strategic Growth and a Vision for the Future</p>

<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA envisions a future of sustainable growth and expansion, aiming to become a leading destination for culturally immersive travel in Northeast India. Future plans include expanding the hotel''s capacity with the addition of new rooms and suites, incorporating eco-friendly practices to minimize its environmental impact, and developing new and innovative cultural experiences to cater to evolving traveler preferences. The hotel is also exploring opportunities to partner with other tourism operators in the region to create comprehensive travel packages that showcase the diverse attractions of Assam and its neighboring states. Furthermore, ROYALE de CASA intends to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, implementing online booking platforms, virtual concierge services, and personalized communication strategies. The long-term goal is to establish Hotel ROYALE de CASA as a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality, attracting both domestic and international travelers seeking a memorable and enriching travel experience. By staying true to its core values of exceptional service, cultural immersion, and community engagement, Hotel ROYALE de CASA is poised to contribute significantly to the growth and development of the tourism industry in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:40:34.000Z'),
(1150, 'Parnil Palace - Hotel in Guwahati', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Parnil Palace, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, stands as a testament to refined hospitality and modern comfort. More than just a hotel, it’s a destination that seamlessly blends the warmth of Assamese culture with world-class amenities, offering a memorable experience to both leisure and business travelers. Situated strategically in Guwahati, Parnil Palace provides easy access to the city''s key attractions, business districts, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal base for exploring the vibrant Assam region. Its presence contributes significantly to the local business landscape by providing a high-quality accommodation option, boosting tourism, and supporting local employment. Parnil Palace aims to be recognized not only as a premier hotel but also as an integral part of Guwahati''s identity.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, Parnil Palace offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its guests. The hotel boasts exquisitely designed rooms and suites, each thoughtfully appointed with modern furnishings, high-speed internet access, and state-of-the-art technology to ensure a comfortable and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Parnil Palace features a multi-cuisine restaurant serving a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies alongside international favorites, providing a culinary journey that satisfies every palate. For corporate travelers, the hotel provides well-equipped conference and meeting facilities, complete with audio-visual equipment and dedicated support staff, making it an ideal venue for business events and seminars. A dedicated travel desk assists guests with tour arrangements and local sightseeing, enabling them to explore the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam. Parnil Palace distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service and attention to detail. Unlike larger chain hotels, Parnil Palace focuses on creating a more intimate and authentic experience, emphasizing local flavors and cultural immersion. This personalized touch directly addresses the needs of discerning travelers seeking a unique and enriching experience in Guwahati.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Parnil Palace''s philosophy. Every guest is treated with genuine warmth and respect, and the staff is dedicated to anticipating and exceeding expectations. The hotel emphasizes proactive communication and responsiveness, ensuring that all inquiries and requests are handled promptly and efficiently. What truly sets Parnil Palace apart is its commitment to connecting with the local community. The hotel actively promotes local artisans and cultural events, providing guests with opportunities to immerse themselves in the authentic Assamese way of life. The restaurant sources fresh ingredients from local farmers and producers, supporting the local economy and showcasing the region''s rich culinary heritage. Moreover, Parnil Palace participates in community initiatives and charitable activities, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility and contributing to the well-being of the local community. The goal is to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel like valued members of the Parnil Palace family, fostering lasting relationships and positive word-of-mouth referrals.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Parnil Palace envisions becoming the leading hospitality destination in Guwahati and a recognized brand across the Northeast region. Future plans include expanding the hotel''s facilities to include a state-of-the-art spa and wellness center, further enhancing the guest experience. The hotel also aims to develop specialized packages and experiences that cater to specific interests, such as wildlife tourism, cultural immersion, and adventure travel. Furthermore, Parnil Palace is committed to investing in its staff through continuous training and development programs, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of hospitality excellence. The long-term goal is to establish Parnil Palace as a symbol of quality, innovation, and community engagement, contributing to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector in Assam and creating a positive impact on the local economy. By consistently exceeding guest expectations and embracing its role as a responsible corporate citizen, Parnil Palace is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p> Parnil Palace intends to leverage technology to enhance guest experiences, including implementing mobile check-in/check-out options, smart room features, and personalized recommendations via a dedicated mobile app. This focus on innovation will allow Parnil Palace to stay ahead of trends and cater to the demands of the modern traveller. The hotel is also exploring partnerships with local businesses to offer curated experiences and packages. By collaborating with local tour operators, craftspeople, and restaurants, Parnil Palace will showcase the best of Guwahati and support the local economy. In addition to its physical expansion and service enhancement initiatives, Parnil Palace plans to strengthen its online presence through targeted digital marketing campaigns and social media engagement. By actively communicating its unique value proposition and showcasing guest experiences, Parnil Palace aims to attract a wider audience and solidify its brand reputation as the go-to hotel in Guwahati.
</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:45:09.000Z'),
(1151, 'Urban Crest Beltola', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Urban Crest Beltola: Crafting Modern Living Experiences in Guwahati</p>

<p>Urban Crest Beltola is a dynamic real estate development company based in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. We are dedicated to creating thoughtfully designed residential and commercial spaces that reflect the unique spirit of the region while embracing modern living standards. More than just constructing buildings, we strive to build communities and contribute to the evolving urban landscape of Guwahati. Our commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction distinguishes us within the local real estate market and positions us as a trusted partner for those seeking to invest in their future.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core business revolves around the development and sale of residential apartments and commercial properties in strategic locations throughout Guwahati. We specialize in crafting modern, functional spaces that cater to the diverse needs of our clientele, from young professionals and growing families to established businesses. Our residential offerings range from compact, stylish apartments ideal for individuals and couples, to spacious family homes with ample amenities. For the commercial sector, we provide strategically located office spaces and retail units designed to enhance business operations and visibility. A key differentiator for Urban Crest Beltola is our focus on sustainable design principles, incorporating eco-friendly materials and energy-efficient technologies wherever possible. This commitment not only minimizes our environmental impact but also provides long-term cost savings and a healthier living and working environment for our clients. We also stand out by meticulously selecting locations that offer excellent connectivity, access to essential amenities such as schools, hospitals, and shopping centers, and promising investment potential, addressing the crucial needs of the modern Guwahati resident and business owner who value convenience and long-term value.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Urban Crest Beltola, we understand that purchasing a home or investing in a commercial property is a significant decision. We therefore prioritize building strong relationships with our customers and providing exceptional support throughout the entire process. From the initial consultation and property viewing to the final handover and after-sales service, our dedicated team is committed to ensuring a seamless and stress-free experience. We emphasize transparency and clear communication, providing our clients with comprehensive information about our projects and assisting them in making informed decisions. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, supporting local initiatives, and partnering with local businesses. We believe that being a responsible corporate citizen is crucial for building trust and fostering positive relationships within the community we serve. We host regular community engagement sessions to gather feedback and ensure our projects are aligned with the needs and aspirations of the local population. This proactive approach to community relations strengthens our brand reputation and solidifies our position as a committed and ethical developer.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Urban Crest Beltola envisions becoming a leading real estate developer in Guwahati and across Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community development. Our long-term goals include expanding our project portfolio to include a wider range of residential and commercial offerings, such as integrated townships and specialized commercial complexes. We are also exploring opportunities to incorporate smart home technologies and advanced sustainability features into our projects, further enhancing the living and working experience for our clients. A key area of focus for the future is strategic land acquisition in prime locations with high growth potential. This will enable us to develop projects that meet the evolving needs of the market and provide long-term value for our investors and customers. We also plan to invest in talent development and training programs to ensure our team remains at the forefront of the industry, equipped with the latest skills and knowledge. Ultimately, our vision is to contribute to the sustainable and inclusive growth of Guwahati and Assam by creating spaces that inspire, connect, and empower people to live and work to their fullest potential.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:45:14.000Z'),
(1152, 'Hotel Relaxy Inn', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Hotel Relaxy Inn: Your Gateway to Tranquility in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<br><br>

<p>Hotel Relaxy Inn stands as a beacon of comfort and refined hospitality within the vibrant cityscape of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to rest your head, we offer a sanctuary where modern amenities harmonize with traditional Assamese warmth. Strategically located to provide convenient access to key landmarks, business centers, and transportation hubs, Relaxy Inn caters to both discerning business travelers and leisure seekers eager to explore the rich cultural tapestry of the region. We are committed to contributing positively to the local business landscape by fostering sustainable practices and prioritizing the well-being of our community.</p>

<br><br>

<p>At the heart of our offerings are thoughtfully designed accommodations to meet diverse needs. Our rooms range from cozy standard options ideal for budget-conscious travelers to spacious suites offering unparalleled comfort and panoramic city views. Each room is equipped with modern necessities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, climate control, and well-appointed en-suite bathrooms featuring premium toiletries. We understand the importance of connectivity for business travelers, hence we provide seamless internet access throughout the property. For those seeking an elevated experience, our suites boast separate living areas, work desks, and additional amenities, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay.</p>

<br><br>

<p>Beyond our comfortable accommodations, Relaxy Inn provides a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. Our in-house multi-cuisine restaurant tantalizes taste buds with a diverse menu featuring local Assamese delicacies alongside popular Indian and international dishes. Our chefs are passionate about using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring authentic flavors. We also offer a well-stocked bar, perfect for unwinding after a long day of meetings or sightseeing. For those seeking to maintain their fitness regime, our well-equipped gym provides a space to exercise and rejuvenate. Furthermore, we offer comprehensive event and meeting facilities, equipped with modern audio-visual technology, making us an ideal venue for corporate gatherings, conferences, and social events. Our team of experienced event planners are on hand to ensure every detail is meticulously executed, resulting in successful and memorable occasions.</p>

<br><br>

<p>What truly sets Relaxy Inn apart is our unwavering commitment to exceptional customer service. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality. Our staff are meticulously trained to anticipate needs, address concerns promptly, and provide personalized recommendations to enhance their stay. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our concierge service is dedicated to assisting guests with travel arrangements, tour bookings, and local information, ensuring they can seamlessly explore the city and its surrounding attractions. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and maintain the highest standards of customer satisfaction. Our dedication to personalized service extends to remembering guest preferences, creating a sense of familiarity and comfort that encourages repeat visits.</p>

<br><br>

<p>Relaxy Inn is deeply committed to engaging with the local community and fostering a strong sense of belonging. We actively participate in local initiatives and support local artisans and businesses. We partner with local tour operators to offer authentic cultural experiences, showcasing the rich heritage of Assam to our guests. We also prioritize sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental footprint through initiatives such as energy conservation, waste reduction, and responsible sourcing. By prioritizing environmental sustainability and community engagement, we aim to contribute to the long-term well-being of Guwahati and its residents.</p>

<br><br>

<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Relaxy Inn envisions significant growth and expansion within the region. Our long-term goals include enhancing our existing facilities with updated amenities, expanding our suite options, and incorporating spa and wellness facilities to cater to the growing demand for holistic travel experiences. We are also exploring opportunities to establish partnerships with local businesses and tourism organizations to further promote Guwahati as a premier destination. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, including mobile check-in/check-out, personalized room preferences, and interactive information portals. Ultimately, Hotel Relaxy Inn aspires to become the leading choice for discerning travelers seeking a blend of comfort, convenience, and authentic Assamese hospitality in Guwahati. We are dedicated to continuously innovating and adapting to meet the evolving needs of our guests and the dynamic landscape of the tourism industry, ensuring that Relaxy Inn remains synonymous with quality and unforgettable experiences for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:45:21.000Z'),
(1153, 'Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati Formerly Alpine inn', 'Hotels', NULL, 'Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati, formerly Alpine Inn, stands as a well-established hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, providing comfortable accommodations and reliable service to both leisure and business travelers. Located in the vibrant Khanapara area, a key hub connecting Guwahati to Upper Assam and neighboring states, the establishment has built a strong reputation for its convenient location, accessibility, and commitment to guest satisfaction. This strategic positioning allows Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati to cater to a diverse clientele, ranging from tourists exploring the region''s natural beauty to professionals attending conferences and meetings in the city. The transition to the Townhouse brand reflects a commitment to enhancing the guest experience and modernizing the facilities, while retaining the familiar charm and hospitality that have long been associated with the property.

<br> <br>

At its core, Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati offers a range of accommodation options designed to meet the varying needs and budgets of its guests. These include well-appointed rooms featuring essential amenities such as comfortable bedding, climate control, complimentary Wi-Fi access, and private bathrooms. Recognizing the growing demand for seamless connectivity, the hotel emphasizes reliable and high-speed internet access throughout the property. Beyond accommodations, the hotel provides essential services such as laundry, travel assistance, and a 24-hour front desk to ensure a comfortable and hassle-free stay. The on-site dining facility serves a selection of regional and continental dishes, providing guests with convenient meal options without having to venture far from the hotel. A key differentiator for Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati is its focus on providing value for money. The hotel aims to offer quality accommodations and services at competitive rates, making it an attractive option for budget-conscious travelers who do not want to compromise on comfort or convenience. This commitment to affordability, coupled with its prime location, makes it a popular choice among local business travelers seeking accessible and reliable accommodations.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati. The hotel strives to create a welcoming and personalized atmosphere for each guest. The staff is trained to be attentive to individual needs and preferences, providing prompt and courteous service. Emphasis is placed on anticipating guest requirements and proactively addressing any concerns that may arise. The hotel actively solicits feedback from guests to identify areas for improvement and continuously enhance the overall experience. Furthermore, Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati aims to connect with the local community by supporting local businesses and initiatives. This includes sourcing locally produced goods and services whenever possible and participating in community events. The hotel also actively promotes Assam''s rich cultural heritage and natural attractions to its guests, encouraging them to explore the region and contribute to its tourism economy. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of goodwill and strengthens the hotel''s reputation as a responsible corporate citizen. The hotel’s existing loyal customer base, built during its time as Alpine Inn, is a testament to its dedication to providing consistent and quality service.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati envisions significant growth potential. The hotel plans to leverage its strong foundation and prime location to further expand its market share. This includes exploring opportunities to renovate and upgrade its facilities to meet evolving customer expectations. Plans are also in place to enhance its service offerings, such as introducing new dining options, expanding its meeting and event spaces, and developing customized packages tailored to specific market segments. The hotel also intends to invest in digital marketing initiatives to increase its online visibility and attract a wider audience. These initiatives include strengthening its presence on social media platforms and improving its search engine optimization (SEO) to enhance its rankings in online search results. The long-term goal is to establish Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati as the premier budget-friendly accommodation option in Guwahati, known for its exceptional service, convenient location, and commitment to customer satisfaction. Furthermore, the hotel aims to become a significant contributor to the local economy and a recognized leader in promoting responsible tourism practices in the region. By continually adapting to market trends, investing in its infrastructure, and prioritizing customer experience, Townhouse Khanapara Guwahati is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a prominent player in the Guwahati hospitality market.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:45:26.000Z'),
(1154, 'The Corner Inn', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>The Corner Inn, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a place to rest your head; it''s an immersive experience that blends modern comfort with the rich cultural heritage of the Northeast. Offering a unique blend of hospitality and local charm, The Corner Inn aims to be the preferred choice for travelers seeking an authentic Assamese experience, distinguishing itself from the conventional hotel chains dominating the city. In a region increasingly focused on tourism, The Corner Inn fulfills a crucial need for personalized and culturally sensitive accommodation options.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, The Corner Inn provides comfortable and well-appointed rooms catering to a range of travelers, from solo adventurers to families. Beyond the standard amenities, each room is thoughtfully designed to reflect the artistic traditions of Assam, featuring locally sourced textiles, handicrafts, and artwork. These unique details offer guests a tangible connection to the region''s culture. The Inn also features an in-house restaurant, "Bhogali''s Kitchen," serving authentic Assamese cuisine prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. This dedicated culinary space allows guests to savour the distinctive flavours of Assam without venturing far. Furthermore, The Corner Inn offers curated experiences, including guided tours of Guwahati''s historical sites, tea garden visits, and cultural performances, providing a holistic immersion into the local culture. These unique selling points differentiate The Corner Inn from its competitors, focusing on cultural immersion and authentic experiences rather than purely transactional accommodation.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The Corner Inn is committed to providing exceptional customer service, recognizing that genuine hospitality is paramount. Every interaction is tailored to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, ensuring each guest feels valued and appreciated. The staff, primarily drawn from the local community, are passionate about showcasing the best of Assam and are trained to provide personalized recommendations for exploring the city and surrounding region. The Inn fosters a sense of community by actively participating in local events and initiatives, building strong relationships with artisans, suppliers, and cultural organizations. This commitment to community engagement extends to offering employment opportunities and supporting local businesses, creating a positive economic impact in the region. The emphasis on personalized service, cultural immersion, and community involvement creates a unique and memorable experience for guests, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, The Corner Inn envisions becoming a leading promoter of sustainable tourism in Assam, expanding its offerings while maintaining its core values of cultural preservation and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the number of rooms while ensuring the personalized experience is not diluted, developing partnerships with local artisans to offer workshops and demonstrations to guests, and creating eco-tourism initiatives that showcase the natural beauty of the region. The Inn also plans to integrate technology to enhance the guest experience, such as online booking platforms, virtual tours of the property, and personalized recommendations based on guest preferences. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of travelers, The Corner Inn aims to establish itself as a landmark destination in Guwahati, attracting visitors from around the world who seek an authentic and enriching cultural experience. The long-term goal is to become synonymous with responsible and culturally sensitive tourism in Assam, contributing to the sustainable development of the region while preserving its unique heritage for future generations.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The Corner Inn strives to further enhance its offerings by introducing curated thematic stays, focusing on specific aspects of Assamese culture, such as silk weaving, bamboo craft, or traditional music. This involves collaboration with local experts to offer immersive workshops and demonstrations to guests, providing them with hands-on experience and a deeper understanding of the region''s artistic traditions. Furthermore, the Inn plans to strengthen its relationship with local farmers and producers to ensure that "Bhogali''s Kitchen" continues to serve the freshest and most authentic Assamese cuisine. This commitment to local sourcing not only supports the local economy but also provides guests with a unique culinary experience that showcases the region''s diverse flavours. As The Corner Inn expands its reach, it remains committed to its core values of sustainability, cultural preservation, and community engagement, ensuring that its growth benefits both its guests and the local community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Finally, The Corner Inn recognizes the importance of digital marketing in reaching a wider audience. Future strategies include enhancing its online presence through targeted social media campaigns, search engine optimization, and collaborations with travel bloggers and influencers. The Inn also plans to develop a loyalty program to reward repeat customers and encourage them to share their positive experiences with others. By leveraging the power of digital marketing, The Corner Inn aims to attract more visitors to Guwahati and showcase the region''s unique cultural heritage to the world. The long-term vision is to establish The Corner Inn as a leading example of responsible and sustainable tourism in Northeast India, inspiring other businesses to adopt similar practices and contributing to the overall development of the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:45:33.000Z'),
(1155, 'Pragati Manor', 'Hotels', NULL, 'Pragati Manor: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Connection in Guwahati

Pragati Manor stands as a distinguished name in Guwahati''s hospitality sector, offering a blend of comfortable accommodations, personalized service, and a deep connection to the local Assamese culture. Situated in the heart of the city, Pragati Manor provides a serene escape for business travelers, tourists exploring the region, and local residents seeking a refined experience. More than just a hotel, it aims to be a welcoming space where guests can feel at home while discovering the rich heritage and vibrant spirit of Assam. Pragati Manor understands that true hospitality goes beyond providing just a room; it''s about creating lasting memories and building genuine relationships.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing well-appointed and thoughtfully designed accommodations. Rooms range from comfortable standard options to more spacious suites, catering to diverse needs and budgets. Each room is meticulously maintained and equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and private bathrooms, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodations, Pragati Manor offers a range of services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and international favorites, a well-equipped business center for corporate travelers, and laundry services for added convenience. A dedicated travel desk assists guests in planning excursions to explore the surrounding attractions, from the sacred Kamakhya Temple to the serene beauty of the Brahmaputra River. What sets Pragati Manor apart is its commitment to showcasing Assamese culture. The hotel frequently hosts cultural events and performances, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the local traditions, music, and art. Furthermore, the restaurant emphasizes authentic Assamese cuisine, using locally sourced ingredients to provide a genuine taste of the region. This unique blend of comfort and cultural immersion distinguishes Pragati Manor from standard hotel offerings in Guwahati. We aim to provide not just a place to stay, but an experience to remember, deeply rooted in the spirit of Assam.

<br> <br>

Customer experience lies at the heart of Pragati Manor''s philosophy. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and cared for. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with genuine smiles and a commitment to making their stay as seamless and enjoyable as possible. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Beyond individual interactions, Pragati Manor is committed to connecting with the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services within the hotel. We also participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. This connection to the local culture and community further enhances the guest experience, allowing them to feel a sense of belonging and connection to the region. We strive to build lasting relationships with our guests and the community, fostering a sense of loyalty and trust.

<br> <br>

Looking to the future, Pragati Manor envisions expanding its presence and solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to introduce new services and amenities to cater to the evolving needs of our guests, including a wellness center and upgraded conference facilities. We also intend to further enhance our commitment to sustainability by implementing eco-friendly practices throughout the hotel. A key focus will be on expanding our outreach to attract both domestic and international tourists, showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam. We aim to develop strategic partnerships with travel agencies and tour operators to promote Guwahati as a premier tourist destination. Ultimately, Pragati Manor aspires to be more than just a hotel; it aims to be a cultural ambassador for Assam, contributing to the economic development and promotion of the region. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that benefits both our guests and the local community, ensuring that Pragati Manor remains a symbol of hospitality and connection in Guwahati for generations to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:50:07.000Z'),
(1156, 'Hotel Jaysha', 'Hotels', NULL, 'Hotel Jaysha: A Guwahati Hospitality Landmark

Hotel Jaysha stands as a prominent landmark in Guwahati''s vibrant hospitality sector, offering a blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. Situated in a strategic location within Guwahati, Hotel Jaysha caters to a diverse clientele, including business travelers, tourists exploring the Northeast, and local residents seeking refined dining and event spaces. The hotel distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, authentic culinary experiences, and a deep understanding of the unique needs of the Assam market. Hotel Jaysha aims not just to provide accommodation, but to create memorable experiences that showcase the rich culture and warmth of Assam.

<br> <br>

Core Services and Products: A Holistic Hospitality Experience

At its core, Hotel Jaysha offers a comprehensive range of hospitality services tailored to meet the demands of modern travelers. Our accommodation options include a variety of well-appointed rooms and suites, designed with comfort and functionality in mind. Each room features modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and en-suite bathrooms. Beyond accommodation, Hotel Jaysha boasts a renowned in-house restaurant specializing in authentic Assamese cuisine, as well as offering a curated selection of Indian and international dishes. The restaurant utilizes fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring a genuine culinary experience that reflects the region''s diverse flavors. Furthermore, Hotel Jaysha provides extensive banquet and conference facilities suitable for hosting a range of events, from corporate meetings and seminars to weddings and social gatherings. These facilities are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless execution and a memorable occasion. What truly sets Hotel Jaysha apart is its commitment to showcasing the best of Assam. We offer curated experiences such as guided tours of local tea gardens, cultural performances, and opportunities to engage with local artisans, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the region''s rich heritage. This focus on cultural immersion differentiates Hotel Jaysha from more generic hotel offerings, appealing to travelers seeking authentic experiences.

<br> <br>

Exceptional Customer Experience: The Heart of Hotel Jaysha

Customer satisfaction is at the heart of Hotel Jaysha’s philosophy. We strive to provide a personalized and attentive service that anticipates the needs of each guest. From the moment of arrival, guests are greeted with warmth and efficiency, ensuring a seamless check-in process. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the local area and provide helpful recommendations for sightseeing, dining, and cultural activities. We understand that every guest is unique, and we tailor our service to meet individual preferences. This includes offering personalized concierge services, customized dining options, and proactive attention to any special requests or requirements. Hotel Jaysha actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as sponsoring local events, supporting local artisans, and partnering with local businesses. This demonstrates our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen and contributes to the overall vibrancy of Guwahati. Furthermore, we prioritize gathering feedback from our guests through surveys, online reviews, and direct communication. This feedback is used to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding expectations. Our commitment to exceptional customer service is reflected in our consistently high ratings and positive reviews, solidifying Hotel Jaysha''s reputation as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

Future Vision: Expansion and Continued Excellence

Hotel Jaysha envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation capacity to meet the growing demand for quality hotel rooms in the region. We are also exploring opportunities to introduce new and innovative services, such as a wellness center and spa, to cater to the evolving needs of our guests. In addition to physical expansion, Hotel Jaysha is committed to investing in technology and infrastructure to enhance the guest experience. This includes implementing advanced reservation systems, improving internet connectivity, and adopting sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact. We are also focused on developing our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring that they are equipped with the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service. Hotel Jaysha recognizes the importance of adapting to changing market trends and evolving customer preferences. We are continuously monitoring the competitive landscape and identifying opportunities to differentiate ourselves through unique offerings and innovative services. By remaining committed to our core values of personalized service, authentic experiences, and community engagement, Hotel Jaysha is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and continue to contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati''s hospitality sector.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:50:14.000Z'),
(1157, 'GHAR 365 Residency', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>GHAR 365 Residency: Redefining Modern Living in Guwahati</p>

<p>GHAR 365 Residency stands as a modern residential solution in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, catering to the growing demand for comfortable, convenient, and community-focused living. In a region experiencing rapid urbanization and a surge in professionals, students, and young families, GHAR 365 Residency offers a compelling alternative to traditional housing models. We distinguish ourselves by providing fully furnished, well-maintained living spaces with a strong emphasis on shared amenities and a vibrant community atmosphere. Our presence in Guwahati is significant as we aim to alleviate the housing challenges faced by transient populations and individuals seeking hassle-free living options, contributing to the city''s evolving urban landscape. We are not merely providing rooms; we are building a lifestyle.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing fully furnished and serviced apartments/rooms designed for both short-term and long-term stays. These units are meticulously designed with modern aesthetics and functional layouts, ensuring a comfortable and productive living environment. We take care of furnishing details, from comfortable beds and seating to essential appliances, eliminating the burden of setting up a new home. Beyond the individual living spaces, GHAR 365 Residency distinguishes itself through its array of shared amenities. These may include co-working spaces conducive to productivity, communal kitchens fostering social interaction, well-equipped fitness centers promoting healthy lifestyles, and recreational areas designed for relaxation and entertainment. Our unique selling point lies in offering a comprehensive living solution where residents can immediately settle in and focus on their personal and professional pursuits without the worries of traditional home management. The need for such services in Guwahati is evident in the increasing number of professionals relocating for work, students pursuing higher education, and individuals seeking a convenient and comfortable living arrangement without the commitment of long-term leases or the hassle of furnishing an apartment from scratch. We address these needs by providing a move-in-ready solution that integrates comfort, convenience, and community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At GHAR 365 Residency, we prioritize creating an exceptional customer experience built on attentiveness, responsiveness, and a genuine commitment to resident satisfaction. Our dedicated management team is available to address inquiries, resolve issues, and ensure the smooth operation of the residency. We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our residents and fostering a sense of community within the residency. Regular social events, community gatherings, and opportunities for interaction are organized to encourage residents to connect with one another, share experiences, and build lasting friendships. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where residents feel at home and supported. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events. This involvement not only benefits our residents by providing access to local resources and opportunities but also contributes to the overall vibrancy and well-being of the Guwahati community. We are committed to being a responsible and engaged member of the local ecosystem.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, GHAR 365 Residency envisions significant growth and expansion within Guwahati and potentially beyond, aiming to become a recognized leader in providing modern residential solutions in Assam and the Northeast. Our future plans include expanding our portfolio of properties to cater to a wider range of needs and preferences, potentially including larger apartments or specialized living spaces for specific demographics. We also aim to enhance our service offerings by incorporating additional amenities and services that cater to the evolving needs of our residents. This could involve incorporating smart home technology, expanding our co-working facilities, or offering specialized wellness programs. Our long-term goals include establishing GHAR 365 Residency as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, convenience, and community. We aim to set a new standard for modern living in the region, contributing to the growth and development of Guwahati and providing a valuable service to its residents. We are continuously exploring opportunities to innovate and improve our offerings to ensure that GHAR 365 Residency remains at the forefront of the residential solutions market.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:50:19.000Z'),
(1158, 'Townhouse Medicity Formerly Hotel Grand Majesty', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Townhouse Medicity, formerly known as Hotel Grand Majesty, stands as a revitalized and reimagined hospitality landmark in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. While retaining the elegance and prime location that defined its predecessor, Townhouse Medicity has strategically pivoted to cater to the evolving needs of a modern clientele, particularly those seeking convenient access to medical facilities and a comfortable, supportive environment during healthcare-related stays. Positioned strategically, it occupies a significant niche within Guwahati’s growing healthcare tourism sector and serves as a welcoming haven for both medical travelers and discerning leisure guests alike. This evolution underscores our commitment to adapting to market demands and providing exceptional value to our patrons.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Townhouse Medicity offers a curated blend of accommodation and support services designed to enhance the guest experience. Our well-appointed rooms and suites provide a comfortable and restful environment, equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and dedicated workspaces. Beyond accommodation, we offer a suite of supplementary services specifically tailored to the needs of medical tourists and their families. These include pre- and post-operative care assistance, dietary meal plans catering to specific medical requirements, transportation arrangements to and from local hospitals and clinics, and dedicated concierge services to navigate the local medical landscape. For leisure guests, we provide a relaxing atmosphere, exceptional dining options showcasing regional Assamese cuisine, and assistance with arranging local sightseeing tours and cultural experiences. The unique selling point lies in our seamless integration of hospitality and healthcare support, creating a worry-free environment for our guests. This focus directly addresses the growing demand for comfortable and convenient accommodations near Guwahati''s burgeoning medical centers, filling a crucial gap in the market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer service is paramount at Townhouse Medicity. We pride ourselves on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where every guest feels valued and supported. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide personalized attention, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. Understanding the unique stresses and anxieties often associated with medical travel, we prioritize empathy, patience, and clear communication. We strive to build genuine connections with our guests, fostering a sense of trust and security. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local Guwahati community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We support local artisans and craftspeople, showcasing their work within our establishment and promoting Assamese culture to our guests. This commitment to local integration reinforces our position as not just a business, but a valued member of the community, contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Townhouse Medicity envisions significant growth and expansion within the hospitality and healthcare support sectors. Our long-term goals include enhancing our medical support services to offer a more comprehensive range of assistance, potentially incorporating telehealth consultations and on-site nursing care. We plan to further develop our partnerships with local hospitals and clinics, solidifying our position as the preferred accommodation provider for medical tourists. Additionally, we aim to expand our reach through targeted marketing campaigns, both domestically and internationally, highlighting the unique advantages of choosing Townhouse Medicity. We also plan to invest in upgrading our facilities, incorporating sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a greener Guwahati. The vision is to establish Townhouse Medicity as a leading example of integrated hospitality, setting a new standard for customer care and community engagement within the region. This growth will be carefully managed to ensure that the core values of comfort, convenience, and compassionate service remain at the heart of our operation.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:50:25.000Z'),
(1159, 'Blue Moon Guest House', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Blue Moon Guest House offers a tranquil and welcoming retreat in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. Situated strategically, we provide comfortable and convenient accommodation for both leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic experience within the heart of Northeast India. In a region rapidly developing its tourism infrastructure, Blue Moon Guest House distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, local cultural immersion, and a serene atmosphere, making it a significant contributor to Guwahati’s growing hospitality sector. We strive to be more than just a place to stay; we aim to be a gateway for our guests to discover the rich heritage and natural beauty of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering is comfortable and well-appointed guest rooms, catering to a range of needs and budgets. We provide single rooms, double rooms, and family suites, all designed with a focus on cleanliness, comfort, and functionality. Each room is equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, private bathrooms with hot and cold water, complimentary Wi-Fi access, and comfortable bedding. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of supplementary services designed to enhance our guests’ experience. These include a delicious breakfast service featuring both continental and traditional Assamese cuisine, a laundry service, and airport pick-up and drop-off services. A key differentiator is our personalized tour arrangement service. Understanding that many of our guests are eager to explore the surrounding region, we partner with local guides and tour operators to offer curated excursions to nearby attractions such as the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Kaziranga National Park. This concierge-style service, focused on showcasing the local culture and natural wonders, significantly sets us apart from larger, more impersonal hotels.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Blue Moon Guest House, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in genuine hospitality and a commitment to anticipating our guests’ needs. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with a warm welcome and personalized attention. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the local area and readily available to provide recommendations for restaurants, shops, and activities. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continually improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their expectations. What truly makes us stand out is our connection to the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products within our guest house and recommending their services to our guests. We also participate in local community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. This commitment fosters a sense of authenticity and allows our guests to experience the true spirit of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Blue Moon Guest House envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our capacity by adding more rooms and facilities to accommodate the increasing demand for quality accommodation in Guwahati. We plan to enhance our services by incorporating more sustainable practices, such as implementing energy-efficient technologies and reducing our environmental footprint. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local organizations to promote eco-tourism and responsible travel within the region. Another key aspect of our future vision is to develop a stronger online presence and expand our marketing efforts to reach a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. We aim to become a recognized and trusted brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional customer service in the Northeast Indian hospitality sector. Ultimately, we aspire to be a leading guesthouse in Guwahati, contributing to the growth of the local economy and promoting the rich cultural heritage of Assam to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:50:29.000Z'),
(1160, 'HOTEL SILVER STAY', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>HOTEL SILVER STAY: Your Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, HOTEL SILVER STAY offers a refreshing blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, we strive to provide an immersive experience that connects our guests to the vibrant culture and stunning natural beauty of the region. We aim to be a preferred choice for both business and leisure travelers seeking quality accommodation and personalized service, contributing positively to the tourism and hospitality sector of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At HOTEL SILVER STAY, we understand that every traveler has unique needs. Our core services are designed to cater to a diverse range of preferences and requirements. We offer a variety of well-appointed rooms and suites, ranging from comfortable standard rooms ideal for budget-conscious travelers to luxurious suites perfect for families or those seeking a more indulgent stay. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, air conditioning, and comfortable bedding to ensure a restful and productive stay. </p>
<br> <br>
<p>Beyond accommodation, we provide a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the overall guest experience. Our on-site restaurant serves a delectable array of local Assamese cuisine, alongside popular Indian and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We also offer a well-stocked bar, providing a relaxed setting for guests to unwind after a long day of work or exploration. For business travelers, we provide well-equipped meeting and conference facilities, complete with audio-visual equipment and support services, making HOTEL SILVER STAY an ideal venue for corporate events and gatherings.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What sets HOTEL SILVER STAY apart is our unwavering commitment to personalized service and a genuine connection with the local community. Our dedicated staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and provide attentive, friendly service, ensuring that every stay is memorable. We believe in fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. We strive to provide information and recommendations about local attractions, cultural events, and hidden gems, helping our guests to experience the authentic Assam beyond the typical tourist trail.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, supporting local artisans, sourcing products from local suppliers, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe in contributing to the economic and social well-being of the region, ensuring that our business benefits the community as a whole. We participate in local festivals and events, offering our guests opportunities to experience the rich cultural heritage of Assam firsthand.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of our business philosophy. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continually improve our services and facilities. We believe in building long-term relationships with our guests, fostering loyalty through exceptional service and personalized attention. Our online presence is actively managed, allowing us to respond promptly to inquiries and address any concerns that may arise. </p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, HOTEL SILVER STAY envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our services to include a wider range of amenities, such as a fitness center, a spa, and a swimming pool, further enhancing the guest experience. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism initiatives, showcasing the natural beauty of Assam while promoting sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to establish HOTEL SILVER STAY as a brand synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We are committed to investing in our staff, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to enhance their skills and knowledge. We believe that a motivated and well-trained team is essential to delivering exceptional customer service. We also plan to leverage technology to streamline our operations and enhance the guest experience, implementing online booking systems, mobile check-in options, and other innovative solutions. We aim to stay ahead of the curve, adapting to the evolving needs of our customers and the changing landscape of the hospitality industry. We are confident that HOTEL SILVER STAY will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati and Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.306Z', '2025-12-07T00:55:07.000Z'),
(1161, 'ALOHI INN', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>ALOHI INN: A Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, ALOHI INN stands as a beacon of warm hospitality, offering a unique blend of modern comfort and Assamese cultural immersion. More than just a place to stay, ALOHI INN is a destination designed to provide travelers with an authentic and enriching experience of Northeast India. In a region known for its breathtaking landscapes and vibrant traditions, ALOHI INN distinguishes itself by meticulously curating experiences that resonate with both leisure and business travelers, offering a seamless integration of comfort, convenience, and cultural exploration.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>ALOHI INN''s significance in the Guwahati business landscape extends beyond accommodation. We aim to be a catalyst for local tourism, promoting the region''s rich heritage and supporting local artisans and businesses. By providing a platform for cultural exchange and offering a superior guest experience, we contribute to the overall growth and prosperity of Guwahati and Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our Core Offerings: Comfort, Convenience, and Cultural Immersion</p>
<br> <br>
<p>ALOHI INN offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests. Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodation. We offer a variety of room types, from standard rooms ideal for budget-conscious travelers to deluxe suites offering enhanced space and amenities for those seeking a more luxurious experience. Each room is designed with modern aesthetics and equipped with essential amenities like high-speed internet access, climate control, and comfortable bedding to ensure a relaxing stay.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Beyond accommodation, we provide a range of supplementary services to enhance the guest experience. Our in-house restaurant serves a delightful array of culinary options, from authentic Assamese delicacies to popular Indian and international dishes. We prioritize using locally sourced ingredients to support regional farmers and offer our guests a taste of Assam''s rich culinary heritage. We also offer a range of other services including laundry, travel assistance, and airport transfers, ensuring a hassle-free experience for our guests.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>One of ALOHI INN''s unique selling points is our commitment to providing authentic cultural experiences. We organize guided tours to local attractions, including the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum. We also host cultural events and performances, showcasing traditional Assamese music, dance, and art forms. Furthermore, we partner with local artisans to offer guests the opportunity to purchase handcrafted souvenirs and support the region''s artistic traditions. These cultural immersion initiatives are designed to provide guests with a deeper understanding and appreciation of Assam''s rich heritage.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our services directly address the needs of the Guwahati market by providing a high-quality accommodation option that caters to both domestic and international travelers. The increasing demand for tourism in Northeast India, coupled with the growing business activity in Guwahati, necessitates the availability of reliable and comfortable lodging. ALOHI INN fills this gap by offering a superior guest experience at a competitive price, making it an attractive option for both leisure and business travelers. Our cultural immersion programs further enhance our appeal, attracting travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Exceptional Customer Experience: Connecting with the Community</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At ALOHI INN, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount to our success. We are committed to providing each guest with a personalized and memorable experience. Our staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and proactive in addressing guest needs. We strive to anticipate guest requests and exceed their expectations, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our guests, making them feel valued and appreciated.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What sets us apart is our dedication to creating a culturally immersive and authentic experience. We go beyond simply providing accommodation and strive to connect our guests with the local community. We partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism and support the region''s economic development. We actively engage with the community through various initiatives, such as sponsoring local events and participating in charitable activities. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we create a positive impact and contribute to the overall well-being of Guwahati.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We actively solicit guest feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We encourage guests to share their experiences through online reviews and in-person surveys. We carefully analyze this feedback and use it to identify areas for improvement and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our guests.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Vision for the Future: Growth, Innovation, and Sustainability</p>
<br> <br>
<p>ALOHI INN envisions a future where it stands as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a recognized champion of sustainable tourism in Northeast India. Our long-term goal is to expand our operations and establish ALOHI INN as a benchmark for quality and service in the region. We plan to explore opportunities for expansion, including adding more rooms and facilities, and potentially opening new locations in other parts of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We are committed to innovation and continuously seeking ways to enhance our guest experience. We plan to invest in new technologies and amenities to provide our guests with the latest in comfort and convenience. We are also exploring new ways to incorporate Assamese culture into our offerings, such as offering cooking classes and cultural workshops. Sustainability is a core value at ALOHI INN. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism practices. We are exploring ways to reduce our energy consumption, conserve water, and minimize waste. We also plan to support local environmental initiatives and promote eco-friendly tourism options.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>By focusing on growth, innovation, and sustainability, ALOHI INN aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and contribute to the long-term prosperity of the region. We are confident that our commitment to exceptional customer service, cultural immersion, and sustainable practices will enable us to achieve our vision and continue to delight our guests for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T00:55:16.000Z'),
(1162, 'Erica Residency', 'Hotels', NULL, 'Erica Residency: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Hospitality in Guwahati

Erica Residency stands as a beacon of refined hospitality in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil haven for both business and leisure travelers. Situated in a prime location within the city, Erica Residency distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, modern amenities, and a genuine connection to the rich cultural heritage of Assam. In a region experiencing burgeoning tourism and increased business activity, Erica Residency addresses a critical need for high-quality accommodation that combines comfort, convenience, and authentic local experiences. It''s more than just a place to stay; it''s a gateway to exploring the beauty and vibrancy of Assam.

<br> <br>

At the core of Erica Residency''s offerings are elegantly appointed rooms and suites, each designed to provide guests with a restful and rejuvenating experience. These accommodations are equipped with contemporary amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and climate control systems, ensuring a comfortable and productive stay. Beyond the rooms themselves, Erica Residency boasts a range of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. These include:

* **Restaurant & Cafe:** Offering a diverse menu of local Assamese delicacies alongside popular international dishes, catering to a range of palates. The emphasis is on fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers.
* **Conference & Event Facilities:** Providing flexible spaces suitable for business meetings, conferences, and social gatherings. Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team, Erica Residency is an ideal venue for professional events in Guwahati.
* **Travel Assistance:** A dedicated concierge service is available to assist guests with travel arrangements, sightseeing tours, and local recommendations, ensuring they can seamlessly explore the region''s attractions and cultural landmarks.
* **Laundry & Valet Services:** Offering convenience and efficiency for guests during their stay.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Erica Residency apart is its unwavering dedication to providing an exceptional customer experience. The staff is meticulously trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere from arrival to departure. The goal is not simply to provide accommodation, but to create memorable moments and foster lasting relationships.

Erica Residency actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. The restaurant sources ingredients from local farmers, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region. Furthermore, the residency partners with local artisans and cultural organizations to showcase the art, crafts, and traditions of Assam, providing guests with a deeper understanding of the region''s unique heritage. By actively engaging with the community, Erica Residency aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a valued member of the Guwahati community. Customer feedback is actively solicited and analyzed to continuously improve services and exceed guest expectations.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Erica Residency envisions becoming the premier destination for discerning travelers in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, such as incorporating a wellness center and spa, to provide guests with a more holistic experience. There are also plans to enhance the cultural immersion aspect of the residency by hosting regular cultural events and workshops, showcasing the diverse traditions of Assam.

Long-term goals include exploring opportunities for expansion within the region, potentially establishing additional residency locations in other key cities of Assam. Erica Residency is committed to sustainable business practices and seeks to minimize its environmental impact by adopting eco-friendly technologies and promoting responsible tourism. Ultimately, Erica Residency aims to be synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality, contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region while providing guests with an unforgettable experience.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T00:55:22.000Z'),
(1163, 'Hotel Cosy Home', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Hotel Cosy Home: Your Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Hotel Cosy Home offers a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, we provide a welcoming haven for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience. Our commitment to personalized service, coupled with our strategic location and thoughtfully designed accommodations, positions Hotel Cosy Home as a significant player in the Guwahati hospitality sector, catering to both leisure and business travelers who value comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Core Services and Products: A Home Away From Home</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Hotel Cosy Home, we pride ourselves on offering a comprehensive range of services designed to meet the diverse needs of our guests. Our core offering revolves around comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. We provide a variety of room types, from cozy standard rooms perfect for solo travelers to spacious family suites designed to accommodate larger groups. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed Wi-Fi, air conditioning, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and private bathrooms with hot and cold water facilities. We maintain impeccable cleanliness standards throughout the hotel to ensure a pleasant and hygienic stay for all our guests.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Beyond accommodation, Hotel Cosy Home features an in-house restaurant serving a delightful array of cuisines, with a special emphasis on authentic Assamese dishes. This culinary experience allows guests to savor the rich flavors of the region without leaving the comfort of the hotel. We also offer complimentary breakfast to all our guests, providing a convenient and delicious start to their day. For guests seeking relaxation and rejuvenation, we offer massage services.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>One of our key differentiators is our personalized approach to service. We go the extra mile to cater to the specific needs and preferences of each guest. Whether it''s arranging airport transfers, providing information about local attractions, or assisting with travel arrangements, our dedicated team is always on hand to ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. Furthermore, we understand the importance of connectivity for today''s travelers, which is why we offer complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi access throughout the hotel premises. Our strategic location in Guwahati places us in close proximity to key attractions, business centers, and transportation hubs, making us an ideal choice for both leisure and business travelers.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, Fostering Loyalty</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Hotel Cosy Home, customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests by providing exceptional service and creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to be courteous, attentive, and knowledgeable about the local area. We encourage open communication with our guests, actively soliciting feedback to continuously improve our services and offerings. We understand the importance of creating a sense of community, which is why we regularly organize cultural events and activities that showcase the rich heritage of Assam. These events provide guests with an opportunity to interact with locals, learn about the local culture, and create memorable experiences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond cultural events. We actively support local businesses and initiatives, sourcing our ingredients and products from local suppliers whenever possible. We also participate in community outreach programs, contributing to the well-being of the local community. We believe that by fostering strong relationships with our guests and the local community, we can create a positive and sustainable business model.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Sustainability</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Cosy Home is committed to continued growth and innovation. We envision expanding our operations to include additional rooms and facilities, further enhancing the guest experience. We plan to introduce new services, such as a travel desk to assist guests with planning their itineraries and exploring the region. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local tour operators to offer curated experiences that showcase the best of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable business practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural beauty. We are exploring ways to reduce our energy consumption, conserve water, and minimize waste. We also plan to implement initiatives to support local artisans and promote responsible tourism. Hotel Cosy Home''s long-term goal is to become a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, commitment to sustainability, and dedication to the local community. We aim to be the preferred choice for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience in Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T00:55:28.000Z'),
(1164, 'Hotel Spectrum Residency', 'Hotels', NULL, 'Hotel Spectrum Residency, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of hospitality, offering a distinctive blend of comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Spectrum Residency aims to be a gateway to experiencing the rich tapestry of Assamese culture and the vibrant spirit of the Northeast. In a region known for its tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and spiritual significance, Hotel Spectrum Residency distinguishes itself by providing a personalized and memorable experience tailored to the needs of both leisure and business travelers. Its strategic location provides easy access to key landmarks, commercial hubs, and transportation arteries, making it an ideal base for exploring Guwahati and its surrounding areas.

<br> <br>

Hotel Spectrum Residency''s core offering revolves around providing exceptional accommodation and comprehensive hospitality services. This includes well-appointed rooms, each designed to offer a sanctuary of tranquility amidst the bustling city. Room categories cater to a diverse range of preferences, from comfortable standard rooms ideal for short stays to spacious suites suitable for extended visits. A key differentiator lies in the hotel''s commitment to incorporating local artistry and craftsmanship into the room décor, creating an authentic sense of place. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a range of amenities designed to enhance the guest experience, including an on-site restaurant serving both regional and international cuisine, a well-equipped fitness center for maintaining wellness routines, and conference facilities designed to accommodate business meetings and small-scale events. What truly sets Hotel Spectrum Residency apart is its dedication to providing personalized service. The staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and to go the extra mile in ensuring a comfortable and hassle-free stay. Understanding the growing demand for authentic experiences, the hotel also curates local tours and activities, allowing guests to delve deeper into Assam''s cultural heritage and natural beauty.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Hotel Spectrum Residency. The hotel strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. This begins with attentive and efficient service from the moment of arrival and extends throughout the entire stay. The staff are not just employees, but rather ambassadors of Assamese hospitality, eager to share their knowledge of the region and provide recommendations tailored to individual interests. The hotel actively solicits feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and ensure that it meets the evolving needs of its clientele. Hotel Spectrum Residency also recognizes the importance of connecting with the local community. It actively supports local artisans and businesses by sourcing products and services locally, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. Furthermore, the hotel participates in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the hotel''s reputation but also fosters a deeper connection with its guests, many of whom are keen to support businesses that are socially responsible.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Hotel Spectrum Residency envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a recognized name throughout the Northeast. The hotel plans to expand its services and amenities to cater to a wider range of travelers. This includes exploring opportunities to develop specialized tourism packages focused on niche interests such as tea tourism, wildlife expeditions, and cultural immersion programs. Further, there are plans to expand the existing conference facilities to accommodate larger events and cater to the growing demand for business travel in the region. A key element of the future vision is a continued commitment to sustainability. Hotel Spectrum Residency aims to implement eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural beauty. This includes initiatives such as reducing water consumption, promoting energy efficiency, and supporting local conservation efforts. By embracing innovation, sustainability, and a continued focus on customer satisfaction, Hotel Spectrum Residency is poised to solidify its position as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati and contribute to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T00:55:34.000Z'),
(1165, 'HOTEL GREENLAND', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>HOTEL GREENLAND: A Tranquil Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, HOTEL GREENLAND offers a compelling blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, HOTEL GREENLAND aims to be a sanctuary for travelers seeking respite, a hub for business professionals, and a welcoming gateway to explore the rich cultural tapestry of Northeast India. The hotel distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable practices, personalized service, and an unwavering dedication to providing guests with an unforgettable experience. In a region known for its stunning natural beauty and warm, welcoming people, HOTEL GREENLAND serves as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati''s evolving hospitality landscape. The hotel strives to be a contributor to the local economy, partnering with local artisans and suppliers to enrich the guest experience and support the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Comprehensive Offering</p>

<p>HOTEL GREENLAND offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. At its heart, the hotel provides impeccably maintained guest rooms and suites, ranging from comfortable standard accommodations to luxurious suites offering panoramic city views. Each room is thoughtfully designed with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and climate control, ensuring a comfortable and productive stay. <br> <br>Beyond accommodation, HOTEL GREENLAND boasts a variety of dining options. Its in-house restaurant showcases a delectable array of Assamese and Indian cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor authentic regional flavors while enjoying a relaxed and inviting ambiance. A well-stocked bar offers a selection of beverages, perfect for unwinding after a long day of sightseeing or business meetings. <br> <br>Recognizing the importance of seamless business travel, HOTEL GREENLAND provides state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities. Equipped with advanced audio-visual technology and supported by a dedicated events team, these spaces are ideal for hosting corporate meetings, seminars, weddings, and other special occasions. <br> <br>What sets HOTEL GREENLAND apart is its commitment to personalized service and attention to detail. The concierge service assists guests with travel arrangements, sightseeing tours, and any other requests, ensuring a hassle-free stay. The hotel also offers laundry and dry-cleaning services, airport transfers, and ample parking facilities, further enhancing guest convenience. The hotel''s unique selling point lies in its ability to seamlessly blend modern amenities with the authentic charm of Assamese culture, providing a truly memorable and enriching experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Unparalleled Customer Experience: Warmth and Connection</p>

<p>At HOTEL GREENLAND, the focus is on creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. The staff is trained to anticipate needs, provide attentive service, and create a sense of genuine connection. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality, reflecting the true spirit of Assam. <br> <br>The hotel strives to create a sense of community by actively engaging with local artisans and cultural organizations. The hotel showcases local art and crafts, providing guests with an opportunity to appreciate the region''s rich cultural heritage. The restaurant sources ingredients from local farmers and suppliers, supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshest possible flavors. <br> <br>HOTEL GREENLAND understands the importance of building relationships with its guests. The hotel actively seeks feedback and continuously strives to improve its services based on guest suggestions. The hotel also uses social media and other communication channels to connect with guests before, during, and after their stay, fostering a sense of loyalty and community. By prioritizing personalized service, supporting local initiatives, and fostering genuine connections, HOTEL GREENLAND creates a truly unique and memorable experience for its guests.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Future Vision: Growth and Sustainability</p>

<p>Looking ahead, HOTEL GREENLAND envisions becoming a leading hospitality destination in Northeast India, known for its commitment to excellence, sustainability, and community engagement. The hotel plans to expand its services and facilities to meet the growing demands of the region''s tourism and business sectors. This includes the potential addition of new guest rooms and suites, a state-of-the-art fitness center, and an expanded dining area. <br> <br>HOTEL GREENLAND is also committed to incorporating sustainable practices into all aspects of its operations. The hotel aims to reduce its environmental footprint through energy-efficient lighting, water conservation measures, and waste reduction programs. The hotel also plans to partner with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism and support environmental conservation efforts. <br> <br>The long-term goal of HOTEL GREENLAND is to become a symbol of hospitality excellence in Guwahati and a contributor to the region''s economic and social development. The hotel aims to create a positive impact on the local community by providing employment opportunities, supporting local businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism. By focusing on growth, sustainability, and community engagement, HOTEL GREENLAND is poised to achieve its vision and solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T01:00:10.000Z'),
(1166, 'HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p><b>HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN: Your Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</b></p>

<p>HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN stands as a welcoming haven for travelers seeking comfort, convenience, and genuine Assamese hospitality in the vibrant city of Guwahati. Strategically located near the downtown area, the inn offers a perfect blend of accessibility to key business hubs and tourist attractions, while providing a tranquil escape from the city''s bustle. In a region rich with cultural heritage and burgeoning economic activity, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN fills a vital niche by catering to both leisure and business travelers seeking a reliable and comfortable stay without compromising on location or quality.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><b>Comprehensive Services and Products Tailored to Your Needs</b></p>

<p>At the core of HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN''s offering are its well-appointed rooms, each designed to provide a relaxing and productive environment for guests. We offer a variety of room types, from standard accommodations perfect for budget-conscious travelers to deluxe suites that offer enhanced space and amenities. All rooms are equipped with essential modern conveniences including high-speed Wi-Fi, air conditioning, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable bedding, ensuring a restful experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Beyond comfortable lodging, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN provides a range of complementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. Our on-site restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese specialties and popular international cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can enjoy a hearty breakfast to start their day, a quick and convenient lunch, or a relaxing dinner after a day of exploration or business meetings. We also offer room service for guests who prefer to dine in the privacy of their own rooms.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Recognizing the needs of business travelers, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN also offers business facilities including meeting rooms equipped with audio-visual equipment. These spaces are ideal for hosting small conferences, workshops, or private meetings. We provide secretarial services and support to ensure that business events run smoothly and efficiently.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>What sets HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN apart is its commitment to providing personalized service and attention to detail. Our staff is trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest, ensuring a memorable and enjoyable stay. We also strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere that reflects the rich cultural heritage of Assam. This commitment to authentic hospitality is a key differentiator in the Guwahati market.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><b>Exceptional Customer Experience: A Reflection of Assamese Hospitality</b></p>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN. We believe in fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and respected. Our staff is carefully selected for their friendly demeanor, professionalism, and dedication to providing exceptional service. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>We understand that every guest has unique needs and preferences. Our staff is trained to be attentive and responsive to individual requests, whether it''s arranging transportation, providing recommendations for local attractions, or catering to dietary requirements. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their expectations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN is committed to connecting with the local community. We actively support local businesses and initiatives, and we strive to incorporate elements of Assamese culture into the guest experience. We partner with local artisans and vendors to showcase their products and crafts, and we offer cultural performances and events that highlight the region''s rich heritage. By engaging with the local community, we create a more authentic and enriching experience for our guests.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><b>Vision for the Future: Expanding Horizons and Enhancing Experiences</b></p>

<p>Looking ahead, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN envisions significant growth and expansion. We plan to enhance our existing facilities with upgrades and renovations, ensuring that our rooms and public spaces remain modern and comfortable. We also aim to expand our range of services and amenities to cater to the evolving needs of our guests. This includes exploring opportunities to add a fitness center, spa services, and other recreational facilities.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Recognizing the growing importance of sustainability, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN is committed to implementing environmentally friendly practices. We plan to invest in energy-efficient technologies, reduce waste, and promote responsible tourism. We believe that by operating in a sustainable manner, we can contribute to the long-term well-being of the community and the environment.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Furthermore, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN is actively exploring opportunities to expand its presence in the region. We are considering opening additional locations in other key cities and tourist destinations in Assam, bringing our brand of authentic hospitality to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to become a leading provider of quality accommodation and exceptional service in the Northeast region of India, recognized for its commitment to customer satisfaction, community engagement, and sustainable practices. We are confident that with our dedicated team, strategic location, and unwavering commitment to excellence, HOTEL TROPICAL INN NEAR DOWNTOWN will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the local business landscape.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T01:00:18.000Z'),
(1167, 'Hotel Aditya Palace', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Hotel Aditya Palace stands as a beacon of refined hospitality in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a seamless blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese warmth. Situated in a prime location within the city, the hotel serves as an ideal base for both business and leisure travelers seeking an authentic experience of Northeast India. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Aditya Palace represents a commitment to exceptional service and a deep understanding of the unique needs of its diverse clientele, making it a significant contributor to the local tourism and business sectors.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The hotel''s unique significance lies in its ability to cater to a wide spectrum of guests. From international tourists eager to explore the rich cultural heritage of Assam to business professionals attending conferences and meetings, Hotel Aditya Palace provides a welcoming and efficient environment. The hotel’s architecture subtly incorporates local design elements, creating an ambiance that is both sophisticated and reflective of the region''s identity. This blend of modern amenities and regional aesthetics distinguishes Hotel Aditya Palace from generic hotel chains, positioning it as a preferred choice for travelers seeking a more immersive experience. Furthermore, its contribution to the local economy through employment opportunities and collaborations with regional businesses solidifies its standing as a vital player in the Assam business landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Hotel Aditya Palace offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet the diverse needs of its guests. At its core, the hotel provides meticulously maintained and elegantly furnished rooms, ranging from comfortable standard accommodations to luxurious suites. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and well-appointed bathrooms, ensuring a comfortable and convenient stay. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a range of facilities designed to enhance the guest experience. This includes a multi-cuisine restaurant serving a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies alongside international favorites, a well-stocked bar offering a curated selection of beverages, and a fully equipped fitness center for guests to maintain their wellness routines.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The hotel''s unique selling points extend beyond its physical amenities. A key differentiator is its commitment to personalized service, with a dedicated team of staff members trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest. The concierge service is particularly noteworthy, providing expert assistance with travel arrangements, local sightseeing tours, and business-related requirements. The multi-cuisine restaurant emphasizes the use of locally sourced ingredients, offering guests an authentic taste of Assam while supporting regional farmers and producers. For the business traveler, Hotel Aditya Palace provides state-of-the-art conference and meeting facilities, equipped with audio-visual equipment and high-speed internet access, making it an ideal venue for corporate events and gatherings.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>These services directly address the needs of the local market in several ways. Guwahati, as a major commercial hub and gateway to Northeast India, experiences a constant influx of business travelers. Hotel Aditya Palace caters to this demand by providing reliable and efficient accommodation, meeting facilities, and business support services. Simultaneously, the hotel recognizes the growing importance of tourism in the region and offers tailored experiences for leisure travelers, including guided tours of nearby attractions, cultural performances, and opportunities to engage with local communities. By seamlessly blending business and leisure offerings, Hotel Aditya Palace effectively meets the diverse needs of the local market and contributes to the growth of both sectors.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer service is paramount at Hotel Aditya Palace, and the hotel prides itself on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every guest. The approach is characterized by a genuine commitment to exceeding expectations and building lasting relationships. Staff members are empowered to go the extra mile to ensure guest satisfaction, whether it''s arranging a special request, providing personalized recommendations, or simply offering a friendly smile and helpful advice. The hotel actively solicits feedback from guests through surveys and online reviews, using this information to continuously improve its services and offerings.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What sets Hotel Aditya Palace apart is its deep connection to the local community. The hotel actively supports local artisans and businesses by featuring their products in its gift shop and utilizing their services whenever possible. The hotel also participates in community initiatives, such as supporting local schools and charities, demonstrating a commitment to social responsibility. Furthermore, Hotel Aditya Palace strives to showcase the rich cultural heritage of Assam through its décor, cuisine, and entertainment offerings, providing guests with an authentic and immersive experience of the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, Hotel Aditya Palace envisions significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity with the addition of new rooms and suites, as well as enhancing its facilities with the construction of a rooftop swimming pool and spa. The hotel also intends to further develop its business services, offering specialized packages for corporate clients and expanding its conference and meeting facilities to accommodate larger events. A key focus will be on sustainable tourism practices, minimizing the hotel''s environmental impact and supporting local communities. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand into other key locations within Northeast India, bringing the Hotel Aditya Palace brand of hospitality to a wider audience. The vision is to become synonymous with quality, service, and authenticity, contributing to the growth of tourism and business in the region while preserving its unique cultural heritage.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T01:00:26.000Z'),
(1168, 'Solace Stay', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>Solace Stay: Your Tranquil Gateway to Assam</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Solace Stay offers a unique blend of modern comfort and authentic Assamese hospitality. More than just accommodation, we provide a curated experience designed to immerse guests in the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam. In a region rapidly growing as a tourism hub, Solace Stay stands out by offering personalized service and a commitment to showcasing the best of Assam, making it a preferred choice for both leisure and business travelers seeking a genuine connection to the local environment. Our commitment to sustainable practices and community engagement further distinguishes us in the Guwahati business landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Core Services and Products</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Solace Stay, we offer a range of accommodation options designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. Our offerings include thoughtfully designed rooms and suites, each reflecting a contemporary aesthetic while incorporating elements of traditional Assamese artistry. Beyond accommodation, we provide a selection of curated experiences designed to enhance your stay. These include guided tours to local tea gardens, visits to historical sites, and opportunities to experience Assamese cuisine through cooking classes and curated dining experiences. Our unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion. We strive to go beyond simply providing a place to stay; we offer a gateway to experiencing the soul of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our services directly address the needs of the local market by providing a high-quality accommodation option that caters to both domestic and international tourists. Guwahati serves as a gateway to Northeast India, and we position ourselves as the ideal starting point for exploring the region. We also cater to business travelers by providing essential amenities such as high-speed internet, conference facilities, and a comfortable workspace, all within a serene and welcoming environment. Understanding the growing demand for sustainable tourism, we are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local artisans and businesses through our sourcing practices and curated experiences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer Experience: A Commitment to Personalized Service</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Solace Stay, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in understanding the individual needs of each guest and exceeding their expectations. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and personalized attention. Our dedicated staff is trained to provide seamless assistance with everything from travel arrangements to local recommendations. We differentiate ourselves through proactive communication, anticipating guest needs, and fostering a genuine connection. We strive to create a welcoming atmosphere where guests feel valued, respected, and comfortable.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, businesses, and cultural organizations. We showcase local artwork and crafts in our premises, providing a platform for local talent and offering guests a unique opportunity to purchase authentic Assamese souvenirs. We also organize community events and initiatives that promote sustainable tourism and support local livelihoods. By actively participating in the community, we aim to foster a sense of belonging and contribute to the overall well-being of Guwahati. This commitment not only enhances the guest experience but also strengthens our reputation as a responsible and community-focused business.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Enriching Experiences</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Solace Stay envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and cultural immersion. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options to cater to a wider range of travelers, including families and larger groups. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-friendly accommodations in other parts of Assam, showcasing the state''s diverse landscapes and promoting responsible tourism. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves enhancing our curated experiences, offering guests even more opportunities to connect with the local culture and environment. We plan to partner with local experts to develop unique tours, workshops, and events that showcase the best of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>In the long term, we aim to establish Solace Stay as a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality and sustainable tourism. We are committed to investing in our staff, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they continue to provide exceptional service. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, offering online booking, mobile check-in, and personalized recommendations. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, we are confident that Solace Stay will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.307Z', '2025-12-07T01:00:33.000Z'),
(1169, 'Hotel Town and country inn', 'Hotels', NULL, '<h1>Hotel Town and Country Inn: A Guwahati Hospitality Landmark</h1>

