<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Hotel Town and Country Inn. The Inn prides itself on its attentive and proactive service, striving to anticipate and fulfill the needs of every guest. The staff is trained to provide personalized attention, offering helpful local insights and recommendations to enhance the guest experience. What truly sets the Inn apart is its genuine connection with the local community. The hotel actively participates in local events and initiatives, promoting Assamese culture and supporting local artisans. This commitment to community engagement fosters a warm and welcoming atmosphere, making guests feel like they are not just staying at a hotel, but are part of the Guwahati community. The Inn also seeks feedback actively from guests to improve services and make for a more pleasant stay. Reviews are addressed promptly and suggestions implemented where possible.

