<br> <br>

At Metro Guest House, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in a genuine desire to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every guest. From the moment they arrive until their departure, our staff are dedicated to anticipating and exceeding their expectations. We strive to create a personal connection with each guest, remembering their preferences and tailoring our service accordingly. What truly sets us apart is our active involvement in the local community. We source our produce and ingredients from local farmers and artisans, supporting the local economy and ensuring that our guests experience the authentic flavors of Assam. We also partner with local tour operators to offer unique and immersive cultural experiences, allowing our guests to connect with the heritage of the region. Furthermore, we actively participate in local community events and initiatives, fostering a strong sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of Guwahati. We proactively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring that we remain responsive to their evolving needs and preferences.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Metro Guest House envisions becoming a leading provider of boutique accommodation in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, its commitment to local culture, and its sustainable business practices. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options to cater to a wider range of travelers, potentially adding additional rooms or suites. We also plan to enhance our service offerings by introducing new amenities such as a small fitness center or a rooftop terrace with panoramic views of the city. A key component of our long-term strategy is to further strengthen our ties with the local community. We aim to expand our partnerships with local artisans and businesses, offering guests unique and authentic experiences that showcase the best of Assam. We are also committed to implementing sustainable business practices, reducing our environmental footprint and contributing to the preservation of Guwahati''s natural beauty. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing a mobile app for check-in, concierge services, and local information. Ultimately, our goal is to create a memorable and enriching experience for every guest, solidifying Metro Guest House''s position as a premier destination in Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.311Z', '2025-12-07T02:10:35.000Z'),
(1240, 'V & Q Homestay', 'Hotels', NULL, '<p>V & Q Homestay offers a comfortable and authentic Assam experience, nestled in the heart of Guwahati. More than just accommodation, V & Q Homestay provides a gateway to understanding the vibrant culture, warm hospitality, and breathtaking landscapes that define this corner of Northeast India. In a region where tourism is steadily growing and visitors seek immersive experiences beyond standard hotels, V & Q Homestay distinguishes itself by offering a personalized and culturally enriching stay that reflects the true spirit of Assam. Our commitment to showcasing local traditions and supporting the community makes us a significant contributor to the evolving tourism landscape of Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At V & Q Homestay, our core offering is providing comfortable and thoughtfully designed accommodation that feels like a home away from home. Guests can choose from a range of rooms, each carefully furnished to reflect the local aesthetic while ensuring modern comfort and convenience. This includes comfortable beds, private bathrooms with hot water, air conditioning, and complimentary Wi-Fi. Beyond just providing a place to sleep, we offer curated experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. This includes authentic Assamese meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, offering a true taste of the region. We also organize guided tours to nearby attractions, such as the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum, ensuring guests can explore the rich history and natural beauty of Guwahati with knowledgeable local guides.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to creating a personalized and immersive experience. We go beyond the standard tourist offerings, connecting our guests with local artisans, musicians, and chefs, allowing them to engage directly with the community and gain a deeper understanding of Assamese traditions. For example, guests can participate in cooking classes to learn how to prepare traditional Assamese dishes, attend a Bihu dance performance, or visit local markets to discover unique handicrafts. This focus on authentic experiences caters directly to the growing demand from travelers who seek more than just sightseeing; they crave meaningful connections and cultural immersion. By offering a blend of comfort, convenience, and cultural engagement, V & Q Homestay fills a crucial gap in the Guwahati accommodation market, providing an alternative to impersonal hotels and generic tourist experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer service at V & Q Homestay is built on the principles of warmth, attentiveness, and genuine care. We understand that our guests are not just customers but individuals seeking a unique and memorable experience. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality, ensuring they feel welcomed and valued. Our staff is trained to be attentive to their needs, providing personalized recommendations and assistance throughout their stay. We strive to create a relaxed and friendly atmosphere where guests feel comfortable interacting with us and learning about the local culture. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their expectations. Our commitment extends beyond just providing excellent service; we actively participate in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans, promoting sustainable tourism practices, and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This commitment resonates with guests who value ethical and responsible travel, fostering a sense of connection and loyalty.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our approach to connecting with the local community is multifaceted. We actively partner with local businesses and artisans to promote their products and services to our guests. We also work with local organizations to support community development projects, ensuring that tourism benefits the entire community, not just our business. By integrating ourselves into the local fabric, we create a more authentic and enriching experience for our guests, while also contributing to the sustainable development of Guwahati. For example, we source our produce from local farmers, employ local staff, and promote locally made handicrafts in our gift shop. These initiatives not only support the local economy but also provide our guests with a deeper understanding of Assamese culture and traditions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, V & Q Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation offerings, adding new cultural experiences, and strengthening our ties with the local community. We aim to develop themed rooms that showcase the diverse cultures and traditions of Assam, offering guests a deeper understanding of the region''s rich heritage. We also plan to introduce new activities such as tea plantation tours, river cruises, and wildlife safaris, showcasing the natural beauty of Assam. Furthermore, we are committed to enhancing our sustainability practices, reducing our environmental footprint, and promoting responsible tourism practices within the community. Our long-term goal is to create a business that not only provides exceptional experiences for our guests but also contributes to the sustainable development of Guwahati and the preservation of its unique culture and environment. We believe that by focusing on quality, authenticity, and sustainability, V & Q Homestay can become a model for responsible tourism in Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.311Z', '2025-12-07T02:15:09.000Z'),
(1241, 'Spring Villa Hotel', 'Hotels', NULL, 'Spring Villa Hotel, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a distinguished hospitality provider offering a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese charm. More than just a place to stay, Spring Villa Hotel is designed to be an immersive experience, connecting guests with the rich culture and natural beauty of the region. In a city rapidly becoming a hub for trade, tourism, and education in Northeast India, Spring Villa Hotel distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, a commitment to sustainable practices, and a genuine connection to the local community. We are poised to be a leading player in Guwahati’s hospitality sector, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking an authentic and comfortable stay.

