(1303, 'Pristine Stay', 'Homestays', NULL, '<p>Pristine Stay offers a curated collection of premium accommodations in Guwahati, Assam, catering to discerning travellers seeking comfort, convenience, and an authentic local experience. Positioned in the heart of Northeast India, Pristine Stay distinguishes itself by providing not just lodging, but a gateway to the rich culture and natural beauty of the region. Recognizing the increasing demand for high-quality accommodation alongside personalized service, Pristine Stay fills a critical gap in the Guwahati hospitality market, offering a compelling alternative to traditional hotels and impersonal vacation rentals.</p>

<br>
<br>

