Our core offering revolves around providing elegantly appointed accommodations coupled with bespoke services designed to exceed expectations. Shamaayim features a limited number of suites and rooms, each thoughtfully designed with contemporary aesthetics and infused with subtle Assamese design elements, creating a unique sense of place. These are not just rooms; they are sanctuaries offering panoramic views, luxurious bedding, state-of-the-art amenities, and dedicated concierge service.

