Beyond the accommodations, Shamaayim boasts a range of exclusive amenities, including a fine-dining restaurant showcasing regional and international cuisine crafted with locally sourced ingredients, a rejuvenating spa offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments, and a meticulously landscaped outdoor pool area perfect for relaxation. One of our unique selling points is our commitment to personalized experiences. We understand that each guest is unique, and we strive to tailor every aspect of their stay to their individual preferences, from curated excursions to private dining experiences. The emphasis on local sourcing extends beyond the restaurant, with Shamaayim actively supporting local artisans and businesses, offering guests an authentic taste of Assam. This commitment resonates deeply with the local market, which increasingly values sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism. By providing luxury that is both refined and respectful of its surroundings, Shamaayim addresses the growing demand for sophisticated and responsible travel experiences in the region.

<br> <br>

At Shamaayim, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our team is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs, provide personalized attention, and create memorable experiences. We foster a culture of warmth and genuine hospitality, treating each guest as an individual and ensuring that their stay is seamless and stress-free.

<br> <br>

What sets Shamaayim apart is our dedication to connecting with the local community. We actively collaborate with local tour operators to offer unique cultural experiences, such as tea garden tours, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and visits to local craft villages. We also host events showcasing Assamese art, music, and cuisine, providing a platform for local talent and enriching the guest experience. We strive to be more than just a hotel; we aim to be an active and responsible member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its economic and cultural vitality. This deep connection resonates with both local and international guests, who appreciate the opportunity to immerse themselves in the authentic culture of Assam. We believe in building long-term relationships with our guests, fostering loyalty through consistent delivery of exceptional service and a genuine commitment to their satisfaction.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Shamaayim envisions becoming the premier luxury destination in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include curated wellness programs, personalized adventure tours, and exclusive events. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our footprint, potentially opening new properties in other key tourist destinations in Assam and the surrounding region, always maintaining the same commitment to quality, luxury, and cultural sensitivity that defines the Shamaayim brand.

<br> <br>

We are committed to continuous improvement and innovation, constantly seeking new ways to enhance the guest experience and stay ahead of evolving market trends. Our long-term goal is to establish Shamaayim as a symbol of refined hospitality, a destination that not only provides luxurious accommodations but also creates lasting memories and contributes to the sustainable development of the region. We aim to be recognized as a leader in responsible tourism, showcasing the beauty and culture of Assam while minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities. Shamaayim – A Luxury Stay is not just a business; it''s a passion project, driven by a desire to create something truly special and meaningful in the heart of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.317Z', '2025-12-07T04:10:32.000Z'),
