(1363, 'Attic3 Air Conditioner Rs 250 Additional Pay On Use Basis', 'Homestays', NULL, 'Attic3 Air Conditioner: Cooling Guwahati, One Room at a Time

Attic3 Air Conditioner, situated in the heart of Guwahati, represents a novel approach to air conditioning solutions in the region. Understanding the unique challenges presented by Guwahati''s climate – from the stifling humidity to fluctuating electricity costs – Attic3 provides a practical and budget-conscious alternative to traditional AC ownership. We''re not just selling air conditioning; we''re offering a solution tailored to the needs of Guwahati residents, emphasizing accessibility and affordability. Attic3 addresses a critical gap in the market by offering a flexible, pay-per-use model that alleviates the burden of upfront costs and ongoing maintenance typically associated with air conditioning units, making comfort accessible to a broader segment of the population in Assam.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing high-quality, energy-efficient air conditioners on a usage-based model. Customers rent an AC unit from Attic3, and instead of a large upfront payment, they pay a minimal rental fee plus an additional Rs 250 for each day the AC is actively used. This "Additional Pay On Use Basis" is our unique selling proposition. It empowers customers to control their cooling expenses precisely, only paying for the comfort they require. Our fleet consists of modern, energy-efficient units designed to minimize electricity consumption, a key concern for many households in Guwahati. This model is particularly advantageous for individuals who only require AC during the hottest months or for specific hours of the day. We also offer comprehensive maintenance and support, ensuring the AC units remain in optimal condition and minimizing disruptions for our customers. Our service includes prompt repairs and replacements, further distinguishing us from traditional rental services that often lack dedicated technical support. By combining reliable equipment with a flexible payment structure, Attic3 meets the diverse cooling needs of the local market in a sustainable and financially responsible manner.

<br> <br>

Customer satisfaction is at the core of the Attic3 philosophy. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, treating each interaction as an opportunity to provide exceptional service. Our customer service team is trained to be responsive, helpful, and understanding of the specific needs of Guwahati residents. We offer personalized consultations to help customers determine the appropriate AC unit size and usage plan for their requirements. We also understand the importance of local connections. We actively participate in community events and partner with local businesses to build awareness and foster goodwill. Our transparent pricing and straightforward rental agreements are designed to build trust and ensure a hassle-free experience. We go the extra mile to address any concerns promptly and efficiently, ensuring that our customers feel valued and supported. This commitment to customer service, combined with our innovative business model, has allowed Attic3 to quickly establish a positive reputation within the local community.

<br> <br>

The future for Attic3 Air Conditioner is bright, with significant potential for expansion and innovation. Our immediate plans include expanding our service area within Guwahati and extending our reach to other cities and towns in Assam. We are also exploring partnerships with local retailers to increase accessibility and convenience for our customers. Furthermore, we intend to invest in smart technology to optimize AC usage and reduce energy consumption, further enhancing the value proposition for our clients. We envision incorporating features like remote control and usage monitoring through a mobile app, empowering customers with greater control over their cooling expenses. In the long term, Attic3 aims to become the leading provider of flexible and affordable air conditioning solutions in the region, contributing to a more sustainable and comfortable living environment for all. We believe that our commitment to innovation, customer service, and community engagement will be key to achieving our ambitious goals. Our vision is to not only provide cooling solutions but also to empower individuals and families in Guwahati to manage their resources effectively and enjoy a higher quality of life.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.317Z', '2025-12-07T04:15:27.000Z'),
(1364, 'Hillside Cottage AC Rs 250 Additional Pay on Use Basis', 'Homestays', NULL, '<h1>Hillside Cottage AC: Comfortable Stays in Guwahati</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Hillside Cottage AC offers a unique and welcoming accommodation option, distinguishing itself with comfortable rooms and a transparent, pay-per-use air conditioning system. We cater to budget-conscious travelers and individuals seeking a tranquil escape from the bustling city, providing a serene environment coupled with essential amenities. Hillside Cottage AC aims to be the preferred choice for visitors looking for value and convenience in Guwahati''s hospitality sector.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Comfort and Convenience: Our Core Offerings</h2>

<p>Our primary offering is comfortable and well-maintained rooms designed to provide a restful stay. Each room is equipped with essential furnishings, clean linens, and private bathrooms. What sets Hillside Cottage AC apart is our innovative approach to air conditioning: we offer it as an optional amenity with a transparent pricing structure of Rs 250 on a pay-per-use basis. This allows guests to control their expenses and only pay for AC when they need it, avoiding unnecessary costs during cooler weather or for those who prefer natural ventilation. Beyond accommodation, we provide complimentary Wi-Fi access and are readily available to assist with local travel arrangements and information. We strive to create a hassle-free experience for our guests, ensuring their needs are met with efficiency and care.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>We understand the needs of travelers visiting Guwahati, be it for business, leisure, or personal reasons. Many visitors, especially those on a tight budget or traveling during milder seasons, find traditional hotels with inclusive AC charges unnecessarily expensive. Hillside Cottage AC addresses this directly by offering the flexibility to opt-in for air conditioning only when needed, making it a cost-effective choice. Our location provides convenient access to key areas within Guwahati, including transportation hubs, commercial districts, and tourist attractions, further enhancing the convenience and value proposition for our guests.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>A Guest-Centric Approach</h2>

<p>At Hillside Cottage AC, we believe in providing personalized attention and building genuine connections with our guests. Our staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and knowledgeable about the local area. We go the extra mile to ensure each guest feels welcomed and comfortable, from assisting with check-in to providing recommendations for local eateries and attractions. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and maintain high standards of cleanliness and comfort. We aim to foster a warm and inviting atmosphere, creating a home away from home for our visitors.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our commitment extends beyond the walls of Hillside Cottage AC. We actively engage with the local community by sourcing supplies from local vendors whenever possible, supporting small businesses, and contributing to the local economy. We believe in responsible tourism and strive to minimize our environmental impact through energy-efficient practices and waste reduction initiatives. We are committed to being a responsible and valued member of the Guwahati community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Looking Ahead: Growth and Expansion</h2>

<p>Hillside Cottage AC envisions a future of sustainable growth and expanded service offerings. We plan to enhance our facilities by adding more rooms and upgrading existing amenities to cater to a wider range of travelers. We are exploring partnerships with local tour operators and transportation services to offer comprehensive travel packages to our guests, simplifying their travel planning and enriching their experience in Guwahati. We aim to establish Hillside Cottage AC as a recognized and respected brand in the Guwahati hospitality sector, known for its value, comfort, and commitment to customer satisfaction.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our long-term goals include expanding our footprint beyond Guwahati, potentially establishing similar accommodations in other strategic locations within Assam and the Northeast region. We are also exploring the incorporation of eco-friendly practices and sustainable tourism initiatives into our business model, reflecting our commitment to environmental responsibility and community development. Hillside Cottage AC is dedicated to providing exceptional hospitality while contributing to the growth and prosperity of the local community and the region as a whole. We aspire to be more than just a place to stay; we want to be a part of our guests'' memorable experiences in Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:15:32.000Z'),
(1365, 'Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours, located at 20 1st Bye Lane North, is a premier travel company dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences throughout the enchanting landscapes of Northeast India, with a strong focus on Assam. We stand out by offering meticulously curated adventures that go beyond typical tourism, immersing travelers in the rich culture, breathtaking natural beauty, and unparalleled hospitality of this often-overlooked region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Unlike standard tour operators, Northeast Magical Escapes is built on a foundation of sustainable and responsible tourism. We believe in preserving the environment and supporting local communities, ensuring that our tours benefit both our clients and the places they visit. Our commitment to ethical travel practices sets us apart in the Assam tourism market, appealing to a growing segment of travelers seeking authentic and meaningful experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing bespoke adventure and cultural tours throughout Northeast India. These include guided treks through the lush hills of Meghalaya, wildlife safaris in the Kaziranga National Park (a UNESCO World Heritage Site known for its rhinoceros population), river cruises on the mighty Brahmaputra, and immersive cultural experiences in the tribal villages of Arunachal Pradesh. We offer a range of packages, from budget-friendly options to luxury itineraries, catering to diverse travel preferences and budgets.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiating factor is our specialization in off-the-beaten-path destinations and activities. We uncover hidden gems, arrange encounters with local artisans, and facilitate participation in traditional festivals, offering unique opportunities unavailable through mainstream tourism channels. For instance, we organize tours to tea gardens providing hands-on experience of tea plucking and processing and arrange overnight stays in traditional bamboo cottages, offering a truly authentic regional experience. Another distinctive service is personalized itinerary design. We work closely with each client to understand their interests and preferences, crafting a custom-made tour that perfectly aligns with their individual needs and desires. This personalized approach guarantees a truly unique and memorable travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Northeast Magical Escapes understands that the local market seeks convenience, authenticity, and value. Our services address these needs by providing seamless travel arrangements, curated experiences highlighting local culture, and competitive pricing. We cater to both domestic and international tourists, offering language support and ensuring accessibility for all travelers. Our guides are not just knowledgeable; they are passionate storytellers who bring the region''s history, culture, and ecology to life.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Northeast Magical Escapes, we place paramount importance on providing exceptional customer service. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, we strive to exceed expectations at every touchpoint. We emphasize clear and prompt communication, ensuring that clients are always well-informed and supported throughout their journey. Our team is available 24/7 to address any questions or concerns, providing peace of mind and ensuring a stress-free travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively collaborate with local businesses, artisans, and organizations, creating a network of partners that share our commitment to sustainable tourism. By employing local guides, sourcing local products, and supporting community-based tourism initiatives, we ensure that our tours directly benefit the people and places we visit. This community-centric approach not only enhances the travel experience but also contributes to the economic development of the region. We regularly participate in local tourism fairs and workshops to build relationships and further promote sustainable tourism practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Northeast Magical Escapes envisions becoming the leading adventure and cultural tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and authentic experiences. We plan to expand our range of tours and destinations, exploring new and exciting possibilities in the region. This includes developing specialized tours focused on specific interests, such as bird watching, photography, and spiritual retreats. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including a user-friendly online booking platform and a mobile app providing real-time travel information and support.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, we are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities, creating new opportunities for economic development and cultural preservation. We aim to establish a training center for local guides, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional tours while promoting sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to not only provide unforgettable travel experiences but also contribute to the sustainable development of Northeast India, ensuring that its natural beauty and cultural heritage are preserved for generations to come. We are actively seeking collaborations with government tourism boards and NGOs to achieve these goals.</p>', '20 1st Bye Lane North', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:20:10.000Z'),
(1366, 'Encamp Adventures - Customized Tour & Trek Packages', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Encamp Adventures - Customized Tour & Trek Packages is a premier travel company based in Beltola Survey, Guwahati, Assam, specializing in crafting unforgettable and personalized tour and trekking experiences within the Northeast Indian landscape and beyond. We distinguish ourselves by meticulously tailoring each itinerary to the specific desires, fitness levels, and interests of our clients, moving beyond generic tour packages to offer authentic, immersive adventures. In a region brimming with untapped natural beauty and rich cultural heritage, Encamp Adventures serves as a vital bridge connecting travelers with the hidden gems and profound experiences Assam and the surrounding areas have to offer. We are more than just a travel agency; we are architects of discovery, committed to sustainable tourism practices that benefit both our clients and the local communities we engage with.

<br> <br>

Our core service is the design and execution of customized tour and trekking packages. This encompasses a wide spectrum of offerings, from short, leisurely cultural tours of Guwahati and nearby historical sites to challenging multi-day treks through the breathtaking Himalayan foothills and biodiversity hotspots of Northeast India. We handle every aspect of the journey, including transportation, accommodation, permits, experienced local guides, and nutritious, regionally-inspired meals. What sets us apart is our dedication to personalization. We conduct thorough consultations with each client to understand their preferences, be it wildlife observation, exploring tea gardens, experiencing tribal cultures, or simply relaxing in serene natural settings. Furthermore, we boast a network of experienced local guides who possess in-depth knowledge of the region''s history, ecology, and cultural nuances, ensuring an enriching and insightful experience for our clients. This bespoke approach directly addresses the growing market demand for authentic and meaningful travel experiences, catering to both domestic and international tourists seeking to explore the unique offerings of Assam and Northeast India. We cater to solo travelers, couples, families, and corporate groups, adjusting our packages to suit varying budgets and time constraints.

<br> <br>

At Encamp Adventures, we place customer satisfaction at the heart of our operations. We believe that exceptional customer service is not merely a formality but a fundamental aspect of creating memorable travel experiences. Our team is readily available to assist clients throughout the entire journey, from initial consultation and itinerary planning to on-the-ground support and post-trip feedback. We foster open communication and actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet evolving customer needs. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment, treating each client as a valued guest. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing logistical arrangements; we aim to forge genuine connections with our clients, sharing our passion for the region and its culture. We actively engage with the local community by partnering with local businesses, employing local guides and support staff, and promoting sustainable tourism practices that minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the economic well-being of the communities we visit. This approach fosters a sense of trust and authenticity, attracting repeat customers and building a strong reputation within the local community. Our Beltola Survey location allows us to be easily accessible to both local residents and tourists arriving in Guwahati, making us a convenient and reliable resource for travel planning.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Encamp Adventures envisions becoming the leading provider of customized tour and trekking experiences in Northeast India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include adventure activities such as river rafting, paragliding, and rock climbing, further diversifying our appeal and catering to a wider range of adventure enthusiasts. We are also committed to developing eco-friendly and sustainable tourism practices, working closely with local communities to promote responsible travel and conservation. This includes initiatives such as reducing waste, supporting local artisans, and educating travelers about the importance of preserving the region''s natural and cultural heritage. We intend to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a broader audience, both domestically and internationally, showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India. Furthermore, we are exploring partnerships with other travel agencies and tourism stakeholders to expand our reach and offer comprehensive travel solutions to our clients. Our long-term goal is to establish Encamp Adventures as a symbol of quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism, contributing to the sustainable development of the region and creating lasting memories for our clients. We aim to be more than just a tour operator; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting cultural understanding and environmental stewardship through the transformative power of travel.', 'Beltola Survey', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:20:17.000Z'),
(1367, 'RINU TOURS AND TRAVEL AGENCY IN GUWAHATI', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '```html
<h1>RINU TOURS AND TRAVEL AGENCY IN GUWAHATI: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</h1>

<p>Nestled on Kamala Kanta Bhattacharya Path in the heart of Guwahati, Rinu Tours and Travel Agency stands as a trusted partner for discerning travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. In a region brimming with natural beauty, vibrant culture, and burgeoning tourism, Rinu Tours carves its niche by offering personalized travel solutions that cater to the diverse needs of local and international explorers. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys, deeply rooted in the spirit of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our significance in the local business landscape stems from our commitment to promoting sustainable tourism and showcasing the hidden gems of Assam and Northeast India. We strive to connect travelers with the region''s rich heritage, supporting local communities and preserving the environment. Unlike larger, more impersonal agencies, Rinu Tours focuses on creating tailored itineraries that reflect individual preferences and budgets, fostering a deeper appreciation for the region''s unique offerings.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Crafting Unforgettable Journeys</h2>

<p>Rinu Tours and Travel Agency offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to every aspect of the travel experience. Our primary offerings include:</p>

<br>
<br>

<ul>
  <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries that explore Assam''s tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park, cultural hubs, and scenic landscapes. Our packages range from short weekend getaways to extended explorations of Northeast India.</li>
  <li><b>Hotel Bookings:</b> We have established strong relationships with a wide range of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ensuring our clients have access to comfortable and convenient accommodations at competitive rates. We cater to all budgets, from budget-friendly options to luxurious retreats.</li>
  <li><b>Flight and Train Ticketing:</b> Our team handles all flight and train ticketing requirements, providing seamless travel arrangements for both domestic and international destinations.</li>
  <li><b>Car Rentals:</b> We offer a diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles for self-drive adventures or chauffeur-driven excursions, allowing travelers to explore the region at their own pace.</li>
  <li><b>Visa Assistance:</b> We provide guidance and support for visa applications, ensuring a hassle-free travel planning process for international travelers.</li>
  <li><b>Adventure Tourism:</b> For the adventurous at heart, we offer specialized tours focusing on activities such as trekking, river rafting, and wildlife safaris.</li>
</ul>

<br>
<br>

<p>What sets Rinu Tours apart is our unwavering commitment to providing personalized service and insider knowledge. Our team comprises experienced travel professionals with a deep understanding of the region and a passion for sharing its beauty with the world. We go beyond simply booking tickets and accommodations; we provide expert advice on the best time to visit, cultural etiquette, local cuisine, and off-the-beaten-path destinations. This personalized approach ensures that each traveler has a truly unique and enriching experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our services directly address the needs of the local market by offering convenient and reliable travel solutions for both residents and tourists. We understand the challenges of navigating the region''s infrastructure and cultural nuances, and we strive to make travel as seamless and enjoyable as possible. We also actively promote local businesses and artisans, contributing to the sustainable development of the region''s tourism industry.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Lasting Relationships</h2>

<p>At Rinu Tours and Travel Agency, customer satisfaction is our top priority. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service at every touchpoint. From the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, we strive to exceed expectations and create memorable experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our approach to customer service is characterized by:</p>

<br>
<br>

<ul>
  <li><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand each client''s individual needs and preferences, tailoring our recommendations accordingly.</li>
  <li><b>Prompt and Reliable Communication:</b> We are readily available to answer questions, provide assistance, and address any concerns that may arise.</li>
  <li><b>Local Expertise:</b> Our team possesses in-depth knowledge of the region, providing valuable insights and recommendations that enhance the travel experience.</li>
  <li><b>Commitment to Quality:</b> We partner with reputable service providers to ensure that our clients receive high-quality accommodations, transportation, and tour experiences.</li>
  <li><b>Proactive Problem Solving:</b> We are prepared to handle any unexpected challenges that may arise during travel, ensuring a smooth and stress-free experience.</li>
</ul>

<br>
<br>

<p>We connect with the local community by actively participating in local events, supporting local businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe in giving back to the community and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s unique cultural heritage.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Creating Lasting Impact</h2>

<p>Rinu Tours and Travel Agency envisions a future where we are recognized as the leading provider of authentic and sustainable travel experiences in Northeast India. Our growth strategy focuses on:</p>

<br>
<br>

<ul>
  <li><b>Expanding our service offerings:</b> We plan to introduce new tour packages that explore emerging destinations and cater to niche interests, such as eco-tourism and wellness travel.</li>
  <li><b>Strengthening our online presence:</b> We are investing in digital marketing and technology to enhance our online visibility and reach a wider audience.</li>
  <li><b>Developing strategic partnerships:</b> We are actively seeking collaborations with local businesses, tourism organizations, and international travel agencies to expand our network and enhance our service capabilities.</li>
  <li><b>Promoting sustainable tourism practices:</b> We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities through responsible tourism initiatives.</li>
</ul>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the region''s tourism industry while providing unforgettable experiences for our clients. We believe that travel has the power to connect people, foster understanding, and create lasting positive change, and we are committed to making a meaningful impact on the lives of both travelers and the local communities we serve. Rinu Tours and Travel Agency aims to be the preferred choice for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching exploration of Assam and beyond, leaving a positive footprint on the region and creating memories that last a lifetime.</p>
```', 'Kamala Kanta Bhattacharya Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:20:27.000Z'),
(1368, 'Wideangle Holidays', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Wideangle Holidays, strategically located on the 3rd Floor of Monal Tower, GS Rd, Guwahati, stands as a premier travel and tour operator dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India. Unlike generic travel agencies, Wideangle Holidays focuses on curating personalized and immersive travel experiences, providing travelers with an authentic and unforgettable journey through this vibrant region. In the competitive Assam business landscape, Wideangle Holidays distinguishes itself through its commitment to responsible tourism, its deep understanding of the local culture, and its dedication to providing exceptional customer service, making it a significant contributor to the growth of the local tourism sector.

<br> <br>

Wideangle Holidays offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of travelers, from solo adventurers to large tour groups. Our core services encompass meticulously planned tour packages, customizable itineraries, hotel bookings, transportation arrangements, and expert guidance throughout the journey. We specialize in crafting unique experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. These include wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, exploring the tea gardens of Assam, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, cultural immersion tours showcasing tribal traditions, and adventure activities like trekking and river rafting. What sets Wideangle Holidays apart is our in-depth local knowledge. We leverage our strong network of local partners – including guides, accommodation providers, and transportation services – to ensure seamless and authentic experiences. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to tailor itineraries to specific interests and budgets, ensuring that every traveler''s needs are met. By focusing on responsible tourism practices and promoting sustainable travel, we aim to contribute to the long-term preservation of Assam''s natural and cultural heritage, addressing a growing demand in the market for ethical and mindful travel options.

<br> <br>

At Wideangle Holidays, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building long-lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional customer service from the initial inquiry to the completion of the trip. Our approach is personalized and attentive, with dedicated travel consultants available to assist customers with every aspect of their travel planning. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, efficiency, and commitment to resolving any issues promptly and professionally. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every customer feels valued and respected. Furthermore, Wideangle Holidays actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, cultural organizations, and eco-tourism initiatives. By promoting local businesses and supporting community-based tourism, we aim to create a positive impact on the local economy and contribute to the sustainable development of the region. We regularly participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the rich cultural heritage of Assam and promoting responsible tourism practices, thereby connecting with the local community on a deeper level and establishing ourselves as a trusted and responsible member of the Assam business community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Wideangle Holidays envisions becoming the leading travel and tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to encompass more destinations in Northeast India, diversifying our services to include niche travel segments such as wellness retreats and photography tours, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are also committed to investing in the training and development of our staff to ensure that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to meet the evolving needs of our customers. Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and businesses to promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to the economic empowerment of local communities. Long-term, Wideangle Holidays aims to establish a reputation as a responsible and ethical travel operator that not only provides exceptional travel experiences but also contributes to the preservation of Assam''s natural and cultural heritage for future generations. We aspire to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism development in the region, inspiring other businesses to adopt responsible practices and contributing to the overall growth and prosperity of the local economy.', '3rd Floor, Monal Tower, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:20:32.000Z'),
(1369, 'My Voyage Tours and Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>My Voyage Tours and Travels, nestled at House Number 3, Beltola - Basistha Rd, near the Housefed Complex in Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to unforgettable experiences crafted with local expertise and a passion for showcasing the beauty of Assam and beyond. In a region rich with natural wonders and cultural heritage, My Voyage Tours and Travels stands out by offering personalized and immersive travel solutions, catering to the diverse needs of both local adventurers and international explorers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>We understand that travel is not merely about reaching a destination, but about the journey itself. That''s why we focus on creating itineraries that are both enriching and seamless, ensuring every aspect of the trip, from transportation and accommodation to activities and cultural immersion, is carefully curated. My Voyage Tours and Travels plays a significant role in the Assam business landscape by promoting sustainable tourism, supporting local communities, and showcasing the region''s unique offerings to a wider audience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including: <b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries tailored to individual preferences, interests, and budgets. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, trekking through the Eastern Himalayas, or experiencing the vibrant culture of the Northeast, we design personalized journeys that exceed expectations. <b>Domestic and International Travel:</b> From quick getaways within India to extensive international adventures, we handle all aspects of travel planning, including flight bookings, hotel reservations, visa assistance, and travel insurance. <b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> We provide comprehensive travel management services for businesses of all sizes, streamlining travel arrangements, optimizing expenses, and ensuring a smooth and efficient travel experience for employees. <b>Adventure Tourism:</b> For thrill-seekers, we offer curated adventure tours, including trekking, river rafting, wildlife safaris, and camping experiences, all conducted under the guidance of experienced professionals. <b>Pilgrimage Tours:</b> Assam is home to numerous sacred sites, and we offer meticulously planned pilgrimage tours, ensuring a spiritually enriching and comfortable journey for devotees.</p> <br> <br>

<p>What sets My Voyage Tours and Travels apart is our deep understanding of the local market and our commitment to providing authentic and immersive experiences. We leverage our extensive network of local partners, including hotels, transportation providers, and cultural experts, to ensure that our clients receive the best possible service and access to unique opportunities. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to blend seamless travel arrangements with genuine cultural immersion, allowing our clients to connect with the local communities and experience the true essence of Assam and the regions we serve. We address the specific needs of the local market by offering tours in Assamese, Hindi, and English, and by providing flexible payment options to suit various budgets.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At My Voyage Tours and Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention, prompt service, and proactive problem-solving. Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, transparency, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. We go the extra mile to ensure that every client feels valued, supported, and confident throughout their travel journey. We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships, partnerships with local artisans, and participation in community events. We strive to be a responsible and ethical business, contributing to the economic and social well-being of the communities we serve. Furthermore, we solicit feedback regularly to improve our services.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, My Voyage Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, known for its exceptional service, innovative tour packages, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our network of local partners, developing new and exciting tour packages, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We aim to introduce eco-friendly travel options and promote responsible tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and benefit local communities. We also plan to invest in training and development for our employees, ensuring that they possess the knowledge and skills necessary to deliver world-class service. Our long-term goal is to establish My Voyage Tours and Travels as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with quality, reliability, and unforgettable travel experiences in Assam and beyond.</p>', 'House Number 3, Beltola - Basistha Rd, near Housefed Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:20:39.000Z'),
(1370, 'Souvenir Solutions Holidays - Travel Agent in Guwahati (Northeast / International Tours)', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Souvenir Solutions Holidays stands as a premier travel agency in Guwahati, Assam, specializing in crafting unforgettable travel experiences for both domestic exploration of Northeast India and international adventures. Situated conveniently on Nayanpur Rd, opposite Punjab National Bank, we serve as a trusted gateway for individuals, families, and corporate clients seeking expertly planned and personalized journeys. In a region brimming with natural beauty and cultural richness, Souvenir Solutions Holidays distinguishes itself by combining global travel expertise with a deep understanding of the unique needs and preferences of the local Assamese market. We are committed to making travel accessible, enjoyable, and enriching for our clientele, fostering a reputation built on reliability, transparency, and exceptional service.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Souvenir Solutions Holidays lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of travel aspirations. Our core offerings encompass meticulously curated tour packages for Northeast India, showcasing the region''s breathtaking landscapes, vibrant cultures, and hidden gems. These packages range from adventurous treks through the Himalayas and serene explorations of tea gardens to immersive cultural experiences with local tribes and relaxing wildlife safaris in renowned national parks like Kaziranga. Beyond Northeast India, we excel in designing and executing international tour packages tailored to individual preferences and budgets. From European city escapes and Southeast Asian adventures to spiritual journeys and exotic island getaways, our experienced travel consultants provide expert guidance and seamless planning. Furthermore, we offer a full spectrum of travel support services, including flight booking (both domestic and international), hotel reservations across various price points, visa assistance to navigate complex travel requirements, travel insurance for peace of mind, and customized itinerary planning to optimize every journey. What sets us apart is our commitment to providing personalized attention, ensuring that each itinerary reflects the specific interests, budget, and travel style of our clients. We leverage our strong relationships with airlines, hotels, and local operators to secure competitive pricing and exclusive deals, making dream vacations a reality for our customers. Understanding the specific needs of the local market, we also offer specialized pilgrimage tours to prominent religious sites in India and abroad, acknowledging the cultural significance of these journeys for many Assamese families.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Souvenir Solutions Holidays. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients through personalized service and genuine care. From the initial consultation to the final return journey, our team is dedicated to providing prompt, attentive, and professional support. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we act as trusted travel advisors, offering expert recommendations, insightful travel tips, and proactive assistance throughout the entire travel process. Our multilingual staff is adept at communicating with clients in various local dialects, fostering a sense of comfort and trust. We understand the importance of clear and transparent communication, ensuring that our clients are fully informed about all aspects of their trip, from visa requirements to local customs. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to better meet their needs. Moreover, Souvenir Solutions Holidays is deeply embedded in the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, sponsoring community programs and supporting local artisans. This commitment to social responsibility further strengthens our bond with the community and reinforces our position as a trusted and respected travel partner.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Souvenir Solutions Holidays envisions a future where travel is not just a luxury but an accessible and enriching experience for everyone. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for our exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our offerings to include specialized adventure tours, eco-tourism initiatives, and immersive cultural experiences that showcase the unique beauty and heritage of Northeast India. We are also committed to leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse tour packages, book flights and hotels, and manage their travel itineraries. Investing in employee training and development is also a key priority, ensuring that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry, equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to provide exceptional service. We are exploring strategic partnerships with local businesses and tourism organizations to further strengthen our network and expand our reach. Ultimately, Souvenir Solutions Holidays aims to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism development in Northeast India, promoting responsible travel practices that benefit both the environment and local communities. By fostering a culture of innovation, customer-centricity, and social responsibility, we are confident that Souvenir Solutions Holidays will continue to thrive and inspire unforgettable travel experiences for years to come.</p>', 'Nayanpur Rd, opp. Punjab National Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:25:10.000Z'),
(1371, 'NORTHEAST VOYAGERS - Tempo traveller and Urbania hiring service In Guwahati with 100% Company Owned Fleets', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'NORTHEAST VOYAGERS: Your Trusted Partner for Group Travel in Guwahati

NORTHEAST VOYAGERS is a premier Tempo Traveller and Urbania hiring service based in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing safe, reliable, and comfortable group transportation solutions. What sets us apart is our commitment to quality and control: we operate a 100% company-owned fleet. This ensures consistent maintenance, stringent safety protocols, and a superior travel experience for our customers, a rarity in a market often dominated by fragmented ownership and variable service standards. We understand the unique transportation challenges and opportunities within Guwahati and the broader Northeast, and we''ve tailored our services to meet these specific needs.

<br> <br>

Core Services and Products: Group Transportation Redefined

Our core offering revolves around providing premium Tempo Traveller and Urbania vehicles for hire, catering to a wide range of group travel requirements. Whether it''s a corporate team outing, a family vacation exploring the scenic beauty of the Northeast, a school or college excursion, pilgrimage tours, or airport transfers for large groups, we have the perfect transportation solution.

<br> <br>

Our unique selling points include:

*   **100% Company-Owned Fleet:** Unlike aggregators or services relying on third-party vehicles, we maintain complete control over our fleet, ensuring consistent quality, rigorous maintenance, and adherence to the highest safety standards. This translates to peace of mind for our customers, knowing they are traveling in well-maintained and reliable vehicles.

*   **Professionally Trained Drivers:** Our drivers are not just experienced behind the wheel; they are trained in customer service, defensive driving techniques, and possess in-depth knowledge of the local routes and destinations. They prioritize passenger safety and comfort above all else.

*   **Comfort and Convenience:** Our Tempo Travellers and Urbanias are equipped with comfortable seating, air conditioning, entertainment systems, and ample luggage space, ensuring a pleasant and relaxing journey for all passengers.

*   **Flexible Hiring Options:** We offer flexible hiring options, including hourly, daily, and long-term rentals, catering to diverse travel needs and budgets. We also provide customized tour packages that include transportation and accommodation, simplifying travel planning for our customers.

*   **Transparent Pricing:** We believe in transparency and fair pricing. Our rates are competitive, and there are no hidden charges. Customers receive clear and upfront quotes before booking.

<br> <br>

We directly address the local market needs by offering a reliable and comfortable alternative to overcrowded public transportation or the uncertainties of relying on individual taxi services for group travel. The Northeast region is renowned for its tourism potential, and we facilitate exploration of this beautiful region by providing comfortable and dependable transport. We also cater to the growing demand for corporate travel solutions, offering a seamless and professional transportation experience for businesses in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

Customer Experience: Prioritizing Satisfaction and Building Relationships

At NORTHEAST VOYAGERS, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to exceed customer expectations at every touchpoint, from the initial inquiry to the completion of the journey. Our customer-centric approach is built on the following pillars:

*   **Personalized Service:** We understand that every customer has unique requirements. Our team takes the time to understand individual needs and tailor our services accordingly.

*   **Responsive Communication:** We are readily available to answer questions, provide assistance, and address any concerns promptly and efficiently. We value open and honest communication.

*   **Reliability and Punctuality:** We are committed to providing reliable and punctual service. Our drivers arrive on time, and our vehicles are well-maintained to minimize the risk of breakdowns or delays.

*   **Building Relationships:** We aim to build long-term relationships with our customers based on trust, reliability, and exceptional service. We value repeat business and strive to become the preferred transportation provider for our customers in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

We actively connect with the local community through various initiatives, including partnerships with local tourism operators, supporting local events, and promoting responsible tourism practices. We are committed to contributing to the economic development of Guwahati and the broader Northeast region.

<br> <br>

Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enhancing Connectivity

Looking ahead, NORTHEAST VOYAGERS is poised for significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include:

*   **Expanding our Fleet:** We plan to continuously expand our fleet with newer and more technologically advanced vehicles to meet the growing demand for our services and offer a wider range of transportation options.

*   **Extending our Service Area:** We aim to extend our service area to cover more destinations within Assam and the Northeast region, enhancing connectivity and facilitating tourism.

*   **Introducing New Services:** We are exploring opportunities to introduce new services, such as luxury coach rentals and specialized transportation solutions for events and conferences.

*   **Enhancing our Technology Platform:** We plan to invest in enhancing our technology platform to provide a more seamless and user-friendly booking experience for our customers. This includes online booking, GPS tracking, and real-time communication.

*   **Sustainability Initiatives:** We are committed to exploring sustainable transportation solutions and reducing our environmental impact.

<br> <br>

NORTHEAST VOYAGERS envisions itself as the leading provider of group transportation solutions in Guwahati and the Northeast, known for its commitment to quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction. We are dedicated to providing safe, comfortable, and convenient travel experiences that enhance connectivity and contribute to the economic growth of the region. By focusing on our core values and continuously striving for improvement, we are confident in our ability to achieve our long-term goals and solidify our position as the trusted partner for group travel in the Northeast.', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.318Z', '2025-12-07T04:25:18.000Z'),
