<br> <br>

BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to incorporate more specialized interests, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion experiences. We are also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking and managing travel arrangements. This includes integrating real-time information on flight availability, accommodation options, and local attractions. We plan to further strengthen our partnerships with local stakeholders, including hotels, transportation providers, and tour guides, to ensure the delivery of high-quality services and experiences. Long-term, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS aims to establish a strong regional presence, expanding our operations to other key cities in the North East. Our ultimate goal is to contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam and the North East, while providing unforgettable travel experiences for our valued customers. We aspire to be the go-to travel partner for anyone seeking adventure, relaxation, and cultural enrichment in this captivating corner of the world.', '2nd Floor, Nazib Complex, GS Rd, near Prag News, opposite Woodland Restaurant', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:40:40.000Z'),
(1390, 'Lets See Tour And Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Lets See Tour And Travels, strategically located at Subham Buildwell, RG Baruah Rd, beside NEEPCO bhawan in Guwahati, Assam, is a premier tour and travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences throughout the Northeast and beyond. Recognizing the region''s burgeoning tourism sector and the increasing demand for personalized and reliable travel solutions, Lets See Tour And Travels aims to be the preferred travel partner for both domestic and international tourists, as well as local residents seeking enriching getaways. We stand out in the competitive landscape by combining local expertise with a customer-centric approach, ensuring every journey is seamless, memorable, and tailored to individual preferences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including meticulously crafted tour packages, seamless transportation arrangements, comfortable accommodation bookings, and expert visa assistance. We specialize in curated tour packages focusing on Assam and the wider Northeast, showcasing the region''s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking natural landscapes, and unique biodiversity. These packages range from immersive cultural experiences in Guwahati and Majuli to adventurous expeditions in Kaziranga National Park and the scenic hills of Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. Beyond regional tours, we also facilitate travel to popular destinations across India and internationally, catering to diverse travel aspirations, from leisure trips to business travel. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to create bespoke itineraries tailored to the specific interests, budget, and time constraints of our clients. We leverage our deep understanding of the local terrain, culture, and logistics to deliver unparalleled travel experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trails. Furthermore, our commitment to sustainable tourism practices ensures that we contribute to the preservation of the region''s natural and cultural assets while providing responsible and ethical travel options.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Lets See Tour And Travels, we understand that exceptional customer service is paramount to building lasting relationships. We prioritize clear communication, prompt responsiveness, and personalized attention to every client. Our experienced travel consultants are dedicated to understanding individual needs and preferences, providing expert advice, and ensuring a smooth and hassle-free booking process. We strive to exceed expectations by going the extra mile, offering 24/7 support during travel, and proactively addressing any concerns that may arise. We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local artisans, businesses, and cultural organizations. This allows us to not only offer authentic and enriching travel experiences but also contribute to the economic development of the region. We regularly participate in local events and tourism initiatives, fostering a sense of community and promoting sustainable tourism practices. Our commitment to building strong relationships within the community reinforces our position as a trusted and responsible travel partner.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Lets See Tour And Travels envisions becoming the leading tour and travel agency in Northeast India, recognized for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate specialized tours, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We intend to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours, managing itineraries, and accessing travel information. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to offer competitive prices and exclusive deals to our clients. A key aspect of our long-term vision is to promote responsible and sustainable tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of local communities. We aim to educate travelers about the importance of preserving the region''s natural and cultural heritage, encouraging them to make conscious choices that benefit both the environment and the local population. By continuously innovating, expanding our offerings, and upholding our commitment to customer satisfaction and sustainability, Lets See Tour And Travels is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a trusted and respected leader in the tourism industry of Northeast India.</p>', 'Subham Buildwell, RG Baruah Rd, beside NEEPCO bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:45:08.000Z'),
(1391, 'Experience Destination', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Experience Destination: Unveiling Assam''s Hidden Gems

Experience Destination, strategically located in the Kohinoor building, 6 C&D, Bhagaduttapur Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a dedicated travel and experiences company focused on showcasing the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam and the Northeast India region. We are more than just a tour operator; we are curators of immersive experiences, designed to connect travelers with the heart and soul of this vibrant land. Recognizing a need for more authentic and sustainable tourism options in the area, Experience Destination was established to provide meticulously crafted itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trails, promoting responsible travel and supporting local communities. Our commitment lies in offering unparalleled service and creating unforgettable memories for every traveler who chooses to explore Assam with us.

<br> <br>

At Experience Destination, we offer a comprehensive suite of travel services catering to a diverse range of interests and preferences. Our core offerings include expertly guided tours of Assam''s iconic destinations such as Kaziranga National Park (renowned for its one-horned rhinoceros), Majuli (the world''s largest river island), and the tea gardens of Upper Assam. Beyond these well-known attractions, we specialize in creating customized itineraries that delve deeper into the region''s lesser-known gems, including visits to tribal villages, explorations of ancient temples, and opportunities for birdwatching and wildlife encounters in remote sanctuaries. We also provide logistical support, including transportation, accommodation bookings, and permit assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience.

<br> <br>

Our unique selling point lies in our emphasis on responsible and sustainable tourism. We partner with local communities to offer authentic cultural experiences, such as traditional cooking classes, handloom weaving demonstrations, and homestays that provide travelers with a genuine glimpse into the Assamese way of life. We prioritize eco-friendly practices and support conservation efforts to protect the region''s natural resources. Furthermore, we are committed to employing local guides and staff, thereby contributing to the economic empowerment of the communities we serve. By offering curated and responsible experiences, we aim to provide travelers with a deeper understanding and appreciation of Assam''s unique cultural and environmental heritage, directly addressing the growing demand for meaningful and sustainable travel options in the local market.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of Experience Destination''s ethos. We strive to provide personalized and attentive service from the moment a traveler makes an inquiry until the completion of their journey. Our team of experienced travel consultants works closely with each client to understand their individual needs and preferences, crafting bespoke itineraries that perfectly match their interests and budget. We believe in building long-term relationships with our customers, and we go the extra mile to ensure their satisfaction. This includes providing 24/7 support throughout their trip, offering flexible booking options, and constantly seeking feedback to improve our services.

<br> <br>

We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We support local artisans and businesses by featuring their products and services in our tours, and we promote cultural exchange programs that foster understanding and appreciation between travelers and local residents. We also participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of the areas where we operate. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the local community, Experience Destination aims to establish itself as a trusted and respected travel partner, known for its exceptional service and commitment to responsible tourism.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Experience Destination envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic and sustainable travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast region. Our future plans include expanding our network of local partners, developing new and innovative tour offerings, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We aim to create themed tours focusing on specific aspects of Assam''s culture and natural heritage, such as tea tourism, river cruises, and adventure travel. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goals include establishing Experience Destination as a globally recognized brand synonymous with responsible and sustainable tourism in Northeast India. We aim to attract a wider range of international travelers while continuing to serve the local market with the same level of dedication and commitment. We are confident that by staying true to our core values of authenticity, sustainability, and customer satisfaction, Experience Destination will continue to grow and thrive, contributing to the economic development and cultural preservation of Assam and the Northeast region for years to come. We see ourselves not just as a business, but as a bridge connecting travelers with the unique beauty and cultural richness of this extraordinary corner of the world.', 'Kohinoor building, 6 C&D, Bhagaduttapur Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:45:15.000Z'),
(1392, 'assam holidays', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Assam Holidays is a dedicated travel and tourism company deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, India. We specialize in crafting authentic and immersive travel experiences that showcase the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking natural beauty, and unique biodiversity of this enchanting region. While we do not have a formal physical storefront, our team of experienced travel professionals operates efficiently to curate customized itineraries, ensuring every traveler discovers the true essence of Assam. We stand out by combining local expertise with a passion for sustainable and responsible tourism, contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural wonders and the well-being of its communities.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core service is the provision of bespoke travel packages tailored to individual preferences and interests. These packages range from wildlife expeditions in Kaziranga National Park, famed for its one-horned rhinoceros, and Manas National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, to serene tea garden stays in verdant landscapes and cultural immersions in historic towns like Sivasagar, the former capital of the Ahom kingdom. We also organize river cruises on the mighty Brahmaputra, allowing travelers to witness the stunning landscapes and diverse riverine ecosystems. Furthermore, we offer specialized tours focused on tribal culture, exploring the traditions, art, and crafts of various indigenous communities across Assam. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the region, enabling us to create experiences that go beyond standard tourist routes, offering authentic encounters and fostering meaningful connections with the local culture. We directly address the needs of the growing domestic and international travel market seeking unique, off-the-beaten-path destinations and sustainable travel options. We handle all aspects of travel planning, including transportation, accommodation, permits, and expert local guides, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable journey.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Assam Holidays, we are committed to providing exceptional customer service. Our approach is centered around building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations. From the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, we maintain open communication and provide personalized support at every stage of the journey. We differentiate ourselves by offering a highly responsive and flexible service, adapting itineraries to accommodate unforeseen circumstances and address specific requests. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing a tour; we strive to create meaningful experiences that leave a lasting positive impact on our clients and the communities we work with. We actively engage with local communities by sourcing guides, accommodations, and services from local providers, thereby directly contributing to their economic empowerment. Furthermore, we promote responsible tourism practices by educating our clients about environmental conservation and cultural sensitivity. We believe in fostering a sense of respect and understanding between travelers and the local population, ensuring a mutually beneficial and enriching experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Assam Holidays is to become the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Assam, recognized for our commitment to responsible tourism and our contribution to the preservation of the region''s unique cultural and natural heritage. We plan to expand our range of offerings to include eco-friendly accommodations and activities, partnering with local communities to develop sustainable tourism initiatives. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, by introducing user-friendly online booking platforms and interactive travel guides. Furthermore, we plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff and local partners, ensuring that we continue to deliver the highest standards of service and expertise. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the economic growth of Assam through responsible tourism, creating employment opportunities and supporting local businesses. We envision Assam Holidays as a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable development and fostering a deeper appreciation for the beauty and diversity of this remarkable region.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:45:20.000Z'),
(1393, 'TRAVENTURE BUDDY', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>TRAVENTURE BUDDY is a dynamic travel and tourism company deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, offering bespoke travel experiences that showcase the rich cultural heritage and breathtaking natural beauty of the region. Situated at the crossroads of tradition and modernity, Traventure Buddy distinguishes itself by fostering sustainable tourism practices, promoting local communities, and curating journeys that resonate with authenticity and adventure.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>In a market often dominated by standardized tour packages, Traventure Buddy stands out as a champion of personalized travel. The company recognizes the unique needs and aspirations of each traveler, crafting itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trails. This commitment to individualized experiences sets Traventure Buddy apart in the vibrant Assam business landscape, contributing significantly to the growth of responsible tourism within the state.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Traventure Buddy’s core service offerings encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including expertly guided tours of Assam''s renowned tea gardens, immersive cultural excursions to tribal villages, and thrilling wildlife safaris through the Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage site. The company also provides comprehensive travel planning services, covering accommodation arrangements, transportation logistics, and permit acquisition, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience for its clients. Beyond Assam, Traventure Buddy extends its expertise to neighboring Northeastern states, crafting multi-destination itineraries that unveil the hidden gems of the entire region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiator for Traventure Buddy is its unwavering dedication to sustainable tourism. The company actively partners with local communities to promote homestay programs and support local artisans, ensuring that tourism dollars directly benefit the people and preserve the cultural fabric of Assam. This commitment resonates strongly with travelers seeking authentic and ethical travel experiences, positioning Traventure Buddy as a leader in responsible tourism within the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, Traventure Buddy offers specialized tour packages tailored to specific interests, such as birdwatching expeditions, photography tours, and yoga retreats in serene natural settings. This targeted approach caters to niche markets and attracts discerning travelers seeking enriching and fulfilling experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Traventure Buddy. The company prides itself on providing personalized attention to each traveler, from the initial consultation to the final farewell. The team of experienced travel consultants and local guides are passionate about showcasing the best of Assam and dedicated to ensuring that every journey is unforgettable. Traventure Buddy fosters strong relationships with local hotels, guesthouses, and transportation providers, guaranteeing quality service and competitive pricing for its clients.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets Traventure Buddy apart is its deep connection with the local community. The company actively participates in local festivals and events, supporting local businesses and promoting Assamese culture. This commitment to community engagement not only enriches the traveler''s experience but also fosters a sense of belonging and respect for the local way of life. Traventure Buddy regularly solicits feedback from its clients and incorporates their suggestions to continuously improve its services and enhance the overall travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Traventure Buddy envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Assam, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and authentic travel experiences. The company plans to expand its service offerings to include more eco-friendly accommodation options, develop new and innovative tour packages, and further strengthen its partnerships with local communities. Traventure Buddy is also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the travel planning process and provide travelers with real-time information and support.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A long-term goal is to establish a training center for local guides and tourism professionals, equipping them with the skills and knowledge to provide world-class service and promote sustainable tourism practices. By investing in the development of local talent, Traventure Buddy aims to contribute to the long-term growth and sustainability of the tourism industry in Assam, ensuring that the region remains a vibrant and welcoming destination for generations to come. Traventure Buddy is dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam, creating lasting memories for travelers while contributing to the economic well-being of local communities.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:45:26.000Z'),
(1394, 'Jernav Tour and Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Jernav Tour and Travels, strategically located in the vibrant Ganeshguri area of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier provider of comprehensive travel and tourism solutions. Recognizing the growing demand for seamless and personalized travel experiences in the region, Jernav Tour and Travels offers a diverse portfolio designed to cater to the unique needs of both domestic and international travelers. The company''s commitment to quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction has quickly established it as a trusted name in the local Assam business landscape, contributing significantly to the growth of the region''s tourism sector. Jernav Tour and Travels distinguishes itself through a deep understanding of Assam''s rich cultural heritage and stunning natural beauty, leveraging this knowledge to curate unforgettable travel itineraries.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Jernav Tour and Travels offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet diverse travel needs. Core services include customized tour packages focusing on Assam''s wildlife sanctuaries, tea gardens, historical sites, and cultural experiences. These packages are tailored to individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints, ensuring a personalized and memorable journey. Beyond Assam, the company also offers tour packages to other parts of India and select international destinations. Furthermore, Jernav provides comprehensive travel arrangements, including flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings, car rentals, and visa assistance. What sets Jernav apart is its dedication to providing authentic and responsible tourism experiences. The company actively promotes eco-tourism practices, supporting local communities and minimizing its environmental impact. The focus on showcasing Assam''s unique cultural identity, through collaborations with local artisans and promoting traditional crafts, provides travelers with a deeper and more meaningful connection to the region. By prioritizing customer convenience and offering a one-stop solution for all travel needs, Jernav Tour and Travels effectively addresses the growing demand for hassle-free travel planning within the local market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Jernav Tour and Travels'' operations. The company prides itself on its proactive and responsive customer service, ensuring that every traveler feels valued and supported throughout their journey. From the initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up, a dedicated team of experienced travel professionals is available to provide personalized assistance and address any concerns. Jernav fosters a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and supporting initiatives that promote tourism and cultural preservation. The company''s knowledgeable and passionate tour guides, many of whom are locals themselves, provide travelers with authentic insights into Assam''s history, culture, and traditions. Jernav Tour and Travels goes the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction, offering flexible booking options, transparent pricing, and a commitment to resolving any issues promptly and efficiently. This dedication to exceptional customer service has earned the company a loyal customer base and a strong reputation within the local community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Jernav Tour and Travels envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam tourism sector and beyond. The company plans to further enhance its service offerings by incorporating innovative technologies and expanding its network of partners. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking and managing travel arrangements, as well as forging strategic alliances with local businesses and tourism organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices. Jernav aims to become a leading provider of specialized tour packages focusing on niche markets, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and cultural immersion programs. The company also plans to expand its reach to new international markets, attracting more foreign tourists to experience the beauty and diversity of Assam. Ultimately, Jernav Tour and Travels aspires to be recognized not only as a successful travel agency but also as a responsible and sustainable tourism operator that contributes to the economic development of the region and the preservation of its cultural heritage. The long-term goal is to establish Jernav as a household name synonymous with quality, reliability, and exceptional travel experiences in Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Ganeshguri', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:45:31.000Z'),
(1395, 'Koyeli Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Koyeli Travels, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Building No. 37, Rangamancha Path, Basistha Rd, near Housing Colony, is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to experiencing the rich tapestry of Assam and beyond. In a region renowned for its breathtaking landscapes, diverse cultures, and spiritual significance, Koyeli Travels has carved a niche for itself by offering bespoke travel solutions tailored to the discerning traveler. We pride ourselves on being intimately familiar with the nuances of the local landscape, allowing us to curate unique and immersive experiences that resonate deeply with both domestic and international visitors. Our commitment extends beyond simply booking flights and accommodations; we strive to create memories that last a lifetime. <br> <br>

In the competitive Assam travel market, Koyeli Travels stands out due to its personalized approach and unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction. While larger, national chains often offer standardized packages, we focus on understanding the individual needs and preferences of each client. This allows us to design customized itineraries that cater to specific interests, whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, or delving into the ancient history of the Kamakhya Temple. We are deeply rooted in the local community and actively promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit both travelers and the environment. <br> <br>

At the core of Koyeli Travels'' offerings are several key services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. These include:

*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries for individuals, families, and groups, catering to a wide range of interests such as cultural tours, wildlife expeditions, adventure travel, and religious pilgrimages. Our team of experienced travel consultants works closely with each client to understand their specific requirements and create a personalized travel plan that exceeds their expectations.

*   **Flight and Accommodation Booking:** We offer comprehensive flight and accommodation booking services, leveraging our extensive network of partners to secure the best deals and ensure a seamless travel experience. Our access to real-time information on flight availability and hotel rates allows us to provide our clients with the most up-to-date options.

*   **Car Rental Services:** To facilitate convenient and comfortable transportation, we provide a range of car rental options, from compact vehicles for city exploration to SUVs for off-road adventures. All our vehicles are well-maintained and driven by experienced, professional drivers.

*   **Assistance with Permits and Documentation:** Navigating the complexities of travel documentation can be daunting. Koyeli Travels offers assistance with obtaining necessary permits and visas, ensuring a hassle-free travel experience.

*   **Specialized Experiences:** We offer unique and curated experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail, such as tea estate visits, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and cultural immersion programs with local communities.

Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of Assam''s unique cultural and natural heritage. We don''t just sell trips; we sell authentic experiences that connect travelers with the heart and soul of the region. We are committed to showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam while promoting responsible tourism practices that benefit local communities. The increasing demand for personalized and authentic travel experiences underscores the relevance of our services in the current market. <br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Koyeli Travels. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service and personalized attention. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, our team is dedicated to ensuring a seamless and enjoyable travel experience. We go the extra mile to anticipate our clients'' needs and exceed their expectations. This commitment is reflected in our high customer satisfaction ratings and repeat business. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to their evolving needs. Furthermore, Koyeli Travels actively participates in local community events and supports local artisans and businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us and in promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit everyone. We frequently partner with local NGOs and community organizations to promote responsible tourism and support conservation efforts. <br> <br>

Looking ahead, Koyeli Travels envisions becoming the premier travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, personalized attention, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our range of services to include more niche travel options, such as eco-tourism and adventure travel, catering to the growing demand for unique and authentic experiences. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows customers to easily browse our offerings, book flights and accommodations, and manage their travel itineraries. We are also exploring partnerships with other travel agencies and tourism organizations to expand our reach and offer our customers a wider range of travel options. Our long-term goal is to not only grow our business but also to contribute to the sustainable development of the Assam tourism industry. We believe that by promoting responsible tourism practices and supporting local communities, we can help preserve the natural and cultural heritage of Assam for future generations. Ultimately, Koyeli Travels aims to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change in the tourism industry and a champion for the preservation of Assam''s unique beauty and culture.', 'Building No. 37, Rangamancha Path, Basistha Rd, near Housing Colony', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:50:10.000Z'),
(1396, 'Solitude Travel Solutions Pvt LTD', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Solitude Travel Solutions Pvt LTD, strategically located on Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near Bimala Bibah Bhawan, is emerging as a premier travel management company in the heart of Assam. Unlike conventional travel agencies, Solitude Travel Solutions is built on a foundation of understanding the unique travel needs and aspirations of the local populace, combined with a commitment to providing personalized and seamless travel experiences. Our presence near a landmark such as Bimala Bibah Bhawan underscores our rootedness within the community and accessibility for our clientele. We strive to be more than just a travel provider; we aim to be a trusted partner in curating unforgettable journeys for both leisure and business travelers across Assam and beyond. The Assam travel market presents a unique blend of domestic and international tourism, with a growing demand for tailored travel solutions, and Solitude Travel Solutions is uniquely positioned to capitalize on this burgeoning market.

<br> <br>

At Solitude Travel Solutions, our core offering revolves around providing comprehensive travel solutions designed to cater to diverse needs. Our primary services include meticulously crafted holiday packages for individuals, families, and groups, with a special focus on showcasing the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India. We offer customizable itineraries that highlight the tea gardens of Upper Assam, the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas, and the serene landscapes of Majuli, the world''s largest river island. Furthermore, we specialize in facilitating corporate travel, providing seamless booking and logistical support for businesses of all sizes. This includes handling flight bookings, accommodation arrangements, transportation logistics, and event management services, all tailored to meet the specific requirements and budgets of our corporate clients. A key differentiator lies in our commitment to providing personalized attention. We assign dedicated travel consultants to each client, ensuring a consistent and knowledgeable point of contact throughout the entire travel planning and execution process. This personalized touch, combined with our competitive pricing and extensive network of local partners, sets us apart from other travel agencies in the region.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of our business philosophy. We believe in building long-lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service and exceeding their expectations at every touchpoint. Our team is composed of highly trained and experienced travel professionals who possess in-depth knowledge of the travel industry and a genuine passion for helping our clients create memorable travel experiences. We prioritize proactive communication, keeping our clients informed about their travel plans, potential disruptions, and any necessary updates. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our clients after each trip to identify areas for improvement and ensure that we are continuously enhancing our service offerings. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond providing travel services. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We understand the importance of preserving the cultural heritage and natural environment of Assam and strive to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the economic well-being of the local community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Solitude Travel Solutions envisions itself as the leading travel management company in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized travel packages, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion programs. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online booking platform and provide our clients with a more seamless and user-friendly experience. This includes developing a mobile app that allows clients to manage their travel itineraries, access real-time flight information, and communicate with our team on the go. We are committed to continuous learning and development, ensuring that our team stays abreast of the latest trends and best practices in the travel industry. This includes attending industry conferences, participating in training programs, and fostering a culture of innovation and creativity within the company. Our long-term goal is to not only grow our business but also to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, creating economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region''s rich cultural heritage and natural environment for future generations. We aim to be synonymous with reliable, responsible, and enriching travel experiences.', 'Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near Bimala Bibah Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:50:16.000Z'),
(1397, 'Heaven tours & travel', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Heaven Tours & Travel stands as a prominent travel agency located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at BB Complex, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Gauhati Commerce College Boys Hostel. Dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences, Heaven Tours & Travel caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from individual leisure travelers and families seeking memorable vacations to corporate clients requiring seamless business travel arrangements. Situated in a bustling area known for its educational institutions and commercial activity, the agency has established itself as a reliable and trustworthy partner for all travel needs within Assam and beyond.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Understanding the unique cultural tapestry and natural beauty of Assam and Northeast India, Heaven Tours & Travel distinguishes itself by offering curated itineraries that delve beyond typical tourist destinations. While providing standard travel services like flight and hotel bookings, their strength lies in crafting bespoke travel plans that cater to specific interests, whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, or experiencing the vibrant festivals and traditions of the region. For those venturing outside the Northeast, Heaven Tours & Travel provides comprehensive international and domestic travel packages, ensuring every detail is meticulously planned, from visa assistance to ground transportation. A key differentiator is their commitment to sustainable tourism, promoting eco-friendly practices and supporting local communities through responsible travel initiatives. The agency''s knowledge of the local market, combined with its global reach through established partnerships with airlines, hotels, and tour operators, allows them to offer competitive pricing without compromising on quality or personalized service. This focus on delivering exceptional value tailored to the needs of the local populace makes Heaven Tours & Travel a valued asset in the Assam business landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Heaven Tours & Travel offers a wide array of core services and products designed to meet the diverse travel needs of its clientele. These include: <br> <br> <b>Flight Bookings:</b> Facilitating both domestic and international flight bookings with a focus on securing the most convenient routes and competitive fares.<br> <br> <b>Hotel Reservations:</b> Providing access to a vast network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, catering to various budgets and preferences. <br> <br> <b>Tour Packages:</b> Crafting customized tour packages within Assam, Northeast India, and across the globe, designed to suit individual interests, be it adventure, cultural exploration, or relaxation. This includes meticulously planned itineraries, experienced guides, and comfortable transportation. <br> <br> <b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> Offering comprehensive travel management solutions for businesses, including efficient booking processes, expense tracking, and travel policy compliance. <br> <br> <b>Visa Assistance:</b> Providing expert guidance and support throughout the visa application process, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free experience. <br> <br> <b>Car Rentals:</b> Arranging reliable car rental services for convenient self-drive or chauffeur-driven experiences. <br> <br> <b>Travel Insurance:</b> Offering comprehensive travel insurance plans to protect travelers against unforeseen circumstances. <br> <br> Heaven Tours & Travel''s unique selling point lies in its personalized approach and deep understanding of the local market. They prioritize building strong relationships with their customers, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Their ability to create customized itineraries that showcase the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India, while ensuring seamless logistics and exceptional service, sets them apart from larger, more impersonal travel agencies.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Heaven Tours & Travel, customer experience is paramount. They strive to create a warm, welcoming, and professional environment where customers feel valued and understood. The agency''s approach to customer service is built on three pillars: personalized attention, proactive communication, and problem-solving. The team at Heaven Tours & Travel takes the time to understand each customer''s specific needs and preferences, crafting tailored travel solutions that exceed expectations. They maintain open and transparent communication throughout the entire travel planning process, providing timely updates and addressing any concerns promptly. In the event of unforeseen issues or travel disruptions, the agency is committed to providing immediate assistance and finding effective solutions to minimize inconvenience. Beyond providing exceptional travel services, Heaven Tours & Travel actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events and participation in tourism initiatives. They understand the importance of fostering strong relationships within the community and contributing to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Assam. By supporting local artisans, promoting responsible travel practices, and showcasing the region''s rich cultural heritage, Heaven Tours & Travel aims to connect with the community on a deeper level and contribute to its overall well-being. They see their customers not just as clients, but as partners in promoting the beauty and diversity of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, Heaven Tours & Travel envisions significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading travel agency in Assam and Northeast India. The agency plans to leverage technology to enhance its online presence and streamline its booking processes, making it even easier for customers to access its services. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app with features such as online booking, real-time travel updates, and personalized recommendations. Furthermore, Heaven Tours & Travel aims to expand its network of partnerships with local businesses, hotels, and tour operators, further enriching its offerings and supporting the local economy. A key strategic focus will be on developing new and innovative tour packages that showcase the unique cultural and natural attractions of the region, attracting both domestic and international tourists. This includes exploring niche tourism segments such as eco-tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural immersion experiences. In the long term, Heaven Tours & Travel aspires to become a recognized brand synonymous with quality, reliability, and sustainable tourism practices. They aim to be a catalyst for the growth of the tourism industry in Assam, creating employment opportunities, supporting local communities, and promoting responsible travel that protects the region''s natural and cultural heritage. By continuously innovating, adapting to changing market trends, and staying true to its core values of customer service and community engagement, Heaven Tours & Travel is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious goals and leave a lasting positive impact on the travel landscape of Assam.</p>', 'BB Complex, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Gauhati commerce college Boys Hostel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:50:24.000Z'),
(1398, 'NIRMALA TOURS & TRAVELS', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'NIRMALA TOURS & TRAVELS, nestled in the heart of Professor Gali, S.S. Rd, represents a cornerstone of Assam’s burgeoning tourism sector. More than just a travel agency, Nirmala Tours & Travels embodies a deep understanding of the region''s unique cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty. We act as curators of immersive experiences, connecting travelers with the soul of Assam and beyond. Our commitment extends beyond mere travel arrangements; we strive to foster sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and preserve the environment for generations to come. We''ve carved a niche for ourselves by prioritizing personalized service and showcasing the authentic spirit of Northeast India, differentiating ourselves from larger, more impersonal travel conglomerates.

<br> <br>

At the core of our offerings are meticulously crafted tour packages designed to cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. From spiritual journeys to the revered Kamakhya Temple and thrilling wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, to serene explorations of tea gardens in Upper Assam and adventurous treks in the Himalayan foothills of Arunachal Pradesh, we offer a comprehensive portfolio. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to tailor itineraries to individual preferences, ensuring a truly bespoke travel experience. Furthermore, we provide comprehensive travel services, including flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings, car rentals, and visa assistance, making us a one-stop shop for all travel needs. Nirmala Tours & Travels directly addresses the growing demand for reliable and authentic travel experiences in Assam, offering expertly planned and executed trips that showcase the region''s hidden gems and cultural richness.

<br> <br>

Customer service is paramount at Nirmala Tours & Travels. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, understanding their needs, and exceeding their expectations at every turn. Our dedicated team of experienced travel professionals, fluent in local languages and possessing in-depth knowledge of the region, goes the extra mile to ensure a seamless and memorable journey for each traveler. We actively seek feedback and continuously strive to improve our services based on customer input. We pride ourselves on our transparent and ethical business practices, fostering trust and loyalty within our clientele. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond responsible tourism; we actively participate in local events, support local artisans, and promote sustainable initiatives that benefit the region. This deep connection to the community not only enhances the travel experience for our clients but also contributes to the overall well-being of Assam.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Nirmala Tours & Travels envisions itself as a leading force in promoting sustainable and responsible tourism throughout Northeast India. We aim to expand our service offerings to include eco-tourism initiatives, community-based tourism projects, and educational travel programs that promote cultural exchange and understanding. We plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and reach a wider audience, while maintaining our commitment to personalized service. Furthermore, we are exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to create synergistic relationships that benefit the entire tourism ecosystem. Our long-term goal is to establish Nirmala Tours & Travels as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism practices, contributing significantly to the economic growth and cultural preservation of Assam and the wider Northeast region.', 'Professor Gali, S.S. Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.319Z', '2025-12-07T04:50:30.000Z'),
(1399, 'Imity Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Imity Travels, located at House no 13, 2nd Floor, K C Patowary Rd, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences tailored to the unique needs and preferences of the Assam community and beyond. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys, offering personalized service and expert knowledge that sets us apart in a competitive market. Our deep understanding of the local culture and landscape, combined with a commitment to sustainable tourism practices, positions Imity Travels as a significant contributor to the burgeoning travel sector in Assam. We strive to not only facilitate travel but also to foster a deeper appreciation for the beauty and diversity of our region and the world.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Imity Travels are our core services, designed to cover a wide spectrum of travel needs. We specialize in crafting customized tour packages, both within Assam and to destinations worldwide. These packages are meticulously planned, incorporating accommodations, transportation, sightseeing, and activities tailored to individual interests and budgets. For corporate clients, we offer comprehensive travel management solutions, including booking flights, hotels, and ground transportation, while adhering to corporate travel policies and maximizing cost-effectiveness. Our ticketing services encompass both domestic and international flights, ensuring competitive pricing and seamless booking processes. Furthermore, we provide visa assistance services, guiding our clients through the often-complex application process with expertise and efficiency.

<br> <br>

What truly distinguishes Imity Travels is our unwavering commitment to personalized service. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we take the time to listen to their individual needs and aspirations. Our experienced travel consultants possess an intimate knowledge of various destinations and travel options, enabling them to provide insightful recommendations and create bespoke itineraries that exceed expectations. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness and accessibility, ensuring that our clients receive prompt and attentive support throughout their journey, from initial consultation to post-trip follow-up. By building strong relationships with local hotels, tour operators, and transportation providers, we are able to secure exclusive deals and offer our clients exceptional value. This personalized approach extends to our engagement with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, promoting sustainable tourism practices and supporting local businesses, thereby contributing to the economic well-being of the region.

