(1405, 'G Northeast Tour & Travels In Guwahati', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>G Northeast Tour & Travels In Guwahati stands as a dedicated and reliable travel partner, deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. Operating from Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, we specialize in curating unforgettable travel experiences that showcase the region''s breathtaking natural beauty, rich cultural heritage, and unique biodiversity. We are more than just a travel agency; we are passionate ambassadors for the Northeast, committed to sustainable tourism practices and enriching the lives of both our travelers and the local communities we interact with. Our significance in the local business landscape stems from our focus on providing authentic experiences, supporting local artisans and businesses, and promoting responsible travel that preserves the region''s pristine environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service offerings encompass a wide range of travel solutions designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. We provide expertly crafted tour packages, including cultural immersion tours, wildlife safaris, adventure treks, and spiritual journeys. These packages are meticulously planned to maximize the traveler''s experience, incorporating comfortable accommodations, reliable transportation, and knowledgeable local guides. A key differentiator is our ability to customize itineraries to meet individual requirements, whether it''s a solo traveler seeking solitude or a large group looking for a shared adventure. We also offer comprehensive travel planning services, including flight and train ticket bookings, hotel reservations, visa assistance, and travel insurance. For those seeking independent exploration, we provide car rental services with experienced drivers familiar with the region''s challenging terrain. Our commitment to using locally owned businesses whenever possible ensures that tourism revenue directly benefits the communities we visit. Understanding the specific needs of travelers visiting Assam and the Northeast, we place a strong emphasis on safety, security, and reliable communication, providing 24/7 support to our clients throughout their journey. Furthermore, we actively promote eco-friendly travel options and work with local communities to develop sustainable tourism initiatives, ensuring that our operations contribute positively to the environment and the local economy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At G Northeast Tour & Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered on building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations at every stage of their journey. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, we strive to provide personalized attention and prompt, efficient service. Our team comprises experienced travel professionals who are passionate about the Northeast and possess in-depth knowledge of the region''s attractions, cultures, and logistics. We are committed to providing accurate and up-to-date information, addressing any concerns promptly, and resolving any issues efficiently. What sets us apart is our dedication to creating a genuine connection with our clients. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that every traveler has a memorable and fulfilling experience. We also foster strong relationships with local communities, working closely with them to develop authentic cultural experiences and support their economic development. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing travel services; we aim to create a positive impact on the local community and contribute to the sustainable development of the region. By participating in local festivals and events, supporting local artisans, and promoting responsible tourism practices, we strive to be an integral part of the community we serve.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, G Northeast Tour & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Guwahati and a recognized authority on travel to Northeast India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours catering to niche interests such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and tribal art and culture. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism initiatives in partnership with local communities, promoting sustainable tourism practices and preserving the region''s natural heritage. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We plan to invest in a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse tour packages, customize itineraries, and book travel services. We also aim to utilize social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote the unique attractions of Northeast India. Our long-term goals include establishing a training academy to develop the skills of local youth in the tourism sector, creating employment opportunities, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We are committed to responsible growth, ensuring that our operations benefit both our clients and the communities we serve. Ultimately, we aspire to be recognized not just as a travel agency, but as a trusted partner in promoting the sustainable development of Northeast India and showcasing its beauty and cultural richness to the world.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:00:09.000Z'),
(1406, 'Krishnaguru Tours & Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Krishnaguru Tours & Travels, nestled on Rodali Path in the heart of Assam, is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to experiencing the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Northeast India. We are a locally rooted company, deeply connected to the community and dedicated to providing authentic and enriching travel experiences that showcase the unique spirit of Assam and its neighboring states. In a region where tourism is increasingly vital, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels stands out by prioritizing sustainable practices, supporting local communities, and offering personalized service that goes beyond the typical tourist itinerary.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around crafting unforgettable travel experiences tailored to the diverse interests of our clientele. We offer a comprehensive range of travel solutions, including expertly curated tour packages focusing on Assam''s famed tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park (renowned for its one-horned rhinoceros), and the ancient temples and historical sites that dot the landscape. Beyond pre-packaged tours, we specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that cater to individual preferences and group needs, whether it''s a spiritual journey, an adventure trek in the Himalayas, or a cultural immersion experience focusing on local crafts and traditions. A key differentiator is our emphasis on off-the-beaten-path destinations, allowing travelers to discover the hidden gems of Assam and experience the region’s authentic charm away from the crowded tourist circuits. We also provide reliable and efficient transportation services, including car rentals with experienced local drivers who possess invaluable knowledge of the region’s roads and culture. Furthermore, we offer flight and train ticketing services, hotel booking assistance, and visa support, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free travel experience for our customers. By combining local expertise with global travel standards, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels effectively bridges the gap between the adventurous traveler and the often-unfamiliar terrain of Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Krishnaguru Tours & Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful travel business. Our approach is centered on building genuine relationships with our customers, understanding their individual needs and aspirations, and going the extra mile to exceed their expectations. We pride ourselves on our personalized attention, from the initial consultation to the final farewell. Our team of experienced travel consultants is passionate about Assam and dedicated to providing expert advice and support throughout the entire travel planning process. We are readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and offer valuable insights into the region''s culture, customs, and etiquette. Moreover, we actively engage with the local community by partnering with local artisans, homestays, and businesses. This not only provides our customers with an authentic and immersive experience but also contributes to the economic empowerment of local communities. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, showcasing our commitment to promoting Assam''s rich cultural heritage. We believe that tourism should be a force for good, and we strive to operate in a responsible and sustainable manner, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the communities we serve. Our commitment to ethical and responsible tourism has earned us the trust and respect of the local community, making us a preferred partner for travelers seeking an authentic and meaningful experience in Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and culturally immersive travel experiences in Northeast India. We plan to expand our operations by developing new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as eco-tourism, adventure tourism, and wellness tourism. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking process, making it easier for customers to plan and book their trips. A key priority is to further strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its economic opportunities. We plan to launch initiatives to promote local handicrafts, traditional cuisine, and cultural performances, providing travelers with a unique and authentic experience while supporting local livelihoods. We also aim to expand our reach beyond Assam, offering tours to other states in Northeast India, such as Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, and Nagaland, showcasing the region''s diverse landscapes and cultures. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting responsible tourism practices, educating travelers about the importance of respecting local cultures and protecting the environment. By combining our passion for travel with our commitment to sustainability and community empowerment, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India.</p>', 'Rodali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:00:16.000Z'),
(1407, 'Lalita Tour & Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Lalita Tour & Travels, strategically located at H/N-16, NH-27 in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to providing seamless, enriching, and unforgettable travel experiences. Understanding the unique allure and inherent challenges of navigating the diverse landscapes of Northeast India, Lalita Tour & Travels has established itself as a trusted partner for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic cultural immersion and breathtaking natural beauty. Unlike generic travel agencies, Lalita Tour & Travels focuses on crafting personalized itineraries that cater to individual preferences, ensuring that every journey is tailored to create lasting memories. Operating within a vibrant and culturally rich environment, Lalita Tour & Travels plays a vital role in promoting sustainable tourism and showcasing the hidden gems of Assam and the surrounding region. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we are curators of experiences, connecting travelers with the soul of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service offerings encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions, designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. These include meticulously planned tour packages focusing on Assam''s wildlife sanctuaries (Kaziranga, Manas, etc.), its tea gardens, cultural sites, and spiritual destinations. We also specialize in customized itinerary design, crafting unique travel plans based on individual interests, budget, and time constraints. Our transport services ensure comfortable and reliable travel, offering a fleet of well-maintained vehicles with experienced drivers familiar with the local terrain. Furthermore, we provide hotel booking services, securing accommodations that range from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts, ensuring a comfortable stay for all our clients. We offer specialized tour packages catering to specific interests such as bird watching tours in key hotspots, adventure activities like river rafting and trekking, and cultural immersion experiences involving interactions with local communities and participation in traditional festivals. What sets Lalita Tour & Travels apart is our deep understanding of the local ecosystem and our commitment to responsible tourism. We prioritize working with local guides and businesses, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community while ensuring that our tours minimize environmental impact and respect local cultures. We bridge the gap between visitor expectations and the authentic experiences that Assam has to offer.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Lalita Tour & Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service at every stage of their journey. Our approach is centered on understanding individual needs and exceeding expectations through personalized attention and meticulous planning. We maintain a team of knowledgeable and friendly travel consultants who are readily available to assist clients with their inquiries, provide expert advice, and ensure a smooth and hassle-free travel experience. We foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and initiatives. We also partner with local artisans and businesses to promote their products and services, contributing to the economic well-being of the community. This commitment extends to our interaction with clients where we strive to provide accurate and informative cultural insights, enriching their understanding and appreciation of the local heritage. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable practices, combined with our dedication to customer satisfaction, creates a unique and positive experience for every traveler, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Lalita Tour & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable practices. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass a wider range of travel experiences, such as specialized eco-tourism packages and community-based tourism initiatives. We aim to leverage technology to enhance our customer service capabilities, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information. We also plan to forge strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, such as hotels, airlines, and tour operators, to expand our reach and offer a more comprehensive range of services. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service. Our long-term goal is to establish Lalita Tour & Travels as a trusted and reliable brand that embodies the spirit of Assam, promoting sustainable tourism and contributing to the economic and cultural development of the region. We aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam to the world while preserving its unique heritage for future generations.</p>', 'H/N-16, NH-27', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:00:22.000Z'),
(1408, 'THIS TRAVEL COMPANY', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p><b>THIS TRAVEL COMPANY: Exploring Assam and Beyond from the Heart of Guwahati</b></p>

<p>Nestled in the serene Santi Enclave, Shakuntala Path, THIS TRAVEL COMPANY stands as a premier travel solution provider, deeply rooted in the vibrant landscape of Assam. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of experiences, dedicated to showcasing the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking natural beauty, and warm hospitality that defines this unique corner of India. Understanding the nuanced needs of both local travelers and those venturing into Assam from afar, we have cultivated a reputation for personalized service, meticulous planning, and a commitment to creating unforgettable journeys. In a region with burgeoning tourism potential, THIS TRAVEL COMPANY plays a pivotal role in connecting travelers with authentic Assam, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy and promoting responsible tourism practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>Core Services: Tailored Travel for Every Explorer</b></p>

<p>THIS TRAVEL COMPANY offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. Our core offerings include:
<br>
<b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries that reflect individual preferences, interests, and budgets. Whether it’s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, cruising down the majestic Brahmaputra River, or delving into the spiritual heart of Majuli, we design experiences that resonate.
<br>
<b>Accommodation Booking:</b> From luxurious resorts to charming homestays, we have established strong partnerships with a wide range of accommodation providers across Assam and Northeast India. This enables us to secure the best deals and ensure comfortable and authentic lodging options for our clients.
<br>
<b>Transportation Solutions:</b> Navigating the region can be challenging, so we offer reliable and convenient transportation options, including private car rentals with experienced drivers, airport transfers, and pre-booked transportation for tours.
<br>
<b>Adventure Travel:</b> For thrill-seekers, we organize trekking expeditions in the Eastern Himalayas, river rafting adventures, and wildlife encounters, all conducted with a focus on safety and environmental responsibility.
<br>
<b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> We provide comprehensive travel solutions for businesses, including flight booking, hotel reservations, and ground transportation, tailored to meet the specific needs of corporate travelers.
<br> <br>
Our unique selling point lies in our deep local knowledge and personalized approach. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we immerse ourselves in understanding our clients'' desires and crafting journeys that exceed expectations. We leverage our network of local guides, artisans, and community partners to provide authentic and enriching experiences that are not readily available through mainstream travel agencies. This commitment to authenticity and personalization is what sets us apart from the competition. We address the local market needs by offering accessible and affordable travel options, promoting local tourism circuits, and providing employment opportunities for individuals within the community. </p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>The THIS TRAVEL COMPANY Customer Experience: Personalized and Community-Focused</b></p>

<p>At THIS TRAVEL COMPANY, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, treating each traveler as an individual with unique needs and aspirations. Our dedicated team of travel consultants provides personalized attention from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. We are readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and provide expert advice, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We proactively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet evolving needs.
<br> <br>
We are deeply committed to the local community and actively participate in initiatives that promote sustainable tourism and support local businesses. We partner with local artisans and craftspeople, showcasing their work and providing them with opportunities to reach a wider audience. We also support community-based tourism projects, empowering local communities to benefit from tourism while preserving their cultural heritage and protecting the environment. By actively engaging with the local community, we foster a sense of mutual respect and contribute to the sustainable development of the region. We participate in local festivals and events, further strengthening our connection with the community and demonstrating our commitment to supporting local culture. </p>

<br> <br>

<p><b>A Vision for the Future: Expanding Horizons and Sustainable Growth</b></p>

<p>Looking ahead, THIS TRAVEL COMPANY envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam and Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to personalized service, authentic experiences, and sustainable tourism practices. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as tea tourism, birdwatching, and cultural immersion. We also aim to strengthen our online presence, making our services more accessible to travelers both within India and internationally.
<br> <br>
A key focus will be on promoting sustainable tourism practices, working with local communities to develop eco-friendly tourism initiatives and minimizing our environmental impact. We plan to invest in training programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they are equipped with the knowledge and skills to deliver exceptional service while promoting responsible tourism practices. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our operations to other parts of Northeast India, further showcasing the region''s diverse attractions to the world. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism development in Assam and Northeast India, contributing to the economic prosperity of the region while preserving its unique cultural heritage and natural environment. We believe that through innovation, collaboration, and a steadfast commitment to our values, THIS TRAVEL COMPANY can achieve its vision and continue to inspire travelers to explore the wonders of Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Santi Enclave, Shakuntala Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:00:29.000Z'),
(1409, 'TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS ( VISA - TOURS - FLIGHTS )', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS (VISA - TOURS - FLIGHTS) is a comprehensive travel solutions provider strategically located on the 1st floor, HN 26, Hengrabari Rd, opposite Axis Bank & SBI ATM, near the Public Health Office, in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a travel agency, TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS acts as a gateway to seamless and enriching travel experiences, catering to both domestic and international destinations. In Assam''s vibrant and increasingly interconnected business landscape, TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS fills a crucial need by simplifying the often-complex process of travel planning, visa acquisition, and flight booking, enabling individuals and businesses alike to focus on the purpose of their journey rather than the logistical hurdles.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the core of TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS'' offerings lie three key services: Visa Assistance, Tour Packages, and Flight Bookings. The Visa Assistance service is particularly crucial, offering expert guidance and support through the often-daunting visa application process for various countries. This includes document verification, application form assistance, interview preparation (where applicable), and timely updates on application status. This service significantly reduces the stress and uncertainty associated with visa acquisition, increasing the likelihood of a successful application. Tour Packages are meticulously crafted to cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. From exploring the natural beauty of Assam and the Northeast to venturing to exotic international locales, TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS offers pre-designed packages and bespoke itineraries tailored to individual preferences. These packages often include accommodation, transportation, sightseeing, and experienced guides, ensuring a hassle-free and immersive travel experience. Finally, the Flight Booking service provides access to a comprehensive network of airlines, offering competitive fares and convenient flight options to destinations worldwide. The agency’s expertise in finding optimal flight routes and securing the best deals makes it a valuable resource for both leisure and business travelers. What truly sets TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS apart is its integrated approach, combining these three core services to offer a complete travel solution under one roof. This "one-stop-shop" convenience saves customers time and effort, making it a highly attractive option in the local market.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS is committed to providing an exceptional customer experience. The agency understands that travel planning can be overwhelming, and its team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants is dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert guidance at every step of the way. The approach is not simply transactional; it’s about building lasting relationships with customers based on trust and reliability. The team takes the time to understand each client''s unique needs and preferences, offering tailored solutions that exceed expectations. Beyond the services provided, TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and partnering with local businesses. This commitment to community involvement fosters goodwill and strengthens the agency’s reputation as a responsible and trustworthy member of the Guwahati business ecosystem. The easily accessible location opposite Axis Bank & SBI ATM, near the Public Health Office, further contributes to the convenience and accessibility of the agency, making it a natural choice for local residents and businesses seeking reliable travel solutions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS envisions significant growth and expansion. The agency plans to leverage technology to enhance its services, including developing a user-friendly online platform for booking flights, browsing tour packages, and accessing visa information. Further expansion of tour offerings is planned, focusing on niche markets such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion experiences, both within Assam and internationally. The agency also aims to strengthen its partnerships with local hotels, transportation providers, and other tourism-related businesses to create a more comprehensive and integrated travel ecosystem. Long-term goals include establishing TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS as a leading travel agency in Northeast India, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to responsible tourism. By consistently exceeding customer expectations and adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market, TRAIASIAN HOLIDAYS is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam and beyond.</p>', '1st floor, HN 26, Hengrabari Rd, opposite Axis Bank & SBI ATM, near Public Health Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:00:36.000Z'),
(1410, 'Avani Travel Services', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Avani Travel Services, conveniently located besides Rajasthan Lime Udyog, stands as a trusted and comprehensive travel solutions provider within the vibrant Assam business environment. More than just a booking agency, Avani Travel Services is dedicated to crafting personalized travel experiences, catering to the diverse needs of leisure travelers, corporate clients, and those seeking specialized Assam tours. Recognizing the growing demand for seamless and reliable travel arrangements, particularly within the context of Assam''s increasing connectivity and tourism potential, Avani Travel Services aims to be the premier choice for all travel-related requirements in the region. We pride ourselves on our in-depth understanding of local nuances coupled with a global perspective, enabling us to offer tailored solutions that exceed expectations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Avani Travel Services lies a commitment to providing a complete suite of travel services designed to simplify and enhance every journey. Our core offerings include: flight bookings (both domestic and international), accommodation arrangements (ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts), comprehensive tour packages (focusing on Assam''s rich cultural heritage and natural beauty), car rental services (with options for self-drive or chauffeur-driven vehicles), and assistance with travel insurance and visa applications. What distinguishes Avani Travel Services is our ability to curate unique, experience-based tours that showcase the hidden gems of Assam. Unlike generic travel agencies, we specialize in crafting itineraries that delve into the local culture, explore off-the-beaten-path destinations, and offer authentic interactions with local communities. This specialization is particularly appealing to travelers seeking meaningful and enriching travel experiences. Our strong relationships with local hotels, transportation providers, and tour guides further allow us to offer competitive pricing without compromising on quality. Furthermore, we understand the critical importance of reliable information and proactive support. Thus, we ensure our clients are well-informed and supported throughout their journey, from initial planning to their safe return.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer service is paramount at Avani Travel Services. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and personalized attention. Our dedicated team of travel consultants are not just booking agents; they are travel advisors who take the time to understand each client''s individual needs and preferences. Whether it''s arranging a romantic getaway, organizing a corporate retreat, or planning a family adventure, we strive to create a bespoke travel experience that perfectly aligns with the client''s vision. Our approach is characterized by responsiveness, flexibility, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. We understand the importance of prompt communication and are readily available to address any queries or concerns, both before, during, and after the trip. Avani Travel Services is also deeply committed to connecting with the local community. We actively partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism and support local initiatives. We believe that responsible tourism is essential for preserving Assam''s natural and cultural heritage, and we encourage our clients to engage in activities that benefit the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Avani Travel Services envisions becoming the leading travel solutions provider in Assam, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative tour packages, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our range of specialized tours to cater to niche interests, such as wildlife tourism, tea tourism, and adventure tourism. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including the development of a user-friendly online booking platform and a mobile app that provides real-time travel updates and support. Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations to create a more vibrant and sustainable tourism ecosystem. This includes collaborating with local artisans and craftspeople to offer unique souvenirs and experiences, as well as supporting initiatives that promote responsible waste management and environmental conservation. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to contribute to the growth and development of Assam''s tourism industry while preserving its natural and cultural heritage for future generations. By focusing on customer satisfaction, innovation, and sustainability, Avani Travel Services is poised to achieve significant growth and become a valuable asset to the Assam business community.</p>', 'Besides Rajasthan Lime Udyog', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:05:08.000Z'),
(1411, 'Green valley Tours & Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Green Valley Tours & Travels stands as a premier tour and travel agency nestled in the heart of Assam, a region renowned for its verdant landscapes, rich cultural heritage, and unparalleled biodiversity. More than just a travel provider, we are curators of authentic Assamese experiences, committed to showcasing the beauty and wonder of this enchanting corner of India to the discerning traveler. Green Valley Tours & Travels differentiates itself by focusing on responsible and sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our operations contribute positively to the local environment and communities. Our deep understanding of the region allows us to offer unique itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trail, fostering a deeper connection between visitors and the land.

<br> <br>

Our core services revolve around crafting personalized travel experiences tailored to the individual needs and preferences of our clients. We offer a diverse range of options, including guided tours of Assam''s famed tea gardens, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (a UNESCO World Heritage Site and home to the one-horned rhinoceros), river cruises on the majestic Brahmaputra River, and cultural immersion programs that provide insights into the traditions and lifestyles of various Assamese communities. Our expertly designed tour packages cater to solo travelers, families, and groups, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable journey. What sets us apart is our commitment to small-group travel, allowing for more intimate and enriching experiences. We also specialize in bespoke itineraries, working closely with our clients to create tailor-made adventures that perfectly align with their interests, time constraints, and budget. Furthermore, we handle all aspects of travel planning, from transportation and accommodation to permits and local guides, providing a complete and hassle-free service. Our services specifically address the growing demand for authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Assam, allowing visitors to explore the region responsibly while supporting local economies.

<br> <br>

At Green Valley Tours & Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe that exceptional service is the cornerstone of a successful travel business, and we go above and beyond to ensure that every client''s experience is positive and memorable. Our team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants are passionate about Assam and dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert advice. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, we are committed to providing prompt, courteous, and efficient service. We maintain strong relationships with local hotels, guesthouses, and transportation providers, enabling us to secure the best possible rates and ensure a comfortable and reliable travel experience. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing travel arrangements; we strive to connect our clients with the local community by supporting local businesses and promoting responsible tourism practices. We partner with local artisans, restaurants, and cultural organizations to provide authentic and enriching experiences that benefit the entire community. Our community involvement fosters goodwill and strengthens our reputation as a responsible and ethical business.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Green Valley Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading tour operator in Assam, recognized for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel experiences. We plan to expand our range of offerings to include specialized tours focused on eco-tourism, birdwatching, and adventure travel, catering to the growing demand for niche tourism products. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local communities to develop community-based tourism initiatives, empowering local residents and promoting sustainable economic development. Furthermore, we are investing in technology to enhance our online presence and improve the efficiency of our booking and communication processes. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that provides travelers with easy access to information about our services and destinations. We recognize the importance of sustainable growth and are committed to ensuring that our operations have a minimal impact on the environment. We will continue to work closely with local communities and organizations to promote responsible tourism practices and protect the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam for future generations. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving tourism industry in Assam that benefits both visitors and local communities alike.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:05:14.000Z'),
(1412, 'KHAREL TRAVELS', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p><strong>KHAREL TRAVELS: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</strong></p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Shop No 340, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Downtown Hospital Kamrup, KHAREL TRAVELS is more than just a travel agency; it''s a dedicated partner for crafting unforgettable travel experiences. In a region renowned for its breathtaking landscapes, rich cultural heritage, and burgeoning tourism sector, KHAREL TRAVELS stands out by offering personalized travel solutions tailored to both local residents and visitors eager to explore the wonders of Assam and beyond. We understand the unique needs of travelers in this dynamic environment and strive to provide seamless, reliable, and enriching travel services that exceed expectations. KHAREL TRAVELS is committed to fostering responsible tourism and promoting the beauty and culture of Assam to the world, while simultaneously catering to the diverse travel needs of the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing comprehensive travel solutions designed to simplify and enhance the travel experience. These services include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Domestic and International Flight Bookings:</strong> We offer competitive pricing and a wide selection of flight options, ensuring travelers find the best deals for their desired destinations. Our experienced agents assist with itinerary planning, seat selection, and baggage allowances, providing a hassle-free booking experience.</li>
  <li><strong>Tailor-Made Tour Packages:</strong> We specialize in creating personalized tour packages that cater to individual preferences and budgets. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, embarking on a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, or venturing into the serene hills of Meghalaya, we curate unique itineraries that showcase the region''s natural beauty and cultural richness. Our packages can include transportation, accommodation, sightseeing, and guided tours.</li>
  <li><strong>Hotel and Accommodation Bookings:</strong> We have established strong partnerships with a wide range of hotels and guesthouses, from budget-friendly options to luxury resorts. We ensure our clients have access to comfortable and convenient accommodations that suit their needs and preferences.</li>
  <li><strong>Car Rental Services:</strong> We provide reliable car rental services, offering a diverse fleet of vehicles to suit different group sizes and travel needs. Our experienced drivers ensure safe and comfortable transportation to various destinations within Assam and neighboring states.</li>
  <li><strong>Assistance with Travel Documentation:</strong> We offer assistance with visa applications, passport renewals, and other travel documentation, simplifying the often-complex process for our clients.</li>
</ul>

<p>What sets KHAREL TRAVELS apart is our commitment to providing personalized service, our in-depth knowledge of the local region, and our ability to create truly unique travel experiences. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we strive to understand our clients'' needs and preferences, crafting itineraries that reflect their individual interests and passions. Our unique selling point is our ability to blend convenience with cultural immersion, ensuring that every journey is both seamless and enriching. We understand the importance of responsible tourism and work with local communities to promote sustainable practices that benefit both travelers and the environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At KHAREL TRAVELS, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients based on trust, reliability, and exceptional service. Our team of dedicated travel professionals is committed to providing prompt and personalized assistance, ensuring that every customer feels valued and supported. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet their evolving needs. We understand the importance of being accessible and responsive, and we strive to provide timely and helpful assistance through various channels, including phone, email, and in-person consultations. Furthermore, KHAREL TRAVELS actively participates in local community events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of the region. We believe in supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit the entire community. We regularly collaborate with local artisans, cultural organizations, and tour operators to create authentic and immersive travel experiences that showcase the rich heritage of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, KHAREL TRAVELS envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the Kamrup region, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative tour packages, and commitment to responsible tourism. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include more specialized tours, such as adventure travel, cultural immersion experiences, and wellness retreats. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and provide a more seamless and convenient booking experience for our clients. We are committed to expanding our network of partners and collaborators, both locally and internationally, to offer our clients access to a wider range of travel options and destinations. Furthermore, we are dedicated to promoting sustainable tourism practices that minimize our environmental impact and benefit local communities. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the growth and development of the tourism sector in Assam, while preserving its natural beauty and cultural heritage for future generations.</p>', 'Shop No 340, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Downtown Hospital Kamrup', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:05:21.000Z'),
(1413, 'Natural Holidays', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Natural Holidays: Your Gateway to Authentic Assam</h1>

<p>Nestled on the 2nd floor of Assam Tourism, AK Azad Rd, Natural Holidays offers a curated selection of immersive travel experiences that showcase the rich biodiversity and cultural tapestry of Assam and the Northeast. More than just a travel agency, Natural Holidays acts as a bridge connecting discerning travellers with the hidden gems and untold stories of this enchanting region. We are deeply rooted in the local community, promoting sustainable tourism practices and ensuring that every journey contributes positively to the environment and the livelihoods of the people we work with. Our commitment lies in providing authentic and responsible travel solutions, making Natural Holidays a significant player in fostering sustainable tourism growth within the Assam business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Unveiling the Wonders of Assam</h2>

<p>Natural Holidays specializes in crafting bespoke travel itineraries tailored to the individual needs and interests of our clients. Our primary services encompass a wide range of offerings designed to explore the diverse facets of Assam:
</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
    <li><b>Wildlife Safaris and Ecotours:</b> Explore the renowned Kaziranga National Park, home to the one-horned rhinoceros, and other protected areas through expert-led safaris, birdwatching expeditions, and guided nature walks. We prioritize responsible wildlife viewing, ensuring minimal disturbance to the natural environment.</li>
    <li><b>Cultural Immersion Tours:</b> Delve into the vibrant traditions of Assam''s diverse ethnic communities with homestay experiences, visits to traditional villages, and participation in local festivals. These tours offer a unique opportunity to connect with local cultures and learn about their unique way of life.</li>
    <li><b>Tea Tourism:</b> Discover the legacy of Assam''s tea industry with visits to sprawling tea estates, tea tasting sessions, and insights into the tea-making process. These tours offer a sensory journey through the verdant tea gardens that define the Assam landscape.</li>
    <li><b>River Cruises:</b> Experience the Brahmaputra River, the lifeline of Assam, through scenic river cruises that offer breathtaking views of the landscape and the opportunity to spot wildlife along the riverbanks.</li>
    <li><b>Trekking and Adventure Activities:</b> For the adventurous traveller, we offer trekking expeditions in the hills of Assam, as well as opportunities for river rafting, kayaking, and other adventure activities.</li>
    <li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> We excel in creating tailor-made travel plans that cater to specific interests, budgets, and time constraints. Whether it''s a romantic getaway, a family vacation, or a solo adventure, we can design the perfect itinerary for you.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling points lie in our in-depth knowledge of the region, our commitment to sustainable tourism, and our strong relationships with local communities. We go beyond the typical tourist experiences, offering authentic and enriching journeys that leave a lasting positive impact. We understand the local market''s need for responsible and sustainable travel options and strive to provide tours that are not only enjoyable but also beneficial to the environment and local communities.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships and Fostering Connections</h2>

<p>At Natural Holidays, we believe in building lasting relationships with our clients. Our approach to customer service is centered on providing personalized attention, prompt responsiveness, and a genuine commitment to ensuring a memorable and hassle-free travel experience. From the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, we are dedicated to exceeding our clients'' expectations. We offer multilingual support and are available to assist our clients at every stage of their journey.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, homestay providers, and artisans. We believe in empowering local communities through tourism and strive to create opportunities for economic growth and cultural preservation. We participate in local events and initiatives, promoting sustainable tourism practices and fostering a sense of pride in the region''s rich heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our commitment to responsible tourism and our deep understanding of the local culture set us apart from other travel agencies. We strive to create travel experiences that are not only enjoyable but also meaningful and transformative.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Championing Sustainable Tourism</h2>

<p>Natural Holidays envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast. Our future plans include expanding our product offerings to include more niche tourism segments, such as agro-tourism and wellness tourism. We are also committed to investing in technology to enhance the customer experience and streamline our operations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We aim to develop more community-based tourism initiatives, empowering local communities to participate in and benefit from tourism activities. We are also committed to promoting responsible tourism practices and minimizing the environmental impact of our operations. We envision a future where tourism contributes to the sustainable development of Assam and the Northeast, preserving its natural beauty and cultural heritage for generations to come. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as a recognized leader in sustainable tourism and contributing to the economic and social well-being of the communities we work with.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located on the 2nd floor of Assam Tourism, AK Azad Rd, Natural Holidays is strategically positioned to serve as a vital resource for both domestic and international tourists seeking to explore the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam. We are dedicated to creating memorable travel experiences that are both enriching and responsible, ensuring that every journey with Natural Holidays leaves a positive impact on the environment and the local communities.</p>
</article>', '2nd floor, Assam Tourism, AK Azad Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.320Z', '2025-12-07T05:05:28.000Z'),
(1414, 'NEexplore NOW', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>NEexplore NOW is an Assam-based business dedicated to providing curated and authentic experiences that connect travelers with the diverse beauty and rich cultural heritage of Northeast India. Located at the heart of Guwahati, we serve as a gateway for both domestic and international tourists seeking unique adventures beyond the typical tourist trail. Our mission is to showcase the unexplored corners of Assam and its neighboring states, fostering sustainable tourism that benefits local communities and preserves the region''s natural wonders.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We stand out in the Assam business landscape by offering a holistic approach to travel planning. Unlike typical travel agencies that often focus on pre-packaged tours, NEexplore NOW prioritizes personalized itineraries designed to meet the specific interests and preferences of each client. We specialize in crafting immersive experiences that go beyond sightseeing, focusing on cultural immersion, adventure activities, and responsible tourism practices. We partner with local guides, homestays, and artisans to ensure our guests have authentic encounters with the region''s unique traditions and landscapes. This dedication to responsible and sustainable practices distinguishes us and allows us to contribute positively to the economic well-being of the local communities we serve.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing meticulously planned and executed travel experiences throughout Northeast India. We offer a range of services, including customized tour packages focused on diverse themes such as: wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, tea garden tours showcasing Assam''s renowned tea heritage, cultural immersion experiences with local tribes and communities, adventure treks through the Eastern Himalayas, and spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. We also provide logistical support such as transportation arrangements, accommodation bookings, permit assistance, and expert local guides proficient in multiple languages.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>One of our unique selling points is our commitment to creating bespoke itineraries. We understand that every traveler has different needs and aspirations. Therefore, we dedicate time to understand their individual preferences, budget, and travel style to create a truly personalized experience. We use in-depth knowledge of the region, combined with local insights, to curate unique itineraries that are often unavailable through mainstream travel channels. For example, we can arrange for travelers to participate in traditional Bihu festivals, stay in authentic tribal villages, or learn the art of Assamese silk weaving directly from local artisans. Our itineraries are designed to provide a balance of structured activities and free time, allowing our guests to explore at their own pace and discover the hidden gems of Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our services directly address the growing demand for authentic and responsible tourism experiences in the Northeast. As the region becomes increasingly accessible, more travelers are seeking alternatives to mass tourism. NEexplore NOW caters to this demand by offering culturally sensitive and environmentally conscious travel options. We prioritize partnerships with locally owned businesses and promote eco-friendly practices, ensuring that our tourism activities contribute to the long-term sustainability of the region. We educate our clients about responsible travel and encourage them to engage respectfully with local cultures and environments.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At NEexplore NOW, customer satisfaction is paramount. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention, prompt responses, and reliable support throughout their travel journey. Our team of experienced travel consultants are passionate about Northeast India and are dedicated to sharing their knowledge and expertise with our clients. We ensure that our guides are not only knowledgeable but also empathetic and culturally sensitive, creating a positive and enriching experience for our guests. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs and expectations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We connect with the local community by actively participating in local events and supporting local initiatives. We believe that tourism should be a force for good, and we are committed to contributing to the economic and social development of the communities we serve. We partner with local artisans and businesses to promote their products and services to our clients, providing them with a platform to showcase their talents and generate income. We also support local conservation efforts and promote sustainable tourism practices that protect the region''s natural environment. We regularly participate in community events and initiatives to demonstrate our commitment to the local community and build strong relationships with local residents.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our vision for the future is to become the leading provider of authentic and sustainable travel experiences in Northeast India. We plan to expand our range of services to include more niche travel options, such as birdwatching tours, photography expeditions, and wellness retreats. We also aim to develop new partnerships with local communities to create more opportunities for cultural exchange and economic empowerment. We intend to leverage technology to enhance our customer experience, by developing a user-friendly online platform that allows travelers to easily plan and book their trips. We are also committed to promoting responsible tourism practices throughout the region, by educating our clients and partners about the importance of environmental conservation and cultural preservation. Ultimately, we envision NEexplore NOW as a catalyst for positive change, helping to transform Northeast India into a premier destination for sustainable and responsible tourism.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:05:35.000Z'),
(1415, 'High Hills Tours and Travels (Registered Under Assam Tourism)', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p><strong>High Hills Tours and Travels (Registered Under Assam Tourism): Exploring the Unseen Beauty of Assam</strong></p>

<p>High Hills Tours and Travels, a proudly registered entity under Assam Tourism, is dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences throughout the enchanting landscapes of Assam and Northeast India. We are more than just a tour operator; we are curators of immersive journeys, meticulously designed to unveil the region''s hidden gems, rich culture, and breathtaking natural beauty. In the vibrant Assam tourism landscape, High Hills Tours and Travels distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable tourism practices, personalized service, and deep-rooted understanding of the local ecosystem. We aim to connect travellers with the authentic Assam, fostering a sense of appreciation and respect for its diverse heritage and environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Core Services and Products: Unveiling Northeast India''s Treasures</strong></p>

<p>Our primary offerings revolve around crafting bespoke tour packages tailored to the specific interests and preferences of our clientele. These packages span a diverse range of experiences, including:</p>

<br> <br>

*   <strong>Cultural Immersion Tours:</strong> Delving into the heart of Assam''s traditions, these tours feature visits to ancient temples, interactions with local artisans, exploration of tribal villages, and opportunities to witness vibrant festivals and cultural performances.
*   <strong>Wildlife Safaris and Eco-Tours:</strong> Assam is renowned for its rich biodiversity, and our wildlife safaris offer unparalleled opportunities to spot iconic species like the one-horned rhinoceros in Kaziranga National Park, explore the lush rainforests of Manas National Park, and discover the diverse avian life of Nameri National Park. Our eco-tours emphasize responsible travel practices and promote conservation awareness.
*   <strong>Adventure and Trekking Expeditions:</strong> For the adventurous souls, we organize trekking expeditions to the scenic hills of Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, and other Northeastern states. These treks range from moderate hikes to challenging climbs, offering breathtaking panoramic views and unforgettable encounters with nature.
*   <strong>Tea Tourism Experiences:</strong> Assam is synonymous with tea, and our tea tourism packages allow guests to experience the entire tea-making process, from plucking leaves in lush tea gardens to tasting freshly brewed blends. These tours include visits to historic tea estates, stays in colonial bungalows, and interactions with tea planters.
*   <strong>Pilgrimage Tours:</strong> We arrange spiritual journeys to significant religious sites in Assam, including the revered Kamakhya Temple, the ancient Shiva temple at Umananda Island, and other sacred locations, providing a deeper understanding of the region''s spiritual heritage.

<br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling points lie in our commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and personalized service. We prioritize supporting local communities, employing local guides, sourcing accommodations from eco-friendly lodges, and promoting responsible tourism practices. We believe in creating experiences that are not only memorable but also contribute positively to the environment and the local economy. We meticulously customize each tour package to cater to individual needs, ensuring that every traveller has a fulfilling and enriching experience. Our services directly address the growing demand for experiential travel, eco-tourism, and culturally immersive experiences in the Assam and Northeast India market. We offer a gateway to discover the unspoiled beauty and cultural richness of the region, catering to both domestic and international tourists seeking unique and authentic travel adventures.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Lasting Connections</strong></p>

<p>At High Hills Tours and Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered around building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their needs, and exceeding their expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, we strive to provide personalized attention and seamless support. We maintain a team of highly trained and knowledgeable travel consultants who are passionate about Assam and dedicated to ensuring that every aspect of the trip is meticulously planned and executed. Our local guides are not only fluent in multiple languages but also deeply knowledgeable about the region''s history, culture, and natural environment. They act as ambassadors, sharing their insights and enriching the travel experience. We actively engage with the local community, supporting local businesses and initiatives that promote sustainable tourism. We also participate in community events and initiatives to foster a sense of connection and contribute to the well-being of the region. We encourage feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We believe in creating lasting connections with our clients, transforming them into loyal advocates for High Hills Tours and Travels and for the beautiful region we call home.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Future Vision: Scaling New Heights in Assam Tourism</strong></p>

<p>High Hills Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading tour operator in Assam, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our network of eco-friendly accommodations and transportation partners, developing new and unique tour packages that showcase the hidden gems of Assam and Northeast India, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We aim to incorporate more sustainable practices into our operations, such as reducing our carbon footprint, promoting responsible waste management, and supporting local conservation efforts. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to provide exceptional service. We are committed to working closely with the Assam Tourism Department and other stakeholders to promote sustainable tourism development in the region. We envision a future where tourism contributes positively to the environment, the local economy, and the cultural heritage of Assam, while providing unforgettable experiences for travelers from around the world. We aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, inspiring other businesses to adopt sustainable practices and contribute to the overall well-being of the region.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:10:11.000Z'),
(1416, 'Foothills Tour', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Foothills Tour, strategically located on the 2nd Floor, H, 48, Lamb Rd, near the Gauhati High Court, is a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to showcasing the rich cultural heritage and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and the surrounding northeastern states of India. More than just a tour operator, Foothills Tour acts as a gateway, connecting travelers with authentic experiences and fostering sustainable tourism practices that benefit both visitors and the local communities. In a region often overshadowed by more mainstream tourist destinations, Foothills Tour plays a vital role in promoting Assam''s unique identity and contributing to the economic well-being of its people by providing curated travel experiences and supporting local businesses.

<br> <br>

Foothills Tour’s core services revolve around crafting personalized and group travel itineraries that cater to diverse interests. These include guided tours to renowned historical sites such as the Kamakhya Temple and the ancient ruins of Hajo, offering insightful perspectives on the region''s religious and cultural significance. Nature enthusiasts can explore the lush tea gardens of Assam, embark on thrilling wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (a UNESCO World Heritage Site famed for its rhinoceros population), and trek through the picturesque hills of Meghalaya, known for its living root bridges and stunning waterfalls. Furthermore, Foothills Tour organizes cultural immersion programs, allowing visitors to engage with local artisans, participate in traditional festivals, and savor the authentic flavors of Assamese cuisine. What distinguishes Foothills Tour is its commitment to responsible tourism, ensuring that travel activities minimize environmental impact and contribute to the economic empowerment of local communities. They prioritize using local guides, supporting local businesses, and promoting sustainable practices throughout their operations, creating a positive ripple effect in the regions they serve. These thoughtfully designed services directly address the increasing demand for authentic, eco-conscious travel experiences, setting them apart in a competitive market.

<br> <br>

At Foothills Tour, the customer experience is paramount. The company prides itself on providing personalized attention and exceptional service from the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour. A team of experienced travel consultants works closely with each client to understand their specific needs and preferences, tailoring itineraries to create unforgettable journeys. Local, knowledgeable guides, fluent in multiple languages including Assamese, Hindi, and English, accompany travelers, providing valuable insights into the history, culture, and ecology of the region. Recognizing the importance of building lasting relationships, Foothills Tour actively engages with the local community through partnerships with homestays, local artisans, and community-based tourism initiatives. This commitment not only enriches the travel experience for visitors but also fosters a sense of connection and mutual respect between travelers and the host communities. Regular feedback sessions are conducted to continuously improve services and ensure customer satisfaction, further demonstrating the company''s dedication to exceeding expectations. The location near the Gauhati High Court provides easy accessibility for both local and international clients, fostering a sense of trust and reliability.

<br> <br>

Foothills Tour envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and authentic travel experiences. Future plans include expanding its range of services to cater to niche markets such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and educational tours. The company aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information. Strengthening partnerships with local communities and organizations remains a key priority, fostering economic empowerment and preserving the region''s cultural heritage. Long-term goals include establishing a training center for local guides and tourism professionals, promoting sustainable tourism practices, and contributing to the overall development of the tourism industry in Assam and the Northeast. Foothills Tour understands the untapped potential of the region and is dedicated to showcasing its beauty and cultural richness to the world, all while ensuring a positive impact on the environment and local communities.', '2nd Floor, H, 48, Lamb Rd, near Gauhati High Court', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:10:17.000Z'),
(1417, 'LANDSCAPE SAFARI', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>LANDSCAPE SAFARI: Crafting Exceptional Outdoor Experiences in Assam</p>

<p>Located on the 2nd floor of Anil Niloy House, at 6, Dr BK Kakati Rd, LANDSCAPE SAFARI is a premier landscape architecture and outdoor design firm dedicated to transforming ordinary spaces into extraordinary environments. Serving the discerning clientele of Guwahati and the broader Assam region, we offer a comprehensive suite of services, from initial concept design to project management and execution, ensuring seamless integration of aesthetics and functionality. Recognizing the rich biodiversity and unique cultural heritage of Assam, LANDSCAPE SAFARI strives to create sustainable and harmonious outdoor spaces that reflect the client''s vision while respecting and enhancing the natural environment. We differentiate ourselves by combining innovative design principles with a deep understanding of local climate conditions, plant species, and construction practices, making us a valuable asset to the regional business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings encompass a wide range of landscape architecture and outdoor design solutions tailored to meet diverse client needs. This includes residential garden design, commercial landscaping, institutional campus planning, and public park development. We also specialize in creating sustainable landscapes incorporating rainwater harvesting, native plant selection, and eco-friendly construction materials. What truly sets LANDSCAPE SAFARI apart is our commitment to personalized service and innovative design solutions. We invest significant time understanding each client''s unique requirements, aesthetic preferences, and budget constraints. Our team of experienced landscape architects and horticulturists utilizes advanced design software and visualization techniques to create detailed plans and 3D renderings, allowing clients to visualize the final product before construction begins. This collaborative approach ensures that the finished landscape exceeds expectations and seamlessly integrates with the surrounding environment. Furthermore, our deep understanding of the local ecosystem allows us to recommend plant species that thrive in the Assam climate, reducing maintenance costs and promoting long-term sustainability. This local expertise is critical in a region with specific climatic challenges and preferences, giving us a significant advantage over firms lacking this localized knowledge.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At LANDSCAPE SAFARI, we believe that customer experience is paramount. Our approach is centered on building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and exceptional service. From the initial consultation to project completion, we maintain open communication, providing regular updates and addressing any concerns promptly. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and commitment to delivering projects on time and within budget. Our team goes the extra mile to ensure client satisfaction, often providing post-completion maintenance advice and support. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events, workshops on sustainable landscaping, and collaborations with local nurseries and artisans. This community involvement not only strengthens our brand reputation but also allows us to stay connected with local trends and preferences. We believe that a thriving business is one that is deeply rooted in the community it serves, and we are committed to contributing to the beautification and sustainability of the Assam landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, LANDSCAPE SAFARI envisions significant growth potential within the Assam region and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include specialized areas such as vertical gardening, green roof design, and ecological restoration. We aim to establish ourselves as a regional leader in sustainable landscaping practices by actively promoting the use of native plants, water conservation techniques, and eco-friendly construction materials. Furthermore, we plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff to enhance their skills and knowledge, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of the landscape architecture industry. We also intend to explore strategic partnerships with other businesses in the construction and real estate sectors to expand our reach and access new markets. Our long-term goal is to create a legacy of beautiful, sustainable landscapes that enhance the quality of life for the people of Assam and contribute to the preservation of our natural heritage. We aspire to become a recognized and respected name synonymous with quality, innovation, and environmental responsibility in the landscaping industry.</p>', '2nd floor, Anil Niloy House, 6, Dr BK Kakati Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:10:23.000Z'),
(1418, 'Urgent Travels India (Head Office) - Best Travel Agent in Guwahati', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Urgent Travels India (Head Office) - Best Travel Agent in Guwahati, strategically located on Jayanagar Rd, near Sukafa Bhawan, opposite Desi Gym, is a premier travel agency serving the diverse travel needs of Guwahati and the broader Assam region. As a prominent player in the local business landscape, Urgent Travels India stands out for its commitment to providing personalized, efficient, and reliable travel solutions. We are dedicated to crafting exceptional travel experiences, whether for leisure, business, or pilgrimage, ensuring seamless journeys from start to finish. Our deep understanding of local preferences, coupled with our extensive network of partners, allows us to offer unparalleled value and convenience to our esteemed clientele.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core service offerings encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions designed to cater to every traveler''s unique requirements. These include:
<br>
<ul>
<li><b>Domestic and International Flight Bookings:</b> We offer competitive fares and flexible itineraries across a wide array of airlines, simplifying air travel planning.</li>
<li><b>Hotel Reservations:</b> From budget-friendly accommodations to luxury resorts, we curate a diverse selection of hotels to suit every taste and budget, both within India and internationally.</li>
<li><b>Tour Packages:</b> Our expertly crafted tour packages cover popular destinations both within Assam and across India, as well as international hotspots, offering curated itineraries and hassle-free travel arrangements. We specialize in tailor-made tours that reflect individual preferences and interests.</li>
<li><b>Car Rentals:</b> We provide a fleet of well-maintained vehicles with experienced drivers for convenient and comfortable transportation within Guwahati and beyond.</li>
<li><b>Visa Assistance:</b> Our experienced team provides guidance and support throughout the visa application process, ensuring accuracy and minimizing delays.</li>
<li><b>Travel Insurance:</b> We offer comprehensive travel insurance plans to protect travelers against unforeseen circumstances, providing peace of mind during their journeys.</li>
<li><b>Pilgrimage Tours:</b> Understanding the spiritual importance of pilgrimages, we facilitate seamless and comfortable journeys to renowned religious sites across India.</li>
</ul>
<br>
What sets Urgent Travels India apart is our unwavering dedication to providing personalized service and creating unique travel experiences. We understand that no two travelers are alike, and we take the time to listen to our clients'' specific needs and preferences. Our experienced travel consultants leverage their extensive knowledge and expertise to design customized itineraries that exceed expectations. Furthermore, our commitment to transparency, competitive pricing, and prompt customer support ensures a stress-free and rewarding travel planning experience. We are known for our quick response times and ability to handle urgent travel requests efficiently, giving us the name ''Urgent Travels''.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Urgent Travels India, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is rooted in building lasting relationships based on trust, reliability, and personalized attention. We go the extra mile to understand each traveler''s unique needs and preferences, ensuring that their journey is tailored to their individual requirements. Our dedicated team of travel experts is available to provide assistance at every stage of the travel process, from initial planning to post-trip follow-up. <br> <br>
We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives and partnerships. We understand the importance of supporting local businesses and promoting tourism within Assam. Our commitment to sustainable tourism practices ensures that we contribute to the preservation of the region''s natural and cultural heritage. We are proud to be a part of the vibrant Guwahati community and strive to be a responsible and contributing member of the local economy. Positive word-of-mouth from satisfied customers has been instrumental in our growth and success, making us a trusted name in the local travel industry.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Urgent Travels India envisions a future where we continue to be the leading travel agency in Guwahati and the surrounding region, renowned for our exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and unwavering commitment to excellence. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass more specialized travel segments, such as adventure tourism and eco-tourism. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, through online booking platforms and personalized travel recommendations. We intend to further develop our network of partnerships with local businesses and tourism stakeholders, contributing to the growth of the Assam tourism industry as a whole. Our long-term goal is to establish Urgent Travels India as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with seamless travel experiences and unparalleled customer satisfaction. We are dedicated to continuously improving our services and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of the travel industry.</p>', 'Jayanagar Rd, near Sukafa Bhawan, opp. Desi Gym', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:10:29.000Z'),
(1419, 'Agarwal Tours -Travel Agent in Guwahati & Tour Operator in India and International', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Agarwal Tours: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Journeys, Local and Global</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Walford, KK Boro Building, near Ganeshguri Flyover, Agarwal Tours stands as a premier travel agent and tour operator, serving as a trusted partner for crafting exceptional travel experiences across India and internationally. More than just a travel agency, Agarwal Tours is dedicated to providing personalized, seamless, and enriching journeys that cater to the diverse needs and aspirations of our clientele. In the vibrant and culturally rich landscape of Assam, Agarwal Tours has carved a niche by understanding the unique preferences of the local market while also possessing the global expertise to curate unforgettable adventures beyond national borders. We are committed to fostering sustainable tourism practices that respect local communities and environments, ensuring that our journeys leave a positive impact.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Agarwal Tours, our core mission is to transform travel dreams into reality. We offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to every aspect of travel planning and execution. Our primary services include:
</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
<li><b>Domestic Tour Packages:</b> Explore the diverse tapestry of India with our meticulously crafted tour packages, covering popular destinations like Rajasthan, Kerala, the Himalayas, and, of course, the captivating landscapes of Northeast India. We offer both fixed departure tours and customizable itineraries to suit individual preferences.</li>
<li><b>International Tour Packages:</b> Venture beyond India''s borders with our diverse range of international tour packages. From the cultural immersion of Southeast Asia to the historical grandeur of Europe and the natural wonders of Africa, we curate experiences that cater to a variety of interests and budgets.</li>
<li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> We understand that every traveler is unique. Our team of experienced travel consultants works closely with clients to create personalized itineraries that reflect their specific interests, preferences, and budget constraints. Whether it''s a romantic getaway, a family adventure, or a solo exploration, we tailor every detail to ensure an unforgettable experience.</li>
<li><b>Flight and Hotel Bookings:</b> We offer comprehensive flight and hotel booking services, leveraging our industry partnerships to secure competitive rates and ensure comfortable accommodations for our clients.</li>
<li><b>Visa Assistance:</b> Navigating the complexities of visa applications can be daunting. Our dedicated visa assistance team provides expert guidance and support to streamline the process and ensure a smooth travel experience.</li>
<li><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> We provide comprehensive travel solutions for businesses of all sizes, managing travel arrangements for conferences, meetings, and incentive trips. Our corporate travel services are designed to optimize travel budgets and ensure seamless logistics.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>Agarwal Tours distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, deep local knowledge, and unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction. Our unique selling points include:
</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
<li><b>Local Expertise:</b> Being rooted in Guwahati, we possess an intimate understanding of the region''s culture, attractions, and logistical nuances, allowing us to create truly authentic and immersive experiences for our clients, especially within Northeast India.</li>
<li><b>Personalized Service:</b> We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients. Our travel consultants take the time to understand their individual needs and preferences, providing personalized recommendations and tailored itineraries.</li>
<li><b>24/7 Support:</b> We offer round-the-clock support to our clients, ensuring assistance is readily available throughout their journey, no matter the time or location.</li>
<li><b>Sustainable Tourism Practices:</b> We are committed to promoting responsible tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and support local communities.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>Our dedication to exceptional customer service is at the heart of everything we do. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment for our clients, fostering a sense of trust and confidence. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events. We believe in supporting local initiatives and promoting the unique cultural heritage of Assam. We continuously seek feedback from our clients to improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs. Our success is measured by the satisfaction of our clients and the positive impact we have on the communities we serve.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Agarwal Tours envisions becoming the leading travel agent and tour operator in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our range of tour packages, focusing on niche markets such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion experiences. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online presence and provide a seamless booking experience for our clients. Our long-term goals include establishing strategic partnerships with international travel agencies to further expand our global reach and contributing to the growth and development of the tourism industry in Assam. We aim to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting responsible travel and fostering cultural understanding.</p>', 'walford, KK Boro Building, near, Ganeshguri Flyover', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:10:37.000Z'),
