At GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on a foundation of personalized attention, responsiveness, and genuine care. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Our team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants is dedicated to providing expert advice and guidance, ensuring that every aspect of the trip is meticulously planned and executed. We go the extra mile to anticipate potential challenges and proactively address any concerns, providing seamless and stress-free travel experiences. We are deeply connected to the local community, actively participating in local events and supporting local initiatives. We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a trusted partner and a valued member of the community. This commitment extends to our online presence, where we actively engage with our customers through social media and online forums, providing travel tips, destination information, and responsive customer support.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel and tourism company in Northeast India, recognized for our commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. We plan to expand our service offerings to include eco-tourism initiatives, community-based tourism projects, and specialized travel packages for niche markets, such as wildlife enthusiasts and cultural heritage seekers. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and communities, fostering sustainable tourism practices that benefit the region as a whole. Furthermore, we are committed to leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, investing in user-friendly online platforms and mobile applications that make travel planning easier and more accessible. We recognize the growing importance of digital marketing and social media in reaching new customers, and we plan to strengthen our online presence to attract both domestic and international travelers. Our vision is to not only showcase the beauty and diversity of Northeast India to the world but also to contribute to the sustainable development and economic prosperity of the region.

<br> <br>

GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS is dedicated to promoting responsible tourism, minimizing our environmental impact, and supporting local communities. We are committed to operating in an ethical and sustainable manner, ensuring that our business practices contribute to the long-term well-being of the region. We actively seek out and partner with organizations that share our values, working together to promote sustainable tourism initiatives and protect the natural environment. We believe that tourism can be a powerful force for good, and we are committed to using our platform to make a positive impact on the lives of the people and the communities we serve. Our dedication extends beyond business; it''s a commitment to preserving the beauty and integrity of Northeast India for generations to come.', 'FLAT - 1C, MADHAB NIWAS JURIPAR, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:25:14.000Z'),
(1432, 'Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours isn''t just another travel company; it''s a curator of immersive experiences designed to unveil the raw beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the wider Northeast India. Operating from its base in [Address - if provided, otherwise omit this completely], the company stands as a gateway for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic adventures beyond the typical tourist trails. We''re deeply rooted in the local community, working collaboratively with indigenous communities and striving to promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit both visitors and the environment. Our significance in the Assam business landscape stems from our commitment to showcasing the region’s unique identity, fostering economic growth in local communities through responsible tourism, and offering unparalleled, personalized experiences that leave a lasting impression.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours lie a carefully crafted selection of core services designed to cater to a diverse range of travel preferences. Our primary offering is guided tours, ranging from multi-day expeditions through Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, showcasing the iconic one-horned rhinoceros and Bengal tigers, to cultural immersion trips exploring the tea gardens of Assam and the living root bridges of Meghalaya. We also specialize in trekking and hiking adventures, taking clients deep into the Himalayas and the lesser-known hill regions of the Northeast. <br> <br> Beyond the guided tours, we provide customizable travel packages that cater to specific interests, whether it’s birdwatching, photography, adventure sports, or spiritual retreats. A key unique selling point is our focus on small group sizes, ensuring a personalized and intimate experience. We believe that smaller groups allow for deeper connections with the local culture and minimize our environmental impact. Furthermore, our knowledgeable and passionate local guides are not just narrators; they are storytellers deeply connected to the land and its people, enriching the journey with invaluable insights and authentic interactions. Our services directly address the local market need for expertly organized, sustainable, and culturally sensitive tourism options, promoting Assam and the Northeast as a premier travel destination.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our clients, understanding their individual needs and preferences, and going the extra mile to exceed their expectations. From the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, we strive for seamless communication, personalized attention, and unwavering support. Our customer service team is readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and provide tailored recommendations to ensure a memorable and hassle-free experience. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to building long-term relationships with our clients. We view them not just as customers, but as fellow travelers and ambassadors for the region. <br> <br> Connecting with the local community is integral to our approach. We actively support local artisans, homestays, and community-based tourism initiatives, ensuring that our tours contribute directly to the economic well-being of the region. We also partner with local NGOs to promote conservation efforts and environmental awareness. By fostering meaningful partnerships and prioritizing responsible tourism practices, we aim to create a positive impact on the communities we visit, preserving their cultural heritage and natural resources for future generations. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, further solidifying our presence as a responsible and engaged member of the community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future of Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours is bright, with significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to become the leading adventure and cultural tourism operator in Northeast India, recognized for our commitment to sustainable practices, personalized experiences, and community engagement. We envision expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on specific themes, such as culinary tourism, textile tours, and wellness retreats. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, including online booking platforms, mobile apps, and virtual reality experiences that showcase the beauty of the region. <br> <br> Strategically, we aim to forge stronger partnerships with international travel agencies and tour operators to attract a wider range of travelers to the Northeast. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-lodges and sustainable tourism infrastructure in remote areas, providing comfortable accommodations while minimizing our environmental impact. Ultimately, our vision is to create a sustainable and thriving tourism ecosystem that benefits both visitors and the local communities, preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Northeast India for generations to come. We see ourselves not just as a tour operator, but as a custodian of the region''s beauty and culture, dedicated to sharing its magic with the world while ensuring its long-term sustainability.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.321Z', '2025-12-07T05:25:20.000Z'),
(1433, 'Booknow Holidays', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Booknow Holidays: Your Gateway to Seamless Travel Experiences in Assam and Beyond

Booknow Holidays, strategically located at the Asian Complex, Ground Floor, GS Rd, stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional and personalized travel solutions. Rooted in Assam’s vibrant cultural landscape, we understand the unique travel needs of our local community while simultaneously catering to global adventurers seeking to explore the wonders of Northeast India and the wider world. We’re more than just a travel agency; we''re a team of experienced travel specialists committed to crafting unforgettable journeys, from serene weekend getaways to meticulously planned international expeditions. In a market often saturated with impersonal online booking platforms, Booknow Holidays distinguishes itself by offering a human touch, expert guidance, and a deep understanding of both local nuances and global travel trends. We aim to be the trusted travel partner of choice for discerning travelers in Assam and beyond, contributing to the growth of sustainable tourism and enriching lives through transformative travel experiences.

<br> <br>

Our core services revolve around providing comprehensive travel solutions designed to meet a wide range of needs and preferences. These include:

*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in creating bespoke tour packages tailored to individual interests and budgets. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, trekking through the Himalayas, or experiencing the cultural richness of Southeast Asia, our team crafts itineraries that are both engaging and enriching.

*   **Flight and Accommodation Bookings:** We offer seamless flight and accommodation booking services, leveraging our established partnerships with airlines and hotels worldwide to secure the best deals for our clients. Our expertise extends to sourcing unique boutique hotels and homestays that offer authentic local experiences.

*   **Visa Assistance:** Navigating the complexities of visa applications can be daunting. Our experienced visa assistance team provides comprehensive support, guiding clients through the process and ensuring a smooth and stress-free application experience.

*   **Corporate Travel Management:** We understand the unique needs of corporate travelers and offer dedicated corporate travel management services, including streamlined booking processes, expense management solutions, and 24/7 support.

*   **Cruise Packages:** We offer an array of cruise packages from river cruises in the Brahmaputra to international ocean voyages, providing expert advice on selecting the perfect cruise itinerary and ensuring a seamless and memorable cruising experience.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Booknow Holidays apart is our unwavering commitment to providing unparalleled customer service. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs and preferences, and going the extra mile to exceed their expectations. Our team of travel consultants are not just booking agents; they are experienced travelers themselves, passionate about sharing their knowledge and expertise to help clients create unforgettable travel experiences. We foster a warm and welcoming environment at our Asian Complex office, where clients can walk in, discuss their travel plans, and receive personalized advice. We are actively involved in local community events, sponsoring initiatives that promote tourism and cultural exchange within Assam. Furthermore, we prioritize ethical and sustainable tourism practices, working with local communities and businesses to minimize our environmental impact and maximize the benefits of tourism for the region. We proactively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet their evolving needs.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Booknow Holidays envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to cater to niche markets, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness travel. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse and book travel services. We aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and communities, further contributing to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam. A key long-term goal is to establish Booknow Holidays as a trusted brand synonymous with quality, reliability, and personalized service, not only within Assam but also across the broader Indian travel market. We are dedicated to empowering our employees through continuous training and development, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of the travel industry. Ultimately, we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable tourism practices and enriching the lives of both our clients and the communities we serve.', 'Asian Complex, Ground Floor, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:25:27.000Z'),
(1434, 'Discover Northeast Travel Company', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Discover Northeast Travel Company, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Santi Niloy Apartment, E 1, Zoo-Narengi Rd, is a premier travel agency dedicated to unveiling the untamed beauty and rich cultural tapestry of Northeast India. We are more than just a travel company; we are storytellers, crafting immersive experiences that resonate deeply with travelers seeking authentic adventures and a connection with the region''s unique heritage. In a landscape increasingly dominated by standardized tour packages, Discover Northeast Travel Company distinguishes itself by offering personalized itineraries, expert local guides, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices, thereby contributing positively to the local Assamese economy and preserving the region''s natural and cultural treasures. We recognize the growing desire for experiential travel and aim to provide journeys that are not only visually stunning but also intellectually stimulating and emotionally rewarding.

<br> <br>

Our core services encompass a wide range of travel solutions, tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. These include: bespoke tour packages designed around specific interests such as wildlife exploration in Kaziranga National Park, cultural immersion in tribal villages, trekking expeditions in the Himalayas, and spiritual journeys to ancient temples; expertly guided tours led by knowledgeable locals who possess an intimate understanding of the region''s history, culture, and ecology; comfortable and reliable transportation services ensuring seamless travel throughout Northeast India; and meticulously curated accommodation options ranging from eco-friendly resorts to charming homestays, all selected for their quality and commitment to local hospitality. What sets us apart is our unwavering focus on responsible tourism. We prioritize working with local communities, supporting eco-friendly accommodations, and promoting activities that minimize environmental impact and celebrate the region''s unique cultural identity. This commitment ensures that our tours not only provide unforgettable experiences for our clients but also contribute to the sustainable development of Northeast India.

<br> <br>

At Discover Northeast Travel Company, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, we are dedicated to providing a seamless and personalized travel experience. Our team of experienced travel consultants works closely with each client to understand their individual needs and preferences, crafting customized itineraries that exceed their expectations. We maintain open communication channels throughout the planning process, providing timely updates and addressing any concerns promptly and efficiently. On the ground, our local guides are not only knowledgeable about the region but also passionate about sharing their love for Northeast India with our guests. They are adept at handling unexpected situations and ensuring that every aspect of the tour runs smoothly. We also actively engage with the local community, partnering with local artisans, restaurants, and cultural organizations to offer our clients authentic and enriching experiences. This approach allows us to foster meaningful connections between our guests and the people of Northeast India, creating a truly immersive and unforgettable journey. We also regularly seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding their expectations.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Discover Northeast Travel Company envisions becoming the leading travel agency for responsible and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our network of local partners, developing new and innovative tour packages that showcase the region''s hidden gems, and investing in sustainable tourism initiatives that benefit local communities. We are particularly focused on promoting eco-tourism and adventure tourism, recognizing the growing demand for these types of experiences. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance our customer service and streamline our operations, making it easier for travelers to plan and book their dream trip to Northeast India. Ultimately, our goal is to create a positive impact on the region by promoting sustainable tourism practices, supporting local communities, and sharing the beauty and culture of Northeast India with the world. We aspire to be recognized not only for the quality of our tours but also for our commitment to responsible tourism and our contribution to the sustainable development of the region. We see immense potential in the growing interest in Northeast India as a unique and unexplored travel destination, and we are confident that Discover Northeast Travel Company is well-positioned to capitalize on this opportunity and become a driving force in the region''s tourism industry.', 'Santi Niloy Apartment, E 1, Zoo-Narengi Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:25:33.000Z'),
(1435, 'Assam Tours and travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Assam Tours and Travels: Your Gateway to Experiencing the Soul of Assam

Assam Tours and Travels, strategically located in Goshala, near the Water Tank, stands as a premier travel and tourism operator dedicated to showcasing the rich tapestry of Assam''s natural beauty, vibrant culture, and unparalleled hospitality. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of authentic experiences, deeply rooted in the local landscape and committed to sustainable tourism practices. In a region brimming with natural wonders and ancient traditions, Assam Tours and Travels distinguishes itself by offering meticulously crafted itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests, from wildlife enthusiasts and adventure seekers to cultural explorers and spiritual pilgrims. Our commitment to personalized service, combined with our extensive knowledge of the region, allows us to create unforgettable journeys that leave a lasting impact. We aim to be a vital player in the Assam tourism sector, contributing to its economic growth while preserving its unique heritage.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Assam Tours and Travels lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to every traveler''s needs. Our core offerings include:

*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries tailored to individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints. Whether it''s a week-long exploration of Kaziranga National Park, a spiritual journey to the Kamakhya Temple, or an immersive cultural experience in a traditional Assamese village, we design packages that exceed expectations.
*   **Wildlife Safaris:** Assam is renowned for its exceptional biodiversity, and we offer expertly guided wildlife safaris to Kaziranga, Manas, and other national parks and sanctuaries. Our experienced naturalists ensure a safe and informative experience, providing insights into the region''s unique flora and fauna, including the one-horned rhinoceros, Bengal tiger, and a myriad of bird species.
*   **Cultural and Heritage Tours:** Delve into the heart of Assam''s rich cultural heritage with our immersive cultural tours. Explore ancient temples, historical monuments, and traditional villages, and witness firsthand the vibrant customs, art forms, and culinary traditions of the Assamese people. We arrange visits to local artisans, weavers, and musicians, providing opportunities to interact with the community and gain a deeper understanding of their way of life.
*   **River Cruises:** Experience the majestic Brahmaputra River with our scenic river cruises. Enjoy breathtaking views of the landscape, observe wildlife along the riverbanks, and immerse yourself in the tranquility of the surroundings. We offer a range of cruise options, from short day trips to multi-day expeditions.
*   **Transportation Services:** We provide a comprehensive range of transportation services, including airport transfers, car rentals, and chauffeur-driven vehicles, ensuring seamless travel throughout Assam. Our fleet of well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers guarantee a comfortable and safe journey.

Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local market and our commitment to providing authentic and responsible tourism experiences. We prioritize sustainable practices, working closely with local communities to ensure that our tours benefit the region and its people. We are dedicated to showcasing the hidden gems of Assam, going beyond the typical tourist attractions to offer unique and unforgettable experiences. Our services directly address the needs of both domestic and international tourists seeking to explore the diverse and captivating landscapes of Assam.

<br> <br>

Customer satisfaction is paramount at Assam Tours and Travels. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, treating each traveler as a valued guest. Our customer service philosophy is centered around personalized attention, responsiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, we are committed to providing exceptional support and assistance.

We actively engage with the local community, supporting local businesses and promoting cultural preservation. We partner with homestays and guesthouses in rural areas, providing economic opportunities for local families. We also organize community-based tourism initiatives, empowering local communities to share their culture and traditions with visitors. We participate in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of connection and belonging within the community. Our presence in Goshala, near the Water Tank, is more than just a business location; it''s a commitment to being an active and responsible member of the local community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Assam Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism operator in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include:

*   **Expanding our Service Offerings:** We plan to introduce new and innovative tour packages, focusing on niche markets such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We will also explore opportunities to develop new tourism destinations within Assam, showcasing the region''s lesser-known attractions.
*   **Strengthening our Partnerships:** We aim to forge strategic partnerships with hotels, resorts, airlines, and other tourism stakeholders to enhance our service offerings and provide our clients with even greater value.
*   **Embracing Technology:** We will invest in technology to streamline our operations, improve customer communication, and enhance the online booking experience. We plan to develop a user-friendly website and mobile app that will allow customers to easily browse our tour packages, make reservations, and access travel information.
*   **Promoting Sustainable Tourism:** We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism practices. We will continue to work with local communities to ensure that our tours benefit the region and its people, while also protecting its natural and cultural heritage.

Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable growth of the Assam tourism sector, creating economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region''s unique cultural and natural heritage for future generations. Assam Tours and Travels aspires to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting responsible tourism practices and showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam to the world.', 'Goshala, near Water Tank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:30:11.000Z'),
(1436, 'North East Seven Sisters - North East Travel Agency | Tour operator in North East | Best Travel Agency in Guwahati', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p><strong>North East Seven Sisters - North East Travel Agency | Tour Operator in North East | Best Travel Agency in Guwahati</strong> is a premier travel agency and tour operator deeply rooted in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of the North East Indian states, often referred to as the ''Seven Sisters''. We stand as a beacon for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic, immersive, and unforgettable experiences in this captivating region. Our profound understanding of the local terrain, culture, and travel logistics distinguishes us as a leading force in Assam''s tourism sector, contributing significantly to the economic growth and promotion of sustainable tourism practices. We are committed to providing exceptional travel solutions, tailored to the diverse needs and preferences of our clientele, while simultaneously preserving the delicate ecological balance and cultural heritage of the North East.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At North East Seven Sisters, our core offerings encompass a comprehensive suite of travel-related services designed to cater to every aspect of a traveler''s journey. Our primary services include expertly curated tour packages that span the diverse landscapes of Arunachal Pradesh, Assam, Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. These packages range from adventurous treks through pristine forests and majestic mountains to cultural explorations of vibrant tribal communities and historical sites. We meticulously design itineraries to cater to various interests, including wildlife enthusiasts eager to spot the elusive one-horned rhinoceros in Kaziranga National Park, spiritual seekers drawn to the ancient monasteries of Tawang, and those seeking tranquility amidst the rolling tea gardens of Assam. We provide customized travel planning services, accommodating individual preferences, group sizes, and budgetary constraints. Our services also extend to seamless travel logistics, encompassing flight and train ticketing, comfortable and reliable transportation options, and handpicked accommodation arrangements ranging from luxurious hotels to charming homestays that offer an authentic taste of local hospitality. What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to providing personalized attention and insider knowledge, ensuring that each traveler experiences the North East in its truest form. Our profound local expertise allows us to unlock hidden gems, facilitate meaningful interactions with local communities, and provide invaluable insights that go beyond the typical tourist experience. We also champion responsible tourism practices, partnering with local communities and promoting eco-friendly initiatives to minimize our environmental footprint and contribute to the sustainable development of the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at North East Seven Sisters. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and personalized environment for every traveler who entrusts us with their journey. Our team of experienced travel consultants are not just agents; they are passionate storytellers, eager to share their love and knowledge of the North East. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their unique needs and aspirations. From the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, we maintain open communication channels, ensuring that every question is answered and every concern is addressed promptly and efficiently. We understand the importance of reliability and transparency, providing clear and accurate information about our services, pricing, and terms and conditions. We are committed to exceeding expectations, going the extra mile to ensure that every detail is meticulously planned and flawlessly executed. Our dedication to customer satisfaction has earned us a reputation for excellence within the local community and beyond. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and support for local artisans and craftspeople. By fostering these relationships, we contribute to the economic empowerment of local communities and promote the preservation of their cultural heritage.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, North East Seven Sisters envisions becoming the undisputed leader in North East India''s tourism sector, recognized for its unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include specialized adventure tours, wellness retreats, and educational travel programs. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that provides seamless access to information, booking services, and personalized travel recommendations. We are also committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate actively in the tourism industry and benefit directly from its growth. We intend to invest in training and development programs for our staff, equipping them with the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and adapt to the evolving needs of the travel market. Our long-term goal is to promote the North East as a premier tourist destination, attracting a diverse range of travelers from around the world and showcasing the region''s unique cultural heritage, natural beauty, and warm hospitality, all while adhering to responsible and sustainable tourism practices that benefit both the environment and the local communities.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:30:19.000Z'),
(1437, 'Asian Holidays & Expeditions', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Asian Holidays & Expeditions, located at House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd, Guwahati, stands as a premier travel and tour operator deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are architects of unforgettable experiences, specializing in curating personalized journeys that showcase the diverse beauty and rich cultural heritage of Northeast India and select destinations across Asia. In a region renowned for its breathtaking landscapes and vibrant traditions, Asian Holidays & Expeditions distinguishes itself through its commitment to authentic travel, sustainable tourism practices, and unparalleled customer service. We strive to be a gateway, connecting travelers with the soul of Asia, while contributing positively to the local communities we interact with.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service lies in crafting bespoke travel itineraries that cater to a wide range of interests and preferences. From adventurous expeditions into the Himalayas and exploring the lush tea gardens of Assam to immersive cultural tours of ancient temples and vibrant festivals, we offer a diverse portfolio of travel options. We specialize in personalized itineraries, ensuring each journey is tailored to the individual needs and desires of our clients. This includes arranging comfortable accommodations, reliable transportation, knowledgeable local guides fluent in multiple languages, and access to unique experiences often unavailable to the average traveler. Our trekking tours are particularly popular, taking adventurers through stunning landscapes like the Dzukou Valley and the Kaziranga National Park periphery, offering a chance to spot rare wildlife and immerse in the region''s natural beauty. Beyond Northeast India, we also offer meticulously planned tours to Southeast Asian destinations such as Thailand, Vietnam, and Cambodia, focusing on cultural immersion and responsible travel. What sets us apart is our deep understanding of the local ecosystem, our established relationships with local communities, and our unwavering commitment to responsible tourism. We prioritize supporting local businesses, minimizing our environmental impact, and respecting the cultural sensitivities of the regions we operate in.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Asian Holidays & Expeditions, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in building relationships, not just processing transactions. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, our dedicated team provides personalized attention and unwavering support. Our travel consultants are not just booking agents; they are passionate travel enthusiasts with in-depth knowledge of the destinations we offer. They take the time to understand each client''s unique interests, budget, and travel style, creating itineraries that perfectly match their expectations. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and proactive problem-solving. Before, during, and after the trip, our team is readily available to address any concerns or provide assistance. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that every journey is a truly memorable one. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our business operations. We actively participate in local tourism initiatives, supporting cultural preservation efforts and promoting sustainable development. By partnering with local artisans, guides, and guesthouse owners, we contribute to the economic well-being of the communities we serve, creating a mutually beneficial relationship that enriches the travel experience for our clients and strengthens the fabric of the local culture.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Asian Holidays & Expeditions envisions itself as a leading force in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include more niche travel experiences, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and specialized photography tours. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, creating a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse itineraries, customize their trips, and access real-time travel information. We are also committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities, developing new initiatives that empower local businesses and promote sustainable tourism practices. A key focus will be on promoting responsible travel, educating travelers about the importance of respecting local cultures and minimizing their environmental impact. We aim to become a recognized advocate for sustainable tourism, inspiring others to adopt responsible practices and contribute to the preservation of the region''s natural and cultural heritage. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market, Asian Holidays & Expeditions is poised to achieve sustainable growth, creating a positive impact on the local economy and the communities we serve, while providing unforgettable travel experiences for our valued clients.</p>', 'House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:30:25.000Z'),
(1438, 'Tribal Planet Tours and Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Tribal Planet Tours and Travels is a Guwahati-based travel agency dedicated to providing authentic and immersive travel experiences throughout Assam and Northeast India. We specialize in crafting personalized itineraries that connect travelers with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant traditions of the region, promoting sustainable tourism practices and empowering local communities.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Operating in a region with immense tourism potential yet often overlooked by mainstream travel circuits, Tribal Planet Tours and Travels distinguishes itself by offering unique and culturally sensitive tours. We aim to be more than just a travel agency; we strive to be a bridge connecting visitors with the heart and soul of Northeast India, fostering understanding and appreciation for its diverse tribal cultures and pristine natural environments. Our commitment to responsible tourism and community engagement sets us apart in the local business landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel options, catering to diverse interests and budgets. These include:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Cultural Immersion Tours:</b> Offering in-depth exploration of tribal villages, participation in local festivals, and interaction with artisans and craftspeople. These tours emphasize respectful cultural exchange and contribute directly to the economic well-being of the communities we visit.</li>
<li><b>Adventure and Eco-Tourism Packages:</b> Featuring trekking in the Eastern Himalayas, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, river rafting expeditions, and exploration of tea gardens. We prioritize eco-friendly practices and ensure minimal environmental impact.</li>
<li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> Designing personalized travel plans based on individual preferences, interests, and time constraints. Our experienced travel consultants work closely with clients to create bespoke experiences that exceed expectations.</li>
<li><b>Homestay and Community-Based Tourism:</b> Promoting authentic cultural experiences by facilitating stays in local homes and providing opportunities to interact with community members. This fosters cultural exchange and provides sustainable income for local families.</li>
<li><b>Transportation and Accommodation Arrangements:</b> Ensuring seamless travel logistics by providing reliable transportation services and booking comfortable and culturally appropriate accommodations.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>A key differentiator for Tribal Planet Tours and Travels is our commitment to providing authentic and responsible tourism experiences. We work closely with local communities to develop sustainable tourism initiatives that benefit both the visitors and the residents. This includes employing local guides, sourcing local products and services, and ensuring that tourism activities are conducted in a culturally sensitive and environmentally responsible manner. Our understanding of the unique challenges and opportunities of the Northeast Indian tourism market allows us to offer services that are both enriching and impactful.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We strive to provide unparalleled customer service, ensuring that every traveler feels welcomed, supported, and valued. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour, our team is dedicated to providing prompt, efficient, and personalized assistance. Our approach is built on building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their needs and expectations, and exceeding them whenever possible. We believe in going the extra mile to ensure that every tour is a memorable and transformative experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our deep connection with the local community is a cornerstone of our business. We actively participate in community development initiatives, support local artisans and entrepreneurs, and promote cultural preservation efforts. We believe that tourism can be a powerful force for positive change, and we are committed to using our business as a platform to empower local communities and promote sustainable development. We also maintain close relationships with local authorities and tourism stakeholders to ensure that our operations align with regional development priorities.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, Tribal Planet Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading sustainable tourism operator in Northeast India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more specialized tours, such as birdwatching expeditions, culinary tours, and wellness retreats. We also intend to invest in developing eco-friendly accommodations and transportation options to further reduce our environmental footprint.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our long-term goals include:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Expanding our reach:</b> Targeting new markets and attracting a wider range of travelers to Northeast India.</li>
<li><b>Strengthening our partnerships:</b> Collaborating with more local communities and organizations to develop sustainable tourism initiatives.</li>
<li><b>Promoting responsible tourism practices:</b> Educating travelers and stakeholders about the importance of sustainable tourism and cultural preservation.</li>
<li><b>Investing in technology:</b> Developing a user-friendly online platform to enhance the customer experience and streamline our operations.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>Tribal Planet Tours and Travels is dedicated to showcasing the beauty and diversity of Northeast India while contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We are confident that our commitment to quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism will enable us to achieve our goals and make a positive impact on the lives of the communities we serve.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:30:31.000Z'),
(1439, 'Jyoti Travels - Taxi Service in Guwahati | Car Rental Service in Guwahati | Best Cab Service in Guwahati', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Jyoti Travels: Your Trusted Partner for Taxi and Car Rental Services in Guwahati</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, Guwahati serves as a vibrant gateway to the Northeast. Jyoti Travels is proud to be a leading provider of reliable and efficient taxi and car rental services within this bustling city. We understand that navigating Guwahati, whether for business or leisure, requires seamless transportation solutions. Our commitment to safety, punctuality, and customer satisfaction has established us as a preferred choice for both local residents and visitors alike. We strive to redefine the standards of transportation services in Guwahati, contributing to the region’s growing connectivity and economic prosperity.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service lies in providing a comprehensive suite of transportation options tailored to meet diverse needs. We offer a range of well-maintained vehicles, from compact cars ideal for city commutes to spacious SUVs perfect for family trips and group excursions to destinations surrounding Guwahati. Whether you require a quick taxi ride across town, a full-day car rental for exploring Assam''s scenic beauty, or airport transfer services, Jyoti Travels has you covered. We offer both chauffeur-driven and self-drive options, ensuring flexibility and convenience for our clientele. Our fleet undergoes regular maintenance and safety checks to guarantee a comfortable and secure travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets Jyoti Travels apart is our unwavering focus on customer satisfaction. We understand that travel can be stressful, and we are dedicated to alleviating that stress by providing a seamless and hassle-free booking process. Our online booking platform is user-friendly and efficient, allowing customers to reserve vehicles quickly and easily. We also offer dedicated customer support via phone and email, ensuring that assistance is always readily available. Our drivers are professionally trained, courteous, and knowledgeable about local routes, committed to providing a safe and pleasant journey. We also emphasize transparency in our pricing, ensuring that our customers are fully aware of all costs involved upfront, with no hidden fees or surprises. This commitment to ethical and transparent business practices has earned us the trust and loyalty of our customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond simply providing transportation, Jyoti Travels actively engages with the local community. We prioritize hiring local drivers, contributing to employment opportunities within Guwahati. We also support local tourism by providing information and recommendations on attractions and activities in the region, helping visitors discover the hidden gems of Assam. We believe in sustainable business practices, actively exploring ways to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a greener Guwahati. We are committed to being a responsible corporate citizen, participating in community initiatives and supporting local causes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Jyoti Travels is poised for continued growth and expansion. Our vision is to become the undisputed leader in taxi and car rental services in Guwahati and the surrounding region. We plan to achieve this by continuously investing in our fleet, technology, and people. We are exploring opportunities to expand our service offerings to include specialized transportation solutions, such as corporate travel packages and event transportation. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance our customer experience, including implementing real-time tracking and mobile app booking capabilities. We are committed to staying ahead of the curve and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers. Our long-term goal is to not only provide transportation but also to facilitate meaningful connections and contribute to the vibrant tapestry of Guwahati''s community and economy. We aim to be synonymous with reliability, convenience, and exceptional service, solidifying our position as the best cab service in Guwahati for years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.322Z', '2025-12-07T05:30:36.000Z'),
(1440, 'Albatross Journey', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Albatross Journey: Navigating Your Path to Success in Assam''s Dynamic Landscape</p>

<p>Nestled at Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute, Albatross Journey is a comprehensive business solutions provider dedicated to empowering individuals and organizations to achieve their full potential within the vibrant and evolving Assam business environment. More than just a service provider, we are a dedicated partner committed to understanding the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the region, offering tailored solutions designed to drive sustainable growth and lasting success. Albatross Journey stands apart by combining global best practices with a deep understanding of local nuances, creating a truly unique value proposition for our clients.</p>

<br> <br>

