(1457, 'Trail & Tides - India''s Trusted Travel Agency', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Trail & Tides: India''s Trusted Travel Agency, nestled at 3, Gopal Boro Path, Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to experiencing the diverse beauty and rich culture of India and beyond. Founded on a passion for exploration and a commitment to exceptional service, Trail & Tides has rapidly become a trusted name in the Assamese travel landscape, connecting local residents with unforgettable journeys. In a region known for its breathtaking landscapes and vibrant traditions, Trail & Tides stands out by tailoring travel experiences that resonate with the unique interests and aspirations of its clientele. We bridge the gap between dream destinations and seamless travel execution, making adventure accessible and enjoyable for everyone.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Trail & Tides lies a commitment to providing comprehensive travel solutions. Our core services encompass meticulously planned domestic and international tour packages, catering to a wide spectrum of travel preferences, from adventure tourism and cultural immersion to relaxing getaways and spiritual pilgrimages. We specialize in crafting personalized itineraries that cater to individual needs and budgets. We manage every detail, from securing flights and accommodations to arranging local transportation and guided tours. Furthermore, Trail & Tides offers expert assistance with visa applications, travel insurance, and currency exchange, ensuring a stress-free and enjoyable travel experience from start to finish. A key differentiator for Trail & Tides is our in-depth knowledge of the Northeast Indian region. We curate specialized tours that showcase the hidden gems of Assam, Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, and other neighboring states, offering travelers a unique opportunity to explore the region''s natural beauty and cultural heritage. These curated experiences often include visits to tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, tribal villages, and historical sites, providing an authentic and immersive travel experience. By focusing on local and regional tourism, Trail & Tides actively contributes to the economic development of the area and promotes sustainable tourism practices.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Trail & Tides. We believe that every journey should be exceptional, and we strive to exceed our customers'' expectations at every touchpoint. Our team of experienced and dedicated travel consultants are passionate about travel and committed to providing personalized attention and expert advice. We take the time to understand our customers'' needs and preferences, ensuring that every itinerary is tailored to their specific requirements. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness and attention to detail, providing prompt and efficient support throughout the entire travel process. Beyond simply booking travel arrangements, we build relationships with our customers, becoming their trusted travel partners. We regularly host travel seminars and workshops, sharing valuable travel tips and insights with the local community. We also actively engage with local businesses and organizations, sponsoring community events and promoting local tourism initiatives. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, Trail & Tides has established itself as a trusted and respected member of the Assamese business landscape.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking to the future, Trail & Tides envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as India''s leading travel agency. Our long-term goals include expanding our network of partner hotels and tour operators, both domestically and internationally, to offer an even wider range of travel options to our customers. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online booking platform and streamline our operations. One key area of focus is the development of sustainable tourism initiatives. We are committed to promoting responsible travel practices that minimize our environmental impact and benefit local communities. We plan to partner with local organizations to support conservation efforts and promote eco-friendly tourism options. Furthermore, we aim to expand our range of specialized tours, catering to niche markets such as adventure tourism, wellness tourism, and culinary tourism. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market, Trail & Tides is poised for continued growth and success, bringing the world closer to the people of Assam and showcasing the beauty of India to the world.</p>', '3, Gopal Boro Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T05:50:21.000Z'),
(1458, 'MyTRIPMATE', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'MyTRIPMATE, strategically located at 2nd floor, 63, Kekora Nagar Path, Guwahati, Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel and tourism solution provider, catering specifically to the burgeoning needs of the Northeast Indian market. Beyond simply arranging trips, MyTRIPMATE aims to be a trusted companion for travelers, offering bespoke itineraries, seamless logistics, and authentic cultural experiences. In a region brimming with untapped tourism potential, MyTRIPMATE distinguishes itself through its deep understanding of local nuances, commitment to sustainable tourism practices, and dedication to creating unforgettable journeys. It stands as a vital link connecting travelers with the rich heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and diverse communities that Assam and the wider Northeast have to offer.

