(1460, 'KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS, strategically located within the renowned Alankar Hotel on MRD Road, M.R.D.Road, represents a premier gateway to experiencing the unparalleled natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam, with a particular focus on the UNESCO World Heritage site, Kaziranga National Park. More than just a travel agency, KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS acts as a dedicated concierge, crafting bespoke travel itineraries that cater to discerning travelers seeking authentic and immersive experiences. We distinguish ourselves through a deep-rooted understanding of the local ecosystem, fostering responsible tourism practices, and providing unparalleled personalized service that transforms a simple vacation into a memorable journey.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing seamless and comprehensive travel solutions centered on Kaziranga National Park and the surrounding region of Assam. These services encompass a wide range of offerings, including: expertly guided jeep safaris into Kaziranga, allowing close encounters with the famed one-horned rhinoceros and other diverse wildlife; meticulously planned birdwatching tours, capitalizing on Kaziranga''s status as an Important Bird Area; comfortable and convenient transportation arrangements, utilizing well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers familiar with the local terrain; pre-arranged accommodation at a variety of lodging options, ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts; and customized cultural immersion programs, showcasing the traditions, cuisine, and art forms of the local Assamese communities. KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS provides specialized trekking and adventure packages for those seeking a more active exploration of the region''s hills and forests, ensuring safety and environmental responsibility are paramount.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS apart is our commitment to providing a uniquely tailored experience. We understand that each traveler has distinct preferences and expectations. Therefore, we engage in detailed consultations to understand their interests, budget, and desired level of activity. This information allows us to create personalized itineraries that perfectly align with their individual needs. Furthermore, our strong relationships with local communities enable us to offer authentic experiences that go beyond typical tourist attractions. These include opportunities to interact with local artisans, participate in traditional festivals, and savor home-cooked meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients. This immersive approach fosters a deeper appreciation for the region''s culture and contributes to the economic empowerment of local communities.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our team consists of knowledgeable and passionate travel professionals who are dedicated to providing prompt, courteous, and efficient support to our clients. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, we are committed to ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We go the extra mile to anticipate our clients'' needs and address any concerns promptly and effectively. Our presence within Alankar Hotel provides a convenient and accessible point of contact for guests, allowing us to offer immediate assistance and personalized recommendations. We are active participants in local tourism initiatives and strive to promote responsible tourism practices that benefit both the environment and the local communities. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continually improve our services and enhance the overall customer experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and culturally enriching travel experiences in the Kaziranga region. Our future plans involve expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as wildlife photography, tea tourism, and river cruises on the Brahmaputra. We aim to strengthen our partnerships with local communities to create new and innovative tourism products that showcase the region''s unique cultural heritage. Investing in digital marketing and online booking platforms to reach a wider audience and streamline the booking process is also a key priority. Moreover, we are committed to promoting responsible tourism practices that minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the conservation of Kaziranga National Park''s unique biodiversity. By focusing on sustainable growth and continuous improvement, KAZIRANGA HOLIDAYS aims to solidify its position as a trusted and respected travel partner for travelers seeking authentic and unforgettable experiences in Assam.</p>', 'Alankar Hotel , MRD Road, M.R.D.Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T05:55:08.000Z'),
(1461, 'Jumbo Safari Best Car Hire,Tempo Traveller Hire, Innova Crysta hire, Ertiga Hire', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Jumbo Safari: Your Premier Transportation Partner in Assam</p>

<p>Jumbo Safari Best Car Hire, Tempo Traveller Hire, Innova Crysta Hire, Ertiga Hire is dedicated to providing reliable, comfortable, and convenient transportation solutions across Assam. Situated at a strategically advantageous location, Jumbo Safari has quickly established itself as a trusted name for both individual travelers and larger groups seeking efficient and dependable car rental services. Our commitment to customer satisfaction, combined with a diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles, positions us as a key player in the region''s growing tourism and business sectors. We understand the unique transportation needs of Assam, from navigating bustling city streets to exploring the serene landscapes, and tailor our services to meet those specific demands.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service revolves around providing a wide array of vehicle rental options designed to suit diverse needs and budgets. We specialize in four primary vehicle categories:</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
<li><b>Best Car Hire:</b> Offering a range of compact and mid-size cars ideal for individual travelers or small families seeking efficient and economical transportation within city limits or for shorter excursions. These vehicles prioritize fuel efficiency and ease of maneuverability.</li>
<li><b>Tempo Traveller Hire:</b> Catering to larger groups, our Tempo Travellers provide comfortable and spacious transportation for family outings, corporate events, and pilgrimage tours. These vehicles are equipped with ample seating and luggage space, ensuring a relaxed and enjoyable journey.</li>
<li><b>Innova Crysta Hire:</b> The Innova Crysta, renowned for its reliability, comfort, and spaciousness, is perfect for families and business travelers requiring a premium transportation experience. Ideal for long-distance travel and navigating challenging terrains, the Innova Crysta offers a smooth and secure ride.</li>
<li><b>Ertiga Hire:</b> Offering a blend of affordability and practicality, the Ertiga is a popular choice for families and smaller groups needing a versatile and fuel-efficient multi-purpose vehicle. Its compact size makes it easy to maneuver in urban areas, while its spacious interior provides comfortable seating for passengers.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling points are rooted in our dedication to providing a seamless and hassle-free rental experience. We emphasize transparency in our pricing, ensuring that customers are fully aware of all costs upfront, with no hidden fees. Our vehicles undergo regular maintenance checks to guarantee optimal performance and safety. We also offer flexible rental packages to accommodate varying durations and itineraries. Furthermore, we provide convenient pick-up and drop-off options, catering to the specific needs of our clientele. Understanding the local market needs, we focus on providing vehicles suitable for Assam''s diverse terrain, including its hilly regions and sometimes challenging road conditions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Jumbo Safari, we firmly believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered on building strong relationships with our customers by providing personalized attention and prompt assistance. Our team is trained to be courteous, knowledgeable, and responsive to all inquiries and requests. We strive to go the extra mile to ensure that every customer has a positive and memorable experience. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and processes. While we are committed to serving tourists and business travelers, we also recognize the importance of connecting with the local community. We aim to participate in local events and initiatives, supporting and contributing to the well-being of the communities we serve.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Jumbo Safari envisions becoming the leading transportation provider in Assam, recognized for its unwavering commitment to quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our fleet to incorporate a wider range of vehicles, including electric vehicles, to promote sustainable tourism. We also intend to invest in advanced technology to streamline our booking process and enhance the overall customer experience. Exploring partnerships with local hotels, tour operators, and businesses to create integrated travel packages is also part of our long-term strategy. We aim to establish a network of service centers across the state to provide convenient maintenance and support to our customers. Ultimately, our goal is to contribute to the growth of Assam''s tourism sector by providing safe, reliable, and affordable transportation solutions for all.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T05:55:14.000Z'),
(1462, 'IGuwahati Tours And Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>IGuwahati Tours And Travels is a leading travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences in and around Guwahati, Assam. Rooted in a deep appreciation for the region''s natural beauty, cultural heritage, and historical significance, we strive to be more than just a tour operator; we aim to be ambassadors of Assam, connecting travelers with the soul of the land. We understand the nuances of local travel, offering curated experiences that cater to both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and enriching adventures. Recognizing the increasing demand for sustainable and responsible tourism, we are committed to practices that minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of local communities.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core service offerings are meticulously designed to showcase the best of Assam and the surrounding Northeast region. We specialize in customized tour packages, encompassing everything from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park to cultural explorations of ancient temples and vibrant tribal villages. We offer diverse packages, including adventure tourism options like river rafting and trekking, spiritual journeys to revered pilgrimage sites, and serene retreats to tea gardens offering immersive experiences in tea production. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to personalization. Unlike generic tour operators, we meticulously tailor each itinerary to the specific interests, preferences, and budget of our clients. We handle all aspects of travel planning, including transportation (flights, trains, and private vehicles), accommodation (ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury hotels), guided tours with knowledgeable local experts, and visa assistance for international travelers. We recognize that the local market desires seamless travel experiences, and we ensure that every detail is taken care of, allowing our clients to relax and fully immerse themselves in their journey. We also offer specialized services such as corporate travel arrangements, school and college excursions, and assistance with organizing events and conferences in Guwahati and the surrounding areas.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At IGuwahati Tours And Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered on building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their needs, and exceeding their expectations. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are highly trained, knowledgeable about the region, and passionate about creating unforgettable travel experiences. We provide personalized attention to each client, offering expert advice, prompt assistance, and 24/7 support throughout their journey. We understand that trust is essential in the travel industry, and we strive to earn that trust by being transparent, reliable, and ethical in all our dealings. We actively engage with the local community, partnering with local businesses, supporting community-based tourism initiatives, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We also regularly participate in local events and festivals, showcasing our services and connecting with potential clients. We value feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall travel experience. Our goal is to create loyal customers who will recommend us to their friends and family.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, IGuwahati Tours And Travels envisions becoming the leading tour operator in Assam, recognized for our commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more niche travel experiences, such as birdwatching tours, photography tours, and culinary tours, showcasing the diverse flora, fauna, and cuisine of the region. We intend to leverage technology to enhance our online presence, improve our booking processes, and provide our clients with a more seamless and personalized travel experience. This includes developing a user-friendly website with online booking capabilities and a mobile app that provides real-time travel updates and support. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to provide exceptional customer service. We aim to forge strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, such as hotels, airlines, and local communities, to create a more integrated and sustainable tourism ecosystem. Our long-term goal is to promote Assam as a premier tourist destination, attracting visitors from all over the world and contributing to the economic growth and social well-being of the region.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T05:55:20.000Z'),
(1463, 'Mitali Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Mitali Travels: Connecting Assam, One Journey at a Time

Nestled in the heart of Boripara, near the Flyover at Block-D 4 Grp Colony, Mitali Travels is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to exploring the rich tapestry of Assam and beyond. In a region brimming with natural beauty, vibrant culture, and increasing economic activity, Mitali Travels stands out as a reliable and customer-focused travel partner, committed to delivering seamless and memorable experiences. We understand the unique needs of the local Assamese community, from facilitating pilgrimages to ensuring smooth corporate travel, and are dedicated to providing personalized services that exceed expectations. Our significance lies not just in arranging travel, but in fostering connections, enabling exploration, and contributing to the region''s economic growth by supporting tourism and facilitating business travel.

<br> <br>

At its core, Mitali Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. Our primary offerings include:

*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that showcase the hidden gems of Assam, from the majestic Brahmaputra River to the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam, and the spiritual Kamakhya Temple. We also offer packages to popular destinations across India and internationally, meticulously planned to suit individual preferences and budgets.
*   **Airline Ticketing:** We provide a hassle-free airline ticketing service, ensuring competitive fares and convenient flight schedules. Our experienced agents are adept at navigating complex booking systems to find the best deals and assist with itinerary planning.
*   **Hotel Reservations:** Leveraging strong partnerships with hotels across various categories, from budget-friendly options to luxury resorts, we secure comfortable and convenient accommodations for our clients. We prioritize locations that are accessible, safe, and reflective of the local culture.
*   **Vehicle Rentals:** Whether it''s a compact car for exploring the city or a comfortable SUV for a family road trip, we offer a diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles for rent. Our vehicle rental service provides flexibility and convenience, allowing travelers to explore at their own pace.
*   **Pilgrimage Tours:** Understanding the deep-rooted spiritual beliefs of the local community, we meticulously organize pilgrimage tours to sacred sites across India, ensuring a comfortable and spiritually enriching experience for our clients.

What sets Mitali Travels apart is our unwavering commitment to personalization. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we tailor our services to meet their specific needs and preferences. Our deep understanding of the local market, combined with our dedication to providing exceptional customer service, makes us the preferred travel partner for individuals, families, and businesses alike. We also pride ourselves on ethical and transparent business practices, ensuring fair pricing and clear communication throughout the booking process. This level of trust and reliability is crucial in building lasting relationships within the community.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is the cornerstone of Mitali Travels. We believe in building relationships, not just processing transactions. Our approach is rooted in empathy, understanding, and a genuine desire to help our clients create unforgettable travel experiences. From the moment a customer walks through our doors or contacts us online, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff take the time to understand their needs, answer their questions, and provide expert guidance.

We go the extra mile to ensure that every journey is seamless and stress-free. We provide pre-trip briefings, offer 24/7 support during travel, and proactively address any potential issues that may arise. Our commitment to customer satisfaction has earned us a loyal following within the local community, with many clients returning to us time and again for their travel needs. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, further strengthening our connection with the community and demonstrating our commitment to its well-being. We also gather feedback regularly to improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding customer expectations.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Mitali Travels envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, becoming the leading travel agency in the region. Our long-term goals include:

*   **Expanding our network:** We plan to establish strategic partnerships with more hotels, airlines, and tour operators, both domestically and internationally, to offer our clients an even wider range of options.
*   **Investing in technology:** We are committed to leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and implementing advanced customer relationship management (CRM) systems.
*   **Developing niche tourism products:** We aim to develop specialized tour packages that cater to specific interests, such as eco-tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural tourism, capitalizing on the region''s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage.
*   **Promoting sustainable tourism:** We are committed to promoting responsible and sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities.
*   **Training and development:** We will continue to invest in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional customer service.

Mitali Travels is dedicated to remaining a trusted and reliable travel partner for the people of Assam, fostering connections, enabling exploration, and contributing to the region''s economic and cultural growth for years to come. We are more than just a travel agency; we are your partners in exploration.', 'Block-d 4 Grp Colony Boripara, near Flyover', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T05:55:28.000Z'),
(1464, 'Cozy Tour & Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Cozy Tour & Travels, nestled in the heart of Assam, offers unparalleled travel experiences tailored to showcase the region''s rich cultural heritage and breathtaking natural beauty. We distinguish ourselves in Assam''s vibrant tourism sector by focusing on personalized service, sustainable practices, and immersive journeys that connect travelers with the soul of Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel needs, from meticulously planned itineraries to comfortable and reliable transportation. We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that cater to diverse interests, including wildlife enthusiasts seeking encounters with the region''s unique fauna in Kaziranga National Park, cultural explorers eager to delve into the traditions of Assam''s various communities, and adventure seekers yearning for thrilling treks amidst the Himalayan foothills. A key differentiator lies in our emphasis on eco-tourism. We partner with local communities, promoting responsible travel that benefits both the environment and the local economy. We offer guided tours led by experienced local experts who share their intimate knowledge of the region''s history, ecology, and culture. Beyond tour packages, we provide comprehensive travel assistance, including hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (car rentals and chartered vehicles), and visa assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience for our clients. We also offer specialized pilgrimage tours, catering to the significant religious tourism within Assam, thoughtfully arranged to facilitate spiritual journeys to renowned temples and sacred sites.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Cozy Tour & Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We are committed to building lasting relationships with our clients by providing prompt, personalized attention and exceeding their expectations at every step of their journey. Our approach is centered on understanding each client''s unique needs and preferences, allowing us to curate experiences that are truly memorable and fulfilling. We foster a welcoming and supportive environment, ensuring that our clients feel comfortable and cared for throughout their travels. Our commitment extends beyond our clients to the local community. We actively participate in local initiatives, supporting sustainable tourism practices that preserve Assam''s natural beauty and promote economic empowerment within the communities we serve. We regularly conduct training programs for local guides and drivers, equipping them with the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service and contribute to the growth of the tourism sector. We also partner with local artisans and businesses, showcasing their products and services to our clients, thereby supporting the local economy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future of Cozy Tour & Travels is bright. We envision becoming the leading tour operator in Assam, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our growth strategy includes expanding our service offerings to cater to emerging travel trends, such as wellness tourism and adventure sports. We plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our operations, making it easier for clients to book and manage their travel arrangements. Furthermore, we intend to forge strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including airlines, hotels, and travel agencies, to expand our reach and offer a wider range of travel options. We are also committed to expanding our network of local guides and drivers, ensuring that we can continue to provide exceptional service as our business grows. In the long term, we aspire to contribute significantly to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices that benefit both the environment and the local communities. We aim to become a model for other tourism businesses in the region, demonstrating that it is possible to achieve both commercial success and social responsibility.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T05:55:34.000Z'),
(1465, 'Sarothi Tourism', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Sarothi Tourism, nestled at House No - 62, 16 - Jogen Baruah Ln, Nabagraha Rd, Guwahati, stands as a dedicated facilitator of enriching travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Rooted in a deep appreciation for the region''s natural beauty, cultural tapestry, and historical significance, Sarothi Tourism distinguishes itself by offering meticulously crafted itineraries that go beyond typical tourist routes, providing immersive and authentic encounters with the heart of Assam. In a landscape often dominated by larger, impersonal travel agencies, Sarothi Tourism offers a personalized and locally-informed approach, contributing meaningfully to the Assam tourism ecosystem by promoting sustainable practices and showcasing the region''s unique offerings.

<br> <br>

Sarothi Tourism''s core service revolves around designing and delivering bespoke travel packages that cater to diverse interests and budgets. These packages encompass a wide spectrum of experiences, including wildlife safaris in renowned national parks like Kaziranga and Manas, spiritual journeys to revered temples and monasteries, exploration of tea gardens with opportunities for tea tasting and factory visits, river cruises on the majestic Brahmaputra, and cultural immersion programs featuring traditional music, dance, and cuisine. What truly sets Sarothi Tourism apart is its commitment to providing customized itineraries. Understanding that each traveler possesses unique preferences, Sarothi Tourism dedicates time to understand individual needs and craft experiences accordingly. This bespoke approach extends to accommodation choices, transportation arrangements, and activity selections, ensuring a seamless and memorable journey. Furthermore, Sarothi Tourism actively promotes eco-tourism and sustainable travel practices, working with local communities to ensure that tourism benefits the region while minimizing environmental impact. This commitment resonates deeply with the growing demand for responsible and conscious travel experiences.

<br> <br>

Sarothi Tourism prioritizes creating exceptional customer experiences. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, every interaction is characterized by genuine care, responsiveness, and a deep understanding of the traveler''s needs. The business emphasizes clear communication, providing detailed information about itineraries, accommodation options, and travel logistics. Moreover, Sarothi Tourism employs knowledgeable and passionate tour guides who are not only well-versed in the region''s history and culture but also adept at creating engaging and interactive experiences. Beyond the provision of travel services, Sarothi Tourism actively engages with the local community. This involves partnering with local artisans, promoting homestays in villages, and supporting initiatives that preserve Assam''s cultural heritage. By fostering strong relationships with local communities, Sarothi Tourism ensures that tourism benefits are shared equitably and that travelers gain a deeper understanding of the region''s authentic culture and traditions. This dedication to community involvement fosters goodwill and enhances the overall travel experience for visitors.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Sarothi Tourism envisions becoming a leading provider of sustainable and culturally immersive travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast. Future plans include expanding its service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as birdwatching, photography, or culinary exploration. Another key focus area is strengthening its online presence and leveraging digital marketing channels to reach a wider audience of potential travelers. Sarothi Tourism is also committed to investing in training and development programs for its staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote sustainable tourism practices. The long-term goal is to establish Sarothi Tourism as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with authentic, responsible, and unforgettable travel experiences in Assam, contributing significantly to the region''s tourism sector while preserving its unique cultural and natural heritage. This includes exploring opportunities to partner with other tourism stakeholders in the region to create collaborative initiatives that benefit the entire tourism ecosystem.', 'House No - 62, 16 - Jogen Baruah Ln, Nabagraha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T06:00:10.000Z'),
(1466, 'S SQUARE TRAVELS', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>S SQUARE TRAVELS, located at 18 [Street Name, if known, else mention area], is a premier travel agency nestled in the heart of Assam, dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences tailored to the unique needs and desires of its clientele. In a region renowned for its breathtaking natural beauty, rich cultural heritage, and burgeoning tourism sector, S SQUARE TRAVELS distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and unwavering focus on sustainable travel practices.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Unlike larger, impersonal agencies, S SQUARE TRAVELS operates with a keen understanding of the Assam landscape and the evolving demands of both domestic and international travelers. The agency''s significance lies in its ability to bridge the gap between the desire for authentic cultural immersion and the need for seamless, hassle-free travel arrangements. By fostering strong relationships with local communities and promoting responsible tourism initiatives, S SQUARE TRAVELS plays a vital role in preserving Assam''s natural and cultural treasures for generations to come.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>S SQUARE TRAVELS offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to diverse needs, ranging from leisure travel and adventure tourism to corporate travel and customized tour packages. The agency''s primary services include expertly crafted tour packages highlighting Assam''s most iconic destinations, such as Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and the tea gardens of Upper Assam. These packages are meticulously designed to provide immersive experiences that go beyond typical sightseeing, incorporating cultural interactions, eco-friendly activities, and opportunities to support local artisans and communities.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Beyond pre-packaged tours, S SQUARE TRAVELS excels in creating bespoke travel itineraries tailored to individual preferences and budgets. Whether it''s arranging a romantic getaway to a secluded hill station, organizing a group trekking expedition in the Himalayas, or coordinating a seamless business trip with logistical support, the agency''s experienced travel consultants work closely with clients to understand their specific requirements and create unforgettable travel experiences. Additionally, S SQUARE TRAVELS offers a range of ancillary services, including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, car rentals, and visa assistance, ensuring a complete and stress-free travel planning process.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>A key differentiating factor for S SQUARE TRAVELS is its deep-rooted local expertise. The agency''s team comprises experienced travel professionals who possess an intimate understanding of Assam''s geography, culture, and tourism infrastructure. This local knowledge enables them to provide valuable insights and recommendations that are not readily available through online resources or larger travel agencies. For example, they can suggest hidden gems, off-the-beaten-path destinations, and authentic cultural experiences that truly capture the essence of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>S SQUARE TRAVELS understands the unique needs of the local market. Many residents seek reliable and affordable travel options for family vacations, pilgrimages, and business trips within India and abroad. The agency caters to this demand by offering competitive pricing, flexible payment options, and personalized assistance throughout the travel planning process. Furthermore, S SQUARE TRAVELS actively promotes sustainable tourism practices, encouraging travelers to respect the environment, support local communities, and minimize their impact on Assam''s delicate ecosystems. This commitment to responsible tourism resonates strongly with environmentally conscious travelers and reinforces the agency''s position as a trusted and ethical travel partner.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of S SQUARE TRAVELS''s business philosophy. The agency strives to create a memorable and enjoyable travel experience for every client, from the initial consultation to the final farewell. The customer service approach is characterized by personalized attention, proactive communication, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. Travel consultants take the time to understand each client''s unique needs and preferences, offering tailored recommendations and expert advice to ensure a seamless and stress-free travel experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>S SQUARE TRAVELS distinguishes itself through its commitment to building lasting relationships with its clients. The agency actively seeks feedback from travelers to continuously improve its services and tailor its offerings to evolving needs. It cultivates a sense of community by hosting travel events, workshops, and online forums where travelers can share their experiences, learn about new destinations, and connect with like-minded individuals. The agency also actively participates in local community events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to supporting the growth and development of Assam''s tourism sector.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, S SQUARE TRAVELS envisions significant growth potential within the burgeoning Assam tourism market. The agency plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized travel packages catering to niche interests, such as wildlife photography, birdwatching, and cultural immersion. It also intends to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows travelers to easily browse tour packages, book flights and accommodations, and access real-time travel information.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Furthermore, S SQUARE TRAVELS is committed to strengthening its partnerships with local communities and promoting sustainable tourism practices. The agency plans to collaborate with local artisans and entrepreneurs to offer authentic cultural experiences and support local economies. It also intends to invest in training programs for its staff to enhance their knowledge of sustainable tourism principles and best practices. The long-term goal of S SQUARE TRAVELS is to become the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and unwavering commitment to responsible tourism.</p>', '18', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T06:00:17.000Z'),
(1467, 'Travel Angles', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Travel Angles: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond, Located Near the Post Office

Travel Angles is a premier travel agency situated conveniently near the Post Office, serving as a vital link connecting the local community in Assam with the wider world. More than just a booking service, Travel Angles is committed to crafting personalized and unforgettable travel experiences, leveraging deep local knowledge and a passion for exploration. We distinguish ourselves through a dedication to understanding individual travel aspirations, ensuring each journey is tailored to exceed expectations. In a region rich in natural beauty and cultural heritage like Assam, Travel Angles plays a critical role in facilitating accessible and enriching travel opportunities for both residents and visitors.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing comprehensive travel solutions, encompassing both domestic and international destinations. These services include expertly curated tour packages designed to showcase the best of Assam and Northeast India, highlighting the region''s stunning landscapes, vibrant culture, and unique biodiversity. We offer customized itineraries catering to diverse interests, from adventurous treks in the Himalayas to serene river cruises on the Brahmaputra. Beyond regional exploration, Travel Angles facilitates seamless international travel with flight bookings, hotel reservations, visa assistance, and travel insurance. A unique selling point is our specialized expertise in crafting sustainable and responsible travel experiences, promoting ecotourism and supporting local communities. We understand the specific needs of the local market, including budget considerations, language preferences, and cultural sensitivities, ensuring a comfortable and hassle-free travel experience for every client.

<br> <br>

At Travel Angles, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients through personalized attention and exceptional service. Our team of experienced travel consultants takes the time to understand each client''s unique requirements, providing expert advice and guidance throughout the entire travel planning process. We go the extra mile to anticipate potential challenges and proactively address them, ensuring a smooth and stress-free journey. Beyond simply booking flights and hotels, we provide valuable insights into local customs, attractions, and dining options, empowering our clients to make the most of their travels. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our business operations. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a strong connection with the people we serve. We believe in promoting responsible tourism that benefits both travelers and the local community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Travel Angles envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. We plan to expand our range of services to include niche travel experiences, such as culinary tours, wildlife safaris, and cultural immersion programs. We are also exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and support the local economy. A key element of our future strategy involves leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are investing in a user-friendly online platform that will allow clients to easily browse tour packages, book flights and hotels, and access travel information. Our long-term goal is to become a trusted travel partner, empowering individuals to explore the world while contributing to the sustainable development of the region.', 'near Post Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T06:00:21.000Z'),
(1468, 'Travel Northeast', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Travel Northeast is a premier travel agency nestled in the heart of Assam, dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences throughout Northeast India. Recognizing the region''s burgeoning tourism sector and the increasing demand for expertly curated itineraries, Travel Northeast positions itself as a vital bridge, connecting travelers with the diverse landscapes, rich cultural heritage, and warm hospitality that characterize this unique corner of India. The agency differentiates itself through its deep local knowledge, commitment to sustainable tourism practices, and personalized approach to crafting unforgettable adventures. Travel Northeast isn''t just booking trips; it''s crafting immersive experiences that leave lasting impressions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Travel Northeast offers a comprehensive suite of travel-related services designed to cater to a wide range of traveler preferences. These include meticulously planned tour packages focusing on various themes, such as wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, cultural immersions in the tribal villages of Arunachal Pradesh, adventurous treks through the hills of Meghalaya, and spiritual journeys to the ancient temples of Assam. Beyond pre-designed packages, the agency specializes in creating bespoke itineraries, tailoring each trip to the individual needs and interests of its clients. This personalized approach ensures that every traveler enjoys a truly unique and authentic experience. Further bolstering its service offerings, Travel Northeast provides assistance with flight and train bookings, hotel reservations, car rentals, and permits required for visiting restricted areas within the Northeast. A key differentiator lies in its network of trusted local guides and accommodation partners, ensuring seamless logistics and access to hidden gems often overlooked by mainstream tourism. Travel Northeast actively promotes eco-tourism by partnering with local communities and emphasizing responsible travel practices, thereby contributing to the preservation of the region''s natural beauty and cultural identity. These core services directly address the needs of the local market by providing convenient access to high-quality travel experiences within the region, fostering both domestic and international tourism.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Travel Northeast places immense emphasis on cultivating exceptional customer experiences, recognizing that word-of-mouth referrals and positive reviews are crucial for long-term success. The agency employs a team of highly trained and passionate travel consultants who are dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert advice at every stage of the journey, from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. The focus is on building genuine relationships with customers, understanding their specific needs and preferences, and exceeding their expectations at every turn. What sets Travel Northeast apart is its proactive approach to problem-solving and its unwavering commitment to ensuring customer satisfaction. A dedicated customer support team is available 24/7 to address any concerns or emergencies that may arise during a trip. Travel Northeast also actively engages with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring cultural initiatives, and promoting local artisans and businesses. This active involvement helps to build trust and goodwill within the community, solidifying the agency''s position as a responsible and valued member of the local business landscape. By fostering a culture of empathy, responsiveness, and genuine care, Travel Northeast strives to create unforgettable travel experiences that leave customers feeling valued, respected, and deeply connected to the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Travel Northeast envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel solutions. Future plans include expanding its network of local partners, developing new and exciting tour packages that showcase the region''s diverse attractions, and leveraging technology to enhance the overall customer experience. The agency aims to invest in digital marketing and social media to reach a wider audience and promote Northeast India as a premier travel destination. Furthermore, Travel Northeast plans to establish a training center to equip local youth with the skills and knowledge necessary to thrive in the tourism industry, thereby contributing to the economic development of the region. Long-term goals include obtaining certifications for sustainable tourism practices, partnering with international organizations to promote responsible travel, and establishing a foundation to support local conservation efforts. By consistently innovating, investing in its people, and prioritizing sustainability, Travel Northeast is poised to capitalize on the growing demand for authentic and meaningful travel experiences in Northeast India, securing its position as a vital player in the region''s tourism sector for years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T06:00:27.000Z'),
(1469, 'Imperial Destinations', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Imperial Destinations: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Assam and Beyond</p>

<p>Located in the heart of Guwahati at Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Hotel Rajdhani Regency, Imperial Destinations is a premier travel agency dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences both within Assam and across India. Recognizing the rich tapestry of cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and untapped tourism potential of Assam, we have positioned ourselves as a key player in fostering sustainable tourism while providing unparalleled service to our clientele. Our strategic location, easily accessible and widely known, provides a convenient starting point for travelers embarking on their Assam adventures. Imperial Destinations stands out by offering personalized travel solutions tailored to individual preferences, coupled with a deep understanding of the local nuances that ensure a truly authentic and memorable journey.</p>

<p>At the core of Imperial Destinations lies a commitment to providing comprehensive travel services that encompass every aspect of our clients'' needs. Our primary service offerings include:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that cater to diverse interests, from wildlife enthusiasts eager to explore Kaziranga National Park to cultural aficionados seeking to immerse themselves in the traditions of Majuli Island. These packages are meticulously designed to incorporate comfortable accommodations, reliable transportation, and engaging activities that showcase the best of each destination.</li>
<li><b>Hotel and Accommodation Bookings:</b> Leveraging our extensive network of partner hotels and guesthouses, we offer a wide range of accommodation options to suit every budget and preference. We prioritize establishments that uphold high standards of hygiene, comfort, and hospitality, ensuring a restful and rejuvenating stay for our clients.</li>
<li><b>Transportation Services:</b> We provide seamless transportation solutions, including car rentals, private transfers, and guided tours, ensuring that our clients can navigate the region with ease and comfort. Our vehicles are well-maintained and driven by experienced professionals who prioritize safety and punctuality.</li>
<li><b>Flight and Train Ticketing:</b> We facilitate the booking of domestic and international flights, as well as train tickets, making it convenient for our clients to plan their travel arrangements from start to finish.</li>
<li><b>Permits and Documentation Assistance:</b> Understanding the complexities of travel regulations, particularly in sensitive areas, we offer assistance with obtaining necessary permits and documentation, ensuring a hassle-free travel experience.</li>
</ul>

<p>What sets Imperial Destinations apart is our unwavering dedication to personalized service and our in-depth knowledge of the local terrain. We don''t just sell travel packages; we create experiences. Our team comprises seasoned travel experts who possess a genuine passion for Assam and its surrounding regions. They are adept at crafting itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist attractions, uncovering hidden gems and providing insights into the local culture and traditions. This commitment to authenticity, combined with our focus on sustainable tourism practices, positions us as a responsible and trusted partner for travelers seeking to explore the wonders of Assam.</p>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Imperial Destinations. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where every client feels valued and understood. Our customer service approach is built on:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand each client''s individual needs and preferences, tailoring our services accordingly.</li>
<li><b>Proactive Communication:</b> We maintain open and transparent communication throughout the planning and execution phases of the trip, keeping our clients informed and reassured.</li>
<li><b>24/7 Support:</b> We provide round-the-clock support to address any questions or concerns that may arise during the trip, ensuring a seamless and stress-free experience.</li>
<li><b>Building Community Ties:</b> We actively engage with the local community by partnering with local artisans, supporting eco-tourism initiatives, and promoting cultural exchange programs. This not only enriches the travel experience for our clients but also contributes to the sustainable development of the region.</li>
</ul>

<p>Our connection with the local community extends beyond mere business partnerships. We actively participate in local events, support local charities, and promote Assam''s unique culture and heritage through our travel itineraries. We believe that tourism should be a force for good, empowering local communities and preserving the region''s natural and cultural treasures.</p>

<p>Looking towards the future, Imperial Destinations envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative tour packages, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our long-term goals include:</p>

<ul>
<li><b>Expanding our service offerings:</b> We plan to introduce new and exciting tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and culinary experiences.</li>
<li><b>Strengthening our partnerships:</b> We aim to forge stronger relationships with local businesses, tourism operators, and government agencies to enhance the quality and sustainability of our services.</li>
<li><b>Investing in technology:</b> We will continue to invest in technology to streamline our operations, improve customer communication, and enhance the overall travel experience.</li>
<li><b>Promoting Assam on a global scale:</b> We are committed to showcasing the beauty and cultural richness of Assam to a wider audience, attracting more tourists to the region and contributing to its economic growth.</li>
</ul>

<p>Imperial Destinations aspires to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable tourism, empowering local communities, and creating unforgettable travel experiences that leave a lasting impact. We invite you to embark on a journey with us and discover the magic of Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Hotel Rajdhani Regency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.323Z', '2025-12-07T06:00:34.000Z'),
(1470, 'AdVenture NorthEast', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>AdVenture NorthEast, situated at the heart of Guwahati at 258, Rajgarh Rd, is a dynamic and forward-thinking enterprise dedicated to fostering sustainable economic growth and empowering businesses throughout Assam and the wider North Eastern region of India. More than just a business, AdVenture NorthEast is a catalyst for positive change, bridging the gap between untapped potential and tangible success in a vibrant, culturally rich, yet often overlooked market. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the NorthEast''s diverse landscape, its intricate network of communities, and its evolving economic ecosystem. This deep understanding allows us to offer tailored solutions designed to resonate with the local context and drive meaningful results for our clients.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings are strategically aligned to address the critical needs of businesses operating in or seeking to enter the NorthEast. We specialize in three key areas: Market Entry Consulting, Sustainable Business Development, and Experiential Tourism. Market Entry Consulting provides comprehensive support to businesses looking to establish or expand their presence in the region. This includes meticulous market research, feasibility studies, regulatory compliance assistance, and strategic partnership development, ensuring a smooth and successful market launch. We leverage our extensive local network and in-depth knowledge of consumer behavior to guide businesses in making informed decisions and navigating the complexities of the regional market. Sustainable Business Development focuses on empowering existing businesses to enhance their operational efficiency, adopt environmentally responsible practices, and achieve long-term sustainability. We offer customized training programs, technology integration solutions, and access to funding opportunities, enabling businesses to thrive in a competitive and increasingly environmentally conscious marketplace. Experiential Tourism aims to promote the unique cultural heritage and natural beauty of the NorthEast through thoughtfully designed and responsible tourism initiatives. This includes curating immersive travel experiences, supporting local artisans and communities, and advocating for sustainable tourism practices that preserve the region''s natural resources and cultural identity. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local context, our commitment to sustainable practices, and our holistic approach to business development. We don''t just offer services; we build partnerships and cultivate long-term relationships with our clients.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At AdVenture NorthEast, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and providing personalized solutions that exceed their expectations. Our approach is characterized by transparency, responsiveness, and a commitment to delivering measurable results. We actively engage with the local community through participation in industry events, sponsorship of local initiatives, and collaboration with non-profit organizations. We are committed to giving back to the community and contributing to the overall well-being of the region. Our commitment extends beyond mere business transactions; we aim to be a trusted advisor and a valued partner in our clients'' journey to success. We achieve this by fostering open communication, actively seeking feedback, and continuously adapting our services to meet the evolving needs of the local market. We regularly host workshops and seminars to share knowledge and best practices, further solidifying our position as a thought leader in the NorthEast business landscape. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and community engagement, AdVenture NorthEast strives to create a positive impact on the lives of the people we serve.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, AdVenture NorthEast envisions becoming the leading business development and sustainability partner in the North Eastern region. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass areas such as financial planning and investment management, further strengthening our commitment to supporting the holistic growth of businesses in the region. We are actively exploring opportunities to leverage technology and innovation to enhance our service delivery and reach a wider audience. This includes developing a digital platform that connects businesses with potential investors, partners, and customers. We are also committed to promoting sustainable practices and advocating for policies that support responsible economic development in the NorthEast. Our long-term goal is to create a thriving and resilient business ecosystem that benefits all stakeholders, from entrepreneurs and small businesses to larger corporations and local communities. By fostering innovation, promoting sustainability, and empowering businesses to reach their full potential, AdVenture NorthEast aims to play a pivotal role in shaping a brighter future for the North Eastern region of India.</p>', '258, Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:05:09.000Z'),
(1471, 'Destiny Assam Tours & Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Destiny Assam Tours & Travels is a premier tour operator and travel agency dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam, India, and its surrounding regions. Situated in the heart of Assam, Destiny Assam Tours & Travels serves as a gateway for travelers seeking authentic experiences, sustainable tourism options, and expertly curated journeys through this captivating corner of the world. The company is deeply rooted in the local community and committed to responsible tourism practices that benefit both visitors and the residents of Assam. Unlike larger, impersonal travel conglomerates, Destiny Assam Tours & Travels offers personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a genuine passion for sharing the wonders of Assam with the world. This commitment to authenticity and connection sets it apart in the regional business landscape.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The core of Destiny Assam Tours & Travels lies in its comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. These services include guided tours throughout Assam, covering renowned destinations such as Kaziranga National Park (famous for its one-horned rhinoceros), the tea gardens of Upper Assam, the ancient temples of Hajo, and the sacred island of Majuli, the world’s largest river island. The company also specializes in crafting bespoke itineraries, tailoring travel plans to individual preferences, incorporating unique interests such as birdwatching, wildlife photography, cultural immersion, and adventure activities like river rafting and trekking. Furthermore, Destiny Assam Tours & Travels provides a complete travel solution, offering services like hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (including car rentals and airport transfers), permit assistance, and expert travel advice. What truly distinguishes the company is its focus on eco-tourism and sustainable travel practices. They actively promote responsible tourism by working with local communities, supporting eco-friendly accommodations, and ensuring that their tours have minimal environmental impact. This resonates strongly with the growing demand for ethically conscious travel options and positions Destiny Assam Tours & Travels as a leader in responsible tourism within Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Destiny Assam Tours & Travels prioritizes creating exceptional customer experiences built on personalized attention, genuine hospitality, and seamless service delivery. The company''s approach is characterized by a deep understanding of local culture and a commitment to exceeding customer expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, the team at Destiny Assam Tours & Travels strives to provide a hassle-free and memorable journey. This begins with proactive communication, providing clear and concise information, and responding promptly to all inquiries. During the tours, experienced and knowledgeable guides share their expertise and passion for Assam, ensuring that visitors gain a profound understanding of the region''s history, culture, and natural environment. Furthermore, the company actively seeks feedback from its customers to continuously improve its services and tailor future experiences to their evolving needs. Beyond customer service, Destiny Assam Tours & Travels is deeply connected to the local community. The company actively supports local artisans, promotes local businesses, and contributes to community development projects. This commitment to social responsibility fosters goodwill within the community and reinforces the company''s reputation as a responsible and ethical business.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Destiny Assam Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading tour operator and travel agency for sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast region of India. The company plans to expand its range of services, incorporating new and innovative tourism products that cater to emerging travel trends. This includes developing niche tours focusing on specific interests such as tea tourism, culinary tourism, and wellness retreats. Furthermore, the company intends to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and businesses to further promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to the economic development of the region. A key focus of the future growth strategy involves leveraging digital technologies to enhance the customer experience and expand the company''s reach. This includes investing in a user-friendly website, utilizing social media platforms for marketing and engagement, and implementing online booking systems to streamline the reservation process. Ultimately, Destiny Assam Tours & Travels aims to establish itself as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism in Assam and beyond.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:05:15.000Z'),
(1472, 'Quick Tours & Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Quick Tours & Travels, nestled in the heart of Juripar Path, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences throughout Assam and beyond. We distinguish ourselves in the vibrant Assam business landscape by offering a personalized approach to travel planning, focusing on crafting unique itineraries that cater to individual preferences and budgets. We understand the distinct charm of Assam and its surrounding regions, and we leverage this intimate knowledge to create unforgettable journeys for our clients.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around creating seamless and enriching travel experiences. We offer a comprehensive range of travel solutions, including: customized tour packages encompassing cultural explorations, wildlife safaris, and adventure tourism; meticulously planned pilgrimage tours to sacred sites; convenient and cost-effective flight and train ticketing services; comfortable and reliable vehicle rental options for independent exploration; and expertly arranged hotel bookings at a variety of establishments, from budget-friendly accommodations to luxurious resorts. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to crafting bespoke itineraries that are tailored to each traveler''s specific interests, whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, delving into the rich cultural heritage of the state, or embarking on a thrilling wildlife adventure in Kaziranga National Park. We are committed to showcasing the hidden gems and authentic experiences that make Assam a truly special destination. Our understanding of the local market allows us to offer competitive pricing, access to exclusive deals, and expert guidance on navigating the region. By providing travel solutions that are tailored to meet the specific needs of our local community and visitors alike, we solidify our position as a trusted travel partner.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Quick Tours & Travels, we firmly believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention and going the extra mile to ensure their satisfaction. Our team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants is dedicated to providing prompt, efficient, and courteous service at every stage of the travel planning process. From the initial consultation to the final confirmation, we are committed to understanding each client''s individual needs and exceeding their expectations. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet their evolving needs. Our connection to the local community is paramount. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of community spirit. We collaborate with local businesses and artisans, promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit the region. By supporting local communities and preserving the cultural heritage of Assam, we are contributing to the long-term sustainability of the tourism industry in the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Quick Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the region, renowned for its unparalleled customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized tour packages focusing on eco-tourism, rural tourism, and wellness tourism. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse our offerings, book their travel arrangements, and access valuable travel information. We aim to establish strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism industry, including hotels, tour operators, and transportation providers, to offer our customers even more comprehensive and competitive travel solutions. Our long-term goals include expanding our operations to other parts of Assam and beyond, bringing our unique brand of personalized travel planning to a wider audience. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our employees, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide the highest level of service to our customers. By staying ahead of the curve, embracing innovation, and remaining true to our core values, Quick Tours & Travels is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. Our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction and our deep understanding of the Assam travel landscape will be the driving forces behind our future endeavors.</p>', 'Juripar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:05:21.000Z'),
(1473, 'Jagannath Travels And Tour Private Limited', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<h1>Jagannath Travels And Tour Private Limited: Exploring Assam and Beyond</h1>

<p>Jagannath Travels And Tour Private Limited, strategically situated at Railway Station, KC Sen Rd, is a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences both within Assam and across India. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of unforgettable journeys, connecting travelers with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and warm hospitality that define this vibrant region. Our commitment to personalized service, deep local knowledge, and unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction distinguishes us within the competitive Assam travel industry, making us a trusted partner for both leisure and business travelers.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>At Jagannath Travels And Tour, we offer a comprehensive suite of travel services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. Our core offerings include:</p>

<br>
<br>

<ul>
    <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke tour packages that cater to individual preferences and interests. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, delving into the ancient history of Guwahati, or embarking on a spiritual pilgrimage to Kamakhya Temple, we craft itineraries that are both enriching and seamless. Our packages encompass accommodation, transportation, guided tours, and curated experiences that showcase the best of Assam and beyond.</li>

    <li><b>Domestic and International Flight Booking:</b> We provide convenient and competitive flight booking services for both domestic and international destinations. Leveraging our partnerships with leading airlines, we ensure our clients have access to a wide range of flight options at the best possible prices, simplifying the complexities of air travel.</li>

    <li><b>Hotel Reservations:</b> We offer a wide selection of hotel accommodations to suit every budget and preference. From luxurious resorts to comfortable guesthouses, we partner with reputable establishments to ensure our clients enjoy a comfortable and memorable stay. Our team meticulously vets each property to guarantee quality, cleanliness, and exceptional service.</li>

    <li><b>Car Rental Services:</b> To facilitate independent exploration, we provide reliable and well-maintained car rental services. Our fleet includes a variety of vehicles, from compact cars to SUVs, catering to different group sizes and travel needs. We prioritize safety and convenience, ensuring our clients have a smooth and enjoyable driving experience.</li>

    <li><b>Group Tours and Corporate Travel:</b> We organize and manage group tours for schools, colleges, and corporate clients. Our experienced team handles all logistical aspects, from transportation and accommodation to catering and event planning, ensuring a hassle-free and successful trip. We also offer specialized corporate travel solutions, including meeting and conference arrangements.</li>
</ul>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our unique selling points lie in our deep understanding of the local Assam market and our unwavering commitment to personalized service. We go beyond simply booking travel arrangements; we strive to create memorable experiences that leave a lasting impression. Our team of experienced travel consultants possesses in-depth knowledge of the region''s attractions, culture, and traditions, allowing us to provide insightful recommendations and tailor itineraries to individual preferences. We also pride ourselves on our responsiveness and attention to detail, ensuring that every aspect of the travel experience is meticulously planned and executed.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>These services directly address the needs of the local market by providing convenient access to high-quality travel arrangements and personalized support. In a region where tourism is increasingly important, Jagannath Travels And Tour plays a crucial role in facilitating travel experiences for both residents and visitors, contributing to the growth of the local economy.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>At Jagannath Travels And Tour, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building long-lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service and personalized attention. Our approach is centered on understanding individual needs and exceeding expectations at every touchpoint.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>We foster a welcoming and supportive environment, where our clients feel valued and respected. Our team of dedicated travel consultants is always available to answer questions, provide assistance, and address any concerns that may arise. We actively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs. We are committed to resolving issues promptly and efficiently, striving to turn every interaction into a positive experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our location near the Railway Station on KC Sen Rd facilitates ease of access for customers travelling in and out of the city. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting the community and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We collaborate with local businesses and organizations to showcase the region''s unique offerings and contribute to its economic development. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, we create a network of support that benefits both our clients and the community as a whole.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>Jagannath Travels And Tour envisions a future of sustained growth and innovation. We aim to expand our service offerings, enhance our technological capabilities, and strengthen our position as a leading travel provider in Assam. Our long-term goals include:</p>

<br>
<br>

<ul>
    <li><b>Expanding our network of partnerships:</b> We will continue to forge strategic alliances with airlines, hotels, and other travel providers to offer our clients a wider range of options and competitive pricing.</li>

    <li><b>Developing new and innovative tour packages:</b> We will invest in research and development to create unique and engaging tour packages that showcase the best of Assam and beyond.</li>

    <li><b>Enhancing our online presence:</b> We will improve our website and online booking platform to provide a seamless and user-friendly experience for our clients.</li>

    <li><b>Investing in employee training and development:</b> We will provide our team with ongoing training to ensure they possess the latest knowledge and skills to deliver exceptional service.</li>

    <li><b>Promoting sustainable tourism practices:</b> We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities through responsible tourism initiatives.</li>
</ul>

<br>
<br>

<p>By pursuing these goals, Jagannath Travels And Tour aims to not only grow our business but also contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Assam and create unforgettable travel experiences for our clients.</p>', 'Railway Station, KC Sen Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:05:29.000Z'),
(1474, 'Majestic North East Tours and Adventures', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Majestic North East Tours and Adventures: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Experiences in Assam and Beyond</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at F Fort Building, Kachari Basti Rd, opposite Barbeque Nation, Majestic North East Tours and Adventures stands as a premier provider of immersive and authentic travel experiences throughout Assam and the wider North East Indian region. More than just a tour operator, we are curators of unforgettable journeys, connecting travelers with the rich cultural tapestry, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant biodiversity that define this unique corner of India. In a region brimming with natural beauty and cultural heritage, Majestic North East Tours and Adventures distinguishes itself by offering meticulously crafted itineraries, personalized service, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices, contributing positively to the local economy and environment. We strive to be the trusted partner for discerning travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service is crafting bespoke tour packages that cater to a diverse range of interests and preferences. From wildlife enthusiasts eager to explore the renowned Kaziranga National Park, home to the one-horned rhinoceros, to cultural aficionados seeking to delve into the traditions of Assam''s numerous ethnic groups, we offer a variety of itineraries designed to meet every need. We specialize in organizing adventure tours, including trekking expeditions through the lush hills of Meghalaya, river cruises on the mighty Brahmaputra, and thrilling jeep safaris through dense forests. Beyond pre-packaged tours, we excel at creating customized itineraries that address specific interests, timelines, and budget considerations. Our unique selling point lies in our deep local knowledge and strong relationships with local communities, allowing us to offer exclusive access to experiences unavailable through other tour operators. This includes home stays in traditional villages, participation in local festivals, and interactions with artisans preserving age-old crafts. We understand the needs of both domestic and international travelers, providing seamless logistical support, comfortable accommodations, and expert guidance throughout their journey. We address the market need for authentic, responsible, and personalized travel experiences in a region increasingly sought after for its unique offerings. We cater to travelers seeking more than just sightseeing; they want to immerse themselves in the culture, connect with the people, and leave with a deeper understanding of the North East.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Majestic North East Tours and Adventures, customer experience is paramount. We believe that exceptional service begins with genuine care and a commitment to exceeding expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our dedicated team strives to provide personalized attention and seamless support. Our approach to customer service is rooted in building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and tailoring our services to ensure a truly memorable experience. We go the extra mile to anticipate potential challenges and provide proactive solutions, ensuring a stress-free and enjoyable journey. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to responsible tourism and community engagement. We actively support local businesses and communities, ensuring that tourism benefits the people and places we visit. We prioritize eco-friendly practices, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting sustainable tourism. We connect with the local community by employing local guides, sourcing locally produced goods and services, and supporting community-based tourism initiatives. This commitment to responsible tourism not only enhances the customer experience but also contributes to the preservation of the region''s natural and cultural heritage. We are actively involved in local tourism initiatives and participate in events that promote sustainable tourism practices, further solidifying our connection with the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Majestic North East Tours and Adventures is to become the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in the North East Indian region. We aspire to expand our reach, offering a wider range of innovative tour packages that cater to diverse interests and preferences. This includes developing specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as culinary tourism, wellness retreats, and adventure sports. Our long-term goals involve establishing strategic partnerships with local communities and businesses, further strengthening our commitment to responsible tourism. We plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, making it easier for travelers to book tours, access information, and connect with our team. We also envision expanding our marketing efforts to reach a wider audience, showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of the North East to the world. Furthermore, we are committed to developing training programs for local guides and tourism professionals, empowering them to provide exceptional service and contribute to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector. We plan to actively participate in industry events and conferences, sharing our expertise and promoting the North East as a premier travel destination. Ultimately, our goal is to create a positive and lasting impact on the region, fostering sustainable economic growth, preserving cultural heritage, and protecting the environment for future generations.</p>', 'F Fort Building, Kachari Basti Rd, opposite Barbeque Nation', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:05:36.000Z'),
(1475, 'Imperial Destinations', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Imperial Destinations: Unveiling Assam''s Treasures and Beyond</p>

<p>Nestled within the bustling Avtar Complex, opposite the iconic Hotel Rajdhani Regency on Naharani Path, lies Imperial Destinations, a distinguished travel agency dedicated to crafting unforgettable journeys throughout Assam and beyond. Operating from the familiar landmark of the Renault Service Center, Imperial Destinations stands as a beacon of reliable and personalized travel planning in the heart of the city. More than just a travel agency, Imperial Destinations acts as a gateway to experiencing the rich tapestry of Assam’s culture, the breathtaking beauty of its landscapes, and the thrill of exploring destinations far and wide. Recognizing the increasing demand for authentic and seamlessly planned travel experiences, Imperial Destinations has positioned itself as a key player in the local tourism sector, committed to showcasing the region''s unique offerings to both domestic and international travelers.</p>

<p>At its core, Imperial Destinations provides a comprehensive suite of travel services tailored to diverse needs and preferences. The agency specializes in crafting bespoke tour packages that showcase the best of Assam, from the sprawling tea gardens of Upper Assam to the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas. These packages aren''t merely itineraries; they are carefully curated experiences designed to immerse travelers in the local culture, offering opportunities to engage with local communities, savor authentic Assamese cuisine, and witness traditional art forms firsthand. Beyond Assam, Imperial Destinations offers a wide array of domestic and international travel options, including customized itineraries for popular destinations in India and curated group tours to international hotspots. They handle all aspects of travel planning, including flight and hotel bookings, transportation arrangements, visa assistance, and travel insurance, ensuring a stress-free and seamless journey for their clients. The unique selling point of Imperial Destinations lies in its dedication to personalized service and its in-depth knowledge of the local region. They go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; they provide expert advice on the best times to visit specific locations, suggest hidden gems that are often overlooked by mainstream tourism, and offer valuable insights into the local culture and customs. This personalized approach allows them to cater to the specific needs and interests of each traveler, creating truly unforgettable experiences. Their services directly address the local market needs by providing a convenient and reliable one-stop-shop for all travel requirements, eliminating the need for customers to navigate the complexities of online travel booking and ensuring access to expert advice and personalized support. Furthermore, their focus on promoting Assam''s tourism helps to boost the local economy and showcase the region''s unique attractions to a wider audience.</p>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Imperial Destinations. From the moment a client walks through the door (or contacts the agency online or by phone), they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. The agency prides itself on building lasting relationships with its customers, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Travel consultants are highly trained and knowledgeable, possessing a deep understanding of travel trends, destination information, and customer service best practices. What sets Imperial Destinations apart is their commitment to going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. This includes providing 24/7 support during travel, proactively addressing any issues or concerns that may arise, and offering flexible booking options to accommodate changing travel plans. They believe in transparency and honesty, providing clear and concise information about pricing, terms, and conditions. Connecting with the local community is also a key priority for Imperial Destinations. They actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices. They also partner with local guides and tour operators to ensure that their tours are authentic and benefit the local community. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, Imperial Destinations contributes to the overall well-being of the community and creates a positive impact on the local economy.</p>

<p>Looking ahead, Imperial Destinations envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the region, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Future plans include expanding their range of services to include specialized tours focused on eco-tourism, adventure travel, and cultural immersion. They also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, implementing online booking platforms and mobile apps to provide convenient access to information and services. Another key goal is to strengthen their partnerships with local businesses and communities, further promoting sustainable tourism practices and contributing to the overall growth of the region. Long-term, Imperial Destinations aims to establish itself as a trusted brand synonymous with quality, reliability, and unforgettable travel experiences, playing a vital role in showcasing Assam''s beauty and promoting tourism throughout the region. They are committed to continually adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market, embracing new technologies, and fostering a culture of innovation and customer-centricity.</p>', 'Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Hotel Rajdhani Regency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:10:10.000Z'),
(1476, 'Majestic North East Tours and Adventures', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<h1>Majestic North East Tours and Adventures: Exploring the Untamed Beauty of Assam and Beyond</h1>

<p>Majestic North East Tours and Adventures, strategically located at F Fort Building, Kachari Basti Rd, opposite Barbeque Nation in Guwahati, is a premier tour operator dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences throughout Assam and the entire North East region of India. We specialize in crafting authentic and immersive journeys that showcase the region''s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant biodiversity. More than just a travel company, we are passionate advocates for sustainable tourism, committed to preserving the natural and cultural treasures of the North East while empowering local communities. Our deep understanding of the region, combined with our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, sets us apart as a trusted partner for exploring the hidden gems of this enchanting corner of India.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Unveiling the North East: Our Core Services</h2>

<p>Majestic North East Tours and Adventures offers a comprehensive range of tour packages and services designed to cater to diverse travel preferences and budgets. Our core services include:</p>

<p><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We excel in creating bespoke itineraries tailored to individual interests and requirements. Whether you''re an avid wildlife enthusiast, a cultural explorer, an adventure seeker, or simply seeking a relaxing escape, we can design the perfect journey for you. These packages often include accommodations, transportation, guided tours, and activities, all meticulously planned to ensure a seamless and unforgettable experience.</p>

<p><b>Group Tours:</b> We organize fixed-departure group tours to popular destinations across the North East, offering a cost-effective and sociable way to explore the region. These tours are led by experienced and knowledgeable guides who provide insightful commentary and ensure the smooth operation of the itinerary.</p>

<p><b>Adventure Tours:</b> For thrill-seekers, we offer a range of adventure activities, including trekking, river rafting, paragliding, and wildlife safaris. Our adventure tours are conducted under the supervision of certified professionals, prioritizing safety and environmental responsibility.</p>

<p><b>Homestay Experiences:</b> Immerse yourself in the local culture with our curated homestay experiences. We partner with local families to offer authentic and enriching stays, providing opportunities to learn about local customs, traditions, and cuisine.</p>

<p><b>Transportation Services:</b> We provide a fleet of well-maintained vehicles, including cars, SUVs, and buses, to ensure comfortable and reliable transportation throughout your journey. We also offer airport transfers and inter-city transportation services.</p>

<p>Our unique selling point lies in our unwavering commitment to responsible tourism and our in-depth knowledge of the North East. We prioritize supporting local communities and promoting sustainable practices in all our operations. Our dedication to providing personalized and attentive service ensures that every traveler enjoys a truly memorable and authentic experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>The Majestic Difference: A Customer-Centric Approach</h2>

<p>At Majestic North East Tours and Adventures, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We are dedicated to providing personalized attention to every traveler, from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. Our team of experienced and friendly travel consultants are available to assist with every aspect of trip planning, ensuring a seamless and stress-free experience. We prioritize clear communication, prompt responsiveness, and a proactive approach to addressing any concerns or issues that may arise.</p>

<p>We strive to build lasting relationships with our customers by exceeding their expectations and consistently delivering exceptional service. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our customers. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, contributing to the economic development and cultural preservation of the North East. We aim to be more than just a tour operator; we aspire to be a responsible and contributing member of the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Charting the Future: Growth and Innovation</h2>

<p>Majestic North East Tours and Adventures envisions becoming the leading tour operator in the North East, renowned for our commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel experiences. We plan to expand our services to include specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as tea tourism, birdwatching, and tribal art and culture. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-lodges and sustainable tourism infrastructure in remote areas of the North East, creating new economic opportunities for local communities.</p>

<p>We are committed to leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app. We will continue to invest in training and development for our staff to ensure that they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to deliver exceptional service. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction, Majestic North East Tours and Adventures is poised for continued growth and success in the dynamic tourism industry of the North East.</p>', 'F Fort Building, Kachari Basti Rd, opposite Barbeque Nation', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:10:18.000Z'),
(1477, 'Gateway Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Gateway Travels: Your Trusted Partner for Exploration and Adventure in Bonda and Beyond</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Bonda, Assam, Gateway Travels stands as a beacon for travel enthusiasts seeking authentic and enriching experiences. More than just a travel agency, Gateway Travels is a dedicated partner committed to curating personalized journeys that capture the essence of Assam''s breathtaking landscapes, vibrant culture, and warm hospitality. Positioned strategically in Bonda, we are uniquely situated to cater to the travel needs of the local community while also welcoming visitors eager to explore the hidden gems of this enchanting region. Gateway Travels distinguishes itself through a deep understanding of the local terrain, a commitment to sustainable tourism practices, and a genuine passion for sharing the beauty of Assam with the world. In a region where travel options can be limited, Gateway Travels fills a critical gap by providing reliable, accessible, and tailored travel solutions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the core of Gateway Travels lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. Our primary offerings include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that cater to individual preferences and interests. Whether it''s a cultural immersion experience in a traditional Assamese village, an adventurous trek through lush tea gardens, or a wildlife safari in a national park, we tailor each itinerary to create unforgettable memories.</li>
  <li><b>Transportation Services:</b> Gateway Travels provides reliable and comfortable transportation options, including car rentals, airport transfers, and guided tours in well-maintained vehicles. Our experienced drivers possess an intimate knowledge of the local roads and ensure a safe and seamless travel experience.</li>
  <li><b>Accommodation Bookings:</b> We collaborate with a network of reputable hotels, guesthouses, and homestays across Assam to offer a wide range of accommodation options to suit every budget and preference. From luxurious resorts to cozy eco-lodges, we ensure a comfortable and relaxing stay for our clients.</li>
  <li><b>Travel Consultation and Planning:</b> Our team of travel experts provides personalized consultation services to help clients plan their dream vacations. We offer expert advice on destinations, activities, visa requirements, and travel insurance, ensuring a hassle-free travel experience from start to finish.</li>
  <li><b>Adventure Tourism:</b> Capitalizing on the region''s natural beauty, we offer adventure activities like river rafting, trekking, and camping experiences, all facilitated by experienced guides and adhering to strict safety standards.</li>
</ul>

<p>Gateway Travels'' unique selling points lie in our commitment to personalized service, our deep local knowledge, and our focus on sustainable tourism. We prioritize creating authentic experiences that benefit both our clients and the local communities we serve. We actively promote responsible travel practices and work with local artisans and businesses to support economic development. These aspects set us apart from larger, less personalized travel agencies.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Gateway Travels. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service and exceeding their expectations. Our approach is centered around:</p>

<ul>
  <li><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand each client''s individual needs and preferences, ensuring that every journey is tailored to their specific requirements.</li>
  <li><b>Prompt and Reliable Service:</b> We are committed to providing prompt and reliable service at every stage of the travel process, from initial consultation to post-trip follow-up.</li>
  <li><b>Local Expertise:</b> Our team of travel experts possesses an intimate knowledge of the local area, allowing us to provide valuable insights and recommendations that enhance the travel experience.</li>
  <li><b>Building Community Connections:</b> Gateway Travels actively participates in local events and initiatives, fostering strong relationships with the community. We partner with local businesses and organizations to promote tourism and support economic development. We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a responsible and contributing member of the Bonda community.</li>
</ul>

<p>We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services. Our commitment to customer satisfaction has earned us a reputation for excellence and has helped us build a loyal customer base. We stand out by creating a welcoming and friendly atmosphere, where clients feel valued and appreciated. Regular engagement with local cultural events and offering curated local experiences, Gateway Travels forges stronger ties with the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Gateway Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the Bonda region and a trusted partner for travelers seeking authentic Assamese experiences. Our future plans include:</p>

<ul>
  <li><b>Expanding our Service Offerings:</b> We plan to introduce new and innovative travel packages that cater to emerging trends and interests, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and adventure sports.</li>
  <li><b>Strengthening our Partnerships:</b> We will continue to build strong relationships with local businesses, organizations, and tourism stakeholders to create a vibrant and sustainable tourism ecosystem.</li>
  <li><b>Investing in Technology:</b> We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, streamline our operations, and expand our reach. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows clients to easily book travel services and access valuable travel information.</li>
  <li><b>Promoting Sustainable Tourism:</b> We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and benefit local communities. We will continue to work with our partners to develop and implement responsible tourism initiatives.</li>
  <li><b>Geographic Expansion:</b> Explore opportunities to expand operations to other key locations within Assam, leveraging our expertise and established brand reputation.</li>
</ul>

<p>Gateway Travels aims to not only facilitate travel but also to contribute to the economic and social well-being of the Bonda community and the broader Assam region. Our long-term goal is to establish Gateway Travels as a symbol of quality, reliability, and responsible tourism in the region, creating a positive impact on both our clients and the communities we serve. By embracing innovation, fostering strong partnerships, and remaining committed to our core values, we are confident that Gateway Travels will continue to thrive and make a meaningful contribution to the tourism industry in Assam.</p>', 'Bonda', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:10:26.000Z'),
(1478, 'Simran Travels Limited', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Simran Travels Limited, strategically located at 8, Nilmoni, Nilomani Phukan Path in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences tailored to the diverse needs of its clientele. More than just a travel agency, Simran Travels is a gateway to exploring the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unique experiences that Assam and the wider North-Eastern region of India have to offer. In a region where tourism is increasingly vital to economic growth and cultural preservation, Simran Travels plays a significant role, bridging the gap between discerning travelers and the authentic beauty of the land.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Simran Travels Limited''s service offerings are meticulously crafted travel packages, personalized itineraries, and comprehensive travel solutions catering to both domestic and international tourists. Our primary services include guided tours exploring Assam''s renowned tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park (famous for its one-horned rhinoceros), and culturally significant sites such as the Kamakhya Temple. We also specialize in adventure tourism, arranging trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills and river cruises along the majestic Brahmaputra River. Furthermore, Simran Travels provides essential travel services such as flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations ranging from budget-friendly options to luxury accommodations, and visa assistance. What distinguishes Simran Travels is our commitment to offering authentic experiences that go beyond typical tourist attractions. We work closely with local communities to promote sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit the local economy and respect the environment. Our unique selling point lies in our in-depth knowledge of the region, allowing us to curate exclusive experiences like homestays with local families, participation in traditional festivals, and opportunities to learn about indigenous crafts and traditions. This ensures that our clients not only see Assam but truly experience its soul.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Simran Travels Limited. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of empathy, responsiveness, and personalized attention. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the journey, our dedicated team of travel experts is committed to providing seamless and stress-free travel arrangements. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients, understanding their individual preferences, and anticipating their needs. Our commitment extends beyond just booking flights and hotels; we strive to be travel partners, offering expert advice, insider tips, and on-the-ground support throughout the trip. This commitment to exceptional customer service has earned us a loyal customer base and a strong reputation within the local community. Simran Travels actively participates in local events and initiatives, supporting community development and promoting tourism in a responsible manner. We believe that by fostering strong relationships with local businesses and communities, we can create a more enriching and sustainable tourism ecosystem for everyone.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Simran Travels Limited envisions becoming the leading travel company in Assam, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism and its ability to provide exceptional travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific themes such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and cultural immersion programs. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance our customer experience, developing a user-friendly mobile app that allows travelers to easily access information, book tours, and connect with our team. Another key focus is on strengthening our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate more actively in the tourism industry and benefit from its economic opportunities. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans and entrepreneurs to showcase their products and services to a wider audience. Ultimately, Simran Travels Limited aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the region, promoting sustainable tourism practices, preserving cultural heritage, and creating economic opportunities for local communities. Our long-term goal is to establish Assam as a premier tourist destination, attracting visitors from around the world and showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of this incredible region.</p>', '8, Nilmoni, Nilomani Phukan Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:10:31.000Z'),
(1479, 'Pushpak Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Pushpak Travels, strategically located in the heart of Assam at ·, is a premier travel agency committed to providing exceptional and personalized travel solutions to both local residents and visitors exploring the wonders of Northeast India. Established with a deep understanding of the unique travel needs of the region, Pushpak Travels has rapidly grown into a trusted name, known for its reliability, expertise, and dedication to crafting unforgettable travel experiences. In a region characterized by its rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and diverse ethnic communities, Pushpak Travels plays a vital role in connecting people with the beauty and adventure Assam has to offer, contributing significantly to the local tourism ecosystem.

<br> <br>

At the core of Pushpak Travels'' offerings are comprehensive travel services designed to cater to a wide range of preferences and budgets. These services include meticulously planned tour packages encompassing popular destinations within Assam and neighboring states like Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. From exploring the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam to embarking on thrilling wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, and discovering the spiritual serenity of Majuli, the world''s largest river island, Pushpak Travels crafts itineraries that showcase the best of the region. Beyond packaged tours, Pushpak Travels also provides customized travel planning services, allowing clients to create bespoke journeys tailored to their specific interests, time constraints, and budgetary considerations. Furthermore, the agency offers reliable transportation services, including car rentals with experienced drivers familiar with the local terrain and road conditions, ensuring safe and comfortable travel. Airline and train ticketing services, hotel booking assistance, and visa assistance for international travelers further complement their comprehensive service portfolio. A key differentiator for Pushpak Travels is its in-depth local knowledge and strong network of local partners, including hotels, guesthouses, and local guides. This allows them to offer unique experiences, such as homestays in traditional villages, cultural immersion programs, and off-the-beaten-path adventures, that are not typically accessible through mainstream travel agencies. This commitment to authentic and sustainable tourism sets Pushpak Travels apart from its competitors.

<br> <br>

Pushpak Travels firmly believes that exceptional customer service is paramount to its success. The agency prides itself on its friendly, knowledgeable, and responsive team of travel consultants who are dedicated to providing personalized attention to each and every client. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, they strive to ensure a seamless and stress-free travel experience. Understanding the importance of building strong relationships within the local community, Pushpak Travels actively participates in local events and initiatives, supporting local artisans and promoting responsible tourism practices. They prioritize working with local businesses and communities to ensure that tourism benefits the region as a whole, preserving its cultural heritage and protecting its natural environment. This commitment to sustainable tourism resonates deeply with local residents and travelers alike, fostering a strong sense of trust and loyalty. Pushpak Travels goes the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction, proactively addressing any concerns and providing prompt assistance whenever needed. Their dedication to building long-term relationships with their clients is reflected in their high rate of repeat business and positive word-of-mouth referrals.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Pushpak Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its innovative travel solutions, unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, and dedication to sustainable tourism practices. Their future plans include expanding their service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on eco-tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural tourism, catering to the growing demand for niche travel experiences. They also plan to leverage technology to enhance their customer service capabilities, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse tour packages, book transportation, and access travel information. Strategic partnerships with other travel agencies, hotels, and airlines are also on the horizon, further strengthening their network and expanding their reach. Pushpak Travels is committed to investing in the training and development of its staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to provide the highest level of service. Furthermore, they are exploring opportunities to expand their operations to other key locations within Northeast India, making their services more accessible to a wider audience. Ultimately, Pushpak Travels aims to play a pivotal role in promoting tourism in Assam and the Northeast, showcasing the region''s unique beauty and contributing to its sustainable economic development.', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:10:38.000Z'),
(1480, 'Guwahati Travels', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Guwahati Travels, strategically located on Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden, stands as a premier travel solution provider deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, Guwahati Travels is a curator of experiences, connecting individuals and groups with the rich tapestry of North-East India and beyond. Recognizing the unique travel needs of the local community and visitors alike, Guwahati Travels distinguishes itself through personalized service, in-depth regional expertise, and a commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism practices. The company plays a vital role in facilitating both leisure and business travel, contributing significantly to the local economy by promoting tourism and supporting related industries.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Guwahati Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services tailored to diverse needs and preferences. These core services include: </p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
    <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Crafting bespoke itineraries focusing on Assam and the wider North-East, encompassing cultural immersion, wildlife adventures, spiritual journeys, and scenic explorations. These packages are designed to cater to individual interests and budgets, ensuring a memorable and authentic experience.</li>
    <li><b>Hotel Bookings:</b> Facilitating reservations at a wide range of accommodations, from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts, both within Guwahati and across the region. Guwahati Travels leverages strong relationships with local hotels to secure competitive rates and ensure quality stays.</li>
    <li><b>Flight and Train Ticketing:</b> Providing efficient and reliable booking services for domestic and international flights, as well as train travel, streamlining transportation logistics for clients.</li>
    <li><b>Car Rentals:</b> Offering a diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles, including sedans, SUVs, and tempo travelers, coupled with experienced and professional drivers. This ensures comfortable and safe transportation for sightseeing, airport transfers, and intercity travel.</li>
    <li><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> Managing travel arrangements for businesses, including booking flights, accommodations, and transportation for employees attending conferences, meetings, or other business-related events. Guwahati Travels emphasizes efficiency and cost-effectiveness in its corporate travel solutions.</li>
    <li><b>Adventure Tourism Activities:</b> Arranging thrilling activities such as river rafting, trekking, wildlife safaris, and camping experiences, catering to adventure enthusiasts seeking an adrenaline rush amidst the natural beauty of the North-East.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Guwahati Travels apart is its unwavering commitment to delivering exceptional value. The agency prioritizes building lasting relationships with clients, taking the time to understand their specific needs and preferences. The team’s deep knowledge of the region allows them to offer insightful recommendations and create truly unforgettable travel experiences. Furthermore, Guwahati Travels distinguishes itself by promoting responsible tourism, emphasizing eco-friendly practices and supporting local communities. By partnering with local artisans, guides, and businesses, the agency contributes to the sustainable development of the region and ensures that tourism benefits local stakeholders.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of Guwahati Travels'' operations. The agency cultivates a personalized and attentive approach, providing dedicated travel consultants who guide clients through every step of the planning process. The team is readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and offer support throughout the entire journey. Guwahati Travels actively seeks feedback from clients to continuously improve its services and enhance the overall travel experience. Beyond providing travel services, Guwahati Travels actively engages with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring initiatives, and promoting tourism awareness. This strong community connection fosters trust and reinforces the agency''s commitment to being a responsible and valued member of the Guwahati business ecosystem.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Guwahati Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the North-East, recognized for its exceptional service, regional expertise, and commitment to sustainable tourism. The company plans to expand its service offerings to include niche travel packages focusing on specific interests such as bird watching, tea tourism, and cultural heritage. Investing in technology to enhance online booking platforms and customer communication channels is also a key priority. Furthermore, Guwahati Travels aims to strengthen its partnerships with local businesses and tourism stakeholders to create a more robust and collaborative tourism ecosystem. The long-term goal is to not only facilitate travel but also to contribute to the economic development and cultural preservation of the North-East region, ensuring that tourism remains a sustainable and beneficial force for years to come. The strategic location opposite Subham Garden serves as a strong foundation for future growth, providing visibility and accessibility to a wide range of potential clients.</p>', 'Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:15:09.000Z'),
(1481, 'Capital Tours (India) Pvt. Ltd.', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Capital Tours (India) Pvt. Ltd., strategically located at 403, Assam Trunk Rd, stands as a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences throughout India, with a particular emphasis on showcasing the diverse and captivating beauty of Assam and the Northeast. More than just a travel agency, Capital Tours acts as a gateway, connecting travelers with the rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and unique adventures that this region has to offer. In a market often dominated by standardized tour packages, Capital Tours distinguishes itself through personalized itineraries, expert local knowledge, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism.

<br><br>

At the heart of Capital Tours'' operations lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a wide range of needs and preferences. These services include meticulously crafted tour packages focusing on Assam''s tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries (such as Kaziranga National Park), historical sites, and vibrant cultural festivals. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the company excels in creating bespoke itineraries tailored to individual interests, group dynamics, and budget considerations. This personalized approach allows travelers to experience India, and particularly Assam, in a way that resonates deeply with them. Capital Tours also provides essential travel logistics services, including flight and train bookings, hotel reservations, transportation arrangements (car rentals, private chauffeur services), and visa assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience from start to finish. One of Capital Tours’ unique selling points is its deep understanding of the local ecosystem. They partner with local communities and businesses to provide authentic cultural experiences and support sustainable tourism practices. This commitment ensures that tourism benefits the local economy and minimizes its environmental impact. These services meet the local market need for curated and responsible travel options, attracting both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and enriching experiences beyond the typical tourist traps.

<br><br>

Capital Tours understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to success in the travel industry. The company prides itself on its team of knowledgeable and passionate travel consultants who are dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert advice to each client. From the initial consultation to the completion of the trip, customers can expect prompt, courteous, and efficient service. Capital Tours fosters a strong connection with the local community through its partnerships with local guides, artisans, and businesses. They prioritize employing local talent and showcasing local products and traditions, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community and providing travelers with authentic cultural immersion. This approach not only enhances the customer experience but also reinforces Capital Tours'' commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. Regular engagement with the community through participation in local events and initiatives further solidifies the company''s position as a trusted and valued member of the local ecosystem.

<br><br>

Capital Tours (India) Pvt. Ltd. envisions a future where it becomes the leading travel company in Northeast India, known for its commitment to sustainable tourism, personalized service, and authentic cultural experiences. The company plans to expand its range of tour packages to include more niche offerings, such as eco-tourism adventures, culinary tours, and wellness retreats. Leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience is a key priority. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and managing travel itineraries, as well as utilizing data analytics to personalize marketing efforts and optimize service delivery. Furthermore, Capital Tours aims to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and businesses, ensuring that tourism benefits the local economy and preserves the region''s rich cultural heritage. Long-term goals include expanding operations to other parts of India and Southeast Asia, while maintaining its core values of sustainability, personalized service, and cultural sensitivity. By focusing on these strategic priorities, Capital Tours is poised for continued growth and success, solidifying its position as a key player in the Indian travel and tourism industry.', '403, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:15:14.000Z'),
(1482, 'AirGennie - "Wander More, Worry Less"', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'AirGennie - "Wander More, Worry Less", situated at No 88, Aghona Bhavan, Mandir Path, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel concierge and experience curator uniquely tailored to the demands and desires of both local residents and visiting tourists in Assam and the wider Northeast India region. Understanding the inherent challenges and unique opportunities present in navigating this culturally rich and geographically diverse landscape, AirGennie offers a comprehensive suite of travel-related services designed to eliminate stress and maximize the enjoyment of every journey. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we are your personal travel architects, crafting bespoke itineraries and providing unparalleled on-the-ground support to ensure seamless and unforgettable experiences. <br> <br>

Our core service lies in meticulously planning and executing personalized travel itineraries that cater to diverse interests and budgets. Whether it''s a spiritual retreat to Kamakhya Temple, an adventurous trek through the verdant hills of Meghalaya, a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, or a cultural immersion in the tea gardens of Assam, AirGennie transforms travel aspirations into tangible realities. We leverage our extensive network of local partners – including hotels, transportation providers, guides, and activity operators – to secure the best possible rates and ensure exceptional quality. Unlike generic online travel platforms, we specialize in crafting experiences that are deeply rooted in the local culture and environment, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local communities. <br> <br>

Beyond itinerary planning, AirGennie offers a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the travel experience. These include airport transfers, visa assistance, travel insurance procurement, currency exchange guidance, and 24/7 on-call support. A unique selling point is our ''Assam Immersion'' package, which includes curated cultural experiences such as traditional Assamese cooking classes, Bihu dance performances, and visits to local artisan workshops. We also offer specialized packages for adventure tourism, focusing on activities like river rafting, rock climbing, and paragliding, always prioritizing safety and environmental responsibility. Our services directly address the common challenges faced by travelers in the region, such as language barriers, limited transportation options, and a lack of reliable information, providing peace of mind and allowing them to fully embrace their adventures. <br> <br>

At AirGennie, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are not just booking agents; they are experienced travelers themselves, possessing in-depth knowledge of the region and a passion for sharing its hidden gems. We go the extra mile to ensure that every client feels valued and supported, providing personalized recommendations, addressing concerns promptly, and proactively anticipating potential issues. Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond the booking process. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor them to meet evolving needs. We also strive to engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events, fostering a sense of shared responsibility for promoting sustainable tourism and preserving the cultural heritage of Assam. <br> <br>

Looking ahead, AirGennie envisions becoming the leading travel concierge service in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized travel packages for niche markets, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and culinary tours. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides real-time travel updates, interactive maps, and personalized recommendations. A key long-term goal is to establish a network of AirGennie-branded guesthouses and boutique hotels in strategic locations throughout the region, providing travelers with a consistent standard of quality and hospitality. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, AirGennie is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India, promoting sustainable growth, and creating memorable experiences for travelers from all walks of life. We are committed to fostering a positive impact on the local economy and preserving the unique cultural identity of the region, ensuring that future generations can continue to "Wander More, Worry Less."', 'No 88, Aghona Bhavan, Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.324Z', '2025-12-07T06:15:20.000Z'),
(1483, 'Moudeep travel agency', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'Moudeep Travel Agency, strategically located on Beltola Bazaar Road, August Kranti Path, stands as a cornerstone of travel solutions within Guwahati and the broader Assam region. More than just a travel agency, Moudeep Travel Agency is a dedicated partner in crafting seamless and enriching travel experiences, catering to both leisure and business travelers alike. Recognizing the unique needs of the local populace and the burgeoning tourism sector in Assam, Moudeep distinguishes itself through personalized service, in-depth regional expertise, and a commitment to ethical and sustainable travel practices. We aim to be the trusted gateway for individuals and organizations seeking to explore the beauty and opportunities of Assam and beyond, while simultaneously contributing to the region''s economic growth and responsible tourism.

<br> <br>

Moudeep Travel Agency offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. Our core offerings include expertly curated tour packages encompassing Assam''s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unique wildlife experiences. We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries that cater to individual preferences, group sizes, and budgetary considerations. These packages often include visits to Kaziranga National Park, tea gardens of Upper Assam, and culturally significant sites in Guwahati and Majuli. In addition to package tours, we provide a full spectrum of travel services including domestic and international flight bookings, hotel reservations across various price points, car rental services with experienced local drivers, and visa assistance for international travel. A key differentiator lies in our deep understanding of the region''s specific logistical challenges, allowing us to navigate potential issues proactively and ensure smooth and hassle-free journeys for our clients. We also offer specialized travel solutions for corporate clients, including conference and event planning, group travel arrangements, and customized incentive programs.

<br> <br>

At Moudeep Travel Agency, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention and going the extra mile to exceed expectations. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to understanding each customer''s unique needs and preferences, offering expert advice and tailored solutions. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness and accessibility, ensuring that customers can easily reach us with any queries or concerns. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to fostering a sense of community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, partnering with local artisans, guides, and businesses to promote authentic Assam experiences. Furthermore, we are committed to responsible tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities through sustainable travel initiatives. This commitment resonates deeply with the local population and creates a strong sense of trust and loyalty.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Moudeep Travel Agency envisions becoming the leading travel solutions provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainable practices. We plan to expand our service offerings to include adventure tourism activities such as trekking, river rafting, and wildlife safaris, catering to the growing demand for experiential travel. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and travel services. Another key area of focus is strategic partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to offer competitive pricing and exclusive deals to our customers. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our reach beyond Assam, offering customized travel packages to other parts of Northeast India and Southeast Asia. Our long-term goal is to establish Moudeep Travel Agency as a respected brand synonymous with reliable, enriching, and responsible travel experiences, both locally and internationally, while continuing to contribute positively to the economic and social well-being of the Assam region.', 'beltola bazaar road, August Kranti Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.325Z', '2025-12-07T06:15:25.000Z'),
(1484, 'Tour Lover''s Travel Agency', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Tour Lover''s Travel Agency is a dedicated and passionate travel provider nestled in the heart of Assam, catering specifically to the adventurous spirit and cultural curiosity of both local residents and visitors eager to explore the region. Understanding the nuanced beauty and rich heritage of Assam and Northeast India, Tour Lover''s aims to move beyond generic tourism, offering curated and authentic experiences that resonate deeply with each traveler.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Agency distinguishes itself within the Assam tourism landscape by focusing on personalized itineraries and sustainable travel practices. In a region increasingly attracting tourists, Tour Lover''s prioritizes responsible tourism, ensuring minimal environmental impact and maximum benefit to local communities. This commitment to ethical travel positions the agency as a conscious and community-focused business within the growing Assamese tourism sector.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Tour Lover''s Travel Agency offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to diverse travel preferences. These core offerings include: <b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Tailored itineraries for individuals, families, and groups, focusing on specific interests such as wildlife, tea gardens, cultural immersion, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and trekking in the Eastern Himalayas. Packages range from short weekend getaways to extensive multi-day explorations of Northeast India. <b>Guided Tours:</b> Expert-led tours by knowledgeable local guides, providing in-depth insights into Assam''s history, culture, and natural wonders. These tours are available in multiple languages, accommodating a wider range of travelers. <b>Accommodation Bookings:</b> Strategic partnerships with a range of accommodations, from comfortable budget hotels to luxurious resorts and heritage bungalows, ensuring suitable options for all price points and preferences. Special emphasis is placed on supporting locally owned guesthouses and homestays to promote community-based tourism. <b>Transportation Services:</b> Reliable and comfortable transportation solutions, including private car rentals, bus charters, and airport transfers, facilitating seamless travel throughout the region. The agency utilizes local drivers with extensive knowledge of the terrain. <b>Adventure Activities:</b> Arrangements for thrilling activities like river rafting, paragliding, and wildlife safaris in national parks like Kaziranga and Manas. All activities are conducted with certified operators adhering to strict safety standards.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Tour Lover''s unique selling point lies in its deep understanding of Assam and the Northeast''s unique cultural and geographical landscape. Unlike larger, national travel agencies, Tour Lover''s possesses intimate knowledge of hidden gems, local traditions, and the best times to visit specific locations. This hyperlocal expertise allows them to craft truly unforgettable and authentic travel experiences. Moreover, the agency actively promotes lesser-known destinations within Assam and the Northeast, contributing to a more equitable distribution of tourism revenue and preventing overcrowding in popular spots. This focus helps to preserve the natural beauty and cultural integrity of these unique areas.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Tour Lover''s Travel Agency prides itself on providing exceptional customer service that extends beyond simply booking travel arrangements. The agency strives to create a personal connection with each client, understanding their individual needs and preferences to craft truly bespoke experiences. The customer service approach is built on responsiveness, transparency, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. Pre-trip consultations are thorough, ensuring that clients are fully informed about their itinerary and prepared for their journey. During the trip, the agency maintains open communication channels, providing ongoing support and assistance to address any unforeseen issues. Post-trip feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve services and tailor future offerings.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Tour Lover''s deeply values its connection with the local community. The agency actively collaborates with local artisans, cultural groups, and community-based tourism initiatives to support sustainable development and promote cultural preservation. They prioritize hiring local staff and sourcing services from local businesses, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community. Additionally, Tour Lover''s participates in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of belonging and strengthening relationships with residents.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Tour Lover''s Travel Agency envisions a future where tourism in Assam and Northeast India is both sustainable and enriching, benefiting both travelers and local communities. The agency''s long-term goals include: Expanding its range of eco-tourism offerings, promoting responsible travel practices, and minimizing environmental impact. Establishing strategic partnerships with more community-based tourism initiatives to support local economic development. Developing innovative technology solutions to enhance the customer experience and streamline operations. Becoming a leading voice in the sustainable tourism movement within Assam, advocating for responsible travel policies and promoting ethical business practices. Ultimately, Tour Lover''s aspires to be recognized as a trusted and respected travel partner, known for its commitment to providing exceptional experiences, supporting local communities, and preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Assam and Northeast India.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.325Z', '2025-12-07T06:15:32.000Z'),
(1485, 'Green Pics Tours', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<p>Green Pics Tours offers immersive and sustainable tourism experiences throughout Assam, showcasing the region''s rich biodiversity, vibrant culture, and breathtaking landscapes. In a rapidly evolving tourism sector, Green Pics Tours distinguishes itself by prioritizing responsible travel practices, enriching the local economy, and educating visitors on the importance of environmental conservation. We are more than just a tour operator; we are curators of authentic Assamese experiences, committed to leaving a positive impact on the communities we visit and the environment we explore. Assam''s tourism industry is experiencing growth, and Green Pics Tours is uniquely positioned to capitalize on the increasing demand for eco-conscious and culturally sensitive travel options.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around offering carefully curated tour packages that highlight Assam''s diverse offerings. These include wildlife safaris in renowned national parks like Kaziranga and Manas, known for their rhino and tiger populations, respectively. We also provide cultural immersion tours that allow travelers to interact with local tribes, experience traditional Assamese festivals, and learn about the region''s unique crafts and culinary traditions. For those seeking adventure, we offer trekking and river rafting expeditions through the lush hills and pristine waterways of Assam. Each tour is designed with sustainability in mind, minimizing environmental impact and maximizing benefits for local communities through the use of locally owned accommodations, transportation, and guide services. A key differentiator is our commitment to small group sizes, ensuring personalized attention and minimizing disturbance to the natural environment. Furthermore, we offer customized itinerary planning, catering to individual preferences and ensuring a bespoke travel experience for each guest. We meet the growing local market need for sustainable and authentic tourism by offering alternatives to mass tourism, fostering responsible travel behavior, and directly supporting local economies.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Green Pics Tours, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in building genuine relationships with our guests, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations. From the moment a traveler expresses interest in our tours to the completion of their journey, we provide personalized attention and support. Our tour guides are not only knowledgeable about the region''s flora, fauna, and culture but are also passionate about sharing their expertise and fostering a deeper appreciation for Assam''s natural and cultural heritage. We prioritize clear and transparent communication, ensuring that our guests are well-informed and prepared for their adventures. What sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively involve local residents in our tours, providing them with economic opportunities and ensuring that tourism benefits are shared equitably. We regularly collect feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their needs. Green Pics Tours actively participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to the community and fostering a sense of shared responsibility for the region''s well-being.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Green Pics Tours envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and culturally immersive tourism experiences in Assam, recognized for our commitment to responsible travel practices, community empowerment, and environmental conservation. Our future plans include expanding our tour offerings to new regions within Assam, further diversifying our services to cater to a wider range of interests, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities and conservation organizations. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, improve operational efficiency, and promote sustainable tourism practices. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that provides detailed information about our tours, allows for online booking, and facilitates communication with our guests. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote responsible tourism practices. Long-term, we aspire to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam''s tourism sector, promoting responsible travel behavior, conserving the region''s natural and cultural heritage, and improving the livelihoods of local communities. We aim to establish a Green Pics Tours Foundation to support local conservation initiatives and community development projects, further solidifying our commitment to making a positive impact on the region.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.325Z', '2025-12-07T06:20:10.000Z'),
(1486, 'TRAVELLERS 365', 'Tour Operators', NULL, 'TRAVELLERS 365: Your Gateway to Seamless Travel Experiences in Assam

TRAVELLERS 365, strategically located in Pakiza Samsun Plaza on Maniram Dewan Rd, is a comprehensive travel solutions provider dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences for both domestic and international travelers. Situated in the heart of Assam, we understand the unique needs and aspirations of our clientele, offering personalized services that go beyond the typical travel agency experience. We are more than just a booking platform; we are travel partners, committed to ensuring every journey is memorable, hassle-free, and tailored to individual preferences. Our significance lies in bridging the gap between travelers'' dreams and logistical realities, particularly within the vibrant and diverse tourism landscape of Assam and Northeast India. <br> <br>

We distinguish ourselves through a deep understanding of the local context, enabling us to offer bespoke itineraries that showcase the region''s hidden gems, cultural richness, and breathtaking natural beauty. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices ensures that we contribute positively to the communities and environments we operate in, fostering a responsible and enriching travel experience for all. We strive to be the go-to resource for travelers seeking authentic and immersive journeys, contributing to the growth of Assam''s tourism sector while upholding the highest standards of professionalism and integrity. <br> <br>

Our core services and products encompass a wide spectrum of travel-related offerings designed to cater to diverse needs and budgets. These include:

*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in crafting personalized itineraries that cater to individual interests, whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, discovering the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas, experiencing the vibrant culture of the indigenous tribes, or embarking on adventurous treks in the Himalayan foothills. Our packages are meticulously designed to ensure a seamless and enriching travel experience, incorporating comfortable accommodations, reliable transportation, and knowledgeable local guides.
*   **Flight and Accommodation Bookings:** We provide access to a comprehensive database of flight options from various airlines, ensuring competitive pricing and convenient connections. Our accommodation booking service offers a wide range of options, from luxury hotels and resorts to comfortable guesthouses and homestays, catering to different budgets and preferences.
*   **Visa and Documentation Assistance:** Navigating visa requirements and travel documentation can be daunting. Our team provides expert guidance and assistance throughout the process, ensuring that travelers have all the necessary documents to travel smoothly and legally.
*   **Transportation Services:** We offer reliable and comfortable transportation solutions, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours, ensuring that travelers can explore the region with ease and convenience.
*   **Travel Insurance:** Protecting our clients is paramount. We offer a range of travel insurance options to safeguard against unforeseen circumstances, providing peace of mind and financial security throughout their journey.

Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach and our deep knowledge of the local area. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we take the time to understand our clients'' individual needs and preferences, crafting itineraries that are truly tailored to their interests and aspirations. This personalized service, coupled with our commitment to quality and reliability, sets us apart from other travel agencies. Our services directly address the local market''s need for trustworthy and knowledgeable travel partners who can navigate the complexities of travel planning and provide access to unique and authentic experiences. <br> <br>

At TRAVELLERS 365, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. We are committed to providing a warm, welcoming, and personalized experience for every client. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing expert advice, answering questions promptly, and resolving any issues that may arise with efficiency and empathy. We prioritize building long-term relationships with our clients, becoming their trusted travel advisors for all their future journeys. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, promoting sustainable tourism practices and supporting local initiatives. We also participate in community events and festivals, fostering a sense of connection and belonging. We believe in creating a positive impact on the community we serve, contributing to its economic growth and cultural preservation. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. We value their opinions and use them to refine our processes and enhance the overall travel experience. <br> <br>

Looking ahead, TRAVELLERS 365 envisions becoming the leading travel solutions provider in Assam and Northeast India. Our growth strategy includes expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on niche interests such as wildlife photography, birdwatching, and adventure sports. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and streamline the booking process, making it even easier for travelers to plan their trips. We aim to forge strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including hotels, airlines, and local tour operators, to offer even more competitive pricing and comprehensive travel solutions. Our long-term goals include establishing a reputation for excellence in customer service, sustainability, and ethical tourism practices. We are committed to contributing to the growth of Assam''s tourism sector while preserving its cultural heritage and natural beauty for future generations. We see ourselves as not just a travel agency, but as a catalyst for positive change in the tourism industry, promoting responsible and enriching travel experiences that benefit both travelers and the local community.', 'Pakiza Samsun Plaza, Maniram Dewan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.325Z', '2025-12-07T06:20:18.000Z'),
(1487, 'Travellers Club', 'Tour Operators', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Travellers Club: Your Gateway to Exploration on Rajgarh Rd</h1>

<p>Travellers Club, strategically situated on Rajgarh Rd, is more than just a travel agency; it''s a purveyor of experiences, a facilitator of dreams, and a trusted partner for exploring the diverse landscapes and rich cultures that Assam and beyond have to offer. In a region brimming with natural beauty and a burgeoning tourism sector, Travellers Club distinguishes itself through personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a commitment to crafting unforgettable journeys. Recognizing the unique needs of the Assam traveller, from the adventurous trekker to the leisure-seeking family, Travellers Club has established itself as a key player in the local business ecosystem, fostering sustainable tourism and contributing to the economic vitality of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Tailored Journeys for Every Explorer</h2>

<p>At the heart of Travellers Club lies a comprehensive suite of travel services meticulously designed to cater to a wide spectrum of travel preferences. Our primary offerings include expertly curated tour packages encompassing destinations throughout Assam, Northeast India, and select international locations. These packages are not simply pre-packaged itineraries; they are dynamic frameworks that can be customized to align with individual interests, budgets, and time constraints. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, trekking through the biodiversity hotspot of Kaziranga National Park, or embarking on a spiritual journey to the revered Kamakhya Temple, Travellers Club provides the expertise and logistical support to ensure a seamless and enriching experience. We also specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries for special interest groups, such as birdwatching enthusiasts, photography clubs, and cultural immersion seekers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond tour packages, Travellers Club offers a full range of individual travel services, including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, car rentals, and visa assistance. Our unique selling point lies in our dedication to providing personalized attention and leveraging our deep understanding of the local travel landscape. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we offer insightful recommendations on the best places to stay, eat, and explore, ensuring that our clients experience the authentic essence of their chosen destination. In a market often dominated by impersonal online travel agencies, Travellers Club provides a human touch, offering expert advice and unwavering support throughout the entire travel process. Recognizing the growing demand for sustainable and responsible tourism, we actively partner with local communities and eco-friendly accommodations, promoting ethical travel practices and contributing to the preservation of Assam''s natural and cultural heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, One Journey at a Time</h2>

<p>Customer service is not just a department at Travellers Club; it''s a philosophy that permeates every aspect of our operations. We understand that travel is an investment, not just of money, but also of time and dreams. That''s why we prioritize building genuine relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, our team of experienced travel consultants provides unwavering support and personalized attention. We believe in proactive communication, keeping our clients informed every step of the way and addressing any concerns promptly and effectively. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to going the extra mile, anticipating potential challenges and providing creative solutions to ensure a smooth and enjoyable travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Travellers Club actively connects with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local events, partnering with community-based tourism organizations, and promoting local artisans and businesses. We believe in fostering a spirit of collaboration and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. Furthermore, we leverage social media and other digital platforms to share travel tips, promote local attractions, and engage with our customers on a personal level. By fostering a strong sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, Travellers Club has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a reputation as a trusted and reliable travel partner in the Rajgarh Rd area and beyond.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Embracing Innovation</h2>

<p>Travellers Club envisions a future of continued growth and innovation, solidifying its position as a leading travel provider in Assam and Northeast India. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to encompass adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and educational travel programs. We are actively exploring partnerships with airlines and hotels to secure competitive rates and enhance our value proposition. Furthermore, we are investing in technology to streamline our operations, improve the customer experience, and expand our reach through online channels. This includes developing a user-friendly mobile app and enhancing our online presence to cater to the growing demand for digital travel solutions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Travellers Club is committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices and contributing to the economic development of the communities we serve. We plan to increase our partnerships with local organizations, promote eco-friendly accommodations, and support initiatives that preserve Assam''s natural and cultural heritage. By embracing innovation, fostering collaboration, and remaining committed to our core values of personalized service and customer satisfaction, Travellers Club is poised to embark on a journey of continued success, empowering individuals to explore the world and create memories that will last a lifetime, all starting from our base on Rajgarh Rd.</p>
</article>', 'Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.325Z', '2025-12-07T06:20:26.000Z'),
