Looking ahead, Travysys envisions becoming a leading force in driving technological innovation and economic growth throughout Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to encompass emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning (ML), enabling us to provide even more sophisticated and transformative solutions to our clients. We also plan to establish strategic partnerships with local educational institutions to foster talent development and contribute to the growth of a skilled workforce in the region. This collaborative approach will ensure a pipeline of qualified professionals to meet the evolving demands of the technology sector. Furthermore, we aim to extend our reach to underserved communities, providing access to technology and digital literacy training to empower individuals and small businesses in rural areas. This commitment to inclusivity will enable us to contribute to a more equitable and prosperous future for all. Our ultimate vision is to be recognized as a trusted partner and a catalyst for positive change, helping businesses and individuals in Assam harness the power of technology to achieve their full potential.', 'GNB Rd, beside Pragjyotika- Assam Emporium', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.325Z', '2025-12-07T06:25:07.000Z'),
