<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Riya - The Travel Expert | Guwahati is ambitious yet firmly rooted in our commitment to providing exceptional travel experiences and contributing to the growth of the local tourism industry. We aim to expand our reach within Assam and the wider Northeast region, becoming the leading travel agency known for its expertise, personalized service, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to invest in technology and infrastructure to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes, making it even easier for clients to access our services. We also intend to develop strategic partnerships with local businesses, hotels, and tour operators to offer an even wider range of unique and authentic experiences. A key focus will be on expanding our corporate travel management services, providing tailored solutions to meet the evolving needs of local businesses. Ultimately, our goal is to create a travel agency that not only provides exceptional service but also plays a vital role in promoting Assam as a premier travel destination, showcasing its rich cultural heritage and breathtaking natural beauty to the world. We envision a future where Riya - The Travel Expert | Guwahati is synonymous with seamless, enriching, and responsible travel experiences in the heart of the Northeast.</p>', 'Ground Floor, House No: 30B, D Neog Path, GS Rd, opposite Dona Towers', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.326Z', '2025-12-07T06:50:09.000Z'),
(1516, 'Travfolks Holidays Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Travfolks Holidays Guwahati, situated in the heart of the city at Divine Plaza, GS Rd, near Aurus Mall, is a premier travel agency dedicated to curating exceptional and authentic travel experiences, primarily focused on showcasing the rich tapestry of Assam and the wider Northeast India. In a region brimming with natural beauty and cultural heritage, Travfolks Holidays stands out by offering personalized itineraries, expert guidance, and unwavering commitment to responsible tourism, solidifying its position as a key player in the growing Assam tourism sector. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be storytellers, weaving together unforgettable journeys that connect travelers with the soul of Northeast India.</p>
