<ul>
 <li><b>Taxi Service in Guwahati:</b> Providing on-demand taxi services for local travel within Guwahati city. This includes point-to-point transfers, airport pickups and drops, and hourly rental packages. We prioritize promptness and reliability to ensure passengers reach their destinations on time.</li>
 <li><b>Car Rental Service in Guwahati:</b> Offering a wide selection of vehicles for self-drive or chauffeur-driven experiences. Our fleet includes economy cars, sedans, SUVs, and luxury vehicles to accommodate different group sizes, travel purposes, and budgets. We provide flexible rental options, including daily, weekly, and monthly rentals.</li>
 <li><b>Outstation Travel:</b> Facilitating comfortable and convenient travel to destinations outside Guwahati. We cater to both individual travelers and groups, providing reliable vehicles and experienced drivers for exploring the scenic beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast.</li>
 <li><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> Partnering with businesses to provide customized transportation solutions for employees, clients, and events. We offer dedicated fleet management, pre-arranged airport transfers, and transportation for corporate meetings and conferences.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Jyoti Travels apart is our unwavering commitment to providing a superior customer experience. We leverage technology to streamline booking processes, provide real-time tracking, and ensure transparent pricing. Our vehicles are meticulously maintained to guarantee safety and comfort, and our drivers are professionally trained and courteous. Furthermore, we distinguish ourselves through our intimate knowledge of the region, enabling us to offer tailored itineraries and insider tips for exploring Assam and the Northeast. Our transparent pricing policy is another key differentiator; we avoid hidden charges and provide clear, upfront quotes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Jyoti Travels, we place customer satisfaction at the heart of our operations. We strive to build lasting relationships with our customers by providing personalized service, anticipating their needs, and exceeding their expectations. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and adapt to evolving customer preferences. Our drivers are not just drivers; they are ambassadors for Jyoti Travels and for Guwahati, committed to providing a safe, comfortable, and informative journey for every passenger.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We understand the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting tourism and promoting the region''s rich cultural heritage. We also prioritize hiring local talent, providing employment opportunities and contributing to the economic development of Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Jyoti Travels envisions becoming the undisputed leader in taxi and car rental services in Guwahati and the Northeast. Our future plans include expanding our fleet to include electric vehicles, further enhancing our commitment to environmental sustainability. We also aim to develop strategic partnerships with hotels, tour operators, and travel agencies to offer integrated travel solutions. We plan to invest in technology to further enhance the customer experience, including developing a mobile app for seamless booking and tracking. Our long-term goal is to establish Jyoti Travels as a trusted brand synonymous with reliability, safety, and exceptional customer service in the transportation sector of Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Jyoti Travels is committed to playing a vital role in the region''s growth by providing efficient, reliable, and customer-centric transportation solutions. We believe that our dedication to quality, safety, and community engagement will enable us to achieve our ambitious goals and contribute to the prosperity of Guwahati and the Northeast.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T06:55:38.000Z'),
(1525, 'Lachit Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Lachit Tours & Travels, strategically located on Sankardev Path in the heart of [City Name, Assam], stands as a beacon of authentic Assamese hospitality and seamless travel solutions. More than just a travel agency, Lachit Tours & Travels embodies the spirit of Lachit Borphukan, the legendary Ahom general, by championing the rich cultural heritage and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and the Northeast. We are dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences that cater to the diverse needs of both domestic and international travelers, fostering a deeper appreciation for this enchanting region. Our commitment to responsible tourism ensures that we contribute positively to the local communities and preserve the delicate ecosystems of the Northeast.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Lachit Tours & Travels, we offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to create unforgettable journeys. Our core offerings include meticulously crafted tour packages showcasing the best of Assam and the Northeast. These packages range from immersive cultural experiences exploring ancient temples and vibrant festivals to thrilling wildlife safaris in renowned national parks like Kaziranga and Manas. We also provide personalized itinerary planning, tailoring each trip to individual preferences and budgets. Beyond pre-packaged tours, we excel in providing essential travel services such as flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations across various price points, and reliable transportation options. Our unique selling proposition lies in our deep understanding of the local terrain, culture, and hidden gems. We go beyond the typical tourist trails, offering opportunities to interact with local artisans, savor authentic Assamese cuisine, and participate in traditional rituals. This intimate knowledge allows us to curate truly unique and enriching experiences that are not readily available through larger, impersonal travel agencies. Our services directly address the growing demand for experiential travel and the increasing interest in exploring the diverse cultures and natural landscapes of Northeast India, a region often overlooked in mainstream tourism.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We strive to provide a level of personalized service that exceeds expectations. Our team of dedicated travel experts is not only knowledgeable about the destinations we offer but also passionate about ensuring that every aspect of the journey is seamless and stress-free. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, we maintain open communication and provide prompt assistance, addressing any concerns or queries with utmost care. We believe in building long-lasting relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond responsible tourism practices. We actively support local businesses and artisans by incorporating their products and services into our tours, contributing to their economic empowerment and preserving traditional crafts. We also participate in local festivals and events, demonstrating our commitment to the cultural fabric of the region. Word-of-mouth referrals are a significant source of our business, a testament to the positive experiences our customers have had with Lachit Tours & Travels. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our services based on customer suggestions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Lachit Tours & Travels envisions becoming the premier travel agency specializing in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional service, authentic experiences, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our network of local partners to offer even more diverse and immersive experiences. We aim to develop specialized tours catering to niche interests, such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and adventure travel. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, introducing online booking platforms and mobile applications that provide real-time information and seamless communication. A key focus will be on promoting responsible and sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and maximizing the benefits to local communities. This includes supporting eco-friendly accommodations, promoting responsible wildlife viewing, and educating travelers about the importance of preserving the natural and cultural heritage of the region. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with educational institutions and research organizations to promote tourism research and development in Northeast India. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the economic growth of the region while preserving its unique identity and natural beauty for future generations.</p>', 'Sankardev Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:00:09.000Z'),
(1526, 'Lalita Tour & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Lalita Tour & Travels, strategically located at H/N-16, NH-27, stands as a cornerstone in Assam''s burgeoning tourism and transportation sector. More than just a travel agency, we are a dedicated partner committed to curating seamless and enriching travel experiences for both local residents and visitors alike. Our deep understanding of the region''s unique cultural tapestry and breathtaking landscapes allows us to offer unparalleled personalized services, setting us apart in a competitive market. Lalita Tour & Travels aims to bridge the gap between aspiration and reality, turning travel dreams into unforgettable memories. We pride ourselves on being a locally rooted business with a global perspective, dedicated to responsible and sustainable tourism practices that benefit the communities we serve.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings encompass a wide spectrum of travel and transportation solutions, meticulously designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. These include comprehensive tour packages throughout Assam and neighboring North-Eastern states, featuring curated itineraries that showcase the region''s hidden gems and iconic landmarks. We specialize in organizing both individual and group tours, catering to families, couples, adventure enthusiasts, and cultural explorers. Beyond leisure travel, Lalita Tour & Travels provides reliable and efficient transportation services, including car rentals, airport transfers, and point-to-point transportation within and beyond Assam. Our fleet of well-maintained vehicles, coupled with experienced and courteous drivers, ensures a safe and comfortable journey for every passenger. What truly distinguishes us is our commitment to customization; we work closely with each client to tailor our services to their specific requirements, budget, and interests, ensuring a truly personalized and unforgettable travel experience. We are a single point of contact for all travel needs.

<br> <br>

At Lalita Tour & Travels, we firmly believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is deeply rooted in building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their unique needs, and exceeding their expectations at every touchpoint. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel professionals is committed to providing personalized attention, expert guidance, and unwavering support. We prioritize clear communication, transparency, and responsiveness, ensuring that our clients are always well-informed and confident in our services. Furthermore, we are actively involved in the local community, supporting local artisans and businesses by incorporating their products and services into our tour packages. This not only enhances the authenticity of the travel experience but also contributes to the economic empowerment of the local communities we serve. This commitment to local partnership and superior customer service is not merely a business strategy but a fundamental part of who we are.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Lalita Tour & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and transportation provider in Assam and the North-Eastern region. Our long-term goals include expanding our network of destinations, enhancing our service offerings, and embracing innovative technologies to further improve the customer experience. We plan to develop specialized tour packages focused on niche interests such as eco-tourism, tea tourism, and cultural immersion, catering to the growing demand for unique and authentic travel experiences. Furthermore, we aim to strengthen our online presence and leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and streamline our booking process. We also intend to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of industry best practices and continue to deliver exceptional service. Our vision is to create a sustainable and responsible business that not only provides exceptional travel experiences but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of the communities we serve.', 'H/N-16, NH-27', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:00:14.000Z'),
(1527, 'Heaven tours & travel', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Heaven Tours & Travel, strategically located at BB Complex, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Gauhati Commerce College Boys Hostel, is a premier travel agency committed to providing exceptional and personalized travel experiences across Assam and beyond. We understand the unique allure of the region, its rich cultural heritage, and its breathtaking landscapes, and we are dedicated to showcasing its beauty to both domestic and international travelers. In a market increasingly saturated with impersonal online booking platforms, Heaven Tours & Travel distinguishes itself through its commitment to building lasting relationships with its clients and crafting bespoke itineraries that cater to individual preferences and needs.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions, including meticulously planned tour packages, flight and accommodation bookings, visa assistance, and car rentals. We specialize in crafting tailored experiences that explore Assam’s hidden gems, from the majestic Brahmaputra River and the verdant tea gardens to the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with diverse flora and fauna. Our unique selling point lies in our intimate knowledge of the region and our ability to curate authentic and immersive experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. For instance, we offer specialized tea tourism packages, birdwatching expeditions led by local experts, and cultural immersion tours that connect travelers with the vibrant traditions of Assam. Moreover, our services directly address the local market''s needs by providing convenient and reliable travel solutions, eliminating the complexities of independent travel planning, especially for those unfamiliar with the region''s nuances.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Heaven Tours & Travel, customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm and welcoming environment where every client feels valued and understood. Our team of experienced travel consultants takes the time to listen attentively to each client’s aspirations and preferences, ensuring that their travel plans are perfectly tailored to their individual needs and budget. We go above and beyond to provide personalized support throughout the entire journey, from the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up. Our commitment extends to the local community through partnerships with local artisans, guides, and accommodations, ensuring that our tours contribute to the sustainable development of the region and provide economic opportunities for its residents. We actively participate in local festivals and events, further strengthening our connection with the community and deepening our understanding of the region''s cultural fabric.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Heaven Tours & Travel envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional service, its commitment to sustainable tourism, and its deep understanding of the region’s unique offerings. Our growth strategy includes expanding our network of partnerships with hotels, airlines, and local service providers, as well as investing in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes. We plan to introduce new and innovative tour packages that cater to niche markets, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and educational tours. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting responsible travel practices and minimizing our environmental impact. By educating our clients about the importance of respecting local cultures and conserving natural resources, we aim to contribute to the long-term sustainability of the region''s tourism industry. Our long-term goal is to create a lasting positive impact on the local economy and environment, while providing unforgettable travel experiences that inspire and enrich the lives of our clients.</p>', 'BB Complex, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Gauhati commerce college Boys Hostel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:00:18.000Z'),
(1528, 'NIRMALA TOURS & TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'NIRMALA TOURS & TRAVELS: Exploring Assam and Beyond from the Heart of S.S. Road

NIRMALA TOURS & TRAVELS, strategically situated on Professor Gali, S.S. Road, stands as a trusted name in travel and tourism within the local Assam business community. More than just a travel agency, Nirmala Tours & Travels is a facilitator of experiences, connecting travelers with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and warm hospitality that define Assam and the wider Northeast India region. The business distinguishes itself through a deep understanding of the local terrain, a commitment to personalized service, and a genuine passion for showcasing the beauty and diversity of the region to the world. Nirmala Tours & Travels is more than a business; it''s a bridge between travelers and the heart of Assam.

<br> <br>

At its core, Nirmala Tours & Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel-related services designed to cater to a diverse clientele, ranging from individual leisure travelers to corporate groups. These services encompass meticulously planned tour packages, both for exploring Assam''s iconic landmarks – such as Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and the tea gardens of Upper Assam – and venturing into neighboring states like Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, and Nagaland. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the agency specializes in crafting bespoke itineraries, meticulously tailored to meet the specific interests, preferences, and budgets of each client. This personalized approach sets Nirmala Tours & Travels apart, ensuring that every journey is a unique and unforgettable experience.

<br> <br>

A key differentiator for Nirmala Tours & Travels is its expertise in arranging seamless travel logistics. This includes flight and train ticket bookings, comfortable and reliable transportation options (ranging from private cars to larger coaches), and accommodation arrangements in a variety of establishments, from cozy guesthouses to luxurious hotels. Furthermore, the agency provides essential travel support services, such as visa assistance, travel insurance, and currency exchange facilitation, ensuring a stress-free and convenient travel experience for its customers. Recognizing the increasing demand for experiential travel, Nirmala Tours & Travels actively promotes unique activities like tea tourism, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and cultural immersion experiences that offer a genuine glimpse into the local way of life. This focus on authentic experiences resonates strongly with travelers seeking more than just sightseeing.

<br> <br>

Customer satisfaction is at the heart of Nirmala Tours & Travels'' operational philosophy. The business prides itself on fostering genuine relationships with its clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences, and providing attentive support throughout their journey. This commitment to personalized service extends beyond the initial booking process, with dedicated travel consultants available to answer queries, provide assistance, and address any concerns that may arise during the trip. Nirmala Tours & Travels actively seeks feedback from its customers to continuously improve its services and ensure that every traveler has a positive and memorable experience. The agency also actively participates in local community events and initiatives, further solidifying its connection to the region and building goodwill among residents. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and community engagement, Nirmala Tours & Travels has established a strong reputation for trustworthiness and reliability, making it a preferred choice for travel services within the local community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Nirmala Tours & Travels envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading travel agency in the Northeast India region. The business plans to leverage digital technologies to enhance its online presence, streamline its booking processes, and reach a wider audience. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that provide comprehensive information about tour packages, destinations, and travel services, as well as enabling online bookings and payments. Furthermore, Nirmala Tours & Travels intends to forge strategic partnerships with local businesses, such as hotels, restaurants, and tour operators, to offer its customers a more diverse and enriched travel experience.

<br> <br>

The agency also recognizes the growing importance of sustainable tourism and is committed to promoting responsible travel practices that minimize environmental impact and support local communities. This includes encouraging eco-friendly accommodations, promoting ethical wildlife tourism, and supporting local artisans and businesses. By embracing innovation, fostering strategic partnerships, and prioritizing sustainable practices, Nirmala Tours & Travels is well-positioned to capitalize on the growing demand for travel in the Northeast India region and achieve its long-term goals of becoming a leading provider of exceptional travel experiences while contributing to the sustainable development of the local community. The aim is to expand its reach geographically, potentially offering outbound travel packages to other parts of India and even international destinations, catering to the evolving needs and aspirations of its clientele.', 'Professor Gali, S.S. Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:00:26.000Z'),
(1529, 'IGuwahati Tours And Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>IGuwahati Tours And Travels stands as a dedicated and locally-rooted travel agency committed to showcasing the beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, we offer meticulously crafted travel experiences that cater to diverse interests, from adventurous explorations of the region''s stunning landscapes to immersive cultural encounters with its vibrant communities. We strive to be more than just a travel provider; we aim to be a gateway, connecting travelers with the authentic soul of this enchanting corner of India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our position in the local Assam business landscape is significant. We are deeply invested in promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit both the environment and the local communities we serve. We collaborate with local artisans, guesthouses, and transportation providers, ensuring that tourism revenue directly contributes to the economic well-being of the region. By prioritizing authentic experiences and responsible travel, IGuwahati Tours And Travels is playing a vital role in shaping a positive and sustainable future for tourism in Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<h3>Core Services and Products</h3>

<br> <br>

<p>IGuwahati Tours And Travels offers a comprehensive range of travel services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. Our primary services include:</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
    <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that cater to individual preferences and interests. Whether it''s a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, a spiritual journey to the Kamakhya Temple, or an exploration of the tea gardens of Upper Assam, we tailor each package to ensure a memorable and fulfilling experience.</li>
    <li><b>Adventure Tourism:</b> For the adventurous traveler, we offer thrilling activities such as river rafting in the Brahmaputra, trekking through the Himalayan foothills, and camping in remote locations. Our adventure tours are led by experienced guides who prioritize safety and environmental responsibility.</li>
    <li><b>Cultural Immersion Tours:</b> We provide opportunities to connect with the local culture through village visits, traditional cooking classes, and interactions with indigenous communities. These tours offer a deeper understanding of the region''s unique heritage and traditions.</li>
    <li><b>Corporate Travel:</b> We cater to the needs of corporate clients, offering efficient and reliable travel solutions for business trips, conferences, and incentive programs.</li>
    <li><b>Transportation Services:</b> We offer a range of transportation options, including car rentals, airport transfers, and guided tours in comfortable and well-maintained vehicles.</li>
    <li><b>Accommodation Booking:</b> We assist with booking accommodation in a variety of hotels, guesthouses, and homestays, ensuring that our clients have a comfortable and convenient stay. We prioritize establishments that adhere to sustainable practices and support the local economy.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the region and our commitment to providing authentic and personalized experiences. We are not just selling tours; we are selling memories. We differentiate ourselves through meticulous planning, attention to detail, and a genuine passion for showcasing the best of Assam and Northeast India.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>These services directly address the needs of the local market and visiting tourists alike. The rising interest in eco-tourism and cultural tourism in the Northeast creates a demand for reliable and experienced travel agencies that can provide sustainable and authentic travel experiences. IGuwahati Tours And Travels fills this gap by offering tours that are both enriching and responsible, promoting a positive image of the region and contributing to its long-term sustainable development.</p>

<br> <br>

<h3>Customer Experience</h3>

<br> <br>

<p>At IGuwahati Tours And Travels, customer satisfaction is our top priority. We strive to create a seamless and enjoyable travel experience from the initial inquiry to the final farewell. Our approach to customer service is built on three core principles: personalized attention, proactive communication, and problem-solving. We assign a dedicated travel consultant to each client, who will work closely with them to understand their needs and preferences and to tailor their itinerary accordingly. We maintain open lines of communication throughout the travel process, providing regular updates and addressing any concerns promptly and efficiently. In the event of unforeseen circumstances, we are committed to finding creative and effective solutions to minimize disruption and ensure that our clients continue to enjoy their trip.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets us apart is our focus on building genuine relationships with our clients. We treat each client as an individual, not just a number. We take the time to understand their interests, their travel style, and their expectations. We go the extra mile to ensure that their experience is not only enjoyable but also meaningful and enriching.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our connection with the local community is fundamental to our business. We actively support local initiatives, such as promoting local handicrafts, encouraging sustainable tourism practices, and partnering with local businesses. We believe that by empowering the local community, we can create a more vibrant and sustainable tourism industry that benefits everyone. We also participate in local events and festivals, showcasing our commitment to the region and its culture.</p>

<br> <br>

<h3>Future Vision</h3>

<br> <br>

<p>IGuwahati Tours And Travels envisions a future where tourism in Northeast India is both sustainable and prosperous. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel agency in the region, recognized for our commitment to quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism practices. We plan to expand our range of services to include more specialized tours, such as birdwatching tours, photography tours, and wellness retreats. We also intend to invest in technology to improve our online presence and streamline our operations, making it easier for clients to book and manage their travel arrangements.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We see significant potential for growth in the coming years, driven by the increasing popularity of Northeast India as a travel destination. We will continue to focus on providing exceptional customer service, developing innovative tour packages, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We are also committed to working closely with the local community to ensure that tourism benefits everyone in the region. We aim to contribute to the economic growth of Assam while preserving its unique culture and natural beauty for generations to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:00:34.000Z'),
(1530, 'Ride and Climb Adventure tour and travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Ride and Climb Adventure Tour and Travels is a dynamic and innovative tour operator nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Located at Ambees Apartment, Sonai Rabha Market, Kahilipara Main Rd, opposite Advance Neuro Hospital, near Ganesh Mandir, the company stands as a gateway to experiencing the rich natural beauty and thrilling adventures that Northeast India has to offer. Ride and Climb isn’t just a travel agency; it’s a curator of unforgettable experiences, meticulously designed to cater to both seasoned adventurers and those seeking their first taste of exploration. In the burgeoning Assam tourism sector, Ride and Climb differentiates itself by focusing on customized adventure tours, emphasizing responsible travel and showcasing the region''s hidden gems often overlooked by mainstream tourism.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core of Ride and Climb''s offerings lies in its diverse range of adventure and cultural tours. These encompass motorbike expeditions through the scenic landscapes of Assam and Meghalaya, trekking adventures in the Himalayan foothills, rock climbing excursions on naturally formed cliffs, and guided tours to explore the vibrant cultural tapestry of the region. Each tour is carefully planned, factoring in safety, environmental impact, and the desire to provide authentic local experiences. A key unique selling point is the bespoke nature of their tours. Unlike standard package tours, Ride and Climb prioritizes understanding individual customer preferences to craft itineraries that perfectly align with their interests and fitness levels. Furthermore, they offer specialized tours focusing on specific aspects of Northeast India, such as tea tourism, wildlife exploration (including Kaziranga National Park), and tribal culture immersion. Recognizing the growing demand for authentic and sustainable travel experiences, Ride and Climb directly addresses the local market''s needs by promoting community-based tourism initiatives and supporting local businesses along their tour routes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the forefront of Ride and Climb''s operational philosophy. The team is dedicated to providing personalized attention from the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour. This includes offering expert advice on travel planning, ensuring comfortable and safe transportation, and providing knowledgeable guides who are passionate about sharing their love for the region. What truly sets Ride and Climb apart is its commitment to building relationships with its customers. They actively solicit feedback to continuously improve their services and foster a sense of community among their travelers. Their presence within the Kahilipara community is also significant. Ride and Climb actively participates in local events, supports local artisans and businesses, and promotes responsible tourism practices that benefit the environment and the local population. This integrated approach ensures that every tour contributes positively to the community and provides travelers with an authentic and enriching experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Ride and Climb Adventure Tour and Travels envisions becoming a leading adventure tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to responsible tourism and exceptional customer service. Future plans include expanding their range of tour offerings to incorporate new adventure activities, such as white-water rafting and paragliding, while also deepening their focus on cultural immersion experiences. A key strategic goal is to develop partnerships with local communities to create sustainable tourism initiatives that empower local residents and preserve the region''s natural and cultural heritage. Ride and Climb also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly mobile app for tour booking and information, and utilizing social media to promote the region''s attractions and engage with a wider audience. Long-term, the company aspires to establish itself as a trusted and reliable partner for travelers seeking authentic and transformative experiences in Northeast India, contributing to the sustainable growth of the region''s tourism sector while preserving its unique character and beauty.</p>', 'Ambees Apartment, Sonai Rabha Market, Kahilipara Main Rd, opposite Advance Neuro Hospital, near Ganesh Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:05:08.000Z'),
(1531, 'Avani Travel Services', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Avani Travel Services, strategically located besides Rajasthan Lime Udyog, is emerging as a premier travel solutions provider in the heart of Assam. Recognizing the unique travel needs of both local residents and visiting tourists, Avani Travel Services aims to redefine the travel experience by offering personalized, reliable, and culturally sensitive services. In a region celebrated for its lush landscapes, vibrant traditions, and burgeoning tourism sector, Avani Travel Services is poised to become a cornerstone of seamless and enriching travel experiences, distinguishing itself through a commitment to personalized attention and a deep understanding of the local context. We are not just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings encompass a wide spectrum of travel-related services meticulously designed to cater to diverse needs. These include meticulously planned tour packages focusing on Assam and the wider Northeast region, showcasing the natural beauty of Kaziranga National Park, the spiritual allure of Kamakhya Temple, and the cultural richness of Majuli Island. We handle all aspects of tour planning, including transportation, accommodation, permits, and knowledgeable local guides, ensuring a hassle-free and immersive experience. Beyond pre-packaged tours, we excel at creating customized itineraries tailored to individual preferences, budgets, and travel styles. Whether it''s a birdwatching expedition, a cultural immersion program, or an adventurous trek through the hills, we can craft the perfect itinerary. Airline and railway ticketing form another essential part of our service portfolio. We leverage our industry connections and expertise to secure the best possible fares and ensure smooth and efficient ticketing processes. Car rental services provide convenient and flexible transportation options for exploring the region at one''s own pace, offering a range of vehicles from compact cars to SUVs. Finally, we offer comprehensive assistance with hotel bookings, partnering with a network of reputable hotels, guesthouses, and resorts to provide comfortable and well-located accommodation options to suit every budget. What sets us apart is our local expertise and dedication to authentic experiences. We don''t just sell travel; we offer an insider''s perspective on Assam, connecting travelers with the true essence of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Avani Travel Services, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to build long-lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and personalized attention. Our approach to customer service is deeply rooted in the local culture of hospitality, ensuring that every interaction is warm, friendly, and attentive. We prioritize clear and open communication, providing timely updates and responding promptly to inquiries. Our team of experienced travel professionals is readily available to offer expert advice, resolve any issues, and ensure a smooth and enjoyable travel experience. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and tailor them to meet evolving needs. Furthermore, we are deeply committed to supporting the local community. We partner with local businesses, promote sustainable tourism practices, and contribute to initiatives that benefit the region. Our presence besides Rajasthan Lime Udyog allows us to serve a broader clientele, catering to both industrial visitors and leisure travelers. We actively participate in local events and festivals, fostering a sense of community and strengthening our connection with the people of Assam. We believe in giving back to the community that has embraced us, and strive to be a responsible and ethical business.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Avani Travel Services envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on niche interests such as tea tourism, eco-tourism, and adventure travel. We intend to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours, flights, and accommodation. Strategic partnerships with airlines, hotels, and other travel-related businesses will further strengthen our position in the market. A key aspect of our future growth strategy is expanding our reach beyond Assam, targeting both domestic and international travelers. We aim to showcase the beauty and cultural richness of the entire Northeast region, promoting it as a premier tourist destination. We also plan to invest in training and development for our employees, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving travel business that benefits both our customers and the local community, contributing to the economic growth and cultural preservation of Assam. We aspire to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change in the region''s tourism sector.</p>', 'Besides Rajasthan Lime Udyog', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:05:15.000Z'),
(1532, 'Indian Travel Agency', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Indian Travel Agency, strategically located on Rupali Path, stands as a cornerstone of the travel and tourism sector in Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of experiences, dedicated to providing seamless and enriching journeys both within India and abroad. Rooted in the heart of Guwahati, we possess an intimate understanding of the local culture, travel preferences, and logistical nuances, enabling us to offer unparalleled service and personalized itineraries tailored to the specific needs of our diverse clientele. Our commitment to ethical practices, transparency, and unwavering customer satisfaction has established us as a trusted name in the industry, contributing significantly to the region''s economic growth by facilitating tourism and supporting local businesses connected to the travel sector.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive suite of travel solutions, catering to both leisure and business travelers. We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that showcase the breathtaking beauty and rich cultural heritage of Assam, Northeast India, and the wider Indian subcontinent. These packages range from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and cultural immersion tours in Majuli, the world''s largest river island, to spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. Beyond domestic travel, we offer expertly curated international tours, providing access to global destinations with seamless flight bookings, visa assistance, and comfortable accommodations. A key differentiator is our ability to customize every aspect of the travel experience. Unlike generic tour operators, we prioritize understanding individual preferences and creating personalized itineraries that align perfectly with specific interests, budgets, and time constraints. We also provide specialized services such as corporate travel management, handling all aspects of business travel arrangements, including flights, hotels, transportation, and event planning. Our in-depth knowledge of local regulations and established relationships with airlines, hotels, and transport providers enable us to negotiate the best possible deals for our clients, ensuring cost-effectiveness without compromising on quality or comfort.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Indian Travel Agency, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe that travel is more than just reaching a destination; it''s about the entire journey, from initial consultation to safe return. Our highly trained and dedicated team is committed to providing exceptional customer service at every touchpoint. We take pride in offering personalized attention, ensuring that each client feels valued and supported throughout their travel experience. What sets us apart is our deep understanding of the local community. We actively engage with local artisans, guides, and accommodation providers, ensuring that our tours benefit the local economy and provide authentic cultural experiences for our clients. We foster a culture of open communication and readily respond to inquiries and concerns, offering 24/7 support to address any unexpected situations that may arise during travel. Our commitment to building long-term relationships with our clients is evident in our high rate of repeat business and positive word-of-mouth referrals. We also actively participate in community events and initiatives, further solidifying our position as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Indian Travel Agency is poised for continued growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for our commitment to innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We are actively exploring partnerships with new hotels, airlines, and tour operators to broaden our network and provide our clients with even more diverse and exciting travel options. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting responsible tourism practices that minimize our environmental impact and support local communities. We believe that by embracing innovation, prioritizing sustainability, and consistently exceeding customer expectations, we can achieve our long-term goals and contribute to the growth of the travel and tourism sector in Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Rupali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:05:21.000Z'),
(1533, 'S SQUARE TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'S SQUARE TRAVELS: Exploring Assam and Beyond from Number 18

S SQUARE TRAVELS, strategically located at Number 18, is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to experiencing the rich tapestry of Assam and the world beyond. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, S SQUARE TRAVELS distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized travel experiences, deep local knowledge, and a dedication to sustainable tourism practices. We aim to be the premier travel partner for both residents of Assam seeking adventures abroad and visitors eager to discover the hidden gems of Northeast India.

<br> <br>

Our core service is crafting bespoke travel itineraries tailored to individual preferences and budgets. We specialize in arranging domestic tours within Assam and Northeast India, showcasing the region''s breathtaking natural beauty, including Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and the rolling hills of Meghalaya. These tours encompass everything from wildlife safaris and river cruises to cultural immersion experiences and trekking adventures. Beyond the Northeast, we offer comprehensive international travel packages, catering to diverse interests such as leisure travel, adventure tourism, and business trips.

<br> <br>

What sets S SQUARE TRAVELS apart is our unwavering commitment to creating unique and memorable experiences. We don''t just book flights and hotels; we curate journeys. We pride ourselves on our in-depth knowledge of the region, allowing us to suggest off-the-beaten-path destinations and authentic cultural encounters that are often overlooked by larger, less specialized travel agencies. Our expertise extends to handling all aspects of travel, including visa assistance, travel insurance, and foreign exchange services, providing our clients with a seamless and stress-free travel planning process. Our carefully selected network of local guides, hotels, and transport providers ensures quality and reliability at every step of the journey. We also offer customized packages for corporate clients, including incentive trips and team-building activities.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at S SQUARE TRAVELS. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we strive to provide personalized attention to each client. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, our team is dedicated to ensuring complete satisfaction. We foster a welcoming and supportive environment, where clients feel comfortable sharing their travel aspirations and receiving expert guidance. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and adapt to the evolving needs of our clientele.

<br> <br>

Our connection to the local community is paramount. We actively promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact. We prioritize partnerships with local businesses, supporting their growth and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. We also participate in community initiatives, such as promoting responsible waste management and raising awareness about the importance of preserving Assam''s natural and cultural heritage. This commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism not only enhances the travel experience for our clients but also helps to protect the environment and support the local communities we serve.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, S SQUARE TRAVELS envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized tours focusing on niche interests such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and tribal culture. We are also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information. We aim to establish strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, both locally and internationally, to broaden our reach and offer our clients an even wider range of travel options.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices and empowering local communities. We believe that tourism can be a powerful force for positive change, and we are committed to playing our part in ensuring that it benefits both travelers and the destinations they visit. By focusing on quality, innovation, and sustainability, S SQUARE TRAVELS is poised to achieve continued growth and success, providing exceptional travel experiences for years to come.

<br> <br>

S SQUARE TRAVELS, located at Number 18, isn’t just a starting point; it is the beginning of your next great adventure.', '18', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:05:28.000Z'),
(1534, 'TRAVELORR', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>TRAVELORR, located at 7A1, 7th floor, Mainaak Towers, Beside Aayakar Bhawan, GS Rd, Guwahati, stands as a prominent travel solutions provider in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, TRAVELORR acts as a trusted partner, crafting seamless and enriching travel experiences for individuals, families, and businesses alike. Situated strategically in a bustling commercial area, TRAVELORR leverages its prime location and deep understanding of the local ecosystem to cater to the unique travel needs of the region. The company’s significance lies in its commitment to providing personalized service, coupled with a comprehensive suite of travel-related offerings, making it a go-to resource for both leisure and corporate travel within and beyond Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>TRAVELORR''s core offerings encompass a broad spectrum of travel services designed to cater to diverse requirements. These include: meticulously planned holiday packages covering both domestic and international destinations, expert assistance with flight and accommodation bookings ensuring competitive pricing and optimal travel routes, customized corporate travel solutions tailored to streamline business travel logistics and manage budgets effectively, and comprehensive visa assistance services navigating the complexities of international travel regulations. A key differentiator for TRAVELORR is its focus on creating bespoke travel itineraries. Rather than offering generic, off-the-shelf packages, the company’s travel specialists work closely with clients to understand their specific preferences, interests, and budgetary constraints, crafting personalized journeys that exceed expectations. This personalized approach, combined with strong relationships with airlines, hotels, and local tour operators, allows TRAVELORR to offer unparalleled value and unique travel experiences. Furthermore, recognizing the burgeoning tourism sector in Assam and the Northeast, TRAVELORR actively promotes and facilitates travel within the region, showcasing its rich cultural heritage and natural beauty to both domestic and international tourists.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>TRAVELORR prioritizes a customer-centric approach, striving to deliver exceptional service at every touchpoint. The company distinguishes itself through its team of highly trained and knowledgeable travel consultants who possess a deep understanding of travel destinations, airline routes, and accommodation options. These consultants are dedicated to providing personalized guidance, offering expert advice, and proactively addressing any concerns or queries that customers may have. Moreover, TRAVELORR actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorships, and collaborations with other businesses. This commitment to community involvement strengthens its connection with local residents and reinforces its position as a trusted and reliable travel partner. The business cultivates trust by fostering open communication, ensuring transparency in pricing, and providing responsive support throughout the entire travel process, from initial consultation to post-trip follow-up.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, TRAVELORR envisions becoming the undisputed leader in the travel solutions market in Assam and the wider Northeast region. The company''s growth strategy involves expanding its range of services to include specialized offerings such as adventure tourism packages, eco-tourism initiatives, and cultural immersion experiences. Furthermore, TRAVELORR plans to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including the development of a user-friendly online platform for booking flights, accommodations, and travel packages. The company is also committed to investing in the training and development of its employees to ensure that they remain at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. Long-term goals include establishing strategic partnerships with tourism boards and industry associations to promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to the overall growth of the travel sector in the region. Ultimately, TRAVELORR aims to build a strong and sustainable business that not only provides exceptional travel services but also plays a positive role in the economic and social development of the local community. By focusing on innovation, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, TRAVELORR is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a leading travel solutions provider in the region.</p>', '7A1, 7th floor, Mainaak Towers, Beside Aayakar Bhawan, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:05:33.000Z'),
(1535, 'RR Travels Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'RR Travels Guwahati stands as a reliable and customer-focused travel agency situated near Jatiya faguna rabha high school path, dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Recognizing the unique needs and desires of the local community, RR Travels Guwahati strives to be more than just a booking service; it aims to be a trusted partner in crafting memorable journeys, both personal and professional. In a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, RR Travels Guwahati plays a crucial role in connecting people to these experiences, while also facilitating travel for business and leisure to destinations across India. We differentiate ourselves through personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices.

