(1538, 'Holidays91 - Travel Agency in Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Holidays91: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Journeys from Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at the 2nd Floor, Chakraborty Complex, GNB Rd, beside Fashion City, Holidays91 stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences for both local residents and visitors exploring the enchanting landscapes of Assam and beyond. In a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, Holidays91 fills a vital role by providing personalized travel solutions that cater to diverse interests and budgets. More than just a travel agency, we are journey architects, committed to turning travel dreams into tangible realities. We understand the nuances of travel in Northeast India and leverage this expertise to craft seamless and memorable adventures.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of Holidays91''s offerings are a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to the multifaceted needs of modern travelers. These include:</p>
<br> <br>
<ul>
<li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Moving beyond generic itineraries, we specialize in creating tailor-made tour packages that reflect individual preferences, whether it’s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, trekking in Arunachal Pradesh, experiencing the wildlife of Kaziranga National Park, or immersing oneself in the vibrant culture of Meghalaya. Our expertise allows us to design journeys that are both enriching and logistically sound.</li>
<li><b>Flight and Accommodation Booking:</b> We streamline the often-complex process of booking flights and accommodations, offering access to a wide range of options to suit different budgets and preferences. We work with reputable airlines and hotels to ensure comfort, safety, and value for money.</li>
<li><b>Car Rentals and Transportation Services:</b> Navigating the diverse terrain of Northeast India requires reliable transportation. Holidays91 offers a range of car rental and transportation services, ensuring seamless travel between destinations. We prioritize safety and comfort, offering well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers.</li>
<li><b>Visa Assistance and Travel Insurance:</b> We understand that international travel can be daunting. Holidays91 provides comprehensive visa assistance and travel insurance services, simplifying the process and providing peace of mind.</li>
<li><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> We cater to the needs of businesses with specialized corporate travel solutions, including booking flights, accommodations, and transportation for employees, as well as organizing corporate events and conferences.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly sets Holidays91 apart is our deep understanding of the local market and our commitment to providing personalized service. We are not just selling travel; we are creating experiences. We understand that each traveler is unique, with distinct needs and aspirations. Our travel consultants take the time to listen to our clients, understand their preferences, and create itineraries that exceed their expectations. We pride ourselves on our attention to detail, ensuring that every aspect of the journey, from transportation to accommodation to activities, is meticulously planned and executed. Furthermore, our location in Guwahati allows us to leverage local knowledge and connections, providing access to unique experiences and insider tips that are not readily available to other travel agencies.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Holidays91. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients, and we strive to provide exceptional customer service at every touchpoint. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, we are dedicated to ensuring that our clients have a seamless and enjoyable travel experience. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services. Beyond providing excellent service, we are actively involved in the local community, participating in local events and supporting local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Holidays91 envisions itself as the leading travel agency in Guwahati and a trusted partner for travelers across Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of services, developing new and innovative tour packages, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are committed to staying ahead of the curve in the ever-evolving travel industry. We plan to strengthen our online presence, making it easier for customers to research and book travel online. We are also exploring partnerships with local artisans and businesses to offer unique and authentic experiences to our clients. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to be synonymous with quality, reliability, and exceptional service in the travel industry, creating unforgettable journeys for generations to come. We aim to further establish ourselves as a vital contributor to the growth of tourism in Assam and the wider Northeast region.</p>', '2nd Floor, Chakraborty Complex, GNB Rd, beside Fashion City', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:10:30.000Z'),
(1539, 'Ezzy Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Ezzy Tours & Travels, located at House No.- 02, RN Choudhury Path, is a premier travel and tourism company deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. We are dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences, showcasing the region''s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unparalleled hospitality. In a landscape often dominated by larger, national players, Ezzy Tours & Travels distinguishes itself through a localized approach, personalized service, and a genuine passion for promoting Assam as a leading tourist destination. Our commitment extends beyond simply booking trips; we aim to create unforgettable journeys that connect travelers with the soul of Assam, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local tourism sector. We operate with integrity, transparency, and a profound respect for the environment and the communities we engage with.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel-related offerings designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. We specialize in meticulously crafted tour packages that explore the diverse facets of Assam, from the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam to the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with rare and endangered species, including the iconic one-horned rhinoceros at Kaziranga National Park. We also offer customized tour itineraries, allowing clients to tailor their travel experiences to their specific interests and timelines. Our services extend to hotel bookings, flight and transportation arrangements (including car rentals with experienced local drivers), and assistance with permits and documentation. What sets Ezzy Tours & Travels apart is our deep understanding of the region and our ability to provide authentic, off-the-beaten-path experiences. We collaborate closely with local communities, promoting eco-tourism initiatives and ensuring that our tours benefit the local economy. We also provide specialized packages focusing on adventure tourism (river rafting, trekking), cultural immersion (visits to tribal villages, participation in local festivals), and spiritual journeys (exploring ancient temples and monasteries). By focusing on these specific areas, we directly address the growing demand for experiential and sustainable travel in Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Ezzy Tours & Travels, customer satisfaction is at the core of our business philosophy. We strive to provide exceptional customer service at every touchpoint, from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. Our dedicated team of travel consultants is comprised of knowledgeable and passionate individuals who possess a deep understanding of Assam''s tourism landscape. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and ability to anticipate and address potential challenges proactively. Beyond providing excellent service, we actively engage with the local community. We participate in local tourism events, sponsor community initiatives, and collaborate with local artisans and businesses. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices further strengthens our connection with the community and enhances our reputation as a responsible and trustworthy travel partner. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. This dedication to customer-centricity has allowed us to build a loyal customer base and establish a strong reputation within the local community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Ezzy Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services to cater to a wider audience, developing new and innovative tour packages that showcase the region''s unique attractions, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes, making it easier for customers to access our services. Furthermore, we aim to expand our team of travel consultants and provide them with ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they remain at the forefront of the industry. A key focus will be on promoting sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and supporting local communities through responsible tourism initiatives. We believe that by focusing on these strategic goals, Ezzy Tours & Travels can contribute to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector in Assam, while providing exceptional travel experiences that exceed our customers'' expectations.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>In addition to our core tour packages, we plan to develop niche travel experiences targeting specific interests, such as birdwatching tours, photography tours, and culinary tours. We also aim to leverage digital marketing channels to reach a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. By actively promoting Assam as a unique and attractive tourist destination, we hope to attract more visitors to the region and contribute to the economic development of local communities. Ultimately, Ezzy Tours & Travels strives to be more than just a travel company; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable tourism practices, preserving Assam''s cultural heritage, and creating unforgettable experiences for our customers.</p>', 'House No.- 02, RN Choudhury Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:10:38.000Z'),
(1540, 'TRAVENTURE BUDDY', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>TRAVENTURE BUDDY is emerging as a key player in Assam''s burgeoning tourism sector, offering meticulously curated travel experiences designed to connect visitors with the authentic beauty and rich cultural heritage of the region. Located in the heart of [Assume Guwahati], TRAVENTURE BUDDY isn''t just another travel agency; it''s a personalized gateway to exploring the hidden gems and iconic landmarks of Assam and the Northeast. The company distinguishes itself by focusing on sustainable tourism practices and fostering meaningful interactions between travelers and local communities, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region while minimizing environmental impact.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>TRAVENTURE BUDDY''s core offerings center around customizable tour packages that cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. These include meticulously planned itineraries covering wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, spiritual journeys to the Kamakhya Temple, cultural immersion experiences in Majuli – the world''s largest river island, and adventurous treks through the scenic hills of Meghalaya (often integrated due to proximity). Beyond the standard packages, TRAVENTURE BUDDY excels in creating bespoke travel plans, meticulously tailoring each journey to the specific preferences and desires of individual clients. This personalized approach extends to accommodation choices, transportation logistics, and activity selections, ensuring a truly unique and unforgettable experience. A significant differentiator lies in TRAVENTURE BUDDY''s commitment to showcasing the local culture beyond typical tourist traps. This includes arranging homestays with local families, organizing interactions with artisans and craftspeople, and offering opportunities to participate in traditional festivals and celebrations. This not only provides travelers with an authentic glimpse into Assamese life but also directly benefits the local communities by generating income and preserving their cultural heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At TRAVENTURE BUDDY, customer satisfaction is paramount. The company prides itself on providing exceptional service from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. Their team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants possesses in-depth knowledge of the region and are passionate about sharing its wonders with visitors. They go above and beyond to ensure that every aspect of the trip is meticulously planned and executed, addressing any concerns or queries promptly and efficiently. This dedication to customer care is reflected in the consistently positive feedback and repeat business TRAVENTURE BUDDY receives. The business actively connects with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, homestay providers, and transportation services. By prioritizing local resources, TRAVENTURE BUDDY contributes to the economic growth of the region and fosters a sense of community ownership in the tourism industry. They also participate in local events and initiatives, further strengthening their ties with the community and demonstrating their commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism. Regular workshops and training sessions are conducted for local guides and service providers, ensuring they are equipped with the necessary skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional experiences to travelers. This investment in local talent not only enhances the quality of service but also empowers individuals to participate in the tourism economy and preserve their cultural heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, TRAVENTURE BUDDY envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic and sustainable travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast. Their future plans include expanding their range of tour packages to include more off-the-beaten-path destinations and niche interests, such as birdwatching tours, tea garden visits, and culinary experiences. A key focus is on leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides travelers with real-time information, personalized recommendations, and seamless booking capabilities. TRAVENTURE BUDDY also aims to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and organizations to further promote sustainable tourism practices and empower local economies. This includes investing in community-based tourism initiatives, supporting local artisans and craftspeople, and promoting environmentally responsible travel practices. Long-term goals encompass establishing a strong brand presence, both regionally and nationally, and attracting a wider range of international visitors to Assam and the Northeast. By continuing to prioritize customer satisfaction, sustainable tourism, and community engagement, TRAVENTURE BUDDY is well-positioned to achieve its vision of becoming a catalyst for positive change in the region''s tourism industry, showcasing the beauty and cultural richness of Assam while contributing to its sustainable development.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.327Z', '2025-12-07T07:15:08.000Z'),
(1541, 'Lets See Tour And Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Lets See Tour And Travels, strategically located at Subham Buildwell, RG Baruah Rd, beside NEEPCO bhawan in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a premier travel and tour operator dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences throughout the Northeast and beyond. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys, connecting travelers with the rich cultural heritage, stunning landscapes, and unique adventures that this region has to offer. Our commitment to personalized service and deep understanding of the local landscape distinguishes us as a trusted partner for both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and enriching travel experiences in Assam and the surrounding areas.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions, designed to cater to diverse travel needs and preferences. These include meticulously planned tour packages focusing on cultural immersion, wildlife encounters, adventure tourism, and relaxation retreats. From exploring the ancient temples of Hajo and Kamakhya to trekking through the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam and cruising down the majestic Brahmaputra River, our itineraries are crafted to showcase the best of the region. We also offer customized tour packages, allowing clients to tailor their travel experiences to their specific interests, budget, and time constraints. In addition to tour packages, we provide comprehensive travel support services, including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, car rentals, and visa assistance. What truly sets Lets See Tour And Travels apart is our unwavering focus on sustainable tourism practices, promoting responsible travel that benefits local communities and minimizes environmental impact. We partner with local artisans, guides, and homestays to ensure that tourism dollars directly support the local economy and preserve the cultural heritage of Assam. Furthermore, our team possesses an intimate knowledge of the region, enabling us to provide insider tips and recommendations that go beyond the typical tourist experience, creating truly authentic and memorable journeys.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Lets See Tour And Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe that travel is a personal experience, and we strive to build strong relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs and preferences. Our dedicated team of travel experts is available to provide personalized assistance throughout the entire travel process, from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. We are committed to providing prompt, efficient, and courteous service, ensuring that every client feels valued and supported. Our commitment extends beyond simply booking travel arrangements; we aim to create meaningful connections with the local community and share the warmth and hospitality of Assam with our guests. We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events, contributing to the social and economic well-being of the region. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, we are able to provide our clients with unique access to cultural experiences and authentic interactions that are not typically available to tourists. Furthermore, we prioritize clear and transparent communication, ensuring that our clients are fully informed about their travel itineraries, costs, and any potential challenges. We are dedicated to providing a stress-free and enjoyable travel experience, allowing our clients to relax and immerse themselves in the beauty and culture of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Lets See Tour And Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and authentic travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our product offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific interests, such as birdwatching, photography, and culinary tourism. We also aim to develop partnerships with eco-tourism initiatives and homestay providers in remote areas of the region, promoting responsible travel and supporting local communities. We are investing in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking process, making it easier for clients to plan and book their travel arrangements. Furthermore, we are committed to continuous training and development for our staff, ensuring that they remain knowledgeable about the latest travel trends and best practices in customer service. Long-term, we aspire to play a key role in promoting Assam and the Northeast as a premier tourist destination, showcasing its unique cultural heritage and natural beauty to the world. We believe that tourism has the potential to be a powerful force for positive change, and we are committed to using our business to create economic opportunities for local communities and preserve the environment for future generations. Our ultimate goal is to create lasting memories for our clients and leave a positive impact on the destinations we serve.</p>', 'Subham Buildwell, RG Baruah Rd, beside NEEPCO bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:15:14.000Z'),
(1542, 'Tawang Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Tawang Travels, nestled in the heart of Rukmininagar, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences throughout the Northeast and beyond. More than just a booking service, Tawang Travels acts as a gateway to the region''s breathtaking landscapes, vibrant culture, and hidden gems, meticulously crafting itineraries that cater to diverse interests and budgets. Positioned strategically in Rukmininagar, a bustling commercial and residential hub, the agency leverages its local expertise and strong network to offer personalized and authentic travel solutions, contributing significantly to Assam''s growing tourism sector.

<br> <br>

Our core service lies in curating customized travel packages that showcase the beauty and diversity of Northeast India. We specialize in organizing trips to popular destinations like Tawang, Shillong, Kaziranga National Park, and Majuli Island, while also venturing off the beaten path to introduce travelers to lesser-known yet equally captivating locations. These packages include transportation arrangements, accommodation bookings (ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts), guided tours led by experienced local experts, and permit assistance for restricted areas. A key differentiator is our focus on responsible tourism, promoting eco-friendly practices and supporting local communities by incorporating homestays and indigenous experiences into our itineraries. We also offer specialized services like corporate travel management, pilgrimage tours, and adventure activities such as trekking, river rafting, and wildlife safaris. Addressing a vital need in the local market, Tawang Travels facilitates seamless travel experiences by handling all logistical aspects, allowing clients to fully immerse themselves in the journey without the stress of planning and execution.

<br> <br>

At Tawang Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. Our team of dedicated travel consultants takes the time to understand each client''s unique preferences, interests, and budget constraints, crafting tailor-made itineraries that exceed expectations. We emphasize clear and transparent communication, ensuring clients are well-informed about every aspect of their trip. Beyond personalized service, Tawang Travels is deeply rooted in the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a strong sense of connection with residents. This commitment extends to our business practices, prioritizing partnerships with local vendors and suppliers to support the regional economy. Our reputation for reliability, integrity, and exceptional customer care has earned us a loyal clientele and a strong word-of-mouth referral network within Rukmininagar and beyond.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Tawang Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism and its ability to deliver unparalleled travel experiences. We plan to expand our service offerings to include international travel packages, catering to the growing demand for outbound tourism from the region. Furthermore, we aim to enhance our online presence and leverage digital technologies to streamline booking processes and reach a wider audience. Investment in staff training and development is also a priority, ensuring our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry and equipped to provide expert advice and personalized service. We are committed to forging strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including hotels, airlines, and tour operators, to further enhance our service capabilities and create synergistic opportunities. Ultimately, Tawang Travels aims to not only facilitate unforgettable journeys but also contribute to the sustainable growth and development of the tourism industry in Northeast India, showcasing its rich cultural heritage and natural beauty to the world.', 'Rukmininagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:15:20.000Z'),
(1543, 'ECorner Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>ECorner Tours & Travels, strategically located on Kedar Rd, near the well-known Rituraj Hotel in the heart of Assam, offers a comprehensive suite of travel and tourism services designed to cater to the diverse needs of both local residents and visiting tourists. We stand as a dedicated facilitator of memorable experiences, connecting people with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant traditions of Assam and beyond. ECorner Tours & Travels is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to exploration and discovery, firmly rooted in the Assamese spirit of hospitality and dedicated to promoting sustainable and responsible tourism practices within the region. The business landscape of Assam is witnessing a surge in tourism, and ECorner Tours & Travels aims to be at the forefront, contributing significantly to the local economy while preserving the natural beauty and cultural integrity of the area.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel solutions, including meticulously planned tour packages, customized itineraries, reliable transportation services, and comfortable accommodation arrangements. We specialize in crafting immersive experiences that showcase the unique charm of Assam, from the lush tea gardens of upper Assam to the serene beauty of the Brahmaputra River and the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with diverse flora and fauna. Our tour packages cater to various interests, including wildlife adventures, cultural explorations, religious pilgrimages, and relaxing retreats. Furthermore, we offer personalized itinerary planning services, enabling clients to tailor their travel experiences to their specific preferences and budgets. Beyond Assam, ECorner Tours & Travels provides travel arrangements for destinations across India and international locales, offering comprehensive flight booking, hotel reservations, and visa assistance. A significant differentiator is our commitment to providing authentic and sustainable travel experiences, actively supporting local communities and promoting eco-friendly tourism practices. This includes partnering with local artisans and businesses, minimizing our environmental impact, and educating travelers about responsible tourism. Understanding the local market, ECorner Tours & Travels also facilitates corporate travel arrangements, managing logistics and providing seamless travel solutions for businesses operating in the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At ECorner Tours & Travels, exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a personalized and seamless travel experience for every client, from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. Our team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants is dedicated to providing prompt, courteous, and professional assistance, ensuring that every detail is meticulously planned and executed. We actively solicit customer feedback to continuously improve our services and exceed expectations. What sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We believe in fostering strong relationships with local businesses, guides, and accommodation providers, ensuring that our clients receive authentic and enriching experiences. We actively participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of the region. Our location on Kedar Rd, near Rituraj Hotel, provides easy accessibility and convenience for local residents and tourists alike. We actively engage with the local community through various outreach programs, offering travel information and promoting responsible tourism practices.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, ECorner Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism provider in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tour packages focusing on niche interests, such as bird watching, adventure tourism, and culinary experiences. We also intend to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information. A key focus will be on strengthening our partnerships with local businesses and communities, further promoting sustainable tourism practices and contributing to the economic development of the region. We aim to increase our market reach through strategic marketing initiatives, targeting both domestic and international tourists. Furthermore, we plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and create memorable travel experiences. Our long-term goal is to establish ECorner Tours & Travels as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with quality, reliability, and responsible tourism in Assam and beyond. We aim to be recognized not only for our business success but also for our positive impact on the local community and the environment.</p>', 'Kedar Rd, Near Rituraj Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:15:26.000Z'),
(1544, 'Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency, strategically located at 21, Citizen Ln, is a premier travel solution provider dedicated to showcasing the breathtaking beauty and rich cultural heritage of Northeast India. In a region often overlooked by mainstream tourism, Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency stands as a beacon, offering meticulously crafted travel experiences that cater to both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and unforgettable adventures. We distinguish ourselves through a profound understanding of the local terrain, deep-rooted community connections, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism practices. Our agency plays a vital role in the Assam business landscape by promoting local economies, preserving cultural traditions, and fostering a deeper appreciation for the unique biodiversity of the Northeast.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core service offerings revolve around creating personalized tour packages that highlight the diverse attractions of Northeast India. These include meticulously planned itineraries covering popular destinations like Kaziranga National Park (famous for its one-horned rhinoceros), the serene tea gardens of Assam, the living root bridges of Meghalaya, the vibrant tribal cultures of Nagaland, the pristine beauty of Arunachal Pradesh, the historical significance of Manipur, and the scenic landscapes of Mizoram and Tripura. Beyond pre-packaged tours, we specialize in crafting bespoke travel experiences tailored to individual preferences and interests. Whether it’s adventure tourism (trekking, river rafting, paragliding), cultural immersion (homestays, traditional festivals, culinary tours), wildlife safaris, or spiritual journeys (temples, monasteries), we provide comprehensive support from initial consultation to post-trip follow-up. A key differentiator is our focus on sustainable tourism. We actively partner with local communities, ensuring that tourism benefits them directly and that our operations minimize environmental impact. Our knowledgeable guides, fluent in local languages and deeply familiar with the region''s history and culture, offer unparalleled insights, enriching the travel experience for our clients. We also provide ancillary services such as flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (including car rentals with experienced local drivers), visa assistance, and travel insurance, offering a one-stop solution for all travel-related needs.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, going above and beyond to ensure their journey is seamless, enjoyable, and memorable. Our approach to customer service is characterized by personalized attention, prompt responsiveness, and proactive problem-solving. Before the trip, we dedicate time to understand each client''s specific requirements, preferences, and budget, ensuring that their itinerary is perfectly tailored to their needs. During the trip, our experienced tour managers provide on-the-ground support, addressing any issues that may arise and ensuring smooth transitions between destinations. After the trip, we actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively collaborate with local artisans, homestay owners, and community-based organizations, empowering them economically and showcasing their talents to the world. By choosing Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency, our clients not only experience the beauty of Northeast India but also contribute to its sustainable development. We actively participate in local cultural events and festivals, fostering a sense of belonging and strengthening our ties with the community. This commitment to local engagement and responsible tourism resonates with travelers seeking authentic and meaningful experiences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to become the leading tour and travel agency specializing in Northeast India, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more niche tourism products, such as eco-tourism retreats, yoga and wellness programs, and specialized photography tours. We are actively exploring opportunities to partner with international travel agencies to promote Northeast India as a premier tourist destination to a global audience. We also intend to invest in technology to enhance our online presence, streamline our operations, and improve the customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly website with online booking capabilities, implementing a CRM system to manage customer relationships, and leveraging social media to promote our services and engage with potential clients. Furthermore, we are committed to developing and training local talent to enhance the quality of our services and create employment opportunities within the community. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and customer-centricity, Bhaity Northeast Tour & Travels Agency is poised to play a leading role in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India, contributing to the region''s economic growth and preserving its unique cultural and natural heritage.</p>', '21, Citizen Ln', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:15:32.000Z'),
(1545, 'Destinatia Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Destinatia Tours & Travels, strategically located on the 2nd Floor of Pragjyotika Assam Emporium, GNB Rd, stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences, primarily focused on showcasing the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and Northeast India. More than just a travel agency, Destinatia Tours & Travels is a gateway to authentic exploration, fostering a deep appreciation for the region''s unique heritage and undiscovered gems. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, we distinguish ourselves through our commitment to sustainable tourism, personalized service, and in-depth regional expertise.

<br> <br>

Our core service revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries that cater to a diverse range of preferences. Whether it''s a serene spiritual retreat amidst the tea gardens of Upper Assam, an adventurous wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, a cultural immersion into the tribal communities of Meghalaya, or a relaxing family vacation exploring the majestic Brahmaputra River, Destinatia Tours & Travels offers a curated selection of tour packages and customized travel solutions. We specialize in both inbound and outbound travel, connecting local residents to international destinations while simultaneously bringing the world to the Northeast. Our unique selling points include: specialized knowledge of the region, enabling us to offer off-the-beaten-path experiences; meticulously planned logistics ensuring seamless travel; and a strong network of local partners including hotels, homestays, guides, and transportation providers, guaranteeing competitive pricing and quality service. We recognize the growing demand for responsible and sustainable tourism in Assam and Northeast India and actively promote eco-friendly practices, supporting local communities and preserving the region’s natural resources. Our commitment is to offer unforgettable experiences that are both enriching for our clients and beneficial for the local environment and communities.

<br> <br>

At Destinatia Tours & Travels, customer experience is paramount. We believe that every journey should be a personal and memorable one. Our approach to customer service is rooted in building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations at every stage of the travel process. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, our dedicated team of travel experts provides personalized assistance, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free experience. We differentiate ourselves through our attentiveness, flexibility, and proactive problem-solving. We are readily available to address any concerns and are committed to making necessary adjustments to itineraries to accommodate unexpected circumstances. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, cultural organizations, and tourism boards. We participate in local events and festivals, promoting Assam''s rich culture and heritage. We also strive to source local products and services wherever possible, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community and ensuring that our tours have a positive impact on the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Destinatia Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam and Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and in-depth regional expertise. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to cater to emerging travel trends, such as wellness tourism, adventure tourism, and educational tourism. We intend to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing user-friendly online platforms for booking tours, managing itineraries, and accessing travel information. Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and stakeholders to promote sustainable tourism practices and ensure that our operations contribute to the long-term well-being of the region. Our long-term goals encompass establishing Destinatia Tours & Travels as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with authentic travel experiences, responsible tourism, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. We are confident that by remaining true to our core values and embracing innovation, we will achieve our vision and continue to inspire travellers to explore the beauty and wonder of Assam and Northeast India.', '2nd Floor, Pragjyotika Assam Emporium, GNB Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:20:09.000Z'),
(1546, 'Booknow Holidays', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Booknow Holidays, situated on the ground floor of the Asian Complex on GS Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel agency catering to the unique needs and aspirations of the Assamese community and beyond. Recognizing the burgeoning demand for personalized and culturally sensitive travel solutions, Booknow Holidays bridges the gap between global travel opportunities and the preferences of local travelers. Operating within a vibrant and evolving business landscape, Booknow Holidays distinguishes itself through its commitment to exceptional customer service, in-depth regional knowledge, and a tailored approach to crafting unforgettable travel experiences.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Booknow Holidays lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to meet the diverse requirements of its clientele. The agency specializes in crafting meticulously planned holiday packages, encompassing both domestic and international destinations. From serene getaways to breathtaking hill stations within Assam and Northeast India to meticulously curated tours of Southeast Asia, Europe, and the Americas, Booknow Holidays offers an extensive portfolio catering to diverse budgets and travel styles. Beyond packaged tours, the agency provides expert assistance with flight bookings, hotel reservations, visa application support, travel insurance, and customized itinerary planning. A key differentiating factor is the agency''s deep understanding of the specific travel needs and preferences of Assamese families, including arrangements for dietary requirements, religious observances, and cultural sensitivities. This localized expertise, coupled with access to a global network of travel partners, allows Booknow Holidays to offer a truly unique and value-driven proposition.

<br> <br>

Booknow Holidays places unparalleled emphasis on creating a seamless and delightful customer experience. The agency operates on the principle of building lasting relationships with its clients, understanding that travel is a deeply personal and often aspirational pursuit. From the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up, the Booknow Holidays team is dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert guidance. The team members are not just travel agents; they are travel enthusiasts, possessing extensive knowledge of destinations, travel logistics, and customer service best practices. The agency fosters a welcoming and comfortable environment, both in its physical office within the Asian Complex and through its online channels. Regular travel seminars and information sessions are organized to educate and inspire prospective travelers, further strengthening the agency''s connection with the local community. By consistently exceeding customer expectations and prioritizing individual needs, Booknow Holidays strives to be more than just a travel agency; it aims to be a trusted travel partner.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Booknow Holidays envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded service offerings. The agency plans to leverage technology to enhance its online presence, improve customer engagement, and streamline booking processes. Strategic partnerships with local businesses, tourism boards, and airlines are also being actively pursued to offer even more competitive pricing and exclusive deals to its customers. The long-term goals include establishing Booknow Holidays as a leading travel brand in Assam and Northeast India, known for its unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, ethical business practices, and contributions to the region''s tourism industry. The agency recognizes the growing importance of sustainable tourism and intends to incorporate responsible travel practices into its offerings, promoting eco-friendly accommodations and supporting local communities. By embracing innovation, fostering strong relationships, and remaining deeply rooted in its local community, Booknow Holidays is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a vital force in shaping the future of travel in Assam.', 'Asian Complex, Ground Floor, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:20:14.000Z'),
(1547, 'Donniez Safari - Northeast India''s Travel Consultant', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Donniez Safari - Northeast India''s Travel Consultant, strategically situated on Jayanagar Rd, behind Little Donnie _ The Traveller''s Cafe, is a premier travel consultancy specializing in crafting bespoke travel experiences throughout Northeast India. More than just a travel agency, Donniez Safari acts as a cultural concierge, connecting travelers with the authentic heart of Assam and the seven sister states. In a region often overlooked by mainstream tourism, Donniez Safari fills a crucial need: providing expert, localized knowledge and seamless logistical support for exploring this captivating and diverse corner of India. We distinguish ourselves through a commitment to responsible tourism, supporting local communities, and showcasing the unique ecological and cultural treasures of the Northeast.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services revolve around designing and executing personalized travel itineraries. This includes everything from crafting immersive cultural tours focused on tribal traditions and Assamese heritage, to organizing adventurous expeditions into the region''s national parks and wildlife sanctuaries. We specialize in arranging permits and navigating the often complex logistical challenges of traveling in certain areas. A key offering is our customized trekking and hiking packages through the scenic hills and valleys, catering to various fitness levels and interests, from leisurely nature walks to challenging peak ascents. Birdwatching tours, capitalizing on the region''s rich avian biodiversity, are another popular option. Furthermore, we provide transportation solutions, including private car rentals with experienced local drivers familiar with the terrain and local customs, as well as assistance with securing internal flights and railway bookings. We also offer curated accommodation options, ranging from comfortable guesthouses in bustling towns to eco-lodges nestled in serene landscapes. Our unique selling point lies in the depth of our regional expertise. We aren''t just selling trips; we''re offering curated experiences built on genuine understanding of the local cultures, ecosystems, and challenges. This is further enhanced by our strong network of local guides, homestay partners, and community-based tourism initiatives, ensuring that our clients benefit from authentic interactions and support the local economy. The need for this type of specialized service is evident in the increasing demand for sustainable and meaningful travel experiences that go beyond typical tourist traps.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Donniez Safari, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, starting from the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up. Our approach is highly personalized; we take the time to understand each traveler''s unique interests, preferences, and budget, crafting itineraries that perfectly match their needs. We prioritize clear and consistent communication, ensuring that our clients are well-informed throughout the planning process and during their journey. Our local presence allows us to provide immediate support and address any unexpected issues that may arise. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism. We actively promote eco-friendly practices, partner with local communities to create economic opportunities, and educate our clients about responsible travel etiquette. We also actively participate in local cultural events and initiatives, fostering a strong connection with the community and contributing to the preservation of the region''s unique heritage. By supporting local artisans, employing local guides, and promoting homestays, we ensure that tourism benefits the communities we visit, creating a win-win situation for both travelers and residents.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Donniez Safari envisions significant growth and expansion while remaining true to its core values. We aim to solidify our position as the leading travel consultant for Northeast India, expanding our service offerings to cater to an even wider range of interests and budgets. We plan to invest in technology to streamline our booking process and enhance the overall customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform with detailed information about our tours, destinations, and responsible tourism practices. Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and expand our network of eco-lodges and homestays. A key long-term goal is to establish a training program for local guides, equipping them with the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional and culturally sensitive experiences for our clients. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new tourism products, such as specialized photography tours, culinary experiences focusing on Northeastern cuisine, and wellness retreats centered on traditional healing practices. Ultimately, Donniez Safari aspires to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism development in Northeast India, showcasing the region''s unparalleled beauty and cultural richness while empowering local communities and protecting the environment for future generations.</p>', 'Jayanagar Rd, behind Little Donnie _ The Traveller''s Cafe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:20:20.000Z'),
(1548, 'Koyeli Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p><strong>Koyeli Travels: Your Gateway to Discovering Assam and Beyond</strong></p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Building No. 37, Rangamancha Path, Basistha Rd, near Housing Colony, Koyeli Travels is more than just a travel agency; it''s a dedicated partner in crafting unforgettable travel experiences. As a locally rooted business, Koyeli Travels understands the unique charm and diverse offerings of Assam and the wider Northeast India region. We pride ourselves on providing personalized travel solutions that cater to the specific needs and desires of our clients, whether they are seeking adventure, cultural immersion, or simply a relaxing escape. In a market saturated with generic travel packages, Koyeli Travels stands out by offering authentic, curated itineraries designed to showcase the best of Assam and beyond, contributing to the growth of local tourism and supporting regional communities.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including: meticulously planned tour packages for Assam and Northeast India, encompassing wildlife safaris in Kaziranga, tea garden visits in Dibrugarh, cultural explorations in Majuli, and adventurous treks in Arunachal Pradesh. We also offer customized itinerary creation, where our experienced travel consultants work closely with clients to design bespoke travel plans that perfectly align with their interests, budget, and time constraints. Beyond regional explorations, Koyeli Travels provides comprehensive flight and accommodation booking services, ensuring seamless travel arrangements for both domestic and international destinations. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local landscape and our commitment to providing insider knowledge and authentic experiences that are often missed by larger, less-focused travel agencies. By partnering with local guides, hotels, and transport providers, we ensure that our clients not only experience the beauty of the region but also contribute to its sustainable development. We also understand the specific needs of the Assamese community, providing tailored travel solutions that consider cultural sensitivities and preferences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Koyeli Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of personalized attention, proactive communication, and genuine care. We go the extra mile to ensure that every client feels valued and supported throughout their journey, from the initial consultation to the final farewell. Our team is readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and provide assistance whenever needed, ensuring a stress-free and enjoyable travel experience. We understand that travel is not just about visiting places; it''s about creating memories that last a lifetime. That''s why we strive to build meaningful connections with our clients and foster a sense of trust and loyalty. To further connect with the local community, Koyeli Travels actively participates in local events and initiatives, supporting community development and promoting responsible tourism practices. We also leverage social media and local advertising to engage with potential clients and share valuable travel tips and insights.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Koyeli Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, authentic travel experiences, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include niche travel offerings, such as eco-tourism and wellness retreats. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and communities to further enhance the authenticity and sustainability of our tours. Technology will play a crucial role in our growth strategy, with plans to develop a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse and book travel packages, customize itineraries, and access valuable travel information. Ultimately, Koyeli Travels aspires to be more than just a travel agency; we want to be a catalyst for positive change in the tourism industry, promoting responsible and sustainable practices that benefit both travelers and the local communities we serve. We see a future where Koyeli Travels helps more people discover the hidden gems of Assam and Northeast India, creating lasting memories and fostering a deeper appreciation for the region''s rich cultural heritage and natural beauty.</p>', 'Building No. 37, Rangamancha Path, Basistha Rd, near Housing Colony', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:20:25.000Z'),
(1549, 'Travel Space Holidays', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Travel Space Holidays, nestled on Bishnu Rabha Path, stands as a vibrant and dedicated travel agency committed to crafting unforgettable experiences for travelers seeking to explore the wonders of Assam, Northeast India, and beyond. More than just a booking service, we are passionate travel curators, blending local expertise with a global perspective to deliver personalized itineraries and exceptional service. In the dynamic Assam business landscape, Travel Space Holidays distinguishes itself by focusing on authentic cultural immersion, sustainable tourism practices, and fostering meaningful connections between travelers and the communities they visit.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around creating bespoke travel experiences tailored to individual needs and preferences. We offer a comprehensive range of services, including:
    *   <b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in designing personalized itineraries that cater to diverse interests, from wildlife enthusiasts eager to explore Kaziranga National Park to cultural explorers seeking to uncover the region''s rich heritage and vibrant traditions. These packages encompass transportation, accommodation, sightseeing, and activities, ensuring a seamless and enriching travel experience.
    *   <b>Hotel and Accommodation Booking:</b> We have established strong relationships with a wide range of hotels, guesthouses, and homestays across Assam and Northeast India, allowing us to offer competitive rates and diverse accommodation options to suit every budget and preference. We carefully select accommodations that prioritize comfort, cleanliness, and authenticity.
    *   <b>Transportation Services:</b> We provide reliable and comfortable transportation solutions, including airport transfers, private car rentals, and guided tours, ensuring convenient and hassle-free travel throughout the region. Our network of experienced drivers and guides possess in-depth knowledge of the local terrain and culture.
    *   <b>Adventure and Trekking Tours:</b> For the adventurous traveler, we offer exhilarating trekking and adventure tours to explore the breathtaking landscapes of Northeast India, including challenging treks in Arunachal Pradesh and Meghalaya. These tours are led by experienced and certified guides who prioritize safety and environmental responsibility.
    *   <b>Cultural Immersion Experiences:</b> We curate authentic cultural immersion experiences that allow travelers to connect with local communities, participate in traditional festivals, and learn about the unique customs and traditions of Assam and Northeast India. These experiences foster cross-cultural understanding and promote sustainable tourism.
    *   <b>Ticketing Services:</b> We facilitate air and train ticketing services, streamlining the travel planning process for our clients. We proactively search for the best deals and provide expert advice on travel logistics.
</p>
<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets Travel Space Holidays apart is our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction and our deep connection to the local community. We believe that travel should be a transformative experience, and we strive to exceed our customers'' expectations at every step. Our dedicated team of travel experts is passionate about providing personalized attention, offering expert advice, and ensuring that every detail of the trip is meticulously planned. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet evolving needs. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by supporting local businesses, promoting sustainable tourism practices, and contributing to community development initiatives. We strive to minimize our environmental impact and maximize the benefits of tourism for local communities, fostering a responsible and sustainable approach to travel.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Travel Space Holidays envisions becoming the premier travel agency in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our network of partners, developing new and exciting tour packages, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We aim to further develop our cultural immersion programs, offering travelers even more opportunities to connect with local communities and learn about the region''s rich heritage. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our services to include eco-tourism initiatives, promoting responsible travel and conservation efforts. We are committed to investing in our team, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that our staff remains at the forefront of the travel industry. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to contribute to the growth and development of the tourism sector in Assam and Northeast India, creating sustainable economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region''s unique cultural and natural heritage for future generations. Our dedication to exceptional service and authentic experiences will continue to drive our success as we strive to become the leading travel partner for those seeking to explore the wonders of this captivating region.</p>', 'Bishnu Rabha Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:20:31.000Z'),
(1550, 'OM Sai Tours and Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'OM Sai Tours and Travels, situated at House no. 3, Ajanta Path, is a dedicated tour and travel agency deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. We provide comprehensive travel solutions, meticulously crafted to cater to the diverse needs of both local residents and visitors exploring the enchanting landscapes and rich cultural heritage of the region and beyond. As a locally owned and operated business, we possess an intimate understanding of Assam''s unique attractions, challenges, and the preferences of our clientele, enabling us to deliver unparalleled travel experiences. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be your trusted partner in creating memorable journeys.

<br> <br>

At OM Sai Tours and Travels, our core offering encompasses a wide array of travel services designed to seamlessly blend convenience, affordability, and personalized attention. Our primary services include meticulously planned tour packages focusing on Assam''s iconic destinations, from the lush tea gardens of Dibrugarh and the sacred Kamakhya Temple to the wildlife havens of Kaziranga and Manas National Parks. We also offer customized itineraries tailored to individual interests and preferences, allowing clients to explore specific regions, engage in particular activities like birdwatching or river cruises, or delve deeper into the local culture and traditions. Furthermore, we provide comprehensive transportation services, including car rentals with experienced local drivers, ensuring safe and comfortable journeys across the often challenging Assamese terrain. Our airline and railway ticketing services streamline travel arrangements, offering competitive prices and expert assistance in navigating complex booking procedures. Hotel booking assistance across a spectrum of accommodation options, from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts, further enhances the convenience we offer. What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to showcasing the authentic Assam, going beyond the typical tourist trails to connect travelers with the real essence of the region – its people, its traditions, and its hidden gems. Our local expertise allows us to offer insider tips, recommend unique experiences, and provide a deeper cultural understanding, making each journey truly enriching. We strive to meet the local market needs by offering flexible payment options, multilingual support, and a 24/7 customer service hotline to address any queries or concerns promptly.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at OM Sai Tours and Travels. We firmly believe that creating lasting memories hinges on providing exceptional service and building strong relationships with our clients. Our approach is rooted in personalized attention, understanding each customer''s unique travel aspirations and tailoring our services accordingly. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our team of dedicated travel consultants provides expert guidance, addresses concerns proactively, and ensures a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We go the extra mile to anticipate needs, offering assistance with everything from visa applications and travel insurance to local SIM cards and currency exchange. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the booking process. During the trip, our local guides and drivers are not just service providers; they are passionate ambassadors for Assam, sharing their knowledge, insights, and genuine warmth with our clients. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding expectations. We also believe in giving back to the local community. We actively partner with local artisans, promote sustainable tourism practices, and contribute to initiatives that support the preservation of Assam''s cultural heritage and natural environment. By fostering strong ties with the local community, we ensure that our business contributes to the well-being of the region and enriches the travel experiences we offer.

<br> <br>

OM Sai Tours and Travels envisions a future where we are recognized as the premier travel agency in Assam, renowned for our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, our deep understanding of the local market, and our dedication to promoting sustainable and responsible tourism. Our growth strategy focuses on expanding our reach and diversifying our service offerings. We plan to develop new tour packages that cater to niche markets, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We also aim to enhance our online presence by developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows customers to easily browse our offerings, make bookings, and access travel information. Furthermore, we are actively exploring strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, such as hotels, airlines, and local attractions, to offer comprehensive and value-added services to our clients. Long-term, we aspire to become a leading advocate for sustainable tourism in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices that minimize environmental impact and maximize the benefits for local communities. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and meet the evolving needs of our customers. Our ultimate goal is to create unforgettable travel experiences that leave a lasting positive impact on both our clients and the communities we serve, contributing to the economic growth and cultural preservation of Assam. We aim to be the go-to travel partner for exploring the beauty and diversity of Assam, fostering a love for travel and creating lasting memories for generations to come.', 'House no, 3, Ajanta Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:25:10.000Z'),
(1551, 'Jungle Travels India Pvt. Ltd.', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Jungle Travels India Pvt. Ltd. stands as a premier travel and tourism company, deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, offering unparalleled experiences that showcase the rich biodiversity and cultural tapestry of Northeast India. More than just a tour operator, we are passionate advocates for sustainable tourism, committed to preserving the natural wonders and supporting the local communities that define this extraordinary region. We differentiate ourselves through expertly curated itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trails, providing authentic and immersive journeys that connect travelers with the true essence of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the core of Jungle Travels India’s offerings are bespoke travel experiences focusing on wildlife tourism, cultural immersion, and adventure travel within Assam and surrounding states. Our signature wildlife tours highlight the majestic Kaziranga National Park, home to the one-horned rhinoceros, and other protected areas brimming with diverse flora and fauna. We offer expertly guided jeep safaris, elephant-back rides (conducted responsibly and ethically), and birdwatching expeditions led by experienced naturalists. Beyond wildlife, we provide culturally enriching tours that delve into the traditions, art, and history of the region, including visits to tribal villages, tea gardens, and ancient temples. For the adventurous traveler, we organize trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river rafting adventures on the Brahmaputra, and explorations of lesser-known natural wonders like hidden waterfalls and pristine forests. Our unique selling point lies in our unwavering commitment to responsible tourism practices, which includes minimizing our environmental impact, supporting local artisans and businesses, and ensuring fair wages for our staff and partners. These services directly address the growing demand for authentic and sustainable travel experiences, particularly among eco-conscious travelers seeking to explore the unique natural and cultural heritage of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Jungle Travels India prioritizes creating exceptional and memorable customer experiences. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we tailor our services to meet individual needs and preferences. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel experts provides personalized attention and seamless support, ensuring a hassle-free and enriching journey. Our approach to customer service is characterized by responsiveness, flexibility, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. We build lasting relationships with our clients by fostering trust and transparency. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local guides, homestay providers, and artisans, ensuring that our tours directly benefit the people and places we visit. We participate in local festivals and events, contributing to the preservation of cultural heritage and fostering a sense of belonging within the community. We believe that by connecting travelers with the local culture and supporting sustainable practices, we can create a positive impact and contribute to the long-term well-being of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Jungle Travels India envisions becoming the leading sustainable tourism provider in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and responsible practices. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more immersive cultural experiences, eco-lodges, and community-based tourism initiatives. We are actively exploring opportunities to develop new and exciting adventure travel products, catering to the growing demand for experiential tourism. A key focus of our future strategy is leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information. We are also committed to investing in the training and development of our staff and partners, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service and promote sustainable tourism practices. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to contribute to the economic growth and environmental sustainability of Assam, while providing travelers with unforgettable experiences that showcase the beauty and diversity of this remarkable region. We strive to be more than just a travel company; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting responsible tourism that benefits both travelers and the local communities.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:25:16.000Z'),
(1552, 'Travel Angles', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Travel Angles, strategically located near the Post Office in the heart of Assam, is a dedicated travel agency committed to providing personalized and comprehensive travel solutions. In a region brimming with natural beauty, rich cultural heritage, and burgeoning tourism, Travel Angles distinguishes itself by offering authentic, curated experiences that cater to both domestic and international travelers. Understanding the nuances of the local market, we strive to bridge the gap between the desire for seamless travel and the complexities of navigating a diverse and captivating landscape. We are not just a travel agency; we are your trusted travel partners, dedicated to transforming travel dreams into unforgettable realities.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core service revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries that encompass every aspect of a journey, from initial planning to seamless execution. We specialize in several key areas. Firstly, we offer comprehensive tour packages focused on exploring Assam''s diverse ecosystems, including its lush tea gardens, the mighty Brahmaputra River, and the famed Kaziranga National Park, home to the one-horned rhinoceros. These packages are designed to appeal to a wide range of interests, from wildlife enthusiasts and adventure seekers to those seeking cultural immersion and relaxation. Secondly, we provide reliable and efficient transportation solutions, including car rentals, airport transfers, and intercity travel arrangements. Given the often-challenging terrain and road conditions in certain parts of Assam, our experienced drivers and well-maintained vehicles ensure a safe and comfortable journey. Thirdly, we meticulously curate accommodation options to suit varied budgets and preferences, from cozy guesthouses that offer an authentic local experience to luxurious resorts that provide unparalleled comfort and amenities. A unique selling point is our commitment to sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our tours contribute positively to the local communities and minimize environmental impact. We actively partner with local artisans, guides, and homestay providers, empowering them economically and showcasing the rich cultural heritage of the region. Understanding the specific needs of the local market, we also offer specialized pilgrimage tours to prominent religious sites, catering to the spiritual aspirations of many residents and visitors.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Travel Angles, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized experience for every client, starting from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. Our team comprises experienced travel consultants who possess an in-depth knowledge of Assam and its surrounding regions. They are not just booking agents; they are travel advisors who take the time to understand each client''s unique needs, preferences, and budget. We prioritize clear and transparent communication, ensuring that our clients are well-informed about every aspect of their trip. Beyond providing excellent service, we actively engage with the local community. We participate in local tourism initiatives, sponsor community events, and support local businesses. We believe that our success is intrinsically linked to the well-being of the community we serve. We also regularly solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our commitment to building strong relationships with our clients and the local community is what truly sets us apart.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Travel Angles envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, personalized service, and authentic travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to explore lesser-known destinations within Assam and neighboring states, thereby promoting regional tourism and economic development. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides real-time travel information, itinerary updates, and 24/7 customer support. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of the travel industry. Furthermore, we aspire to forge strategic partnerships with international travel agencies, expanding our reach and attracting a wider audience to the captivating beauty of Assam. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to position Assam as a premier tourist destination on the global stage, and we are committed to playing a pivotal role in achieving this vision. We are confident that with our dedication, expertise, and commitment to sustainable practices, Travel Angles will continue to flourish and make a significant contribution to the tourism sector in Assam.</p>', 'near Post Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:25:22.000Z'),
(1553, 'MyTRIPMATE', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'MyTRIPMATE, strategically located on the 2nd floor of 63, Kekora Nagar Path in the heart of Assam, is a dynamic and innovative travel solutions provider dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences for both local residents and visitors exploring the diverse landscapes and rich cultural heritage of Northeast India. More than just a travel agency, MyTRIPMATE acts as a personalized travel concierge, meticulously planning and executing bespoke itineraries that cater to individual preferences and budgets. In a region brimming with untapped tourism potential, MyTRIPMATE distinguishes itself by focusing on sustainable tourism practices, promoting local businesses, and showcasing the authentic charm of Assam and its neighboring states. The company aims to be a catalyst for responsible travel, contributing to the economic empowerment of local communities while preserving the natural beauty and cultural integrity of the region.

<br> <br>

At its core, MyTRIPMATE offers a comprehensive suite of travel-related services, including meticulously planned tour packages, comfortable and reliable transportation arrangements, and carefully selected accommodation options that range from boutique guesthouses to luxurious resorts. A key differentiator lies in their specialization in curated experiences. Instead of offering generic, off-the-shelf tours, MyTRIPMATE works closely with clients to understand their interests, whether it''s exploring tea gardens, trekking through lush rainforests, experiencing vibrant festivals, or delving into the unique tribal cultures of the region. They then craft personalized itineraries that incorporate these preferences, ensuring a truly immersive and authentic travel experience. Furthermore, MyTRIPMATE prioritizes eco-friendly practices, partnering with local guides and businesses that share their commitment to sustainability. By promoting responsible tourism and supporting local economies, MyTRIPMATE helps ensure that the benefits of tourism are shared widely and that the region''s natural and cultural heritage is preserved for future generations. Their service addresses the specific needs of the local market by offering accessible and affordable travel options within Assam and the Northeast, catering to both leisure travelers and those seeking business travel solutions.

<br> <br>

MyTRIPMATE''s approach to customer service is deeply rooted in building strong relationships and fostering a sense of trust. Their team comprises knowledgeable and passionate travel experts who are dedicated to providing personalized attention and going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. From the initial consultation to the completion of the trip, MyTRIPMATE maintains open communication, promptly addressing any queries or concerns that may arise. They leverage their local expertise to provide valuable insights and recommendations, ensuring that customers have a seamless and enriching travel experience. What truly sets MyTRIPMATE apart is their commitment to connecting with the local community. They actively support local artisans, businesses, and cultural organizations, creating opportunities for travelers to engage with the authentic Assam experience. They regularly participate in local events and festivals, promoting their services and fostering a sense of community spirit. This deep connection with the local community not only enhances the travel experience for their clients but also contributes to the overall development and prosperity of the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, MyTRIPMATE envisions itself as a leading travel solutions provider in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, personalized service, and community engagement. Their future plans include expanding their service offerings to cater to a wider range of traveler needs, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and cultural immersion programs. They also plan to invest in technology to enhance their online presence and streamline their operations, making it easier for customers to plan and book their trips. A long-term goal is to establish a network of sustainable tourism initiatives across the region, partnering with local communities to develop eco-friendly accommodations, promote responsible tourism practices, and create economic opportunities for local residents. By focusing on sustainable growth, fostering strong community relationships, and providing exceptional customer service, MyTRIPMATE is poised to make a significant contribution to the tourism industry in Northeast India, while preserving the region''s unique cultural heritage and natural beauty. The business aims to be synonymous with responsible and enriching travel experiences in Assam and beyond, leaving a positive and lasting impact on both travelers and the local communities they encounter.', '2nd floor, 63, Kekora Nagar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:25:29.000Z'),
(1554, 'TRAVEL CONTINENTAL', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>TRAVEL CONTINENTAL, strategically located on the 1st Floor of Raja Complex, 7(A, Basistha Rd, Guwahati, stands as a premier travel and tourism agency, deeply rooted in Assam''s vibrant cultural and economic landscape. We are more than just a travel agency; we are architects of experiences, crafting personalized journeys that cater to the diverse needs of our clientele, from leisure travelers seeking immersive cultural exploration to corporate entities requiring seamless travel solutions. Recognizing the unique demands of the local market, TRAVEL CONTINENTAL is committed to providing unparalleled service, fostering enduring relationships with our clients, and contributing to the growth of Assam''s tourism sector. <br> <br> </p>

<p>At the heart of TRAVEL CONTINENTAL lies a commitment to delivering comprehensive travel solutions. Our core offerings encompass a broad spectrum of services, meticulously designed to meet the evolving needs of today''s traveler. These include: <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Domestic and International Flight Bookings:</b> We provide access to an extensive network of airlines, ensuring competitive pricing and optimal flight schedules for both domestic and international destinations. Our experienced travel consultants meticulously compare options to secure the most suitable flights, taking into account factors like budget, travel time, and preferred airlines.<br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Hotel Reservations:</b> Our partnerships with a wide range of hotels, from budget-friendly accommodations to luxurious resorts, enable us to offer diverse lodging options to suit any preference and budget. We leverage our industry connections to secure exclusive deals and provide insider recommendations, guaranteeing a comfortable and memorable stay. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that cater to individual interests and travel styles. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, discovering the wildlife of Kaziranga National Park, or venturing into the Himalayan foothills, our itineraries are meticulously planned to provide authentic and enriching experiences. We also offer international tour packages, connecting our clients with destinations across the globe. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> We provide comprehensive travel management services for businesses of all sizes. Our services include booking flights and hotels, arranging transportation, and providing 24/7 support. We understand the unique needs of corporate travelers and strive to provide efficient and cost-effective solutions that streamline their travel arrangements. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Visa Assistance:</b> Navigating the complexities of visa applications can be daunting. We provide expert guidance and support throughout the visa application process, ensuring that our clients have the necessary documentation and are well-prepared for their visa interviews. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Unique Selling Points:</b> Our competitive edge lies in our unwavering commitment to personalized service, our deep understanding of the local market, and our dedication to providing value for money. We go the extra mile to understand our clients'' needs and preferences, tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. Our local expertise enables us to offer insider tips and recommendations, providing our clients with authentic and memorable travel experiences. <br> <br> </p>

<p>TRAVEL CONTINENTAL prioritizes creating a customer experience that is both seamless and memorable. We understand that travel planning can be stressful, and we strive to make the process as easy and enjoyable as possible. Our team of dedicated travel consultants is passionate about travel and committed to providing exceptional service. We take the time to listen to our clients'' needs, answer their questions, and provide expert advice. We also offer 24/7 support, ensuring that our clients have assistance whenever they need it. <br> <br> </p>

<p>What truly distinguishes TRAVEL CONTINENTAL is our deep connection with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe that tourism can be a powerful force for good, and we are committed to using our business to make a positive impact on the community. We also partner with local guides and tour operators to provide our clients with authentic and immersive cultural experiences. We source local products and services whenever possible, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable tourism practices.<br> <br> </p>

<p>Looking ahead, TRAVEL CONTINENTAL envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, firmly establishing itself as the leading travel agency in the region. Our long-term goals include: <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Expanding our service offerings:</b> We plan to introduce new and innovative travel services, such as adventure tourism packages, wellness retreats, and specialized tours catering to niche interests. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Strengthening our partnerships:</b> We will continue to build strong relationships with airlines, hotels, and tour operators, both locally and internationally, to secure the best deals and provide our clients with unparalleled access to travel resources. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Investing in technology:</b> We will leverage technology to enhance our customer experience, streamline our operations, and expand our reach. This includes investing in online booking platforms, mobile apps, and data analytics tools. <br> <br> </p>

<p><b>Promoting sustainable tourism:</b> We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that protect the environment, preserve local cultures, and benefit local communities. We will continue to partner with local organizations to promote responsible travel and educate our clients about the importance of sustainability. <br> <br> </p>

<p>TRAVEL CONTINENTAL is more than just a travel agency; we are a trusted partner, a reliable resource, and a dedicated member of the Assam community. We are passionate about travel and committed to providing our clients with exceptional experiences that exceed their expectations. We believe that travel has the power to transform lives, and we are honored to play a role in helping our clients explore the world.
</p>', '1st Floor, Raja Complex, 7(A, Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:25:38.000Z'),
(1555, 'Gateway Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Gateway Travels: Your Passage to Assam''s Wonders from Bonda</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Bonda, Gateway Travels stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences across Assam and beyond. We are more than just a travel agency; we are your dedicated partners in crafting unforgettable journeys, whether you seek spiritual solace, adventurous exploration, or immersive cultural encounters. Recognizing the unique allure and burgeoning tourism potential of Assam, we''ve positioned ourselves as a pivotal gateway, connecting travelers with the diverse landscapes, rich heritage, and vibrant culture that this beautiful region offers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Gateway Travels, we understand that every journey is unique. That''s why our core services are designed to cater to a broad spectrum of travel needs, ensuring a personalized and seamless experience for each of our clients. Our primary offerings include meticulously crafted tour packages encompassing popular Assam destinations like Kaziranga National Park (renowned for its one-horned rhinoceros), Majuli (the world''s largest river island), and the tea gardens of Dibrugarh, as well as lesser-known gems offering authentic cultural experiences. We also specialize in customized itineraries tailored to individual preferences, budget constraints, and specific interests. Whether it''s a family vacation, a romantic getaway, or an adventurous solo expedition, we meticulously plan every detail to ensure a fulfilling and memorable trip.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond pre-packaged and customized tours, Gateway Travels offers comprehensive travel solutions encompassing airline and train ticketing, hotel reservations across various price points, and reliable transportation services including car rentals and airport transfers. Our commitment to providing hassle-free travel extends to visa assistance and travel insurance, ensuring our clients are well-prepared and protected throughout their journey. What sets us apart is our deep understanding of the local terrain and culture. We leverage this knowledge to curate authentic experiences, partnering with local communities and businesses to offer unique insights into Assam''s rich heritage. This includes arranging visits to local villages, interactions with artisans, and opportunities to savor authentic Assamese cuisine.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, treating each interaction as an opportunity to exceed expectations. Our team of experienced travel professionals is dedicated to providing personalized attention, understanding individual needs, and offering expert advice to ensure a seamless and enjoyable travel experience. We are committed to providing prompt and efficient service, responding to inquiries with clarity and offering solutions to any challenges that may arise. Our commitment extends beyond booking flights and hotels; we strive to be a trusted advisor and resource, sharing valuable information and insights to enhance the travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, Gateway Travels actively engages with the local community in Bonda and beyond. We believe in responsible tourism and are committed to supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices. This includes partnering with local artisans, supporting community-based tourism initiatives, and encouraging responsible travel behavior among our clients. We understand that our success is intrinsically linked to the well-being of the community and the preservation of Assam''s natural and cultural heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Gateway Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, authentic experiences, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific interests like birdwatching, wildlife photography, and tea tourism. We also aim to develop partnerships with more local communities, empowering them to benefit from tourism while preserving their unique cultural heritage. We are actively exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our presence in the region by establishing satellite offices in key locations across Assam, making our services more accessible to a wider range of travelers. We recognize the growing demand for adventure tourism and are actively developing new itineraries that cater to this segment, including trekking expeditions, river rafting adventures, and camping experiences in pristine natural settings. Ultimately, Gateway Travels aims to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism development in Assam, contributing to the economic empowerment of local communities and the preservation of the region''s natural and cultural treasures.</p>', 'Bonda', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.328Z', '2025-12-07T07:30:09.000Z'),
(1556, 'Spectra Travel Agency', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Spectra Travel Agency, strategically located at House No 22, Dharmeswar Taru Path, Krishnapur House No 22, Dharmeswar Taru Path, 3, near AG Office Road, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Recognizing the growing demand for personalized and expertly curated travel solutions in the region, Spectra Travel Agency stands out by offering a comprehensive range of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its clientele, from leisure travelers to corporate clients. The agency distinguishes itself through its commitment to ethical practices, sustainable tourism, and the promotion of local culture and heritage, contributing significantly to the burgeoning tourism sector of Assam.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Spectra Travel Agency''s offerings are its core services, encompassing comprehensive travel planning, meticulously arranged tour packages, hassle-free flight and accommodation bookings, and expert visa assistance. These services are not merely transactional; they are thoughtfully designed to provide a seamless and enriching travel experience. Unique selling points include specialized tour packages highlighting the hidden gems of Assam, customized itineraries catering to individual preferences and budgets, and a dedicated team of multilingual travel consultants with in-depth knowledge of the region. The agency understands the local market''s needs by offering packages that include cultural immersion experiences, adventure tourism opportunities in the Northeast, and spiritual journeys to renowned religious sites, thereby directly addressing the specific travel interests and preferences of the Assamese community. Furthermore, Spectra Travel Agency leverages its established network of local partners, including hotels, transportation providers, and tour guides, to ensure competitive pricing and exceptional service quality, making travel accessible and enjoyable for everyone.

