<br> <br>

At Meenakshi Tour N Travels, we firmly believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered around building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and genuine care. We go the extra mile to ensure that every aspect of the travel experience is seamless and stress-free, from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are readily available to provide expert advice, address concerns promptly, and offer personalized recommendations. We actively seek customer feedback to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet evolving needs. We are also deeply rooted in the local community, actively participating in local events and collaborating with local businesses to promote the region''s unique offerings. This strong community connection enables us to provide our customers with authentic and immersive experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We source local guides, support local artisans, and promote locally owned businesses, ensuring that our tours contribute to the economic well-being of the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Meenakshi Tour N Travels envisions becoming a leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional customer service, sustainable tourism practices, and innovative travel solutions. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass emerging travel trends such as wellness tourism and experiential travel. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing user-friendly online platforms and mobile applications that provide seamless booking and travel management capabilities. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism value chain and share their unique cultural heritage with the world. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver world-class travel experiences. We will also focus on promoting Assam and Northeast India as a premier travel destination through targeted marketing campaigns and collaborations with tourism boards and industry partners. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector in the region, creating economic opportunities for local communities while preserving the environment and cultural heritage for future generations.', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:35:16.000Z'),
(1562, 'Horizon Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Horizon Travels: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond

Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at 1ST FLOOR, NO. 234-A, Bye Lane Number 8, near RAJGARH, Horizon Travels is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences tailored to the unique needs and desires of the local community and visitors alike. More than just a travel agency, Horizon Travels serves as a bridge, connecting individuals and families to the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and the wider world. Our commitment to personalized service, deep understanding of the local landscape, and dedication to creating unforgettable journeys distinguishes us as a vital part of the Assam business ecosystem. We aim to not only facilitate travel but to inspire exploration, foster cultural exchange, and create lasting memories for our clients.

<br> <br>

At the core of Horizon Travels'' offerings lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to diverse travel needs. We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages throughout Assam and Northeast India, showcasing the region''s stunning biodiversity, ancient temples, vibrant festivals, and unique tribal cultures. These packages range from serene tea garden retreats and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to adventurous treks in the hills of Meghalaya and immersive cultural experiences in the tribal villages of Nagaland. Understanding the needs of the local market, we also offer pilgrimage tours to revered sites across India, meticulously planned and executed for a seamless and spiritually enriching experience.

<br> <br>

Beyond regional tourism, Horizon Travels provides a full range of domestic and international travel services. We offer flight bookings with competitive fares, hotel reservations at a variety of properties ranging from budget-friendly accommodations to luxury resorts, visa assistance, and travel insurance. Recognizing the growing demand for hassle-free travel, we also facilitate corporate travel arrangements, including conference bookings, group travel logistics, and customized itineraries designed to meet specific business objectives. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to combine global travel expertise with an intimate understanding of the local context, ensuring that every trip is meticulously planned, flawlessly executed, and personally enriching.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of the Horizon Travels philosophy. We believe that travel planning should be a collaborative process, and our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing personalized attention to each client. We take the time to understand individual preferences, budget constraints, and travel aspirations, tailoring our services to create the perfect itinerary. Our commitment extends beyond the booking process. We provide ongoing support throughout the journey, offering assistance with travel arrangements, visa applications, and any unexpected challenges that may arise.

<br> <br>

Horizon Travels actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, partnerships with local businesses, and promotion of sustainable tourism practices. We believe in supporting the local economy and preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Assam. By sourcing local guides, utilizing locally owned accommodations, and promoting responsible tourism, we contribute to the sustainable development of the region. This commitment to the community extends to our corporate social responsibility initiatives, which focus on supporting local education and environmental conservation efforts.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Horizon Travels envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading travel provider in Assam and Northeast India. Our future plans include developing specialized tour packages catering to niche interests such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness tourism. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including online booking platforms and mobile applications that provide real-time travel updates and personalized recommendations.

<br> <br>

We aim to establish strategic partnerships with international tour operators to attract a wider range of international visitors to Assam, showcasing the region''s unique attractions to a global audience. Furthermore, we are committed to continuously training and developing our team of travel consultants, ensuring that they possess the knowledge, skills, and dedication to provide exceptional service. Our long-term goal is to become synonymous with exceptional travel experiences, contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam while upholding our commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and customer satisfaction. Horizon Travels strives to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a trusted partner, guiding our clients on unforgettable journeys and helping them discover the wonders of Assam and the world.', '1ST FLOOR, NO. 234-A, Bye Lane Number 8, near RAJGARH', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:35:23.000Z'),
(1563, 'Asian Holidays & Expeditions', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Asian Holidays & Expeditions, located at House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd, is a dedicated travel company specializing in crafting authentic and enriching travel experiences across Assam and wider Northeast India, with a particular focus on showcasing the diverse cultures and breathtaking landscapes of Asia. More than just a travel agency, Asian Holidays & Expeditions acts as a bridge, connecting travelers with the heart and soul of the region, offering carefully curated itineraries and bespoke travel solutions for both domestic and international visitors. In a region known for its rich biodiversity and unexplored beauty, Asian Holidays & Expeditions stands out by prioritizing sustainable tourism practices and fostering meaningful connections between travelers and local communities. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings encompass a wide range of travel services designed to cater to diverse interests and preferences. We specialize in customized tour packages that showcase the unique aspects of Assam, from its lush tea gardens and majestic Brahmaputra River to its vibrant festivals and ancient temples. These packages can be tailored to individual needs, accommodating varying budgets, durations, and activity levels. Birdwatching tours, adventure treks in the Himalayas, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, and cultural immersion experiences with local tribes are just a few examples of the experiences we facilitate. Beyond Assam, we extend our expertise to crafting memorable journeys across Northeast India, including Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. We also offer meticulously planned expeditions to other Asian destinations, focusing on culturally rich locations and hidden gems. Hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (including car rentals and local transport), visa assistance, and travel insurance are all integral parts of our service, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free travel experience. Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to responsible tourism, which ensures that our operations benefit the local communities we work with and minimize our environmental impact. We actively promote eco-friendly accommodations, support local artisans, and encourage travelers to respect the cultural sensitivities of the region. By focusing on sustainable practices and authentic experiences, Asian Holidays & Expeditions meets the growing demand for ethical and immersive travel options in the local market and beyond.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Asian Holidays & Expeditions, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our team of experienced travel consultants is passionate about creating personalized travel experiences that exceed expectations. We take the time to understand each client''s individual needs and preferences, providing expert advice and guidance every step of the way. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, we are dedicated to ensuring a smooth, enjoyable, and memorable journey. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the booking process. We maintain regular communication with our clients throughout their trip, providing support and assistance as needed. We also actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our customers. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, community organizations, and tourism initiatives. By supporting local entrepreneurs and promoting sustainable tourism practices, we contribute to the economic development and cultural preservation of the region. We also participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam and fostering a sense of community pride.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Asian Holidays & Expeditions envisions itself as a leading travel company in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism and its ability to create authentic and transformative travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to include more specialized themes, such as culinary tours, wellness retreats, and photography expeditions. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking process, making it easier for customers to plan and book their trips. A key long-term goal is to establish a training program for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in the tourism industry. This initiative will not only contribute to the economic empowerment of local communities but also ensure that the future of tourism in the region is sustainable and responsible. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and community engagement, Asian Holidays & Expeditions is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India and beyond.</p>', 'House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:35:29.000Z'),
(1564, 'Krishnaguru Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Krishnaguru Tours & Travels, situated on Rodali Path, is a premier travel and tourism company deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of experiences, connecting travelers with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and spiritual essence that Assam and Northeast India offer. In a region brimming with untapped potential for tourism, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels stands out as a reliable and passionate partner for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and immersive journeys. We pride ourselves on our local expertise, personalized service, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices, contributing to the growth of the local economy and preservation of our natural and cultural heritage.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including meticulously planned tour packages, efficient transportation solutions, and comfortable accommodation arrangements. We offer a diverse range of tour packages, catering to varied interests and budgets. These range from spiritual journeys to the Krishnaguru Sewashram, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, cultural explorations of Majuli Island, and adventure treks in the Himalayan foothills. Beyond pre-designed packages, we excel in creating bespoke travel itineraries, tailoring each trip to the individual preferences and requirements of our clients. Our transportation services ensure seamless travel across the region, with a fleet of well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers familiar with the local terrain. Furthermore, we partner with a network of reputable hotels, guesthouses, and homestays to provide comfortable and authentic accommodation options, ranging from budget-friendly to luxury experiences. A key differentiator for Krishnaguru Tours & Travels is our focus on responsible and sustainable tourism. We strive to minimize our environmental impact and maximize the benefits to local communities by supporting local businesses and promoting eco-friendly practices.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Krishnaguru Tours & Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are passionate about Assam and possess in-depth knowledge of the region. They are adept at understanding individual travel needs and crafting personalized itineraries that exceed expectations. We are committed to providing prompt and efficient communication, addressing any queries or concerns with utmost attention. Our on-the-ground support ensures a smooth and hassle-free travel experience. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings. Beyond customer service, we are deeply connected with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local artisans and promoting cultural preservation. We believe that tourism should be a force for good, contributing to the economic empowerment of local communities and the preservation of Assam''s unique cultural identity.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on niche interests, such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and tribal culture immersion. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-friendly accommodations in remote areas, promoting sustainable tourism and creating employment opportunities for local communities. Technological innovation is also a key focus, with plans to develop a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse and book tours, customize itineraries, and access travel information. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, showcasing the region''s unique beauty and cultural heritage to the world while preserving it for future generations.</p>', 'Rodali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:35:35.000Z'),
(1565, 'Voyage Tours and Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Voyage Tours and Travels, strategically located on Daljan Path, near N R Housing Complex in Assam, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences tailored to the diverse needs and desires of its clientele. Recognizing the rich tapestry of Assam''s landscapes, cultures, and traditions, Voyage Tours and Travels aims to be more than just a travel provider; it strives to be a gateway to unforgettable journeys, fostering deeper connections with the region''s unique offerings. In a local business landscape increasingly focused on personalized experiences, Voyage Tours and Travels stands out by combining local expertise with a global perspective, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching adventures. <br> <br>

Our core business revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries, handling comprehensive travel logistics, and providing exceptional customer service from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up.  We offer a broad spectrum of services, including: personalized tour packages focusing on Assam''s tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, cultural heritage sites, and adventure tourism activities like river rafting and trekking; efficient flight and railway ticketing services for domestic and international travel; comfortable and reliable car rental services tailored to various group sizes and travel requirements; hotel and resort booking services, ensuring access to the best accommodations at competitive rates; and expert visa assistance and travel insurance services, providing peace of mind throughout the journey. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to creating highly customized travel experiences. We delve deep into understanding our clients'' individual preferences, interests, and budgets to design itineraries that perfectly match their needs. This personalized approach extends beyond simply booking flights and hotels; it involves curating unique experiences, recommending hidden gems, and providing insider tips to ensure each journey is truly unforgettable. Our services directly address the needs of the local market by offering accessible and affordable travel options for residents looking to explore their own region, as well as providing expertly guided tours for international visitors seeking an authentic glimpse into Assam''s captivating beauty and culture. <br> <br>

At Voyage Tours and Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered on building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations at every touchpoint. Our team of dedicated and knowledgeable travel consultants are passionate about Assam and are committed to providing personalized attention and expert advice.  We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, our attention to detail, and our ability to handle any unexpected situations that may arise during travel. We go above and beyond to ensure that our clients feel supported and cared for throughout their entire journey. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond providing travel services. We actively participate in local events, support local businesses, and promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit the environment and local communities. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us and are committed to being a responsible and ethical business partner. Our strategic location on Daljan Path allows for easy accessibility for local residents, and we actively engage with the N R Housing Complex community through special offers and partnerships. <br> <br>

Looking to the future, Voyage Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include niche travel experiences such as culinary tours, wellness retreats, and community-based tourism initiatives; developing strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote Assam as a premier tourist destination; leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience and streamline operations, including a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app; and investing in employee training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry. We plan to grow our market reach beyond Assam, targeting travelers from across India and around the world who are seeking authentic and enriching travel experiences. By continually adapting to the evolving needs of the market and remaining true to our core values, we are confident that Voyage Tours and Travels will continue to thrive and make a significant contribution to the tourism industry in Assam and beyond.
</p>', 'Daljan Path, near N R Housing Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:40:09.000Z'),
(1566, 'Assam Tours and travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Assam Tours and Travels, strategically located in Goshala, near Water Tank, stands as a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of authentic experiences, committed to providing seamless and memorable journeys for every traveler, whether they are seeking adventure in the Brahmaputra valley, tranquility in the tea gardens, or cultural immersion in the vibrant local communities.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Assam Tours and Travels distinguishes itself in the local business landscape through its deep understanding of the region and its commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. We work closely with local communities, promoting their traditions and supporting their economic growth. This commitment not only enriches the traveler''s experience but also contributes to the preservation of Assam''s unique cultural heritage and natural environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around crafting personalized travel itineraries that cater to a wide range of interests and budgets. These include:</p>

*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in designing bespoke tour packages tailored to individual preferences, focusing on various themes such as wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, tea tourism in the lush estates of Upper Assam, cultural tours exploring the Ahom kingdom and tribal traditions, and adventure tours encompassing trekking, river rafting, and paragliding.<br>
*   **Hotel Bookings:** Leveraging our extensive network of partner hotels and guesthouses across Assam and the Northeast, we offer a diverse range of accommodation options, from budget-friendly stays to luxurious resorts, ensuring comfort and convenience for our clients.<br>
*   **Transportation Services:** We provide reliable and comfortable transportation services, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours in well-maintained vehicles, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free travel experience.<br>
*   **Guided Tours:** Our knowledgeable and experienced local guides provide insightful commentary and personalized attention, enriching the traveler''s understanding of Assam''s history, culture, and natural environment.<br>
*   **Specialized Experiences:** We curate unique and immersive experiences, such as tea tasting sessions, traditional Assamese cooking classes, visits to local artisan villages, and cultural performances, offering travelers a deeper connection with the region.<br>
*   **Pilgrimage Tours:** We organize well managed pilgrimage tours to sacred sites in Assam like Kamakhya Temple and Hajo, catering to spiritual tourists.

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Assam Tours and Travels apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity and personalized service. We go beyond the typical tourist experience, striving to connect travelers with the heart and soul of Assam. Our itineraries are carefully designed to showcase the region''s hidden gems and cultural nuances, offering a truly immersive and unforgettable travel experience. Furthermore, our dedication to responsible tourism ensures that our operations benefit local communities and minimize our environmental impact.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Assam Tours and Travels, we believe that customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on responsiveness, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, our dedicated team is available to provide support and guidance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We also foster strong relationships with local businesses and communities, creating a network of support that enhances the overall travel experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We connect with the local community through various initiatives, including supporting local artisans by promoting their products in our tour packages, employing local guides and drivers, and partnering with community-based tourism projects. We also actively participate in local events and festivals, showcasing Assam''s rich cultural heritage to a wider audience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Assam Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Assam and the Northeast, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include:</p>

*   **Expanding our reach:** We aim to broaden our network of partner hotels and service providers across the region, offering a wider range of options for our clients.<br>
*   **Developing new tour packages:** We are continuously exploring new destinations and experiences, developing innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends and interests.<br>
*   **Investing in technology:** We plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence, streamline our operations, and improve the customer experience.<br>
*   **Strengthening our commitment to sustainability:** We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting responsible tourism practices across the region.<br>
*   **Promoting Assam Tourism Globally:** Intend to bring more global clients, therefore promoting Assam at a global level.

<br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam''s tourism industry, creating economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region''s unique cultural heritage and natural environment for future generations. Assam Tours and Travels is dedicated to being a catalyst for positive change, promoting responsible tourism that benefits both travelers and the communities they visit. We are confident that our passion for Assam, combined with our commitment to excellence, will enable us to achieve our vision and solidify our position as a leader in the region''s tourism sector.</p>', 'Goshala, near Water Tank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:40:17.000Z'),
(1567, 'BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS, strategically located on the 2nd Floor, Nazib Complex, GS Rd, near Prag News, and opposite Woodland Restaurant, stands as a prominent and reliable provider of travel and tourism solutions within the vibrant Assam business landscape. More than just a travel agency, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS acts as a facilitator of experiences, connecting individuals and groups with the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty that Assam and the wider Northeast India region offer. The company distinguishes itself by its deep-rooted understanding of the local terrain, culture, and logistical challenges, ensuring seamless and memorable travel experiences for its clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS offers a comprehensive suite of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of modern travelers. At its core, the business provides meticulously planned tour packages covering popular destinations within Assam and neighboring states like Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, and Nagaland. These packages range from short weekend getaways focusing on wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, to extended cultural immersions exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam and the tribal villages of the hills. Beyond pre-packaged tours, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS excels in creating bespoke itineraries designed to individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints. This personalized approach sets it apart, appealing to discerning travelers seeking unique and authentic experiences. <br> <br> Furthermore, the company offers essential travel services including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations across a wide spectrum of accommodations (from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts), and car rentals with experienced drivers familiar with the region''s roads. The unique selling proposition lies in the combination of local expertise, personalized service, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices. By partnering with local communities and promoting eco-friendly initiatives, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS contributes to the preservation of Assam''s natural and cultural heritage. The services directly address the growing demand for organized and reliable travel solutions in a region where logistical complexities can often deter independent travelers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS. The business fosters a welcoming and supportive environment, prioritizing clear communication, prompt responses to inquiries, and proactive problem-solving. Trained travel consultants are available to guide customers through every stage of the journey, from initial planning to on-the-ground support. The company’s approach to customer service is built on building long-term relationships rather than transactional interactions. This is achieved through attentive listening, personalized recommendations, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. <br> <br> BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with artisans and cultural organizations, and promotion of local businesses within its tour packages. This community engagement not only enhances the authenticity of the travel experiences offered but also contributes to the economic empowerment of local communities. Word-of-mouth referrals are a significant source of business, testament to the positive experiences shared by satisfied customers and the company''s reputation for integrity and reliability.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision of BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS is to become the leading travel and tourism provider in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Expansion plans include diversifying its tour offerings to cater to niche markets such as adventure tourism (trekking, river rafting), wellness tourism (yoga retreats, Ayurvedic treatments), and educational tourism (study tours focused on local culture and history). The company also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience through online booking platforms, mobile applications, and virtual reality tours that showcase the region''s attractions. <br> <br> Long-term goals involve establishing strategic partnerships with international tour operators to attract a wider range of tourists from around the globe, further contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam and the Northeast. BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS recognizes the importance of responsible tourism and is committed to implementing sustainable practices throughout its operations, ensuring that its business activities benefit both the environment and the local communities it serves. The strategic location near Prag News and opposite Woodland Restaurant provides excellent visibility and accessibility, laying a strong foundation for continued growth and success.</p>', '2nd Floor, Nazib Complex, GS Rd, near Prag News, opposite Woodland Restaurant', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:40:25.000Z'),
(1568, 'Sai Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Sai Travels, strategically situated at Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path, near the Transcendental Meditation Centre, represents a burgeoning force in Assam’s travel and tourism sector. More than just a travel agency, Sai Travels is committed to providing bespoke travel solutions tailored to the diverse needs of both domestic and international travelers exploring the rich tapestry of experiences that Assam and Northeast India offer. In a region renowned for its natural beauty and cultural heritage, Sai Travels aims to be the trusted partner for unforgettable journeys.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Sai Travels'' service offerings lies a comprehensive suite of travel solutions. These include meticulously planned tour packages encompassing wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, cultural immersion experiences in Majuli, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and adventurous treks in the hills of Meghalaya. Recognizing the diverse needs of its clientele, Sai Travels also provides personalized travel planning services, meticulously crafting itineraries that align with individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints. Furthermore, Sai Travels excels in offering reliable transportation services, including airport transfers, vehicle rentals with experienced local drivers who also serve as guides, and seamless logistical support for group tours and corporate events. A key differentiator for Sai Travels is its commitment to showcasing the authentic Assam experience. This is achieved through collaborations with local artisans, promoting eco-tourism initiatives, and curating experiences that support sustainable tourism practices. By focusing on responsible travel, Sai Travels not only enhances the visitor experience but also contributes to the preservation of Assam''s natural and cultural heritage. Understanding the local market, Sai Travels offers customized pilgrimage tours, catering to the religious tourism segment which is significant in the region. The team is well-versed in local languages and customs, ensuring smooth communication and culturally sensitive travel experiences for all.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Sai Travels distinguishes itself through an unwavering commitment to exceptional customer service. The business firmly believes in building lasting relationships with its clients, achieved through personalized attention, prompt responses, and a genuine dedication to exceeding expectations. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the journey, every interaction with Sai Travels is designed to be seamless and stress-free. A dedicated team of travel experts, deeply knowledgeable about the region, is available to provide expert advice, answer questions, and offer support at every stage of the travel process. Sai Travels actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participating in community events, and supporting local initiatives. This deep-rooted connection to the community allows Sai Travels to offer unique and authentic experiences that are not readily available through mainstream tourism channels. Moreover, Sai Travels leverages technology to enhance the customer experience, utilizing online booking platforms, mobile applications, and social media channels to provide convenient access to information and services. Customer feedback is actively sought and utilized to continuously improve service quality and tailor offerings to meet evolving customer needs.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The vision for Sai Travels extends beyond simply being a successful travel agency. The long-term goal is to become a leading force in promoting sustainable and responsible tourism in Assam and the Northeast. Future plans include expanding its range of tour packages to encompass lesser-known destinations within the region, developing specialized adventure tourism offerings, and strengthening its partnerships with local communities to create mutually beneficial tourism initiatives. Sai Travels also intends to invest in staff training and development to ensure that its team remains at the forefront of the industry, equipped with the knowledge and skills necessary to deliver exceptional service. A key strategic objective is to leverage technology to further enhance the customer experience and streamline operations. This includes developing a user-friendly mobile application that provides travelers with real-time information, personalized recommendations, and seamless booking capabilities. Ultimately, Sai Travels aspires to play a pivotal role in showcasing the beauty and cultural richness of Assam to the world, while simultaneously contributing to the economic development and environmental sustainability of the region. The ambition is to become synonymous with responsible and unforgettable travel experiences in Northeast India.</p>', 'Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path, near Transcendal Meditation Centre', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:40:31.000Z'),
(1569, 'GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS, strategically situated at FLAT - 1C, MADHAB NIWAS JURIPAR, Panjabari Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to providing exceptional and immersive travel experiences throughout Northeast India and beyond. Recognizing the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam and its neighboring states, GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS distinguishes itself by offering bespoke travel solutions tailored to individual preferences and interests, contributing meaningfully to the burgeoning tourism sector of the region. The company stands as a gateway for travelers seeking authentic and unforgettable adventures, showcasing the hidden gems and vibrant traditions of this captivating corner of India. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS’ service offerings lies a commitment to crafting personalized journeys. The core services encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions, including expertly designed tour packages focusing on cultural immersion, wildlife encounters, adventure tourism, and spiritual exploration. Specific tour offerings might include meticulously planned itineraries to Kaziranga National Park for wildlife safaris, visits to the tea gardens of Assam for a taste of the region''s renowned tea culture, explorations of the ancient temples and monasteries of Arunachal Pradesh, and treks through the breathtaking landscapes of Meghalaya. Beyond pre-packaged tours, GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS excels in creating custom itineraries, ensuring that each traveler''s unique needs, budget, and aspirations are meticulously addressed. The company also provides essential travel services such as flight and accommodation booking, transportation arrangements (including private car rentals and guided tours), visa assistance, and travel insurance, providing a seamless and stress-free travel experience from start to finish. A key differentiator is GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS'' focus on sustainable and responsible tourism, actively promoting eco-friendly practices and supporting local communities to ensure that tourism benefits the region in a positive and enduring manner.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS places paramount importance on delivering exceptional customer service and building lasting relationships. The company strives to create a welcoming and personalized experience for every traveler, beginning with attentive pre-trip consultations to understand their specific requirements and preferences. Knowledgeable and experienced travel consultants are dedicated to providing expert advice, answering questions, and offering insightful recommendations to ensure that each itinerary is perfectly tailored. During the trip itself, travelers benefit from the support of friendly and professional guides who are passionate about sharing their knowledge of the region''s history, culture, and natural wonders. GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS also maintains a proactive approach to communication, providing regular updates and assistance throughout the journey, and promptly addressing any concerns or issues that may arise. By fostering genuine connections with travelers and demonstrating a deep understanding of the local community, GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS aims to create memorable and enriching experiences that leave a lasting positive impression. The company actively seeks feedback from customers to continually improve its services and ensure that it consistently exceeds expectations. Building trust and rapport with the local community is also a priority, as GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS actively collaborates with local businesses, artisans, and community organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and support the economic empowerment of local residents.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to providing exceptional customer service, promoting sustainable tourism, and showcasing the unique beauty and cultural heritage of the region. The company plans to expand its service offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, including specialized tours focusing on niche interests such as birdwatching, photography, and adventure sports. Strategic partnerships with local hotels, transportation providers, and other tourism-related businesses will further enhance the quality and breadth of services offered. Furthermore, GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS aims to leverage technology to improve the customer experience, by developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours, accessing travel information, and interacting with customer support representatives. A key focus will be on expanding the company''s marketing and promotional efforts to attract more domestic and international tourists to the region. This includes participating in travel fairs, collaborating with travel bloggers and influencers, and utilizing digital marketing channels to reach a wider audience. GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS is committed to fostering a culture of innovation and continuous improvement, constantly seeking new ways to enhance its services, promote sustainable tourism practices, and contribute to the growth and development of the local community. The long-term goal is to establish GRAND EASTERN HOLIDAYS as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with exceptional travel experiences and a commitment to responsible tourism in Northeast India and beyond.</p>', 'FLAT - 1C, MADHAB NIWAS JURIPAR, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:40:38.000Z'),
(1570, 'Tripfare', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Tripfare, strategically located on Hatigaon Main Rd, near Hatigaon High School in Guwahati, Assam, is a dynamic travel solutions provider committed to offering seamless and personalized travel experiences. In a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, yet often underserved by comprehensive travel services, Tripfare stands out by connecting the local community with both domestic and international destinations, catering to a diverse range of travel needs.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Tripfare''s core service is providing a comprehensive suite of travel solutions, encompassing flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings, customized tour packages, and visa assistance. Beyond simply booking tickets, Tripfare acts as a trusted travel advisor, understanding individual client needs and crafting itineraries that align with their budget, interests, and travel style. A key differentiator is their focus on personalized service. Agents take the time to understand the traveler''s specific preferences, offering expert advice on everything from optimal travel routes to hidden gems at their destination. This tailored approach distinguishes Tripfare from online booking platforms and larger travel agencies.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, Tripfare recognizes the importance of affordability for the local market. While offering a premium service experience, they actively seek out cost-effective travel options and negotiate competitive rates with airlines, hotels, and tour operators. They regularly feature special deals and promotions tailored to local travelers, making travel more accessible to a wider segment of the community. Recognizing the increasing trend towards experiential travel, Tripfare specializes in crafting unique tour packages that showcase the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam and Northeast India, appealing to both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and immersive experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Tripfare, customer experience is paramount. The business is built on a foundation of trust, integrity, and a genuine desire to help customers create unforgettable travel memories. The staff is comprised of experienced travel professionals who are not only knowledgeable but also passionate about providing exceptional service. They go above and beyond to assist customers with every aspect of their trip, from pre-departure planning to on-the-ground support. The convenient location near Hatigaon High School makes Tripfare easily accessible to the local community. The team speaks multiple languages, ensuring effective communication with diverse clientele. Beyond transactional interactions, Tripfare strives to build lasting relationships with its customers. They actively seek feedback to continuously improve their services and tailor their offerings to meet evolving customer needs. They are also involved in local community initiatives, reinforcing their commitment to the neighborhood and its residents.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Tripfare envisions itself as the premier travel solutions provider in the Hatigaon area and beyond, becoming synonymous with reliable, personalized, and affordable travel. Future plans include expanding its range of services to include travel insurance, foreign exchange services, and corporate travel management. They are also exploring partnerships with local businesses, such as hotels and tour operators, to create synergistic offerings and boost the local tourism industry. To stay ahead in the ever-evolving travel landscape, Tripfare plans to invest in technology to streamline its operations and enhance the customer experience. This includes implementing a user-friendly online booking platform and leveraging data analytics to personalize travel recommendations. Long-term goals include expanding its physical presence to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially venturing into other parts of Assam. Tripfare is dedicated to continuous innovation and adaptation, ensuring that it remains a valuable resource for the local community and a driving force in the regional travel industry.</p>', 'Hatigaon Main Rd, near Hatigaon High School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.329Z', '2025-12-07T07:45:08.000Z'),
(1571, 'Yellow Kites Travels Pvt. Ltd.| Travel agency | Best International Packages |Customized travel plans | Budget-friendly', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '```html
<p>Yellow Kites Travels Pvt. Ltd., strategically located at ABC, Mayur Garden, Bus Stop, Level-4, GS Rd in Assam, is a full-service travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences for both domestic and international destinations. In a region known for its vibrant culture, stunning landscapes, and growing tourism sector, Yellow Kites Travels stands out by offering a unique blend of expertly curated international packages, personalized travel plans, and budget-conscious options. We cater to the evolving needs of the Assam travel market, offering convenience, expertise, and value that resonates with discerning travelers seeking both adventure and relaxation.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around creating unforgettable travel experiences. We specialize in providing "Best International Packages" that are meticulously designed to offer a comprehensive and immersive exploration of various destinations around the globe. These packages typically include flights, accommodations, guided tours, and local experiences, all bundled together for optimal convenience and value. Beyond pre-packaged tours, a key differentiator for Yellow Kites Travels is our emphasis on "Customized Travel Plans." We understand that every traveler has unique preferences and requirements. Our experienced travel consultants work closely with each client to create bespoke itineraries that cater to their specific interests, budget, and travel style. Whether it''s a romantic getaway, a family vacation, an adventure-filled expedition, or a corporate retreat, we tailor every aspect of the trip to ensure a truly personalized experience. Furthermore, we are committed to making travel accessible to a wider audience by offering "Budget-friendly" options without compromising on quality or enjoyment. We leverage our industry relationships and expertise to secure competitive pricing and offer cost-effective travel solutions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Yellow Kites Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention, expert guidance, and unwavering support throughout their travel journey. Our team is comprised of passionate travel enthusiasts who are knowledgeable about various destinations and travel trends. We go the extra mile to understand our clients'' needs and preferences, offering insightful recommendations and proactive solutions. Before, during, and after each trip, we are readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and provide assistance. We are committed to exceeding expectations and ensuring that every client has a seamless and memorable travel experience. To further connect with the local community, Yellow Kites Travels actively participates in local events and initiatives. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to the economic development of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Yellow Kites Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more specialized travel packages, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and cultural immersion programs. We will also leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, offering online booking platforms, mobile apps, and virtual travel consultations. A key focus will be on strengthening our partnerships with airlines, hotels, and tour operators to secure even more competitive pricing and exclusive deals for our clients. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our team by providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that our travel consultants remain at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. Our long-term goal is to establish Yellow Kites Travels as a trusted brand that is synonymous with quality, reliability, and unforgettable travel experiences, not only within Assam but also across the broader Indian market.</p>
