(1581, 'Green Horn Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Green Horn Travels, located at Barman Enclave, 2, Hengrabari Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a burgeoning travel agency dedicated to providing unique and enriching travel experiences, with a particular focus on showcasing the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam and Northeast India. In a region rapidly embracing tourism, Green Horn Travels distinguishes itself by offering personalized service, sustainable travel practices, and a deep commitment to promoting local communities. The agency fills a crucial gap in the market by catering to travelers seeking authentic and responsible tourism experiences, moving beyond conventional sightseeing to offer immersive and meaningful journeys.</p>

