<br>

<p>Green Horn Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to diverse needs and interests. These services include: meticulously crafted tour packages throughout Assam and Northeast India, focusing on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga and Manas National Parks, cultural tours exploring the traditions of various indigenous communities, adventure tourism including trekking and river rafting, and pilgrimage tours to significant religious sites. Additionally, the agency provides personalized itinerary planning to meet individual customer preferences, ensuring a bespoke travel experience. A key differentiator lies in the agency''s commitment to eco-tourism. Green Horn Travels actively promotes sustainable practices by partnering with eco-friendly accommodations, supporting local artisans, and minimizing environmental impact. The agency also prioritizes employing local guides and drivers, thereby directly contributing to the economic empowerment of communities in the region. This focus on sustainability resonates strongly with the growing segment of travelers seeking responsible and ethical travel options. Moreover, Green Horn Travels distinguishes itself by offering specialized tours focusing on Assam''s rich tea heritage, allowing visitors to experience the journey from tea leaf to cup firsthand. These tours contribute significantly to highlighting a key aspect of the region’s identity and economy.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of Green Horn Travels'' operations. The agency strives to build lasting relationships with its clients by providing exceptional service at every stage of the travel process. From the initial consultation to the final departure, customers receive personalized attention and dedicated support. Green Horn Travels prides itself on its responsiveness, flexibility, and ability to address individual needs and concerns promptly. To further enhance the customer experience, the agency has implemented a robust feedback mechanism, allowing them to continuously improve their services and offerings. Green Horn Travels actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. They partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and support community development projects. They regularly participate in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of connection and belonging. The agency also supports local artisans by showcasing their products in their office and promoting them to tourists, contributing to the preservation of traditional crafts. By embedding itself within the local community, Green Horn Travels gains invaluable insights into the needs and preferences of both residents and visitors, allowing them to tailor their services and create truly authentic and memorable travel experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Green Horn Travels envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. The agency plans to expand its service offerings to include more niche tourism products, such as birdwatching tours, photography expeditions, and culinary experiences showcasing Assamese cuisine. They also aim to strengthen their partnerships with local communities and businesses, creating a more integrated and sustainable tourism ecosystem. A key focus for the future is leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. Green Horn Travels intends to develop a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse and book tours, access travel information, and connect with the agency''s team. They also plan to utilize social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote their unique offerings. Green Horn Travels also intends to invest in training and development programs for its staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote sustainable tourism practices. The agency believes that by continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of the market, they can achieve their long-term goals and contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Northeast India. Their ultimate aim is to not only provide unforgettable travel experiences but also to empower local communities, protect the environment, and showcase the rich cultural heritage of the region to the world.</p>', 'Barman Enclave, 2, Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.330Z', '2025-12-07T07:55:16.000Z'),
(1582, 'DD TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>DD TRAVELS: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond, Located on Lokhra Rd</p>

<br> <br>

<p>DD TRAVELS, strategically situated on Lokhra Rd, stands as a trusted and comprehensive travel solution provider, deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, DD TRAVELS serves as a bridge, connecting individuals and businesses to unforgettable experiences, seamless travel arrangements, and dependable transportation solutions. Recognizing the unique tapestry of the Assamese landscape – from its lush tea gardens and the majestic Brahmaputra River to its vibrant culture and spiritual sanctuaries – DD TRAVELS caters specifically to the needs of both local residents seeking outbound adventures and travelers eager to explore the wonders of the Northeast. In a region characterized by its rich biodiversity and burgeoning tourism sector, DD TRAVELS has carved a niche by offering personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible travel practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of DD TRAVELS’ service offerings are meticulously designed tour packages, encompassing both domestic and international destinations. For those seeking adventure within India, packages range from exploring the Himalayas to discovering the historical sites of Rajasthan. For international travelers, options extend to popular destinations in Southeast Asia, Europe, and beyond. Beyond pre-packaged tours, DD TRAVELS excels in crafting bespoke travel itineraries, meticulously tailored to individual preferences, budget constraints, and time considerations. This personalized approach distinguishes DD TRAVELS from its competitors, ensuring that each client receives a travel experience that aligns perfectly with their specific desires. Furthermore, DD TRAVELS provides a full suite of travel-related services, including flight booking (domestic and international), hotel reservations (ranging from budget-friendly options to luxury accommodations), visa assistance, travel insurance, and transportation services (car rentals, airport transfers, and bus ticketing). The commitment to providing a complete travel solution under one roof makes DD TRAVELS a convenient and reliable choice for its clientele. A key differentiator lies in DD TRAVELS’ specialization in tours showcasing the unique cultural and ecological heritage of Assam and the Northeast. These tours are designed to promote responsible tourism, support local communities, and educate travelers about the region''s rich traditions and environmental significance. By emphasizing authenticity and sustainability, DD TRAVELS contributes to the long-term well-being of the region and provides travelers with enriching and meaningful experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>DD TRAVELS places paramount importance on delivering exceptional customer service, recognizing that positive word-of-mouth referrals are crucial for success in the local market. The team at DD TRAVELS is composed of experienced and knowledgeable travel professionals who possess a deep understanding of the travel industry and a genuine passion for helping clients realize their travel dreams. From the initial consultation to the completion of the trip, clients receive personalized attention and dedicated support. DD TRAVELS understands the importance of clear and transparent communication, ensuring that clients are fully informed about their travel arrangements and any potential issues that may arise. A proactive approach to problem-solving and a commitment to resolving client concerns promptly and efficiently are hallmarks of DD TRAVELS’ customer service philosophy. The company actively seeks feedback from its clients to continuously improve its services and refine its offerings. Furthermore, DD TRAVELS actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorship of community initiatives, and collaborations with local businesses. This commitment to community involvement fosters goodwill and strengthens DD TRAVELS’ reputation as a responsible and trusted member of the Lokhra Rd business landscape. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the community, DD TRAVELS has cultivated a loyal customer base and established itself as a reliable travel partner.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, DD TRAVELS envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, driven by a commitment to innovation, customer satisfaction, and responsible tourism practices. The company plans to enhance its online presence through the development of a user-friendly website and the strategic use of social media marketing to reach a wider audience. Further investments in technology will enable DD TRAVELS to streamline its operations, improve efficiency, and provide clients with a more seamless booking experience. DD TRAVELS intends to expand its network of partnerships with hotels, airlines, and tour operators to offer an even wider range of travel options and competitive pricing. A key area of focus will be on developing new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, ecotourism, and wellness travel. In line with its commitment to responsible tourism, DD TRAVELS plans to strengthen its partnerships with local communities to promote sustainable tourism practices and empower local businesses. This includes offering tours that support local artisans, promote traditional crafts, and provide employment opportunities for local residents. Ultimately, DD TRAVELS aims to become the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to responsible tourism practices. By staying true to its core values and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, DD TRAVELS is well-positioned to achieve its long-term goals and contribute to the growth and prosperity of the local tourism sector.</p>', 'Lokhra Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.330Z', '2025-12-07T07:55:23.000Z'),
(1583, 'Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels, situated on Lachit Barphukan Path in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel agency dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India. More than just a travel provider, Northeast Gateway acts as a cultural ambassador, connecting travelers with authentic experiences and fostering sustainable tourism practices within the region. The agency recognizes the unique appeal of Northeast India, often overlooked by mainstream tourism, and strives to make it accessible and enjoyable for visitors from all walks of life. Our local expertise and dedication to responsible tourism differentiate us, making us a vital contributor to the burgeoning Assam business landscape and a trusted partner for travelers seeking authentic Northeast Indian adventures. Northeast Gateway understands that travel is not just about seeing places, but about experiencing cultures, connecting with people, and creating lasting memories. This philosophy is at the core of everything we do.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Our core service revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries throughout the eight states of Northeast India: Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland, Sikkim, and Tripura. We offer a diverse portfolio of travel experiences, ranging from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park to cultural immersion tours exploring the ancient temples of Assam and the vibrant tribal cultures of Nagaland and Manipur. Treks through the stunning landscapes of Meghalaya, including the famed living root bridges, are also a popular offering. For those seeking spiritual journeys, we organize visits to significant pilgrimage sites and monasteries across the region. Northeast Gateway goes beyond standard package tours. We specialize in customizing itineraries to perfectly match the interests, preferences, and budgets of our clients. This personalized approach, coupled with our in-depth knowledge of the region, is a key differentiator. We also provide essential travel services like flight and train ticketing, hotel booking, transportation arrangements, and permit assistance, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free travel experience. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism. We partner with local communities and businesses to ensure that tourism benefits the local economy and minimizes its environmental impact. We promote eco-friendly accommodations, support local artisans, and encourage cultural exchange that respects and preserves the traditions of the Northeast. We recognize that our success is intrinsically linked to the well-being of the communities we serve. Our services address the specific needs of the local market by providing accessible and reliable travel solutions for both domestic and international tourists. We offer specialized packages for schools and colleges, corporate groups, and families, making Northeast India a viable and attractive travel destination for all.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels. We believe that exceptional service begins with genuine care and attention to detail. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our team is dedicated to providing personalized assistance and ensuring complete customer satisfaction. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients, treating them not just as customers but as valued guests. Our multilingual team is well-versed in the local languages and customs, enabling us to effectively communicate with and cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. We proactively address any concerns or issues that may arise during the travel process, ensuring a smooth and stress-free experience. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in local events, support local initiatives, and promote cultural awareness. We regularly organize workshops and training programs for local guides and hospitality professionals, enhancing their skills and knowledge. We also collaborate with local artisans and craftspeople, showcasing their products and promoting their livelihoods. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we are able to provide our clients with authentic and enriching experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We gather regular feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We are committed to providing a consistently high level of service and exceeding customer expectations.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels envisions a future where Northeast India is recognized as a premier travel destination, renowned for its natural beauty, cultural diversity, and sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel agency in the region, setting the standard for quality, innovation, and responsible tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on specific themes, such as birdwatching, adventure sports, and wellness retreats. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own eco-friendly accommodations and resorts, providing our clients with unique and sustainable lodging options. We intend to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly mobile app and online platform that provides access to real-time travel information, booking services, and interactive maps. We will also invest in digital marketing and social media to reach a wider audience and promote Northeast India as a must-visit destination. Furthermore, we are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities and businesses, providing them with greater opportunities to participate in the tourism sector. We will continue to support local initiatives that promote sustainable development, cultural preservation, and environmental protection. We believe that by working together, we can create a thriving tourism industry that benefits both visitors and residents alike. Ultimately, Northeast Gateway aims to be more than just a travel agency. We aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering local communities, preserving cultural heritage, and promoting sustainable tourism practices that will ensure a bright future for Northeast India.
</p>', 'Lachit Barphukan Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.330Z', '2025-12-07T07:55:32.000Z'),
(1584, 'Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours offers curated travel experiences designed to unveil the hidden beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the wider Northeast India. Situated at the heart of [Omitted Specific Location for privacy], we are more than just a tour operator; we are storytellers, weaving unforgettable journeys that connect travelers with the soul of this enchanting region. We distinguish ourselves through a deep commitment to sustainable tourism, fostering genuine connections with local communities and preserving the natural environment for future generations. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, Northeast Magical Escapes stands out as a beacon of responsible and authentic travel, offering a unique alternative to mass tourism.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services center around meticulously crafted itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests and preferences. From thrilling wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, home to the majestic one-horned rhinoceros, to serene tea garden tours showcasing Assam''s rich tea heritage, we offer experiences that are both captivating and educational. For adventure seekers, we organize treks through the lush hills of Meghalaya, exploring living root bridges and cascading waterfalls. Culture enthusiasts can immerse themselves in the vibrant traditions of the Bodo, Mising, and other indigenous communities through homestay experiences and cultural performances. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to personalize each journey, tailoring itineraries to individual needs and ensuring an intimate and immersive experience. We also offer specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as birdwatching, photography, or spiritual retreats. These services directly address the growing demand for authentic and responsible travel experiences in the region, providing travelers with a meaningful alternative to conventional tourist packages.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Northeast Magical Escapes, we understand that exceptional customer service is paramount. We go beyond simply arranging transportation and accommodation; we strive to create genuine connections with our guests, anticipating their needs and exceeding their expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel experts is committed to providing personalized attention and unwavering support. We employ local guides who possess in-depth knowledge of the region''s history, culture, and ecology, enriching the travel experience with insightful commentary and authentic perspectives. To foster a strong connection with the local community, we actively partner with local businesses and organizations, ensuring that tourism benefits the region''s economy and supports sustainable development. We also prioritize responsible waste management and promote ethical interactions with wildlife, minimizing our environmental impact and preserving the natural beauty of Assam for generations to come. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices differentiates us from other tour operators and resonates deeply with environmentally conscious travelers.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Northeast Magical Escapes envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour offerings to encompass more remote and unexplored regions of the Northeast, further diversifying our cultural immersion programs, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, providing online booking platforms, virtual reality tours, and interactive travel guides. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote responsible tourism practices. We recognize the immense potential for growth in the tourism sector in Northeast India, and we are confident that Northeast Magical Escapes is well-positioned to capitalize on this opportunity while contributing to the sustainable development of the region.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T07:55:37.000Z'),
(1585, 'MaarinTravels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'MaarinTravels, nestled in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing bespoke travel experiences that capture the essence of Northeast India and beyond. Situated in [Address in Assam, be specific - e.g., G.S. Road, Guwahati, Assam], MaarinTravels stands out in the local business landscape by focusing on personalized itineraries, sustainable tourism practices, and deep connections with local communities. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys, committed to showcasing the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant traditions that make Assam and the Northeast a truly unique destination.

