<br> <br>

* **Guided Tours:** Our experienced and knowledgeable guides are passionate about sharing the wonders of Northeast India. They provide insightful commentary, facilitate meaningful interactions with local communities, and ensure a safe and enjoyable travel experience. We offer a variety of guided tours, ranging from cultural immersion experiences to wildlife safaris and adventure treks.

<br> <br>

* **Accommodation Booking:** We partner with a wide range of accommodations, from luxurious hotels to charming homestays and eco-lodges, to provide our clients with comfortable and authentic lodging options. We carefully select our partner properties based on their quality, service, and commitment to sustainability.

<br> <br>

* **Transportation Arrangements:** We handle all transportation logistics, including airport transfers, car rentals, and train and flight bookings, to ensure a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We prioritize safety and reliability, working with reputable transportation providers to guarantee comfortable and efficient travel.

<br> <br>

* **Permit Assistance:** Navigating the permit requirements for travel in Northeast India can be complex. We provide expert assistance with obtaining the necessary permits, ensuring that our clients can travel legally and without hassle.

<br> <br>

Our unique selling points lie in our dedication to personalized service, our in-depth knowledge of the region, and our commitment to responsible tourism. We understand the nuances of the local market and strive to exceed the expectations of our clients by providing exceptional value and unparalleled experiences. We cater to the growing demand for authentic and sustainable travel options, appealing to travelers who seek meaningful connections with the destinations they visit.

<br> <br>

At MaarinTravels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional customer service at every stage of the travel journey. Our dedicated team is available to answer questions, provide support, and address any concerns that may arise. We go above and beyond to ensure that our clients feel valued and cared for.

<br> <br>

We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, businesses, and organizations. We participate in local events, support community initiatives, and promote sustainable tourism practices. We believe in giving back to the community and contributing to the economic development of the region. We strive to be a responsible corporate citizen and a positive force in the local business landscape.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, MaarinTravels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to personalized service, sustainable tourism practices, and deep connections with local communities. We plan to expand our service offerings, develop new and innovative tour packages, and further strengthen our partnerships with local stakeholders. We are exploring opportunities to incorporate technology into our operations to enhance the customer experience and streamline our processes. Our long-term goal is to promote Northeast India as a premier tourist destination while preserving its natural beauty and cultural heritage for future generations. We aim to foster a sustainable tourism ecosystem that benefits both travelers and the local communities. We are committed to continuous improvement and innovation, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of the travel industry in Northeast India.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:00:12.000Z'),
(1586, 'WTF Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>WTF Travels: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond</p>

<p>Nestled conveniently on Beltola-Basistha Road, near KFC, WTF Travels is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel agency within the dynamic Assam business ecosystem. More than just a booking service, WTF Travels strives to be a trusted partner for both local residents seeking getaways and visitors eager to experience the rich cultural heritage and breathtaking landscapes of Northeast India. Understanding the nuances of the local travel market, WTF Travels differentiates itself through personalized service, expertly curated tour packages, and a deep commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. We aim to be the first thought when considering travel, whether it’s a weekend escape within Assam or an international adventure.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of WTF Travels lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of needs and preferences. Our core offerings include:</p>

<ul>
    <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that delve into the hidden gems of Assam and the wider Northeast, moving beyond standard tourist trails. These packages are meticulously designed to suit individual interests, budgets, and time constraints. Whether it''s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, trekking through the verdant hills of Meghalaya, or experiencing the vibrant culture of Arunachal Pradesh, we ensure an unforgettable journey.</li>
    <li><b>Domestic and International Flight Bookings:</b> Leveraging our strong relationships with airlines, we provide seamless flight booking services, securing competitive fares for both domestic and international destinations. Our experienced agents are adept at navigating complex booking procedures, ensuring a hassle-free experience for our clients.</li>
    <li><b>Hotel and Accommodation Reservations:</b> We have established partnerships with a wide network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ranging from budget-friendly options to luxurious retreats. This allows us to offer diverse accommodation choices that meet the specific needs and preferences of our customers. We personally vet many establishments to ensure quality and comfort.</li>
    <li><b>Car Rentals and Transportation:</b> Understanding the importance of comfortable and reliable transportation, we offer a comprehensive car rental service, providing access to a diverse fleet of vehicles. Our drivers are experienced, knowledgeable about local routes, and committed to providing safe and efficient transportation.</li>
    <li><b>Visa Assistance and Travel Insurance:</b> To ensure a seamless travel experience, we provide expert assistance with visa applications and offer a range of travel insurance options, protecting our clients against unforeseen circumstances.</li>
</ul>

<p>What truly sets WTF Travels apart is our unwavering focus on personalized service. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we take the time to listen to their needs and preferences. Our team of experienced travel consultants is passionate about creating tailor-made itineraries that exceed expectations. Moreover, we are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact. Our unique selling point is the personalized attention and local expertise that larger, online travel agencies simply cannot replicate. We speak the local language, understand the local culture, and know the best hidden spots to make your trip truly special.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at WTF Travels. We strive to create a welcoming and friendly environment where customers feel valued and appreciated. Our customer service approach is built on the principles of empathy, responsiveness, and proactivity. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services. We also understand the importance of building strong relationships with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and organizations. We believe that by giving back to the community, we can contribute to its growth and prosperity. Furthermore, we use social media platforms to engage with our customers, share travel tips and inspiration, and promote local tourism. Our physical location, near the busy KFC on Beltola-Basistha Road, provides easy accessibility and visibility, making it convenient for customers to visit us in person. We also foster customer loyalty through repeat business incentives and personalized travel planning for returning clients.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, WTF Travels envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainability. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized adventure tours, wellness retreats, and cultural immersion experiences. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and provide a seamless booking experience for our customers. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows customers to easily browse our tour packages, book flights and hotels, and access travel information. We also plan to forge strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, such as hotels, restaurants, and transportation providers, to create a comprehensive and integrated travel ecosystem. Moreover, we are committed to investing in the training and development of our employees, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service. Ultimately, WTF Travels aspires to not just facilitate travel, but to curate transformative experiences that enrich lives and foster a deeper appreciation for the world around us.</p>', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, near KFC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:00:20.000Z'),
(1587, 'Guwahati Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Guwahati Travels: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</p>

<p>Guwahati Travels, strategically located on Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences throughout Assam, Northeast India, and beyond. More than just a booking service, we are passionate travel architects, crafting personalized journeys that resonate with the unique spirit and diverse landscapes of the region. As a locally rooted business, we possess an unparalleled understanding of Assam''s hidden gems and logistical nuances, setting us apart within the dynamic Assam business environment. We strive to be the trusted partner for both leisure and business travelers seeking seamless and enriching travel solutions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core service offering encompasses a comprehensive range of travel solutions designed to cater to a diverse clientele. These include:</p>

<p><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages tailored to individual preferences and budgets. Whether it''s exploring the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, discovering the spiritual heartland of Majuli Island, or trekking through the scenic hills of Meghalaya, we meticulously design itineraries that capture the essence of each destination. Our packages encompass accommodation, transportation, guided tours, and authentic cultural experiences.</p>

<p><b>Hotel Bookings:</b> We maintain strong relationships with a wide network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ranging from budget-friendly options to luxurious accommodations. This allows us to secure the best possible rates and ensure a comfortable and convenient stay for our clients.</p>

<p><b>Flight and Train Ticketing:</b> We provide efficient and reliable flight and train ticketing services, assisting customers with booking domestic and international flights, as well as train journeys across India. Our experienced team navigates complex schedules and fares to find the most suitable travel arrangements.</p>

<p><b>Car Rentals and Transportation:</b> We offer a diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles for rent, ranging from compact cars to spacious SUVs and tempo travelers. Our experienced and courteous drivers ensure safe and comfortable transportation for individuals and groups.</p>

<p><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> We provide comprehensive travel management services for businesses, including corporate event planning, group travel arrangements, and customized itineraries for business trips. Our dedicated corporate travel team is committed to delivering cost-effective and efficient travel solutions that meet the specific needs of our corporate clients.</p>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our deep local expertise, personalized service, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We prioritize ethical and responsible travel practices, supporting local communities and preserving the natural environment. Unlike large, impersonal online travel agencies, we offer a human touch, providing personalized recommendations and attentive support throughout the entire travel journey.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Guwahati Travels, customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service that exceeds expectations. Our approach is characterized by:</p>

<p><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand each customer''s individual needs and preferences, crafting travel itineraries that are tailored to their specific requirements.</p>

<p><b>Responsive Communication:</b> We are readily available to answer questions, provide assistance, and address any concerns that may arise. Our dedicated customer support team is available via phone, email, and in-person at our Lokhra Rd office.</p>

<p><b>Seamless Booking Process:</b> We strive to make the booking process as simple and convenient as possible, offering online booking options and personalized assistance from our experienced travel consultants.</p>

<p><b>Building Relationships:</b> We believe in building long-term relationships with our customers, fostering loyalty and trust. We actively engage with the local community, participating in local events and supporting community initiatives.</p>

<p>Our commitment to customer service extends beyond the booking process. We provide ongoing support throughout the travel journey, ensuring that our customers have a seamless and enjoyable experience. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall travel experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Guwahati Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional service, sustainable practices, and commitment to customer satisfaction. Our future plans include:</p>

<p><b>Expanding our Destination Portfolio:</b> We plan to expand our destination portfolio to include more destinations within Northeast India and beyond, offering a wider range of travel options for our customers.</p>

<p><b>Developing Innovative Tour Packages:</b> We are committed to developing innovative and experiential tour packages that showcase the unique cultural and natural attractions of the region.</p>

<p><b>Leveraging Technology:</b> We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that provides seamless booking options and personalized travel recommendations.</p>

<p><b>Strengthening Partnerships:</b> We will continue to strengthen our partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to secure the best possible rates and ensure a high-quality travel experience for our customers.</p>

<p><b>Promoting Sustainable Tourism:</b> We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and preserve the natural environment. We will continue to support local businesses and initiatives that promote responsible tourism.</p>

<p>Guwahati Travels is dedicated to playing a vital role in the growth and development of the tourism industry in Assam and Northeast India. We are confident that our commitment to excellence, personalized service, and sustainable practices will enable us to achieve our long-term goals and solidify our position as the premier travel agency in the region. Our location on Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden, serves as a welcoming hub for travelers seeking to explore the wonders of Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:00:28.000Z'),
(1588, 'Brothers Travel & tourism, Car rental service in Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Brothers Travel & Tourism: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam & Beyond, with Premier Car Rental Services in Guwahati

Brothers Travel & Tourism is a Guwahati-based car rental and tourism company dedicated to providing reliable, comfortable, and personalized travel experiences across Assam and Northeast India. Located at Bylane 2, SK Boruah Path, we are strategically positioned to serve both local residents and visiting tourists seeking seamless transportation solutions and expertly curated travel itineraries. More than just a car rental agency, we strive to be a trusted partner in exploration, offering tailored services that cater to diverse travel needs, from short city commutes to extensive regional tours. Our commitment to customer satisfaction, combined with our in-depth local knowledge, sets us apart in the dynamic Assam tourism sector. We understand that travel is not just about reaching a destination; it''s about the journey and the memories created along the way.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Brothers Travel & Tourism lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to make travel effortless and enjoyable. Our core offering is our diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles, ranging from compact cars ideal for navigating Guwahati''s bustling streets to spacious SUVs perfect for exploring the rugged terrains of Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. We provide self-drive options for experienced drivers seeking independence and chauffeured services for those who prefer to relax and leave the driving to our professional and courteous drivers. Beyond car rental, we specialize in crafting personalized tour packages that showcase the best of Assam''s rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and diverse wildlife. These packages encompass accommodation arrangements, sightseeing tours, and cultural experiences, all meticulously planned to suit individual preferences and budgets. What distinguishes us is our unwavering focus on providing value for money without compromising on quality or safety. We ensure that our vehicles undergo regular maintenance checks and that our drivers are well-trained and knowledgeable about the region''s roads and attractions. We also provide transparent pricing with no hidden charges, building trust with our customers from the outset. Moreover, we cater specifically to the nuances of the local market, understanding the challenges and opportunities presented by Assam''s unique geography and travel conditions.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Brothers Travel & Tourism. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service at every touchpoint. From the moment a customer makes an inquiry to the completion of their journey, we strive to exceed expectations. Our friendly and responsive customer support team is available to assist with booking inquiries, itinerary planning, and any on-trip assistance required. We understand that unforeseen circumstances can arise during travel, and we are committed to providing prompt and effective solutions to ensure minimal disruption. Our drivers are not just drivers; they are also informal guides who can offer valuable insights into the local culture, customs, and attractions. We actively seek customer feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Furthermore, we recognize the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively support local businesses and initiatives, promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit both our customers and the region as a whole. Our involvement in community events and initiatives helps us build goodwill and reinforces our commitment to being a responsible and ethical business.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Brothers Travel & Tourism envisions becoming the leading car rental and tourism provider in Guwahati and Northeast India. We plan to expand our fleet of vehicles to cater to a wider range of customer needs and preferences, including adding electric vehicles to promote environmentally friendly transportation options. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online booking platform and improve the overall customer experience. This includes implementing real-time vehicle tracking, online payment options, and personalized travel recommendations. A key element of our future growth strategy is to further develop our tour package offerings, focusing on niche tourism segments such as eco-tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural tourism. We aim to collaborate with local artisans, communities, and homestay providers to create authentic and immersive travel experiences that showcase the unique character of Assam and Northeast India. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to not only grow our business but also contribute to the sustainable development of the region''s tourism industry, promoting responsible travel practices that benefit both the environment and the local communities. We believe that by focusing on customer satisfaction, innovation, and community engagement, we can achieve our vision and become a trusted partner for travelers seeking to explore the wonders of Assam and beyond.', 'Bylane 2, SK boruah path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:00:34.000Z'),
(1589, 'ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Assamese Experiences</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Ground Floor, Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Rajdhani Regency, ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting bespoke and immersive travel experiences throughout Assam and the Northeast. In a region celebrated for its breathtaking landscapes, diverse cultures, and rich biodiversity, ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY distinguishes itself by offering personalized itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trail, connecting travelers with the authentic soul of Assam. Recognizing the increasing demand for sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism, we are committed to showcasing the region''s beauty while supporting local communities and preserving its natural heritage. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be storytellers, guides, and facilitators, enabling our clients to forge meaningful connections with the land and its people.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, tailored to individual preferences and interests. We specialize in crafting customized tour packages that explore Assam''s diverse offerings, from the serene tea gardens of Upper Assam to the majestic Brahmaputra River and the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with endangered species like the one-horned rhinoceros. For adventure seekers, we offer trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river rafting adventures, and birdwatching tours led by experienced local guides. Cultural immersion is at the heart of our philosophy, and we organize village homestays, visits to tribal communities, and participation in local festivals, providing travelers with authentic glimpses into the region’s unique traditions and customs. Furthermore, we provide comprehensive travel solutions, including flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings, car rentals, and visa assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. Our unique selling point lies in our in-depth knowledge of Assam and the Northeast, our commitment to responsible tourism, and our ability to create personalized itineraries that cater to the specific needs and interests of each client. We understand the local market''s desire for accessible, authentic, and sustainable travel options, and we strive to exceed expectations by delivering exceptional value and unparalleled service.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is rooted in building genuine relationships and understanding individual needs. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, we strive to provide personalized attention and support, ensuring that every detail of the trip is meticulously planned and executed. We believe in proactive communication, keeping our clients informed and updated throughout their journey. Our team consists of experienced travel professionals who are passionate about Assam and dedicated to providing exceptional service. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Furthermore, we are committed to supporting the local community by partnering with local businesses, employing local guides, and promoting responsible tourism practices. We regularly participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a strong sense of community engagement and demonstrating our commitment to the sustainable development of Assam''s tourism sector. We believe that by investing in the local community, we can create a more enriching and rewarding experience for our clients while contributing to the long-term well-being of the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include niche travel experiences such as wellness retreats, yoga tours, and photography workshops. We also plan to develop stronger partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate more actively in the tourism sector. We are exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides real-time travel information and personalized recommendations. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting Assam as a premier travel destination on both the national and international stage, showcasing its unique beauty and cultural heritage to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam''s tourism sector, ensuring that it benefits both the local community and the environment. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our vision and create a lasting positive impact on the region.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Rajdhani Regency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:00:40.000Z'),
(1590, 'High Hills Tours and Travels (Registered Under Assam Tourism)', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>High Hills Tours and Travels, registered under Assam Tourism, is a premier tour operator dedicated to showcasing the breathtaking beauty and rich cultural heritage of Assam and the greater Northeast India region. Based strategically to offer seamless access to the region’s diverse landscapes, we specialize in crafting bespoke travel experiences that cater to a wide range of interests, from adventure tourism and wildlife safaris to cultural immersion and spiritual journeys. We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and preserve the region''s natural environment for generations to come.
<br> <br>
In a region renowned for its tea gardens, national parks, and vibrant traditions, High Hills Tours and Travels distinguishes itself by offering personalized service, expert local knowledge, and a deep commitment to responsible travel. Our registration with Assam Tourism underscores our adherence to the highest standards of quality, safety, and ethical business practices, providing our clients with peace of mind knowing they are traveling with a reputable and trusted operator.
</p>

<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. These include:
<br> <br>
<b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating tailor-made itineraries that cater to individual preferences, interests, and budgets. Whether it''s a family vacation exploring the Kaziranga National Park, a backpacking adventure through the Himalayan foothills, or a cultural tour delving into the traditions of Assam''s various ethnic communities, we can design the perfect trip.
<br> <br>
<b>Wildlife Safaris:</b> Assam is home to a remarkable array of wildlife, including the endangered one-horned rhinoceros. We offer expertly guided safaris in Kaziranga, Manas, and other national parks, providing unforgettable opportunities to witness these magnificent creatures in their natural habitat. Our experienced naturalists ensure both a thrilling and educational experience.
<br> <br>
<b>Cultural Tours:</b> Immerse yourself in the rich cultural tapestry of Assam through our curated cultural tours. We offer opportunities to visit ancient temples, interact with local artisans, participate in traditional festivals, and learn about the region''s diverse heritage.
<br> <br>
<b>Adventure Tourism:</b> For adventure seekers, we offer a range of exciting activities such as trekking, river rafting, and camping in some of the region''s most stunning landscapes. Our experienced guides prioritize safety while providing an exhilarating experience.
<br> <br>
<b>Transportation Services:</b> We provide reliable and comfortable transportation services throughout the region, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours in well-maintained vehicles.
<br> <br>
What truly sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to providing authentic and immersive travel experiences. We work closely with local communities to ensure that our tours benefit them directly, and we are dedicated to minimizing our environmental impact. Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to combine expert local knowledge with personalized service, creating unforgettable travel memories for our clients. Our services address the growing demand for responsible and authentic tourism in Assam, connecting travelers with the region''s natural beauty, cultural richness, and warm hospitality.
</p>

<p>At High Hills Tours and Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment for all our clients, ensuring that their needs are met with promptness and professionalism. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert guidance, from the initial planning stages to the completion of the tour.
<br> <br>
We foster strong relationships with local communities, businesses, and organizations to ensure that our tours are not only enjoyable but also contribute to the sustainable development of the region. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting cultural preservation and environmental conservation efforts. Our commitment to responsible tourism has earned us the trust and respect of the local community, which in turn enhances the quality of our tours and the overall experience for our clients. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are exceeding their expectations. Our commitment to building lasting relationships with our clients extends beyond the tour itself; we strive to be a trusted resource for all their future travel needs in the region.
</p>

<p>Looking ahead, High Hills Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading sustainable tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to responsible tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel experiences. Our future plans include:
<br> <br>
<b>Expanding our Service Offerings:</b> We plan to introduce new and exciting tour packages that cater to emerging trends in tourism, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and community-based tourism.
<br> <br>
<b>Strengthening our Online Presence:</b> We will invest in enhancing our online presence through a user-friendly website and active engagement on social media, making it easier for customers to discover and book our tours.
<br> <br>
<b>Developing Strategic Partnerships:</b> We will continue to forge strategic partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other tourism stakeholders to offer our clients competitive pricing and seamless travel arrangements.
<br> <br>
<b>Investing in Training and Development:</b> We will provide ongoing training and development opportunities for our staff to ensure that they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to deliver exceptional service.
<br> <br>
<b>Promoting Sustainable Tourism Practices:</b> We will continue to champion sustainable tourism practices by working with local communities to develop eco-friendly tourism initiatives and promoting responsible travel behavior among our clients.
<br> <br>
Our long-term goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy, environment, and culture of Northeast India while providing our clients with unforgettable travel experiences that they will cherish for a lifetime. We are confident that with our dedicated team, commitment to quality, and passion for showcasing the beauty of the region, High Hills Tours and Travels will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam and beyond.
</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:05:11.000Z'),
(1591, 'North East Tour Planner --by Travel Zone', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '```html
<p>North East Tour Planner – by Travel Zone, located at Kamala Enclave, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd, stands as a premier travel facilitator dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of North East India. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of immersive experiences, connecting discerning travellers with the heart and soul of Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, we distinguish ourselves through a deep-rooted commitment to responsible tourism, personalized service, and an unwavering passion for promoting the region’s unique heritage and ecological treasures.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core service revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests, from adventurous treks through the Himalayas and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to cultural explorations of ancient temples and tribal villages. We offer a comprehensive suite of services including: customized tour packages encompassing accommodation, transportation, and guided excursions; specialized adventure tours focusing on trekking, river rafting, and wildlife observation; cultural immersion programs offering authentic experiences with local communities; comfortable and reliable transportation solutions ranging from private car rentals to group bus services; and meticulous accommodation booking services encompassing a variety of options from heritage hotels to eco-friendly homestays. What sets us apart is our intimate knowledge of the region, allowing us to provide insider access to hidden gems and off-the-beaten-path experiences that are often overlooked by mainstream travel agencies. We work directly with local communities, ensuring that tourism benefits the region’s economy and promotes sustainable practices. Our itineraries are designed not only to showcase the natural wonders of the North East but also to foster meaningful interactions between travellers and the local people, creating enriching and transformative journeys.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At North East Tour Planner, we understand that exceptional customer service is paramount to creating unforgettable travel experiences. We pride ourselves on a personalized approach, taking the time to understand each client’s individual needs and preferences. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel experts provides unwavering support and attention to detail, ensuring a seamless and stress-free journey. We foster a strong connection with the local community by partnering with local guides, drivers, and homestay owners, creating opportunities for them to share their knowledge and culture with our clients. We are actively involved in community initiatives aimed at promoting sustainable tourism and preserving the region’s natural and cultural heritage. Our commitment to ethical and responsible tourism practices has earned us the trust and loyalty of our clients, many of whom return year after year to explore new facets of the North East with us. We believe in fostering long-term relationships, not just transactions, and strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment for every traveller.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, North East Tour Planner envisions becoming the leading and most trusted travel brand in the region, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and authentic experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour offerings to cater to niche markets such as birdwatching, photography, and yoga retreats. We are investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app. We plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its economic opportunities. We are also committed to promoting responsible tourism practices, educating travellers about the importance of respecting the environment and local cultures. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the North East region by promoting tourism that is both economically viable and environmentally responsible. By showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of the North East to the world, we aim to create a positive impact on the lives of local communities and preserve the region’s natural heritage for future generations.</p>
```', 'Kamala Enclave, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:05:17.000Z'),
(1592, 'Leisure Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Leisure Travels, strategically located at 93 Sundarpur, RGB Road, opposite Modern Living and near Vinyl Cafe, is a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting unforgettable travel experiences for residents of Assam and beyond. More than just booking flights and hotels, Leisure Travels distinguishes itself by providing personalized, curated itineraries that cater to the diverse interests and budgets of its clientele, playing a vital role in facilitating both inbound and outbound tourism within the region. Recognizing the growing desire for seamless and enriching travel, Leisure Travels fills a critical need in the local market by offering expert guidance, transparent pricing, and unwavering customer support.

<br> <br>

The core of Leisure Travels'' offerings lies in its comprehensive suite of travel services. These include flight booking across all major airlines, accommodation reservations ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts, and meticulously planned tour packages. A significant differentiator is the agency''s focus on customized itinerary creation. Travel consultants work closely with each client to understand their preferences, interests (such as historical sites, nature exploration, cultural immersion, or adventure activities), and budgetary constraints. Based on this in-depth consultation, Leisure Travels crafts bespoke travel plans that maximize enjoyment and minimize stress. Another key offering is specialized packages catering to niche markets, such as honeymoon trips, family vacations, adventure tours in the Northeast, and pilgrimage tours to sacred sites within India. These specialized packages leverage the expertise of Leisure Travels'' team, ensuring a unique and enriching experience. By providing clear and transparent pricing, and by guaranteeing comprehensive support throughout the entire journey, Leisure Travels ensures a smooth and rewarding experience for all its customers.

<br> <br>

Leisure Travels prides itself on delivering exceptional customer service that extends far beyond mere transactions. The agency understands that travel planning can be complex and often daunting. Therefore, they emphasize personalized attention and readily available support. Each customer is assigned a dedicated travel consultant who acts as their single point of contact from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. This consultant provides expert advice, answers questions promptly, and resolves any issues that may arise. Furthermore, Leisure Travels actively fosters connections with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and collaborating with local businesses. This active engagement builds trust and strengthens the agency''s reputation as a reliable and community-focused travel partner. Leisure Travels also leverages digital channels, including a user-friendly website and social media platforms, to provide convenient access to information, facilitate online bookings, and engage with customers. This multi-channel approach ensures that customers can interact with Leisure Travels in a way that best suits their needs and preferences. By consistently exceeding customer expectations and nurturing strong community ties, Leisure Travels has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a strong reputation for excellence.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Leisure Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the region, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative offerings, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. Key growth initiatives include expanding its range of specialized travel packages to cater to emerging market trends, such as eco-tourism and wellness travel. The agency plans to forge strategic partnerships with local hotels, tour operators, and transportation providers to enhance its service offerings and provide customers with even greater value. Furthermore, Leisure Travels is committed to investing in its team, providing ongoing training and development to ensure that its travel consultants remain at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. The agency also recognizes the growing importance of digital technology and plans to further enhance its online presence, develop mobile applications, and leverage data analytics to personalize customer experiences. By embracing innovation, fostering strategic partnerships, and prioritizing customer satisfaction, Leisure Travels is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and continue to play a vital role in promoting tourism and economic growth within the region. In essence, Leisure Travels aims to not just be a travel agency, but a facilitator of dreams, helping individuals and families explore the world and create memories that last a lifetime.', '93 sundarpur , RGB ROad Opp - Modern Living, near Vinyle Cafe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:05:23.000Z'),
(1593, 'Natural Holidays', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Natural Holidays, situated on the 2nd floor of Assam Tourism at AK Azad Road, is a premier travel agency dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India. We distinguish ourselves by crafting immersive and responsible travel experiences that resonate with both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic encounters. In a region brimming with natural wonders, from the majestic Brahmaputra River to the sprawling tea gardens and biodiverse national parks, Natural Holidays acts as a key facilitator, connecting discerning travelers with the hidden gems of Assam and its neighboring states.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around providing customized travel itineraries that cater to a wide spectrum of interests and preferences. We specialize in organizing wildlife safaris to Kaziranga National Park, renowned for its population of one-horned rhinoceros, and Manas National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Beyond wildlife, we offer meticulously planned cultural tours that delve into the traditions of Assam''s diverse ethnic communities, including Bodo, Mising, and Karbi. For those seeking tranquility, we curate serene retreats amidst tea estates, offering a glimpse into the world of tea cultivation and processing. Adventure enthusiasts can choose from trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river cruises along the Brahmaputra, and paragliding opportunities in selected locations. What sets us apart is our commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We actively partner with local communities and businesses to ensure that our tours benefit the local economy and minimize our environmental impact. Our itineraries prioritize eco-friendly accommodations, support local artisans, and promote responsible wildlife viewing practices. This dedication to sustainability is a significant differentiator, appealing to an increasingly conscious traveler base. These offerings directly address the growing demand in the local market for curated experiences that go beyond conventional sightseeing, providing deeper cultural immersion and a connection to nature.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Natural Holidays, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour, our dedicated team of travel specialists is committed to providing personalized attention and expert guidance. We understand that every traveler has unique needs and expectations, and we strive to create bespoke itineraries that exceed those expectations. Our knowledgeable and experienced tour guides are fluent in multiple languages and possess an intimate understanding of the region''s history, culture, and ecology. They are passionate about sharing their knowledge and ensuring that every traveler has an enriching and memorable experience. Beyond personalized service, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We organize cultural events and workshops that showcase the region''s art, music, and cuisine, fostering a sense of connection and understanding between travelers and local residents. We also support local schools and community organizations through donations and volunteer programs, contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This dedication to community engagement strengthens our relationships with local stakeholders and enhances our credibility as a responsible and ethical travel agency. We foster lasting relationships with our customers, many of whom return to explore more of the region with us.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Natural Holidays envisions becoming the leading sustainable tourism operator in Northeast India. We plan to expand our range of services to include more specialized and niche tourism products, such as birdwatching tours, angling expeditions, and wellness retreats. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own eco-friendly accommodations, providing travelers with even more sustainable and immersive travel experiences. A key focus of our future growth strategy is leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are developing a user-friendly online platform that will allow travelers to easily browse our tours, book accommodations, and access travel information. We also plan to utilize social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote the region''s unique attractions. Furthermore, we aim to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and businesses, ensuring that our growth benefits the region as a whole. We are committed to investing in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service and promote sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the economic development of Assam and Northeast India while preserving its natural and cultural heritage for future generations. We see immense potential for growth in the region''s tourism sector and are confident that Natural Holidays is well-positioned to capitalize on this opportunity.</p>', '2nd floor, Assam Tourism, AK Azad Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.331Z', '2025-12-07T08:05:29.000Z'),
(1594, 'TRAVELOPEDIA INTERNATIONAL PRIVATE LIMITED', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>TRAVELOPEDIA INTERNATIONAL PRIVATE LIMITED, strategically located in Lobby B, Supreme Tower, 201, GS Road, Guwahati, Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel solutions provider within the region. Understanding the unique nuances of the North-East Indian travel market, Travelopedia International is committed to offering bespoke travel experiences that cater to both domestic and international travelers seeking adventure, relaxation, and cultural immersion. The company distinguishes itself through its dedication to personalized service, leveraging local expertise, and fostering sustainable tourism practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Travelopedia International offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to simplify and enhance the travel planning process. These services encompass: <b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Tailored itineraries that cater to individual preferences, budgets, and interests, focusing on exploring the diverse landscapes and cultural heritage of Assam and the North-East. From wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to spiritual journeys through ancient temples and monasteries, each package is meticulously designed to create memorable experiences. <b>Flight and Accommodation Bookings:</b> A user-friendly platform and dedicated team facilitating seamless booking of domestic and international flights, hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ensuring competitive pricing and convenient options. <b>Visa Assistance:</b> Expert guidance and support throughout the visa application process for international travel, minimizing complexities and ensuring compliance with all relevant regulations. <b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> Streamlined travel solutions for businesses, including corporate bookings, event management, and incentive travel programs, optimizing travel budgets and ensuring efficient logistics. <b>Adventure Tourism:</b> Organizing trekking expeditions, river rafting adventures, and other adrenaline-pumping activities, catering to the growing demand for adventure tourism in the region. The unique selling proposition lies in its ability to blend local knowledge with global standards, providing authentic and immersive travel experiences that are both enriching and sustainable. The focus on responsible tourism ensures that local communities benefit from tourism activities, preserving the environment and cultural heritage of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Travelopedia International prioritizes creating exceptional customer experiences at every touchpoint. The company''s approach is centered on building lasting relationships with clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations. This commitment is reflected in its personalized consultation services, responsive customer support, and proactive communication. The team consists of experienced travel professionals who are passionate about delivering outstanding service and creating unforgettable travel memories. Furthermore, Travelopedia International actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and support for local initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, the company ensures that its operations contribute to the economic and social well-being of the region. The company leverages digital platforms and social media to connect with its target audience, sharing travel tips, promoting local attractions, and engaging in meaningful conversations. This online presence complements its offline operations, creating a seamless and integrated customer experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Travelopedia International envisions becoming the leading travel company in North-East India, renowned for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. The company''s future plans include expanding its service offerings to include niche tourism segments such as wellness tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion programs. Investment in technology is a key priority, with plans to develop a more advanced online platform and mobile app to enhance the booking experience and provide real-time travel updates. Furthermore, the company intends to establish strategic partnerships with international travel agencies and tour operators to broaden its reach and attract a wider range of customers. Long-term goals include establishing a strong brand presence in the international market, promoting North-East India as a premier travel destination, and contributing to the sustainable development of the region''s tourism industry. Travelopedia International is committed to staying ahead of industry trends, adapting to changing customer needs, and delivering exceptional value to its clients. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction, the company is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. The ambition is to not only provide travel services, but to act as ambassadors for the region, showcasing its beauty, culture, and hospitality to the world.</p>', 'LOBBY B, Supreme Tower, 201, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.332Z', '2025-12-07T08:05:36.000Z'),
(1595, 'Nexplore Travels', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Nexplore Travels, situated on the 2nd Floor of the Regalia Complex, above the SBI Chandmari Branch on Maniram Dewan Road, Guwahati, is a distinguished travel agency committed to providing exceptional and personalized travel experiences throughout Assam, the Northeast region, and beyond. Nexplore Travels stands out by blending global travel expertise with a deep understanding of the unique cultural and geographical landscape of Assam, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching adventures. We are not just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys.

<br> <br>

Our presence in the heart of Guwahati allows us to connect directly with the local community, understanding their specific travel needs and preferences. This localized knowledge, coupled with our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction, positions Nexplore Travels as a trusted partner for all travel requirements within the region. We aim to be the go-to travel solution for residents and visitors alike, fostering a reputation built on reliability, transparency, and personalized service.

<br> <br>

Nexplore Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. Our core offerings include expertly crafted tour packages that showcase the beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast. These packages range from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park to cultural immersions in Majuli, the world''s largest river island, and trekking expeditions in the breathtaking hills of Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. We also specialize in designing bespoke itineraries, tailoring travel plans to the specific interests, budget, and timeframe of each client.

<br> <br>

Beyond pre-packaged tours, Nexplore Travels provides a full spectrum of travel-related services. This includes flight bookings (both domestic and international), hotel reservations encompassing a wide range of options from budget-friendly accommodations to luxury resorts, car rentals for seamless transportation, and assistance with visa applications and travel insurance. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly integrate these services, offering a one-stop-shop solution for all travel needs. We also prioritize sustainable and responsible tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact. Furthermore, we leverage our strong relationships with local service providers to secure competitive rates and exclusive experiences for our clients.

<br> <br>

At Nexplore Travels, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service and personalized attention at every stage of their journey. Our team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants are passionate about travel and dedicated to understanding each client''s individual needs and preferences. We go the extra mile to ensure that every aspect of their trip is carefully planned and executed, from the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up.

<br> <br>

We understand that travel can be stressful, so we strive to make the entire process as smooth and hassle-free as possible. We offer 24/7 customer support to address any queries or concerns that may arise during travel. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, contributing to the economic development of the region and promoting cultural exchange. We participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and demonstrating our commitment to the community we serve.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Nexplore Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the Northeast region, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized tours catering to niche interests, such as birdwatching, photography, and wellness retreats. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and managing travel itineraries.

<br> <br>

We are committed to expanding our network of partnerships with local service providers, further enhancing our ability to offer unique and authentic experiences. A significant part of our long-term goal is to promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental footprint and supporting local communities. We aim to educate travelers about responsible travel and encourage them to engage with local cultures in a respectful and meaningful way. Ultimately, Nexplore Travels aspires to be more than just a travel agency; we want to be a catalyst for positive change, fostering a deeper appreciation for the beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast, while contributing to the sustainable development of the region.', '2nd Floor, Regalia Complex, Maniram Dewan Rd, above SBI Chandmari Branch', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.332Z', '2025-12-07T08:10:09.000Z'),
(1596, 'Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, 'Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd., strategically situated at Bora Service, Assam Trunk Rd, stands as a cornerstone of travel and tourism in Assam. We are more than just a travel agency; we are architects of experiences, connecting individuals and groups with the rich tapestry of culture, nature, and adventure that Assam and the wider Northeast India region have to offer. We distinguish ourselves through a commitment to personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a dedication to sustainable and responsible tourism practices. In a region experiencing a burgeoning interest in eco-tourism and cultural immersion, Carewell Travels and Tour serves as a trusted and reliable partner, bridging the gap between travelers'' aspirations and the realities of exploring this captivating part of the world.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings encompass a comprehensive suite of travel solutions designed to cater to a diverse clientele. These include meticulously crafted tour packages focusing on Assam''s famed tea gardens, the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas, and the spiritual significance of Majuli, the world''s largest river island. We also specialize in customized itineraries, meticulously tailored to individual preferences, budget considerations, and time constraints. This personalized approach ensures that each traveler experiences Assam in a way that resonates deeply with them. Beyond tour packages, we provide essential services such as flight and train ticketing, hotel booking across a range of categories from budget-friendly to luxury accommodations, and reliable transportation arrangements including car rentals and airport transfers. What truly sets Carewell Travels and Tour apart is our unwavering commitment to showcasing the authentic Assam, focusing on responsible tourism that benefits local communities and preserves the natural environment. We partner with local artisans, guesthouses, and guides, ensuring that tourism dollars directly contribute to the economic empowerment of the region. Our expertise extends beyond popular destinations; we actively promote off-the-beaten-path experiences, allowing travelers to discover hidden gems and engage in meaningful cultural exchange.

<br> <br>

At Carewell Travels and Tour, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is built on proactive communication, personalized attention, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey, our clients are guided by a team of knowledgeable and dedicated travel consultants who are passionate about Assam and committed to providing seamless and stress-free travel experiences. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we offer valuable insights into local customs, traditions, and etiquette, helping travelers to navigate the region with confidence and respect. We understand that travel can be unpredictable, which is why we provide 24/7 on-call support to address any unforeseen issues or emergencies that may arise. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our business operations. We actively participate in local initiatives aimed at promoting sustainable tourism and supporting community development. We believe in fostering a culture of responsible travel, encouraging our clients to engage with local communities in a respectful and mindful manner. This deep connection to the local community not only enriches the travel experience but also contributes to the long-term well-being of the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Carewell Travels and Tour envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded reach within the Assam and Northeast India tourism sector. We are committed to further developing our sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and maximizing the benefits for local communities. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include specialized adventure tours, wellness retreats, and educational programs focused on the region''s rich cultural heritage. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, implementing user-friendly online booking platforms and interactive travel guides. We are actively exploring partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including airlines, hotels, and local businesses, to create a more integrated and seamless travel ecosystem. Ultimately, Carewell Travels and Tour aims to become the premier travel and tour operator in Assam, recognized for our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We are dedicated to showcasing the beauty and diversity of Northeast India to the world, while ensuring that tourism benefits both travelers and the local communities that call this region home.', 'Bora Service, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.332Z', '2025-12-07T08:10:15.000Z'),
(1597, 'Albatross Journey', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Albatross Journey is more than just a travel agency; it''s a gateway to experiencing the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and beyond. Strategically located at Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute, Albatross Journey serves as a central hub for both local residents seeking to explore new horizons and tourists eager to immerse themselves in the region''s unique offerings. We differentiate ourselves by crafting personalized travel experiences that emphasize authentic cultural immersion, sustainable tourism practices, and a deep understanding of the Northeast Indian landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core services revolve around designing and executing customized travel itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. These include guided tours of Assam''s renowned tea gardens, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (a UNESCO World Heritage Site), exploration of the serene Majuli Island (the world''s largest river island), and curated cultural experiences highlighting the vibrant traditions of various Assamese communities. We also offer bespoke travel packages for destinations outside of Assam, ensuring a seamless and enriching travel experience across India and internationally.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Albatross Journey apart is our commitment to providing authentic, responsible, and sustainable travel options. We actively partner with local communities, artisans, and homestays to ensure that tourism benefits the region directly and minimizes its environmental impact. Our itineraries are meticulously planned to offer unique insights into the local culture, customs, and cuisine, going beyond typical tourist traps to provide a genuinely immersive experience. Furthermore, we boast a team of experienced travel consultants with in-depth knowledge of Assam and the Northeast, capable of advising clients on the best routes, accommodations, and activities based on their individual preferences and requirements.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Understanding the specific needs of the local market is paramount to our success. We recognize that many residents of Guwahati and surrounding areas seek convenient and affordable travel options for family vacations, weekend getaways, and pilgrimages. Therefore, we offer specialized packages tailored to these demands, including group tours, family-friendly itineraries, and transportation assistance. For incoming tourists, we act as a comprehensive resource, providing not only travel arrangements but also cultural guidance, language support, and logistical assistance to ensure a comfortable and memorable stay in Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience lies at the heart of Albatross Journey''s philosophy. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention, responsive communication, and exceptional service at every stage of the travel process. From the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up, we strive to exceed expectations and ensure that every customer feels valued and satisfied. Our staff are trained to be not just travel agents, but travel advisors, anticipating customer needs and proactively addressing any concerns that may arise. We foster a warm and welcoming atmosphere at our physical location on GNB Road, encouraging walk-in inquiries and offering expert advice to anyone planning a trip.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We actively connect with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local cultural events, partnering with local businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe that responsible tourism is essential for preserving the region''s unique heritage and environment, and we are committed to playing a positive role in the community. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring that we remain responsive to their evolving needs.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Albatross Journey envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and sustainability. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of travel packages to encompass more destinations within the Northeast and across India, developing specialized eco-tourism initiatives, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and provide a seamless online booking experience for our customers. Furthermore, we aim to invest in employee training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry and continues to provide exceptional service to our valued clients. We believe that Albatross Journey has the potential to not only grow as a business but also contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, promoting its unique beauty and culture to the world.</p>', 'Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.332Z', '2025-12-07T08:10:21.000Z'),
(1598, 'Tour Lover''s Travel Agency', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Tour Lover''s Travel Agency is a dedicated travel service provider committed to curating unforgettable experiences, deeply rooted in the rich culture and breathtaking landscapes of Assam and beyond. Situated strategically, we aim to be the premier choice for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching journeys. In a region known for its unparalleled natural beauty and vibrant traditions, Tour Lover''s Travel Agency distinguishes itself through personalized service, expert local knowledge, and a passion for sustainable tourism that benefits the communities we serve. We strive to not just facilitate travel, but to foster a genuine appreciation for the world''s diverse cultures and ecosystems.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Tour Lover''s Travel Agency lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a diverse range of travel preferences and budgets. Our core offerings include meticulously crafted tour packages, encompassing everything from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to cultural immersion experiences in the tea gardens of Upper Assam. We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries, tailoring each trip to the individual needs and desires of our clients. These custom tours might include trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river cruises on the mighty Brahmaputra, or spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. Beyond pre-packaged and custom tours, we provide a full spectrum of travel services including flight and hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (including car rentals and private chauffeur services), visa assistance, and travel insurance. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local terrain, coupled with strong relationships with local communities and service providers. This allows us to offer unparalleled access to authentic experiences, often unavailable through larger, less specialized travel agencies. We address a critical need in the local market: providing seamless, reliable, and culturally sensitive travel experiences that showcase the best of Assam and the surrounding regions, attracting both seasoned travelers and those embarking on their first adventure.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Tour Lover''s Travel Agency. We believe that exceptional customer service begins with attentive listening and a genuine desire to understand each traveler''s unique needs and aspirations. Our team is comprised of knowledgeable and passionate travel professionals who are dedicated to providing personalized attention from the initial inquiry to the final farewell. We go the extra mile to anticipate potential challenges and proactively address them, ensuring a smooth and stress-free travel experience. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to fostering genuine connections with the local community. We actively support local artisans, guides, and businesses, ensuring that our tours contribute to the economic well-being of the regions we operate in. Furthermore, we are committed to responsible tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting cultural preservation. We believe that by engaging with the local community in a meaningful way, we can provide our clients with a more authentic and enriching travel experience, while simultaneously contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We regularly participate in local events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Tour Lover''s Travel Agency is one of sustainable growth and continued excellence in travel services. We aim to expand our reach both domestically and internationally, attracting a wider range of travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. A key component of our future plans involves developing new and innovative tour offerings that cater to emerging travel trends, such as eco-tourism, adventure travel, and wellness retreats. We are actively exploring partnerships with other tourism stakeholders in the region to create comprehensive and integrated travel packages that showcase the diverse attractions of Northeast India. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in technology and training to enhance our operational efficiency and improve the overall customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information, as well as providing ongoing training for our staff to ensure they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills. Long-term, our goal is to become the leading travel agency in Assam and the surrounding regions, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We envision Tour Lover''s Travel Agency as a catalyst for promoting responsible tourism and showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam to the world.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.332Z', '2025-12-07T08:10:26.000Z'),
(1599, 'Jk Travel Agency Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati, strategically located at 4QJC+6V4, is a leading travel service provider dedicated to crafting exceptional travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Recognizing the growing demand for personalized and hassle-free travel solutions in the Northeast region, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati has established itself as a trusted partner for individuals, families, and corporate clients seeking adventure, relaxation, and seamless travel arrangements. Situated in a vibrant hub of Assam, the agency leverages its local expertise and extensive network to offer unparalleled access to the region''s diverse landscapes, cultural heritage, and burgeoning tourism sector. Jk Travel Agency Guwahati understands the specific needs and preferences of the local population, distinguishing itself from larger, national chains by offering tailored services with a personal touch.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati''s core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel-related solutions, designed to cater to diverse needs and budgets. These include meticulously planned tour packages showcasing the best of Assam and Northeast India, featuring popular destinations like Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and Shillong. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the agency excels in crafting bespoke itineraries tailored to individual preferences, ensuring a unique and unforgettable journey. Flight booking services are offered for both domestic and international travel, utilizing advanced booking systems to secure competitive fares and convenient travel schedules. Hotel reservations form another crucial aspect of the agency''s offerings, providing access to a wide range of accommodations, from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious hotels, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable stay. Recognizing the importance of smooth logistics, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati also provides reliable transportation services, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours with experienced local drivers. A key unique selling point lies in the agency''s deep understanding of the local terrain and culture, allowing them to provide insider tips and recommendations that enrich the travel experience. This local expertise also allows them to offer unique cultural experiences and homestays, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local communities. The agency specifically addresses the needs of the local market by offering packages in regional languages and catering to local festivals and events, ensuring relevance and accessibility for all.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Jk Travel Agency Guwahati''s operational philosophy. The agency prides itself on providing personalized attention and exceptional customer service, ensuring that every client feels valued and supported throughout their travel journey. The team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to understanding each client''s unique requirements and preferences, offering expert advice and guidance to create the perfect travel plan. The agency''s commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the initial booking process, with readily available support channels to address any queries or concerns that may arise during the trip. Jk Travel Agency Guwahati fosters a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and promoting sustainable tourism practices. They partner with local businesses and organizations to create authentic and immersive travel experiences, benefiting both visitors and the local economy. The agency actively seeks feedback from its clients and uses this information to continuously improve its services and offerings, demonstrating a commitment to excellence and customer-centricity. By emphasizing personalized service, local expertise, and community engagement, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a strong reputation as a reliable and trustworthy travel partner.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati envisions significant growth potential in the evolving travel landscape of Assam and the Northeast. The agency plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized travel packages catering to specific interests, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion programs. Investment in digital marketing and online booking platforms will be a key focus, allowing the agency to reach a wider audience and streamline the booking process. Partnerships with other travel agencies and tourism stakeholders will be explored to expand the agency''s reach and offer more comprehensive travel solutions. Long-term goals include establishing Jk Travel Agency Guwahati as the leading travel agency in the Northeast, recognized for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. The agency also aims to empower local communities through tourism by promoting homestays, supporting local artisans, and creating employment opportunities. By embracing technology, fostering strategic partnerships, and remaining committed to its core values of customer service and community engagement, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>', '4QJC+6V4', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.332Z', '2025-12-07T08:10:32.000Z'),
(1600, 'North East Holiday Tours', 'Travel Agencies', NULL, '```html
<p>North East Holiday Tours is a premier travel agency located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at Downtown, Hari Mandir Path. As a locally rooted business, we specialize in crafting authentic and enriching travel experiences throughout the Northeast Indian region, a landscape often overlooked by mainstream tourism. We stand out by offering meticulously planned itineraries that delve deep into the cultural richness, stunning natural beauty, and unique traditions of Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. North East Holiday Tours is more than just a travel agency; we are ambassadors for the region, dedicated to showcasing its hidden gems and promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core service revolves around providing bespoke tour packages designed to cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. From adventurous treks through the Himalayas and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to spiritual journeys to ancient temples and immersive cultural experiences in tribal villages, we offer a wide spectrum of options. We specialize in customized itineraries, allowing us to tailor each trip to the specific needs and preferences of our clients. This includes carefully selected accommodation, reliable transportation, experienced local guides fluent in multiple languages, and curated activities that provide authentic insights into the region''s heritage. A key differentiator is our commitment to responsible tourism. We partner with local communities, support eco-friendly initiatives, and ensure that our tours contribute positively to the preservation of the Northeast''s natural and cultural assets. Unlike larger, impersonal travel companies, we prioritize personalized attention and build lasting relationships with our clients, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable travel experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At North East Holiday Tours, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is built on a foundation of trust, transparency, and genuine care. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour, our dedicated team of travel specialists provides personalized support and guidance every step of the way. We go the extra mile to anticipate our clients'' needs, address their concerns promptly, and ensure their comfort and safety throughout their journey. We are deeply invested in the local community and actively participate in local events and initiatives. This allows us to stay connected to the pulse of the region, ensuring that our tours are always up-to-date and reflect the latest developments and opportunities. Furthermore, we prioritize employing local guides and staff, fostering economic growth within the communities we serve. This commitment to local empowerment and cultural sensitivity allows us to offer a truly authentic and immersive travel experience that resonates deeply with our clients. Our reputation for reliability, integrity, and exceptional customer care has earned us a loyal customer base and strong positive word-of-mouth referrals within the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, North East Holiday Tours envisions becoming the leading travel agency specializing in sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism in Northeast India. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of tour offerings to cater to niche interests such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and adventure sports. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online platform that allows travelers to easily browse and customize their itineraries. We are also committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities and supporting initiatives that promote sustainable tourism practices. This includes investing in training programs for local guides, supporting community-based tourism projects, and advocating for policies that protect the region''s natural and cultural heritage. Ultimately, our vision is to create a thriving tourism industry that benefits both travelers and local communities alike, while preserving the unique beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India for generations to come. We aim to be recognized not just as a travel agency, but as a responsible and ethical business that contributes positively to the economic and social well-being of the region.</p>
