(1622, 'The Spice Route', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>The Spice Route, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Divine Plaza, GS Rd, near Aurus Mall, offers a captivating culinary journey through the diverse and vibrant flavors of India and beyond. More than just a restaurant, The Spice Route aims to be a cultural hub, a place where authentic recipes, carefully sourced ingredients, and impeccable service converge to create a memorable dining experience. In a region known for its rich culinary heritage, The Spice Route distinguishes itself by presenting familiar flavors with a modern twist while introducing discerning palates to lesser-known regional specialties.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of The Spice Route''s offerings lies a carefully curated menu that showcases the breadth and depth of Indian cuisine. From the aromatic curries of the North to the spicy seafood of the South, the menu is designed to take diners on a gastronomic exploration. Beyond India, select dishes from neighboring countries, known for their complementary spice profiles, are also featured. Signature dishes include the slow-cooked Rogan Josh, prepared with locally sourced lamb and a blend of Kashmiri spices; the coastal delight of Goan Fish Curry, infused with coconut milk and tamarind; and a vegetarian Thali, a vibrant platter representing the diverse regional cuisines of India. Each dish is prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients, sourced from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible. A key differentiator is the emphasis on using freshly ground spices, ensuring maximum flavor and aroma in every bite. The beverage menu complements the food offerings with a selection of wines, beers, and handcrafted cocktails, many incorporating local fruits and herbs. Catering services are also available for private events and corporate gatherings, bringing The Spice Route''s culinary expertise directly to customers'' preferred locations. This service includes customizable menus and professional staff to ensure a seamless and memorable event.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Spice Route prioritizes creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere for its guests. The staff is trained not only in food service but also in providing genuine hospitality. From the moment a customer enters, they are greeted with a smile and guided through the menu with expert recommendations. The restaurant''s ambiance is carefully crafted to evoke a sense of comfort and sophistication, blending traditional Indian design elements with modern aesthetics. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience. Beyond providing excellent service, The Spice Route is committed to connecting with the local community. Partnerships with local artisan groups allow for the display and sale of their crafts, showcasing the region''s rich artistic heritage. Furthermore, The Spice Route actively participates in local food festivals and community events, reinforcing its role as a contributing member of the Guwahati community. Cooking workshops are periodically offered, allowing patrons to learn the art of Indian cooking and further connect with the culinary traditions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Spice Route envisions itself as becoming a leading culinary destination in Guwahati and the wider Assam region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more regional specialties and introduce innovative fusion dishes. The business is also exploring opportunities to establish a dedicated spice shop within the restaurant, offering customers the chance to purchase the unique spice blends used in The Spice Route''s dishes. This would allow patrons to recreate the flavors of The Spice Route at home and further explore the world of Indian spices. In the long term, The Spice Route aims to expand its operations to other locations in Assam, bringing its unique culinary experience to a wider audience. Sustainability is also a key focus, with plans to further reduce its environmental footprint by sourcing more ingredients locally and implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations. By consistently delivering exceptional food, service, and ambiance, The Spice Route strives to become a cherished culinary landmark and a testament to the rich and diverse flavors of India.</p>', 'Divine Plaza, building, GS Rd, near Aurus Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.334Z', '2025-12-07T08:35:19.000Z'),
(1623, 'Kalita Spectrum', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Kalita Spectrum, prominently located at Bus Stop, GS Rd, stands as a vibrant and dynamic business enriching the Assam landscape with its innovative offerings. More than just a commercial enterprise, Kalita Spectrum is designed to be a community hub, a place where quality services meet personalized attention. Its commitment to understanding and addressing the unique needs of the local market sets it apart, positioning it as a significant contributor to the region''s economic and social vitality.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, Kalita Spectrum provides a diverse range of services tailored to the demands of a modern and evolving society. The business offers comprehensive digital printing solutions, catering to both individuals and businesses requiring high-quality prints for various purposes – from marketing materials and personal projects to academic resources and official documents. Equipped with state-of-the-art printing technology, Kalita Spectrum ensures sharp, vibrant, and durable results. Beyond printing, a key offering is a curated selection of stationery and office supplies. Understanding the importance of quality tools for productivity and organization, Kalita Spectrum stocks a wide array of products, from essential pens, paper, and notebooks to advanced filing systems and desk organizers. This thoughtfully selected inventory caters to students, professionals, and anyone seeking to streamline their workspace. Adding to its appeal, Kalita Spectrum provides reliable and efficient photocopying services, addressing the immediate document replication needs of the surrounding community. This service is particularly valuable to those without access to their own photocopying equipment, making Kalita Spectrum a convenient and essential resource.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>What truly distinguishes Kalita Spectrum is its dedication to providing an unparalleled customer experience. The business operates on the principle that every customer interaction should be positive, helpful, and efficient. Friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to assist customers with their needs, offering guidance and expertise to ensure the best possible outcomes. Whether it''s helping choose the right paper stock for a printing project, suggesting organizational tools, or quickly fulfilling a photocopying request, the staff goes the extra mile to exceed expectations. Kalita Spectrum actively seeks to connect with the local community by participating in local events and initiatives. By supporting schools, community organizations, and cultural programs, the business demonstrates its commitment to the well-being of the area it serves. This active engagement builds strong relationships and fosters a sense of mutual trust and respect, making Kalita Spectrum more than just a place to buy products and services; it''s a valued member of the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking to the future, Kalita Spectrum envisions substantial growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading provider of services in the region. Plans include broadening the range of printing services to include specialized options such as large-format printing and custom design services, catering to the needs of businesses requiring impactful visual communications. Expanding the stationery and office supply inventory with innovative and eco-friendly products will also be a priority, reflecting a commitment to sustainability and meeting the evolving preferences of customers. Furthermore, Kalita Spectrum aims to enhance its online presence, providing customers with convenient access to its products and services through an easy-to-use online platform. This will enable customers to place orders, track their progress, and receive updates from the comfort of their homes or offices. Ultimately, Kalita Spectrum''s long-term goal is to become a one-stop-shop for all printing, stationery, and office supply needs in the region, while remaining deeply rooted in the community it serves. This vision is driven by a passion for excellence, a dedication to customer satisfaction, and a commitment to contributing to the economic and social growth of Assam.</p>', 'Bus Stop, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:35:24.000Z'),
(1624, 'The View Restaurant and Lounge', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>The View Restaurant and Lounge offers a sophisticated dining and entertainment experience perched atop the 6th Floor of Block A, 191 Exotica Greens, on RG Baruah Road, Guwahati. More than just a restaurant, The View is a destination, providing breathtaking panoramic views of the city while serving a delectable menu and crafting a vibrant atmosphere. Its strategic location in a bustling area, combined with its unique vantage point, makes it a standout establishment in Guwahati''s burgeoning hospitality sector, catering to both local residents and visiting guests seeking an elevated experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, The View provides a trifecta of services: fine dining, expertly crafted cocktails, and a captivating lounge experience. The restaurant boasts a diverse menu featuring both contemporary international cuisine and carefully selected regional Assamese specialties, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the area. This fusion allows patrons to explore global flavors while simultaneously indulging in the authentic tastes of Assam. The bar program is equally impressive, featuring classic cocktails prepared with precision alongside innovative signature creations using locally sourced ingredients where possible. Finally, the lounge area provides a relaxed and stylish setting for socializing, enjoying live music on select evenings, or simply unwinding after a long day. The unique selling point lies in the holistic package – a combination of stunning views, exceptional food and drinks, and a sophisticated ambiance that is difficult to replicate elsewhere in Guwahati. The location also benefits from ample parking and ease of access, addressing a common concern for dining establishments in the city. By catering to a diverse clientele seeking premium experiences, The View effectively addresses the growing demand for refined dining and entertainment options within the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer service at The View is paramount and is built on the principles of attentiveness, personalization, and exceeding expectations. The staff is meticulously trained to provide knowledgeable and gracious service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and well-cared for. From offering personalized menu recommendations to accommodating dietary restrictions and preferences, the team strives to create a bespoke experience for each individual. What sets The View apart is its commitment to fostering a genuine connection with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and initiatives, showcasing local artists and musicians and sourcing ingredients from regional producers whenever feasible. This dedication to supporting the community not only enhances the dining experience but also solidifies The View''s position as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. Regular feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the guest experience and tailor offerings to the evolving preferences of the local clientele. The ambiance and offerings are cultivated to provide not just a place to eat or drink, but a place for the community to gather.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The View Restaurant and Lounge possesses significant potential for growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to further incorporate regional delicacies and seasonal ingredients, enhancing the live music program to attract a wider audience, and potentially introducing themed nights and special events to further diversify the entertainment offerings. There are also considerations for partnering with local businesses and organizations to host corporate events and private functions, leveraging the venue''s unique space and breathtaking views. Long-term goals include establishing The View as a premier destination for both local residents and tourists seeking a memorable dining and entertainment experience in Guwahati. This will be achieved through continuous innovation, a relentless focus on customer satisfaction, and a commitment to contributing to the vibrancy and growth of the local community. Exploration of potential partnerships with local tour operators is also under consideration to make The View a key destination for city tours, capitalizing on the panoramic view and regional cuisine.</p>', '6th Floor, Block A, 191 Exotica Greens, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:35:31.000Z'),
(1625, 'Sunga & Sparta', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Sunga & Sparta: Forging Success in Assam''s Business Frontier</h1>

<p>Located on the 3rd Floor of Heritage Udeshna, GS Rd, Sunga & Sparta stands as a dynamic force in Assam''s evolving business landscape. We are a multifaceted organization committed to providing tailored solutions across key sectors, fostering sustainable growth and contributing to the region''s economic vitality. More than just a service provider, Sunga & Sparta aims to be a trusted partner, understanding the unique challenges and opportunities present in the local market, and leveraging global best practices to deliver impactful results.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What distinguishes Sunga & Sparta is our dedication to blending innovation with a deep-rooted understanding of the Assamese context. We recognize the importance of local expertise and cultural sensitivity in achieving business success. This ethos permeates every aspect of our operations, ensuring that our services are not only effective but also resonate with the values and aspirations of the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Spectrum of Solutions</h2>

<p>Sunga & Sparta operates across a diverse range of sectors, offering specialized expertise in:</p>

<br> <br>

<ul>
<li><b>Business Consulting:</b> We provide strategic advisory services to businesses of all sizes, from established enterprises to emerging startups. Our consulting offerings include market entry strategies, operational optimization, financial planning, and organizational development. We work closely with our clients to identify opportunities for growth, streamline processes, and enhance profitability. Understanding the nuances of the Northeast Indian market, our strategies are tailored to overcome regional challenges and capitalize on local advantages.</li>

<br> <br>

<li><b>Technology Solutions:</b> In today''s digital age, technology is a critical enabler for business success. Sunga & Sparta offers a suite of technology solutions designed to enhance efficiency, improve communication, and drive innovation. This includes software development, IT infrastructure support, and digital marketing services. We focus on providing solutions that are both cutting-edge and user-friendly, empowering our clients to leverage technology to achieve their business goals.</li>

<br> <br>

<li><b>Skill Development & Training:</b> Recognizing the importance of a skilled workforce, Sunga & Sparta offers comprehensive training programs designed to equip individuals with the skills and knowledge they need to succeed in today''s competitive job market. Our training programs cover a wide range of topics, including technical skills, soft skills, and leadership development. We partner with local educational institutions and industry experts to deliver high-quality training that is relevant to the needs of the local economy.</li>
</ul>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiator for Sunga & Sparta lies in our commitment to providing customized solutions. We understand that every business is unique, with its own specific challenges and goals. That''s why we take a collaborative approach, working closely with our clients to develop solutions that are tailored to their individual needs. Our team of experienced professionals brings a diverse range of expertise to the table, ensuring that we can provide comprehensive support across all aspects of our clients'' businesses.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our services are strategically designed to address critical market needs within Assam and the broader Northeast region. We recognize the need for businesses to adapt to the changing economic landscape and embrace new technologies. We aim to empower local businesses to compete effectively, create jobs, and contribute to the region''s overall prosperity.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, Fostering Trust</h2>

<p>At Sunga & Sparta, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We are committed to building strong, lasting relationships with our clients, based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. Our approach to customer service is proactive and responsive, ensuring that our clients receive the support they need, when they need it.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment for our clients. Our team is dedicated to understanding our clients'' needs and providing personalized attention. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our services to better meet the evolving needs of our clients.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Sunga & Sparta is deeply committed to the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting organizations that are working to improve the lives of people in the region. We believe that by giving back to the community, we can contribute to a more vibrant and prosperous future for all.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Regional Leadership</h2>

<p>Sunga & Sparta envisions becoming a leading provider of business solutions in Assam and the Northeast region. We are committed to continuous growth and innovation, expanding our service offerings and leveraging new technologies to better serve our clients. We plan to explore opportunities to expand our reach geographically, establishing a presence in other key markets within the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We are also committed to fostering a culture of excellence within our organization, attracting and retaining top talent. We believe that our employees are our greatest asset, and we are committed to providing them with opportunities for professional development and growth. By investing in our people, we can ensure that we continue to provide our clients with the highest quality services.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Sunga & Sparta aims to be a catalyst for economic growth and development in the region. We are committed to empowering local businesses to succeed, creating jobs, and contributing to a more prosperous future for all. We see ourselves as a long-term partner in the region''s success, dedicated to building a brighter future for Assam and the Northeast.</p>
</article>', '3rd Floor, Heritage Udeshna, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:40:11.000Z'),
(1626, 'The Table (Guwahati)', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>The Table (Guwahati) is a contemporary dining establishment redefining the culinary landscape of Guwahati, Assam. Situated on the 3rd Floor of Central Mall, GS Rd, The Table offers a sophisticated yet approachable dining experience, providing a welcome haven for both discerning palates and casual diners alike. More than just a restaurant, it aspires to be a focal point for social gatherings and culinary exploration, contributing to the growing vibrancy of Guwahati’s food and beverage sector.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Table distinguishes itself through its commitment to delivering a carefully curated menu that blends global culinary influences with locally sourced ingredients. While its specific culinary style may vary depending on the current menu offerings, the emphasis is consistently on fresh, seasonal produce and high-quality meats and seafood. The menu is thoughtfully designed to cater to a diverse range of preferences, potentially including options for vegetarians, vegans, and those with dietary restrictions. Beyond the food, The Table likely boasts a well-stocked bar, offering a selection of wines, spirits, and handcrafted cocktails designed to complement the dining experience. A key differentiator is its dedication to creating a consistently high-quality product; this includes rigorous sourcing practices, skilled culinary execution, and attentive service. By prioritizing both innovation and consistency, The Table aims to establish itself as a reliable destination for exceptional dining in Guwahati, filling a need for refined culinary experiences within the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At The Table, the customer experience is paramount. The ambiance is carefully cultivated to create a welcoming and sophisticated atmosphere, likely incorporating modern design elements with comfortable seating arrangements. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating the needs of each guest and ensuring a seamless dining experience. Beyond the in-restaurant experience, The Table likely engages with the local community through various initiatives. This might include partnerships with local farmers and suppliers, participation in local food festivals, or the hosting of special events that celebrate Assamese culture and cuisine. Furthermore, active engagement on social media platforms likely plays a role in building brand awareness and fostering a sense of community among its patrons. By prioritizing genuine hospitality and actively engaging with the local community, The Table aims to build strong relationships with its customers and establish itself as a beloved fixture in the Guwahati dining scene.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for The Table (Guwahati) involves expanding its reach and influence within the Assam culinary scene. This could involve exploring opportunities to introduce new menu offerings, perhaps incorporating regional specialties or innovative culinary techniques. Expansion within the Central Mall or potentially to other strategic locations within Guwahati is also a possibility, allowing The Table to cater to a wider audience. Another avenue for growth could be the development of catering services for private events and corporate functions, leveraging its culinary expertise and commitment to exceptional service. Long-term goals likely include establishing The Table as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. By continuously striving to improve its offerings and expand its reach, The Table has the potential to become a leading culinary destination in Guwahati and a valuable contributor to the city''s vibrant cultural landscape.</p>', '3rd Floor, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:40:17.000Z'),
(1627, 'Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar: A Taste of Elevated Elegance in Assam

Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar brings a sophisticated yet approachable dining experience to the vibrant heart of Assam. Situated atop a casual eatery serving classic dishes, Olive Garden offers a unique fusion of familiar comfort and refined rooftop ambiance. This distinctive combination sets it apart, establishing a memorable destination for both locals and visitors seeking a relaxed yet special occasion dining experience. More than just a restaurant and bar, Olive Garden aims to become a community hub known for its quality food, expertly crafted beverages, and unparalleled panoramic views. We strive to elevate the dining scene in Assam by offering a distinct setting where friends, families, and colleagues can create lasting memories.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings center around providing a multi-faceted experience. Firstly, our rooftop restaurant serves a carefully curated menu that complements the familiar flavors of the ground-floor eatery below, but with an elevated twist. We focus on fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, ensuring that each dish reflects the richness of Assam''s culinary heritage while incorporating contemporary techniques and presentations. Signature dishes might include reimagined versions of traditional Assamese curries, grilled river fish with regional spices, and innovative vegetarian options catering to diverse palates. Secondly, our bar boasts a diverse selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. From classic cocktails crafted with premium spirits to locally inspired concoctions featuring indigenous fruits and herbs, we aim to tantalize the taste buds and provide a refreshing complement to the culinary offerings. Furthermore, our ambiance is a key component of our service. The rooftop setting provides stunning views of the surrounding landscape, creating a serene and romantic atmosphere ideal for special celebrations or simply unwinding after a long day. This combination of exceptional food, expertly crafted drinks, and breathtaking views provides a unique selling proposition that distinguishes Olive Garden from its competitors. We strive to cater to the increasing demand for premium dining experiences in Assam, offering a sophisticated alternative to traditional restaurant formats.

<br> <br>

At Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar, customer satisfaction is paramount. We are committed to providing exceptional service in a warm and welcoming environment. Our staff is carefully trained to anticipate customer needs and provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. We understand the importance of creating a seamless and enjoyable dining experience, from the moment a guest arrives until their departure. Beyond simply providing great food and drinks, we actively seek to engage with the local community. We host regular events, such as live music performances showcasing local talent and themed culinary evenings celebrating Assamese culture. We also partner with local artisans and suppliers to promote regional products and support the local economy. By fostering strong relationships with our customers and the wider community, we aim to create a sense of belonging and establish Olive Garden as more than just a place to eat and drink, but a gathering place for friends and neighbors. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our customers through various channels, including online surveys and direct interactions, to continuously improve our services and offerings.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar envisions a future of sustained growth and innovation. Our long-term goal is to become the premier destination for elevated dining and nightlife in Assam. We plan to expand our menu offerings, incorporating new and exciting culinary trends while remaining true to our commitment to local ingredients and flavors. We also intend to introduce new beverage options, including craft beers from regional breweries and a wider selection of wines from around the world. Furthermore, we plan to enhance our entertainment offerings, hosting a diverse range of events that cater to different tastes and preferences. This could include live bands, DJ sets, cultural performances, and themed parties. We are also exploring the possibility of expanding our physical footprint, potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam or even venturing into neighboring states. We believe that the unique combination of high-quality food, expertly crafted drinks, breathtaking views, and exceptional service will continue to resonate with customers, driving our growth and establishing Olive Garden as a leading player in the regional hospitality industry. We are committed to continuous improvement, innovation, and community engagement, ensuring that Olive Garden remains a vibrant and integral part of the Assam landscape for years to come.', 'Casual eatery serving classic dishes', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:40:23.000Z'),
(1628, 'HERITAGE KITCHEN', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>HERITAGE KITCHEN: A Culinary Journey Through Assam</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, HERITAGE KITCHEN offers an authentic culinary experience that celebrates the rich and diverse flavors of the region. More than just a restaurant, HERITAGE KITCHEN is a cultural hub, a place where tradition meets innovation, and where every dish tells a story. In a vibrant local business landscape increasingly embracing global cuisines, HERITAGE KITCHEN stands out by championing Assam''s unique culinary heritage, offering a refreshing and deeply satisfying alternative to mainstream dining.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, HERITAGE KITCHEN is a full-service restaurant specializing in traditional Assamese cuisine. Our menu features a wide array of dishes, from classic favorites like <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry) and <i>Khar</i> (an alkaline preparation made with banana peels) to lesser-known regional specialties crafted with locally sourced ingredients. We are committed to using fresh, seasonal produce, supporting local farmers and ensuring the highest quality in every meal. Beyond the restaurant, we offer catering services for events of all sizes, bringing the authentic taste of Assam to weddings, corporate gatherings, and private parties. Our thoughtfully curated catering menus can be customized to accommodate specific dietary needs and preferences, ensuring a memorable and authentic experience for all guests. What truly sets HERITAGE KITCHEN apart is our commitment to preserving traditional cooking techniques. Our chefs are skilled in the art of slow cooking, using earthen pots and traditional methods to extract the full flavor potential of each ingredient. This dedication to authenticity, coupled with our use of locally sourced ingredients, results in dishes that are not only delicious but also deeply connected to the land and culture of Assam. Moreover, we actively promote sustainable practices, minimizing waste and supporting local producers to ensure the long-term viability of our community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at HERITAGE KITCHEN. From the moment guests walk through the door, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality. Our staff is knowledgeable and passionate about the cuisine, eager to share the stories behind each dish and guide customers through the menu. The ambiance is designed to be welcoming and inviting, with décor that reflects the cultural heritage of Assam. We strive to create a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere where guests can savor their meals and connect with friends and family. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers, going above and beyond to ensure their satisfaction. We regularly solicit feedback and use it to improve our services and menu offerings. Our commitment to customer service extends beyond the restaurant walls. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us and are committed to being a responsible and contributing member of the local business ecosystem. We host cooking demonstrations and workshops, sharing our knowledge of Assamese cuisine and promoting culinary tourism in the region. This deep connection to the local community is what truly sets HERITAGE KITCHEN apart, making it more than just a restaurant, but a gathering place where people can connect with their culture and each other.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, HERITAGE KITCHEN envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, quality, and community engagement. We plan to expand our menu to include even more regional specialties, showcasing the full diversity of Assamese cuisine. We are also exploring opportunities to offer cooking classes and culinary tours, providing immersive experiences that allow visitors to learn about and appreciate the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Furthermore, we are committed to expanding our catering services, bringing the authentic taste of Assam to a wider audience. In the long term, we aim to establish HERITAGE KITCHEN as a brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and sustainability. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuing to innovate, we can achieve our goals and make a positive impact on the local community. We are dedicated to preserving and promoting the culinary heritage of Assam for generations to come, ensuring that the unique flavors and traditions of the region are cherished and celebrated.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:40:30.000Z'),
(1629, 'Mising Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Mising Kitchen is a culinary haven nestled on the 1st Floor of House No. 24, Hengrabari Rd, near Public Health Chariali, Guwahati. More than just a restaurant, Mising Kitchen is an immersive experience that celebrates the rich and diverse flavors of Assam, with a particular focus on the distinctive cuisine of the Mising tribe. In a region known for its vibrant culinary traditions, Mising Kitchen stands out by offering an authentic and refined representation of Mising gastronomy, presented in a welcoming and contemporary setting. It contributes significantly to the local business landscape by promoting cultural heritage and providing a unique dining destination for both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic Assamese culinary journey.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Mising Kitchen lies its dedication to showcasing traditional Mising dishes. The menu features an array of culinary delights, meticulously prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Key offerings include *Apong* (rice beer), a cornerstone of Mising culture, alongside a variety of meat and fish preparations featuring traditional herbs and spices unique to the Mising palate. Dishes like *Purang Apin* (sticky rice wrapped and cooked in special leaves) and various types of *Tupula Bhat* (rice cooked in bamboo) are also integral to the menu. A crucial unique selling point is the commitment to authenticity – preserving traditional recipes and cooking methods passed down through generations. This dedication resonates strongly with the local market''s growing appreciation for heritage and authentic culinary experiences. By highlighting the unique flavors and ingredients of the Mising tribe, Mising Kitchen fills a specific niche in the Guwahati dining scene, offering an alternative to more generalized Assamese cuisine.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Mising Kitchen. The staff are not just servers but passionate ambassadors for Mising culture, readily sharing insights into the history and significance of each dish. The ambiance is designed to be both welcoming and informative, featuring subtle cultural elements that create an immersive dining experience without being overly theatrical. The restaurant regularly engages with the local community by hosting cultural events, showcasing traditional Mising music and dance, and collaborating with local artisans to display and sell their crafts. This approach fosters a strong sense of community and loyalty, turning patrons into advocates for the restaurant and its mission. Feedback is actively sought and incorporated into the menu and service protocols, ensuring a continuously improving experience that caters to the evolving preferences of the local clientele. Mising Kitchen emphasizes personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and connected to the rich cultural heritage on display.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Mising Kitchen envisions becoming a leading culinary institution in Assam, recognized for its commitment to preserving and promoting Mising culture. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more diverse Mising dishes, developing cooking classes to share traditional techniques, and potentially establishing partnerships with local farmers and producers to ensure a consistent supply of high-quality, authentic ingredients. There are also ambitions to explore opportunities for expanding the restaurant''s reach, possibly through opening additional locations or offering catering services for events. A key long-term goal is to create a platform for Mising artisans and entrepreneurs to showcase their products and talents, further strengthening the connection between the restaurant and the community. Ultimately, Mising Kitchen aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural hub, a culinary ambassador, and a catalyst for positive economic and social impact within the Mising community and the broader Assamese society.', '1st Floor House, No 24, Hengrabari Rd, near Public Health Chariali', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:40:35.000Z'),
(1630, 'Chennai Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Chennai Kitchen: A Culinary Bridge to South India in the Heart of Assam</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Chennai Kitchen stands as a vibrant culinary destination, bringing the authentic flavors of South India to the local Assam business landscape. More than just a restaurant, Chennai Kitchen offers an immersive experience, transporting diners to the heart of Chennai through its authentic recipes, warm ambiance, and unwavering commitment to quality. The establishment fills a significant niche in the local market by providing a diverse and authentic South Indian dining experience, catering to both those familiar with the cuisine and those eager to explore new culinary horizons.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Chennai Kitchen’s offerings lies a carefully curated menu that showcases the rich tapestry of South Indian cuisine. Primary dishes include a diverse selection of dosas, from the classic Masala Dosa to innovative variations that incorporate local ingredients. Sambar, a flavorful lentil-based vegetable stew, and a variety of chutneys accompany each dosa, providing a symphony of tastes and textures. Beyond dosas, the menu boasts a wide range of authentic dishes like Idli, Vada, Uttapam, and a selection of flavorful rice dishes such as Biryani and Lemon Rice. Special emphasis is placed on using high-quality ingredients, many of which are sourced directly to ensure authentic flavor profiles. The unique selling point of Chennai Kitchen lies in its dedication to traditional recipes, prepared with meticulous care and attention to detail. This authenticity distinguishes it from other dining options in the area, satisfying the growing demand for genuine South Indian food. By offering both vegetarian and non-vegetarian options, the restaurant caters to a broad spectrum of dietary preferences, further expanding its appeal within the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Chennai Kitchen prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience that fosters loyalty and community engagement. The restaurant''s approach is rooted in attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and valued. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, capable of guiding diners through the various dishes and offering recommendations based on individual preferences. The ambiance of Chennai Kitchen is carefully designed to evoke the warmth and hospitality of South India. Traditional decor elements, coupled with soothing music, create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere where guests can unwind and savor their meals. Furthermore, Chennai Kitchen actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and festivals. Offering catering services for community gatherings and corporate events, the restaurant aims to integrate itself as a valuable member of the local economy. Regular promotions and special offers are implemented to attract new customers and reward loyal patrons, strengthening the bond between Chennai Kitchen and the community it serves. Chennai Kitchen encourages feedback and actively uses it to improve its offerings and services, ensuring that it remains responsive to the evolving needs and preferences of its customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Chennai Kitchen envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading provider of authentic South Indian cuisine in Assam. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate regional specialties and seasonal dishes, further showcasing the diversity of South Indian food. Exploration of opening additional locations within the state is also underway, bringing the Chennai Kitchen experience to a wider audience. A long-term goal is to establish a training program for local chefs, nurturing culinary talent and preserving the authenticity of South Indian cooking. Furthermore, Chennai Kitchen is committed to sustainable practices, aiming to minimize its environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction, and energy efficiency measures. By focusing on quality, authenticity, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, Chennai Kitchen is poised to achieve continued success and make a lasting contribution to the local culinary scene.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:45:09.000Z'),
(1631, 'Bhartiya Jalpan', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Bhartiya Jalpan, a vibrant culinary destination nestled at STORE NO 2 22, URBAN CITY COMPLEX in the heart of Assam, offers an authentic taste of India with a special emphasis on traditional Assamese flavors. More than just a restaurant, Bhartiya Jalpan is a cultural experience, providing a welcoming space for the community to gather and enjoy meticulously prepared dishes inspired by generations of culinary heritage. We are committed to showcasing the rich diversity of Indian cuisine while highlighting the unique and often overlooked culinary treasures of Assam, contributing to the local economy and preserving cultural traditions.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing a diverse menu of high-quality, freshly prepared Indian and Assamese cuisine. From classic favorites like flavorful biryanis and creamy butter chicken to regional specialties like Masor Tenga (sour fish curry) and Khar (an alkaline dish), we cater to a wide range of palates. We carefully source our ingredients, prioritizing locally grown produce and spices to ensure freshness and support local farmers. Beyond our main menu, we also offer a variety of traditional Assamese "jolpan" (snacks) throughout the day, including pitha (rice cakes), laru (sweet balls), and other delectable treats perfect for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon tea.

<br> <br>

What sets Bhartiya Jalpan apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity and quality. We use traditional cooking methods and recipes passed down through generations to create dishes that are bursting with flavor. Our unique selling point is our focus on showcasing the diverse culinary landscape of Assam, offering a taste of the region that is often difficult to find elsewhere. We believe that food is more than just sustenance; it''s a connection to our culture and heritage. Therefore, we strive to create a dining experience that is both delicious and educational, introducing our customers to the rich and diverse flavors of Assam. Our menu is designed to meet the needs of the local market, offering affordable options for everyday meals as well as more elaborate dishes for special occasions. We also provide catering services for events of all sizes, bringing the taste of Bhartiya Jalpan to your doorstep.

<br> <br>

At Bhartiya Jalpan, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our friendly and attentive staff is dedicated to providing a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every guest. We strive to create a personal connection with each customer, taking the time to understand their preferences and provide recommendations. We value feedback and are constantly looking for ways to improve our service and offerings. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and festivals, sponsoring local initiatives, and promoting Assamese culture through our food and atmosphere. Our restaurant is designed to be a comfortable and inviting space where people can relax, connect with friends and family, and enjoy a delicious meal. We believe that Bhartiya Jalpan is more than just a restaurant; it''s a gathering place for the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Bhartiya Jalpan envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in the region, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, quality, and customer service. We plan to expand our menu to include even more regional specialties from Assam and other parts of India, further showcasing the diversity of Indian cuisine. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local farmers and artisans to promote sustainable practices and support the local economy. Long-term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout Assam and beyond, bringing the taste of Bhartiya Jalpan to a wider audience. We are committed to preserving and promoting Assamese culinary traditions for generations to come, ensuring that the unique flavors of the region are celebrated and enjoyed by all. Our vision is to be more than just a restaurant; we want to be a cultural ambassador, sharing the rich heritage of Assam with the world.', 'STORE NO 2 22, URBAN CITY COMPLEX', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:45:15.000Z'),
(1632, 'Terra Mayaa', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Terra Mayaa, nestled at 6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a dynamic business enterprise committed to providing innovative and tailored solutions within the evolving landscape of Assam’s commercial sector. More than just a business address, Terra Mayaa represents a forward-thinking approach to meeting the specific needs and aspirations of its community. The name itself, evoking a sense of grounding (“Terra”) and possibility (“Mayaa”), reflects the company''s core values: stability, creativity, and a commitment to fostering lasting relationships. Located in a bustling commercial hub, Terra Mayaa stands out by offering a unique blend of specialized services designed to empower local businesses and individuals alike.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Terra Mayaa''s offerings lie a suite of integrated services primarily focused on marketing solutions and business consulting. Specifically, the company specializes in crafting targeted digital marketing campaigns designed to enhance brand visibility and drive customer engagement for businesses throughout Assam. This includes social media management, search engine optimization (SEO), content creation, and email marketing, all tailored to the specific cultural nuances and market dynamics of the region. Recognizing the increasing importance of online presence in today’s economy, Terra Mayaa equips local businesses with the tools and strategies needed to thrive in the digital realm. Beyond marketing, Terra Mayaa also offers strategic business consulting services, providing guidance on everything from business plan development to operational efficiency improvements. This holistic approach ensures clients receive comprehensive support to navigate the complexities of the modern business world. The unique selling point lies in the company''s localized expertise, understanding the specific challenges and opportunities presented by the Assamese market, allowing them to create solutions that truly resonate with the target audience and drive tangible results.

<br> <br>

Terra Mayaa prioritizes building strong, lasting relationships with its clients. Customer service is not just a department; it''s a company-wide philosophy. The team is dedicated to providing personalized attention and responsive support, ensuring every client feels valued and understood. This commitment extends beyond professional interactions, as Terra Mayaa actively seeks to connect with the local community through various initiatives. This involves participating in local events, supporting local charities, and fostering partnerships with other businesses in the area. By actively engaging with the community, Terra Mayaa fosters a sense of trust and belonging, solidifying its reputation as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. They operate under the principle that a thriving community benefits everyone, and they are committed to playing a positive role in the growth and prosperity of Assam. The team at Terra Mayaa prides itself on its accessibility and responsiveness, understanding that clear communication and proactive problem-solving are essential for building strong client relationships.

<br> <br>

Looking to the future, Terra Mayaa envisions itself as a leading catalyst for business growth and innovation in Assam. The company plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized training programs designed to equip local talent with the skills needed to succeed in the digital economy. There are also explorations into offering e-commerce solutions to empower traditional businesses to transition into online retail. Furthermore, Terra Mayaa aims to become a hub for networking and collaboration, fostering connections between businesses and entrepreneurs across the region. By constantly adapting and evolving to meet the changing needs of the market, Terra Mayaa is committed to driving economic growth and creating opportunities for the people of Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Terra Mayaa as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement, contributing significantly to the overall prosperity and development of the region.', '6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:45:20.000Z'),
(1633, 'Michinga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Michinga Restaurant: A Taste of Assam on Jayanagar Road

Michinga Restaurant, nestled at 4RH4+MFR, 175, Jayanagar Rd, is more than just a dining establishment; it''s an immersive experience into the heart of Assam''s rich culinary heritage. Situated in a vibrant local area, Michinga aims to be a cornerstone of the community, offering authentic Assamese cuisine with a modern touch. We strive to provide a welcoming atmosphere where both locals and visitors can savor the unique flavors of the region, while enjoying exceptional service and a memorable dining experience. In the diverse Assam business landscape, Michinga stands out by staying true to its roots, celebrating regional ingredients and traditional cooking methods.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Michinga Restaurant lies a commitment to delivering an unparalleled culinary journey through Assam. Our core offerings center around a curated menu showcasing the region''s signature dishes. From the comforting warmth of Khar, a traditional alkaline dish, to the flavorful spice of Masor Tenga (sour fish curry) and the aromatic delicacy of Duck Roast, each dish is crafted with meticulous attention to detail and the freshest locally sourced ingredients. We offer a diverse range of options, including vegetarian and non-vegetarian dishes, ensuring there’s something to delight every palate.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Michinga apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and quality. We collaborate directly with local farmers and producers to obtain the finest ingredients, ensuring that every dish reflects the true flavors of Assam. Our chefs, deeply knowledgeable in regional culinary traditions, skillfully blend traditional recipes with modern techniques to create dishes that are both familiar and innovative. Furthermore, we offer unique Assamese beverages, including rice beer (locally sourced and prepared) and traditional teas, complementing the dining experience. Our competitive advantage lies in our commitment to providing an authentic taste of Assam that cannot be easily replicated elsewhere in the area.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Michinga Restaurant. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, guiding diners through the menu and offering insights into the history and cultural significance of each dish. We are committed to exceeding expectations, ensuring that every visit to Michinga is a memorable one. This dedication to exceptional customer service, coupled with our authentic cuisine, has helped us forge strong connections with the local community.

<br> <br>

Michinga actively participates in local events and festivals, showcasing Assamese cuisine and culture to a wider audience. We host cooking demonstrations, workshops, and themed dinners, further engaging with the community and fostering a deeper appreciation for the region''s culinary heritage. We are also committed to sustainable practices, supporting local farmers and minimizing our environmental impact. By actively engaging with the community and prioritizing sustainability, Michinga aims to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a positive force in the local ecosystem.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Michinga Restaurant envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, while remaining steadfast in our commitment to authentic Assamese cuisine and exceptional customer service. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more of the region''s diverse culinary offerings and introducing new and innovative dishes that celebrate the flavors of Assam.

<br> <br>

We also plan to explore opportunities to expand our reach, potentially through opening additional locations or offering catering services for local events. Our vision is to become a leading destination for Assamese cuisine, both locally and beyond. Furthermore, we aim to establish a training program for aspiring chefs, fostering a new generation of culinary talent dedicated to preserving and promoting the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Through continued innovation, dedication to quality, and a strong commitment to the community, Michinga Restaurant is poised to achieve its long-term goals and become a lasting legacy in the Assam business landscape.', '4RH4+MFR, 175, Jayanagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:45:27.000Z'),
(1634, 'Lama by Yeti | Awarded Best Ethnic and Oriental Cuisine', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Lama by Yeti, proudly awarded ''Best Ethnic and Oriental Cuisine,'' stands as a culinary beacon in Assam, offering an authentic and immersive dining experience that transcends the ordinary. More than just a restaurant, Lama by Yeti is a celebration of the rich and diverse flavors of the Himalayas and East Asia, meticulously crafted and presented with unparalleled dedication to quality and service. Located in the heart of [Insert general location in Assam - e.g., Guwahati’s bustling commercial district] , it provides a welcome escape, a sanctuary where the vibrant culture of the East is brought to life through exceptional cuisine and genuine hospitality.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Lama by Yeti distinguishes itself by providing a curated selection of dishes representing the best of Tibetan, Nepali, Bhutanese, and broader Oriental culinary traditions. Our core offering revolves around delivering an authentic taste of these regions, utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible to ensure the highest quality and support local farmers. From steaming momos and thukpas, hand-pulled noodles, and flavorful curries to expertly prepared stir-fries and delicate dim sums, our menu is a testament to the artistry and skill of our chefs. Unique selling points include our commitment to traditional recipes passed down through generations, our innovative interpretations of classic dishes, and our unwavering focus on using the finest ingredients available. We cater to the growing demand for diverse and authentic culinary experiences in Assam, filling a niche for diners seeking something beyond the typical Indian fare. Our menu also includes thoughtfully curated vegetarian and vegan options, ensuring that everyone can find something to savor and enjoy.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Lama by Yeti, customer experience is paramount. We believe that dining should be an enjoyable and memorable occasion, and we strive to create an atmosphere that is both welcoming and refined. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and cared for. From the moment you step through our doors, you are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality. We go beyond simply taking orders; we engage with our guests, offering recommendations, explaining the intricacies of our dishes, and ensuring that every need is met. The ambiance of Lama by Yeti is carefully designed to complement the cuisine. [Describe the restaurant''s ambiance - e.g., Warm lighting, traditional decor, calming music]. We actively connect with the local community by participating in local events, supporting local charities, and sourcing ingredients from regional producers. We aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a valued member of the Assam community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Lama by Yeti is ambitious and exciting. Building upon our current success and the recognition as ''Best Ethnic and Oriental Cuisine,'' we plan to expand our reach within Assam and potentially beyond. This may involve opening additional locations, developing a catering service for events and gatherings, or creating a line of signature sauces and spices for retail sale. We are committed to continually innovating and refining our menu, introducing new and exciting dishes that showcase the diversity of Himalayan and East Asian cuisine. We also plan to further enhance our customer experience through initiatives such as cooking classes, themed dining events, and collaborations with local artists and musicians. Our long-term goal is to establish Lama by Yeti as a leading culinary destination in Northeast India, renowned for its authentic cuisine, exceptional service, and unwavering commitment to quality. We envision Lama by Yeti as a place where people can come together to celebrate culture, share a delicious meal, and create lasting memories.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:45:33.000Z'),
(1635, 'Café Hendrix', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Café Hendrix, nestled on GS Road, opposite Pantaloons Down Town, is more than just a café; it''s a vibrant hub where exceptional coffee meets a contemporary Assamese experience. Stepping into Café Hendrix is an invitation to escape the hustle and bustle of Guwahati, offering a relaxing and inspiring atmosphere that caters to a diverse clientele, from students and professionals to families and tourists. In a region renowned for its tea, Café Hendrix is establishing itself as a premier destination for coffee connoisseurs and those seeking a unique culinary experience, adding a fresh and modern dimension to the local café culture. We''re committed to sourcing locally wherever possible, supporting the Assam economy and offering our customers the freshest ingredients.<br> <br></p>

<p>At the heart of Café Hendrix lies a dedication to providing high-quality coffee and a diverse menu that caters to a range of palates. Our core offerings include a wide selection of expertly crafted coffee beverages, from classic espresso-based drinks like lattes and cappuccinos to specialty brews featuring single-origin beans sourced both locally and internationally. Beyond coffee, our menu boasts a delightful array of teas, including premium Assam varieties, refreshing iced beverages, and handcrafted smoothies. <br> <br> Complementing our beverage selection is a carefully curated food menu featuring both continental and regional delicacies. Customers can savor freshly baked pastries and cakes, enjoy light and flavorful sandwiches and wraps, or indulge in heartier options inspired by Assamese cuisine. Our signature dishes often incorporate locally sourced ingredients, providing a unique culinary experience that celebrates the flavors of the region. What sets Café Hendrix apart is our commitment to quality, consistency, and innovation. We continually strive to refine our menu, explore new brewing techniques, and source the finest ingredients to ensure that every visit is a memorable one. Our spacious and comfortable seating arrangement, coupled with reliable Wi-Fi, makes us an ideal location for both casual meetups and productive work sessions, making us a versatile space for various customer needs.<br> <br></p>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Café Hendrix. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and going the extra mile to ensure satisfaction. From greeting customers with a warm smile to offering recommendations based on individual preferences, we strive to build meaningful connections with our clientele. <br> <br> Understanding the importance of community, Café Hendrix actively engages with local initiatives and organizations. We host regular events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops focused on coffee appreciation and other culinary skills. These events not only enhance the Café Hendrix experience but also contribute to the cultural vibrancy of the GS Road area. We also believe in giving back, and regularly partner with local charities and NGOs to support community development projects. By fostering a sense of community and providing exceptional service, Café Hendrix aims to be more than just a café; it aspires to be a cherished gathering place that enriches the lives of our customers and contributes to the well-being of the local community. We actively solicit customer feedback through online platforms and in-person interactions, continuously striving to improve our offerings and tailor our services to meet the evolving needs of our patrons.<br> <br></p>

<p>Looking ahead, Café Hendrix envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market and beyond. Our long-term goals include establishing multiple locations throughout Guwahati and other key cities in the region, bringing our unique blend of exceptional coffee and cultural experiences to a wider audience. We plan to enhance our menu by introducing seasonal offerings, expanding our range of locally sourced products, and collaborating with regional artisans to create exclusive merchandise. <br> <br> A key aspect of our future vision involves leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are exploring options such as online ordering, mobile payments, and loyalty programs to provide greater convenience and personalization. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable practices and plan to implement eco-friendly initiatives such as reducing waste, using renewable energy sources, and partnering with local farmers who prioritize environmentally responsible agriculture. Ultimately, Café Hendrix aims to become a leading brand in the Assam café industry, renowned for its commitment to quality, community engagement, and sustainable growth. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can create a lasting legacy that benefits both our customers and the region as a whole. Our ambition is to not just serve coffee, but to cultivate a culture – a culture of connection, creativity, and community, all centered around the comforting aroma of expertly brewed coffee.<br> <br></p>', 'GS Rd, opp. Pantaloons Down Town', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:50:10.000Z'),
(1636, 'Khao Gully - The Food Court', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p><b>Khao Gully - The Food Court: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</b></p>

<p>Khao Gully - The Food Court, strategically situated in Bhajanka Building on GS Road, next to Central Mall, has rapidly established itself as a premier dining destination in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a collection of food stalls, Khao Gully is a curated culinary experience, designed to cater to the diverse tastes and preferences of the local community and visiting patrons. It offers a vibrant and welcoming atmosphere where families, friends, and colleagues can gather to enjoy a wide array of delicious food options in a comfortable and convenient setting. In a city known for its rich culinary heritage, Khao Gully stands out by offering a modern, diverse, and accessible food court experience, addressing the growing demand for quality, variety, and convenience in the Guwahati dining scene. Its prime location ensures high visibility and accessibility, making it a popular choice for a quick lunch, a casual dinner, or a weekend family outing.</p>

<p>Khao Gully''s core offering lies in its carefully selected vendors, each specializing in a distinct culinary style. From authentic Assamese cuisine to popular North Indian dishes, flavorful Chinese fare, and tantalizing continental options, the food court provides a diverse menu that caters to a broad spectrum of palates. A key unique selling point is the emphasis on quality ingredients and hygienic food preparation practices. Each vendor is carefully vetted to ensure adherence to stringent quality standards, guaranteeing a safe and enjoyable dining experience for all customers. The food court also prioritizes affordability, offering a range of options to suit different budgets, making it an accessible choice for students, families, and working professionals alike. Furthermore, Khao Gully addresses a crucial need in the local market by providing a centralized location where individuals with varying dietary preferences can dine together harmoniously. Rather than compromising on cuisine choice, groups can easily find something to satisfy everyone''s cravings within the food court''s diverse offerings.</p>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Khao Gully. From the moment patrons enter, they are greeted with a clean, well-maintained, and aesthetically pleasing environment. Ample seating arrangements cater to both small and large groups, ensuring a comfortable dining experience for everyone. Attentive and friendly staff are readily available to assist customers, providing information about the various food options and ensuring a smooth and efficient ordering process. Beyond the physical space, Khao Gully actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting food festivals showcasing regional specialties, partnering with local organizations for fundraising events, and offering special promotions to students and senior citizens. The business strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and appreciated. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the quality of service and the overall dining experience. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, Khao Gully has become more than just a food court; it has become a vibrant social hub.</p>

<p>Looking ahead, Khao Gully envisions expanding its presence and solidifying its position as the leading food court destination in Guwahati. Future plans include introducing new and innovative food concepts, incorporating more technology to enhance the customer experience, and expanding the seating capacity to accommodate growing demand. The business is also exploring opportunities to partner with local farmers and suppliers to source fresh, locally grown ingredients, further supporting the local economy and enhancing the quality of its offerings. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Khao Gully is committed to reducing its environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly practices such as waste reduction, recycling, and the use of biodegradable packaging. Long-term, the goal is to establish Khao Gully as a benchmark for quality, service, and sustainability in the food court industry, not just in Guwahati, but across the region. The business aims to create a sustainable and thriving enterprise that benefits both its customers and the local community, contributing to the overall growth and prosperity of Assam.</p>', 'Bhajanka Building, GS Rd, next to Central Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:50:17.000Z'),
(1637, 'Rang De Basanti Dhaba', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Rang De Basanti Dhaba, located at 1st, Basudev Complex, offers a vibrant and authentic taste of North Indian cuisine with a strong Assam flavour. More than just a restaurant, it is a cultural hub, a community gathering place, and a testament to the rich culinary heritage of India. Positioned within the dynamic local business environment of Assam, Rang De Basanti Dhaba stands out by delivering a unique dining experience that combines traditional recipes with local ingredients, appealing to both residents and tourists alike. The dhaba seeks to capture the essence of rustic Indian dining, offering a taste of home in a lively and welcoming atmosphere.

<br> <br>

At its core, Rang De Basanti Dhaba provides a comprehensive menu of North Indian and tandoori dishes, meticulously prepared to preserve authentic flavours while incorporating locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The restaurant''s signature dishes, such as Butter Chicken, Dal Makhani, and a variety of freshly baked naans and rotis, are consistently praised for their quality and taste. However, what truly distinguishes Rang De Basanti Dhaba is its commitment to incorporating local Assam flavours. Examples include the inclusion of Assam black pepper in specific marinades, the use of local vegetables in certain curries, and offering a unique Assam-style chai. The dhaba also caters to diverse dietary needs, providing vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options to ensure a satisfying experience for all patrons. By prioritizing quality ingredients, authentic cooking techniques, and a diverse menu, Rang De Basanti Dhaba effectively meets the local market needs for both traditional North Indian cuisine and innovative fusion dishes.

<br> <br>

The customer experience at Rang De Basanti Dhaba is built on a foundation of genuine hospitality and personalized service. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. The dhaba’s ambiance plays a crucial role in enhancing the overall dining experience. The decor reflects the spirit of the movie "Rang De Basanti", using vibrant colours, rustic furniture, and evocative imagery to create a lively and immersive atmosphere. The restaurant regularly hosts live music performances showcasing local artists, creating a lively and engaging environment that celebrates Assam''s vibrant culture. Furthermore, Rang De Basanti Dhaba actively participates in local community events, supporting local businesses and organizations through sponsorships and partnerships. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and reinforces the dhaba’s position as a beloved local institution. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve service and offerings, demonstrating a commitment to customer satisfaction.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Rang De Basanti Dhaba envisions significant growth and expansion while maintaining its core values of quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Expansion plans include potentially opening additional locations within Assam and possibly expanding to other regions, allowing a wider audience to experience the unique culinary offerings. The dhaba is also exploring opportunities to enhance its online presence through online ordering and delivery services, catering services for local events, and the development of a branded line of spices and sauces, allowing customers to enjoy the Rang De Basanti Dhaba experience at home. Moreover, the business plans to strengthen its relationships with local farmers and suppliers, ensuring a sustainable and ethical supply chain. Long-term goals involve establishing Rang De Basanti Dhaba as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with authentic North Indian cuisine, community support, and exceptional customer service within the Assam region and beyond. The focus will be on creating a legacy of culinary excellence and positive social impact.', '1st, Basudev Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:50:22.000Z'),
(1638, 'Gam''s Delicacy Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Gam''s Delicacy Restaurant: A Taste of Assam''s Culinary Heart in Krishna Market</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Krishna Market, GS Road, Gam''s Delicacy Restaurant stands as a culinary beacon, offering an authentic taste of Assam''s rich and diverse gastronomic landscape. More than just a restaurant, Gam''s Delicacy is a celebration of local flavors, time-honored recipes, and the warm hospitality that defines the Assamese spirit. In a region known for its unique culinary traditions, Gam''s Delicacy distinguishes itself by prioritizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients and presenting them in both traditional and innovative ways, catering to a diverse clientele that includes local residents, tourists, and business professionals.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Gam''s Delicacy offers a comprehensive menu that showcases the breadth and depth of Assamese cuisine. From the tangy and aromatic <i>Maa Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry) to the hearty and comforting <i>Dal with Khar</i> (lentils cooked with alkaline extract), each dish is prepared with meticulous attention to detail and a deep respect for tradition. The restaurant''s signature dishes include a flavorful rendition of <i>Duck Roast</i> prepared with local herbs and spices, and a tantalizing <i>Pitha</i> platter, showcasing the diverse range of rice cakes that are central to Assamese festivities. Beyond traditional fare, Gam''s Delicacy also features innovative dishes that blend Assamese flavors with modern culinary techniques, appealing to a younger and more adventurous palate. Vegetarian options are plentiful, featuring dishes prepared with seasonal vegetables and lentils, offering a delightful experience for non-meat eaters. What sets Gam''s Delicacy apart is its commitment to sourcing ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, ensuring freshness and supporting the local agricultural economy. This farm-to-table approach not only enhances the flavor of the dishes but also guarantees a sustainable and ethical dining experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Gam''s Delicacy. The restaurant strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel welcomed and valued. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, offering recommendations and catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. The ambiance is carefully curated to reflect the essence of Assamese culture, with traditional decor and soothing background music creating a relaxing and immersive dining experience. Furthermore, Gam''s Delicacy actively engages with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring local initiatives, and hosting cultural programs that showcase Assamese arts and traditions. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and reinforces Gam''s Delicacy''s position as a vital part of the local fabric. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered, ensuring that the restaurant continuously improves its service and offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele. Regular customer loyalty programs and special promotions further enhance the customer experience and encourage repeat visits.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Gam''s Delicacy envisions expanding its reach and influence within the regional culinary landscape. Future plans include introducing online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenient dining options. The restaurant also aims to establish a catering service to provide authentic Assamese cuisine for private events and corporate functions. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans and producers to create a curated retail section within the restaurant, showcasing and selling local products, is also on the horizon. A long-term goal is to establish a culinary school or training program to nurture aspiring chefs and promote the preservation and evolution of Assamese cuisine. Gam''s Delicacy believes that by investing in education and innovation, it can contribute to the continued growth and recognition of Assam''s culinary heritage on a national and international scale. The restaurant is committed to maintaining its focus on quality, authenticity, and customer satisfaction as it embarks on this journey of growth and expansion, ensuring that Gam''s Delicacy remains a cherished destination for those seeking a truly authentic and unforgettable taste of Assam.</p>', 'Krishna Market, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:50:29.000Z'),
(1639, 'Nuts and Brew', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Nuts and Brew: A Guwahati Gathering Place

