(1642, 'Kalita Cafe', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Kalita Cafe, a vibrant and welcoming establishment nestled in the heart of Guwahati''s bustling commercial district, offers a unique culinary experience that celebrates the rich flavors and traditions of Assam. More than just a cafe, Kalita Cafe serves as a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect over delicious food, expertly brewed beverages, and engaging conversation. Our dedication to quality, coupled with our commitment to showcasing Assamese culture, sets us apart in a rapidly evolving food and beverage landscape. We strive to be a positive influence in the community, sourcing locally whenever possible and fostering a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the warmth and hospitality inherent in Assamese culture.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around providing a diverse and satisfying culinary experience. We specialize in authentic Assamese cuisine, featuring classic dishes like Khar, Masor Tenga, and Pitha, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We also offer a curated selection of popular continental and Indian dishes to cater to a broader range of palates. Beyond food, our beverage menu boasts a wide array of options, including premium Assamese tea, freshly brewed coffee, and refreshing fruit juices. A key differentiator is our commitment to showcasing the diverse regional variations of Assamese tea. We offer a ''Tea Tasting'' experience, allowing customers to sample different blends and learn about the unique characteristics of each variety. Furthermore, we bake all our cakes and pastries in-house, guaranteeing freshness and quality. Our unique selling proposition lies in the harmonious blend of authentic Assamese flavors with contemporary cafe offerings, creating a memorable and satisfying experience for every guest. We address the local market need for a high-quality, culturally relevant dining option that provides a relaxed and inviting atmosphere.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Kalita Cafe, customer experience is paramount. We believe in providing friendly, attentive, and personalized service to every guest. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and passionate about sharing the stories behind the dishes and beverages we offer. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where customers feel comfortable and valued. We actively engage with the local community by hosting cultural events, showcasing local artists, and partnering with local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us. For example, we regularly feature local musicians during evening hours, providing a platform for emerging talent. We also collaborate with nearby schools and organizations to offer catering services for their events. Our connection with the local community is further strengthened through our social media presence, where we share updates on our menu, events, and community initiatives. We encourage feedback and actively respond to customer suggestions, ensuring that we continuously improve and meet the evolving needs of our patrons.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Kalita Cafe envisions expanding its reach and impact within the Assam business landscape. Our future plans include opening additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam, while maintaining the quality and authenticity that define our brand. We aim to further develop our menu by introducing innovative Assamese fusion dishes that appeal to a wider audience. We also plan to enhance our online presence through a user-friendly online ordering system and a robust social media marketing strategy. A key long-term goal is to establish Kalita Cafe as a leading advocate for Assamese cuisine and culture, both within Assam and beyond. We are exploring opportunities to partner with tourism agencies to promote Assam''s culinary heritage to visitors. We are also committed to expanding our sustainability initiatives by sourcing more ingredients directly from local farmers and reducing our environmental footprint. Ultimately, our vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam, while providing a memorable and authentic experience for every customer.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:55:22.000Z'),
(1643, 'Naga Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Naga Kitchen: A Taste of the Northeast on GS Road</p>

<p>Nestled on the bustling GS Road, opposite Pantaloons, Naga Kitchen offers a unique and authentic culinary experience, bringing the distinctive flavors of Nagaland and the wider Northeast to the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant, Naga Kitchen is a cultural ambassador, introducing patrons to the rich tapestry of Northeastern cuisine, often overlooked in mainstream Indian dining. In a region increasingly embracing diverse culinary influences, Naga Kitchen stands out by providing an authentic and immersive experience that celebrates the region''s indigenous food culture. Its significance lies not only in offering delicious and unique food but also in promoting regional identity and cultural understanding within the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Naga Kitchen, the heart of the offering revolves around traditional Naga dishes, meticulously prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The menu boasts a range of signature items, including smoked pork with akhuni (fermented soybean), a staple of Naga cuisine known for its intense umami flavor. Other popular dishes include bamboo shoot curry, various preparations of anishi (fermented yam leaves), and flavorful rice plates served with an array of seasonal vegetables and meat curries. What truly sets Naga Kitchen apart is its commitment to authenticity. Recipes are often passed down through generations, ensuring the dishes retain their traditional flavors and cooking techniques. The restaurant also offers a selection of Northeastern thalis, providing a comprehensive culinary journey through the region, allowing customers to sample a variety of flavors and textures in one sitting. This caters to the adventurous palate and provides a convenient way to explore the diverse culinary landscape of the Northeast. Naga Kitchen directly addresses the local market''s growing interest in exploring regional Indian cuisines beyond the familiar, offering a genuine and accessible gateway to the flavors of Nagaland.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Naga Kitchen. The restaurant strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, reflecting the hospitality of the Naga people. The staff are trained not only to provide efficient service but also to educate customers about the dishes, their origins, and cultural significance. They are knowledgeable and passionate about the cuisine, acting as ambassadors for Naga culture and providing context for the dishes served. This personalized approach to customer service fosters a sense of connection and makes each visit a learning experience. Naga Kitchen actively engages with the local community through participation in food festivals and cultural events, promoting its cuisine and raising awareness about Naga culture. Furthermore, the restaurant sources ingredients from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible, supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of its dishes. By creating a welcoming environment, offering exceptional service, and actively engaging with the community, Naga Kitchen has established itself as more than just a restaurant; it is a gathering place where people can connect, learn, and appreciate the rich cultural heritage of the Northeast.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Naga Kitchen is ambitious and centered on sustainable growth and cultural preservation. The business aims to expand its menu offerings, introducing more diverse and lesser-known dishes from Nagaland and other Northeastern states. This includes exploring innovative ways to present traditional ingredients and flavors in a modern and appealing way. The long-term goal is to establish Naga Kitchen as a leading culinary destination for Northeastern cuisine, both locally and potentially nationally. This includes plans to potentially open additional locations, expanding the reach of Naga cuisine to a wider audience. Another key objective is to strengthen its commitment to sustainability by further sourcing ingredients locally and minimizing its environmental impact. Naga Kitchen envisions itself as a champion of Naga culture, actively promoting its heritage through culinary experiences, educational initiatives, and partnerships with local artisans and cultural organizations. By focusing on authenticity, innovation, and community engagement, Naga Kitchen aims to not only grow its business but also contribute to the preservation and promotion of the rich culinary and cultural heritage of the Northeast for generations to come.</p>', 'GS Rd, opp. Pantaloons', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:55:29.000Z'),
(1644, 'Barbeque Nation', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Barbeque Nation, situated on the 2nd Floor of Adityam Building on GS Rd, is a prominent dining destination that has carved a niche for itself in the vibrant culinary scene of Assam. More than just a restaurant, Barbeque Nation offers an immersive and interactive dining experience that sets it apart from traditional eateries. It has become a go-to place for families, friends, and colleagues seeking a lively atmosphere, diverse flavors, and exceptional value. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning hospitality sector, Barbeque Nation has successfully blended global barbeque traditions with local preferences, contributing significantly to the evolving gastronomic landscape of Guwahati and beyond.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Barbeque Nation’s appeal is its all-you-can-eat barbeque concept. Customers are seated at tables equipped with live grills, allowing them to customize and cook a wide array of marinated meats, seafood, and vegetables to their liking. This interactive element fosters a sense of engagement and allows for personalized culinary exploration. Beyond the barbeque itself, the restaurant boasts an extensive buffet featuring a diverse selection of appetizers, main courses, salads, and desserts, catering to a wide range of palates and dietary preferences. The restaurant regularly introduces new and innovative dishes, keeping the menu fresh and exciting for returning customers. What truly distinguishes Barbeque Nation is its commitment to quality ingredients, expertly crafted marinades, and a vibrant atmosphere, creating a memorable dining experience that offers exceptional value for money. This approach directly addresses the local market''s desire for both quality and affordability, making it a popular choice for celebrations, family outings, and casual gatherings.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Barbeque Nation prioritizes creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. The staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, ensuring that diners feel comfortable and well-cared for throughout their visit. The restaurant''s ambiance is designed to be lively and engaging, with a focus on creating a social and interactive dining environment. Special attention is paid to cleanliness and hygiene, maintaining high standards to ensure a safe and comfortable dining experience. Beyond the immediate customer interaction, Barbeque Nation actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. This may include participating in local events, offering special promotions for local residents, and supporting local charities. By fostering a sense of community and demonstrating a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction, Barbeque Nation has built a loyal customer base and established itself as a trusted and respected member of the local business community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Barbeque Nation envisions continued growth and expansion within Assam and potentially beyond. The company plans to further refine its menu, incorporating more local flavors and ingredients to cater specifically to the regional palate. There is a focus on enhancing the customer experience through technological innovations, such as online ordering and reservation systems, as well as loyalty programs designed to reward frequent diners. The company is committed to sustainable practices, exploring ways to reduce its environmental impact and support local suppliers. Ultimately, Barbeque Nation aims to solidify its position as a leading dining destination, not only in Guwahati but throughout the region, by consistently delivering exceptional food, outstanding service, and a memorable dining experience that reflects the vibrant spirit of Assam.</p>', '2nd Floor, Adityam Building, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.335Z', '2025-12-07T08:55:34.000Z'),
(1645, 'Attic : The Restro Cafe', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Attic : The Restro Cafe is more than just a place to eat; it''s a vibrant hub nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of culinary delight, artistic expression, and community engagement. Situated in a locale known for its burgeoning cafe culture, Attic stands out by seamlessly merging a relaxed, bohemian atmosphere with a commitment to providing exceptional food and beverages, making it a significant and refreshing addition to the local business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Attic : The Restro Cafe provides a diverse menu catering to a wide range of palates. Our primary offerings include a curated selection of continental and Indian dishes, with a particular emphasis on locally sourced ingredients. From hearty breakfast options featuring Assamese delicacies to globally inspired main courses and delectable desserts, we aim to provide a culinary journey for every customer. Alongside our food menu, we boast a comprehensive beverage selection, including specialty coffees crafted with locally roasted beans, a variety of teas, refreshing mocktails, and carefully chosen soft drinks. What truly sets Attic apart is its commitment to providing options for dietary restrictions, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free choices, ensuring inclusivity and accessibility for all. Our unique selling point lies in our fusion cuisine, blending traditional Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. We also host themed food festivals showcasing regional and international cuisines, offering our customers an ever-evolving and exciting dining experience. Our menu directly addresses the growing demand in Guwahati for sophisticated yet accessible dining experiences that celebrate local ingredients and cultural diversity.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Attic : The Restro Cafe. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized atmosphere for every guest. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and friendly service, anticipating customer needs and ensuring a seamless dining experience. Beyond the excellent service, Attic distinguishes itself through its unique ambiance. The cafe''s design incorporates elements of traditional Assamese art and craftsmanship, creating a visually appealing and culturally enriching environment. We also regularly host live music performances, art exhibitions featuring local artists, and open mic nights, transforming the space into a vibrant cultural hub. To further connect with the local community, Attic actively participates in local events and initiatives, partnering with NGOs and community organizations to support social causes. We also leverage social media platforms to engage with our customers, sharing updates on events, promotions, and new menu items, fostering a strong sense of community and loyalty. Our commitment to creating a memorable and meaningful experience goes beyond simply serving food; we aim to cultivate a space where people can connect, create, and celebrate the vibrant culture of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Attic : The Restro Cafe envisions becoming a leading culinary and cultural destination in Guwahati and beyond. Our growth strategy involves expanding our menu offerings to include more innovative and locally inspired dishes, while also exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to further enhance our commitment to sustainability and supporting the local economy. We plan to introduce cooking workshops and culinary classes, offering customers the opportunity to learn about Assamese cuisine and culinary techniques. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, replicating the unique Attic experience and expanding our reach to a wider audience. Our long-term goals include establishing Attic as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement, solidifying our position as a cornerstone of the local business landscape. We also intend to further develop our online presence, enabling online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenient and accessible dining options. Ultimately, we aim to not only provide exceptional food and beverages but also to contribute to the cultural and economic vibrancy of Assam, creating a positive impact on the community we serve.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:00:09.000Z'),
(1646, 'JholoeKiya : Experiential Dining', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<article>
<h1>JholoeKiya: Experiential Dining - A Culinary Journey Rooted in Assam</h1>

<p>JholoeKiya: Experiential Dining, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at The Greenwood, Dr. Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road, Beltola, is more than just a restaurant; it''s a destination. We offer a unique and immersive dining experience that transcends the traditional restaurant model, providing guests with a culinary journey that celebrates the rich heritage and diverse flavors of Assam and the broader Northeast India. JholoeKiya is strategically positioned to cater to the growing demand for authentic regional cuisine presented with a modern, sophisticated twist, filling a crucial gap in the Guwahati dining scene.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We stand out by focusing on creating memorable moments. From the moment guests enter, they are enveloped in an atmosphere designed to engage all senses. Our carefully curated ambiance features traditional Assamese decor subtly blended with contemporary design elements, creating a warm and inviting space. We offer a meticulously crafted menu that showcases authentic Assamese and North-Eastern dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our signature dishes feature traditional cooking techniques passed down through generations, but are presented with modern culinary flair. Beyond the food itself, we offer interactive elements such as live cooking demonstrations, storytelling sessions that delve into the history of the dishes, and opportunities to learn about the origins and significance of the ingredients used. Our beverage program complements the cuisine, featuring locally brewed rice beers, traditional teas, and innovative cocktails incorporating regional fruits and spices. We also host special themed evenings highlighting different aspects of Assamese culture, further enriching the dining experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At JholoeKiya, we understand that exceptional service is paramount. Our staff is carefully selected and trained not only to provide attentive and efficient service but also to act as ambassadors of Assamese culture. They are knowledgeable about the menu, the ingredients, and the cultural significance of the dishes, and are passionate about sharing their knowledge with our guests. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local farmers, artisans, and cultural organizations. We source ingredients from local farms whenever possible, supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of our dishes. We also collaborate with local artisans to showcase their work within the restaurant, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. Furthermore, we participate in local events and festivals, promoting Assamese culture and cuisine to both residents and visitors.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, JholoeKiya envisions becoming the premier destination for experiential dining in Guwahati and a recognized champion of Assamese cuisine on a national stage. We plan to expand our menu to include even more diverse regional dishes and to introduce new interactive elements to further enhance the dining experience. We are also exploring opportunities to offer cooking classes and workshops, allowing guests to learn the secrets of Assamese cuisine firsthand. Furthermore, we plan to develop a line of artisanal food products featuring locally sourced ingredients, allowing guests to take a piece of JholoeKiya home with them. We are committed to sustainability and plan to implement eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting responsible tourism. Our long-term goal is to not only provide exceptional dining experiences but also to contribute to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culture and heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>JholoeKiya is more than just a restaurant; it''s a culinary ambassador, a cultural hub, and a vibrant part of the Guwahati community. We invite you to join us on a journey of discovery, where you can savor the flavors of Assam, immerse yourself in its rich culture, and create memories that will last a lifetime. We are confident that JholoeKiya will become synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and unforgettable dining experiences.</p>
</article>', 'The Greenwood Guwahati Dr. Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road Beltola, Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:00:16.000Z'),
