(1661, 'Naga flavour - Authentic Naga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p><b>Naga Flavour - Authentic Naga Restaurant: A Culinary Journey to the Heart of Nagaland in Guwahati</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Naga Flavour, located on the 1st floor of Avtar Complex, Basistha Rd, Guwahati, isn''t just a restaurant; it''s an immersive cultural experience. It offers a genuine taste of Nagaland, bringing the distinct and vibrant flavors of the Naga hills to the heart of Assam. In a region rich with culinary diversity, Naga Flavour distinguishes itself by specializing solely in authentic Naga cuisine, filling a previously unmet demand for this unique culinary tradition. It stands as a beacon of Naga culture, offering both locals and tourists a chance to explore and appreciate the unique gastronomic heritage of the Naga people. Its presence enriches the local business landscape by introducing a distinctive dining option, contributing to the area''s culinary tapestry and attracting customers seeking adventurous and authentic food experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering is a comprehensive menu featuring traditional Naga dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring the freshest and most authentic flavors. Signature dishes include pork with akhuni (fermented soybean), bamboo shoot curry with fish, and various preparations of Naga dal, each reflecting the unique cooking styles and ingredients of different Naga tribes. Naga Flavour also offers a selection of traditional rice beers, complementing the spicy and flavorful dishes. What sets Naga Flavour apart is not just the food itself, but the entire dining experience. We prioritize the use of traditional cooking methods, often employing open fire and bamboo steaming to impart distinct smoky and earthy notes to the dishes. This commitment to authenticity, coupled with the use of unique ingredients sourced from or inspired by Nagaland, offers a dining experience unmatched by other restaurants in the area. We also offer catering services for small events, allowing customers to share the unique taste of Nagaland with their friends and family. This caters to the local market''s desire for unique and authentic experiences, providing a welcome alternative to standard restaurant fare.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Naga Flavour, customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where guests feel comfortable exploring the unfamiliar tastes of Naga cuisine. Our staff is trained not only to provide efficient and friendly service but also to educate customers about the dishes, their origins, and cultural significance. We actively engage with the local community through participation in food festivals and cultural events, showcasing Naga cuisine and promoting cross-cultural understanding. We also prioritize building relationships with local suppliers, supporting small businesses and ensuring the freshest ingredients. Regular feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience and menu offerings, ensuring that Naga Flavour remains a vibrant and responsive member of the Guwahati community. We believe that the best way to connect with the local community is through genuine interaction and a shared appreciation for culture and cuisine.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Naga Flavour envisions itself as the premier destination for authentic Naga cuisine in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to showcase an even wider variety of dishes from different Naga tribes, offering cooking classes to share the art of Naga cooking, and potentially opening additional locations within Assam and other major cities. A key focus will be on sustainable practices, including sourcing ingredients responsibly and minimizing environmental impact. The business also aims to become a platform for promoting Naga culture, showcasing traditional music, art, and handicrafts within the restaurant. Long-term goals include establishing partnerships with Naga farmers and producers, ensuring a stable supply of authentic ingredients and supporting the economic development of Nagaland. Naga Flavour strives to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural ambassador, fostering appreciation for the rich heritage of Nagaland and creating a lasting positive impact on both the local community and the broader culinary landscape.</p>', '1st floor Avtar Complex, Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:15:17.000Z'),
(1662, 'Gogoi Pork', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Gogoi Pork, situated prominently within the supermarket at Swapta Swahid Path, GS Rd, is a purveyor of high-quality pork products, deeply rooted in the culinary traditions of Assam. More than just a meat provider, Gogoi Pork strives to be a cornerstone of the local food culture, offering a range of products that cater to both everyday meals and festive celebrations. The business is committed to sourcing the finest local pork, ensuring freshness and contributing to the sustainability of regional agriculture. Located within a bustling supermarket, Gogoi Pork offers unparalleled accessibility for residents and visitors alike, making it a convenient stop for those seeking premium pork products. Our commitment to quality, coupled with our strategic location, positions Gogoi Pork as a significant player in the local food market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Gogoi Pork''s offerings is a diverse selection of fresh pork cuts, catering to a wide array of culinary needs. From succulent pork belly, perfect for traditional Assamese preparations like Khar, to lean cuts ideal for grilling or stir-frying, we provide options for every taste and recipe. Beyond fresh cuts, Gogoi Pork also offers processed pork products, including smoked sausages, bacon, and cured meats. These products are made using time-honored recipes and techniques, resulting in distinctive flavors that are both authentic and satisfying. A key differentiator for Gogoi Pork is its emphasis on locally sourced pork. We partner with regional farmers who adhere to ethical and sustainable farming practices, ensuring that our products are not only of the highest quality but also contribute to the well-being of the local economy. By prioritizing local sourcing, we minimize transportation distances, preserving freshness and reducing our environmental footprint. Gogoi Pork''s commitment to quality and local sourcing makes it the preferred choice for discerning customers seeking authentic and flavorful pork products.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Gogoi Pork understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to building lasting relationships with the community. Our staff is knowledgeable about our products, readily offering cooking suggestions and recipe ideas to customers. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel valued and supported. Beyond providing excellent service within our supermarket location, Gogoi Pork actively engages with the local community. We participate in local food festivals and events, showcasing our products and connecting with potential customers. We also collaborate with local chefs and restaurants, supplying them with our premium pork and supporting the regional culinary scene. By building strong relationships with both our customers and the broader community, Gogoi Pork aims to become a trusted and respected member of the local business landscape. We believe that our commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement sets us apart and fosters a sense of loyalty among our clientele.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Gogoi Pork envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded impact within the local market. Our immediate plans include expanding our product line to include more specialized pork cuts and value-added products, catering to evolving consumer preferences. We also aim to strengthen our relationships with local farmers, ensuring a consistent supply of high-quality pork and supporting sustainable agricultural practices. A key element of our future vision is to enhance our brand presence and customer reach. We plan to leverage digital marketing strategies to connect with a wider audience, promoting our products and highlighting our commitment to quality and local sourcing. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of establishing a direct-to-consumer online platform, offering convenient access to our products for customers throughout the region. Ultimately, Gogoi Pork aspires to be recognized as the leading provider of premium pork products in Assam, known for its unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. Our long-term goal is to not only grow our business but also contribute to the prosperity of the local economy and the preservation of Assam''s rich culinary heritage.</p>', 'supermarket, Swapta Swahid Path, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:15:23.000Z'),
(1663, 'Leaf Deck Café', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Leaf Deck Café: A Refreshing Oasis on GS Road, Guwahati

Leaf Deck Café stands as a vibrant addition to Guwahati''s burgeoning café culture, offering a unique blend of culinary delights and a tranquil ambiance right on GS Road, opposite GTAC. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, Leaf Deck is designed to be a community hub, a place where friends can connect, professionals can unwind, and everyone can enjoy a moment of respite from the city''s hustle. Nestled in a prime location, the café aims to distinguish itself not only through its quality offerings but also through a commitment to creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. Recognizing the increasing demand for quality leisure spaces in Guwahati, Leaf Deck strives to fill the gap by providing a comfortable and stylish setting for social interaction and relaxation.

<br> <br>

At its core, Leaf Deck Café offers a comprehensive menu designed to cater to diverse palates. Our primary offerings encompass a curated selection of artisanal coffees, expertly brewed using locally sourced beans whenever possible, supporting Assam''s rich coffee heritage. Beyond coffee, we present a variety of refreshing beverages, including handcrafted teas, smoothies, and mocktails, perfect for the Guwahati climate. The food menu complements our drinks selection with a range of savory and sweet options. From light bites like sandwiches, wraps, and salads, perfect for a quick lunch, to more substantial dishes like pasta and continental options, we aim to satisfy a wide spectrum of culinary preferences. Our pastries and desserts are made fresh daily, offering a tempting indulgence for those with a sweet tooth.

<br> <br>

What sets Leaf Deck Café apart is its commitment to providing a unique and locally relevant experience. We prioritize using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers. Our menu also incorporates Assamese flavors and ingredients, subtly weaving in regional culinary traditions to create a distinctive identity. The café’s ambiance is carefully curated to provide a relaxing and inviting atmosphere. The interior design incorporates natural elements, creating a sense of calm and tranquility. Comfortable seating arrangements, coupled with soft lighting and soothing music, further enhance the overall experience. We also offer free Wi-Fi, making Leaf Deck an ideal spot for students, remote workers, and anyone looking to stay connected.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of Leaf Deck Café''s philosophy. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. We strive to create a genuine connection with our customers, remembering their preferences and anticipating their needs. Building relationships within the local community is also a priority. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, partnering with nearby organizations to support community causes. We also host regular events at the café, such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and workshops, creating a vibrant and engaging space for the local community to come together. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the café itself. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. We are also responsive to online reviews and comments, addressing any concerns promptly and professionally.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Leaf Deck Café envisions becoming a cornerstone of the GS Road community, known for its quality offerings, exceptional service, and commitment to local values. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more innovative and seasonal dishes, showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine. We also aim to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and craftsmen to showcase their work at the café, providing a platform for them to reach a wider audience. Long-term, we aspire to expand our presence beyond the current location, opening new branches in other parts of Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam, while maintaining the same commitment to quality, community, and exceptional customer service that defines Leaf Deck Café. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, Leaf Deck can become a leading café brand in Assam, contributing to the region''s vibrant culinary landscape.', 'GS Rd, opp. GTAC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:15:30.000Z'),
(1664, 'Kori''s', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Kori''s: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati

Kori''s, located at Kori''s Cafe & Restro, 2nd Floor, R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opp. S.B.I Bank, is more than just a cafe and restaurant; it''s a destination. Nestled in the vibrant Jonali Path area of Guwahati, Assam, Kori''s offers a unique blend of delectable cuisine, a welcoming ambiance, and exceptional service, establishing itself as a key player in the local food and beverage sector. In a region known for its rich culinary heritage and burgeoning cafe culture, Kori''s stands out by providing a modern, elevated dining experience while remaining deeply connected to the community it serves. The establishment aims to be a place where locals and visitors alike can gather, connect, and savor memorable moments over delightful food and drinks.

