Looking to the future, Kori''s has significant potential for growth and expansion. Plans may include expanding the menu to include seasonal specials, introducing a loyalty program to reward regular customers, or offering catering services for local events. Another potential avenue for growth could be establishing an online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, thereby reaching a wider audience and increasing accessibility. Long-term goals may involve opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati or even expanding to other cities in Assam. Kori''s could also consider partnering with local farmers and producers to source ingredients sustainably and support the local economy. By staying true to its core values of quality, customer service, and community engagement, Kori''s aims to solidify its position as a leading cafe and restaurant in the region and continue to delight customers for years to come.', 'kori''s cafe & restro, 2nd Floor, R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opp. S.B.I Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:15:36.000Z'),
(1665, 'Kerala Bhavan', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Kerala Bhavan, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a vibrant testament to the rich culinary and cultural heritage of Kerala. More than just a restaurant, Kerala Bhavan is a cultural bridge, bringing authentic Kerala flavors and traditions to the diverse palate of Assam. In a region renowned for its own distinct culinary identity, Kerala Bhavan has carved a niche for itself by offering a genuine and immersive Kerala experience, contributing significantly to the expanding culinary diversity of the city.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Kerala Bhavan''s core offering revolves around authentic Kerala cuisine. The menu boasts a wide array of dishes, from the ever-popular appam and stew to the flavorful fish curries cooked in traditional clay pots, using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Seafood, a cornerstone of Kerala cuisine, features prominently, with preparations ranging from spicy prawn masala to delicate fish moilee. Vegetarian options are equally abundant, showcasing the diverse range of vegetables and spices used in Kerala cooking. The restaurant also offers traditional Kerala snacks and sweets, providing a complete culinary journey. A key differentiator is the restaurant''s commitment to using authentic Kerala recipes and cooking techniques, ensuring a genuine taste of the region. This authenticity is further enhanced by sourcing spices and other key ingredients directly from Kerala, preserving the integrity of the flavors. This attention to detail and commitment to authenticity are major selling points, appealing to both Keralites residing in Assam and locals eager to explore new culinary horizons. Kerala Bhavan effectively addresses the market need for authentic regional cuisine and provides a refreshing alternative to the more common restaurant offerings in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Kerala Bhavan, customer experience is paramount. The restaurant strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, reminiscent of a traditional Kerala home. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and to provide attentive and personalized service. The ambiance is carefully curated to evoke the spirit of Kerala, with subtle décor elements reflecting the state''s rich culture. What truly sets Kerala Bhavan apart is its dedication to fostering a sense of community. The restaurant regularly hosts cultural events, showcasing Kerala dance, music, and art, providing a platform for cultural exchange and celebrating the shared heritage of Kerala and Assam. Furthermore, Kerala Bhavan actively participates in local festivals and community initiatives, strengthening its ties to the community and solidifying its position as a valuable cultural asset in Guwahati. The restaurant also caters to specific dietary needs and preferences, ensuring that every guest feels comfortable and catered to. Feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience and maintain the highest standards of customer satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Kerala Bhavan envisions expanding its reach and impact within the local business landscape. Plans include introducing a wider range of Kerala dishes, including regional specialties and seasonal offerings, to further diversify the menu and cater to evolving customer preferences. There is also potential for expanding the restaurant''s catering services, bringing authentic Kerala cuisine to events and gatherings throughout Guwahati. Another key area of focus is strengthening partnerships with local suppliers and farmers, promoting sustainable practices and supporting the local economy. The long-term goal is to establish Kerala Bhavan as the premier destination for authentic Kerala cuisine and cultural experiences in Assam. Further, there are considerations to expand into related areas such as offering Kerala cooking classes to share the culinary traditions with a wider audience and potentially establishing a small retail outlet selling Kerala spices, snacks, and handicrafts. By consistently delivering exceptional food, impeccable service, and a genuine cultural experience, Kerala Bhavan aims to solidify its position as a beloved and respected business in the Guwahati community, contributing to the city''s vibrant culinary scene and fostering a deeper appreciation for the diverse cultural heritage of India.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.336Z', '2025-12-07T09:20:09.000Z'),
(1666, 'Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road, situated on the 4th Floor of Adityam Building on GS Road, offers an authentic Rajasthani dining experience, reimagined for the vibrant palate of Guwahati. More than just a restaurant, Ghoomar is a culinary journey, transporting guests to the heart of Rajasthan with its meticulously crafted thalis, warm hospitality, and commitment to preserving the rich traditions of Rajasthani cuisine. In a city known for its diverse culinary influences, Ghoomar stands out as a beacon of authentic regional Indian flavors, providing a unique and memorable dining experience that resonates with locals and visitors alike. It distinguishes itself not only through the quality of its food but also through its commitment to cultural representation and elevated service, making it a significant and cherished part of the GS Road business landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of Ghoomar’s offering is the traditional Rajasthani Thali. This isn''t merely a plate of food; it''s a carefully curated ensemble of dishes, each representing a different facet of Rajasthani culinary artistry. From the savory Dal Baati Churma to the spicy Gatte ki Sabzi and the sweet notes of Moong Dal Halwa, every element is prepared with authentic recipes and high-quality ingredients. The restaurant emphasizes using locally sourced produce whenever possible to ensure freshness and support local farmers, while adhering to traditional cooking methods to maintain the authenticity of the flavors. What truly sets Ghoomar apart is its unwavering commitment to providing an all-you-can-eat thali experience, allowing guests to savor a wide variety of dishes and explore the diverse flavors of Rajasthan without limitations. This abundance, coupled with the dedication to authentic taste, fills a significant need in the local market, catering to customers who appreciate both value and quality in their dining experiences. Additionally, Ghoomar offers a selection of Rajasthani beverages and snacks to complement the thali, further enriching the overall dining experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road believes that exceptional food should be accompanied by exceptional service. The restaurant cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where guests are treated with genuine Rajasthani hospitality. Staff members are trained to be attentive, knowledgeable about the menu, and eager to cater to individual preferences and dietary requirements. The restaurant understands that many diners might be unfamiliar with Rajasthani cuisine, and therefore, the staff are adept at explaining the dishes and offering recommendations. Beyond impeccable service, Ghoomar strives to connect with the local community by participating in local events and festivals, showcasing Rajasthani culture through food. Special thalis are occasionally introduced to celebrate specific occasions or seasons, adding an element of novelty and excitement for regular patrons. By fostering a sense of community and cultural exchange, Ghoomar establishes itself as more than just a restaurant; it becomes a cultural ambassador, promoting the rich heritage of Rajasthan within the heart of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. While maintaining its core commitment to authentic Rajasthani cuisine and exceptional service, the restaurant plans to explore opportunities to broaden its reach and impact. This could involve expanding to new locations within Guwahati or even exploring other cities in the region. Future plans may also include introducing new dishes and variations on the traditional thali to cater to evolving tastes and preferences. Furthermore, Ghoomar aims to enhance its online presence through online ordering and delivery services, making it even more accessible to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Ghoomar as the premier destination for authentic Rajasthani cuisine in the region, renowned for its quality, service, and commitment to cultural preservation. By continuously innovating and adapting while staying true to its core values, Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road is poised for continued success and a lasting legacy in the Assam culinary landscape.</p>', '4th Floor, Adityam Building, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:20:14.000Z'),
(1667, 'Black bird (the local kitchen)', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Black bird (the local kitchen) is a culinary gem nestled in the heart of Assam, dedicated to showcasing the rich and diverse flavors of Assamese cuisine with a modern twist. More than just a restaurant, Black bird is a celebration of local ingredients, traditional recipes passed down through generations, and the vibrant culture of the region. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, providing a unique dining experience that delights both residents and visitors alike. Black bird stands out by offering authentic Assamese dishes prepared with a contemporary approach, elevating traditional fare to new heights while remaining true to its roots.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing an authentic and unforgettable Assamese culinary journey. We specialize in dishes crafted from locally sourced produce, meats, and spices, ensuring freshness and supporting the region''s farmers and producers. Our menu features a range of traditional Assamese delicacies, from the tangy and flavorful <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry) to the savory and aromatic <i>Khar</i> (alkaline dish), each prepared with meticulous attention to detail and using time-honored techniques. A signature element of Black bird is our commitment to innovative presentations. We take pride in presenting traditional dishes in modern, visually appealing ways, enhancing the overall dining experience. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to bridge the gap between authentic Assamese flavors and contemporary culinary aesthetics, appealing to both traditionalists and adventurous palates. We also offer a selection of refreshing local beverages, including Assamese tea and homemade fruit juices, complementing the food and further immersing our guests in the region''s culinary heritage. Black bird addresses a growing demand for authentic Assamese cuisine in a market often dominated by other regional and international options. We cater to individuals seeking a genuine taste of Assam, as well as tourists eager to explore the region''s rich culinary traditions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Black bird, we prioritize creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels like family. Our approach to customer service is rooted in genuine hospitality and personalized attention. Our staff is not only knowledgeable about our menu and ingredients but also passionate about sharing the stories behind each dish, providing diners with insights into Assamese culture and culinary traditions. We believe in building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and loyalty. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local food festivals and events, showcasing our culinary expertise and promoting Assamese cuisine to a wider audience. We also collaborate with local artists and artisans to decorate our space, creating an ambiance that reflects the region''s artistic heritage. Black bird is more than just a place to eat; it''s a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and experience the true essence of Assam. We achieve this by ensuring that the setting of the physical restaurant supports the overall food and service excellence, creating an atmosphere that is both modern and welcoming.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Black bird envisions becoming a leading advocate for Assamese cuisine on a regional and potentially national scale. Our future plans involve expanding our menu to include even more diverse and lesser-known Assamese dishes, further enriching the culinary experience we offer. We aim to establish partnerships with local farmers and producers to source an even greater percentage of our ingredients locally, strengthening our commitment to sustainability and supporting the local economy. We are also exploring opportunities to offer cooking classes and workshops, sharing our knowledge and passion for Assamese cuisine with aspiring cooks and food enthusiasts. Furthermore, we envision expanding our reach through catering services and online ordering, making our authentic Assamese fare accessible to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to establish Black bird as a cultural ambassador for Assam, promoting its unique culinary heritage and contributing to the region''s economic growth. We plan to explore the potential for opening additional locations, carefully selecting sites that align with our brand values and commitment to quality. By continuously innovating, embracing sustainability, and fostering strong community ties, Black bird aims to remain a vibrant and integral part of the Assam business landscape for years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:20:21.000Z'),
(1668, 'Kimchi Eonni', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Kimchi Eonni: Bringing Authentic Korean Flavors to Shanti Path

Kimchi Eonni, located at NO:18, Shanti Path, next to PRAPTI MART, is a culinary gem bringing the vibrant and authentic tastes of Korean cuisine to the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant, Kimchi Eonni is a cultural bridge, offering a unique dining experience that resonates with the local palate while introducing the richness and diversity of Korean culinary traditions. In a region known for its diverse culinary landscape, Kimchi Eonni distinguishes itself by specializing in authentic Korean dishes prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients, filling a niche for those seeking genuine international flavors. We strive to be a beloved community hub, a place where people can gather, enjoy delicious food, and experience a taste of Korea.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing an extensive menu of traditional Korean dishes, with a particular emphasis on the namesake, Kimchi. We offer a variety of Kimchi preparations, from the classic Napa cabbage Kimchi to other regional and seasonal variations. Beyond Kimchi, our menu features popular Korean staples such as Bibimbap (mixed rice with vegetables and meat), Bulgogi (marinated grilled beef), Japchae (glass noodles with vegetables), Tteokbokki (spicy rice cakes), and a selection of comforting Korean soups and stews like Kimchi Jjigae (Kimchi stew) and Sundubu Jjigae (soft tofu stew). We also cater to vegetarian and vegan preferences with thoughtfully crafted plant-based options.

<br> <br>

What sets Kimchi Eonni apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity. We source many of our ingredients directly, ensuring that the flavors are true to their Korean origins. We also take pride in our preparation methods, using traditional techniques passed down through generations. Our unique selling point lies in offering a truly immersive culinary experience, allowing customers to explore the depth and complexity of Korean cuisine beyond the familiar. By using locally sourced vegetables, where possible, we contribute to the local economy and ensure the freshness of our dishes. We also address the local market needs by offering customizable spice levels, ensuring our dishes are enjoyable for every palate. We are aware of the Assamese preference for specific flavors and ingredients, and we carefully balance authenticity with regional preferences to cater to our diverse clientele.

<br> <br>

At Kimchi Eonni, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a guest walks through our door, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality, embodying the spirit of "Eonni," which translates to "older sister" in Korean – a term of endearment and respect. Our staff is knowledgeable and passionate about Korean cuisine, ready to guide customers through the menu, explain the dishes, and offer recommendations based on their preferences. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where customers feel like they are dining in a Korean home.

<br> <br>

We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, organizing culinary workshops, and collaborating with other local businesses. We believe in fostering a sense of community and cultural exchange through food. We also encourage feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our menu and service. Our commitment to providing a personalized and attentive experience has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish ourselves as a trusted and respected member of the Shanti Path community.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Kimchi Eonni envisions expanding its reach and becoming a leading destination for Korean cuisine in Assam. Our plans include introducing new and exciting dishes to our menu, expanding our seating capacity, and exploring the possibility of offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to a wider audience. We also aim to develop a line of signature Kimchi and Korean sauces for retail sale, allowing customers to enjoy the flavors of Kimchi Eonni in their own homes.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goals include establishing Kimchi Eonni as a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Korean food and exceptional customer service. We also hope to contribute to the cultural landscape of Assam by promoting cross-cultural understanding and appreciation through culinary experiences. By staying true to our values of authenticity, quality, and community engagement, Kimchi Eonni is committed to achieving sustainable growth and solidifying its position as a beloved and cherished establishment in the local business landscape, a place where the warmth of Korean hospitality meets the vibrant spirit of Assam.', 'NO:18, Shanti Path, next to PRAPTI MART', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:20:29.000Z'),
(1669, 'Sura Vie', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Sura Vie, situated on the 4th floor of The Hub Mall, GS Rd, presents a sophisticated and contemporary experience in Guwahati''s evolving hospitality sector. More than just a destination, Sura Vie aims to be a landmark, offering a unique blend of culinary artistry, premium beverages, and an ambiance that resonates with both local sensibilities and international standards. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and growing cosmopolitan outlook, Sura Vie distinguishes itself by creating a space where tradition meets modernity, providing an elevated dining and social experience unlike any other in the immediate vicinity.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Sura Vie offers a diverse range of services centered around providing a high-quality dining and beverage experience. The culinary offerings feature a curated menu designed to appeal to a wide range of palates. It encompasses both regional specialties prepared with locally sourced ingredients and internationally inspired dishes, all crafted with meticulous attention to detail. Complementing the food menu is an extensive beverage program that includes a carefully selected array of wines, spirits, and craft cocktails. The bar program focuses on both classic concoctions and innovative, signature drinks designed to be memorable and flavorful. What sets Sura Vie apart is its commitment to quality and presentation. Each dish and drink is thoughtfully prepared and presented, demonstrating a passion for culinary excellence. This commitment directly addresses the local market''s growing desire for sophisticated and high-quality dining options that go beyond the ordinary. The intent is to deliver not merely sustenance, but a full sensory experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Sura Vie. From the moment a guest enters, the focus is on creating a welcoming and attentive environment. The staff are trained to provide personalized service, anticipating needs and ensuring that every visit is memorable. The ambiance of the space itself contributes significantly to the customer experience. The interior design reflects a modern aesthetic, incorporating comfortable seating, stylish decor, and carefully curated lighting to create a sophisticated and inviting atmosphere. The attention to detail extends to the background music and the overall energy of the space, fostering a sense of relaxed elegance. But what truly connects Sura Vie with the local community is a commitment to fostering relationships. The establishment aims to be a gathering place for friends, colleagues, and families. This is achieved through hosting special events, showcasing local artists, and actively participating in community initiatives. The goal is to be more than just a business; it''s about being a contributing member of the local fabric, fostering a sense of belonging and shared experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Sura Vie envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. The initial goal is to solidify its position as the premier dining and social destination in the Hub Mall area and the broader Guwahati region. This involves continuously refining the menu, enhancing the customer experience, and expanding the beverage program. Future plans may include introducing themed nights, live music performances, and collaborative events with local businesses and organizations. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand to other strategic locations within Assam and potentially beyond. This expansion would be carefully planned and executed to maintain the quality and consistency that define the Sura Vie brand. The ultimate vision is to establish Sura Vie as a recognized and respected name synonymous with exceptional dining, impeccable service, and a commitment to enriching the local community.</p>', '4th floor, The Hub Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:20:35.000Z'),
(1670, 'Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant is a newly established culinary destination, poised to become a cornerstone of the dining scene in the heart of Assam. Located in a strategically chosen area known for its vibrant community and increasing foot traffic, Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular regional and international dishes, served within a welcoming and family-friendly atmosphere. In a region rich with culinary tradition, our restaurant aims to elevate the dining experience by prioritizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients, innovative menu options, and exceptional customer service. We are committed to not just providing meals, but creating memorable experiences that cater to the diverse palates and social needs of the local community. The restaurant recognizes the importance of adapting to the evolving preferences of its customers, ensuring a consistently relevant and appealing offering in the competitive hospitality sector.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant, our core offering revolves around providing a comprehensive dining experience that caters to a wide range of tastes and preferences. Our menu is carefully curated to feature a harmonious blend of traditional Assamese delicacies, prepared using time-honored recipes and the freshest local ingredients, alongside a selection of familiar Indian favorites and carefully chosen continental dishes. This ensures that both local patrons seeking authentic flavors and visitors exploring the region''s cuisine can find something to delight their palate. Beyond the diverse menu, a key unique selling point lies in our commitment to showcasing the culinary heritage of Assam. We actively seek out and incorporate seasonal ingredients sourced directly from local farmers and producers, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the highest quality and freshness in our dishes. The bar area offers a selection of locally brewed beers and carefully selected wines, complementing the food menu and providing a relaxed social setting. For families, we provide a dedicated children''s menu with healthy and appealing options, along with a safe and comfortable environment that allows parents to relax and enjoy their meals. Furthermore, the restaurant offers catering services for local events and gatherings, bringing our culinary expertise directly to the community. This multifaceted approach ensures that Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant meets the diverse dining needs of the local market, catering to individuals, families, and corporate clients alike.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant''s operational philosophy. We believe that exceptional service is just as important as the quality of our food. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where customers can relax, connect with friends and family, and enjoy a memorable dining experience. To further enhance customer satisfaction, we actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We are deeply committed to connecting with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local cultural events, partnering with local businesses, and participating in charitable activities. We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our neighbors and contributing to the well-being of the community. Regular themed evenings and special promotions are planned to create a lively and engaging atmosphere, further fostering a sense of community and encouraging repeat visits. We are dedicated to creating a space where people feel a sense of belonging and can come together to celebrate the vibrant culture and culinary traditions of Assam. This community-centric approach, combined with exceptional service and high-quality food, sets Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant apart as a truly special dining destination.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant envisions itself as a leading culinary institution in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more of the region''s diverse culinary heritage, while also incorporating modern culinary techniques and trends. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to ensure a consistent supply of fresh, high-quality ingredients and support sustainable agricultural practices. Expansion is also a key element of our future vision. We aim to open additional branches in other strategic locations within Assam, bringing our unique dining experience to a wider audience. We also plan to invest in technology to streamline our operations, enhance customer service, and improve efficiency. This includes implementing online ordering and reservation systems, as well as utilizing data analytics to better understand customer preferences and tailor our offerings accordingly. Furthermore, we are committed to developing our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service and contribute to the success of the business. Ultimately, our goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional dining experiences but also makes a positive contribution to the local community and the culinary landscape of Assam. We strive to become a destination that locals are proud of and that visitors seek out to experience the authentic flavors and warm hospitality of the region.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:25:10.000Z'),
(1671, 'John Chang''s Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>John Chang''s Kitchen, nestled at 5Q5F+RMH, GS Rd, stands as a vibrant testament to the fusion of authentic Assamese culinary traditions and modern dining experiences. More than just a restaurant, it is a destination that celebrates the rich flavors of Assam, offering a carefully curated menu that showcases the region''s diverse culinary heritage. Located in a bustling area, John Chang''s Kitchen offers a welcome respite, inviting patrons to savor both familiar comforts and exciting new tastes, contributing uniquely to the Assam business landscape by promoting local ingredients and culinary practices.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of John Chang''s Kitchen lies its dedication to serving exceptional Assamese cuisine. The core offering revolves around providing authentic and innovative dishes that reflect the diverse regional flavors. From the classic Khar, a signature alkaline dish known for its unique taste and digestive properties, to the flavorful Masor Tenga, a sour fish curry, the menu is a journey through Assam''s culinary landscape. Alongside traditional favorites, the kitchen also offers creative interpretations of local ingredients, introducing dishes that blend familiar tastes with modern culinary techniques. A significant unique selling point is the emphasis on sourcing fresh, locally grown produce whenever possible, ensuring quality and supporting local farmers. This commitment to local sourcing not only enhances the flavor profiles of the dishes but also directly addresses the growing demand for sustainable and ethically produced food within the community. The menu caters to a wide range of palates, including vegetarian and non-vegetarian options, ensuring there is something for everyone to enjoy. By highlighting the unique and often underrepresented flavors of Assam, John Chang''s Kitchen fills a crucial gap in the local market, providing a platform for the region''s culinary heritage to be appreciated and celebrated.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at John Chang''s Kitchen. The approach is centered on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Attentive and knowledgeable staff are trained to provide personalized recommendations and insights into the menu, enriching the dining experience with stories and context about the dishes. Beyond the exceptional food, the ambiance plays a crucial role in setting John Chang''s Kitchen apart. The décor reflects the cultural richness of Assam, with subtle nods to local art and craftsmanship. This dedication to creating a culturally immersive experience fosters a strong connection with the local community. John Chang''s Kitchen actively engages with local events and initiatives, participating in food festivals and collaborating with local artisans. This commitment to community involvement demonstrates a genuine desire to be more than just a restaurant; it strives to be a gathering place, a cultural hub, and a contributing member of the local ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for John Chang''s Kitchen is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and continued contribution to the Assam culinary scene. Expansion plans may include introducing new menu items that further explore the region''s diverse ingredients and cooking styles, perhaps incorporating lesser-known delicacies and traditional cooking methods. Exploring opportunities for catering services and partnerships with local businesses could broaden the reach and impact of the brand. A long-term goal is to establish John Chang''s Kitchen as a leading advocate for sustainable food practices in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize local sourcing and ethical food production. Educational initiatives, such as cooking workshops and culinary tours, could further promote awareness of Assamese cuisine and its cultural significance. Ultimately, the vision is to solidify John Chang''s Kitchen''s position as a culinary landmark, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and its contribution to the vibrancy of the local community and the broader Assam region.</p>', '5Q5F+RMH, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:25:16.000Z'),
(1672, 'Souka Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Souka Restaurant, a vibrant culinary establishment located at the heart of Guwahati''s bustling Paltan Bazaar, offers an authentic taste of Assam blended with contemporary flavors. More than just a restaurant, Souka is a celebration of Assam''s rich cultural heritage, expressed through its cuisine, ambiance, and commitment to community engagement. Situated amidst the commercial hub, Souka provides a welcome respite for locals and tourists alike, offering a refined dining experience that captures the essence of Assam’s culinary traditions. Souka seeks to be a landmark destination, a place where stories are shared, traditions are savored, and culinary memories are created.
<br> <br>
Souka Restaurant''s core offering revolves around providing an elevated dining experience centered on authentic Assamese cuisine with creative twists. The menu features a diverse array of traditional dishes, carefully prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Signature dishes include *Masor Tenga*, a tangy fish curry known for its distinctive sour flavor, *Khar*, a unique dish made with alkaline extract and various vegetables or meat, and *Pitha*, a range of traditional rice cakes and sweets. Souka differentiates itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, innovative presentation, and a modern interpretation of classic Assamese recipes. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to bridge the gap between traditional flavors and contemporary palates, appealing to both seasoned connoisseurs of Assamese cuisine and those new to the region''s culinary delights. The menu also features carefully curated options for vegetarian and vegan diners, ensuring inclusivity and catering to diverse dietary preferences. By partnering with local farmers and suppliers, Souka supports the local economy and ensures the freshness and quality of its ingredients, contributing to a sustainable food ecosystem.
<br> <br>
At Souka Restaurant, customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The ambiance is carefully curated to reflect Assam’s cultural heritage, featuring traditional Assamese decor, soothing music, and comfortable seating arrangements. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about sharing the stories behind each dish. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where guests feel valued and appreciated. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience. Beyond the restaurant walls, Souka actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and offering cooking workshops that showcase Assamese cuisine. Souka believes in building strong relationships with its neighbors and contributing to the vibrant cultural tapestry of Guwahati. Special events and themed nights celebrating Assamese festivals are regularly organized, further solidifying Souka''s commitment to preserving and promoting local traditions.
<br> <br>
Souka Restaurant envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional customer service, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties from across Assam, introducing a line of packaged Assamese spices and ingredients for customers to take home, and potentially opening additional locations in other major cities in the region. The long-term goal is to establish Souka as a national brand that represents the best of Assamese cuisine and culture, bringing the flavors and traditions of Assam to a wider audience. We plan to leverage digital marketing and social media to reach new customers and build brand awareness. Investment in staff training and development will remain a priority to ensure consistent quality and exceptional service across all aspects of the business. Souka is committed to sustainable practices and will continue to explore ways to minimize its environmental impact and support local communities. We also plan to explore collaborations with local artisans and craftsmen to showcase their work within the restaurant, further enhancing the cultural experience for our guests.
</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:25:21.000Z'),
(1673, 'TransCurry Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>TransCurry Restaurant: A Taste of Assam, Globally Inspired</p>

<br> <br>

<p>TransCurry Restaurant is a vibrant culinary destination situated at the heart of [Insert specific, even if general, location in Assam, e.g., “Guwahati''s bustling Ganeshguri area” or “a prime location on GS Road”]. More than just a restaurant, TransCurry is a celebration of Assam''s rich culinary heritage, infused with global influences to create a unique and unforgettable dining experience. In a region renowned for its distinctive flavors and warm hospitality, TransCurry stands out by skillfully blending traditional Assamese ingredients and cooking techniques with innovative international approaches. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, contributing to the region''s cultural vibrancy and economic growth by providing exceptional food and service, while creating a welcoming space for locals and visitors alike.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing authentic Assamese cuisine with a contemporary twist. Our menu features classic dishes like <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry), <i>Khar</i> (an alkaline dish made with dried banana peels), and a variety of bamboo shoot preparations, all prepared with the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. What sets TransCurry apart is our commitment to innovation. We don''t simply replicate traditional recipes; we reimagine them. Our chefs experiment with global culinary techniques and flavor profiles to create innovative dishes that complement and enhance the inherent qualities of Assamese cuisine. For example, we might offer a <i>Masor Tenga</i> inspired broth with seared scallops or a <i>Khar</i> risotto with Parmesan cheese and truffle oil. We also offer a selection of international dishes, carefully curated to complement our Assamese offerings and cater to diverse palates. Vegetarian and vegan options are thoughtfully developed and prominently featured, reflecting our commitment to catering to all dietary preferences. Our carefully curated beverage menu features local teas, artisanal cocktails inspired by Assamese fruits and spices, and a selection of wines and beers from around the world. This diverse and innovative approach directly addresses the needs of the local market, which seeks both authentic regional flavors and globally inspired dining experiences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At TransCurry, we believe that exceptional food is only part of the dining experience. Our approach to customer service is centered around creating a warm, welcoming, and personalized atmosphere. From the moment guests enter our doors, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and passionate about the food and culture they represent. We strive to anticipate our guests'' needs and exceed their expectations, whether it''s offering a recommendation based on their preferences or accommodating specific dietary requests. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, and partnering with local artists and artisans to showcase their work in our restaurant. We regularly host cultural events, such as traditional Assamese music performances and cooking demonstrations, to further connect with the community and promote the region''s rich heritage. We actively solicit feedback from our customers through online reviews, in-house surveys, and direct interactions, using this feedback to continuously improve our service and offerings. Our commitment to providing a memorable and authentic Assamese experience has earned us a loyal following and a reputation as a beloved local establishment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, TransCurry envisions becoming a recognized and respected culinary ambassador for Assam on a national and even international stage. Our growth strategy focuses on several key areas. We plan to expand our restaurant''s footprint, potentially opening additional locations in other major cities in Assam and beyond. We also intend to develop a line of packaged Assamese food products, such as spice blends, sauces, and ready-to-eat meals, to make the flavors of Assam more accessible to a wider audience. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with other businesses in the tourism and hospitality sectors to create immersive Assamese cultural experiences. Furthermore, we plan to invest in culinary training programs to nurture and develop local talent, ensuring that the next generation of chefs is equipped to preserve and innovate Assamese cuisine. Our long-term goal is to establish TransCurry as a leading brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional quality, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. We believe that by staying true to our roots, embracing innovation, and prioritizing our customers and community, we can achieve this vision and contribute to the continued growth and prosperity of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:25:28.000Z'),
(1674, 'The Root Barrel', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Located on the 7th Floor of Exotica Greens, The Root Barrel is a dynamic and innovative venture poised to reshape the business landscape of Assam. More than just a business, The Root Barrel represents a commitment to fostering local talent, promoting sustainable practices, and providing exceptional services to a rapidly growing community. Nestled within a modern, accessible location, it seeks to be a central hub for connection, innovation, and growth within the region.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The Root Barrel operates as a multifaceted establishment, offering a carefully curated blend of co-working spaces, artisanal coffee, and locally sourced produce. At its core, the business provides premium, flexible co-working solutions designed to meet the evolving needs of freelancers, startups, and established businesses. These spaces are thoughtfully designed to inspire creativity, foster collaboration, and enhance productivity, featuring high-speed internet, ergonomic furniture, private meeting rooms, and state-of-the-art technology. Supplementing the co-working environment is a sophisticated café offering specialty coffee crafted from locally sourced beans. By partnering directly with Assam''s coffee growers, The Root Barrel provides not only a unique and flavorful experience but also supports local agriculture and sustainable farming practices. Further enriching the offering is a selection of seasonal, locally sourced produce. This conscious effort to connect consumers with the region’s rich agricultural heritage underscores the commitment to sustainability and community well-being. The unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of these three elements – co-working, coffee, and local produce – creating a vibrant ecosystem that supports local businesses, fosters innovation, and promotes a healthy lifestyle.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount to The Root Barrel''s success. The business prides itself on providing exceptional, personalized service to every individual who walks through its doors. The focus is on building genuine relationships with clients and fostering a strong sense of community. This is achieved through proactive engagement, attentive staff, and a welcoming atmosphere. Regular networking events, workshops, and community gatherings are organized to connect members, encourage collaboration, and celebrate local talent. The Root Barrel distinguishes itself through its dedication to supporting the local community. This is demonstrated not only through the sourcing of local produce and coffee but also through active participation in local initiatives and partnerships with community organizations. The Root Barrel actively solicits feedback from customers to continually refine its services and ensure that they are meeting the evolving needs of the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Root Barrel envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam region. The long-term goal is to establish itself as the premier destination for co-working, artisanal coffee, and local produce, becoming a symbol of innovation and community support. Future plans include expanding the co-working space to accommodate a growing membership base, developing partnerships with additional local farmers and artisans, and launching new initiatives that further promote sustainability and community engagement. Expansion may include opening new locations in other key areas of Assam, bringing The Root Barrel''s unique blend of services and community focus to a wider audience. Further, exploring opportunities to incorporate technology to streamline operations and enhance the customer experience is a crucial aspect of the vision. This involves implementing online booking systems, interactive community platforms, and data analytics to better understand customer needs and preferences. Ultimately, The Root Barrel aims to be more than just a business; it strives to be a catalyst for positive change, driving economic growth, promoting sustainable practices, and building a stronger, more vibrant community in Assam.</p>', '7th Floor, Exotica Greens', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:25:34.000Z'),
(1675, 'Red Hot Chilli Pepper', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Red Hot Chilli Pepper, situated at the vibrant location of 9, RG Baruah Rd, near Chariali, Guwahati, Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a culinary hotspot, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and innovative culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, Red Hot Chilli Pepper is a destination, a place where the rich heritage of Assam meets the modern palate. In the competitive landscape of Guwahati''s food scene, Red Hot Chilli Pepper stands out by offering an authentic, locally sourced, and artistically presented dining experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Red Hot Chilli Pepper''s offerings is a commitment to showcasing the diverse and flavorful cuisine of Assam. The restaurant''s core menu features a carefully curated selection of both traditional and contemporary dishes. Key offerings include signature Assamese thalis, showcasing regional specialties like *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry), *Khar* (alkaline dish), and a variety of locally sourced vegetable preparations. Beyond the traditional, the restaurant also features innovative dishes that blend local ingredients with international culinary techniques, catering to a more adventurous palate. Unique selling points include a focus on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients directly from Assam''s farms, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local agriculture. The restaurant also boasts a signature line of homemade pickles and chutneys, adding an extra layer of authentic Assamese flavor to the dining experience. These services directly address the local market''s growing demand for authentic, high-quality Assamese cuisine, presented in a modern and appealing way, and appeal to both local residents and tourists seeking an immersive culinary experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Red Hot Chilli Pepper. The restaurant strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel welcomed and valued. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every diner''s needs are met with efficiency and genuine hospitality. What sets Red Hot Chilli Pepper apart is its deep connection to the local community. The restaurant actively partners with local farmers and artisans, sourcing ingredients and products that showcase the region''s rich cultural heritage. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists and culinary workshops focusing on Assamese cuisine, are organized to further engage with the community and promote local talent. The restaurant also actively participates in local festivals and events, offering special menus and catering services to support community initiatives. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the customer experience but also strengthens Red Hot Chilli Pepper''s position as a valued member of the local business ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Red Hot Chilli Pepper is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth. The restaurant aims to expand its reach by opening additional locations within Assam and potentially beyond, bringing the flavors of Assam to a wider audience. Future plans include developing a line of packaged food products, such as pickles, chutneys, and spice blends, allowing customers to enjoy the flavors of Red Hot Chilli Pepper at home. The restaurant also intends to invest in culinary training programs for local youth, providing opportunities for them to develop valuable skills and contribute to the region''s culinary landscape. Long-term goals include establishing Red Hot Chilli Pepper as a leading advocate for sustainable tourism in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices and supporting local communities. By focusing on innovation, community engagement, and sustainable practices, Red Hot Chilli Pepper is poised to become a culinary institution in Assam, celebrated for its authentic flavors, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community.</p>', '9, RG Baruah Rd, near Chariali', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:30:08.000Z'),
(1676, 'YOKO Sizzlers - A Fine Dine Restaurant, City Center Guwahati', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>YOKO Sizzlers – A Fine Dine Restaurant, strategically situated on the 4th Floor of City Center Mall, Christian Basti, GS Rd, near International Hospital in Guwahati, represents a sophisticated addition to the city''s culinary scene. As a fine-dining establishment specializing in sizzlers, YOKO Sizzlers offers a distinctive and engaging dining experience that caters to the evolving tastes of Guwahati’s discerning clientele. Our restaurant distinguishes itself not only through the quality and diversity of its sizzler offerings but also through its commitment to exceptional service and a vibrant ambiance, contributing meaningfully to the local Assam business landscape by elevating the standard for casual and fine-dining options within the city center.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of YOKO Sizzlers’ appeal lies its diverse and meticulously crafted menu, centered around the sizzler concept. We offer a wide array of sizzlers, ranging from classic continental options featuring succulent grilled meats and seafood, to innovative vegetarian and regional Indian variations tailored to local palates. Each sizzler is prepared with the freshest, highest-quality ingredients, sourced both locally and internationally, and presented on a sizzling hot plate to deliver an unforgettable sensory experience. Beyond sizzlers, our menu also features a selection of appetizers, soups, salads, and desserts designed to complement the main courses and provide a complete and satisfying meal. A curated beverage list, including mocktails, juices, and a selection of wines and beers, further enhances the dining experience. The unique selling point of YOKO Sizzlers is the theatrical presentation of our dishes, the consistent high quality of ingredients, and the ability to customize sizzlers to individual preferences. This addresses the local market need for elevated dining experiences that offer both familiar flavors and exciting culinary innovations within a comfortable and accessible setting.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at YOKO Sizzlers. We are committed to providing impeccable service, delivered by a highly trained and attentive staff. From the moment guests enter the restaurant, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, ensuring a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. Our staff is knowledgeable about the menu and prepared to offer recommendations and accommodate dietary restrictions or preferences. We strive to create a personalized and memorable dining experience for each guest. Beyond the food and service, YOKO Sizzlers fosters a strong connection with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, and we strive to source ingredients from local suppliers whenever possible, supporting the local economy and reducing our environmental footprint. The restaurant also provides a venue for celebrating special occasions, offering customized menus and decorations for birthdays, anniversaries, and corporate events. We aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a gathering place that contributes positively to the social and cultural fabric of Guwahati.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for YOKO Sizzlers involves continued growth and expansion while maintaining our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. We plan to introduce seasonal menus featuring locally sourced ingredients, further enhancing the dining experience and supporting local farmers and producers. Exploring opportunities to expand our menu with more regional Assamese cuisine-inspired sizzlers will also be on the cards. We also envision expanding our presence within Guwahati and potentially to other cities in the Northeast region, bringing the YOKO Sizzlers experience to a wider audience. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that we maintain the high standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with our brand. Long-term, we aim to establish YOKO Sizzlers as a leading fine-dining destination in Guwahati and a recognizable name in the broader culinary landscape of Northeast India, renowned for its innovative cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community. We aim to become the preferred choice for those seeking a sophisticated and memorable dining experience.</p>', '4th Floor, City Center Mall Christian Basti, GS Rd, near International Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:30:13.000Z'),
(1677, 'Paaro Jodi Khaa', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Paaro Jodi Khaa, a name synonymous with quality and authenticity, stands proudly at 168, Jayanagar Rd, opposite to BPCL, serving the heart of Assam with its distinctive offerings. More than just a business, Paaro Jodi Khaa is a celebration of local flavors and traditions, thoughtfully curated to cater to the discerning palates of the community. Situated in a prime location, we are easily accessible and deeply ingrained in the fabric of Jayanagar, making us a familiar and trusted establishment in the local business ecosystem.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Paaro Jodi Khaa, our core offerings revolve around providing an unparalleled culinary experience rooted in Assamese cuisine. We specialize in two primary areas: traditional Assamese thalis and homemade Assamese delicacies. Our thalis are a carefully composed symphony of flavors, showcasing the diversity of Assamese culinary heritage. Each dish is prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, reflecting the region''s rich agricultural bounty. From the delicate *khar* to the spicy *masor tenga*, every element of the thali is meticulously crafted to deliver an authentic taste of Assam. Complementing our thalis are a range of homemade Assamese delicacies, including *pithas* (rice cakes), *larus* (sweet balls), and traditional sweets, all prepared with time-honored recipes passed down through generations. What sets Paaro Jodi Khaa apart is our unwavering commitment to quality, authenticity, and hygiene. We take immense pride in preserving the traditional methods of Assamese cooking, ensuring that every dish is a true reflection of its cultural origins. Furthermore, our dedication to using locally sourced ingredients not only guarantees freshness but also supports local farmers and producers, fostering a sustainable and mutually beneficial relationship within the community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Paaro Jodi Khaa. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and hospitable environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each visit is a memorable one. From the moment a customer walks through our doors, they are greeted with a genuine smile and a willingness to cater to their specific needs and preferences. We understand that food is not just about sustenance; it''s about connection, culture, and shared experiences. Therefore, we go the extra mile to create an atmosphere that fosters a sense of community and belonging. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorships, and partnerships with other businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us, and we are committed to playing an active role in its growth and development. Word-of-mouth referrals are our strongest testament to the positive experiences our customers have consistently enjoyed.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Paaro Jodi Khaa envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading provider of authentic Assamese cuisine. Our long-term goals include expanding our product offerings to cater to a wider range of tastes and preferences while remaining true to our core values of quality and authenticity. We are exploring opportunities to introduce new and innovative dishes that showcase the versatility of Assamese ingredients and culinary techniques. We also plan to enhance our online presence and explore opportunities for online ordering and delivery, making our products more accessible to customers beyond the immediate Jayanagar area. Another key aspect of our future vision is to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers and producers, creating a more sustainable and resilient supply chain. We are committed to supporting local agriculture and ensuring that our business practices are environmentally responsible. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the authentic taste of Paaro Jodi Khaa to a wider audience. We believe that by staying true to our roots, embracing innovation, and remaining deeply committed to our customers and community, Paaro Jodi Khaa can achieve its ambitious goals and make a lasting contribution to the culinary landscape of Assam. We aspire to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a cultural ambassador, showcasing the richness and diversity of Assamese cuisine to the world.</p>', '168, Jayanagar Rd, opposite to BPCL', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:30:19.000Z'),
(1678, 'Aroma : Modern Dining', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Aroma : Modern Dining is a culinary haven situated in the heart of Assam, offering a refined and contemporary dining experience that blends global culinary trends with the rich flavors of the region. More than just a restaurant, Aroma aspires to be a social hub, a place where people connect over exquisite food, impeccable service, and a welcoming atmosphere. Aroma’s strategic location allows it to cater to both locals seeking a sophisticated dining option and tourists eager to explore Assam''s gastronomic landscape. Aroma distinguishes itself by providing an elevated experience without sacrificing the warmth and hospitality for which Assam is known. The establishment aims to contribute to the vibrant and evolving culinary scene of the region, fostering a greater appreciation for both local and international cuisine.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Aroma : Modern Dining offers a comprehensive menu curated to tantalize the taste buds with a fusion of global and regional flavors. The primary offering revolves around a carefully crafted a la carte menu featuring modern interpretations of classic dishes alongside innovative creations using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The restaurant prides itself on its commitment to freshness, quality, and artistic presentation. Beyond the a la carte experience, Aroma offers set course menus designed for special occasions and corporate events, providing a seamless and memorable dining experience. A well-stocked bar complements the food menu, featuring a wide selection of wines, spirits, and handcrafted cocktails, including Assam tea-infused concoctions. One of Aroma’s unique selling points is its regular introduction of seasonal menus that highlight the best of Assam’s produce throughout the year. This commitment to seasonality ensures that the dishes are always fresh, flavorful, and reflective of the region''s agricultural heritage. Aroma also caters to dietary needs with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options clearly marked on the menu, ensuring that all guests can enjoy a delightful dining experience. This focus on inclusivity addresses the evolving dietary preferences within the local market, making Aroma a welcoming choice for a diverse clientele.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Aroma : Modern Dining, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness. The staff is meticulously trained to provide impeccable service, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. The ambiance is carefully curated to create a relaxed yet sophisticated atmosphere, with thoughtfully designed interiors, comfortable seating, and soft lighting. Aroma strives to create a memorable dining experience that extends beyond the food itself. Regular live music performances by local artists add to the ambiance, creating a vibrant and engaging social scene. Aroma actively engages with the local community by hosting culinary workshops, partnering with local farmers and producers, and supporting local charities. By fostering these connections, Aroma positions itself as more than just a restaurant; it becomes an integral part of the community, contributing to its cultural and economic vibrancy. Aroma’s commitment to customer satisfaction is further reinforced through actively seeking feedback and using it to continuously improve its services and offerings. This dedication to continuous improvement ensures that Aroma remains a preferred dining destination for both locals and visitors alike.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Aroma : Modern Dining is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and community engagement. The immediate plan involves expanding the restaurant''s catering services to serve a wider range of events and functions within the region. This expansion will leverage Aroma''s existing culinary expertise and reputation for excellence to capture a larger share of the catering market. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other key cities within Assam, replicating the successful formula of modern dining with a local twist. Aroma envisions becoming a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community involvement. Another key focus is on developing partnerships with local agricultural initiatives to source more ingredients directly from farmers, supporting sustainable agriculture and reducing the restaurant''s carbon footprint. Furthermore, Aroma plans to establish a culinary training program to nurture local talent and provide opportunities for aspiring chefs and hospitality professionals. By investing in training and development, Aroma aims to contribute to the growth of the hospitality industry in Assam and create a pipeline of skilled workers for its expanding operations. Ultimately, Aroma : Modern Dining aims to be more than just a successful business; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable practices, supporting local communities, and elevating the culinary landscape of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:30:25.000Z'),
(1679, 'Gandharb Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Gandharb Restaurant, nestled at 4QQQ+X2G, Dr RP Rd, behind MLA Hostel in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a refined dining experience that seamlessly blends authentic Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, Gandharb is a celebration of Assam''s rich cultural heritage, expressed through its meticulously crafted menu and warm, inviting atmosphere. In a region known for its diverse culinary traditions, Gandharb distinguishes itself by offering a carefully curated selection of both traditional and innovative dishes, appealing to a broad spectrum of palates, from seasoned locals to adventurous tourists. The restaurant strives to be a cornerstone of the local food scene, providing a sophisticated yet accessible gateway to the culinary wonders of Assam. </p> <br> <br>

<p>At the core of Gandharb Restaurant lies a commitment to showcasing the vibrant and diverse flavors of Assam. Our primary offering is a comprehensive menu featuring authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Diners can indulge in classic dishes such as <em>Masor Tenga</em> (sour fish curry), <em>Khar</em> (an alkaline dish made with banana peel), and <em>Pitha</em> (rice cakes) alongside innovative creations that reimagine traditional flavors in modern presentations. Beyond the Assamese specialties, the menu also features a selection of pan-Indian and continental dishes, ensuring a diverse range of options to cater to varying preferences. A carefully curated beverage list complements the food offerings, featuring local teas, refreshing juices, and a selection of wines and spirits. What truly sets Gandharb apart is its dedication to quality ingredients, expert preparation, and artistic presentation. In a market where culinary offerings often prioritize speed and affordability, Gandharb focuses on providing a premium dining experience that emphasizes authenticity, flavor, and visual appeal. This commitment addresses the growing demand for high-quality, locally inspired dining options within the city. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Gandharb Restaurant. From the moment guests step through the door, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, providing informed recommendations and catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. The ambiance is designed to be both elegant and inviting, creating a comfortable and memorable dining experience. The restaurant’s location, while slightly tucked away behind MLA Hostel, offers a sense of tranquility away from the bustling city streets. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as sourcing ingredients from local farmers and artisans, participating in local food festivals, and hosting culinary workshops to promote Assamese cuisine. We aim to build strong relationships with our customers and become a trusted and beloved part of the community. This dedication to personalized service and community engagement fosters customer loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals, further solidifying Gandharb’s position as a leading dining destination in Guwahati. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Gandharb Restaurant envisions a future where it is recognized as the leading ambassador of Assamese cuisine, both locally and nationally. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more diverse regional specialties and developing a signature line of packaged Assamese delicacies for retail sale. We plan to enhance our online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and online ordering platforms, reaching a wider customer base. Furthermore, we aspire to establish strategic partnerships with local tourism agencies and hotels to promote Gandharb as a must-visit dining destination for tourists visiting Assam. In the coming years, we aim to explore opportunities for expanding to additional locations within Assam and potentially to other major cities in India, bringing the authentic flavors of Assamese cuisine to a broader audience. We are also committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact by reducing waste and sourcing ingredients responsibly. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and staying true to our core values, Gandharb Restaurant is poised for sustained growth and long-term success in the dynamic culinary landscape of Assam and beyond. </p>', '4QQQ+X2G, Dr RP Rd, behind MLA Hostel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:30:32.000Z'),
(1680, 'Confucius', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Confucius, located on the First Floor of Protech Dawn, GS Rd, opposite Shoolin Grand, in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a business solutions provider dedicated to empowering local enterprises with innovative and effective strategies for sustainable growth. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the Assam business landscape and tailor our services to meet the specific needs of this dynamic market. Confucius is more than just a consultancy; we are partners in progress, committed to building a thriving business ecosystem within the region. Our approach is rooted in practical application, drawing on global best practices while remaining firmly grounded in local realities. We believe in fostering long-term relationships built on trust, transparency, and a shared vision for success.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings revolve around providing comprehensive business solutions designed to optimize performance and drive profitability for our clients. We specialize in three key areas: Business Strategy & Consulting, Digital Marketing Solutions, and Operational Efficiency Improvement. Our Business Strategy & Consulting services focus on developing and implementing strategic roadmaps that align with our clients'' long-term objectives. This includes market analysis, competitive intelligence, business plan development, and assistance with securing funding opportunities. We help businesses identify their competitive advantages, define their target markets, and create sustainable growth strategies.

<br> <br>

Our Digital Marketing Solutions are designed to enhance online presence, generate leads, and drive customer engagement. We offer a full suite of digital marketing services, including search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, content creation, email marketing, and pay-per-click (PPC) advertising. We understand the importance of leveraging digital channels to reach a wider audience and build brand awareness in today’s interconnected world. We focus on creating data-driven strategies that deliver measurable results and maximize return on investment.

<br> <br>

Operational Efficiency Improvement is at the heart of our commitment to helping businesses thrive. We work closely with our clients to identify areas where operational processes can be streamlined and optimized. This includes process analysis, workflow optimization, supply chain management, and technology implementation. We aim to reduce costs, improve productivity, and enhance overall operational performance. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to combine strategic thinking with practical implementation. We don''t just provide recommendations; we work alongside our clients to implement changes and ensure that they achieve their desired outcomes. We are also deeply committed to understanding the local market dynamics in Assam. We possess a strong understanding of the cultural nuances, economic realities, and regulatory environment that shape the business landscape in this region. This allows us to tailor our solutions to the specific needs of our clients and ensure that they are aligned with local customs and practices.

<br> <br>

At Confucius, we prioritize providing an exceptional customer experience. We believe in building strong, lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. We take the time to understand our clients'' unique needs and challenges, and we tailor our services accordingly. Our team is responsive, proactive, and dedicated to providing personalized attention to each and every client. We also understand the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local business events and initiatives, and we are committed to supporting the growth and development of the Assam business ecosystem. We believe that by working together, we can create a more prosperous and vibrant community for all. We strive to be accessible and approachable, fostering an open communication environment where clients feel comfortable sharing their thoughts and concerns. Regular feedback sessions and progress updates are integrated into our service delivery model, ensuring transparency and collaborative decision-making. We consider our clients to be partners, and their success is our success.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Confucius envisions becoming the leading business solutions provider in Assam, recognized for our expertise, innovation, and commitment to client success. We plan to expand our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market, including incorporating new technologies and methodologies. We are committed to investing in our team and providing them with the training and development opportunities they need to stay ahead of the curve. We also aim to build strategic partnerships with other organizations and institutions to expand our reach and enhance our capabilities. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable economic growth of Assam by empowering local businesses to thrive and compete in the global marketplace. We see potential in expanding into areas such as sustainability consulting and entrepreneurship training, further contributing to a holistic business ecosystem. We aim to establish Confucius as a thought leader in the regional business community, actively participating in industry discussions and contributing to the development of best practices. Our commitment to innovation and client satisfaction will continue to drive our growth and solidify our position as a trusted partner for businesses in Assam.', 'First Floor, Protech Dawn, GS Rd, opposite Shoolin Grand', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:35:10.000Z'),
(1681, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar, situated at 2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a vibrant and contemporary establishment that seamlessly blends the inviting atmosphere of a traditional cafe with the sophisticated ambiance of a modern bar. It stands as a distinctive addition to the Guwahati culinary scene, offering a unique experience that caters to a diverse clientele seeking quality coffee, delicious food, and expertly crafted cocktails in a comfortable and stylish setting. Mocha Cafe & Bar aims to be more than just a place to grab a quick bite or a drink; it aspires to be a community hub, a place where connections are forged, ideas are exchanged, and lasting memories are created.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Mocha Cafe & Bar''s offerings lies a carefully curated menu that caters to both coffee aficionados and those seeking more substantial fare. The coffee program features meticulously sourced beans, expertly roasted to bring out their distinct flavor profiles. Patrons can enjoy a range of classic espresso drinks, from rich and creamy lattes to bold and intense cappuccinos, all prepared by skilled baristas dedicated to the art of coffee making. Beyond coffee, the menu boasts a selection of gourmet sandwiches, fresh salads, and delectable pastries, all made with high-quality ingredients and prepared with a focus on flavor and presentation. As the day transitions into evening, Mocha Cafe & Bar transforms into a sophisticated bar, offering a wide array of handcrafted cocktails, premium spirits, and a curated selection of wines and beers. The bar menu is designed to complement the food offerings, providing the perfect pairing for any occasion. A key differentiator for Mocha Cafe & Bar is its commitment to sourcing local ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers and showcasing the unique flavors of Assam.

<br> <br>

The customer experience is paramount at Mocha Cafe & Bar. From the moment guests step through the door, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. The interior design is carefully considered to create a space that is both stylish and comfortable, with plush seating, warm lighting, and tasteful decor. The goal is to create an environment where customers can relax, unwind, and enjoy their time. Mocha Cafe & Bar actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting live music performances, art exhibitions, and community events. The cafe also partners with local organizations to support charitable causes and promote social responsibility. By fostering strong relationships with the community, Mocha Cafe & Bar aims to become an integral part of the neighborhood fabric.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Mocha Cafe & Bar envisions significant growth potential. The business plans to expand its menu offerings, introduce new and innovative cocktails, and enhance its customer loyalty program. There are also plans to explore opportunities for expansion, potentially opening additional locations in Guwahati and other parts of Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Mocha Cafe & Bar as a leading brand in the region, known for its commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of its customers, Mocha Cafe & Bar is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a cherished destination for locals and visitors alike. Continuous improvement and adaptation to the local market are key to sustaining success and solidifying Mocha Cafe & Bar''s position as a premier establishment in the Assam hospitality landscape.', '2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:35:15.000Z'),
(1682, 'Maihang', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Maihang is a burgeoning enterprise deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, committed to delivering authentic Assamese experiences and products while fostering sustainable growth within the local community. Situated strategically to serve both local residents and tourists seeking a genuine taste of Assam, Maihang operates as a multifaceted business, bridging the gap between traditional craftsmanship, local produce, and modern consumer demands.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Maihang functions as a curator and purveyor of high-quality Assamese goods and services. The business''s primary offerings encompass three key areas: handcrafted textiles, locally sourced agricultural products, and curated cultural experiences. The textile division showcases the rich weaving traditions of Assam, featuring handloom products such as Mekhela Chadors, Eri silk shawls, and cotton fabrics directly sourced from local weavers. This not only provides customers with authentic, ethically produced garments but also supports the livelihoods of artisans preserving age-old techniques. The agricultural arm focuses on showcasing the diverse bounty of Assam, offering a range of products including premium Assam tea, organic spices, and indigenous fruits and vegetables sourced directly from local farmers. Maihang emphasizes sustainable farming practices and fair prices to empower the agricultural community. Finally, the cultural experiences component offers immersive opportunities for visitors to connect with Assam''s heritage, including guided tours of tea gardens, traditional cooking workshops, and demonstrations of local crafts. These experiences are designed to be authentic, informative, and engaging, offering a deeper understanding of the region''s rich cultural tapestry.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Maihang''s unique selling proposition lies in its commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment. Unlike mass-produced goods, Maihang’s products are carefully selected and often handcrafted, reflecting the unique artistry and cultural heritage of Assam. The business prioritizes ethical sourcing practices, ensuring that artisans and farmers receive fair compensation for their work. This commitment to sustainability extends to environmental considerations, with a focus on promoting organic farming practices and minimizing waste throughout the supply chain. Furthermore, Maihang actively invests in the local community through initiatives such as skills training programs for artisans and farmers, fostering economic development and preserving traditional crafts for future generations. These initiatives not only contribute to the economic well-being of the community but also strengthen Maihang''s brand image and customer loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Maihang. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment for all visitors, whether they are local residents or international tourists. The staff is trained to provide personalized service, offering detailed information about the products, their origins, and the artisans or farmers who produced them. Maihang actively engages with the local community through participation in local festivals and events, showcasing its products and promoting Assamese culture. The business also utilizes social media platforms to connect with customers, share stories about its artisans and farmers, and provide updates on new products and events. Furthermore, Maihang actively solicits customer feedback to continuously improve its products and services. The business believes that building strong relationships with its customers is essential for long-term success.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Maihang envisions itself as a leading advocate for Assamese culture and a catalyst for sustainable economic development in the region. The business plans to expand its product offerings to include a wider range of handcrafted goods, agricultural products, and cultural experiences. This expansion will be guided by a commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment. Maihang also aims to establish a stronger online presence to reach a wider audience and facilitate the sale of its products to customers worldwide. The business plans to partner with other local businesses and organizations to promote Assam as a destination for cultural tourism and sustainable agriculture. Long-term, Maihang aspires to become a model for responsible business practices in the region, demonstrating how businesses can contribute to the economic and social well-being of the community while preserving cultural heritage.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:35:23.000Z'),
(1683, 'O2...The Open Banquet', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>O2...The Open Banquet stands as a vibrant and versatile event space, strategically located in the bustling Bipanan Khetra area on Panjabari Road, near Juripara Junction. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, O2...The Open Banquet provides a much-needed premium venue option for a diverse range of events, catering to the growing demand for sophisticated and adaptable event spaces in the region. More than just a banquet hall, it''s a space designed to transform ordinary gatherings into extraordinary experiences, contributing significantly to the local business landscape by providing a platform for celebrations, corporate events, and community gatherings alike. </p> <br> <br>

<p>O2...The Open Banquet specializes in providing a comprehensive event hosting service, offering a meticulously designed space and support services to ensure seamless execution. Our core offering is the flexible banquet hall itself, capable of being configured to accommodate various event sizes and styles, from intimate gatherings of 50 guests to larger celebrations hosting upwards of 500. Beyond the physical space, we offer a curated selection of add-on services including: <br>
*<b>Catering Services:</b> Partnering with local culinary experts to provide diverse menu options ranging from traditional Assamese cuisine to continental and international flavors.<br>
*<b>Decor and Styling:</b> Offering customizable decoration packages to create the desired ambiance for each event, from elegant and sophisticated to vibrant and festive. <br>
*<b>Audio-Visual Equipment:</b> Providing state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems, along with projection capabilities, to enhance presentations and entertainment.<br>
*<b>Event Planning Assistance:</b> A dedicated team of event coordinators to assist clients with planning and execution, ensuring a stress-free experience. <br> <br>
The unique selling point of O2...The Open Banquet lies in its blend of modern amenities, flexible space, and personalized service. We understand the importance of creating memorable experiences, and our commitment to quality and attention to detail sets us apart. Furthermore, the strategic location near Juripara Junction ensures easy accessibility for guests from across Guwahati and beyond, addressing a key need in a city where travel can be challenging. This accessibility, combined with our comprehensive service offerings, makes O2...The Open Banquet a premier choice for event hosting in the region.
</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of O2...The Open Banquet. We believe in fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere from the moment a client inquires about our services. Our approach is centered on understanding each client''s unique needs and vision, working collaboratively to bring their event to life. We prioritize clear and consistent communication, providing prompt and helpful responses to all inquiries. On the day of the event, our dedicated team is present to ensure everything runs smoothly, addressing any unexpected issues with professionalism and efficiency. <br> <br>
We actively engage with the local community by hosting and supporting local events, showcasing the talents of local artists and businesses. Building strong relationships with local vendors and suppliers allows us to offer competitive pricing and unique service options, further enhancing the value we provide to our clients. This commitment to community integration not only strengthens our business but also contributes to the vibrant cultural tapestry of Guwahati. We strive to be more than just a venue; we aim to be a trusted partner in creating lasting memories for our clients and a valuable asset to the local community.
</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for O2...The Open Banquet is one of continued growth and expansion, establishing ourselves as the leading event destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to enhance our service offerings by incorporating sustainable practices, such as partnering with local farmers for catering and implementing energy-efficient technologies. Exploring opportunities to create themed event packages that cater to specific cultural events and festivals relevant to Assam is also a key consideration. <br> <br>
Furthermore, we intend to invest in staff training and development to ensure our team remains at the forefront of event management expertise. This includes staying updated on the latest trends in event technology, catering, and decor. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Assam and offering franchise opportunities to entrepreneurs who share our passion for creating exceptional event experiences. O2...The Open Banquet aspires to not only be a successful business but also a positive force in the community, fostering economic growth and contributing to the cultural vibrancy of the region, offering a space where memories are made and celebrations come to life.
</p>', 'Bipanan Khetra Panjabari Road, near Juripara Junction', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:35:29.000Z'),
(1684, '11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p><strong>11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet: A Culinary Landmark in FA Road, Assam</strong></p>

<p>Nestled on the ground floor of Shivani Arcade, opposite Kumudinee Apartment on FA Road, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet stands as a premier destination for discerning diners and event planners in Assam. More than just a restaurant, 11 July is a vibrant hub where culinary artistry meets exceptional hospitality, creating memorable experiences for every guest. We have quickly established ourselves as a significant player in the local culinary scene, offering a diverse range of dining and event solutions tailored to the unique tastes and traditions of the region while maintaining an internationally inspired outlook.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet, we pride ourselves on our commitment to quality, creativity, and unparalleled service. Our establishment is designed to cater to a broad spectrum of needs, from intimate dinners and casual gatherings to grand celebrations and corporate events. We are not simply providing food and drinks; we are crafting experiences that linger long after the last course is served.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Experiences</strong></p>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around three primary pillars: the Kitchen, the Bar, and the Banquet. Each element is meticulously designed and managed to provide a seamless and satisfying experience for our clientele.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>The Kitchen:</strong> Our restaurant showcases a meticulously curated menu that blends authentic Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. We source fresh, locally available ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the highest quality in every dish. From traditional Assamese thalis bursting with regional specialties to globally inspired entrees, our menu offers something to delight every palate. Vegetarian and vegan options are thoughtfully included, reflecting our commitment to inclusivity and dietary preferences. What sets us apart is our dedication to innovation; we regularly introduce seasonal specials and chef''s recommendations, ensuring that our menu remains exciting and engaging for our regular patrons. Our open kitchen concept allows guests to witness the culinary magic firsthand, adding an element of theatre to the dining experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>The Bar:</strong> Our well-stocked bar is a sophisticated haven for cocktail enthusiasts and those seeking a relaxed ambiance. We offer a comprehensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers, both domestic and international. Our experienced mixologists are adept at crafting classic cocktails and creating innovative concoctions using fresh ingredients and unique flavor combinations. The bar also features a curated selection of non-alcoholic beverages, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy. We frequently host themed cocktail nights and tasting events, adding an extra layer of excitement and entertainment for our guests.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>The Banquet:</strong> Our spacious and elegantly appointed banquet hall provides the perfect setting for a wide range of events, from weddings and receptions to corporate conferences and private parties. We offer flexible seating arrangements and customizable décor options to suit the specific needs of each event. Our dedicated event planning team works closely with clients to ensure that every detail is meticulously executed, from menu selection and table settings to audio-visual equipment and entertainment. We pride ourselves on our ability to seamlessly manage events of all sizes, providing a stress-free and memorable experience for our clients and their guests. Our commitment to personalized service and attention to detail sets us apart from other banquet facilities in the area. We also offer customized catering services, allowing clients to bring the 11 July culinary experience to off-site events.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>These services meet the specific needs of the local market by providing a high-quality dining and event experience that is both accessible and affordable. We understand the importance of value for money, and we strive to offer exceptional quality at competitive prices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, Fostering Community</strong></p>

<p>At 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, friendly, and professional service at all times. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our customers, remembering their preferences and anticipating their needs. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. What makes us stand out is our commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels valued and appreciated.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We are deeply connected to the local community and actively participate in local events and initiatives. We partner with local businesses and organizations to support the local economy and promote community engagement. We also host regular community events at our establishment, such as live music performances and cultural celebrations, further strengthening our ties to the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Enduring Excellence</strong></p>

<p>Looking ahead, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet envisions a future of continued growth and innovation. We plan to expand our menu and services to further cater to the evolving tastes and needs of our clientele. We are exploring opportunities to introduce new dining concepts and event packages, further diversifying our offerings. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering and reservation systems. Our long-term goal is to establish 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet as a culinary landmark in Assam, synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional hospitality. We aim to become the premier destination for dining and events in the region, while remaining deeply rooted in the local community. We believe that our commitment to excellence, combined with our passion for innovation and our unwavering focus on customer satisfaction, will enable us to achieve our ambitious goals.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Shivani Arcade, FA Rd, opp. Kumudinee Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:35:37.000Z'),
(1685, 'Khorikaa', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Khorikaa, located on the 1st Floor of Kamal C Plaza, 2, GS Rd, represents a vibrant addition to the Assam business landscape. More than just a commercial establishment, Khorikaa embodies the spirit of local craftsmanship and innovation, offering a curated selection of products and services designed to cater to the evolving needs and aspirations of the community. The business is built upon a foundation of authenticity and a commitment to delivering exceptional quality, setting it apart as a reliable and respected name in the region. Khorikaa strives to be a hub where tradition meets modernity, a place where customers can discover unique items, experience outstanding service, and connect with the rich cultural heritage of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Khorikaa’s core offering revolves around providing high-quality, handcrafted goods that reflect the artistry and skill of local artisans. Central to its product line are traditionally woven Assamese textiles, including mekhela chadors, gamosas, and other handloom products. These aren''t merely articles of clothing; they are pieces of art that tell stories of the region''s history and heritage. Beyond textiles, Khorikaa also features a range of handcrafted products, such as artisanal jewelry, decorative items, and locally sourced food products, emphasizing the unique flavors and ingredients of Assam. A significant unique selling point lies in Khorikaa''s dedication to fair trade practices, ensuring that artisans receive equitable compensation for their work, fostering sustainable economic growth within the community. Furthermore, Khorikaa actively promotes the use of eco-friendly materials and sustainable production methods, aligning with the growing demand for environmentally conscious products. By offering a blend of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary design, Khorikaa caters to a diverse customer base, from those seeking authentic cultural souvenirs to individuals looking for unique and ethically sourced products for everyday use.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Khorikaa. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide knowledgeable and personalized service, assisting customers in understanding the stories behind the products and the artisans who create them. Khorikaa strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where customers feel valued and respected. This is achieved through attentive listening, proactive problem-solving, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. The business actively engages with the local community through participation in local festivals, cultural events, and collaborations with other small businesses. This involvement strengthens Khorikaa''s connection to the community, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty among its customers. Khorikaa also leverages digital platforms to connect with a wider audience, showcasing its products, sharing artisan stories, and providing convenient online shopping options. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience and ensure that Khorikaa remains responsive to the evolving needs of its clientele. Moreover, special attention is paid to packaging and presentation, ensuring that every purchase from Khorikaa is a delightful and memorable experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Khorikaa envisions a future where it becomes a leading platform for promoting Assamese art and culture on a national and even international scale. A key strategic goal is to expand its product line to include a broader range of handcrafted items, partnering with more artisans and craftspeople across the region. This expansion will not only enhance the diversity of offerings but also provide economic opportunities for more individuals within the community. Another important aspect of Khorikaa''s future vision is to strengthen its online presence, developing a robust e-commerce platform that allows customers from anywhere in the world to access its products. The business is also exploring opportunities to collaborate with tourism agencies and hotels to promote its products to visitors, further enhancing its visibility and reach. In the long term, Khorikaa aims to establish itself as a brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and ethical sourcing, representing the best of Assam''s craftsmanship and culture to a global audience. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of its customers and artisans, Khorikaa is poised for sustainable growth and continued success in the years to come.</p>', '1st Floor, Kamal C Plaza, 2, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:40:10.000Z'),
(1686, 'Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Shankar Complex, GS Rd, opposite Reliance Trends, offers a unique and vibrant dining experience that seamlessly blends the rich culinary traditions of China and Thailand. More than just a restaurant, Confucius represents a fusion of authentic flavors and contemporary dining, aiming to introduce a diverse and sophisticated palette to the discerning residents of Assam. The restaurant fills a significant gap in the local market by providing a high-quality, accessible, and culturally rich dining option that caters to a wide range of preferences.

<br> <br>

At Confucius, guests can embark on a gastronomic journey through the diverse landscapes of Chinese and Thai cuisine. Our menu features an extensive selection of dishes, ranging from classic Cantonese Dim Sum and spicy Sichuan delicacies to fragrant Thai curries and aromatic noodle dishes. Each dish is meticulously prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, combined with authentic imported spices to ensure an unparalleled flavor profile. Key highlights of our menu include our signature Peking Duck, a crispy and flavorful masterpiece prepared according to traditional methods; our Green Thai Curry, brimming with fresh herbs and creamy coconut milk; and our variety of flavorful stir-fried noodles, customized to individual spice preferences. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to authenticity while adapting certain flavors to resonate with the local Assamese palate. This careful balance ensures that both seasoned connoisseurs and newcomers to Asian cuisine can find something to delight in. By offering both Chinese and Thai cuisine under one roof, Confucius eliminates the need for diners to choose, catering to varied tastes within a group and providing a truly comprehensive Asian dining experience.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Confucius. From the moment guests step inside, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. Our well-trained staff are knowledgeable about the menu and happy to offer recommendations, ensuring a personalized and memorable dining experience. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable ambiance, with a tastefully decorated interior that reflects the cultural heritage of both China and Thailand. In addition to providing exceptional in-house dining, we also offer convenient takeaway and delivery services, allowing customers to enjoy our delicious food from the comfort of their own homes. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and collaborations with community organizations. This dedication to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and establishes Confucius as more than just a restaurant, but as a valued member of the Guwahati community. We gather feedback regularly and adapt our offerings to meet the evolving needs of our clientele.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam business landscape. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as the premier destination for Asian cuisine in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our menu, introducing seasonal specials and innovative dishes that showcase the culinary artistry of our chefs. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing our unique dining experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we are investing in sustainable practices, such as reducing food waste and sourcing ingredients from local farmers whenever possible, to minimize our environmental impact. We aim to continually enhance our service standards and maintain our commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. By focusing on quality, innovation, and community engagement, Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious goals and make a lasting contribution to the vibrant culinary scene of Assam.', 'Shankar Complex, GS Rd, opp. Reliance Trends', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:40:17.000Z'),
(1687, 'Pirates of Grill', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Pirates of Grill, a vibrant and engaging dining destination located on the 4th floor of City Center, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospitals in Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and interactive culinary experience that sets it apart within the local restaurant scene. More than just a restaurant, Pirates of Grill is a celebration of flavor, community, and immersive dining, providing a refreshing alternative to traditional restaurant formats. Its strategic location within City Center ensures high visibility and accessibility, attracting a diverse clientele from across the city.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, Pirates of Grill specializes in a "do-it-yourself" grilling concept, where diners are presented with a diverse array of marinated meats, seafood, and vegetables, and can grill them directly at their table using provided skewers and tabletop grills. This interactive element fosters a sense of participation and customization, allowing each guest to tailor their meal to their individual preferences. Alongside the grilling options, Pirates of Grill also offers a comprehensive buffet spread featuring a variety of Indian and international dishes, ensuring there''s something to satisfy every palate. The unlimited nature of both the grilling and buffet experiences provides exceptional value for money, making it a popular choice for families, groups, and corporate gatherings. The restaurant prides itself on sourcing fresh, high-quality ingredients, and the marinades are carefully crafted to deliver bold and authentic flavors. Unique selling points include the live grilling experience, the expansive buffet selection, and the festive, pirate-themed ambiance, which creates a memorable and engaging dining experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Pirates of Grill is committed to providing exceptional customer service that extends beyond simply taking orders and serving food. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu and grilling process, providing guidance and assistance to ensure a seamless and enjoyable experience for every guest. The restaurant cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of community and camaraderie. Recognizing the importance of local connection, Pirates of Grill actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with local businesses, and special promotions tailored to regional festivals and celebrations. The restaurant also prioritizes gathering customer feedback through surveys and online reviews, using this information to continuously improve its offerings and enhance the overall dining experience. The goal is to create not just customers, but loyal advocates who return time and again, recommending Pirates of Grill to their friends and family.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking to the future, Pirates of Grill envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam region and potentially beyond. Plans are underway to further enhance the dining experience through the introduction of new menu items, innovative grilling techniques, and expanded beverage options. There''s an ambition to incorporate more local Assamese cuisine into the buffet spread, showcasing the region''s unique culinary heritage to a wider audience. The business is also exploring opportunities to expand its presence through the opening of additional locations in other key cities within Assam or even venturing into neighboring states. A strong emphasis will remain on maintaining the quality of food and service that has become synonymous with the Pirates of Grill brand. Long-term goals include establishing Pirates of Grill as a leading dining destination in the region, recognized for its unique interactive grilling experience, its commitment to customer satisfaction, and its dedication to supporting the local community. The business is committed to sustainable practices, exploring ways to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the region.</p>', '4th floor, City Center, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospitals', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.337Z', '2025-12-07T09:40:24.000Z'),
(1688, 'The Socialite', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p><b>The Socialite: Connecting Assam Through Events and Experiences</b></p>

<p>Located at the bustling heart of Guwahati, on 3rd Floor, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd, The Socialite is more than just an event management company; it''s a curator of unforgettable experiences. We specialize in crafting bespoke events that resonate with the vibrant spirit of Assam, offering a unique blend of modern sophistication and local cultural nuances. In a region often underserved by high-quality, innovative event solutions, The Socialite aims to bridge the gap by delivering seamless and impactful events that leave a lasting impression. We understand the importance of fostering community connections and strive to be a vital contributor to the local business landscape by facilitating networking opportunities and promoting local talent. We aim to be a name synonymous with professionalism, creativity, and flawless execution in the Assam event industry.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive suite of event management solutions, designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. This includes corporate events such as conferences, seminars, product launches, and team-building activities, all tailored to align with specific business objectives. We also excel in organizing social events, including weddings, birthday parties, anniversaries, and cultural celebrations, incorporating traditional Assamese elements with contemporary designs. Beyond event planning, we offer a range of supplementary services, including venue sourcing, catering coordination, entertainment booking (featuring local artists whenever possible), décor and styling, audio-visual setup, and complete on-site management. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to personalization. We believe every event should be a reflection of our client’s vision and brand identity. We invest time in understanding their unique needs and preferences, ensuring that every detail, from the initial concept to the final execution, is meticulously planned and flawlessly implemented. Furthermore, our deep understanding of the local market allows us to leverage regional resources, talent, and cultural traditions, resulting in authentic and memorable experiences for all attendees. By understanding the logistical challenges specific to Guwahati and Assam, we offer solutions that others might overlook, ensuring seamless execution and minimizing potential disruptions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At The Socialite, customer experience is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to providing exceptional service, characterized by responsiveness, transparency, and a proactive approach. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients, becoming trusted partners who understand their evolving needs. Our dedicated team of experienced event professionals is passionate about delivering flawless execution and exceeding expectations. We pride ourselves on our ability to anticipate potential challenges and proactively address them, ensuring a stress-free experience for our clients. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, artists, and suppliers. By supporting local talent and promoting regional culture, we aim to foster a sense of community and contribute to the economic growth of Assam. We also regularly solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs. We are not just an event management company; we are an active member of the Guwahati community, committed to making a positive impact.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Socialite envisions becoming the leading event management company in Assam and the Northeast region. We plan to expand our service offerings to include virtual and hybrid event solutions, catering to the growing demand for online and blended experiences. We also aim to develop specialized packages for niche markets, such as destination weddings and adventure tourism events, leveraging the region''s natural beauty and cultural heritage. Strategic partnerships with key stakeholders in the tourism and hospitality sectors are a priority to further expand our reach and influence. Our long-term goals include establishing a strong brand reputation, building a loyal client base, and fostering a culture of innovation and excellence within our team. We are committed to investing in the professional development of our employees, ensuring they have the skills and knowledge to deliver world-class event experiences. Ultimately, The Socialite aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the Assam business landscape, by promoting tourism, supporting local businesses, and creating memorable experiences that showcase the region''s unique charm and potential.</p>', '3rd, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:40:31.000Z'),
(1689, 'The Yellow Chilli', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'The Yellow Chilli, situated within the vibrant hub of Mridul Properties Pvt Ltd, The Hub Mall, GS Rd, stands as a culinary beacon, offering a distinctive and modern interpretation of Indian cuisine. More than just a restaurant, The Yellow Chilli is a destination where authentic flavors meet contemporary presentation, creating an unforgettable dining experience that resonates with the dynamic spirit of Assam. In a region celebrated for its rich culinary heritage, The Yellow Chilli distinguishes itself by elevating traditional dishes with innovative techniques and a commitment to using the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, positioning itself as a significant player in Guwahati''s evolving food scene.

<br> <br>

At the heart of The Yellow Chilli''s offering is a carefully curated menu showcasing the diverse tapestry of Indian gastronomy. While traditional favorites hold a prominent place, the restaurant also prides itself on signature dishes that are exclusive to The Yellow Chilli experience. These aren''t simply rehashes of existing recipes; they represent a commitment to culinary artistry, blending familiar tastes with unexpected textures and aromas. The menu features a wide array of vegetarian and non-vegetarian options, catering to diverse palates and dietary preferences. From flavorful kebabs and aromatic biryanis to rich curries and delectable desserts, each dish is prepared with meticulous attention to detail, ensuring a consistent and high-quality culinary journey. A key differentiator lies in the restaurant''s ability to strike a perfect balance between authenticity and innovation. Dishes are rooted in traditional recipes but are presented with a modern flair, appealing to both seasoned connoisseurs of Indian food and adventurous diners seeking new culinary experiences. By sourcing ingredients locally, The Yellow Chilli not only supports the local economy but also ensures the freshness and quality of its offerings, aligning with the growing demand for sustainable and responsible dining practices in the region.

<br> <br>

The Yellow Chilli understands that dining is more than just about food; it’s about creating a memorable experience. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and an inviting ambiance. The restaurant''s design blends contemporary aesthetics with subtle Indian influences, creating a space that is both stylish and comfortable. The attentive and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to providing personalized service, guiding guests through the menu and ensuring that every need is met. Special attention is given to creating a family-friendly environment, making The Yellow Chilli an ideal destination for celebrations, casual meals, and everything in between. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and used to continuously improve the dining experience, reflecting a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction. Furthermore, The Yellow Chilli actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and initiatives. This fosters a strong sense of belonging and demonstrates a dedication to contributing to the cultural fabric of Assam. By prioritizing customer service, creating a welcoming atmosphere, and actively engaging with the local community, The Yellow Chilli strives to build lasting relationships with its patrons.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, The Yellow Chilli envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam and beyond. The business aims to expand its reach through strategic partnerships and potential franchising opportunities, while maintaining its commitment to quality and innovation. A key focus will be on continuously evolving the menu to incorporate new culinary trends and seasonal ingredients, ensuring that the dining experience remains fresh and exciting. Plans are also in place to enhance the restaurant''s online presence and explore new avenues for customer engagement through social media and online ordering platforms. The ultimate goal is to establish The Yellow Chilli as a brand synonymous with exceptional Indian cuisine, outstanding customer service, and a strong commitment to the local community. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, The Yellow Chilli is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. The business plans to explore catering opportunities for local events and businesses to further integrate into the community and diversify its revenue streams. Furthermore, there is an aspiration to develop a line of signature spice blends and sauces, allowing customers to recreate the Yellow Chilli experience in their own homes, further expanding the brand''s reach and creating new avenues for engagement.', 'Mridul Properties Pvt Ltd, The Hub Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:40:38.000Z'),
(1690, 'The Alchemy Grill and Lounge', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>The Alchemy Grill and Lounge stands as a vibrant addition to the culinary and social scene of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a restaurant and bar, it’s a destination designed to ignite the senses and foster connection. Nestled in a strategic location [ *Please Insert Specific Address Here* ], The Alchemy Grill and Lounge offers a sophisticated yet welcoming atmosphere, making it a prime location for both casual gatherings and special occasions. We aim to be a catalyst for enriching the local community through elevated dining and entertainment experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of The Alchemy Grill and Lounge lies a commitment to transforming quality ingredients into memorable culinary creations. Our primary offering centers around a meticulously crafted menu that blends international grilling techniques with the rich tapestry of Assamese flavors. We feature premium cuts of meat, sustainably sourced seafood, and fresh, locally sourced produce whenever possible. Our signature dishes are inspired by both global trends and regional traditions, offering a unique and exciting gastronomic journey. Complementing the grill is an extensive lounge menu, featuring handcrafted cocktails, a curated selection of wines, and a diverse range of spirits and beers. The lounge provides a sophisticated space for socializing and enjoying expertly mixed drinks.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>What sets The Alchemy Grill and Lounge apart is our dedication to creating an unparalleled experience. From the carefully designed interior to the expertly prepared food and drinks, every detail is considered. Our open-flame grill is a focal point, allowing patrons to witness the artistry of our chefs. We also offer a unique selection of shareable plates, encouraging a convivial dining experience. Recognizing the growing demand for innovative food and beverage options in Guwahati, The Alchemy Grill and Lounge provides a sophisticated alternative to the existing dining landscape. We cater to a diverse clientele, including young professionals, families, and tourists looking for a memorable experience. Our commitment to quality ingredients, exceptional service, and a vibrant atmosphere positions us as a leader in the regional hospitality industry.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Alchemy Grill and Lounge. We strive to provide a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service. From the moment a guest walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine hospitality. We actively seek feedback from our customers and continuously improve our offerings based on their suggestions. To connect with the local community, we actively participate in local events and partner with regional suppliers. We also host regular live music performances and themed nights, creating a vibrant and engaging social atmosphere. Building relationships and fostering a sense of community are integral to our success. We are dedicated to creating a space where people can come together to enjoy great food, drinks, and company.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for The Alchemy Grill and Lounge is to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement within the Assam region and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to incorporate more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the region. We also envision introducing cooking classes and workshops to share our culinary expertise with the community. Potential expansion plans include opening additional locations in other key cities within Northeast India. We are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing training and development, ensuring that we maintain the highest standards of service. Furthermore, we will explore opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainability and support community initiatives. The Alchemy Grill and Lounge strives to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valuable asset to the community, contributing to the vibrant cultural and economic landscape of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:45:08.000Z'),
(1691, 'Lam Naga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Lam Naga Restaurant: A Culinary Journey Through Authentic Naga Cuisine</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, near the popular Naga Delicacy at 4RF4+9XM, Mandir Path, lies Lam Naga Restaurant, a culinary haven dedicated to showcasing the rich and diverse flavors of Nagaland. More than just a restaurant, Lam Naga serves as a cultural ambassador, offering an immersive experience that transports diners to the hills of Nagaland through authentic Naga cuisine and warm hospitality. Positioned in a vibrant area known for its diverse culinary offerings, Lam Naga distinguishes itself by focusing exclusively on the unique and often unexplored flavors of Naga cuisine, filling a significant gap in the local culinary scene and providing a much-needed platform for this distinctive regional fare. The restaurant prides itself on sourcing the freshest, most authentic ingredients possible, ensuring that each dish reflects the true essence of Naga culinary traditions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Taste of Nagaland</p>

<p>Lam Naga Restaurant specializes in a wide array of traditional Naga dishes, each prepared with meticulous attention to detail and adherence to authentic recipes. The menu features signature Naga delicacies such as Smoked Pork with Akhuni (fermented soybean), Anishi (fermented yam leaves) based dishes, Bamboo Shoot Curry, and a variety of flavorful meat and vegetable stews cooked with traditional Naga spices and herbs. The restaurant also offers a selection of Naga-style rice preparations, including sticky rice, a staple in Naga cuisine. What sets Lam Naga apart is not only the authenticity of its dishes but also the careful presentation and the use of unique Naga ingredients often sourced directly from the region. This commitment to authenticity and quality provides a dining experience that is both educational and incredibly satisfying, catering to adventurous food enthusiasts and those seeking to experience the true taste of Nagaland. Beyond the core menu, Lam Naga often introduces seasonal specials featuring rare and unique Naga ingredients, further enriching the dining experience and showcasing the breadth and depth of Naga culinary traditions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer Experience: A Warm Welcome and Authentic Connection</p>

<p>At Lam Naga Restaurant, customer service is paramount. The staff is not only well-trained in providing attentive and efficient service but also knowledgeable about Naga cuisine and culture. They are happy to explain the origins of the dishes, the ingredients used, and the culinary traditions behind them, creating a more engaging and informative dining experience for guests. The restaurant strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere that reflects the hospitality for which Nagaland is known. The ambiance is designed to be comfortable and inviting, with subtle nods to Naga culture and aesthetics. Lam Naga actively engages with the local community through participation in food festivals, cultural events, and partnerships with local organizations. They are committed to sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible, supporting local farmers and businesses. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of loyalty among customers and reinforces Lam Naga''s position as a valued member of the local business landscape. Furthermore, the restaurant regularly solicits feedback from customers to continually improve its offerings and ensure that it is meeting the evolving needs and preferences of the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion with Authentic Naga Flavor</p>

<p>Lam Naga Restaurant envisions a future where it becomes the premier destination for authentic Naga cuisine in Assam and beyond. The restaurant plans to expand its menu, introducing even more regional specialties and incorporating innovative culinary techniques while staying true to its commitment to authenticity. Future plans may include expanding the restaurant''s physical space to accommodate a larger dining audience and potentially opening additional locations in other cities. Furthermore, Lam Naga is exploring opportunities to offer catering services for events and functions, bringing the unique flavors of Naga cuisine to a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing a strong online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, enhancing accessibility and reach. Lam Naga is also committed to sustainable practices, exploring ways to minimize its environmental impact and support responsible sourcing of ingredients. By focusing on innovation, quality, and community engagement, Lam Naga Restaurant is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a leading culinary destination, celebrating and preserving the rich culinary heritage of Nagaland.</p>', '4RF4+9XM, Mandir Path, Near Naga Delicacy', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:45:15.000Z'),
(1692, 'Urban Mantra six mile', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Urban Mantra Six Mile, nestled on Namghar Path, represents a fresh perspective on modern living in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a retail and service provider, Urban Mantra strives to be a community hub, a place where convenience meets connection and quality intersects with local sensibilities. Recognizing the dynamic pace of life in Six Mile, and the desire for accessible, high-quality services, Urban Mantra aims to streamline daily routines while fostering a sense of belonging within the neighborhood. We are dedicated to understanding the evolving needs of our customers and providing solutions that enhance their urban experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Urban Mantra Six Mile lies a curated selection of essential services and products. Our offerings are designed to cater to the diverse needs of the local community, ranging from everyday necessities to specialized services that simplify modern living. We provide a meticulously stocked convenience store, offering a variety of groceries, personal care items, and household essentials, ensuring that residents have easy access to the products they need without having to travel far. In addition to the convenience store, Urban Mantra houses a state-of-the-art laundry and dry-cleaning service. This service utilizes eco-friendly practices and modern technology to provide efficient and reliable cleaning solutions for clothing and household textiles. Furthermore, a modern and efficient tailoring service caters to alteration and custom clothing needs. What sets Urban Mantra apart is its commitment to quality and convenience. We source high-quality products, employ skilled professionals, and leverage technology to optimize our processes, ensuring a seamless and satisfying experience for our customers. We aim to offer a one-stop shop where residents can efficiently manage their daily chores and access the services they need without compromising on quality or convenience.
</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Urban Mantra Six Mile. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers by providing exceptional service and fostering a welcoming atmosphere. Our team is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized assistance. We prioritize understanding each customer''s unique needs and tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. Beyond transactional interactions, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. This includes sponsoring local events, partnering with local businesses, and organizing workshops and seminars on topics relevant to the community. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, Urban Mantra aims to be more than just a business; we strive to be a trusted neighbor and a valuable resource for residents of Six Mile. We continuously solicit feedback from our customers to improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Our commitment to exceptional customer service and community engagement is what truly sets Urban Mantra apart and makes us a preferred destination for residents of Six Mile.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Urban Mantra Six Mile envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Six Mile community, a place where residents can rely on us for quality services, convenience, and a strong sense of belonging. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to cater to the evolving needs of the community. We are exploring the possibility of adding a package receiving and forwarding service, responding to the increasing demand for reliable delivery solutions in the area. Furthermore, we are investigating opportunities to offer specialized services such as mobile phone repair and IT support. To achieve our long-term goals, we plan to invest in technology to further streamline our operations and enhance the customer experience. We will also continue to focus on building strong relationships with local businesses and community organizations. Our ultimate vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of the Six Mile community. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of our customers, ensuring that Urban Mantra remains a valuable and relevant resource for years to come.</p>', 'Namghar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:45:20.000Z'),
(1693, 'Nandadulal Pure Veg', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Nandadulal Pure Veg stands as a culinary beacon for vegetarian cuisine in the heart of Assam, offering a delectable array of dishes crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. More than just a restaurant, Nandadulal Pure Veg is committed to providing an authentic and satisfying dining experience that resonates with the values and traditions of the community. In a region where vegetarian options are often limited, Nandadulal Pure Veg fills a crucial gap, providing a dedicated space for individuals and families seeking flavorful and ethically prepared meals. The establishment strives to be a welcoming haven, fostering a sense of community and celebrating the rich culinary heritage of vegetarianism. Its significance lies not only in the quality of its food but also in its dedication to promoting a healthier and more sustainable lifestyle within the local business landscape. <br> <br>

Nandadulal Pure Veg''s core offerings center around a diverse menu of vegetarian dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese delicacies to popular North Indian and South Indian specialties. The restaurant''s signature dishes often feature locally grown vegetables and lentils, prepared using time-honored recipes passed down through generations. These could include a fragrant Assamese Thali with khar, tenga, and pitika, or a flavorful North Indian Dal Makhani with freshly baked naan. A South Indian selection featuring crispy dosas, fluffy idlis, and savory sambar might also be available. What sets Nandadulal Pure Veg apart is its unwavering commitment to using only the freshest, highest-quality ingredients. Emphasis is placed on sourcing produce from local farmers, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the dishes are bursting with flavor. Furthermore, the restaurant may offer a selection of freshly squeezed juices, traditional Assamese drinks, and desserts to complete the dining experience. By focusing on pure vegetarian cuisine and emphasizing fresh, local ingredients, Nandadulal Pure Veg caters directly to the needs of the local market, offering a unique and compelling alternative to the predominantly non-vegetarian dining options in the area. <br> <br>

At Nandadulal Pure Veg, customer experience is paramount. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The restaurant aims to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, whether it''s through comfortable seating, tasteful décor, or the soothing sounds of traditional Assamese music. A key element of their customer service approach is personalization. Staff may take the time to understand dietary preferences and offer recommendations based on individual needs. Perhaps they offer customized spice levels or suggest dishes that cater to specific allergies. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated into service improvements and menu updates. Beyond providing exceptional food and service, Nandadulal Pure Veg actively seeks to connect with the local community. This may involve sponsoring local events, participating in community festivals, or partnering with local organizations to promote healthy eating habits. By fostering strong relationships with its customers and the broader community, Nandadulal Pure Veg aims to become more than just a restaurant, but a trusted and valued member of the local neighborhood. The establishment strives to create a sense of belonging, where customers feel like family and are always greeted with a warm smile. <br> <br>

The future vision for Nandadulal Pure Veg is one of sustainable growth and community enrichment. Expansion within the local area and potentially into neighboring districts is a possibility, allowing more people to experience the restaurant''s unique brand of vegetarian cuisine. Menu innovation will be a continuous process, with plans to introduce new dishes that showcase the diversity of Assamese and Indian vegetarian cooking, while also catering to evolving customer preferences. There may be considerations to incorporate technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering, table reservations, or a loyalty program. Furthermore, Nandadulal Pure Veg envisions becoming a leading advocate for vegetarianism and healthy eating within the region. This could involve hosting cooking classes, workshops on nutrition, or collaborating with local schools and healthcare providers to promote awareness about the benefits of a plant-based diet. A long-term goal is to establish Nandadulal Pure Veg as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. By staying true to its core values and continuously striving for excellence, Nandadulal Pure Veg is poised to make a lasting contribution to the local culinary landscape and inspire a healthier, more sustainable future for the community it serves.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:45:26.000Z'),
(1694, 'AB''s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'AB''s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati, located on the 2nd Floor of Mayur Heights at ABC Point, GS Road, is a vibrant and established restaurant that has quickly become a cornerstone of the Guwahati culinary scene. More than just a dining establishment, AB''s offers an immersive and interactive barbecue experience, setting it apart from traditional restaurants and catering specifically to the discerning palates of Assam. Positioned strategically on GS Road, a major commercial artery of Guwahati, AB''s benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a popular choice for families, friends, and corporate gatherings. The restaurant’s commitment to quality, variety, and exceptional customer service contributes significantly to its positive reputation within the local business landscape.

<br> <br>

At the heart of AB''s offering is its distinctive "Wish Grill," where diners can customize their own barbecue experience by selecting from a wide array of exotic meats, seafood, and vegetables. This personalized approach allows guests to experiment with flavors and create their own unique dishes. Complementing the Wish Grill is a comprehensive buffet spread featuring both Indian and international cuisines. From traditional Indian curries and biryanis to continental favorites, the buffet provides a diverse selection to cater to varying tastes and preferences. Unique selling points include the interactive grilling experience, the sheer variety of dishes offered, and the restaurant''s commitment to using fresh, high-quality ingredients. This resonates particularly well in Guwahati, where food is an integral part of the culture and residents appreciate authentic flavors and generous portions. AB''s effectively addresses the local market''s desire for a unique dining experience that combines entertainment with culinary excellence.

<br> <br>

AB''s - Absolute Barbecues places a strong emphasis on providing an exceptional customer experience. The restaurant''s staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and well-cared for. Beyond the core food offerings, AB''s frequently hosts special events and promotions to further enhance the dining experience. This includes live music performances, festive celebrations, and themed food festivals. The restaurant actively engages with the local community through social media and partnerships with local organizations. By participating in community events and offering special deals to local residents, AB''s fosters a sense of belonging and loyalty. This commitment to building strong relationships with the local community is a key differentiator and contributes to the restaurant''s continued success. Regular feedback is actively solicited from patrons through comment cards and online platforms. This feedback is carefully analyzed and used to continuously improve the dining experience and address any customer concerns.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, AB''s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati, envisions sustained growth and expansion within the region. The restaurant aims to further solidify its position as the premier barbecue destination in Guwahati by continuously innovating its menu, enhancing the customer experience, and strengthening its ties with the local community. Potential future plans include expanding the restaurant''s seating capacity to accommodate growing demand, introducing new menu items that reflect local culinary traditions, and exploring opportunities to offer catering services for events and gatherings. The long-term goal is to establish AB''s as a trusted and respected brand that is synonymous with quality, value, and exceptional dining experiences. The management team is also exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the AB''s experience to a wider audience. With its strong foundation, dedicated team, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, AB''s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati is well-positioned for continued success and growth in the years to come.', '2nd Floor, Mayur Heights ABC Point, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:45:31.000Z'),
(1695, 'Chaska - Fine Dining', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Chaska - Fine Dining: A Culinary Oasis on GS Road

Chaska - Fine Dining represents a sophisticated addition to the culinary landscape of Guwahati, Assam, offering a distinctive fine dining experience on the bustling GS Road. More than just a restaurant, Chaska aims to be a destination where authentic flavors meet contemporary presentation, creating memorable moments for its patrons. Situated in a prime location, Chaska distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, innovative menu design, and impeccable service, filling a crucial niche in the market for discerning diners seeking refined culinary experiences. We strive to be a beacon of culinary excellence, enriching the local business environment by attracting both local clientele and visitors alike.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing an exceptional multi-cuisine fine dining experience. The menu is thoughtfully curated, featuring a blend of global culinary techniques applied to locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. While we offer an array of international dishes prepared with meticulous attention to detail, we also celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam, presenting traditional Assamese flavors with a modern twist. This fusion approach is a key differentiator, appealing to both those seeking familiar comforts and those eager to explore new gastronomic horizons. Our focus on fresh, high-quality ingredients sets us apart from casual dining establishments, and our commitment to consistent execution ensures a delightful experience every time. We address the local market''s need for a premium dining option, offering a sophisticated alternative to the prevalent casual dining scene. Specifically, we feature seasonally inspired menus to highlight the freshest available local produce.

<br> <br>

At Chaska, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is trained to anticipate needs, provide informed recommendations, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable dining journey. We cultivate a welcoming and elegant ambiance, creating a space where guests can relax and savor their meals. Beyond providing exceptional food and service, Chaska actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and collaborations with regional artisans and suppliers. We believe in fostering a strong connection with the community by supporting local businesses and promoting the region''s unique cultural identity. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to ensure we continually improve our offerings and maintain the highest standards of service. Regular customer loyalty programs are also in place to reward our most valued patrons.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Chaska envisions becoming the premier fine dining destination in Guwahati and a recognized name throughout Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu offerings, hosting exclusive culinary events, and potentially opening additional locations to reach a wider audience. We are committed to staying ahead of culinary trends and continuously innovating to provide our guests with new and exciting dining experiences. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with local farms and producers to further enhance our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients. Our long-term goal is to elevate the culinary landscape of the region, contributing to the growth of the local economy and establishing Assam as a destination for discerning food lovers. We are also exploring options for online ordering and delivery to cater to the evolving needs of our customers while maintaining the high quality associated with the Chaska brand.', 'GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:50:08.000Z'),
(1696, 'Eats & Beats Restro', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Eats & Beats Restro is a vibrant and dynamic dining establishment located at Tripura Rd Jayanagar Road, conveniently situated near Agile Hospital and opposite SBI in the heart of [Assam City/Town]. We offer a unique blend of delicious cuisine and live musical performances, creating a memorable and immersive experience for our patrons. Our restaurant is more than just a place to eat; it''s a community hub where friends and family can gather, enjoy good food, and appreciate local talent.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>In the burgeoning Assam business landscape, Eats & Beats Restro distinguishes itself through its dual focus on culinary excellence and artistic expression. We recognized a need for a venue that catered to both the appetite for quality food and the desire for enriching entertainment. By combining these two elements, we''ve carved a niche for ourselves as a go-to destination for a complete and satisfying evening. We are committed to supporting the local arts scene by providing a platform for musicians and performers, while simultaneously offering a diverse menu crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Eats & Beats Restro, our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and satisfying dining experience. Our menu features a curated selection of dishes ranging from regional Assamese specialties to popular Indian and Continental favorites. We take pride in using fresh, high-quality ingredients to create flavorful and authentic meals. Beyond the food, our live musical performances are a significant draw. We feature a rotating roster of local bands and musicians, showcasing a variety of genres, including traditional Assamese music, contemporary pop, and soulful melodies. This unique combination provides a truly immersive and entertaining experience that differentiates us from standard restaurants.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key unique selling point for Eats & Beats Restro is our commitment to creating a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We carefully curate our music program to ensure it complements the dining experience, creating a lively yet comfortable ambiance. Furthermore, our menu is designed to cater to a wide range of tastes and dietary preferences, ensuring that there''s something for everyone to enjoy. Our location, easily accessible and well-known due to its proximity to Agile Hospital and SBI, also provides a significant advantage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our services effectively meet the local market needs by providing a versatile venue for various occasions. Whether it''s a casual lunch with colleagues, a family dinner, or a celebratory event with friends, Eats & Beats Restro offers the perfect setting. We also cater to the growing demand for live entertainment, particularly among younger audiences, providing a space where they can discover new local artists and enjoy a night out. By offering a combination of quality food, engaging entertainment, and a welcoming atmosphere, we provide a comprehensive and fulfilling dining experience that resonates with the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Eats & Beats Restro. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each dining experience is memorable. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our food, service, and overall atmosphere. We also engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting fundraising events for local charities and sponsoring community events. These efforts help us build strong relationships with our neighbors and foster a sense of community within our restaurant.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets Eats & Beats Restro apart is our genuine commitment to creating a connection with the local community. We actively support local artists by providing them with a platform to showcase their talent. We also source ingredients from local farmers and producers whenever possible, contributing to the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of our food. By prioritizing community engagement, we aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a valuable asset to the local area.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Eats & Beats Restro envisions becoming a landmark destination known for its exceptional food, vibrant entertainment, and unwavering commitment to the local community. We plan to expand our menu to include more regional specialties and introduce innovative dishes that reflect the evolving tastes of our customers. We also aim to enhance our entertainment offerings by featuring a wider range of musical genres and performance styles. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to further strengthen our ties to the community. Our long-term goal is to establish Eats & Beats Restro as a beloved institution that enriches the cultural fabric of [Assam City/Town] for years to come.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We also intend to introduce loyalty programs and special event nights to further engage our customer base and enhance their experience. Exploring options such as themed nights dedicated to specific genres of music or showcasing local artisans during weekend markets are under consideration. Ultimately, Eats & Beats Restro aims to be a catalyst for positive community engagement while offering a unique and enjoyable dining and entertainment experience. Our continued success will be driven by our dedication to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.</p>', 'Tripura Rd Jayanagar Road near Agile Hospital, opp. SBI', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:50:17.000Z'),
(1697, '11th Avenue Cafe Bistro', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>11th Avenue Cafe Bistro: A Culinary Gem on Tayabulla Road</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled at 19, Tayabulla Road, 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro offers a unique dining experience that blends the warmth of a traditional Assamese cafe with the sophistication of a European-style bistro. More than just a place to eat, it''s a community hub, a meeting place, and a destination for those seeking quality food, exceptional coffee, and a welcoming atmosphere. In the bustling local landscape of Assam, 11th Avenue stands out as a carefully curated space where both locals and visitors can find respite and enjoy a memorable culinary journey.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro lies a commitment to providing diverse and high-quality offerings. The core of our business revolves around two main pillars: expertly crafted food and specialty coffee. Our menu features a curated selection of dishes, from classic continental breakfast options and light lunch fare to heartier evening meals. We take pride in using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring that each dish is bursting with flavor and reflects the regional bounty. Our chefs expertly blend traditional techniques with modern culinary trends, resulting in innovative and satisfying meals. Vegetarians and those with dietary restrictions will find ample choices, reflecting our commitment to catering to a diverse clientele.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond our food, we are equally passionate about our coffee. We carefully select premium beans from reputable suppliers, roasting them in-house to achieve the perfect aroma and flavor profile. Our baristas are highly trained and dedicated to crafting exceptional espresso-based drinks, from classic cappuccinos to more adventurous latte art creations. Our unique selling point lies in the fusion of these two elements: a high-quality food menu complemented by a truly exceptional coffee experience, all within a comfortable and inviting setting. This combination caters to the local market''s growing demand for sophisticated dining options that retain a sense of authenticity and regional flavor.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro. From the moment a guest walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff is dedicated to providing personalized service, anticipating needs, and ensuring that every visit is enjoyable. We believe in building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and belonging. Our welcoming atmosphere, comfortable seating, and thoughtful décor contribute to an environment where guests can relax, socialize, and savor their meals. We regularly host events and special promotions, further engaging with the local community and creating a vibrant social hub. We also actively solicit customer feedback, using it to continuously improve our offerings and enhance the overall dining experience. Furthermore, we actively engage with our local community through collaborations with local artists, supporting local charities, and participating in community events. We strive to be more than just a cafe; we aim to be a valued member of the Tayabulla Road neighborhood.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro is poised for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a recognized culinary destination in Assam, known for our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our coffee roasting operations, potentially supplying our beans to other cafes and restaurants in the region. We hope to establish ourselves as a trusted brand synonymous with excellent food, exceptional coffee, and a genuine sense of hospitality. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations, bringing the 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro experience to new communities while always maintaining the core values of quality, community, and exceptional service that define us.</p>', '19, Tayabulla Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:50:22.000Z'),
(1698, 'The Whiskey Bar & Grill', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>The Whiskey Bar & Grill aims to redefine the dining and social scene in Guwahati, Assam, by offering a sophisticated yet approachable establishment where quality food, premium beverages, and exceptional service converge. More than just a restaurant and bar, it''s envisioned as a vibrant hub for professionals, residents, and tourists seeking a memorable experience rooted in local hospitality and international standards. Positioned to capitalize on Guwahati’s growing demand for upscale dining and curated beverage experiences, The Whiskey Bar & Grill seeks to become a landmark destination in the city''s culinary landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The establishment distinguishes itself by meticulously curating its whiskey selection, showcasing a diverse range from renowned Scotch distilleries to emerging Indian brands, offering both connoisseurs and novices an opportunity to explore the world of whiskey. Beyond whiskey, the bar features an extensive selection of other spirits, craft beers, and expertly crafted cocktails, catering to a broad spectrum of preferences. Complementing the beverage program is a carefully designed menu focusing on grilled specialties and elevated comfort food. Utilizing locally sourced ingredients where possible, the kitchen crafts dishes that pair perfectly with the bar''s offerings, from hearty steaks and burgers to lighter fare like salads and appetizers. The menu is designed to be both approachable and refined, ensuring there''s something to satisfy every palate. This careful balance of quality and accessibility is a core differentiator in the local market. Furthermore, The Whiskey Bar & Grill will cater to the increasing demand for private dining and event spaces by offering customizable options for gatherings, corporate events, and celebrations.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At The Whiskey Bar & Grill, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm Assam hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverage offerings, providing personalized recommendations and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. The ambiance is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and sophisticated atmosphere, with comfortable seating, thoughtfully chosen decor, and ambient lighting that enhances the overall mood. Regular live music performances featuring local artists will further contribute to the vibrant atmosphere, making The Whiskey Bar & Grill a destination for entertainment as well as dining. By actively engaging with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in local events, and support for charitable initiatives, The Whiskey Bar & Grill aims to foster a sense of belonging and become an integral part of Guwahati’s social fabric. Feedback is actively solicited and valued, ensuring continuous improvement and adaptation to meet the evolving needs and preferences of the local clientele.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, The Whiskey Bar & Grill envisions significant growth potential. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong reputation within Guwahati as the premier destination for whiskey enthusiasts and discerning diners. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more seasonal and regional specialties, further highlighting the culinary heritage of Assam. Exploring partnerships with local distilleries and breweries is another key objective, strengthening ties with the local economy and offering unique, locally sourced products. Geographically, potential expansion to other key cities in Northeast India is being considered, leveraging the brand''s success and replicating the unique concept in new markets. This expansion would be carefully planned and executed to maintain the quality and standards that define The Whiskey Bar & Grill. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish The Whiskey Bar & Grill as a recognized and respected brand throughout the region, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The Whiskey Bar & Grill seeks to become more than just a business; it strives to become a cornerstone of the Guwahati community, a place where people can gather to celebrate, connect, and create lasting memories. By staying true to its core values of quality, service, and community engagement, The Whiskey Bar & Grill is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the vibrant growth of the local business landscape.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:50:29.000Z'),
(1699, 'Shanghai Salsa', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Shanghai Salsa, located at 1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path, Guwahati, Assam, brings a vibrant and exciting fusion of flavors to the culinary landscape of the region. Unlike typical dining establishments, Shanghai Salsa offers a unique experience that blends the exotic tastes of Chinese cuisine with the zesty spice of authentic Mexican salsa, creating a memorable dining destination that caters to the adventurous palates of the local community and beyond. The business aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural hub where diverse flavors and communities converge.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Shanghai Salsa lies its commitment to delivering an innovative and unparalleled dining experience. The core offering revolves around a curated menu that creatively marries the best of Chinese and Mexican culinary traditions. Patrons can expect a tantalizing array of dishes featuring familiar Chinese staples reimagined with the bold and vibrant flavors of Mexican salsa. Think of dishes like Szechuan Chicken Tacos with a fiery mango salsa, or perhaps Kung Pao Shrimp burritos with a refreshing cucumber-cilantro salsa. Vegetarian options are also prominent, featuring dishes like tofu stir-fry fajitas or vegetable spring rolls with a spicy black bean salsa dip. The unique selling point of Shanghai Salsa is undoubtedly its ability to bridge two seemingly disparate culinary worlds, resulting in a flavor profile that is both familiar and surprisingly innovative. This novelty provides a refreshing alternative to the traditional dining choices available in Guwahati and caters to a growing demand for more experimental and globally inspired cuisine. Furthermore, the business focuses on using locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and quality of its dishes. This commitment to local sourcing resonates well with the community and reinforces Shanghai Salsa''s dedication to supporting the regional economy.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Shanghai Salsa understands that exceptional food is only one component of a successful dining experience. The business places a high premium on providing attentive and personalized customer service. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and enthusiasm, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, able to offer recommendations, and accommodate dietary restrictions or preferences. The ambience of the restaurant is designed to be both inviting and vibrant, reflecting the fusion of cultures that define its culinary offerings. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered to continuously improve the dining experience and ensure that it meets the evolving needs and expectations of its clientele. Shanghai Salsa also actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with other businesses, and the hosting of special themed nights that celebrate both Chinese and Mexican cultures. This active community involvement helps build brand loyalty and solidifies Shanghai Salsa''s position as a valued member of the Ambikagiri Nagar Path neighborhood.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Shanghai Salsa envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati and broader Assam market. The business plans to expand its menu offerings, introducing new and exciting fusion dishes that continue to push the boundaries of culinary innovation. One of the primary future goals is to establish a strong online presence through a user-friendly website and active social media engagement, allowing for online ordering and delivery services, expanding its reach to customers beyond the immediate vicinity. Further plans include the exploration of catering services for local events and corporate gatherings, offering a unique and memorable culinary experience for a wider audience. Longer-term goals include the potential expansion to additional locations within Assam and potentially other northeastern states, bringing the unique Shanghai Salsa experience to a broader regional market. The business is also committed to continuous staff training and development, ensuring that its employees remain knowledgeable, passionate, and dedicated to providing exceptional service. By staying true to its core values of culinary innovation, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, Shanghai Salsa is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious growth objectives and become a leading culinary destination in the region.</p>
</body>
</html>', '1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:50:34.000Z'),
(1700, 'Bamboo Heights Ethnic Family Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Bamboo Heights Ethnic Family Restaurant: A Taste of Assam''s Heritage</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, at Panjabari Rd, opposite Purabi Diary and near Sankardev Kalakhetra, Bamboo Heights Ethnic Family Restaurant offers a unique and authentic Assamese dining experience. More than just a restaurant, Bamboo Heights is a celebration of Assam''s rich culinary heritage, providing a welcoming space for families and individuals to connect over delicious, traditionally prepared food. In a local business landscape increasingly influenced by global cuisines, Bamboo Heights stands out by championing the distinctive flavors and ingredients of Assam, contributing to the preservation and promotion of its cultural identity. It’s a culinary landmark aiming to provide a genuine taste of Assam to both residents and visitors alike, fostering a deeper appreciation for the region''s gastronomic treasures.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Bamboo Heights’ offerings lies a diverse menu showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. Our signature dishes include traditional thalis featuring a variety of curries, vegetables, and rice preparations, all prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We pride ourselves on our slow-cooked meats, infused with unique Assamese spices and herbs, offering a depth of flavor rarely found elsewhere. Vegetarian options are equally prominent, with a focus on fresh, seasonal vegetables and traditional lentil preparations. Our unique selling point lies in the authenticity of our recipes, passed down through generations, ensuring that each dish embodies the true essence of Assamese home cooking. Furthermore, we offer a curated selection of traditional Assamese beverages, complementing the food and enhancing the overall dining experience. By prioritizing local sourcing and traditional cooking methods, Bamboo Heights directly addresses the growing demand for authentic regional cuisine, appealing to both local residents seeking a taste of home and tourists eager to explore the unique flavors of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Bamboo Heights. From the moment guests step through our doors, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality. Our attentive and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to providing personalized service, guiding diners through the menu and explaining the nuances of each dish. The restaurant''s ambiance is carefully designed to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, reflecting the rustic charm of rural Assam. Regular cultural events, such as traditional music performances and art exhibitions, further enhance the dining experience and foster a strong connection with the local community. We believe in building relationships with our customers, not just serving them food. Feedback is actively encouraged and used to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are consistently meeting the needs of our diverse clientele. By actively engaging with the local community through partnerships with local artisans and participation in community events, Bamboo Heights aims to be more than just a restaurant – it strives to be a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and experience the true spirit of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Bamboo Heights envisions becoming a leading ambassador for Assamese cuisine, both within the region and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate lesser-known regional specialties, further showcasing the diversity of Assam''s culinary landscape. We also plan to establish partnerships with local farmers and producers, strengthening our commitment to sustainable sourcing and supporting the local economy. Exploring opportunities for catering services and packaged food products is also under consideration, allowing us to reach a wider audience and share the flavors of Assam with those who may not be able to visit our restaurant. Ultimately, Bamboo Heights aims to be recognized as a cultural institution, a place where people can not only enjoy delicious food but also learn about and appreciate the rich heritage of Assam. We are committed to preserving and promoting Assamese culture through our food, our service, and our engagement with the local community, ensuring that the traditions of Assam continue to thrive for generations to come.</p>', 'Panjabari Rd, opp. Purabi Diary, near Sankardev Kalakhetra', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.338Z', '2025-12-07T09:55:08.000Z'),
(1701, 'Upsouth', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Upsouth, a vibrant and innovative eatery, brings the authentic flavors of South India to the heart of Assam, offering a refreshing culinary experience that resonates with the local palate. Located at '''', Upsouth stands out as more than just a restaurant; it’s a cultural bridge, showcasing the diversity of Indian cuisine while catering to the specific preferences of the Assamese community. In a region known for its rich culinary traditions, Upsouth introduces a contemporary twist on classic South Indian dishes, providing a novel and exciting dining option for residents and visitors alike.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Upsouth''s offerings are its meticulously crafted South Indian delicacies. The menu features a wide array of dosas, idlis, vadas, uttapams, and rice preparations, each prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. These dishes are not simply replicated; they are adapted to incorporate local tastes, subtly blending the sharp spices of South India with the more mellow flavors favored in Assam. For instance, a unique twist on the traditional masala dosa might feature locally grown potatoes and spices, creating a dish that is both familiar and uniquely Upsouth. Furthermore, Upsouth emphasizes healthy cooking methods, using minimal oil and prioritizing fresh, natural ingredients. One of Upsouth''s unique selling points is its commitment to hygiene and food safety, assuring customers of a consistently high-quality dining experience. The restaurant also caters to various dietary needs, offering gluten-free and vegan options, ensuring inclusivity and appealing to a broad spectrum of customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Upsouth is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience, starting with a warm and inviting ambiance. The restaurant''s interior is designed to be both modern and comfortable, creating a welcoming atmosphere for families, friends, and individuals alike. Customer service is paramount; Upsouth''s staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, providing helpful recommendations and addressing any concerns promptly. To further enhance the customer experience, Upsouth incorporates technology, offering online ordering and table reservations. The restaurant also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting cultural events and supporting local farmers and suppliers. By participating in local festivals and collaborating with community organizations, Upsouth has established itself as a valuable member of the Assamese community, fostering a sense of belonging and connection with its customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Upsouth envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded influence within the Assamese culinary landscape. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further showcasing the diversity of South Indian cuisine while continuing to cater to local tastes. Another key aspect of the future vision is expansion, with plans to open additional locations in other key areas of Assam. This strategic expansion will enable Upsouth to reach a wider audience and further solidify its position as a leading South Indian restaurant in the region. Long-term goals also include developing a line of packaged South Indian snacks and ingredients, making the unique flavors of Upsouth accessible to customers beyond the restaurant''s physical locations. By focusing on innovation, quality, and community engagement, Upsouth is poised to continue its success and become a beloved culinary institution in Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T09:55:13.000Z'),
(1702, 'GUWAHATI AKHOL', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<article>
<h1>GUWAHATI AKHOL: Nurturing Assam''s Agricultural Future</h1>
<p>GUWAHATI AKHOL is a dedicated agricultural solutions provider based in the heart of Assam, committed to empowering local farmers and fostering sustainable agricultural practices. Recognizing the pivotal role agriculture plays in the state''s economy and the livelihoods of countless families, GUWAHATI AKHOL operates as more than just a business; it functions as a partner, offering tailored support and resources to enhance productivity, improve crop quality, and promote environmentally responsible farming.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We understand the unique challenges faced by Assam''s agricultural community, from unpredictable weather patterns and pest infestations to limited access to advanced technologies and market information. GUWAHATI AKHOL addresses these challenges by providing a comprehensive suite of services and products designed to optimize every stage of the agricultural process, from pre-planting preparation to post-harvest management. Our commitment to innovation, coupled with a deep understanding of local agricultural conditions, positions us as a trusted resource for farmers seeking to thrive in a rapidly evolving agricultural landscape.</p>
<br> <br>
<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>
<p>GUWAHATI AKHOL''s core offerings encompass a diverse range of solutions tailored to meet the specific needs of Assam''s diverse agricultural sectors. These include:</p>
<br> <br>
<ul>
<li><b>High-Quality Seeds and Saplings:</b> We source and supply a wide variety of certified, high-yielding seeds and saplings, carefully selected for their suitability to Assam''s climate and soil conditions. This includes rice varieties, vegetables, fruits, and other commercially viable crops. Our focus is on providing seeds that are disease-resistant and adapted to the local environment, ensuring optimal yields and minimizing crop losses.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Agricultural Inputs:</b> GUWAHATI AKHOL offers a range of essential agricultural inputs, including fertilizers, pesticides, and micronutrients. We prioritize the supply of eco-friendly and sustainable options, encouraging farmers to adopt responsible farming practices that minimize environmental impact while maximizing crop health and productivity. We provide guidance on the appropriate application of these inputs to ensure optimal results.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Farm Equipment and Tools:</b> To enhance efficiency and reduce manual labor, we provide access to a range of modern farm equipment and tools, from small-scale hand tools to larger machinery. We also offer guidance and training on the proper use and maintenance of these tools, ensuring that farmers can maximize their investment and improve their operational efficiency.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Expert Agricultural Advisory Services:</b> Our team of experienced agricultural experts provides personalized advisory services to farmers, offering guidance on crop selection, soil management, pest control, irrigation techniques, and post-harvest handling. We conduct on-site farm visits, provide practical recommendations, and offer ongoing support to help farmers overcome challenges and achieve their production goals.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Market Linkage Support:</b> Recognizing the importance of access to markets, GUWAHATI AKHOL facilitates market linkages for farmers, connecting them with potential buyers and helping them to negotiate fair prices for their produce. We provide information on market trends, demand patterns, and quality standards, empowering farmers to make informed decisions and maximize their profitability.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>Our unique selling point lies in our holistic approach to agricultural development. We don''t just sell products; we provide comprehensive solutions that address the entire agricultural value chain. This, combined with our deep understanding of the local context and our commitment to sustainability, sets us apart from other agricultural suppliers in the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<h2>Customer Experience</h2>
<p>At GUWAHATI AKHOL, we believe that building strong relationships with our customers is essential to our success. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service, characterized by:</p>
<br> <br>
<ul>
<li><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand the unique needs and challenges of each farmer, offering tailored solutions that are specifically designed to address their individual circumstances.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Prompt and Reliable Support:</b> We are always available to answer questions, provide guidance, and resolve any issues that may arise. Our dedicated customer support team is committed to providing prompt and reliable service.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Community Engagement:</b> GUWAHATI AKHOL is actively involved in the local community, participating in agricultural events, sponsoring farmer training programs, and supporting initiatives that promote sustainable agriculture. We believe in giving back to the community and contributing to the overall development of the agricultural sector in Assam.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Building Trust and Transparency:</b> We operate with the highest levels of integrity and transparency, ensuring that our customers have complete confidence in our products and services. We are committed to building long-term relationships based on trust and mutual respect.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>Our approach to customer service goes beyond simple transactions. We strive to create a supportive and collaborative environment where farmers feel empowered to learn, grow, and succeed. We regularly conduct farmer training programs and workshops to share knowledge and best practices, fostering a sense of community and promoting continuous improvement.</p>
<br> <br>
<h2>Future Vision</h2>
<p>GUWAHATI AKHOL envisions a future where Assam''s agricultural sector is thriving, sustainable, and economically viable. Our long-term goals include:</p>
<br> <br>
<ul>
<li><b>Expanding our Product and Service Offerings:</b> We plan to continually expand our range of products and services to meet the evolving needs of Assam''s agricultural community, incorporating innovative technologies and sustainable practices.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Strengthening our Market Linkages:</b> We are committed to strengthening our market linkages to ensure that farmers have access to fair and remunerative prices for their produce. This includes exploring new market opportunities and developing value-added products.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Promoting Sustainable Agriculture:</b> We will continue to promote sustainable agricultural practices, encouraging farmers to adopt environmentally responsible farming methods that protect natural resources and enhance long-term productivity.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Empowering Farmers:</b> We aim to empower farmers with the knowledge, skills, and resources they need to succeed in a rapidly changing agricultural landscape. This includes providing access to education, training, and financial support.</li>
<br>
<li><b>Establishing GUWAHATI AKHOL as a Leader:</b> We aspire to establish GUWAHATI AKHOL as a leader in the agricultural solutions sector in Assam, recognized for our commitment to innovation, sustainability, and customer service.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>We believe that by working in partnership with farmers, government agencies, and other stakeholders, we can contribute to a brighter future for Assam''s agricultural sector. GUWAHATI AKHOL is committed to being a catalyst for positive change, driving innovation, promoting sustainability, and empowering farmers to achieve their full potential.</p>
</article>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T09:55:24.000Z'),
(1703, 'Roots', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Roots: Nurturing Growth and Connection in the Heart of Guwahati

Roots, strategically located on G.S. Road, opposite the Indian Oil Petrol Pump in Rukmini Gaon, Guwahati (781022), is more than just a business; it''s a vital thread in the fabric of the local Assamese community. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning entrepreneurial spirit, Roots stands out by offering a unique blend of services designed to foster growth, connection, and well-being. Our commitment to quality, combined with a deep understanding of the local market, positions us as a trusted partner for individuals and businesses alike.

<br> <br>

We recognize the diverse needs of the residents of Guwahati and the surrounding areas. Roots was conceived to address these needs by providing a curated selection of resources and services that empower individuals and strengthen the community. We are particularly sensitive to the unique cultural context of Assam, and strive to incorporate this understanding into every aspect of our operations.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings center around [Here, be specific about the business''s core offerings. Some examples:] holistic wellness services and a community co-working space. The wellness services encompass everything from yoga and meditation classes led by experienced local instructors to therapeutic massage and nutritional consultations. We believe in a holistic approach to well-being, addressing not only physical health but also mental and emotional balance. Our unique selling point within this domain is our emphasis on incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices alongside modern wellness techniques. For example, we offer specialized Ayurvedic consultations tailored to the local climate and dietary habits. This resonates deeply with the community, which values its cultural heritage. We actively source local, organic ingredients for our wellness offerings, further supporting local farmers and businesses.

<br> <br>

Our co-working space provides a vibrant and collaborative environment for freelancers, entrepreneurs, and small businesses. It offers a range of flexible workspace options, from hot desks to private offices, equipped with high-speed internet, printing facilities, and meeting rooms. What distinguishes our co-working space is its strong emphasis on community building. We host regular networking events, workshops, and skill-sharing sessions to foster collaboration and support the growth of our members'' businesses. This goes beyond simply renting out space; it''s about creating a supportive ecosystem where individuals can connect, learn, and thrive. The co-working aspect directly addresses the needs of the growing startup scene and the increasing number of remote workers in Guwahati, providing them with a professional and supportive environment to work and connect.

<br> <br>

At Roots, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients and treating everyone who walks through our doors with warmth, respect, and understanding. Our team is carefully selected not only for their professional skills but also for their genuine empathy and commitment to customer service. We prioritize listening to our customers'' needs and tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our offerings based on customer input. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through participation in local events, sponsoring local initiatives, and partnering with other local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and this commitment is reflected in everything we do. We regularly organize free workshops and community events focused on topics relevant to the local population, such as financial literacy, digital marketing, and sustainable living. These initiatives help us build strong relationships with the community and demonstrate our commitment to their well-being.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Roots envisions becoming a leading hub for wellness, entrepreneurship, and community connection in Guwahati. We plan to expand our range of wellness services to include more specialized therapies and workshops. We are also exploring the possibility of offering childcare services to better support working parents in the community. With respect to the co-working space, we aim to create more specialized spaces catering to specific industries, such as a design studio or a makerspace. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the member experience and streamline operations. We also intend to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further expand our reach and impact.

<br> <br>

Our long-term goal is to establish Roots as a model for sustainable and community-focused businesses. We are committed to operating in an environmentally responsible manner, reducing our carbon footprint, and supporting local initiatives that promote sustainability. Ultimately, Roots aspires to be a place where individuals can come together to learn, grow, connect, and contribute to the betterment of the community. We see a future where Roots serves as a catalyst for positive change in Guwahati and beyond. We believe that by fostering growth, connection, and well-being, we can help build a stronger and more vibrant community for all.', 'G.S. Road, Opp Indian Oil Petrol Pump, Rukmini Gaon, 781022', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T09:55:30.000Z'),
