(1705, 'Rabha Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Rabha Kitchen: A Culinary Gem Celebrating Assam''s Rich Heritage</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of [Location, Assam - if unavailable, omit specific location], Rabha Kitchen isn''t just a restaurant; it''s a vibrant celebration of Assam''s diverse culinary heritage, particularly focusing on the unique flavors and traditions of the Rabha community. We are committed to providing an authentic and immersive dining experience, showcasing both traditional recipes passed down through generations and innovative interpretations that cater to modern palates. Rabha Kitchen stands out in the local business landscape as more than just a food establishment; it''s a cultural ambassador, actively promoting and preserving the rich gastronomic tapestry of Assam. We aim to be a cornerstone of the community, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect with the region''s cultural identity through the universal language of food.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offering centers around authentic Rabha and broader Assamese cuisine. The menu features signature dishes such as *Chuk''a Bhat* (sticky rice cooked in a unique bamboo method), *Pitha* (traditional rice cakes in various sweet and savory forms), and flavorful meat and vegetable curries prepared with locally sourced ingredients and traditional Rabha spices. What distinguishes Rabha Kitchen is our unwavering commitment to using fresh, seasonal produce sourced directly from local farmers, ensuring not only superior quality but also supporting the local agricultural economy. Beyond the food itself, we offer unique cultural experiences, occasionally featuring live Rabha folk music performances and showcasing traditional Rabha handicrafts. This multi-faceted approach sets us apart from typical restaurants, providing a richer, more immersive cultural experience. We address a critical need in the local market: a craving for authentic, locally-sourced food and a desire to connect with the region''s unique cultural identity. We provide a venue for experiencing this heritage firsthand.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Rabha Kitchen, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and personalized dining atmosphere. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the dishes and the cultural significance behind them, allowing them to guide guests through the menu and answer any questions. We believe in building genuine relationships with our customers, treating them as honored guests rather than just patrons. The ambiance reflects the warmth and hospitality inherent in Rabha culture, featuring traditional décor and comfortable seating arrangements. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local festivals and events, offering catering services for community gatherings, and partnering with local artisans to showcase their work. Our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients also strengthens our connection with the community, fostering a sense of shared purpose and mutual support. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs and expectations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Rabha Kitchen envisions becoming a nationally recognized culinary destination, renowned for its authentic Rabha and Assamese cuisine and its commitment to cultural preservation. We plan to expand our menu to include even more diverse regional dishes, further showcasing the richness and complexity of Assam''s culinary landscape. Future plans include establishing a cooking school where visitors can learn to prepare traditional Rabha dishes, creating a hands-on cultural experience. We also aim to develop a line of packaged Rabha spices and culinary products, allowing customers to recreate the flavors of Rabha Kitchen in their own homes and share them with others. Long-term, we aspire to establish partnerships with other cultural organizations and tourism agencies to promote Assam as a unique and compelling travel destination. We believe that Rabha Kitchen has the potential to be a catalyst for economic growth in the local community, supporting local farmers, artisans, and other businesses. Our ultimate goal is to not just serve delicious food but to preserve and promote the vibrant cultural heritage of the Rabha community and Assam as a whole, ensuring that it is enjoyed and appreciated for generations to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T10:00:08.000Z'),
(1706, 'Nagameez', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Nagameez: Your Partner for Growth in the Heart of Assam</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located at 4RC4+J9C, Tripura Rd, near Agile Hospital, Nagameez stands as a dynamic and forward-thinking business dedicated to serving the evolving needs of the local community and beyond. While specific sector specialisation remains a core asset, Nagameez is defined by its adaptability and commitment to providing tailored solutions. Our strategic location allows us to be readily accessible to clients throughout the region, fostering strong relationships and enabling responsive service.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Nagameez, we believe in the power of partnership. Whether you''re a budding entrepreneur or an established enterprise, we strive to provide the support and resources necessary for you to thrive. Our team possesses a deep understanding of the Assam business landscape, enabling us to offer insightful guidance and practical solutions that resonate with the local context.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our Core Offerings: Solutions Tailored to Your Needs</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nagameez offers a versatile suite of services designed to address a wide range of business requirements. While the specific nature of these services is dependent on client needs and current market trends, our offerings typically fall into several key areas. These may include, but are not limited to, business consultancy, marketing support, technological solutions, and logistical assistance. We approach each project with a fresh perspective, ensuring that the solutions we deliver are precisely aligned with the client''s objectives and the realities of their operating environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiator for Nagameez lies in our ability to combine global best practices with a deep understanding of the local Assam market. This allows us to offer solutions that are both innovative and practical, leveraging the latest technologies and methodologies while remaining sensitive to the unique cultural and economic dynamics of the region. We take pride in our ability to bridge the gap between global trends and local realities, empowering our clients to compete effectively in an increasingly interconnected world.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Meeting Local Market Needs: A Commitment to Community</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We understand that businesses in Assam face unique challenges and opportunities. From navigating complex regulatory landscapes to accessing skilled labor and capital, the path to success can be daunting. At Nagameez, we are committed to providing the support and guidance needed to overcome these obstacles. We actively seek to understand the specific needs of our clients and tailor our services accordingly. This personalized approach ensures that our clients receive the most relevant and effective solutions for their particular situation.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer Experience: Building Lasting Relationships</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Nagameez, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful business. We are dedicated to providing a seamless and positive experience for every client, from the initial consultation to the completion of the project. Our team is comprised of experienced professionals who are passionate about helping businesses succeed. We are committed to building long-term relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. We prioritize open communication, responsiveness, and a proactive approach to problem-solving.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We also understand the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting the growth and development of the region. We believe that by investing in the community, we are investing in our own future. This commitment to community engagement is an integral part of our business philosophy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Community Impact</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Nagameez is committed to continued growth and innovation. We plan to expand our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market and to leverage emerging technologies to provide even more effective solutions for our clients. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our reach beyond Assam, bringing our expertise and dedication to other regions in India. Our ultimate goal is to become a leading business partner for companies of all sizes, empowering them to achieve their full potential.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We envision Nagameez as more than just a business; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change in the community. We are committed to creating jobs, supporting local entrepreneurs, and contributing to the overall economic development of the region. We believe that by working together, we can build a brighter future for Assam and for India as a whole.</p>', '4RC4+J9C, Tripura Rd, near Agile Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T10:00:15.000Z'),
(1707, 'Belly’s Day Out', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Belly’s Day Out: A Culinary Gem Nestled in the Heart of Sewali Path</p>

<p>Nestled near Main Road in the vibrant community of Sewali Path, Assam, Belly’s Day Out isn''t just a restaurant; it''s an experience. We are a culinary haven dedicated to providing authentic Assamese flavors alongside carefully selected North Indian and Continental dishes, all prepared with the freshest local ingredients. In a region celebrated for its rich culinary heritage, Belly''s Day Out stands out by skillfully blending traditional techniques with modern presentation, creating a dining destination that caters to both locals and visitors seeking an immersive gastronomic journey. Our commitment extends beyond simply serving food; we aim to cultivate a warm and welcoming atmosphere that reflects the genuine hospitality Assam is known for, making us a significant and cherished part of the local business community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>A Symphony of Flavors: Our Core Offerings</p>

<p>At Belly’s Day Out, we pride ourselves on offering a diverse menu that caters to a variety of palates. Our core offering revolves around three distinct culinary pillars: Authentic Assamese cuisine, classic North Indian dishes, and familiar Continental favorites. This allows us to appeal to a broad customer base, from those craving traditional Assamese delicacies like <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry) and <i>Pitha</i> (rice cakes) to those seeking the comforting flavors of butter chicken or a perfectly cooked steak. <br> <br> What truly sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to quality and freshness. We source our ingredients locally, working closely with farmers and suppliers in the region to ensure that every dish is prepared with the best seasonal produce, spices, and meats. This dedication to local sourcing not only supports the community but also guarantees the authentic flavors that define our culinary identity. Furthermore, we meticulously craft each dish from scratch, employing traditional cooking methods passed down through generations to preserve the integrity and unique character of Assamese cuisine. Our approach to North Indian and Continental dishes mirrors this dedication to quality, ensuring each option is prepared with meticulous attention to detail and the finest ingredients. We offer vegetarian and vegan options within each culinary pillar, recognizing and catering to the diverse dietary needs of our clientele.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Creating Memorable Experiences: Our Customer-Centric Approach</p>

<p>Customer service is at the heart of everything we do at Belly’s Day Out. From the moment guests step through our doors, we strive to create a welcoming and attentive environment. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and the cultural significance of our dishes, enabling them to provide insightful recommendations and answer any questions with genuine enthusiasm. We believe in building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and loyalty. <br> <br> To further enhance the customer experience, we pay close attention to the ambiance of our restaurant. The décor reflects the beauty and artistry of Assam, with subtle touches that create a warm and inviting atmosphere. We regularly host events and promotions, such as live music performances featuring local artists, to celebrate the region''s cultural heritage and provide guests with unique and memorable experiences. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools and charities, participating in local festivals and events. By consistently exceeding expectations and fostering a strong connection with the community, Belly’s Day Out has established itself as more than just a restaurant; it''s a gathering place where people can come together to enjoy good food, good company, and the rich cultural tapestry of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>A Future Brimming with Flavor: Our Vision for Growth</p>

<p>The future of Belly’s Day Out is bright, with ambitious plans for continued growth and innovation. Our long-term goal is to become a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for our commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. We envision expanding our menu to include even more diverse regional specialties, showcasing the incredible culinary diversity of the Northeast. <br> <br> We are actively exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, with plans to open additional locations in other key areas of Assam. We are also investing in technology to streamline our operations and enhance the customer experience, including online ordering and delivery services. We understand the importance of sustainability and are committed to implementing environmentally friendly practices throughout our business, from sourcing local ingredients to reducing waste. By staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, Belly’s Day Out is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a culinary leader in the region.</p>', 'near, Main Road, Sewali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T10:00:22.000Z'),
(1708, 'KOUPAT RESTAURANT', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>KOUPAT RESTAURANT: A Culinary Gem in the Heart of Janakpur Road</p>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant locality of House No. 17, Janakpur Rd, near Om Enclave Apartment, KOUPAT RESTAURANT offers a distinctive dining experience that blends authentic Assamese flavors with a touch of modern culinary innovation. More than just a restaurant, KOUPAT aspires to be a community hub, a place where families gather, friends connect, and individuals savor the richness of Assam’s culinary heritage. In a region known for its deep-rooted culinary traditions, KOUPAT stands out by offering a carefully curated menu that respects these traditions while introducing contemporary interpretations designed to tantalize the modern palate. Its strategic location, in a growing residential area, positions KOUPAT as a convenient and desirable dining destination for both local residents and visitors seeking an authentic taste of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of KOUPAT RESTAURANT lies its unwavering commitment to delivering exceptional culinary experiences. The restaurant''s core offering centers around authentic Assamese cuisine, featuring dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients and traditional cooking methods. The menu boasts a diverse selection of flavorful curries, rice preparations, and innovative vegetarian and non-vegetarian options. Signature dishes include a range of traditional fish preparations, slow-cooked meats infused with local herbs and spices, and unique vegetable dishes that showcase the region''s agricultural bounty. Beyond the core Assamese offerings, KOUPAT also features a selection of popular North Indian dishes and continental items, catering to a broader range of palates and preferences. What sets KOUPAT apart is its dedication to quality and authenticity. The chefs prioritize fresh, locally sourced ingredients, ensuring that each dish bursts with vibrant flavors and reflects the true essence of Assamese cuisine. This commitment to quality extends to the beverage offerings, which include a selection of local teas, refreshing juices, and other beverages that complement the food. Furthermore, KOUPAT provides catering services for local events and gatherings, bringing its culinary expertise to a wider audience and establishing itself as a go-to provider for authentic Assamese cuisine within the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>KOUPAT RESTAURANT understands that a truly exceptional dining experience goes beyond just the food. The restaurant places a strong emphasis on creating a warm, welcoming, and attentive atmosphere for every guest. From the moment customers step through the door, they are greeted with friendly smiles and personalized service. The staff is meticulously trained to provide knowledgeable recommendations, address dietary concerns, and ensure that every need is met. The ambiance of KOUPAT is carefully curated to reflect the local culture and create a comfortable and inviting space. The interior décor incorporates traditional Assamese motifs and artwork, creating a sense of authenticity and connection to the region. Beyond providing exceptional service and creating a pleasant ambiance, KOUPAT actively seeks to connect with the local community. The restaurant regularly hosts events and promotions that celebrate Assamese culture and traditions. This includes showcasing local artists, supporting local farmers and producers, and participating in community festivals and initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with its neighbors and actively contributing to the local community, KOUPAT aims to be more than just a restaurant; it strives to be a valued and respected member of the neighborhood.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking towards the future, KOUPAT RESTAURANT envisions becoming a culinary landmark within the Janakpur Road area and beyond. The business has ambitious plans for growth and expansion, with a focus on enhancing its existing offerings and reaching new customers. One key aspect of the future vision involves expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative and contemporary Assamese dishes, while still honoring the region''s culinary traditions. This will involve experimenting with new ingredients, techniques, and presentations to create exciting and memorable dining experiences. Another area of focus is on strengthening the restaurant''s online presence and utilizing digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience. This includes developing a user-friendly website, engaging with customers on social media platforms, and offering online ordering and delivery services. Furthermore, KOUPAT plans to explore opportunities for strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to cross-promote its services and expand its reach within the community. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of the city or region, and perhaps even franchising the KOUPAT brand to bring the flavors of Assam to a wider audience. Ultimately, KOUPAT RESTAURANT aims to be recognized as a leading culinary destination, known for its exceptional food, impeccable service, and unwavering commitment to promoting Assamese culture and heritage.</p>', 'House no 17, Janakpur Rd, near Om Enclave Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T10:00:28.000Z'),
(1709, 'Mamagoto', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Mamagoto, a vibrant and contemporary casual dining establishment, brings a refreshing perspective to the culinary scene in Assam. Strategically located to serve both residents and visitors, Mamagoto distinguishes itself by offering a Pan-Asian dining experience that blends authentic flavors with modern presentation, setting a new standard for accessible and exciting cuisine within the region''s diverse food landscape. We aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a community hub where people can connect over delicious food and memorable experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Mamagoto specializes in delivering a carefully curated menu that spans the diverse culinary tapestry of Asia. Our core offerings include a wide array of expertly prepared dishes featuring vibrant flavors from Thailand, China, Japan, Malaysia, and Indonesia. From fragrant Thai curries bursting with aromatic spices to delicately crafted sushi rolls showcasing the freshest ingredients, our menu is designed to cater to a wide range of palates and preferences. Our noodle and rice bowls, customizable with various protein and vegetable options, provide a hearty and satisfying meal, while our selection of small plates and appetizers are perfect for sharing and sampling the diverse tastes of Asia. Vegetarian and vegan options are prominently featured, reflecting our commitment to inclusivity and catering to the evolving dietary needs of our community. Furthermore, Mamagoto prides itself on using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and quality of our dishes. Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to deliver an authentic Pan-Asian experience in a relaxed and stylish setting, offering a high-quality dining option that is both accessible and affordable. This addresses a growing demand for diverse culinary experiences within the local market, providing an alternative to traditional dining options and introducing customers to a world of exciting flavors.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Mamagoto, we believe that exceptional food is only part of the dining experience. We are deeply committed to providing outstanding customer service that exceeds expectations and fosters lasting relationships with our patrons. Our staff is meticulously trained to be knowledgeable about our menu, attentive to customer needs, and passionate about delivering a warm and welcoming atmosphere. We strive to create a comfortable and enjoyable environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. We actively seek customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our service and offerings. Beyond the walls of our restaurant, Mamagoto actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with local businesses, and support for local charities. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we are committed to being a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. Our commitment to customer service and community engagement sets us apart and contributes to our strong reputation within the local market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future of Mamagoto is bright, filled with possibilities for growth and expansion within Assam and beyond. Our long-term goal is to establish Mamagoto as the premier destination for Pan-Asian cuisine in the region, known for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and strong community ties. We plan to expand our menu to include more innovative and seasonal dishes, showcasing the diversity and creativity of Asian cuisine. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other cities and towns within Assam, bringing the Mamagoto experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we are investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including online ordering, mobile payments, and loyalty programs. We believe that by staying true to our core values of quality, service, and community engagement, we can achieve our ambitious goals and continue to thrive in the dynamic and evolving culinary landscape. We envision Mamagoto as not just a restaurant, but as a cherished part of the local community, a place where people can come together to celebrate life''s moments and enjoy the vibrant flavors of Asia.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T10:00:35.000Z'),
(1710, 'Makhan Bhog', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Makhan Bhog: A Taste of Tradition at the Heart of Guwahati

Makhan Bhog, situated at Ground, Royal Centre, GS Rd, opposite Deorah College, is more than just a sweet shop; it''s an embodiment of Assamese culinary traditions blended with contemporary tastes. Nestled in a prime location, it serves as a convenient and delightful destination for residents and visitors alike, offering a diverse range of sweets, snacks, and savory items. Its strategic positioning across from Deorah College contributes to a steady stream of customers, creating a vibrant and welcoming atmosphere. Makhan Bhog stands out as a cornerstone of the local culinary scene, committed to providing exceptional quality and authentic flavors that resonate with the community. <br> <br>

Core Offerings: Sweetening Lives and Satisfying Cravings

At its core, Makhan Bhog offers a comprehensive selection of traditional Indian sweets, with a particular emphasis on Assamese delicacies. From the rich and creamy "lassi" and "peda" to the delicate "sandesh" and "barfi," each sweet is crafted using time-honored recipes and the freshest ingredients. This commitment to quality ensures an authentic and unforgettable taste experience. Beyond sweets, Makhan Bhog also features a savory menu that includes popular snacks like "samosas," "kachoris," and "pani puri," prepared with the same dedication to quality and flavor. This combination of sweet and savory options makes Makhan Bhog a one-stop destination for satisfying cravings and celebrating special occasions.

The unique selling point of Makhan Bhog lies in its ability to seamlessly blend tradition with modern preferences. While staying true to the authentic flavors of Indian sweets, the business also innovates by introducing new variations and presentations, catering to evolving customer demands. This adaptability, coupled with the use of high-quality ingredients and skilled craftsmanship, sets Makhan Bhog apart from its competitors. Furthermore, the business actively sources local ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and businesses while ensuring the freshness and authenticity of its products.

Makhan Bhog effectively addresses the local market needs by providing a reliable source of high-quality sweets and snacks for various occasions, from everyday treats to festive celebrations. The accessibility of the location and the diverse menu options make it a popular choice for students, families, and working professionals in the surrounding area. The business also caters to special orders and events, providing customized sweet boxes and catering services for weddings, birthdays, and corporate gatherings. <br> <br>

Customer Experience: Building Relationships and Fostering Community

Makhan Bhog understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to success. The staff is trained to be friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable about the products, ensuring that every customer feels welcomed and valued. The business strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, where customers can relax and enjoy their treats. Special attention is given to maintaining cleanliness and hygiene throughout the store, further enhancing the customer experience.

What truly sets Makhan Bhog apart is its genuine connection with the local community. The business actively participates in local events and festivals, offering special promotions and treats to celebrate with the community. It also supports local charities and initiatives, demonstrating a commitment to giving back and making a positive impact. This active involvement fosters a strong sense of loyalty and trust among customers, who view Makhan Bhog as more than just a sweet shop, but as a valued member of the community. Furthermore, Makhan Bhog welcomes feedback and suggestions from customers, using this input to continuously improve its products and services. This customer-centric approach ensures that the business remains relevant and responsive to the evolving needs of the community. <br> <br>

Future Vision: Sweetening the Future, One Bite at a Time

Makhan Bhog envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued success. The business plans to expand its product line by introducing new and innovative sweets and snacks, while staying true to its commitment to quality and authenticity. This expansion may include exploring regional Assamese sweets that are less commonly available, further solidifying its position as a champion of local culinary heritage.

Furthermore, Makhan Bhog aims to enhance its online presence by developing a user-friendly website and online ordering system. This will allow customers to easily browse the menu, place orders, and arrange for delivery or pickup, expanding the business''s reach beyond its physical location. The business also plans to explore opportunities for franchising or opening new branches in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, bringing the taste of Makhan Bhog to a wider audience.

In the long term, Makhan Bhog aspires to become a leading brand in the Indian sweet and snack industry, known for its exceptional quality, authentic flavors, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. The business will continue to invest in its people, processes, and technology to ensure that it remains competitive and innovative. Makhan Bhog is confident that by staying true to its core values and embracing new opportunities, it can achieve its ambitious goals and continue to sweeten the lives of its customers for many years to come.', 'Ground, Royal Centre, GS Rd, opposite Deorah College', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.339Z', '2025-12-07T10:05:11.000Z'),
(1711, 'Good Food Restaurant (GFR)', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Good Food Restaurant (GFR) is more than just a place to eat; it''s a culinary cornerstone deeply embedded in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Located in a bustling area known for its vibrant culture and diverse population, GFR offers a unique dining experience that seamlessly blends traditional Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. In a region rich with culinary heritage, GFR stands out by elevating local ingredients and recipes to new heights, creating dishes that are both familiar and innovative. We are committed to providing a memorable gastronomic journey for every guest, solidifying our position as a premier dining destination in the local business landscape.

<br> <br>

GFR''s core offering revolves around delivering authentic Assamese cuisine with a modern twist. Our menu features a wide array of dishes, from classic preparations of *masor tenga* and *aloo pitika* to innovative creations that incorporate locally sourced ingredients like bamboo shoot, ghost chili, and a variety of indigenous herbs and spices. We meticulously select our produce from local farmers and suppliers, ensuring the freshness and quality of every dish. Beyond the food, we offer a curated selection of beverages, including traditional Assamese rice beer (locally sourced and carefully vetted for quality), locally grown teas, and a range of refreshing non-alcoholic options. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to present traditional Assamese food in an elegant and accessible manner, appealing to both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic culinary experience. This resonates deeply with the local market, where there is a strong appreciation for heritage and a growing desire for high-quality dining options that celebrate local flavors.

<br> <br>

At GFR, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in the Assamese tradition of hospitality, where guests are treated with utmost respect and care. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and eager to share insights into the ingredients and preparation methods of each dish. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel comfortable and welcome. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local food festivals, supporting local farmers and artisans, and hosting events that celebrate Assamese culture and heritage. We also leverage social media platforms to connect with our customers, gather feedback, and share updates on our menu and events. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, we aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a gathering place where people can come together to celebrate the rich culinary traditions of Assam.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, GFR envisions becoming a regional leader in showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. Our long-term goals include expanding our operations to other cities in Assam and potentially beyond, while maintaining the same commitment to quality, authenticity, and customer service that has made us successful. We plan to introduce new menu items that further explore the diversity of Assamese cuisine, including dishes from lesser-known regions and communities. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local tourism organizations to promote Assam''s culinary heritage to a wider audience. Furthermore, GFR is committed to sustainable practices. We will continue to prioritize sourcing ingredients from local farmers, reducing food waste, and implementing energy-efficient measures. We also plan to establish a culinary training program for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge to pursue careers in the hospitality industry. By investing in our community and embracing sustainable practices, GFR aims to create a lasting positive impact on the local economy and environment while solidifying its position as a leading culinary destination in Assam.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:05:17.000Z'),
(1712, 'PURPLE KITCHEN', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>PURPLE KITCHEN is a vibrant and innovative culinary venture nestled in the heart of Assam, offering a unique dining experience that celebrates the rich flavors and traditions of the region while embracing modern culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, PURPLE KITCHEN aims to be a cultural hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can gather, savor exceptional food, and connect with the spirit of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around authentic Assamese cuisine, meticulously prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We pride ourselves on showcasing the diverse culinary landscape of Assam, from the aromatic ''khar'' dishes to the spicy ''masor tenga'' and the comforting ''pitha''. We also feature innovative interpretations of classic Assamese recipes, creating dishes that are both familiar and exciting. In addition to our traditional fare, we offer a curated selection of pan-Asian dishes with a distinct Assamese twist, catering to a wider range of palates. Furthermore, we offer catering services for events of all sizes, bringing the PURPLE KITCHEN experience to your doorstep. Our products also include a range of homemade pickles, chutneys, and traditional Assamese snacks, packaged beautifully and available for purchase, allowing customers to take a piece of PURPLE KITCHEN home with them. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to using only the freshest, locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and producers and ensuring the highest quality and authentic flavors in every dish. We also offer unique tasting menus that showcase the diverse regional cuisines of Assam, providing a culinary journey for our guests. These services directly address the growing demand for authentic and high-quality Assamese food in the local market, appealing to both locals seeking familiar flavors and tourists eager to explore the region''s culinary heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At PURPLE KITCHEN, we believe that exceptional food is only part of the equation; exceptional service is equally crucial. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide warm, attentive, and personalized service to every guest. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local artisans and farmers, showcasing their products and promoting their work within our restaurant. We also regularly host cultural events, such as traditional music performances and cooking demonstrations, creating a vibrant and engaging space for the community to come together. Our commitment to sustainability is also a cornerstone of our customer experience. We minimize our environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction, and energy conservation, appealing to environmentally conscious customers. Feedback is actively sought and valued, enabling us to continually improve our services and offerings to better meet the needs and expectations of our customers. We nurture lasting relationships with our customers by creating a sense of community and offering an unforgettable dining experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, PURPLE KITCHEN envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional service, and community engagement. We plan to expand our menu to include more regional specialties, further showcasing the diverse culinary traditions of Assam. We also intend to establish a cooking school, offering classes on traditional Assamese cuisine and empowering individuals to learn and preserve these culinary traditions. Exploring strategic partnerships with local hotels and tour operators to promote PURPLE KITCHEN to a wider audience is also a key part of our future plans. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the PURPLE KITCHEN experience to new communities. Ultimately, our goal is to elevate Assamese cuisine to a national and international level, showcasing the rich flavors and traditions of the region to the world. We are committed to sustainable growth, ensuring that our business practices are environmentally responsible and contribute to the economic development of the local community.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:05:24.000Z'),
(1713, 'Canopy Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Canopy Kitchen: A Culinary Haven Nestled in the Heart of Assam</p>

<p>Canopy Kitchen stands as a vibrant and welcoming culinary destination in the heart of Assam, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and contemporary culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, Canopy Kitchen aspires to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can experience the rich tapestry of Assamese cuisine in a comfortable and inviting atmosphere. Rooted in a deep appreciation for local ingredients and culinary heritage, Canopy Kitchen distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, innovation, and genuine hospitality. In a region renowned for its distinct food culture, Canopy Kitchen carves a niche by elevating traditional dishes while simultaneously embracing modern culinary trends, solidifying its position as a significant player in the local Assam business landscape. The business aims to showcase the best of Assam to the world.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Canopy Kitchen lies a dedication to providing exceptional culinary experiences. The restaurant''s core offering revolves around a diverse menu featuring authentic Assamese dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Signature dishes include preparations of freshwater fish from the Brahmaputra River, slow-cooked pork with bamboo shoots, and flavorful duck curries infused with aromatic herbs and spices. Vegetarian options abound, showcasing the region''s abundant seasonal vegetables and pulses. Beyond traditional fare, Canopy Kitchen also introduces innovative interpretations of classic Assamese recipes, creating a fusion of old and new that appeals to a broad palate. A unique selling point is the restaurant''s commitment to using organic and sustainable farming practices, ensuring that the food is not only delicious but also ethically sourced. To complement the food menu, Canopy Kitchen offers a carefully curated selection of beverages, including local teas, fruit juices, and regional wines. This combination of authentic Assamese cuisine, innovative dishes, and quality ingredients effectively addresses the growing demand for unique and sustainable dining experiences in the local market. The business seeks to fulfill a desire from locals and tourists to sample the best of Assamese cuisine in a setting that matches it.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Canopy Kitchen. The restaurant fosters a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where every guest feels like a valued member of the community. From the moment customers step through the door, they are greeted with genuine smiles and attentive service. The staff is knowledgeable about the menu and happy to provide recommendations, ensuring that each diner has a personalized and memorable experience. What truly sets Canopy Kitchen apart is its dedication to creating a sense of connection with the local community. The restaurant actively supports local farmers and artisans, showcasing their products and stories within the dining space. Regular events, such as cooking demonstrations and cultural performances, further enhance the community spirit. The design of the restaurant is thoughtfully curated to reflect the region''s natural beauty and cultural heritage, creating a space that is both visually appealing and emotionally resonant. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and fostering a strong sense of community, Canopy Kitchen has established a loyal following and a reputation for excellence in the local hospitality sector. It''s about more than just food; it''s about creating an experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Canopy Kitchen envisions itself as a leading force in promoting Assamese cuisine and culture on a wider scale. The business aims to expand its operations strategically, opening additional locations in key tourist destinations within Assam and potentially beyond. Plans are also underway to develop a line of packaged food products featuring signature Canopy Kitchen recipes, allowing customers to enjoy the flavors of Assam in their own homes. Furthermore, the business intends to invest in culinary training programs for local youth, fostering talent and ensuring the continued growth of the region''s culinary sector. A long-term goal is to establish Canopy Kitchen as a globally recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and sustainable practices. By embracing innovation, expanding its reach, and remaining true to its core values, Canopy Kitchen is poised for continued growth and success, contributing significantly to the economic and cultural vitality of Assam. The business will focus on sustainability.</p> <br> <br>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:05:31.000Z'),
(1714, 'Uptown Escape Cafe & Cocktail Bar', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Uptown Escape Cafe & Cocktail Bar offers a sophisticated yet welcoming haven in the heart of [City Name, Assam], providing a unique blend of cafe culture and evening entertainment. More than just a place to grab a coffee or a cocktail, Uptown Escape is envisioned as a vibrant community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and experience a taste of refined Assam hospitality.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Unlike the typical cafes and bars in the area, Uptown Escape distinguishes itself through its carefully curated ambiance, blending modern design with subtle nods to Assam''s rich cultural heritage. This carefully considered atmosphere sets the stage for a diverse range of experiences, from quiet afternoon coffee dates to lively evening gatherings.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Uptown Escape offers a dual-service model. During the day, it operates as a cafe, serving a selection of expertly brewed coffees, teas, and specialty beverages alongside a menu of light meals and snacks. The coffee beans are sourced from local Assam estates whenever possible, supporting local farmers and offering patrons a taste of authentic Assamese coffee culture. The food menu features both familiar cafe favorites and locally inspired dishes, catering to a variety of tastes and dietary preferences. Options include traditional Assamese snacks re-imagined for a contemporary palate, ensuring an authentic regional experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>As evening approaches, Uptown Escape transitions into a cocktail bar, offering a carefully crafted menu of classic and innovative cocktails. Skilled mixologists utilize fresh, locally sourced ingredients, including regional fruits and spices, to create unique and memorable drinks. The bar also offers a selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers, ensuring something for every discerning palate. Regularly hosted live music events, featuring local artists and bands, further enhance the evening atmosphere, creating a vibrant and engaging entertainment experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A key differentiator for Uptown Escape is its commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. The staff is meticulously trained to provide friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable service. Every interaction is geared towards making guests feel welcome and valued. Beyond excellent service, Uptown Escape actively seeks to integrate itself into the local community. The cafe and bar host community events, such as art exhibitions featuring local artists, book readings, and themed nights celebrating Assamese culture. Partnering with local businesses and organizations further strengthens ties to the community and fosters a sense of belonging.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The long-term vision for Uptown Escape involves becoming a recognized and respected establishment within the Assam hospitality landscape. This includes expanding its menu offerings, refining its cocktail selection, and further enhancing the overall customer experience. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans and producers to showcase Assamese crafts and products within the cafe and bar setting is also a priority. Furthermore, Uptown Escape aims to be a leader in sustainable business practices, implementing eco-friendly initiatives to minimize its environmental impact. This includes sourcing ingredients responsibly, reducing waste, and promoting environmental awareness within the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Expansion opportunities are also being considered. This could involve opening additional locations in other parts of Assam or even franchising the Uptown Escape concept to other regions. Any future expansion will be carefully planned and executed to ensure that the core values of quality, community engagement, and exceptional customer service are maintained. Uptown Escape Cafe & Cocktail Bar is poised to become a beloved destination, contributing to the vibrancy and cultural richness of [City Name, Assam].</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:05:37.000Z'),
(1715, 'O''Guwahati', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>O''Guwahati, situated at First Floor, Bliss Enclave, Kalaguru Bishnu Prasad Rabha Flyover, is a dynamic and innovative enterprise dedicated to enriching the commercial and cultural fabric of Guwahati and the wider Assam region. We are more than just a business; we are a conduit connecting local artisans, entrepreneurs, and the discerning consumer, fostering economic growth and celebrating the unique heritage of Northeast India. Our commitment extends beyond profit margins; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable practices and empowering local communities through mindful business operations.</p> <br> <br>

<p>O''Guwahati operates on a multi-faceted platform, primarily focusing on two key areas: curated retail of authentic Assamese products and bespoke event management services tailored to the specific needs of the region. Our retail division showcases a carefully selected collection of handicrafts, textiles, local produce, and artisanal goods sourced directly from talented creators across Assam. This includes Eri silk garments, handcrafted bamboo products, exquisite Jaapi headwear, organic tea blends, and a diverse array of culinary delights that embody the authentic flavors of the region. What sets us apart is our rigorous quality control, ensuring that every item reflects the highest standards of craftsmanship and authenticity. We also prioritize fair trade practices, guaranteeing that artisans receive just compensation for their work, thereby contributing to their economic well-being. In addition to our retail offerings, our event management services cater to a diverse clientele, ranging from corporate organizations to private individuals. We specialize in creating memorable and impactful events, whether it''s a product launch, a cultural festival, a corporate conference, or a wedding celebration. Our experienced team handles all aspects of event planning and execution, from conceptualization and venue selection to logistics, catering, and entertainment. We incorporate local cultural elements into our events, showcasing the rich heritage of Assam and creating unique and immersive experiences for attendees.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At O''Guwahati, we understand that customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and engaging environment where customers feel valued and respected. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff are passionate about Assamese culture and heritage, and they are always eager to share their expertise with customers. We go above and beyond to provide personalized service, ensuring that each customer finds exactly what they are looking for. This extends beyond the point of purchase. We actively cultivate relationships with our customers, soliciting feedback and continuously improving our products and services to meet their evolving needs. O''Guwahati is deeply rooted in the local community. We actively participate in community events, sponsor local initiatives, and collaborate with other businesses to promote the economic and cultural vitality of Guwahati. Our business is built on transparency, integrity, and a genuine commitment to serving the needs of our customers and the community as a whole. We understand the importance of building trust, and we work hard to earn and maintain the loyalty of our customers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, O''Guwahati envisions expanding its reach and impact across the Northeast region and beyond. Our long-term goals include establishing a robust online presence to cater to a wider customer base, expanding our network of artisan partners, and developing innovative new products and services that celebrate the unique culture of Assam. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for local artisans, providing them with the skills and resources they need to thrive in a competitive market. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting sustainable business practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and supporting local conservation efforts. We see significant potential in collaborating with tourism operators to showcase the best of Assamese culture and hospitality to visitors from around the world. By leveraging our expertise in event management and retail, we can create immersive and authentic experiences that will leave a lasting impression on tourists and contribute to the growth of the tourism sector. O''Guwahati aims to become a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and a commitment to social responsibility. We are confident that with our passion, dedication, and strategic vision, we can achieve our goals and make a positive impact on the lives of the people of Assam and beyond.</p>', 'First Floor, Bliss Enclave, Kalaguru Bishnu Prasad Rabha Flyover', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:10:09.000Z'),
(1716, 'Kitchen Bar & Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Kitchen Bar & Restaurant, nestled on the 1st Floor of Amulya Complex on RG Baruah Rd, Zoo Rd, is more than just an eatery; it''s a destination crafted to elevate the dining and social experience in Guwahati. We’re not simply another establishment in Assam’s vibrant culinary scene; we aspire to be a cornerstone, a place where exceptional food, curated beverages, and genuine hospitality converge to create lasting memories. Our establishment aims to contribute positively to the local business landscape by offering a unique and sophisticated experience that caters to diverse palates and occasions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Kitchen Bar & Restaurant lies a dedication to providing exceptional core services. Our culinary offerings are a symphony of flavors, blending global inspirations with local ingredients and techniques. The menu features a carefully curated selection of dishes, ranging from innovative appetizers designed to tantalize the taste buds to satisfying main courses that showcase the culinary team''s expertise. We also offer a dedicated selection of vegetarian options prepared with the same attention to detail and flavor as our non-vegetarian dishes. Beyond the food, our bar boasts an impressive array of spirits, wines, and handcrafted cocktails prepared by skilled mixologists. Whether you''re seeking a perfectly balanced classic cocktail or a unique concoction inspired by regional flavors, our bar is equipped to deliver an exceptional beverage experience. A key differentiator is our commitment to sourcing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring the highest quality and freshest flavors in our dishes. This commitment not only enhances the dining experience but also strengthens our connection to the local community. By providing a sophisticated yet approachable atmosphere, we cater to a broad demographic, addressing the market need for a premium dining destination that is equally suitable for casual gatherings, business lunches, and special occasions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Kitchen Bar & Restaurant. We believe that exceptional service is the cornerstone of a memorable visit. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and proactive, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment you step through our doors, you''ll be greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness. We strive to create a personalized experience for each guest, taking into account their preferences and needs. Our waitstaff is adept at providing menu recommendations, offering wine pairings, and accommodating dietary restrictions. Moreover, we understand the importance of creating a welcoming atmosphere for the local community. We actively engage with local organizations and events, participating in community initiatives and hosting special events that celebrate local culture and traditions. This commitment to community engagement helps us build strong relationships with our neighbors and establish Kitchen Bar & Restaurant as a true community hub. Furthermore, we proactively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring that we are consistently meeting and exceeding their expectations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant envisions a future characterized by sustained growth and a continued commitment to excellence. Our long-term goals include expanding our brand recognition within Guwahati and potentially beyond, establishing ourselves as a leading dining destination in the region. We plan to achieve this through a combination of strategic marketing initiatives, consistent quality, and a commitment to innovation. We intend to further develop our menu, introducing new dishes and beverage offerings that reflect emerging culinary trends and cater to evolving customer preferences. We are also exploring opportunities to enhance our physical space, potentially adding outdoor seating or private dining areas to accommodate larger groups and special events. Another key area of focus is sustainability. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact through responsible sourcing practices, waste reduction initiatives, and energy efficiency measures. We believe that operating in a sustainable manner is not only ethically responsible but also essential for the long-term success of our business. Ultimately, our vision is to create a lasting legacy of culinary excellence and community engagement, solidifying Kitchen Bar & Restaurant as a beloved and respected institution in Guwahati.</p>', '1st Floor, Amulya Complex RG Baruah Rd, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:10:14.000Z'),
(1717, 'Shahi Darbar', 'Restaurants', NULL, '**Shahi Darbar: A Taste of Royal Hospitality in the Heart of Guwahati**

Shahi Darbar, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati at Ganpati Plaza, Police Outpost, 1st Floor, SRCB Road, behind Fancy Bazaar (Hotel D''River View), offers a unique and authentic dining experience that sets it apart within the local Assamese culinary scene. More than just a restaurant, Shahi Darbar strives to be a destination, a place where the warmth of Indian hospitality meets the rich tapestry of flavors inspired by royal traditions. Positioned strategically near key commercial and residential areas, Shahi Darbar caters to a diverse clientele seeking quality cuisine and a memorable ambiance. The location itself provides both accessibility and a degree of exclusivity, away from the immediate bustle of Fancy Bazaar but close enough to be a convenient dining option for residents and visitors alike.

<br> <br>

At its core, Shahi Darbar specializes in serving exquisitely prepared Indian cuisine, with a particular emphasis on North Indian and Mughlai delicacies. The menu is thoughtfully curated, showcasing classic dishes alongside innovative creations that blend traditional recipes with modern culinary techniques. Signature dishes include slow-cooked biryanis, succulent kebabs marinated in aromatic spices, and rich, creamy curries prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Understanding the diverse palates of its patrons, Shahi Darbar also offers a selection of vegetarian options, ensuring that every guest finds something to delight their taste buds. Beyond the food itself, the presentation is a key element of the Shahi Darbar experience. Dishes are artfully plated, reflecting the restaurant’s commitment to providing a visually appealing and sophisticated dining experience. This commitment to quality and presentation represents a key differentiator in the competitive Guwahati food market, where authenticity and attention to detail are highly valued.

<br> <br>

Shahi Darbar is dedicated to providing exceptional customer service that reflects the true meaning of "Atithi Devo Bhava" (the guest is equivalent to God). Every interaction, from the initial greeting to the final farewell, is designed to create a welcoming and memorable experience. The staff is meticulously trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and genuinely passionate about ensuring customer satisfaction. Furthermore, Shahi Darbar actively seeks feedback from its patrons to continuously improve its services and offerings. The restaurant fosters a connection with the local community through participation in local events, partnerships with local suppliers, and initiatives that support local causes. By actively engaging with the community, Shahi Darbar demonstrates its commitment to being more than just a business; it strives to be a contributing member of the Guwahati community, building lasting relationships and fostering a sense of belonging.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Shahi Darbar envisions becoming a premier dining destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional cuisine, unparalleled service, and strong community ties. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate regional Assamese dishes, further enhancing the culinary experience with local flavors and ingredients. This expansion aims to celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam while also catering to the evolving preferences of its customers. In addition to menu enhancements, Shahi Darbar is exploring opportunities to expand its physical footprint, potentially opening new locations within Guwahati and potentially even expanding to other cities in the Northeast region. The long-term goal is to establish Shahi Darbar as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional dining experiences, solidifying its position as a key player in the regional hospitality industry. Ultimately, Shahi Darbar aspires to not only serve delicious food but also to create lasting memories and contribute positively to the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati.', 'Ganpati Plaza, Police Outpost, 1st Floor, SRCB Road Hotel D''River View, behind Fancy Bazaar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:10:19.000Z'),
(1718, 'The Kitchen Lab', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>The Kitchen Lab is a dynamic culinary business nestled in the heart of Assam, dedicated to fostering a vibrant food culture through innovative cooking classes, bespoke catering services, and the creation of artisanal food products showcasing the region''s rich agricultural heritage. More than just a cooking school or catering company, The Kitchen Lab functions as a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can gather to explore the diverse flavors of Assam and beyond, learn new skills, and connect through the universal language of food. In a region known for its tea gardens and traditional cuisine, The Kitchen Lab offers a refreshing take on culinary arts, bridging the gap between traditional methods and modern techniques.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Kitchen Lab provides a diverse range of cooking classes catering to all skill levels, from novice home cooks to aspiring chefs. Classes cover a wide spectrum of cuisines, including authentic Assamese dishes, pan-Asian favorites, international flavors, and specialized baking and pastry techniques. These classes are designed to be interactive and engaging, emphasizing hands-on learning in a state-of-the-art kitchen environment. The use of locally sourced, fresh ingredients is a cornerstone of The Kitchen Lab''s philosophy, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable food practices. This commitment to local sourcing is a significant differentiator, appealing to environmentally conscious consumers and those seeking an authentic culinary experience.<br> <br>

Beyond cooking classes, The Kitchen Lab offers bespoke catering services for a variety of events, from intimate gatherings to large-scale celebrations. Their catering menu is highly customizable, allowing clients to create unique and memorable dining experiences tailored to their specific needs and preferences. Whether it''s a traditional Assamese feast or a contemporary fusion menu, The Kitchen Lab''s culinary team excels at delivering exceptional quality and impeccable service. The catering service also extends to corporate events and workshops, providing healthy and delicious meals that fuel productivity and enhance the overall event experience.<br> <br>

In addition to classes and catering, The Kitchen Lab produces a line of artisanal food products, including handcrafted pickles, spice blends, and traditional Assamese sweets. These products are made with the finest local ingredients and are available for purchase online and at select local retailers. This expands the business''s reach and allows customers to enjoy the flavors of The Kitchen Lab in the comfort of their own homes. The unique selling point of these products lies in their authenticity, quality, and the incorporation of traditional Assamese recipes with a modern twist. These products also serve as excellent gifts and souvenirs, promoting the culinary heritage of Assam to a wider audience. </p> <br> <br>

<p>The Kitchen Lab prioritizes creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for all its customers. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable, friendly, and attentive to individual needs. Cooking classes are kept small to ensure personalized attention and ample opportunity for interaction with the instructors. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience. The business also actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local schools and organizations, offering cooking demonstrations and workshops to promote healthy eating habits and culinary education. Special events, such as farmers markets and food festivals, are regularly hosted to showcase local produce and connect with the community on a deeper level. This commitment to community engagement fosters loyalty and strengthens the business''s reputation as a trusted and valued member of the local ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Kitchen Lab envisions becoming the leading culinary destination in Assam, expanding its reach and impact through several key initiatives. Plans include expanding the range of cooking classes offered, introducing specialized workshops focused on specific culinary techniques, and developing new and innovative food products. The business also aims to establish a strong online presence through e-commerce and social media marketing, reaching a wider audience beyond the local area. Furthermore, The Kitchen Lab intends to forge strategic partnerships with hotels and resorts in the region, offering culinary experiences and catering services to tourists and visitors. A key long-term goal is to establish a culinary training program for aspiring chefs, contributing to the development of a skilled workforce and promoting culinary excellence in Assam. Through these strategic initiatives, The Kitchen Lab is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of food in Assam and beyond.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:10:26.000Z'),
(1719, 'Paradise Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Paradise Restaurant, nestled on the bustling Maniram Dewan Road, is more than just a place to eat; it''s a culinary haven that brings together the rich tapestry of Assamese flavors with modern dining experiences. Located in a vibrant commercial and residential area, Paradise Restaurant stands out as a destination that caters to diverse palates, from those seeking authentic regional dishes to those with international tastes. The restaurant has quickly established itself as a significant part of the local Assam business landscape, offering a unique blend of traditional hospitality and contemporary dining, attracting both local residents and visiting tourists.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Paradise Restaurant lies a commitment to delivering exceptional culinary experiences. The restaurant''s primary offering is a diverse menu featuring authentic Assamese cuisine alongside a curated selection of popular Indian and Continental dishes. The Assamese specialties are prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, showcasing the region''s unique spices and culinary traditions. From the tangy ''Tenga'' dishes to the flavorful ''Masor Tenga'' (Sour Fish Curry), and the aromatic ''Khar,'' Paradise Restaurant aims to provide a genuine taste of Assam. Beyond the regional fare, the menu includes classic Indian curries, tandoori delicacies, and continental favorites, ensuring there is something for everyone. What sets Paradise Restaurant apart is its dedication to quality and freshness. All dishes are prepared with meticulous attention to detail, using high-quality ingredients and time-honored cooking techniques. The chefs pride themselves on creating dishes that are both flavorful and visually appealing. This unique selling point, combined with the restaurant''s strategic location on Maniram Dewan Road, allows it to cater to the local market''s need for a diverse and high-quality dining experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Paradise Restaurant. The restaurant strives to create a welcoming and comfortable ambiance where guests can relax and enjoy their meals. From the moment customers enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and provide recommendations based on individual preferences. Paradise Restaurant understands the importance of building strong connections with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and supports community initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and goodwill. Furthermore, Paradise Restaurant often hosts special events and themed nights that showcase local artists and cultural performances, further enriching the dining experience. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the community, Paradise Restaurant has cultivated a loyal customer base and established itself as a beloved local establishment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Paradise Restaurant envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The long-term goals include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties and innovative dishes, further enhancing the culinary offerings. The restaurant plans to explore opportunities to source ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, supporting the local economy and ensuring the highest quality ingredients. Furthermore, Paradise Restaurant is exploring the possibility of expanding its physical space to accommodate more diners and create additional private dining areas for special occasions. There are also plans to enhance the online presence, including online ordering and delivery services, to cater to the growing demand for convenient dining options. Ultimately, Paradise Restaurant aims to become a culinary landmark in Assam, known for its authentic cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating, Paradise Restaurant is poised to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a leading dining destination in the region.</p>', 'Maniram Dewan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:10:32.000Z'),
(1720, 'Square', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Square, strategically located within the Novotel Guwahati GS Road in Downtown Dispur, is rapidly establishing itself as a vital hub for business professionals and local entrepreneurs seeking comprehensive support services and a sophisticated environment. Situated in the heart of Guwahati''s commercial district, Square offers a unique blend of premium office solutions, collaborative workspaces, and specialized services designed to empower businesses and facilitate growth within the dynamic Assam market. Recognizing the increasing need for flexible, adaptable, and technologically advanced workspaces in the region, Square provides a tailored approach that transcends traditional office setups, positioning itself as a key enabler of economic development in the Northeast.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Square''s offerings are its meticulously designed office spaces and collaborative workspaces. These range from private, fully furnished executive suites ideal for established companies to open-plan co-working areas perfect for freelancers, startups, and remote teams. What sets Square apart is not simply the availability of physical space, but the comprehensive suite of supporting services integrated within. These services include high-speed internet connectivity, advanced telecommunication systems, professional reception and administrative support, printing and scanning facilities, and access to state-of-the-art meeting rooms equipped with video conferencing capabilities. Beyond the functional aspects, Square fosters a community-driven environment through networking events, workshops, and seminars that facilitate knowledge sharing and collaboration among its members. A unique selling point lies in its flexible lease terms and scalable solutions, allowing businesses to adjust their space requirements as their needs evolve. Square directly addresses the local market''s demand for reliable infrastructure, professional support, and a prestigious business address, eliminating the common challenges associated with setting up and managing a traditional office space in Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Square. The business prides itself on providing personalized service and building lasting relationships with its clients. A dedicated team of experienced professionals is committed to understanding each client''s unique needs and providing tailored solutions to support their success. This proactive approach to customer service extends beyond the provision of office space and encompasses assistance with administrative tasks, event planning, and even introductions to potential business partners within the local community. Square actively engages with the local business ecosystem by hosting regular networking events and partnering with local organizations to promote entrepreneurship and economic growth in Assam. By fostering a sense of community and providing exceptional service, Square distinguishes itself from competitors and creates a welcoming and productive environment for its members. The location within Novotel Guwahati GS Road also provides an added advantage, allowing clients convenient access to the hotel''s amenities, including restaurants, accommodation, and event spaces, creating a seamless and convenient business experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Square envisions becoming the leading provider of flexible workspace solutions and business support services in Northeast India. The company''s future plans include expanding its range of services to cater to the evolving needs of the market. This may involve incorporating specialized services such as virtual office packages, business incubation programs, and industry-specific training workshops. Expansion into other key commercial hubs within Assam and neighboring states is also a long-term goal, with the aim of establishing a regional network of Square locations that can provide consistent, high-quality services to businesses across the Northeast. Square is committed to leveraging technology to enhance its services and provide clients with innovative tools and solutions to improve their efficiency and productivity. The ultimate vision is to create a vibrant ecosystem that empowers businesses to thrive, fosters innovation, and contributes to the overall economic development of the region. By continuously adapting to the needs of the market and investing in its people and technology, Square is poised for sustained growth and long-term success.</p>', 'Novotel Guwahati GS Road, Downtown Dispur', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:15:08.000Z'),
(1721, 'Âashirwad Restaurant(Jain Food)', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Âashirwad Restaurant (Jain Food) offers a unique and vital culinary experience within the diverse gastronomic landscape of Assam. Specializing exclusively in authentic Jain cuisine, Âashirwad Restaurant fills a significant gap in the local market by providing a dedicated dining option for individuals and families adhering to Jain dietary principles. The restaurant distinguishes itself not only through its strict adherence to these principles but also through its commitment to crafting flavorful and satisfying dishes that showcase the versatility and richness of Jain vegetarian cuisine. Âashirwad Restaurant aims to be more than just a place to eat; it strives to be a welcoming community hub where patrons can enjoy a meal with peace of mind, knowing that their dietary needs are completely understood and respected. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Âashirwad Restaurant lies its comprehensive Jain menu. This includes a wide array of traditional dishes prepared without the use of root vegetables like onions, garlic, potatoes, and carrots, which are typically avoided in Jain cuisine. The restaurant carefully sources its ingredients, ensuring their purity and suitability for Jain consumption. Key offerings include specialty thalis featuring a selection of curries, dals, rice, and bread, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced vegetables and spices. Signature dishes, crafted by experienced chefs specializing in Jain cooking, offer a delightful exploration of flavors and textures, demonstrating that Jain food can be both nutritious and incredibly delicious. In addition to its dine-in options, Âashirwad Restaurant also provides takeaway and catering services, allowing customers to enjoy authentic Jain cuisine in the comfort of their own homes or at special events. The unique selling point is the restaurant''s unwavering dedication to authentic Jain preparation methods, ensuring a truly genuine and reassuring experience for its clientele. This commitment addresses a critical market need within the community, where limited options are typically available for those seeking pure and uncompromised Jain food. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Âashirwad Restaurant understands that customer experience extends far beyond just the quality of the food. The restaurant cultivates a warm and inviting atmosphere, creating a welcoming space for families, individuals, and groups. Staff members are carefully trained to understand the nuances of Jain dietary requirements and are always ready to assist customers with their choices, providing helpful information and recommendations. The restaurant''s decor reflects a blend of modern aesthetics and traditional Indian elements, creating a comfortable and relaxing environment. Beyond providing excellent food and service, Âashirwad Restaurant actively engages with the local community. The restaurant participates in local festivals and events, often providing Jain food stalls and demonstrations, further promoting the awareness and appreciation of Jain culture and cuisine. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and community engagement, Âashirwad Restaurant strives to create lasting relationships with its patrons and become an integral part of the local social fabric.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Âashirwad Restaurant envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, driven by its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community service. The restaurant plans to expand its menu offerings, introducing new and innovative Jain dishes that cater to diverse tastes while staying true to its core principles. Exploration of online ordering and delivery platforms is also on the horizon, aiming to broaden its reach and convenience for customers across the region. Furthermore, Âashirwad Restaurant has aspirations to establish itself as a leading authority on Jain cuisine in Assam, potentially through cooking classes and educational workshops designed to share the knowledge and appreciation of this unique culinary tradition. Long-term goals include the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, making authentic Jain food more accessible to a wider audience. By continuously improving its services, expanding its reach, and fostering a strong sense of community, Âashirwad Restaurant is poised to become a prominent and enduring fixture in the Assam culinary landscape.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:15:14.000Z')
