(1722, 'Dining Table Restraunt', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Dining Table Restaurant is a culinary haven nestled in the heart of Assam, offering an authentic and immersive dining experience that celebrates the rich flavors and cultural heritage of the region. More than just a restaurant, Dining Table is a gathering place, a testament to the enduring traditions of Assamese hospitality, and a contributor to the vibrant local economy. We strive to provide an unforgettable journey for every guest, one dish at a time.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Dining Table, our core offering revolves around providing high-quality, regionally-inspired cuisine. Our menu is carefully curated to showcase the diversity of Assamese culinary traditions, featuring both classic dishes prepared with time-honored recipes and innovative interpretations that blend traditional flavors with modern techniques. We prioritize sourcing fresh, locally-grown ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the peak of flavor in every dish. Our signature dishes, such as *Maaher Tenga* (a sour fish curry) and *Pitha* (traditional Assamese cakes), are prepared with meticulous attention to detail, using authentic spices and cooking methods. Alongside our Assamese specialties, we also offer a selection of Indian and Continental dishes to cater to a wider range of palates. Beyond food, we provide a comprehensive beverage menu featuring local teas, refreshing fruit juices, and a curated selection of wines and spirits. What sets Dining Table apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity and quality. We believe that food is more than just sustenance; it’s a cultural experience. We meticulously recreate the flavors of Assam, ensuring that each dish tells a story and connects our guests to the region''s rich heritage. This focus on authenticity addresses a significant need in the local market, providing a genuine taste of Assam that is often diluted or overlooked in more generic dining establishments.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The Dining Table experience is built upon a foundation of exceptional customer service and genuine Assamese hospitality. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm welcome and attentive service. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu, providing informed recommendations and catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. We strive to create a comfortable and inviting atmosphere, with carefully designed interiors that reflect the beauty and charm of Assam. Soft lighting, traditional Assamese artwork, and comfortable seating create a relaxed and welcoming ambiance. We understand the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events and festivals, showcasing our cuisine and supporting local initiatives. We also partner with local farmers and suppliers, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. Our commitment to the community extends beyond our business operations. We regularly donate a portion of our proceeds to local charities and organizations that work to improve the lives of those in need. We also host community events at our restaurant, providing a space for people to come together, celebrate, and connect.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Dining Table Restaurant envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, renowned for its authentic cuisine, exceptional service, and unwavering commitment to the local community. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal dishes, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine. We also plan to enhance our online presence, making it easier for customers to make reservations, order online, and stay up-to-date on our latest offerings. In the long term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout Assam, bringing the Dining Table experience to a wider audience. We also envision establishing a culinary training program, providing opportunities for local residents to develop their skills and pursue careers in the hospitality industry. We are committed to sustainable practices and reducing our environmental impact. We plan to implement initiatives such as composting food waste, using eco-friendly packaging, and sourcing more of our ingredients from local, sustainable farms. Ultimately, our goal is to create a lasting positive impact on the local community, both economically and culturally, while providing an unforgettable dining experience for every guest.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:15:21.000Z'),
(1723, 'Food Mafia', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Food Mafia: Redefining the Culinary Landscape of Assam</p>

<p>Food Mafia isn''t just another restaurant; it''s a culinary experience carefully crafted to resonate with the vibrant tastes and traditions of Assam. Located at [Insert actual address of the business here. Example: GS Road, Guwahati, Assam], Food Mafia is quickly establishing itself as a destination for discerning diners seeking authentic flavors with a modern twist. In a region known for its rich culinary heritage, Food Mafia distinguishes itself by sourcing local ingredients, employing innovative cooking techniques, and offering a dining atmosphere that''s both sophisticated and welcoming. Our commitment to quality, combined with a deep understanding of Assamese palates, positions Food Mafia as a key player in the evolving food scene of the region.</p>

<p>Our Core Offerings: A Fusion of Tradition and Innovation</p>

<p>At the heart of Food Mafia lies a diverse menu showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine alongside carefully selected dishes from other regional Indian cuisines. We pride ourselves on our signature Assamese Thali, a meticulously curated platter that offers a symphony of flavors, from the tangy Masor Tenga (sour fish curry) to the earthy Khar (alkaline dish) and the subtly spiced Duck Roast. Each dish is prepared with locally sourced ingredients, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. <br> <br> Beyond the Thali, our menu includes a range of appetizers, entrees, and desserts designed to cater to diverse palates. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to elevate traditional Assamese dishes with modern culinary techniques, creating innovative flavors and presentations that are both familiar and exciting. We also offer a selection of vegetarian options, ensuring there''s something for everyone to enjoy. <br> <br> Recognizing the growing demand for healthier options, we are committed to incorporating fresh, seasonal produce into our dishes, and offer options that cater to dietary restrictions. This commitment to quality and innovation allows us to meet the evolving needs of the local market, attracting a loyal customer base that appreciates our dedication to authentic flavors and exceptional dining experiences.</p>

<p>Crafting a Memorable Customer Experience</p>

<p>At Food Mafia, we understand that dining is more than just enjoying food; it''s about creating memories. From the moment guests walk through our doors, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is trained to provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that each diner finds the perfect dish to suit their taste preferences. <br> <br> We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere that reflects the rich culture of Assam. Our restaurant features [Describe the ambiance. Example: contemporary decor with traditional Assamese motifs, comfortable seating arrangements, and soft lighting]. We also host regular events, such as live music performances and cultural showcases, to further enhance the dining experience and connect with the local community. <br> <br> Beyond the restaurant, we are committed to engaging with the local community through various initiatives. We partner with local farmers and suppliers, supporting their businesses and ensuring the sustainability of our operations. We also participate in local food festivals and events, showcasing our culinary expertise and promoting Assamese cuisine to a wider audience. Our commitment to customer service extends beyond the restaurant walls, fostering a strong sense of community and loyalty.</p>

<p>Looking Ahead: Growth and Innovation</p>

<p>Food Mafia is poised for significant growth in the coming years. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and introducing a catering service to cater to local events and gatherings. We also plan to launch an online ordering platform, making our dishes accessible to a wider audience. <br> <br> In the long term, we envision Food Mafia becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its innovative cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community. We are exploring opportunities to expand our operations to other cities in the region, bringing our unique dining experience to a broader audience. <br> <br> We are also committed to investing in our staff, providing them with training and development opportunities to enhance their skills and advance their careers. By fostering a culture of innovation and excellence, we aim to attract and retain top talent, ensuring that Food Mafia remains at the forefront of the culinary scene in Assam. Our vision is to not only provide exceptional food, but also to contribute to the economic and cultural growth of the region, solidifying our position as a vital part of the Assamese community. Ultimately, Food Mafia aspires to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a culinary ambassador, showcasing the rich flavors and traditions of Assam to the world.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.340Z', '2025-12-07T10:15:29.000Z'),
(1724, 'Skyscape Guwahati', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Skyscape Guwahati is a dynamic business solutions provider strategically situated to serve the burgeoning commercial landscape of Guwahati and the wider Assam region. Understanding the unique challenges and opportunities presented by this vibrant economic hub, Skyscape Guwahati offers a suite of tailored services designed to empower businesses of all sizes, from nascent startups to established enterprises. We are committed to fostering sustainable growth and innovation within the local community, contributing to the overall economic prosperity of the region. Skyscape Guwahati distinguishes itself through a deep understanding of local nuances, combined with a commitment to international best practices, creating a powerful synergy that drives success for our clients.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Skyscape Guwahati''s offerings lies a comprehensive range of business solutions categorized into three core areas: Strategic Consulting, Digital Empowerment, and Operational Efficiency. Our Strategic Consulting services provide businesses with expert guidance on market entry strategies, competitive analysis, and long-term business planning. We help clients identify untapped opportunities, navigate complex regulatory environments, and develop robust strategies for sustainable growth within the Assam market. The Digital Empowerment division focuses on leveraging cutting-edge technologies to enhance online presence, streamline operations, and improve customer engagement. This includes services such as website design and development, search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, and e-commerce solutions tailored to the local consumer base. Finally, our Operational Efficiency services are designed to optimize internal processes, reduce costs, and improve overall productivity. This encompasses areas such as supply chain management, logistics optimization, and human resource solutions, ensuring businesses operate at peak performance.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly sets Skyscape Guwahati apart is our unwavering commitment to delivering exceptional customer experiences. We believe in building strong, lasting relationships with our clients, acting as trusted partners rather than mere service providers. This philosophy is embedded in every aspect of our operations, from the initial consultation to the ongoing support we provide. We prioritize clear communication, transparency, and a proactive approach to problem-solving. Our team of highly skilled professionals is dedicated to understanding the unique needs and challenges of each client, tailoring our services accordingly. We actively participate in local business events and initiatives, fostering a strong connection with the community and staying abreast of the latest trends and developments within the Assam market. Furthermore, we are committed to sourcing local talent and supporting local suppliers, contributing to the overall growth and development of the region''s economy. We believe that our success is intrinsically linked to the success of our clients and the broader community we serve.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Skyscape Guwahati envisions becoming the leading business solutions provider in the Northeast region of India. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to cater to emerging needs in areas such as sustainable business practices and green technology integration. We are actively exploring partnerships with leading industry experts and technology providers to further enhance our capabilities and deliver even greater value to our clients. A key focus for the future is the development of specialized training programs designed to equip local talent with the skills and knowledge needed to thrive in the modern business environment. We aim to establish Skyscape Guwahati as a hub for innovation and entrepreneurship, fostering a vibrant ecosystem that supports the growth of businesses across the region. Long-term, we aspire to contribute significantly to the economic diversification and sustainable development of Assam, creating opportunities for future generations. Our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement will continue to guide our journey as we strive to achieve our ambitious goals.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:15:35.000Z'),
(1725, 'Michinga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Michinga Restaurant: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Bhuban Road

Michinga Restaurant, nestled at H. No. 5QR3+MHW, 8B, Bhuban Rd, Near To Latasli Ground, represents a vibrant addition to the culinary scene of Bhuban Road, Assam. More than just a place to eat, Michinga aims to be a community hub, offering a welcoming atmosphere and an authentic taste of local and regional delicacies alongside carefully selected continental options. Our restaurant distinguishes itself through a commitment to fresh, locally sourced ingredients, a dedication to traditional Assamese recipes with a modern twist, and an unwavering focus on providing a memorable dining experience for every guest. We strive to capture the spirit of Assam''s rich culinary heritage while simultaneously embracing innovation and contemporary dining trends.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Michinga''s offerings are its core services: a diverse menu designed to cater to a wide range of palates. Our primary focus is on authentic Assamese cuisine, featuring signature dishes prepared using time-honored recipes passed down through generations. We take pride in using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and quality of our dishes. Alongside traditional Assamese fare, we offer a curated selection of popular Indian dishes and carefully selected continental options to provide variety and appeal to a broader clientele.

<br> <br>

Our unique selling points include a commitment to quality ingredients, a comfortable and inviting ambience, and a dedication to providing exceptional customer service. We also offer a "Taste of Assam" menu featuring a rotating selection of seasonal specialties and regional delicacies that are not commonly found in other restaurants. This allows us to showcase the diverse and nuanced flavors of Assamese cuisine. Further, we provide outdoor seating arrangements, creating a relaxed and refreshing environment for patrons, especially during the pleasant evenings of Assam.

<br> <br>

Michinga Restaurant directly addresses the local market needs by providing a high-quality dining option that celebrates Assamese culinary heritage. In a region where food plays a central role in social life and cultural identity, we offer a space where people can gather to enjoy authentic flavors, share memorable experiences, and connect with their community. We have observed a growing demand for restaurants that prioritize local ingredients and traditional recipes, and we are confident that Michinga is well-positioned to meet this demand.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Michinga Restaurant. We believe that every guest interaction is an opportunity to build relationships and create lasting memories. Our staff is trained to provide attentive, friendly, and personalized service. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests feel comfortable and valued. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our service and offerings.

<br> <br>

We stand out by fostering a strong sense of community. We regularly host events that celebrate local culture and traditions, such as Bihu celebrations and cooking demonstrations featuring local chefs. We also partner with local organizations to support community initiatives. By actively engaging with the local community, we aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and share their love of food and culture. We’re dedicated to sourcing ingredients from local farmers and artisans, contributing to the economic well-being of the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Michinga Restaurant envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as a leading culinary destination in Bhuban Road and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to further showcase the diversity of Assamese cuisine, introduce catering services for local events and gatherings, and potentially open additional locations in other parts of Assam.

<br> <br>

We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering, reservation systems, and loyalty programs. We are committed to investing in our staff and providing ongoing training to ensure they have the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with tourism agencies to promote Michinga as a culinary destination for visitors to the region. Our vision is to become a culinary ambassador for Assam, sharing the unique flavors and traditions of our region with the world. Michinga aims to be synonymous with quality, authenticity, and a genuine passion for food and hospitality.', 'h no, 5QR3+MHW, 8B, Bhuban Rd, Near To Latasli Ground', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:20:09.000Z'),
(1726, 'DERXAJ MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'DERXAJ MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT is rapidly establishing itself as a culinary cornerstone in the heart of Assam, offering a diverse and delectable range of dishes that cater to the palates of both local residents and visitors. Located at [Insert Actual Address Here], DERXAJ is more than just a restaurant; it’s a vibrant dining experience that celebrates the rich tapestry of global flavors while remaining deeply rooted in Assamese hospitality. We aim to provide an accessible, high-quality dining option that reflects the evolving culinary landscape of the region, creating a welcoming space for individuals, families, and groups to gather and enjoy exceptional food.

<br> <br>

At DERXAJ MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT, our core offering revolves around a carefully curated menu that spans multiple culinary traditions. From authentic Assamese delicacies prepared with locally sourced ingredients to popular dishes from Indian, Chinese, and Continental cuisines, we strive to provide a comprehensive culinary journey for our patrons. Our signature dishes, which are regularly updated based on seasonal availability and customer feedback, showcase our commitment to innovation while respecting traditional cooking methods. A key differentiator is our emphasis on using fresh, high-quality ingredients, many sourced directly from local farmers and suppliers. This not only supports the local economy but also ensures that our dishes are bursting with flavor and nutritional value. Furthermore, we offer a range of vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options to cater to diverse dietary needs and preferences, making DERXAJ an inclusive dining destination for everyone. Our unique selling point lies in the seamless blend of international flavors with the warmth and authenticity of Assamese hospitality, creating a memorable dining experience that sets us apart from competitors. We address the local market need for diverse and high-quality dining options, offering a place where people can explore different cuisines without compromising on taste or quality.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at DERXAJ MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT. We believe that exceptional food should be complemented by impeccable service and a welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. From the moment a customer walks through our doors, they are greeted with genuine warmth and assisted with their needs. We actively solicit feedback from our customers through comment cards, online surveys, and social media engagement to continuously improve our services and offerings. What truly makes us stand out is our dedication to creating a sense of community. We regularly host events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, cooking demonstrations, and themed dinners, to foster a connection with our patrons and celebrate the vibrant culture of Assam. We also partner with local charities and organizations to support community initiatives and give back to the society that has welcomed us so warmly. We understand that building strong relationships with our customers and the local community is essential for long-term success.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, DERXAJ MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT envisions a future of sustained growth and innovation. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional Assamese specialties and introducing a range of handcrafted beverages that complement our food offerings. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional branches in other key locations within Assam, bringing our unique culinary experience to a wider audience. Our long-term goals include establishing DERXAJ as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional service. We aim to become a leading culinary destination in Assam, attracting both local and international visitors. We are also committed to sustainable business practices, reducing our environmental footprint through responsible sourcing, waste management, and energy conservation. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of our customers and the changing dynamics of the market, DERXAJ MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the vibrant culinary landscape of Assam for years to come.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:20:14.000Z'),
(1727, 'Guwahati Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Guwahati Kitchen stands as a culinary beacon in the heart of Assam, dedicated to showcasing the rich and diverse flavors of the region to both locals and visitors alike. More than just a restaurant, Guwahati Kitchen is a celebration of Assamese culture, a place where traditional recipes meet modern culinary techniques to create a truly unforgettable dining experience. Located in [Please insert specific address here. If not available, provide a general location description, e.g., "a vibrant neighborhood in the heart of Guwahati"], we pride ourselves on using locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers, and contributing to the sustainable development of the Assamese food industry.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Guwahati Kitchen distinguishes itself in the bustling Guwahati food scene through its commitment to authenticity, quality, and community. We offer a comprehensive menu that encompasses the breadth of Assamese cuisine, from classic dishes prepared with time-honored techniques to innovative creations that reinterpret traditional flavors for the modern palate. Our signature dishes include the hearty *Masor Tenga*, a tangy fish curry, and the flavorful *Pitha*, a rice cake available in a variety of sweet and savory preparations. A particular emphasis is placed on showcasing the unique ingredients that define Assamese cooking, such as *khorisa* (fermented bamboo shoot), *jolokia* (bhut jolokia pepper), and a variety of indigenous herbs and spices. We also offer a selection of *thalis*, allowing customers to sample a range of dishes and experience the full spectrum of Assamese flavors. Vegetarian options are plentiful and thoughtfully crafted, ensuring that all dietary preferences are catered to with equal care. In addition to our dine-in service, we also offer takeaway and catering options, bringing the taste of Guwahati Kitchen to homes and events throughout the city. Our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients is a key differentiator, ensuring not only exceptional flavor but also supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable agricultural practices. We believe that this focus on quality and sustainability resonates deeply with our customers and reinforces our position as a leader in the Assam culinary landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Guwahati Kitchen, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and memorable atmosphere for every guest. Our staff is knowledgeable about Assamese cuisine and passionate about sharing their knowledge with customers, providing recommendations and insights into the dishes. We are committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. The restaurant''s ambiance is designed to reflect the beauty and culture of Assam, with traditional decor and soothing music creating a relaxing and authentic dining environment. Beyond simply serving food, we aim to foster a sense of community. We actively participate in local events, support local charities, and collaborate with other businesses to promote Assam''s cultural heritage. We also host cooking workshops and demonstrations, providing opportunities for customers to learn about Assamese cuisine and develop their own culinary skills. We believe that this commitment to community engagement not only enhances the customer experience but also strengthens our connection to the local culture and reinforces our role as a valuable member of the Guwahati community. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use their suggestions to continuously improve our services and offerings.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Guwahati Kitchen is one of sustained growth, innovation, and continued commitment to showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. We plan to expand our operations to reach a wider audience, both within Guwahati and beyond. This may include opening additional locations, developing a line of packaged food products featuring our signature recipes, or expanding our catering services to serve larger events. We are also committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they continue to deliver exceptional service. Furthermore, we plan to deepen our commitment to sustainability by working with local farmers to promote organic and environmentally friendly farming practices. We also aim to explore new and innovative ways to incorporate traditional Assamese ingredients into modern dishes, further pushing the boundaries of Assamese cuisine while staying true to its roots. We envision Guwahati Kitchen becoming a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Ultimately, our goal is to not only serve delicious food but also to promote Assam''s culture and contribute to the economic development of the region.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:20:21.000Z'),
(1728, 'Mast Biryani', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Mast Biryani, nestled at 4QPR+QHH, Beltola Rd, near Rajdhani Regency in the heart of Guwahati, is quickly establishing itself as a premier destination for authentic and flavorful Biryani in Assam. More than just a restaurant, Mast Biryani is a culinary experience, meticulously crafted to deliver the richness of traditional Biryani while catering to the discerning palates of the local community. We strive to be a cornerstone of Assam''s vibrant food scene, offering not only exceptional food but also a welcoming and memorable dining experience. Our dedication to quality ingredients, authentic recipes, and superior customer service sets us apart and positions us for sustained success in the region.

<br> <br>

At its core, Mast Biryani specializes in a diverse range of Biryani preparations, each reflecting the culinary heritage of different regions known for their unique Biryani styles. From the delicately spiced Lucknowi Biryani to the robust and aromatic Hyderabadi Biryani, and the flavorful Kolkata Biryani, our menu offers a comprehensive exploration of this beloved dish. Beyond Biryani, we also offer complementary dishes such as flavorful kebabs, rich curries, and refreshing raitas, creating a complete and satisfying meal. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to using only the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, combined with traditional cooking techniques that have been perfected over generations. This approach ensures that every dish is bursting with authentic flavor and represents the true essence of Biryani. We understand the local market''s appreciation for quality and value, and we strive to provide generous portions at competitive prices, making our Biryani accessible to a wide range of customers.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Mast Biryani. We believe that every interaction, from the moment a customer steps through our doors to their last bite, should be positive and memorable. Our staff is carefully trained to provide attentive and friendly service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We are committed to creating a warm and inviting atmosphere, where families and friends can gather to enjoy a delicious meal in a comfortable setting. We actively seek feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. Beyond the dine-in experience, we also offer convenient takeaway and delivery options, ensuring that customers can enjoy Mast Biryani wherever they are. We are also committed to connecting with the local community through participation in local events and collaborations with other businesses. We believe in building strong relationships with our neighbors and contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Mast Biryani envisions becoming a household name in Assam, synonymous with quality Biryani and exceptional dining experiences. Our growth strategy includes expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and catering to evolving customer preferences. We plan to explore opportunities to open additional locations in key areas of Guwahati and beyond, making our Biryani more accessible to a wider audience. We are also committed to investing in technology to streamline our operations and enhance the customer experience. This includes implementing online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and mobile applications. Furthermore, we are dedicated to sustainable business practices and minimizing our environmental impact. We aim to source more ingredients locally, reduce waste, and implement energy-efficient technologies. Our long-term goal is to establish Mast Biryani as a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to create a legacy of culinary excellence that will be enjoyed by generations to come.', '4QPR+QHH, Beltola Rd, near Rajdhani Regency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:20:26.000Z'),
(1729, 'CMS Food Court', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>CMS Food Court: A Culinary Hub on Shillong Road</p>

<br> <br>

<p>CMS Food Court is a vibrant and dynamic culinary destination strategically located on Shillong Road, serving as a key player in the burgeoning Assam food and beverage industry. More than just a collection of eateries, CMS Food Court offers a curated selection of diverse cuisines and dining experiences, catering to the varied tastes and preferences of the local community and travelers alike. Its appeal lies not only in its convenient location but also in its commitment to quality, hygiene, and providing a welcoming atmosphere for families, friends, and individuals seeking a satisfying and enjoyable meal. CMS Food Court distinguishes itself by fostering a collaborative environment amongst its vendors, ensuring a consistent standard of excellence and a diverse menu that keeps patrons returning for more.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of CMS Food Court''s offerings is a collection of carefully selected food stalls, each specializing in a distinct culinary niche. Patrons can find everything from authentic Assamese thalis showcasing the region''s rich culinary heritage to popular North Indian dishes, quick-bite Chinese staples, and even continental favorites. What sets CMS Food Court apart is the emphasis on utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and producers but also ensures the highest quality and flavor in every dish. Each vendor is chosen for their expertise, commitment to hygiene standards, and ability to deliver exceptional food consistently. Further differentiating itself is the focus on providing options for diverse dietary needs, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free choices, ensuring that every customer can find something to enjoy. This thoughtful approach caters to the evolving preferences of the modern consumer and demonstrates CMS Food Court''s commitment to inclusivity.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at CMS Food Court, shaping every aspect of the business from the welcoming ambiance to the efficient service. The food court boasts a clean and well-maintained dining area, creating a comfortable and relaxed setting for guests to enjoy their meals. A dedicated team of customer service personnel is on hand to assist with inquiries, manage seating arrangements, and ensure a seamless dining experience. Beyond the immediate service, CMS Food Court actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting local events, supporting community organizations, and participating in regional food festivals. By fostering a strong connection with the community, CMS Food Court establishes itself as more than just a place to eat; it becomes a social hub where people can connect, celebrate, and enjoy the vibrant culture of Assam. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continuously improve the quality of food and service, demonstrating a commitment to exceeding customer expectations. The food court also implements innovative ordering and payment systems to further enhance the customer experience, reducing wait times and making the entire process more convenient.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, CMS Food Court envisions itself as the leading food destination on Shillong Road and a recognized culinary landmark within the region. Strategic growth plans include expanding the vendor selection to further diversify the culinary offerings, potentially introducing international cuisines and specialty food concepts. There are also plans to enhance the physical space with improved seating arrangements, landscaping, and potentially even a dedicated children''s play area to further cater to families. Furthermore, CMS Food Court recognizes the importance of leveraging technology to enhance its operations and customer engagement. This includes developing a mobile app for online ordering and loyalty programs, as well as utilizing social media platforms to promote vendors, announce special events, and engage with customers. The long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional food and service but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of its customers, CMS Food Court is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>', 'Shillong Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:20:31.000Z'),
(1730, 'ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN, situated on the 1st Floor of Hotel Palacio, above Poddar Car World on GS Road, represents a novel and exciting addition to the Assam''s culinary and leisure scene. This establishment uniquely combines the craft brewery experience with a full-service kitchen, offering a multifaceted venue for locals and visitors alike. Positioned in a prominent location, ABACUS aims to become a preferred destination for those seeking quality handcrafted beverages, delectable cuisine, and a vibrant social atmosphere. The establishment is poised to contribute to the evolving landscape of Guwahati''s hospitality sector by introducing a differentiated offering that appeals to a diverse clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of ABACUS lies its commitment to crafting distinctive and flavorful beers. The brewery component focuses on producing a range of handcrafted brews, from refreshing lagers and crisp pilsners to robust IPAs and rich stouts. Seasonal specialties and experimental batches are also anticipated to be part of the rotating tap list, ensuring a constantly evolving selection for beer enthusiasts. Alongside its brewery offerings, ABACUS boasts a full-service kitchen delivering a complementary menu that extends beyond typical pub fare. The kitchen focuses on creating a menu that uses locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, offering familiar flavors with a modern twist and dishes designed to pair expertly with the in-house brewed beers. This fusion of brewery and kitchen is designed to provide a holistic experience that caters to diverse preferences, setting ABACUS apart from standard standalone breweries or restaurants. It directly addresses the local market’s growing appetite for craft beverages and unique dining experiences, offering a convenient and engaging alternative within the city.</p> <br> <br>

<p>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience that fosters loyalty and positive word-of-mouth. The service philosophy centers on creating a welcoming and attentive environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. Knowledgeable and friendly staff are trained to guide customers through the beer selection, offer food pairing suggestions, and cater to individual dietary needs and preferences. The ambiance of ABACUS is designed to be both modern and inviting, creating a space where people can relax, socialize, and enjoy the company of friends and family. Regular events such as live music performances, trivia nights, and brewery tours are planned to engage the local community and cultivate a sense of belonging. By actively participating in local initiatives and supporting community organizations, ABACUS aims to establish itself as a responsible and integral part of the greater Guwahati community. The establishment envisions itself as a social hub where individuals can gather, connect, and celebrate the vibrant culture of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong presence in the local market and building a loyal customer base. Plans include expanding the brewing capacity to meet increasing demand, introducing new and innovative beer styles, and continuously refining the food menu based on customer feedback and seasonal availability. Potential future avenues include exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations, expanding the retail offerings to include merchandise and packaged beers, and potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam or the Northeast region. The long-term vision for ABACUS is to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality handcrafted beverages, exceptional cuisine, and a commitment to community engagement. It aspires to play a significant role in shaping the evolving hospitality landscape of Assam and beyond, solidifying its position as a premier destination for locals and tourists alike. The business intends to adapt to the changes in the market, constantly innovating to provide superior products and customer service and aiming to be a trendsetter in the local brewing and food scene.
</p>', '1st Floor, Hotel Palacio, GS Rd, above Poddar Car World', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:25:07.000Z'),
(1731, '188 Downtown', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>188 Downtown is a vibrant and innovative establishment poised to become a cornerstone of the business landscape in its Assam locale. More than just a business, 188 Downtown aims to be a central hub, fostering connections, providing exceptional services, and contributing meaningfully to the community''s economic and social fabric. It distinguishes itself through a commitment to quality, a deep understanding of local needs, and a forward-thinking approach to business practices.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, 188 Downtown provides a range of services tailored to cater to the evolving demands of the local market. A key offering is its curated selection of artisanal goods sourced from regional producers. This showcases the rich talent and craftsmanship of Assam, providing a platform for local artisans to reach a wider audience. The business also features a contemporary cafe serving locally sourced teas, coffees, and light meals. This cafe provides a welcoming space for business meetings, casual gatherings, and individuals seeking a relaxed environment to work or socialize. Furthermore, 188 Downtown offers co-working spaces equipped with modern amenities, catering to freelancers, entrepreneurs, and small businesses seeking a collaborative and productive work environment. These spaces are designed to foster creativity and innovation, with flexible membership options to suit diverse needs.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The unique selling proposition of 188 Downtown lies in its seamless integration of retail, hospitality, and workspace solutions, all under one roof. This multifaceted approach creates a dynamic ecosystem that benefits both its customers and the local community. The focus on sourcing local products not only supports regional artisans but also ensures that customers have access to authentic and high-quality goods. The emphasis on creating a welcoming and productive atmosphere in the cafe and co-working spaces fosters a sense of community and collaboration. This holistic approach differentiates 188 Downtown from traditional retail outlets, cafes, or co-working spaces, positioning it as a unique and valuable asset to the local economy.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at 188 Downtown. The business is committed to providing exceptional service characterized by warmth, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to meet customer needs. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the products and services offered, providing insightful recommendations and personalized assistance. 188 Downtown actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve its offerings and ensure that it remains responsive to their evolving needs. Regular community events, such as workshops, exhibitions, and networking sessions, are organized to foster connections and create a vibrant and inclusive atmosphere. By actively engaging with the local community, 188 Downtown aims to build strong relationships and become a trusted and valued member of the neighborhood.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, 188 Downtown envisions significant growth and expansion. Future plans include expanding its retail offerings to include a wider range of locally sourced products, potentially incorporating online sales channels to reach a broader customer base. The co-working spaces may be expanded to accommodate growing demand, with the addition of private offices and meeting rooms. There are also plans to partner with local educational institutions to offer workshops and training programs that support entrepreneurship and skill development within the community. Long-term goals include establishing 188 Downtown as a regional leader in providing innovative and sustainable business solutions, while remaining deeply committed to supporting the economic and social well-being of the local community. The business aspires to become a model for responsible and community-focused enterprise in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize local partnerships and sustainable practices.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:25:12.000Z'),
(1732, 'Hari Mirch', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Hari Mirch stands as a vibrant and authentic culinary beacon in the heart of Assam, dedicated to bringing the bold and diverse flavors of the region to a wider audience. More than just a restaurant, Hari Mirch is a celebration of Assamese culture and cuisine, a place where tradition meets innovation, and every dish tells a story. Located at [Insert Location - if not available, omit this sentence and start with "Hari Mirch is..."], we strive to provide an unparalleled dining experience that honors local ingredients and culinary heritage. Hari Mirch understands the discerning palate of its local community and the increasing desire for genuine Assamese flavors amongst visitors, making it a unique and significant player in the local business landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the core of Hari Mirch’s offerings lies a diverse menu showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. Our signature dishes include fragrant rice plates served with flavorful curries made from locally sourced ingredients, such as the intensely flavored *masor tenga* (sour fish curry) and the comforting *aloo pitika* (mashed potatoes with mustard oil and onions). We also offer a selection of *khar* dishes, known for their unique alkaline taste, a staple of Assamese households. For those seeking a lighter option, our selection of Assamese snacks and *pitha* (traditional rice cakes) provides a glimpse into the region''s rich culinary heritage. What sets Hari Mirch apart is its unwavering commitment to authenticity. We meticulously source our ingredients from local farmers and producers, ensuring the freshest and highest quality. Our chefs are masters of their craft, using traditional recipes passed down through generations while incorporating modern techniques to elevate the dining experience. Hari Mirch caters to the local market by offering familiar favorites prepared with utmost care and also introduces exciting new dishes that showcase the versatility of Assamese ingredients. The use of organic and sustainable practices further reinforces our commitment to the well-being of our community and the environment.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Hari Mirch believes that exceptional food is only part of the equation; outstanding customer service is equally paramount. We aim to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels like a part of the Hari Mirch family. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about Assamese cuisine, guiding customers through the diverse flavors and offering personalized recommendations. We actively seek feedback from our customers, continuously striving to improve our offerings and enhance the dining experience. Beyond providing excellent service within the restaurant, Hari Mirch is committed to connecting with the local community. We participate in local events, support local farmers and artisans, and host cultural programs that celebrate Assamese heritage. We also offer catering services for local gatherings and celebrations, bringing the flavors of Hari Mirch to homes and events throughout the region. By actively engaging with the community, Hari Mirch aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural hub and a source of local pride.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, Hari Mirch envisions becoming the leading ambassador of Assamese cuisine, both locally and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to include even more diverse and innovative dishes, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the region. A key area of growth involves expanding our online presence and delivery services, allowing us to reach a wider audience and cater to the growing demand for convenient and authentic Assamese food. We also aim to establish partnerships with other local businesses and tourism operators to promote Assam as a culinary destination. Furthermore, Hari Mirch is committed to sustainable practices and plans to implement initiatives to reduce our environmental impact and support local farming communities. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a lasting legacy by preserving and promoting Assamese cuisine, ensuring that it continues to thrive for generations to come. Hari Mirch strives to be a model of success, demonstrating that businesses can be both profitable and socially responsible, contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:25:17.000Z'),
(1733, 'PEPA - The Ethnic Kitchen', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>PEPA - The Ethnic Kitchen is more than just a restaurant; it''s an immersive culinary journey into the heart of Assam''s diverse ethnic communities. Located in [Insert Actual Location - if not known, write: a vibrant and accessible location in the city], PEPA offers a unique dining experience that celebrates the region''s rich gastronomic heritage. In a local business landscape often dominated by generic culinary offerings, PEPA stands out by providing authentic, home-style meals prepared with traditional recipes and locally sourced ingredients. We are committed to preserving and promoting the unique flavours and culinary traditions of Assam’s various tribes and communities, offering a truly distinctive alternative to mainstream dining.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing an authentic taste of Assam. We specialize in dishes representing a variety of ethnic groups, going beyond the standard Assamese fare to showcase the lesser-known culinary gems of communities like the Bodo, Mising, Karbi, and Dimasa people. Our menu features dishes rarely found in commercial establishments, prepared with traditional techniques and ingredients. This includes smoked meats, fermented delicacies, an array of locally sourced vegetables, and unique preparations of fish and poultry. We offer a range of services, including dine-in, takeaway, and catering for small to medium-sized events. A key unique selling point is our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and ensuring the authenticity of our dishes. We also cater to dietary needs and preferences, offering vegetarian and vegan options rooted in the region''s diverse culinary landscape. Our offerings directly address the need for authentic ethnic cuisine in the local market, satisfying the growing demand for unique and culturally significant dining experiences. We aim to provide a platform for experiencing the diverse food of Assam, catering both to locals seeking a taste of home and tourists eager to explore the region''s culinary heritage.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At PEPA, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, reminiscent of a traditional Assamese home. Our staff are trained not just to serve, but to engage with customers, sharing stories and insights about the dishes and the communities they represent. We encourage interaction and are always happy to explain the origins and preparation methods of our food. What sets us apart is our genuine commitment to hospitality and cultural exchange. We believe in creating a space where people can not only enjoy delicious food but also learn about and appreciate the cultural diversity of Assam. We actively connect with the local community through collaborations with local farmers, artisans, and cultural organizations. We host occasional cultural events and workshops to further promote the region''s heritage. By providing personalized service, creating a welcoming atmosphere, and fostering community engagement, PEPA aims to build lasting relationships with its customers and become a cherished part of the local community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for PEPA - The Ethnic Kitchen is ambitious and rooted in sustainable growth. We aim to expand our menu to represent even more of Assam''s diverse ethnic communities, becoming the go-to destination for experiencing the region''s complete culinary landscape. We plan to introduce educational initiatives, such as cooking classes and cultural workshops, to further promote the understanding and appreciation of Assam''s culinary heritage. We are also exploring the possibility of establishing partnerships with local tourism operators to offer culinary tours and experiences. In the long term, we envision expanding our operations to other locations, both within Assam and potentially beyond, to share the unique flavors of the region with a wider audience. We are committed to maintaining our focus on sustainability, ethical sourcing, and community engagement as we grow. Our ultimate goal is to become a recognized and respected ambassador for Assam''s culinary heritage, contributing to the preservation and promotion of the region''s rich cultural diversity and fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation of its unique identity through the universal language of food.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:25:24.000Z'),
(1734, 'Vatika - The Kitchen Garden', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p><b>Vatika - The Kitchen Garden: Cultivating Flavors, Nurturing Community</b></p>

<p>Vatika - The Kitchen Garden is a unique culinary venture nestled in the heart of [Insert locality within Assam]. More than just a restaurant, Vatika is a celebration of Assam''s rich agricultural heritage, offering a farm-to-table dining experience that connects diners directly with the source of their food. In a region known for its vibrant culinary traditions and abundance of fresh produce, Vatika stands out by prioritizing sustainability, local sourcing, and innovative interpretations of traditional Assamese cuisine. The business seeks to contribute to the local economy by partnering with regional farmers and artisans, fostering a vibrant food ecosystem within Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Vatika offers a range of services centered around providing a fresh, authentic, and sustainable dining experience. At its core, Vatika operates as a restaurant, serving breakfast, lunch, and dinner. The menu is carefully curated to showcase the best of Assamese ingredients, with a strong emphasis on seasonal availability. From aromatic curries infused with local herbs and spices to innovative salads featuring freshly harvested vegetables, each dish tells a story of the region''s culinary landscape. A key distinguishing feature is the on-site kitchen garden, where many of the restaurant''s herbs, vegetables, and fruits are grown. This not only ensures freshness but also allows guests to witness the journey of their food from garden to plate. Beyond the restaurant, Vatika also offers catering services for private events and gatherings. These services extend the restaurant''s commitment to quality and sustainability, bringing the flavors of the kitchen garden to a wider audience. Furthermore, Vatika hosts cooking classes and workshops, providing opportunities for locals and tourists alike to learn about Assamese cuisine and sustainable cooking practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Vatika addresses critical needs in the local market. There''s an increasing demand for healthy, locally sourced food. Vatika directly responds to this by offering a transparent and traceable food supply chain. The focus on traditional Assamese cuisine also caters to a growing desire among locals to reconnect with their culinary heritage. For tourists, Vatika provides an authentic and immersive cultural experience, allowing them to savor the true flavors of Assam while supporting local farmers and businesses. The workshops and cooking classes further enhance the customer experience, providing valuable skills and knowledge while promoting culinary tourism in the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Vatika, customer experience is paramount. The staff is dedicated to providing warm, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The restaurant''s ambiance is designed to be relaxing and inviting, with a rustic charm that reflects the region''s natural beauty. Regular feedback is actively solicited from customers to continuously improve the dining experience. What truly sets Vatika apart is its strong connection to the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events, supports community initiatives, and partners with local schools to educate children about sustainable agriculture and healthy eating habits. This deep engagement fosters a sense of community ownership and strengthens Vatika''s reputation as a responsible and ethical business.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Vatika envisions significant growth potential. A key focus will be expanding the on-site kitchen garden to increase self-sufficiency and further reduce its environmental footprint. There are plans to introduce a line of locally produced food products, such as pickles, jams, and spices, allowing customers to take a taste of Vatika home with them. Strategic partnerships with hotels and tour operators will be explored to attract a wider range of tourists and showcase Assamese cuisine on a larger scale. Long-term goals include establishing a training program for aspiring chefs and farmers, contributing to the development of a skilled workforce in the region. The ultimate vision is for Vatika to become a leading example of sustainable and community-focused business, inspiring others to embrace local sourcing and promote the rich culinary heritage of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:25:31.000Z'),
(1735, 'Kasturi Restaurant (Dhakai Bengali Cuisine)', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Kasturi Restaurant (Dhakai Bengali Cuisine) is a vibrant culinary destination nestled in a bright, modern space, offering a genuine taste of Dhaka''s rich and diverse Bengali culinary heritage. Situated in the heart of Assam, Kasturi distinguishes itself by presenting authentic Dhakai cuisine, a culinary tradition relatively unexplored in the region. More than just a restaurant, Kasturi is a cultural ambassador, introducing Assam to the nuanced flavors and intricate spice blends that define the culinary landscape of Dhaka. The restaurant fills a significant gap in the local dining scene, catering to a growing demand for diverse and authentic international cuisines while providing a comforting and familiar taste for those already acquainted with Bengali food. This makes it a unique and valuable addition to Assam''s business landscape.

<br> <br>

Kasturi Restaurant specializes in providing an exceptional Dhakai Bengali dining experience. Our core offerings revolve around a meticulously curated menu showcasing iconic dishes such as Morog Polao, a fragrant and flavorful chicken biryani; Kachchi Biryani, a layered meat and rice dish slow-cooked to perfection; and various Bhortas (mashed vegetables) prepared with traditional Dhakai recipes. We also offer a wide selection of freshly caught fish preparations, reflecting Dhaka''s proximity to major river systems and their influence on local cuisine. What truly sets Kasturi apart is our commitment to using authentic ingredients and traditional cooking techniques passed down through generations. This ensures that each dish delivers an unparalleled taste of Dhaka, creating a truly memorable culinary journey. By offering these specialties, Kasturi effectively caters to the local market''s desire for novel and authentic dining experiences, distinguishing itself from other restaurants in the area. Our selection of desserts such as Rosogolla and Mishti Doi complement the meal and create an experience that is truly Bangladeshi.

<br> <br>

At Kasturi, we believe that exceptional food deserves exceptional service. Our approach to customer service is rooted in creating a warm, welcoming, and attentive environment for every guest. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, providing detailed explanations of each dish and offering personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. Beyond providing attentive service, Kasturi actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting cultural events showcasing Dhakai music and art, partnering with local organizations to support community initiatives, and sourcing ingredients from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible. These efforts help us build strong relationships with our neighbors and foster a sense of community around the restaurant, making Kasturi a beloved gathering place for food enthusiasts and those seeking a taste of home. We also strive to make the experience accessible to everyone by offering a variety of pricing options and catering to dietary restrictions.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Kasturi Restaurant envisions becoming the premier destination for Dhakai Bengali cuisine in Assam and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our menu to showcase a wider range of regional specialties, offering cooking classes to share the secrets of Dhakai cuisine with the community, and potentially opening additional locations to reach a broader audience. We also aim to enhance our online presence through online ordering and delivery services, making it even easier for customers to enjoy our food from the comfort of their own homes. Long-term, Kasturi aims to become a recognized and respected culinary institution, contributing to the cultural richness of Assam while providing a sustainable and rewarding business for its employees and investors. We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of quality and authenticity, ensuring that Kasturi remains a beacon of Dhakai Bengali cuisine for generations to come. We believe that our focus on authentic flavors, exceptional service, and community engagement will be the key to our continued success and growth.', 'Bright, modern space for classic meals', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.341Z', '2025-12-07T10:30:08.000Z'),
(1736, 'Brewbakes', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Brewbakes, a vibrant café and bakery nestled in the heart of Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd, offers a unique blend of artisanal baked goods and expertly crafted beverages, quickly becoming a cherished community hub in Guwahati’s bustling landscape. More than just a place to grab a quick bite or a caffeine fix, Brewbakes represents a commitment to quality ingredients, skilled craftsmanship, and a welcoming atmosphere that resonates with the local Assamese culture and its diverse palates. In a market often dominated by national chains, Brewbakes distinguishes itself by prioritizing local sourcing, supporting regional farmers and producers, and infusing traditional flavors into contemporary offerings.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Brewbakes lies its dedication to delivering exceptional baked goods and beverages. The café''s signature offerings include a diverse selection of handcrafted cakes, pastries, and breads, each made fresh daily using premium ingredients. Customers can indulge in classic favorites like chocolate cake and croissants, as well as discover unique creations incorporating local ingredients like *pitha*, *laru*, and indigenous fruits. Alongside the baked goods, Brewbakes boasts a carefully curated beverage menu featuring specialty coffee sourced from regional estates, a variety of teas, refreshing fruit juices, and innovative blended drinks. A major selling point is the emphasis on customization; customers can tailor their orders to their preferences, whether it’s adjusting the sweetness level of a pastry or requesting a specific coffee roast. This adaptability directly addresses the preferences of the local market, which values both quality and personalized service. The menu also features lighter fare such as sandwiches and salads, perfect for a quick lunch or a light snack, catering to the on-the-go lifestyle of many in the area.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Brewbakes is built upon a foundation of exceptional customer service and community engagement. The staff is trained not only to prepare and serve high-quality products but also to create a warm and welcoming environment for every guest. Attentive service, personalized recommendations, and a genuine interest in customer satisfaction are key to the Brewbakes experience. The café regularly hosts events and promotions that celebrate local culture and foster community spirit. This might include live music performances by local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, or themed baking workshops that teach participants how to create traditional Assamese sweets. By actively participating in the local community, Brewbakes aims to become more than just a business; it strives to be a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and share experiences. Furthermore, Brewbakes actively engages with its customer base through social media, responding to feedback, sharing updates, and promoting upcoming events, fostering a strong sense of loyalty and connection.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, Brewbakes envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati region and beyond. The long-term goals include establishing additional locations, each maintaining the same commitment to quality, community, and customer service that defines the original café. There are plans to expand the product line to include a wider range of artisanal goods, such as homemade jams, chutneys, and packaged snacks, showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam. Brewbakes is also exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to promote regional products and tourism. This collaborative approach aims to contribute to the overall economic development of the area. In addition, Brewbakes recognizes the importance of sustainability and is committed to implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, from sourcing ethically produced ingredients to reducing waste and promoting responsible consumption. Ultimately, the vision for Brewbakes is to become a leading brand in the region, known not only for its exceptional products but also for its positive impact on the community and the environment.</p>', 'Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:30:15.000Z'),
(1737, 'Dikhou Ethnic Food', 'Restaurants', NULL, 'Dikhou Ethnic Food: A Taste of Assam''s Heritage

Dikhou Ethnic Food is a culinary gem nestled in the heart of Assam, dedicated to preserving and promoting the rich gastronomic heritage of the region. More than just a restaurant, Dikhou Ethnic Food is a cultural experience, offering authentic Assamese cuisine prepared with locally sourced ingredients and traditional cooking methods. We stand as a testament to Assam’s diverse ethnic communities, showcasing their unique culinary traditions and contributing to the vibrant tapestry of the local business landscape. Our commitment extends beyond providing delicious meals; we strive to educate our patrons about the history and significance of Assamese food, fostering a deeper appreciation for the region’s cultural identity.

<br> <br>

At Dikhou Ethnic Food, we pride ourselves on offering a comprehensive range of authentic Assamese dishes. Our menu features signature items like *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry), *Pitha* (traditional rice cakes), and * Khar * (an alkaline dish made with banana peels), each prepared according to time-honored recipes passed down through generations. We specialize in highlighting lesser-known delicacies from various Assamese communities, providing a unique and diverse culinary journey for our customers. Our sourcing strategy prioritizes local farmers and producers, ensuring the freshness and quality of our ingredients while supporting the local economy. Unlike conventional restaurants that may offer generic Indian or "North Eastern" fare, we focus exclusively on genuine Assamese cuisine, emphasizing the distinct flavors and culinary techniques that define the region. This dedication to authenticity is our key differentiator, attracting both locals seeking a taste of home and tourists eager to explore Assam''s culinary treasures. We also offer catering services for local events, sharing Assam''s culinary heritage at weddings, festivals, and corporate gatherings.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of our business philosophy. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels like a cherished member of the family. Our staff is not only well-trained in food service but also knowledgeable about Assamese culture and cuisine, enabling them to provide insightful recommendations and answer customer questions with enthusiasm. We believe in building genuine connections with our customers, going above and beyond to ensure their satisfaction. We regularly host cultural events, such as traditional music performances and cooking demonstrations, to engage with the local community and celebrate Assam''s rich heritage. This active community involvement has fostered a strong sense of loyalty among our customers. We actively seek customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We also maintain an active presence on social media, sharing recipes, cultural insights, and updates about our latest offerings, further strengthening our connection with the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Dikhou Ethnic Food envisions expanding its reach while staying true to its core values of authenticity and community engagement. We plan to introduce a line of packaged Assamese spices and ingredients, allowing customers to recreate the flavors of Assam in their own kitchens. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans to showcase and sell traditional Assamese crafts, further promoting the region''s cultural heritage. Our long-term goal is to establish Dikhou Ethnic Food as a leading ambassador of Assamese cuisine, not only within Assam but also nationally and internationally. We are committed to sustainable business practices, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local farmers and producers. We aspire to become a model for ethical and culturally sensitive entrepreneurship, demonstrating that it is possible to build a successful business while preserving and promoting cultural heritage. We are currently investigating the feasibility of opening additional locations within Assam, bringing the taste of authentic Assamese cuisine to a wider audience. We also aim to develop a culinary training program, equipping local youth with the skills and knowledge needed to succeed in the hospitality industry while preserving traditional Assamese cooking techniques.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:30:22.000Z'),
(1738, 'Brewbakes', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Brewbakes, a vibrant and welcoming establishment nestled in the heart of Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd, has quickly become a local favorite, offering a delightful fusion of freshly brewed beverages and delectable baked goods. More than just a café, Brewbakes represents a unique blend of Assamese hospitality and contemporary culinary trends, contributing significantly to the evolving food and beverage scene in Guwahati. We strive to provide a comfortable and inviting space where individuals can connect, relax, and enjoy quality offerings in a warm, community-oriented atmosphere.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Brewbakes offers a diverse and carefully curated menu centered around two primary categories: expertly crafted beverages and freshly baked goods. Our coffee program features locally sourced beans whenever possible, roasted to perfection and brewed with precision. We offer a full range of espresso-based drinks, from classic cappuccinos and lattes to innovative signature creations that incorporate regional flavors and ingredients. Beyond coffee, Brewbakes boasts a selection of refreshing teas, both traditional and contemporary blends, along with fruit-infused beverages and other specialty drinks to cater to diverse preferences. Our commitment to quality extends beyond beverages into our bakery offerings. Each day, our bakers create an array of tempting treats, from classic cakes and pastries to savory pies and quiches. We emphasize using fresh, high-quality ingredients, with a focus on local produce and seasonal specialties whenever available. Our unique selling point lies in the harmonious combination of these two distinct offerings, allowing customers to enjoy a complete and satisfying experience. We are particularly known for pairings of specific coffees with certain baked goods, enhancing the flavor profiles and creating a memorable culinary journey. This integrated approach directly addresses the local market''s desire for both familiar comfort foods and innovative, high-quality culinary experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Brewbakes. We are dedicated to creating a warm and welcoming environment where every customer feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and genuinely friendly, ensuring that each interaction is positive and memorable. We believe in going the extra mile to accommodate individual needs and preferences, offering personalized recommendations and catering to dietary restrictions whenever possible. What truly sets Brewbakes apart is its commitment to fostering a sense of community. We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events, striving to be more than just a business but a valued member of the neighborhood. We provide a comfortable and inviting space for people to connect, whether they are catching up with friends, working remotely, or simply seeking a moment of respite. Free Wi-Fi, comfortable seating arrangements, and a thoughtfully curated ambiance all contribute to creating a welcoming atmosphere. We also regularly host events, such as live music performances and art exhibitions, showcasing local talent and further strengthening our ties to the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Brewbakes envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, both within the local community and beyond. We are actively exploring opportunities to expand our menu offerings, incorporating more regional ingredients and culinary traditions to create a truly unique and authentic Assamese experience. We are also committed to expanding our online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services to reach a wider audience. Our long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and exploring opportunities to franchise the Brewbakes concept to other cities in Assam and beyond. We are committed to maintaining the same high standards of quality, customer service, and community engagement that have made us a local favorite, regardless of our scale. Sustainability is also a key aspect of our future vision. We are actively seeking ways to reduce our environmental impact, from sourcing locally and minimizing waste to implementing energy-efficient practices. We believe that by operating responsibly and sustainably, we can contribute to a healthier and more vibrant community for generations to come. Ultimately, Brewbakes aims to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, community, and the rich culinary heritage of Assam.</p>', 'Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:30:28.000Z'),
(1739, 'Uttsah Restaurant', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<p>Uttsah Restaurant, a vibrant and authentic Assamese culinary haven nestled in the heart of [Insert General Location, e.g., Guwahati''s bustling Paltan Bazaar district], offers a unique and immersive dining experience that celebrates the rich tapestry of Assam''s gastronomic heritage. More than just a restaurant, Uttsah aims to be a cultural ambassador, introducing both locals and visitors to the diverse flavors, traditions, and warmth of Assamese hospitality. In a region increasingly influenced by global cuisines, Uttsah stands out by prioritizing locally sourced ingredients, traditional cooking methods, and a genuine commitment to preserving the authenticity of Assamese food culture. We strive to be a landmark establishment, recognized not only for exceptional food but also for our contribution to the cultural vibrancy of the community.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>At Uttsah Restaurant, our core offering revolves around providing an unparalleled Assamese dining experience. We meticulously curate a menu that showcases the breadth and depth of Assamese cuisine, ranging from familiar favorites to lesser-known regional specialties. Key dishes include flavorful preparations of fish using traditional methods like *khar*, a unique alkaline extract, and *masor tenga*, a tangy sour fish curry. Meat lovers can savor dishes like *lal saah murgi*, chicken cooked in red rice beer, and pork delicacies prepared with local herbs and spices. Vegetarian options abound, with dishes featuring seasonal vegetables and pulses, reflecting the agricultural richness of the region. Our signature *thali*, a complete Assamese meal served on a traditional bell metal platter, offers a comprehensive introduction to the diverse flavors of the state. A significant differentiator is our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We work directly with farmers and producers in the surrounding region to ensure the highest quality and support the local agricultural economy. Furthermore, we offer cooking classes and interactive dining experiences, allowing guests to delve deeper into the art of Assamese cuisine and appreciate the cultural significance of each dish.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Uttsah. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive atmosphere that reflects the traditional Assamese concept of *Atithi Devo Bhava* – "The guest is equivalent to God." Our staff is trained not only in providing efficient and attentive service but also in sharing their knowledge and passion for Assamese cuisine and culture. We take pride in anticipating our customers'' needs and tailoring our recommendations to their individual preferences. The restaurant''s ambiance is carefully designed to evoke a sense of place, with traditional Assamese décor, music, and artwork. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, cultural organizations, and community initiatives. We regularly host cultural events, such as Bihu celebrations and traditional music performances, to promote Assamese heritage and foster a sense of community. We are also committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact through waste reduction, energy efficiency, and responsible sourcing. We believe that by providing exceptional service, fostering a strong connection with the community, and upholding our commitment to sustainability, we can create a truly memorable and meaningful dining experience for our guests.
</p>
<br>
<br>
<p>Uttsah Restaurant envisions becoming the leading ambassador for Assamese cuisine, not only within [Insert General Location, e.g., Guwahati] but also on a national and international scale. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate even more regional specialties and innovative culinary creations that showcase the versatility of Assamese ingredients. We are exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other major cities in India and abroad, bringing the flavors of Assam to a wider audience. We also plan to enhance our online presence through a user-friendly website and social media channels, offering online ordering, catering services, and virtual cooking classes. We are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring that they are equipped with the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service and represent our brand with pride. In the long term, we aim to establish a culinary institute dedicated to preserving and promoting Assamese cuisine, providing training to aspiring chefs and fostering a deeper appreciation for the region''s culinary heritage. We aspire to be more than just a restaurant; we want to be a cultural institution that plays a vital role in preserving and promoting the rich culinary traditions of Assam for generations to come. Our ultimate goal is to have Uttsah Restaurant synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and exceptional hospitality.
</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:30:35.000Z'),
(1740, 'KARIM''S', 'Restaurants', NULL, '<article>
<h1>KARIM''S: A Taste of Tradition, A Vision for the Future</h1>

<p>KARIM''S is more than just a business; it''s a cornerstone of the community, offering a unique blend of traditional Assam hospitality and forward-thinking enterprise. Located in the heart of {}, KARIM''S has become synonymous with quality, reliability, and a genuine commitment to serving the needs of its customers. In a region rich with cultural heritage and burgeoning economic activity, KARIM''S stands out by seamlessly integrating time-honored practices with modern business principles, creating a truly distinctive presence in the Assam business landscape. KARIM''S seeks to be a vital element of the local economy, providing employment opportunities, supporting local suppliers, and actively participating in community events. It''s a place where customers feel valued, employees feel empowered, and the local community feels supported. </p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>At KARIM''S, the focus is on providing high-quality goods and services designed to meet the specific needs of the local community. While the specific offerings may vary depending on the location and market demands, a consistent commitment to excellence remains. This may include, but is not limited to, retail offerings such as groceries featuring locally sourced produce and specialty items unique to Assam, essential household goods, or the provision of crucial services such as mobile top-up facilities, bill payment options, or postal services for the convenience of local residents. If KARIM''S operates in the food sector, it may offer a range of traditional Assamese dishes made with authentic recipes and fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Alternatively, KARIM''S could specialize in selling and servicing agricultural equipment vital for the region''s agricultural industry, providing expert advice, maintenance, and repair services to local farmers. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>What truly distinguishes KARIM''S is its dedication to providing products and services that are not only high in quality but also tailored to the specific needs and preferences of the local population. Understanding the cultural nuances and specific requirements of the community is at the heart of the business model. Whether it''s sourcing particular spices for authentic Assamese cuisine, stocking essential tools for local artisans, or offering services that cater to the unique demographics of the area, KARIM''S strives to provide value that goes beyond the purely transactional. The unique selling point often lies in the personalized service, the deep understanding of local needs, and the commitment to sourcing locally whenever possible, supporting other businesses in the community and fostering a sense of shared prosperity. </p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Customer Experience</h2>

<p>KARIM''S is built on a foundation of exceptional customer service. The philosophy is simple: treat every customer with respect, understand their needs, and go the extra mile to exceed their expectations. This commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in every aspect of the business, from the welcoming atmosphere of the physical store to the prompt and helpful responses to customer inquiries. Employees are carefully selected and trained not only for their technical skills but also for their ability to connect with customers on a personal level. They are encouraged to listen attentively, offer genuine assistance, and build lasting relationships with the community. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>KARIM''S strives to be more than just a place to buy goods and services; it aspires to be a gathering place for the community. This may involve hosting local events, sponsoring community initiatives, or simply providing a comfortable and welcoming space for people to connect. Actively participating in local festivals, supporting local schools, or partnering with charitable organizations are all ways in which KARIM''S strengthens its ties to the community and demonstrates its commitment to social responsibility. This deep connection to the local community is what truly sets KARIM''S apart and fosters a sense of loyalty among its customers. The aim is to create an environment where customers feel valued, respected, and connected to something larger than themselves. </p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Future Vision</h2>

<p>The future vision for KARIM''S is one of sustainable growth and continued community engagement. The business aims to expand its offerings to meet the evolving needs of the local market while remaining true to its core values of quality, reliability, and customer service. This may involve expanding the range of products and services offered, investing in new technologies to improve efficiency and customer experience, or opening new locations in underserved areas. However, growth will always be balanced with a commitment to preserving the unique character of KARIM''S and its deep connection to the community. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>KARIM''S is also committed to exploring new opportunities for innovation and sustainability. This may involve adopting environmentally friendly practices, supporting local producers and artisans, or investing in renewable energy sources. The long-term goal is to create a business that is not only profitable but also socially responsible and environmentally sustainable, contributing to the overall well-being of the community. By embracing innovation, fostering collaboration, and remaining true to its core values, KARIM''S is well-positioned to thrive in the years to come and continue to be a vital part of the Assam business landscape. The ambition is to become a model for other businesses in the region, demonstrating that it is possible to achieve both commercial success and social impact. </p>

</article>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:35:09.000Z'),
(1741, 'Leaf Deck Café', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Leaf Deck Café: A Tranquil Oasis in Guwahati''s Bustling Heart

Leaf Deck Café, strategically located on GS Rd, opposite GTAC, is more than just a café; it’s a destination. It’s a haven for those seeking a moment of tranquility amidst the vibrant energy of Guwahati''s commercial artery. We aim to provide a unique and enriching experience, blending the comfort of familiar café staples with the distinct flavors and warm hospitality of Assam. We understand that Guwahati, a rapidly growing city, needs spaces where individuals can connect, relax, and rejuvenate, and Leaf Deck Café strives to be that space. Our location, easily accessible and prominently situated, makes us a convenient choice for students, professionals, and residents alike. We stand out by offering a carefully curated menu featuring locally sourced ingredients, a serene ambiance, and a commitment to exceptional customer service, contributing meaningfully to the local business landscape.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings center around providing high-quality food and beverages in a welcoming atmosphere. Our menu boasts a range of freshly brewed coffees, teas, and specialty beverages, alongside a selection of light meals, snacks, and delectable desserts. We prioritize sourcing ingredients locally wherever possible, showcasing the rich agricultural heritage of Assam. This includes sourcing tea directly from local gardens and incorporating regional produce into our dishes. One of our unique selling points is our "Assam Tea Tasting Flight," allowing customers to sample a variety of locally grown teas and learn about their distinct characteristics. We also offer a selection of traditional Assamese snacks and sweets, introducing visitors and locals alike to the region''s culinary delights. Our menu is designed to cater to a wide range of tastes and dietary preferences, including vegetarian and vegan options. By focusing on quality, local sourcing, and unique regional flavors, we aim to satisfy the growing demand for authentic and sustainable dining experiences in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

At Leaf Deck Café, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel comfortable and valued. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable visit. We strive to build genuine relationships with our patrons, becoming a familiar and trusted part of their daily routines. Beyond providing excellent service, we are committed to engaging with the local community. We host regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, book readings, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for showcasing local talent and fostering a sense of community. We actively participate in local initiatives and support local charities, demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the community that supports us. Through our exceptional service, community engagement, and unique events, we aim to create a café experience that is both memorable and meaningful.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Leaf Deck Café has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a recognized and respected brand within the Guwahati hospitality sector, known for our quality, service, and community engagement. We plan to expand our menu, introducing new and innovative dishes that further showcase the flavors of Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical footprint, potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati or even expanding to other cities in the Northeast region. We are committed to sustainable practices and aim to reduce our environmental impact by implementing eco-friendly initiatives throughout our operations. Furthermore, we plan to develop partnerships with local farmers and producers, further strengthening our commitment to local sourcing and supporting the agricultural community. Our long-term goal is to establish Leaf Deck Café as a leading café brand in the region, contributing to the growth of the local economy and providing a welcoming and enjoyable space for the community to connect and thrive. We see ourselves as more than just a café; we aspire to be a hub for culture, connection, and community in the heart of Guwahati.', 'GS Rd, opp. GTAC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:35:17.000Z'),
(1742, 'Uptown Escape Cafe & Cocktail Bar', 'Cafes', NULL, '# Uptown Escape Cafe & Cocktail Bar: A Sophisticated Oasis in Guwahati

