<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Café Hendrix envisions a future of sustained growth and continued innovation. The long-term goal is to establish the café as a leading destination for coffee and culinary experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Expansion plans include potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas of the city and exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations. Café Hendrix also plans to further develop its online presence and expand its catering services to reach a wider audience. In addition to physical expansion, the café is committed to continuously improving its menu, sourcing the highest quality ingredients, and staying ahead of culinary trends. This includes exploring new coffee brewing techniques, experimenting with innovative flavor combinations, and expanding the selection of healthy and sustainable food options. Ultimately, Café Hendrix aims to create a lasting legacy of excellence, contributing to the economic and cultural vitality of the community while providing a welcoming and inspiring space for people to connect, relax, and enjoy the finer things in life. The focus remains on consistently delivering exceptional quality, fostering a strong sense of community, and adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of its customers.', 'GS Rd, opp. Pantaloons Down Town', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:35:31.000Z'),
(1744, '11th Avenue Cafe Bistro', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>11th Avenue Cafe Bistro: A Culinary Oasis on Tayabulla Road</p>

<p>Nestled at 19, Tayabulla Road, 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro is more than just a place to eat; it''s a vibrant hub where culinary innovation meets Assam''s warm hospitality. In a region steeped in rich traditions and burgeoning with modern aspirations, 11th Avenue offers a distinctive dining experience, catering to a diverse clientele seeking a blend of familiar comforts and exciting gastronomic adventures. The cafe bistro distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, a curated menu that reflects both local flavors and international influences, and a welcoming ambiance that fosters connection and community engagement. It''s a destination designed to elevate the everyday, whether it''s a quick coffee break, a leisurely lunch, or a memorable evening gathering.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings encompass a carefully crafted menu that bridges the gap between cafe staples and bistro sophistication. We serve a range of specialty coffees, prepared with locally sourced beans when available and expertly brewed to perfection. Beyond coffee, patrons can indulge in a selection of artisanal teas, refreshing beverages, and handcrafted pastries made fresh daily. Our bistro menu features a variety of dishes, from light salads and sandwiches to more substantial entrees showcasing regional produce and innovative culinary techniques. A signature element is our emphasis on seasonal ingredients, ensuring that each dish is bursting with flavor and reflects the bounty of Assam''s fertile lands. We also offer catering services for small to medium-sized events, providing customized menus tailored to specific client needs and preferences. The unique selling point of 11th Avenue lies in its ability to provide a refined dining experience at accessible prices, offering a valuable alternative to existing options in the local market, addressing the need for a comfortable yet stylish space for both casual and special occasions.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro, exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a guest walks through the door, they are greeted with a warm welcome and attentive service. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, offering recommendations and accommodating dietary restrictions. We strive to create a personalized experience for each customer, remembering preferences and building genuine relationships. What sets us apart is our active involvement in the local community. We partner with local artists and artisans to showcase their work, providing a platform for creative expression and enriching the ambiance of the cafe. We also host community events, such as live music performances and art exhibitions, fostering a sense of belonging and connection. Furthermore, we actively support local initiatives and charities, demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the community that supports us. This holistic approach to customer engagement creates a loyal following and establishes 11th Avenue as more than just a business; it''s a valued member of the neighborhood.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading culinary destination in the region. Our future plans include introducing new menu items that further highlight the diversity of Assamese cuisine while continuing to incorporate international flavors. We aim to establish stronger relationships with local farmers and suppliers, ensuring a sustainable and ethical supply chain. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our catering services and offer online ordering options for added convenience. A key element of our long-term strategy is to develop a loyalty program that rewards our regular customers and encourages repeat business. Furthermore, we are considering opening a second location in a nearby area, replicating the successful formula of 11th Avenue while adapting to the unique characteristics of the new community. Ultimately, our goal is to create a thriving and sustainable business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of Assam, while continuing to provide exceptional food, service, and experiences to our valued customers.</p>', '19, Tayabulla Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:35:37.000Z'),
(1745, 'Cafe Aera', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Cafe Aera: A Refreshing Oasis Above the Bustle of GS Road

Cafe Aera, nestled above Heritage Kitchen and beside the Heritage Udeshna Building on GS Road, is more than just a cafe; it''s a carefully curated experience designed to offer a respite from the vibrant chaos of Guwahati’s primary thoroughfare. We aim to provide a tranquil and inviting space where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and enjoy high-quality food and beverages in a comfortable and stylish setting. Cafe Aera stands out by blending modern cafe culture with a touch of Assamese hospitality, creating a unique and memorable destination. Our commitment to quality ingredients, exceptional service, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati cafe scene.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Cafe Aera lies our dedication to providing a diverse and delectable menu. We offer a wide range of specialty coffees, prepared with carefully sourced beans and expertly crafted by our trained baristas. Beyond coffee, our menu features a selection of teas, refreshing iced beverages, and freshly made juices to cater to diverse tastes. Our food offerings encompass a curated selection of light meals, snacks, and desserts, designed to be both satisfying and flavourful. This includes gourmet sandwiches, flavorful wraps, freshly baked pastries, and decadent cakes. We pay close attention to ingredient sourcing, prioritizing local and seasonal produce whenever possible to ensure freshness and support local farmers. Understanding the local palate, we also offer a selection of traditional Assamese snacks and sweets with a contemporary twist, introducing a familiar yet exciting element to our menu. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to consistency and quality across all our offerings, ensuring a memorable culinary experience with every visit.

<br> <br>

Cafe Aera prioritizes creating a welcoming and personalized customer experience. From the moment our guests enter, they are greeted with a warm smile and attentive service. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and eager to assist customers with their selections, offering recommendations and addressing any concerns. We believe in fostering a sense of community within our cafe, creating a space where people feel comfortable connecting with friends, working remotely, or simply enjoying a moment of solitude. Our ambiance is carefully cultivated to be both relaxing and stimulating, with comfortable seating, soothing music, and ample natural light. We offer complimentary Wi-Fi to cater to the needs of students and professionals, and we regularly host events and promotions to engage with the local community. This might include live music performances, art exhibitions featuring local artists, or themed food and beverage nights, all designed to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. By actively participating in local initiatives and supporting community events, Cafe Aera aims to become an integral part of the GS Road neighborhood.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Cafe Aera envisions becoming a landmark destination on GS Road, known for its exceptional quality, outstanding service, and unwavering commitment to the community. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes and beverages that reflect the evolving tastes of our customers. This might involve collaborating with local chefs and food producers to showcase the best of Assamese cuisine. We also aim to enhance our physical space, creating a more comfortable and inviting environment for our guests. This could involve expanding our seating area, adding outdoor seating options, or incorporating more local art and design elements. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our reach beyond the cafe walls, such as offering catering services for local businesses and events. We are also committed to sustainable practices, exploring ways to reduce our environmental impact and support local initiatives. Ultimately, our goal is to establish Cafe Aera as a thriving and sustainable business that contributes positively to the local economy and enhances the quality of life for the people of Guwahati.', 'GS Rd, above Heritage Kitchen, beside Heritage Udeshna Building', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:40:08.000Z'),
(1746, 'The Beer Cafe, Guwahati', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, strategically located on the second floor of Times Square Mall, RG Baruah Rd, near Quick Shoppe, is more than just a place to grab a drink; it''s a vibrant social hub redefining Guwahati''s pub culture. In a region known for its rich tea heritage and burgeoning urban lifestyle, The Beer Cafe offers a curated experience that blends global beer appreciation with local hospitality, creating a unique and welcoming environment for both seasoned beer enthusiasts and casual patrons alike. We stand out as a premier destination for those seeking a diverse selection of beers, coupled with a lively atmosphere and attentive service.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, offers a wide-ranging selection of beers, catering to diverse palates and preferences. From popular domestic brands to imported craft brews, the menu is carefully curated to showcase a spectrum of flavors, styles, and brewing traditions. We pride ourselves on offering choices beyond the commonplace, featuring both well-established international beers and exciting selections from emerging Indian microbreweries. Beyond beer, the cafe provides a complementary menu of appetizers, snacks, and meals designed to perfectly pair with the beer offerings, enhancing the overall dining experience. Unique selling points include our knowledgeable staff, trained to guide customers through the beer selection process, offering recommendations and insights into the nuances of each brew. We regularly update our beer menu, introducing seasonal offerings and limited-edition releases, ensuring that there''s always something new to discover. This commitment to variety and expertise addresses the growing demand in Guwahati for a sophisticated and informed beer-drinking culture.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of The Beer Cafe, Guwahati. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where patrons feel comfortable and valued. Our staff is trained not only to serve but also to engage with customers, providing personalized recommendations and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable visit. We host regular events, such as live music performances, themed beer nights, and quiz competitions, fostering a sense of community and camaraderie. The ambiance is designed to be both lively and relaxing, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and carefully curated music that complements the overall experience. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events. We also leverage social media to connect with our customers, sharing updates, promotions, and behind-the-scenes glimpses of the cafe. This approach to customer service aims to build long-term relationships, transforming first-time visitors into loyal patrons who appreciate the unique and authentic experience that The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, offers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, envisions continued growth and expansion within the region. Our long-term goals include becoming the undisputed leader in Guwahati''s beer and pub culture, setting the standard for quality, service, and innovation. We plan to explore opportunities to expand our menu, introducing new and exciting beer styles, as well as expanding the food offerings to cater to a wider range of dietary preferences. We also aim to enhance the customer experience through technology, potentially introducing online ordering, loyalty programs, and interactive beer guides. Furthermore, we are committed to supporting the growth of the local brewing industry, actively seeking out partnerships with Assam-based microbreweries and showcasing their products at our cafe. The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, aspires to be more than just a business; it aims to be a positive contributor to the Guwahati community, promoting responsible drinking habits and fostering a vibrant social scene. We believe that our commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement will position us for continued success in the years to come.</p>', 'Second floor, Times Square Mall, RG Baruah Rd, near Quick Shoppe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:40:14.000Z'),
(1747, 'Cafe Shillong, Guwahati', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Cafe Shillong, Guwahati, nestled at 45/46, RG Baruah Rd, is more than just a cafe; it''s a cultural bridge, a culinary experience, and a community hub. In the vibrant and diverse city of Guwahati, Cafe Shillong stands out as a unique establishment that blends the distinct flavors and cultural ethos of Shillong, the capital of Meghalaya, with the dynamic spirit of Assam. It addresses a significant gap in the local market by offering a taste of Northeast India''s diverse culinary heritage within a comfortable and contemporary setting. Its significance lies in its ability to provide a unique experience that caters to both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic and memorable taste of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Cafe Shillong’s core offerings revolve around providing a diverse menu that celebrates the culinary traditions of the Northeast. From signature Khasi dishes like Jadoh (a flavorful rice preparation cooked with pork blood and spices) to popular Naga dishes featuring bamboo shoot and fermented beans, the menu is a carefully curated selection of regional specialties. Beyond the authentic Northeastern fare, the cafe also serves a range of continental dishes, snacks, and beverages, ensuring that there''s something to satisfy every palate. A key unique selling point is the commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and producers but also ensures the highest quality and authenticity of the dishes. Furthermore, the cafe frequently hosts live music performances featuring local artists, adding to the vibrant and immersive cultural experience it offers. This integrated approach – authentic cuisine, local ingredients, and live music – sets Cafe Shillong apart from other establishments in the city and directly caters to the growing demand for experiential dining and cultural immersion.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Cafe Shillong''s operational philosophy. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, providing detailed descriptions and recommendations to guide customers through the diverse offerings. Beyond attentive service, the cafe cultivates a warm and inviting atmosphere, creating a space where customers feel comfortable and welcomed. Regular feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continually improve the menu and service standards. Cafe Shillong actively connects with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and collaborating with local artists and artisans. The cafe also hosts special events, such as food festivals and cultural showcases, to promote Northeastern culture and heritage. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and strengthens the cafe''s relationship with its patrons, transforming it into more than just a place to eat; it becomes a gathering place for friends, families, and community members.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Cafe Shillong, Guwahati, involves strategic expansion and continued innovation. While maintaining its core values of authenticity and community engagement, the business aims to explore opportunities for growth, potentially including opening additional locations within Guwahati and other parts of Assam. A key area of focus is strengthening partnerships with local producers to further enhance the use of locally sourced ingredients and support sustainable agricultural practices. Another area of development involves expanding the menu to include even more diverse and lesser-known dishes from different Northeastern tribes, further solidifying its position as a culinary ambassador for the region. The long-term goal is to establish Cafe Shillong as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with authentic Northeastern cuisine, cultural preservation, and community empowerment. This includes actively promoting tourism to the Northeast by showcasing its rich cultural heritage and culinary delights to a wider audience. Through careful planning, consistent execution, and a strong commitment to its core values, Cafe Shillong is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come, solidifying its place as a vital part of Guwahati''s vibrant business landscape.</p>', '45/46, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:40:20.000Z'),
(1748, 'The HideOut Café', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The HideOut Café, nestled on VIP Road opposite the Arizona Sports Arena, offers a refreshing escape and a vibrant hub for the community in Assam. More than just a café, The HideOut is envisioned as a welcoming space where individuals can connect, unwind, and indulge in quality refreshments within a relaxed and contemporary setting. In a region known for its rich tea culture and burgeoning café scene, The HideOut distinguishes itself through its curated menu, emphasis on locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, and commitment to creating a unique and memorable customer experience. It serves as a dynamic addition to the local business landscape, catering to a diverse clientele from sports enthusiasts visiting the arena to residents seeking a comfortable and accessible social spot. </p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, The HideOut Café provides a diverse menu of beverages and light fare. We specialize in handcrafted coffee drinks, utilizing premium Arabica beans roasted to perfection, offering everything from classic espressos and lattes to innovative signature blends infused with local flavors. Beyond coffee, our menu features a selection of refreshing teas, including traditional Assam varieties, along with a range of fruit juices, smoothies, and mocktails. Complementing our beverages is a curated selection of light meals, including sandwiches, wraps, salads, and pastries. A distinctive feature is the inclusion of Assamese-inspired snacks and small plates, showcasing the region''s culinary heritage and offering a unique taste experience not commonly found in other cafes. We prioritize sourcing ingredients from local farms and producers whenever feasible, supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of our offerings. This commitment to local sourcing distinguishes The HideOut and resonates strongly with customers seeking authentic and sustainable dining options. By offering high-quality beverages and food in a comfortable setting, The HideOut caters to the growing demand for accessible, convenient, and enjoyable dining experiences within the community. </p> <br> <br>

<p>The customer experience at The HideOut Café is paramount, built around creating a welcoming and personalized atmosphere. Our staff are trained to provide attentive and friendly service, ensuring that each customer feels valued and comfortable. The café''s ambiance is carefully designed to be both stylish and relaxing, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and complimentary Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for work, leisure, or social gatherings. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists'' exhibitions, organizing live music performances, and partnering with local businesses for promotional events. Our aim is to be more than just a café; we aspire to be a community hub where people can connect, share ideas, and support local talent. We also actively solicit customer feedback through surveys and online platforms, constantly striving to improve our offerings and tailor our services to meet the evolving needs of our clientele. By fostering a strong sense of community and prioritizing customer satisfaction, The HideOut aims to cultivate lasting relationships with our customers and become a beloved institution within the neighborhood. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, The HideOut Café envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing a loyal customer base, expanding our menu offerings to include more diverse and seasonal items, and potentially opening additional locations within the region. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to further enhance our community involvement and expand our reach. We also aim to develop a strong online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, making it easier for customers to access our products and services. We recognize the growing demand for sustainable and ethically sourced food and beverages, and we are committed to further strengthening our sourcing practices and minimizing our environmental impact. In addition to physical expansion, we are also considering offering catering services for local events and businesses, further diversifying our revenue streams. By remaining adaptable, innovative, and committed to our core values of quality, community, and customer satisfaction, The HideOut Café is poised to become a leading destination for coffee and community engagement in Assam, contributing to the vibrant and evolving business landscape of the region.
</p>', 'VIP Rd, opp. to Arizona Sports Arena', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.342Z', '2025-12-07T10:40:28.000Z'),
(1749, 'Mama Yumm Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Mama Yumm Cafe: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Located at Aditya Tower, GS Road, next to the prestigious Novotel Hotel, Mama Yumm Cafe offers a refreshing and inviting dining experience that distinguishes itself within Guwahati''s burgeoning cafe scene. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, Mama Yumm Cafe strives to be a community hub, a comforting haven for both locals and travelers seeking quality food, exceptional service, and a genuinely welcoming atmosphere. We contribute to the vibrant tapestry of Assam''s culinary landscape by offering a unique blend of familiar favorites and innovative creations, catering to diverse palates and preferences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Mama Yumm Cafe lies our commitment to providing exceptional food and beverages crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients. Our core offerings encompass a diverse menu that spans breakfast, lunch, and dinner, as well as a curated selection of specialty coffees, teas, and refreshing beverages. For breakfast, patrons can choose from classic options such as omelets and pancakes to regionally inspired dishes featuring local ingredients and flavors. Lunch and dinner menus showcase a mix of continental and Indian cuisine, with pasta dishes, sandwiches, burgers, and flavorful curries prepared with authentic spices and techniques. Vegetarian and vegan options are readily available, ensuring that dietary needs are thoughtfully catered to.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly sets Mama Yumm Cafe apart is our unwavering dedication to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We collaborate with nearby farms and suppliers to ensure the freshness and quality of our produce, while also supporting local businesses and reducing our environmental footprint. Our beverage selection is equally impressive, featuring handcrafted coffee drinks prepared with carefully selected beans, a variety of aromatic teas, and refreshing fruit juices made with seasonal produce. The presentation of each dish and drink is meticulously considered, enhancing the overall dining experience and creating visually appealing offerings that are as delicious as they are beautiful.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer service is paramount at Mama Yumm Cafe. We believe that creating a positive and memorable experience for every guest is essential to our success. Our team members are carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, attentive, and efficient service. From the moment a guest enters our cafe, they are greeted with a warm smile and made to feel welcome. We strive to anticipate their needs, offer helpful recommendations, and ensure their complete satisfaction. We also actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Beyond providing exceptional food and service, Mama Yumm Cafe actively seeks to connect with the local community. We host regular events, such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and workshops, to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We also partner with local organizations and charities to support community initiatives and give back to the area that has so warmly embraced us. By fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of our community, we aim to be more than just a cafe – we strive to be a cherished gathering place for all.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Mama Yumm Cafe envisions significant growth potential. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that reflect the evolving tastes of our customers. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations throughout Guwahati and beyond, bringing our unique brand of hospitality to a wider audience. We are committed to investing in our staff, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to enhance their skills and advance their careers. Furthermore, we are dedicated to sustainability and reducing our environmental impact through responsible sourcing practices and waste reduction initiatives.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Mama Yumm Cafe as a leading cafe brand in Assam, known for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and strong community engagement. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously striving for improvement, we can achieve this vision and create a lasting positive impact on the local culinary landscape and the communities we serve. Mama Yumm Cafe is more than just a place to eat; it''s a place to connect, relax, and savor the simple pleasures of life.</p>', 'Aditya Tower, GS Rd, next to Novotel Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.343Z', '2025-12-07T10:40:36.000Z'),
