(1772, 'Shambhala Kitchen - Tibetan and Himalayan Cafe (A unit of Little Donnie)', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Shambhala Kitchen - Tibetan and Himalayan Cafe, a unit of Little Donnie, brings the authentic flavors of Tibet and the Himalayas to the vibrant culinary scene of Assam. More than just a restaurant, it is an immersive experience that transports patrons to the serene and culturally rich regions it represents. Situated in a currently undisclosed location, Shambhala Kitchen fills a unique niche, offering a distinct alternative to the existing dining options and catering to both adventurous palates and those seeking comfort in familiar flavors.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Shambhala Kitchen specializes in providing a wide array of traditional Tibetan and Himalayan dishes. Our core offerings include momos (steamed or fried dumplings), thukpa (noodle soup), various curries featuring yak or locally sourced meats and vegetables, and a selection of authentic teas and beverages. Our unique selling point lies in the genuine recipes, carefully preserved and prepared using traditional methods. We prioritize fresh, high-quality ingredients, sourcing locally whenever possible to support local farmers and ensure the authenticity of our dishes. Furthermore, we offer vegetarian and vegan options, catering to the diverse dietary preferences of our customers. Our menu is thoughtfully curated to showcase the best of Himalayan cuisine while adapting to local tastes, offering a balanced blend of the familiar and the exotic. Shambhala Kitchen addresses a growing demand for diverse culinary experiences within Assam, providing a refreshing departure from standard restaurant fare and catering to a clientele eager to explore new flavors and cultures.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Shambhala Kitchen, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere that reflects the tranquility and hospitality of the Himalayan region. Our staff is trained not only in culinary expertise but also in providing exceptional customer service, ensuring every guest feels welcomed and valued. We aim to create a personal connection with our customers, sharing stories and insights about the dishes and the culture they represent. Our commitment extends beyond providing excellent food; we host occasional cultural events, such as traditional music performances and art exhibitions, to further enrich the dining experience and connect with the local community. Shambhala Kitchen actively engages with local organizations and participates in community events, solidifying its role as a positive and contributing member of the Assam business landscape. We regularly seek feedback from our customers and utilize it to improve our offerings and services, ensuring we consistently meet and exceed their expectations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Shambhala Kitchen envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its authentic Tibetan and Himalayan cuisine, exceptional customer service, and commitment to the community. Future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate seasonal dishes and regional specialties, introducing cooking classes and workshops to share our culinary expertise with the public, and potentially opening additional locations within Assam and beyond. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their products in our cafe, further promoting the region''s rich cultural heritage. Our long-term goal is to establish Shambhala Kitchen as a sustainable and socially responsible business, contributing to the economic growth of Assam while preserving and celebrating the unique culinary traditions of the Himalayas. We are committed to innovation and continuous improvement, constantly seeking new ways to enhance the dining experience and exceed customer expectations, ensuring Shambhala Kitchen remains a cherished culinary gem in the heart of Assam.
</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:05:20.000Z'),
(1773, 'Guwahati Coffee House', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Guwahati Coffee House aims to be more than just a place to grab a cup of coffee; it aspires to be a cornerstone of the community, a haven for conversation, and a celebration of Assam''s rich cultural heritage, all served with the finest locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, it carves a unique niche within the city''s burgeoning cafe scene by blending traditional Assamese hospitality with contemporary coffee culture.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Guwahati Coffee House offers a curated selection of coffee beverages, ranging from expertly pulled espresso-based drinks to traditional Assamese black tea preparations. The coffee beans, where feasible, are sourced from nearby estates, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. Beyond coffee, the menu boasts a range of handcrafted teas, refreshing iced beverages, and a selection of locally inspired snacks and light meals. Our unique selling point lies not only in the quality of our ingredients but also in our commitment to showcasing Assam''s culinary traditions. The "Jolpan Platter," for instance, features traditional Assamese breakfast items, offering a taste of local flavors to both residents and tourists alike. This dedication to authenticity sets us apart from generic coffee chains and positions us as a destination that celebrates the region''s distinct identity. The menu is designed to cater to a wide spectrum of palates, from those seeking a familiar caffeine fix to adventurous foodies eager to explore local tastes. We also offer vegan and gluten-free options, ensuring inclusivity for all customers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Guwahati Coffee House. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where patrons feel comfortable lingering, working, or connecting with friends. Our staff is trained not only in coffee preparation but also in providing genuine and attentive service, anticipating customer needs and fostering a sense of community. The interior design incorporates elements of Assamese art and craftsmanship, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space. We regularly host local artists, musicians, and storytellers, providing a platform for creative expression and enriching the cultural landscape of Guwahati. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the cafe, catering to students and professionals seeking a productive workspace. We also actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools and charitable organizations, participating in local events and contributing to the well-being of the city. Our commitment extends to ethical sourcing and sustainable practices. We are working to minimize our environmental footprint through waste reduction programs and the use of eco-friendly materials.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Guwahati Coffee House envisions becoming a premier destination for coffee lovers and cultural enthusiasts alike. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and collaborating with local artisans to showcase their crafts. We aim to establish a roasting facility to further enhance the quality and freshness of our coffee beans, while also providing employment opportunities for the local community. Branching out to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam is also a consideration for long-term growth. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of offering coffee brewing workshops and cultural immersion experiences to educate and engage our customers. Our ultimate goal is to create a sustainable and impactful business that contributes to the economic and cultural vitality of Assam, solidifying Guwahati Coffee House as a cherished landmark in the city.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:05:27.000Z'),
(1774, 'Lush - The Café', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Lush - The Café, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at House No. 12 Jorpukhuri, Gautam Krishna Kunj, Lamb Rd, is more than just a café; it''s a culinary haven designed to offer a refreshing and enriching experience within the local Assam business landscape. We strive to be a cornerstone of the community, a place where friends gather, ideas are exchanged, and memories are made, all while indulging in high-quality food and beverages in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. We understand the unique character of Assam and aim to reflect it in our ambiance, menu, and overall customer experience, setting us apart from typical coffee shops and eateries.

<br> <br>

Lush - The Café''s core offerings revolve around providing a diverse and satisfying culinary experience. Our menu boasts a carefully curated selection of dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese snacks and light meals, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, to continental favorites with a modern twist. We offer a variety of artisanal coffees and teas, refreshing beverages, and delectable desserts, catering to a wide range of palates and preferences. A unique selling point is our focus on incorporating local Assamese flavors and ingredients into our menu, creating dishes that are both familiar and innovative. We also pride ourselves on our commitment to providing vegetarian and vegan options, ensuring that there''s something for everyone to enjoy. The café also plans to offer a small selection of locally produced artisanal goods for sale, further supporting the Assam business community. This multifaceted approach allows us to meet the local market needs for quality food, diverse options, and a celebration of local culture.

<br> <br>

At Lush - The Café, customer experience is paramount. We believe in providing exceptional service that goes beyond simply taking orders and delivering food. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance of the café is designed to be warm and inviting, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and a relaxing atmosphere. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and services. We also strive to connect with the local community by hosting events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional talent, and workshops that celebrate Assamese culture and traditions. This focus on community engagement helps us foster a strong sense of belonging and build lasting relationships with our customers, making Lush - The Café a true community hub.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Lush - The Café envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as a recognized and respected brand within the Guwahati food and beverage industry. We plan to expand our menu to include more innovative dishes and beverages, continuously adapting to evolving customer preferences. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and potentially expanding to other cities in Assam. To achieve this, we are committed to investing in our staff, improving our operational efficiency, and strengthening our marketing efforts. We also recognize the importance of sustainability and plan to implement eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a more sustainable future for Assam. Our vision is to not only be a successful business but also a positive force within the community, promoting local culture, supporting local businesses, and providing a valuable service to the people of Guwahati.

<br> <br>

Lush - The Café is dedicated to creating a vibrant and welcoming space that celebrates the rich culture and culinary heritage of Assam, while offering a contemporary café experience that meets the needs of a modern audience. Through a combination of exceptional food and beverages, outstanding customer service, and a commitment to community engagement, Lush - The Café aims to be a beloved destination for locals and visitors alike.', 'House No. 12 Jorpukhuri, Gautam Krishna Kunj, Lamb Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:05:32.000Z'),
(1775, 'Verandah - A Book Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Verandah – A Book Cafe offers a unique haven in the heart of Geetanagar, Assam, situated conveniently next to the police station on Mother Teresa Road. More than just a cafe, Verandah provides a curated space where the community can connect over literature, freshly brewed coffee, and a menu designed to complement both. In Assam''s vibrant cultural landscape, Verandah fills a specific niche by providing a tranquil retreat amidst the bustling city life, fostering a love for reading and creating a platform for local artists and writers. It contributes to the region’s growing appreciation for literary arts and provides a much-needed space for intellectual exchange. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, Verandah offers a dual experience: a carefully selected bookstore and a cozy cafe. The bookstore component focuses on a diverse range of genres, from contemporary fiction and classic literature to regional Assamese writings and non-fiction works that cater to a broad spectrum of interests. We specifically highlight local authors, providing them with a platform to showcase their talents and connect with readers. The cafe aspect complements the reading experience by offering a selection of expertly prepared coffee, teas, and other beverages, alongside a menu of light meals and snacks designed to be enjoyed while reading or engaging in conversation. Our unique selling point lies in the synergy between these two elements; customers can browse books while enjoying a cup of coffee, participate in book clubs, attend author events, and simply relax in a literary atmosphere. The menu features locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, appealing to customers who value fresh, regional products. The carefully chosen selection aims to cater to the evolving tastes of the local community, offering a welcoming space for students, professionals, and book lovers of all ages. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Verandah places immense emphasis on creating a memorable and welcoming customer experience. Staff are trained not only to provide efficient service but also to offer knowledgeable recommendations on books and beverages. The atmosphere is carefully cultivated to be both comfortable and inspiring, with comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and a quiet ambiance conducive to reading and conversation. We strive to create a sense of community by hosting regular events such as book launches, poetry readings, and open mic nights, fostering a vibrant literary scene and connecting local artists with their audience. Beyond these events, Verandah actively engages with the local community through partnerships with schools and libraries, promoting literacy and a love of reading among younger generations. We also actively solicit feedback from our customers and adapt our offerings to meet their needs and preferences, ensuring that Verandah remains a cherished hub within the Geetanagar community. The cafe regularly updates its social media platforms to engage the community with events, new book arrivals and community initiatives. </p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Verandah envisions significant growth potential. We plan to expand our book selection to include a wider range of international titles and specialized genres, further catering to the diverse interests of our customers. We aim to enhance the cafe menu with innovative dishes and beverage options, focusing on seasonal ingredients and locally inspired flavors. Future plans include establishing an online presence with an e-commerce platform to reach a broader audience beyond the Geetanagar area, allowing customers to browse and purchase books online. We also intend to increase collaborations with local artists and writers, offering workshops, residencies, and other opportunities to support their creative endeavors. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Verandah experience to a wider community. By continuing to focus on exceptional customer service, a curated selection of books, and a commitment to the local community, Verandah aims to become a leading cultural hub in the region, fostering a love for reading and supporting the growth of the literary arts. </p>', 'Police station, Mother Teresa Rd, next to Geetanagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:10:08.000Z'),
(1776, 'QALAA', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>QALAA, nestled in the heart of Assam, is more than just a business; it''s a testament to the region''s rich heritage and entrepreneurial spirit. Standing as a unique entity within the local business landscape, QALAA is committed to providing exceptional services tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community. We strive to blend modern business practices with a deep understanding of local culture and traditions, fostering sustainable growth and contributing to the overall prosperity of the region. QALAA aims to be a cornerstone of innovation and reliability, earning the trust of our customers and partners alike.</p>

<br> <br>

