<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, QALAA envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. Our potential lies in [Identify specific areas for growth, e.g., expanding our product line, reaching new markets, establishing strategic partnerships, leveraging technology]. We plan to achieve this by [Outline key strategies for growth, e.g., investing in research and development, strengthening our online presence, expanding our distribution network, developing innovative marketing campaigns]. Our long-term goals include [Mention long-term aspirations, e.g., becoming a leading provider of [Service/Product] in Assam, establishing a national presence, contributing to the economic development of the region, promoting Assamese culture on a global scale]. QALAA is committed to building a sustainable and ethical business that not only delivers exceptional value to our customers but also makes a positive impact on the environment and the community. We believe that by staying true to our values and embracing innovation, QALAA can achieve its ambitious goals and become a true success story in the Assam business landscape.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:10:15.000Z'),
(1777, 'Kalita Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Kalita Cafe, a vibrant and welcoming establishment located in the heart of Guwahati, is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a cultural hub celebrating the rich heritage of Assam while offering a modern cafe experience. We stand out in the burgeoning Assam business landscape by blending traditional Assamese flavors and hospitality with contemporary cafe culture, creating a unique space where locals and tourists alike can connect, relax, and savor the essence of Assam. Kalita Cafe is committed to sourcing local ingredients and supporting regional artisans, further solidifying our position as a socially responsible and culturally aware business.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Kalita Cafe, our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and satisfying culinary experience. We specialize in handcrafted coffee beverages, using locally sourced coffee beans whenever possible, ensuring a rich and aromatic experience. Alongside our coffee selection, we offer a tempting array of traditional Assamese snacks and dishes, such as pitha, laru, and a variety of savory preparations that showcase the region''s unique culinary traditions. Our menu also includes familiar cafe favorites, catering to a wider range of tastes and preferences. <br> <br> A key differentiator for Kalita Cafe is our commitment to authenticity and quality. We prioritize using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and producers. Our chefs and baristas are trained to expertly prepare traditional Assamese recipes while maintaining the highest standards of hygiene and presentation. We also feature unique, Assam-inspired beverage creations that cannot be found anywhere else. By harmonizing authentic Assamese cuisine with contemporary cafe staples, we cater to both the nostalgia of local residents and the curiosity of tourists eager to explore the region''s culinary heritage. </p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Kalita Cafe''s philosophy. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and personalized atmosphere for every visitor. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our menu and the local area. We encourage interaction and are always happy to share stories about Assamese culture and traditions. Our goal is to make every customer feel like a valued guest. <br> <br> We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We host cultural events, such as Assamese music performances and traditional craft workshops, providing a platform for local artists and artisans. We also partner with local NGOs and organizations to support social causes and promote community development. By fostering a strong connection with the community, we aim to be more than just a cafe; we aspire to be a gathering place where people can come together, celebrate their culture, and contribute to the vibrancy of Assam. We regularly seek feedback from our customers to ensure we are continually improving our service and meeting their needs.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Kalita Cafe envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to establish Kalita Cafe as a leading brand representing Assam''s rich culinary and cultural heritage across India and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to include more regional delicacies and introduce innovative, Assam-inspired culinary creations. We also aim to open additional locations, strategically positioned to cater to a broader audience while maintaining the unique charm and character of our original cafe. <br> <br> Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to develop a line of packaged Assamese food products, such as tea, coffee, and traditional snacks, which can be sold both online and in retail stores. This will allow us to extend our brand reach and share the flavors of Assam with a wider audience. We are also committed to investing in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service and contribute to the continued success of Kalita Cafe. Our vision is to build a sustainable and socially responsible business that celebrates Assam''s culture, supports the local economy, and provides a memorable experience for every customer. We plan to integrate sustainable practices into all aspects of our operations, from sourcing ingredients to waste management, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a greener future.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:10:22.000Z'),
(1778, 'Bagan: Poolside Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Bagan: Poolside Cafe, nestled within the serene embrace of The Greenwood Resort in Assam, offers a unique and refreshing dining experience that seamlessly blends relaxation with culinary delight. More than just a cafe, Bagan is an oasis, a place where guests can unwind by the shimmering pool while savouring meticulously crafted dishes and beverages. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, Bagan distinguishes itself by offering a sophisticated yet approachable atmosphere, catering to both resort guests and local residents seeking a refined escape from the everyday.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Bagan''s offerings are its carefully curated menu and attentive service. The cafe boasts a diverse selection of dishes, ranging from light and refreshing salads and sandwiches perfect for poolside snacking to more substantial meals featuring both local Assamese flavors and international cuisine. Fresh, locally sourced ingredients are prioritized, ensuring vibrant flavors and supporting regional farmers. A highlight of the menu is the dedicated section showcasing traditional Assamese snacks and dishes, providing a taste of the region''s culinary heritage to both domestic and international guests. The beverage selection complements the food perfectly, with freshly brewed coffees, artisanal teas, refreshing mocktails, and a selection of wines and beers. What truly sets Bagan apart is its commitment to providing personalized service. The staff is trained to anticipate guests'' needs and create a welcoming and attentive atmosphere, ensuring every visit is a memorable one. This focus on quality and personalized service addresses a growing demand in the local market for elevated dining experiences within a relaxed and picturesque setting.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Bagan prioritizes creating a memorable and enriching customer experience. The ambiance is carefully cultivated to promote relaxation and enjoyment, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and the soothing presence of the surrounding greenery and pool. The staff is dedicated to providing attentive and friendly service, ensuring each guest feels welcomed and valued. Beyond exceptional service, Bagan actively connects with the local community. The cafe regularly hosts events and promotions, such as live music performances showcasing local artists and themed dining nights that celebrate Assamese culture and cuisine. By partnering with local artisans and suppliers, Bagan contributes to the economic growth of the region and fosters a sense of community pride. Furthermore, Bagan actively engages with its customers on social media, sharing updates on new menu items, special events, and highlighting the stories of local suppliers. This creates a transparent and engaging dialogue, further strengthening its connection with the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, Bagan: Poolside Cafe envisions expanding its offerings and solidifying its position as a leading destination for relaxed and refined dining in the region. Future plans include introducing seasonal menu variations that showcase the best of Assam''s local produce throughout the year. There are also plans to expand the cafe''s event hosting capabilities, offering tailored packages for private parties and corporate gatherings. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Bagan aims to further reduce its environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly practices, such as minimizing waste and sourcing more ingredients from sustainable local farms. Long-term goals include establishing Bagan as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, relaxation, and authentic Assamese hospitality. By continuously innovating and adapting to evolving customer preferences, Bagan: Poolside Cafe is poised for continued growth and success, contributing positively to the vibrant business landscape of Assam and providing a unique and memorable experience for its valued guests.</p>', 'The Greenwood Resort', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:10:30.000Z'),
(1779, 'Tea Villa Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Tea Villa Cafe: A Contemporary Tea Experience in the Heart of Guwahati</h1>

<p>Tea Villa Cafe, strategically located on the 5th Floor of Supreme Tower, GS Rd, near the foot over bridge in Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a cafe; it''s a destination designed to elevate the tea-drinking experience. In a region renowned for its tea heritage, Tea Villa Cafe distinguishes itself by blending traditional appreciation with a modern, globally-inspired approach. We cater to a discerning clientele seeking both familiar comforts and exciting new flavors, contributing a unique vibrancy to the evolving Assam business landscape. The cafe is positioned as a sophisticated, yet approachable, space for business meetings, casual gatherings, and moments of personal indulgence.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors</h2>

<p>At the heart of Tea Villa Cafe lies an extensive menu focused on high-quality teas sourced from both local Assam gardens and renowned tea regions worldwide. We offer a diverse selection ranging from classic Assam black teas and delicate green teas to herbal infusions and specialty blends. Each tea is meticulously prepared, ensuring optimal flavor extraction and a truly satisfying cup. Beyond tea, our cafe boasts a delectable array of complementary offerings. Patrons can indulge in freshly baked pastries, savory snacks, and light meals, all carefully crafted to complement the tea selection. Our skilled chefs prepare everything with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, adding to the overall quality and supporting the regional economy. Unique selling points include our curated tea flights, allowing guests to sample a variety of teas in a single sitting, and our expertly paired food and tea combinations, designed to tantalize the taste buds. Furthermore, Tea Villa Cafe features a selection of specialty coffees and other beverages to cater to diverse preferences. This blend of traditional tea culture with modern cafe offerings addresses a growing local demand for sophisticated, high-quality food and beverage experiences, providing an alternative to standard coffee shops and traditional tea houses.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>The Tea Villa Cafe Customer Experience: Connecting with the Community</h2>

<p>Customer service at Tea Villa Cafe is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm, welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our tea selection, providing personalized recommendations and guidance to enhance the customer experience. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our offerings and service standards. What truly sets Tea Villa Cafe apart is our commitment to connecting with the local community. We regularly host events, such as tea tasting sessions, live music performances, and art exhibitions, creating a vibrant hub for cultural exchange and social interaction. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to promote regional products and initiatives. We aim to become an integral part of the community, not just a place to enjoy a cup of tea, but a space for connection, creativity, and shared experiences. The accessibility provided by the location near the foot over bridge also contributes to higher customer traffic.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Brewing Success and Expansion</h2>

<p>Tea Villa Cafe envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading tea destination in Guwahati and beyond. Our immediate plans include introducing seasonal tea menus, showcasing the unique flavors of Assam''s diverse tea harvests throughout the year. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our online presence, offering tea subscriptions and curated gift boxes to reach a wider audience. Long-term goals involve opening additional Tea Villa Cafe locations in other key cities in Assam and potentially other regions, bringing our unique tea experience to a broader market. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainability and ethical sourcing, ensuring that our teas are produced in a responsible manner, supporting local tea farmers and protecting the environment. We aim to become a model for sustainable business practices in the Assam region, demonstrating that business success can go hand in hand with social and environmental responsibility. Our ultimate ambition is to elevate the appreciation of tea culture, fostering a deeper understanding of its rich history and diverse flavors, and becoming a global ambassador for Assam tea.</p>

</article>', '5th Floor, Supreme Tower, GS Rd, near foot over bridge', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.345Z', '2025-12-07T11:10:36.000Z'),
(1780, 'Cafe Maya', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Cafe Maya: A Taste of Assam, A Hub for Community</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of [Specific Area in Assam, e.g., Guwahati''s Chandmari area, Jorhat''s Gar-Ali], Cafe Maya is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a vibrant community hub that celebrates the rich culinary heritage of Assam while offering a modern and inviting atmosphere. With a commitment to quality, authenticity, and exceptional customer service, Cafe Maya has quickly become a beloved local establishment, contributing to the thriving business landscape of the region. The cafe distinguishes itself by sourcing local ingredients whenever possible, promoting sustainable practices, and offering a unique menu that blends traditional Assamese flavors with contemporary cafe fare.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, Cafe Maya provides a diverse range of services and products designed to cater to the varied tastes of its clientele. The menu boasts a selection of expertly brewed coffee, ranging from classic espressos and lattes to signature blends featuring locally sourced coffee beans from Assam''s verdant plantations. Beyond coffee, customers can indulge in a curated selection of teas, including traditional Assamese black tea and herbal infusions. <br> <br> Complementing the beverage offerings, Cafe Maya''s food menu showcases both familiar cafe staples and innovative dishes inspired by Assamese cuisine. Patrons can savor freshly baked pastries, sandwiches, and light meals alongside regional specialties like *pitha* (rice cakes), *aloo pitika* (mashed potato with mustard oil), and flavorful curries. A particular draw for customers is Cafe Maya''s commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local farmers. This focus on local sourcing is a significant differentiator, resonating with customers who appreciate sustainable practices and authentic culinary experiences. Furthermore, the cafe caters to dietary needs by offering vegetarian and vegan options, making it an inclusive space for all.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Cafe Maya''s commitment to exceptional customer service sets it apart. The staff are trained to be friendly, knowledgeable, and attentive, creating a welcoming and comfortable environment for every guest. Beyond just serving food and drinks, Cafe Maya aims to foster a sense of community. The cafe regularly hosts events such as live music performances by local artists, poetry slams, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and enriching the cultural scene. <br> <br> Understanding the importance of connection in the digital age, Cafe Maya offers free Wi-Fi, making it a popular spot for students, freelancers, and professionals to work and collaborate. The cafe also actively engages with the local community through social media, sharing updates on events, menu specials, and showcasing the stories of local suppliers. By fostering a strong connection with its customers and the broader community, Cafe Maya has cultivated a loyal following and established itself as a gathering place where people can connect, relax, and enjoy the best of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Cafe Maya envisions continued growth and expansion while staying true to its core values of quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional delicacies and seasonal ingredients, further showcasing the culinary diversity of Assam. There are also aspirations to establish partnerships with local artisans and craftspeople, offering a curated selection of handcrafted goods for sale within the cafe, further supporting the local economy. <br> <br> Longer-term goals include exploring opportunities to open additional locations within Assam, bringing the Cafe Maya experience to a wider audience. The business is also committed to embracing sustainable practices, such as reducing waste and sourcing energy from renewable sources. Ultimately, Cafe Maya aims to become a leading example of a socially responsible and community-focused business in Assam, contributing to the region''s economic growth while preserving its cultural heritage. The vision is to not just serve great coffee and food, but to be an integral part of the community, fostering connections and celebrating the spirit of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:15:08.000Z'),
(1781, 'The Bibliophilia Café', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Bibliophilia Café: A Haven for Readers and a Hub for Community on Jaswanta Road</p>

<p>Nestled on the first floor of Jaswanta Road House No. 2, directly opposite Ashok Publications and a stone''s throw from the venerable Baruah Book Agency, The Bibliophilia Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it''s a sanctuary for book lovers and a vibrant hub fostering a sense of community within Guwahati''s literary landscape. Going beyond the typical café experience, we offer a unique blend of literary inspiration, culinary delights, and a welcoming atmosphere that caters to the discerning tastes of Assam''s readers and thinkers. Our prime location, surrounded by publishers and bookstores, positions us as a natural extension of the region''s rich literary heritage, providing a dedicated space for discussion, relaxation, and engagement with the written word.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At The Bibliophilia Café, our core offering revolves around providing a curated experience for our patrons. Firstly, we offer a carefully selected menu of beverages and light meals, featuring locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From expertly brewed Assam tea and robust coffee blends to delectable pastries and savory snacks, our culinary offerings are designed to complement the reading experience. We also offer a selection of regionally inspired dishes that showcase the unique flavors of Assam. Secondly, and perhaps more significantly, we offer a thoughtfully curated collection of books for browsing and purchase. While not a full-fledged bookstore, our selection focuses on works by Assamese authors, translated regional literature, and contemporary fiction and non-fiction that resonates with our target audience. This curated selection provides opportunities for discovery and supports local literary talent. Finally, we host a variety of literary events, including book readings, author talks, poetry slams, and writing workshops. These events are designed to foster a sense of community, encourage intellectual discourse, and promote literacy throughout the region. Our unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of these three elements: quality food and beverages, a carefully curated book selection, and engaging literary events. We meet the local market needs by providing a much-needed space for literary engagement that goes beyond traditional bookstores and libraries, offering a more relaxed and social atmosphere.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Bibliophilia Café. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and inspired. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our book selection and upcoming events, and they are always ready to offer recommendations or engage in literary discussions. We prioritize personalized service, taking the time to understand our customers'' preferences and needs. Beyond providing excellent service, we actively engage with the local community by partnering with local authors, publishers, and literary organizations. We host events that showcase their work and provide a platform for them to connect with readers. We also support local charities and initiatives that promote literacy and education. What sets us apart is our commitment to creating a genuine sense of community. We aim to be more than just a café; we want to be a gathering place for book lovers, a hub for literary discussion, and a catalyst for cultural exchange. Regular customers find themselves engaging with each other, forming book clubs, and developing lasting friendships. The café is designed to be a comfortable and inviting space, featuring cozy seating areas, ample natural light, and a relaxed atmosphere that encourages reading and conversation.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Bibliophilia Café envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to establish ourselves as a leading cultural hub in Guwahati and a recognized champion of Assamese literature. We plan to expand our book selection to include a wider range of genres and authors, while continuing to prioritize local talent. We also intend to enhance our event programming, offering a more diverse range of literary and cultural events. This includes collaborations with theatre groups, musicians, and other artists to create a truly multidisciplinary experience. We are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing our unique blend of literary inspiration and culinary delights to a wider audience. Furthermore, we are considering developing an online platform to sell books and merchandise, and to stream our events to a global audience. By leveraging technology, we can extend our reach and connect with book lovers around the world. Ultimately, The Bibliophilia Café aspires to be more than just a business; we want to be a cultural institution that contributes to the intellectual and artistic vitality of Assam.</p>', 'Jaswanta Road House No. 2, First Floor, opposite Ashok Publications and Near Baruah Book Agency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:15:14.000Z'),
(1782, 'DOCKYARD by Cafe Bellevue', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>DOCKYARD by Cafe Bellevue, nestled in Lubu''s Haven near Don Bosco University and Casario Enclave, presents a fresh and vibrant addition to the Assam culinary scene. More than just a cafe, DOCKYARD aims to be a community hub, a co-working space, and a destination for experiencing innovative cuisine, all within a relaxed and inspiring setting. Its strategic location, bordering a thriving educational institution and a growing residential community, positions it perfectly to cater to students, professionals, and families seeking a unique and fulfilling experience. DOCKYARD leverages the established reputation of Cafe Bellevue, known for quality and consistency, while carving out its own distinct identity through its ambiance, menu, and commitment to community engagement. The business addresses the increasing demand for comfortable and productive workspaces, coupled with the desire for high-quality, accessible dining options in the rapidly developing area.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, DOCKYARD by Cafe Bellevue provides a multi-faceted offering catering to a diverse clientele. The primary service is, of course, the cafe itself, serving a carefully curated menu of coffee, teas, and other beverages prepared by skilled baristas. This includes classic espresso drinks, refreshing iced beverages, and locally-inspired tea blends using Assam tea. The food menu features a selection of light meals, snacks, and desserts, with an emphasis on fresh, locally-sourced ingredients whenever possible. Patrons can expect sandwiches, salads, pasta dishes, and pastries, with regular seasonal specials designed to showcase the best of Assam''s agricultural bounty. Beyond the standard cafe fare, DOCKYARD distinguishes itself by offering dedicated co-working spaces. These spaces are equipped with comfortable seating, reliable high-speed internet access, and power outlets, providing an ideal environment for students, freelancers, and remote workers to focus and collaborate. Furthermore, DOCKYARD offers private meeting rooms that can be booked for small group meetings or presentations. These rooms are equipped with audio-visual equipment to facilitate productive discussions. A key unique selling point is the harmonious blend of a professional workspace with the welcoming atmosphere of a cafe, creating a more appealing alternative to traditional offices or libraries. This synergy directly addresses the needs of the local market, where the demand for flexible and affordable workspace is growing, particularly amongst the student and young professional populations.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at DOCKYARD by Cafe Bellevue. The aim is to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and valued. The staff is trained to provide friendly and attentive service, anticipating customer needs and going the extra mile to ensure satisfaction. This includes personalized recommendations, prompt order fulfillment, and a genuine willingness to address any concerns. DOCKYARD strives to create a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting regular events, such as live music performances, art exhibitions showcasing local artists, and workshops on topics of interest to the community. The cafe also partners with local businesses and organizations to promote their products and services, further strengthening its ties to the area. DOCKYARD aims to be more than just a place to eat and work; it aspires to be a gathering place for the community, a space where people can connect, collaborate, and be inspired. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience. This is achieved through feedback forms, online surveys, and direct interaction with customers. By listening to its customers and adapting to their needs, DOCKYARD ensures that it remains relevant and responsive to the evolving demands of the local market. The ambience is designed to be both aesthetically pleasing and functional, incorporating elements of modern design with comfortable seating and ample natural light.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, DOCKYARD by Cafe Bellevue has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on consolidating its position as a leading destination for cafe and co-working services in the local area. This involves continuously refining the menu, enhancing the co-working facilities, and expanding the range of community events offered. Longer-term goals include expanding the business to other locations in Assam, potentially through a franchise model. This would allow DOCKYARD to reach a wider audience and establish itself as a recognized brand throughout the region. Another potential area of growth is the development of a catering service, providing food and beverages for local events and businesses. This would leverage the cafe''s culinary expertise and expand its revenue streams. DOCKYARD also aims to become a sustainable business, reducing its environmental impact through initiatives such as using eco-friendly packaging, sourcing locally-produced ingredients, and minimizing waste. The vision for DOCKYARD by Cafe Bellevue is to be a thriving and sustainable business that contributes positively to the local community, providing high-quality services, fostering creativity and collaboration, and creating a welcoming space for everyone to enjoy. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating, DOCKYARD is well-positioned to achieve its long-term goals and become a leading player in the Assam business landscape.</p>', 'Lubu''s Haven, near Don Bosco University, near Casario Enclave', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:15:23.000Z'),
(1783, 'Barista - Guwahati', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Barista - Guwahati is a premium café established to bring the authentic café experience to the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Positioned to be more than just a coffee shop, Barista - Guwahati aims to be a vibrant hub where the community can connect, collaborate, and enjoy exceptional coffee and culinary delights. Located strategically, the café offers a welcoming ambiance and a respite from the hustle and bustle of city life, while simultaneously fostering a sense of belonging and community spirit unique to the Assamese culture.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Understanding the growing demand for quality coffee and a relaxed environment in Guwahati, Barista stands out by sourcing premium coffee beans, expertly roasted and brewed by skilled baristas. Beyond coffee, the menu offers a diverse selection of handcrafted beverages, including specialty teas, refreshing coolers, and indulgent milkshakes, catering to a variety of tastes. Complementing the beverage selection is a delectable array of pastries, cakes, sandwiches, and light meals, prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Barista - Guwahati distinguishes itself by incorporating subtle Assamese flavors and ingredients into select menu items, creating a unique culinary experience that resonates with local palates. This fusion of international café standards with regional tastes sets Barista - Guwahati apart from generic coffee chains, solidifying its position as a preferred destination for discerning customers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Barista - Guwahati, the customer experience is paramount. The café is designed to be warm and inviting, featuring comfortable seating, aesthetically pleasing décor, and a relaxed atmosphere conducive to both work and leisure. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Barista - Guwahati actively participates in local events, hosts workshops and art exhibitions, and collaborates with local artists and artisans to showcase their talent. The café also provides free Wi-Fi access, making it an ideal spot for students, freelancers, and professionals to work remotely. By consistently delivering exceptional service, creating a welcoming environment, and actively engaging with the community, Barista - Guwahati fosters a loyal customer base and establishes itself as a beloved local institution.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Barista - Guwahati is ambitious and centered on sustainable growth and community impact. Plans include expanding the menu to include more locally inspired dishes, partnering with local farmers and suppliers to ensure the use of fresh, sustainable ingredients, and increasing its participation in community initiatives. Exploring opportunities to offer catering services for local events and businesses is also a key part of the strategic plan. Furthermore, Barista - Guwahati aims to establish itself as a training ground for aspiring baristas and hospitality professionals, providing them with the skills and knowledge they need to succeed in the industry. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Barista - Guwahati experience to a wider audience, while maintaining the same commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement that defines the brand.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:15:27.000Z'),
(1784, 'Zen9 Café & Bar', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Zen9 Café & Bar offers a tranquil escape in the heart of Assam, providing a unique fusion of culinary delights, expertly crafted beverages, and a serene ambiance. Nestled in [Insert Specific Location, e.g., the vibrant Paltan Bazaar area of Guwahati], Zen9 stands out as more than just a typical café and bar; it''s a destination where community, relaxation, and exceptional experiences converge. In a region known for its rich tea heritage and burgeoning social scene, Zen9 distinguishes itself by offering a sophisticated yet approachable environment that caters to a diverse clientele, from young professionals and families to tourists seeking a taste of local culture with a modern twist. The business aims to create memorable moments for its patrons, becoming a beloved fixture in the Assam hospitality landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Zen9 Café & Bar lies a dedication to providing high-quality services and products that resonate with the local palate and international trends. The menu features a curated selection of dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese snacks and meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients to globally inspired cuisine. Highlights include signature Assamese thalis, flavorful momos, and a variety of continental dishes, all prepared with a focus on fresh, seasonal produce. The bar boasts an impressive array of beverages, including expertly mixed cocktails, a selection of local and imported beers, and a carefully chosen wine list. Zen9 also prides itself on its selection of Assam teas and coffees, sourced directly from local estates, ensuring an authentic and high-quality experience for tea and coffee aficionados. A key differentiator is the commitment to using only the freshest ingredients and employing skilled chefs and bartenders who are passionate about their craft. The cafe addresses a need in the local market for a venue that offers both quality food and drinks in a comfortable and stylish setting. By providing a diverse menu, Zen9 caters to a broad range of tastes and preferences, ensuring that there is something for everyone.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Zen9 Café & Bar. The establishment prides itself on providing exceptional service, creating a welcoming and attentive atmosphere. The staff is trained to anticipate customer needs, provide recommendations, and ensure that every guest feels valued and appreciated. The ambiance is designed to promote relaxation and connection, featuring comfortable seating, soothing décor inspired by Zen principles, and subtle lighting. Beyond providing excellent service within the café and bar, Zen9 actively seeks to connect with the local community. This involves hosting events showcasing local artists and musicians, partnering with local businesses to promote Assam products, and supporting community initiatives. Regular themed nights, such as live music performances, karaoke, and open mic events, attract a diverse crowd and foster a sense of belonging. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and community engagement, Zen9 aims to build long-lasting relationships with its patrons and become an integral part of the local cultural fabric.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Zen9 Café & Bar envisions a future marked by sustainable growth and continued innovation. The long-term goal is to establish Zen9 as a leading hospitality destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, community, and customer satisfaction. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal offerings, further enhancing the use of locally sourced ingredients, and exploring opportunities for collaboration with local artisans and producers. The business is also considering expanding its physical footprint, potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam or offering catering services for local events. Furthermore, Zen9 plans to invest in technology to improve efficiency and enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering and loyalty programs. By remaining adaptable, responsive to customer feedback, and committed to its core values, Zen9 Café & Bar is poised to achieve significant growth and contribute to the vibrant Assam business landscape for years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:15:34.000Z'),
(1785, 'Nanz Cafe and Restaurant', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Nanz Cafe and Restaurant, nestled at House Number 241, Zoo Rd, near Archies Gallery Tiniali in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a distinctive culinary experience that blends the comfort of a familiar cafe with the sophistication of a modern restaurant. More than just a place to eat, Nanz is envisioned as a community hub, a meeting point where the rich tapestry of Assamese culture interweaves with global flavors, creating a memorable experience for every patron. Positioned strategically on Zoo Road, a bustling artery of Guwahati, Nanz aims to be a landmark destination renowned for its quality, ambiance, and commitment to local ingredients. In a region known for its distinctive tea culture and emerging culinary scene, Nanz strives to elevate the dining experience by offering a curated menu that caters to a diverse palate, from traditional Assamese delicacies to contemporary international dishes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Nanz Cafe and Restaurant lies a commitment to providing exceptional food and beverage services. The cafe element focuses on freshly brewed, high-quality coffee, a diverse selection of teas (including locally sourced Assamese tea, of course), and a range of light bites, pastries, and sandwiches. This caters to the casual diner seeking a quick respite or a comfortable workspace. The restaurant side presents a more extensive menu featuring both regional specialties and globally inspired dishes. Assamese favorites, prepared with authentic ingredients and traditional techniques, are a key highlight, allowing both locals and visitors to savor the true flavors of the region. The international offerings, carefully selected and expertly prepared, provide a complementary range of options, ensuring that there’s something for everyone. A unique selling point is the emphasis on sourcing fresh, local ingredients wherever possible, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring the highest quality in every dish. This commitment to locality translates into a fresher, more flavorful dining experience and demonstrates a dedication to the sustainability of the regional economy. Nanz recognizes a growing demand in Guwahati for refined dining experiences coupled with a desire for authentic, regional flavors. It aims to bridge this gap by providing a carefully crafted menu that caters to both preferences, making it a versatile and appealing choice for a wide range of customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Nanz Cafe and Restaurant. The emphasis is on creating a warm, welcoming, and attentive atmosphere where every guest feels valued. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional service, demonstrating genuine hospitality and a commitment to exceeding expectations. From the moment a customer walks through the door, they are greeted with a smile and guided through the menu with knowledgeable recommendations. The ambiance of Nanz is designed to be both inviting and aesthetically pleasing, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and attention to detail in every aspect of the dining environment. Special efforts are made to connect with the local community through events, promotions, and collaborations with local artists and organizations. Nanz envisions itself as more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a gathering place for the community, a space where people can connect, celebrate, and enjoy the best of Assamese hospitality. Feedback is actively sought and valued, ensuring that the business is constantly evolving to meet the changing needs and preferences of its customers. The goal is to cultivate a loyal customer base built on trust, quality, and genuine connection.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, Nanz Cafe and Restaurant envisions significant growth potential. The initial focus is on establishing a strong brand reputation within Guwahati, becoming a recognized and respected name in the local culinary scene. Future expansion plans may include opening additional locations within the city and potentially extending to other areas of Assam. The business also aims to expand its offerings, potentially including catering services for local events and corporate functions. Exploring partnerships with local tourism agencies to promote Assamese cuisine and culture to a wider audience is also a key consideration. Long-term goals include establishing Nanz as a flagship restaurant representing the best of Assamese culinary heritage while embracing global culinary trends. The business is committed to investing in employee training and development, ensuring that the staff continues to provide exceptional service and maintain the high standards that define the Nanz experience. By focusing on quality, innovation, and community engagement, Nanz Cafe and Restaurant is poised to become a significant contributor to the Assam business landscape, creating a lasting legacy of culinary excellence and hospitality.</p>', 'House Number 241, Zoo Rd, near Archies Gallery Tiniali', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:20:09.000Z'),
(1786, 'Coffee Country Guwahati', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Coffee Country Guwahati is a vibrant and welcoming coffee destination nestled in the heart of Katahbari, located on Katahbari Main Rd, opposite DY365 and conveniently situated behind Hotel Parashuram. More than just a coffee shop, Coffee Country Guwahati strives to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, relax, and savor expertly crafted coffee and delicious treats in a comfortable and inviting atmosphere. Our commitment to quality ingredients, exceptional service, and a strong connection to the local culture sets us apart in Guwahati''s burgeoning café scene.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of Coffee Country Guwahati lies a passion for exceptional coffee. We source high-quality beans, prioritizing partnerships with ethical and sustainable suppliers whenever possible. Our skilled baristas are trained to extract the full flavor potential from each bean, creating a range of classic espresso-based beverages, including lattes, cappuccinos, and macchiatos, alongside expertly brewed filter coffee options. Beyond coffee, our menu extends to a carefully curated selection of teas, refreshing iced beverages, and delectable food offerings. This includes freshly baked pastries, savory sandwiches, and regionally inspired snacks designed to complement our coffee and provide a complete and satisfying experience. A unique selling point is our focus on incorporating locally sourced ingredients into our food menu, showcasing the flavors of Assam and supporting local producers. We understand the local market''s preference for both traditional and contemporary offerings, and our menu reflects this balance, ensuring there''s something for everyone to enjoy. We also cater to dietary restrictions and preferences, offering vegetarian and vegan options.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Coffee Country Guwahati. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff are not just employees; they are passionate coffee enthusiasts dedicated to providing friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We go beyond simply taking orders, taking the time to engage with customers, answer questions, and offer recommendations based on their preferences. To foster a strong connection with the local community, we actively participate in local events and initiatives. We host regular open mic nights showcasing local talent, organize workshops on coffee brewing techniques, and partner with local charities to give back to the community. Our commitment to creating a positive and inclusive environment extends to our physical space, which is designed to be comfortable and inviting, with ample seating, free Wi-Fi, and a relaxing ambiance that encourages conversation and connection. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continually improve our offerings and service.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, Coffee Country Guwahati envisions becoming a leading coffee destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to include more innovative and locally inspired offerings, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local artists and artisans to display their work in our café, creating a platform to support and promote local talent. We also have plans to expand our physical space, potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati. This expansion will allow us to reach a wider audience and further solidify our position as a community hub. Long-term, we aim to establish Coffee Country Guwahati as a brand synonymous with quality, community, and sustainability, representing the best of Assam''s coffee culture. We are committed to staying ahead of industry trends and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs and preferences of our customers.</p>', 'Katahbari Main Rd, opposite DY365, behind Hotel Parashuram', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:20:14.000Z'),
(1787, 'HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! Holiday Home Stay', 'Cafes', NULL, 'HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! Holiday Home Stay: A Sanctuary of Flavors and Comfort on Zoo Road

HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! Holiday Home Stay presents a unique proposition in the vibrant Zoo Road area, offering a seamless blend of culinary delights and comfortable accommodation. This establishment is more than just a café and a guesthouse; it''s a haven crafted to cater to both locals seeking a refreshing escape and travelers yearning for authentic Assam hospitality. Situated strategically on Zoo Road, HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! represents a significant addition to the local business ecosystem, providing a unique space that encourages community engagement and promotes the region''s cultural richness. Its emphasis on locally sourced ingredients and personalized service sets it apart, contributing to the area''s growing reputation as a destination for discerning tastes and comfortable stays.

<br> <br>

At its heart, HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! offers two core services: a curated café experience and a welcoming holiday home stay. The café menu boasts a diverse selection of items, ranging from traditional Assamese snacks and beverages to continental favorites, all prepared with a focus on fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This dedication to local produce supports regional farmers and ensures the highest quality in every dish. Unique selling points of the café include its specialty coffee blends sourced from nearby plantations, its homemade pastries inspired by Assam''s rich culinary heritage, and its serene ambiance perfect for quiet reflection or casual meetings.

<br> <br>

The Holiday Home Stay provides comfortable and well-appointed rooms designed to cater to both short-term and extended stays. Each room is thoughtfully furnished to create a relaxing and inviting atmosphere, equipped with modern amenities to ensure a convenient and enjoyable experience. A key differentiator of the home stay is its emphasis on personalized service, where guests are treated as individuals and their specific needs are catered to with utmost care. This includes arranging local tours, providing insights into Assamese culture, and offering bespoke dining options to suit individual preferences. These services directly address the increasing demand for quality accommodation options that offer a more intimate and culturally immersive experience than traditional hotels, particularly in a location like Zoo Road known for its proximity to attractions and natural beauty.

<br> <br>

HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! prides itself on delivering an exceptional customer experience that extends beyond simply providing food and lodging. The staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the local area, acting as ambassadors for Assam''s culture and hospitality. The business actively fosters a sense of community by hosting regular events such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and culinary workshops showcasing regional specialties. These initiatives not only attract customers but also provide a platform for local artists and artisans to showcase their talents. Building strong relationships with local suppliers and engaging in community initiatives reinforces HOLIDAY CAFÉ &!''s commitment to being a responsible and contributing member of the Zoo Road community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! envisions significant growth potential by expanding its services and reaching a wider audience. Future plans include developing a line of packaged Assam-inspired food products for retail, expanding the Holiday Home Stay to include additional rooms and facilities, and establishing partnerships with local tour operators to offer curated travel experiences. The business also aims to enhance its online presence through social media marketing and online booking platforms to attract both domestic and international travelers. Long-term goals involve establishing HOLIDAY CAFÉ &! as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional hospitality, contributing to the growth of tourism and promoting the unique culture and flavors of Assam to the world. This vision is rooted in a commitment to continuous improvement, innovation, and a deep understanding of the evolving needs and preferences of its customers and the community it serves.', 'Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:20:19.000Z'),
(1788, 'Cafe Rivea', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Cafe Rivea, nestled on the bustling MG Road, is more than just a cafe; it''s a vibrant hub that blends contemporary culinary experiences with the rich cultural tapestry of Assam. It stands as a testament to the evolving tastes of the region, offering a refreshing alternative to the traditional landscape while simultaneously celebrating local ingredients and community spirit. Cafe Rivea contributes significantly to the local business environment by providing a sophisticated yet accessible space for social gatherings, business meetings, and individual moments of respite, filling a niche for a premium cafe experience within the heart of the city.

<br> <br>

At the core of Cafe Rivea lies a commitment to providing exceptional food and beverage offerings. The cafe specializes in a diverse menu that ranges from expertly brewed, ethically sourced coffees and handcrafted teas to innovative takes on classic cafe fare. Signature items include locally-inspired pastries featuring Assam tea infusions, gourmet sandwiches utilizing artisanal breads, and fresh, seasonal salads crafted with ingredients sourced from nearby farms whenever possible. What truly distinguishes Cafe Rivea is its dedication to quality and innovation. Each dish and drink is thoughtfully prepared using premium ingredients and presented with meticulous attention to detail. The cafe’s unique selling proposition rests on its ability to offer a curated culinary journey that caters to both local palates and international tastes, addressing the growing demand for sophisticated dining experiences in the area. Furthermore, Cafe Rivea caters to specific dietary needs, offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options, ensuring inclusivity and appealing to a broader customer base.

<br> <br>

Cafe Rivea prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience, fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere that encourages repeat visits. The cafe''s staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. This commitment extends beyond simply taking orders; it involves building genuine connections with patrons, understanding their preferences, and creating a sense of belonging. The ambiance of Cafe Rivea is carefully curated to enhance the overall experience. The cafe boasts a modern and inviting interior design, incorporating elements of local artistry and craftsmanship. Comfortable seating arrangements, thoughtfully chosen lighting, and curated music playlists contribute to a relaxed and stimulating environment. Furthermore, Cafe Rivea actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artist showcases, sponsoring community events, and partnering with local businesses. This dedication to community involvement strengthens the cafe''s brand image and fosters a loyal customer base. The cafe also encourages customer feedback through surveys and social media interactions, continuously striving to improve and tailor its offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele.

<br> <br>

Cafe Rivea envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a premier cafe destination in the region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative and locally inspired dishes, further showcasing the culinary heritage of Assam. The business aims to introduce a loyalty program to reward frequent customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Exploration of opportunities to partner with local businesses to offer curated gift baskets and catering services is also underway. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations within the city and exploring opportunities for franchising, bringing the Cafe Rivea experience to a wider audience. Ultimately, Cafe Rivea aspires to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement, contributing to the vibrant and evolving culinary landscape of Assam. The commitment to sustainable practices, such as sourcing local ingredients and minimizing waste, will remain a core tenet of the business as it grows, ensuring a responsible and ethical approach to long-term success.', 'MG Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:20:26.000Z'),
(1789, 'The Vinyl Café', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Vinyl Café, nestled on the bustling RG Baruah Road in Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and immersive experience that blends the timeless allure of vinyl records with the comforting ambiance of a modern café. More than just a place to grab a coffee, The Vinyl Café is a cultural hub, a listening room, and a community gathering space all rolled into one. In a market often dominated by generic coffee chains, The Vinyl Café distinguishes itself by offering a curated selection of music, a thoughtfully designed space, and a dedication to fostering a deeper appreciation for the art of analog music. It carves a unique niche in the Assam business landscape by catering to a growing segment of consumers seeking authentic experiences and a connection to something tangible in an increasingly digital world.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, The Vinyl Café offers two primary services: exceptional café fare and a curated vinyl record collection available for listening and purchase. The café menu features a range of specialty coffees, teas, and locally sourced snacks and light meals. The coffee beans are carefully selected, roasted to perfection, and brewed with precision to deliver a consistently high-quality cup. The snacks and meals are designed to complement the beverages and offer a delightful culinary experience. However, the true differentiator lies in the vinyl collection. The café boasts an impressive array of records spanning various genres, from classic rock and jazz to contemporary indie and world music. Customers can browse the collection, select a record, and listen to it on high-quality turntables and headphones within the café. Furthermore, many of the records are available for purchase, allowing customers to expand their own collections and support independent artists. This dual offering effectively meets the needs of the local market by providing a comfortable space for socializing and relaxation, coupled with a unique and engaging entertainment option that appeals to music enthusiasts and curious newcomers alike.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Vinyl Café. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about both coffee and music, offering personalized recommendations and engaging in thoughtful conversations with customers. The café''s design fosters a welcoming and relaxed atmosphere, with comfortable seating, warm lighting, and carefully curated artwork that complements the musical theme. Regular listening sessions and themed events further enhance the customer experience and create a sense of community. The business actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists and musicians, hosting live performances, and supporting local initiatives. This approach not only builds brand loyalty but also positions The Vinyl Café as a responsible and engaged member of the community. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the café''s offerings and ensure that it remains a relevant and valued space for its patrons.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The Vinyl Café envisions itself as becoming a leading cultural destination in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the vinyl collection to include a wider range of genres and artists, introducing more specialized coffee blends and brewing techniques, and hosting larger-scale music events and workshops. There is also potential to explore partnerships with other local businesses, such as bookstores and art galleries, to create cross-promotional opportunities and further enhance the café''s appeal. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other cities across Assam, bringing the unique Vinyl Café experience to a wider audience. The business is committed to remaining true to its core values of quality, authenticity, and community engagement, ensuring that it continues to be a place where people can connect with each other, discover new music, and enjoy a truly unique and memorable experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>By focusing on providing a unique, experience-driven offering and actively engaging with the local community, The Vinyl Café is poised for continued growth and success in the Assam business landscape. Its blend of curated music, quality café fare, and a commitment to customer satisfaction sets it apart from the competition and positions it as a valuable asset to the city of Guwahati.</p>', 'RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.346Z', '2025-12-07T11:20:33.000Z'),
(1790, 'Smuk lounge and cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Smuk Lounge & Cafe: A Tranquil Oasis Near Vrindawan Garden

Nestled near the vibrant Pinaki Path, adjacent to the serene Vrindawan Garden, Smuk Lounge & Cafe offers a refreshing escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. More than just a cafe, Smuk is envisioned as a community hub, a place where friends gather, ideas flourish, and moments of tranquility are savored. Situated in a rapidly developing area of Assam, Smuk addresses the growing demand for sophisticated yet comfortable spaces that cater to both social gatherings and individual relaxation. It aims to distinguish itself in the local business landscape by offering a unique blend of high-quality food and beverages, a soothing ambiance, and a strong commitment to fostering community engagement.

<br> <br>

At its core, Smuk Lounge & Cafe provides a curated selection of beverages and light fare. Our offerings range from expertly crafted coffee and specialty teas to refreshing mocktails and artisanal fruit blends. The food menu features delectable pastries, light sandwiches, and locally inspired snacks, all prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients. A significant differentiator is our commitment to sourcing locally whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers and ensuring the freshness and authenticity of our offerings. We also cater to various dietary needs, offering vegetarian and gluten-free options to ensure that everyone can find something to enjoy. Beyond the menu, Smuk provides a comfortable and inviting space, designed with a modern minimalist aesthetic that promotes relaxation and productivity. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the cafe, making it an ideal spot for remote work, study sessions, or casual browsing. The cafe also hosts occasional events, such as live music performances and art exhibitions, further enriching the customer experience.

<br> <br>

Smuk''s approach to customer service is rooted in creating a welcoming and personalized experience. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our menu offerings, providing recommendations and catering to individual preferences. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our customers, remembering their names and preferred orders, and creating a sense of belonging. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Beyond individual interactions, Smuk aims to connect with the local community by participating in local events and initiatives. We partner with local artists and artisans to showcase their work, creating opportunities for them to reach a wider audience. We also support local charities and organizations through fundraising events and donations. This commitment to community engagement helps us to build strong relationships with our neighbors and establish Smuk as a valuable asset to the area.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Smuk Lounge & Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion within the local market. Our immediate plans involve expanding our menu to include more substantial meal options, catering to lunch and dinner crowds. We are also exploring the possibility of introducing a loyalty program to reward our frequent customers and encourage repeat business. Longer-term goals include opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, replicating the Smuk experience while adapting to the specific needs and preferences of each local community. We also aspire to become a recognized brand, synonymous with quality, comfort, and community engagement. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers and the changing dynamics of the local market. Ultimately, our vision is to establish Smuk Lounge & Cafe as a cornerstone of the local community, a place where people can connect, relax, and create lasting memories. We aim to not just offer food and beverages but to provide an experience that enriches the lives of those we serve.', 'near, Pinaki Path, near vrindawan garden', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:25:08.000Z'),
(1791, 'Cafe Riverrun', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Cafe Riverrun, nestled at 47 Moheshwar Cottage on MG Rd, offers a unique and refreshing haven in the heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, Riverrun strives to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, relax, and enjoy high-quality food and beverages in a welcoming and aesthetically pleasing environment. Positioned strategically on MG Road, a vital artery of commercial and social activity, Riverrun aims to become a recognizable and cherished landmark within the local business landscape, contributing to its vibrancy and character. We differentiate ourselves by combining a contemporary cafe experience with a deep appreciation for Assamese culture and locally sourced ingredients, appealing to a broad demographic seeking quality and authenticity.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, Cafe Riverrun provides a comprehensive cafe experience. This includes a diverse menu featuring freshly brewed coffee sourced from local Assam estates, a selection of teas highlighting regional specialties, and a range of cold beverages catering to varied preferences. Beyond beverages, Riverrun offers a carefully curated menu of food items, encompassing breakfast options like traditional Assamese jolpan with a modern twist, light lunches, and delectable pastries. A significant selling point is our commitment to using locally sourced, seasonal ingredients whenever possible. This supports local farmers and producers, ensures freshness, and allows us to showcase the unique flavors of Assam. To meet the needs of the local market, we also offer vegetarian and vegan options, recognizing the growing demand for plant-based meals. Furthermore, recognizing the importance of connectivity, Riverrun provides complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for students, professionals, and travelers seeking a productive and comfortable workspace.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Cafe Riverrun. We are committed to providing attentive and personalized service that exceeds expectations. Our staff is trained not only to efficiently fulfill orders but also to engage with customers, offer recommendations, and create a genuinely welcoming atmosphere. We believe in fostering a sense of community within our cafe. To achieve this, we host occasional events such as open mic nights featuring local musicians, art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional artists, and workshops on coffee brewing and tea tasting. This commitment to community engagement allows us to connect with our customers on a deeper level and establish Riverrun as a space where people can come together, share ideas, and celebrate local talent. The ambiance of Cafe Riverrun is carefully curated to provide a relaxing and inspiring environment, reflecting Assam’s natural beauty. From the decor to the music, every detail is designed to enhance the overall customer experience and create a memorable visit.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Cafe Riverrun is ambitious and forward-thinking. While consolidating its position as a leading cafe on MG Road is the immediate priority, the long-term goal is to expand its reach and impact within the region. We envision opening additional locations in other key areas of Assam, each retaining the unique character and community focus that defines Riverrun. We also plan to further develop our partnerships with local farmers and producers, increasing our reliance on sustainably sourced ingredients. Exploring opportunities to offer online ordering and delivery services to cater to a wider customer base is also under consideration. In addition, we aim to become a recognized advocate for Assamese culture and cuisine, actively promoting the region''s rich heritage through our menu, events, and community initiatives. Ultimately, Cafe Riverrun aspires to be more than just a successful business; it aims to be a positive force in the local community, contributing to its economic growth, cultural vibrancy, and overall well-being.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Furthermore, we are investigating the possibility of developing a signature line of packaged coffee and tea blends, allowing customers to enjoy the Riverrun experience at home. These products would be carefully crafted using the finest locally sourced ingredients and packaged in an aesthetically pleasing manner, reflecting the brand''s commitment to quality and authenticity. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of connection with the Cafe Riverrun brand. This program will offer exclusive discounts, special offers, and early access to events, further enhancing the customer experience and encouraging repeat business. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the local market, Cafe Riverrun is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a leading destination for coffee, community, and culture in Assam.</p>', '47 Moheshwar Cottage, MG Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:25:16.000Z'),
(1792, 'Cafe Craft', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Cafe Craft: A Culinary and Creative Hub in the Heart of Pension Para

Cafe Craft, nestled at Goswami Service, 54, Pension Para Rd, is more than just a café; it''s a vibrant community hub that blends artisanal coffee, delectable food, and creative expression in the heart of Assam. Recognizing a need for a space where locals could connect, create, and enjoy high-quality, locally-sourced refreshments, Cafe Craft was envisioned as a unique addition to the Pension Para landscape, offering a distinct experience that caters to a diverse clientele. From students seeking a quiet study spot to families looking for a relaxing weekend brunch, and artists searching for inspiration, Cafe Craft aims to be a welcoming haven for all. The cafe distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, community engagement, and a celebration of local talent.

<br> <br>

At its core, Cafe Craft provides a carefully curated menu featuring specialty coffee, prepared with locally roasted beans that emphasize the unique flavor profiles of Assam''s rich coffee-growing region. Beyond coffee, the cafe offers a diverse selection of teas, refreshing beverages, and a food menu designed to satisfy a range of tastes. Customers can indulge in freshly baked pastries, sandwiches made with locally sourced bread, and regional Assamese delicacies prepared with traditional recipes and modern culinary techniques. The cafe takes pride in its ability to cater to various dietary needs, offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. What truly sets Cafe Craft apart is its unique integration of creative arts. The cafe regularly hosts art exhibitions, open mic nights, and creative workshops, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talents. This dedication to supporting the local arts community reinforces Cafe Craft’s position as a cultural center, not just a place to grab a coffee.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Cafe Craft. The cafe is designed to be welcoming and inclusive, with comfortable seating arrangements, a warm and inviting atmosphere, and attentive service. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and the local area, providing recommendations and assisting customers with their needs. Cafe Craft understands the importance of building strong relationships with the local community. It actively participates in local events, sponsors community initiatives, and collaborates with nearby businesses. By fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of the community, Cafe Craft aims to be more than just a business; it strives to be a valuable asset to Pension Para. The cafe also utilizes social media platforms to engage with customers, share updates, and promote local events, fostering a strong online community in addition to its physical presence. The focus is always on creating a personalized and memorable experience for each visitor, ensuring they leave feeling valued and eager to return.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Cafe Craft envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading culinary and creative destination in the region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties, sourcing more ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, and increasing the frequency and variety of creative events. There''s also potential to introduce a loyalty program to reward regular customers and foster stronger relationships. A key goal is to establish partnerships with local schools and organizations to offer educational workshops and mentorship programs focused on culinary arts and creative expression. By continually innovating and adapting to the needs of the community, Cafe Craft aims to achieve sustainable growth while maintaining its commitment to quality, community engagement, and a celebration of local talent. The long-term vision is to replicate the Cafe Craft model in other locations across Assam, creating a network of community hubs that promote local culture and foster a thriving creative ecosystem.', 'Goswami Service, 54, Pension Para Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:25:22.000Z'),
(1793, '37 Street Affair - Food. Comfort. Flavour - Since 2017', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Established in 2017, 37 Street Affair – Food. Comfort. Flavour – has become a beloved culinary destination on Panjabari Rd, specifically located at 92, Panjabari Rd, in the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant, 37 Street Affair is an experience, a place where modern culinary techniques meet the warmth of Assamese hospitality. It represents a unique blend in the local business landscape, offering a contemporary dining experience while remaining deeply rooted in the region’s cultural identity and culinary traditions. Its sustained success demonstrates a deep understanding of local preferences, combined with a commitment to quality and innovation that sets it apart from traditional eateries and fast-food chains prevalent in the area.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, 37 Street Affair offers a diverse menu designed to tantalize taste buds and cater to a wide range of palates. The primary offerings include a curated selection of globally-inspired dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, guaranteeing freshness and supporting regional farmers. The menu features expertly crafted pizzas with unique flavour combinations, hearty burgers made with premium quality meats, and a variety of continental dishes, from pasta to flavorful rice bowls. A signature selection of Assamese-inspired dishes are also available, incorporating traditional flavors and techniques to create a modern interpretation of classic regional cuisine. Unique selling points include the commitment to using fresh, high-quality ingredients, the innovative menu that combines global trends with local tastes, and the meticulous attention to detail in both food presentation and service. These offerings specifically address a growing need in the local market for a dining establishment that provides a refined yet approachable culinary experience, bridging the gap between casual dining and fine dining establishments. The restaurant also boasts a dedicated beverage menu featuring signature mocktails, refreshing beverages and a curated selection of wines and spirits that complement the food offerings.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at 37 Street Affair. The approach to customer service is built on principles of attentiveness, efficiency, and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained to anticipate needs, provide informed recommendations, and ensure that every guest feels valued and comfortable. What truly makes the business stand out is its ability to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, making it a preferred spot for families, friends, and colleagues alike. The interior design, carefully curated to provide a modern yet cozy ambiance, further enhances the dining experience. Beyond the immediate customer interactions, 37 Street Affair actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, partnerships with local businesses, and support for local initiatives. This active community engagement has fostered a strong sense of loyalty among its customers, solidifying its position as a neighborhood favourite and a valued contributor to the local economy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for 37 Street Affair involves strategic growth and expansion while maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement. Plans are in place to explore opportunities for expanding its footprint, possibly through the establishment of additional locations within Assam or even venturing into other Northeast Indian states. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that the brand''s core values and commitment to quality are not compromised. There are also plans to enhance the menu offerings, introducing new and exciting dishes that continue to reflect the latest culinary trends while celebrating the unique flavours of Assam. Investment in technology is also a key focus, with plans to implement online ordering platforms, streamline operational processes, and enhance customer engagement through digital channels. The long-term goal is to establish 37 Street Affair as a leading culinary brand in Northeast India, recognized for its innovative menu, exceptional customer service, and unwavering commitment to the local community. By focusing on sustainable growth, continuous improvement, and a strong brand identity, 37 Street Affair is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and continue to delight customers for years to come.</p>', '92, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:25:29.000Z'),
(1794, 'Café LICA', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Café LICA, situated on the 1st Floor of Aruna Tower, strategically located below the CEC Centre on Lakhimi Path, Main Road, is a vibrant and welcoming café that aims to be more than just a place to grab a coffee. It''s envisioned as a community hub, a space for connection, and a provider of quality food and beverages in the heart of Assam. Nestled within a bustling commercial area, Café LICA provides a relaxing escape from the everyday hustle, offering a unique blend of contemporary café culture and traditional Assamese hospitality. Its significance lies in catering to a diverse clientele, from students and professionals seeking a productive workspace to families and friends looking for a comfortable place to socialize. Café LICA aims to be an integral part of the local business landscape by fostering a welcoming atmosphere and contributing positively to the community.
<br> <br>
Café LICA''s core offerings revolve around providing a diverse menu of high-quality food and beverages. Coffee, sourced from carefully selected beans, forms the cornerstone of the beverage selection, with a range of espresso-based drinks, from classic cappuccinos and lattes to innovative signature blends. A wide array of teas, including locally sourced Assamese tea, cater to diverse preferences. Beyond beverages, the café offers a curated selection of snacks, light meals, and desserts. This includes pastries, sandwiches, and salads, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. A key unique selling point is the café''s commitment to incorporating Assamese culinary influences into its menu. Expect to find traditional Assamese snacks and dishes alongside familiar café staples, offering a unique culinary experience. This blending of familiar and local flavors caters directly to the local market’s desire for both convenience and cultural authenticity. Furthermore, the availability of high-speed Wi-Fi provides a conducive environment for students and professionals, solidifying the café''s position as a preferred working and meeting space.
<br> <br>
At Café LICA, customer experience is paramount. The approach to customer service is centered on creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and welcomed. Staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, offering personalized recommendations and addressing individual needs. The café’s ambiance is carefully designed to be both aesthetically pleasing and functional, with comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and tasteful décor that reflects a contemporary yet locally inspired aesthetic. What sets Café LICA apart is its commitment to fostering a strong connection with the local community. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as hosting local artist exhibitions, organizing community events, and supporting local businesses. Furthermore, the café actively seeks feedback from its customers to continually improve its offerings and ensure it remains responsive to the needs of the community. The aim is to create a space where people feel a sense of belonging and where Café LICA becomes an integral part of their daily lives.
<br> <br>
Café LICA envisions itself as a growing and evolving business with significant potential for expansion and long-term success. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate a wider range of Assamese culinary delights, further solidifying its position as a unique dining destination. Exploring partnerships with local farmers and producers to source ingredients directly would further enhance the café''s commitment to supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of its offerings. The business also aims to expand its catering services to cater to local businesses and events, providing a convenient and high-quality food and beverage solution for various occasions. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other strategic areas of Assam, replicating the successful model of Café LICA while adapting to the specific needs and preferences of each local market. Ultimately, Café LICA aspires to become a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, community, and authentic Assamese hospitality. The goal is to create a lasting legacy as a business that not only provides excellent food and beverages but also contributes positively to the cultural and economic fabric of Assam.', '1st Floor, Aruna Tower Below CEC Centre, Lakhimi Path, main, road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:25:34.000Z'),
(1795, 'K Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>K Cafe, nestled atop Ratnagiri Tower at Public Health Tinali on Hengrabari Rd, presents a distinctive and refreshing addition to the burgeoning café culture of Assam. More than just a place to grab a coffee, K Cafe aims to be a vibrant social hub, offering a unique blend of modern café experiences with a touch of local warmth and hospitality. Situated in a prime location with panoramic rooftop views, K Cafe stands out as an oasis amidst the bustling city, promising a relaxed atmosphere and a carefully curated menu designed to cater to diverse tastes.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its heart, K Cafe is a purveyor of exceptional coffee. We meticulously source high-quality beans, roasted to perfection, and expertly brewed by our skilled baristas. Our coffee menu features a range of classic espresso-based drinks, innovative specialty brews, and refreshing iced coffees. Beyond coffee, we offer a diverse selection of beverages, including artisanal teas, handcrafted lemonades, and invigorating smoothies. Complementing our drinks menu is a delectable array of food offerings. From freshly baked pastries and wholesome sandwiches to light meals and shareable platters, our menu is designed to provide satisfying options throughout the day. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, infusing our offerings with the authentic flavors of Assam and supporting local farmers and producers. The rooftop location is also key, providing a unique selling point of al fresco dining with exceptional views. This meets the growing demand for sophisticated yet accessible dining experiences that resonate with the local community and attract tourists alike. K Cafe offers a premium experience without the premium price tag.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at K Cafe. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that each visit is memorable. From the moment a customer walks through the door, they are greeted with a warm smile and a genuine desire to cater to their needs. We pay meticulous attention to detail, from the carefully chosen music to the comfortable seating arrangements, all designed to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. Beyond the standard café experience, K Cafe actively seeks to connect with the local community. We host regular events such as live music performances, open mic nights, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talent. We also partner with local organizations to support community initiatives and promote social causes. We aim to be more than just a business; we strive to be a positive force in the community, fostering connections and creating a sense of belonging.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, K Cafe envisions itself as a leading destination for coffee lovers and social butterflies alike. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further highlighting the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to introduce new coffee brewing techniques and specialty coffee beans, providing our customers with even more unique and exciting experiences. In the long term, K Cafe aspires to become a recognizable brand synonymous with quality, community, and innovation. We envision expanding our presence to other locations in the region, bringing the K Cafe experience to a wider audience. We are committed to sustainable practices, striving to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a more sustainable future for our community. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, K Cafe has the potential to become a beloved institution in the local business landscape, fostering connections, creating opportunities, and enriching the lives of our customers and the community we serve.</p>', 'Rooftop, Ratnagiri Tower, Public Health Tinali, Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:30:09.000Z'),
(1796, 'The Flavours Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, 'The Flavours Cafe, nestled at House No. 60, GMC Hostel Road, Udayachal Rd, is more than just a place to grab a quick bite; it''s a culinary haven designed to offer a taste of both familiar comfort and exciting innovation. Situated in a bustling area, the cafe aims to be a pivotal part of the local Assam food scene, providing a welcoming atmosphere for students, professionals, and families alike. We strive to be a place where conversations flow as freely as the tea, and where every dish tells a story. Our commitment to quality ingredients, coupled with a passion for culinary artistry, sets us apart in a market increasingly saturated with generic food outlets.

<br> <br>

The core of The Flavours Cafe lies in its diverse menu, carefully curated to cater to a broad spectrum of tastes. We specialize in both traditional Assamese delicacies and contemporary cafe staples, ensuring something for everyone. Our signature dish, the *Masor Tenga* (a tangy fish curry), is prepared using locally sourced fish and authentic spices, offering a true taste of Assam. Alongside this, we offer a range of globally inspired dishes, including gourmet sandwiches, pasta, and freshly baked pastries. Our coffee selection is equally impressive, featuring expertly brewed espresso drinks and aromatic local tea blends. What truly distinguishes us is our commitment to using fresh, seasonal ingredients. We partner with local farmers whenever possible, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the highest quality produce. This focus on freshness and local sourcing is a significant selling point, appealing to increasingly health-conscious and ethically-minded consumers. The menu is designed to evolve with the seasons, introducing new and exciting dishes that highlight the best of what Assam has to offer. We also provide vegetarian and vegan options, recognizing the growing demand for plant-based alternatives in the market.

<br> <br>

At The Flavours Cafe, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and genuine welcome. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. We actively solicit feedback from our patrons, using their insights to continually improve our offerings and service. Beyond simply serving food, we aim to create a community hub. We regularly host live music performances featuring local artists, creating a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We also organize cooking workshops and food tasting events, fostering a sense of connection among our customers and promoting culinary exploration. Understanding the importance of accessibility, we offer free Wi-Fi and comfortable seating arrangements, making The Flavours Cafe an ideal place for students to study, professionals to conduct meetings, or friends to simply relax and connect. Our commitment to community extends beyond our immediate vicinity; we actively participate in local initiatives and support charitable organizations, further solidifying our role as a responsible and engaged member of the Assam community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, The Flavours Cafe envisions significant growth potential within the Assam market. Our immediate plan involves expanding our menu to include more regional specialties and introducing a catering service for local events and businesses. We also aim to establish an online ordering system, allowing customers to easily order their favorite dishes for takeaway or delivery. In the long term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout Assam, bringing our unique blend of culinary artistry and community spirit to a wider audience. We are exploring partnerships with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their work in our cafes, further promoting the region''s rich cultural heritage. Sustainable practices are also a key focus for the future. We are committed to reducing our environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly packaging, minimizing waste, and sourcing from sustainable suppliers. Our ultimate goal is to establish The Flavours Cafe as a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation. We aim to not only serve delicious food but also to create a lasting positive impact on the local economy and the lives of our customers.', 'House No. 60, GMC Hostel Road, Udayachal Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:30:15.000Z'),
(1797, 'TL7 Café', 'Cafes', NULL, 'TL7 Café: A Riverside Retreat in Belle View

TL7 Café, nestled at the heart of Upper Stand Rd (Riverside), Belle View, Road Rd, offers a unique and refreshing experience within the burgeoning café culture of Assam. More than just a coffee shop, TL7 is designed as a community hub, a place where the rich traditions of Assamese hospitality meet modern culinary trends. It aims to be a welcoming destination for residents and visitors alike, offering a haven for relaxation, connection, and the enjoyment of quality food and beverages. The café strives to be a cornerstone of the Belle View area, contributing to its vibrant character and appeal.

<br> <br>

At its core, TL7 Café provides a diverse menu centered on exceptional coffee, locally sourced teas, and freshly prepared food. The coffee selection showcases ethically sourced beans, expertly brewed by trained baristas who are passionate about their craft. From classic espresso drinks to innovative coffee concoctions infused with local flavors, there''s something to satisfy every palate. The tea menu features a curated selection of Assam teas, highlighting the region''s renowned tea heritage, along with herbal infusions and iced teas perfect for the warm climate. Beyond beverages, TL7 offers a menu of light meals, snacks, and delectable desserts. Patrons can enjoy freshly baked pastries, sandwiches made with locally sourced ingredients, and traditional Assamese snacks prepared with a modern twist. The unique selling point lies in the fusion of global café culture with the authentic flavors of Assam, creating a culinary experience that is both familiar and uniquely local. This responds directly to the growing demand for quality coffee and artisanal food in the region, while also celebrating the local culinary identity.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at TL7 Café. From the moment a guest steps inside, they are greeted with warm smiles and attentive service. The café is designed to foster a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, with comfortable seating arrangements, aesthetically pleasing décor, and ambient lighting that creates a cozy and welcoming environment. The staff is not only trained to provide efficient service but also to engage with customers, offering personalized recommendations and creating a genuine connection. TL7 actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting live music performances featuring local artists, showcasing artwork from regional talent, and organizing community events that bring people together. By supporting local producers and artisans, TL7 reinforces its commitment to the community and contributes to the economic well-being of the area. Furthermore, TL7 emphasizes sustainability practices, striving to minimize its environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction, and energy efficiency.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, TL7 Café envisions significant growth potential within the Belle View area and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate seasonal dishes and catering to dietary preferences, such as vegan and gluten-free options. TL7 aspires to become a destination for special events, offering catering services and private event bookings. Exploration of partnerships with local businesses and organizations is also a key component of the growth strategy, aiming to create synergistic relationships that benefit the entire community. The long-term goal is to establish TL7 Café as a beloved and respected brand, synonymous with quality, community, and exceptional customer service. This vision extends to the potential for opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the TL7 experience to a wider audience while staying true to its core values and commitment to the local community. Ultimately, TL7 strives to be more than just a café; it aspires to be a cultural landmark, a gathering place that enriches the lives of its patrons and contributes to the vibrant tapestry of Assam''s business landscape.', 'Upper stand rd(riverside), belle view, road rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:30:22.000Z'),
(1798, 'Cafe Detox', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Cafe Detox, a vibrant and health-conscious establishment located on Beltola Jayanagar Rd, opposite the Administrative Staff College, is redefining the cafe experience in Guwahati. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, Cafe Detox is committed to providing a rejuvenating and nourishing escape from the everyday hustle, offering a menu centered around fresh, locally sourced ingredients and a welcoming atmosphere that promotes well-being. In a city increasingly aware of the importance of healthy living, Cafe Detox fills a crucial niche by providing delicious and accessible options for those seeking a balanced and mindful lifestyle.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Cafe Detox offers a diverse range of services and products focused on detoxification and healthy eating. The menu features freshly pressed juices and smoothies packed with vitamins and antioxidants, carefully crafted to invigorate the body and cleanse the system. Salads are a staple, utilizing seasonal vegetables and incorporating lean proteins and healthy fats to create satisfying and nutritious meals. Beyond these staples, the cafe also offers a selection of healthy wraps, sandwiches made with whole-grain bread, and thoughtfully prepared breakfast bowls designed to provide sustained energy throughout the day. A unique selling point is the cafe''s commitment to sourcing ingredients from local farms and producers, ensuring freshness and supporting the local economy. Furthermore, Cafe Detox features a range of herbal teas and infusions, expertly blended to offer specific health benefits, such as boosting immunity, aiding digestion, and promoting relaxation. Understanding the increasing demand for plant-based options, the menu prominently features vegetarian and vegan choices, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy. By offering a comprehensive selection of healthy and delicious food and beverages, Cafe Detox caters to the growing need for convenient and accessible options for health-conscious individuals in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Cafe Detox prioritizes creating a positive and welcoming customer experience. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and able to provide recommendations based on individual dietary needs and preferences. The cafe''s ambiance is designed to be relaxing and inviting, featuring comfortable seating, natural light, and soothing decor. The overall atmosphere aims to promote a sense of calm and well-being, encouraging customers to unwind and recharge. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Cafe Detox actively participates in local events and initiatives focused on health and wellness. The cafe also hosts workshops and seminars on topics related to nutrition, mindfulness, and healthy living, further solidifying its role as a community hub for those seeking to improve their well-being. By fostering a strong connection with the local community and providing exceptional customer service, Cafe Detox has established itself as a beloved destination for those seeking a healthy and uplifting experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Cafe Detox is ambitious and centered around expanding its impact on the local community. The cafe plans to introduce new menu items that cater to specific dietary needs and preferences, such as gluten-free options and keto-friendly meals. There are also plans to expand the retail section of the cafe, offering a wider selection of healthy snacks, supplements, and locally sourced products. Exploring partnerships with local fitness studios and wellness centers is also a key component of the long-term strategy, allowing Cafe Detox to reach a wider audience and promote a holistic approach to health and wellness. One potential avenue for growth is the development of a line of pre-packaged juices and snacks that can be sold at local grocery stores and markets, increasing accessibility and expanding the brand''s reach. Ultimately, Cafe Detox aspires to become a leading advocate for healthy living in Guwahati, inspiring individuals to make mindful choices and prioritize their well-being. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the community, Cafe Detox is well-positioned for continued growth and success in the years to come.</p>', 'Beltola Jayanagar Rd, opposite to administrative staff College', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:30:28.000Z'),
(1799, 'Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery isn''t just another establishment on Beltola-Basistha Road; it''s a vibrant culinary destination designed to capture the spirit of Assam while offering a modern and engaging dining experience. Located conveniently at A G, Bus Stop, directly opposite Brahmaputra Apartment, the cafe serves as a welcoming haven for locals and visitors alike, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and contemporary cafe fare. In a region known for its rich tea heritage and burgeoning food scene, Cafe Xtreme aims to stand out by providing high-quality ingredients, innovative menu options, and an unparalleled atmosphere of comfort and community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Cafe Xtreme''s offerings lies a dual focus: exceptional teas and delectable food. The teahouse aspect boasts an extensive selection of locally sourced Assamese teas, ranging from robust black teas to delicate green and white varieties. These teas are meticulously prepared and served, allowing patrons to fully appreciate the nuanced flavors and aromas that characterize Assam’s world-renowned tea industry. Beyond the traditional, Cafe Xtreme also offers innovative tea-based beverages, including iced teas, flavored blends, and tea cocktails, catering to a diverse range of palates. The "Eatery" component complements the tea selection with a diverse menu of food options. This ranges from traditional Assamese snacks and light meals like *pitha*, *jolpan*, and *thukpa*, prepared with authentic recipes and locally sourced ingredients, to continental favorites such as sandwiches, pasta, and pizzas. Special emphasis is placed on fresh, seasonal ingredients, ensuring that every dish is bursting with flavor and reflects the culinary richness of the region. A unique selling point is the cafe''s commitment to using organic ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices. By offering both classic Assamese dishes and familiar international fare, Cafe Xtreme successfully bridges the gap between tradition and modernity, appealing to a broad customer base. This caters to the local market''s desire for both authentic flavors and familiar comfort foods.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery. The cafe prides itself on providing warm, attentive, and personalized service. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about the teas and dishes they serve, able to provide recommendations and answer questions with enthusiasm. The atmosphere is carefully curated to be inviting and comfortable, with a blend of modern design elements and traditional Assamese touches. Comfortable seating arrangements, ample lighting, and thoughtfully chosen decor create a relaxing and enjoyable environment for individuals, couples, and groups. Beyond just providing excellent service and a pleasant atmosphere, Cafe Xtreme actively seeks to connect with the local community. The cafe regularly hosts events such as live music performances featuring local artists, tea tasting workshops, and cooking demonstrations showcasing Assamese cuisine. These events provide opportunities for customers to engage with the cafe on a deeper level and foster a sense of community. Furthermore, Cafe Xtreme actively supports local initiatives and charities, demonstrating its commitment to giving back to the community it serves. By prioritizing customer service, cultivating a welcoming atmosphere, and actively engaging with the local community, Cafe Xtreme strives to be more than just a place to eat and drink; it aims to be a gathering place where people can connect, relax, and experience the best of Assamese culture.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery is ambitious yet grounded in a deep understanding of the local market and a commitment to quality. The immediate plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal dishes, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine. There are also plans to introduce a loyalty program to reward regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Longer-term goals involve establishing Cafe Xtreme as a recognizable brand within the region, potentially through opening additional locations in other key areas. This expansion would be carefully managed to maintain the same high standards of quality and customer service that define the original location. Another area of focus is developing a line of branded tea products and Assamese delicacies that can be sold both in the cafe and online, allowing customers to enjoy Cafe Xtreme''s offerings from the comfort of their own homes. Furthermore, the business is exploring opportunities to partner with local tea gardens and producers to create exclusive tea blends and support sustainable farming practices. By consistently innovating, expanding its reach, and staying true to its core values of quality, community, and authenticity, Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery aims to become a leading culinary destination in Assam, enriching the local food scene and providing a memorable experience for every customer.</p>', 'A G, Bus Stop, Beltola - Basistha Rd, opp. Brahmaputra Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:30:35.000Z'),
(1800, 'The Little Bistro', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p><strong>The Little Bistro: A Taste of Assam, Served with Heart</strong></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled in the heart of [City/Town Name], Assam, The Little Bistro is more than just a place to eat; it’s a vibrant culinary experience that celebrates the rich flavors and warm hospitality of the region. In a landscape dotted with traditional eateries and larger establishments, The Little Bistro distinguishes itself by offering a refined yet approachable dining atmosphere, specializing in both authentic Assamese cuisine and contemporary dishes crafted with locally sourced ingredients. Its significance lies in providing a platform for local farmers and artisans, contributing to the economic vitality of the community while offering discerning diners a unique and memorable gastronomic journey. The Little Bistro aims to be a cornerstone of the local food scene, fostering a sense of community through shared meals and genuine connection.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Little Bistro offers a diverse menu carefully curated to cater to a wide range of palates. The primary focus is on showcasing the diverse and distinctive flavors of Assam. Signature dishes include variations on traditional *khar*, expertly prepared fish dishes using fresh catches from local rivers, and innovative takes on popular Assamese snacks. Alongside these regional specialties, the bistro also features a selection of contemporary dishes, prepared using modern culinary techniques while maintaining a commitment to using locally sourced produce and ethically raised meats. This blend of traditional and modern appeals to both local residents seeking familiar comfort food and tourists eager to explore the region''s culinary heritage. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets The Little Bistro apart is its dedication to quality ingredients and meticulous preparation. The bistro cultivates relationships with local farmers and producers, ensuring that only the freshest, highest-quality ingredients are used in every dish. The sourcing strategy minimizes environmental impact and supports the local economy. Further distinguishing the bistro is its commitment to culinary innovation. The chefs constantly experiment with new flavors and techniques, creating unique dishes that push the boundaries of Assamese cuisine while remaining true to its roots. This creative approach ensures that the menu remains fresh, exciting, and reflective of the changing seasons. Finally, the bistro offers catering services for local events, bringing its unique culinary experience to celebrations and gatherings throughout the community. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Little Bistro is committed to providing an exceptional customer experience from the moment guests step through the door. The ambiance is carefully designed to be both inviting and sophisticated, creating a relaxed atmosphere conducive to shared meals and conversation. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and genuinely welcoming, anticipating guests'' needs and providing personalized recommendations. The team is passionate about the food they serve and eager to share their knowledge of Assamese cuisine with diners. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond simply serving delicious food, The Little Bistro strives to connect with the local community in meaningful ways. The bistro actively participates in local events, partnering with community organizations to support local causes. The restaurant also hosts cooking classes and workshops, sharing its passion for food and culinary expertise with aspiring chefs and food enthusiasts. The commitment to community engagement strengthens its ties to the local area and reinforces its position as a valued member of the community. The restaurant actively seeks feedback from its customers and incorporates their suggestions into menu development and service improvements, demonstrating a genuine commitment to meeting their needs and exceeding their expectations. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, The Little Bistro envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. The immediate plan involves expanding the bistro''s menu to include a wider range of regional specialties, showcasing the diverse culinary traditions of Northeast India. This expansion will introduce both locals and tourists to an even richer tapestry of flavors. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other cities in Assam and potentially expanding into other parts of India. These future locations would maintain the same commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement that defines The Little Bistro. The business is also exploring opportunities to develop a line of packaged food products, featuring its signature sauces, spices, and other culinary creations. This initiative would allow The Little Bistro to reach a wider audience and share its passion for Assamese cuisine with food lovers across the country and beyond. The ultimate vision is to establish The Little Bistro as a culinary ambassador for Assam, promoting its rich culinary heritage and contributing to the region''s economic and cultural vitality.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:35:10.000Z'),
(1801, 'Guwahati Heights', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Guwahati Heights, strategically located on Lamb Rd, stands as a beacon of modern commerce and community engagement in the heart of Assam. More than just a business, it''s a dynamic hub designed to cater to the evolving needs of Guwahati and beyond, contributing significantly to the region’s economic vibrancy. Situated in a key thoroughfare, Guwahati Heights leverages its prime location to offer a unique blend of services tailored to both local residents and visiting professionals, fostering a sense of connection and convenience that distinguishes it within the local business landscape. The establishment seeks to enhance the quality of life in the region, not only through its immediate offerings but also through its commitment to sustainable practices and community involvement, solidifying its position as a responsible and respected corporate citizen.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The core of Guwahati Heights lies in its diverse portfolio of offerings, meticulously designed to address specific market demands. Primarily, the business focuses on providing premium serviced apartments, offering a comfortable and convenient alternative to traditional hotels. These apartments are not merely lodging; they are fully equipped, elegantly furnished spaces ideal for extended stays, corporate travelers, and families seeking a home-away-from-home experience. Complementing the accommodation services is a state-of-the-art co-working space, fostering collaboration and innovation among entrepreneurs, freelancers, and small businesses. This co-working environment is equipped with high-speed internet, meeting rooms, and administrative support, providing a conducive atmosphere for productivity and networking. A distinguishing feature of Guwahati Heights is its commitment to sourcing local products and services wherever possible. The on-site café, for instance, prioritizes locally sourced ingredients, supporting regional farmers and businesses while offering guests an authentic taste of Assam. This focus on local sourcing extends to the furnishings and amenities within the apartments, showcasing the region''s rich craftsmanship and contributing to its economic growth. The unique selling proposition is the synergistic blend of hospitality, co-working, and community engagement, creating an ecosystem that fosters both personal and professional growth within a supportive and vibrant environment. </p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Guwahati Heights, reflecting a deep understanding of Assamese hospitality and a commitment to exceeding expectations. The approach is rooted in personalization, with staff trained to anticipate and respond to individual needs with warmth and efficiency. From seamless check-in procedures to tailored recommendations for local attractions and dining experiences, every interaction is designed to create a memorable and positive impression. What truly sets Guwahati Heights apart is its dedication to fostering a sense of community. Regular networking events, workshops, and cultural performances are organized within the co-working space and the common areas, providing opportunities for residents and visitors to connect, collaborate, and celebrate the rich heritage of Assam. Moreover, Guwahati Heights actively engages with local charities and initiatives, demonstrating a genuine commitment to social responsibility and contributing to the well-being of the community. This active involvement extends beyond financial contributions, with staff encouraged to volunteer their time and skills to support local causes. By prioritizing customer satisfaction, fostering community engagement, and promoting local culture, Guwahati Heights strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment that resonates with both local residents and international travelers.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Guwahati Heights is ambitious and forward-looking, centered on sustainable growth and continued community impact. Plans are underway to expand the serviced apartment offerings, incorporating innovative design elements and eco-friendly technologies to enhance the guest experience and minimize environmental footprint. This expansion will also include the addition of specialized facilities, such as a wellness center and a rooftop garden, further enriching the amenities available to residents and visitors. Simultaneously, the co-working space is envisioned to evolve into a regional hub for innovation and entrepreneurship, attracting talent and investment to Assam. This will involve strategic partnerships with local universities and incubation centers, providing mentorship and resources to aspiring entrepreneurs. Long-term goals include replicating the Guwahati Heights model in other key locations across Northeast India, creating a network of interconnected hubs that promote regional development and cultural exchange. The ultimate aim is to establish Guwahati Heights as a leading brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement, contributing to the economic prosperity and social well-being of the region for generations to come. The commitment to sustainable practices, coupled with a dedication to fostering local talent and promoting regional culture, will ensure that Guwahati Heights remains a positive force in the community for years to come.</p>', 'Lamb Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:35:17.000Z'),
(1802, 'Cafe Karma', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Cafe Karma, nestled at 19 Lamb Rd, is more than just a place to grab a cup of coffee; it’s a community hub and a culinary haven that celebrates the rich flavors of Assam and international cafe culture. In a region known for its tea estates and warm hospitality, Cafe Karma offers a unique and inviting space where locals and visitors alike can connect, relax, and indulge in thoughtfully prepared food and beverages. Its significance lies in providing a modern, globally-inspired cafe experience while remaining deeply rooted in the local Assamese culture and catering to the growing demand for sophisticated dining and social spaces in the area.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Cafe Karma lies a commitment to quality and authenticity. The cafe''s primary offerings revolve around expertly crafted coffee beverages, ranging from classic espresso-based drinks to innovative signature blends featuring locally sourced coffee beans. Beyond coffee, the menu boasts a diverse selection of teas, fresh juices, and artisanal beverages. Food offerings include a curated selection of baked goods, light meals, and desserts, blending traditional Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. Think of freshly baked *pitha* with a modern twist, alongside international favorites like sandwiches, salads, and pastries. A unique selling point is the cafe''s emphasis on using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers and ensuring the freshest, most flavorful experience for customers. This dedication to local sourcing not only contributes to the sustainability of the business but also appeals to the growing consumer awareness of ethical and responsible practices.

<br> <br>

Cafe Karma prioritizes delivering an exceptional customer experience that goes beyond simply serving food and drinks. The cafe’s ambiance is carefully designed to be welcoming and comfortable, featuring a blend of modern aesthetics and traditional Assamese design elements. Comfortable seating, warm lighting, and carefully curated decor create an atmosphere that is conducive to relaxation, conversation, and productivity. The staff is trained to be friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable about the menu, providing personalized service and making each customer feel valued. What truly sets Cafe Karma apart is its active engagement with the local community. The cafe regularly hosts events such as live music performances showcasing local talent, art exhibitions featuring regional artists, and workshops on topics ranging from coffee brewing to traditional Assamese crafts. These initiatives not only enrich the cafe''s atmosphere but also foster a sense of community and belonging, making Cafe Karma a gathering place for people from all walks of life.

<br> <br>

Cafe Karma envisions becoming a leading cafe and cultural destination in the region, known for its exceptional quality, community engagement, and sustainable practices. Future plans include expanding the menu to offer a wider range of food options, incorporating more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients. The business aims to establish partnerships with local artisans and producers to showcase their products and support the local economy. Exploration of opportunities to expand beyond the current location is underway, with the potential to open additional branches in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Cafe Karma experience to a wider audience. In the long term, the goal is to establish Cafe Karma as a recognizable and respected brand synonymous with quality, community, and a celebration of Assamese culture, while continuously evolving and adapting to meet the changing needs and preferences of its customers. Furthermore, leveraging technology to enhance customer experience, such as online ordering and loyalty programs, is also being considered.', '19, Lamb Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:35:23.000Z'),
(1803, 'Chai Met Sutta Café | Guwahati', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Chai Met Sutta Café | Guwahati offers a refreshing haven amidst the bustling cityscape, a place where traditional Assam charm meets modern café culture. Located on the 1st Floor, GS Rd, above HP World/Assam Silk, near Pragati Manor Hotel in Ward No 19, our café provides a unique and inviting space for residents and visitors alike to experience the rich flavors of Assam, all while enjoying a relaxing and convivial atmosphere. We aim to be more than just a café; we aspire to be a community hub, a place for connection, and a celebration of Assam''s vibrant culture.

<br> <br>

Our core offering revolves around providing an exceptional chai experience, moving beyond the commonplace to showcase the diverse range of teas grown and produced in Assam. We source our tea leaves directly from local gardens whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting the regional economy. Our menu features traditional Assam black tea prepared in various styles, including the classic ''kadak'' chai and creamy ''malai'' chai, alongside innovative tea blends incorporating local spices and herbs. Complementing our chai selection is a curated menu of "sutta" – small bites and snacks – that perfectly pair with our teas. These include both traditional Assamese delicacies like pithas (rice cakes) and larus (sweet balls) as well as popular café staples with a regional twist. Our unique selling point lies in the authenticity of our ingredients, the meticulous preparation of our beverages, and the creation of an atmosphere that is both comfortable and culturally enriching. We address a clear need in the local market for a high-quality tea experience that celebrates Assam''s heritage while offering a modern and inviting space.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Chai Met Sutta Café. We believe in creating a welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained not only to prepare excellent chai but also to provide friendly and attentive service, offering recommendations and sharing insights into the different tea varieties and culinary offerings. We actively seek to connect with the local community by hosting events such as poetry readings, musical performances featuring local artists, and tea tasting workshops that showcase the art and science of tea making. We strive to be more than just a business; we want to be a place where people can come together, share ideas, and celebrate the spirit of Guwahati. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental footprint by using biodegradable packaging and supporting local suppliers who share our values. We gather customer feedback regularly and use it to refine our offerings and improve our service, ensuring that we continue to meet the evolving needs of our clientele.

<br> <br>

Looking to the future, Chai Met Sutta Café | Guwahati envisions expanding its presence and becoming a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese tea culture. Our long-term goals include establishing additional locations in Guwahati and other key cities in Assam, each maintaining the same commitment to quality, community engagement, and cultural preservation. We also plan to expand our product line to include packaged teas, local crafts, and artisanal food products, allowing customers to take a piece of Assam home with them. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local tourism operators to offer tea tasting tours and cultural experiences, promoting Assam''s rich heritage to a wider audience. We believe that by staying true to our core values of quality, authenticity, and community, Chai Met Sutta Café can achieve sustainable growth and become a valuable asset to the Assam business landscape. We see the potential to franchise the business model within the North East region, empowering local entrepreneurs and further promoting the appreciation of Assam tea and culture. Our ambition is to establish Chai Met Sutta Café as a must-visit destination for anyone seeking an authentic and enriching experience in Guwahati.', 'Ward No 19, Landmark :, 1st Floor, GS Rd, above HP World/Assam Silk, near Pragati Manor Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:35:30.000Z'),
(1804, 'Vanilla Grain', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Vanilla Grain, nestled on the 1st Floor of 9, Rajgarh, opposite Bye Lane, is a distinctive establishment reshaping the culinary and gifting landscape of Assam. More than just a provider of baked goods and curated gift items, Vanilla Grain aims to be a cornerstone of the local community, offering experiences that resonate with the warmth and tradition of the region, while incorporating a modern sensibility. We strive to elevate everyday moments, transforming them into celebrations with our artisanal offerings and personalized service. Our location in Rajgarh provides accessibility and positions us as a convenient destination for both planned purchases and spontaneous indulgences.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Vanilla Grain''s offerings are two core areas: artisanal baked goods and thoughtfully curated gift selections. Our bakery specializes in crafting a range of items, from classic cakes and pastries to regional delicacies prepared with a modern twist. We source high-quality ingredients, emphasizing local Assam produce whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. Our signature items include a unique Assam tea-infused cake, a bestseller that captures the essence of the region''s flavor profile, and a selection of handcrafted cookies that cater to diverse tastes, from traditional shortbread to innovative spice combinations. The baked goods are made fresh daily, guaranteeing quality and taste in every bite.

<br> <br>

Beyond our bakery, Vanilla Grain distinguishes itself through its meticulously curated gift selections. We understand the importance of gifting as a means of expressing emotions and strengthening relationships. Therefore, we offer a diverse array of items, ranging from handcrafted Assam silk scarves and locally sourced artisanal teas to bespoke hampers featuring a combination of our baked goods and regional specialties. These gifts are designed to cater to various occasions, from birthdays and anniversaries to corporate events and festive celebrations. We offer personalization options, allowing customers to create unique and meaningful gifts that reflect the recipient''s individual preferences and personality. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of high-quality products, artistic presentation, and a commitment to showcasing the best of Assam''s artistry and culinary traditions. This addresses a local market need for sophisticated gifting options that celebrate regional heritage while meeting contemporary expectations.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Vanilla Grain. We believe in creating a welcoming and personalized environment for every visitor. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and knowledgeable service, assisting customers in selecting the perfect treat or gift. We encourage sampling and offer detailed information about the ingredients and preparation methods used in our baked goods. We also provide gift-wrapping services that are elegant and eco-friendly, reflecting our commitment to sustainability. Beyond in-store interactions, Vanilla Grain actively engages with the local community through participation in local festivals and events, and through collaborations with local artists and artisans. We also offer online ordering and delivery services for added convenience, ensuring that our offerings are accessible to a wider audience. We foster a strong connection with the local community through social media engagement, showcasing customer testimonials and sharing behind-the-scenes glimpses of our creative process. We also host baking workshops and tasting events to educate and engage our customers, further solidifying our role as a culinary hub in Rajgarh.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Vanilla Grain envisions significant growth and expansion. We plan to introduce new product lines, including a range of healthy and gluten-free baked goods to cater to evolving consumer preferences. We also intend to expand our gift selection to include more artisanal products from across Assam and Northeast India, further promoting regional craftsmanship. A key aspect of our future vision is to establish a stronger online presence, developing a robust e-commerce platform that allows customers to easily browse and purchase our products from anywhere in the world. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations within Guwahati and other key cities in Assam, making Vanilla Grain''s unique offerings more accessible to a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing Vanilla Grain as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and a celebration of Assam''s rich cultural heritage. We also aim to become a leading employer in the local community, providing opportunities for skills development and career advancement for aspiring bakers and artisans. We believe that by staying true to our core values of quality, customer service, and community engagement, Vanilla Grain will continue to thrive and contribute to the vibrant business landscape of Assam.', '1st Floor, 9, Rajgarh, opp. Bye Lane', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:35:38.000Z'),
(1805, 'The Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 is a vibrant and modern establishment, poised to become a cornerstone of the culinary and social scene in its Assam location. Building upon the legacy of its predecessor, Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 offers a revitalized dining experience that blends the comforting familiarity of local flavors with innovative international culinary trends. More than just a place to eat and drink, it aims to be a community hub – a welcoming space for friends to connect, families to gather, and individuals to unwind. Situated in a bustling area known for its mix of residential and commercial activity, the bistro cafe is strategically positioned to cater to a diverse clientele, from busy professionals seeking a quick and delicious lunch to residents looking for a relaxed evening meal or a weekend brunch destination. Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 distinguishes itself by its commitment to quality ingredients, exceptional service, and a consistently inviting atmosphere, setting a new standard for casual dining in the region.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 offers a carefully curated menu featuring a diverse range of culinary delights. The menu is designed to appeal to a broad palate, with options ranging from traditional Assamese dishes prepared with a modern twist to globally inspired bistro classics. Signature dishes often incorporate locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring freshness and quality. The cafe also boasts a comprehensive beverage program, including expertly crafted coffee drinks made with premium beans, a selection of refreshing teas, and a curated list of wines and local craft beers. A key unique selling point is the focus on seasonal specials, highlighting the best ingredients available at different times of the year and introducing new and exciting flavors to regular patrons. Furthermore, Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 offers catering services for small to medium-sized events, providing a convenient and high-quality option for local businesses and residents. These services are tailored to meet the specific needs of the local market, addressing the demand for both traditional and contemporary food options for social gatherings and corporate functions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0''s operating philosophy. The team is dedicated to providing warm, attentive, and personalized service to every guest, creating a welcoming and comfortable environment for all. Staff members are trained not only in food and beverage service but also in building rapport with customers and understanding their individual needs. The bistro cafe regularly seeks feedback from its patrons to continuously improve its offerings and ensure customer satisfaction. Furthermore, Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists and organizations, showcasing their work and hosting events that celebrate the region''s culture and heritage. This commitment to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the bistro cafe''s position as a valued member of the local business ecosystem. The establishment also leverages social media platforms to connect with customers, share updates about new menu items and events, and respond to inquiries in a timely and professional manner, further enhancing the overall customer experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 envisions significant growth potential within the local market. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative dishes and cater to evolving customer preferences. The bistro cafe is also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations within the region, bringing its unique dining experience to a wider audience. A key long-term goal is to establish Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality food, exceptional service, and a strong commitment to the local community. The business also plans to invest in employee training and development to ensure that its staff continues to provide the highest level of service and maintain the bistro cafe''s reputation for excellence. Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 is also actively researching sustainable practices to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the local community. This includes sourcing ingredients from local and sustainable suppliers, reducing waste, and implementing energy-efficient technologies. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and community engagement, Rhapsody Bistro Cafe 2.0 is well-positioned for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:40:08.000Z'),
(1806, 'Barua Brew and Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Barua Brew and Cafe, nestled in the heart of [Insert approximate or general location description, e.g., Guwahati’s bustling Ganeshguri area or a serene corner of Jorhat town], offers a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and modern cafe culture. More than just a place to grab a quick coffee, Barua Brew and Cafe aspires to be a community hub, a place where conversations flow as freely as the locally sourced tea, and where every visit feels like a warm embrace. In a region rich with tea heritage and a burgeoning cafe scene, Barua Brew and Cafe distinguishes itself through a commitment to authentic Assamese ingredients, sustainable practices, and a deep appreciation for local artistry and talent. It represents a modern interpretation of Assamese hospitality, blending the comfort of tradition with the energy of a contemporary space.

<br> <br>

At the core of Barua Brew and Cafe lies a curated menu designed to showcase the best of Assam. Our primary offering is, of course, tea. We feature a diverse selection of single-origin Assamese teas, sourced directly from local tea gardens, each with its distinct character and flavor profile. From robust black teas perfect for a morning kick-start to delicate green teas ideal for an afternoon respite, we cater to every palate. Beyond tea, we offer a range of expertly brewed coffee beverages, crafted with locally roasted beans that deliver a rich and aromatic experience. Our food menu complements our beverage selection with a delectable array of traditional Assamese snacks and light meals. Think<i>pitha</i>, a variety of rice cakes,<i>jolpan</i>, a traditional Assamese breakfast dish, and other regional delicacies prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We also offer contemporary cafe staples like sandwiches, salads, and pastries, prepared with an Assamese twist. Our unique selling point is our unwavering dedication to using authentic Assamese ingredients and recipes, supporting local farmers and artisans, and creating a truly immersive culinary experience. This commitment directly addresses the local market''s desire for authentic regional flavors and experiences, differentiating us from generic cafe chains.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Barua Brew and Cafe. From the moment a guest walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality. Our staff is trained not only to provide efficient and friendly service but also to share their knowledge about Assamese tea, coffee, and cuisine. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where customers feel comfortable lingering over a cup of tea, working remotely, or meeting with friends and family. The cafe''s ambiance reflects our commitment to local artistry, featuring artwork by local artists, handicrafts from nearby villages, and traditional Assamese textiles. We actively engage with the local community through events such as tea-tasting workshops, art exhibitions, and musical performances showcasing local talent. We also partner with local organizations to support community initiatives. This active engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and makes Barua Brew and Cafe a true community gathering place, not just a business.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Barua Brew and Cafe envisions itself as a leading ambassador for Assamese tea and culture, both within the region and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our sourcing network to support more local tea gardens and farmers, introducing new and innovative tea-based products, and developing a retail line of Assamese tea, coffee, and handicrafts. We also plan to explore opportunities for expanding our cafe network, carefully selecting locations that align with our values and allow us to continue serving the local community. A key long-term goal is to establish a training program for young people in the hospitality industry, providing them with the skills and knowledge they need to succeed in Assam’s growing tourism sector. Ultimately, Barua Brew and Cafe aims to be a sustainable and socially responsible business that contributes to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam, while providing a consistently exceptional experience for our customers. We aspire to become synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community spirit in the Assam cafe landscape.
</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:40:14.000Z'),
(1807, 'Roots', 'Cafes', NULL, '<h1>Roots: Cultivating Connection and Commerce in the Heart of Guwahati</h1>

Roots, strategically located on G.S. Road, opposite the Indian Oil Petrol Pump in Rukmini Gaon, Guwahati (781022), is more than just a business; it’s a community hub designed to foster connection, celebrate local artistry, and cater to the evolving needs of its clientele. In a vibrant and rapidly growing city like Guwahati, Roots stands out by offering a curated selection of experiences and products that reflect both traditional Assamese values and contemporary aspirations. Our commitment to quality, coupled with our deep understanding of the local market, positions Roots as a significant contributor to the region''s commercial and cultural landscape. <br> <br>

We understand that in today''s world, businesses must offer more than just goods and services. They must also build lasting relationships and contribute to the overall well-being of the community. Roots strives to achieve this through our carefully selected offerings and dedication to exceptional customer service. We aim to be a place where people feel welcome, valued, and inspired. <br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Fusion of Tradition and Modernity</h2>

At its core, Roots operates as a multifaceted business, primarily focusing on two key areas: a boutique retail experience and a community event space. Our retail section showcases a thoughtfully curated collection of artisanal goods, locally sourced crafts, and unique products that reflect the rich heritage of Assam and the wider Northeast India. We partner with local artisans, entrepreneurs, and small businesses to offer a platform for their creations, providing them with access to a wider market and supporting the preservation of traditional crafts. From handwoven textiles and intricately designed jewelry to organic teas and locally produced spices, our retail selection offers something for everyone seeking authentic and high-quality products. <br> <br>

The community event space, designed with flexibility and functionality in mind, hosts a variety of activities, including workshops, exhibitions, performances, and social gatherings. This space serves as a platform for artists, educators, and community organizers to connect, collaborate, and share their knowledge and talents. Whether it''s a traditional Bihu dance workshop, a contemporary art exhibition, or a business networking event, Roots provides a welcoming and inspiring environment for people to come together and engage with their community. <br> <br>

Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to supporting local talent and promoting sustainable practices. We prioritize partnering with businesses that share our values and are committed to ethical sourcing and production. By offering a carefully curated selection of products and experiences, we provide a unique alternative to mass-produced goods and impersonal retail environments. This approach resonates strongly with the local market, which increasingly values authenticity, quality, and community engagement. We address the need for spaces that foster creativity, collaboration, and cultural exchange, contributing to the overall vibrancy of the city. <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships and Fostering Community</h2>

At Roots, we believe that exceptional customer service is the foundation of a successful business. Our approach is rooted in building genuine relationships with our customers, understanding their needs, and exceeding their expectations. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and respected. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff are always on hand to provide assistance, answer questions, and offer personalized recommendations. <br> <br>

We understand that our success is directly linked to the success of our community. That''s why we are actively involved in supporting local initiatives and organizations. We regularly host events that benefit local charities and promote social causes. We also collaborate with local schools and community groups to offer educational programs and workshops. By giving back to the community, we are not only making a positive impact but also strengthening our relationships with our customers and partners. <br> <br>

What truly sets Roots apart is our commitment to creating a sense of belonging. We aim to be more than just a business; we want to be a place where people can connect with others, discover new interests, and feel inspired. Our community event space plays a crucial role in achieving this goal, providing a platform for people to come together and share their passions. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. This collaborative approach ensures that Roots remains relevant, responsive, and deeply connected to the needs of the local community. <br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Cultivating Growth and Expanding Horizons</h2>

Looking ahead, Roots envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading community hub in Guwahati. We plan to expand our retail offerings to include a wider range of locally sourced products and unique artisanal goods. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with more local businesses and organizations, further strengthening our commitment to supporting the local economy. <br> <br>

We also aim to enhance our community event space, creating a more versatile and engaging environment for workshops, exhibitions, and performances. We plan to invest in new equipment and technology to improve the overall experience for both participants and organizers. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of offering online platforms for our retail products and community events, expanding our reach beyond the physical location and catering to a wider audience. <br> <br>

Our long-term goal is to establish Roots as a model for sustainable and community-focused business practices. We believe that businesses have a responsibility to contribute to the well-being of their communities and to operate in an ethical and environmentally responsible manner. We are committed to continuously improving our practices and promoting sustainability throughout our operations. By staying true to our values and focusing on building strong relationships with our customers and partners, we are confident that Roots will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the city of Guwahati for years to come.', 'G.S. Road, Opp Indian Oil Petrol Pump, Rukmini Gaon, 781022', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:40:21.000Z'),
(1808, 'Devogram Cafe & Restro', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Devogram Cafe & Restro is a vibrant and welcoming establishment nestled in the heart of [Insert Specific Location Details Here, e.g., "the bustling Ganeshguri area of Guwahati," or "the serene landscape near Kaziranga National Park"]. More than just a cafe and restaurant, Devogram is envisioned as a community hub, a place where the rich culinary traditions of Assam blend seamlessly with contemporary dining experiences. It aims to be a destination that resonates with both locals and tourists, offering a taste of Assam''s diverse flavors in a comfortable and aesthetically pleasing environment. In a region known for its hospitality and burgeoning food scene, Devogram strives to carve a niche by prioritizing quality, authenticity, and a genuine connection with its patrons. The cafe aspires to be more than just a place to eat; it aims to be a memorable part of the Assam experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Devogram Cafe & Restro offers a diverse menu catering to a wide range of palates. At its core, the business provides cafe services including freshly brewed coffee sourced from local Assam tea gardens, alongside a selection of teas, both traditional and innovative blends. Complementing the beverages are an array of freshly baked goods, pastries, and light snacks perfect for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon. The "Restro" aspect of the business features a more comprehensive dining experience. Here, guests can savor authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Signature dishes might include variations of Khar, a traditional alkaline dish, or preparations featuring fresh river fish. Alongside Assamese classics, Devogram also offers a curated selection of Indian and Continental dishes, ensuring there''s something for everyone. A unique selling point lies in the cafe''s commitment to showcasing the culinary diversity of Assam beyond the standard fare. Periodic menu additions highlight lesser-known regional dishes, accompanied by educational descriptions of their origins and ingredients, adding an element of cultural exploration to the dining experience. This focus on authenticity and regional specialties distinguishes Devogram from more generic cafes and restaurants in the area, directly catering to the growing demand for authentic local experiences from both tourists and local residents seeking to reconnect with their heritage.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Devogram Cafe & Restro. The cafe''s ambiance is designed to be warm and inviting, reflecting the hospitality for which Assam is known. The decor blends modern aesthetics with traditional Assamese elements, creating a space that is both stylish and comfortable. Staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, providing personalized recommendations and catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. Beyond exceptional service, Devogram actively engages with the local community. This can include sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, supporting local artisans by showcasing their work within the cafe, and hosting events that celebrate Assamese culture. Regular musical performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions, and workshops related to Assamese cuisine and handicrafts are envisioned as core elements of the cafe''s community engagement strategy. Furthermore, Devogram utilizes social media platforms to connect with its audience, sharing stories about its suppliers, showcasing its menu offerings, and promoting local events. This holistic approach to customer experience – encompassing quality service, a welcoming atmosphere, and active community involvement – aims to foster loyalty and establish Devogram as a beloved local institution.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Devogram Cafe & Restro is one of sustainable growth and increasing influence as a champion of Assamese culture and cuisine. Expansion plans may include opening additional locations in strategic areas of Assam, such as near popular tourist destinations or in underserved communities. A key long-term goal is to establish a culinary training program for local youth, providing them with valuable skills and opportunities in the hospitality industry. This initiative would not only address the shortage of skilled labor in the region but also contribute to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culinary traditions. Another potential avenue for growth lies in the development of a line of packaged Assamese food products, such as tea blends, spices, and traditional snacks, which could be sold both in the cafe and online, expanding the business''s reach beyond its physical location. Ultimately, Devogram aims to become a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality, quality food, and a commitment to community development. The long-term vision is for Devogram to be not just a successful business, but a vital part of the cultural fabric of Assam.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:40:29.000Z'),
(1809, 'THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE is a refined and inviting destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, poised to redefine the tea-drinking experience. More than just a tea room, it''s a celebration of Assam''s rich tea heritage, meticulously curated to offer both traditional reverence and contemporary innovation. In a region synonymous with tea production, THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE distinguishes itself by providing a sophisticated and educational journey through the world of tea, from estate to cup. We strive to be a pivotal addition to Guwahati''s business landscape, attracting both local enthusiasts and international visitors seeking an authentic and elevated Assam tea experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE are its core services and products, each designed to showcase the versatility and depth of Assam tea. Our primary offering is a meticulously selected menu of single-origin Assam teas, sourced directly from reputable local estates committed to sustainable and ethical practices. We offer a variety of preparations, from traditional brewing methods using handcrafted teaware to innovative tea-infused beverages. Beyond classic black teas, we feature lesser-known Assam varietals, including green, white, and oolong teas, broadening the understanding of Assam''s tea-making capabilities.<br> <br> Complementing our tea selection is a range of carefully chosen food pairings, designed to enhance the flavor profiles of each tea. These include locally sourced pastries, light meals featuring regional ingredients, and traditional Assamese snacks. We also offer tea-related merchandise, such as loose-leaf teas, teaware sets, and tea-infused beauty products, providing customers with an opportunity to extend their tea experience beyond the lounge. <br> <br> What truly sets THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE apart is our commitment to education and engagement. We host regular tea tasting sessions, workshops on tea brewing techniques, and talks by local tea experts. This focus on knowledge sharing positions us as more than just a tea room; we are a center for tea culture and appreciation, fulfilling a growing demand for authentic and informative experiences within the local market. Our curated selection of teas unavailable elsewhere in the city also provides a unique selling point.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The customer experience at THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE is paramount. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff are highly trained not only in tea preparation and service but also in the history and nuances of Assam tea. They are knowledgeable guides, ready to assist customers in selecting the perfect tea based on their preferences and to answer any questions they may have. <br> <br> The lounge''s ambiance is carefully crafted to foster relaxation and connection. The interior design blends traditional Assamese elements with modern aesthetics, creating a space that is both elegant and comfortable. Comfortable seating, soft lighting, and curated music contribute to a tranquil atmosphere. <br> <br> We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, farmers, and cultural organizations. We showcase local art, host community events, and source ingredients from local suppliers whenever possible. This commitment to supporting the local economy and celebrating Assamese culture fosters a strong sense of connection and loyalty among our customers. Furthermore, we actively solicit and incorporate customer feedback to continually improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE is one of sustainable growth and continued commitment to excellence. Our immediate plans include expanding our tea menu to include rare and limited-edition Assam teas, further solidifying our position as a destination for tea connoisseurs. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster long-term relationships. <br> <br> Looking further ahead, we envision expanding our online presence to reach a wider audience, offering online tea sales and virtual tea tasting experiences. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other key cities in India and internationally, bringing the authentic Assam tea experience to a global audience. <br> <br> Our long-term goals include establishing THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE as a recognized leader in the Assam tea industry, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to be a catalyst for promoting Assam tea culture and supporting the livelihoods of local tea farmers. By consistently delivering exceptional experiences and fostering a deep appreciation for Assam tea, we are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious goals and contribute to the region''s economic and cultural vibrancy.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.347Z', '2025-12-07T11:40:38.000Z'),
(1810, 'Addicted', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p><b>Addicted: Fueling Assam''s Drive with Premium Automotive Solutions</b></p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located in the heart of Assam''s industrial sector at the In & Out Building, Industrial Development Corporation, Zoo Rd, "Addicted" is emerging as a prominent provider of specialized automotive services and products. Addicted isn''t just another auto business; it aims to be a vital resource contributing to the efficiency and performance of vehicles across the region. Recognizing the unique needs of the Assamese market, from navigating challenging terrain to enduring the region''s distinctive climate, Addicted is positioned to become a trusted partner for individual vehicle owners, fleet operators, and businesses relying on reliable transportation.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Addicted focuses on delivering a comprehensive suite of services and products designed to enhance vehicle performance and longevity. Core offerings include a carefully curated selection of high-quality automotive parts, ranging from essential maintenance items like filters, belts, and lubricants to performance upgrades such as specialized suspension systems and enhanced braking components. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing products that are specifically suited to the demands of Assam''s environment, ensuring they can withstand the humidity, varying road conditions, and unique driving styles prevalent in the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond parts, Addicted boasts a team of skilled technicians capable of providing expert diagnostics, repair, and maintenance services. Specialization lies in areas often overlooked by general auto shops, such as performance tuning, advanced diagnostics of modern vehicle electronics, and customized solutions for improving fuel efficiency. The service department is equipped with state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment and specialized tools, allowing the team to tackle complex automotive challenges with precision and expertise. The workshop strives to provide services for all types of vehicles.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets Addicted apart is its dedication to providing a superior customer experience deeply rooted in the local community. The business operates on the principle of building long-term relationships with customers based on trust and transparency. Every interaction is approached with a commitment to understanding the individual needs of each customer, offering tailored solutions, and providing clear and honest communication throughout the service process. Addicted understands that vehicle maintenance can be stressful, and strives to make the process as smooth and convenient as possible.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Furthermore, Addicted aims to actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. This includes sponsoring local automotive events, providing educational workshops on vehicle maintenance, and participating in community outreach programs. By fostering a strong connection with the community, Addicted aims to become more than just a business; it seeks to be a valued contributor to the region''s economic and social well-being. This community engagement helps to build brand loyalty and trust among local customers, creating a sustainable business model.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Addicted envisions expanding its range of services and products to meet the evolving needs of the Assamese automotive market. This includes exploring partnerships with leading automotive manufacturers, expanding the service department to accommodate a wider range of vehicles, and investing in advanced training for its technicians. A key focus will be on incorporating sustainable practices into the business operations, such as promoting eco-friendly automotive products and implementing energy-efficient technologies.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Addicted''s long-term goal is to become the leading provider of premium automotive solutions in Assam, recognized for its expertise, customer service, and commitment to the community. By continuously innovating and adapting to the changing landscape of the automotive industry, Addicted is poised to achieve sustained growth and make a significant contribution to the region''s transportation infrastructure. The business aims to set a new standard for automotive services in Assam, offering a blend of technical expertise, customer focus, and community engagement that resonates with local values.</p>', 'In &, In And Out Building, Industrial Develoment Corporation, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:45:09.000Z'),
(1811, 'Public domain cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Public Domain Café: A Haven for Creativity and Community in Panjabari

Located at H.No. 93, Panjabari Rd, Public Domain Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it''s a vibrant hub where creativity blossoms and community thrives. Nestled in the heart of Panjabari, Guwahati, the café distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of quality food and beverage alongside a strong commitment to supporting local artists and fostering intellectual exchange. In Assam''s dynamic business landscape, Public Domain Café fills a niche by providing a welcoming and inspiring space for students, professionals, and artists alike. We aim to be a cornerstone of the Panjabari community, contributing to its cultural richness and providing a platform for local talent to shine.

<br> <br>

At Public Domain Café, our core offering revolves around delivering a superior café experience. We meticulously source high-quality coffee beans, ensuring a rich and flavorful brew that caters to discerning palates. Our menu extends beyond coffee to include a diverse selection of teas, refreshing beverages, and delectable pastries and light meals, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We recognize the growing demand for healthier options and strive to incorporate nutritious choices into our menu, catering to various dietary preferences.

<br> <br>

What truly sets Public Domain Café apart is its dedication to the “public domain” concept. We actively curate a space that showcases and celebrates works in the public domain – literature, art, music, and film – creating an atmosphere that encourages intellectual curiosity and appreciation for shared cultural heritage. This is reflected in our decor, our curated selection of books and magazines, and our regular events which include open mic nights, art exhibitions featuring local artists, and screenings of classic films. We also offer free Wi-Fi, making it an ideal workspace for freelancers and students. Our unique selling point lies in this combination of a comfortable café environment with a strong emphasis on fostering creativity and intellectual engagement. This resonates deeply with the local market, particularly the student population and the burgeoning artistic community in and around Panjabari.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Public Domain Café. We believe in providing friendly, attentive service that makes every visitor feel welcome and valued. Our staff is trained not just to serve coffee, but to engage with customers, understand their needs, and create a positive and memorable experience. We actively seek feedback and continuously strive to improve our offerings based on customer preferences. To further enhance community engagement, we regularly host workshops and events designed to connect local residents and foster a sense of belonging. We collaborate with local artists, musicians, and writers to provide them with a platform to showcase their talents and connect with their audience. This dedication to community building extends to actively participating in local initiatives and supporting charitable causes within the Panjabari area. We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a positive force in the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Public Domain Café envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu offerings to cater to a wider range of culinary tastes and preferences. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and further cultivate a sense of community. A key aspect of our future vision is to enhance our online presence through social media and a user-friendly website, allowing us to connect with a broader audience and promote our events and initiatives.

<br> <br>

We are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to create mutually beneficial relationships and further contribute to the local economy. One potential avenue is collaborating with local educational institutions to offer student discounts and host academic events at the café. We are also considering expanding our retail offerings to include merchandise featuring local artists and craftspeople. Ultimately, Public Domain Café aspires to become a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, creativity, and community engagement in the Guwahati area and beyond. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our long-term goals and make a lasting positive impact on the Panjabari community and the wider Assam business landscape.

<br> <br>

We are also committed to sustainability and are actively exploring ways to reduce our environmental footprint. This includes sourcing eco-friendly packaging, minimizing waste, and promoting responsible consumption among our customers. We believe that by operating in a sustainable and ethical manner, we can contribute to a better future for our community and the planet.', 'h no, 93, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:45:17.000Z'),
(1812, 'Ethnic Taste - A Fusion Café', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Ethnic Taste - A Fusion Café: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<p>Nestled near the vibrant atmosphere of the Cricket Stadium, at Gate no-3, Cricket Stadium, Rgbs Road, Bye Lane-4, House No-15, 4, RGBS Rd, near Barsapara, Guwahati, Ethnic Taste - A Fusion Café offers a unique dining experience that blends the rich tapestry of Assamese culinary traditions with innovative flavors from around the world. More than just a restaurant, Ethnic Taste aims to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can gather to savor delicious food, enjoy warm hospitality, and celebrate the diverse cultural heritage of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>In the dynamic Guwahati business landscape, Ethnic Taste distinguishes itself by offering a distinct alternative to standard dining options. We recognize the growing desire for innovative culinary experiences while respecting the importance of local flavors and traditions. Our café serves as a bridge, connecting the familiar comfort of Assamese cuisine with the exciting allure of global gastronomy. We are committed to sourcing fresh, local ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers, and contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy. By offering a unique and thoughtfully curated menu, Ethnic Taste aims to elevate the dining scene in Guwahati and become a destination for food enthusiasts seeking an unforgettable experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around providing a diverse and flavorful menu that caters to a wide range of palates. The menu features a selection of authentic Assamese dishes prepared with traditional methods and locally sourced ingredients. Alongside these regional staples, we present a carefully crafted array of fusion dishes that blend Assamese flavors with international culinary techniques. Imagine tasting a delicately spiced Masor Tenga infused with subtle hints of Thai lemongrass, or enjoying a traditional Pitha reinvented as a savory crepe with a filling inspired by global street food. We also offer a variety of specialty coffees, teas, and refreshing beverages, carefully selected to complement the flavors of our food. Vegetarian and vegan options are thoughtfully included to cater to diverse dietary needs and preferences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>A key differentiator for Ethnic Taste is our commitment to quality and innovation. We continuously experiment with new flavor combinations, explore different cooking techniques, and refine our menu based on customer feedback and seasonal availability of ingredients. This dedication to culinary creativity ensures that our offerings remain fresh, exciting, and consistently satisfying. Furthermore, we prioritize using organic and sustainably sourced ingredients whenever possible, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local farmers who share our commitment to quality. Our goal is to provide not just a meal, but a culinary adventure that stimulates the senses and leaves a lasting impression.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Ethnic Taste, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and passionate about sharing their love for food and the local culture. We actively seek customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our service and menu offerings. We host regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, cooking demonstrations showcasing Assamese cuisine, and cultural celebrations that highlight the region''s rich heritage. These events are designed to foster a sense of community and provide opportunities for people to connect and share their experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>What truly sets us apart is our commitment to building meaningful relationships with the local community. We actively participate in local events, support local charities, and partner with local businesses to promote the region''s cultural and economic growth. We believe that by giving back to the community, we can create a positive impact and foster a sense of belonging. We regularly engage with our customers through social media, sharing updates about our menu, events, and community initiatives. We encourage open communication and actively respond to customer inquiries and feedback, ensuring that our customers feel heard and valued.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Ethnic Taste envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Guwahati, recognized for its innovative fusion cuisine, exceptional customer service, and commitment to the local community. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introduce new and exciting dishes, and further refine our culinary techniques. We are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, bringing our unique blend of flavors and hospitality to a wider audience. We also aim to establish partnerships with local culinary schools and training programs, providing opportunities for aspiring chefs and hospitality professionals to develop their skills and contribute to the growth of the industry.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to become a symbol of Assamese culinary innovation and a driving force in the region''s tourism and cultural development. We believe that by staying true to our values, continuously innovating, and fostering strong relationships with our customers and the community, we can achieve our vision and leave a lasting positive impact on the Guwahati business landscape and beyond. We are confident that Ethnic Taste will continue to evolve and thrive, serving as a testament to the power of food, culture, and community.</p>', 'Gate no-3, Cricket Stadium, Rgbs Road, Bye Lane-4, House No-15, 4, RGBS Rd, near Barsapara', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:45:26.000Z'),
(1813, 'Yummy Belly', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Yummy Belly, strategically located in the bustling Sixmile area on GS Road, near Dominos, has quickly become a beloved culinary destination in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a restaurant, Yummy Belly offers a vibrant and welcoming space where the rich flavors of the region blend seamlessly with contemporary culinary techniques. Recognizing the growing demand for both authentic Assamese cuisine and convenient dining options, Yummy Belly fills a crucial gap in the local market by providing a diverse menu, a comfortable atmosphere, and unwavering commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Yummy Belly specializes in delivering an exceptional dining experience anchored by a diverse menu catering to a wide range of palates. The primary offerings include: a curated selection of authentic Assamese dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, to showcase the unique and vibrant flavors of the region; a variety of North Indian favorites, cooked with traditional recipes and aromatic spices; and a range of popular Chinese dishes, prepared with a focus on fresh ingredients and authentic techniques. What truly sets Yummy Belly apart is its commitment to freshness and quality. Each dish is carefully prepared using high-quality ingredients, ensuring a memorable culinary journey for every customer. Furthermore, Yummy Belly offers convenient takeaway and delivery services, catering to the needs of busy professionals and families in the Sixmile area. This adaptability to modern lifestyles makes Yummy Belly a go-to choice for both casual dining and quick, delicious meals. The restaurant consistently adapts its menu based on seasonal availability of ingredients and customer preferences, showcasing a dedication to innovation and catering to local tastes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Yummy Belly. The restaurant fosters a warm and inviting atmosphere, encouraging customers to relax and savor their meals. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, readily assisting customers with their choices and addressing any concerns promptly and efficiently. Yummy Belly strives to build lasting relationships with its clientele by prioritizing personalized service and creating a welcoming environment. The restaurant actively engages with the local community by participating in local events and sponsoring community initiatives. By fostering a strong connection with the community, Yummy Belly has cultivated a loyal customer base that appreciates its commitment to quality, service, and local engagement. Positive word-of-mouth referrals and glowing online reviews stand as testament to the restaurant''s success in delivering an outstanding customer experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Yummy Belly envisions a future marked by continued growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on further enhancing the menu by introducing innovative dishes that blend traditional flavors with modern culinary trends. Exploring opportunities to expand the seating capacity to accommodate the growing customer base is also a priority. Long-term goals include establishing Yummy Belly as a recognizable and respected brand throughout Guwahati and potentially beyond. This could involve opening additional locations in strategic areas of the city or even exploring franchise opportunities. Furthermore, Yummy Belly aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering platforms and loyalty programs. By staying adaptable to evolving market trends and consistently delivering high-quality food and exceptional service, Yummy Belly is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious growth objectives and solidify its position as a leading culinary destination in Assam.</p>', 'Sixmile, GS Rd, near Dominos', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:45:31.000Z'),
(1814, 'Desi Swag Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Desi Swag Cafe, located at 8A, Nilomani Phukan Path, is more than just a cafe; it''s a vibrant cultural hub bringing a modern, stylish twist to traditional Assamese flavors and hospitality. In a region rich with culinary heritage and a growing demand for contemporary dining experiences, Desi Swag Cafe distinguishes itself by seamlessly blending authentic Assamese cuisine with a trendy, inviting atmosphere. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local community, offering a unique space where tradition meets innovation.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Desi Swag Cafe lies our commitment to providing a distinctive and memorable culinary journey. Our core offering revolves around authentic Assamese dishes, meticulously prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. While staying true to traditional recipes, we also introduce innovative twists, catering to a diverse palate. Our menu features signature items like the classic ''Masor Tenga'' (sour fish curry) prepared with a modern twist, flavorful ''Pitha'' platters showcasing the region''s diverse rice cakes, and a range of revitalizing Assamese teas, sourced directly from local tea gardens. A unique selling point is our focus on presentation, elevating traditional fare to an aesthetically pleasing dining experience suitable for social media sharing and creating lasting impressions. Recognizing the evolving preferences of the local market, we also offer continental options and vegetarian choices, ensuring that there''s something for everyone. The menu is carefully curated to cater to breakfast, lunch, and dinner, providing a comprehensive dining solution throughout the day.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Desi Swag Cafe prides itself on delivering exceptional customer service that goes beyond merely serving food. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality, making them feel instantly welcomed and valued. Our staff is meticulously trained not only in food service but also in understanding and responding to individual customer needs and preferences. What sets us apart is our commitment to creating a sense of community. We organize regular events like live music performances featuring local artists, cooking workshops showcasing Assamese culinary techniques, and cultural exhibitions that celebrate the rich heritage of the region. We actively engage with our customers on social media, fostering a digital community where they can share their experiences, provide feedback, and stay updated on our latest offerings and events. By prioritizing genuine human interaction and creating a vibrant social space, we aim to foster strong connections with the local community and become a beloved gathering place.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Desi Swag Cafe envisions becoming a prominent brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and contemporary dining in the region. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal ingredients, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese flavors. We also aim to establish partnerships with local farmers and artisans, promoting sustainable practices and supporting the local economy. Expansion is a key element of our long-term strategy, with plans to open additional locations in other parts of Assam and eventually across India, bringing the taste of authentic Assamese cuisine to a wider audience. We are also exploring the possibility of launching a line of packaged Assamese snacks and ingredients, allowing customers to enjoy our flavors at home. Ultimately, our goal is to be recognized as a leading culinary destination that not only provides exceptional food and service but also actively contributes to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culture and heritage. We aspire to become a national brand that represents the true essence of Assam, one delicious bite at a time.</p>', '8A, Nilomani Phukan Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:45:37.000Z'),
(1815, 'Café Coffee Day', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Café Coffee Day, nestled in the heart of Basistha Road at Rajat Bhawan, near the My Jio Store, is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a vibrant community hub offering a welcoming space for locals and visitors alike. In Assam''s dynamic business environment, where tea has historically reigned supreme, Café Coffee Day introduces a contemporary coffee culture, blending global coffee trends with local tastes and preferences. It provides a modern, relaxed environment distinct from traditional establishments, catering to a growing demand for specialized coffee and a comfortable gathering place.

<br> <br>

At its core, Café Coffee Day provides a wide array of coffee-based beverages, from classic espressos and cappuccinos to signature frappes and innovative seasonal creations. Beyond coffee, the menu extends to include a selection of teas, both hot and iced, catering to the region’s deep-rooted tea affinity. Complementing the beverage offerings are a variety of food items, including sandwiches, wraps, pastries, cakes, and quick bites. The unique selling point lies in the carefully curated coffee blends, sourced from some of the finest coffee plantations, ensuring a rich and aromatic experience. Furthermore, the café prides itself on adapting its menu to incorporate locally sourced ingredients and flavors, offering items that resonate with the Assam palate. This focus on local integration allows Café Coffee Day to meet the specific needs of the market, providing familiar tastes alongside internationally inspired options. For instance, seasonal variations on lattes using local spices or pastries inspired by traditional Assamese sweets might be offered.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Café Coffee Day. The staff is trained to provide friendly, efficient service, creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The café’s ambiance is designed to be comfortable and conducive to both work and relaxation, with comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and often, Wi-Fi connectivity. This makes it an ideal spot for students studying, professionals holding informal meetings, or friends catching up. What truly sets Café Coffee Day apart is its commitment to engaging with the local community. This is achieved through hosting local events, showcasing regional artwork, and partnering with local businesses for promotions. The café also strives to be a responsible corporate citizen, participating in local initiatives and supporting community projects. This deep connection to the community fosters a sense of belonging and makes Café Coffee Day more than just a coffee shop; it''s a valued member of the neighborhood.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Café Coffee Day envisions itself as an even more integral part of the Basistha Road community. The business plans to expand its offerings, potentially including live music performances, book readings, and other cultural events, transforming the café into a vibrant cultural center. There is also potential to introduce a loyalty program to reward regular customers and enhance customer retention. Furthermore, the business aims to strengthen its commitment to sustainability, exploring ways to reduce its environmental impact and support local farmers and producers. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Guwahati, bringing the unique Café Coffee Day experience to a wider audience while maintaining the core values of quality, community engagement, and customer satisfaction. By continuing to innovate and adapt to the evolving needs of the local market, Café Coffee Day aims to solidify its position as the premier destination for coffee and community in the Basistha Road area and beyond.', 'Rajat Bhawan, Basistha Rd, near My Jio Store', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:50:07.000Z'),
(1816, 'Adora cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Adora Cafe, nestled in the heart of Assam, is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a haven crafted to celebrate the region''s rich culinary heritage and vibrant social spirit. We aim to provide an unparalleled experience, blending the warmth of Assamese hospitality with expertly crafted beverages and delectable food, establishing ourselves as a cornerstone of the local community and a premier destination for both residents and visitors.

<br> <br>

Adora Cafe differentiates itself through a commitment to sourcing local ingredients, showcasing the authentic flavors of Assam. Our menu features a carefully curated selection of artisanal coffees, each roasted to perfection and prepared with meticulous attention to detail by our skilled baristas. Alongside classic espresso drinks, we offer unique Assamese tea blends, paying homage to the region''s tea-growing legacy. Our food menu complements our beverage offerings, featuring traditional Assamese snacks and meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced produce whenever possible. We also offer a variety of pastries and light meals, catering to diverse palates while maintaining a commitment to quality and flavor. Unlike many generic coffee chains, Adora Cafe provides a distinctive regional experience, immersing customers in the unique culture and tastes of Assam. We are committed to ethical sourcing and sustainability, supporting local farmers and producers, and minimizing our environmental impact. Our cafe provides a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, perfect for catching up with friends, working remotely, or simply enjoying a moment of tranquility.

<br> <br>

At Adora Cafe, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service, ensuring that each customer''s experience is exceptional. We actively engage with the local community by hosting events, supporting local artists, and participating in community initiatives. Our cafe provides a gathering space for residents to connect, celebrate, and build relationships. We believe in building genuine connections with our customers, understanding their preferences, and anticipating their needs. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. Adora Cafe fosters a sense of community by promoting local talent through showcasing their artwork and products within the cafe, and by supporting local charities and organizations.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Adora Cafe envisions expanding its reach while maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement. We plan to introduce new menu items that further showcase the region''s culinary diversity, and we are exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and businesses to offer unique products and experiences. We also aim to enhance our online presence, making it easier for customers to order online, stay informed about our events, and connect with us on social media. Furthermore, we are exploring the potential of opening additional locations within Assam, bringing the Adora Cafe experience to a wider audience. Long-term, we aspire to become a recognized symbol of Assamese hospitality and culinary excellence, contributing to the economic and social well-being of the communities we serve. We envision Adora Cafe as a lasting legacy, celebrating the rich culture and traditions of Assam for generations to come. We plan to implement sustainability initiatives to further reduce our carbon footprint and promote environmental responsibility. This includes sourcing more renewable energy and reducing waste through composting and recycling programs.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:50:11.000Z'),
(1817, 'Starbucks', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Starbucks, located on the Ground Floor of the iconic Tata Tea Building on GS Rd, opposite Aayakar Bhawan in Guwahati, Assam, represents a unique blend of global coffee culture and local sensibilities. More than just a coffee shop, it''s a destination that provides a familiar yet distinct experience, bridging the gap between international standards and the burgeoning café culture of Assam. Situated in a prime location, this Starbucks outlet caters to a diverse clientele, from students and professionals to tourists and local residents, offering a premium coffee experience within a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere. It aims to be a gathering place, a workspace, and a respite from the bustling city life, fostering a sense of community and connection within the heart of Guwahati.

<br> <br>

This Starbucks location offers the full range of signature Starbucks beverages, including espresso-based drinks like lattes, cappuccinos, and macchiatos, as well as brewed coffee, iced coffee, and Frappuccinos. Beyond coffee, the menu features a variety of teas, refreshers, and other specialty drinks. The food offerings include a selection of pastries, cakes, sandwiches, and salads, catering to diverse tastes and dietary preferences. Unique to this location, and in line with Starbucks’ global strategy, the menu often incorporates locally inspired flavors and ingredients. This might include pastries with regional spices or beverages featuring local fruits, providing a distinct Assamese touch to the familiar Starbucks experience. The key selling points are the consistent quality of beverages and food, the comfortable and aesthetically pleasing ambiance, and the reliable Wi-Fi, which makes it a popular choice for working professionals and students alike. By offering a consistently high-quality experience and a localized touch, Starbucks meets the growing demand for premium coffee and a comfortable social space within the Guwahati market.

<br> <br>

The customer experience at Starbucks on GS Road is paramount. Baristas are trained to provide friendly and efficient service, ensuring that each customer feels welcome and valued. The focus is on creating personalized experiences, remembering regular customers'' preferences, and offering recommendations based on individual tastes. The atmosphere is designed to be conducive to both relaxation and productivity, with comfortable seating, ample lighting, and a consistent background music selection. Beyond the in-store experience, Starbucks actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. This might include sponsoring local arts initiatives, collaborating with nearby educational institutions, or supporting local charities. By actively participating in the local ecosystem, Starbucks aims to be more than just a coffee shop, but a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Starbucks at the Tata Tea Building envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam market. Future plans may include introducing new menu items that further incorporate local flavors and ingredients, hosting regular community events to foster stronger connections with local residents, and potentially expanding to new locations within Guwahati and other key cities in the region. The long-term goal is to solidify its position as the leading premium coffee destination in Assam, known for its exceptional coffee, welcoming atmosphere, and commitment to the local community. This involves continuously adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of the local market, embracing sustainable practices, and investing in the training and development of its employees. The vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional coffee but also contributes positively to the social and economic well-being of the Assam region.', 'Ground Floor, Tata Tea Building, GS Rd, opposite Aayakar Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:50:17.000Z'),
(1818, 'Yellow 29', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Yellow 29: Illuminating Opportunities on Rajgarh Road

Located at h/no, 25, Rajgarh Rd, opposite Icon Academy, Yellow 29 is emerging as a dynamic and innovative business hub in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a service provider, Yellow 29 aims to be a catalyst for growth, offering tailored solutions that address the specific needs and nuances of the local business environment. In a region characterized by its entrepreneurial spirit and rich cultural heritage, Yellow 29 is committed to fostering collaboration, driving innovation, and contributing to the overall economic prosperity of Assam. It stands out through its commitment to understanding the local market intimately and delivering services designed for maximum impact within that context.

<br> <br>

At its core, Yellow 29 provides a suite of services focused on business development and digital empowerment. These core offerings encompass several key areas:

*   **Digital Marketing Solutions:** Recognizing the increasing importance of online presence, Yellow 29 crafts customized digital marketing strategies for local businesses. This includes search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, content creation, and targeted advertising campaigns designed to reach local consumers and expand brand awareness. The emphasis is on leveraging digital platforms to connect businesses with their target audience in a meaningful and measurable way.

*   **Business Consulting & Strategy:** Yellow 29 offers expert consulting services to guide businesses through the challenges of startup, growth, and sustainability. This includes market research, competitive analysis, business plan development, and strategic planning sessions. The goal is to equip businesses with the knowledge and tools they need to make informed decisions and achieve their objectives. This service is particularly vital in Assam''s evolving market, where local knowledge and adaptability are crucial.

*   **Training and Skill Development:** Recognizing the skills gap within the region, Yellow 29 provides specialized training programs focused on digital literacy, entrepreneurship, and professional development. These programs are designed to empower individuals with the skills they need to succeed in the modern business world and contribute to the growth of the local economy. This aspect directly caters to the local need for skilled professionals.

The unique selling proposition of Yellow 29 lies in its hyper-local focus and its commitment to providing personalized services. The team understands the specific challenges and opportunities facing businesses in Assam and tailors its solutions accordingly. Unlike larger, more generic consulting firms, Yellow 29 offers a hands-on, collaborative approach, working closely with clients to achieve tangible results.

<br> <br>

Yellow 29 places immense value on building strong relationships with its clients and the local community. Customer service is not just a department; it''s a philosophy that permeates every aspect of the business. The team is dedicated to providing prompt, responsive, and personalized support to each client. They prioritize clear communication, transparency, and a genuine commitment to client success.

Beyond client interactions, Yellow 29 actively engages with the local community through sponsorships, workshops, and participation in local events. This commitment to social responsibility reflects the business''s belief in giving back to the community and contributing to its overall well-being. They understand the importance of building trust and fostering a sense of community, which is particularly crucial in the tightly knit society of Assam. Moreover, being situated opposite Icon Academy positions Yellow 29 as a potential resource for students and young entrepreneurs, further solidifying its community connection.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Yellow 29 envisions becoming the leading business solutions provider in Assam, recognized for its innovation, expertise, and commitment to local development. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include areas such as financial planning, legal consulting, and technology solutions. Future goals include establishing a strong online presence, developing strategic partnerships with other local businesses, and expanding its reach to other cities and towns in the region.

The long-term vision for Yellow 29 is to create a thriving ecosystem that supports entrepreneurship, fosters innovation, and drives economic growth in Assam. The business aims to be a catalyst for change, empowering local businesses to achieve their full potential and contribute to a brighter future for the region. The strategic location on Rajgarh Road, a developing commercial area, positions Yellow 29 for significant future growth. The team is dedicated to continually adapting and evolving to meet the changing needs of the local market and to remain at the forefront of business innovation.', 'h/no, 25, Rajgarh Rd, opposite Icon Academy', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:50:25.000Z'),
(1819, 'Yummy Belly', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Yummy Belly, a vibrant culinary destination nestled in the heart of Assam, offers a unique and authentic taste of the region alongside beloved international flavors. More than just a restaurant, Yummy Belly strives to be a community hub, a place where friends and families gather to celebrate life''s simple joys over delicious food and warm hospitality. Recognizing the growing demand for both traditional Assamese cuisine and globally-inspired dishes, Yummy Belly bridges the gap, offering a diverse menu that caters to a wide range of palates and preferences. The business seeks to elevate the local dining scene by providing high-quality ingredients, expertly prepared meals, and a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the rich cultural heritage of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of Yummy Belly''s offerings is a diverse menu meticulously crafted to showcase the best of both worlds: authentic Assamese delicacies and popular international dishes. Our Assamese selection features signature dishes like <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry), <i>Khar</i> (an alkaline dish made with vegetables), and <i>Pitha</i> (traditional rice cakes), prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. We take pride in presenting these dishes with an authentic touch, preserving traditional recipes and cooking methods passed down through generations. Complementing the regional cuisine is a selection of international favorites, ranging from flavorful Chinese stir-fries and comforting Italian pasta dishes to zesty Mexican tacos and satisfying American burgers. This fusion approach allows Yummy Belly to cater to a broad customer base, offering something for everyone, from those seeking a taste of home to adventurous eaters eager to explore new flavors. Our unique selling point lies not only in the variety of our menu but also in our commitment to quality. We carefully select our ingredients, prioritize hygiene in our kitchen, and employ experienced chefs who are passionate about creating memorable dining experiences. This dedication to excellence is what sets Yummy Belly apart and helps us meet the growing demand for quality dining options in the local market.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Yummy Belly. We believe that every interaction with our customers is an opportunity to build a lasting relationship. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a customer walks through the door, they are greeted with a warm smile and guided through the menu, offered recommendations, and catered to with genuine care. We understand that dining out is more than just about the food; it''s about creating a memorable experience. That''s why we strive to create a comfortable and inviting atmosphere, with cozy seating arrangements, pleasant decor, and soothing music. Beyond providing exceptional service within the restaurant, Yummy Belly actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with local artisans and suppliers, and initiatives to support local charities. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and are committed to being a responsible and engaged member of the local business landscape. We regularly host special events and promotions to attract new customers and reward loyal patrons, fostering a sense of community and belonging within our restaurant. Our goal is to make Yummy Belly more than just a place to eat; it''s a place to connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Yummy Belly envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, renowned for its authentic cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the community. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, exploring opportunities for catering and delivery services, and potentially opening additional locations to reach a wider audience. We also plan to invest in employee training and development to ensure that our staff continues to provide the highest level of service. A key component of our long-term vision is to establish Yummy Belly as a sustainable business that contributes positively to the local economy and environment. We are exploring ways to reduce our environmental footprint, such as sourcing more ingredients from local farmers, implementing waste reduction strategies, and promoting sustainable practices within our operations. Furthermore, we aim to develop strategic partnerships with other local businesses and organizations to promote tourism and cultural exchange in the region. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and community engagement, Yummy Belly is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a cherished culinary institution in Assam. We are committed to continuous improvement, listening to customer feedback, and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, ensuring that Yummy Belly remains a vibrant and relevant part of the local community for years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:50:33.000Z'),
(1820, 'FILO cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>FILO cafe: A Culinary Haven in the Heart of Assam</p>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant and culturally rich landscape of Assam, FILO cafe stands as a testament to the fusion of modern culinary artistry and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a cafe, FILO is a community hub, a space where the aroma of freshly brewed coffee blends seamlessly with the comforting scent of local spices, creating an inviting atmosphere for both residents and visitors alike. FILO cafe distinguishes itself through its commitment to sourcing local ingredients, promoting sustainable practices, and offering a unique gastronomic experience that celebrates the diverse flavors of the region. It aims to contribute meaningfully to the local economy while providing a contemporary and comfortable space for individuals to connect and unwind. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, FILO cafe offers a curated selection of beverages and food items designed to cater to a wide range of palates. Our coffee program is meticulously crafted, featuring ethically sourced beans roasted to perfection, ensuring a rich and flavorful cup every time. Beyond coffee, we offer a variety of teas, including locally sourced Assam tea, refreshing iced beverages, and artisanal smoothies. Our food menu is where FILO cafe truly shines. We specialize in modern interpretations of classic Assamese dishes, using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Imagine indulging in a flavorful <i>masor tenga</i> with a contemporary twist, or savoring a plate of <i>aloo pitika</i> prepared with farm-fresh potatoes and aromatic herbs. We also offer a range of continental dishes, from sandwiches and salads to pasta and pastries, ensuring there''s something for everyone. One of our unique selling points is our focus on creating vegetarian and vegan options that are not just an afterthought, but thoughtfully designed to be delicious and satisfying. Furthermore, FILO cafe regularly introduces seasonal specials that showcase the best of what local farmers have to offer, promoting sustainability and supporting the local agricultural community. By seamlessly blending traditional Assamese flavors with modern culinary techniques, FILO cafe addresses a growing demand for innovative and authentic dining experiences in the region. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>The FILO cafe experience is built on a foundation of exceptional customer service and genuine connection. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and passionate about our menu, providing personalized recommendations and catering to individual preferences. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, with comfortable seating arrangements, aesthetically pleasing décor that reflects the region''s artistic heritage, and soothing background music. FILO cafe also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. We host regular events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the works of regional talent, and workshops on topics ranging from coffee brewing to sustainable living. We also partner with local charities and organizations to support community development projects. By actively participating in the local cultural landscape, FILO cafe aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a vibrant and integral part of the community it serves. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, FILO cafe envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. We plan to expand our menu offerings to include more regional specialties and innovative dishes, while continuing to prioritize locally sourced ingredients. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the FILO cafe experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local farmers and artisans, creating a more sustainable and equitable supply chain. We also aim to enhance our online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenience. Long-term, FILO cafe aspires to be a model for sustainable business practices in the region, demonstrating that it is possible to be both profitable and socially responsible. Our ultimate goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy and community, while providing a unique and unforgettable culinary experience for our customers. </p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:55:09.000Z'),
(1821, 'Deja Brew Cafe And Bistro', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Deja Brew Cafe And Bistro: A Culinary Oasis on Zoo Road, Guwahati

Deja Brew Cafe And Bistro is a vibrant and welcoming establishment situated in a prime location on Zoo Road, LKRB Path, near Doordarshan Kendra in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a cafe, Deja Brew is a community hub, offering a sophisticated yet comfortable space where locals and visitors alike can enjoy expertly crafted beverages, delectable cuisine, and genuine hospitality. In the burgeoning culinary landscape of Guwahati, Deja Brew distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, its dedication to creating a unique dining experience, and its strong connection to the surrounding community. The cafe aims to be a preferred destination for those seeking a relaxing atmosphere, delicious food, and exceptional service in the heart of the city.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Deja Brew’s offering is a carefully curated menu of both classic and innovative beverages. From expertly pulled espresso drinks crafted with locally sourced coffee beans (where feasible) to refreshing iced teas and blended fruit smoothies, there’s something to satisfy every palate. The bistro aspect of Deja Brew elevates the dining experience beyond typical cafe fare. The menu features a selection of appetizers, salads, sandwiches, and entrees, crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients. Dishes reflect both local flavors and international influences, appealing to a diverse clientele. The cafe also offers a range of delectable desserts and pastries, perfect for an afternoon treat or a sweet ending to a satisfying meal. A key differentiator is the emphasis on using locally sourced produce and ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and businesses while ensuring the freshest possible flavors. The menu is thoughtfully designed to cater to various dietary preferences, including vegetarian and vegan options. The focus on quality ingredients, skilled preparation, and diverse menu offerings positions Deja Brew as a culinary destination rather than just a place to grab a quick coffee.

<br> <br>

Deja Brew understands that customer experience is paramount. The cafe strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel valued and comfortable. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, providing personalized service that exceeds expectations. From greeting customers with a smile to offering recommendations from the menu, the emphasis is on creating a positive and memorable experience. The cafe also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists'' exhibitions, organizing live music performances, and partnering with community organizations for fundraising events. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens Deja Brew’s position as a local gathering place. Furthermore, the cafe thoughtfully designs its space to create a relaxing and aesthetically pleasing environment, considering factors such as comfortable seating, ambient lighting, and tasteful decor. The goal is to create a space that is both functional and inviting, encouraging customers to linger and enjoy their time at Deja Brew.

<br> <br>

Deja Brew Cafe And Bistro envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Zoo Road community and a recognized culinary destination in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the menu with seasonal specials that showcase local ingredients and culinary traditions. The cafe also aims to enhance its online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, reaching a wider audience and providing convenient access to its offerings. There are also plans to potentially introduce catering services for local events and businesses, further expanding the cafe''s reach and revenue streams. Longer-term goals include exploring opportunities to open additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati, replicating the successful model of Deja Brew while maintaining the same commitment to quality, community engagement, and exceptional customer service. The overarching vision is to establish Deja Brew as a trusted and beloved brand, synonymous with quality, community, and culinary excellence within the vibrant landscape of Guwahati''s hospitality sector.', 'Zoo Road, LKRB Path, Zoo Rd, near Doordarshan kendra', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:55:15.000Z')
