(1822, 'Suto cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Suto Cafe: A Taste of Assam, A Hub for Community</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of '''', Suto Cafe offers a refreshing blend of traditional Assamese flavors and modern cafe culture. More than just a place to grab a quick bite or a cup of coffee, Suto Cafe aims to be a vibrant community hub, fostering connections and celebrating the rich cultural heritage of Assam through its unique culinary offerings and welcoming atmosphere. In a region where traditional tea stalls and restaurants dominate, Suto Cafe distinguishes itself by offering a refined cafe experience while staying true to its Assamese roots.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Suto Cafe''s offerings lies a curated selection of authentic Assamese dishes and beverages alongside familiar cafe staples. Our menu is carefully crafted to showcase the diverse culinary landscape of Assam, featuring dishes like *Pitha*, *Kharsoli*, and various rice-based preparations made with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We take pride in using traditional recipes passed down through generations, ensuring an authentic and flavorful experience for our patrons. Complementing these traditional dishes are innovative fusion creations that blend Assamese ingredients with contemporary culinary techniques, appealing to a wider range of palates. In addition to our food offerings, we boast an extensive beverage menu that includes specialty Assamese teas sourced directly from local tea gardens. From the robust *CTC* tea to the delicate *orthodox* varieties, our teas are brewed with precision and care, offering a truly immersive tea-drinking experience. Beyond tea, we offer a selection of freshly brewed coffee, refreshing juices, and traditional Assamese beverages like *Jalpan* (a light meal) and *Labra* (a mixed vegetable dish), catering to diverse tastes and preferences. A unique selling point is our commitment to ethical sourcing, working directly with local farmers and artisans to ensure the freshness and quality of our ingredients while supporting the local economy. We address a critical need in the local market by providing a comfortable and modern space where people can enjoy authentic Assamese cuisine in a relaxed and social setting, bridging the gap between traditional flavors and contemporary cafe culture.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Suto Cafe. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and welcomed. Our staff is trained not only in food preparation and service but also in providing friendly and personalized attention to each customer. We believe in building genuine connections with our patrons, taking the time to understand their preferences and ensuring their satisfaction. We regularly host community events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the talents of regional artisans, and workshops on Assamese culture and cuisine. These events serve to foster a sense of community and provide a platform for local talent to shine. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local schools, organizations, and charities, contributing to social causes and promoting community development. We actively solicit customer feedback through surveys and online platforms, using this input to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our commitment to providing exceptional customer service and fostering a strong connection with the local community sets us apart and positions us as more than just a cafe – we are a gathering place, a cultural hub, and a community partner.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Suto Cafe envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading purveyor of Assamese cuisine and cafe culture. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional delicacies and seasonal ingredients, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese culinary traditions. We plan to establish partnerships with more local farmers and artisans, strengthening our commitment to ethical sourcing and supporting the local economy. We aim to open additional locations in other parts of Assam and potentially beyond, bringing the unique flavors and experiences of Suto Cafe to a wider audience. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own line of packaged Assamese teas and food products, allowing customers to enjoy the taste of Suto Cafe at home. Long-term, our goal is to become a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional customer service, and a commitment to community engagement. We aspire to play a significant role in promoting Assamese culture and tourism, contributing to the economic and social development of the region. By staying true to our core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of our customers, we are confident that Suto Cafe will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the community for years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:55:21.000Z'),
(1823, 'The Backyard Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Backyard Cafe, nestled in the heart of [Replace with specific locality, e.g., Chandmari, Guwahati], Assam, is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it''s a community hub, a culinary sanctuary, and a celebration of Assam''s rich cultural heritage. In a region often characterized by traditional tea stalls and quick-service restaurants, The Backyard Cafe offers a unique and inviting alternative: a space where modern culinary techniques meet local flavors, served with a genuine warmth that reflects the hospitality of the Assamese people. We aim to be a destination that both locals and tourists seek out for a memorable experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, The Backyard Cafe is a full-service cafe and restaurant offering a diverse menu designed to appeal to a broad palate. Our signature offerings include specialty coffee beverages crafted from locally sourced beans, prepared with precision and passion by our trained baristas. Beyond coffee, our menu boasts a selection of freshly baked pastries, cakes, and desserts, all made in-house using high-quality ingredients. For those seeking heartier fare, we offer a range of savory dishes, blending continental cuisine with regional Assamese influences. Think wood-fired pizzas with locally sourced toppings, pasta dishes incorporating indigenous herbs and spices, and innovative interpretations of classic Assamese recipes. One of our unique selling points is our commitment to sustainability, prioritizing locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and artisans, and minimizing our environmental footprint. We also offer a curated selection of Assamese teas and traditional snacks, providing visitors with an authentic taste of the region. This focus on local sourcing and culinary innovation allows us to cater to the growing demand for authentic, locally relevant experiences, distinguishing us from generic food service establishments.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The Backyard Cafe prioritizes creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. Our customer service philosophy is rooted in the Assamese tradition of hospitality, emphasizing warmth, respect, and attentiveness. We strive to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere where customers feel comfortable lingering over a cup of coffee, enjoying a meal with friends, or simply unwinding after a long day. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and passionate about providing exceptional service. We actively engage with the local community through events and partnerships. We host live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional talent, and workshops on topics ranging from coffee brewing to traditional Assamese crafts. We also collaborate with local charities and organizations to support community initiatives, further strengthening our ties to the area. By actively engaging with and supporting the local community, we aim to build a loyal customer base and foster a sense of belonging.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Backyard Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam business landscape. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more innovative and locally inspired dishes, and enhancing our outdoor seating area to create an even more inviting and comfortable space for our customers. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and producers to offer a curated selection of Assamese handicrafts and souvenirs, further promoting the region''s rich cultural heritage. In the long term, we aspire to establish The Backyard Cafe as a recognizable and respected brand throughout Assam, with multiple locations offering the same high-quality food, exceptional service, and unwavering commitment to community engagement. We are also considering expanding our services to include catering for local events and offering online ordering and delivery options to reach a wider audience. Our ultimate goal is to be a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its innovative cuisine, sustainable practices, and unwavering commitment to providing a memorable and authentic experience for every guest, all while contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of the local community.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:55:28.000Z'),
(1824, 'The 11:11 cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The 11:11 Café: A Sanctuary of Flavors and Connection in the Heart of Assam</p>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant landscape of Assam, The 11:11 Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it’s a destination, a meeting point, and a celebration of local culture infused with a touch of contemporary flair. We strive to be a cornerstone of the community, offering a warm and inviting atmosphere where friends gather, ideas spark, and memories are made. While many cafes populate the urban landscape, The 11:11 Café differentiates itself by prioritizing locally sourced ingredients, supporting regional artisans, and cultivating a genuine connection with its patrons. Our commitment extends beyond simply serving excellent food and beverages; it encompasses a dedication to enriching the lives of those we serve and contributing positively to the local economy. We aim to offer a tranquil escape from the hustle and bustle, a space where individuals can recharge, connect, and appreciate the simple pleasures of life. The 11:11 Café seeks to redefine the café experience in Assam, creating a lasting impression that extends far beyond the last sip or bite.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>A Menu Crafted with Passion and Purpose: Core Services and Products</p>

<p>At the heart of The 11:11 Café lies a commitment to quality and authenticity. Our primary offering revolves around a carefully curated menu featuring specialty coffee, artisanal teas, delectable pastries, and a selection of light meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our coffee beans are sourced from regional plantations known for their exceptional quality, ensuring a rich and aromatic experience for coffee aficionados. We collaborate with local tea estates to offer a variety of Assam teas, showcasing the unique flavors and traditions of the region. Beyond the beverages, our pastries are freshly baked daily, using traditional recipes with a modern twist. Our light meals, ranging from sandwiches and salads to traditional Assamese snacks with a contemporary presentation, are designed to cater to diverse palates while remaining true to the flavors of the region. A key differentiator is our dedication to incorporating seasonal, locally sourced produce into our menu, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. This commitment to sustainability and regional sourcing sets us apart, allowing us to offer a unique and authentic culinary experience that resonates with the local community. We also offer options for dietary restrictions such as vegan, vegetarian, and gluten-free choices, broadening our appeal and catering to a diverse customer base. Our unique selling point is the ability to provide high-quality, locally-sourced food and beverages in a comfortable and aesthetically pleasing environment, creating a holistic experience that celebrates the essence of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Creating a Welcoming Embrace: Customer Experience and Community Engagement</p>

<p>The 11:11 Café is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience characterized by warmth, attentiveness, and genuine connection. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about our menu offerings and provide personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. We prioritize creating a welcoming atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We believe in going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction, whether it''s remembering a regular customer''s favorite order or offering assistance with local information. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to community engagement. We actively participate in local events, partner with local artisans to showcase their products, and host workshops and gatherings that promote cultural exchange and community building. The café''s décor incorporates elements of Assamese art and culture, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space. We host open mic nights featuring local musicians, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops on traditional Assamese crafts. This proactive approach to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our connection with the local population. We also utilize social media platforms to share local stories, promote community events, and solicit feedback from our customers, ensuring that we remain responsive to their needs and preferences. By actively engaging with the community and providing personalized service, we aim to create a loyal customer base and establish The 11:11 Café as a beloved community hub.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking Towards the Horizon: Future Vision and Growth Potential</p>

<p>The future of The 11:11 Café is bright, driven by a clear vision for sustainable growth and continued community engagement. Our long-term goal is to expand our presence within Assam, potentially opening additional locations while maintaining the core values and principles that have made us successful. We envision expanding our menu offerings to include more traditional Assamese dishes and beverages, further celebrating the culinary heritage of the region. We plan to establish stronger partnerships with local farmers and artisans, ensuring a consistent supply of high-quality, locally sourced ingredients and products. We aim to implement sustainable practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible business practices. This includes reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting local environmental initiatives. We also plan to explore opportunities to offer catering services for local events and corporate gatherings, further expanding our reach within the community. In addition, we are investigating the feasibility of offering online ordering and delivery services, catering to the growing demand for convenience. We recognize the importance of adapting to evolving consumer preferences and technological advancements. We envision The 11:11 Café becoming a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. By staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we are confident that The 11:11 Café will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the local community for years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T11:55:37.000Z'),
(1825, 'Kalita Spectrum', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Kalita Spectrum, situated conveniently at Bus Stop, GS Rd, stands as a dynamic and forward-thinking business dedicated to serving the unique needs of the Assam community. More than just a commercial entity, Kalita Spectrum aims to be a vital hub, fostering growth and connection through its specialized offerings. The business recognizes the particular demands and opportunities presented by the local landscape and tailors its services to address them directly, striving to be a valuable asset to both individual customers and the broader business ecosystem of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Kalita Spectrum provides a multifaceted suite of services designed to empower its clientele. The primary offerings revolve around two key areas: technology solutions and business consulting. The technology solutions arm focuses on providing customized software development, IT support, and digital marketing strategies tailored for local businesses. Recognizing that many businesses in the region may lack the resources or expertise to navigate the digital world effectively, Kalita Spectrum bridges that gap with accessible and impactful solutions. From creating user-friendly websites and e-commerce platforms to implementing robust cybersecurity measures, the technology solutions team ensures businesses can operate efficiently and securely in today''s digital age. The unique selling point here lies in the hyper-localization of these solutions, accounting for language preferences, local market trends, and specific regulatory requirements within Assam. <br> <br>

On the consulting side, Kalita Spectrum offers strategic business planning, financial advisory services, and market research aimed at fostering growth and sustainability for local enterprises. This includes assisting startups with developing viable business models, helping established companies optimize their operations, and guiding organizations through the complexities of obtaining funding and managing finances. Again, the focus is on providing bespoke advice that considers the unique economic and cultural context of Assam, differentiating it from generic consulting services. By combining technological prowess with sound business acumen, Kalita Spectrum equips businesses with the tools and knowledge they need to thrive in a competitive environment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Kalita Spectrum. The approach is built on fostering genuine relationships and understanding the individual needs of each client. Beyond simply delivering services, the team strives to create a supportive and collaborative environment where clients feel valued and empowered. This is achieved through proactive communication, personalized attention, and a commitment to exceeding expectations. Kalita Spectrum actively engages with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring initiatives, and offering educational workshops. This fosters a sense of trust and mutual respect, solidifying its position as a reliable partner within the community. Furthermore, the staff is recruited locally, enriching the connection to the culture, and ensuring greater empathy when addressing customer needs and requests. By understanding the unique challenges and opportunities facing the local population, Kalita Spectrum can offer solutions that are not only effective but also culturally sensitive.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Kalita Spectrum envisions itself as a catalyst for growth and innovation within the Assam business landscape. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include training programs focused on digital literacy and entrepreneurship, further empowering individuals and businesses to succeed in the modern economy. Furthermore, Kalita Spectrum aims to establish strategic partnerships with other organizations and institutions to create a collaborative ecosystem that fosters innovation and economic development. This might include collaborations with local universities to provide internship opportunities for students or partnerships with government agencies to support small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs). Long-term goals include establishing Kalita Spectrum as a recognized center of excellence for technology solutions and business consulting within the region, contributing to the creation of jobs, and driving sustainable economic growth for the benefit of the entire community. By remaining responsive to the evolving needs of the market and continuously investing in its people and capabilities, Kalita Spectrum is poised to achieve its vision of becoming a transformative force within the Assam business community.</p>', 'Bus Stop, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:00:09.000Z'),
(1826, 'The Throttle Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Throttle Cafe, strategically located near Hatigaon at Police Station, Hatigaon Bhetapara Rd, represents a vibrant and novel addition to the Assam culinary scene. More than just a place to grab a bite, it’s envisioned as a community hub where the love of good food meets a passion for all things automotive. The cafe distinguishes itself by creating a unique thematic dining experience, catering to a diverse clientele while seamlessly integrating into the local culture and economy of Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Throttle Cafe offers a curated menu that blends familiar comfort food with innovative culinary creations, appealing to both adventurous palates and those seeking classic flavors. The cafe''s signature offerings include gourmet burgers, artisanal pizzas with locally sourced ingredients, and a selection of globally-inspired dishes with a distinct Assamese twist. A diverse range of beverages, from freshly brewed coffee and exotic teas to refreshing mocktails and locally crafted juices, complement the food menu. Beyond the culinary offerings, The Throttle Cafe boasts a unique selling point: its automotive theme. The decor features carefully selected memorabilia, custom-built furniture incorporating automotive elements, and a generally immersive atmosphere for car and bike enthusiasts. This distinctive theme sets it apart from standard cafes in the area, attracting a niche market while remaining accessible and welcoming to a broader audience. Furthermore, the cafe recognizes the growing demand for healthier options, offering a selection of salads, vegetarian dishes, and gluten-free alternatives, addressing diverse dietary needs within the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Throttle Cafe prioritizes delivering an exceptional customer experience, placing a strong emphasis on personalized service and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, attentive to customer needs, and proactive in creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. The cafe aims to foster a sense of community by hosting regular events, such as live music performances by local artists, themed nights celebrating different cuisines, and gatherings for automotive enthusiasts. Feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continuously improve the customer experience. To further connect with the local community, The Throttle Cafe actively participates in local initiatives and collaborates with nearby businesses. This includes sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, supporting local artisans by showcasing their work within the cafe, and sponsoring community events. By integrating itself into the fabric of the Hatigaon neighborhood, The Throttle Cafe strives to become a beloved and integral part of the community''s social life.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Throttle Cafe envisions a significant potential for growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond. Future plans include introducing seasonal menu changes that capitalize on locally available produce, expanding the beverage offerings to include regional specialties, and developing a line of branded merchandise that captures the cafe''s unique automotive theme. Furthermore, the cafe is exploring opportunities to offer catering services for local events and corporate functions, leveraging its culinary expertise and distinctive branding. Long-term goals include establishing The Throttle Cafe as a recognized brand synonymous with quality food, exceptional service, and a unique thematic experience. This vision may involve opening additional locations in strategic areas within Assam and potentially expanding into other Northeast Indian states. The focus remains on maintaining the core values of community engagement, customer satisfaction, and culinary innovation, ensuring that The Throttle Cafe continues to be a vibrant and relevant player in the region''s growing hospitality sector.</p>', 'Police Station, Hatigaon Bhetapara Rd, near Hatigaon', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:00:16.000Z'),
(1827, 'Piquant', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Piquant, situated at House 189/2, Behind Tisa Medicos, Saikia Enclave, is rapidly establishing itself as a distinctive culinary and retail destination in the heart of Assam. More than just a shop or eatery, Piquant aims to be a vibrant hub where local flavors meet curated goods, offering a unique and memorable experience for residents and visitors alike. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning entrepreneurial spirit, Piquant seeks to contribute to the local economy by supporting local artisans and providing a platform for authentic Assamese products and culinary creations. Our focus on quality, authenticity, and community engagement sets us apart, making Piquant a welcome addition to the Saikia Enclave neighborhood and the broader Assam business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Piquant lies a dual offering: a carefully curated selection of artisanal products and a delectable range of locally inspired culinary treats. Our retail section showcases the talent and craftsmanship of local artisans, featuring handcrafted textiles, traditional Assamese crafts, organic teas, locally sourced spices, and unique gift items. We prioritize products that embody the region''s cultural heritage and are produced sustainably and ethically. The culinary arm of Piquant offers a modern twist on traditional Assamese cuisine. Our menu features reimagined classics using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, catering to both traditional palates and those seeking innovative flavors. Think flavorful jolpan with a contemporary presentation, aromatic masor tenga crafted with seasonal fish, and a variety of homemade sweets that celebrate the region''s rich culinary history. What truly sets Piquant apart is our commitment to providing a holistic experience. We don’t just sell products or serve food; we offer a story, a connection to the land, and a taste of Assam''s soul. This approach effectively addresses the local market''s desire for authentic experiences and high-quality, locally sourced goods and food.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Piquant. From the moment a customer steps through our doors, they are greeted with warm hospitality and personalized attention. Our staff is knowledgeable about our products and passionate about sharing the stories behind them. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting workshops featuring local artisans, organizing food festivals showcasing regional cuisine, and participating in local events. We believe in building strong relationships with our customers, treating them as neighbors and friends. This personalized approach extends to our online presence, where we actively engage with our followers on social media, responding promptly to inquiries and providing helpful information about our products and services. We regularly seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting their needs. Our dedication to exceptional customer service and community engagement has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish Piquant as a trusted and respected member of the Saikia Enclave community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Piquant envisions a future where it becomes a leading ambassador for Assamese culture and craftsmanship. Our long-term goal is to expand our reach, both within Assam and beyond, while remaining true to our core values of quality, authenticity, and community engagement. We plan to achieve this by expanding our retail offerings to include a wider range of artisanal products from across the region, further refining our culinary menu to showcase the diversity of Assamese cuisine, and developing strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We are also exploring opportunities to establish an online presence to reach a wider audience and facilitate the sale of our products to customers both nationally and internationally. Another key aspect of our future vision is to empower local artisans and entrepreneurs by providing them with training and resources to help them grow their businesses. We believe that by supporting the local economy and fostering a culture of innovation, we can contribute to the sustainable development of the region. Piquant aspires to become more than just a business; we strive to be a cultural institution, a community gathering place, and a catalyst for positive change in Assam.</p>', 'House 189/2, Behind Tisa Medicos, Saikia Enclave', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:00:22.000Z'),
(1828, 'The Rush', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Located in the vibrant heart of Guwahati at RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd, ''The Rush'' is quickly establishing itself as a dynamic and innovative hub catering to the evolving needs of the city''s increasingly discerning clientele. More than just a business, The Rush aims to be a destination, a space where convenience, quality, and community converge to create a unique and enriching experience. Situated in a prime location known for its bustling activity and accessibility, The Rush is poised to become a landmark establishment within the local Assam business landscape. We strive to differentiate ourselves by understanding the specific nuances of the regional market and tailoring our offerings to reflect the local culture and preferences. Our core philosophy revolves around providing exceptional value while fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment for all.</p> <br> <br>
<p>At its core, The Rush offers a curated selection of services and products designed to simplify and enhance daily life. While specific offerings might evolve with market trends and customer feedback, a key component of our current business model focuses on providing premium grab-and-go food options. This includes freshly prepared meals, artisanal snacks, and locally sourced beverages, catering to the fast-paced lifestyles of professionals, students, and residents in the area. We are committed to using high-quality ingredients, prioritizing local suppliers whenever possible to support the regional economy and ensure freshness. </p> <br> <br>
<p>Beyond food and beverage, The Rush features a carefully selected retail component offering items that complement our core offerings and reflect the lifestyle of our target demographic. This could include unique gifts, locally crafted goods, and essential everyday items, creating a convenient one-stop shop for busy individuals. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of speed, quality, and local relevance. We are not just another convenience store or café; we are a curated experience that caters to the specific needs and desires of the Guwahati community. By emphasizing local sourcing, sustainable practices, and a commitment to quality, we strive to build a brand that resonates with the values of our customers. We address the local market needs by providing convenient access to high-quality products and services that are tailored to the specific tastes and preferences of the Assamese community, offering alternatives to generic, mass-produced options.</p> <br> <br>
<p>The customer experience is paramount at The Rush. We believe that every interaction is an opportunity to build lasting relationships and create brand loyalty. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We aim to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We encourage feedback and actively seek ways to improve our offerings and enhance the overall experience. Beyond individual interactions, The Rush actively seeks to connect with the local community through various initiatives. This includes partnering with local artists and artisans to showcase their work, sponsoring local events, and supporting charitable causes that are important to the community. By actively engaging with the community, we aim to become an integral part of the fabric of Guwahati, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, The Rush envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing multiple locations throughout Guwahati and other key cities in Assam. We plan to continuously evolve our offerings to meet the changing needs of the market, exploring opportunities to introduce new products and services that align with our core values. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as implementing online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and personalized recommendations. We see opportunities to develop a strong online presence, reaching a wider audience and building a stronger brand identity. Ultimately, our vision is to become a leading lifestyle brand in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, convenience, and community. We are confident that by staying true to our core values and continuously adapting to the needs of our customers, The Rush can achieve its ambitious goals and make a positive impact on the local community.</p>', 'RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:00:29.000Z'),
(1829, 'Safarnama', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Safarnama, nestled within the vibrant Sikaria Compound on GS Rd, near Sohum Shoppe, is rapidly becoming a cornerstone of travel and exploration within the Assam landscape. More than just a travel agency, Safarnama aspires to be a curator of authentic experiences, connecting locals and tourists alike with the rich tapestry of culture, adventure, and natural beauty that Assam and the wider Northeast India region have to offer. We differentiate ourselves through a dedication to personalized service, a deep understanding of the local terrain and its nuances, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism practices.

<br> <br>

Our core business revolves around crafting unforgettable travel experiences. We offer a comprehensive suite of services, encompassing tour packages, customized itineraries, transportation arrangements, and accommodation bookings. Our tour packages are meticulously designed to cater to diverse interests, from wildlife enthusiasts eager to explore the Kaziranga National Park to spiritual seekers drawn to the ancient temples of Kamakhya and Hajo. For those seeking a more personalized adventure, our team of experienced travel consultants works closely with each client to create bespoke itineraries that align perfectly with their individual preferences, budget, and timeframe.

<br> <br>

A key differentiator for Safarnama is our deep-rooted local knowledge. Unlike larger, national travel agencies, we possess an intimate understanding of Assam’s hidden gems, off-the-beaten-path destinations, and unique cultural traditions. We partner with local guides, homestays, and artisans to ensure that our clients experience the authentic heart of the region. This local expertise also allows us to navigate logistical challenges with ease, ensuring seamless and stress-free travel for our clients. This knowledge extends to responsible tourism, ensuring our tours benefit local communities while minimizing environmental impact. We actively promote eco-friendly practices and support local businesses, fostering a sustainable tourism ecosystem.

<br> <br>

At Safarnama, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where clients feel valued and understood. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our team is dedicated to providing prompt, professional, and personalized assistance. We understand that travel planning can be daunting, and we are committed to guiding our clients through every step of the process, answering their questions, addressing their concerns, and ensuring that their travel experience exceeds their expectations. This commitment extends beyond the booking process; we maintain ongoing communication with our clients throughout their journey, providing support and assistance as needed.

<br> <br>

Our approach to connecting with the local community is multi-faceted. We actively participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the region''s cultural heritage and promoting tourism. We also partner with local organizations to support community development initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we aim to contribute to the region''s economic growth and cultural preservation. Furthermore, we tailor some of our tours specifically for local residents looking to explore other parts of Assam and Northeast India, providing affordable and accessible travel options for those within the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Safarnama envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to personalized service, authentic experiences, and sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and culinary experiences. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online booking platform and streamline our operations, making it easier for clients to plan and book their travel experiences.

<br> <br>

We are committed to building a team of highly skilled and passionate travel professionals who share our vision of providing exceptional customer service and promoting responsible tourism. We will continue to invest in training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry. We also aim to forge strategic partnerships with airlines, hotels, and other travel providers to offer our clients the best possible value and selection. Ultimately, Safarnama’s long-term goal is to create a positive impact on the region by promoting sustainable tourism, supporting local communities, and preserving Assam''s rich cultural heritage for generations to come.', 'Sikaria Compound, GS Rd, near Sohum Shoppe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:00:35.000Z'),
(1830, 'The Kaffeine Klub', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Kaffeine Klub, a vibrant and welcoming café nestled on Tripura Rd in the heart of Assam, is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a community hub, a meeting place, and a purveyor of exceptional coffee experiences. Strategically located on Tripura Rd, The Kaffeine Klub aims to be a defining element in the local business environment of Assam, offering a unique blend of tradition and modernity that resonates with the region''s diverse population.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The Kaffeine Klub offers a curated menu built around specialty coffee, sourced from both local Assam plantations and internationally acclaimed farms. We understand the importance of supporting local producers, and our selection of Assam coffee beans showcases the rich, distinctive flavors of the region. Beyond coffee, our menu features a selection of handcrafted beverages including teas, refreshing iced drinks, and unique seasonal creations. To complement our drinks, we offer a delicious array of freshly baked pastries, light meals, and locally inspired snacks, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our unique selling point lies in the seamless fusion of quality ingredients, expert preparation, and a commitment to providing a comfortable and inviting atmosphere. By emphasizing locally sourced Assam coffee and regional delicacies, The Kaffeine Klub caters to the growing demand for authentic, high-quality food and beverage experiences within the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At The Kaffeine Klub, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued. Our baristas are not only skilled coffee artisans but also friendly faces ready to engage with customers, offer recommendations, and create personalized experiences. We go beyond simply serving beverages; we aim to build relationships. Our commitment to excellent service extends to offering free Wi-Fi, comfortable seating arrangements suitable for both individual work and group gatherings, and a curated playlist of music that enhances the overall ambiance. The Kaffeine Klub actively connects with the local community by hosting events such as open mic nights featuring local musicians, art exhibitions showcasing regional artists, and collaborative workshops with local artisans. By fostering these connections, The Kaffeine Klub seeks to be an integral part of the local fabric, enriching the community and providing a space for creativity and collaboration.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Kaffeine Klub envisions itself as a thriving and expanding business within Assam and potentially beyond. Our future plans include developing a line of signature coffee blends and teas for retail sale, allowing customers to enjoy The Kaffeine Klub experience at home. We also plan to expand our food offerings to include more substantial meal options, catering to a wider range of dietary needs and preferences. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other key areas within Assam, bringing our unique blend of quality coffee, exceptional service, and community engagement to a broader audience. Long-term, our goal is to establish The Kaffeine Klub as a recognizable and respected brand synonymous with quality, community, and a celebration of Assam''s rich culinary heritage. We are committed to sustainable business practices and are actively seeking ways to reduce our environmental footprint and support local initiatives. The Kaffeine Klub''s vision is to not just serve coffee but to serve the community and contribute to the economic and cultural growth of Assam.</p>', 'Tripura Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:05:09.000Z'),
(1831, 'CAFE AS-01', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>CAFE AS-01: A Contemporary Coffee House Rooted in Assamese Hospitality</p>

<p>Nestled at 254, Rajgarh Rd, CAFE AS-01 offers a refreshing oasis in the bustling heart of the city. More than just a coffee shop, CAFE AS-01 is a community hub, a place where the aroma of freshly brewed coffee blends seamlessly with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. We aim to provide a unique and memorable experience, catering to the diverse needs of students, professionals, and residents alike, offering a space for relaxation, productivity, and connection. CAFE AS-01 distinguishes itself from conventional cafes by integrating locally sourced ingredients and traditional Assamese flavors into its menu, creating a distinct culinary identity that celebrates the region''s rich heritage. Our commitment extends beyond serving excellent coffee; we strive to cultivate a welcoming atmosphere and contribute positively to the local economy and cultural landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around high-quality specialty coffee, sourced from reputable growers and expertly prepared by skilled baristas. We offer a diverse range of coffee beverages, from classic espressos and lattes to innovative signature drinks that incorporate local spices and flavors. Beyond coffee, CAFE AS-01 boasts a curated menu of light meals and snacks, featuring both continental favorites and Assamese-inspired dishes. Think freshly baked pastries, flavorful sandwiches using locally baked bread, and traditional Assamese snacks like *pitha* with a modern twist. A selection of refreshing beverages, including locally sourced fruit juices and herbal teas, complements the food offerings. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We partner with local farmers and producers to ensure the freshness and quality of our ingredients, while simultaneously supporting the local economy. This commitment translates into a unique and authentic culinary experience that reflects the flavors of Assam. Furthermore, we offer free, reliable Wi-Fi and comfortable seating options, making CAFE AS-01 an ideal location for students to study, professionals to work remotely, or anyone seeking a peaceful retreat.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At CAFE AS-01, customer experience is paramount. We believe in providing personalized and attentive service that makes every customer feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and passionate about coffee, readily offering recommendations and answering questions. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and service. We aim to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and connected. We regularly host events, such as live music performances featuring local artists and coffee tasting workshops, to foster a sense of community and engagement. We also actively participate in local initiatives and support local charities, further demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the community. Furthermore, we prioritize cleanliness and hygiene, ensuring a safe and comfortable environment for our customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, CAFE AS-01 envisions becoming a leading coffee house in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, community, and Assamese culture. Our future plans include expanding our menu to offer a wider range of Assamese dishes and snacks, further showcasing the region''s culinary diversity. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and encourage repeat business. Exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their products in our cafe is also on the agenda. We believe this will further enhance the customer experience and support the local creative economy. Long-term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout the region, bringing the CAFE AS-01 experience to a wider audience. We remain committed to our core values of quality, community, and Assamese hospitality as we embark on this journey of growth. We strive to be more than just a coffee shop; we aim to be a vibrant and integral part of the Rajgarh Rd community and a destination that celebrates the best of Assam.</p>', '254, Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.348Z', '2025-12-07T12:05:15.000Z'),
(1832, 'La Monalisha Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>La Monalisha Cafe: A Culinary Oasis Opposite Rajiv Bhawan</p>

<p>La Monalisha Cafe, strategically located at ABC, opposite Rajiv Bhawan, is more than just a cafe; it''s a destination where the vibrant culture of Assam blends seamlessly with modern culinary trends. In a region known for its rich tea heritage and burgeoning cafe scene, La Monalisha distinguishes itself by offering a carefully curated menu, a welcoming ambiance, and a genuine commitment to providing a memorable experience for every guest. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local community, a place where individuals can connect, relax, and savor moments of respite amidst the bustling city life. Our commitment to quality ingredients and innovative flavors sets us apart, establishing La Monalisha as a significant and cherished presence in the Assam business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At La Monalisha Cafe, we pride ourselves on offering a diverse range of services and products designed to cater to the varied palates of our clientele. Our core offerings include a meticulously crafted coffee menu featuring locally sourced Assam tea and premium coffee beans, ensuring an authentic and flavorful experience. We also provide an array of freshly baked pastries, cakes, and desserts, prepared daily with the finest ingredients. Beyond beverages and baked goods, our menu extends to include light meals such as sandwiches, salads, and regional specialties, providing satisfying options for breakfast, lunch, and dinner. <br> <br> A unique selling point of La Monalisha Cafe is our focus on incorporating local Assamese flavors into our menu. We collaborate with local farmers and suppliers to source fresh, seasonal ingredients, ensuring that our dishes reflect the unique culinary heritage of the region. This commitment to local sourcing not only supports the local economy but also allows us to offer our customers a truly authentic taste of Assam. Moreover, we offer customized catering services for small gatherings and corporate events, bringing the La Monalisha experience to your doorstep. We understand the local market''s need for quality dining options that are both accessible and representative of the region''s culinary identity, and our services are designed to meet this demand effectively.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at La Monalisha Cafe. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. We believe in building genuine connections with our patrons, taking the time to understand their preferences and cater to their individual needs. This personalized approach fosters loyalty and encourages repeat business. <br> <br> What sets La Monalisha Cafe apart is our commitment to creating a sense of community. We regularly host events and workshops that celebrate local art, music, and culture, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a sense of belonging. We actively engage with the local community through social media and local partnerships, ensuring that we are not just a business but also a responsible and engaged member of the neighborhood. We strive to create a space where people can come together, share ideas, and celebrate the vibrant spirit of Assam. Our customer-centric approach and community engagement efforts are integral to our success and contribute to our standing as a beloved local establishment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>La Monalisha Cafe envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded community impact. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as a premier destination for both locals and tourists seeking an authentic and enriching culinary experience. We plan to expand our menu offerings to include more regional specialties and innovative fusion dishes, further showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of the city and the surrounding region, making the La Monalisha experience more accessible to a wider audience. <br> <br> Furthermore, we are committed to enhancing our online presence and offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenient dining options. We plan to invest in staff training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of culinary trends and customer service excellence. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers, further solidifying our commitment to sustainable sourcing and supporting the local economy. Our vision is to not only be a successful business but also a positive force for change in the community, promoting local culture, fostering economic growth, and providing a welcoming space for all.</p>', 'ABC, opposite Rajiv Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:05:21.000Z'),
(1833, 'BARISTA', 'Cafes', NULL, 'BARISTA, nestled conveniently on Zoo Rd, is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a vibrant hub bringing a sophisticated café culture to the heart of Assam. Recognizing a gap in the local market for expertly crafted coffee and a welcoming, globally-inspired atmosphere, BARISTA has quickly established itself as a premier destination for residents and visitors alike seeking a refined yet comfortable experience. More than simply selling coffee, BARISTA aims to cultivate a community centered around quality, connection, and a shared appreciation for the perfect cup. The strategic location on Zoo Rd, a bustling thoroughfare, ensures high visibility and accessibility, making BARISTA a convenient stop for those starting their day, taking a break, or meeting with friends and colleagues. BARISTA reflects the burgeoning economic dynamism of Assam, catering to an increasingly discerning clientele that values both quality and atmosphere.

<br> <br>

At its core, BARISTA offers a comprehensive range of coffee beverages, expertly prepared by skilled baristas trained in the art of espresso making. From classic espressos, cappuccinos, and lattes to innovative signature blends featuring locally sourced ingredients where possible, the menu caters to a diverse palate. Beyond coffee, BARISTA boasts a curated selection of teas, refreshing iced beverages, and decadent hot chocolates. Food offerings complement the beverage menu, including freshly baked pastries, savory sandwiches, and light meals perfect for breakfast, lunch, or a quick snack. A key differentiator for BARISTA is its commitment to quality ingredients. Coffee beans are carefully selected, ensuring a rich and flavorful brew. Milk is sourced from local dairies prioritizing freshness and supporting local agriculture. This dedication to quality extends to all ingredients used in the food menu, ensuring a consistently delicious and satisfying experience. This commitment to quality and freshness, paired with a varied menu, sets BARISTA apart from generic coffee chains and caters specifically to the growing demand for premium café experiences in the region.

<br> <br>

BARISTA prioritizes creating a welcoming and memorable customer experience. The café''s design incorporates elements of modern aesthetics with comfortable seating arrangements, fostering an atmosphere conducive to both relaxation and productivity. Friendly and attentive baristas are trained not just to prepare exceptional coffee but also to engage with customers, offering personalized recommendations and building relationships. Wi-Fi connectivity is readily available, making BARISTA an ideal workspace for freelancers and students. Community engagement is also paramount. BARISTA actively participates in local events and partners with nearby businesses to foster a sense of belonging. Regular promotions and special offers are designed to reward loyal customers and attract new ones. Furthermore, BARISTA aims to become a community gathering spot, hosting events such as live music performances or art exhibitions, thus further integrating itself into the social fabric of Zoo Rd and the surrounding area. BARISTA strives to be more than just a transaction; it strives to be a part of the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, BARISTA envisions becoming the leading independent café chain in Assam. Future plans include expanding its menu offerings to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal ingredients. Consideration is being given to introducing a loyalty program to further reward repeat customers. The potential for opening additional locations in other strategic areas within Assam is actively being explored, carefully selecting sites that align with the brand''s ethos and target market. A strong emphasis will continue to be placed on staff training and development, ensuring that BARISTA maintains its high standards of quality and customer service as it grows. Furthermore, BARISTA is committed to sustainable practices, exploring opportunities to reduce its environmental footprint and support local communities through fair trade partnerships and responsible sourcing. Ultimately, BARISTA aims to create a lasting legacy, not only as a successful business but also as a positive force within the Assam business landscape, contributing to the region''s vibrant culture and economic growth.', 'Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:05:28.000Z'),
(1834, 'Banksy Café', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Banksy Café: A Unique Culinary and Artistic Oasis on Hengrabari Road

Banksy Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it''s a vibrant hub designed to invigorate the senses and foster community engagement on Hengrabari Road, Guwahati. Nestled amidst the bustling activity of its location, the café distinguishes itself through a unique fusion of high-quality culinary offerings, a captivating artistic ambiance inspired by street art, and a commitment to providing exceptional customer experiences. In a city known for its rich culture and emerging café scene, Banksy Café aims to stand out by offering a distinctive and memorable destination that caters to both locals and visitors alike. It contributes to the growing Assam business landscape by providing a differentiated product, attracting a diverse customer base, and promoting local talent.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Banksy Café lies a curated menu of artisanal coffee, delectable pastries, and light meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The coffee program features carefully selected beans, expertly roasted to deliver rich, flavorful brews ranging from classic espresso-based drinks to innovative specialty creations. Patrons can indulge in a variety of sweet and savory treats, from freshly baked croissants and muffins to satisfying sandwiches and salads, perfect for a quick lunch or an afternoon snack. A key differentiator is the café''s commitment to incorporating Assam''s unique culinary heritage into its offerings. This could include using local teas, spices, or ingredients in signature dishes and beverages, providing a taste of the region''s distinct flavors. Banksy Café also offers a selection of refreshing beverages, including freshly squeezed juices, smoothies, and handcrafted iced teas, providing options for all tastes and preferences. Beyond just offering food and drinks, Banksy Café aims to be a lifestyle destination, providing a meeting place, a workspace, or a place for quiet reflection.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Banksy Café. The staff is trained to provide warm, friendly, and efficient service, creating a welcoming atmosphere for all visitors. The café''s design further enhances the customer experience. The interior décor is carefully curated to reflect the spirit of street art, featuring murals, graffiti-inspired artwork, and vibrant colors. This unique aesthetic provides a visually stimulating environment that encourages conversation and creativity. Banksy Café also understands the importance of connecting with the local community. The café regularly hosts events such as live music performances, art exhibitions featuring local artists, and workshops focused on coffee brewing, culinary arts, and creative expression. By actively engaging with the community, Banksy Café fosters a sense of belonging and becomes a valuable gathering place for residents and visitors alike. Wi-Fi is freely available, catering to professionals who need a space to work and students seeking a comfortable study environment.

<br> <br>

The vision for Banksy Café extends beyond its current location on Hengrabari Road. Future plans include expanding the menu to include more substantial meal options and evening offerings, such as wine and beer, creating a vibrant nightlife destination. There are also plans to partner with local farmers and suppliers to further enhance the café''s commitment to sourcing sustainable and ethical ingredients. Another significant goal is to establish Banksy Café as a platform for emerging artists and entrepreneurs in Assam. This could involve providing opportunities for local artists to showcase their work, hosting workshops and seminars to empower aspiring business owners, and collaborating with local businesses to promote their products and services. The long-term goal is to establish Banksy Café as a recognizable and respected brand throughout Guwahati and beyond, known for its commitment to quality, creativity, and community engagement. The ambition is to make Banksy Café a symbol of innovation and cultural vibrancy within the local business landscape, attracting tourists and locals alike to a unique space. The potential for franchise opportunities in other cities throughout Assam is also being explored, allowing the Banksy Café concept to reach a wider audience while maintaining its core values.', 'Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:05:34.000Z'),
(1835, 'The Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p><b>The Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge: A Haven of Refreshment and Relaxation in the Heart of Guwahati</b></p>
<br> <br>
The Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge, strategically located on GS Road, near the popular Silkalay Store, is rapidly becoming a cornerstone of the Guwahati social scene. More than just a cafe, The Cloud 9 is designed as an urban oasis, offering a meticulously curated experience that blends the comfort of a familiar cafe with the sophistication of a modern lounge. In a city known for its vibrant culture and growing cosmopolitan atmosphere, The Cloud 9 stands out by providing a versatile space that caters to diverse needs, from casual coffee meetings to celebratory gatherings. We''ve identified a growing demand in the Assam business landscape for spaces that offer a seamless transition between work and leisure, and The Cloud 9 is purpose-built to fill that void. Our ambition is to become synonymous with quality, comfort, and community in Guwahati, a place where memories are made and connections are fostered.
<br> <br>
Our core offerings are built around providing exceptional food and beverage options in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. At the heart of our cafe experience is our expertly brewed coffee, sourced from select growers and prepared by skilled baristas dedicated to crafting the perfect cup. Our menu extends beyond coffee, featuring a diverse range of teas, refreshing beverages, and delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. What truly distinguishes The Cloud 9 is our emphasis on using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. In the evenings, The Cloud 9 transforms into a lounge, offering a carefully curated selection of wines, beers, and cocktails. Our bartenders are adept at crafting both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks, ensuring there''s something to suit every palate. The ambiance is further enhanced by thoughtfully selected music and lighting, creating a sophisticated yet approachable atmosphere perfect for unwinding after a long day or socializing with friends and colleagues. We also offer complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for remote work or informal meetings.
<br> <br>
At The Cloud 9, exceptional customer service is paramount. Our team is carefully selected and trained to anticipate the needs of our guests, providing friendly, attentive, and personalized service that goes above and beyond expectations. We believe that genuine hospitality is the key to building lasting relationships with our customers. Beyond just serving food and drinks, we strive to create a welcoming environment where everyone feels valued and appreciated. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists and musicians, organizing themed events, and partnering with local businesses. This helps us foster a sense of community and establish The Cloud 9 as a hub for cultural exchange and social interaction. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to ensure we are continuously improving and adapting to their evolving needs. Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our high customer retention rate and positive word-of-mouth referrals. We want every guest who walks through our doors to leave with a positive experience and a desire to return.
<br> <br>
The Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge envisions becoming a recognized and respected brand throughout Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu to offer a wider range of culinary options, catering to diverse dietary preferences and incorporating seasonal ingredients. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local food artisans and craft breweries to further showcase the region''s unique offerings. We also plan to introduce loyalty programs and special promotions to reward our regular customers and attract new ones. In the long term, we envision expanding our presence to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam. We are committed to sustainable business practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the community. Our goal is to build a business that is not only profitable but also socially responsible and environmentally conscious. Ultimately, we aspire to create a lasting legacy, establishing The Cloud 9 as a place where people can come together to connect, relax, and create unforgettable memories. We believe that with our dedication to quality, customer service, and community engagement, The Cloud 9 is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and become a vital part of the Assam business landscape.
<br> <br>
We are also constantly adapting to new technologies to provide a better customer experience. Online ordering, reservation systems and streamlined payment options are all tools we are either currently using or actively exploring for implementation. This ensures we''re not only providing a great physical experience, but a convenient digital one as well.', 'GS Rd, near Silkalay Store', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:10:09.000Z'),
(1836, 'KC House', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>KC House: A Cornerstone of Commerce Near Kar Bhawan</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Nestled on the ground floor of Kay M Plaza, strategically located by the bustling Bus stop near Kar Bhawan, KC House is rapidly establishing itself as a vital commercial hub within the Assam business landscape. More than just a business establishment, KC House aims to be a dynamic platform that connects local talent, provides essential services, and contributes to the economic vitality of the area. Its prime location makes it easily accessible to a wide range of customers, from daily commuters to local residents and businesses, positioning it as a central point for commercial activity. The unique aspect of KC House lies in its dedication to providing a curated selection of services that cater specifically to the identified needs of the surrounding community, blending convenience with quality. This commitment sets KC House apart and makes it a significant contributor to the growth of local commerce in the vicinity of Kar Bhawan.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, KC House provides a suite of carefully selected services and products designed to address the immediate needs of the local market. One of its primary offerings is high-speed internet access and related digital services, catering to the growing demand for online connectivity among students, professionals, and businesses alike. This is particularly crucial given the increasing reliance on digital communication and online transactions in today''s world. Furthermore, KC House provides essential printing and photocopying services, catering to the document needs of individuals, students, and local businesses who require quick and reliable access to these facilities. Another significant aspect of the business is its curated selection of stationery and office supplies, fulfilling the requirements of nearby offices, educational institutions, and individuals who need essential supplies for their daily activities. The unique selling point of KC House lies in its commitment to providing high-quality services at competitive prices, coupled with unparalleled customer service and a deep understanding of the local market needs. This combination of factors makes it a preferred destination for customers seeking reliable and convenient solutions to their everyday requirements.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at KC House. From the moment a customer enters the premises, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and eager to assist customers with their needs. KC House aims to create a lasting impression by going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. Beyond providing excellent services, KC House is dedicated to building strong connections with the local community. It actively participates in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and camaraderie. This commitment to community engagement extends to supporting local businesses and organizations, creating a network of mutual support and collaboration. By prioritizing customer service and actively engaging with the community, KC House differentiates itself from its competitors and establishes itself as a trusted and valued member of the local business ecosystem. The goal is not just to provide services, but to build lasting relationships with customers and contribute to the overall well-being of the community near Kar Bhawan.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, KC House envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading commercial hub in the area. The business plans to expand its service offerings based on customer feedback and market analysis, potentially including value-added services. Furthermore, KC House aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, exploring options such as online ordering and digital payment solutions. A key long-term goal is to establish strategic partnerships with other local businesses and organizations, creating a synergistic network that benefits the entire community. The business also aspires to create employment opportunities for local residents, further contributing to the economic growth of the area. With a strong foundation built on customer satisfaction, community engagement, and a commitment to excellence, KC House is well-positioned for continued success and future growth in the vibrant business landscape near Kar Bhawan. The vision is to not just be a business, but to be a catalyst for positive change and economic development in the local area, serving as a beacon of opportunity and prosperity for the community.</p>', 'Ground floor, Kay M Plaza, Bus stop, near Kar Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:10:14.000Z'),
(1837, 'IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE: A Unique Fusion of Flavors Atop Pancham Tower</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Located on the 2nd floor of Pancham Tower, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE offers a distinctive dining experience that seamlessly blends the warmth of Irish hospitality with the vibrant culinary traditions of Assam. More than just a cafe, it''s a destination designed to be a hub for conversation, community, and culinary exploration. Nestled amidst the bustling cityscape, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE provides a welcoming oasis, offering both familiar comforts and exciting new tastes. The cafe aims to contribute to the local business landscape by creating a space that fosters connections and celebrates the rich cultural tapestry of the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE are its core offerings: a carefully curated menu featuring both traditional Irish dishes and locally inspired Assamese specialties. The menu caters to a diverse palate, offering options for breakfast, lunch, and dinner, as well as a selection of snacks and beverages throughout the day. Signature dishes include hearty Irish stews, freshly baked scones, and a range of Assamese delicacies such as <i>khar</i>, <i>masor tenga</i>, and other regional favorites, prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The cafe also boasts a selection of premium teas, including Assam''s famed black tea, alongside expertly crafted coffee drinks and refreshing beverages. A unique selling point is the cafe’s commitment to using authentic recipes and traditional cooking methods, ensuring that each dish delivers an unparalleled taste experience. This blend of international and local flavors caters directly to the diverse demographic of Assam, offering something for everyone and addressing the growing demand for diverse and authentic culinary experiences. The cafe’s commitment to quality and freshness is paramount, setting it apart from more generic offerings in the area.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The cafe''s ambiance is carefully designed to be both inviting and relaxing, with comfortable seating arrangements and a decor that reflects both Irish charm and Assamese artistry. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about providing personalized recommendations. Beyond simply serving food and drinks, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE aims to foster a sense of community. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, book readings, and themed culinary nights, are planned to engage with the local community and create a vibrant social atmosphere. The cafe actively seeks feedback from customers and uses it to continuously improve its offerings and service. Building strong relationships with local suppliers and producers is also a key element of the cafe''s approach, ensuring that the business contributes to the local economy and supports sustainable practices. The focus is on building lasting relationships with customers, making them feel valued and connected to the IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE envisions becoming a landmark destination in the local culinary scene. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and innovative dishes, further showcasing the best of both Irish and Assamese cuisine. The cafe also aims to develop a loyalty program to reward repeat customers and strengthen customer relationships. Potential expansion opportunities are being explored, with the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam. Furthermore, the cafe plans to invest in online ordering and delivery services to cater to a wider audience. A long-term goal is to establish IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. The business also aims to play a more active role in promoting local culture and tourism, potentially partnering with local artisans and tourism organizations. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE is poised for sustainable growth and a lasting impact on the Assam business landscape. The ultimate vision is to create a space that not only serves exceptional food and drinks but also contributes positively to the social and cultural fabric of the community.</p>', '2ND FLOOR, PANCHAM TOWER', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:10:20.000Z'),
(1838, 'Bark Bark Coffee - A Pet Friendly Dog Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Bark Bark Coffee: A Pet-Friendly Oasis on Rajgarh Road</p>

<p>Nestled on the bustling Rajgarh Road, Bark Bark Coffee is more than just a café; it''s a community hub where the love of coffee intertwines with the unwavering bond between humans and their canine companions. Serving as a unique haven in the Assam business landscape, we cater to a growing demographic of pet owners and coffee enthusiasts seeking a welcoming and inclusive space. Beyond providing a comfortable setting to enjoy expertly crafted beverages and delectable treats, Bark Bark Coffee fosters a sense of belonging for both people and their furry friends, addressing a significant demand for pet-friendly establishments within the region.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Our core offering revolves around a dual-pronged approach: high-quality coffee and a safe, stimulating environment for dogs. We meticulously source our coffee beans from reputable suppliers, ensuring a rich and flavorful experience for our patrons. Our menu features a diverse range of coffee preparations, from classic espressos and lattes to regionally inspired concoctions that incorporate local ingredients. Complementing our coffee selection are a variety of pastries, sandwiches, and light meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. </p>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly sets Bark Bark Coffee apart is our dedication to creating a pet-friendly atmosphere. We offer a designated dog-friendly zone, complete with comfortable seating, water bowls, and complimentary dog treats. Recognizing the importance of responsible pet ownership, we maintain strict hygiene standards and enforce guidelines to ensure the safety and well-being of all our patrons, both human and canine. Our space is thoughtfully designed to provide ample room for dogs to socialize and play, promoting a sense of community among pet owners. We also offer a curated selection of pet-related products, including durable toys, organic treats, and stylish accessories, catering to the needs of our four-legged customers. Furthermore, we host occasional dog-related events, such as adoption drives and training workshops, further solidifying our commitment to the local pet community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Bark Bark Coffee, customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly and efficient service, catering to the individual needs of each customer, whether they are seeking a quick caffeine fix or a leisurely afternoon with their furry friend. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. Beyond providing exceptional coffee and a pet-friendly space, we strive to build genuine connections with our community. We participate in local events, partner with animal shelters, and actively promote responsible pet ownership. By fostering a sense of community and contributing to the well-being of both humans and animals, we aim to be more than just a café; we aspire to be a positive force in the local Rajgarh Road area.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Bark Bark Coffee envisions becoming the leading pet-friendly destination in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu to offer a wider range of food and beverage options, including specialized items for dogs with dietary restrictions. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses to offer complementary services, such as grooming and dog walking. We aim to establish a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting responsible pet ownership through educational initiatives and partnerships with local animal welfare organizations. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to replicate the Bark Bark Coffee model in other locations throughout Assam, creating a network of pet-friendly spaces that celebrate the unique bond between humans and their canine companions while contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local communities we serve.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We are confident that Bark Bark Coffee''s unique concept, commitment to quality, and dedication to customer satisfaction will continue to resonate with the local community and establish us as a beloved and enduring presence on Rajgarh Road.</p>', 'Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:10:26.000Z'),
(1839, '45 Minutes Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, '45 Minutes Cafe: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati

Nestled on the ground floor of the iconic Punjab National Bank building, opposite All India Radio in Guwahati, 45 Minutes Cafe offers a refreshing culinary escape from the bustle of city life. More than just a cafe, it''s a meeting place, a quiet corner for contemplation, and a vibrant hub where the local Assamese community and visitors alike can connect over exceptional food and beverages. In a city known for its rich tea culture and burgeoning food scene, 45 Minutes Cafe distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, efficient service, and a thoughtfully curated menu that blends familiar favorites with innovative twists, establishing it as a significant and appreciated addition to Guwahati''s business landscape.

<br> <br>

At the heart of 45 Minutes Cafe lies a dedication to providing a diverse range of high-quality food and beverage options, all served with speed and efficiency. The cafe''s primary offering revolves around a thoughtfully designed menu featuring everything from freshly brewed coffees and expertly crafted teas to delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. Recognizing the local palate, the menu incorporates Assamese flavors and ingredients where appropriate, offering dishes that resonate with the community while also appealing to international tastes. A key differentiator is the cafe''s commitment to sourcing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and businesses while ensuring the highest quality for its customers. The “45 Minutes” promise reflects a commitment to serving customers quickly, making it an ideal spot for busy professionals, students, and anyone looking for a satisfying meal or beverage on a tight schedule. The cafe also boasts a range of grab-and-go options, catering to the fast-paced lifestyles of those working and commuting in the area. Further enhancing its appeal is the availability of free Wi-Fi, making it a convenient spot for remote work or casual browsing.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at 45 Minutes Cafe. The staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and efficient service, ensuring that every customer feels welcome and valued. The cafe''s ambiance is carefully cultivated to create a relaxing and inviting atmosphere, blending modern design elements with comfortable seating arrangements. The open layout fosters a sense of community, while strategically placed quiet corners provide privacy for those seeking a more secluded experience. 45 Minutes Cafe actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists and businesses, showcasing their work and products within the cafe space. Regular events, such as live music performances or art exhibitions, further enhance the cafe''s role as a community gathering place. Feedback is actively sought from customers through various channels, including online surveys and in-person interactions, allowing the cafe to continuously improve its offerings and better meet the needs of its clientele. This dedication to customer satisfaction and community engagement fosters loyalty and reinforces 45 Minutes Cafe''s position as a valued member of the Guwahati business ecosystem.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, 45 Minutes Cafe envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and exciting offerings, including seasonal specials that showcase the best of Assamese produce. Expansion within Guwahati is being considered, with potential locations identified in other high-traffic areas. Furthermore, the cafe is exploring opportunities to develop a strong online presence, including online ordering and delivery services, to cater to a wider audience. A longer-term goal is to establish 45 Minutes Cafe as a recognized brand, synonymous with quality, efficiency, and community engagement. This might involve franchising opportunities or expansion into other cities within the Northeast region. Sustainability is also a key focus, with plans to implement eco-friendly practices throughout the cafe''s operations, including reducing waste, using sustainable packaging, and supporting local environmental initiatives. By remaining committed to its core values of quality, service, and community, 45 Minutes Cafe aims to become a leading cafe brand in the region, contributing to the growth and vibrancy of Guwahati''s business and social landscape.', 'Ground Floor, Punjab national bank building, opp. All India radio', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:10:32.000Z'),
(1840, 'Garden Café', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Garden Café: A Tranquil Oasis in the Heart of Assam

Garden Café, nestled at the coordinates 5Q4M+F92, represents more than just a place to eat; it''s a community hub where the vibrant flavors of Assam blend harmoniously with a serene, garden-like atmosphere. In a region renowned for its rich tea culture and stunning landscapes, Garden Café offers a unique dining experience that caters to both locals and visitors seeking respite and refreshment. It aims to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, providing a relaxing ambiance and high-quality offerings that set it apart.

<br> <br>

Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Relaxation

At its heart, Garden Café offers a carefully curated menu featuring both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular cafe staples. Think of fragrant, locally sourced ingredients transformed into dishes that are both familiar and exciting. The menu extends beyond just food, encompassing a wide selection of beverages. From expertly brewed Assam tea, sourced directly from nearby tea gardens, to artisanal coffees and refreshing fruit smoothies, there''s something to satisfy every palate.

<br> <br>

What truly distinguishes Garden Café is its commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and producers but also ensures the highest quality and flavor in every dish. The café is also known for its unique offerings such as special tea blends inspired by the surrounding flora and handcrafted Assamese sweets rarely found elsewhere. We understand the local market''s desire for authenticity and quality, and strive to deliver on both fronts. Garden Cafe also offers catering services for small events, bringing its unique flavors and ambiance to private gatherings. We can design menus to perfectly fit the needs and theme of any gathering.

<br> <br>

Customer Experience: Cultivating Connections and Creating Memories

Garden Café is designed to be an inviting and welcoming space for all. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional customer service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. More than just taking orders, the team is empowered to engage with customers, share insights about the menu, and create a personalized experience. The garden setting itself contributes significantly to the overall customer experience, offering a tranquil escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. Customers can relax amidst lush greenery, enjoy the fresh air, and savor their meals in a peaceful environment.

<br> <br>

The café also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. It regularly hosts events such as live music performances by local artists, workshops on Assamese cooking and tea blending, and art exhibitions showcasing the talents of local creatives. By fostering a sense of community and supporting local talent, Garden Café aims to become a vital part of the social fabric of the area. In addition, Garden Café emphasizes sustainable practices. This includes minimizing waste, using eco-friendly packaging, and sourcing ingredients from producers who share a commitment to environmental responsibility.

<br> <br>

Future Vision: Blooming into a Regional Destination

Garden Café envisions a future where it becomes a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement in Assam. The long-term goal is to expand the business, potentially opening additional locations in other parts of the region, while maintaining the unique character and values that define the original café. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that the quality of the food, service, and ambiance remains consistently high.

<br> <br>

Future plans also include enhancing the menu with new and innovative dishes that showcase the diversity of Assamese cuisine. There are plans to incorporate more traditional recipes, explore fusion cuisine, and create seasonal menus that take advantage of the region''s abundant produce. Additionally, Garden Café aims to further develop its online presence, offering online ordering, delivery services, and engaging content that promotes the café and its values. This will help to reach a wider audience and build brand awareness. We will develop a robust social media strategy, and email marketing program to engage current and potential clients with news, promotions, and events.

<br> <br>

Ultimately, Garden Café aspires to be more than just a successful business; it aims to be a force for good in the local community. By supporting local farmers, promoting Assamese culture, and creating a welcoming space for all, Garden Café hopes to contribute to the economic and social well-being of the region. The vision is to bloom into a regional destination, drawing visitors from far and wide who seek an authentic and enriching experience in the heart of Assam.', '5Q4M+F92', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:15:09.000Z'),
(1841, 'D''Kaffeto', 'Cafes', NULL, '<article>
<h1>D''Kaffeto: A Culinary Oasis on Tayabulla Road</h1>

<p>D''Kaffeto, nestled at 53, Tayabulla Rd, is more than just a cafe; it''s a vibrant hub contributing to the evolving culinary scene of Assam. We offer a unique blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern culinary techniques, creating a welcoming space for locals and visitors alike. Positioned strategically on Tayabulla Road, D''Kaffeto aims to be a preferred destination for those seeking a relaxing atmosphere, quality food, and exceptional coffee, all while embracing the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Our Core Offerings: A Symphony of Flavors</h2>

<p>At the heart of D''Kaffeto lies a commitment to providing high-quality food and beverages that cater to diverse palates. Our menu features a curated selection of dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese delicacies prepared with locally sourced ingredients to popular continental favorites. We pride ourselves on using fresh, seasonal produce to ensure optimal flavor and nutritional value. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Coffee, naturally, is a cornerstone of our business. We serve expertly crafted coffee beverages using premium Arabica beans, sourced from reputable regional growers when available. From classic espressos and lattes to unique signature blends infused with local spices, our coffee menu is designed to tantalize the taste buds of even the most discerning coffee connoisseur. Beyond coffee, we offer a wide array of refreshing beverages including handcrafted teas, juices, and smoothies, perfect for the Assam climate. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling proposition stems from our dedication to creating an authentic and memorable dining experience. We strive to elevate the traditional cafe experience by combining exceptional food and drink with a warm and inviting ambiance. Further, whenever possible, we highlight the origin and stories behind our ingredients, connecting customers with the local farmers and producers who contribute to our culinary creations. This transparent approach builds trust and fosters a deeper appreciation for the food we serve. D''Kaffeto addresses the growing demand for quality dining options within the local market, offering a sophisticated yet approachable alternative to conventional eateries.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Community, One Cup at a Time</h2>

<p>At D''Kaffeto, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our patrons by providing attentive and personalized service. Our staff is carefully trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and eager to assist customers with their selections. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and valued. </p> <br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists and musicians, participating in community events, and supporting local charities. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, fostering a sense of mutual respect and collaboration. We are committed to incorporating feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and enhance the overall dining experience. Our focus extends beyond simply serving food; it is about cultivating a vibrant community space where people can connect, relax, and enjoy the best that Assam has to offer.</p> <br> <br>

<h2>Looking Ahead: A Vision for Growth and Sustainability</h2>

<p>D''Kaffeto envisions a future where it remains a beloved landmark on Tayabulla Road and a significant contributor to the local economy. We plan to expand our menu, introducing new and innovative dishes that showcase the culinary diversity of Assam and beyond. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to further strengthen our commitment to sourcing sustainable and ethically produced ingredients.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goals include expanding our operations to other strategic locations within Assam, while maintaining the same high standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with the D''Kaffeto brand. We are also exploring opportunities to develop a line of packaged food products featuring our signature recipes, allowing customers to enjoy the D''Kaffeto experience in the comfort of their own homes. Ultimately, D''Kaffeto aims to be more than just a cafe; it aspires to be a symbol of culinary excellence and community spirit, contributing to the vibrancy and prosperity of Assam for generations to come. We are dedicated to fostering a sustainable business model that benefits both our customers and the local community, ensuring a bright and delicious future for all.</p>
</article>', '53, Tayabulla Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:15:17.000Z'),
(1842, 'Leaf & Bean', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Leaf & Bean, nestled in the heart of Assam at 4QRW+Q82, is more than just a purveyor of fine teas and coffees; it''s an experience. We are dedicated to showcasing the rich agricultural heritage of the region, offering a curated selection of locally sourced Assam teas and freshly roasted coffees alongside complementary artisanal goods. In a market increasingly dominated by mass-produced beverages, Leaf & Bean stands out by prioritizing quality, authenticity, and a deep connection to the local community. Our commitment to sustainable practices and fair trade principles further distinguishes us, ensuring that every cup supports both the environment and the livelihoods of local farmers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core offering centers around two pillars: premium Assam teas and freshly roasted specialty coffees. We source our tea leaves directly from select gardens known for their exceptional quality and adherence to traditional cultivation methods. This allows us to offer a diverse range of black, green, and white teas, each with its unique flavor profile reflecting the terroir of Assam. Our coffee beans, while sourced from various reputable origins to provide a breadth of flavor experiences, are roasted in-house using state-of-the-art equipment. This ensures optimal freshness and allows us to meticulously control the roasting process, maximizing the inherent characteristics of each bean. Beyond beverages, we also offer a selection of locally baked goods, artisanal honey, and handmade crafts that complement our drinks and provide a platform for other local artisans. Our unique selling point lies in our unwavering commitment to quality and traceability, allowing customers to understand the origins of their tea and coffee, and appreciate the artistry involved in their creation. This focus on local sourcing directly addresses the growing demand for authentic and sustainable products in the Assam market, supporting local economies and promoting regional specialties.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Leaf & Bean, customer service is not merely a transaction; it''s about building relationships and creating a welcoming atmosphere. Our team is trained to be knowledgeable about our products, offering personalized recommendations and sharing the stories behind each tea and coffee. We believe in creating a space where customers feel comfortable exploring new flavors and learning about the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Our cafe is designed to be a community hub, hosting regular events such as tea tasting workshops, coffee brewing demonstrations, and art exhibitions featuring local talent. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, charitable organizations, and farmers'' cooperatives. This commitment to social responsibility extends beyond our immediate community, as we actively promote sustainable farming practices and fair trade principles. By fostering a sense of belonging and promoting local culture, we aim to be more than just a cafe; we strive to be a positive force in the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Leaf & Bean envisions becoming a leading destination for premium Assam teas and specialty coffees in the region, recognized for our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our online presence to reach a wider customer base, offering nationwide shipping and online tea and coffee subscriptions. We also plan to introduce a line of Leaf & Bean branded products, including tea infusers, coffee brewing equipment, and gift sets, further enhancing our brand recognition and expanding our revenue streams. A key element of our long-term vision is to establish direct trade relationships with more local tea gardens and coffee farmers, ensuring fair prices and promoting sustainable agricultural practices. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in strategic locations throughout Assam, bringing the Leaf & Bean experience to a broader audience. Ultimately, our goal is to showcase the unique flavors and cultural heritage of Assam to the world, while empowering local communities and promoting sustainable development. We see immense potential for growth in the Assam market, driven by increasing consumer awareness of quality and sustainability, and we are confident that Leaf & Bean is well-positioned to capitalize on these trends.</p>', '4QRW+Q82', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:15:23.000Z'),
(1843, 'Taobao', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Taobao, located on the 4th Floor of Aurus Mall, GS Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a vibrant hub for curated lifestyle products, fashion, and unique artisanal goods, offering a compelling blend of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary design. More than just a retail space, Taobao strives to be a destination where local artistry is celebrated, and customers can discover distinctive pieces that reflect their individual style and support local enterprise. Its presence within the prominent Aurus Mall allows Taobao to access a broad customer base and contribute significantly to the evolving retail landscape of Assam. Taobao aims to provide a dynamic and inspiring shopping experience, differentiating itself from mainstream retailers through its dedication to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. </p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Taobao offers a diverse range of products designed to cater to the discerning tastes of the local market. The primary offerings include: a carefully curated selection of apparel from both established and emerging designers, showcasing contemporary trends alongside traditional Assamese textiles; a collection of handcrafted artisanal goods, encompassing ceramics, woodwork, and other unique home décor items; and a range of fashion accessories, from jewelry and bags to scarves and belts, sourced from local artisans and regional suppliers. The unique selling point lies in Taobao''s commitment to sourcing high-quality, often locally-made, products that are not readily available elsewhere. This deliberate focus on supporting local artisans not only fosters regional economic growth but also provides customers with access to truly unique and authentic items. By understanding the local market''s appreciation for craftsmanship and quality, Taobao successfully bridges the gap between traditional artistry and contemporary lifestyle needs. For example, handwoven Eri silk shawls, sourced directly from local weavers, are presented alongside modern, minimalist jewelry designs, appealing to a broad spectrum of customers with varying preferences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Taobao prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience, recognizing that building lasting relationships is crucial for long-term success. The store''s ambiance is designed to be welcoming and inviting, with thoughtfully curated displays and attentive staff who are passionate about the products they sell. Customer service goes beyond simple transactions; the team at Taobao strives to provide personalized recommendations, style advice, and detailed information about the origin and craftsmanship of each item. This commitment to transparency and knowledge empowers customers to make informed purchasing decisions and fosters a deeper appreciation for the artistry behind the products. Regular workshops and events, showcasing local artisans and their crafts, further enhance the customer experience and strengthen Taobao''s connection with the local community. These events provide opportunities for customers to meet the creators behind the products, learn about traditional techniques, and engage in hands-on activities, fostering a sense of community and shared appreciation for Assamese culture. Taobao actively seeks feedback from its customers, continuously refining its product offerings and services to better meet their needs and expectations. This customer-centric approach differentiates Taobao from larger retail chains and establishes it as a trusted destination for unique and high-quality products.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Taobao envisions significant growth potential and has ambitious plans for the future. The immediate focus is on expanding the product range to include additional categories, such as handcrafted furniture and sustainable home goods, while maintaining the commitment to quality and local sourcing. Exploring opportunities to partner with more artisans from across the Northeast region is also a key priority, further strengthening Taobao''s position as a champion of regional craftsmanship. In the long term, Taobao aims to establish a stronger online presence, enabling it to reach a wider audience beyond the local area. This includes developing an e-commerce platform that showcases the diverse range of products and provides detailed information about the artisans and their stories. Furthermore, Taobao plans to explore opportunities to collaborate with other businesses and organizations to promote sustainable practices and support local economic development. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Taobao is poised to become a leading destination for curated lifestyle products and a significant contributor to the cultural and economic vibrancy of Assam. Ultimately, Taobao''s long-term goal is to create a lasting legacy of supporting local artistry and providing customers with access to unique and high-quality products that reflect the rich heritage of the region.</p>', '4th Floor, Aurus Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:15:30.000Z'),
(1844, 'The Deck Cafe By Mayflower', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Deck Cafe By Mayflower, strategically located on MLN Road, offers a refreshing oasis in the bustling heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, it''s a carefully curated experience designed to blend the relaxed atmosphere of a deck with the rich culinary heritage of the region. We aim to be a vital hub for both the local community and visitors, offering a welcoming space for relaxation, connection, and the enjoyment of high-quality food and beverages. In a market increasingly seeking authentic and personalized experiences, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower distinguishes itself by providing a unique setting and a commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We strive to contribute positively to the local business ecosystem by fostering relationships with local farmers and artisans, strengthening our community ties, and offering a distinctive alternative to standard cafe fare.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower offers a diverse menu of freshly prepared food and beverages. Our selection ranges from light bites and healthy salads to more substantial meals, catering to a variety of palates and dietary preferences. A key differentiator lies in our commitment to showcasing Assam''s rich culinary traditions. We incorporate locally sourced tea, spices, and produce into our dishes, creating unique and flavorful options that reflect the region’s identity. Alongside classic cafe staples like expertly brewed coffee and refreshing iced beverages, we feature regional specialties and innovative fusion dishes that appeal to both adventurous foodies and those seeking familiar comforts. Our outdoor seating area, designed to resemble a relaxed deck, provides a unique and inviting ambiance that sets us apart from typical indoor cafes. This allows customers to enjoy the pleasant Assam weather while savoring their meals and drinks. By prioritizing quality ingredients, diverse menu options, and a unique atmosphere, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower effectively addresses the local market''s demand for distinctive dining experiences and a comfortable social gathering place.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Deck Cafe By Mayflower. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each visit is memorable. We actively solicit customer feedback and use it to continually improve our offerings and service standards. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, we regularly host events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops related to food, culture, and sustainability. These events not only provide entertainment but also create opportunities for people to connect and build relationships within the community. We also actively participate in local initiatives and collaborate with other businesses to support community development. By fostering a strong sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower aims to be more than just a cafe; we aspire to be a beloved gathering place that contributes positively to the social fabric of MLN Road and beyond.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower envisions continued growth and expansion while maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement. We plan to introduce new menu items and seasonal specials that further showcase the region''s culinary diversity. We are exploring opportunities to expand our catering services to meet the growing demand for high-quality food at local events and gatherings. Another key focus is on enhancing our sustainability practices by reducing waste, sourcing more ingredients locally, and implementing eco-friendly operational procedures. We also aim to strengthen our online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms to reach a wider audience. Long-term, we aspire to establish The Deck Cafe By Mayflower as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, community, and the authentic flavors of Assam. This may involve opening additional locations or exploring franchising opportunities, always with the goal of maintaining our core values and providing exceptional experiences to our customers and contributing positively to the local economy. We believe that by staying true to our vision and continuously innovating, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower has the potential to become a thriving and enduring business that enriches the lives of the people we serve.</p>', 'MLN Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:15:36.000Z'),
(1845, 'Bagan : Patio Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Bagan : Patio Cafe is a distinctive culinary and social destination situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically at The Greenwood, Bhabendra Nath Sakia Road, Beltola - Basistha Rd. More than just a cafe, Bagan offers a carefully curated experience blending the warmth of Assamese hospitality with the vibrant energy of a modern patio setting. It distinguishes itself in the local business landscape by providing a relaxed yet refined atmosphere, catering to diverse needs ranging from casual meetups to more formal gatherings. The strategic location provides convenient access for residents and visitors alike, establishing Bagan as a prominent landmark in the Beltola-Basistha area.

<br> <br>

Bagan : Patio Cafe’s core offerings revolve around providing a delectable array of food and beverage options within a welcoming ambiance. Our primary services encompass a wide-ranging menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and popular continental dishes, meticulously prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From flavorful Assamese thalis showcasing regional specialties to expertly brewed coffee and refreshing beverages, Bagan caters to a variety of palates. Beyond the food, Bagan offers a comfortable and aesthetically pleasing environment for customers to relax, socialize, or work remotely. The patio setting provides a unique open-air experience, setting it apart from typical enclosed cafes. A crucial selling point is the cafe''s commitment to quality – not just in the ingredients and preparation of its menu items, but also in the overall ambiance and service. The offerings directly address the local market''s need for a high-quality dining and social experience in a comfortable and accessible setting. We understand the community''s desire for a space that reflects both tradition and modernity.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Bagan : Patio Cafe. The approach to service is centered on creating a welcoming and personalized environment for each guest. Staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every customer feels valued and well-cared for. Bagan strives to foster a sense of community by hosting occasional events, showcasing local artists, and partnering with nearby organizations. What truly makes Bagan stand out is its genuine connection with the local community. The cafe actively engages with local suppliers, supporting their businesses and incorporating their products into the menu. It serves as a gathering place for local residents, students, and professionals, creating a sense of belonging and fostering social interaction. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the offerings and overall experience. The goal is not just to provide food and beverages, but to create memorable moments and build lasting relationships with the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Bagan : Patio Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion while staying true to its core values of quality, community, and customer satisfaction. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more seasonal and regional specialties, enhancing the patio space with additional features and amenities, and exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans and businesses on a larger scale. The long-term goals involve establishing Bagan as a premier culinary and social destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and strong community ties. The business recognizes the potential for scaling its operations, perhaps through opening additional locations or developing a catering service, while maintaining the same high standards of quality and customer focus that define the Bagan brand. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the local market, Bagan : Patio Cafe is poised to become an enduring success story in the Assamese business landscape.', 'The Greenwood, Bhabendra Nath Sakia Road, Beltola - Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:20:08.000Z'),
(1846, 'TeaKingdom', 'Cafes', NULL, '<article>
<h1>TeaKingdom: A Taste of Assam''s Finest</h1>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam at 5QCG+QVW, Uday Path, TeaKingdom isn''t just a tea shop; it''s an experience, a celebration of Assam''s rich tea heritage, and a vibrant hub for the local community. More than just a beverage provider, TeaKingdom aims to be a cultural touchstone, offering both traditional and innovative tea experiences that cater to diverse palates while staying true to the essence of Assam''s world-renowned tea. In a region steeped in tea culture, TeaKingdom distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, its innovative product offerings, and its deep connection to the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<section>
<h2>Core Services and Products: Beyond the Cup</h2>

<p>At its core, TeaKingdom offers a wide array of premium Assam teas, sourced directly from local gardens known for their commitment to sustainable practices and exceptional flavor profiles. From robust and malty CTC teas perfect for a morning boost to delicate and aromatic Orthodox teas ideal for afternoon relaxation, TeaKingdom caters to every tea lover''s preference. We go beyond the traditional offerings with our signature blends, crafted in-house to capture the unique flavors of the region. These innovative blends often incorporate local spices, fruits, and herbs, creating a truly unique and memorable tea experience. <br> <br>Beyond the tea itself, TeaKingdom offers a curated selection of teaware, including traditional Assamese bamboo cups and modern ceramic designs. This allows customers to not only enjoy our teas but also elevate their tea-drinking ritual. To complement our tea offerings, we also provide a selection of locally sourced snacks and pastries, designed to perfectly pair with our various tea blends. Our focus on local sourcing ensures the freshness and quality of our products, while also supporting other businesses in the region. <br> <br>Our unique selling point lies in our ability to blend tradition with innovation. We honor the heritage of Assam tea while simultaneously introducing new and exciting flavors and experiences. This approach resonates with both locals and tourists alike, making TeaKingdom a destination for those seeking an authentic and memorable taste of Assam. We address the local market needs by providing a central location where people can purchase high-quality tea, learn about its production, and connect with other tea enthusiasts.</p>
</section>

<br> <br>

<section>
<h2>Customer Experience: Building Community One Cup at a Time</h2>

<p>At TeaKingdom, customer service isn''t just a department; it''s a philosophy. Every interaction is an opportunity to build relationships and create a welcoming and memorable experience. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our teas, offering personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. We encourage customers to sample different blends and learn about the origin and production of each tea. This educational approach fosters a deeper appreciation for Assam tea and empowers customers to make informed choices. <br> <br>What truly sets TeaKingdom apart is our commitment to connecting with the local community. We regularly host tea tasting events, workshops, and cultural performances that celebrate the traditions of Assam. These events provide a platform for local artisans and performers to showcase their talents, while also creating a sense of community among our customers. We also partner with local schools and organizations to promote tea education and awareness among younger generations. By actively engaging with the community, TeaKingdom has become more than just a business; it''s a gathering place, a cultural center, and a source of local pride. We strive to create a warm, inviting atmosphere where everyone feels welcome, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>
</section>

<br> <br>

<section>
<h2>Future Vision: Cultivating Growth and Innovation</h2>

<p>Looking ahead, TeaKingdom envisions expanding its reach while staying true to its core values. One key area of focus is expanding our online presence to cater to a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. This will involve developing a user-friendly e-commerce platform and implementing effective marketing strategies to reach new customers. We also plan to explore opportunities for franchising, allowing us to bring the TeaKingdom experience to other parts of Assam and beyond, while maintaining our commitment to quality and local sourcing. <br> <br>Innovation will continue to be a driving force behind our growth. We plan to invest in research and development to create new and exciting tea blends, utilizing local ingredients and exploring new brewing techniques. We also intend to expand our product line to include tea-infused food items and other tea-related products, further enhancing the TeaKingdom experience. <br> <br>Our long-term goal is to establish TeaKingdom as a leading brand in the Assam tea industry, recognized for its quality, innovation, and commitment to the local community. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously seeking new ways to enhance the customer experience, we can achieve sustainable growth and make a positive impact on the region''s tea culture. We aim to not only sell tea but to also preserve and promote the rich heritage of Assam tea for generations to come, solidifying our position as a cultural ambassador of the region.</p>
</section>
</article>', '5QCG+QVW, Uday Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:20:15.000Z'),
(1847, 'MUNCH POINT CAFE', 'Cafes', NULL, 'MUNCH POINT CAFE: A Culinary Oasis in Lakhimi Nagar

MUNCH POINT CAFE, situated at the convenient address of 10, Lakhimi Nagar Rd, stands as a vibrant and welcoming haven for food enthusiasts in the heart of Assam. More than just a café, MUNCH POINT aspires to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can gather, connect, and enjoy a delightful culinary experience. Recognizing the growing demand for high-quality, diverse food options within a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, MUNCH POINT CAFE fills a unique niche in the local business landscape by blending traditional Assam flavors with contemporary café fare. We strive to offer a refreshing alternative to the usual dining experiences, catering to a broad spectrum of tastes and preferences while embracing the rich culinary heritage of the region.

<br> <br>

At the heart of MUNCH POINT CAFE lies a commitment to providing exceptional food and beverage offerings. Our core menu revolves around a diverse selection of freshly prepared items, ranging from aromatic Assamese tea blends and robust coffee variations to delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. We pride ourselves on sourcing locally grown ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness, supporting local farmers, and minimizing our environmental impact. This dedication to local sourcing not only enhances the flavor profiles of our dishes but also contributes to the sustainability of the regional economy.

<br> <br>

A significant unique selling point of MUNCH POINT CAFE is our fusion menu, which artfully combines traditional Assamese cuisine with modern culinary techniques. Imagine savoring a subtly spiced ''Masor Tenga'' inspired sandwich or indulging in a ''Pitha'' inspired pastry, each bite offering a delightful exploration of flavors. This innovative approach caters to both those seeking familiar comforts and adventurous palates eager to experience new culinary horizons. Furthermore, we offer a rotating menu of seasonal specials, ensuring that there’s always something new and exciting to discover. This ensures that our offerings consistently meet the evolving taste preferences of the local market. Understanding the varied needs of our clientele, we also provide options for dietary restrictions, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free choices, making MUNCH POINT CAFE an inclusive and accessible destination for everyone.

<br> <br>

The customer experience at MUNCH POINT CAFE is paramount. We believe that creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere is just as important as serving delicious food. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. From the moment you step through our doors, you''ll be greeted with a warm smile and attentive service, making you feel right at home.

<br> <br>

We strive to foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and initiatives. We host regular live music performances featuring local artists, showcasing the region''s vibrant cultural scene. Additionally, we collaborate with local artisans and craftspeople to feature their products within the café, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. By actively engaging with the community, MUNCH POINT CAFE aims to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valued and integral part of the Lakhimi Nagar neighborhood. Moreover, we leverage customer feedback through surveys and direct interactions to continuously improve our offerings and services, demonstrating our commitment to exceeding customer expectations.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, MUNCH POINT CAFE envisions expanding its presence within the local Assam business landscape. Our long-term goals include opening additional locations in neighboring towns and cities, bringing our unique blend of traditional and modern cuisine to a wider audience. We also plan to further develop our catering services, providing delicious and customized menus for local events and gatherings. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local educational institutions to offer internships and training programs, contributing to the development of the next generation of culinary professionals in Assam.

<br> <br>

Another key aspect of our future vision is to strengthen our commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing. We are actively researching ways to reduce our environmental footprint through initiatives such as composting food waste, using eco-friendly packaging, and partnering with suppliers who share our commitment to responsible practices. Ultimately, MUNCH POINT CAFE strives to be a beacon of culinary excellence, community engagement, and sustainable business practices in the heart of Assam. We believe that by providing exceptional food, creating a welcoming atmosphere, and actively supporting the local community, we can achieve our long-term goals and solidify our position as a leading café destination in the region.', '10, Lakhimi Nagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:20:23.000Z'),
(1848, 'The Caffeine Bar', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>The Caffeine Bar, nestled on the 1st Floor of Harbala Market, is more than just a coffee shop; it''s a vibrant hub designed to invigorate the local Assam community with exceptional coffee, delectable treats, and a welcoming atmosphere. Recognizing the growing demand for high-quality coffee experiences and a social gathering place, The Caffeine Bar aims to be a cornerstone of Harbala Market, offering a sophisticated yet accessible escape from the everyday. Our commitment to sourcing premium ingredients and providing personalized service sets us apart, making us a significant addition to the evolving culinary landscape of the region. We strive to create a space where customers can connect, relax, and fuel their day with the best that Assam has to offer, while also contributing to the economic vitality of Harbala Market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Caffeine Bar specializes in handcrafted coffee beverages, prepared with meticulously selected beans sourced from reputable regional suppliers and beyond. Our offerings range from classic espresso drinks like lattes and cappuccinos, crafted with precision and care, to unique signature blends inspired by local flavors and preferences. Beyond coffee, our menu boasts a tempting array of freshly baked pastries, light meals, and refreshing beverages, catering to a wide range of palates. Unique selling points include our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers and producers. We also pride ourselves on our artisanal approach to coffee preparation, employing skilled baristas who are passionate about their craft and dedicated to providing consistently excellent beverages. Furthermore, The Caffeine Bar offers customizable options, allowing customers to tailor their drinks to their specific tastes and dietary needs. These services directly address the local market needs by providing a premium coffee experience that is both convenient and accessible within the bustling Harbala Market area, catering to students, professionals, and residents alike seeking a quality caffeine fix and a place to unwind.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The customer experience is paramount at The Caffeine Bar. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our baristas are trained not only to expertly prepare coffee but also to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and service standards. What truly sets The Caffeine Bar apart is our commitment to fostering a sense of community. We regularly host events such as open mic nights, coffee tasting sessions, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and encouraging social interaction. We also actively participate in local initiatives, partnering with community organizations and supporting charitable causes. This approach allows us to connect with the local community on a deeper level, transforming The Caffeine Bar from just a coffee shop into a vital social hub that contributes to the well-being of Harbala Market and its residents.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for The Caffeine Bar is ambitious yet grounded in a deep understanding of the local market and its potential. We plan to expand our menu to include more locally inspired dishes and beverages, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We also envision establishing partnerships with other local businesses to create mutually beneficial collaborations. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves enhancing our online presence and offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to the evolving needs of our customers. Looking further ahead, we aspire to open additional locations within Assam, bringing the unique Caffeine Bar experience to a wider audience. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to become a leading coffee brand in the region, recognized not only for its exceptional coffee and food but also for its commitment to community engagement and sustainable business practices. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously innovating, The Caffeine Bar has the potential to become a lasting and impactful presence in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Harbala Market', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:20:30.000Z'),
(1849, 'Terra Mayaa', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Terra Mayaa, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd, is a unique establishment that seamlessly blends traditional Assamese artistry with contemporary design, offering a curated experience that resonates with both locals and visitors alike. More than just a retail space, Terra Mayaa serves as a vibrant hub for cultural expression, showcasing the rich heritage of Assam through meticulously crafted products and immersive experiences. In a region brimming with natural beauty and cultural depth, Terra Mayaa distinguishes itself by providing a platform for local artisans, fostering sustainable practices, and offering customers a tangible connection to the region''s identity. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, promoting Assamese craftsmanship on a wider scale and contributing to the economic empowerment of local communities.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the core of Terra Mayaa''s offerings are a diverse range of handcrafted products and experiences. Our primary focus is on showcasing the exceptional skills of Assamese artisans through meticulously designed textiles, handcrafted jewelry, traditional pottery, and unique home décor items. Our textiles feature the vibrant colors and intricate patterns of Assamese silk, eri silk, and cotton, reflecting the region''s rich weaving traditions. Our jewelry collection incorporates locally sourced materials like gemstones and traditional beads, each piece telling a story of Assamese artistry. Beyond tangible products, Terra Mayaa also offers interactive workshops and cultural experiences designed to immerse visitors in the local culture. These workshops range from traditional weaving demonstrations to pottery classes, providing a hands-on understanding of the skills and artistry involved.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>A key differentiator for Terra Mayaa lies in its commitment to sustainable practices and fair trade principles. We partner directly with local artisans, ensuring they receive fair compensation for their work and promoting ethical sourcing of materials. This approach not only supports the livelihoods of local communities but also ensures the preservation of traditional crafts that are integral to Assam''s cultural identity. In a market often saturated with mass-produced goods, Terra Mayaa stands out by offering authentic, handcrafted items that embody the spirit and artistry of Assam. Our commitment to quality, coupled with our dedication to supporting local artisans, makes us a preferred destination for those seeking unique and meaningful products.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Terra Mayaa prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience that extends beyond a simple transaction. From the moment customers step through our doors, they are greeted with warm hospitality and a personalized approach. Our knowledgeable staff are passionate about Assamese culture and are dedicated to providing customers with in-depth information about the products and the artisans who create them. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers feel comfortable exploring the rich tapestry of Assamese artistry. We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local schools, cultural organizations, and community events.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We believe in fostering strong relationships with our customers and building a community around our shared appreciation for Assamese culture. This commitment is reflected in our customer loyalty programs, personalized recommendations, and active presence on social media platforms where we share stories about our artisans, showcase new products, and engage in conversations about local culture. By creating a positive and engaging customer experience, Terra Mayaa aims to become more than just a retail store but a trusted source of authentic Assamese products and a hub for cultural exchange.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Terra Mayaa envisions a future of continued growth and expanded reach. Our long-term goals include establishing an online presence to reach a wider audience and expanding our product line to include more diverse expressions of Assamese artistry. We also plan to increase our involvement in community development initiatives, providing training and resources to local artisans to help them further develop their skills and expand their businesses. By fostering sustainable growth and empowering local communities, Terra Mayaa aims to solidify its position as a leading advocate for Assamese culture and a driving force in the local economy.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market while staying true to our core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. Terra Mayaa''s future is bright, filled with opportunities to showcase the beauty and artistry of Assam to the world, one handcrafted product and cultural experience at a time. We aim to become synonymous with quality Assamese craftsmanship, a destination that both locals and tourists recognize as the premier spot for unique and authentic products that embody the true spirit of the region.
</p>
</body>
</html>', '6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:20:36.000Z'),
(1850, 'Cafe TENZO', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Cafe TENZO, nestled in the heart of Adaghudam, Assam, is more than just a cafe; it''s a community hub, a haven for authentic flavors, and a testament to the rich culinary heritage of the region. We offer a unique and inviting space where locals and visitors alike can gather to enjoy exceptional coffee, delectable Assamese snacks, and a warm, welcoming atmosphere that embodies the spirit of Assam. Cafe TENZO aims to be the premier destination in Adaghudam for those seeking a genuine taste of local culture, exceptional quality, and unparalleled hospitality, contributing significantly to the vibrant local business ecosystem.

<br> <br>

At Cafe TENZO, our core offering revolves around delivering a carefully curated menu that blends familiar cafe staples with the distinctive tastes of Assam. Our signature coffee blends are sourced from reputable local estates, ensuring freshness and supporting regional farmers. Alongside our coffee, we offer a diverse selection of teas, including authentic Assamese tea known for its robust flavor and invigorating properties. Beyond beverages, our menu boasts a range of traditional Assamese snacks like *pitha* (rice cakes), *jolpan* (traditional breakfast items), and savory treats, prepared with locally sourced ingredients and time-honored recipes. What sets Cafe TENZO apart is our commitment to authenticity and quality. We meticulously select our ingredients, collaborate with local artisans, and train our staff to deliver a truly exceptional experience that reflects the unique culinary heritage of Assam. We address a clear need in the local market for a cafe that not only provides quality food and beverages but also actively promotes and celebrates the regional culture.

<br> <br>

The customer experience at Cafe TENZO is paramount. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels like a valued member of our community. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. We actively engage with the local community through hosting events, showcasing local artists, and partnering with regional organizations. We are more than just a cafe; we are a gathering place, a cultural center, and a source of local pride. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment that fosters connection and celebrates the unique spirit of Assam. Our commitment to creating a positive and memorable experience for every guest sets us apart and fosters strong customer loyalty.

<br> <br>

Looking to the future, Cafe TENZO envisions becoming a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement throughout Assam. We plan to expand our menu to include more diverse Assamese dishes, catering to a wider range of tastes and preferences. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and producers to offer curated selections of regional crafts and products, further promoting the local economy. We are committed to sustainability and ethical sourcing, ensuring that our operations have a minimal environmental impact and that we contribute positively to the well-being of the community. Ultimately, Cafe TENZO aims to be a model for responsible and sustainable business practices, demonstrating that it is possible to achieve both commercial success and positive social impact. We see the potential to establish multiple locations throughout the region, bringing the unique Cafe TENZO experience to an even wider audience and solidifying our position as a leading ambassador for Assamese culture and hospitality.', 'Cafe Tenzo adaghudam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.349Z', '2025-12-07T12:25:06.000Z'),
(1851, 'BLACK COFFEE CAFE', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>BLACK COFFEE CAFE: A Distinct Brew in the Heart of Assam</p>

<br> <br>

<p>BLACK COFFEE CAFE is more than just a coffee shop; it’s a destination. Nestled in the vibrant landscape of Assam, we offer a unique and inviting space where the rich aroma of freshly brewed coffee blends seamlessly with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. In a region renowned for its tea, BLACK COFFEE CAFE provides a compelling alternative, catering to a growing demand for high-quality coffee experiences and fostering a burgeoning coffee culture among locals and visitors alike. We are committed to sourcing ethically and roasting meticulously, creating a sensory experience that elevates the everyday.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of BLACK COFFEE CAFE lies a dedication to providing exceptional coffee and complementary culinary offerings. Our primary service is the crafting of expertly brewed coffee beverages, ranging from classic espressos and cappuccinos to innovative signature drinks that incorporate local flavors and ingredients. We source high-quality Arabica beans, roasted in small batches to ensure optimal freshness and flavor. Beyond coffee, our menu features a curated selection of teas, pastries, sandwiches, and light meals, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. These options cater to diverse palates and dietary preferences, ensuring a satisfying experience for every guest.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets BLACK COFFEE CAFE apart is our unwavering commitment to quality and authenticity. We avoid pre-packaged ingredients and mass-produced items, opting instead for handcrafted beverages and food that showcase the region''s bounty. This dedication extends to our unique selling point: our signature "Assam Blend," a custom-roasted coffee bean blend that highlights the distinctive characteristics of locally grown coffee. By collaborating with regional coffee farmers, we support local agriculture and contribute to the sustainability of the Assamese coffee industry. Our menu also features rotating seasonal specials, incorporating fruits and spices that are unique to Assam, further enhancing the connection to the local environment and providing a constantly evolving culinary experience for our patrons.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>BLACK COFFEE CAFE is more than just a place to grab a drink; it''s a community hub. We prioritize creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers can relax, connect, and feel at home. Our staff is trained to provide friendly and attentive service, anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. We regularly host events such as live music performances by local artists, coffee tasting workshops, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a sense of community engagement. Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond the café walls, with initiatives such as sponsoring local sporting events and supporting local charities, demonstrating our dedication to giving back to the community that supports us.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for BLACK COFFEE CAFE is one of sustainable growth and regional expansion. We plan to open additional locations throughout Assam, bringing our unique coffee experience to a wider audience. A key component of our growth strategy involves strengthening our relationships with local coffee farmers, ensuring a reliable supply of high-quality beans and further supporting the local agricultural economy. We also intend to expand our online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services, as well as a curated selection of coffee beans and merchandise. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to develop a coffee roasting facility, allowing us to control the entire coffee-making process from bean to cup, ensuring the highest quality and consistency. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized and respected brand in the Assamese coffee market, known for its exceptional coffee, commitment to local community, and dedication to sustainable practices.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:25:12.000Z'),
(1852, 'Freza''s Bakery and Confectionery', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Freza''s Bakery and Confectionery, a delightful haven of sweet and savory treats, stands proudly on Hatigaon Main Rd, enriching the Assam culinary landscape with its artisanal offerings. More than just a bakery, Freza''s is a celebration of flavor, tradition, and community, providing a warm and welcoming space where customers can indulge in freshly baked goods made with passion and the finest ingredients. Situated in a vibrant and accessible location, Freza''s aims to be a cornerstone of the neighborhood, offering a delectable escape from the everyday.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Freza''s lies a commitment to quality and craftsmanship. The bakery''s core offerings encompass a wide array of freshly baked breads, from classic sourdough and whole wheat loaves to innovative artisanal varieties incorporating local Assam ingredients. Cakes, pastries, and desserts form another significant pillar of the business, featuring everything from elaborate celebration cakes and delicate French pastries to traditional Assamese sweets reimagined with a modern twist. Freza''s also caters to those seeking savory options, providing a selection of quiches, pies, sandwiches, and other light meals, all prepared with the same dedication to freshness and flavor. A dedicated tea and coffee selection perfectly complements the food offerings, creating a complete sensory experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What truly sets Freza''s apart is its commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. By partnering with regional farmers and suppliers, the bakery ensures the freshness and quality of its products while supporting the local economy. This dedication to local sourcing, combined with innovative recipes and meticulous attention to detail, allows Freza''s to offer unique and memorable flavors that reflect the essence of Assam. The bakery''s ability to blend traditional baking techniques with modern culinary trends also makes it a standout establishment in the area.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Freza''s believes that exceptional customer service is paramount. Every interaction is an opportunity to create a positive and lasting impression. The staff is meticulously trained to be knowledgeable, friendly, and attentive, ensuring that each customer feels valued and appreciated. From personalized cake consultations to helpful recommendations, Freza''s strives to exceed customer expectations at every turn. The bakery''s inviting ambiance, characterized by its warm décor and comfortable seating, further enhances the overall customer experience, encouraging patrons to linger and savor their treats.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Freza''s actively participates in local events and initiatives. The bakery regularly sponsors local school events, participates in farmers'' markets, and collaborates with other businesses in the area to promote the Hatigaon community. By fostering strong relationships with its neighbors, Freza''s has become more than just a bakery; it has become a gathering place, a hub of connection, and a vital part of the community''s fabric.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Freza''s Bakery and Confectionery envisions a future of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to expand its product line, introducing new and exciting flavors while maintaining its commitment to quality and local sourcing. Plans are underway to introduce online ordering and delivery services, making Freza''s delectable offerings even more accessible to a wider audience. Furthermore, the bakery hopes to establish a baking academy, providing training and mentorship opportunities to aspiring bakers in the region, further contributing to the growth and development of the local culinary scene.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Ultimately, Freza''s aspires to become a household name in Assam, synonymous with exceptional baked goods, outstanding customer service, and unwavering commitment to the community. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating, Freza''s Bakery and Confectionery is poised to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a leading bakery and confectionery in the region, enriching the lives of its customers, one delicious treat at a time. The vision is to build a legacy of quality and taste that extends beyond the immediate neighborhood and contributes to Assam''s growing reputation as a culinary destination.</p>', 'Hatigaon Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:25:19.000Z'),
(1853, 'SURABHI MILLET CAFE', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>SURABHI MILLET CAFE: Nourishing Assam with Tradition and Innovation</p>

<p>Located in the heart of Assam''s administrative hub at the Assam Secretariat (Gana Sewa Bhawan), SURABHI MILLET CAFE is more than just a restaurant; it''s a celebration of indigenous grains and a commitment to promoting healthy, sustainable eating habits. In a region rich with agricultural heritage, yet increasingly influenced by global food trends, Surabhi Millet Cafe offers a refreshing alternative – a culinary haven where traditional Assamese flavors meet the nutritional power of millets. We aim to be a leading voice in advocating for the increased consumption of millets, not just for their health benefits but also for their contribution to the sustainable livelihoods of local farmers. Situated strategically within the Secretariat, the cafe provides a convenient and nutritious dining option for government employees, visitors, and the wider Guwahati community, positioning itself as a key player in promoting a healthier Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around crafting delectable dishes using millets as the primary ingredient. Millets, known for their high fiber content, gluten-free nature, and rich nutritional profile, form the base for a diverse menu that caters to a variety of tastes and preferences. We offer a range of options from traditional Assamese breakfast staples reimagined with millets, like millet-based <i>pitha</i> and <i>jolpan</i>, to innovative lunch and dinner entrees such as millet biryani, millet dosas, and millet-crusted fish. Our menu also features a selection of healthy snacks and beverages, including millet smoothies, millet cookies, and naturally sweetened drinks. What sets Surabhi Millet Cafe apart is its dedication to sourcing ingredients locally, working directly with farmers in the region to procure high-quality millets and other fresh produce. This not only ensures the freshness and authenticity of our dishes but also supports the local agricultural economy. Our unique selling point is the fusion of traditional Assamese recipes with the nutritional benefits of millets, creating a culinary experience that is both healthy and culturally relevant. We address a growing need in the local market for nutritious and wholesome food options, especially among health-conscious individuals and those seeking to explore the rich culinary heritage of Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At SURABHI MILLET CAFE, we believe that exceptional food should be accompanied by exceptional service. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every customer, where they feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained not only in food preparation but also in providing attentive and personalized service. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that their dining experience is nothing short of delightful. Beyond providing a delicious and nutritious meal, we are committed to educating our customers about the benefits of millets and their role in promoting a healthy lifestyle. We host regular workshops and tasting events to raise awareness about the versatility and nutritional value of millets. Furthermore, we actively participate in community events and initiatives, promoting local culture and supporting local farmers. We believe in building strong relationships with our customers and the wider community, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose. Our goal is to be more than just a cafe; we want to be a community hub where people can come together to enjoy healthy food, learn about local culture, and connect with like-minded individuals.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, SURABHI MILLET CAFE envisions expanding its reach and impact within Assam and beyond. We plan to introduce new and innovative millet-based products to cater to a wider range of palates and dietary needs. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with other organizations and businesses to promote millet consumption and sustainable agriculture. Our long-term goals include establishing a network of millet cafes across Assam, creating a sustainable supply chain that benefits both farmers and consumers. We aspire to be recognized as a leading advocate for millets, not only in Assam but also nationally. We aim to leverage technology to enhance our operations, improve customer service, and expand our online presence. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide the best possible service to our customers. Ultimately, our vision is to create a thriving business that not only provides healthy and delicious food but also contributes to the economic development of Assam and the well-being of its people.</p>', 'Assam Secretariat ( Gana Sewa Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:25:27.000Z'),
(1854, 'Sip Station', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Sip Station: A Refreshing Oasis in the Heart of Assam</p>

<p>Located on Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near the Bank of Baroda, Sip Station has quickly become a beloved fixture of the local community in Assam. More than just a beverage provider, Sip Station is a vibrant hub where locals connect, refresh, and enjoy a diverse selection of drinks in a welcoming atmosphere. Recognizing the growing demand for quality beverages beyond traditional options, Sip Station fills a unique niche, offering a modern and diverse menu while maintaining a strong connection to local tastes and preferences. The business’s strategic location and commitment to customer satisfaction have solidified its position as a go-to destination for a refreshing break.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Core Offerings: A Diverse Menu for Every Palate</p>

<p>Sip Station''s core offering revolves around providing a wide array of beverages to cater to diverse tastes. The menu boasts an impressive selection of freshly brewed coffees, ranging from classic espresso-based drinks to innovative signature blends featuring locally sourced coffee beans when available. Tea lovers can indulge in a variety of options, including traditional Assamese tea prepared with expertise, as well as herbal infusions and iced teas. Beyond hot beverages, Sip Station excels in crafting refreshing cold drinks. These include fruit smoothies made with fresh, seasonal fruits, creamy milkshakes, and customized juice blends. Special attention is given to sourcing high-quality ingredients, ensuring each drink is both delicious and satisfying. Seasonal offerings, such as mango lassi during the summer months or spiced chai in the winter, add an element of surprise and delight, keeping the menu fresh and appealing year-round. What truly sets Sip Station apart is its willingness to customize drinks based on individual preferences, allowing customers to create their perfect beverage. The use of locally sourced ingredients when feasible further enhances the unique character of the business and strengthens its ties to the community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The Sip Station Experience: Connecting with the Community</p>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Sip Station. From the moment a customer walks in, they are greeted with a warm and friendly atmosphere. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each visitor feels valued and appreciated. Beyond simply taking orders, the team engages with customers, offering recommendations, answering questions about the menu, and creating a genuine connection. Sip Station actively participates in local events and initiatives, further embedding itself within the community. Offering special promotions during local festivals or partnering with nearby businesses for cross-promotional activities helps to foster a sense of belonging and goodwill. The physical space itself is designed to be inviting and comfortable, with ample seating and a relaxed ambiance that encourages customers to linger and enjoy their drinks. Free Wi-Fi is available, making it a popular spot for students and professionals looking for a place to work or study. Positive reviews and word-of-mouth referrals are a testament to Sip Station''s commitment to exceeding customer expectations and building lasting relationships.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking Ahead: Growth and Innovation</p>

<p>Sip Station envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, aiming to become the premier beverage destination in the region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more food options, such as light snacks and pastries, to complement the existing beverage offerings. Exploring partnerships with local bakeries and food vendors would further enhance the menu and support other businesses in the community. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Sip Station is actively exploring ways to reduce its environmental impact, such as using eco-friendly packaging, implementing recycling programs, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable suppliers. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in nearby towns and cities, bringing the Sip Station experience to a wider audience. Maintaining the same commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement will be crucial as the business grows. Sip Station aims to not only provide exceptional beverages but also to contribute to the economic and social well-being of the local area.</p>', 'Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near Bank of Baroda', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:25:33.000Z'),
(1855, 'Ithakaa Restaurant and Cafe', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Ithakaa Restaurant and Cafe: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Assam

Ithakaa Restaurant and Cafe stands as a vibrant culinary destination nestled in the heart of Assam, offering a distinctive dining experience that blends global flavors with local ingredients and traditions. More than just a restaurant, Ithakaa aims to be a community hub, a place where friends and families gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories over exceptional food and beverages. In a region known for its rich culinary heritage, Ithakaa distinguishes itself by offering a diverse menu that appeals to both traditional palates and those seeking contemporary gastronomic adventures. Its commitment to quality, combined with its warm and inviting ambiance, positions Ithakaa as a significant player in the Assam''s evolving hospitality sector, contributing to the region''s growing reputation as a destination for food lovers.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Ithakaa’s offerings lies a carefully curated menu that spans a range of culinary influences. While deeply rooted in Assamese culinary traditions, the restaurant also features dishes inspired by international cuisines, creating a delightful fusion that caters to diverse tastes. Signature dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, showcase the region''s fresh produce and unique flavors. The menu includes both classic favorites and innovative creations, ensuring there’s something to satisfy every craving.

<br> <br>

Beyond the restaurant''s main dining area, Ithakaa boasts a charming cafe section, offering a selection of specialty coffees, teas, and delectable pastries. The cafe provides a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, perfect for casual meetings, quick lunches, or simply unwinding with a good book. The cafe''s artisanal coffee blends, sourced from local estates when available, are a particular highlight, offering patrons a taste of Assam''s celebrated coffee culture. A significant unique selling point is Ithakaa’s commitment to sourcing fresh, seasonal ingredients, supporting local farmers and producers whenever possible. This not only ensures the highest quality of food but also contributes to the local economy. Further differentiating itself is the focus on creating a memorable dining experience that goes beyond just the food.

<br> <br>

Ithakaa prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else, fostering a culture of attentive and personalized service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and eager to assist diners with recommendations and dietary needs. The restaurant cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where guests feel comfortable and valued. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the dining experience. The goal is to create a loyal customer base that sees Ithakaa not just as a place to eat, but as a place to belong.

<br> <br>

Community engagement is a core value for Ithakaa. The restaurant actively participates in local events, supports local artists and artisans, and partners with charitable organizations to give back to the community. The space is frequently used for community gatherings, workshops, and exhibitions, further solidifying its role as a central hub. The restaurant also incorporates Assamese art and decor into its design, celebrating the region''s cultural heritage and creating a sense of place for its patrons. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, Ithakaa aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aims to be a vital part of the fabric of the region.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Ithakaa envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu with more locally inspired dishes, explore opportunities for catering services, and possibly open additional locations within Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Ithakaa as a leading restaurant brand in the region, known for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and unwavering commitment to the community. The restaurant also plans to invest in staff training and development, ensuring that its team remains at the forefront of the hospitality industry. Ultimately, Ithakaa aspires to be a culinary destination that not only satisfies the appetites of its patrons but also contributes to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:30:11.000Z'),
(1856, 'Feed me II', 'Cafes', NULL, '<p>Feed me II: A Culinary Haven on Rajgarh Road</p>

<p>Nestled on Rajgarh Road, opposite the Alcare Diagnostic Centre, Feed me II is more than just a restaurant; it''s a burgeoning culinary destination offering a unique and satisfying dining experience in the heart of Assam. This establishment distinguishes itself through its commitment to fresh, locally-sourced ingredients, innovative menu offerings, and a warm, welcoming atmosphere. In a region increasingly appreciating diverse culinary experiences, Feed me II fills a vital niche by providing high-quality meals at accessible prices, quickly establishing itself as a favorite among locals and visitors alike. Recognizing the strong community spirit of Assam, Feed me II aims to be a place where friends and families can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories over delicious food.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the heart of Feed me II lies a commitment to providing a diverse and satisfying menu catering to a wide range of tastes. The restaurant''s core offerings include a selection of carefully curated dishes featuring both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular continental favorites. This thoughtful blend appeals to both those seeking familiar comfort foods and those eager to explore the rich culinary heritage of the region. A significant unique selling point is the restaurant''s emphasis on sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers whenever possible. This commitment ensures the freshness and quality of the food while simultaneously supporting the local economy. Whether indulging in a flavorful Assamese thali, savoring a perfectly grilled continental dish, or enjoying a refreshing beverage, patrons can be assured of a dining experience that is both satisfying and ethically responsible. The menu is also designed to be adaptable, regularly incorporating seasonal ingredients and introducing new dishes to keep the dining experience fresh and exciting, ensuring repeat customers and building long-term loyalty.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Feed me II. The staff is trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance is carefully curated to be both inviting and comfortable, creating a relaxed atmosphere conducive to enjoyable dining. Understanding the importance of connection, Feed me II actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and initiatives. The restaurant also leverages social media to connect with customers, share updates, and gather feedback, fostering a sense of community and belonging. Furthermore, Feed me II is committed to providing a clean and hygienic dining environment, adhering to the highest standards of food safety and sanitation. This dedication to quality and safety builds trust and confidence among patrons, solidifying the restaurant''s reputation as a reliable and reputable dining destination. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the local community, Feed me II cultivates a loyal customer base and fosters strong, lasting relationships.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Feed me II envisions significant potential for growth and expansion within the local Assam business landscape. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, further showcasing the diverse culinary traditions of Assam. There are also aspirations to introduce catering services for local events and gatherings, providing a convenient and high-quality option for those seeking delicious and reliable catering. Furthermore, the business aims to explore the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of the region, extending its reach and bringing its unique dining experience to a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing Feed me II as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, freshness, and community engagement. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and remaining committed to its core values, Feed me II is poised to achieve sustained growth and solidify its position as a leading culinary destination in Assam.</p>', 'Rajgarh Rd, opp. to Alcare Diagnostic Centre', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:30:17.000Z'),
(1857, 'KitChai', 'Cafes', NULL, 'KitChai, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati at Commerce Point, Boys Hostel, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Gauhati Commerce College, is more than just a tea stall; it''s a cultural hub and a modern interpretation of Assam''s rich tea heritage. We aim to provide a refreshing and authentic experience, catering to the diverse palates of students, professionals, and residents alike. KitChai stands out by blending traditional Assamese flavors with contemporary brewing techniques and a commitment to fostering a welcoming community space. We''re dedicated to creating a unique tea-drinking experience that resonates with the local community and celebrates the essence of Assam.

<br> <br>

At its core, KitChai offers a diverse menu centered around Assam tea, showcasing its versatility and depth. We feature classic milk teas prepared with locally sourced ingredients, alongside innovative tea-based beverages such as iced teas, tea lattes, and even tea-infused mocktails. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to quality and experimentation. We source premium Assam tea leaves directly from local gardens, ensuring freshness and supporting regional farmers. We also offer a rotating selection of seasonal specials, incorporating local fruits and spices to create exciting and novel flavor combinations. Complementing our tea selection, we offer a curated menu of light snacks and traditional Assamese delicacies, perfectly paired to enhance the tea-drinking experience. This includes items like Singara, Ghugni, and other locally popular snacks, providing a convenient and affordable option for students and office workers in the area. Our offerings directly address the local market''s demand for quality, affordable, and culturally relevant beverages and snacks.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at KitChai. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and inclusive atmosphere where customers can relax, connect, and enjoy a moment of respite. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our tea offerings and provide personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our customers, remembering their orders, and engaging in friendly conversation. Beyond providing exceptional service, KitChai actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. We host regular events such as open mic nights, poetry slams, and workshops on Assamese culture and tea appreciation. We also collaborate with local artists and artisans to showcase their work within our space, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. Further, KitChai offers student discounts and actively participates in campus events at Gauhati Commerce College, building strong relationships with the student community and becoming a valued part of their daily lives.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, KitChai envisions becoming a leading tea brand in Guwahati and beyond, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional flavors and experimenting with different brewing techniques to create unique tea blends. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and further strengthen our relationships with them. A key element of our growth strategy involves establishing strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to expand our reach and enhance our brand visibility. We aim to open additional outlets in strategic locations across Guwahati, while maintaining the same commitment to quality and community that has defined our initial success. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to package and sell our signature tea blends online and in select retail outlets, allowing us to reach a wider audience and share the taste of Assam with the world. KitChai aspires to not only serve exceptional tea but also to contribute to the cultural and economic vitality of Assam, celebrating its rich heritage and empowering local communities.', 'Commerce Point, Boys Hostel, RG Baruah Rd, opp. Gauhati Commerce College', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:30:22.000Z'),
