(1859, 'Kori''s', 'Cafes', NULL, 'Kori''s Cafe & Restro: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati

Kori''s Cafe & Restro, nestled on the 2nd Floor of R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opposite S.B.I Bank, is more than just a place to grab a meal; it''s a vibrant hub where culinary artistry meets warm Assamese hospitality. Situated in a bustling area of Guwahati, Kori''s offers a welcome escape from the city''s rhythm, providing a comfortable and inviting atmosphere for locals and visitors alike. We distinguish ourselves through a commitment to quality ingredients, innovative menu offerings, and a genuine connection with the community, establishing Kori''s as a significant player in the local dining scene.

