At the core of C square Cafe''s offerings are meticulously prepared food and beverage selections. The menu features a diverse range of items, from freshly brewed premium coffees and handcrafted teas to delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. We differentiate ourselves by emphasizing the use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and quality of our offerings. Our signature coffee blends are sourced from nearby estates known for their robust flavors, providing an authentic taste of Assam. Beyond the standard cafe fare, C square Cafe offers a curated selection of innovative dishes, incorporating regional flavors with modern culinary techniques. For instance, you might find a twist on traditional Assamese snacks, prepared with a focus on healthy ingredients and appealing presentation. Unique selling points include our commitment to using organic ingredients where feasible, our customizable beverage options, and our dedication to providing vegetarian and vegan-friendly choices, catering to a broad spectrum of dietary preferences. This thoughtful approach allows C square Cafe to fill a gap in the market by providing healthier, more diverse, and higher-quality dining options.

