Customer experience is paramount at C square Cafe. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and personalized environment for every guest. Our staff is trained not only to efficiently take orders and serve food but also to engage with customers, anticipate their needs, and create a memorable interaction. The cafe''s ambiance is carefully designed to be both aesthetically pleasing and comfortable, featuring cozy seating arrangements, soft lighting, and tasteful decor. We offer complimentary Wi-Fi to cater to students and professionals who need a place to work or study. To foster a strong connection with the local community, C square Cafe actively participates in local events and initiatives. We might host open mic nights showcasing local talent, art exhibitions featuring regional artists, or collaborations with local businesses to promote cross-promotion. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. By fostering a sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, C square Cafe aims to become a cherished local institution.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, C square Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. We plan to establish ourselves as the premier cafe destination on GMCH Road and then expand our reach throughout the city. Future plans include introducing a loyalty program to reward frequent customers, expanding our menu with seasonal offerings and specialty items, and potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas. We are also exploring the possibility of offering catering services for local events and businesses. Long-term goals include establishing C square Cafe as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, community engagement, and exceptional culinary experiences. We aim to contribute to the economic development of the region by supporting local farmers and businesses, providing employment opportunities, and fostering a vibrant cultural scene. Through strategic planning, dedicated execution, and a unwavering commitment to our core values, C square Cafe is poised to become a thriving and influential player in the Assam business landscape. We also plan to invest in employee training programs to ensure our staff possesses the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service and maintain our high standards of quality.', 'GMCH Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:35:14.000Z'),
(1862, 'Nuts and Brew', 'Bars', NULL, 'Nuts and Brew: A Unique Confluence of Flavors and Community in the Heart of Guwahati

Nuts and Brew, strategically located on the 3rd Floor of GS Rd, above Forever 21, and directly in front of the Novotel Hotel, is rapidly establishing itself as a distinctive and cherished destination within Guwahati''s vibrant culinary and social scene. More than just a cafe, Nuts and Brew offers a carefully curated experience that blends the comfort of familiar flavors with the excitement of innovative combinations. Situated in a high-traffic area, the cafe provides a respite from the bustling city, promising a haven for both local residents and visiting travelers seeking quality, convenience, and a memorable experience. Its presence contributes to the evolving landscape of Guwahati''s food and beverage sector, introducing a fresh concept that resonates with a diverse clientele.

<br> <br>

At its core, Nuts and Brew offers a delightful fusion of premium roasted nuts and artisanal coffee, supplemented by a delectable selection of complementary treats. The ''Nuts'' component showcases a range of globally sourced nuts, meticulously roasted in-house to perfection, offering a variety of flavors from classic salted and spiced options to exotic blends and candied varieties. These nuts are available for individual purchase, as well as featured in various menu items, from nut-crusted pastries to inventive salad toppings.

<br> <br>

The ''Brew'' aspect focuses on high-quality, ethically sourced coffee beans, expertly brewed by trained baristas. The coffee menu spans classic espresso-based beverages, including cappuccinos, lattes, and macchiatos, alongside cold brews, iced coffees, and specialty coffee creations unique to Nuts and Brew. The cafe also boasts a selection of teas, herbal infusions, and refreshing non-coffee beverages, catering to diverse preferences. Beyond the core offerings, Nuts and Brew offers a carefully curated selection of pastries, cakes, and savory snacks designed to perfectly complement the nut and coffee selections. The menu is regularly updated to incorporate seasonal ingredients and innovative flavor profiles, ensuring a dynamic and engaging culinary experience.

<br> <br>

A key differentiator for Nuts and Brew lies in its commitment to quality ingredients, meticulous preparation, and creative flavor combinations. The cafe prioritizes sourcing premium nuts and coffee beans, ensuring a superior taste experience. The in-house roasting and brewing processes allow for greater control over quality and consistency. Furthermore, Nuts and Brew distinguishes itself through its unique menu offerings, incorporating nuts into both sweet and savory dishes in unexpected and delightful ways. By appealing to both traditional tastes and adventurous palates, Nuts and Brew effectively meets the diverse needs of the local market, providing a versatile destination for coffee breaks, casual meetings, and indulgent treats.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Nuts and Brew. The cafe strives to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, where guests feel valued and appreciated. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable, friendly, and attentive, providing personalized recommendations and catering to individual preferences. The cafe design incorporates comfortable seating, warm lighting, and tasteful décor, creating a relaxed and inviting ambiance.

<br> <br>

Nuts and Brew actively seeks to connect with the local community through various initiatives. The cafe hosts regular events, such as live music performances, coffee tasting sessions, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a sense of community. It also partners with local suppliers and artisans, supporting the local economy and showcasing regional products. Moreover, Nuts and Brew actively engages with its customers through social media, soliciting feedback, sharing updates, and building a strong online community. This multifaceted approach to customer service and community engagement distinguishes Nuts and Brew as a truly local establishment.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Nuts and Brew envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and potentially beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more diverse and innovative nut-based dishes, enhancing the coffee selection with new brewing techniques and specialty beans, and developing a line of branded products, such as packaged nuts, coffee blends, and merchandise. The business aims to solidify its position as a leading destination for quality coffee, premium nuts, and community engagement, becoming a beloved fixture in the local culinary landscape. Nuts and Brew also explores opportunities for opening additional locations in strategic areas, bringing its unique concept to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Nuts and Brew as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit.', '3rd Floor, GS Rd, above Forever 21, in front of Novotel Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:35:22.000Z'),
(1863, 'Spectrum Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Spectrum Bar, nestled on the first floor of the Hotel Shoolin Grand Building, strategically located on GS Rd, Rukmini Gaon, opposite the Indian Petrol Pump, is a sophisticated and vibrant destination redefining the bar experience in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to enjoy a drink, Spectrum Bar offers a curated environment designed to cater to discerning patrons seeking quality, ambiance, and exceptional service. Its prime location within a reputable hotel ensures accessibility and further solidifies its position as a noteworthy establishment within the local hospitality sector. Spectrum Bar addresses a clear demand for a refined nightlife and social experience, offering a unique alternative to the more traditional bars found in the area.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, Spectrum Bar provides a diverse and premium selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. This includes an extensive list of classic and contemporary cocktails crafted by skilled mixologists, a curated selection of local and international beers, and a carefully chosen wine list to complement diverse palates. Beyond the drinks, Spectrum Bar distinguishes itself through its commitment to offering high-quality bar snacks and appetizers. These are thoughtfully prepared to enhance the drinking experience, featuring both familiar favorites and innovative culinary creations that incorporate local flavors and ingredients where appropriate. What truly sets Spectrum Bar apart is the emphasis on creating a complete sensory experience. The bar features a stylish and comfortable interior design, carefully selected music to enhance the atmosphere, and attentive service from a well-trained staff. This holistic approach elevates Spectrum Bar beyond a typical drinking establishment, positioning it as a destination for those seeking a memorable and refined social experience. The bar specifically meets the growing demand from locals and tourists alike who are looking for an upscale venue to unwind, socialize, and enjoy expertly crafted beverages in a sophisticated setting.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Spectrum Bar. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and proactive in anticipating customer needs. Beyond simply serving drinks, the team is dedicated to creating a personalized experience, offering recommendations based on individual preferences and ensuring that every guest feels valued and comfortable. The bar regularly hosts themed nights and special events to further enhance the customer experience and create a sense of community. These events often feature live music from local artists, guest bartenders showcasing unique cocktail creations, or special promotions tailored to specific occasions. Spectrum Bar actively seeks to connect with the local community by partnering with local businesses and organizations for events and promotions. This demonstrates a commitment to supporting the local economy and fostering a sense of belonging. Furthermore, Spectrum Bar is committed to providing a safe and responsible environment for its patrons, adhering to all relevant regulations and promoting responsible drinking habits. By prioritizing customer satisfaction, fostering a sense of community, and upholding high standards of service, Spectrum Bar has cultivated a loyal following and established a reputation as a premier destination in Guwahati''s nightlife scene.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Spectrum Bar is one of continued growth and innovation. The immediate focus is on solidifying its position as the leading bar in the Rukmini Gaon area. This includes expanding the menu to incorporate new and exciting beverage options, refining the ambiance through ongoing interior updates, and further enhancing the training and development of the staff. Longer-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand the Spectrum Bar brand to other locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam. This expansion would be carefully considered to ensure that the brand''s core values of quality, service, and ambiance are maintained. Another key aspect of the future vision is to further develop Spectrum Bar''s role as a community hub. This could involve partnering with local charities and organizations to support important causes, hosting more community-focused events, and creating initiatives that promote local arts and culture. The ultimate goal is to establish Spectrum Bar as not only a successful business but also a valuable contributor to the local community. The management team is committed to adapting to changing market trends, embracing new technologies, and continuously seeking ways to improve the customer experience. This dedication to innovation and customer satisfaction will ensure that Spectrum Bar remains a vibrant and relevant destination for years to come.</p>', 'Hotel Shoolin Grand Building, First floor, GS Rd, Rukmini Gaon, opposite Indian Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:35:29.000Z'),
(1864, 'The Maroon Room – Pan Asian Fine Dine in Guwahati', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Maroon Room - Pan Asian Fine Dine in Guwahati, strategically located on the 5th Floor of Aurus Mall, near Supermarket, presents a unique and sophisticated dining experience, adding a vibrant touch to Guwahati''s culinary scene. It is more than just a restaurant; it''s an immersive journey into the heart of Pan-Asian cuisine, tailored to the discerning palates of Assam''s residents and visitors alike. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and diverse culinary traditions, The Maroon Room aims to elevate the dining landscape by offering a refined and contemporary interpretation of classic Asian dishes, making it a significant player in the local hospitality sector.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Maroon Room specializes in providing an exceptional Pan-Asian fine dining experience. Our core offerings include a meticulously curated menu featuring dishes from across Asia, including Chinese, Thai, Japanese, Vietnamese, and Korean cuisines. Each dish is carefully crafted using the freshest, highest-quality ingredients, many sourced locally to support Assam''s farmers and producers, while others are imported to ensure authentic flavor profiles. Our unique selling points include our commitment to culinary innovation, the artistry of our presentation, and the serene ambiance of our dining space. What sets us apart is our dedication to blending traditional techniques with modern culinary trends, creating a harmonious fusion that appeals to both adventurous foodies and those seeking familiar comfort. The menu features a balance of classic favorites and inventive creations, ensuring that there is something to delight every guest. We also offer an extensive beverage menu, including premium wines, handcrafted cocktails, and a selection of Asian teas, all carefully chosen to complement the food. We address the local market''s desire for sophisticated dining experiences by providing a venue for special occasions, business lunches, and intimate dinners, filling a need for high-quality Asian cuisine in a refined setting.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At The Maroon Room, customer experience is paramount. We are committed to providing impeccable service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed, valued, and pampered. Our staff is highly trained to anticipate and cater to individual needs, creating a personalized dining experience that exceeds expectations. From the moment guests enter the restaurant, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our ambiance is carefully designed to foster a sense of tranquility and elegance, with tasteful décor, soft lighting, and comfortable seating. The open kitchen allows guests to witness the culinary artistry firsthand, adding an element of theatre to the dining experience. We actively engage with the local community by participating in food festivals, hosting culinary workshops, and collaborating with local artists and artisans. We source ingredients from local farmers, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the freshness of our dishes. We also strive to incorporate elements of Assamese culture into our menu and décor, paying homage to the region''s rich heritage. Feedback is actively solicited and meticulously analyzed, ensuring continuous improvement in our service and offerings. We also maintain an active online presence, engaging with customers through social media and responding promptly to inquiries and reviews.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The Maroon Room envisions becoming the premier Pan-Asian fine dining destination in Guwahati and a recognized culinary leader in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional Asian specialties, introducing seasonal tasting menus, and offering private dining options for special events. We aim to enhance our sustainability practices by further reducing our environmental impact and sourcing more ingredients locally. We are exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other cities in Assam and beyond, bringing our unique brand of Pan-Asian cuisine to a wider audience. We plan to introduce a culinary training program for local youth, fostering talent and creating employment opportunities in the hospitality sector. We also intend to forge strategic partnerships with hotels and tourism agencies to attract more visitors to Guwahati and showcase the region''s culinary offerings. Our long-term goal is to establish The Maroon Room as a symbol of culinary excellence, innovation, and community engagement, contributing to the growth and development of Guwahati''s hospitality industry.</p>', '5th Floor, Aurus Mall, near Supermarket', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:35:35.000Z'),
(1865, 'Café Hendrix', 'Bars', NULL, '<div class="business-description"><h2>Business Description</h2><p>Café Hendrix: A Symphony of Flavors in the Heart of Guwahati

Café Hendrix, strategically located on GS Rd, opposite Pantaloons Down Town, is more than just a café; it''s a vibrant hub where the rich culinary heritage of Assam harmonizes with contemporary tastes, creating a unique and inviting experience. Situated in one of Guwahati''s busiest commercial areas, Café Hendrix stands out as a haven for those seeking respite from the bustling city life, offering a welcoming atmosphere and an enticing menu that caters to diverse palates. Its significance in the local business landscape lies in its ability to blend the familiar comfort of a classic café with innovative offerings that appeal to both local residents and visiting tourists, contributing to the city''s evolving food and beverage scene.

Core Services and Products

At its heart, Café Hendrix is a purveyor of exceptional coffee and a diverse range of delectable food items. The menu is thoughtfully curated, featuring premium coffee blends sourced from both local Assam estates and internationally renowned regions. From meticulously crafted espressos and creamy cappuccinos to refreshing iced coffees, every cup is a testament to the café''s commitment to quality. Beyond coffee, Café Hendrix offers a wide selection of teas, including traditional Assamese tea and herbal infusions.

The food menu is equally impressive, ranging from light bites and pastries to more substantial meals. Customers can enjoy freshly baked croissants, muffins, and cakes alongside savory options like sandwiches, paninis, and salads. A particular highlight is the inclusion of Assamese delicacies, offering a taste of local cuisine to both locals and tourists. Consider dishes like *pitha* or *aloo pitika*, providing a unique cultural experience within the familiar café setting. The use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible ensures freshness and supports local farmers, a key differentiator in the market. The café also offers a selection of refreshing beverages, including fresh fruit juices and smoothies, catering to health-conscious customers.

The unique selling point of Café Hendrix is its commitment to quality, consistency, and a curated culinary experience that blends global flavors with local Assamese influences. This sets it apart from generic coffee chains and establishes it as a destination for those seeking something more than just a caffeine fix. The location''s prime visibility and accessibility on GS Rd also contribute to its success, drawing in a steady stream of customers throughout the day.

Customer Experience

Café Hendrix prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else. The staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and efficient service, creating a welcoming atmosphere for every visitor. The café''s interior design contributes significantly to the overall experience. It''s designed to be comfortable and inviting, with ample seating options to accommodate individuals, couples, and small groups. The décor blends modern aesthetics with subtle nods to Assamese culture, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space.

Beyond the physical environment and service, Café Hendrix actively engages with the local community. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as hosting local artist exhibitions, organizing live music performances, and partnering with local charities for fundraising events. These activities not only enhance the café''s appeal but also foster a sense of community and belonging among its patrons. Special events themed around Assamese festivals are regularly held, further strengthening the café''s connection to its cultural roots. Feedback is actively solicited through comment cards and online platforms, allowing the café to continuously improve its offerings and address customer concerns promptly. The focus on creating a positive and memorable experience for every customer has contributed to the café''s strong reputation and loyal customer base.

Future Vision

Looking ahead, Café Hendrix envisions becoming a leading café brand in Guwahati and beyond, recognized for its quality, innovation, and commitment to the local community. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative food and beverage options, exploring collaborations with local chefs and artisans to create unique culinary experiences.

Expansion is also on the horizon, with plans to open additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that the quality and consistency that define Café Hendrix are maintained across all locations. The café also plans to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering and a loyalty program. Furthermore, Café Hendrix is committed to sustainable practices, including reducing waste, sourcing ingredients locally, and promoting eco-friendly initiatives. The long-term goal is to establish Café Hendrix as a symbol of quality, community engagement, and sustainable business practices within the Assam business landscape, contributing to the region''s economic growth and cultural vibrancy.</p></div>', 'GS Rd, opp. Pantaloons Down Town', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:40:11.000Z'),
(1866, 'The Beer Cafe, Guwahati', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, strategically situated on the second floor of Times Square Mall, RG Baruah Rd, near Quick Shoppe, offers a refreshing and sophisticated haven for beer enthusiasts and those seeking a relaxed, social atmosphere in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a bar, The Beer Cafe is a destination – a place where the rich brewing traditions of the world meet the vibrant culture of Assam, creating a unique and appealing experience. It aims to fill a significant niche in the local hospitality sector by providing a curated selection of beers, a comfortable environment, and attentive service, making it a prominent player in Guwahati''s burgeoning dining and entertainment scene. Its location within a popular mall provides high visibility and accessibility, further solidifying its position in the competitive market.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of The Beer Cafe''s offerings is its diverse and carefully selected beer menu. Going beyond the typical mainstream options, the cafe prides itself on featuring a wide array of domestic and international brews, including craft beers, ales, lagers, stouts, and wheat beers. This allows customers to explore a range of flavors and styles, catering to both seasoned beer aficionados and those new to the world of brewing. Complementing the beer selection is a menu of appetizers and light meals designed to perfectly pair with the beverages. These food options range from classic bar snacks to more substantial dishes, providing a comprehensive dining experience. A key differentiator for The Beer Cafe is its commitment to educating customers about the beers they are drinking. Knowledgeable staff can offer recommendations and insights into the different styles and brewing processes, enhancing the overall experience. This educational aspect, coupled with the diverse selection and strategic location, sets The Beer Cafe apart from other bars and restaurants in Guwahati, making it a unique destination for both casual gatherings and special occasions.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Beer Cafe, Guwahati. The ambiance is designed to be welcoming and comfortable, with a focus on creating a relaxed and social atmosphere. The decor is modern and stylish, creating an inviting space for patrons to unwind. The staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and well-cared for. Beyond simply serving food and drinks, The Beer Cafe strives to build a sense of community. Regular events such as live music performances, trivia nights, and beer tasting sessions are organized to engage with the local population and foster a loyal customer base. The cafe also actively participates in local events and initiatives, further strengthening its connection to the community. By creating a welcoming environment, providing exceptional service, and fostering a sense of community, The Beer Cafe aims to be more than just a place to grab a drink – it strives to be a gathering place where people can connect, relax, and enjoy themselves.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The initial success of the cafe provides a solid foundation for future endeavors. One key area of focus is expanding the beer selection, continually introducing new and exciting brews to cater to evolving customer tastes. There are also plans to enhance the food menu, offering a wider range of culinary options that complement the beer selection. Geographical expansion is another potential avenue for growth, with the possibility of opening additional locations in Guwahati and other cities in Assam. Furthermore, The Beer Cafe aims to strengthen its online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, making its offerings more accessible to a wider audience. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish The Beer Cafe as a leading destination for beer enthusiasts and a prominent player in the hospitality industry throughout the region. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and maintaining a strong focus on customer experience, The Beer Cafe is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a beloved establishment in Guwahati''s vibrant social scene.</p>', 'Second floor, Times Square Mall, RG Baruah Rd, near Quick Shoppe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:40:18.000Z'),
(1867, 'EXORO The Rooftop Pub', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>EXORO The Rooftop Pub is a distinctive addition to Guwahati''s vibrant social scene, offering a premium rooftop dining and entertainment experience at its prime location on the 4th Floor of Roodraksh Mall, Bhangagarh, GS Rd. More than just a pub, EXORO is designed as an elevated escape, a place where patrons can unwind, socialize, and enjoy panoramic city views alongside exceptional food, beverages, and service. In a market increasingly demanding quality and unique experiences, EXORO sets itself apart through its commitment to creating a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of EXORO''s offering lies a curated selection of beverages, including both classic and innovative cocktails, a diverse range of domestic and international beers, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list designed to complement the food menu. The kitchen at EXORO specializes in globally-inspired dishes with a local twist, utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This ensures that each plate is not only delicious but also reflects the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Beyond the food and drink, EXORO regularly hosts live music performances, DJ sets, and themed events, transforming the space into a dynamic hub for entertainment. These events are strategically planned to appeal to a diverse audience, fostering a sense of community and creating a consistently exciting atmosphere.</p>
<br> <br>
