<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at EXORO. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. From the moment patrons arrive, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, setting the tone for a positive and enjoyable experience. The layout of the pub is designed to encourage interaction and create a sense of community. Whether it''s a casual evening with friends, a celebratory dinner, or a corporate event, EXORO strives to create an environment where guests can relax, connect, and create lasting memories. Regular feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience, ensuring that EXORO remains responsive to the evolving needs and preferences of its clientele.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>EXORO actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists, musicians, and businesses. This collaborative approach not only supports the local economy but also helps to build a loyal customer base that values EXORO''s commitment to the region. By hosting events that showcase local talent and offering dishes that highlight regional flavors, EXORO fosters a sense of pride and belonging within the community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, EXORO envisions becoming the premier rooftop destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional food, drinks, service, and atmosphere. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and exciting culinary creations, introduce innovative cocktail offerings, and enhance the entertainment lineup with a wider range of live music and DJ performances. The business is exploring opportunities to collaborate with other businesses in the Roodraksh Mall and surrounding areas to create a more vibrant and integrated experience for patrons. Long-term goals include expanding to other locations within Assam and potentially beyond, bringing the EXORO experience to a wider audience. This expansion will be carefully planned and executed to maintain the high standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with the EXORO brand.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Furthermore, EXORO is committed to sustainable business practices, exploring ways to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the community. This includes sourcing ingredients from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible, implementing energy-efficient technologies, and supporting local environmental initiatives. By prioritizing sustainability, EXORO aims to create a business that is not only successful but also responsible and ethical.</p>', '4th Floor, Roodraksh Mall, Bhangagarh, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.350Z', '2025-12-07T12:40:24.000Z'),
(1868, 'Bulls & Beers, MRP Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '```html
<h1>Bulls & Beers, MRP Bar: A Refreshing Addition to Guwahati''s Social Scene</h1>

