(1872, 'The Whiskey Bar & Grill', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Whiskey Bar & Grill, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 191 Exotica Greens, 6th Floor, 604, Block A, RG Baruah Rd, is more than just a dining and drinking establishment; it''s a destination. Offering a sophisticated yet approachable ambiance, The Whiskey Bar & Grill has rapidly become a prominent fixture in the local Assam business landscape. We distinguish ourselves by providing a curated experience centered around premium whiskeys from around the world, expertly paired with a diverse menu of grilled specialties and globally-inspired dishes. Recognizing the growing demand for elevated culinary experiences in Guwahati, The Whiskey Bar & Grill aims to provide a haven for both casual diners and discerning connoisseurs.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings are built on two pillars: exceptional beverages and delectable cuisine. Our extensive whiskey selection is carefully chosen to cater to a wide range of palates, from novice whiskey enthusiasts to seasoned aficionados. We offer guided tastings, whiskey flights, and expertly crafted cocktails using both classic and innovative recipes. Beyond whiskey, our bar boasts a comprehensive selection of other spirits, wines, and beers, ensuring something for everyone. The "Grill" aspect of our name is equally important. Our kitchen team specializes in grilling premium cuts of meat, fresh seafood, and flavorful vegetarian options, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible to support regional producers and ensure optimal freshness. Menu items are designed to complement the whiskey selection, with careful consideration given to flavor profiles and pairings. What sets us apart is our commitment to providing an accessible and educational whiskey experience, demystifying the spirit and making it approachable for all. This, combined with our high-quality grilled cuisine, provides a unique and compelling dining experience that caters to the evolving tastes of the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At The Whiskey Bar & Grill, the customer experience is paramount. We believe that genuine hospitality and attentive service are essential ingredients for a memorable visit. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and beverage offerings, enabling them to provide personalized recommendations and answer any questions customers may have. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where guests feel comfortable and valued. To enhance the customer experience, we frequently host live music events featuring local artists, creating a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We also actively participate in local community events and collaborate with other businesses to promote Guwahati''s growing culinary scene. We understand the importance of connecting with the local community and strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a valued member of the neighborhood. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers through surveys and direct interaction to continuously improve our services and offerings and to ensure that we are meeting their needs and expectations.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, The Whiskey Bar & Grill envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a premier dining and drinking destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to introduce new whiskey selections and seasonal menu items regularly to keep our offerings fresh and exciting. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local distilleries and breweries to showcase the burgeoning craft beverage scene in Assam. Furthermore, we aim to develop our online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and social media engagement to reach a wider audience. We are also considering expanding our physical footprint by adding outdoor seating or a private dining room to accommodate larger groups and events. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to establish The Whiskey Bar & Grill as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service. We are committed to investing in our team, our community, and our business to ensure sustained growth and success in the years to come. Our vision is to create a legacy of culinary excellence and contribute to the vibrant and evolving landscape of Guwahati''s dining and entertainment scene.</p>', '191 Exotica Greens, 6th Floor, 604, Block A, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:45:21.000Z'),
(1873, 'House of Madira', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>House of Madira: A Taste of Assam, Crafted with Care</p>

<p>Located in the heart of Guwahati at Ground Floor, Block B, Central Mall, GS Rd, House of Madira offers a curated collection of alcoholic beverages and artisanal snacks, emphasizing locally sourced ingredients and unique Assam flavors. More than just a retail outlet, House of Madira is an experience – a place to discover the diverse tastes of the region, expertly curated and presented with a commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. In a market dominated by national brands, House of Madira distinguishes itself by championing local producers and offering a refined selection that appeals to both seasoned connoisseurs and those new to the world of spirits and fine foods. Our commitment to showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam positions us as a significant contributor to the local business landscape, fostering economic growth for regional artisans and producers. We strive to be a destination that reflects the vibrant culture of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of House of Madira lies a carefully chosen selection of alcoholic beverages. While offering a range of popular spirits and wines, our true focus is on showcasing the unique offerings from Assam and the Northeast. This includes locally brewed rice beer (Judima), fruit wines crafted from regional produce, and even locally distilled spirits that adhere to the highest quality standards. Complementing the beverages, we offer an array of artisanal snacks and accompaniments, again prioritizing locally sourced ingredients. Imagine sampling a handcrafted cheese platter featuring cheeses from Meghalaya, paired with a glass of locally produced plum wine, or enjoying spicy bhut jolokia infused cashew nuts alongside a refreshing craft beer. Our unique selling point is this emphasis on regional flavors and the ability to create pairings that are both exciting and authentically Assamese. We directly address the growing market demand for unique and authentic culinary experiences, moving beyond mass-produced goods to offer a taste of the region''s soul. We actively partner with local farmers, producers, and artisans, ensuring that our products are fresh, high-quality, and contribute to the sustainability of the local economy. We also provide tasting sessions and guided pairings, allowing customers to fully appreciate the nuances of the regional products.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at House of Madira. We believe that every interaction is an opportunity to build a lasting relationship and share our passion for the region''s culinary treasures. Our staff is meticulously trained not just on product knowledge, but also on providing personalized recommendations and creating a welcoming atmosphere. We encourage customers to sample products, ask questions, and explore the unique offerings available. Beyond the transactional aspect, we strive to create a sense of community. We host regular events, such as wine tasting evenings featuring local vineyards, food pairing workshops highlighting regional cuisine, and meet-the-producer events where customers can interact directly with the artisans behind their favorite products. We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships of local events and partnerships with other businesses. This involvement helps us to build brand loyalty, generate positive word-of-mouth, and foster a sense of shared pride in the region''s rich culinary heritage. We also collect customer feedback through online surveys and in-store suggestion boxes, constantly striving to improve our service and cater to the evolving needs of our clientele. Our commitment to ethical sourcing, sustainable practices, and supporting local artisans further enhances the customer experience, appealing to a growing segment of consumers who prioritize social responsibility.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for House of Madira is one of continued growth and expansion, while remaining true to our core values of showcasing regional flavors and supporting local producers. We envision expanding our product line to include a wider range of artisanal goods, such as handcrafted chocolates, traditional Assamese sweets, and unique food products made with indigenous ingredients. We also plan to explore opportunities for online sales, allowing us to reach a wider audience and share the flavors of Assam with customers across the country. Furthermore, we are actively considering opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and potentially expanding to other cities in the Northeast. A key component of our growth strategy is to further develop our relationships with local producers, providing them with the resources and support they need to scale their operations and reach a wider market. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own branded products, using locally sourced ingredients and traditional recipes to create unique and distinctive offerings. Our long-term goal is to become a leading destination for authentic Assamese culinary experiences, recognized for our commitment to quality, customer service, and supporting the local community. We aim to be more than just a store; we want to be a cultural ambassador, sharing the unique flavors and traditions of Assam with the world.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Block B, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:45:27.000Z'),
(1874, 'The Twilight Exists', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Twilight Exists, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at RG Complex, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd, is more than just a business; it''s a destination. We offer a carefully curated blend of retail and experience, designed to cater to the discerning tastes of the local community and beyond. In a rapidly evolving Assam business landscape, The Twilight Exists distinguishes itself by focusing on providing unique, high-quality goods and services that foster a sense of connection and discovery.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Twilight Exists operates as a specialty boutique and cafe, strategically combined to create a synergistic and immersive customer experience. Our retail section features a selection of handcrafted artisanal products sourced primarily from local and regional artisans. This includes textiles, jewelry, home décor, and unique gift items, each telling a story of craftsmanship and cultural heritage. By prioritizing local artisans, we actively contribute to the economic empowerment of the community and celebrate the rich artistic traditions of Assam and the Northeast.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Complementing the retail offerings is our cafe, a warm and inviting space serving freshly brewed coffee, locally sourced teas, and a selection of light bites and pastries. The cafe is not just a place to grab a quick bite; it''s designed as a community hub, a space where people can connect, relax, and engage in conversation. We source our ingredients locally whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers and producers. The menu features both classic cafe staples and regional specialties, offering a taste of Assam''s culinary heritage. A unique selling point of our cafe is the occasional hosting of events such as open mic nights, poetry readings, and art exhibitions, further fostering a sense of community and creative expression.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The unique selling proposition of The Twilight Exists lies in its ability to seamlessly blend retail and hospitality, creating a holistic and engaging customer experience. Unlike traditional retailers or cafes, we offer a space where customers can browse unique handcrafted items while enjoying a delicious beverage and connecting with others. This integrated approach resonates deeply with the local market, which increasingly values experiences and authenticity. We cater to a diverse clientele, including local residents, tourists seeking authentic souvenirs, and individuals looking for unique and thoughtful gifts.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Twilight Exists. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized environment for every visitor. Our staff is carefully trained to provide exceptional customer service, offering knowledgeable assistance with product selection and personalized recommendations. We believe in building relationships with our customers, understanding their needs and preferences, and fostering a sense of loyalty. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>To further enhance the customer experience, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We participate in local festivals and events, showcasing our products and promoting local artisans. We also partner with local schools and organizations to host workshops and events that promote creativity and cultural awareness. These initiatives help us build strong relationships with the community and establish The Twilight Exists as a trusted and valued local business.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Twilight Exists envisions becoming a leading destination for authentic artisanal products and community engagement in Guwahati. Our future plans include expanding our retail selection to include a wider range of products from artisans across the Northeast region. We also plan to enhance our cafe offerings with a more diverse menu featuring regional specialties and healthy options. We aim to establish an online presence, enabling us to reach a wider audience and showcase the talents of our local artisans to the world.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>In the long term, The Twilight Exists aspires to become a model for sustainable and community-focused business. We are committed to supporting local artisans, promoting cultural heritage, and creating a positive impact on the community. We envision expanding our operations to other locations in Assam and the Northeast, bringing our unique blend of retail and hospitality to a wider audience. By staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we are confident that The Twilight Exists will continue to thrive and contribute to the vibrant business landscape of Assam.</p>', 'RG Complex, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:45:34.000Z'),
(1875, 'Freemason’s Brewworks', 'Bars', NULL, '<article>
<h1>Freemason’s Brewworks: A Guwahati Landmark</h1>

<p>Freemason’s Brewworks, a vibrant microbrewery and restaurant, offers a distinctive dining and entertainment experience in the heart of Guwahati. Located on the 5th Floor of City Center Mall, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospital, it stands as a premier destination for craft beer enthusiasts and those seeking a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere. More than just a place to grab a drink, Freemason’s Brewworks aims to cultivate a community gathering place, providing a refreshing departure from the typical dining options in the area and contributing to the burgeoning food and beverage scene in Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>In a market increasingly receptive to unique culinary experiences, Freemason’s Brewworks fills a crucial niche by offering handcrafted beers brewed on-site. This commitment to quality and craftsmanship sets it apart from establishments that primarily serve mass-produced beverages. Furthermore, its strategic location within City Center Mall provides easy access and visibility, making it an attractive option for shoppers, professionals, and residents alike. The business leverages the mall''s foot traffic while simultaneously drawing in patrons specifically for its unique offerings, creating a symbiotic relationship that benefits both Freemason''s Brewworks and the surrounding retail environment.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Crafting Experiences: Core Services and Products</h2>

<p>At the heart of Freemason’s Brewworks lies its microbrewery, producing a diverse range of craft beers to cater to varying palates. From crisp lagers and hoppy IPAs to rich stouts and flavorful ales, the brewery aims to offer a rotating selection of seasonal and experimental brews. Beyond beer, the menu features a carefully curated selection of appetizers, entrees, and desserts, designed to complement the beer offerings. The food menu focuses on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, reflecting a commitment to supporting local farmers and producers and providing a truly regional experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>What distinguishes Freemason’s Brewworks is its commitment to the brewing process itself. Patrons can often observe the brewing process through strategically placed windows, offering a glimpse into the art and science behind each pint. This transparency fosters a sense of connection and appreciation for the craftsmanship involved. Furthermore, the brewery hosts regular events, such as brewery tours, beer pairing dinners, and live music performances, further enhancing its appeal and creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The appeal extends beyond just the beer and food. The interior design of Freemason’s Brewworks is deliberately crafted to create a warm and inviting ambiance. A blend of rustic and modern elements creates a space that feels both comfortable and sophisticated. Comfortable seating arrangements, thoughtfully designed lighting, and curated artwork contribute to an overall atmosphere that encourages relaxation and conversation. The open layout allows for easy flow and interaction, fostering a sense of community among patrons.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>A Customer-Centric Approach</h2>

<p>Freemason’s Brewworks prioritizes exceptional customer service as a cornerstone of its success. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the beer offerings and food menu, providing informed recommendations and engaging with customers to understand their preferences. A friendly and attentive atmosphere is fostered, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated into service improvements and menu development.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The business also actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. Supporting local charities and sponsoring local initiatives further strengthens its ties to the community and reinforces its commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. These efforts not only enhance the brand''s reputation but also contribute to the overall well-being of the Guwahati community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Brewing the Future: Vision and Growth</h2>

<p>Looking ahead, Freemason’s Brewworks envisions becoming a leading destination for craft beer and culinary experiences in Guwahati and beyond. The business plans to expand its brewing capacity to meet increasing demand and introduce new and innovative beer styles. Exploration of partnerships with local restaurants and bars to distribute its craft beers is also being considered, further expanding its reach and brand awareness.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The long-term goals include establishing Freemason’s Brewworks as a recognizable brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. This includes exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other strategic areas within Assam and potentially beyond, while maintaining the core values of craftsmanship, quality, and customer service that have defined its success. Through continuous innovation, a dedication to quality, and a strong connection to the local community, Freemason’s Brewworks is poised to continue its growth and solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati’s vibrant food and beverage landscape.</p>
</article>', '5th Floor, City Center Mall, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:50:10.000Z'),
(1876, 'T Sin Q - Sports cum Lounge Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>T Sin Q - Sports cum Lounge Bar: Where Assam''s Sporting Spirit Meets Relaxed Sophistication</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Bedi Market, Dr RP Rd, T Sin Q – Sports cum Lounge Bar is a dynamic establishment redefining the social scene in Assam. More than just a bar, T Sin Q offers a multifaceted experience, blending the thrill of live sports with the comfort and ambiance of a sophisticated lounge. Addressing a gap in the local market for a venue that caters to both sports enthusiasts and those seeking a refined social gathering spot, T Sin Q has quickly become a popular destination for residents and visitors alike, contributing significantly to the evolving leisure landscape of the area. The establishment distinguishes itself by creating a harmonious blend of energetic sports viewing and relaxed lounge atmosphere, a rare offering in the regional hospitality sector.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At its core, T Sin Q provides a diverse range of services tailored to cater to a broad clientele. Primarily, the business operates as a full-service bar, offering a curated selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. This includes local Assam beers, popular international brands, handcrafted cocktails, and a variety of soft drinks and juices. Complementing the beverage offerings is a thoughtfully designed food menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and popular continental snacks. The menu is crafted to pair perfectly with the drinks, enhancing the overall dining experience. A key differentiator for T Sin Q is its focus on live sports broadcasting. Multiple large-screen televisions are strategically placed throughout the venue, ensuring optimal viewing from any location. This allows patrons to enjoy major sporting events, creating a vibrant and communal atmosphere. Additionally, T Sin Q provides a comfortable lounge area with plush seating, mood lighting, and carefully selected music. This space is designed for more intimate gatherings and relaxed conversations, providing a welcome contrast to the energy of the sports viewing area. Regular promotions, themed nights, and special events further enhance the appeal, ensuring there''s always something new and exciting happening at T Sin Q. These services directly respond to the local market''s need for a versatile venue that can cater to various social occasions, from casual get-togethers to celebratory events.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at T Sin Q. The business is committed to providing exceptional service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. A team of highly trained and attentive staff members are dedicated to anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. From the moment a guest enters the premises, they are greeted with a warm and friendly atmosphere. The staff are knowledgeable about the menu and are always happy to offer recommendations or assist with any queries. Beyond the immediate service, T Sin Q actively engages with the local community by sponsoring local sports teams, hosting charity events, and participating in community initiatives. This commitment to social responsibility fosters a strong sense of connection with the neighborhood. Moreover, T Sin Q emphasizes creating a safe and inclusive environment for all patrons. Security measures are in place to ensure the well-being of guests, and the staff are trained to handle any situation with professionalism and discretion. This dedication to customer service, community engagement, and safety is what truly sets T Sin Q apart, fostering a loyal customer base and positive word-of-mouth referrals. The commitment to creating a memorable and enjoyable experience for every guest is central to the business''s philosophy.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, T Sin Q envisions a future of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to solidify its position as the premier sports cum lounge bar in the region, attracting a wider audience and enhancing its brand reputation. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more local and international cuisine options, catering to diverse palates. The introduction of live music performances and DJ nights is also under consideration, further diversifying the entertainment offerings. A potential expansion of the venue itself is being explored to accommodate the growing demand and provide even more comfortable seating options. Furthermore, T Sin Q plans to leverage social media and digital marketing strategies to reach a broader audience and enhance customer engagement. A loyalty program is also in development to reward repeat customers and foster a sense of community. The long-term goal is to establish T Sin Q as a recognizable and respected brand within the hospitality industry, known for its quality service, vibrant atmosphere, and commitment to the local community. T Sin Q aspires to be more than just a bar; it aims to be a social hub, a place where people can come together to celebrate life''s moments, big and small, in a welcoming and enjoyable environment. The business is committed to adapting to the evolving needs of the market and continuously innovating to stay ahead of the competition, ensuring a sustainable and successful future.</p>', 'Bedi Market, Dr RP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:50:18.000Z'),
(1877, 'RANN JYPSY BY RANNVIJAY (A JKM VENTURE)', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>RANN JYPSY BY RANNVIJAY (A JKM VENTURE), nestled on Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path, is a dynamic and innovative enterprise poised to reshape the retail and lifestyle landscape of Assam. More than just a business, it''s a carefully curated experience, blending contemporary trends with a deep appreciation for local artistry and culture. As a JKM VENTURE, RANN JYPSY draws upon a foundation of established business acumen and strategic vision, allowing it to bring a fresh perspective to the market and offer something truly unique to the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, RANN JYPSY is a multi-faceted retail destination offering a carefully selected range of products and services catering to a discerning clientele. While the precise offerings may evolve to reflect current trends and customer preferences, the underlying principle remains constant: to provide high-quality, thoughtfully sourced items that reflect both global influences and the rich heritage of Assam. We envision a retail space that seamlessly integrates apparel, accessories, lifestyle goods, and potentially even a curated selection of artisanal food products. Think a fusion of modern fashion, handcrafted jewelry, unique home décor items that tell a story, and perhaps even locally sourced delicacies, all under one roof.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The unique selling point of RANN JYPSY lies not just in the products themselves, but in the overall experience it offers. We aim to create an atmosphere that is both aspirational and accessible, fostering a sense of discovery and delight. Unlike mass-market retailers, we focus on curating a collection that is distinct and meaningful, emphasizing quality, craftsmanship, and ethical sourcing. We believe in supporting local artisans and showcasing the talent of the region, potentially incorporating locally produced textiles, crafts, and artwork into our inventory. This commitment to local sourcing not only supports the community but also adds a unique and authentic flavor to the RANN JYPSY brand.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Understanding the specific needs and preferences of the local market is paramount to our success. Assam possesses a vibrant cultural identity and a growing appreciation for quality and style. RANN JYPSY seeks to cater to this demographic by offering products that are both fashionable and functional, catering to the diverse needs of the community. Whether it''s offering clothing that is suitable for the climate, accessories that reflect local traditions, or lifestyle goods that enhance everyday life, we strive to provide solutions that resonate with the local consumer. Our market research involves a continuous understanding of regional trends and consumer behaviors, which drives our curated product selection.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of the RANN JYPSY philosophy. We believe that exceptional customer service is not just about transactions, but about building relationships and creating a positive and memorable experience for every visitor. Our staff will be trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and genuinely helpful, providing personalized recommendations and assisting customers in finding exactly what they are looking for. We aim to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where customers feel comfortable browsing, exploring, and engaging with our products and services. We envision hosting in-store events, workshops, and collaborations with local artists and designers to further enhance the customer experience and foster a sense of community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond providing excellent service, RANN JYPSY aims to connect with the local community through meaningful engagement and support. This could involve partnering with local charities, sponsoring community events, or participating in initiatives that promote local arts and culture. We believe that by actively contributing to the well-being of the community, we can build trust and loyalty with our customers and create a positive impact on the region. The business aims to be a responsible corporate citizen, upholding ethical business practices and contributing to the sustainable development of the local economy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, RANN JYPSY BY RANNVIJAY (A JKM VENTURE) has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong presence on Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path and building a loyal customer base. Over time, the business envisions expanding its product offerings, exploring opportunities for online sales, and potentially opening additional retail locations in other parts of Assam and beyond. We also anticipate leveraging the JKM VENTURE network to explore synergistic partnerships and collaborations that can further enhance our brand and reach. Ultimately, RANN JYPSY aspires to become a leading retail and lifestyle destination in Assam, known for its quality products, exceptional customer service, and unwavering commitment to the local community. The long-term goal is to become a recognized brand synonymous with style, sophistication, and a deep appreciation for the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p>', 'Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:50:25.000Z'),
(1878, 'Lunar Restro Bar and Club', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Lunar Restro Bar and Club: Elevating Guwahati''s Nightlife Experience</p>

<p>Lunar Restro Bar and Club, situated on the 5th Floor of Subham Square, opposite the Indira Gandhi Athletic Stadium in Guwahati, is a premier destination offering a sophisticated blend of dining, entertainment, and nightlife. More than just a venue, Lunar strives to be a vibrant hub where the local community can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories. As a key player in Assam''s growing hospitality sector, Lunar distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, innovation, and a deep understanding of local preferences.</p>

<p><strong>Core Services and Products</strong></p>

<p>At the heart of Lunar''s offering is a carefully curated menu featuring a fusion of global cuisine and local Assamese flavors. The culinary team prides itself on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring both quality and support for local producers. Signature dishes are thoughtfully crafted to appeal to a diverse palate, from traditional favorites to contemporary culinary creations. Complementing the food menu is an extensive selection of beverages, including classic cocktails, premium spirits, a wide array of beers, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list. The bar staff are trained in mixology, ensuring each drink is expertly prepared and presented.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Beyond the culinary offerings, Lunar provides a dynamic entertainment experience. The venue features a state-of-the-art sound system, professional lighting, and a spacious dance floor, making it an ideal setting for live music performances, DJ sets, and themed parties. Lunar regularly hosts local bands and artists, providing a platform for showcasing Assam''s rich musical talent. The ambiance is designed to be both sophisticated and inviting, creating an atmosphere where guests can relax, socialize, and enjoy the energy of the night. Unique selling points include its panoramic city views from the 5th-floor location, its commitment to providing a safe and secure environment, and its diverse range of entertainment options, catering to a wide demographic. These factors help Lunar meet the local market''s demand for high-quality entertainment and dining experiences.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><strong>Customer Experience</strong></p>

<p>Lunar Restro Bar and Club places a premium on providing exceptional customer service. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, beverages, and entertainment offerings, ensuring they can answer questions and provide recommendations. Lunar actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve its services and offerings. This dedication to customer satisfaction is reflected in the high levels of repeat business and positive reviews. Lunar also actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. By sponsoring local initiatives and supporting charitable causes, Lunar demonstrates its commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Assam business community.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Lunar distinguishes itself through its commitment to creating a memorable and enjoyable experience for every guest. This is achieved through a combination of high-quality food and beverages, a dynamic entertainment program, and exceptional customer service. The venue''s design is carefully considered to create a sophisticated and inviting atmosphere, while the staff are dedicated to providing a warm and welcoming experience.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p><strong>Future Vision</strong></p>

<p>Looking ahead, Lunar Restro Bar and Club envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, further enhancing the entertainment offerings with new and innovative programming, and potentially opening additional locations in other key cities throughout the region. The long-term goal is to establish Lunar as the leading restro bar and club in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. The business also seeks to develop sustainable practices to minimize its environmental footprint and contribute to a more responsible and eco-friendly operation. This includes exploring opportunities to reduce waste, conserve energy, and source sustainable products. By focusing on these key areas, Lunar aims to create a business that is not only successful but also contributes to the well-being of the local community and the environment.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Lunar aims to solidify its position as a premier entertainment and dining destination, continuing to innovate and adapt to the evolving needs and preferences of the local market. This commitment to excellence ensures that Lunar Restro Bar and Club will remain a vibrant and integral part of Guwahati''s nightlife scene for years to come.</p>', '5th Floor, Subham Square, opposite Indira Gandhi Athletic Stadium', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:50:32.000Z'),
(1879, 'Gossip Sky Bar and Resto', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Gossip Sky Bar and Resto: Elevated Dining and Entertainment in the Heart of Assam</p>

<p>Gossip Sky Bar and Resto is a sophisticated dining and entertainment establishment located on the 1st Floor of the Bibekananda Complex, strategically positioned opposite Rajib Bhawan in a vibrant and accessible area of Assam. More than just a restaurant and bar, Gossip Sky Bar and Resto offers a unique, elevated experience, seamlessly blending exquisite culinary offerings with a stylish ambiance and breathtaking views of the surrounding cityscape. It aims to be a premier destination for both local residents and visitors seeking a memorable and refined experience, setting a new standard for dining and nightlife in the region. Its location provides easy access, making it a convenient spot for after-work gatherings, celebratory dinners, and casual meetups.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At the core of Gossip Sky Bar and Resto''s offerings are its diverse and meticulously crafted menus. The restaurant features a multi-cuisine approach, showcasing a curated selection of Indian, Continental, and Pan-Asian dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This commitment to quality extends to the bar, which boasts an impressive array of expertly mixed cocktails, premium spirits, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list. The culinary team focuses on innovative flavor combinations and elegant presentation, ensuring that each dish is a feast for both the eyes and the palate. The signature cocktails are uniquely named and crafted, reflecting the local culture and adding a touch of whimsy to the drinking experience. A key differentiator is the rooftop setting, providing panoramic views that complement the dining experience, making it a highly desirable location for special occasions and romantic evenings. The provision of a comfortable and stylish indoor area also ensures year-round usability, irrespective of weather conditions. By catering to a wide range of tastes and preferences, Gossip Sky Bar and Resto aims to become a culinary landmark, consistently exceeding expectations and solidifying its position as a top-tier dining destination.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Gossip Sky Bar and Resto. The establishment strives to create a welcoming and attentive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. The service staff is meticulously trained to provide knowledgeable recommendations, anticipate needs, and deliver impeccable service with a genuine smile. From the moment a guest enters until their departure, the focus is on ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. The ambiance is carefully curated with tasteful décor, comfortable seating, and mood-setting lighting, creating a relaxed yet sophisticated atmosphere. Regular live music performances and themed events add to the entertainment value, providing guests with a dynamic and engaging experience. Gossip Sky Bar and Resto actively engages with the local community by hosting special events, partnering with local artists and vendors, and supporting local initiatives. This commitment to community involvement helps to build strong relationships and foster a sense of belonging. By consistently exceeding expectations in both service and ambiance, Gossip Sky Bar and Resto aims to cultivate a loyal customer base and become an integral part of the local social scene.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Gossip Sky Bar and Resto is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and continuous improvement. The management team plans to expand its menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that reflect evolving culinary trends and local preferences. Exploring opportunities for outdoor seating enhancements and potentially incorporating a dedicated private dining area are also under consideration. A significant focus will be placed on leveraging digital marketing channels to increase brand awareness and attract new customers, while also strengthening relationships with existing patrons through loyalty programs and personalized communication. Furthermore, the business aims to establish itself as a responsible corporate citizen by implementing sustainable practices and supporting local charities and community initiatives. Long-term goals include expanding the Gossip Sky Bar and Resto brand to other prime locations within Assam and potentially beyond, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. The commitment to exceptional quality, customer satisfaction, and community engagement will remain at the heart of the business''s growth strategy, ensuring its continued success and positive impact on the local landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Bibekananda complex, opposite Rajib Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:50:39.000Z'),
(1880, 'The Root Barrel', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Root Barrel, strategically located on the 7th Floor of Exotica Greens, is a dynamic and innovative business redefining the Assam experience through a unique blend of traditional craftsmanship, modern design, and sustainable practices. More than just a commercial enterprise, The Root Barrel strives to be a vibrant hub where local artisans, businesses, and the community converge, fostering growth and showcasing the rich cultural heritage of the region. By bridging the gap between local artistry and global appeal, The Root Barrel positions itself as a significant player in the emerging Assam business landscape, contributing to economic diversification and promoting the region''s distinctive identity on a broader stage. Our presence in Exotica Greens, a modern and accessible location, allows us to easily connect with a diverse clientele while simultaneously offering a sophisticated and professional environment for business interactions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of The Root Barrel’s offerings lie two core pillars: curated artisan products and bespoke event experiences. Our product line showcases the exquisite skill and artistry of local Assam artisans, featuring handcrafted textiles, intricate woodwork, organic teas, and unique jewelry pieces. These items are meticulously selected for their quality, authenticity, and representation of Assam''s cultural heritage. Beyond simply selling these products, we aim to tell the story behind each creation, connecting customers with the artisans and preserving traditional techniques. Our unique selling point is our commitment to ethical sourcing and fair trade practices, ensuring that the artisans receive equitable compensation for their work and are empowered to sustain their craft. This focus on ethical and sustainable production resonates strongly with the growing consumer demand for responsibly sourced goods. <br> <br>Complementing our product offerings is our bespoke event service, which provides tailored event planning and execution for both corporate and private clients. Drawing inspiration from Assam''s vibrant culture and natural beauty, we create unforgettable experiences ranging from corporate retreats and product launches to weddings and cultural celebrations. Our events are infused with local flavor, incorporating regional cuisine, traditional music, and authentic decor. We leverage our network of local suppliers and artisans to ensure that each event is a unique and memorable reflection of Assam’s identity. These services directly address the local market''s need for sophisticated and culturally relevant event solutions, filling a gap in the existing market.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Root Barrel. We cultivate a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every visitor feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, offering personalized assistance and expert guidance to help customers discover the perfect product or create a memorable event. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our customers, understanding their needs and preferences to deliver solutions that exceed their expectations. We stand out by offering a truly immersive Assam experience, showcasing the region’s culture and traditions through our products, events, and interactions. <br> <br> Furthermore, The Root Barrel actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, community organizations, and educational institutions. We host workshops and cultural events to promote local artistry, educate the public about Assam''s heritage, and foster a sense of community pride. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, showcasing our products and services and contributing to the vibrancy of the Assam community. This commitment to community engagement strengthens our brand reputation and fosters long-term customer loyalty.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Root Barrel envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our product line to incorporate a wider range of Assam-made goods, developing an online platform to reach a global audience, and establishing strategic partnerships with businesses and organizations both within and outside of Assam. We aim to become the leading destination for authentic Assam products and experiences, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. <br> <br> We plan to explore opportunities to expand our event services to cater to a broader range of clients and event types, including offering destination wedding packages and corporate retreats in Assam. We also aim to develop a training program for local artisans, providing them with the skills and resources they need to grow their businesses and reach new markets. By investing in the development of local talent and promoting sustainable practices, The Root Barrel is committed to creating a positive impact on the Assam community and contributing to the region''s economic prosperity. Our presence at Exotica Greens will remain a cornerstone as we build brand recognition and create a trusted space in the local market.</p>', '7th Floor, Exotica Greens', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:55:10.000Z'),
(1881, 'Cheers Cross Roads', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Cheers Cross Roads stands as a vibrant hub of commerce and community, strategically positioned to serve the diverse needs of Assam. More than just a business, it represents a commitment to quality, local engagement, and sustainable growth within the region''s evolving economic landscape. Cheers Cross Roads strives to be a cornerstone of the local economy, fostering connections and contributing to the prosperity of the surrounding area.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Cheers Cross Roads primarily offers a curated selection of locally sourced goods and artisanal products. Recognizing the rich tradition of craftsmanship in Assam, we feature handwoven textiles, organic teas, and unique handcrafted items. These products showcase the talent and heritage of local artisans, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. A key aspect of our service is fostering a direct link between consumers and producers, promoting fair trade practices and supporting the sustainability of local businesses. This connection underscores our commitment to showcasing the best of Assam to both residents and visitors alike. Additionally, Cheers Cross Roads provides a space for community events and workshops, further enhancing its role as a central gathering point. We also provide local produce which includes seasonal fruits and vegetables.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The unique selling point of Cheers Cross Roads lies in its dedication to authenticity and ethical sourcing. We meticulously vet our suppliers, ensuring that products meet rigorous standards of quality and sustainability. Furthermore, our commitment to fair pricing and transparent business practices distinguishes us from larger, impersonal retail chains. By prioritizing local partnerships, we create a mutually beneficial ecosystem that supports the growth of small businesses and preserves the unique cultural heritage of Assam. This not only resonates with consumers seeking authentic experiences but also reinforces our commitment to responsible business practices.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Cheers Cross Roads prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience built on warmth, personalized service, and genuine connection. Our staff is deeply knowledgeable about the products we offer, providing insightful information and recommendations tailored to individual needs. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. Beyond transactional interactions, Cheers Cross Roads actively engages with the local community through sponsorship of local events and participation in community initiatives. We aim to be more than just a business; we aim to be a trusted neighbor and a valuable contributor to the social fabric of Assam. Regularly hosting artist showcase also provides community engagement.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Cheers Cross Roads is ambitious, focused on sustainable growth and expanded community impact. We plan to broaden our product offerings while maintaining our commitment to local sourcing and ethical practices. This includes exploring partnerships with emerging artisans and expanding our reach through online platforms and strategic collaborations. We are also exploring opportunities to develop educational programs that promote sustainable business practices and empower local entrepreneurs. Ultimately, Cheers Cross Roads aspires to become a model for responsible business in Assam, demonstrating that economic success can be achieved while upholding social and environmental values.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Cheers Cross Roads envisions expanding its operations to include a small-scale processing unit for local agricultural products. This initiative would not only create additional employment opportunities but also add value to the region''s agricultural output. This planned expansion aims to solidify Cheers Cross Roads'' position as a key driver of economic development and a champion of local producers.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:55:14.000Z'),
(1882, 'The Root Barrel', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Nestled on the 7th Floor of Exotica Greens, The Root Barrel is rapidly establishing itself as a vibrant hub for Assam''s burgeoning artisanal food and beverage scene. More than just a cafe or a restaurant, The Root Barrel is a curated experience, designed to showcase the rich agricultural heritage of the region and offer a unique, locally-sourced culinary journey to its patrons. In a market often dominated by national and international chains, The Root Barrel stands out by celebrating the distinct flavors and ingredients that define Assam, contributing to the local economy and fostering a deeper connection between consumers and producers. The business actively works to promote sustainable practices within its supply chain, focusing on ethical sourcing and supporting local farmers and artisans.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, The Root Barrel offers a range of carefully crafted services and products designed to appeal to a diverse clientele. The menu features dishes made with locally-sourced ingredients, including seasonal produce, traditional Assamese spices, and unique regional delicacies. From breakfast options showcasing indigenous grains to dinner plates featuring slow-cooked meats and vegetarian delicacies, the offerings are diverse and cater to a range of palates. A key differentiator is the focus on showcasing the unique tea varieties of Assam, with expert tea sommeliers guiding customers through tasting experiences and highlighting the subtle nuances of each blend. Beyond food and beverages, The Root Barrel also features a retail section where customers can purchase locally crafted goods, including handmade textiles, artisanal food products, and traditional Assamese crafts. These items serve as both souvenirs and tangible representations of the region''s cultural richness. The cafe also offers catering services for events, providing customized menus that reflect the client''s preferences and the seasonality of local ingredients.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The customer experience at The Root Barrel is paramount. Every aspect of the business, from the thoughtfully designed interior to the attentive service, is crafted to create a welcoming and memorable experience. Staff members are trained not only in providing efficient service but also in sharing information about the local ingredients and the stories behind the dishes. The Root Barrel actively engages with the local community through events such as cooking classes, tea tasting workshops, and collaborations with local artists and musicians. These initiatives not only attract new customers but also foster a sense of community and connection. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to improve the menu, services, and overall experience. The Root Barrel aims to cultivate a loyal customer base who appreciate the business''s commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. The establishment regularly partners with local NGOs to raise awareness and funds for various social causes, further solidifying its role as a responsible and contributing member of the community.
</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, The Root Barrel envisions itself as a leading force in shaping Assam''s culinary landscape. The business plans to expand its operations, potentially opening additional locations in other key cities within the region. It also aims to further develop its online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services, as well as expanding its reach to customers beyond the local area. A key focus for the future is strengthening its relationships with local farmers and artisans, ensuring a reliable supply of high-quality, locally-sourced ingredients. The business is also exploring the possibility of creating its own line of branded products, featuring unique Assamese ingredients and flavors. In the long term, The Root Barrel aspires to become a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and sustainable business practices. They plan to invest in employee training and development, ensuring that their staff members have the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and contribute to the business''s continued success. The ultimate goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy, promote the region''s cultural heritage, and provide a platform for local producers to thrive.
</p>', '7th Floor, Exotica Greens', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:55:21.000Z'),
(1883, 'The View Restaurant and Lounge', 'Bars', NULL, 'The View Restaurant and Lounge, strategically situated on the 6th Floor, Block A, of the prestigious 191 Exotica Greens, RG Baruah Rd, is more than just a dining establishment; it’s an experience. As a sophisticated restaurant and lounge, The View offers a unique blend of exquisite culinary offerings, expertly crafted beverages, and a breathtaking panoramic vista of Guwahati, solidifying its position as a prominent and desirable destination within Assam’s burgeoning hospitality sector. The restaurant distinguishes itself by providing an elevated and refined ambiance, catering to discerning clientele seeking memorable dining and social experiences.

<br> <br>

The View’s significance lies not only in its prime location and stunning views, but also in its commitment to providing a sophisticated alternative to the existing dining landscape. By focusing on high-quality ingredients, impeccable service, and a thoughtfully curated atmosphere, The View aims to set a new standard for hospitality in the region, attracting both local residents and discerning travelers. The restaurant also contributes positively to the local economy by sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible and creating employment opportunities within the community.

<br> <br>

At its core, The View Restaurant and Lounge provides a multifaceted dining and entertainment experience. The restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring a blend of continental cuisine with subtle infusions of regional Assamese flavors. This culinary approach is designed to appeal to a broad palate while also celebrating the rich culinary heritage of the area. From meticulously prepared appetizers to elegantly plated main courses and decadent desserts, each dish is a testament to the culinary team''s dedication to quality and innovation.

<br> <br>

Beyond the restaurant offerings, The View Lounge boasts an extensive selection of premium spirits, handcrafted cocktails, and a carefully curated wine list. Expert mixologists craft signature cocktails that complement the stunning views and sophisticated atmosphere, creating a truly immersive experience. The lounge also offers a selection of light bites and sharing platters, perfect for enjoying with friends or colleagues.

<br> <br>

A significant unique selling point of The View is its unparalleled panoramic view of Guwahati. The floor-to-ceiling windows offer breathtaking vistas, transforming the dining experience into something truly special. This visual appeal is further enhanced by the elegant and contemporary interior design, creating a sophisticated and comfortable atmosphere.

<br> <br>

The View addresses a clear market need for a high-end dining and social venue in Guwahati. While the city offers a variety of dining options, The View stands out by providing a complete experience that combines exceptional food and drinks, impeccable service, and an unforgettable ambiance. The restaurant also caters to the increasing demand for sophisticated nightlife options, providing a refined alternative to traditional bars and clubs.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at The View Restaurant and Lounge. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a guest enters the premises until their departure, every detail is carefully considered to create a seamless and memorable experience.

<br> <br>

The restaurant aims to create a welcoming and inclusive environment, fostering a sense of community among its patrons. This is achieved through regular events, promotions, and collaborations with local artists and organizations. The View also actively engages with the local community through social media, soliciting feedback and building relationships with its customers.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, The View understands the importance of adapting to the evolving needs of its customers. The restaurant continuously seeks feedback and monitors industry trends to ensure that its offerings remain relevant and appealing. This commitment to continuous improvement is essential for maintaining a competitive edge in the dynamic hospitality market.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, The View Restaurant and Lounge envisions itself as a leading hospitality destination in Assam, renowned for its exceptional culinary offerings, impeccable service, and breathtaking views. The business anticipates continued growth by expanding its offerings and enhancing its customer experience.

<br> <br>

Future plans include introducing seasonal menus that showcase the freshest local ingredients, further refining the cocktail program, and hosting a wider range of events and promotions. The business also plans to explore opportunities for expanding its brand presence, potentially through partnerships or additional locations. The ultimate goal is to establish The View as a symbol of sophisticated dining and social experiences in the region, contributing to the vibrancy and growth of Assam''s business landscape. Long-term goals encompass establishing a strong reputation for culinary excellence and impeccable service, building a loyal customer base, and contributing positively to the local community.', '6th Floor, Block A, 191 Exotica Greens, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:55:28.000Z'),
(1884, 'SHOTS - Cafe & Bar | Guwahati', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>SHOTS - Cafe & Bar | Guwahati, situated on the 2nd Floor of Nirvana Tower, RG Baruah Rd, opposite City Center Mall, offers a unique and vibrant social experience in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a cafe and bar, SHOTS strives to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and create lasting memories. Understanding the evolving social scene in Assam, SHOTS distinguishes itself by blending a relaxed daytime café atmosphere with an energetic and sophisticated nightlife destination.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>SHOTS provides a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse preferences and occasions. During the day, it functions as a modern cafe, serving high-quality coffee sourced from local Assam estates, a selection of teas, freshly baked pastries, and a curated menu of light meals and snacks. The focus is on providing a comfortable and productive environment for individuals looking to work remotely, catch up with friends, or simply enjoy a peaceful moment. As evening approaches, SHOTS transforms into a lively bar, featuring an extensive selection of cocktails crafted by skilled bartenders, a wide range of domestic and international beers, and a premium spirits list. To complement the drinks menu, the bar offers a selection of appetizers and small plates, perfect for sharing and enhancing the social experience. The unique selling point of SHOTS lies in its versatility. It seamlessly transitions from a daytime cafe to a vibrant bar, catering to a broad spectrum of customer needs throughout the day and night. This adaptability addresses the growing demand in Guwahati for spaces that can accommodate different social activities and preferences, from casual daytime gatherings to energetic evening celebrations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At SHOTS, customer experience is paramount. The establishment prioritizes attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu offerings, providing informed recommendations and addressing customer inquiries with professionalism and enthusiasm. Beyond exceptional service, SHOTS cultivates a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The interior design is contemporary and stylish, creating a comfortable and visually appealing space. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, themed nights, and interactive workshops, are organized to foster a sense of community and engagement. Furthermore, SHOTS actively participates in local initiatives and collaborations, supporting local businesses and organizations to strengthen its connection with the surrounding community. By fostering a positive and engaging environment, SHOTS aims to create a loyal customer base and establish itself as a beloved destination in Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, SHOTS envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati hospitality sector. The long-term goals include expanding the menu offerings to incorporate more regional flavors and ingredients, further showcasing the culinary heritage of Assam. Plans are also underway to introduce loyalty programs and exclusive events to reward regular customers and foster brand loyalty. Furthermore, SHOTS is exploring opportunities to expand its presence to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in the Northeast region, bringing its unique cafe and bar concept to a wider audience. The business is committed to continuous improvement, constantly seeking feedback from customers and adapting its services to meet evolving needs and preferences. By maintaining a focus on quality, innovation, and community engagement, SHOTS aims to solidify its position as a leading cafe and bar in Guwahati and a significant contributor to the local business landscape.</p>', '2nd Floor, Nirvana Tower, RG Baruah Rd, opposite City Center Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.351Z', '2025-12-07T12:55:32.000Z'),
(1885, 'Roxy Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Roxy Bar, strategically located at Royal Centre, 603, Guwahati - Shillong Rd, GS Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience in Guwahati, Assam. Situated on a major artery connecting Guwahati and Shillong, Roxy Bar benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a natural choice for after-work gatherings, celebratory occasions, and memorable evenings out. More than just a bar, Roxy Bar aims to contribute to the evolving social scene of Guwahati, offering a carefully curated environment that blends modern aesthetics with authentic Assamese hospitality.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Roxy Bar’s core offering revolves around providing a high-quality beverage selection coupled with a thoughtfully designed food menu. We specialize in expertly crafted cocktails, utilizing premium spirits and fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our bartenders are trained to create both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks that cater to diverse palates. Beyond cocktails, our bar boasts an extensive range of domestic and international beers, including craft selections, as well as a comprehensive wine list featuring reds, whites, and sparkling options. To complement the drinks, Roxy Bar offers a menu of appetizers and small plates designed for sharing and enjoyment. The menu includes both international favorites and dishes with subtle nods to Assamese flavors, providing a unique culinary experience. A key differentiator for Roxy Bar is its commitment to providing exceptional value. While maintaining a premium atmosphere and offering high-quality products, we strive to offer competitive pricing, making Roxy Bar accessible to a wider range of customers within the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>
<p>At Roxy Bar, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm and attentive service designed to make them feel welcome and valued. Our staff is trained to anticipate customer needs and provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that each visit is tailored to individual preferences. The ambiance of Roxy Bar is carefully cultivated to create a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere. The interior design features comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and carefully selected lighting, creating an inviting space for both intimate conversations and lively gatherings. Music plays a crucial role in shaping the Roxy Bar experience. We feature a diverse playlist, carefully curated to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere without being intrusive. Periodically, Roxy Bar hosts live music performances featuring local musicians, further enhancing the entertainment options and connecting with the local artistic community. Beyond the immediate customer experience, Roxy Bar actively seeks to connect with the broader Guwahati community. We participate in local events and support local initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the business landscape. We also leverage social media platforms to connect with customers, share updates, and promote special events, fostering a strong sense of community around the Roxy Bar brand.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, Roxy Bar envisions itself as a leading nightlife destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to continuously refine our offerings, introducing new cocktails, menu items, and entertainment options to keep the experience fresh and exciting for our customers. One potential avenue for growth is expanding our private event capabilities, offering customized packages for corporate gatherings, birthday celebrations, and other special occasions. We also plan to explore opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to create unique and mutually beneficial promotions. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they continue to deliver exceptional service. In the long term, Roxy Bar may explore the possibility of expanding to other locations within Assam or the Northeast region, replicating our successful model while adapting to the specific needs and preferences of each local market. Ultimately, our goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the cultural and economic vitality of Guwahati and the surrounding region.</p>', 'Royal Centre, 603, Guwahati - Shillong Rd, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:00:09.000Z'),
(1886, 'The Socialite', 'Bars', NULL, '<p><strong>The Socialite: Connecting Guwahati Through Curated Experiences</strong></p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 3rd, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd, The Socialite is a dynamic event management and experiential marketing agency redefining social engagement within the Assam business landscape. More than just an event planner, The Socialite acts as a catalyst, forging meaningful connections between businesses, communities, and individuals through uniquely crafted experiences. We understand the nuances of the local culture and leverage that knowledge to create events that resonate deeply with the audience, fostering lasting impressions and driving tangible results. Our presence fills a crucial gap in the market, offering sophisticated and strategically aligned event solutions that elevate brands and enrich the social fabric of the region. We believe in the power of shared experiences to build relationships and drive business forward.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings are centered around delivering unforgettable event experiences, encompassing three key areas: corporate events, social gatherings, and experiential marketing campaigns. For corporate clients, we specialize in orchestrating seamless conferences, product launches, team-building activities, and gala dinners that reflect brand values and achieve specific business objectives. From securing prime venues and managing logistics to curating engaging content and coordinating speaker lineups, we handle every detail with meticulous precision. Our social event planning services cater to a wide range of occasions, including weddings, anniversaries, birthday celebrations, and themed parties, ensuring that each event is a reflection of the client''s personality and vision. The Socialite doesn''t just plan parties; we craft memories. Experiential marketing forms the third pillar of our services, where we design and execute immersive campaigns that captivate audiences and leave a lasting impact. This includes brand activations, pop-up events, and interactive installations designed to connect consumers with brands on a deeper, more emotional level. What sets The Socialite apart is our unwavering commitment to innovation, our deep understanding of the Assamese market, and our ability to tailor solutions to meet the unique needs of each client. We pride ourselves on sourcing local vendors and supporting local businesses, contributing to the economic growth of the region while delivering authentic and culturally relevant experiences. Our intimate knowledge of local preferences, coupled with our global perspective on event trends, allows us to deliver truly unique and effective solutions.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At The Socialite, exceptional customer service is paramount. We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is the key to success. From the initial consultation to the post-event follow-up, we are dedicated to providing a personalized and attentive service experience. Our team of experienced event professionals works closely with each client to understand their vision, budget, and objectives, ensuring that every detail is executed flawlessly. We proactively seek feedback and continuously strive to improve our services. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting charitable organizations and contributing to the cultural vibrancy of Guwahati. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us, and we are committed to using our platform to make a positive impact. This commitment to community engagement not only strengthens our brand reputation but also fosters a sense of trust and loyalty among our clients and partners. We strive to build long-term relationships based on mutual respect and shared values, becoming an integral part of the social and business fabric of Guwahati.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Socialite envisions becoming the leading event management and experiential marketing agency in Northeast India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include destination event planning, catering to clients from across the region who wish to host events in Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own line of branded event products and merchandise, further enhancing the overall event experience. A key focus for the future is leveraging technology to enhance our services and streamline our operations. This includes implementing event management software, utilizing data analytics to track event performance, and incorporating virtual and augmented reality elements into our experiential marketing campaigns. We are committed to staying ahead of the curve and embracing new technologies that can enhance the value we provide to our clients. Furthermore, we aim to foster a culture of innovation and creativity within our team, encouraging continuous learning and development. We believe that our employees are our greatest asset, and we are committed to providing them with the training and resources they need to succeed. Our long-term goal is to establish The Socialite as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with exceptional events, outstanding customer service, and a commitment to community engagement. We are confident that with our dedication, expertise, and passion for creating unforgettable experiences, we can achieve our vision and make a lasting impact on the social and business landscape of Assam.</p>', '3rd, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:00:17.000Z'),
(1887, 'Urban Mantra six mile', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Urban Mantra Six Mile, nestled on Namghar Path, is a contemporary lifestyle boutique offering a curated selection of fashion, home décor, and artisanal crafts. More than just a retail space, Urban Mantra aims to be a haven for discerning customers seeking unique, high-quality products that reflect both modern sensibilities and Assam''s rich cultural heritage. The boutique strives to bridge the gap between global trends and local artistry, making it a distinctive presence in Guwahati’s evolving retail landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Urban Mantra offers a diverse range of products and services designed to cater to a broad spectrum of tastes. The fashion section features apparel from emerging and established designers, focusing on comfortable yet stylish clothing made from natural fabrics like cotton, silk, and linen. The selection emphasizes contemporary silhouettes and timeless designs, appealing to individuals seeking sophisticated everyday wear and occasion-specific attire. Complementing the clothing line is a selection of handcrafted jewelry, bags, and accessories, sourced from local artisans and cooperatives, supporting indigenous craftsmanship and sustainable practices.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The home décor section showcases a carefully chosen collection of furniture, textiles, lighting, and decorative objects. These items are designed to add character and warmth to any living space, ranging from minimalist pieces with clean lines to more ornate designs inspired by traditional Assamese motifs. The store also features a selection of handcrafted pottery, paintings, and sculptures from local artists, promoting regional talent and providing customers with the opportunity to own unique pieces of art. A notable offering is its curated selection of Assamese tea, sourced directly from local tea gardens, providing an authentic taste of the region’s renowned beverage. These teas, along with locally produced honey and spices, are thoughtfully packaged and presented, making them ideal gifts or personal indulgences. The unique selling point lies in the fusion of contemporary design with traditional craftsmanship, creating a product offering that is both modern and deeply rooted in the local culture. This blend resonates with the growing demand for ethically sourced, handcrafted products that tell a story.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Urban Mantra Six Mile. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized assistance and styling advice, ensuring that each customer feels valued and understood. The boutique fosters a warm and welcoming atmosphere, encouraging customers to browse at their leisure and discover new and exciting products. Regular events, such as designer meet-and-greets, art exhibitions, and tea tasting sessions, are organized to engage the local community and create a sense of belonging. These events provide a platform for local artists and artisans to showcase their work and connect with potential customers. The business actively participates in local festivals and community initiatives, strengthening its ties with the neighborhood and demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the product offering and service quality. Building long-term relationships with customers is a key priority, fostering brand loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Urban Mantra Six Mile envisions expanding its product line to include a wider range of sustainable and ethically sourced goods. This includes exploring partnerships with more artisans and cooperatives from across Northeast India, showcasing the diverse talent and cultural heritage of the region. Plans are underway to develop an online platform to reach a wider audience and facilitate convenient online shopping. The business also aims to establish itself as a destination for cultural tourism, offering workshops and demonstrations that provide visitors with a deeper understanding of Assamese art, craft, and culture. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, extending the Urban Mantra brand to new markets. The ultimate vision is to become a leading lifestyle brand in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, craftsmanship, and community engagement, while remaining true to its roots on Namghar Path, Six Mile. The focus will always be on curating a collection that celebrates the best of both worlds: contemporary design and traditional Assamese artistry, enriching the lives of its customers and contributing to the vibrant cultural tapestry of the region.</p>', 'Namghar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:00:23.000Z'),
(1888, 'Zen9 Café & Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Zen9 Café & Bar, situated on the 3rd Floor of the First Building within Central Mall on GS Road, offers a sophisticated yet relaxed dining and social experience, establishing itself as a unique destination within Guwahati''s vibrant culinary scene. More than just a café or a bar, Zen9 seamlessly blends the ambiance of a contemporary restaurant with the conviviality of a stylish lounge, catering to a diverse clientele seeking quality food, refreshing beverages, and a comfortable atmosphere. Its location within Central Mall provides accessibility and visibility, making it a convenient and appealing choice for shoppers, professionals, and residents alike. The café’s commitment to providing a consistently high-quality experience differentiates it within the Assam business landscape, where the demand for refined dining and social venues is continuously growing.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Zen9 Café & Bar provides a comprehensive array of services designed to cater to various customer preferences and needs. At its core, the business offers a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and globally inspired dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From delectable appetizers and hearty main courses to decadent desserts, the culinary offerings are crafted to tantalize the taste buds and provide a satisfying dining experience. The beverage menu is equally extensive, showcasing a wide selection of expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, fine wines, and a range of non-alcoholic options, including freshly brewed coffee, artisanal teas, and refreshing juices. A key differentiating factor is the café''s ability to seamlessly transition from a daytime café environment to a vibrant bar setting in the evening. This versatility allows Zen9 to cater to different customer segments throughout the day, from those seeking a quiet lunch or afternoon coffee to those looking for a lively evening of drinks and socializing. Furthermore, Zen9 offers catering services for small events and gatherings, bringing its signature culinary expertise and impeccable service to private functions.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Zen9 Café & Bar, and every aspect of the business is designed to create a welcoming and memorable environment. The café prides itself on providing exceptional service delivered by a team of friendly, knowledgeable, and attentive staff members who are dedicated to exceeding customer expectations. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, ensuring a positive and comfortable experience. The ambiance of Zen9 is carefully curated to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, featuring comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and soft, ambient lighting. This creates an environment conducive to both intimate conversations and larger social gatherings. Zen9 actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting live music performances featuring local artists, showcasing artwork from regional talent, and participating in community events. By supporting local talent and fostering a sense of community, Zen9 aims to become more than just a business; it strives to be a valued member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its cultural vibrancy and social fabric.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Zen9 Café & Bar envisions significant growth potential within the rapidly expanding Guwahati market. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more innovative and locally inspired dishes, further solidifying its position as a culinary destination. The business also aims to enhance its beverage offerings by introducing new and exciting cocktails, craft beers, and specialty wines, appealing to a broader range of tastes. Exploring opportunities to host themed events, such as wine tasting evenings, live music nights, and culinary workshops, is also on the horizon. These events will further enhance the café''s appeal and attract new customers. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other strategic locations within Guwahati and beyond, replicating the successful Zen9 model while adapting to the unique characteristics of each new market. The focus will remain on providing exceptional customer service, creating a welcoming and vibrant atmosphere, and contributing to the growth and development of the local community. Zen9 Café & Bar is committed to establishing itself as a leading destination for quality food, refreshing beverages, and memorable experiences in Assam.</p>', '3rd Floor First Building, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:00:29.000Z'),
(1889, 'The Alley Bar & Kitchen', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Alley Bar & Kitchen, nestled within the Hotel Agneedeep on By Lane Number 2 in Assam, offers a distinctive dining and social experience that bridges the gap between a sophisticated bar and a welcoming kitchen. More than just a place to grab a drink or a meal, The Alley is envisioned as a community hub, a place where locals and travelers alike can connect, unwind, and enjoy thoughtfully prepared food and beverages in a relaxed, yet stylish setting. Its location, slightly tucked away from the main thoroughfare, lends it an exclusive, intimate atmosphere, setting it apart from the more conventional establishments in the area.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Alley Bar & Kitchen offers a curated selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, alongside a menu focused on fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. The bar program features classic cocktails prepared with precision, alongside signature creations that incorporate regional flavors and ingredients, celebrating the unique culinary landscape of Assam. Beyond the standard spirits, a focus is placed on craft beers, both domestic and international, providing options for the discerning beer enthusiast. The kitchen complements the bar with a menu designed for sharing and socializing. Appetizers are a particular strength, with options ranging from traditional Assamese snacks presented in a modern style to globally inspired small plates perfect for pairing with drinks. Larger plates are also available, showcasing seasonal produce and providing satisfying meal options. A key differentiator is the commitment to providing vegetarian and vegan options that are as thoughtfully crafted and flavorful as their meat-based counterparts, catering to a wider range of dietary preferences within the community. This focus on inclusivity and catering to diverse tastes is a core element of The Alley''s business philosophy.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The Alley Bar & Kitchen understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to success. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverage offerings, providing personalized recommendations and creating a welcoming atmosphere for every guest. The goal is to foster a sense of belonging, where patrons feel comfortable lingering and connecting with each other. The establishment emphasizes creating a memorable dining experience through attention to detail, from the quality of the ingredients to the ambiance of the space. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists and themed cocktail nights, are organized to engage the community and provide unique entertainment options. The business actively participates in local initiatives and supports regional suppliers, demonstrating a commitment to the surrounding area and building strong relationships with neighboring businesses. Social media is utilized to connect with customers, promote events, and share stories about the restaurant''s food, beverages, and staff, fostering a sense of transparency and authenticity.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, The Alley Bar & Kitchen envisions continued growth and expansion within the local market. Future plans include refining the menu based on customer feedback and seasonal availability, constantly striving to offer the most innovative and appealing dishes. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and artisans will further strengthen the commitment to sourcing local ingredients and supporting the regional economy. The possibility of expanding the physical space to accommodate larger groups and events is also being considered. Furthermore, The Alley aims to establish itself as a leader in responsible bar and restaurant practices, focusing on sustainable sourcing, waste reduction, and ethical labor practices. The long-term goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local community and provides a consistently exceptional experience for all who walk through its doors. By focusing on quality, innovation, and community engagement, The Alley Bar & Kitchen aims to solidify its position as a premier destination for dining and socializing in Assam.</p>', 'ABC, Hotel Agneedeep, By Lane Number 2', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:00:35.000Z'),
(1890, 'Beer Nation Cafe', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Beer Nation Cafe, situated on the 1st Floor of the Silver Square Building, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for craft beer enthusiasts and those seeking a vibrant, community-focused social experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, Beer Nation Cafe aims to cultivate a culture of appreciation for diverse brewing styles, locally sourced ingredients, and engaging social interaction. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, contributing to the growth and diversification of the regional hospitality sector by offering a unique and carefully curated experience unmatched in the area.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around an extensive and carefully selected menu of craft beers, both domestic and international. We prioritize partnerships with local breweries in Assam and the Northeast, showcasing their unique flavors and supporting the regional brewing industry. Beyond the familiar lagers and ales, customers can explore a rotating selection of stouts, IPAs, sours, and specialty brews, catering to a wide range of palates. We also offer insightful tasting notes and pairing suggestions to enhance the overall beer drinking experience. Complementing our beer selection is a thoughtfully designed food menu featuring globally-inspired dishes with a local twist. We emphasize fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, crafting dishes that perfectly complement the beer offerings and cater to diverse dietary preferences, including vegetarian and vegan options. In addition to food and beer, Beer Nation Cafe hosts regular events such as live music performances by local artists, trivia nights, and beer tasting workshops, fostering a lively and engaging atmosphere. Our unique selling point is the combination of a high-quality beer selection, locally-sourced ingredients, and community-focused events, creating a holistic experience that caters to the growing demand for sophisticated and engaging social venues in Assam.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Beer Nation Cafe, we are committed to providing exceptional customer service that fosters loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals. Our staff is highly trained not only in beer knowledge but also in providing attentive and personalized service. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and valued. We strive to anticipate customer needs, provide helpful recommendations, and address any concerns promptly and effectively. We are actively involved in the local community, supporting local charities and organizations through fundraising events and partnerships. We also prioritize building relationships with local businesses, sourcing ingredients locally and collaborating on promotional opportunities. Our connection to the local community is further strengthened through our active presence on social media platforms, where we share updates on new beer arrivals, upcoming events, and engage in meaningful conversations with our customers. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers through online surveys and in-person interactions to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring we are meeting and exceeding their expectations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, Beer Nation Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities within the Assam market and potentially beyond. Our long-term goals include establishing additional locations in key cities across the Northeast, further solidifying our position as a leading provider of craft beer and community-focused social experiences. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that showcase local ingredients and culinary traditions. We also aim to enhance our event programming, incorporating more diverse and engaging activities that cater to a broader range of interests. A key component of our future vision is a continued commitment to sustainability, implementing environmentally friendly practices throughout our operations. This includes reducing our carbon footprint, minimizing waste, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable and ethical sources. We also plan to invest in employee training and development, empowering our staff to provide exceptional service and contribute to the overall success of the business. By focusing on continuous improvement, community engagement, and sustainable practices, Beer Nation Cafe aims to not only grow as a business but also contribute positively to the social and economic development of the region.</p>', '1st Floor, Silver Square Building', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:05:09.000Z'),
(1891, 'Wine O’Clock Restro Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Wine O’Clock Restro Bar, strategically located on Beltola - Basistha Rd, near Basistha in Guwahati, Assam, offers a sophisticated yet relaxed dining and social experience. In a region where culinary experiences are deeply intertwined with social gatherings, Wine O’Clock distinguishes itself by providing a curated blend of global flavors, local tastes, and a comprehensive beverage selection, fostering a unique and appealing atmosphere for diverse patrons.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Wine O’Clock offers a multi-faceted dining and social experience centered around its restaurant and bar services. The restaurant features a diverse menu encompassing continental cuisine, authentic Assamese delicacies, and innovative fusion dishes, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The emphasis is on quality and culinary creativity, offering diners a range of choices from familiar favorites to exciting new flavors. Complementing the food menu is a comprehensive bar offering. This includes a thoughtfully curated wine list featuring both international and Indian selections, alongside a wide range of spirits, beers (domestic and imported), and expertly crafted cocktails. Wine O''Clock stands out by providing an experience beyond simple food and drinks; it''s about creating an atmosphere where patrons can enjoy convivial evenings, celebrate special occasions, or simply unwind after a long day. The restro bar also occasionally hosts themed nights featuring live music, DJ sets, and special food and drink promotions, further enhancing its appeal. These curated events are designed to cater to diverse tastes and provide unique entertainment options within the local community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience at Wine O’Clock is paramount. The establishment is committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring every guest feels welcomed and valued. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverage options, offering informed recommendations and catering to individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully designed to be both inviting and sophisticated. A warm and contemporary décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and carefully chosen music all contribute to a relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere. Beyond excellent service and a pleasant ambiance, Wine O''Clock aims to foster a sense of community. The location near Basistha allows it to cater to local residents and those visiting the area. The restro bar actively engages with the community through participation in local events and collaborations with local suppliers. This community-focused approach helps build strong relationships and reinforces Wine O''Clock''s position as a valued establishment within the Beltola-Basistha area.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Wine O’Clock Restro Bar envisions a future of continued growth and innovation. Plans include expanding the menu to further showcase regional Assamese cuisine and incorporating sustainable practices in sourcing and operations. There are also considerations to broaden the event calendar to include more diverse entertainment options, such as art exhibitions, culinary workshops, and collaborative events with local artisans. Wine O''Clock aims to become a recognized culinary and social destination in Guwahati, known for its quality food and drinks, excellent service, and commitment to the local community. Long-term goals include establishing Wine O’Clock as a benchmark for restro-bar experiences in Assam and potentially expanding to other strategic locations within the region, always retaining the core values of quality, community engagement, and exceptional customer service that define the brand.</p>', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, near Basistha', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:05:15.000Z'),
(1892, 'THE ECHO Pub & Grill', 'Bars', NULL, '```html
<h1>THE ECHO Pub & Grill: A Vibrant Hub in Guwahati''s Culinary Landscape</h1>

THE ECHO Pub & Grill, strategically located on the 1st & 2nd Floor of Dr. Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road, Basistha Rd, opposite Union Bank of India, is rapidly becoming a prominent fixture in Guwahati''s thriving social and culinary scene. Beyond simply offering food and beverages, THE ECHO aims to create a welcoming and engaging environment where patrons can connect, relax, and enjoy a consistently high-quality experience. Situated in a key area with easy access and visibility, THE ECHO fills a need for a refined yet approachable pub and grill that caters to a diverse clientele seeking both familiar comforts and exciting new flavors. The business distinguishes itself through a commitment to exceptional service, a thoughtfully curated menu, and a vibrant ambiance that resonates with the spirit of Assam.

<br> <br>

THE ECHO Pub & Grill''s core offerings revolve around providing a comprehensive dining and social experience. At its heart is a meticulously crafted menu featuring a blend of classic pub fare and grilled specialties, infused with local Assamese influences wherever possible. Think perfectly grilled meats and seafood, alongside innovative appetizers and globally inspired dishes, all prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients. Vegetarian options are given equal consideration, ensuring that all dietary preferences are catered to. The bar boasts an extensive selection of beers, wines, and spirits, including locally brewed craft beers, alongside a creative cocktail menu designed to complement the food offerings. What truly sets THE ECHO apart is its commitment to providing consistently excellent food and drink in a comfortable and stylish setting. The two-story layout allows for varied experiences – the first floor offering a more casual pub atmosphere, while the second floor provides a slightly more refined dining setting, suitable for both intimate dinners and larger group gatherings. This flexibility allows THE ECHO to meet the diverse needs of the local market, from after-work drinks to weekend celebrations.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at THE ECHO Pub & Grill. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service. A warm and welcoming atmosphere is cultivated from the moment guests enter, ensuring that every visit is a memorable one. The emphasis is on building rapport with customers, understanding their preferences, and anticipating their needs. Beyond simply taking orders and serving food, the staff acts as ambassadors for the brand, engaging in genuine interactions and creating a sense of community. THE ECHO actively seeks feedback from its patrons, using both formal and informal channels to continuously improve its offerings and service standards. Furthermore, THE ECHO is committed to connecting with the local community through active participation in local events and partnerships with local suppliers whenever feasible. This dedication to supporting local businesses and engaging with the community reinforces THE ECHO''s position as more than just a pub and grill; it''s a valuable contributor to the social fabric of Guwahati. Special events, live music nights (featuring local artists), and themed promotions are regularly organized to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere, fostering a sense of belonging and encouraging repeat visits.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, THE ECHO Pub & Grill envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati market and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more innovative dishes and locally sourced ingredients, enhancing the beverage offerings with new and exciting cocktails and craft beers, and potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas of the city or other parts of Assam. The long-term goal is to establish THE ECHO as a leading hospitality brand recognized for its commitment to quality, service, and community engagement. Exploring opportunities for outdoor seating, offering online ordering and delivery services, and implementing loyalty programs are also under consideration to further enhance the customer experience and expand market reach. THE ECHO is committed to staying ahead of industry trends, continuously innovating, and adapting to meet the evolving needs of its customers, ensuring its continued success and solidifying its position as a cornerstone of Guwahati''s social and culinary landscape.

<br> <br>

THE ECHO aspires to be more than just a pub and grill; it strives to be a destination – a place where people come to celebrate, connect, and create lasting memories. By prioritizing quality, service, and community, THE ECHO is poised to become a beloved and enduring institution in Guwahati.
```', '1st & 2nd Floor Dr. Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road, Basistha Rd, opposite Union Bank of India', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:05:21.000Z'),
(1893, 'FTV Lounge', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>FTV Lounge stands as a beacon of sophisticated entertainment and upscale hospitality within Guwahati’s vibrant social scene. Strategically located at ABC, 5th & 6th Floor, Lobby Level 2, Exotica Arcade, GS Rd, next to IDBI Bank, this premier establishment offers a distinctive experience, elevating the city’s nightlife and providing a sought-after venue for discerning clientele. Situated in a prime location on GS Road, the Lounge is easily accessible and benefits from high foot traffic, establishing itself as a prominent landmark within the Exotica Arcade. FTV Lounge aims to bring a cosmopolitan flair to Assam, offering a fusion of world-class ambiance with a genuine appreciation for local culture and preferences.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core offering of FTV Lounge revolves around providing a multifaceted entertainment experience. This includes a meticulously curated selection of premium spirits, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. A signature menu features a diverse range of culinary delights, from globally inspired appetizers and finger foods to more substantial dishes designed to complement the beverage offerings. The Lounge distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality and innovation. Live music performances featuring local and national artists, alongside sophisticated DJ sets, contribute to the electric atmosphere. Occasional themed nights, fashion events, and corporate gatherings are also hosted, further diversifying the Lounge''s appeal and solidifying its position as a dynamic entertainment hub. FTV Lounge understands the specific needs of the local market by incorporating regional flavors and ingredients into its menu, supporting local artists through performance opportunities, and catering to a diverse demographic, ensuring that there is something for everyone to enjoy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At FTV Lounge, the customer experience is paramount. A dedicated and highly trained staff ensures that every guest receives personalized attention and impeccable service. The ambiance is carefully designed to create an atmosphere of refined elegance, with stylish décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems. The Lounge strives to foster a sense of community by hosting events that celebrate local culture and partnering with local businesses. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered, allowing FTV Lounge to continuously improve and tailor its offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele. Beyond providing a space for entertainment, FTV Lounge aims to be a place where people can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories. The Lounge also maintains a strong presence on social media, engaging with its audience and promoting upcoming events, creating a virtual community around the brand.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, FTV Lounge envisions significant growth and expansion. Future plans include exploring opportunities to expand the menu with even more innovative culinary creations and introducing new entertainment concepts to keep the experience fresh and exciting. Collaborations with renowned mixologists and chefs are also being considered to further elevate the Lounge''s offerings. The long-term goal is to establish FTV Lounge as the leading entertainment destination in Guwahati and a recognized brand across the Northeast region. This will involve strategic investments in marketing and branding, as well as a continuous focus on innovation and customer satisfaction. Potential expansion plans may also include opening new locations in other key cities in Assam and beyond, replicating the successful formula of FTV Lounge while adapting to the unique characteristics of each market. The Lounge is committed to remaining a vibrant and integral part of the local community, contributing to the economic growth and cultural richness of the region. Ultimately, FTV Lounge strives to be more than just a lounge; it aims to be a destination that embodies sophistication, entertainment, and a true appreciation for the spirit of Assam.</p>', 'ABC, 5th & 6th Floor, Lobby Level 2, Exotica Arcade, GS Rd, next to IDBI Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:05:26.000Z'),
(1894, 'Slice Of Lime Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Slice Of Lime Bar & Restaurant, strategically located at 4RJ5+HC7, GS Rd in the heart of Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier dining and social destination. Unlike conventional establishments, Slice Of Lime offers a carefully curated experience that blends contemporary culinary trends with the rich cultural tapestry of the region. It’s more than just a place to eat and drink; it''s a venue designed to foster connections, celebrate local flavors, and provide a vibrant atmosphere for both residents and visitors. The restaurant aims to fill a specific niche by offering high-quality food and beverages in a sophisticated yet approachable setting, something that is noticeably lacking in the immediate vicinity. Slice Of Lime seeks to be a landmark, not just a place to eat, but a destination that enhances the local social scene and contributes positively to the surrounding business community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Slice Of Lime provides a comprehensive dining and bar experience. The restaurant''s menu boasts a diverse selection of dishes, ranging from expertly prepared regional Assamese cuisine using locally sourced ingredients to international favorites, catering to a wide range of palates. The culinary team is dedicated to crafting flavorful and visually appealing dishes, emphasizing fresh, seasonal produce and authentic cooking techniques. Beyond the food, Slice Of Lime features a well-stocked bar offering a wide variety of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. This includes classic cocktails, craft beers (featuring local Assam breweries when available), and a carefully selected wine list designed to complement the menu. A key differentiator is the emphasis on creating unique and signature cocktails that reflect the restaurant''s identity and offer a memorable drinking experience. The restaurant also offers private dining and catering services for special events and gatherings, extending its reach beyond the regular dining hours. Live music performances, themed nights, and special menu promotions are also regularly featured, making Slice Of Lime a dynamic and engaging venue.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Slice Of Lime. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff is meticulously trained to provide knowledgeable and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and comfortable. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a welcoming and enjoyable atmosphere. The interior décor blends modern aesthetics with subtle nods to Assamese culture, creating a space that is both stylish and inviting. Music is carefully selected to enhance the dining experience without being intrusive. Slice Of Lime understands the importance of building strong relationships with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and supports local farmers and producers, reinforcing its commitment to sustainability and regional development. Furthermore, the restaurant actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve its offerings and adapt to changing preferences. Regular customer surveys, social media engagement, and direct communication with staff are all utilized to ensure that the restaurant remains responsive and attuned to the needs of the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Slice Of Lime envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The long-term goal is to establish the restaurant as a leading dining and entertainment destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties and collaborating with local chefs and artisans to showcase the diverse culinary heritage of Assam. Exploring opportunities for franchising or opening additional locations in other parts of the state is also a consideration. Furthermore, Slice Of Lime is committed to leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, exploring online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and other digital solutions to improve convenience and engagement. Sustainable practices will continue to be a priority, with ongoing efforts to minimize environmental impact and support local communities. The restaurant also intends to invest in ongoing training and development for its staff, ensuring that they remain equipped to provide exceptional service and contribute to the restaurant''s continued success. Ultimately, Slice Of Lime aspires to become an iconic establishment that not only serves exceptional food and drinks but also plays a vital role in shaping the cultural landscape of Assam.</p>', '4RJ5+HC7, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:05:32.000Z'),
(1895, 'Playboy Beer Garden, Guwahati', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Playboy Beer Garden, Guwahati, situated on the 6th Floor of Exotica Garden, GS Road, ABC, next to IDBI Bank, is a premium destination that elevates the city''s social and entertainment landscape. More than just a bar, it''s a carefully curated experience designed to offer patrons a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere, making it a significant player in Guwahati''s burgeoning hospitality sector. Playboy Beer Garden is uniquely positioned to cater to the discerning tastes of Guwahati''s residents and visitors, providing a high-quality offering distinct from the more traditional establishments in the area.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Playboy Beer Garden provides an extensive selection of premium beers, both domestic and international, carefully curated to cater to a wide range of palates. Complementing the impressive beer selection is a meticulously crafted menu featuring delectable food items ranging from innovative appetizers and bar snacks to substantial entrees designed to perfectly complement the beverage offerings. We also provide a range of spirits, wines, and non-alcoholic beverages. What truly distinguishes Playboy Beer Garden is its commitment to providing a holistic entertainment experience. This encompasses not only the quality of the drinks and food but also the ambiance, which features stylish décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and thoughtfully curated music playlists. Regular events, such as live music performances, themed nights, and special promotions, are organized to provide an engaging and dynamic experience for patrons. By blending premium beverages, high-quality food, and vibrant entertainment, Playboy Beer Garden meets the growing demand in Guwahati for sophisticated and contemporary social venues.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Playboy Beer Garden, and every detail is carefully considered to ensure guest satisfaction. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, knowledgeable, and courteous service, creating a welcoming and comfortable environment for every visitor. A proactive approach is taken to anticipate customer needs and exceed expectations, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals. Understanding the importance of community engagement, Playboy Beer Garden actively participates in local events and initiatives, building relationships with nearby businesses and residents. The business aims to become a recognizable and respected member of the Guwahati community by supporting local artists and showcasing regional talent, thereby fostering a sense of connection and shared identity with its patrons. Furthermore, Playboy Beer Garden actively solicits feedback from customers through various channels, enabling continuous improvement and ensuring that the business remains responsive to the evolving preferences of its clientele. This dedication to personalized service and community integration sets Playboy Beer Garden apart as a truly unique and customer-centric establishment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking toward the future, Playboy Beer Garden, Guwahati, envisions itself as the leading premium beer garden and entertainment destination in the region. Growth plans include expanding the menu to introduce new and exciting culinary offerings, enhancing the beverage selection with innovative craft beers and cocktails, and further refining the entertainment schedule to attract a wider audience. Exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with local breweries and distilleries to feature regional products and support local businesses is also under consideration. The business is committed to investing in employee training and development to maintain the highest standards of service and professionalism. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Assam, bringing the distinctive Playboy Beer Garden experience to a broader audience. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving market demands, Playboy Beer Garden is confident in its ability to achieve sustainable growth and solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati''s vibrant social scene.</p>', '6th Floor, Exotica Garden GS Road, ABC, next to IDBI Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:10:08.000Z'),
(1896, 'Broncco', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Broncco, located on the 2nd floor of Prithvi Centre on GS Road, is a dynamic business poised to make a significant impact on the Assam business landscape. More than just a service provider, Broncco aims to be a collaborative partner, understanding and addressing the nuanced needs of its clients within the unique context of the region''s economic environment. We strive to foster sustainable growth for businesses and individuals alike, contributing to a vibrant and prosperous Assam. Our location in the heart of Guwahati''s commercial hub allows us to be easily accessible and responsive to the evolving demands of the market. Broncco represents a commitment to innovation, quality, and ethical business practices, aiming to set a new standard for excellence in its chosen fields.

