Looking to the future, Broncco envisions becoming a leading provider of innovative business solutions in Assam and beyond. We are committed to expanding our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market, exploring opportunities in areas such as technology integration, sustainable business practices, and export promotion. We plan to leverage technology to enhance our service delivery and improve the customer experience. This includes investing in data analytics, artificial intelligence, and automation to provide more personalized and efficient solutions. We are also committed to fostering a culture of innovation within our organization, encouraging our employees to develop new ideas and explore emerging trends. Broncco''s long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable economic development of Assam, empowering businesses and individuals to thrive in a dynamic and competitive global economy. By focusing on innovation, quality, and community engagement, Broncco is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and become a significant force in the region''s business landscape. Broncco is aiming for significant growth and plans to become a nationally renowned company.</p>', '2nd floor, Prithvi Centre, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:10:14.000Z'),
(1897, 'Exotica Bar and Restro', 'Bars', NULL, 'Exotica Bar & Restro: A Culinary Oasis on Beltola-Basistha Road

Exotica Bar & Restro stands as a vibrant and welcoming establishment on Beltola-Basistha Road, directly opposite City Gas Service, offering a unique blend of delectable cuisine, refreshing beverages, and a relaxed atmosphere. More than just a dining destination, Exotica is designed to be a social hub, a place where friends and families can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories. Its strategic location, combined with its commitment to quality and service, positions Exotica as a significant player in the growing Assam hospitality landscape, catering to both local residents and visitors alike. Exotica aims to be a contemporary and inviting place, providing a comfortable escape where customers can enjoy high-quality service, delicious food, and refreshing beverages in a stylish and welcoming setting.

<br> <br>

At the heart of Exotica Bar & Restro lies a carefully curated menu designed to tantalize the taste buds and cater to diverse palates. The restaurant boasts a wide array of culinary offerings, from authentic Assamese dishes showcasing the region''s rich gastronomic heritage to popular Indian and Continental cuisines. The bar is equally well-stocked, offering a selection of premium spirits, wines, beers, and creative cocktails crafted by skilled mixologists. A particular focus is placed on sourcing fresh, locally-sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the highest quality in every dish. What sets Exotica apart is its commitment to culinary innovation. The kitchen team constantly experiments with new flavors and techniques, introducing seasonal specials and menu updates that keep the dining experience fresh and exciting. This dedication to both tradition and innovation allows Exotica to appeal to a broad spectrum of customers, from those seeking a taste of home to those eager to explore new culinary horizons. The restaurant differentiates itself from its competitors through its attention to detail and its ability to consistently deliver high-quality food and service in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Exotica Bar & Restro. From the moment guests step through the door, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is meticulously trained to provide personalized recommendations, anticipate needs, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. The ambiance is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, with tasteful decor, comfortable seating, and thoughtfully chosen music. Exotica understands the importance of connecting with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events, sponsors community initiatives, and fosters relationships with neighboring businesses. Special promotions and themed nights are regularly organized to create a sense of excitement and engagement. Exotica Bar & Restro strives to be more than just a place to eat and drink; it aims to be a valuable member of the Beltola-Basistha Road community, a place where people feel welcome, connected, and valued. Regular feedback is actively sought from customers through surveys and social media engagement to continuously improve the customer experience and ensure that Exotica remains responsive to the evolving needs of the community.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Exotica Bar & Restro envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. The business plans to solidify its position as a leading dining and entertainment destination on Beltola-Basistha Road, while also exploring opportunities to expand its reach to other locations within Guwahati and potentially beyond. This includes exploring strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to broaden its customer base and enhance its brand recognition. Plans are also in place to enhance the outdoor seating area, creating an even more inviting and comfortable space for guests to enjoy the pleasant Assam weather. Investment in employee training and development is a key priority, ensuring that the staff continues to provide the highest level of service and maintain Exotica''s reputation for excellence. Furthermore, Exotica plans to leverage digital marketing strategies to enhance its online presence and reach a wider audience. This includes actively managing its social media channels, developing a user-friendly website with online ordering capabilities, and implementing targeted advertising campaigns. Ultimately, the long-term goal of Exotica Bar & Restro is to become a household name in Guwahati, synonymous with quality, service, and a memorable dining experience. By consistently delivering on its core values and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Exotica is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the vibrant culinary scene of Assam.', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, opposite City Gas Service', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:10:20.000Z'),
(1898, 'The Vibe House', 'Bars', NULL, '<h1>The Vibe House: A Creative Hub in the Heart of Assam</h1>

The Vibe House, situated on the 2nd floor of the Indra East building, above Wonder Cars, is rapidly establishing itself as a dynamic and innovative hub for creatives and businesses alike in Assam. More than just a workspace, The Vibe House is a curated environment designed to foster collaboration, inspire innovation, and provide the resources necessary for individuals and companies to thrive in a rapidly evolving market. Located in a central and accessible area, it offers a unique blend of professional services and creative energy, setting it apart from traditional office spaces and coworking environments in the region. Its significance lies in its commitment to nurturing local talent, supporting entrepreneurial ventures, and contributing to the vibrant cultural and economic landscape of Assam.

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Empowering Growth and Creativity</h2>

At its core, The Vibe House provides a multifaceted suite of services designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. Our primary offerings include:

*   **Coworking Spaces:** We offer a variety of flexible coworking options, from hot desks to dedicated workstations, catering to freelancers, startups, and small businesses. These spaces are equipped with high-speed internet, comfortable furnishings, and access to printing and other essential office equipment.

*   **Private Office Suites:** For teams requiring a more private and secure workspace, we provide fully furnished and customizable office suites, accommodating various team sizes. These suites offer privacy while still fostering a sense of community through access to shared amenities and networking opportunities.

*   **Meeting and Event Spaces:** The Vibe House features well-equipped meeting rooms and a larger event space suitable for workshops, seminars, product launches, and other gatherings. These spaces are designed to be versatile and adaptable, offering the technology and support needed to host successful events.

*   **Creative Studio:** Recognizing the growing demand for high-quality content creation, we offer a dedicated creative studio equipped with professional lighting, backdrops, and audio-visual equipment. This space is ideal for photographers, videographers, and content creators looking to produce professional-grade work.

*   **Business Support Services:** Beyond physical space, The Vibe House provides a range of business support services, including virtual office solutions, mail handling, administrative assistance, and access to a network of professional consultants in areas such as legal, accounting, and marketing.

Our unique selling point lies in our holistic approach. We are not just providing space; we are building a community and providing the resources needed to succeed. The provision of a dedicated creative studio is a significant differentiator, recognizing the increasing importance of digital content in today''s market. These services directly address the needs of the local market by providing affordable, flexible, and professional workspaces, fostering collaboration and supporting the growth of small businesses and creative professionals.

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Community</h2>

The Vibe House prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for all its members. Our approach to customer service is centered on building genuine relationships and understanding the individual needs of each client. We strive to provide personalized attention, proactive support, and a sense of belonging.

What makes The Vibe House stand out is its commitment to fostering a strong sense of community. We organize regular networking events, workshops, and social gatherings to encourage interaction and collaboration among members. These events provide opportunities to connect with like-minded individuals, share ideas, and build valuable relationships. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by partnering with local businesses and organizations to host events and initiatives that benefit the wider area. We aim to be more than just a workspace; we aim to be a vital part of the local ecosystem. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall member experience. Our on-site management team is always available to address any concerns and ensure that members have everything they need to thrive.

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Driving Innovation</h2>

The Vibe House envisions becoming the leading hub for creativity and innovation in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our facilities to accommodate a growing membership base and introducing new services to meet the evolving needs of the market. We are exploring opportunities to partner with educational institutions to offer training programs and workshops that equip individuals with the skills needed to succeed in the digital age. We also plan to launch an incubator program to support early-stage startups and help them scale their businesses.

Long-term, The Vibe House aims to become a catalyst for economic growth and cultural development in the region. We believe that by providing a supportive environment for entrepreneurs and creatives, we can contribute to the creation of new jobs, the development of innovative products and services, and the enrichment of the local community. We are committed to staying at the forefront of industry trends and adapting our services to meet the changing needs of our members. This includes exploring new technologies and incorporating sustainable practices into our operations. The vision is to cultivate a thriving ecosystem where ideas are born, collaborations flourish, and businesses reach their full potential.', '2nd floor, Indra East building, above Wonder Cars', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.352Z', '2025-12-07T13:10:26.000Z'),
