(1902, 'COCKTAIL LOUNGE', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>COCKTAIL LOUNGE, situated at 35, GS Rd in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience, distinct within the emerging Assam business landscape. More than just a place to grab a drink, COCKTAIL LOUNGE aims to be a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking expertly crafted cocktails, a refined ambiance, and exceptional service. In a region where social gatherings and celebrations hold significant cultural importance, COCKTAIL LOUNGE provides a modern and stylish venue that caters to both locals and visitors alike. We are committed to fostering a lively yet comfortable atmosphere, contributing to the burgeoning hospitality sector of Guwahati and creating a memorable experience that encourages repeat business and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around meticulously crafted cocktails using premium spirits, fresh ingredients, and innovative techniques. The menu is designed to cater to a broad range of palates, from classic concoctions expertly executed to signature creations that showcase local flavors and ingredients. Beyond cocktails, we offer a curated selection of wines, beers (including locally brewed options where available), and non-alcoholic beverages. To complement our drinks menu, COCKTAIL LOUNGE provides a selection of gourmet snacks and appetizers designed to enhance the overall experience. <br> <br> What sets us apart is our commitment to quality and artistry in every aspect of our service. Our experienced bartenders are passionate about their craft and dedicated to providing personalized recommendations and crafting drinks tailored to individual preferences. Furthermore, the lounge''s ambiance is carefully curated with sophisticated décor, comfortable seating, and a carefully selected music playlist to create an inviting and upscale atmosphere. This focus on quality, craftsmanship, and ambiance addresses the growing demand for premium nightlife experiences in Guwahati, offering an alternative to more traditional establishments. By sourcing local ingredients whenever possible, we also support local businesses and showcase the unique flavors of Assam to our patrons.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At COCKTAIL LOUNGE, customer experience is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of attentiveness, professionalism, and genuine hospitality. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with a warm welcome and provided with attentive service throughout their visit. Our staff is trained to anticipate needs, offer personalized recommendations, and ensure that every guest feels valued and comfortable. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and refine our service standards. <br> <br> To connect with the local community, we actively participate in local events and initiatives. We partner with local artists and musicians to showcase their talent and provide entertainment for our guests. We also host special events and themed nights that celebrate local culture and traditions. By fostering a sense of community and engagement, COCKTAIL LOUNGE aims to be more than just a business; we strive to be a contributing member of the Guwahati social scene. This commitment to community involvement fosters loyalty and enhances our reputation as a responsible and engaged business.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Looking ahead, COCKTAIL LOUNGE envisions significant growth potential within the burgeoning Guwahati hospitality market. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more innovative cocktails and food pairings, developing a loyalty program to reward repeat customers, and exploring opportunities to host private events and corporate gatherings. We also aim to enhance our online presence through social media marketing and online reservations to reach a wider audience. <br> <br> Long-term, our goal is to establish COCKTAIL LOUNGE as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, sophistication, and exceptional customer service in Guwahati. We envision expanding to additional locations within Assam and potentially beyond, replicating our successful model while adapting to the unique characteristics of each market. By consistently delivering a superior experience and fostering strong relationships with our customers and the local community, COCKTAIL LOUNGE is poised to become a leading player in the Assam hospitality industry, contributing to its economic growth and enhancing its reputation as a vibrant and welcoming destination.</p>', '35, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:15:21.000Z'),
(1903, 'Nyx Lounge & Deck', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Nyx Lounge & Deck offers a premium destination for relaxation, socializing, and elevated experiences in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Strategically located on the 3rd Floor of The Hotel Palacio, above Poddar Card World on GS Road, Nyx distinguishes itself as a sophisticated escape, providing a unique blend of indoor lounge ambiance and open-air deck serenity. We cater to a discerning clientele seeking a refined atmosphere, expertly crafted beverages, and memorable moments.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Nyx, our core offering revolves around providing a comprehensive leisure experience. We feature a fully stocked bar with an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and handcrafted cocktails prepared by experienced mixologists. Our bartenders are adept at both classic mixes and innovative concoctions, ensuring a diverse and satisfying range of options for every palate. Complementing our beverage selection is a carefully curated food menu featuring delectable appetizers, shareable platters, and select main courses, designed to enhance the overall experience. Dishes often incorporate local flavors and ingredients, providing a unique taste of Assam alongside international favorites. Beyond the food and drinks, Nyx''s unique selling point lies in its dual environment. Guests can choose to unwind in the stylishly designed indoor lounge, complete with comfortable seating and ambient lighting, or step onto the expansive outdoor deck, offering panoramic city views. This versatility allows us to cater to diverse preferences and occasions, from intimate gatherings to larger celebrations.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>We understand the importance of creating a positive and memorable experience for every guest. Our customer service philosophy is centered around attentiveness, professionalism, and personalization. Our staff is trained to anticipate needs, provide knowledgeable recommendations, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable visit. We believe that genuine hospitality is key to building lasting relationships with our patrons. Nyx Lounge & Deck also strives to connect with the local community through special events, themed nights, and collaborations with local artists and musicians. We host live music performances, DJ sets, and other entertainment events, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a vibrant social atmosphere. By actively engaging with the community, we aim to be more than just a business; we aim to be a cultural hub and a place where people can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Nyx Lounge & Deck is to solidify its position as the premier lounge and deck destination in Guwahati and to expand its reach within the Assam region. We are committed to continuously improving our offerings, refining our service standards, and innovating to stay ahead of the evolving needs of our customers. Potential growth avenues include expanding our menu offerings, incorporating innovative beverage programs, and enhancing the overall ambiance of the space. We also envision establishing partnerships with local businesses and organizations to create unique experiences and cater to a wider audience. Long-term goals include potentially exploring opportunities to expand to other locations within Assam and potentially beyond, while maintaining the core values of quality, service, and community engagement that define the Nyx brand. We aim to be synonymous with sophistication, relaxation, and unforgettable moments, contributing positively to the social and cultural landscape of the region.</p>', '3rd Floor, The Hotel Palacio, GS Rd, above Poddar Card World', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:15:26.000Z'),
(1904, 'SAQUE BAR', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>SAQUE BAR, strategically located at 48, Motilal Nehru Rd, opposite Pan Bazar Girls High School, Guwahati, Assam, is a vibrant and welcoming establishment redefining the social and recreational experience in the heart of the city. More than just a bar, SAQUE BAR aims to be a cornerstone of the community, offering a sophisticated yet approachable space where locals and visitors alike can unwind, connect, and create lasting memories. In a region known for its rich culture and warm hospitality, SAQUE BAR distinguishes itself by blending a contemporary atmosphere with a deep appreciation for Assamese traditions and flavors, contributing significantly to the local business landscape by offering a unique and appealing social venue.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, SAQUE BAR provides a curated selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages designed to cater to a diverse palate. From classic cocktails crafted with premium spirits to locally sourced beers and innovative mocktails featuring regional fruits and herbs, the bar aims to provide a sophisticated and delightful drinking experience. Beyond beverages, SAQUE BAR offers a carefully crafted menu of appetizers and small plates designed to complement the drink selection. These culinary offerings feature a blend of international flavors and local Assamese ingredients, providing a delightful gastronomic journey for patrons. A unique selling point is the bar''s commitment to featuring seasonal specials that showcase the best of what Assam has to offer, both in terms of ingredients and local culinary talent. This emphasis on local sourcing and innovation caters directly to the growing demand for authentic and sustainable experiences within the local market. Furthermore, the bar regularly hosts themed nights and special events, featuring live music, DJ sets, and cultural performances, adding another layer of entertainment and appeal to its core offerings. This ensures there’s always something new and exciting for patrons to experience, solidifying SAQUE BAR''s position as a dynamic and engaging social hub.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>SAQUE BAR prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience built on warmth, attentiveness, and genuine connection. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, attentive to customer needs, and passionate about creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The interior design complements this ethos, featuring comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and a layout that encourages both intimate conversations and lively social interactions. Music selection is carefully curated to enhance the ambiance without overpowering conversation, fostering a relaxed and enjoyable environment. Beyond the immediate customer service experience, SAQUE BAR actively seeks to connect with the local community through sponsorships of local events, collaborations with local artists and artisans, and participation in community initiatives. This commitment to social responsibility reinforces the bar''s position as a valuable member of the community, fostering a loyal customer base and a positive brand image. Customer feedback is actively solicited and valued, with a dedicated team focused on continuously improving the service and offerings based on customer suggestions and preferences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, SAQUE BAR envisions becoming a leading destination for social gatherings and entertainment in Guwahati. The long-term goal is to expand its reach and impact by further developing its menu, introducing new and innovative offerings, and strengthening its ties with the local community. Plans are underway to explore collaborations with local breweries and distilleries to create exclusive SAQUE BAR-branded beverages, further enhancing its unique selling proposition. The business also intends to invest in staff training and development, ensuring that the team remains knowledgeable, passionate, and committed to providing exceptional customer service. Furthermore, SAQUE BAR plans to leverage digital marketing and social media to reach a wider audience and enhance its brand awareness. The potential for growth lies in replicating the successful SAQUE BAR model in other strategic locations within Assam and beyond, establishing a network of bars that uphold the same values of quality, community engagement, and exceptional customer service. Ultimately, SAQUE BAR aims to be more than just a bar; it strives to be a symbol of Guwahati''s vibrant culture and a testament to the power of community connection.</p>', '48, Motilal Nehru Rd, Opposite Pan Bazar Girls High School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:15:31.000Z'),
(1905, 'Zero Mile', 'Bars', NULL, 'Zero Mile: Connecting Assam, One Service at a Time

