(1906, 'ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN', 'Bars', NULL, '<article>
<h1>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN: A New Landmark in Guwahati''s Culinary and Craft Beer Scene</h1>

<p>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN is a dynamic and innovative establishment redefining the dining and craft beer experience in Guwahati. Conveniently located on the 1st Floor of Hotel Palacio, above Poddar Car World on GS Road, this brewpub and kitchen offers a unique blend of handcrafted beers, delectable cuisine, and a vibrant atmosphere, establishing itself as a key player in Assam''s burgeoning hospitality sector. ABACUS Brewing Co. & Kitchen aims to be more than just a restaurant and brewery; it aspires to be a community hub where locals and tourists alike can gather, connect, and enjoy exceptional food and drink crafted with passion and precision.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Craftsmanship</h2>

<p>At the heart of ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN lies its commitment to producing high-quality, handcrafted beers. Our in-house brewery features state-of-the-art equipment and is overseen by experienced brewers dedicated to crafting a diverse range of beers to suit every palate. From crisp, refreshing lagers perfect for the Guwahati heat to robust, flavorful ales that showcase the complexity of malt and hops, our beer menu offers something for everyone. Seasonal brews and experimental batches further enhance the selection, ensuring there’s always something new and exciting to discover. We meticulously source our ingredients, prioritizing local and regional suppliers where possible to ensure freshness and contribute to the local economy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Complementing our exceptional beer selection is a carefully curated menu that features both local Assamese flavors and international culinary influences. Our kitchen team is dedicated to creating dishes that pair perfectly with our beers, offering a seamless dining experience. From flavorful appetizers and shareable plates to hearty main courses and satisfying desserts, our menu is designed to cater to a variety of tastes and preferences. Signature dishes incorporate locally sourced ingredients, providing guests with an authentic taste of Assam. Vegetarian and vegan options are also prominently featured, ensuring inclusivity and catering to diverse dietary needs. Our menu is regularly updated to reflect seasonal availability and culinary innovation, ensuring a fresh and exciting dining experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>One of our unique selling points is the immersive experience we offer. Patrons can witness the brewing process firsthand through strategically placed viewing windows, gaining insight into the art and science behind our craft beers. Beer flights and tasting sessions allow guests to sample a variety of brews and learn about their individual characteristics. Our knowledgeable staff is always on hand to provide recommendations and answer any questions, enhancing the overall learning and enjoyment.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN directly addresses the growing demand for craft beer and elevated dining experiences in Guwahati. The local market has seen a surge in interest in artisanal products and unique culinary offerings, and we are perfectly positioned to meet this demand. By combining handcrafted beers with a thoughtfully designed menu and a vibrant atmosphere, we offer a compelling alternative to traditional dining and drinking establishments.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Building Community Through Exceptional Service</h2>

<p>Our approach to customer service is centered on creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. From the moment they walk through the door, patrons are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable, helpful, and passionate about our products, ensuring that every guest feels valued and informed. We prioritize building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What sets ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN apart is our commitment to creating a unique and engaging atmosphere. The interior design is modern and inviting, with comfortable seating arrangements and a vibrant aesthetic. Live music performances and special events are regularly hosted, adding to the overall entertainment value. We also actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artists, musicians, and organizations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We understand the importance of connecting with the local community and actively participate in local events and initiatives. We source ingredients from local farmers and producers whenever possible, supporting the regional economy and reducing our environmental footprint. We also partner with local charities and organizations to give back to the community and contribute to its well-being. By being an active and engaged member of the community, we aim to build lasting relationships and foster a sense of belonging.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Brewing Success and Expanding Horizons</h2>

<p>The future vision for ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth. We plan to expand our brewing capacity to meet the increasing demand for our craft beers. This may involve the acquisition of new equipment or the expansion of our brewing facility. We also plan to introduce new beer styles and culinary offerings to keep our menu fresh and exciting.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We are also exploring opportunities to expand our reach beyond our current location. This could involve opening new locations in other parts of Guwahati or even expanding to other cities in Assam and beyond. We are also considering partnerships with local retailers and distributors to make our beers more widely available.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our long-term goal is to establish ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN as a leading craft brewery and culinary destination in the region. We are committed to providing exceptional products and service, fostering a strong sense of community, and contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam. By staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we are confident that we can achieve our goals and create a lasting legacy.</p>
</article>', '1st Floor, Hotel Palacio, GS Rd, above Poddar Car World', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:20:17.000Z'),
(1907, 'Disco Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Disco Bar, located at GMC Ward Number 38, ABC Road, Gopinath Path, is a vibrant and contemporary addition to the burgeoning nightlife scene of Guwahati, Assam. Beyond being just a place to unwind, Disco Bar strives to be a cornerstone of the local community, offering a unique entertainment experience that blends modern trends with the warmth and hospitality that Assam is known for. We differentiate ourselves by fostering an inclusive and energetic atmosphere that caters to a diverse clientele, from young professionals seeking a lively night out to established residents looking for a sophisticated and enjoyable evening.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Disco Bar''s offerings is a carefully curated selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. We pride ourselves on our extensive cocktail menu, featuring both classic concoctions and innovative creations crafted by experienced mixologists. Our bar is stocked with a wide range of premium spirits, local beers showcasing Assam''s brewing talent, and international wines to satisfy discerning palates. Complementing our drink selection is a delectable menu of appetizers and small plates, designed to enhance the social experience. From flavorful local snacks perfect for sharing to international favorites prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients where possible, our food offerings cater to a variety of tastes. Our unique selling point lies not just in the quality of our drinks and food but in the overall ambiance we create. We boast a state-of-the-art sound system and dynamic lighting, transforming the space into a pulsating dance floor where patrons can let loose and enjoy the music. Regular themed nights and DJ performances ensure there''s always something new and exciting to experience at Disco Bar. This addresses a growing need in Guwahati for sophisticated entertainment venues that offer more than just standard bar fare, providing a space for connection, celebration, and genuine enjoyment.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Disco Bar. We are dedicated to providing exceptional service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our offerings, ready to guide patrons through the menu and offer personalized recommendations. We believe in creating a safe and inclusive environment for everyone, fostering a sense of community among our customers. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artists, musicians, and businesses, creating opportunities for collaboration and promoting the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Regular social media engagement keeps our patrons informed about upcoming events, promotions, and new offerings, further solidifying our connection with the community. We also actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs and preferences. This commitment to service extends beyond the bar itself; we actively participate in local events and initiatives, demonstrating our dedication to the betterment of the community we serve.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking to the future, Disco Bar envisions becoming a premier entertainment destination in Guwahati and beyond. Our immediate plans involve expanding our event programming to include live music performances, comedy nights, and other diverse forms of entertainment. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local breweries and distilleries to showcase the unique flavors of Assam. Longer-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within the region, bringing the Disco Bar experience to a wider audience. We are also committed to investing in sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a greener future for Assam. We aim to be more than just a bar; we aspire to be a cultural hub, a place where people can connect, celebrate, and experience the best that Guwahati has to offer. This vision is fueled by our dedication to innovation, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, positioning Disco Bar for sustained growth and success in the dynamic Assam business landscape. We aim to continuously evolve our offerings, staying ahead of trends and anticipating the needs of our discerning clientele, ensuring that Disco Bar remains a vibrant and exciting destination for years to come.</p>', 'GMC Ward Number 38 ABC Road, Gopinath Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:20:22.000Z'),
(1908, 'Xs Bar & Lounge', 'Bars', NULL, 'Xs Bar & Lounge, strategically situated in the heart of Guwahati at Anil Plaza - II, Tarun Nagar Main Rd, offers a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience unlike any other in the Assam business landscape. More than just a bar, Xs is a destination – a place where discerning patrons can unwind, socialize, and enjoy an elevated evening in an atmosphere of refined elegance. Our commitment to quality, coupled with a deep understanding of local preferences, positions Xs Bar & Lounge as a premier establishment contributing to the evolving entertainment sector of the region. We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a vital part of the community, fostering connections and providing a welcoming space for all.

<br> <br>

Our core services revolve around providing a diverse and carefully curated selection of beverages, complemented by delectable culinary offerings. At Xs Bar & Lounge, guests can choose from an extensive menu featuring premium spirits, both domestic and international, a wide array of expertly crafted cocktails, a selection of fine wines, and refreshing beers. Beyond beverages, we offer a curated menu of appetizers and small plates designed to perfectly complement the drinks and enhance the overall experience. These include both classic bar snacks and innovative creations featuring locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, providing a taste of Assam alongside international flavors. What sets Xs apart is our unwavering focus on quality ingredients, skilled bartenders, and attentive service. We continuously update our menu to reflect current trends and cater to the evolving tastes of our clientele. By focusing on premium offerings and providing a unique ambiance, Xs Bar & Lounge effectively meets the local market''s demand for a refined and sophisticated nightlife option, setting a new standard for entertainment in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Xs Bar & Lounge. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is thoroughly trained to provide personalized recommendations, anticipate needs, and ensure that every visit is memorable. The ambiance of Xs is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and sophisticated atmosphere. The interior design incorporates modern aesthetics with comfortable seating arrangements, creating distinct zones for socializing and relaxation. We regularly host themed nights, live music performances (featuring local artists whenever possible), and special events to further enhance the entertainment experience. To foster a stronger connection with the local community, Xs actively participates in local initiatives and supports charitable causes. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and strive to be a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. Our commitment to exceptional customer service, combined with a vibrant atmosphere and community involvement, distinguishes Xs Bar & Lounge as a leader in Guwahati''s entertainment scene.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Xs Bar & Lounge envisions a future of continued growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include becoming the premier destination for nightlife and entertainment in Assam. We plan to achieve this through a combination of strategic initiatives, including expanding our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative cocktail creations, and enhancing our live entertainment program. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with local breweries and distilleries to further showcase the unique flavors of the region. Furthermore, we plan to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and enhance our brand awareness. We are also considering the possibility of opening additional locations in other key cities within Assam, further expanding our reach and impact. Our commitment to providing exceptional service, creating a vibrant atmosphere, and contributing to the local community will remain at the core of our business strategy as we pursue our vision for the future. We are confident that Xs Bar & Lounge will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth of the Assam business landscape for years to come.', 'Anil Plaza - II, Tarun Nagar Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:20:28.000Z'),
(1909, 'Skye', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Skye, strategically located on the 10th Floor of the Novotel Hotel on GS Road, Guwahati, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for discerning clientele seeking a sophisticated blend of business acumen and leisure indulgence. Beyond merely offering services, Skye cultivates an atmosphere of refined elegance and personalized attention, positioning itself as a valuable asset to Assam''s evolving business and social landscape. Its presence enriches the local market by providing a premium experience previously unavailable, catering to both local residents and international visitors with equal finesse. Nestled atop one of Guwahati''s most prominent hotels, Skye offers unparalleled panoramic views, enhancing every interaction with a sense of elevated perspective.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Skye''s core offerings are multifaceted, designed to cater to a diverse array of needs. At its heart lies a meticulously crafted selection of premium beverage options, ranging from expertly mixed cocktails to a curated wine list featuring both international and regionally inspired selections. This is complemented by a sophisticated menu of gourmet appetizers and light meals, prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible to support local farmers and enhance the freshness of the offerings. Beyond the culinary experience, Skye provides an exclusive setting for private events, corporate gatherings, and celebratory occasions. Its versatile space can be adapted to suit various layouts and functionalities, complete with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and dedicated event planning support. What truly sets Skye apart is its unwavering commitment to providing a seamlessly integrated experience. The ambiance, the service, and the culinary offerings are meticulously orchestrated to create an atmosphere of sophisticated relaxation and effortless enjoyment. This attention to detail allows Skye to meet the local market''s growing demand for premium venues that can seamlessly blend business and pleasure, providing a space for networking, celebration, and refined socializing.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Skye. The business operates on a philosophy of personalized service, where every guest is treated with the utmost respect and attentiveness. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality, ensuring a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is extensively trained not only in the art of mixology and service but also in anticipating guest needs and providing tailored recommendations. Skye differentiates itself through its commitment to building lasting relationships with its clientele. It actively engages with the local community by hosting themed events, collaborating with local artists and musicians, and participating in charitable initiatives. This dedication to social responsibility fosters a sense of community and demonstrates Skye''s commitment to being more than just a business; it strives to be an integral part of the local fabric. Moreover, the unique location within the Novotel Hotel provides guests with seamless access to world-class accommodations and amenities, further enhancing the overall experience. The combination of impeccable service, stunning views, and community engagement creates a unique and memorable experience that distinguishes Skye from its competitors.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Skye envisions a future marked by sustained growth and expansion, establishing itself as the undisputed leader in Guwahati''s premium hospitality sector. Future plans include expanding its menu to incorporate more regionally inspired dishes and beverages, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. There are also plans to introduce exclusive membership programs that offer enhanced benefits and privileges to loyal customers, further solidifying relationships and fostering a sense of belonging. Longer-term goals involve exploring opportunities to expand Skye''s presence to other strategic locations within Assam and potentially beyond, replicating its successful model of providing a sophisticated and personalized hospitality experience. The business is also committed to investing in its staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they remain at the forefront of industry best practices. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Skye aims to maintain its position as a trendsetter in the local hospitality landscape. The ambition is not simply to be a successful business, but to become a symbol of sophistication and quality, representing the best of Assam''s growing business and social scene.</p>', '10th Floor, Novotel Hotel, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:20:35.000Z'),
(1910, 'BudgetBars.com', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>BudgetBars.com, strategically located at 5QFH+GJG, Mother Teresa Rd, stands as a burgeoning force within the Assam snacking and convenience food sector. More than just a purveyor of affordable snack bars, BudgetBars.com embodies a commitment to providing accessible, quality nutrition to the local community, addressing a growing need for convenient and budget-friendly options in a fast-paced world. Our unique approach lies in sourcing locally produced ingredients whenever possible, thereby supporting local farmers and contributing to the sustainability of the regional economy. We are deeply invested in becoming an integral part of the Assam business landscape, fostering strong relationships with suppliers and customers alike.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of BudgetBars.com lies a carefully curated selection of snack bars designed to cater to a variety of tastes and dietary needs. Our flagship line focuses on protein bars crafted with locally sourced rice flour, jaggery, and various nuts and seeds abundant in the Assam region. These bars provide a sustained energy release, making them ideal for students, working professionals, and anyone seeking a nutritious and convenient snack. Furthermore, we offer a range of gluten-free and vegan options, ensuring that individuals with specific dietary restrictions can also enjoy our offerings. A key differentiator is our unwavering focus on affordability. We believe that healthy snacking should not be a luxury, and we strive to maintain competitive pricing without compromising on the quality of our ingredients or the taste of our bars. The local market''s demand for value-driven products coupled with a rising awareness of healthy eating habits positions BudgetBars.com for sustained growth.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at BudgetBars.com. We strive to cultivate a welcoming and personalized experience for every customer, whether they are browsing our online store or visiting our physical location on Mother Teresa Rd. Our knowledgeable staff is always ready to assist with product selection, answer questions about ingredients and nutritional information, and provide personalized recommendations based on individual needs and preferences. Beyond direct sales, we actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and farmers'' markets. We regularly offer free samples and educational workshops on healthy snacking, further solidifying our commitment to promoting well-being within the Assam region. We actively solicit customer feedback through online surveys and in-store comment cards, using this valuable information to continuously improve our products and services. Our commitment to building strong, lasting relationships with our customers sets us apart and fosters a sense of loyalty that drives repeat business.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for BudgetBars.com extends beyond simply selling snack bars. We aspire to become a leading provider of convenient and affordable nutritional solutions across Assam. We envision expanding our product line to include other healthy snacks, such as trail mixes and energy bites, all while maintaining our commitment to sourcing locally and supporting the regional economy. We plan to establish partnerships with local schools and organizations to promote healthy eating habits among children and young adults. We are also exploring the possibility of expanding our distribution network to reach more remote areas of Assam, ensuring that our products are accessible to a wider range of consumers. Long-term, BudgetBars.com aims to be recognized not only as a successful business but also as a positive force for change within the community, contributing to the health and well-being of the people of Assam. We will continue to innovate, adapt to evolving consumer needs, and remain steadfast in our commitment to providing affordable, nutritious, and delicious snacks that enhance the lives of our customers.</p>', '5QFH+GJG, Mother Teresa Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:25:06.000Z'),
(1911, 'Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar', 'Bars', NULL, 'Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar, nestled atop Hotel Awesome Palace, opposite the Passport Seva Kendra office, is rapidly becoming a premier destination in Assam for discerning diners and social enthusiasts seeking a unique blend of culinary excellence, handcrafted beverages, and captivating ambiance. More than just a restaurant and bar, Olive Garden offers an elevated experience, literally and figuratively, setting it apart from the typical dining and nightlife options in the region. Its strategic location, combined with a commitment to quality and innovation, positions it as a significant player in Assam’s burgeoning hospitality sector.

<br> <br>

Olive Garden specializes in providing an unforgettable rooftop dining and bar experience. Our core offerings revolve around a diverse menu featuring both continental and regional Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. From expertly grilled steaks and flavorful pasta dishes to authentic Assamese thalis and innovative fusion creations, the menu caters to a wide range of palates. Complementing the culinary offerings is a carefully curated bar menu showcasing signature cocktails, premium spirits, a selection of fine wines, and locally brewed beers. The rooftop setting itself is a key product; designed for comfort and style, it offers breathtaking panoramic views, creating a memorable backdrop for any occasion. What truly distinguishes Olive Garden is its commitment to providing a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere where guests can enjoy exceptional food and drinks while taking in the scenic beauty of the surrounding area. This unique combination directly addresses the local market''s demand for high-quality dining experiences coupled with appealing social spaces.

<br> <br>

At Olive Garden, the customer experience is paramount. We strive to provide impeccable service that is both attentive and personalized, ensuring every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to anticipate needs, offer insightful recommendations, and create a welcoming environment. Beyond excellent service, we foster a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives. We host live music performances featuring local artists, providing a platform for talent and adding to the vibrant cultural scene. Seasonal menus incorporate regional specialties, celebrating Assamese culinary heritage. Furthermore, Olive Garden actively participates in local events and supports community causes, demonstrating a commitment to giving back and building lasting relationships. This approach aims to establish Olive Garden as more than just a business; it’s a valued member of the community.

<br> <br>

The future vision for Olive Garden Rooftop Restro Cum Bar is one of sustainable growth and continued innovation. We aim to expand our menu offerings, incorporating more regional specialties and introducing innovative culinary concepts. We also plan to enhance the rooftop space with improved amenities and design features, creating an even more inviting and versatile environment. Long-term goals include establishing Olive Garden as a leading dining and entertainment destination in Assam, known for its exceptional quality, impeccable service, and strong community ties. We envision expanding our brand presence through strategic partnerships and potential future locations, always maintaining our commitment to delivering a unique and memorable experience. We aspire to be recognized not only for our culinary excellence but also for our contributions to the local economy and community development, solidifying our position as a responsible and thriving business.', 'Hotel Awesome Palace, opposite Passport seva kendra office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:25:12.000Z'),
(1912, 'Typically Indian Bar & Grill', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Typically Indian Bar & Grill, strategically located on the first and second floors of Block B in Central Mall, is redefining the dining experience in Assam. More than just a restaurant, it''s a vibrant culinary destination that seamlessly blends authentic Indian flavors with a modern, sophisticated ambiance. We are committed to providing a memorable dining experience that caters to the diverse tastes of our community while celebrating the richness and diversity of Indian cuisine.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our location within Central Mall offers exceptional accessibility and visibility, making us a convenient choice for shoppers, families, and professionals seeking a high-quality dining option. We stand apart from other restaurants by offering a comprehensive and elevated Indian culinary experience, moving beyond standard fare to showcase regional specialties and innovative interpretations of classic dishes. We believe our commitment to quality ingredients, skillful preparation, and impeccable service sets us apart as a premier dining establishment in the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Typically Indian Bar & Grill provides a wide array of services and products designed to appeal to a broad customer base. Our core offerings encompass a full-service restaurant experience, a well-stocked bar featuring a selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers, and comprehensive catering services for events of all sizes. Our menu is carefully curated to represent the diverse culinary traditions of India, from the robust flavors of North Indian curries to the subtle spices of South Indian delicacies, and the unique tastes of Assam itself. We also feature a selection of grilled dishes prepared with the freshest ingredients, offering a modern twist on traditional favorites. Vegetarian and vegan options are readily available and thoughtfully prepared, ensuring that all dietary needs are catered to.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>One of our key differentiators is our commitment to sourcing the highest quality ingredients, with an emphasis on locally sourced produce whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers but also ensures the freshness and flavor of our dishes. Our experienced chefs bring their expertise to every plate, meticulously crafting each dish with passion and precision. Beyond the quality of our food, our expertly crafted cocktails and broad selection of beverages provides a diverse and satisfying accompaniment to the meal.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We understand the needs of the local market, where a desire for authentic Indian flavors coexists with a growing appreciation for sophisticated dining experiences. We address this by offering a menu that balances familiar favorites with innovative new dishes, all prepared with a focus on quality and presentation. Our location within Central Mall allows us to cater to shoppers seeking a convenient and delicious meal, as well as local residents and businesses looking for a place to celebrate special occasions or enjoy a relaxing evening out. Our catering services further extend our reach, enabling us to bring the flavors of Typically Indian Bar & Grill to corporate events, weddings, and private parties.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Typically Indian Bar & Grill, we prioritize providing exceptional customer service at every touchpoint. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and proactive, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where customers can relax and enjoy their dining experience. From the moment a guest enters our restaurant to the time they depart, we aim to exceed their expectations with personalized attention and genuine hospitality. Our bar staff are experts in their craft, offering advice and crafting custom cocktails to suit individual tastes. We believe that exceptional service is just as important as the quality of our food and drinks, and we are committed to providing a seamless and enjoyable experience for all of our customers.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and partnering with local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we are committed to being a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. We also strive to promote local art and culture within our restaurant, showcasing the talents of local artists and musicians. By supporting local talent and participating in community events, we aim to strengthen our connection with the community and foster a sense of belonging.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Typically Indian Bar & Grill envisions a future where we are recognized as the premier destination for Indian cuisine and exceptional dining experiences in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more regional specialties, developing innovative new dishes that cater to evolving tastes, and establishing a strong reputation for quality and consistency. We also plan to explore opportunities to expand our catering services and potentially open additional locations in other parts of the region. We aim to become a culinary institution that not only serves delicious food but also celebrates the richness and diversity of Indian culture.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, we are also exploring the possibility of introducing online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenient dining options. We are committed to continuously improving our operations and enhancing our customer experience to remain competitive in the ever-evolving restaurant industry. We believe that our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement will enable us to achieve our long-term goals and solidify our position as a leading dining establishment in Assam.</p>', 'First and Second floor, Central Mall - Block B', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:25:20.000Z'),
(1913, 'JP WINEGATE', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>JP WINEGATE: A Refined Wine & Spirits Experience in Assam</p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, at the easily accessible location of 4RX6+VPM, JP WINEGATE stands as a premier destination for discerning individuals seeking a curated selection of wines, spirits, and a sophisticated retail experience. More than just a liquor store, JP WINEGATE strives to elevate the appreciation of fine beverages within the local community, contributing to a more refined and enjoyable social landscape. By prioritizing quality, knowledgeable service, and a commitment to local tastes, JP WINEGATE distinguishes itself in the Assam business environment. We aim to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a local institution, synonymous with quality and trusted expertise.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the core of JP WINEGATE''s offering is a diverse and carefully selected range of wines and spirits sourced from around the globe. This includes popular domestic brands, sought-after international labels, and an increasing selection of premium and rare bottles catering to more sophisticated palates. While catering to a broad spectrum of preferences, we maintain a strong focus on quality and value, ensuring every product on our shelves meets our rigorous standards. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing expertly curated selections. We don''t just stock shelves; we carefully consider each product''s provenance, production methods, and flavour profiles. We also feature a range of artisanal and locally produced beverages, giving local producers a platform to showcase their offerings. This blend of international and local products makes us the go-to destination for both everyday enjoyment and special occasions. The rising demand for premium alcoholic beverages in Assam makes JP WINEGATE a timely and relevant addition to the local market. We address the need for a trustworthy retailer that can guide customers through the often-intimidating world of wine and spirits, offering genuine recommendations and expert advice.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>JP WINEGATE is built upon a foundation of exceptional customer service. We understand that purchasing wine and spirits can be a personal and sometimes daunting experience, and we strive to create a welcoming and approachable atmosphere for all customers. Our staff is trained to provide informative and unbiased advice, helping customers navigate our extensive selection and find the perfect beverage for any occasion. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clientele, understanding their preferences, and providing tailored recommendations. Regular in-store tasting events and educational workshops are planned to further engage the community, fostering a deeper appreciation for the world of wine and spirits. We also actively participate in local festivals and events, strengthening our connection with the community and demonstrating our commitment to supporting local initiatives. We aim to foster a vibrant and responsible drinking culture within Assam by educating customers and promoting mindful consumption.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, JP WINEGATE envisions itself as a leading force in shaping the evolving beverage landscape of Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our product range to incorporate a wider selection of craft beers and non-alcoholic beverages, further catering to diverse consumer preferences. We plan to develop strategic partnerships with local restaurants and hotels, becoming a preferred supplier and contributing to the growth of the hospitality sector. Expansion to other key locations within Assam is also being considered to broaden our reach and serve a wider customer base. Moreover, we intend to invest in a robust online presence, offering convenient online ordering and delivery options while maintaining the same high standards of customer service that define our physical store. We are committed to continuously improving our operations, embracing sustainable practices, and remaining at the forefront of industry trends. JP WINEGATE aims to not only grow as a business but also contribute to the economic and social development of the region, becoming a valued and respected member of the Assam community.</p>', '4RX6+VPM', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:25:25.000Z'),
(1914, 'Octave Bar - Vivanta Guwahati', 'Bars', NULL, 'Octave Bar - Vivanta Guwahati, nestled within the prestigious Vivanta Guwahati at 613, Mahapurush Srimanta Sankardev Path, stands as a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience. More than just a bar, Octave Bar is a carefully curated space where exceptional mixology meets a refined ambiance, contributing significantly to Guwahati''s evolving entertainment scene and solidifying Vivanta Guwahati''s position as a hub for both business and leisure travelers. Its unique location within a luxury hotel ensures accessibility, convenience, and an elevated level of service, setting it apart from standalone establishments in the city. Octave Bar enhances the appeal of Guwahati as a destination, offering a world-class drinking and social experience that attracts both local residents and international guests.

<br> <br>

At its core, Octave Bar offers a comprehensive selection of premium beverages, expertly crafted cocktails, and a curated menu of delectable bar snacks designed to complement the drink offerings. The bar boasts an extensive selection of spirits, including rare and aged whiskeys, fine wines from around the world, and a diverse range of domestic and international beers. A significant draw is the bar''s commitment to innovative mixology. Skilled bartenders employ both classic techniques and creative flair to produce signature cocktails using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, reflecting the flavors and spirit of Assam. This commitment to quality and innovation is a key differentiator, attracting patrons seeking unique and memorable drinking experiences. Furthermore, Octave Bar often features themed nights and special events, further diversifying its offerings and catering to a wide range of tastes. These events can include live music performances featuring local artists, guest bartender appearances, and exclusive tasting sessions, offering a dynamic and engaging atmosphere that keeps patrons coming back for more.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Octave Bar. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a patron enters, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, creating a comfortable and inviting atmosphere. The bar''s ambiance is carefully designed to create a sophisticated yet relaxed setting, featuring stylish décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and subtle lighting that enhances the overall mood. The goal is to provide a space where guests can unwind, socialize, and enjoy themselves in a refined environment. Beyond excellent service and ambiance, Octave Bar actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. These can include partnerships with local breweries and distilleries, supporting local artists through live performances, and hosting events that promote local culture and traditions. By actively engaging with the community, Octave Bar fosters a sense of connection and belonging, further enhancing its appeal as a destination for both local residents and visitors alike. The emphasis on creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere makes Octave Bar a popular choice for social gatherings, celebrations, and after-work drinks.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Octave Bar envisions continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as Guwahati''s premier bar destination. Future plans include further enhancements to the bar''s menu, introducing new and innovative cocktails that showcase local ingredients and flavors. The bar also aims to expand its offerings of live entertainment, featuring a wider range of musical genres and artists to cater to diverse tastes. Another key area of focus is on sustainability and responsible sourcing, ensuring that the bar operates in an environmentally conscious manner. This includes reducing waste, conserving energy, and sourcing ingredients from local, sustainable producers. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand the Octave Bar brand to other locations within Assam and beyond, bringing its unique blend of sophistication, innovation, and local flavor to a wider audience. By continuing to innovate, adapt, and prioritize customer experience, Octave Bar - Vivanta Guwahati is poised for continued success and growth, contributing significantly to the vibrant and evolving landscape of Guwahati''s hospitality industry.', 'Vivanta, 613, Mahapurush Srimanta Sankardev Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:25:31.000Z'),
(1915, 'Intoxica Bar Cum Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Intoxica Bar Cum Restaurant, strategically situated on Dr. RP Rd in the heart of Assam, is more than just an establishment; it''s a vibrant social hub redefining the dining and entertainment experience for locals and visitors alike.  Blending the sophistication of a modern bar with the comforting allure of a traditional restaurant, Intoxica offers a unique and compelling proposition in the region''s burgeoning hospitality sector.  We aim to be a cornerstone of the community, a place where memories are made, connections are forged, and exceptional service is always the standard.  Our commitment to quality, ambiance, and customer satisfaction distinguishes us within the competitive landscape, positioning Intoxica as a premier destination for discerning patrons.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Intoxica''s core offerings encompass a diverse and carefully curated selection of beverages and culinary delights.  Our bar boasts an extensive menu of premium spirits, both local and international beers, expertly crafted cocktails, and a refined wine list designed to complement a variety of palates. The restaurant side features a menu that showcases the rich culinary heritage of Assam, incorporating fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible.  We offer authentic Assamese dishes prepared with traditional recipes, alongside popular Indian and Continental favorites. A key differentiator is our focus on innovative fusion cuisine, blending regional flavors with international techniques to create unique and memorable dishes not found elsewhere.  Our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients not only ensures freshness and quality but also supports local farmers and producers, contributing to the economic vitality of the region.  The combination of a well-stocked bar and a diverse menu caters to a broad spectrum of tastes and preferences, ensuring that every guest finds something to enjoy.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Intoxica, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our highly trained and attentive staff is dedicated to providing a warm, welcoming, and personalized experience for every guest. From the moment a customer enters our doors, they are greeted with a smile and treated with genuine hospitality. We prioritize attentiveness and responsiveness to individual needs, ensuring that every request is met with efficiency and a willingness to go the extra mile.  Beyond providing excellent service within the restaurant, we actively engage with the local community through sponsorships of local events, participation in charitable initiatives, and hosting community gatherings.  We strive to foster a strong sense of connection with our neighbors, building relationships that extend beyond the transactional. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and used to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring that we are always meeting the evolving needs and preferences of our clientele. We also focus on creating a vibrant and comfortable atmosphere through live music performances featuring local artists, themed nights, and special promotions, enhancing the overall dining and entertainment experience. The ambiance of Intoxica is carefully designed to be both sophisticated and inviting, making it the perfect place to celebrate special occasions, unwind after a long day, or simply enjoy a delicious meal with friends and family.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Intoxica Bar Cum Restaurant envisions a future marked by sustainable growth and continued excellence.  Our long-term goals include expanding our menu offerings to further showcase the culinary diversity of Assam and introducing innovative beverage programs that reflect the latest trends in mixology. We are actively exploring opportunities to expand our physical footprint, potentially opening additional locations within Assam and beyond, while maintaining the same commitment to quality and customer satisfaction that defines our brand.  We aim to become a recognized and respected name in the hospitality industry, known for our exceptional food, drinks, service, and community engagement.  A key component of our future vision is a commitment to sustainability, implementing environmentally friendly practices throughout our operations, from sourcing ingredients to waste management. We are also dedicated to investing in the professional development of our staff, providing ongoing training and opportunities for advancement, ensuring that we have a skilled and motivated team to deliver exceptional service.  We believe that by staying true to our values, embracing innovation, and consistently exceeding customer expectations, Intoxica Bar Cum Restaurant will continue to thrive and contribute to the vibrant cultural and economic landscape of Assam for years to come.</p>', 'Dr, Dr RP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:30:08.000Z'),
(1916, 'Vapourr Lounge and Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Vapourr Lounge and Bar, a sophisticated destination perched on the 3rd floor of Pancham Towers A-3, in the heart of Lachit Nagar, Ulubari, near the iconic Hanuman Mandir, offers a distinctive and elevated experience in Guwahati''s vibrant social scene. Vapourr transcends the conventional notion of a lounge or bar, presenting a meticulously curated environment where discerning patrons can unwind, connect, and indulge in an array of premium offerings. Its strategic location provides easy accessibility, making it a preferred choice for both locals and visitors seeking a refined escape from the city''s hustle. In a region where traditional hospitality intertwines with modern aspirations, Vapourr Lounge and Bar carves a niche by blending global trends with local sensibilities, contributing to the evolving landscape of Assam''s entertainment and leisure sector.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Vapourr Lounge and Bar provides a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. The establishment boasts a fully stocked bar featuring an extensive selection of domestic and international spirits, meticulously crafted cocktails prepared by experienced mixologists, and a curated wine list to complement various palates. Beyond beverages, Vapourr offers a delectable menu of appetizers and small plates, crafted using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, providing a gastronomic journey that harmonizes with the ambiance. A key differentiator lies in its commitment to creating a relaxed yet vibrant atmosphere, facilitated by comfortable seating arrangements, ambient lighting, and carefully selected music that evolves throughout the evening. The establishment’s ventilation system is state-of-the-art, ensuring a comfortable and smoke-free environment for all patrons, enhancing the overall experience. This focus on creating a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere caters specifically to the needs of the local market, providing a space where individuals can socialize, celebrate, or simply unwind after a long day.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Vapourr Lounge and Bar. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and catered to. From the moment a patron enters, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, setting the tone for a memorable evening. The management actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve the services and offerings, demonstrating a genuine commitment to exceeding expectations. The lounge regularly hosts themed nights and special events, creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere that fosters a sense of community. Furthermore, Vapourr Lounge and Bar actively participates in local events and initiatives, strengthening its ties with the community and demonstrating its dedication to being more than just a business, but a contributing member of the local ecosystem. This focus on building relationships and providing exceptional service sets Vapourr apart from its competitors and fosters customer loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Vapourr Lounge and Bar envisions becoming a landmark destination in Guwahati''s entertainment scene, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Potential expansion plans include introducing specialized themed nights focusing on regional music and cuisine, further integrating local culture into the experience. The business also aims to develop strategic partnerships with local artists and musicians to provide a platform for showcasing talent, thereby contributing to the growth of the region''s artistic landscape. Furthermore, plans are underway to explore the possibility of expanding the menu to include more elaborate dining options, catering to a wider range of culinary preferences. In the long term, Vapourr Lounge and Bar aspires to establish a strong brand reputation synonymous with quality, sophistication, and community spirit, securing its position as a leading destination for entertainment and socializing in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', '3rd floor, Lachit nagar , Ulubari , Pancham Towers A-3, near Hanuman Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.353Z', '2025-12-07T13:30:13.000Z'),
(1917, 'The cocktails Bar & Grill', 'Bars', NULL, '```html
<h1>The Cocktails Bar & Grill: A Vibrant Hub in Avtar Complex</h1>

The Cocktails Bar & Grill is a premium dining and entertainment establishment located in the heart of Avtar Complex, Avtar Complex Path. We are more than just a bar and grill; we are a destination, a place where the community gathers to celebrate life''s moments, big and small. Our unique blend of handcrafted cocktails, delectable grilled cuisine, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart within the bustling Assam business landscape. We strive to provide an unparalleled experience, reflecting the rich cultural tapestry of the region while catering to a diverse clientele with sophisticated tastes.

<br> <br>

Nestled strategically within Avtar Complex, we benefit from high foot traffic and excellent visibility, making us a readily accessible and recognizable establishment. We contribute to the local economy not only by providing employment opportunities but also by sourcing ingredients from regional suppliers whenever possible, fostering a collaborative environment with other local businesses. We believe in being a positive influence within the community, actively participating in local events and supporting charitable initiatives.

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: A Fusion of Flavors and Experiences</h2>

At The Cocktails Bar & Grill, our core offering revolves around providing a high-quality dining and entertainment experience. Our meticulously crafted cocktail menu features both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks, each prepared with premium spirits, fresh ingredients, and a touch of artistry. Our skilled bartenders are passionate about their craft and are adept at creating personalized cocktails to suit individual preferences.

<br> <br>

Complementing our cocktail program is a diverse and flavorful grill menu. We specialize in expertly grilled meats, seafood, and vegetarian options, prepared with locally inspired spices and seasonings. From succulent kebabs and perfectly seared steaks to flavorful vegetable skewers and fresh seafood platters, our menu caters to a wide range of palates and dietary preferences. We are committed to using fresh, high-quality ingredients, ensuring that every dish is a culinary delight.

<br> <br>

What truly sets us apart is the seamless integration of our bar and grill offerings with a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We regularly host live music performances featuring local artists, creating a lively and entertaining ambiance for our patrons. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of exceptional cocktails, delicious food, and captivating entertainment, all under one roof. This holistic approach allows us to meet the growing demand for premium dining and entertainment options within the local market, providing a much-needed space for socializing, relaxation, and celebration.

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Creating Lasting Memories</h2>

Customer satisfaction is at the heart of our business philosophy. We are dedicated to providing exceptional service that exceeds expectations and creates lasting memories. Our staff is meticulously trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service standards.

<br> <br>

We believe in fostering a strong connection with the local community. We actively engage with our customers through social media, promoting local events and offering special promotions. We also host themed nights and special events that celebrate the culture and traditions of Assam, further strengthening our ties with the community. Our commitment to exceptional service and community engagement has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish a strong reputation as a premier dining and entertainment destination. We strive to create an environment where everyone feels comfortable, respected, and eager to return.

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Elevating the Experience</h2>

The Cocktails Bar & Grill has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming the premier destination for dining and entertainment in the greater Avtar Complex area and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, introducing innovative cocktail concepts, and enhancing our entertainment offerings.

<br> <br>

We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in strategically chosen areas. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they remain at the forefront of the hospitality industry. We aim to continue to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, exploring options such as online ordering, mobile payments, and interactive menus. Our ultimate vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional dining and entertainment but also contributes positively to the local community and economy. We believe that by staying true to our core values of quality, service, and community engagement, we can achieve our ambitious goals and solidify our position as a leading establishment in the Assam business landscape.
```', 'Avtar Complex, Avtar Complex Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:30:19.000Z'),
(1918, 'Leaf Deck Café Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Leaf Deck Café Bar, situated in the vibrant heart of Assam, represents a refreshing addition to the local culinary and social scene. Strategically located above the well-known Kesaria Chaiwala and opposite All India Radio, it offers a convenient and accessible destination for both residents and visitors. More than just a café or a bar, Leaf Deck is envisioned as a community hub, a place where conversations flow as freely as the local tea, and where diverse palates find satisfaction in a carefully curated menu. In a region steeped in tradition yet embracing modernity, Leaf Deck aims to bridge the gap by offering a sophisticated, contemporary experience while retaining a strong connection to the local culture and spirit.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Leaf Deck Café Bar offers a dual experience: a daytime café transitioning into a vibrant bar in the evening. The café menu features a selection of freshly brewed coffees, including both international favorites and locally sourced Assam tea, prepared with precision and care. Complementing the beverages is a range of light bites, pastries, and more substantial meals crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Sandwiches, salads, and other quick eats are designed to cater to the lunch crowd and those seeking a light afternoon snack. As the sun sets, Leaf Deck transforms into a bar offering a selection of beers, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar menu features appetizers and small plates that are perfect for sharing, encouraging socializing and interaction. A unique selling point of Leaf Deck is its commitment to incorporating local flavors and ingredients into its menu, creating dishes and drinks that are both familiar and innovative. For example, expect to find cocktails featuring local fruits or teas, and appetizers inspired by traditional Assamese cuisine with a modern twist. This approach not only provides a distinctive culinary experience but also supports local farmers and producers. Leaf Deck specifically addresses the local market''s desire for a sophisticated yet approachable social space, filling a gap between traditional tea stalls and high-end restaurants.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Leaf Deck Café Bar. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable service. From offering recommendations on the menu to engaging in genuine conversation, they are committed to creating a welcoming atmosphere for every guest. The ambiance of Leaf Deck is carefully crafted to be both stylish and comfortable. The interior design blends modern aesthetics with elements of local Assamese culture, creating a space that is both visually appealing and culturally relevant. Comfortable seating, thoughtful lighting, and carefully curated music all contribute to a relaxed and inviting environment. Beyond providing exceptional service and ambiance, Leaf Deck actively seeks to connect with the local community. This is achieved through hosting events such as live music performances by local artists, art exhibitions showcasing local talent, and themed nights that celebrate Assamese culture and traditions. Leaf Deck aims to be more than just a business; it strives to be an integral part of the community, a place where people can come together to relax, socialize, and celebrate the rich culture of Assam.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Leaf Deck Café Bar envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong reputation within the local community and building a loyal customer base. This will be achieved through consistent quality of service, ongoing menu innovation, and active engagement with the community. Future plans include expanding the menu to offer a wider range of dishes and drinks, potentially including regional specialties and seasonal offerings. Another area of focus is on developing partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote cross-promotion and collaboration. This could involve collaborating with local artists, musicians, and other creative professionals to host events and exhibitions at Leaf Deck. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Leaf Deck experience to a wider audience. The business also aims to explore opportunities to support local farmers and producers through sustainable sourcing practices and fair trade agreements. Ultimately, Leaf Deck Café Bar aims to be a leading example of a locally owned business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of the community, while providing a memorable and enjoyable experience for its customers.</p>', 'above Kesaria Chaiwala, opposite to All India Radio', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:30:25.000Z'),
(1919, 'Gam''s Bar cum Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Gam''s Bar cum Restaurant: A Culinary and Social Hub in Amritpur</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled in the heart of Ward No-43, Hazarika Complex, Amritpur Path, Gam''s Bar cum Restaurant has quickly established itself as a premier destination for discerning locals and visitors alike. More than just a place to eat and drink, Gam''s offers a unique blend of culinary experiences and a vibrant social atmosphere, setting it apart in the burgeoning Assam business landscape. Gam''s is a testament to local entrepreneurship, providing a welcome space for community gatherings and a taste of both traditional and contemporary flavors.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its core, Gam''s Bar cum Restaurant offers a diverse range of services catering to a variety of palates and preferences. The "Restaurant" aspect focuses on providing high-quality food, drawing inspiration from authentic Assamese cuisine while also incorporating popular Indian and Continental dishes. Fresh, locally sourced ingredients are prioritized to ensure both flavor and support for local farmers and producers. The menu is carefully curated to offer something for everyone, from hearty family meals to lighter snacks. This commitment to quality and variety distinguishes Gam''s from more generic dining establishments in the area.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The "Bar" component complements the restaurant perfectly, offering a wide selection of beverages, including both local and international beers, spirits, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar staff are trained to provide attentive and knowledgeable service, guiding patrons through the drink menu and creating a welcoming and convivial atmosphere. Special events and promotions, such as live music nights or themed cocktail evenings, are regularly organized to further enhance the social experience. This dual offering – quality food and a diverse drinks menu – positions Gam''s as a one-stop destination for dining and entertainment.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly sets Gam''s apart is its commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. The staff are trained to be friendly, attentive, and responsive to the needs of each guest. A warm and inviting ambiance is cultivated through thoughtful décor, comfortable seating, and carefully curated background music. The goal is to create a space where patrons feel relaxed, valued, and eager to return. Gam''s also actively engages with the local community, sponsoring local events, participating in community initiatives, and providing a platform for local artists and musicians. This dedication to community involvement fosters a strong sense of loyalty and connection, making Gam''s more than just a business; it''s a part of the local fabric.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, Gam''s Bar cum Restaurant has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. One key objective is to further refine the menu, incorporating more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients to showcase the region''s culinary heritage. Plans are also underway to expand the outdoor seating area, creating an even more inviting and comfortable space for patrons to enjoy the Assam weather. Furthermore, Gam''s is exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to offer unique experiences, such as cooking classes or wine tasting events. The long-term vision is to establish Gam''s as a leading culinary and social destination in the region, known for its quality, innovation, and commitment to the community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Gam''s aims to become a recognizable brand synonymous with quality and genuine Assamese hospitality. This includes exploring options for catering services and expanding its presence through online ordering and delivery platforms, making its offerings more accessible to a wider audience. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of its customers, and by remaining deeply rooted in the local community, Gam''s Bar cum Restaurant is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come, becoming a cornerstone of the Amritpur social scene and a source of pride for the local community.</p>', 'Ward No-43, Hazarika Complex, Amritpur Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:30:31.000Z'),
(1920, 'Crystal Discotheque', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Crystal Discotheque, located on the 1st floor of B Thakuria Plaza on Mother Teresa Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier nightlife destination in Assam. More than just a discotheque, Crystal Discotheque offers a sophisticated and immersive entertainment experience that caters to a discerning clientele seeking high-quality music, ambiance, and service. In a region where nightlife options are often limited, Crystal Discotheque fills a significant void by providing a contemporary and safe space for socializing and celebration, enriching the local entertainment scene and contributing to the burgeoning business landscape along Mother Teresa Road.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The core offering of Crystal Discotheque centers around providing an unparalleled nightlife experience. This includes a meticulously curated music program featuring both resident and guest DJs playing a diverse range of genres, from popular Bollywood hits and international chart-toppers to house and electronic music, ensuring a vibrant and engaging atmosphere for all patrons. The discotheque boasts a state-of-the-art sound system and dynamic lighting that creates an electrifying environment, further enhancing the sensory experience. Beyond music and ambiance, Crystal Discotheque offers a wide selection of premium beverages, including expertly crafted cocktails, imported spirits, and a curated wine list. A carefully designed menu of delectable appetizers and small plates complements the drinks, providing a complete and satisfying experience. A key differentiator is the emphasis on providing a safe and secure environment, with well-trained security personnel and adherence to all relevant regulations, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable night for every guest.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Crystal Discotheque is committed to delivering exceptional customer service, creating a welcoming and memorable experience for each visitor. The staff is trained to be attentive, courteous, and responsive to customer needs, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable evening. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere. The discotheque actively seeks feedback from patrons to continuously improve its services and offerings. Crystal Discotheque understands the importance of connecting with the local community and fosters relationships through special events and promotions that resonate with the cultural fabric of Assam. This includes hosting theme nights celebrating local festivals, collaborating with local artists and performers, and supporting charitable initiatives. By actively engaging with the community and prioritizing customer satisfaction, Crystal Discotheque aims to become a beloved and integral part of the local social scene.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Crystal Discotheque involves expanding its reach and solidifying its position as the leading discotheque in the region. This includes plans to host larger-scale events featuring renowned national and international DJs, further elevating the entertainment offerings. There are also plans to expand the menu to include more diverse culinary options, catering to a wider range of palates. Exploring opportunities for collaborations with local businesses and tourism agencies is also a priority, aiming to promote Crystal Discotheque as a key attraction for both local residents and visitors. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Assam and the Northeast, bringing the Crystal Discotheque experience to a wider audience. The management is committed to investing in continuous improvements to the facility, technology, and staff training, ensuring that Crystal Discotheque remains at the forefront of the entertainment industry and continues to provide an exceptional experience for its valued customers, solidifying its status as a key contributor to the local economy and a vibrant part of the Assamese nightlife.</p>', '1st floor, B Thakuria Plaza, Mother Teresa Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:35:08.000Z'),
(1921, 'SISO Speakeasy', 'Bars', NULL, '```html
<p>SISO Speakeasy, nestled within Anil Plaza - II, ABC, is redefining the social and culinary landscape of Assam. More than just an establishment, SISO Speakeasy is a vibrant hub that blends sophisticated ambiance with genuine local hospitality. It represents a new paradigm in Assam’s burgeoning hospitality sector, offering a curated experience that caters to discerning tastes while celebrating the region’s rich cultural tapestry. It''s not simply a place to dine and unwind; it''s a destination that fosters connection, conversation, and the creation of lasting memories. SISO Speakeasy fills a vital niche, offering an alternative to the standardized offerings prevalent in the area, providing a unique and memorable experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, SISO Speakeasy offers a carefully curated selection of expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, and a diverse menu of both local Assamese delicacies and globally inspired cuisine. The establishment prides itself on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring both the quality and sustainability of its offerings. The cocktail program is designed to be innovative and engaging, featuring both classic concoctions and original creations that showcase the mixologists'' skill and creativity. Beyond beverages, the food menu offers something for every palate, from traditional Assamese dishes prepared with authentic recipes to contemporary interpretations of international favorites. What truly sets SISO Speakeasy apart is its commitment to providing an exceptional experience through meticulous attention to detail in every aspect, from the ambiance to the service to the quality of the offerings. This holistic approach ensures a truly unforgettable visit.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at SISO Speakeasy. Every guest is treated with genuine warmth and personalized attention, creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The staff is highly trained to anticipate needs and provide seamless service, ensuring that every visit is exceptional. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a sense of relaxed sophistication, with comfortable seating, atmospheric lighting, and curated music that enhances the overall experience. SISO Speakeasy actively connects with the local community by hosting events that showcase local artists, musicians, and culinary talent. This commitment to supporting local culture fosters a sense of community and belonging, making SISO Speakeasy more than just a business; it''s a valuable part of the local fabric. Regular themed nights, live music performances, and collaborations with local artisans create a dynamic and engaging environment that appeals to a diverse clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for SISO Speakeasy is one of continued growth and innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu with seasonal offerings that highlight the best of Assam''s regional produce. The establishment also intends to further develop its cocktail program, introducing new and exciting creations that push the boundaries of mixology. Long-term goals include establishing SISO Speakeasy as a premier destination for both locals and tourists seeking an authentic and unforgettable Assamese experience. This includes exploring opportunities to partner with local tourism agencies and hotels to promote the establishment as a key attraction in the area. SISO Speakeasy is committed to upholding its reputation for excellence, continuously improving its offerings, and solidifying its position as a leader in Assam''s hospitality industry. Ultimately, the goal is to create a legacy of exceptional experiences and lasting contributions to the local community.</p>
```', 'Anil Plaza - II, ABC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:35:12.000Z')
