(1922, 'Maikhana Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Maikhana Bar: A Fusion of Assam''s Spirit and Modern Hospitality</p>

<p>Nestled at 5QH2+MFG, GS Rd, Maikhana Bar offers a unique and contemporary interpretation of the traditional Assam experience. More than just a place to enjoy a drink, Maikhana aims to be a vibrant hub where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and savor the rich flavors and cultural heritage of the region. In a market saturated with generic bars, Maikhana distinguishes itself by embracing local ingredients, promoting regional artisans, and cultivating an atmosphere that resonates with the authentic spirit of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Maikhana Bar provides a curated selection of beverages and culinary offerings that celebrate Assam''s bounty. Our primary service is providing a relaxed and sophisticated environment to enjoy expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, and a thoughtfully chosen assortment of wines and beers. Beyond the standard bar offerings, Maikhana specializes in incorporating indigenous ingredients into our cocktails, such as locally sourced fruits, spices, and herbs. This commitment to local sourcing extends to our food menu, which features small plates and appetizers designed to complement our drink selection. We showcase regional delicacies with a modern twist, offering dishes that are both familiar and innovative. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly blend the traditional and the contemporary, offering an authentic Assam experience in a stylish and comfortable setting. This approach caters directly to the growing demand for locally sourced and culturally relevant experiences within the Assam market, providing a welcome alternative to the generic offerings prevalent elsewhere.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Maikhana Bar. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff are trained to provide attentive and personalized service, offering recommendations and sharing stories about the ingredients and traditions behind our offerings. We believe in building genuine connections with our customers, fostering a sense of community and belonging. To further enhance the customer experience, Maikhana regularly hosts live music performances featuring local artists, creating a platform for showcasing Assam''s vibrant cultural scene. We also partner with local artisans to display and sell their crafts within the bar, providing them with exposure and supporting the local economy. Maikhana actively engages with the community by participating in local events and initiatives, solidifying its role as a responsible and contributing member of the Assam business landscape.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Maikhana Bar envisions becoming a premier destination for experiencing the authentic flavors and culture of Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and partnering with local farmers and producers to ensure a consistent supply of high-quality, locally sourced ingredients. We also aim to develop a signature line of Maikhana-branded products, such as bottled cocktails and artisanal snacks, that can be sold both in the bar and online. Furthermore, we plan to expand our footprint by opening additional locations in key cities throughout Assam, bringing the Maikhana experience to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to establish Maikhana Bar as a recognized and respected brand that embodies the spirit of Assam and contributes to the region''s economic and cultural growth. We are committed to continuously innovating and evolving, while remaining true to our core values of authenticity, quality, and community engagement.</p>', '5QH2+MFG, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:35:18.000Z'),
(1923, 'Mynah''s : Bar & Bistro', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Mynah''s : Bar & Bistro, nestled within the serene ambiance of The Greenwood Resort in Assam, offers a sophisticated yet welcoming dining and social experience. More than just a place to eat and drink, Mynah''s aspires to be a cornerstone of the resort''s appeal and a notable destination for discerning locals and tourists alike, contributing positively to the growing hospitality sector in the region. The name itself, drawing inspiration from the Mynah bird, symbolizes the lively and communicative atmosphere we strive to cultivate, mirroring the bird''s social nature and adaptable presence.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its heart, Mynah''s operates on a dual concept: a vibrant bar and a refined bistro. The bar area boasts an extensive selection of beverages, ranging from classic cocktails and premium spirits to locally sourced beers and thoughtfully curated wines. Skilled mixologists craft innovative drinks, incorporating regional fruits and spices to offer a unique taste of Assam. The bistro complements the bar with a carefully designed menu featuring both international favorites and dishes that celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Fresh, locally sourced ingredients are prioritized, ensuring the highest quality and supporting regional farmers. Signature dishes showcase the distinctive flavors of Assam, providing guests with an authentic gastronomic journey. Furthermore, Mynah''s offers a selection of delectable appetizers and sharing plates, perfect for enjoying with friends or colleagues.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Mynah''s : Bar & Bistro differentiates itself through several key factors. Firstly, its location within The Greenwood Resort provides an unparalleled setting, offering guests stunning views and a tranquil escape. Secondly, the commitment to utilizing local produce and incorporating Assamese flavors into the menu sets it apart from typical hotel restaurants. The focus on expertly crafted cocktails and a well-curated wine list caters to a sophisticated clientele. Finally, the dual bar and bistro concept allows for a versatile experience, appealing to those seeking a casual drink, a formal dinner, or anything in between. This blend of ambiance, quality, and local flavor directly addresses the market need for a premium dining and social destination that reflects the unique character of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Mynah''s. Every interaction is designed to be attentive, personalized, and memorable. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, beverages, and local area, enabling them to provide informed recommendations and cater to individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully curated to be both elegant and inviting, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and ambient lighting. Live music performances featuring local artists are occasionally hosted, adding to the vibrant atmosphere and supporting the regional arts scene. Mynah''s actively engages with the local community through partnerships with regional producers and participation in local events. Special promotions and themed evenings are regularly organized to attract new customers and foster a sense of community among regulars. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Mynah''s : Bar & Bistro envisions significant growth potential. The business plans to expand its menu offerings, incorporating more innovative dishes and seasonal specials that showcase the diverse flavors of Assam. The bar aims to further develop its cocktail program, introducing new and exciting creations that reflect the latest trends and utilize local ingredients. Strategic partnerships with local businesses and tour operators will be pursued to increase visibility and attract a wider audience. There are also plans to host regular events, such as wine tastings, cooking demonstrations, and themed parties, to enhance the customer experience and create a vibrant social hub. Long-term goals include establishing Mynah''s as a leading dining and entertainment destination in the region, known for its exceptional food, drinks, service, and commitment to the local community. Ultimately, Mynah''s aims to contribute to the growth and development of the tourism and hospitality sector in Assam, showcasing the region''s unique charm and culinary heritage to the world.</p>', 'The Greenwood Resort', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:35:24.000Z'),
(1924, 'Kitchen Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Kitchen Bar & Restaurant, situated on the 1st Floor of Amulya Complex on RG Baruah Rd, Zoo Rd, is a vibrant establishment redefining the dining and social scene in Guwahati. More than just a place to eat and drink, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant offers a holistic experience that blends delectable cuisine, crafted beverages, and a lively ambiance. Positioned strategically in a bustling commercial and residential area, it aims to become a preferred destination for both local residents and visitors seeking a memorable culinary adventure and a relaxing social atmosphere.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>In the burgeoning Assam business landscape, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant distinguishes itself by embracing a modern and innovative approach to the traditional restaurant and bar concept. It acknowledges the evolving tastes and preferences of the local populace, catering to a diverse clientele that appreciates quality food, expertly mixed drinks, and a sophisticated yet comfortable setting. Its significance lies in contributing to the growth of the local hospitality sector while simultaneously offering a unique and enjoyable experience not readily found elsewhere in the area. The restaurant contributes to the local economy by sourcing ingredients locally wherever possible, supporting regional suppliers and farmers, and providing employment opportunities for the community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Kitchen Bar & Restaurant offers a carefully curated menu featuring a diverse selection of cuisines, from regional Assamese specialties to popular continental dishes. This allows patrons to explore a range of flavors and culinary experiences within a single visit. The bar boasts an extensive beverage selection, including classic cocktails, innovative signature drinks, premium spirits, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list. This variety ensures that there is something to suit every taste and occasion. A unique selling point is the emphasis on fresh, high-quality ingredients, prepared with attention to detail and presented with flair. The chefs and bartenders are passionate about their craft, constantly experimenting with new flavors and techniques to create innovative and exciting offerings. The restaurant also accommodates dietary restrictions and preferences, offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>These services directly address the local market''s need for diverse dining options that cater to a variety of tastes and preferences. The demand for quality entertainment and social venues is also met through the vibrant bar atmosphere, which provides a space for people to unwind, connect, and celebrate. By blending local flavors with international influences, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant aims to provide a culinary journey that appeals to both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic Assamese experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At Kitchen Bar & Restaurant, customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverages, providing recommendations and answering questions with expertise and courtesy. The restaurant strives to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, where patrons feel valued and appreciated. Special attention is paid to creating a memorable dining experience, with attention to detail in everything from table settings to music selection. What truly sets Kitchen Bar & Restaurant apart is its commitment to building relationships with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and initiatives, sponsoring community programs and supporting local charities. It also hosts special events and promotions that cater to the interests of the local community, fostering a sense of belonging and creating a loyal customer base.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Furthermore, the restaurant uses social media platforms to actively engage with the community, share updates, promote events, and respond to customer feedback promptly. This open and transparent communication helps build trust and strengthens the restaurant''s connection with its patrons.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for Kitchen Bar & Restaurant is one of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to become a recognized and respected brand within the Guwahati hospitality sector, known for its quality, innovation, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional Assamese specialties, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the area. There are also plans to introduce themed nights and events to further enhance the dining and entertainment experience. Longer-term goals involve potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Kitchen Bar & Restaurant experience to a wider audience. The business also intends to invest in staff training and development to ensure that its employees are equipped with the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service. By continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of the market, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant is poised for long-term success and sustainability.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Ultimately, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant aspires to be more than just a restaurant and bar; it seeks to be a vital part of the local community, a place where people can come together to enjoy good food, good drinks, and good company. The goal is to create a lasting legacy of excellence and contribute to the growth and prosperity of the Assam business landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Amulya Complex RG Baruah Rd, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:35:30.000Z'),
(1925, 'Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<h1>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant: A Culinary Haven on GS Road</h1>

<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant isn''t just another dining establishment; it''s a vibrant culinary landmark nestled on GS Road, conveniently located near HOTEL PRAGOTI MANOR. It represents a fusion of modern dining sensibilities with the warmth and hospitality deeply rooted in Assamese culture. Positioned in a bustling area, the restaurant provides a much-needed haven for families, professionals, and tourists alike, offering a diverse menu and a welcoming atmosphere that sets it apart in the local dining scene. Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant aims to be the preferred choice for those seeking quality food, refreshing drinks, and memorable moments shared with loved ones.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>A Diverse Culinary Experience</h2>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and delectable menu that caters to a wide range of palates. The "Kitchen" aspect highlights our focus on freshly prepared dishes using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local farmers. The "Bar" component features a curated selection of beverages, from classic cocktails and imported spirits to local beers and non-alcoholic options, designed to complement our food offerings perfectly. Finally, the "Family Restaurant" designation underscores our commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for families of all sizes. <br> <br> Our menu boasts a wide selection of dishes. Our Indian curries, cooked with traditional spices, are a huge favorite. Our sizzlers are always in high demand. We also offer Continental meals. The restaurant also has a dedicated pastry section with a pastry chef crafting exquisite pastries and cakes. <br> <br> What truly distinguishes Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant is our unwavering commitment to quality and innovation. We are constantly evolving our menu to incorporate seasonal ingredients and introduce exciting new dishes, all while maintaining the high standards that our patrons have come to expect. The dedication to crafting memorable dining experiences is what makes us stand out.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Exceptional Customer Experience: More Than Just a Meal</h2>

<p>At Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant, customer service isn''t just a department; it''s an ethos that permeates every aspect of our operation. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every dining experience is a positive one. We strive to anticipate our customers'' needs and exceed their expectations, from offering personalized recommendations to accommodating special dietary requirements. <br> <br> Beyond the exceptional service, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We regularly host events and promotions that celebrate local culture and traditions, further cementing our position as an integral part of the community fabric. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers and fostering a sense of belonging. This dedication to community engagement and exceptional customer service contributes significantly to our brand reputation and customer loyalty.</p>

<br>
<br>

<h2>Vision for the Future: Growing with Assam</h2>

<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant envisions a future where it continues to be a leading dining destination in the region. Our long-term goals involve expanding our reach, both physically and digitally. We are exploring opportunities to open additional locations in strategic areas, bringing our unique dining experience to a wider audience. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online presence, streamline our operations, and improve the overall customer experience. This includes online ordering platforms, loyalty programs, and digital marketing initiatives. <br> <br> Furthermore, we are committed to continuous improvement and innovation. We will continue to refine our menu, explore new culinary trends, and invest in training and development for our staff. We aspire to be not only a successful business but also a responsible corporate citizen, contributing to the economic growth and social well-being of the local community. We aim to become a culinary destination that is not just visited, but remembered, and cherished for generations to come.</p>', 'GS Rd, near HOTEL PRAGOTI MANOR', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:40:09.000Z'),
(1926, 'Tulip Restaurant(Club DMD)', 'Bars', NULL, 'Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD) stands as a vibrant culinary destination in Guwahati, Assam, strategically located on GS Rd, opposite Bharti House, above the Bata Showroom. More than just a restaurant, Tulip represents a fusion of exquisite dining and engaging entertainment, catering to a diverse clientele seeking a memorable experience. Its prominent location ensures high visibility and accessibility, making it a landmark establishment within the bustling cityscape. Tulip distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of restaurant ambiance coupled with the energy of a club atmosphere (Club DMD), catering to both daytime diners and evening revelers. The business significantly contributes to the local economy by providing employment opportunities and supporting local suppliers, enriching the Assam business landscape with its innovative approach.

<br> <br>

Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD) offers a diverse array of culinary delights, focusing primarily on Indian and Continental cuisine, carefully curated to tantalize taste buds and cater to varying preferences. The menu boasts a selection of meticulously prepared dishes, using fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible to ensure quality and authenticity. From traditional Assamese delicacies to contemporary international favorites, the culinary offerings are designed to create a memorable dining experience. Beyond food, Tulip provides a wide selection of beverages, including mocktails, cocktails, and premium spirits. Club DMD, the entertainment aspect of Tulip, comes alive in the evenings with live music performances, DJ sets, and themed events, creating a vibrant and energetic atmosphere. This unique combination of fine dining and entertainment sets Tulip apart from other restaurants in Guwahati, providing a complete experience that caters to both the appetite and the desire for social interaction. This dual offering addresses a specific need in the local market for a venue that seamlessly transitions from a sophisticated dining experience to an exciting nightlife destination.

<br> <br>

Customer service is at the heart of Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD)’s operations. The staff is trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. From the moment a customer walks in, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality, setting the tone for a positive and memorable experience. The restaurant prides itself on creating a comfortable and inviting ambiance, where guests can relax and enjoy their meals and entertainment. Regular feedback is actively sought from customers to continually improve the quality of service and offerings. Tulip actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events and partnerships with local organizations. Special promotions and events are frequently organized to celebrate local festivals and traditions, fostering a strong connection with the community. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement has earned Tulip a loyal following and a reputation as a premier dining and entertainment destination in Guwahati.

<br> <br>

The future vision for Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD) is centered around continued growth and innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and exciting culinary creations, incorporating global trends while maintaining a focus on local flavors. Expansion of the physical space is also being considered to accommodate the growing demand and enhance the overall customer experience. Technology integration is a key focus, with plans to introduce online ordering, reservation systems, and loyalty programs to further enhance customer convenience. Furthermore, Tulip aims to solidify its position as a leader in the Guwahati entertainment scene by hosting a wider range of events and attracting renowned artists and performers. Long-term goals include establishing Tulip as a regional brand, with potential expansion to other cities in Assam and beyond, becoming synonymous with quality dining, engaging entertainment, and unwavering customer service. This ambitious vision is driven by a commitment to excellence and a deep understanding of the evolving needs and preferences of the local market.', 'GS Rd, opposite Bharti House, above Bata Showroom', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:40:14.000Z'),
(1927, 'THE JOLLY ANGLER', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>THE JOLLY ANGLER, situated on Bhuvan Rd in the heart of Assam, isn''t just a fishing tackle shop; it''s a community hub for angling enthusiasts and a valuable resource for those seeking to connect with the region''s rich aquatic environment. In a landscape where fishing is both a livelihood and a cherished pastime, THE JOLLY ANGLER distinguishes itself by providing a curated selection of equipment, expert advice, and a genuine passion for the sport. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by Assam''s diverse river systems and cater to the specific needs of local anglers, making us a trusted partner in their fishing endeavors.</p> <br> <br>
<p>At the core of THE JOLLY ANGLER''s offerings lies a comprehensive range of fishing tackle suited to the varied fishing conditions found in Assam. We stock rods, reels, lines, and lures designed to tackle everything from the mighty Brahmaputra''s catfish to the smaller streams'' playful mahseer. Beyond the standard offerings, we specialize in providing equipment adapted for traditional Assamese fishing techniques. This includes specific types of nets, bamboo rods, and locally crafted lures, preserving and promoting these time-honored methods. Furthermore, we carry a selection of high-quality imported gear, catering to more specialized angling pursuits. Our unique selling point is our deep understanding of local waters and fish species. We don''t just sell equipment; we provide informed recommendations tailored to specific locations and target species, ensuring our customers have the best chance of success. We also offer equipment repair services, extending the lifespan of our customers'' gear and minimizing waste, a service particularly valuable in a region where access to specialized repair facilities can be limited. This focus on local expertise and practical support sets us apart from larger, more generic retailers.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at THE JOLLY ANGLER. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers, fostering a welcoming and supportive environment where anglers of all levels feel comfortable seeking advice and sharing their experiences. Our staff members are not just sales associates; they are experienced anglers themselves, possessing firsthand knowledge of local fishing spots and techniques. We prioritize providing personalized recommendations, taking the time to understand each customer''s specific needs and skill level. We regularly host informal workshops and demonstrations, teaching customers about new techniques, equipment maintenance, and responsible angling practices. Our commitment extends beyond the store walls. We actively participate in local fishing competitions and conservation initiatives, demonstrating our dedication to preserving Assam''s aquatic resources for future generations. We also maintain a community bulletin board, sharing information about local fishing conditions, events, and conservation efforts, further solidifying our role as a central hub for the local angling community.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, THE JOLLY ANGLER envisions significant growth potential by further solidifying its position as the leading angling resource in the region. Our future plans include expanding our product offerings to include a wider range of specialized equipment and outdoor gear, catering to the growing demand for recreational fishing and ecotourism. We also aim to develop partnerships with local tour operators and guesthouses, offering guided fishing trips and package deals that showcase the beauty and abundance of Assam''s waterways. A key element of our long-term strategy is to establish an online presence, allowing us to reach a broader audience and provide convenient access to our products and services. This will include an e-commerce platform and a comprehensive online resource library featuring articles, videos, and forums dedicated to Assamese angling. Furthermore, we plan to invest in training and development for our staff, ensuring they remain at the forefront of angling knowledge and customer service. Ultimately, THE JOLLY ANGLER aspires to be more than just a fishing shop; we aim to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism, responsible angling practices, and the preservation of Assam''s precious aquatic ecosystems, contributing to the economic and environmental well-being of the region.</p>', 'Bhuvan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:40:20.000Z'),
(1928, 'Garage Onshop & grill,Guwahati', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Garage Onshop & Grill, Guwahati, strategically located near Ojha Hyundai Chariali (4R72+6PV), represents a novel and dynamic addition to the Guwahati culinary and retail scene. More than just a restaurant, Garage Onshop & Grill offers a curated experience blending automotive-inspired aesthetics with a delicious menu and a carefully selected retail section, creating a destination that appeals to a diverse clientele. It fills a unique niche in the local market, offering a more immersive and engaging experience than traditional dining establishments. The concept distinguishes itself through its thematic design, high-quality offerings, and a commitment to fostering a sense of community, setting it apart from its competitors and contributing to the vibrant and evolving business landscape of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Garage Onshop & Grill''s offering is a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese favorites and popular continental dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The "Grill" component emphasizes expertly grilled meats and vegetables, offering healthy and flavorful options. Beyond the food, the "Onshop" element presents a carefully curated selection of automotive-themed merchandise, lifestyle products, and potentially local artisanal goods, providing customers with the opportunity to browse and purchase unique items while they dine. This combination of culinary and retail offerings is a key differentiator, providing a multifaceted experience that encourages repeat visits and word-of-mouth marketing. The restaurant also adapts its menu seasonally, incorporating local produce and catering to regional tastes, ensuring relevance and appealing to the evolving preferences of the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Garage Onshop & Grill places a high priority on providing exceptional customer service. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and welcoming, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere for every guest. The automotive theme extends to the service style, with a focus on efficiency and precision, mirroring the attention to detail found in a well-maintained garage. The business actively engages with the local community through social media, hosting themed events, and participating in local festivals. This commitment to community involvement not only builds brand loyalty but also positions Garage Onshop & Grill as a valued member of the Guwahati community. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to improve the overall experience, ensuring that the business continuously adapts to meet the needs and expectations of its clientele. This active engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and contributes to the restaurant''s positive reputation.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Garage Onshop & Grill involves expanding its menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, becoming a true showcase for Assamese cuisine. There are also plans to grow the retail section, potentially partnering with local artisans and craftspeople to offer a wider range of unique and locally made products. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, replicating the successful blend of dining and retail experiences. Exploring partnerships with local automotive businesses and related organizations is also being considered, further strengthening the brand''s identity and expanding its reach. The business aims to become a recognized and respected brand within the region, synonymous with quality food, unique retail offerings, and a strong commitment to community engagement. Furthermore, the implementation of sustainable practices in sourcing, waste management, and energy consumption is a priority, ensuring the business operates responsibly and contributes to the environmental well-being of the community. Garage Onshop & Grill aspires to be more than just a business; it seeks to be a valuable asset to the Guwahati community for years to come.</p>', '4R72+6PV, near Ojha Hyundai chariali', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:40:26.000Z'),
(1929, 'ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ, strategically located on VIP Rd, is more than just a dining establishment; it''s a vibrant hub that blends the warmth of Assamese hospitality with a modern, sophisticated atmosphere. Serving as a relaxed setting for both casual gatherings and special occasions, ABSA offers a unique proposition within the local food and beverage sector, catering to the evolving tastes of the community while staying true to its cultural roots.</p> <br> <br>

<p>ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ provides a carefully curated experience encompassing both a well-stocked bar and a diverse restaurant menu. The bar boasts a selection of local and international beverages, including signature cocktails crafted with fresh, regional ingredients. The restaurant menu features a blend of traditional Assamese cuisine, offering familiar favorites prepared with authentic recipes, alongside continental and pan-Asian dishes designed to appeal to a broad palate. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers while ensuring the freshness and quality of the dishes. This commitment resonates strongly with patrons who value sustainability and appreciate authentic culinary experiences. Furthermore, ABSA distinguishes itself by regularly hosting themed nights, featuring live music performances by local artists and offering specialized menus highlighting seasonal delicacies, thereby enhancing its appeal as a dynamic entertainment destination.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience lies at the heart of ABSA''s operational philosophy. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a relaxing and enjoyable environment, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor inspired by Assamese art and culture, and strategically placed lighting to enhance the overall mood. ABSA also actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events and partnerships with community organizations. The establishment regularly solicits feedback from customers through surveys and online platforms, using this valuable information to continually improve its services and offerings. Moreover, ABSA understands the importance of catering to diverse needs, offering vegetarian and vegan options, accommodating dietary restrictions, and providing accessible facilities for guests with disabilities. This inclusive approach fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens its connection with the community it serves.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ envisions becoming a leading destination for dining and entertainment in the region. Expansion plans include extending operating hours to cater to late-night crowds and introducing a dedicated delivery service to reach a wider customer base. The business also aims to enhance its online presence through a user-friendly website and active engagement on social media platforms, promoting its offerings and interacting with its customers. A key strategic objective is to develop exclusive partnerships with local breweries and wineries to further expand the beverage selection and support regional businesses. Furthermore, ABSA intends to introduce culinary workshops and cooking classes, providing customers with opportunities to learn about Assamese cuisine and enhance their culinary skills. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other strategic areas, replicating the successful model while adapting to the specific needs of each local market. Ultimately, ABSA strives to be more than just a bar and restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural landmark and a source of pride for the community it serves.</p>', 'VIP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:40:31.000Z'),
(1930, 'Ree - Wind Lounge Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Ree - Wind Lounge Bar & Restaurant: A Refreshing Oasis on the Guwahati Shillong Road</p>

<p>Located strategically on the bustling Guwahati Shillong Road, near Poddar Car World, Ree - Wind Lounge Bar & Restaurant offers a sophisticated and inviting escape from the everyday. More than just a place to eat and drink, Ree - Wind is a destination designed to provide a complete sensory experience, blending delectable cuisine, expertly crafted beverages, and a vibrant atmosphere to create memorable moments. In the evolving Assam business landscape, Ree - Wind distinguishes itself by offering a contemporary interpretation of hospitality, catering to a discerning clientele seeking quality, ambiance, and exceptional service. We aim to be a premier destination, recognized for our commitment to excellence and contribution to the local community''s social fabric.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Ree - Wind, our core offerings are meticulously crafted to satisfy a diverse range of palates and preferences. Our restaurant features a menu showcasing a fusion of regional Assam delicacies and international flavors, prepared with the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From traditional Assamese thalis elevated with modern culinary techniques to continental favorites executed with precision, our kitchen aims to deliver a culinary journey that is both familiar and exciting. <br> <br> Complementing the restaurant is our expertly stocked lounge bar, boasting an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and handcrafted cocktails. Our bartenders are skilled mixologists, capable of creating classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks to perfectly complement your meal or provide a delightful standalone experience. A key differentiating factor is our commitment to providing live music performances featuring local artists, fostering a vibrant and dynamic atmosphere that encourages relaxation and socializing. We also offer private dining options for special occasions and corporate events, providing a tailored experience with personalized menus and dedicated service. Our unique selling point lies in this holistic approach – a combination of exceptional food, premium drinks, live entertainment, and a sophisticated ambiance all under one roof, catering to a market need for refined entertainment and dining options outside of the Guwahati city center.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Ree - Wind. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our service philosophy is built on attentiveness, efficiency, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and provided with personalized attention. Our staff is thoroughly trained to anticipate needs, offer knowledgeable recommendations, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. <br> <br> Beyond providing exceptional service, we are committed to connecting with the local community. We actively support local artists and musicians by providing them with a platform to showcase their talent. We also partner with local suppliers and farmers to source fresh produce, contributing to the local economy and promoting sustainable practices. We regularly host community events and promotions, further strengthening our ties with the surrounding area and fostering a sense of belonging. Our commitment to providing not just a service, but an experience, is what sets us apart. We strive to be a place where people can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Ree - Wind envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Guwahati Shillong Road''s dining and entertainment scene. Our long-term goal is to establish Ree - Wind as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service. We plan to expand our menu offerings, incorporating seasonal specials and introducing new culinary concepts to keep our offerings fresh and exciting. <br> <br> We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas throughout the region. We are committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they are equipped to deliver the highest standards of service. Furthermore, we plan to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and enhance our brand visibility. Ultimately, our vision is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local economy and enriches the lives of our customers and employees. We aim to continually evolve and adapt to meet the changing needs of the market while staying true to our core values of quality, service, and community engagement.</p>', 'Guwahati Shillong Rd, near Poddar Car World', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.354Z', '2025-12-07T13:45:08.000Z'),
(1931, 'The Rush', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Nestled on the bustling RG Baruah Road in Guwahati, right on Zoo Road, stands The Rush, a dynamic establishment quickly becoming synonymous with quality and innovation in the heart of Assam. More than just a business, The Rush represents a commitment to providing exceptional products and services tailored to the evolving needs of the local community. Its strategic location on RG Baruah Road, a vibrant commercial artery, underscores its accessibility and dedication to serving the residents and businesses of Guwahati. The Rush distinguishes itself through a blend of modern business practices and a deep understanding of Assam''s unique cultural and economic landscape. The business’s significance lies in its dedication to fostering local talent, promoting sustainable practices, and contributing to the overall economic growth of the region. </p> <br> <br>

