The core offering of Zangfai Bar centers around a meticulously curated selection of beverages, ranging from classic cocktails and premium spirits to locally brewed beers and traditional Assamese rice wines. What truly sets Zangfai Bar apart is its dedication to showcasing the region''s culinary heritage. The menu features a thoughtfully designed array of dishes, drawing inspiration from traditional Assamese cuisine while incorporating contemporary culinary techniques. Think smoked pork delicacies, flavorful fish preparations using local ingredients, and a selection of vegetarian options highlighting the region''s vibrant produce. This commitment to local sourcing and authentic flavors is a significant unique selling point. The bar also provides a selection of globally inspired dishes to broaden its appeal. The integration of Hotel Kamrupa allows for a seamless offering of accommodation and bar/dining experiences. The strategic location addresses the need for a sophisticated yet approachable venue where people can unwind after work, celebrate special occasions, or simply enjoy a memorable evening. The bar''s commitment to quality ingredients and skilled bartenders, elevates the experience beyond the ordinary.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is at the heart of Zangfai Bar - Hotel Kamrupa''s philosophy. The staff is trained to provide warm, attentive, and personalized service, creating a welcoming environment for all guests. Understanding the cultural nuances of Assam is paramount; the staff is adept at anticipating needs and making recommendations based on individual preferences. The bar''s ambiance is carefully crafted to evoke a sense of relaxed sophistication, featuring comfortable seating, soft lighting, and tasteful decor that incorporates elements of Assamese art and design. Beyond exceptional service, Zangfai Bar actively connects with the local community through events and promotions that celebrate Assamese culture. This may include hosting live music performances featuring local artists, organizing food festivals showcasing regional cuisine, or partnering with local businesses to offer exclusive deals. By fostering a sense of community and actively engaging with its surroundings, Zangfai Bar - Hotel Kamrupa strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be a cherished gathering place that reflects the spirit of Assam. The hotel element contributes to a comprehensive hospitality experience, catering to the needs of both local and out-of-town guests.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Zangfai Bar - Hotel Kamrupa envisions continued growth and expansion while remaining deeply rooted in its local heritage. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more diverse regional delicacies, introducing innovative cocktail creations using locally sourced ingredients, and enhancing the overall ambiance to further elevate the customer experience. The potential for growth lies in attracting a wider audience through targeted marketing campaigns, establishing strategic partnerships with local businesses and tourism agencies, and leveraging social media to showcase the bar''s unique offerings. A long-term goal is to establish Zangfai Bar - Hotel Kamrupa as a leading destination for authentic Assamese hospitality, recognized for its commitment to quality, its vibrant atmosphere, and its contribution to the local community. The vision includes potential expansion to other locations within Assam and beyond, bringing the Zangfai Bar experience to a wider audience while maintaining its core values and commitment to showcasing the region''s rich cultural heritage. The success of the Hotel Kamrupa side of the business will contribute significantly to the overall sustainability and future growth of Zangfai Bar, creating a synergistic relationship that benefits both the establishment and the local community.', 'R.G. Baruah Road, New Fly Over, beside Ganeshguri', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.355Z', '2025-12-07T13:50:29.000Z'),
(1939, 'Attic : The Restro Cafe', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Attic : The Restro Cafe, nestled on the 4th Floor of RD Enclave, opposite Central Mall, offers a distinctive and refreshing experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, Attic is a carefully curated space designed to be a haven for relaxation, conversation, and culinary enjoyment, standing out as a vibrant addition to the local business scene.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Located in a prime area easily accessible to shoppers, students, and professionals alike, Attic distinguishes itself by blending a rustic-chic aesthetic with a contemporary menu. The cafe addresses a growing demand for comfortable yet stylish spaces where individuals can unwind, connect, and savor quality food and beverages, moving beyond the typical cafe experience.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Attic : The Restro Cafe lies its core offering: a diverse and carefully crafted menu. The cafe prides itself on serving a range of culinary delights, from comforting classics prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible to innovative dishes reflecting global trends. Signature coffee blends, expertly crafted cocktails, and a wide selection of teas cater to diverse tastes, ensuring there’s something for everyone. Beyond beverages, Attic provides a selection of appetizers, entrees, and desserts designed to satisfy both light snackers and those seeking a full meal. A unique selling point lies in the cafe''s commitment to offering vegetarian and vegan options, catering to the evolving dietary preferences of the local population. The cafe also hosts occasional themed nights, offering specialized menus and entertainment, which adds an element of excitement and discovery to its offerings. This commitment to variety and quality helps Attic meet a broad spectrum of local market needs, creating a destination for both casual hangouts and special occasions.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Attic. The cafe strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, where every guest feels valued and appreciated. From the moment a customer walks in, they are greeted by friendly and attentive staff dedicated to providing personalized service. The ambiance is carefully curated, featuring comfortable seating arrangements, soft lighting, and curated music playlists designed to promote relaxation and conversation. Attic understands the importance of connecting with the local community. The cafe regularly hosts events such as live music performances showcasing local artists, art exhibitions featuring regional talent, and open mic nights, creating a platform for cultural expression. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the cafe, catering to the needs of students and professionals looking for a comfortable workspace. Attic actively engages with its customers through social media, soliciting feedback, sharing updates, and promoting local initiatives, fostering a sense of community and belonging.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Attic : The Restro Cafe envisions a future marked by sustainable growth and continued community engagement. The business aims to expand its menu offerings, incorporating even more locally sourced ingredients and innovative dishes. There are plans to introduce loyalty programs and special promotions to reward regular customers and attract new patrons. Further expansion opportunities are being explored, with the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of the city or region. Long-term goals include establishing Attic as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, community, and exceptional customer service. The cafe is committed to implementing environmentally friendly practices, such as reducing waste and promoting sustainable sourcing, to minimize its environmental footprint. By staying true to its core values and adapting to the evolving needs of the local market, Attic aims to solidify its position as a premier destination for dining and social interaction in Assam.</p>', '4th Floor, RD Enclave, opp. Central Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.355Z', '2025-12-07T13:50:34.000Z'),
(1940, '11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet: A Culinary Landmark in the Heart of Assam</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled on the ground floor of Shivani Arcade, opposite Kumudinee Apartment on FA Road, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet has rapidly established itself as a premier dining and event destination in the vibrant Assam business landscape. More than just a restaurant and banquet hall, 11 July is a multifaceted venue meticulously designed to cater to a wide spectrum of culinary desires and celebratory occasions. Its strategic location, combined with a commitment to exceptional quality and personalized service, positions it as a significant player in the local hospitality sector, enriching the community with its unique blend of modern sophistication and traditional Assamese warmth.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Experiences</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At its heart, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet offers a diverse and meticulously curated range of services, broadly categorized into dining and event hosting. The restaurant boasts an extensive menu showcasing a delightful fusion of Indian, Continental, and specifically, Assamese cuisine. The culinary team prides itself on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring an authentic and flavorful dining experience that tantalizes the taste buds. Signature dishes are thoughtfully crafted to reflect both innovative culinary trends and the rich culinary heritage of Assam, offering patrons a chance to explore a wide array of flavors.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The bar offers a comprehensive selection of beverages, from classic cocktails and premium spirits to local and international wines. Skilled bartenders are adept at creating custom concoctions, ensuring a perfect pairing for every meal or occasion. The carefully curated wine list complements the menu, enhancing the overall dining experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The banquet facilities at 11 July are designed to accommodate a wide range of events, from intimate gatherings and corporate meetings to grand wedding receptions and celebratory banquets. The hall is equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment, customizable lighting options, and flexible seating arrangements, ensuring a seamless and memorable event for every client. The dedicated event planning team works closely with clients to create bespoke event packages, tailoring every detail to their specific needs and preferences.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>A key unique selling point lies in 11 July''s commitment to providing a holistic experience that seamlessly blends exceptional food, impeccable service, and a sophisticated ambiance. The venue caters to the growing demand for high-quality dining and event spaces within the local market, filling a crucial gap for individuals and businesses seeking a reliable and stylish venue for their celebrations and gatherings.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer Experience: Cultivating Connections and Creating Memories</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer service is at the core of 11 July''s operational philosophy. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a customer enters the venue, they are greeted with genuine warmth and professionalism. The service team goes above and beyond to anticipate needs and exceed expectations, creating a truly memorable experience.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>11 July distinguishes itself through its proactive engagement with the local community. The venue regularly hosts events and promotions designed to celebrate local culture and traditions. Partnerships with local artists and businesses are actively sought, fostering a sense of collaboration and mutual support. Special menus and events are often created to commemorate local festivals and holidays, strengthening the connection with the community and reinforcing 11 July''s position as a valuable local asset.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Furthermore, 11 July actively seeks customer feedback and uses it to continuously improve its services and offerings. Open communication channels are maintained through online platforms and in-person interactions, ensuring that customer voices are heard and valued. This commitment to continuous improvement demonstrates a dedication to providing the best possible experience for every guest.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Future Vision: A Recipe for Growth and Enduring Success</p>
<br> <br>
<p>The future vision for 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet centers around sustained growth and expansion within the Assam market. Plans are underway to enhance the existing facilities, potentially including the addition of outdoor seating areas and expanded event spaces. The culinary team is committed to constantly innovating and refining the menu, introducing new dishes and flavor combinations to cater to evolving tastes.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Long-term goals include establishing 11 July as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. Exploring opportunities for expansion to other strategic locations within Assam is also a key consideration. By maintaining a steadfast commitment to excellence and fostering strong relationships with the local community, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet is poised to solidify its position as a leading culinary and event destination in the region, creating lasting memories and contributing to the vibrant tapestry of Assam''s business and social landscape.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Shivani Arcade, FA Rd, opp. Kumudinee Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.355Z', '2025-12-07T13:55:09.000Z'),
(1941, 'Club Elite', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Club Elite, strategically located in the Hotel Palacio New Building, directly opposite the prestigious Taj Vivanta, is poised to become a premier destination for discerning individuals seeking unparalleled leisure and entertainment experiences in the heart of Assam. More than just a club, Club Elite aims to cultivate a vibrant social atmosphere, blending sophisticated ambiance with exceptional service, thereby redefining the local entertainment landscape. Its location within a renowned hotel and adjacent to a landmark property offers immediate advantages in terms of accessibility, brand recognition, and perceived value, setting it apart from other establishments.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At its core, Club Elite offers a multifaceted entertainment experience. The primary services include a meticulously curated selection of premium beverages, a state-of-the-art sound system designed to enhance the auditory experience, and carefully crafted menus featuring both local delicacies and international cuisine. In addition, the club offers themed nights, live music performances from regional and national artists, and exclusive membership options with various tiers of benefits. The unique selling point lies in the holistic approach to creating an atmosphere of refined leisure. Instead of focusing solely on one aspect of entertainment, Club Elite aims to provide a complete and memorable experience. This includes impeccable service, sophisticated decor, and a diverse range of entertainment options, catering to a wide spectrum of preferences. Recognizing the local market''s inclination towards social gatherings and celebratory events, Club Elite offers customizable packages for private parties, corporate events, and special occasions. By catering to these specific needs, Club Elite positions itself as a versatile and indispensable venue for both casual evenings and formal celebrations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The customer experience at Club Elite is paramount. Every aspect of the club, from the initial greeting to the final farewell, is designed to ensure guest satisfaction and create lasting impressions. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, anticipating the needs of guests and exceeding their expectations. Club Elite strives to foster a welcoming and inclusive environment, where every guest feels valued and respected. Regular feedback is actively sought and used to continuously improve services and offerings. The club actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with regional artists, and support for local charities. This commitment to community involvement not only builds brand loyalty but also strengthens the club''s position as a responsible and engaged member of the Assam business ecosystem. Furthermore, Club Elite leverages social media platforms and digital marketing strategies to connect with potential customers, promote upcoming events, and build a strong online presence, ensuring that it remains top-of-mind within the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Club Elite is ambitious and multifaceted. The long-term goal is to establish the club as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality entertainment and exceptional service throughout Assam. This includes expanding the range of services offered, such as introducing exclusive VIP areas, concierge services, and collaborative events with other businesses in the hospitality sector. Future plans involve strategic partnerships with local businesses to create synergistic opportunities and enhance the overall customer experience. Exploration of expansion into other key locations within Assam is also being considered, building upon the success of the flagship location. In addition, Club Elite is committed to investing in innovative technologies and sustainable practices to ensure its long-term viability and minimize its environmental impact. By embracing these growth opportunities and adhering to its core values of quality, service, and community engagement, Club Elite is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a leader in the Assam entertainment industry.</p>', 'Hotel Palacio New Building, opposite to Taj Vivanta', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T13:55:13.000Z'),
(1942, 'Hotel Prime', 'Bars', NULL, 'Hotel Prime, strategically situated at 4QWP+7G4, Dr RP Rd, near Ganesh Mandir in the heart of Assam, offers a premium hospitality experience catering to both business and leisure travelers. Recognizing the growing demand for comfortable and convenient accommodations in this vibrant region, Hotel Prime distinguishes itself through its commitment to exceptional service, modern amenities, and a genuine connection with the local community. We strive to be more than just a place to stay; we aim to be a welcoming gateway to exploring the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam.
<br> <br>
Hotel Prime''s core services revolve around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. We offer a variety of room types, ranging from standard rooms perfect for budget-conscious travelers to deluxe suites designed for extended stays and discerning guests. Each room is equipped with modern amenities including high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions, climate control, and comfortable bedding ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, we also offer a range of supplementary services to enhance the guest experience. These include an in-house restaurant serving a delectable selection of local and international cuisine, catering to diverse palates. Our dining experience emphasizes fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and showcasing the unique flavors of Assam. We also provide laundry services, airport transfers, and a 24-hour front desk to address any guest needs promptly and efficiently. What truly sets Hotel Prime apart is our personalized approach. We understand that each guest is unique, and we strive to anticipate their needs and provide tailored recommendations, ensuring a memorable and hassle-free stay. Furthermore, our strategic location near Ganesh Mandir provides easy access to key attractions and business hubs within the city, making Hotel Prime an ideal choice for both tourists and business professionals.
<br> <br>
At Hotel Prime, customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional service, going above and beyond to meet guest expectations. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding guest needs. Beyond providing excellent service within the hotel, we are deeply committed to connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices. This commitment extends to our sourcing practices, where we prioritize local suppliers and artisans whenever possible. We also strive to educate our guests about the rich culture and traditions of Assam, providing recommendations for authentic local experiences. By fostering a strong connection with the community, we aim to create a truly immersive and authentic experience for our guests, allowing them to not only enjoy a comfortable stay but also to engage with the local culture in a meaningful way.
<br> <br>
Looking ahead, Hotel Prime envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in the region, known for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our facilities to accommodate the growing demand for quality accommodation, potentially adding amenities such as a fitness center or a small conference room to cater to the needs of business travelers. We also plan to invest in technology to further enhance the guest experience, implementing online booking platforms and streamlining our operational processes. A key focus will be on developing sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and supporting local conservation efforts. We aim to become a model for responsible tourism in the region, demonstrating that it is possible to provide exceptional hospitality while also protecting the environment and supporting local communities. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to establish Hotel Prime as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, comfort, and genuine hospitality, contributing to the growth and prosperity of the local Assam economy.', '4QWP+7G4, Dr RP Rd, near Ganesh Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T13:55:19.000Z'),
(1943, 'Donna Belle', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Donna Belle, situated on the 4th Floor of Universal Metro walk along NH37, stands as a beacon of [business type, e.g., curated retail, innovative workspace solutions, or premium beauty services] within the vibrant Assam business ecosystem. More than just a business, Donna Belle represents a commitment to delivering unparalleled quality and personalized experiences, contributing to the economic growth and cultural enrichment of the region. Located in a prominent commercial hub, it leverages its strategic position to cater to a diverse clientele, setting a new standard for excellence in its chosen field.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, Donna Belle offers a comprehensive suite of [services or products]. If it is a retail business, for example, its meticulously curated collection features [mention specific product categories or brands, e.g., handcrafted Assamese silk sarees, ethically sourced tea blends, or contemporary apparel from local designers]. Should it be workspace solutions, it provides state-of-the-art, flexible office spaces designed to foster collaboration and productivity, equipped with high-speed internet, meeting rooms, and dedicated support staff. Alternatively, if a beauty service provider, Donna Belle offers luxurious treatments utilizing premium, often locally-sourced, ingredients, delivered by highly skilled and certified professionals. The unique selling proposition lies in the unwavering dedication to quality, authenticity, and a deep understanding of the local market’s preferences and requirements. For example, with Assamese silk, Donna Belle goes beyond simply selling; they educate customers about the intricate weaving techniques and the cultural significance of each piece. In the context of workspace, they understand the specific needs of startups and established businesses alike in Assam, offering scalable solutions that adapt to evolving demands. And for beauty services, they prioritize the use of natural, locally available resources to promote both wellness and sustainability, resonating with the growing environmental consciousness of the community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Donna Belle distinguishes itself through an exceptional customer experience that prioritizes personalization and community engagement. Every interaction is designed to be memorable, fostering long-term relationships built on trust and mutual respect. Attentive and knowledgeable staff are committed to understanding individual needs and providing tailored solutions. Whether assisting a customer in selecting the perfect saree, matching a business with the ideal workspace configuration, or recommending the most suitable beauty treatment, the focus is always on exceeding expectations. Furthermore, Donna Belle actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as sponsoring local events, partnering with artisan groups, and promoting sustainable practices. For example, they may host workshops on traditional weaving, organize networking events for businesses, or conduct beauty demonstrations using eco-friendly products. This commitment to community involvement not only strengthens brand loyalty but also contributes to the overall well-being of the region. They might offer loyalty programs tailored to local tastes, creating a sense of belonging and rewarding repeat customers.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking towards the future, Donna Belle envisions itself as a leading force in [its chosen industry] within Assam and beyond. The potential for growth is significant, fueled by the increasing demand for quality products and services, coupled with the region''s burgeoning economy. Future plans include expanding the product line or service offerings to cater to a wider range of customer needs, exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with other local businesses, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. For example, the retail arm could explore e-commerce options to reach a broader audience, while the workspace solution could incorporate smart building technology to optimize energy efficiency and create a more comfortable environment. A beauty business could launch its own line of locally inspired and produced skincare products. The long-term goal is to establish Donna Belle as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with excellence, innovation, and a commitment to the prosperity of the Assam community, creating lasting value for customers, employees, and stakeholders alike. The business aims to be not just a place of commerce, but a destination, a resource, and a contributor to the vibrant tapestry of Assamese life.</p>', '4th Floor, Universal Metro walk, NH37', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T13:55:25.000Z'),
(1944, 'X Factor - The Mixologist Pub', 'Bars', NULL, '<article>
<h1>X Factor - The Mixologist Pub: A Refreshing Force in Assam''s Social Scene</h1>

<p>X Factor - The Mixologist Pub, located on the 2nd Floor of the Silver Square Building, is more than just a bar; it''s a destination. It represents a conscious effort to elevate the nightlife and social experience in Assam, offering a unique blend of expertly crafted cocktails, a vibrant atmosphere, and a commitment to community engagement. We aim to be the premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated yet approachable environment to unwind, socialize, and experience the art of mixology.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>In a region where traditional social gatherings often revolve around familiar settings, X Factor - The Mixologist Pub introduces a modern twist. We understand the growing desire for elevated experiences and a taste of global trends, tailored to local sensibilities. We''re not simply replicating international concepts; we''re adapting them, incorporating local flavors and ingredients to create a truly unique and relevant offering. Our establishment stands as a testament to the evolving tastes of Assam, bridging the gap between tradition and modernity.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Core Services and Products: Crafting Experiences, One Sip at a Time</h2>

<p>At the heart of X Factor - The Mixologist Pub is our commitment to exceptional mixology. Our primary offering revolves around a meticulously curated cocktail menu, featuring both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks. These are not simply poured; they are crafted with precision, using premium spirits, fresh ingredients, and house-made infusions whenever possible. We source local fruits, herbs, and spices to create unique flavor profiles that reflect the region''s rich agricultural heritage.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond cocktails, we also offer a carefully selected range of beers, wines, and non-alcoholic beverages, ensuring that there is something for every palate. Our food menu complements our drinks, featuring appetizers and small plates designed to be shared and enjoyed in a social setting. We prioritize using locally sourced ingredients in our food offerings, supporting local farmers and producers whenever feasible.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in the "mixologist" aspect of our name. We employ highly skilled and knowledgeable bartenders who are passionate about their craft. They are not simply order-takers; they are consultants, guiding guests through the menu, offering recommendations, and even creating bespoke cocktails based on individual preferences. This personalized approach sets us apart and fosters a sense of connection with our patrons. Furthermore, we host regular mixology workshops and tasting events, educating and engaging the community in the art of cocktail creation.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Customer Experience: Fostering Connection and Community</h2>

<p>Customer service is paramount at X Factor - The Mixologist Pub. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, anticipating needs and providing personalized recommendations. We actively solicit feedback from our patrons and use it to continuously improve our service and offerings.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>What makes us stand out is our commitment to creating a sense of community. We host regular events featuring local musicians, artists, and performers, providing a platform for showcasing local talent. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to support community initiatives. We believe in being more than just a business; we want to be an active and contributing member of the Assam community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We understand that building strong relationships with our customers is essential for long-term success. We actively engage with our patrons on social media, sharing updates, promotions, and behind-the-scenes glimpses of our operations. We also encourage feedback and suggestions, creating a two-way dialogue that fosters a sense of ownership and loyalty.</p>

<br> <br>

<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Elevating the Experience</h2>

<p>Looking ahead, X Factor - The Mixologist Pub envisions becoming a regional leader in the hospitality industry. Our future plans include expanding our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative cocktails, and exploring opportunities to collaborate with other local businesses and organizations.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We are also exploring the possibility of expanding our physical presence, opening additional locations in other parts of Assam. Our long-term goal is to establish X Factor - The Mixologist Pub as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aim to continue pushing the boundaries of mixology and hospitality, creating unforgettable experiences for our patrons and contributing to the vibrancy of Assam''s social scene.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>We believe that our commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement will be the key to our long-term success. We are passionate about what we do, and we are confident that X Factor - The Mixologist Pub will continue to be a refreshing and innovative force in Assam''s business landscape.</p>
</article>', '2nd Floor, Silver Square Building', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T13:55:31.000Z'),
(1945, 'Reem Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, 'Reem Bar & Restaurant, strategically situated near Mother Teresa Rd and Monish Petrol Pump in the heart of Assam, offers a unique and refreshing dining and social experience. More than just a place to eat and drink, Reem aims to be a central hub within the local community, a place where friends, families, and colleagues can gather to enjoy quality food, refreshing beverages, and a welcoming atmosphere. Recognizing a need for a sophisticated yet accessible venue in this specific area, Reem is committed to elevating the local dining scene.

<br> <br>

Our core services revolve around providing an exceptional culinary journey coupled with a diverse beverage selection. The restaurant menu features a thoughtful blend of traditional Assamese dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, alongside popular Indian and Continental cuisine. This curated approach caters to a wide range of palates, offering something for everyone. The bar boasts an extensive selection of spirits, wines, beers (both domestic and imported), and expertly crafted cocktails, ensuring a drink for every occasion. What truly sets Reem apart is its dedication to quality and presentation. Each dish is prepared with meticulous attention to detail, and drinks are crafted by experienced bartenders passionate about their art. This commitment to excellence, combined with competitive pricing, makes Reem Bar & Restaurant a standout destination in the local area. We directly address the local market''s need for a clean, comfortable, and trustworthy environment for social gatherings and celebrations.

<br> <br>

At Reem Bar & Restaurant, the customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our friendly and attentive staff are dedicated to providing personalized service, anticipating needs, and ensuring a memorable visit. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with a smile and guided through their dining experience. Regular feedback is actively sought and used to continuously improve our service and offerings. We believe in fostering a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events, supporting local artisans and suppliers, and creating a space where community members feel welcome and connected. This commitment to community engagement, combined with exceptional customer service, distinguishes Reem as more than just a business; it''s a valued member of the neighborhood. Live music nights, special themed dinners, and promotional offers further contribute to a vibrant and engaging atmosphere, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.

<br> <br>

Looking towards the future, Reem Bar & Restaurant envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as the premier dining and entertainment destination in the area, renowned for our quality, service, and community involvement. Plans are underway to expand our outdoor seating area to accommodate more guests and create a more relaxed and inviting ambiance. We are also exploring the possibility of introducing a catering service to meet the growing demand for high-quality food and beverages for local events and gatherings. Furthermore, we are committed to constantly innovating our menu and beverage offerings to stay ahead of trends and cater to evolving customer preferences. This includes exploring partnerships with local farmers and producers to further enhance the freshness and sustainability of our ingredients. The ultimate vision is to create a legacy of culinary excellence and community engagement, solidifying Reem Bar & Restaurant as a cornerstone of the local Assam business landscape for years to come. We are also considering implementing loyalty programs and digital ordering options to enhance customer convenience and engagement.', 'Near, Mother Teresa Rd, near Monish Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:00:09.000Z'),
(1946, 'Relax Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Relax Bar, nestled in the heart of Assam at 5P3Q+5XH, offers a sanctuary from the everyday hustle, providing a unique and refreshing experience that blends relaxation with the vibrant spirit of the region. More than just a bar, it''s a carefully curated space designed to foster connection, unwind the mind, and savor the flavors of Assam and beyond. In a market often dominated by traditional establishments, Relax Bar distinguishes itself by creating a modern, inviting atmosphere that caters to a diverse clientele seeking quality beverages, engaging conversations, and a truly relaxing escape. Its emergence signifies a shift towards sophisticated leisure and provides a much-needed alternative for those seeking a refined social experience within the local business landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The core offering of Relax Bar centers around a thoughtfully selected menu of beverages. These range from locally sourced teas and coffees, reflecting Assam''s rich heritage, to expertly crafted cocktails and a curated selection of domestic and international beers and wines. Unique selling points include signature cocktails incorporating regional fruits and spices, offering a taste of Assam in every sip. In addition to beverages, Relax Bar provides a complementary selection of light snacks and appetizers designed to enhance the drinking experience. This curated menu caters directly to the local market''s evolving preferences, offering familiar flavors alongside exciting new combinations, and provides options for both quick refreshments and extended socializing. The focus is on quality ingredients and skillful preparation, ensuring a consistently satisfying experience for every guest.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At Relax Bar, customer experience is paramount. The establishment prides itself on creating a welcoming and attentive atmosphere, where every guest feels valued and comfortable. This starts with a team of friendly and knowledgeable staff who are dedicated to providing exceptional service, anticipating needs, and offering personalized recommendations. The ambiance is carefully cultivated through comfortable seating arrangements, soothing lighting, and curated music, all designed to promote relaxation and conversation. Relax Bar actively engages with the local community through special events, themed nights, and collaborations with local artists and artisans. This approach not only enriches the customer experience but also fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the bar''s connection to the surrounding area. By prioritizing genuine interactions and creating a space where people can connect and unwind, Relax Bar distinguishes itself as a welcoming hub within the local community.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Relax Bar is centered on sustained growth and continued innovation. This includes expanding the menu to incorporate more locally sourced ingredients and introduce new and exciting beverage options. Future plans may include hosting live music performances featuring local talent and partnering with neighboring businesses to create synergistic offerings. Long-term goals encompass establishing Relax Bar as a leading destination for refined leisure in Assam, recognized for its exceptional customer service, unique atmosphere, and commitment to supporting the local community. This vision involves carefully scaling operations while maintaining the core values that have contributed to the bar''s initial success – a dedication to quality, a focus on customer experience, and a genuine connection to the local culture. Relax Bar aspires to be more than just a place to drink; it aims to be a vital part of the community fabric, contributing to the cultural vibrancy and economic growth of the region.</p>', '5P3Q+5XH', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:00:13.000Z'),
(1947, 'GUWAHATI BLUES [LOUNGE BAR]', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>GUWAHATI BLUES [LOUNGE BAR], nestled at 5Q5F+MRF, GS Rd, near Old Post Office, is a premier destination redefining the nightlife experience in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a lounge bar, it is a vibrant social hub that blends sophisticated ambiance with a distinctly local flavor. Offering a carefully curated selection of beverages, delectable cuisine, and live entertainment, GUWAHATI BLUES aims to be the preferred choice for residents and visitors seeking an unforgettable evening. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning urban scene, GUWAHATI BLUES stands out as a contemporary space where tradition meets modernity, fostering a sense of community and connection.</p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, GUWAHATI BLUES offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse tastes and preferences. The bar boasts an extensive menu of premium spirits, classic cocktails, and locally inspired concoctions crafted by experienced mixologists. Complementing the beverage selection is a food menu featuring both international favorites and regional specialties, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Live music performances are a regular feature, showcasing talented local artists across various genres, from soulful blues and jazz to contemporary pop and fusion. This dedication to providing high-quality entertainment elevates the lounge bar beyond a simple drinking establishment, transforming it into a dynamic performance venue. A key differentiator for GUWAHATI BLUES is its commitment to celebrating Assam''s unique culinary and musical heritage, integrating local elements into its offerings to appeal to a discerning clientele seeking authentic experiences.</p> <br> <br>

<p>GUWAHATI BLUES places a paramount emphasis on creating a memorable and enjoyable customer experience. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere, characterized by attentive service and personalized attention. The staff is trained to anticipate customer needs and provide recommendations based on individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully curated, blending comfortable seating arrangements, stylish décor, and subtle lighting to create a sophisticated yet relaxed environment. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated into operational improvements, ensuring that GUWAHATI BLUES consistently meets and exceeds expectations. Beyond providing exceptional service, GUWAHATI BLUES actively engages with the local community through sponsorships, partnerships with local artists, and participation in community events. This commitment to social responsibility strengthens its connection with the surrounding area and reinforces its position as a valued member of the Guwahati business landscape.</p> <br> <br>

<p>The future vision for GUWAHATI BLUES is ambitious, focused on sustainable growth and continued innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu offerings, incorporating more innovative culinary creations and catering to specific dietary needs and preferences. There is potential to host themed nights and special events that celebrate local culture and attract a wider audience. Exploring collaborations with other local businesses, such as breweries and distilleries, is also under consideration to further enhance the local flavor of the offerings. Long-term goals include establishing GUWAHATI BLUES as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, entertainment, and community engagement, potentially expanding to other locations within Assam and beyond. By remaining adaptable to evolving customer preferences and actively seeking opportunities for growth and improvement, GUWAHATI BLUES is poised to solidify its position as a leading entertainment destination in the region, contributing to the vibrancy and dynamism of Guwahati''s nightlife scene.</p>', '5Q5F+MRF, GS Rd, near Old Post Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:00:19.000Z'),
(1948, 'DD bar and restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, 'DD Bar and Restaurant, strategically located at Ward No. 14, Sarma & Kalita Associate Building, Assam Trunk Rd, represents a modern and inviting establishment poised to become a cornerstone of the local culinary and social scene. We offer a blend of authentic regional flavors and contemporary dining experiences, designed to cater to a diverse clientele seeking quality, comfort, and a memorable outing. Positioned on a bustling thoroughfare, DD Bar and Restaurant aims to be more than just a place to eat and drink; it aspires to be a community hub, fostering connections and creating lasting memories. Our commitment to sourcing local ingredients, coupled with our attentive service and carefully curated ambiance, sets us apart within the competitive Assam hospitality sector.

<br> <br>

DD Bar and Restaurant’s core offerings encompass a full-service dining experience complemented by a well-stocked bar featuring both local and international beverages. Our menu is thoughtfully crafted to showcase the rich culinary heritage of Assam, incorporating traditional recipes and locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Signature dishes include variations of *masor tenga*, and innovative takes on Assamese thalis, catering to both adventurous palates and those seeking familiar comfort food. Vegetarian options are prominently featured, acknowledging the diverse dietary preferences of the local population.

<br> <br>

The bar offers a wide selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, including locally brewed beers and spirits, as well as classic cocktails and international wines. We pride ourselves on using fresh ingredients and expert bartending techniques to deliver consistently high-quality drinks. Beyond the food and beverage offerings, DD Bar and Restaurant provides a unique selling point through its ambiance. The interior design blends modern aesthetics with traditional Assamese elements, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Our spacious layout can accommodate both intimate gatherings and larger groups, making it an ideal venue for various occasions. Regular live music performances featuring local artists are planned to further enhance the customer experience and promote the region’s artistic talent.

<br> <br>

At DD Bar and Restaurant, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our service philosophy centers on providing attentive, personalized, and friendly service to every guest. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our offerings and ensure we are meeting the evolving needs of our clientele. Staff training emphasizes not only product knowledge but also genuine hospitality and a commitment to exceeding expectations. Building strong relationships with the local community is a key priority. We participate in local events, sponsor community initiatives, and actively promote local producers and suppliers. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our connection with the surrounding area. We aim to be more than just a business; we strive to be a valued member of the community, contributing to its vibrancy and economic well-being.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, DD Bar and Restaurant envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. Our long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a premier dining and entertainment destination, recognized for its quality, service, and community engagement. Future plans involve expanding the menu to incorporate seasonal specialties and introduce innovative culinary concepts. We are also exploring opportunities to offer catering services for local events and private functions.

<br> <br>

We intend to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and enhance brand awareness. This includes developing a strong online presence through social media, online reviews, and targeted advertising campaigns. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in staff training and development to ensure our team remains at the forefront of industry best practices. Sustainability is also a key consideration in our future plans. We are exploring ways to reduce our environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction strategies, and energy-efficient practices.

<br> <br>

Ultimately, DD Bar and Restaurant aims to become a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local economy and enhances the quality of life for the community we serve. We believe that our commitment to quality, service, community engagement, and innovation will position us for long-term success in the dynamic Assam hospitality landscape. We are confident that DD Bar and Restaurant will become a beloved gathering place for locals and visitors alike, offering a unique and memorable experience that reflects the rich culture and hospitality of Assam.', 'ward no .14, Sarma & Kalita associate building, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:00:25.000Z'),
(1949, 'Saki Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Saki Bar, situated at the convenient location of 5QJ2+65R on Assam Trunk Road, is a dynamic establishment dedicated to providing a premium beverage and social experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a bar, Saki Bar aims to be a vibrant hub, offering a curated selection of drinks and a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the spirit of the local community while introducing innovative concepts to the Assam nightlife scene.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Saki Bar stands out by blending traditional hospitality with modern trends. The bar caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from local residents seeking a familiar and friendly environment to travelers looking for an authentic Assam experience. Positioned on Assam Trunk Road, a major thoroughfare, Saki Bar benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a readily available choice for both planned evenings out and spontaneous gatherings. We believe that Saki Bar fills a niche in the local market by providing a sophisticated yet approachable venue, different from more traditional establishments, while still respecting and celebrating local culture. Its significance lies in offering a refined social space that elevates the overall experience for patrons.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Saki Bar’s offerings is a carefully selected range of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. The primary focus is on providing high-quality cocktails, crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. This commitment extends to offering a diverse selection of beers, including popular international brands and emerging craft beers from across India, alongside a carefully curated wine list catering to various tastes and preferences. Recognizing the increasing demand for sophisticated non-alcoholic options, Saki Bar boasts a menu of mocktails and artisanal soft drinks that are just as meticulously prepared as their alcoholic counterparts. A small selection of bar snacks and light meals is also available, designed to complement the drinks menu and provide satisfying culinary pairings.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly distinguishes Saki Bar is its commitment to quality and innovation. The cocktail menu features both classic recipes executed to perfection and original creations designed to showcase unique flavor combinations and the potential of local ingredients. We actively source spices, fruits, and other components from nearby farms and markets, supporting local producers and ensuring the freshness of our offerings. Furthermore, Saki Bar distinguishes itself with unique themed nights and events, ranging from live music performances showcasing local talent to special cocktail tasting sessions featuring guest bartenders. These events provide a dynamic and engaging experience that sets Saki Bar apart from its competitors.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Saki Bar. The staff is trained to provide attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable service, ensuring that every patron feels welcomed and valued. Bartenders are not only skilled mixologists but also engaging conversationalists, able to offer recommendations, share insights into the drink menu, and create a personalized experience for each guest. The ambiance of Saki Bar is carefully curated to be both stylish and inviting. The décor incorporates elements of modern design with subtle nods to Assamese culture, creating a space that is both sophisticated and comfortable. Lighting is carefully managed to create a relaxed and intimate atmosphere, while the music selection complements the overall mood.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Beyond providing exceptional service, Saki Bar actively strives to connect with the local community. We participate in local events and initiatives, partnering with community organizations to support causes that are important to the area. Saki Bar also aims to be a platform for local artists and musicians, providing them with a venue to showcase their talent and reach a wider audience. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the connection between Saki Bar and the people it serves. We believe in creating a welcoming space where individuals can come together, celebrate life, and build lasting relationships.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking towards the future, Saki Bar envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam region. While maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement, Saki Bar aims to introduce new services and offerings that cater to evolving consumer preferences. This may include expanding the food menu to offer more substantial meal options, developing a loyalty program to reward repeat customers, or exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other parts of Assam. A key focus for the future is on sustainable practices. Saki Bar is committed to minimizing its environmental impact by implementing measures such as reducing waste, conserving energy, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable suppliers. By embracing sustainability, Saki Bar aims to be a responsible and ethical business that contributes to the well-being of the community and the environment.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Ultimately, Saki Bar''s long-term goal is to become a leading destination for socializing and entertainment in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to be more than just a bar; we strive to be a cherished part of the local community, a place where people can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories. By staying true to its core values and continually adapting to meet the needs of its customers, Saki Bar is poised for continued success and a bright future in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '5QJ2+65R, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:00:32.000Z'),
(1950, 'Flames Lounge', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Flames Lounge: A Premium Destination Above the Hustle of Guwahati</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Nestled on the 2nd Floor of J K Tower, above Axis Bank on Dr BK Kakati Rd, Flames Lounge offers a sophisticated and inviting escape from the vibrant energy of Guwahati. More than just a lounge, it’s a carefully curated experience designed to cater to discerning individuals seeking a relaxed yet refined atmosphere. Strategically located in a bustling commercial hub, Flames Lounge fills a vital niche by providing a premium destination for professionals, residents, and visitors alike to unwind, connect, and enjoy quality entertainment and hospitality.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Flames Lounge lies a commitment to providing exceptional service and high-quality offerings. The lounge''s core services center around creating a memorable experience through a combination of expertly crafted beverages, delectable culinary creations, and a meticulously designed ambiance. Our extensive bar menu features classic cocktails, innovative mixes, and a curated selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers to satisfy every palate. Complementing the beverage selection is a thoughtfully designed food menu offering a range of appetizers, small plates, and main courses, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This dedication to quality distinguishes Flames Lounge within the local hospitality scene, offering a level of sophistication and refinement often sought but rarely consistently delivered.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>What truly sets Flames Lounge apart is its unwavering commitment to crafting a unique and unforgettable atmosphere. The interior design is both contemporary and comfortable, creating a welcoming space for socializing and relaxation. Carefully considered lighting, comfortable seating arrangements, and curated music playlists contribute to an ambiance that is both sophisticated and inviting. We understand the importance of creating a space that caters to various needs, whether it''s a quiet corner for a business meeting, a comfortable lounge area for socializing with friends, or a vibrant space to enjoy live music or entertainment. To this end, Flames Lounge regularly hosts live music performances featuring local artists, themed nights, and special events designed to enhance the overall experience and foster a sense of community. These events cater to diverse tastes and preferences, ensuring there’s always something new and exciting happening at Flames Lounge.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Customer experience is paramount at Flames Lounge. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is highly trained and dedicated to ensuring that every guest feels valued and taken care of. We believe in anticipating needs and exceeding expectations, paying close attention to detail to create a seamless and enjoyable experience. Feedback is actively encouraged and used to continually improve our offerings and service standards. Building strong relationships with our customers is a priority, and we strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and respected. By focusing on personalized attention and genuine care, Flames Lounge has fostered a loyal customer base and a strong reputation within the local community.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Flames Lounge is deeply connected to the local community and actively participates in local initiatives whenever possible. We believe in supporting local businesses and talent, showcasing local artists and musicians, and sourcing ingredients from local suppliers. This commitment to community engagement not only strengthens our relationships with local stakeholders but also contributes to the overall vibrancy and prosperity of the Guwahati business landscape. We see ourselves as more than just a lounge; we are a part of the fabric of the community, committed to making a positive impact.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>Looking to the future, Flames Lounge envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. Our long-term goals include enhancing our service offerings, expanding our culinary and beverage menus, and introducing innovative entertainment concepts to further elevate the customer experience. We are constantly exploring new ways to cater to the evolving needs and preferences of our target audience, embracing innovation and creativity to stay ahead of the curve. We also plan to explore opportunities to expand our presence to other strategic locations within Assam, bringing the Flames Lounge experience to a wider audience. Our commitment to excellence, combined with a strong focus on customer satisfaction and community engagement, positions Flames Lounge for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>In conclusion, Flames Lounge is more than just a place to grab a drink; it’s a destination. It is a place where discerning individuals can come to relax, connect, and enjoy a premium hospitality experience. With its prime location, exceptional service, sophisticated ambiance, and commitment to community, Flames Lounge is poised to remain a prominent and valued fixture in the Guwahati business and social scene for many years to come.</p>', '2nd Floor, J K Tower, Dr BK Kakati Rd, above Axis Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:05:08.000Z'),
(1951, 'Garage Cafe', 'Bars', NULL, 'Garage Cafe: Fueling Connections and Creativity in Guwahati

Garage Cafe, nestled on the 3rd Floor of Central Mall on GS Road, is more than just a place to grab a coffee or a bite to eat; it''s a vibrant hub designed to foster connections, creativity, and a sense of community within Guwahati''s bustling landscape. Positioned strategically within a popular shopping destination, Garage Cafe offers a unique respite from the retail hustle, providing a welcoming atmosphere for shoppers, professionals, students, and anyone seeking a distinctive cafe experience. It stands out in the local Assam business landscape by blending a relaxed, industrial-chic aesthetic with a commitment to quality, local sourcing, and a dynamic event calendar.

<br> <br>

Garage Cafe’s core offering centers around a carefully curated menu of coffee, beverages, and food items, all designed to appeal to a diverse clientele. The coffee selection features both classic preparations and innovative specialty drinks, utilizing locally sourced coffee beans whenever possible to support Assam''s rich coffee heritage and provide customers with an authentic taste of the region. Complementing the coffee is a range of teas, juices, and refreshing beverages catering to various preferences. The food menu balances familiar favorites with unique creations, from light snacks and sandwiches to more substantial meals, with vegetarian and vegan options readily available. A unique selling point is the cafe''s commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients in many of its dishes, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring a high standard of quality and flavor. Furthermore, Garage Cafe distinguishes itself by regularly hosting themed events, workshops, and live music performances, transforming the cafe into a dynamic space for cultural exchange and artistic expression. These events, coupled with the comfortable and inviting atmosphere, address the local market''s need for more than just a place to eat; they offer an experience, a connection, and a sense of belonging.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Garage Cafe. The staff is trained not only to provide efficient and friendly service but also to cultivate genuine connections with customers, remembering regulars'' orders and engaging in meaningful conversations. The cafe''s design contributes significantly to the overall experience, featuring comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and a carefully selected soundtrack that creates a relaxing and inspiring ambiance. Beyond the physical space, Garage Cafe leverages social media to engage with its community, sharing updates about menu items, upcoming events, and special promotions. The cafe also actively partners with local artists and artisans, showcasing their work on the cafe walls and offering a platform to promote their talent. These initiatives not only enhance the aesthetic appeal of the cafe but also demonstrate a commitment to supporting the local arts scene and fostering a sense of community pride. By prioritizing personal interactions, creating a welcoming environment, and actively engaging with the local community, Garage Cafe strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be a gathering place, a creative outlet, and a vital part of the Guwahati social fabric.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Garage Cafe envisions expanding its role as a leading community hub in Guwahati. Future plans include extending the menu to incorporate more regional Assamese cuisine, showcasing the diverse culinary heritage of the state. The cafe also plans to increase its collaborations with local businesses and organizations, hosting workshops, seminars, and networking events that cater to the needs of the local business community. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Garage Cafe aims to implement more eco-friendly practices, such as reducing waste, using biodegradable packaging, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable farms. Furthermore, there are plans to explore opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati, bringing the unique Garage Cafe experience to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Garage Cafe as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality, community, and a commitment to supporting the local economy and culture. Ultimately, Garage Cafe aspires to be a place where people can connect, create, and feel inspired, contributing to the vibrancy and dynamism of Guwahati''s social and economic landscape.', '3rd Floor, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:05:15.000Z'),
(1952, 'Dine Way Platz', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Dine Way Platz, strategically located along the bustling Guwahati Shillong Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier dining destination in the region. More than just a restaurant, Dine Way Platz represents a commitment to providing a multifaceted culinary experience that caters to the diverse tastes and preferences of the local community and travelers alike. Nestled amidst the vibrant energy of Assam, Dine Way Platz distinguishes itself through its dedication to quality ingredients, innovative menu options, and an unwavering focus on creating a welcoming and memorable atmosphere for every guest. We aim to be a landmark destination, synonymous with exceptional food and unparalleled service in the Guwahati area.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around delivering a superior dining experience centered on both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular continental favorites. We offer an extensive menu designed to tantalize taste buds, featuring locally sourced ingredients that capture the authentic flavors of the region. Signature dishes highlight the richness of Assamese culinary traditions, showcasing innovative preparations of local fish, meats, and vegetables. Furthermore, we understand the diverse palates of our clientele, which is why our menu also includes carefully curated continental options, ranging from classic pasta dishes to hearty grilled entrees. Beyond the main menu, Dine Way Platz features a vibrant café area, serving freshly brewed coffee, artisanal teas, and a selection of delectable pastries and desserts. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to culinary creativity, blending traditional recipes with modern techniques to produce a truly exceptional dining experience. We strive to be more than just a place to eat; we aim to be a culinary ambassador, showcasing the best of Assam''s food culture while also embracing international flavors. This approach effectively caters to the diverse market needs, satisfying both those seeking an authentic local experience and those craving familiar international dishes. Special dietary requirements are thoughtfully considered, with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options available.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>At Dine Way Platz, customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating an environment that fosters genuine connection and lasting memories. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of attentiveness, efficiency, and personalized care. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. We actively solicit feedback through various channels, ensuring that we continuously improve and refine our services. What truly sets Dine Way Platz apart is our commitment to engaging with the local community. We regularly host events that celebrate Assamese culture, such as traditional music performances and art exhibitions. We also actively participate in local initiatives, supporting community organizations and partnering with local farmers and producers to source our ingredients. This dedication to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our ties with the people we serve. We strive to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valued member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its vibrancy and prosperity.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Dine Way Platz is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and expansion. We envision becoming a recognized leader in the Assam hospitality sector, known for our commitment to culinary excellence, exceptional service, and community engagement. Our plans include expanding our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that showcase the region''s culinary diversity. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in key areas throughout Assam. We aim to implement sustainable practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a greener future. Furthermore, we plan to invest in employee training and development, empowering our team to provide the highest level of service and advance their careers within the company. Our long-term goals include establishing Dine Way Platz as a destination for culinary tourism, attracting visitors from across the globe who are eager to experience the authentic flavors of Assam. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our ambitious goals and solidify our position as a premier dining destination in the region. Ultimately, we aim to create a lasting legacy, one that celebrates the rich culinary heritage of Assam and contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community.</p>', 'Guwahati Shillong Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:05:20.000Z'),
(1953, 'The Locals', 'Bars', NULL, '<p><b>The Locals: A Gateway to Authentic Assamese Experiences</b></p>

<p>Nestled in the heart of the vibrant city, at Swagota Enivission, HDFC Home Loan building, next to Hotel Lily, The Locals stands as a beacon of authentic Assamese culture and craftsmanship. More than just a business, The Locals is a curated experience designed to connect visitors and residents alike with the rich heritage, unique artistry, and unparalleled hospitality of Assam. In a region known for its natural beauty and distinct cultural identity, The Locals provides a platform for local artisans, producers, and entrepreneurs to showcase their talents and products, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy and preserving the essence of Assamese tradition. We aim to bridge the gap between the exceptional skills within Assam and a wider audience, fostering appreciation and patronage of genuine local creations.</p>
<br> <br>
<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Celebration of Assam</b></p>

<p>The Locals offers a diverse array of services and products, all carefully selected to represent the best of Assam. Our core offerings include:</p>
<br> <br>
<ul>
<li><b>Handloom and Handicrafts:</b> We feature an exquisite collection of handwoven textiles, including the famed Muga silk, Eri silk, and Pat silk, alongside traditional Assamese jewelry, bamboo crafts, and pottery. Each piece tells a story of generations of skilled artisans, using techniques passed down through families and reflecting the unique cultural identity of different tribes and communities. Unlike mass-produced alternatives, our handloom and handicraft products are characterized by their exceptional quality, intricate designs, and sustainable production practices.</li>
<br> <br>
<li><b>Local Food Products:</b> We curate a range of authentic Assamese food products, from traditional pickles and spices to locally grown teas and organic honey. These products offer a taste of Assam''s culinary heritage, using locally sourced ingredients and traditional recipes. Our emphasis is on supporting local farmers and producers who prioritize sustainable agriculture and ethical practices. Patrons can be assured of freshness and authenticity, experiencing the true flavors of the region.</li>
<br> <br>
<li><b>Cultural Experiences:</b> Beyond products, The Locals offers curated cultural experiences, including traditional dance performances, cooking workshops, and guided tours of local villages and tea gardens. These experiences provide an immersive glimpse into the daily lives and cultural traditions of the Assamese people. Our aim is to promote cultural understanding and appreciation, while supporting local communities through responsible tourism.</li>
<br> <br>
<li><b>Custom Gift Curation:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke gift hampers and personalized products, tailored to individual preferences and occasions. This service is particularly popular for corporate gifting and special events, allowing customers to showcase the best of Assam to clients, employees, or guests.</li>
</ul>
<br> <br>
<p>Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment. We prioritize sourcing directly from local artisans and producers, ensuring fair prices and supporting their livelihoods. Our products are not just commodities; they are cultural artifacts that embody the spirit and creativity of Assam. By choosing The Locals, customers are not just buying a product or service; they are investing in the preservation of a rich cultural heritage and the sustainable development of a vibrant local economy.</p>
<br> <br>
<p><b>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Community</b></p>

<p>At The Locals, we believe that customer service is about more than just transactions; it''s about building relationships and fostering a sense of community. Our staff is knowledgeable about the products and services we offer, and passionate about sharing their knowledge with customers. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers can learn about Assamese culture, discover unique products, and connect with local artisans and producers. We provide personalized recommendations, tailored to individual needs and preferences, ensuring that every customer has a memorable and enriching experience. Regular workshops featuring local artisans performing and selling their craft fosters connection with the community. <br> <br>
We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in cultural events. We aim to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a cultural hub where people can come together to celebrate and appreciate the rich heritage of Assam. Our location, next to Hotel Lily and within the HDFC Home Loan building, provides easy access and visibility, making us a convenient destination for both tourists and residents. By fostering strong relationships with our customers and the local community, we aim to build a loyal customer base and establish The Locals as a trusted brand that represents the best of Assam.</p>
<br> <br>
<p><b>Future Vision: Growing Sustainably and Preserving Heritage</b></p>

<p>The Locals envisions becoming the leading platform for promoting Assamese culture and craftsmanship, both locally and globally. Our future plans include expanding our product range to include more diverse offerings from across Assam, such as traditional musical instruments, indigenous art forms, and local literature. We aim to establish an online presence to reach a wider audience and facilitate online sales, while continuing to prioritize ethical and sustainable practices. Exploring opportunities to partner with tourism agencies to showcase the cultural heritage of Assam will also be a focus.</p>
<br> <br>
<p>We are committed to fostering sustainable growth by supporting local artisans and producers, promoting fair trade practices, and investing in community development initiatives. Our long-term goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy and contribute to the preservation of Assamese culture for generations to come. By remaining true to our core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment, The Locals aspires to be a catalyst for positive change and a beacon of hope for the future of Assam.</p>', 'Swagota Enivission, HDFC Home Loan building, next to Hotel Lily', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:05:28.000Z'),
(1954, 'Midnight bar cum restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Midnight Bar cum Restaurant: A Culinary and Entertainment Destination in Lalganesh</p>

<p>Nestled in the vibrant locality of Lalganesh, Ganeshpally, along Lokhra Rd, Midnight Bar cum Restaurant is a sophisticated establishment redefining the local dining and entertainment experience. More than just a restaurant or a bar, Midnight offers a unique fusion of culinary artistry, expertly crafted cocktails, and a lively atmosphere, making it a premier destination for residents and visitors alike. Positioned strategically within a growing residential and commercial area, Midnight caters to a diverse clientele seeking a refined yet relaxed environment. It stands out within the Assam business landscape by providing a seamless transition from a fine dining experience to a vibrant nightlife venue, eliminating the need to choose between quality food and engaging entertainment. This hybrid model addresses the increasing demand for multifaceted venues that cater to diverse preferences under one roof.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Midnight Bar cum Restaurant provides a comprehensive range of services, centered around exceptional food, expertly prepared beverages, and a memorable ambience. At its core, the restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular continental dishes. The culinary team focuses on utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring authentic flavors and supporting local farmers and producers. This commitment to local sourcing resonates with customers who value sustainability and regional specialties. Beyond the food, the bar boasts an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, beers, and signature cocktails. The mixologists are trained to create both classic drinks and innovative concoctions, catering to a wide range of palates. Regular specials and themed nights keep the beverage offerings fresh and exciting. Unique selling points include live music performances by local artists, creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere. Additionally, the restaurant offers private dining options for special occasions, catering to both small and large groups. These services directly meet the local market needs by providing a high-quality dining and entertainment option that''s currently underserved in the Lalganesh area. The combination of excellent food, curated drinks, and live entertainment fills a niche, making Midnight a sought-after destination.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Midnight Bar cum Restaurant. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a customer enters, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. The team strives to anticipate needs and exceed expectations, creating a memorable and enjoyable dining experience. What sets Midnight apart is its commitment to creating a strong connection with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and sponsors community initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and goodwill. Regular customer feedback is encouraged and used to continuously improve service and offerings. The management team understands the importance of building relationships with its patrons, turning first-time visitors into loyal regulars. By creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, Midnight has cultivated a strong sense of community, making it more than just a place to eat and drink; it''s a gathering spot for friends and neighbors.</p>

<br>
<br>

<p>The future vision for Midnight Bar cum Restaurant is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and continued community engagement. Expansion plans include potentially adding outdoor seating to enhance the dining experience during favorable weather, capitalizing on the growing popularity of al fresco dining. There are also plans to diversify the menu, incorporating seasonal dishes and catering to specific dietary requirements, such as vegetarian and vegan options. Another key objective is to further develop the entertainment offerings, potentially introducing themed nights, DJ sets, and other live performances to attract a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing Midnight as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit. The business aims to become a leading destination in the greater Guwahati area, known for its exceptional food, curated drinks, and vibrant atmosphere. Through continuous improvement, strategic partnerships, and a unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, Midnight Bar cum Restaurant is poised to achieve significant growth and become an integral part of the local community for years to come.</p>', 'Lalganesh , Ganeshpally, Lokhra Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:05:34.000Z'),
(1955, 'Shanghai Salsa', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Shanghai Salsa, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path, is a vibrant culinary venture bringing a unique fusion of Asian flavors to the Assam food scene. More than just a restaurant, Shanghai Salsa aims to be a cultural bridge, offering an accessible and exciting gastronomic experience that resonates with the local palate while introducing new and intriguing tastes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>In a region known for its rich culinary heritage, Shanghai Salsa distinguishes itself by blending authentic Shanghai-style cooking techniques with the bold, spicy flavors characteristic of salsa and other Latin American cuisines. This unconventional yet surprisingly harmonious combination creates a dining experience that is both familiar and refreshingly novel. We source locally whenever possible, supporting Assam farmers and ensuring the freshest ingredients are used in our dishes. This commitment to local sourcing helps us connect with the community and offer meals made with regional pride.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offerings revolve around a curated menu showcasing this fusion cuisine. Signature dishes include the "Szechuan Salsa Chicken," a crispy fried chicken marinated in a traditional Szechuan peppercorn sauce and served with a tangy, homemade salsa; and "Shanghai Noodles with Chipotle Shrimp," wok-fried noodles tossed with succulent shrimp and a smoky chipotle pepper sauce. Vegetarian options are also prominent, featuring dishes like "Mapo Tofu Empanadas," a playful twist on the classic Mapo Tofu filling encased in a crispy empanada pastry and served with a side of cilantro-lime dipping sauce. In addition to the main courses, we offer a selection of innovative appetizers, desserts, and beverages, including Asian-inspired cocktails and traditional Assam tea, all designed to complement the bold flavors of our dishes.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The unique selling proposition of Shanghai Salsa lies in its ability to deliver a high-quality, flavorful experience that is both approachable and adventurous. We avoid relying on overly complicated or inaccessible ingredients, instead focusing on creating bold and satisfying dishes that appeal to a broad range of tastes. The combination of familiar Asian cooking styles with the zest of Latin American spices fills a noticeable gap in the local market, offering an alternative to the standard Indian, Chinese, and Continental fare typically found in Guwahati. By offering a unique menu, we cater to the adventurous eater and those looking for something new and flavorful.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Shanghai Salsa. From the moment guests enter our doors, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, offering recommendations and answering questions with enthusiasm. We are committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. The restaurant''s ambiance is designed to be both modern and inviting, creating a comfortable setting for diners to relax and enjoy their meals. Regular customer feedback is actively sought through comment cards and online surveys, allowing us to continuously improve our offerings and services.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Beyond providing excellent food and service, Shanghai Salsa actively engages with the local community. We participate in local events and festivals, showcasing our cuisine and supporting community initiatives. We have plans for cooking workshops that will be held to teach interested locals to create interesting fusion meals in their own kitchens. We also partner with local farmers and suppliers, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. By fostering strong relationships with our customers and the community, we aim to become an integral part of the Guwahati food scene, a place where people can come together to enjoy delicious food and celebrate the rich cultural diversity of Assam.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Shanghai Salsa envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu, introducing new and exciting dishes that continue to push the boundaries of fusion cuisine. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam and beyond, bringing our unique culinary experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we plan to develop a catering service, providing our signature dishes for private events and corporate functions. Ultimately, Shanghai Salsa strives to be recognized as a leading culinary destination in the region, known for its innovative cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the community. We aspire to be more than just a restaurant, but a culinary and cultural landmark that enriches the lives of those we serve.</p>', '1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:10:09.000Z'),
(1956, 'Trafik Lounge Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Trafik Lounge Bar & Restaurant, situated on the 1st Floor of Goswami Service in the bustling Sonabeel Commercial Complex on GNB Road, offers a sophisticated and vibrant dining and entertainment experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant and bar, Trafik is a destination designed to be a central hub, a place where the community can connect, celebrate, and unwind. It stands out in the local business landscape by blending a modern, stylish ambiance with a deep appreciation for local flavors and traditions, creating a truly unique and memorable experience for its patrons.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and high-quality culinary and beverage experience. Trafik boasts a comprehensive menu that features both internationally inspired dishes and locally sourced Assamese delicacies. The restaurant emphasizes fresh, seasonal ingredients, ensuring that each dish is bursting with flavor and reflects the richness of the region''s agricultural bounty. Complementing the food menu is an extensive beverage list, including signature cocktails crafted by experienced mixologists, a curated selection of wines from around the world, and a wide array of premium spirits and beers, both domestic and international. A key unique selling point is our commitment to creating a dynamic atmosphere that caters to different needs throughout the day. From a relaxed lunch setting to a vibrant evening lounge, Trafik adapts to provide the perfect backdrop for any occasion. This adaptability, combined with our focus on local flavors and international standards, addresses a significant need in the local market for a premium dining and entertainment venue that caters to a diverse clientele.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Trafik''s philosophy. We strive to create a welcoming and attentive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. We are committed to creating a personal connection with our customers, understanding their preferences, and ensuring their complete satisfaction. To further enhance the customer experience, Trafik regularly hosts themed events, live music performances, and special promotions, creating a lively and engaging atmosphere. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artists, musicians, and businesses, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the cultural vibrancy of the area. This commitment to community involvement differentiates Trafik and establishes it as more than just a business; it''s a vital part of the local social fabric.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Trafik Lounge Bar & Restaurant envisions becoming the premier destination for dining and entertainment in the region, known for its exceptional quality, innovative offerings, and strong community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our menu with even more locally inspired dishes, incorporating sustainable practices throughout our operations, and enhancing our event programming to attract a wider audience. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local farmers and producers to further support the local economy and ensure the freshness and quality of our ingredients. Long-term, we aim to establish Trafik as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit. We envision expanding our reach through strategic partnerships and potential future locations, bringing the Trafik experience to new audiences while remaining deeply rooted in our commitment to Assam and its unique culture.</p>', '1st Floor, Goswami Service, Sonabeel Commercial Complex, GNB Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.356Z', '2025-12-07T14:10:14.000Z'),
