(1958, 'Unique WINE SHOP', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Unique WINE SHOP, situated at 4QPR+X8F, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd, stands as a distinctive establishment in Assam''s evolving retail landscape, offering a curated selection of wines and spirits that cater to both discerning palates and those new to the world of viniculture. Unlike conventional liquor stores, Unique WINE SHOP strives to provide an immersive and educational experience, transforming the act of purchasing wine into a journey of discovery. The shop distinguishes itself through its meticulously selected inventory, knowledgeable staff, and commitment to fostering a vibrant wine culture within the local community. Recognizing the growing appreciation for quality wines and spirits in Assam, Unique WINE SHOP aims to elevate the consumer experience beyond mere transaction, offering a space where knowledge, appreciation, and community converge. </p> <br> <br>

<p>At the heart of Unique WINE SHOP lies its dedication to providing a thoughtfully curated selection of wines and spirits from both local and international vineyards and distilleries. The primary offering revolves around a diverse array of wines, ranging from everyday table wines to premium vintages suitable for special occasions. The shop also stocks a selection of spirits, including single malt scotches, artisanal gins, and fine brandies, catering to a broad spectrum of tastes. Unique WINE SHOP differentiates itself by actively seeking out smaller, independent producers, highlighting unique terroirs and winemaking philosophies. This commitment to showcasing lesser-known labels alongside familiar favorites provides customers with opportunities to explore and expand their palates. Furthermore, the shop offers ancillary products such as wine accessories, glassware, and gourmet food pairings, enhancing the overall wine-drinking experience. To meet the specific needs of the local market, Unique WINE SHOP also sources wines known to pair well with Assamese cuisine, bridging the gap between local culinary traditions and international wine culture. These products are presented with detailed tasting notes and pairing suggestions, further empowering customers to make informed choices. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at Unique WINE SHOP. The business prides itself on providing personalized and attentive service, fostering a welcoming atmosphere where customers feel comfortable exploring the world of wine. The staff is composed of individuals passionate about wine and spirits, possessing the knowledge and communication skills necessary to guide customers through the selection process. Rather than simply fulfilling orders, the staff engages in conversations, offering recommendations based on individual preferences, dietary restrictions, and planned occasions. This personalized approach extends beyond the point of sale, with the shop hosting regular wine tasting events and educational workshops designed to deepen customers'' understanding and appreciation of wine. These events provide a platform for customers to interact with winemakers, learn about different grape varietals, and refine their tasting skills. Unique WINE SHOP also actively connects with the local community by partnering with restaurants and hotels to curate wine lists and offer staff training. Furthermore, the shop leverages social media and email marketing to share informative content, promote upcoming events, and solicit feedback from customers, ensuring a continuous dialogue and fostering a sense of community. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Unique WINE SHOP envisions itself as a leading voice in Assam''s emerging wine culture. The business plans to expand its inventory to include a wider range of rare and limited-edition wines, catering to the growing demand for premium products. Strategic partnerships with vineyards and distilleries will enable Unique WINE SHOP to offer exclusive bottlings and experiences to its customers. Another key focus is on developing online presence, allowing customers to browse the inventory, place orders, and access educational resources from the comfort of their own homes. The online platform will be complemented by a robust delivery service, ensuring that customers throughout the region can enjoy the offerings of Unique WINE SHOP. In the long term, the business aims to establish itself as a destination for wine tourism, attracting visitors from across the region and beyond. This vision includes the creation of a dedicated tasting room and event space, further enhancing the customer experience and solidifying Unique WINE SHOP''s position as a hub for wine lovers in Assam. By continuing to prioritize customer education, community engagement, and a commitment to quality, Unique WINE SHOP is poised for sustained growth and success in the years to come. </p>', '4QPR+X8F, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:10:26.000Z'),
(1959, 'Latasca', 'Bars', NULL, 'Latasca: Weaving Tradition with Modern Commerce in the Heart of Assam

Latasca, situated on the 1st floor of the Maa Durga Commercial Complex, near Nepali Mandir, is a dynamic business enterprise deeply rooted in the cultural fabric of Assam. More than just a commercial venture, Latasca aims to be a bridge between the rich traditions of the region and the demands of a modern marketplace. Its location, a bustling commercial hub, positions it perfectly to serve both local residents and visitors seeking authentic Assamese experiences and high-quality products. Latasca strives to be a recognized symbol of Assamese entrepreneurship, contributing to the economic vitality of the region while preserving its unique heritage.

<br> <br>

At the core of Latasca''s operations lies a commitment to providing exceptional services and showcasing the best of Assam. Primarily, Latasca focuses on offering curated artisanal products, directly sourced from local weavers, craftsmen, and agricultural producers. This not only ensures fair prices for the artisans but also guarantees the authenticity and quality of the goods offered to customers. Key product categories include:

<br> <br>

*   **Handloom Textiles:** Latasca features a stunning collection of traditional Assamese silk fabrics, including Eri, Muga, and Paat silk, woven into sarees, mekhela chadors, and other garments. The unique selling point is the emphasis on showcasing intricate designs and patterns passed down through generations, reflecting the diverse cultural heritage of Assam''s various communities. Each piece tells a story, connecting the buyer to the region''s rich textile traditions.
*   **Handicrafts:** From intricately carved wooden artifacts and bamboo products to meticulously crafted jewelry and terracotta items, Latasca offers a diverse range of handicrafts. These items showcase the skill and artistry of local artisans, who use traditional techniques and locally sourced materials. The emphasis is on sustainability and ethical production practices.
*   **Assam Tea & Spices:** Latasca offers a selection of premium Assam tea, sourced directly from local tea gardens known for their quality and sustainable farming practices. Complementing the tea selection is an array of locally grown spices, renowned for their unique flavors and aromas, adding a culinary dimension to the Assamese experience.
*   **Local Delicacies & Preserves:** showcasing the vibrant flavours of Assam, Latasca provides locally made pickles, jams, and traditional sweets, often made with unique regional ingredients, giving a flavour of authentic Assam.

<br> <br>

Latasca''s product offerings are carefully selected to meet the needs and preferences of the local market, as well as tourists seeking authentic souvenirs and gifts. By supporting local artisans and producers, Latasca actively contributes to the economic empowerment of rural communities and the preservation of traditional skills.

<br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Latasca. The business distinguishes itself through personalized service and a genuine passion for sharing the story behind each product. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the origins, craftsmanship, and cultural significance of the items on offer, providing customers with a rich and engaging shopping experience. The atmosphere at Latasca is designed to be welcoming and inviting, creating a space where customers can browse at their leisure, learn about Assamese culture, and connect with the local community.

<br> <br>

Latasca actively connects with the local community through collaborations with local artisans, participation in cultural events, and support for community initiatives. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of trust and loyalty among customers, who appreciate Latasca''s genuine dedication to supporting the local economy and preserving Assamese traditions. Furthermore, Latasca intends to collaborate with local cultural groups for events that showcase traditional Assamese art forms, music, and dance, helping to promote and celebrate the region''s rich cultural heritage.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Latasca envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. The long-term goal is to become a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and sustainability in the Assamese artisanal sector. Future plans include expanding the product range to include more innovative and contemporary designs, while still staying true to the region''s rich cultural heritage. Latasca also plans to enhance its online presence through e-commerce platforms and social media marketing, to reach a wider audience beyond its physical location.

<br> <br>

Furthermore, Latasca is exploring opportunities to establish partnerships with tourism agencies and hotels to offer curated experiences and packages that showcase the best of Assam''s culture and craftsmanship. This includes organizing guided tours to local artisan workshops and tea gardens, providing visitors with a deeper understanding of the region''s unique heritage. Ultimately, Latasca aims to play a significant role in promoting Assam as a premier destination for cultural tourism and sustainable commerce, creating a positive impact on the local economy and preserving its unique cultural identity for future generations.', '1st floor, Maa Durga Commercial Complex, near Nepali Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:10:34.000Z'),
(1960, 'HM RESTRO BAR', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>HM RESTRO BAR, strategically located on RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd, near State Zoo, opposite Shraddhanjali Kanan in Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique dining and entertainment experience that blends modern culinary trends with the rich cultural heritage of the region. More than just a restaurant and bar, HM RESTRO BAR aims to be a vibrant social hub, providing a welcoming atmosphere for both locals and tourists seeking a memorable evening. Positioned in a prime location near the zoo and a popular memorial park, it leverages the area''s high foot traffic and established reputation as a destination for leisure and relaxation. In the burgeoning Assam business landscape, HM RESTRO BAR distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement, setting a new standard for hospitality in the city.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of HM RESTRO BAR''s offerings are its diverse culinary options and carefully curated beverage selection. The menu features a delectable array of dishes, ranging from classic Indian and Assamese delicacies to contemporary global cuisine, prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Signature dishes showcase the unique flavors of Assam, providing an authentic taste of the region. Complementing the food menu is an extensive bar selection, including a wide range of spirits, wines, beers, and expertly crafted cocktails. These cocktails often incorporate local herbs and fruits, adding a distinctive Assam-inspired twist. Unique selling points include live music performances featuring local artists, themed nights celebrating different cultures and cuisines, and special events tailored to the Assam community. These services address the local market''s need for diverse dining and entertainment options in a sophisticated and welcoming setting.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at HM RESTRO BAR. The establishment strives to provide exceptional service, ensuring every guest feels valued and appreciated. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Beyond exceptional service, HM RESTRO BAR actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. This includes collaborations with local farmers and artisans to source ingredients and products, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices. The restaurant also hosts community events, such as charity fundraisers and cultural celebrations, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the social fabric of the area. This deep connection with the local community differentiates HM RESTRO BAR and cements its position as a beloved gathering place.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, HM RESTRO BAR envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative and sustainable dining options, further enhancing the bar selection with premium and craft beverages, and introducing new entertainment offerings to cater to a wider audience. The business also aims to explore opportunities to expand its physical footprint, potentially opening new locations in other strategic areas of Guwahati or even venturing into other cities in Assam. Long-term goals include establishing HM RESTRO BAR as a leading hospitality brand in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. The vision is to become synonymous with exceptional dining and entertainment, contributing to the vibrant cultural landscape of Assam and attracting both local and international visitors. This will be achieved through consistent investment in staff training, continuous improvement of services, and a steadfast dedication to exceeding customer expectations.</p>', 'RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd, near State Zoo, opposite Shraddhanjali Kanan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:15:07.000Z'),
(1961, 'Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, 'Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant: A Culinary & Social Hub in Naharani Path

Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant, situated in the heart of Ward No 26, Naharani Path, represents a unique blend of a relaxed bar atmosphere and a refined dining experience. It stands as a valuable addition to the local Assam business environment, offering a sophisticated yet accessible space for residents and visitors alike to socialize, unwind, and enjoy quality food and beverages. Unlike purely entertainment-focused establishments or standard restaurants, Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant successfully merges these elements to create a versatile destination catering to diverse needs and preferences. Its strategic location on Naharani Path positions it as a central point, easily accessible and contributing to the area''s vibrancy. <br> <br>

Our primary offering revolves around providing a diverse and satisfying culinary experience, complemented by a thoughtfully curated selection of beverages. The restaurant menu features a range of dishes, from traditional Assamese delicacies prepared with locally sourced ingredients to popular continental and Indian favorites. We pride ourselves on using fresh, high-quality ingredients to ensure that every dish is flavorful and satisfying. The bar boasts a selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks, including local beers, international spirits, and signature cocktails crafted by skilled bartenders. <br> <br>

What truly sets Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant apart is its commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment. We strive to offer more than just food and drinks; we aim to provide an experience. The restaurant''s ambiance is carefully designed to be both comfortable and aesthetically pleasing, with a modern yet warm décor. Our staff is trained to provide friendly and attentive service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. We believe in building personal connections with our patrons, fostering a sense of community and loyalty. We regularly host special events, live music performances, and themed nights to enhance the customer experience and cater to a variety of interests. By engaging with local organizations and participating in community initiatives, Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant actively contributes to the well-being and social fabric of Naharani Path. <br> <br>

Customer service is at the heart of our operation. We emphasize personalized attention, striving to understand and anticipate the needs of each guest. Our staff is knowledgeable about the menu and beverage offerings, able to provide recommendations and answer questions with enthusiasm. We actively solicit feedback from our customers, using their input to continuously improve our services and offerings. Online reviews and social media engagement are carefully monitored, allowing us to address concerns promptly and maintain a positive reputation. We believe that exceeding customer expectations is essential for building long-term relationships and fostering loyalty. <br> <br>

Looking ahead, Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant envisions becoming a recognized and respected culinary and social landmark in the region. We plan to expand our menu offerings to include more seasonal dishes and cater to evolving dietary preferences. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers, further supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness of our ingredients. We intend to enhance our bar offerings with a wider selection of craft beers and premium spirits. <br> <br>

Furthermore, we are considering expanding our physical space to accommodate larger groups and private events. This could involve adding a dedicated banquet hall or outdoor seating area. We are also exploring the possibility of offering catering services for local events and gatherings. Our long-term goal is to establish Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant as a premier destination for both locals and tourists seeking a memorable and authentic culinary and social experience in Naharani Path. We are committed to continuous improvement, innovation, and community engagement, ensuring that Alpine Bar Cum Restaurant remains a vibrant and integral part of the local landscape for years to come. We also intend to leverage digital marketing strategies and online ordering platforms to broaden our reach and convenience for customers.', 'Ward No 26, Naharani Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:15:12.000Z'),
