(1968, 'Paplu Room', 'Bars', NULL, 'Paplu Room: A Hub of Innovation and Collaboration in Guwahati

Paplu Room, located on the 2nd Floor of Uphar Market along the bustling Guwahati Shillong Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a dynamic hub for entrepreneurs, freelancers, and small businesses in Guwahati and the surrounding Assam region. More than just a co-working space, Paplu Room fosters a vibrant community where ideas are shared, collaborations are forged, and businesses thrive. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the local business environment, and our mission is to provide a supportive and stimulating ecosystem that empowers our members to reach their full potential. Paplu Room contributes to the growing entrepreneurial spirit of Assam by providing essential resources and cultivating a collaborative network. <br> <br>

At its core, Paplu Room offers flexible and affordable workspace solutions catering to a diverse range of needs. These include:

*   **Dedicated Desks:** Providing a stable and personalized workspace for individuals seeking a consistent and productive environment. Each dedicated desk comes with ergonomic seating, ample power outlets, and secure storage options.

*   **Hot Desks:** Ideal for freelancers, remote workers, and those who require a flexible workspace on an ad-hoc basis. Hot desks offer a cost-effective solution with access to all common amenities.

*   **Private Offices:** Fully furnished and equipped private offices designed to accommodate small teams and startups. These offices offer privacy, security, and a professional environment for client meetings and focused work.

*   **Meeting Rooms:** Well-equipped meeting rooms available for hourly or daily rentals, perfect for presentations, workshops, team meetings, and client consultations. These rooms are equipped with presentation technology, whiteboards, and comfortable seating.

Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to fostering a strong sense of community. We regularly host networking events, workshops, and seminars featuring local experts and industry leaders. This provides our members with valuable opportunities to connect with potential collaborators, learn new skills, and gain insights into the local market. Unlike generic co-working spaces, Paplu Room actively curates its community to ensure a diverse mix of talents and perspectives, creating a truly enriching and collaborative environment. Our high-speed internet, printing and scanning facilities, and complimentary beverages further enhance the overall workspace experience. <br> <br>

Customer experience is paramount at Paplu Room. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where every member feels valued and empowered. Our dedicated community managers are always on hand to assist with any needs, from technical support to networking introductions. We believe in building strong relationships with our members, understanding their individual goals, and providing tailored support to help them succeed. We actively solicit feedback from our members to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs. Our connection with the local community extends beyond our membership base. We partner with local businesses and organizations to host events that benefit the wider community, fostering a spirit of collaboration and mutual support. We believe in giving back to the community that has welcomed us and are committed to playing a positive role in its economic development. Our online presence is actively maintained to foster interaction and engagement within our community. <br> <br>

Looking ahead, Paplu Room envisions becoming the leading hub for innovation and entrepreneurship in Guwahati and Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our physical space to accommodate growing demand and introducing new services tailored to the specific needs of our members. We are exploring partnerships with venture capitalists and angel investors to provide our members with access to funding opportunities. We are also developing mentorship programs that connect experienced entrepreneurs with aspiring startups, providing valuable guidance and support. In the long term, we aspire to create a vibrant ecosystem that not only supports the growth of individual businesses but also contributes to the overall economic development of the region. This includes fostering innovation, attracting talent, and creating jobs. We aim to be a catalyst for positive change and contribute to a brighter future for Assam and Northeast India. By continuing to focus on community building, exceptional customer service, and innovative programming, Paplu Room is poised to make a significant and lasting impact on the local business landscape.', '2nd Floor, Uphar Market, Guwahati Shillong Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:20:24.000Z'),
(1969, 'Ivory Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Ivory Bar: A Refined Hospitality Experience in the Heart of Solapara, Assam</p>

<p>Located on the 1st floor of Solapara Road, opposite Capital Travels, Ivory Bar offers a sophisticated and welcoming haven for those seeking a premium hospitality experience in Guwahati. More than just a bar, Ivory Bar is envisioned as a destination where impeccable service, a carefully curated ambiance, and a diverse selection of beverages and light fare converge to create memorable moments for locals and travelers alike. In a region increasingly appreciating refined leisure and social experiences, Ivory Bar aims to set a new standard for quality and personalized service within the Assam business landscape. Situated in a prominent location known for its accessibility and vibrant atmosphere, Ivory Bar contributes to the area''s appeal as a hub for both business and leisure.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Experiences</p>

<p>At the heart of Ivory Bar''s offerings is a meticulously crafted beverage menu, featuring an extensive selection of premium spirits, both domestic and international. From classic cocktails expertly prepared by skilled mixologists to a curated selection of fine wines and locally sourced craft beers, the bar caters to a diverse range of palates. In addition to its impressive drinks menu, Ivory Bar offers a thoughtfully designed selection of light fare and appetizers, complementing the beverages and providing a satisfying culinary experience. Dishes are prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients, emphasizing regional flavors and international influences. The ambiance is carefully considered, with sophisticated lighting, comfortable seating arrangements, and curated music creating a relaxing and upscale setting. The unique selling point lies not only in the quality of the products but also in the overall experience, which is designed to be both refined and approachable. Understanding the needs of the local market, Ivory Bar aims to provide a space where individuals can unwind after a long day, celebrate special occasions, or simply enjoy the company of friends and colleagues in a stylish and comfortable environment. By offering a diverse range of experiences from lively evening gatherings to quieter, more intimate settings, Ivory Bar addresses the evolving preferences of the local community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection</p>

<p>Ivory Bar prioritizes providing exceptional customer service that goes beyond simple transactions. The staff is extensively trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and proactive in anticipating customer needs. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm welcome and a genuine desire to ensure their satisfaction. The focus is on building lasting relationships with customers, understanding their preferences, and creating a personalized experience that encourages repeat visits. Ivory Bar recognizes the importance of connecting with the local community. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as hosting themed nights featuring local artists and musicians, collaborating with local businesses for promotional events, and participating in community initiatives. By actively engaging with the local culture, Ivory Bar seeks to become more than just a business; it aims to be a valued member of the community. Feedback is actively sought and carefully considered, allowing the bar to continuously improve its services and tailor its offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement is what sets Ivory Bar apart and establishes its reputation as a premier hospitality destination in Solapara.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Continued Excellence</p>

<p>The future vision for Ivory Bar is one of sustained growth, innovation, and continued excellence in the hospitality sector. The business aims to expand its offerings and services to cater to a wider range of customers while maintaining its commitment to quality and personalized service. Future plans may include introducing new menu items, expanding the selection of beverages, and hosting special events and promotions that appeal to diverse interests. Exploration of partnerships with other businesses in the region to create unique and collaborative experiences is also a key aspect of the long-term strategy. Technology will play an increasingly important role in enhancing the customer experience, with plans to implement online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and other digital solutions that streamline operations and improve customer engagement. Furthermore, Ivory Bar is committed to investing in its staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they remain at the forefront of the industry. By staying abreast of industry trends, embracing innovation, and remaining deeply connected to the local community, Ivory Bar aspires to become a leading hospitality destination in Guwahati and a symbol of quality and excellence in the region. The goal is to not only provide a memorable experience for every guest but also to contribute positively to the local economy and cultural landscape.</p>', '1st floor, Solapara Rd, opposite capital travels', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:20:31.000Z'),
(1970, 'Malt', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Malt: Crafting Experiences in the Heart of Guwahati</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Located within the prestigious Novotel Guwahati GS Road, Downtown Dispur, Malt stands as a sophisticated destination redefining leisure and entertainment in Assam. More than just a venue, Malt is an experience meticulously crafted to cater to discerning palates and those seeking elevated moments. Situated strategically within a prominent hotel and business district, Malt brings a unique offering to the Guwahati social scene, providing a blend of premium beverages, delectable cuisine, and a vibrant atmosphere. It represents a significant addition to the local hospitality landscape, providing both hotel guests and the wider Guwahati community with a stylish and convenient space for relaxation, celebration, and networking. Malt distinguishes itself by prioritizing quality, ambience, and personalized service, contributing positively to the evolving entertainment culture of the region.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Malt''s core offering revolves around a curated selection of premium beverages, featuring an extensive range of spirits, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar showcases both classic and contemporary mixes, prepared by skilled mixologists dedicated to delivering a perfect drink every time. Beyond the drinks, Malt boasts a thoughtfully designed menu of delectable food offerings. The culinary selections are carefully paired with the beverage program, providing a complete and harmonious gastronomic experience. The menu features a range of appetizers, small plates, and main courses designed to satisfy diverse tastes. Whether it’s enjoying a perfectly prepared cocktail after a long day of work, celebrating a special occasion with friends, or savoring a quiet moment alone, Malt offers a setting for every experience. What truly sets Malt apart is its commitment to providing a premium experience within a relaxed and inviting environment, filling a niche in the Guwahati market for a sophisticated yet unpretentious gathering place.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At Malt, customer experience is paramount. The emphasis is on creating a welcoming and personalized atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and proactive, ensuring seamless service and anticipating customer needs. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness, setting the tone for a memorable experience. The ambience, enhanced by carefully selected music and lighting, fosters a relaxed and sophisticated environment. Malt actively seeks to connect with the local community through curated events and promotions. These initiatives include themed nights, live music performances, and collaborations with local artists and businesses. By actively engaging with the community, Malt fosters a sense of belonging and becomes more than just a bar; it becomes a vibrant hub for social interaction and cultural exchange. Feedback is actively sought and valued, continuously refining services to meet and exceed customer expectations. Malt aims to build lasting relationships with its patrons, becoming a cherished destination in the heart of Guwahati.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for Malt is to solidify its position as the premier destination for sophisticated leisure and entertainment in Guwahati and beyond. Expansion opportunities within Assam and potentially other North Eastern states are being explored. Future plans include enhancing the menu with innovative culinary offerings, expanding the selection of premium beverages, and hosting larger-scale events and collaborations. There''s a strong focus on developing the Malt brand into a recognizable symbol of quality, sophistication, and exceptional customer service. Digital marketing strategies will be further refined to reach a wider audience and enhance online engagement. Partnerships with local businesses and organizations will continue to be cultivated to strengthen community ties. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Malt as a leading hospitality brand, synonymous with creating unforgettable experiences and contributing positively to the vibrant cultural landscape of the region.</p>', 'Novotel Guwahati GS Road, Downtown Dispur', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:25:07.000Z'),
(1971, 'D Father Lounge', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>D Father Lounge: A Refined Social Hub in the Heart of Assam</p>

<br> <br>

<p>D Father Lounge is an emerging social and leisure destination, strategically located to serve the evolving tastes of Assam''s discerning clientele. Positioned to be more than just a lounge, D Father Lounge aims to cultivate a sophisticated yet welcoming atmosphere where individuals can connect, unwind, and enjoy premium hospitality. Recognizing the growing demand for upscale entertainment options within the region, D Father Lounge strives to be a notable player in the local business landscape by offering a curated experience that blends modern luxury with Assamese warmth and tradition.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>At the heart of D Father Lounge''s offerings lies a diverse selection of core services and products tailored to meet the needs of a broad demographic. The lounge provides a comprehensive beverage menu featuring both classic and innovative cocktails, a selection of premium spirits, and a curated wine list designed to complement the local palate. Accompanying the beverage offerings is a carefully crafted food menu emphasizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The cuisine focuses on fusion dishes incorporating regional Assamese flavors alongside popular international culinary styles. Beyond the food and beverage aspect, D Father Lounge also provides a curated entertainment program, featuring live music performances showcasing local artists, themed nights, and special events designed to enhance the overall social experience. The lounge also features comfortable seating arrangements, including private booths and communal areas, facilitating both intimate conversations and larger group gatherings. The unique selling proposition rests in the commitment to quality in every aspect, from the ingredients used to the service provided. This holistic approach ensures that D Father Lounge stands apart from competitors by providing an elevated experience that caters to the desire for refined entertainment within the local market.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at D Father Lounge, and the establishment is dedicated to creating a welcoming and memorable atmosphere for every guest. The staff is trained to provide attentive, personalized service, anticipating customer needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable visit. The lounge''s design reflects a commitment to comfort and aesthetics, incorporating elements of modern design while retaining a distinct Assamese character. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and implemented to continually improve the services and offerings. To foster a deeper connection with the local community, D Father Lounge actively participates in local events and collaborates with regional businesses. This includes sponsoring local artists, supporting community initiatives, and partnering with nearby restaurants and hotels to create package deals. The aim is to become an integral part of the local social fabric, recognized not only as a premium leisure destination but also as a responsible and engaged member of the community.</p>

<br> <br>

<p>The future vision for D Father Lounge involves strategic and sustainable growth within the Assam market and beyond. The initial focus is on solidifying its reputation as a premier entertainment destination within its current location. This will be achieved through continuous improvement in service quality, expansion of the menu offerings, and diversification of the entertainment program. Future plans include potentially expanding into other strategic locations within Assam, replicating the successful model while adapting to the specific characteristics of each new market. Additionally, D Father Lounge intends to explore opportunities to develop signature products and experiences, such as branded merchandise, special event packages, and culinary collaborations. The long-term goals encompass establishing D Father Lounge as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, sophistication, and community engagement throughout the region. This vision is underpinned by a commitment to innovation, customer satisfaction, and responsible business practices.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:25:13.000Z'),
(1972, 'R.D. Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, 'R.D. Bar & Restaurant stands as a prominent establishment in the heart of [Insert Specific Location in Assam], offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and modern culinary techniques. More than just a dining destination, R.D. Bar & Restaurant is a vibrant social hub, contributing significantly to the local business landscape by providing a welcoming space for residents and visitors alike to connect and enjoy authentic regional experiences. The restaurant distinguishes itself through its commitment to sourcing locally produced ingredients, supporting regional farmers and artisans while delivering unparalleled freshness and flavor to its patrons. It aspires to be synonymous with quality, community, and the rich culinary heritage of Assam.

