Looking to the future, R.D. Bar & Restaurant envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation. Growth plans include expanding its menu to incorporate more diverse regional cuisines and potentially opening additional locations within the state to cater to a broader audience. The restaurant is also exploring opportunities to develop a line of artisanal food products, showcasing the unique flavors of Assam to a wider market. Furthermore, R.D. Bar & Restaurant aims to strengthen its partnerships with local farmers and suppliers, promoting sustainable agricultural practices and supporting the local economy. Long-term goals include establishing a culinary training program to nurture local talent and contribute to the development of the region''s hospitality industry. This multifaceted approach to growth will allow R.D. Bar & Restaurant to not only expand its business but also make a significant positive impact on the local community and economy.', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:25:19.000Z'),
(1973, 'Rm Bar and Restaurant', 'Bars', NULL, '<p><strong>Rm Bar and Restaurant: A Culinary and Social Hub in the Heart of Assam</strong></p>

<p>Rm Bar and Restaurant stands as a vibrant and welcoming establishment, offering a unique blend of culinary delights and engaging social experiences. Nestled in the heart of Assam (address to be inserted), we have quickly become a favorite among locals and visitors alike, providing a memorable dining and entertainment destination. Our commitment to quality, combined with a distinctly Assamese touch, sets us apart in the local hospitality landscape. We strive to create an atmosphere where guests can relax, connect, and savor the best that Assam has to offer, both in terms of food and culture.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Diverse Offerings: From Traditional Flavors to Modern Mixology</strong></p>

<p>At Rm Bar and Restaurant, we pride ourselves on our diverse menu that caters to a wide range of palates. Our culinary offerings are divided into distinct sections, each designed to provide a unique gastronomic journey:</p>

<p><strong>Assamese Cuisine:</strong> We celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam with authentic dishes prepared using locally sourced ingredients. From the tangy *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry) to the flavorful *Khar* (alkaline dish), and the comforting *Duck Curry*, our menu showcases the diversity of Assamese flavors. Our chefs meticulously prepare each dish, ensuring that the traditional recipes are honored while maintaining the highest standards of hygiene and presentation.</p>

<p><strong>Indian Classics:</strong> Alongside our regional specialties, we also offer a selection of popular Indian dishes. This allows us to cater to a broader audience, providing familiar favorites alongside the more adventurous Assamese fare.</p>

<p><strong>Continental Delights:</strong> For those seeking international flavors, our menu features a curated selection of Continental dishes. From pasta and pizzas to grilled meats and salads, we offer a variety of options to satisfy diverse tastes.</p>

<p><strong>The Bar:</strong> Our well-stocked bar boasts an impressive selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. Our skilled bartenders craft classic cocktails, innovative mixes, and refreshing mocktails. We also offer a wide range of spirits, beers, and wines, carefully selected to complement our food menu.</p>

<p>What truly sets us apart is our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and suppliers but also ensures that our dishes are bursting with authentic flavors. We also offer customizable menu options to cater to dietary restrictions and preferences, ensuring that every guest has a satisfying experience.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Loyalty</strong></p>

<p>At Rm Bar and Restaurant, we understand that a memorable dining experience extends beyond just the food and drinks. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service and creating a welcoming atmosphere that makes our guests feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every guest receives personalized attention.</p>

<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local music performances, showcasing local artists, and participating in community events. We believe in supporting local talent and contributing to the vibrant cultural scene of Assam.</p>

<p>We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings. We use this feedback to refine our menu, enhance our ambiance, and optimize our customer service protocols. We also leverage social media to connect with our customers, share updates, and promote special events. We strive to create a community around Rm Bar and Restaurant, fostering a sense of belonging and loyalty among our patrons.</p>

<br> <br>

<p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Strengthening Roots</strong></p>

<p>Looking ahead, Rm Bar and Restaurant envisions continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading culinary and social destination in Assam. Our long-term goals include:</p>

<p><strong>Expanding our Menu:</strong> We plan to introduce new and exciting dishes to our menu, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine and incorporating innovative culinary techniques.</p>

<p><strong>Enhancing our Ambiance:</strong> We are committed to continuously improving our ambiance, creating a more comfortable and visually appealing space for our guests. This may involve renovations, upgrades to our décor, and the introduction of new entertainment options.</p>

<p><strong>Strengthening Community Ties:</strong> We will continue to actively engage with the local community, supporting local businesses and participating in community events. We aim to become an integral part of the social fabric of Assam.</p>

<p><strong>Exploring Expansion Opportunities:</strong> We are exploring opportunities to expand our operations to other locations in Assam and beyond, bringing the unique Rm Bar and Restaurant experience to a wider audience. This expansion will be carefully planned and executed, ensuring that we maintain the high standards of quality and customer service that have made us successful.</p>

<p>Rm Bar and Restaurant is more than just a place to eat and drink; it''s a place to connect, celebrate, and experience the best of Assam. We are committed to providing exceptional food, outstanding service, and a welcoming atmosphere for all our guests, and we look forward to continuing to serve the community for many years to come.</p>', NULL, 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:25:26.000Z'),
(1974, 'Sura Vie', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Sura Vie, located on the 4th floor of The Hub Mall, GS Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination in Guwahati for those seeking a curated experience encompassing fine dining and sophisticated social interaction. More than just a restaurant or lounge, Sura Vie aims to be a vibrant hub where individuals can connect, celebrate, and savor exceptional culinary creations in a stylish and welcoming environment. Situated in a prime location within one of Guwahati''s most popular malls, Sura Vie benefits from high visibility and easy accessibility, making it a convenient choice for both planned outings and spontaneous gatherings. Recognizing the burgeoning demand for high-quality entertainment and diverse dining options in Assam, Sura Vie is poised to become a cornerstone of the region''s social scene, offering a unique blend of local warmth and international flair.</p> <br> <br>
<p>At the heart of Sura Vie''s offerings are its distinctive dining and lounge experiences. The establishment prides itself on its meticulously crafted menu, which features a diverse range of culinary delights. Patrons can expect to find a thoughtfully curated selection of dishes, blending regional Assam flavors with global culinary trends. This fusion approach not only caters to a wide range of palates but also showcases the region''s rich culinary heritage. Complementing the food menu is an extensive beverage list featuring classic cocktails, innovative mixes, premium spirits, and a carefully selected wine list. Live music performances and themed events are frequently hosted, adding another layer of entertainment and creating a vibrant atmosphere. What sets Sura Vie apart is its commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring the highest quality in every dish. The focus is on delivering a holistic sensory experience, from the exquisite taste of the food to the captivating ambiance, making each visit a memorable occasion. The unique selling proposition lies in successfully combining fine dining, a sophisticated lounge atmosphere, and vibrant entertainment, fulfilling a previously unmet need in the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Sura Vie understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to building a loyal clientele. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, anticipating the needs of each guest and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. From the moment patrons enter Sura Vie, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. The team strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, where everyone feels comfortable and valued. Beyond simply providing excellent service, Sura Vie actively engages with the local community. Partnerships with local artists and musicians are fostered to showcase regional talent and contribute to the cultural vibrancy of Guwahati. Sura Vie also participates in local events and supports community initiatives, demonstrating a commitment to giving back and building strong relationships. This focus on community engagement extends to the menu, which often features dishes inspired by local recipes and traditions. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated into the business, ensuring that Sura Vie continues to evolve and meet the changing needs of its patrons. The aim is to cultivate a sense of belonging, where customers feel like valued members of the Sura Vie family.</p> <br> <br>
<p>Looking ahead, Sura Vie envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market and potentially beyond. The long-term goal is to establish Sura Vie as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, sophistication, and exceptional customer experience. Future plans include expanding the menu with innovative new dishes and beverage offerings, continuing to showcase local and regional culinary talent. The business also aims to further enhance its entertainment offerings, introducing new live music acts, themed events, and collaborations with local artists. Expansion to other strategic locations within Assam is under consideration, allowing Sura Vie to reach a wider audience. Furthermore, Sura Vie is committed to incorporating sustainable practices into its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to a more responsible business environment. By consistently delivering exceptional experiences, fostering strong community relationships, and embracing innovation, Sura Vie is poised to become a leading player in the region''s hospitality industry, leaving a lasting positive impact on the local economy and cultural landscape.</p>', '4th floor, The Hub Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.357Z', '2025-12-07T14:25:32.000Z'),
(1975, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar', 'Bars', NULL, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar, nestled at 2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd, is more than just a cafe; it''s a vibrant hub where the rich tapestry of Assam''s culture meets contemporary culinary experiences. Strategically located on the bustling GS Road, Mocha Cafe & Bar serves as a destination for locals and visitors seeking a relaxing and engaging atmosphere, exceptional coffee and beverages, and a menu that blends local flavors with global inspiration. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local community, fostering connections and providing a memorable experience with every visit.

<br> <br>

Our core offerings encompass a diverse range of services designed to cater to a broad spectrum of tastes. At the heart of our business is our carefully curated selection of specialty coffees, from classic espressos and cappuccinos crafted with locally sourced beans (where available), to innovative mocha blends that give our cafe its distinctive name. Complementing our coffee is an extensive beverage menu featuring handcrafted teas, refreshing smoothies, and a selection of mocktails perfect for unwinding after a long day. Beyond beverages, Mocha Cafe & Bar boasts a menu of delectable food items. This includes a variety of sandwiches, wraps, and light meals, as well as a selection of locally-inspired snacks and desserts that celebrate the region''s culinary heritage. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to combine a sophisticated cafe experience with a comfortable and welcoming bar atmosphere, making us an ideal spot for morning coffee, lunch meetings, or evening gatherings. We adapt our menu seasonally, incorporating fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring a dynamic and engaging culinary experience for our customers. Our offerings directly address the local market''s desire for high-quality coffee, diverse food options, and a social space that promotes community interaction.

<br> <br>

At Mocha Cafe & Bar, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our team is dedicated to providing attentive and friendly service, going the extra mile to personalize each interaction. We train our staff to be knowledgeable about our menu and to offer recommendations based on individual preferences. Beyond exceptional service, we foster a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting live music performances featuring local artists, organizing themed events that celebrate Assamese culture, and partnering with local businesses to promote their products and services. We actively solicit customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and enhance the overall experience. We also emphasize creating a visually appealing and comfortable environment, with thoughtful décor, comfortable seating, and ambient lighting designed to promote relaxation and conversation. Wi-Fi is freely available, making Mocha Cafe & Bar an ideal workspace for freelancers and remote workers.

<br> <br>

Looking ahead, Mocha Cafe & Bar envisions significant growth potential. We aim to expand our reach within the local market by exploring opportunities to open additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati and beyond. We also plan to enhance our menu with new and innovative offerings, constantly adapting to evolving customer preferences. A key aspect of our future strategy involves strengthening our online presence through social media engagement, online ordering platforms, and targeted marketing campaigns. We also plan to explore partnerships with local delivery services to extend our reach and provide greater convenience to our customers. Long-term, our goal is to establish Mocha Cafe & Bar as a leading cafe and bar destination in Assam, recognized for its exceptional coffee, diverse menu, commitment to customer service, and strong community engagement. We envision becoming a recognizable brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and a true representation of the vibrant spirit of Assam. We believe in fostering a sustainable business model, focusing on responsible sourcing and minimizing our environmental impact. We are confident that by staying true to our core values and continually striving for excellence, Mocha Cafe & Bar will achieve its long-term goals and make a lasting contribution to the local business landscape.', '2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.358Z', '2025-12-07T14:30:09.000Z'),
(1976, 'Club 9 Bar', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>Club 9 Bar, strategically situated on GS Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience in Assam. More than just a bar, Club 9 is a carefully curated social space designed to cater to the evolving tastes of the local community, offering a unique blend of premium beverages, delectable cuisine, and engaging entertainment. Its location on the bustling GS Road, a vital artery of commerce and social activity, ensures high visibility and accessibility, positioning Club 9 as a key player in the region’s leisure and hospitality sector.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Club 9 Bar''s core offering revolves around providing an unparalleled beverage experience. The bar boasts an extensive selection of spirits, wines, and beers, sourced both locally and internationally, catering to a wide range of preferences. Skilled mixologists craft innovative cocktails using fresh, high-quality ingredients, ensuring each drink is a work of art. Complementing the beverage menu is a carefully crafted food menu featuring a selection of appetizers, small plates, and main courses designed to perfectly pair with the drinks. The focus is on providing high-quality ingredients, expertly prepared, with attention to local palates. One of Club 9’s unique selling points is its commitment to creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere. This is achieved through regular live music performances featuring local bands and DJs, themed nights, and special events, ensuring there’s always something new and exciting on offer. This strategy directly addresses a need in the local market for more sophisticated and diverse entertainment options.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Club 9 Bar’s philosophy. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance is carefully cultivated to strike a balance between sophistication and approachability, creating a relaxed and comfortable environment where patrons can unwind and socialize. Beyond exceptional service and atmosphere, Club 9 actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events, partnerships with regional businesses, and charitable initiatives. This active participation fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the bar’s connection to the community it serves. Feedback is actively solicited and implemented, demonstrating a commitment to continuous improvement and ensuring that the bar consistently meets the evolving needs and expectations of its clientele.</p> <br> <br>

<p>Looking ahead, Club 9 Bar envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the menu to incorporate more regional culinary specialties, further catering to local tastes and promoting Assamese cuisine. Exploring opportunities for outdoor seating and expansion of the venue are also being considered to accommodate a growing customer base. Furthermore, Club 9 aims to establish itself as a leader in responsible alcohol service and promote a safe and enjoyable environment for all patrons. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a consistently high-quality establishment, becoming a recognizable brand within the Assam nightlife scene, and potentially expanding to other strategic locations within the region. The focus remains on providing a superior customer experience, fostering a strong connection with the local community, and continuously innovating to meet the evolving demands of the market.</p>', 'GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.358Z', '2025-12-07T14:30:14.000Z'),
(1977, 'The Krib, Bar and Eatery', 'Bars', NULL, '<p>The Krib, Bar and Eatery, nestled on the Ground Floor of Hotel Apollo Grand, GS Rd, near Central Mall, is more than just a dining establishment; it''s a destination. It represents a modern, sophisticated approach to hospitality, seamlessly blending the ambiance of a high-end bar with the warmth and approachability of a neighborhood eatery. Situated in a prime location within Guwahati, a bustling hub in Assam, The Krib caters to a discerning clientele seeking quality food, expertly crafted beverages, and an inviting atmosphere. Its strategic positioning within a prominent hotel and proximity to a major shopping destination provides a significant advantage, attracting both hotel guests and local residents alike. The Krib distinguishes itself by offering a curated experience that elevates the standard for social gatherings and culinary exploration in the region. </p> <br> <br>

<p>At its core, The Krib offers a comprehensive range of services designed to satisfy diverse palates and preferences. The establishment operates as a full-service bar, featuring an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers, including locally sourced craft brews when available. Bartenders are trained to create both classic cocktails and innovative concoctions, ensuring a drink menu that is both familiar and exciting. Complementing the bar is a robust eatery menu offering a diverse selection of appetizers, entrees, and desserts. The culinary offerings range from globally inspired dishes to regional specialties, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The unique selling point of The Krib lies in its commitment to providing a sophisticated yet relaxed environment where patrons can enjoy high-quality food and beverages without the pretension often associated with upscale establishments. This commitment addresses a growing need in the local market for venues that offer a refined experience that is also accessible and comfortable. The curated food and beverage options are designed to cater to both local tastes and international preferences, appealing to a broad demographic. </p> <br> <br>

<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Krib. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, anticipating needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable visit. The ambiance is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and inclusive environment, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and carefully selected music that enhances the overall atmosphere without being intrusive. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, The Krib actively participates in local events and initiatives. Special promotions and themed nights are regularly organized to attract new customers and foster a sense of community among regulars. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience, demonstrating a commitment to exceeding expectations. Furthermore, The Krib leverages social media and digital platforms to connect with the local community, showcasing its offerings, promoting events, and engaging in meaningful conversations with its patrons. The goal is to cultivate a loyal customer base by consistently delivering exceptional service and creating a welcoming space where people feel valued and appreciated. </p> <br> <br>

<p>The Krib envisions becoming a leading destination for social gatherings and culinary experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients, further enhancing the culinary offerings. Exploring opportunities to partner with local producers and artisans to showcase regional products and support the local economy is also a key consideration. Expansion within Hotel Apollo Grand, perhaps adding a private dining area or outdoor seating, is being evaluated to accommodate growing demand. The long-term goal is to establish The Krib as a recognizable and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. This includes potentially exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other strategic areas within Assam and the Northeast region. Ultimately, The Krib aspires to be more than just a bar and eatery; it strives to be a vital part of the local community, contributing to the vibrant social and culinary landscape of Guwahati while providing exceptional experiences for all its patrons. Continuous innovation in menu offerings, ambiance, and customer service will remain central to achieving this vision. </p>', 'Ground Floor, Hotel Apollo Grand, GS Rd, near Central Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Closes at 10 PM', NULL, 0, 0, 'Active', NULL, '2026-08-07T11:06:21.358Z', '2025-12-07T14:30:21.000Z'),
(1978, 'Tsangpo2.0', 'Bars', NULL, 'Tsangpo2.0: Bridging Tradition and Innovation in Assam''s Business Hub

Nestled on the 7th floor of Hotel Brahmaputra Madhukalya, Sixmile, Panjabari Rd, Tsangpo2.0 represents a dynamic force in Assam''s evolving business landscape. More than just a company, Tsangpo2.0 embodies the spirit of the Brahmaputra River – a constant flow of innovation, connectivity, and growth, deeply rooted in local values yet embracing global perspectives. We stand as a testament to Assam''s potential, leveraging our strategic location and understanding of the local market to deliver unparalleled services and solutions. Tsangpo2.0 is committed to fostering sustainable growth and contributing to the economic prosperity of the region.

